#: doc/classes/AudioEffectEQ6.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a 6-band equalizer audio effect to an audio bus.\n"
"Gives you control over frequencies from 32 Hz to 10000 Hz. Each frequency "
"can be modulated between -60/+24 dB."
