"Access color components using their index. [code][0][/code] is equivalent to "
"[member r], [code][1][/code] is equivalent to [member g], [code][2][/code] "
"is equivalent to [member b], and [code][3][/code] is equivalent to [member "
"a]."
msgstr ""
"Acessa componentes de cor usando seu índice. [code][0][/code] é equivalente "
"a [member r], [code][1][/code] é equivalente a [member g], [code][2][/code] "
"é equivalente a [member b] e [code][3][/code] é equivalente a [member a]."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml doc/classes/float.xml doc/classes/int.xml
#: doc/classes/Plane.xml doc/classes/Quaternion.xml doc/classes/Vector2.xml
#: doc/classes/Vector2i.xml doc/classes/Vector3.xml doc/classes/Vector3i.xml
#: doc/classes/Vector4.xml doc/classes/Vector4i.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the same value as if the [code]+[/code] was not there. Unary [code]+"
"[/code] does nothing, but sometimes it can make your code more readable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o mesmo valor que se o [code]+[/code] não estivesse lá. O [code]+[/"
"code] unário não faz nada, mas às vezes pode tornar seu código mais legível."

#: doc/classes/Color.xml
msgid ""
"Inverts the given color. This is equivalent to [code]Color.WHITE - c[/code] "
"or [code]Color(1 - c.r, 1 - c.g, 1 - c.b, 1 - c.a)[/code]. Unlike with "
"[method inverted], the [member a] component is inverted, too."
msgstr ""
"Inverte a cor fornecida. Isso é equivalente a [code]Color.WHITE - c[/code] "
"ou [code]Color(1 - c.r, 1 - c.g, 1 - c.b, 1 - c.a)[/code]. Ao contrário de "
"[method inverted], o componente [member a] também é invertido."

#: doc/classes/ColorPalette.xml
msgid ""
"A resource class for managing a palette of colors, which can be loaded and "
"saved using [ColorPicker]."
msgstr ""
"Uma classe de recurso para gerenciar uma paleta de cores, que pode ser "
"carregada e salva usando o [ColorPicker]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPalette.xml
msgid ""
"The [ColorPalette] resource is designed to store and manage a collection of "
"colors. This resource is useful in scenarios where a predefined set of "
"colors is required, such as for creating themes, designing user interfaces, "
"or managing game assets. The built-in [ColorPicker] control can also make "
"use of [ColorPalette] without additional code."
msgstr ""
"O recurso [ColorPalette] foi projetado para armazenar e gerenciar uma "
"coleção de cores. Este recurso é útil em cenários onde um conjunto "
"predefinido de cores é necessário, como para criar temas, projetar "
"interfaces de usuário ou gerenciar ativos de jogos. O controle [ColorPicker] "
"embutido também pode fazer uso de [ColorPalette] sem código adicional."

#: doc/classes/ColorPalette.xml
msgid "A [PackedColorArray] containing the colors in the palette."
msgstr "Um [PackedColorArray] contendo as cores na paleta."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "A widget that provides an interface for selecting or modifying a color."
msgstr ""
"Um widget que fornece uma interface para selecionar ou modificar uma cor."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"A widget that provides an interface for selecting or modifying a color. It "
"can optionally provide functionalities like a color sampler (eyedropper), "
"color modes, and presets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This control is the color picker widget itself. You can use a "
"[ColorPickerButton] instead if you need a button that brings up a "
"[ColorPicker] in a popup."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given color to a list of color presets. The presets are displayed "
"in the color picker and the user will be able to select them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The presets list is only for [i]this[/i] color picker."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given color to a list of color recent presets so that it can be "
"picked later. Recent presets are the colors that were picked recently, a new "
"preset is automatically created and added to recent presets when you pick a "
"new color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The recent presets list is only for [i]this[/i] color picker."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given color from the list of color presets of this color picker."
msgstr ""
"Remove a cor fornecida da lista de predefinições de cores deste seletor de "
"cores."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given color from the list of color recent presets of this color "
"picker."
msgstr ""
"Remove a cor fornecida da lista de predefinições recentes de cores deste "
"seletor de cores."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Returns the list of colors in the presets of the color picker."
msgstr "Retorna a lista de cores nos predefinições do seletor de cores."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Returns the list of colors in the recent presets of the color picker."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de cores nas recentes predefinições do seletor de cores."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it's possible to add presets under Swatches. If "
"[code]false[/code], the button to add presets is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Se [code] true [/code], é possível adicionar predefinições sob Amostras. Se "
"[code] false [/code], o botão para adicionar predefinições fica desativado."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "The currently selected color."
msgstr "A cor selecionada no momento."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The currently selected color mode."
msgstr "O modo de cor selecionado no momento."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color mode buttons are visible."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], os botões de modo de cor estarão visíveis."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the color will apply only after the user releases the "
"mouse button, otherwise it will apply immediately even in mouse motion event "
"(which can cause performance issues)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a cor será aplicada somente após o usuário soltar o "
"botão do mouse; caso contrário, ela será aplicada imediatamente, mesmo em "
"eventos de movimento do mouse (o que pode causar problemas de desempenho)."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows an alpha channel slider (opacity)."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], mostra um controle deslizante do canal alfa."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows an intensity slider. The intensity is applied as "
"follows: convert the color to linear encoding, multiply it by [code]2 ** "
"intensity[/code], and then convert it back to nonlinear sRGB encoding."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], mostra um controle deslizante de intensidade. A "
"intensidade é aplicada da seguinte forma: converte a cor para codificação "
"linear, multiplica por [code]2 ** intensity[/code] e depois a converte de "
"volta para a codificação sRGB não linear."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the hex color code input field is visible."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o campo de entrada de código de cor hexadecimal estará "
"visível."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The shape of the color space view."
msgstr "A forma da visualização do espaço de cores."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Swatches and Recent Colors presets are visible."
msgstr ""
"Se [code] Ativo [/code], as Amostras e as predefinições de Cores Recentes "
"ficam visíveis."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color sampler and color preview are visible."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o amostrador de cores e a visualização de cores ficam "
"visíveis."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the color sliders are visible."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], os controles deslizantes de cor estão visíveis."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Emitted when the color is changed."
msgstr "Emitido quando a cor muda."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Emitted when a preset is added."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma predefinição é adicionada."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Emitted when a preset is removed."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma predefinição é removida."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Red/Green/Blue sliders in sRGB color space."
msgstr ""
"Permite editar a cor com controles deslizantes de Vermelho/Verde/Azul no "
"espaço de cores sRGB."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Allows editing the color with Hue/Saturation/Value sliders."
msgstr ""
"Permite editar a cor com controles deslizantes de Matiz/Saturação/Valor."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "This is replaced by [constant MODE_LINEAR]."
msgstr "Isto é substituído por [constant MODE_LINEAR]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Red/Green/Blue sliders in linear color space."
msgstr ""
"Permite editar a cor com controles deslizantes de Vermelho/Verde/Azul no "
"espaço de cores linear."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Allows editing the color with Hue/Saturation/Lightness sliders.\n"
"OKHSL is a new color space similar to HSL but that better match perception "
"by leveraging the Oklab color space which is designed to be simple to use, "
"while doing a good job at predicting perceived lightness, chroma and hue.\n"
"[url=https://bottosson.github.io/posts/colorpicker/]Okhsv and Okhsl color "
"spaces[/url]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSV Color Model rectangle color space."
msgstr "Espaço de cores do retângulo do modelo de cores HSV."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSV Color Model rectangle color space with a wheel."
msgstr "Espaço de cores retangular do modelo de cores HSV com uma roda."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSV Color Model circle color space. Use Saturation as a radius."
msgstr ""
"Espaço de cores circular do modelo de cores HSV. Use a saturação como raio."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "HSL OK Color Model circle color space."
msgstr "Espaço de cores circular do Modelo de Cores HSL OK."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The color space shape and the shape select button are hidden. Can't be "
"selected from the shapes popup."
msgstr ""
"A forma do espaço de cor e o botão de seleção de forma ficam ocultos. Não "
"pode ser selecionado no pop-up de formas."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "OKHSL Color Model rectangle with constant lightness."
msgstr "Retângulo do Modelo de Cor OKHSL com leveza constante."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "OKHSL Color Model rectangle with constant saturation."
msgstr "Retângulo do Modelo de Cor OKHSL com saturação constante."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Color of rectangle or circle drawn when a picker shape part is focused but "
"not editable via keyboard or joypad. Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, "
"so a partially transparent color should be used to ensure the picker shape "
"remains visible."
msgstr ""
"Cor do retângulo ou círculo desenhado quando uma parte da forma do seletor "
"está focada, mas não editável via teclado ou joypad. Exibido [i]sobre[/i] a "
"forma do seletor, portanto, uma cor parcialmente transparente deve ser usada "
"para garantir que a forma do seletor permaneça visível."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the [theme_item Slider.center_grabber] theme property of the "
"sliders."
msgstr ""
"Substitui a propriedade de tema [theme_item Slider.center_grabber] dos "
"controles deslizantes."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The width of the hue selection slider."
msgstr "A largura do controle deslizante de seleção de tom."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The minimum width of the color labels next to sliders."
msgstr ""
"A largura mínima dos rótulos de cores ao lado dos controles deslizantes."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The margin around the [ColorPicker]."
msgstr "A margem ao redor do [ColorPicker]."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The height of the saturation-value selection box."
msgstr "A altura da caixa de seleção de saturação-valor."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The width of the saturation-value selection box."
msgstr "A largura da caixa de seleção de saturação-valor."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for the \"Add Preset\" button."
msgstr "O ícone para o botão \"Adicionar Predefinição\"."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The texture for the arrow grabber."
msgstr "A textura para o pegador de seta."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The icon for the button that copies the color in text format to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"O ícone para o botão que copia a cor em formato de texto para a área de "
"transferência."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "Custom texture for the hue selection slider on the right."
msgstr ""
"Textura personalizada para o controle deslizante de seleção de matiz à "
"direita."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for the button that switches color text to hexadecimal."
msgstr "O ícone para o botão que alterna o texto de cores para hexadecimal."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for color preset drop down menu when expanded."
msgstr ""
"O ícone para o menu suspenso de predefinição de cores quando expandido."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for color preset drop down menu when folded."
msgstr ""
"O ícone para o menu suspenso de predefinição de cores quando recolhido."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for color preset option menu."
msgstr "O ícone para o menu de opções de predefinições de cor."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The indicator used to signalize that the color value is outside the 0-1 "
"range."
msgstr ""
"O indicador usado para sinalizar que o valor de cor está fora do intervalo "
"de 0 a 1."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The image displayed over the color box/circle (depending on the [member "
"picker_shape]), marking the currently selected color."
msgstr ""
"A imagem exibida sobre a caixa/círculo de cores (dependendo de [member "
"picker_shape]), marcando a cor selecionada no momento."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The fill image displayed behind the picker cursor."
msgstr "A imagem de preenchimento exibida atrás do cursor do seletor."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Background panel for the color preview box (visible when the color is "
"translucent)."
msgstr ""
"Painel de fundo para a caixa de visualização de cores (visível quando a cor "
"é translúcida)."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The icon for the revert button (visible on the middle of the \"old\" color "
"when it differs from the currently selected color). This icon is modulated "
"with a dark color if the \"old\" color is bright enough, so the icon should "
"be bright to ensure visibility in both scenarios."
msgstr ""
"O ícone para o botão de reverter (visível no meio da cor \"antiga\" quando "
"difere da cor selecionada no momento). Este ícone é modulado com uma cor "
"escura se a cor \"antiga\" for brilhante o suficiente, portanto, o ícone "
"deve ser brilhante para garantir a visibilidade em ambos os cenários."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for the screen color picker button."
msgstr "O ícone para o botão seletor de cores da tela."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for circular picker shapes."
msgstr "O ícone para formas de seletor circulares."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for rectangular picker shapes."
msgstr "O ícone para formas de seleção retangulares."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid "The icon for rectangular wheel picker shapes."
msgstr "O ícone para formas de seletor de roda retangulares."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used when the circle-shaped part of the picker is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, so a partially transparent "
"[StyleBox] should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A "
"[StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline works well for this "
"purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] "
"resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/"
"controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"O [StyleBox] usado quando a parte em formato de círculo do seletor está "
"focada. Exibido [i]sobre[/i] a forma do seletor, portanto, um [StyleBox] "
"parcialmente transparente deve ser usado para garantir que a forma do "
"seletor permaneça visível. Um [StyleBox] que representa um contorno ou um "
"sublinhado funciona bem para este propósito. Para desativar o efeito visual "
"de foco, atribua um recurso [StyleBoxEmpty]. Note que desativar o efeito "
"visual de foco prejudicará a usabilidade da navegação por teclado/controle, "
"portanto, isso não é recomendado por motivos de acessibilidade."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used when the rectangle-shaped part of the picker is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the picker shape, so a partially transparent "
"[StyleBox] should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A "
"[StyleBox] that represents an outline or an underline works well for this "
"purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] "
"resource. Note that disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/"
"controller navigation usability, so this is not recommended for "
"accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] usado quando a parte em formato de retângulo do seletor está "
"focada. Exibido [i]sobre[/i] a forma do seletor, portanto, um [StyleBox] "
"parcialmente transparente deve ser usado para garantir que a forma do "
"seletor permaneça visível. Um [StyleBox] que representa um contorno ou um "
"sublinhado funciona bem para este propósito. Para desativar o efeito visual "
"de foco, atribua um recurso [StyleBoxEmpty]. Note que desativar o efeito "
"visual de foco prejudicará a usabilidade da navegação por teclado/controle, "
"portanto, isso não é recomendado por motivos de acessibilidade."

#: doc/classes/ColorPicker.xml
msgid ""
"The [StyleBox] used for the old color sample part when it is focused. "
"Displayed [i]over[/i] the sample, so a partially transparent [StyleBox] "
"should be used to ensure the picker shape remains visible. A [StyleBox] that "
"represents an outline or an underline works well for this purpose. To "
"disable the focus visual effect, assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note "
"that disabling the focus visual effect will harm keyboard/controller "
"navigation usability, so this is not recommended for accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"O [StyleBox] usado para a parte antiga da amostra de cor quando ela está "
"focada. Exibido [i]sobre[/i] a amostra, portanto, um [StyleBox] parcialmente "
"transparente deve ser usado para garantir que a forma do seletor permaneça "
"visível. Um [StyleBox] que representa um contorno ou um sublinhado funciona "
"bem para este propósito. Para desativar o efeito visual de foco, atribua um "
"recurso [StyleBoxEmpty]. Note que desativar o efeito visual de foco "
"prejudicará a usabilidade da navegação por teclado/controle, portanto, isso "
"não é recomendado por motivos de acessibilidade."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "A button that brings up a [ColorPicker] when pressed."
msgstr "Um botão que abre um [ColorPicker] quando pressionado."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Encapsulates a [ColorPicker], making it accessible by pressing a button. "
"Pressing the button will toggle the [ColorPicker]'s visibility.\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods "
"associated with this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, the button may not be wide enough for the color "
"preview swatch to be visible. Make sure to set [member "
"Control.custom_minimum_size] to a big enough value to give the button enough "
"space."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [ColorPicker] that this node toggles.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the control's [PopupPanel] which allows you to connect to popup "
"signals. This allows you to handle events when the ColorPicker is shown or "
"hidden.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the alpha channel in the displayed [ColorPicker] will "
"be visible."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o canal alfa no [ColorPicker] exibido estará visível."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the intensity slider in the displayed [ColorPicker] "
"will be visible."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o controle deslizante de intensidade no [ColorPicker] "
"exibido estará visível."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "Emitted when the color changes."
msgstr "Emitido quando a cor muda."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the [ColorPicker] is created (the button is pressed for the "
"first time)."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o [ColorPicker] é criado (o botão é pressionado pela primeira "
"vez)."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [ColorPicker] is closed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o [ColorPicker] é fechado."

#: doc/classes/ColorPickerButton.xml
msgid "The background of the color preview rect on the button."
msgstr "O fundo do retângulo de visualização de cores no botão."

#: doc/classes/ColorRect.xml
msgid "A control that displays a solid color rectangle."
msgstr "Um controle que exibe um retângulo de cor sólida."

#: doc/classes/ColorRect.xml
msgid ""
"Displays a rectangle filled with a solid [member color]. If you need to "
"display the border alone, consider using a [Panel] instead."
msgstr ""
"Exibe um retângulo preenchido com uma [member color] sólida. Se precisar "
"exibir apenas a borda, considere usar um [Panel] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/ColorRect.xml
msgid "The fill color of the rectangle."
msgstr "A cor de preenchimento do retângulo."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid ""
"More customization of the rendering pipeline will be added in the future."
msgstr ""
"Mais personalizações do pipeline de renderização serão adicionadas no futuro."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid "Stores attributes used to customize how a Viewport is rendered."
msgstr ""
"Armazena atributos usados para personalizar como um Viewport é renderizado."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid ""
"The compositor resource stores attributes used to customize how a [Viewport] "
"is rendered."
msgstr ""
"O recurso compositor armazena atributos usados para personalizar como um "
"[Viewport] é renderizado."

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid "The Compositor"
msgstr "O Compositor"

#: doc/classes/Compositor.xml
msgid ""
"The custom [CompositorEffect]s that are applied during rendering of "
"viewports using this compositor."
msgstr ""
"Os [CompositorEffect] personalizados que são aplicados durante a "
"renderização de viewports usando este compositor."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"The implementation may change as more of the rendering internals are exposed "
"over time."
msgstr ""
"A implementação pode mudar à medida que mais elementos internos de "
"renderização forem expostos ao longo do tempo."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid "This resource allows for creating a custom rendering effect."
msgstr "Este recurso permite criar um efeito de renderização personalizado."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"This resource defines a custom rendering effect that can be applied to "
"[Viewport]s through the viewports' [Environment]. You can implement a "
"callback that is called during rendering at a given stage of the rendering "
"pipeline and allows you to insert additional passes. Note that this callback "
"happens on the rendering thread. CompositorEffect is an abstract base class "
"and must be extended to implement specific rendering logic."
msgstr ""
"Este recurso define um efeito de renderização personalizado que pode ser "
"aplicado a [Viewport]s por meio do [Environment] das viewports. Você pode "
"implementar um callback que é chamado durante a renderização em um "
"determinado estágio do pipeline de renderização e permite inserir passes "
"adicionais. Note que este callback ocorre na thread de renderização. "
"CompositorEffect é uma classe base abstrata e deve ser estendida para "
"implementar a lógica de renderização específica."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this function with your custom rendering code. [param "
"effect_callback_type] should always match the effect callback type you've "
"specified in [member effect_callback_type]. [param render_data] provides "
"access to the rendering state, it is only valid during rendering and should "
"not be stored."
msgstr ""
"Implemente esta função com seu código de renderização personalizado. [param "
"effect_callback_type] deve sempre corresponder ao tipo de retorno de chamada "
"de efeito que você especificou em [member effect_callback_type]. [param "
"render_data] fornece acesso ao estado de renderização, sendo válido apenas "
"durante a renderização e não deve ser armazenado."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this will trigger a color buffer "
"resolve before the effect is run.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the resolved buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var color_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"color\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and MSAA is enabled, this will trigger a depth buffer "
"resolve before the effect is run.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the resolved buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var depth_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"render_buffers\", "
"\"depth\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"The type of effect that is implemented, determines at what stage of "
"rendering the callback is called."
msgstr ""
"O tipo de efeito que é implementado, determina em qual estágio da "
"renderização o callback é chamado."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this rendering effect is applied to any viewport it is "
"added to."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], este efeito de renderização é aplicado a qualquer "
"viewport à qual seja adicionado."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers motion vectors being calculated during "
"the opaque render state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the motion vector "
"buffer use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var motion_buffer = render_scene_buffers.get_velocity_texture()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers normal and roughness data to be output "
"during our depth pre-pass, only applicable for the Forward+ renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [method _render_callback], to access the roughness buffer "
"use:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var render_scene_buffers = render_data.get_render_scene_buffers()\n"
"var roughness_buffer = "
"render_scene_buffers.get_texture(\"forward_clustered\", "
"\"normal_roughness\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The raw normal and roughness buffer is stored in an optimized format, "
"different than the one available in Spatial shaders. When sampling the "
"buffer, a conversion function must be applied. Use this function, copied "
"from [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"da5f39889f155658cef7f7ec3cc1abb94e17d815/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/"
"shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl#L334-L341]here[/"
"url]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"vec4 normal_roughness_compatibility(vec4 p_normal_roughness) {\n"
"\tfloat roughness = p_normal_roughness.w;\n"
"\tif (roughness > 0.5) {\n"
"\t\troughness = 1.0 - roughness;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\troughness /= (127.0 / 255.0);\n"
"\treturn vec4(normalize(p_normal_roughness.xyz * 2.0 - 1.0) * 0.5 + 0.5, "
"roughness);\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this triggers specular data being rendered to a "
"separate buffer and combined after effects have been applied, only "
"applicable for the Forward+ renderer."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], isso aciona a renderização de dados especulares em um "
"buffer separado e a combinação após a aplicação de efeitos, aplicável apenas "
"para o renderizador Forward+."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called before our opaque rendering pass, but after depth "
"prepass (if applicable)."
msgstr ""
"O callback é chamado antes da nossa passagem de renderização opaca, mas após "
"a pré-passagem de profundidade (se aplicável)."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called after our opaque rendering pass, but before our sky "
"is rendered."
msgstr ""
"O callback é chamado após nossa passagem de renderização opaca, mas antes "
"que nosso céu seja renderizado."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called after our sky is rendered, but before our back "
"buffers are created (and if enabled, before subsurface scattering and/or "
"screen space reflections)."
msgstr ""
"O retorno de chamada é chamado após o nosso céu ser renderizado, mas antes "
"que nossos buffers posteriores sejam criados (e, se ativado, antes do "
"espalhamento subsurface e/ou reflexões em espaço de tela)."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called before our transparent rendering pass, but after our "
"sky is rendered and we've created our back buffers."
msgstr ""
"O callback é chamado antes da nossa passagem de renderização transparente, "
"mas depois que nosso céu é renderizado e criamos nossos buffers traseiros."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"The callback is called after our transparent rendering pass, but before any "
"built-in post-processing effects and output to our render target."
msgstr ""
"O callback é chamado após nossa passagem de renderização transparente, mas "
"antes de quaisquer efeitos de pós-processamento integrados e saída para "
"nosso destino de renderização."

#: doc/classes/CompositorEffect.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EffectCallbackType] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum EffectCallbackType]."

#: doc/classes/CompressedCubemap.xml
msgid "An optionally compressed [Cubemap]."
msgstr "Um [Cubemap] opcionalmente compactado."

#: doc/classes/CompressedCubemap.xml
msgid ""
"A cubemap that is loaded from a [code].ccube[/code] file. This file format "
"is internal to Godot; it is created by importing other image formats with "
"the import system. [CompressedCubemap] can use one of 4 compression "
"methods:\n"
"- Lossless (WebP or PNG, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Lossy (WebP, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Compressed (compressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Uncompressed (uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (compressed on the GPU. Lower file sizes than VRAM "
"Compressed, but slower to compress and lower quality than VRAM Compressed)\n"
"Only [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] actually reduces the memory usage on the GPU. "
"The [b]Lossless[/b] and [b]Lossy[/b] compression methods will reduce the "
"required storage on disk, but they will not reduce memory usage on the GPU "
"as the texture is sent to the GPU uncompressed.\n"
"Using [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] also improves loading times, as VRAM-compressed "
"textures are faster to load compared to textures using lossless or lossy "
"compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable artifacts and is "
"intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D.\n"
"See [Cubemap] for a general description of cubemaps."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompressedCubemapArray.xml
msgid "An optionally compressed [CubemapArray]."
msgstr "Um [CubemapArray] opcionalmente compactado."

#: doc/classes/CompressedCubemapArray.xml
msgid ""
"A cubemap array that is loaded from a [code].ccubearray[/code] file. This "
"file format is internal to Godot; it is created by importing other image "
"formats with the import system. [CompressedCubemapArray] can use one of 4 "
"compression methods:\n"
"- Lossless (WebP or PNG, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Lossy (WebP, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Compressed (compressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Uncompressed (uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (compressed on the GPU. Lower file sizes than VRAM "
"Compressed, but slower to compress and lower quality than VRAM Compressed)\n"
"Only [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] actually reduces the memory usage on the GPU. "
"The [b]Lossless[/b] and [b]Lossy[/b] compression methods will reduce the "
"required storage on disk, but they will not reduce memory usage on the GPU "
"as the texture is sent to the GPU uncompressed.\n"
"Using [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] also improves loading times, as VRAM-compressed "
"textures are faster to load compared to textures using lossless or lossy "
"compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable artifacts and is "
"intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D.\n"
"See [CubemapArray] for a general description of cubemap arrays."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid "Texture with 2 dimensions, optionally compressed."
msgstr "Textura com 2 dimensões, opcionalmente comprimida."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"A texture that is loaded from a [code].ctex[/code] file. This file format is "
"internal to Godot; it is created by importing other image formats with the "
"import system. [CompressedTexture2D] can use one of 4 compression methods "
"(including a lack of any compression):\n"
"- Lossless (WebP or PNG, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Lossy (WebP, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Compressed (compressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Uncompressed (uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (compressed on the GPU. Lower file sizes than VRAM "
"Compressed, but slower to compress and lower quality than VRAM Compressed)\n"
"Only [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] actually reduces the memory usage on the GPU. "
"The [b]Lossless[/b] and [b]Lossy[/b] compression methods will reduce the "
"required storage on disk, but they will not reduce memory usage on the GPU "
"as the texture is sent to the GPU uncompressed.\n"
"Using [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] also improves loading times, as VRAM-compressed "
"textures are faster to load compared to textures using lossless or lossy "
"compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable artifacts and is "
"intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture2D.xml doc/classes/CompressedTexture3D.xml
msgid "Loads the texture from the specified [param path]."
msgstr "Carrega a textura do [param path] especificado."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid "The [CompressedTexture2D]'s file path to a [code].ctex[/code] file."
msgstr ""
"O caminho de arquivo do [CompressedTexture2D] para um arquivo [code].ctex[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture2DArray.xml
msgid "Array of 2-dimensional textures, optionally compressed."
msgstr "Array de texturas bidimensionais, opcionalmente comprimidas."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture2DArray.xml
msgid ""
"A texture array that is loaded from a [code].ctexarray[/code] file. This "
"file format is internal to Godot; it is created by importing other image "
"formats with the import system. [CompressedTexture2DArray] can use one of 4 "
"compression methods:\n"
"- Lossless (WebP or PNG, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Lossy (WebP, uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Compressed (compressed on the GPU)\n"
"- VRAM Uncompressed (uncompressed on the GPU)\n"
"- Basis Universal (compressed on the GPU. Lower file sizes than VRAM "
"Compressed, but slower to compress and lower quality than VRAM Compressed)\n"
"Only [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] actually reduces the memory usage on the GPU. "
"The [b]Lossless[/b] and [b]Lossy[/b] compression methods will reduce the "
"required storage on disk, but they will not reduce memory usage on the GPU "
"as the texture is sent to the GPU uncompressed.\n"
"Using [b]VRAM Compressed[/b] also improves loading times, as VRAM-compressed "
"textures are faster to load compared to textures using lossless or lossy "
"compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable artifacts and is "
"intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D.\n"
"See [Texture2DArray] for a general description of texture arrays."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture3D.xml
msgid "Texture with 3 dimensions, optionally compressed."
msgstr "Textura com 3 dimensões, opcionalmente comprimida."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"[CompressedTexture3D] is the VRAM-compressed counterpart of "
"[ImageTexture3D]. The file extension for [CompressedTexture3D] files is "
"[code].ctex3d[/code]. This file format is internal to Godot; it is created "
"by importing other image formats with the import system.\n"
"[CompressedTexture3D] uses VRAM compression, which allows to reduce memory "
"usage on the GPU when rendering the texture. This also improves loading "
"times, as VRAM-compressed textures are faster to load compared to textures "
"using lossless compression. VRAM compression can exhibit noticeable "
"artifacts and is intended to be used for 3D rendering, not 2D.\n"
"See [Texture3D] for a general description of 3D textures."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CompressedTexture3D.xml
msgid "The [CompressedTexture3D]'s file path to a [code].ctex3d[/code] file."
msgstr ""
"O caminho de arquivo do [CompressedTexture3D] para um arquivo [code].ctex3d[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTextureLayered.xml
msgid "Base class for texture arrays that can optionally be compressed."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para matrizes de textura que opcionalmente podem ser compactadas."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTextureLayered.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for [CompressedTexture2DArray] and [CompressedTexture3D]. Cannot "
"be used directly, but contains all the functions necessary for accessing the "
"derived resource types. See also [TextureLayered]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para [CompressedTexture2DArray] e [CompressedTexture3D]. Não "
"pode ser usada diretamente, mas contém todas as funções necessárias para "
"acessar os tipos de recursos derivados. Veja também [TextureLayered]."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTextureLayered.xml
msgid "Loads the texture at [param path]."
msgstr "Carrega a textura em [param path]."

#: doc/classes/CompressedTextureLayered.xml
msgid "The path the texture should be loaded from."
msgstr "O caminho de onde a textura deve ser carregada."

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape2D.xml
msgid "A 2D polyline shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Uma forma de polilinha 2D usada para colisão física."

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D polyline shape, intended for use in physics. Used internally in "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] when it's in [constant "
"CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SEGMENTS] mode.\n"
"Being just a collection of interconnected line segments, "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D] is the most freely configurable single 2D shape. It "
"can be used to form polygons of any nature, or even shapes that don't "
"enclose an area. However, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is [i]hollow[/i] even if "
"the interconnected line segments do enclose an area, which often makes it "
"unsuitable for physics or detection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used for collision, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is intended to "
"work with static [CollisionShape2D] nodes like [StaticBody2D] and will "
"likely not behave well for [CharacterBody2D]s or [RigidBody2D]s in a mode "
"other than Static.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Physics bodies that are small have a chance to clip through "
"this shape when moving fast. This happens because on one frame, the physics "
"body may be on the \"outside\" of the shape, and on the next frame it may be "
"\"inside\" it. [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is hollow, so it won't detect a "
"collision.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Due to its complexity, [ConcavePolygonShape2D] is the "
"slowest 2D collision shape to check collisions against. Its use should "
"generally be limited to level geometry. If the polyline is closed, "
"[CollisionPolygon2D]'s [constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS] mode can "
"be used, which decomposes the polygon into convex ones; see "
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D]'s documentation for instructions."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"The array of points that make up the [ConcavePolygonShape2D]'s line "
"segments. The array (of length divisible by two) is naturally divided into "
"pairs (one pair for each segment); each pair consists of the starting point "
"of a segment and the endpoint of a segment."
msgstr ""
"A matriz de pontos que compõem os segmentos de linha do "
"[ConcavePolygonShape2D]. A matriz (de comprimento divisível por dois) é "
"dividida naturalmente em pares (um par para cada segmento); cada par "
"consiste no ponto inicial de um segmento e no ponto final de um segmento."

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape3D.xml
msgid "A 3D trimesh shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Uma forma de malha triangular 3D usada para colisão física."

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D trimesh shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to provide a "
"shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"Being just a collection of interconnected triangles, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] "
"is the most freely configurable single 3D shape. It can be used to form "
"polyhedra of any nature, or even shapes that don't enclose a volume. "
"However, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is [i]hollow[/i] even if the interconnected "
"triangles do enclose a volume, which often makes it unsuitable for physics "
"or detection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used for collision, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is intended to "
"work with static [CollisionShape3D] nodes like [StaticBody3D] and will "
"likely not behave well for [CharacterBody3D]s or [RigidBody3D]s in a mode "
"other than Static.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Physics bodies that are small have a chance to clip through "
"this shape when moving fast. This happens because on one frame, the physics "
"body may be on the \"outside\" of the shape, and on the next frame it may be "
"\"inside\" it. [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is hollow, so it won't detect a "
"collision.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] Due to its complexity, [ConcavePolygonShape3D] is the "
"slowest 3D collision shape to check collisions against. Its use should "
"generally be limited to level geometry. For convex geometry, "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] should be used. For dynamic physics bodies that need "
"concave collision, several [ConvexPolygonShape3D]s can be used to represent "
"its collision by using convex decomposition; see [ConvexPolygonShape3D]'s "
"documentation for instructions."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the faces of the trimesh shape as an array of vertices. The array "
"(of length divisible by three) is naturally divided into triples; each "
"triple of vertices defines a triangle."
msgstr ""
"Retorna as faces da malha trimesh como uma matriz de vértices. A matriz (de "
"comprimento divisível por três) é dividida naturalmente em triplas; cada "
"tripla de vértices define um triângulo."

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the faces of the trimesh shape from an array of vertices. The [param "
"faces] array should be composed of triples such that each triple of vertices "
"defines a triangle."
msgstr ""
"Define as faces da forma trimesh a partir de um array de vértices. O array "
"[param faces] deve ser composto por triplas de modo que cada tripla de "
"vértices defina um triângulo."

#: doc/classes/ConcavePolygonShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], collisions occur on both sides of the concave "
"shape faces. Otherwise they occur only along the face normals."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], ocorrem colisões em ambos os lados das "
"faces da forma côncava. Caso contrário, ocorrem apenas ao longo das normais "
"das faces."

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 3D physics bodies in a way that simulates "
"a ball-and-socket joint."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta física que conecta dois corpos físicos 3D de uma maneira que "
"simula uma junta esférica."

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that connects two 3D physics bodies in a way that simulates "
"a ball-and-socket joint. The twist axis is initiated as the X axis of the "
"[ConeTwistJoint3D]. Once the physics bodies swing, the twist axis is "
"calculated as the middle of the X axes of the joint in the local space of "
"the two physics bodies. Useful for limbs like shoulders and hips, lamps "
"hanging off a ceiling, etc."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta de física que conecta dois corpos físicos 3D de maneira a simular "
"uma junta esférica. O eixo de torção é iniciado como o eixo X do "
"[ConeTwistJoint3D]. Assim que os corpos físicos oscilam, o eixo de torção é "
"calculado como o meio dos eixos X da junta no espaço local dos dois corpos "
"físicos. Útil para membros como ombros e quadris, lâmpadas penduradas no "
"teto, etc."

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
#: doc/classes/PinJoint3D.xml
msgid "Returns the value of the specified parameter."
msgstr "Retorna o valor do parâmetro especificado."

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
#: doc/classes/PinJoint3D.xml
msgid "Sets the value of the specified parameter."
msgstr "Define o valor do parâmetro especificado."

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The speed with which the swing or twist will take place.\n"
"The higher, the faster."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Defines, how fast the swing- and twist-speed-difference on both sides gets "
"synced."
msgstr ""
"Define quão rápido a diferença de velocidade de oscilação e torção em ambos "
"os lados é sincronizada."

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The ease with which the joint starts to twist. If it's too low, it takes "
"more force to start twisting the joint."
msgstr ""
"A facilidade com que a junta começa a torcer. Se for muito baixa, é "
"necessária mais força para começar a torcer a junta."

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Swing is rotation from side to side, around the axis perpendicular to the "
"twist axis.\n"
"The swing span defines, how much rotation will not get corrected along the "
"swing axis.\n"
"Could be defined as looseness in the [ConeTwistJoint3D].\n"
"If below 0.05, this behavior is locked."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Twist is the rotation around the twist axis, this value defined how far the "
"joint can twist.\n"
"Twist is locked if below 0.05."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConeTwistJoint3D.xml doc/classes/Generic6DOFJoint3D.xml
#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml doc/classes/Light3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Param] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum Param]."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid "Helper class to handle INI-style files."
msgstr "Classe auxiliar para manipular arquivos no estilo INI."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"This helper class can be used to store [Variant] values on the filesystem "
"using INI-style formatting. The stored values are identified by a section "
"and a key:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"[section]\n"
"some_key=42\n"
"string_example=\"Hello World3D!\"\n"
"a_vector=Vector3(1, 0, 2)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The stored data can be saved to or parsed from a file, though ConfigFile "
"objects can also be used directly without accessing the filesystem.\n"
"The following example shows how to create a simple [ConfigFile] and save it "
"on disc:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Create new ConfigFile object.\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Store some values.\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10)\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001)\n"
"\n"
"# Save it to a file (overwrite if already exists).\n"
"config.save(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Create new ConfigFile object.\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// Store some values.\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10);\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001);\n"
"\n"
"// Save it to a file (overwrite if already exists).\n"
"config.Save(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This example shows how the above file could be loaded:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var score_data = {}\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Load data from a file.\n"
"var err = config.load(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"\n"
"# If the file didn't load, ignore it.\n"
"if err != OK:\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\n"
"# Iterate over all sections.\n"
"for player in config.get_sections():\n"
"\t# Fetch the data for each section.\n"
"\tvar player_name = config.get_value(player, \"player_name\")\n"
"\tvar player_score = config.get_value(player, \"best_score\")\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var score_data = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// Load data from a file.\n"
"Error err = config.Load(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"\n"
"// If the file didn't load, ignore it.\n"
"if (err != Error.Ok)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Iterate over all sections.\n"
"foreach (String player in config.GetSections())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Fetch the data for each section.\n"
"\tvar player_name = (String)config.GetValue(player, \"player_name\");\n"
"\tvar player_score = (int)config.GetValue(player, \"best_score\");\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Any operation that mutates the ConfigFile such as [method set_value], "
"[method clear], or [method erase_section], only changes what is loaded in "
"memory. If you want to write the change to a file, you have to save the "
"changes with [method save], [method save_encrypted], or [method "
"save_encrypted_pass].\n"
"Keep in mind that section and property names can't contain spaces. Anything "
"after a space will be ignored on save and on load.\n"
"ConfigFiles can also contain manually written comment lines starting with a "
"semicolon ([code];[/code]). Those lines will be ignored when parsing the "
"file. Note that comments will be lost when saving the ConfigFile. This can "
"still be useful for dedicated server configuration files, which are "
"typically never overwritten without explicit user action.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The file extension given to a ConfigFile does not have any "
"impact on its formatting or behavior. By convention, the [code].cfg[/code] "
"extension is used here, but any other extension such as [code].ini[/code] is "
"also valid. Since neither [code].cfg[/code] nor [code].ini[/code] are "
"standardized, Godot's ConfigFile formatting may differ from files written by "
"other programs."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe auxiliar pode ser usada para armazenar valores de [Variant] no "
"sistema de arquivos usando a formatação no estilo INI. Os valores "
"armazenados são identificados por uma seção e uma chave:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"[section]\n"
"some_key=42\n"
"string_example=\"Hello World3D!\"\n"
"a_vector=Vector3(1, 0, 2)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Os dados armazenados podem ser salvos em um arquivo ou analisados a partir "
"dele, embora objetos ConfigFile também possam ser usados diretamente sem "
"acessar o sistema de arquivos.\n"
"O exemplo a seguir mostra como criar um [ConfigFile] simples e salvá-lo no "
"disco:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Cria um novo objeto ConfigFile.\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Armazena alguns valores.\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10)\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\")\n"
"config.set_value(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001)\n"
"\n"
"# Salva em um arquivo (sobrescreve se já existir).\n"
"config.save(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Cria um novo objeto ConfigFile.\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// Armazena alguns valores.\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"player_name\", \"Steve\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player1\", \"best_score\", 10);\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"player_name\", \"V3geta\");\n"
"config.SetValue(\"Player2\", \"best_score\", 9001);\n"
"\n"
"// Salva em um arquivo (sobrescreve se já existir).\n"
"config.Save(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Este exemplo mostra como o arquivo acima poderia ser carregado:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var score_data = {}\n"
"var config = ConfigFile.new()\n"
"\n"
"# Carrega os dados de um arquivo.\n"
"var err = config.load(\"user://scores.cfg\")\n"
"\n"
"# Se o arquivo não carregar, ignora.\n"
"if err != OK:\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\n"
"# Itera sobre todas as seções.\n"
"for player in config.get_sections():\n"
"\t# Busca os dados de cada seção.\n"
"\tvar player_name = config.get_value(player, \"player_name\")\n"
"\tvar player_score = config.get_value(player, \"best_score\")\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var score_data = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"var config = new ConfigFile();\n"
"\n"
"// Carrega os dados de um arquivo.\n"
"Error err = config.Load(\"user://scores.cfg\");\n"
"\n"
"// Se o arquivo não carregar, ignora.\n"
"if (err != Error.Ok)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Itera sobre todas as seções.\n"
"foreach (String player in config.GetSections())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Busca os dados de cada seção.\n"
"\tvar player_name = (String)config.GetValue(player, \"player_name\");\n"
"\tvar player_score = (int)config.GetValue(player, \"best_score\");\n"
"\tscore_data[player_name] = player_score;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Qualquer operação que altere o ConfigFile, como [method set_value], [method "
"clear] ou [method erase_section], altera apenas o que está carregado na "
"memória. Se você quiser gravar a alteração em um arquivo, precisará salvar "
"as modificações com [method save], [method save_encrypted] ou [method "
"save_encrypted_pass].\n"
"Tenha em mente que os nomes de seções e propriedades não podem conter "
"espaços. Qualquer coisa após um espaço será ignorada ao salvar e ao "
"carregar.\n"
"Os ConfigFiles também podem conter linhas de comentário escritas manualmente "
"começando com um ponto e vírgula ([code];[/code]). Essas linhas serão "
"ignoradas ao analisar o arquivo. Note que os comentários serão perdidos ao "
"salvar o ConfigFile. Isso ainda pode ser útil para arquivos de configuração "
"de servidores dedicados, que normalmente nunca são sobrescritos sem uma ação "
"explícita do usuário.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A extensão de arquivo dada a um ConfigFile não tem nenhum "
"impacto em sua formatação ou comportamento. Por convenção, a extensão "
"[code].cfg[/code] é usada aqui, mas qualquer outra extensão, como "
"[code].ini[/code], também é válida. Como nem a [code].cfg[/code] nem a "
"[code].ini[/code] são padronizadas, a formatação de ConfigFile do Godot pode "
"diferir de arquivos gravados por outros programas."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid "Removes the entire contents of the config."
msgstr "Remove todo o conteúdo da configuração."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Obtain the text version of this config file (the same text that would be "
"written to a file)."
msgstr ""
"Obtenha a versão de texto deste arquivo de configuração (o mesmo texto que "
"seria gravado em um arquivo)."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Deletes the specified section along with all the key-value pairs inside. "
"Raises an error if the section does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Exclui a seção especificada junto com todos os pares chave-valor internos. "
"Gera um erro se a seção não existir."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Deletes the specified key in a section. Raises an error if either the "
"section or the key do not exist."
msgstr ""
"Exclui a chave especificada em uma seção. Gera um erro se a seção ou a chave "
"não existirem."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all defined key identifiers in the specified section. "
"Raises an error and returns an empty array if the section does not exist."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um array de todos os identificadores de chave definidos na seção "
"especificada. Gera um erro e retorna um array vazio se a seção não existir."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid "Returns an array of all defined section identifiers."
msgstr "Retorna um array de todos os identificadores de seção definidos."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current value for the specified section and key. If either the "
"section or the key do not exist, the method returns the fallback [param "
"default] value. If [param default] is not specified or set to [code]null[/"
"code], an error is also raised."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor atual para a seção e chave especificadas. Se a seção ou a "
"chave não existirem, o método retornará o valor de fallback [param default]. "
"Se [param default] não for especificado ou definido como [code]null[/code], "
"um erro também será gerado."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified section exists."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se a seção especificada existir."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified section-key pair exists."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o par seção-chave especificado existir."

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Loads the config file specified as a parameter. The file's contents are "
"parsed and loaded in the [ConfigFile] object which the method was called "
"on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Loads the encrypted config file specified as a parameter, using the provided "
"[param key] to decrypt it. The file's contents are parsed and loaded in the "
"[ConfigFile] object which the method was called on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Loads the encrypted config file specified as a parameter, using the provided "
"[param password] to decrypt it. The file's contents are parsed and loaded in "
"the [ConfigFile] object which the method was called on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Parses the passed string as the contents of a config file. The string is "
"parsed and loaded in the ConfigFile object which the method was called on.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the contents of the [ConfigFile] object to the file specified as a "
"parameter. The output file uses an INI-style structure.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the contents of the [ConfigFile] object to the AES-256 encrypted file "
"specified as a parameter, using the provided [param key] to encrypt it. The "
"output file uses an INI-style structure.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the contents of the [ConfigFile] object to the AES-256 encrypted file "
"specified as a parameter, using the provided [param password] to encrypt it. "
"The output file uses an INI-style structure.\n"
"Returns [constant OK] on success, or one of the other [enum Error] values if "
"the operation failed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfigFile.xml
msgid ""
"Assigns a value to the specified key of the specified section. If either the "
"section or the key do not exist, they are created. Passing a [code]null[/"
"code] value deletes the specified key if it exists, and deletes the section "
"if it ends up empty once the key has been removed."
msgstr ""
"Atribui um valor à chave especificada da seção especificada. Se a seção ou a "
"chave não existirem, elas serão criadas. Passar um valor [code]null[/code] "
"exclui a chave especificada se ela existir e exclui a seção se ela ficar "
"vazia assim que a chave for removida."

#: doc/classes/ConfirmationDialog.xml
msgid "A dialog used for confirmation of actions."
msgstr "Um diálogo usado para confirmação de ações."

#: doc/classes/ConfirmationDialog.xml
msgid ""
"A dialog used for confirmation of actions. This window is similar to "
"[AcceptDialog], but pressing its Cancel button can have a different outcome "
"from pressing the OK button. The order of the two buttons varies depending "
"on the host OS.\n"
"To get cancel action, you can use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_cancel_button().pressed.connect(_on_canceled)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetCancelButton().Pressed += OnCanceled;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [AcceptDialog] is invisible by default. To make it visible, "
"call one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such "
"as [method Window.popup_centered_clamped]."
msgstr ""
"Uma caixa de diálogo usada para confirmação de ações. Esta janela é "
"semelhante ao [AcceptDialog], mas pressionar seu botão Cancelar pode ter um "
"resultado diferente de pressionar o botão OK. A ordem dos dois botões varia "
"dependendo do sistema operacional hospedeiro.\n"
"Para obter a ação de cancelamento, você pode usar:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_cancel_button().pressed.connect(_on_canceled)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetCancelButton().Pressed += OnCanceled;\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O [AcceptDialog] fica invisível por padrão. Para torná-lo "
"visível, chame um dos métodos [code]popup_*[/code] da [Window] no nó, como "
"[method Window.popup_centered_clamped]."

#: doc/classes/ConfirmationDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the cancel button.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConfirmationDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The text displayed by the cancel button (see [method get_cancel_button])."
msgstr ""
"O texto exibido pelo botão cancelar (consulte [method get_cancel_button])."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid "Base class for all GUI containers."
msgstr "Classe base para todos os recipientes de GUI."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for all GUI containers. A [Container] automatically arranges its "
"child controls in a certain way. This class can be inherited to make custom "
"container types."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para todos os contêineres de GUI. Um [Container] organiza "
"automaticamente seus controles filhos de uma certa maneira. Esta classe pode "
"ser herdada para criar tipos de contêiner personalizados."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"Implement to return a list of allowed horizontal [enum Control.SizeFlags] "
"for child nodes. This doesn't technically prevent the usages of any other "
"size flags, if your implementation requires that. This only limits the "
"options available to the user in the Inspector dock.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Having no size flags is equal to having [constant "
"Control.SIZE_SHRINK_BEGIN]. As such, this value is always implicitly allowed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"Implement to return a list of allowed vertical [enum Control.SizeFlags] for "
"child nodes. This doesn't technically prevent the usages of any other size "
"flags, if your implementation requires that. This only limits the options "
"available to the user in the Inspector dock.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Having no size flags is equal to having [constant "
"Control.SIZE_SHRINK_BEGIN]. As such, this value is always implicitly allowed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"Fit a child control in a given rect. This is mainly a helper for creating "
"custom container classes."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta um controle filho em um retângulo dado. Isso é principalmente um "
"auxiliar para criar classes de container personalizadas."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"Queue resort of the contained children. This is called automatically anyway, "
"but can be called upon request."
msgstr ""
"Coloca em fila a reorganização dos filhos contidos. Isso é chamado "
"automaticamente de qualquer maneira, mas pode ser chamado sob demanda."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this container is marked as a region for "
"accessibility. Use [member Control.accessibility_name] to give the region a "
"descriptive name. Screen readers can navigate between regions using landmark "
"navigation."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], este contêiner é marcado como uma região para "
"acessibilidade. Use [member Control.accessibility_name] para dar à região um "
"nome descritivo. Leitores de tela podem navegar entre regiões usando "
"navegação por marcos."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid "Emitted when children are going to be sorted."
msgstr "Emitido quando os filhos estão prestes a ser ordenados."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid "Emitted when sorting the children is needed."
msgstr "Emitido quando se é necessário organizar os filhos."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"Notification just before children are going to be sorted, in case there's "
"something to process beforehand."
msgstr ""
"Notificação imediatamente antes que os filhos sejam ordenados, caso haja "
"algo a ser processado antecipadamente."

#: doc/classes/Container.xml
msgid ""
"Notification for when sorting the children, it must be obeyed immediately."
msgstr ""
"Notificação para quando ordenar os filhos, deve ser obedecida imediatamente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for all GUI controls. Adapts its position and size based on its "
"parent control."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para todos os controles de GUI. Adapta sua posição e tamanho com "
"base em seu controle pai."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for all UI-related nodes. [Control] features a bounding rectangle "
"that defines its extents, an anchor position relative to its parent control "
"or the current viewport, and offsets relative to the anchor. The offsets "
"update automatically when the node, any of its parents, or the screen size "
"change.\n"
"For more information on Godot's UI system, anchors, offsets, and containers, "
"see the related tutorials in the manual. To build flexible UIs, you'll need "
"a mix of UI elements that inherit from [Control] and [Container] nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since both [Node2D] and [Control] inherit from [CanvasItem], "
"they share several concepts from the class such as the [member "
"CanvasItem.z_index] and [member CanvasItem.visible] properties.\n"
"[b]User Interface nodes and input[/b]\n"
"Godot propagates input events via viewports. Each [Viewport] is responsible "
"for propagating [InputEvent]s to their child nodes. As the [member "
"SceneTree.root] is a [Window], this already happens automatically for all UI "
"elements in your game.\n"
"Input events are propagated through the [SceneTree] from the root node to "
"all child nodes by calling [method Node._input]. For UI elements "
"specifically, it makes more sense to override the virtual method [method "
"_gui_input], which filters out unrelated input events, such as by checking z-"
"order, [member mouse_filter], focus, or if the event was inside of the "
"control's bounding box.\n"
"Call [method accept_event] so no other node receives the event. Once you "
"accept an input, it becomes handled so [method Node._unhandled_input] will "
"not process it.\n"
"Only one [Control] node can be in focus. Only the node in focus will receive "
"events. To get the focus, call [method grab_focus]. [Control] nodes lose "
"focus when another node grabs it, or if you hide the node in focus. Focus "
"will not be represented visually if gained via mouse/touch input, only "
"appearing with keyboard/gamepad input (for accessibility), or via [method "
"grab_focus].\n"
"Set [member mouse_filter] to [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] to tell a "
"[Control] node to ignore mouse or touch events. You'll need it if you place "
"an icon on top of a button.\n"
"[Theme] resources change the control's appearance. The [member theme] of a "
"[Control] node affects all of its direct and indirect children (as long as a "
"chain of controls is uninterrupted). To override some of the theme items, "
"call one of the [code]add_theme_*_override[/code] methods, like [method "
"add_theme_font_override]. You can also override theme items in the "
"Inspector.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Theme items are [i]not[/i] [Object] properties. This means you "
"can't access their values using [method Object.get] and [method Object.set]. "
"Instead, use the [code]get_theme_*[/code] and [code]add_theme_*_override[/"
"code] methods provided by this class."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para todos os nós relacionados à interface do usuário (UI). "
"[Control] apresenta um retângulo delimitador que define suas extensões, uma "
"posição de ancoragem relativa ao seu controle pai ou à viewport atual, e "
"deslocamentos (offsets) relativos à ancoragem. Os deslocamentos são "
"atualizados automaticamente quando o nó, qualquer um de seus pais ou o "
"tamanho da tela mudam.\n"
"Para mais informações sobre o sistema de UI do Godot, ancoragens, "
"deslocamentos e contêineres, veja os tutoriais relacionados no manual. Para "
"construir UIs flexíveis, você precisará de uma mistura de elementos de UI "
"que herdam de nós [Control] e [Container].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Como [Node2D] e [Control] herdam de [CanvasItem], eles "
"compartilham vários conceitos da classe, como as propriedades [member "
"CanvasItem.z_index] e [member CanvasItem.visible].\n"
"[b]Nós de Interface de Usuário e entrada[/b]\n"
"O Godot propaga eventos de entrada via viewports. Cada [Viewport] é "
"responsável por propagar [InputEvent]s para seus nós filhos. Como o [member "
"SceneTree.root] é uma [Window], isso já acontece automaticamente para todos "
"os elementos de UI no seu jogo.\n"
"Eventos de entrada são propagados através da [SceneTree] do nó raiz para "
"todos os nós filhos chamando [method Node._input]. Para elementos de UI "
"especificamente, faz mais sentido sobrescrever o método virtual [method "
"_gui_input], que filtra eventos de entrada não relacionados, como "
"verificando a ordem Z, [member mouse_filter], foco, ou se o evento ocorreu "
"dentro da caixa delimitadora do controle.\n"
"Chame [method accept_event] para que nenhum outro nó receba o evento. Uma "
"vez que você aceita uma entrada, ela se torna processada para que [method "
"Node._unhandled_input] não a processe.\n"
"Apenas um nó [Control] pode estar em foco. Apenas o nó em foco receberá "
"eventos. Para obter o foco, chame [method grab_focus]. Nós [Control] perdem "
"o foco quando outro nó o captura, ou se você ocultar o nó em foco. O foco "
"não será representado visualmente se obtido via entrada de mouse/toque, "
"aparecendo apenas com entrada de teclado/gamepad (para acessibilidade), ou "
"via [method grab_focus].\n"
"Defina [member mouse_filter] como [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] para dizer "
"a um nó [Control] para ignorar eventos de mouse ou toque. Você precisará "
"disso se colocar um ícone em cima de um botão.\n"
"Recursos [Theme] alteram a aparência do controle. O [member theme] de um nó "
"[Control] afeta todos os seus filhos diretos e indiretos (contanto que a "
"cadeia de controles seja ininterrupta). Para sobrescrever alguns itens de "
"tema, chame um dos métodos [code]add_theme_*_override[/code], como [method "
"add_theme_font_override]. Você também pode sobrescrever itens de tema no "
"Inspetor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Itens de tema [i]não[/i] são propriedades de [Object]. Isso "
"significa que você não pode acessar seus valores usando [method Object.get] "
"e [method Object.set]. Em vez disso, use os métodos [code]get_theme_*[/code] "
"e [code]add_theme_*_override[/code] fornecidos por esta classe."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "GUI documentation index"
msgstr "Índice de documentação da GUI"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Control node gallery"
msgstr "Galeria de nós Control"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/SceneTree.xml
msgid "Multiple resolutions"
msgstr "Múltiplas resoluções"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "All GUI Demos"
msgstr "Todas as demonstrações de GUI"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Return the description of the keyboard shortcuts and other contextual help "
"for this control."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a descrição dos atalhos de teclado e outras ajudas contextuais para "
"este controle."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Godot calls this method to test if [param data] from a control's [method "
"_get_drag_data] can be dropped at [param at_position]. [param at_position] "
"is local to this control.\n"
"This method should only be used to test the data. Process the data in "
"[method _drop_data].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the drag was initiated by a keyboard shortcut or [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] is set to [constant Vector2.INF], "
"and the currently selected item/text position should be used as the drop "
"position.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\t# Check position if it is relevant to you\n"
"\t# Otherwise, just check data\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"expected\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Check position if it is relevant to you\n"
"\t// Otherwise, just check data\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"expected\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"O Godot chama este método para testar se [param data] de um [method "
"_get_drag_data] de um controle pode ser solto em [param at_position]. [param "
"at_position] é local para este controle.\n"
"Este método deve ser usado apenas para testar os dados. Processe os dados em "
"[method _drop_data].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se o arraste foi iniciado por um atalho de teclado ou [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] é definido como [constant "
"Vector2.INF], e a posição do item/texto atualmente selecionado deve ser "
"usada como a posição onde soltar.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\t# Verifique a posição se for relevante para você\n"
"\t# Caso contrário, apenas verifique os dados\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"expected\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Verifique a posição se for relevante para você\n"
"\t// Caso contrário, apenas verifique os dados\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"expected\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Godot calls this method to pass you the [param data] from a control's "
"[method _get_drag_data] result. Godot first calls [method _can_drop_data] to "
"test if [param data] is allowed to drop at [param at_position] where [param "
"at_position] is local to this control.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the drag was initiated by a keyboard shortcut or [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] is set to [constant Vector2.INF], "
"and the currently selected item/text position should be used as the drop "
"position.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"color\")\n"
"\n"
"func _drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\tvar color = data[\"color\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"color\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _DropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\tColor color = data.AsGodotDictionary()[\"color\"].AsColor();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"O Godot chama este método para lhe passar o [param data] resultante do "
"[method _get_drag_data] de um controle. O Godot primeiro chama [method "
"_can_drop_data] para testar se [param data] tem permissão para ser solto em "
"[param at_position], onde [param at_position] é local para este controle.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se o arraste foi iniciado por um atalho de teclado ou [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] é definido como [constant "
"Vector2.INF], e a posição do item/texto atualmente selecionado deve ser "
"usada como a posição onde soltar.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _can_drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\treturn typeof(data) == TYPE_DICTIONARY and data.has(\"color\")\n"
"\n"
"func _drop_data(position, data):\n"
"\tvar color = data[\"color\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _CanDropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn data.VariantType == Variant.Type.Dictionary && "
"data.AsGodotDictionary().ContainsKey(\"color\");\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _DropData(Vector2 atPosition, Variant data)\n"
"{\n"
"\tColor color = data.AsGodotDictionary()[\"color\"].AsColor();\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return a human-readable description of the position "
"of the child [param node] in the custom container, added to the [member "
"accessibility_name]."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para retornar uma descrição legível por humanos da "
"posição do [param node] filho no contêiner personalizado, adicionado ao "
"[member accessibility_name]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the cursor shape for "
"the position [param at_position] in the control's local coordinates, which "
"will typically be used while hovering over this control. See [method "
"get_cursor_shape].\n"
"If not overridden, defaults to [member mouse_default_cursor_shape]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Godot calls this method to get data that can be dragged and dropped onto "
"controls that expect drop data. Returns [code]null[/code] if there is no "
"data to drag. Controls that want to receive drop data should implement "
"[method _can_drop_data] and [method _drop_data]. [param at_position] is "
"local to this control. Drag may be forced with [method force_drag].\n"
"A preview that will follow the mouse that should represent the data can be "
"set with [method set_drag_preview]. A good time to set the preview is in "
"this method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the drag was initiated by a keyboard shortcut or [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] is set to [constant Vector2.INF], "
"and the currently selected item/text position should be used as the drag "
"position.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\tvar mydata = make_data() # This is your custom method generating the drag "
"data.\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(make_preview(mydata)) # This is your custom method "
"generating the preview of the drag data.\n"
"\treturn mydata\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar myData = MakeData(); // This is your custom method generating the drag "
"data.\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(MakePreview(myData)); // This is your custom method "
"generating the preview of the drag data.\n"
"\treturn myData;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"O Godot chama este método para obter dados que podem ser arrastados e soltos "
"em controles que esperam dados de soltura. Retorna [code]null[/code] se não "
"houver dados para arrastar. Os controles que desejam receber dados de "
"soltura devem implementar [method _can_drop_data] e [method _drop_data]. "
"[param at_position] é local para este controle. O arraste pode ser forçado "
"com [method force_drag].\n"
"Uma pré-visualização que seguirá o mouse e que deve representar os dados "
"pode ser definida com [method set_drag_preview]. Um bom momento para definir "
"a pré-visualização é dentro deste método.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se o arraste foi iniciado por um atalho de teclado ou [method "
"accessibility_drag], [param at_position] é definido como [constant "
"Vector2.INF], e a posição do item/texto atualmente selecionado deve ser "
"usada como a posição de arraste.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\tvar mydata = make_data() # Este é o seu método personalizado que gera os "
"dados de arraste.\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(make_preview(mydata)) # Este é o seu método personalizado "
"que gera a pré-visualização dos dados de arraste.\n"
"\treturn mydata\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar myData = MakeData(); // Este é o seu método personalizado que gera os "
"dados de arraste.\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(MakePreview(myData)); // Este é o seu método personalizado "
"que gera a pré-visualização dos dados de arraste.\n"
"\treturn myData;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the maximum size for "
"this control. Alternative to [member custom_maximum_size] for controlling "
"maximum size via code. The actual maximum size will be the max value of "
"these two (in each axis separately).\n"
"If not overridden, defaults to [constant Vector2.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will not be called when the script is attached to a "
"[Control] node that already overrides its maximum size (e.g. "
"[ScrollContainer]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is recommended to use [method get_bound_minimum_size] "
"instead of [method get_combined_minimum_size] when implementing this method, "
"as the former respects maximum size limits when calculating the minimum "
"size, while the latter does not."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the minimum size for "
"this control. Alternative to [member custom_minimum_size] for controlling "
"minimum size via code. The actual minimum size will be the max value of "
"these two (in each axis separately).\n"
"If not overridden, defaults to [constant Vector2.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will not be called when the script is attached to a "
"[Control] node that already overrides its minimum size (e.g. [Label], "
"[Button], [PanelContainer] etc.). It can only be used with most basic GUI "
"nodes, like [Control], [Container], [Panel] etc."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns the tooltip text for "
"the position [param at_position] in the control's local coordinates, which "
"will typically appear when the cursor is resting over this control. See "
"[method get_tooltip].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this method returns an empty [String] and [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] is not overridden, no tooltip is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Return the auto-translation mode at the given [param at_position]. If not "
"implemented, the [member tooltip_auto_translate_mode] property will be used "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o modo de tradução automática na posição [param at_position] "
"fornecida. Se não for implementado, a propriedade [member "
"tooltip_auto_translate_mode] será usada."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Override this method to handle "
"and accept inputs on UI elements. See also [method accept_event].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Click on the control to print a message:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\n"
"\t\tif event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT and event.pressed:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"I've been clicked D:\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _GuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton mb)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (mb.ButtonIndex == MouseButton.Left && mb.Pressed)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"I've been clicked D:\");\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If the [param event] inherits [InputEventMouse], this method will [b]not[/b] "
"be called when:\n"
"- the control's [member mouse_filter] is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- the control is obstructed by another control on top, that doesn't have "
"[member mouse_filter] set to [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- the control's parent has [member mouse_filter] set to [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_STOP] or has accepted the event;\n"
"- the control's parent has [member clip_contents] enabled and the [param "
"event]'s position is outside the parent's rectangle;\n"
"- the [param event]'s position is outside the control (see [method "
"_has_point]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param event]'s position is relative to this control's "
"origin."
msgstr ""
"Método virtual a ser implementado pelo usuário. Sobrescreva este método para "
"manipular e aceitar entradas em elementos de UI. Veja também [method "
"accept_event].\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Clique no controle para imprimir uma mensagem:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\n"
"\t\tif event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT and event.pressed:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"I've been clicked D:\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _GuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton mb)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (mb.ButtonIndex == MouseButton.Left && mb.Pressed)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"I've been clicked D:\");\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Se o [param event] herdar [InputEventMouse], este método [b]não[/b] será "
"chamado quando:\n"
"- o [member mouse_filter] do controle estiver definido como [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- o controle estiver obstruído por outro controle acima, que não tenha o "
"[member mouse_filter] definido como [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE];\n"
"- o pai do controle tiver o [member mouse_filter] definido como [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_STOP] ou tiver aceitado o evento;\n"
"- o pai do controle tiver o [member clip_contents] ativado e a posição do "
"[param event] estiver fora do retângulo do pai;\n"
"- a posição do [param event] estiver fora do controle (veja [method "
"_has_point]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A posição do [param event] é relativa à origem deste controle."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns whether the given "
"[param point] is inside this control.\n"
"If not overridden, default behavior is checking if the point is within the "
"control's Rect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a point is inside the control, you can "
"use [code]Rect2(Vector2.ZERO, size).has_point(point)[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Returns a [Control] node that "
"should be used as a tooltip instead of the default one. [param for_text] is "
"the return value of [method get_tooltip].\n"
"The returned node must be of type [Control] or Control-derived. It can have "
"child nodes of any type. It is freed when the tooltip disappears, so make "
"sure you always provide a new instance (if you want to use a pre-existing "
"node from your scene tree, you can duplicate it and pass the duplicated "
"instance). When [code]null[/code] or a non-Control node is returned, the "
"default tooltip will be used instead.\n"
"The returned node will be added as child to a [PopupPanel], so you should "
"only provide the contents of that panel. That [PopupPanel] can be themed "
"using [method Theme.set_stylebox] for the type [code]\"TooltipPanel\"[/code] "
"(see [member tooltip_text] for an example).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The tooltip is shrunk to minimal size. If you want to ensure "
"it's fully visible, you might want to set its [member custom_minimum_size] "
"to some non-zero value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The node (and any relevant children) should have their [member "
"CanvasItem.visible] set to [code]true[/code] when returned, otherwise, the "
"viewport that instantiates it will not be able to calculate its minimum size "
"reliably.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If overridden, this method is called even if [method "
"get_tooltip] returns an empty string. When this happens with the default "
"tooltip, it is not displayed. To copy this behavior, return [code]null[/"
"code] in this method when [param for_text] is empty.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Use a constructed node as a tooltip:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _make_custom_tooltip(for_text):\n"
"\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\tlabel.text = for_text\n"
"\treturn label\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Control _MakeCustomTooltip(string forText)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar label = new Label();\n"
"\tlabel.Text = forText;\n"
"\treturn label;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Use a scene instance as a tooltip:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _make_custom_tooltip(for_text):\n"
"\tvar tooltip = preload(\"res://some_tooltip_scene.tscn\").instantiate()\n"
"\ttooltip.get_node(\"Label\").text = for_text\n"
"\treturn tooltip\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Control _MakeCustomTooltip(string forText)\n"
"{\n"
"\tNode tooltip = ResourceLoader.Load<PackedScene>(\"res://"
"some_tooltip_scene.tscn\").Instantiate();\n"
"\ttooltip.GetNode<Label>(\"Label\").Text = forText;\n"
"\treturn tooltip;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Método virtual a ser implementado pelo usuário. Retorna um nó [Control] que "
"deve ser usado como dica de ferramenta em vez do padrão. [param for_text] é "
"o valor de retorno de [method get_tooltip].\n"
"O nó retornado deve ser do tipo [Control] ou derivado de Control. Ele pode "
"ter nós filhos de qualquer tipo. Ele é liberado quando a dica de ferramenta "
"desaparece, portanto, certifique-se de sempre fornecer uma nova instância "
"(se quiser usar um nó pré-existente da sua árvore de cena, você pode duplicá-"
"lo e passar a instância duplicada). Quando [code]null[/code] ou um nó que "
"não seja do tipo Control for retornado, a dica de ferramenta padrão será "
"usada.\n"
"O nó retornado será adicionado como filho a um [PopupPanel], portanto, você "
"só deve fornecer o conteúdo desse painel. Esse [PopupPanel] pode ter seu "
"tema alterado usando [method Theme.set_stylebox] para o tipo [code]"
"\"TooltipPanel\"[/code] (veja [member tooltip_text] para um exemplo).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A dica de ferramenta é encolhida ao tamanho mínimo. Se quiser "
"garantir que ela fique totalmente visível, você pode definir o seu [member "
"custom_minimum_size] para algum valor diferente de zero.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O nó (e quaisquer filhos relevantes) devem ter seu [member "
"CanvasItem.visible] definido como [code]true[/code] ao ser retornado, caso "
"contrário, a viewport que o instanciar não conseguirá calcular seu tamanho "
"mínimo de forma confiável.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se sobrescrito, este método é chamado mesmo se [method "
"get_tooltip] retornar uma string vazia. Quando isso acontece com a dica de "
"ferramenta padrão, ela não é exibida. Para copiar esse comportamento, "
"retorne [code]null[/code] neste método quando [param for_text] estiver "
"vazio.\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Usar um nó construído como dica de ferramenta:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _make_custom_tooltip(for_text):\n"
"\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\tlabel.text = for_text\n"
"\treturn label\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Control _MakeCustomTooltip(string forText)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar label = new Label();\n"
"\tlabel.Text = forText;\n"
"\treturn label;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Usar uma instância de cena como dica de ferramenta:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _make_custom_tooltip(for_text):\n"
"\tvar tooltip = preload(\"res://some_tooltip_scene.tscn\").instantiate()\n"
"\ttooltip.get_node(\"Label\").text = for_text\n"
"\treturn tooltip\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Control _MakeCustomTooltip(string forText)\n"
"{\n"
"\tNode tooltip = ResourceLoader.Load<PackedScene>(\"res://"
"some_tooltip_scene.tscn\").Instantiate();\n"
"\ttooltip.GetNode<Label>(\"Label\").Text = forText;\n"
"\treturn tooltip;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"User defined BiDi algorithm override function.\n"
"Returns an [Array] of [Vector3i] text ranges and text base directions, in "
"the left-to-right order. Ranges should cover full source [param text] "
"without overlaps. BiDi algorithm will be used on each range separately."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Marks an input event as handled. Once you accept an input event, it stops "
"propagating, even to nodes listening to [method Node._unhandled_input] or "
"[method Node._unhandled_key_input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not affect the methods in [Input], only the way "
"events are propagated."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Starts drag-and-drop operation without using a mouse."
msgstr "Inicia a operação de arrastar e soltar sem usar um mouse."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Ends drag-and-drop operation without using a mouse."
msgstr "Encerra a operação de arrastar e soltar sem usar um mouse."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [Color] with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_color_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_color].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Override a [Label]'s color and reset it later:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Given the child Label node \"MyLabel\", override its font color with a "
"custom value.\n"
"$MyLabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color(1, 0.5, 0))\n"
"# Reset the font color of the child label.\n"
"$MyLabel.remove_theme_color_override(\"font_color\")\n"
"# Alternatively it can be overridden with the default value from the Label "
"type.\n"
"$MyLabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", "
"get_theme_color(\"font_color\", \"Label\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Given the child Label node \"MyLabel\", override its font color with a "
"custom value.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").AddThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\", new "
"Color(1, 0.5f, 0));\n"
"// Reset the font color of the child label.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").RemoveThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\");\n"
"// Alternatively it can be overridden with the default value from the Label "
"type.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").AddThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\", "
"GetThemeColor(\"font_color\", \"Label\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Cria uma substituição local para uma [Color] de tema com o [param name] "
"especificado. Substituições locais sempre têm precedência ao buscar itens de "
"tema para o controle. Uma substituição pode ser removida com [method "
"remove_theme_color_override].\n"
"Veja também [method get_theme_color].\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Substituir a cor de um [Label] e redefini-la mais tarde:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Dado o nó filho Label \"MyLabel\", substitua sua cor de fonte por um valor "
"personalizado.\n"
"$MyLabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color(1, 0.5, 0))\n"
"# Redefina a cor da fonte do rótulo filho.\n"
"$MyLabel.remove_theme_color_override(\"font_color\")\n"
"# Alternativamente, ela pode ser substituída pelo valor padrão do tipo "
"Label.\n"
"$MyLabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", "
"get_theme_color(\"font_color\", \"Label\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Dado o nó filho Label \"MyLabel\", substitua sua cor de fonte por um "
"valor personalizado.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").AddThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\", new "
"Color(1, 0.5f, 0));\n"
"// Redefina a cor da fonte do rótulo filho.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").RemoveThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\");\n"
"// Alternativamente, ela pode ser substituída pelo valor padrão do tipo "
"Label.\n"
"GetNode<Label>(\"MyLabel\").AddThemeColorOverride(\"font_color\", "
"GetThemeColor(\"font_color\", \"Label\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme constant with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_constant_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_constant]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [Font] with the specified [param name]. "
"Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for the "
"control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_font_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_font]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme font size with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_font_size_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_font_size]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme icon with the specified [param name]. "
"Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for the "
"control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_icon_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_icon]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [StyleBox] with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_stylebox_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_stylebox].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Modify a property in a [StyleBox] by duplicating it:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# The snippet below assumes the child node \"MyButton\" has a StyleBoxFlat "
"assigned.\n"
"# Resources are shared across instances, so we need to duplicate it\n"
"# to avoid modifying the appearance of all other buttons.\n"
"var new_stylebox_normal = "
"$MyButton.get_theme_stylebox(\"normal\").duplicate()\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_width_top = 3\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_color = Color(0, 1, 0.5)\n"
"$MyButton.add_theme_stylebox_override(\"normal\", new_stylebox_normal)\n"
"# Remove the stylebox override.\n"
"$MyButton.remove_theme_stylebox_override(\"normal\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// The snippet below assumes the child node \"MyButton\" has a StyleBoxFlat "
"assigned.\n"
"// Resources are shared across instances, so we need to duplicate it\n"
"// to avoid modifying the appearance of all other buttons.\n"
"StyleBoxFlat newStyleboxNormal = "
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").GetThemeStylebox(\"normal\").Duplicate() as "
"StyleBoxFlat;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderWidthTop = 3;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderColor = new Color(0, 1, 0.5f);\n"
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").AddThemeStyleboxOverride(\"normal\", "
"newStyleboxNormal);\n"
"// Remove the stylebox override.\n"
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").RemoveThemeStyleboxOverride(\"normal\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Cria uma substituição local para um [StyleBox] de tema com o [param name] "
"especificado. Substituições locais sempre têm precedência ao buscar itens de "
"tema para o controle. Uma substituição pode ser removida com [method "
"remove_theme_stylebox_override].\n"
"Veja também [method get_theme_stylebox].\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Modificar uma propriedade em um [StyleBox] duplicando-o:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# O trecho abaixo supõe que o nó filho \"MyButton\" tem um StyleBoxFlat "
"atribuído.\n"
"# Recurso são compartilhados entre instâncias, então precisamos duplicá-lo\n"
"# para evitar a modificação da aparência de todos os outros botões.\n"
"var new_stylebox_normal = "
"$MyButton.get_theme_stylebox(\"normal\").duplicate()\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_width_top = 3\n"
"new_stylebox_normal.border_color = Color(0, 1, 0.5)\n"
"$MyButton.add_theme_stylebox_override(\"normal\", new_stylebox_normal)\n"
"# Remove a substituição do stylebox.\n"
"$MyButton.remove_theme_stylebox_override(\"normal\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// O trecho abaixo supõe que o nó filho \"MyButton\" tem um StyleBoxFlat "
"atribuído.\n"
"// Recurso são compartilhados entre instâncias, então precisamos duplicá-lo\n"
"// para evitar a modificação da aparência de todos os outros botões.\n"
"StyleBoxFlat newStyleboxNormal = "
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").GetThemeStylebox(\"normal\").Duplicate() as "
"StyleBoxFlat;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderWidthTop = 3;\n"
"newStyleboxNormal.BorderColor = new Color(0, 1, 0.5f);\n"
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").AddThemeStyleboxOverride(\"normal\", "
"newStyleboxNormal);\n"
"// Remove a substituição do stylebox.\n"
"GetNode<Button>(\"MyButton\").RemoveThemeStyleboxOverride(\"normal\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Prevents [code]*_theme_*_override[/code] methods from emitting [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] until [method end_bulk_theme_override] is called."
msgstr ""
"Impede que os métodos [code]*_theme_*_override[/code] emitam [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] até que [method end_bulk_theme_override] seja "
"chamado."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Ends a bulk theme override update. See [method begin_bulk_theme_override]."
msgstr ""
"Encerra uma atualização de substituição de tema em massa. Consulte [method "
"begin_bulk_theme_override]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Finds the next (below in the tree) [Control] that can receive the focus."
msgstr ""
"Encontra o próximo [Control] (abaixo na árvore) que pode receber o foco."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Finds the previous (above in the tree) [Control] that can receive the focus."
msgstr ""
"Encontra o [Control] anterior (acima na árvore) que pode receber o foco."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Finds the next [Control] that can receive the focus on the specified [enum "
"Side].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is different from [method get_focus_neighbor], which "
"returns the path of a specified focus neighbor."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Forces drag and bypasses [method _get_drag_data] and [method "
"set_drag_preview] by passing [param data] and [param preview]. Drag will "
"start even if the mouse is neither over nor pressed on this control.\n"
"The methods [method _can_drop_data] and [method _drop_data] must be "
"implemented on controls that want to receive drop data."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the anchor for the specified [enum Side]. A getter method for "
"[member anchor_bottom], [member anchor_left], [member anchor_right] and "
"[member anchor_top]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a âncora para o [enum Side] especificado. Um método getter para "
"[member anchor_bottom], [member anchor_left], [member anchor_right] e "
"[member anchor_top]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [member offset_left] and [member offset_top]. See also [member "
"position]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [member offset_left] e [member offset_top]. Veja também [member "
"position]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the bound value of [method get_combined_minimum_size] by [method "
"get_combined_maximum_size].\n"
"This value is the true minimum size of the container, as the maximum size "
"has priority over the minimum size.\n"
"For example, if the combined minimum size is (100, 100) and the combined "
"maximum size is (50, 150), the bound minimum size will be (50, 100)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the combined maximum size from [member custom_maximum_size] and "
"[method get_maximum_size], as well as the [member custom_maximum_size] of "
"this node's parent if it is a Control node with [member "
"propagate_maximum_size] set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho máximo combinado de [member custom_maximum_size] e [method "
"get_maximum_size], bem como o [member custom_maximum_size] do pai deste nó, "
"se for um nó Control com [member propagate_maximum_size] definido como "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the combined minimum size from [member custom_minimum_size] and "
"[method get_minimum_size]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho mínimo combinado de [member custom_minimum_size] e [method "
"get_minimum_size]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the combined value of [member pivot_offset] and [member "
"pivot_offset_ratio], in pixels. The ratio is multiplied by the control's "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor combinado de [member pivot_offset] e [member "
"pivot_offset_ratio], em pixels. A proporção é multiplicada pelo tamanho do "
"controle."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the mouse cursor shape for this control when hovered over [param "
"at_position] in local coordinates. For most controls, this is the same as "
"[member mouse_default_cursor_shape], but some built-in controls implement "
"more complex logic.\n"
"You can override [method _get_cursor_shape] to implement custom behavior for "
"this method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Returns [member offset_right] and [member offset_bottom]."
msgstr "Retorna [member offset_right] e [member offset_bottom]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [member focus_mode], but takes the [member "
"focus_behavior_recursive] into account. If [member focus_behavior_recursive] "
"is set to [constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], or it is set to [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] and its ancestor is set to [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], then this returns [constant FOCUS_NONE]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [member focus_mode], mas leva o [member focus_behavior_recursive] "
"em consideração. Se [member focus_behavior_recursive] estiver definido como "
"[constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], ou estiver definido como [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] e seu ancestral estiver definido como [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], isso retornará [constant FOCUS_NONE]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the focus neighbor for the specified [enum Side]. A getter method "
"for [member focus_neighbor_bottom], [member focus_neighbor_left], [member "
"focus_neighbor_right] and [member focus_neighbor_top].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To find the next [Control] on the specific [enum Side], even if "
"a neighbor is not assigned, use [method find_valid_focus_neighbor]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position and size of the control relative to the containing "
"canvas. See [member global_position] and [member size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the node itself or any parent [CanvasItem] between the node "
"and the canvas have a non default rotation or skew, the resulting size is "
"likely not meaningful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member Viewport.gui_snap_controls_to_pixels] to "
"[code]true[/code] can lead to rounding inaccuracies between the displayed "
"control and the returned [Rect2]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum size for this control. See [member custom_maximum_size]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho máximo para este controle. Consulte [member "
"custom_maximum_size]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the minimum size for this control. See [member custom_minimum_size]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho mínimo para este controle. Consulte [member "
"custom_minimum_size]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [member mouse_filter], but takes the [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive] into account. If [member mouse_behavior_recursive] "
"is set to [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], or it is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] and its ancestor is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], then this returns [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [member mouse_filter], mas leva o [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive] em consideração. Se [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive] estiver definido como [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], ou se estiver definido como [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED] e seu ancestral estiver definido como [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED], isso retornará [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the offset for the specified [enum Side]. A getter method for "
"[member offset_bottom], [member offset_left], [member offset_right] and "
"[member offset_top]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o deslocamento para o [enum Side] especificado. Um método getter "
"para [member offset_bottom], [member offset_left], [member offset_right] e "
"[member offset_top]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Returns the width/height occupied in the parent control."
msgstr "Retorna a largura/altura ocupada no controle pai."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Returns the parent control node."
msgstr "Retorna o nó de controle pai."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position and size of the control in the coordinate system of the "
"containing node. See [member position], [member scale] and [member size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member rotation] is not the default rotation, the resulting "
"size is not meaningful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [member Viewport.gui_snap_controls_to_pixels] to "
"[code]true[/code] can lead to rounding inaccuracies between the displayed "
"control and the returned [Rect2]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position of this [Control] in global screen coordinates (i.e. "
"taking window position into account). Mostly useful for editor plugins.\n"
"Equivalent to [code]get_screen_transform().origin[/code] (see [method "
"CanvasItem.get_screen_transform]).\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Show a popup at the mouse position:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"popup_menu.position = get_screen_position() + "
"get_screen_transform().basis_xform(get_local_mouse_position())\n"
"\n"
"# The above code is equivalent to:\n"
"popup_menu.position = get_screen_transform() * get_local_mouse_position()\n"
"\n"
"popup_menu.reset_size()\n"
"popup_menu.popup()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Color] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a color item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type]. If [param theme_type] is omitted the class name of the current "
"control is used as the type, or [member theme_type_variation] if it is "
"defined. If the type is a class name its parent classes are also checked, in "
"order of inheritance. If the type is a variation its base types are checked, "
"in order of dependency, then the control's class name and its parent classes "
"are checked.\n"
"For the current control its local overrides are considered first (see "
"[method add_theme_color_override]), then its assigned [member theme]. After "
"the current control, each parent control and its assigned [member theme] are "
"considered; controls without a [member theme] assigned are skipped. If no "
"matching [Theme] is found in the tree, the custom project [Theme] (see "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/custom]) and the default [Theme] are used "
"(see [ThemeDB]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Get the font color defined for the current Control's class, if it "
"exists.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\")\n"
"\t# Get the font color defined for the Button class.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\", \"Button\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Get the font color defined for the current Control's class, if it "
"exists.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\");\n"
"\t// Get the font color defined for the Button class.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\", \"Button\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Color] do primeiro [Theme] correspondente na árvore se esse "
"[Theme] tiver um item de cor com o [param name] e [param theme_type] "
"especificados. Se [param theme_type] for omitido, o nome da classe do "
"controle atual será usado como o tipo ou [member theme_type_variation] se "
"for definido. Se o tipo for um nome de classe, suas classes pai também serão "
"verificadas, em ordem de herança. Se o tipo for uma variação, seus tipos "
"base são verificados, em ordem de dependência, então o nome da classe do "
"controle e suas classes pai são verificadas.\n"
"Para o controle atual, suas substituições locais são consideradas primeiro "
"(consulte [method add_theme_color_override]) e, em seguida, seu [tema de "
"membro] atribuído. Após o controle atual, cada controle pai e seu [member "
"theme] atribuído são considerados; controles sem um [member theme] atribuído "
"são ignorados. Se nenhum [Theme] correspondente for encontrado na árvore, o "
"projeto personalizado [Theme] (consulte [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"custom]) e o [Theme] padrão serão usados (consulte [ThemeDB]).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Get the font color defined for the current Control's class, if it "
"exists.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\")\n"
"\t# Get the font color defined for the Button class.\n"
"\tmodulate = get_theme_color(\"font_color\", \"Button\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Get the font color defined for the current Control's class, if it "
"exists.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\");\n"
"\t// Get the font color defined for the Button class.\n"
"\tModulate = GetThemeColor(\"font_color\", \"Button\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a constant from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a constant item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the default base scale value from the first matching [Theme] in the "
"tree if that [Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_base_scale] value.\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the default font from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_font] value.\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the default font size value from the first matching [Theme] in the "
"tree if that [Theme] has a valid [member Theme.default_font_size] value.\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Font] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that [Theme] "
"has a font item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a font size from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a font size item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an icon from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that [Theme] "
"has an icon item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [StyleBox] from the first matching [Theme] in the tree if that "
"[Theme] has a stylebox item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the tooltip text for the position [param at_position] in the "
"control's local coordinates, which will typically appear when the cursor is "
"resting over this control. By default, it returns [member tooltip_text].\n"
"You can override [method _get_tooltip] to implement custom behavior for this "
"method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this method returns an empty [String] and [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] is not overridden, no tooltip is displayed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an [InputEventMouseButton] that attempts to click the control. If "
"the event is received, the control gains focus.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tgrab_click_focus() # When clicking another Control node, this node will be "
"clicked instead.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGrabClickFocus(); // When clicking another Control node, this node will be "
"clicked instead.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Cria um [InputEventMouseButton] que tenta clicar no controle. Se o evento "
"for recebido, o controle ganha foco.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tgrab_click_focus() # Ao clicar em outro nó Control, este nó será clicado "
"em seu lugar.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGrabClickFocus(); // Ao clicar em outro nó Control, este nó será clicado "
"em seu lugar.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Steal the focus from another control and become the focused control (see "
"[member focus_mode]).\n"
"If [param hide_focus] is [code]true[/code], the control will not visually "
"show its focused state. Has no effect for [LineEdit] and [TextEdit] when "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/common/show_focus_state_on_pointer_event] is set "
"to [code]Text Input Controls[/code], or for any control when it is set to "
"[code]Always[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using this method together with [method Callable.call_deferred] "
"makes it more reliable, especially when called inside [method Node._ready]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this is the current focused control. See "
"[member focus_mode].\n"
"If [param ignore_hidden_focus] is [code]true[/code], controls that have "
"their focus hidden will always return [code]false[/code]. Hidden focus "
"happens automatically when controls gain focus via mouse input, or manually "
"using [method grab_focus] with [code]hide_focus[/code] set to [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that "
"has a color item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme [Color] "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_color_override]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that "
"has a constant item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme constant "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_constant_override]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that "
"has a font item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme [Font] "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_font_override]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that "
"has a font size item with the specified [param name] and [param "
"theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme font size "
"with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_font_size_override]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se houver uma substituição local para um tamanho "
"de fonte do tema com o [param name] especificado neste nó [Control].\n"
"Consulte [method add_theme_font_size_override]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that "
"has an icon item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme icon with "
"the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_icon_override]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se houver uma sobrescrita local para um ícone de "
"tema com o [param name] especificado neste nó [Control].\n"
"Veja [method add_theme_icon_override]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a matching [Theme] in the tree that "
"has a stylebox item with the specified [param name] and [param theme_type].\n"
"See [method get_theme_color] for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if there is a local override for a theme "
"[StyleBox] with the specified [param name] in this [Control] node.\n"
"See [method add_theme_stylebox_override]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a drag operation is successful. Alternative to "
"[method Viewport.gui_is_drag_successful].\n"
"Best used with [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_DRAG_END]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the layout is right-to-left. See also [member "
"layout_direction]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o layout for da direita para a esquerda. Veja "
"também [member layout_direction]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Give up the focus. No other control will be able to receive input."
msgstr "Abandona o foco. Nenhum outro controle poderá receber entrada."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme [Color] with the specified [param name] "
"previously added by [method add_theme_color_override] or via the Inspector "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma substituição local para uma [Color] de tema com o [param name] "
"especificado, adicionada anteriormente por [method add_theme_color_override] "
"ou por meio do dock Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme constant with the specified [param "
"name] previously added by [method add_theme_constant_override] or via the "
"Inspector dock."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma substituição local para uma constante de tema com o [param name] "
"especificado adicionada anteriormente por [method "
"add_theme_constant_override] ou através da doca do Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme [Font] with the specified [param name] "
"previously added by [method add_theme_font_override] or via the Inspector "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma substituição local para uma [Font] de tema com o [param name] "
"especificado, adicionada anteriormente por [method add_theme_font_override] "
"ou por meio do dock Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme font size with the specified [param "
"name] previously added by [method add_theme_font_size_override] or via the "
"Inspector dock."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma substituição local para um tamanho de fonte de tema com o [param "
"name] especificado adicionado anteriormente por [method "
"add_theme_font_size_override] ou através da doca do Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme icon with the specified [param name] "
"previously added by [method add_theme_icon_override] or via the Inspector "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma substituição local para um ícone de tema com o [param name] "
"especificado, adicionada anteriormente por [method add_theme_icon_override] "
"ou por meio do dock Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a local override for a theme [StyleBox] with the specified [param "
"name] previously added by [method add_theme_stylebox_override] or via the "
"Inspector dock."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma substituição local para um [StyleBox] de tema com o [param name] "
"especificado adicionado anteriormente por [method "
"add_theme_stylebox_override] ou através da doca do Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Resets the size to [method get_combined_minimum_size]. This is equivalent to "
"calling [code]set_size(Vector2())[/code] (or any size below the minimum)."
msgstr ""
"Redefine o tamanho para [method get_combined_minimum_size]. Isso é "
"equivalente a chamar [code]set_size(Vector2())[/code] (ou qualquer tamanho "
"abaixo do mínimo)."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the anchor for the specified [enum Side] to [param anchor]. A setter "
"method for [member anchor_bottom], [member anchor_left], [member "
"anchor_right] and [member anchor_top].\n"
"If [param keep_offset] is [code]true[/code], offsets aren't updated after "
"this operation.\n"
"If [param push_opposite_anchor] is [code]true[/code] and the opposite anchor "
"overlaps this anchor, the opposite one will have its value overridden. For "
"example, when setting left anchor to 1 and the right anchor has value of "
"0.5, the right anchor will also get value of 1. If [param "
"push_opposite_anchor] was [code]false[/code], the left anchor would get "
"value 0.5."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Works the same as [method set_anchor], but instead of [code]keep_offset[/"
"code] argument and automatic update of offset, it allows to set the offset "
"yourself (see [method set_offset])."
msgstr ""
"Funciona da mesma forma que [method set_anchor], mas em vez do argumento "
"[code]keep_offset[/code] e da atualização automática do deslocamento, "
"permite definir o deslocamento você mesmo (consulte [method set_offset])."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets both anchor preset and offset preset. See [method set_anchors_preset] "
"and [method set_offsets_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Define tanto a predefinição de âncora quanto a predefinição de deslocamento. "
"Consulte [method set_anchors_preset] e [method set_offsets_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the anchors to a [param preset] from [enum Control.LayoutPreset] enum. "
"This is the code equivalent to using the Layout menu in the 2D editor.\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's position will also "
"be updated."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets [member offset_left] and [member offset_top] at the same time. "
"Equivalent of changing [member position]."
msgstr ""
"Define [member offset_left] e [member offset_top] ao mesmo tempo. "
"Equivalente a alterar [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the given callables to be used instead of the control's own drag-and-"
"drop virtual methods. If a callable is empty, its respective virtual method "
"is used as normal.\n"
"The arguments for each callable should be exactly the same as their "
"respective virtual methods, which would be:\n"
"- [param drag_func] corresponds to [method _get_drag_data] and requires a "
"[Vector2];\n"
"- [param can_drop_func] corresponds to [method _can_drop_data] and requires "
"both a [Vector2] and a [Variant];\n"
"- [param drop_func] corresponds to [method _drop_data] and requires both a "
"[Vector2] and a [Variant]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Shows the given control at the mouse pointer. A good time to call this "
"method is in [method _get_drag_data]. The control must not be in the scene "
"tree. You should not free the control, and you should not keep a reference "
"to the control beyond the duration of the drag. It will be deleted "
"automatically after the drag has ended.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export var color = Color(1, 0, 0, 1)\n"
"\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\t# Use a control that is not in the tree\n"
"\tvar cpb = ColorPickerButton.new()\n"
"\tcpb.color = color\n"
"\tcpb.size = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(cpb)\n"
"\treturn color\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export]\n"
"private Color _color = new Color(1, 0, 0, 1);\n"
"\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Use a control that is not in the tree\n"
"\tvar cpb = new ColorPickerButton();\n"
"\tcpb.Color = _color;\n"
"\tcpb.Size = new Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(cpb);\n"
"\treturn _color;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Exibe o controle especificado na posição do ponteiro do mouse. Um bom "
"momento para chamar este método é em [method _get_drag_data]. O controle não "
"deve estar na árvore da cena. Você não deve liberar o controle e não deve "
"manter uma referência a ele além da duração do arrasto. Ele será excluído "
"automaticamente após o término do arrasto.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@export var color = Color(1, 0, 0, 1)\n"
"\n"
"func _get_drag_data(position):\n"
"\t# Usa um controle que não está na árvore\n"
"\tvar cpb = ColorPickerButton.new()\n"
"\tcpb.color = color\n"
"\tcpb.size = Vector2(50, 50)\n"
"\tset_drag_preview(cpb)\n"
"\treturn color\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Export]\n"
"private Color _color = new Color(1, 0, 0, 1);\n"
"\n"
"public override Variant _GetDragData(Vector2 atPosition)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Usa um controle que não está na árvore\n"
"\tvar cpb = new ColorPickerButton();\n"
"\tcpb.Color = _color;\n"
"\tcpb.Size = new Vector2(50, 50);\n"
"\tSetDragPreview(cpb);\n"
"\treturn _color;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Sets [member offset_right] and [member offset_bottom] at the same time."
msgstr "Define [member offset_right] e [member offset_bottom] ao mesmo tempo."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the focus neighbor for the specified [enum Side] to the [Control] at "
"[param neighbor] node path. A setter method for [member "
"focus_neighbor_bottom], [member focus_neighbor_left], [member "
"focus_neighbor_right] and [member focus_neighbor_top]."
msgstr ""
"Define o vizinho de foco para o [enum Side] especificado para o [Control] no "
"caminho do nó [param neighbor]. Um método setter para [member "
"focus_neighbor_bottom], [member focus_neighbor_left], [member "
"focus_neighbor_right] e [member focus_neighbor_top]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [member global_position] to given [param position].\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's anchors will be "
"updated instead of offsets."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the offset for the specified [enum Side] to [param offset]. A setter "
"method for [member offset_bottom], [member offset_left], [member "
"offset_right] and [member offset_top]."
msgstr ""
"Define o deslocamento para o [enum Side] especificado para [param offset]. "
"Um método definidor para [member offset_bottom], [member offset_left], "
"[member offset_right] e [member offset_top]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the offsets to a [param preset] from [enum Control.LayoutPreset] enum. "
"This is the code equivalent to using the Layout menu in the 2D editor.\n"
"Use parameter [param resize_mode] with constants from [enum "
"Control.LayoutPresetMode] to better determine the resulting size of the "
"[Control]. Constant size will be ignored if used with presets that change "
"size, e.g. [constant PRESET_LEFT_WIDE].\n"
"Use parameter [param margin] to determine the gap between the [Control] and "
"the edges."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [member position] to given [param position].\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's anchors will be "
"updated instead of offsets."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the size (see [member size]).\n"
"If [param keep_offsets] is [code]true[/code], control's anchors will be "
"updated instead of offsets."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Invalidates the maximum size cache in this node and in child nodes with "
"[member CanvasItem.top_level] set to [code]false[/code]. Intended to be used "
"with [method get_maximum_size] when the return value is changed. Setting "
"[member custom_maximum_size] directly calls this method automatically.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling this method also calls [method update_minimum_size] "
"since the combined minimum size may be affected by the maximum size change."
msgstr ""
"Invalida o cache de tamanho mínimo neste nó e nos nós pais até o nível "
"superior. Destinado a ser usado com [method get_minimum_size] quando o valor "
"de retorno é alterado. Definir [member custom_minimum_size] diretamente "
"chama esse método automaticamente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Invalidates the minimum size cache in this node and in parent nodes up to "
"top level. Intended to be used with [method get_minimum_size] when the "
"return value is changed. Setting [member custom_minimum_size] directly calls "
"this method automatically."
msgstr ""
"Invalida o cache de tamanho mínimo neste nó e nos nós pais até o nível "
"superior. Destinado a ser usado com [method get_minimum_size] quando o valor "
"de retorno é alterado. Definir [member custom_minimum_size] diretamente "
"chama esse método automaticamente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the mouse cursor to [param position], relative to [member position] of "
"this [Control].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method warp_mouse] is only supported on Windows, macOS and "
"Linux. It has no effect on Android, iOS and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The paths to the nodes which are controlled by this node."
msgstr "Os caminhos para os nós que são controlados por este nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The paths to the nodes which are describing this node."
msgstr "Os caminhos para os nós que estão descrevendo este nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "The human-readable node description that is reported to assistive apps."
msgstr ""
"A descrição legível por humanos do nó que é relatada a aplicativos de "
"acessibilidade."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The paths to the nodes which this node flows into."
msgstr "Os caminhos para os nós para os quais este nó flui."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The paths to the nodes which label this node."
msgstr "Os caminhos para os nós que rotulam este nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The mode with which a live region updates. A live region is a [Node] that is "
"updated as a result of an external event when the user's focus may be "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"O modo com que uma região dinâmica é atualizada. Uma região dinâmica é um "
"[Node] que é atualizado como resultado de um evento externo quando o foco do "
"usuário pode estar em outro lugar."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "The human-readable node name that is reported to assistive apps."
msgstr ""
"O nome de nó legível por humanos que é relatado a aplicativos assistivos."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Anchors the bottom edge of the node to the origin, the center, or the end of "
"its parent control. It changes how the bottom offset updates when the node "
"moves or changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""
"Ancora a borda inferior do nó na origem, no centro ou no final de seu "
"controle pai. Ele altera como o deslocamento inferior é atualizado quando o "
"nó se move ou muda de tamanho. Você pode usar uma das constantes [enum "
"Anchor] por conveniência."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Anchors the left edge of the node to the origin, the center or the end of "
"its parent control. It changes how the left offset updates when the node "
"moves or changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""
"Ancora a borda esquerda do nó na origem, no centro ou no final de seu "
"controle pai. Ele altera como o deslocamento esquerdo é atualizado quando o "
"nó se move ou muda de tamanho. Você pode usar uma das constantes [enum "
"Anchor] por conveniência."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Anchors the right edge of the node to the origin, the center or the end of "
"its parent control. It changes how the right offset updates when the node "
"moves or changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""
"Ancora a borda direita do nó na origem, no centro ou no final de seu "
"controle pai. Ele altera como o deslocamento direito é atualizado quando o "
"nó se move ou muda de tamanho. Você pode usar uma das constantes [enum "
"Anchor] por conveniência."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Anchors the top edge of the node to the origin, the center or the end of its "
"parent control. It changes how the top offset updates when the node moves or "
"changes size. You can use one of the [enum Anchor] constants for convenience."
msgstr ""
"Ancora a borda superior do nó na origem, no centro ou no final de seu "
"controle pai. Ele altera como o deslocamento superior é atualizado quando o "
"nó se move ou muda de tamanho. Você pode usar uma das constantes [enum "
"Anchor] por conveniência."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Use [member Node.auto_translate_mode] and [method Node.can_auto_translate] "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Use [member Node.auto_translate_mode] e [method Node.can_auto_translate] em "
"vez disso."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Toggles if any text should automatically change to its translated version "
"depending on the current locale."
msgstr ""
"Alterna se algum texto deve mudar automaticamente para sua versão traduzida, "
"dependendo da localidade atual."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Enables whether rendering of [CanvasItem] based children should be clipped "
"to this control's rectangle. If [code]true[/code], parts of a child which "
"would be visibly outside of this control's rectangle will not be rendered "
"and won't receive input."
msgstr ""
"Habilita se a renderização de filhos baseados em [CanvasItem] deve ser "
"recortada no retângulo deste controle. Se [code]true[/code], partes de um "
"filho que estariam visivelmente fora do retângulo deste controle não serão "
"renderizadas e não receberão entrada."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum size of this Control's bounding rectangle. If set to a value "
"greater than or equal to [code](0, 0)[/code], the node's bounding rectangle "
"will never exceed this size. A value below [code](0, 0)[/code] means there "
"is no maximum size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The final effective maximum size may be subject to parent "
"Container sizing and propagated maximum sizes. See also: [method "
"get_combined_maximum_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not all [Control] subtypes handle a custom maximum size "
"gracefully, which may lead to unexpected behavior if the control's contents "
"exceed this size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value has priority over [member custom_minimum_size]. For "
"example, if you set [member custom_maximum_size] to [code](100, 100)[/code] "
"and [member custom_minimum_size] to [code](200, 200)[/code], the resulting "
"size will be [code](100, 100)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is recommended to use [method get_bound_minimum_size] "
"instead of [method get_combined_minimum_size] when using this property, as "
"the former respects maximum size limits when calculating the minimum size, "
"while the latter does not."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum size of the node's bounding rectangle. If you set it to a value "
"greater than [code](0, 0)[/code], the node's bounding rectangle will always "
"have at least this size. Note that [Control] nodes have their internal "
"minimum size returned by [method get_minimum_size]. It depends on the "
"control's contents, like text, textures, or style boxes. The actual minimum "
"size is the maximum value of this property and the internal minimum size "
"(see [method get_combined_minimum_size]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member custom_maximum_size] has priority over this property. "
"For example, if you set [member custom_minimum_size] to [code](200, 200)[/"
"code] and [member custom_maximum_size] to [code](100, 100)[/code], the "
"resulting size will be [code](100, 100)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho mínimo do retângulo delimitador do nó. Se você defini-lo como um "
"valor maior que [code](0, 0)[/code], o retângulo delimitador do nó sempre "
"terá pelo menos este tamanho. Observe que nós [Control] têm seu tamanho "
"mínimo interno retornado por [method get_minimum_size]. Ele depende do "
"conteúdo do controle, como texto, texturas ou caixas de estilo. O tamanho "
"mínimo real é o valor máximo desta propriedade e o tamanho mínimo interno "
"(veja [method get_combined_minimum_size]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member custom_maximum_size] tem prioridade sobre esta "
"propriedade. Por exemplo, se você definir [member custom_minimum_size] como "
"[code](200, 200)[/code] e [member custom_maximum_size] como [code](100, 100)"
"[/code], o tamanho resultante será [code](100, 100)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Determines which controls can be focused together with [member focus_mode]. "
"See [method get_focus_mode_with_override]. Since the default behavior is "
"[constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], this can be used to prevent all "
"children controls from getting focused."
msgstr ""
"Determina quais controles podem receber foco junto com [member focus_mode]. "
"Veja [method get_focus_mode_with_override]. Como o comportamento padrão é "
"[constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], isso pode ser usado para impedir que "
"todos os controles filhos recebam foco."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Determines which controls can be focused. Only one control can be focused at "
"a time, and the focused control will receive keyboard, gamepad, and mouse "
"events in [method _gui_input]. Use [method get_focus_mode_with_override] to "
"determine if a control can grab focus, since [member "
"focus_behavior_recursive] also affects it. See also [method grab_focus]."
msgstr ""
"Determina quais controles podem receber foco. Apenas um controle pode "
"receber foco por vez, e o controle focado receberá eventos de teclado, "
"gamepad e mouse em [method _gui_input]. Use [method "
"get_focus_mode_with_override] para determinar se um controle pode obter "
"foco, já que [member focus_behavior_recursive] também o afeta. Veja também "
"[method grab_focus]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the down "
"arrow on the keyboard or down on a gamepad by default. You can change the "
"key by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_down] input action. The "
"node must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus "
"to the closest [Control] to the bottom of this one."
msgstr ""
"Indica ao Godot qual nó por padrão deve dar foco se o usuário pressionar a "
"seta para baixo no teclado ou para baixo em um gamepad. Você pode alterar a "
"tecla editando a ação de entrada [Member ProjectsSettings.input/ui_down]. O "
"nó deve ser um [Control]. Se essa propriedade não estiver definida, Godot "
"dará foco ao [Control] mais próximo abaixo deste."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the left "
"arrow on the keyboard or left on a gamepad by default. You can change the "
"key by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_left] input action. The "
"node must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus "
"to the closest [Control] to the left of this one."
msgstr ""
"Indica ao Godot qual nó por padrão deve dar foco se o usuário pressionar a "
"seta esquerda no teclado ou de um gamepad. Você pode alterar a tecla "
"editando a ação de entrada [member ProjectsSettings.input/ui_left]. O nó "
"deve ser um [Control]. Se essa propriedade não estiver definida, o Godot "
"dará foco ao [Control] mais próximo à esquerda deste."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the right "
"arrow on the keyboard or right on a gamepad by default. You can change the "
"key by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_right] input action. The "
"node must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus "
"to the closest [Control] to the right of this one."
msgstr ""
"Informa ao Godot para qual nó ele deve dar foco se o usuário pressionar a "
"seta para a direita no teclado ou para a direita em um gamepad por padrão. "
"Você pode alterar a tecla editando a ação de entrada [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_right]. O nó deve ser um [Control]. Se esta "
"propriedade não for definida, o Godot dará foco ao [Control] mais próximo à "
"direita deste."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses the top "
"arrow on the keyboard or top on a gamepad by default. You can change the key "
"by editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] input action. The node "
"must be a [Control]. If this property is not set, Godot will give focus to "
"the closest [Control] to the top of this one."
msgstr ""
"Informa ao Godot para qual nó ele deve dar foco se o usuário pressionar a "
"seta para cima no teclado ou para cima em um gamepad por padrão. Você pode "
"alterar a tecla editando a ação de entrada [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_up]. O nó deve ser um [Control]. Se esta propriedade não for definida, o "
"Godot dará foco ao [Control] mais próximo ao topo deste."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses [kbd]Tab[/"
"kbd] on a keyboard by default. You can change the key by editing the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_focus_next] input action.\n"
"If this property is not set, Godot will select a \"best guess\" based on "
"surrounding nodes in the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"Indica ao Godot qual nó por padrão deve dar foco se o usuário pressionar "
"[kbd]Tab [/kbd] em um teclado. Você pode alterar a tecla editando a ação de "
"entrada [Projecttings.input/ui_focus_next].\n"
"Se essa propriedade não estiver definida, o Godot selecionará um dando o "
"\"melhor palpite\" com base nos nós circundantes na árvore da cena."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells Godot which node it should give focus to if the user presses "
"[kbd]Shift + Tab[/kbd] on a keyboard by default. You can change the key by "
"editing the [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_focus_prev] input action.\n"
"If this property is not set, Godot will select a \"best guess\" based on "
"surrounding nodes in the scene tree."
msgstr ""
"Indica ao Godot qual nó por padrão deve dar foco se o usuário pressionar "
"[kbd] Shift + Tab [/kbd] em um teclado. Você pode alterar a tecla editando "
"de ação de entrada em [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_focus_prev].\n"
"Se essa propriedade não estiver definida, o Godot selecionará um dando o "
"\"melhor palpite\" com base nos nós circundantes na árvore da cena."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The node's global position, relative to the world (usually to the "
"[CanvasLayer])."
msgstr ""
"A posição global do nó, em relação ao mundo (geralmente ao [Canvaslayer])."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the direction on the horizontal axis in which the control should "
"grow if its horizontal minimum size is changed to be greater than its "
"current size, as the control always has to be at least the minimum size."
msgstr ""
"Controla a direção no eixo horizontal na qual o controle deve crescer se seu "
"tamanho mínimo horizontal for alterado para ser maior do que seu tamanho "
"atual, já que o controle sempre precisa ter pelo menos o tamanho mínimo."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the direction on the vertical axis in which the control should grow "
"if its vertical minimum size is changed to be greater than its current size, "
"as the control always has to be at least the minimum size."
msgstr ""
"Controla a direção no eixo vertical na qual o controle deve crescer se seu "
"tamanho mínimo vertical for alterado para ser maior do que seu tamanho "
"atual, já que o controle sempre precisa ter pelo menos o tamanho mínimo."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Controls layout direction and text writing direction. Right-to-left layouts "
"are necessary for certain languages (e.g. Arabic and Hebrew). See also "
"[method is_layout_rtl]."
msgstr ""
"Controla a direção do layout e a direção da escrita do texto. Layouts da "
"direita para a esquerda são necessários para determinados idiomas (por "
"exemplo, árabe e hebraico). Veja também [method is_layout_rtl]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically converts code line numbers, list "
"indices, [SpinBox] and [ProgressBar] values from the Western Arabic (0..9) "
"to the numeral systems used in current locale.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Numbers within the text are not automatically converted, it can "
"be done manually, using [method TextServer.format_number]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], converte automaticamente os números da linha de "
"código, índices de lista, valores [SpinBox] e [ProgressBar] do Arábico "
"(0..9) para os sistemas numéricos usados na localidade atual.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Os números dentro do texto não são convertidos automaticamente, "
"isso pode ser feito manualmente, usando [method TextServer.format_number]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Determines which controls can receive mouse input together with [member "
"mouse_filter]. See [method get_mouse_filter_with_override]. Since the "
"default behavior is [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], this can be used to "
"prevent all children controls from receiving mouse input."
msgstr ""
"Determina quais controles podem receber entrada de mouse junto com [member "
"mouse_filter]. Veja [method get_mouse_filter_with_override]. Como o "
"comportamento padrão é [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_INHERITED], isso pode ser "
"usado para impedir que todos os controles filhos recebam entrada de mouse."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The default cursor shape for this control. Useful for Godot plugins and "
"applications or games that use the system's mouse cursors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, shapes may vary depending on the cursor theme of the "
"system."
msgstr ""
"A forma padrão do cursor para esse Control. Útil para plugins e aplicativos "
"do Godot ou jogos que usam os cursores do mouse do sistema.\n"
"[b] Nota: [/b] No Linux, as formas podem variar dependendo do tema do cursor "
"do sistema."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Determines which controls will be able to receive mouse button input events "
"through [method _gui_input] and the [signal mouse_entered], and [signal "
"mouse_exited] signals. Also determines how these events should be "
"propagated. See the constants to learn what each does. Use [method "
"get_mouse_filter_with_override] to determine if a control can receive mouse "
"input, since [member mouse_behavior_recursive] also affects it."
msgstr ""
"Determina quais controles poderão receber eventos de entrada de botão do "
"mouse por meio de [method _gui_input] e dos sinais [signal mouse_entered] e "
"[signal mouse_exited]. Também determina como esses eventos devem ser "
"propagados. Veja as constantes para saber o que cada uma faz. Use [method "
"get_mouse_filter_with_override] para determinar se um controle pode receber "
"entrada de mouse, já que [member mouse_behavior_recursive] também o afeta."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"When enabled, scroll wheel events processed by [method _gui_input] will be "
"passed to the parent control even if [member mouse_filter] is set to "
"[constant MOUSE_FILTER_STOP].\n"
"You should disable it on the root of your UI if you do not want scroll "
"events to go to the [method Node._unhandled_input] processing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Because this property defaults to [code]true[/code], this "
"allows nested scrollable containers to work out of the box."
msgstr ""
"Quando ativado, eventos da roda do mouse processados por [method _gui_input] "
"serão passados para o controle pai mesmo se [member mouse_filter] estiver "
"definido como [constant MOUSE_FILTER_STOP].\n"
"Você deve desativá-lo na raiz da sua UI se não quiser que eventos de rolagem "
"vão para o processamento [method Node._unhandled_input].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Como esta propriedade é [code]true[/code] por padrão, isso "
"permite que contêineres roláveis aninhados funcionem nativamente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Distance between the node's bottom edge and its parent control, based on "
"[member anchor_bottom].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"Distância entre a borda inferior do nó e seu controle pai, com base em "
"[member anchor_bottom].\n"
"Os deslocamentos geralmente são controlados por um ou vários nós pais "
"[Container], portanto, você não deve modificá-los manualmente se seu nó for "
"um filho direto de um [Container]. Os deslocamentos são atualizados "
"automaticamente quando você move ou redimensiona o nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Distance between the node's left edge and its parent control, based on "
"[member anchor_left].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"Distância entre a borda esquerda do nó e seu controle pai, com base em "
"[member anchor_left].\n"
"Os deslocamentos geralmente são controlados por um ou vários nós pais "
"[Container], portanto, você não deve modificá-los manualmente se seu nó for "
"um filho direto de um [Container]. Os deslocamentos são atualizados "
"automaticamente quando você move ou redimensiona o nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Distance between the node's right edge and its parent control, based on "
"[member anchor_right].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"Distância entre a borda direita do nó e seu controle pai, com base em "
"[member anchor_right].\n"
"Os deslocamentos geralmente são controlados por um ou vários nós pais "
"[Container], portanto, você não deve modificá-los manualmente se seu nó for "
"um filho direto de um [Container]. Os deslocamentos são atualizados "
"automaticamente quando você move ou redimensiona o nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Distance between the node's top edge and its parent control, based on "
"[member anchor_top].\n"
"Offsets are often controlled by one or multiple parent [Container] nodes, so "
"you should not modify them manually if your node is a direct child of a "
"[Container]. Offsets update automatically when you move or resize the node."
msgstr ""
"Distância entre a borda superior do nó e seu controle pai, com base em "
"[member anchor_top].\n"
"Os deslocamentos geralmente são controlados por um ou vários nós pais "
"[Container], portanto, você não deve modificá-los manualmente se seu nó for "
"um filho direto de um [Container]. Os deslocamentos são atualizados "
"automaticamente quando você move ou redimensiona o nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], applies all offset transform properties. Otherwise, no "
"offset transform is applied and the properties have no effect."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], aplica todas as propriedades de transformação de "
"deslocamento. Caso contrário, nenhuma transformação de deslocamento é "
"aplicada e as propriedades não têm efeito."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Pivot used by [member offset_transform_rotation] and [member "
"offset_transform_scale] in absolute units.\n"
"The final pivot position is the combined value of this property and [member "
"offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [member offset_transform_pivot] but expressed in units relative to "
"the [Control] [member size] where [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] is the top-left "
"corner of this control, and [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] is its bottom-right "
"corner.\n"
"The final pivot position is the combined value of this property and [member "
"offset_transform_pivot].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Position offset in absolute units. The final offset is the combined value of "
"this property and [member offset_transform_position_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [member offset_transform_position] but expressed in units relative "
"to the [Control] [member size] where [code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] is the top-"
"left corner of this control, and [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] is its bottom-"
"right corner.\n"
"The final offset is the combined value of this property and [member "
"offset_transform_position].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Rotation offset. The rotation pivot is defined by [member "
"offset_transform_pivot] and [member offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Scale offset. The scale pivot is defined by [member offset_transform_pivot] "
"and [member offset_transform_pivot_ratio].\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the offset transforms is only applied visually and "
"does not affect input. In other words, this Control will still receive input "
"events at its original location before the offset transform is applied.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the entire transform of this Control is affected and "
"input events will register where the Control is visually.\n"
"Has no effect unless [member offset_transform_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"By default, the node's pivot is its top-left corner. When you change its "
"[member rotation] or [member scale], it will rotate or scale around this "
"pivot.\n"
"The actual offset is the combined value of this property and [member "
"pivot_offset_ratio]."
msgstr ""
"Por padrão, o pivô do nó é seu canto superior esquerdo. Quando você altera "
"sua [member rotation] ou [member scale], ele girará ou escalará em torno "
"deste pivô.\n"
"O deslocamento real é o valor combinado desta propriedade e [member "
"pivot_offset_ratio]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [member pivot_offset], but expressed as uniform vector, where "
"[code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code] is the top-left corner of this control, and "
"[code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] is its bottom-right corner. Set this property to "
"[code]Vector2(0.5, 0.5)[/code] to pivot around this control's center.\n"
"The actual offset is the combined value of this property and [member "
"pivot_offset]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The node's position, relative to its containing node. It corresponds to the "
"rectangle's top-left corner. The property is not affected by [member "
"pivot_offset]."
msgstr ""
"A posição do nó, em relação ao nó que o contém. Corresponde ao canto "
"superior esquerdo do retângulo. A propriedade não é afetada por [member "
"pivot_offset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this Control's children will use the value returned by "
"[method get_combined_maximum_size] in their own size calculations."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os filhos deste Control usarão o valor retornado por "
"[method get_combined_maximum_size] em seus próprios cálculos de tamanho."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The node's rotation around its pivot, in radians. See [member pivot_offset] "
"to change the pivot's position.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is edited in the inspector in degrees. If you "
"want to use degrees in a script, use [member rotation_degrees]."
msgstr ""
"A rotação do nó em torno de seu pivô, em radianos. Consulte [member "
"pivot_offset] para alterar a posição do pivô.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade é editada no inspetor em graus. Se você quiser "
"usar graus em um script, use [[member rotation_degrees]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Helper property to access [member rotation] in degrees instead of radians."
msgstr ""
"Propriedade auxiliar para acessar [member rotation] em graus em vez de "
"radianos."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The node's scale, relative to its [member size]. Change this property to "
"scale the node around its [member pivot_offset]. The Control's tooltip will "
"also scale according to this value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is mainly intended to be used for animation "
"purposes. To support multiple resolutions in your project, use an "
"appropriate viewport stretch mode as described in the [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.html]documentation[/url] instead of "
"scaling Controls individually.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member FontFile.oversampling] does [i]not[/i] take [Control] "
"[member scale] into account. This means that scaling up/down will cause "
"bitmap fonts and rasterized (non-MSDF) dynamic fonts to appear blurry or "
"pixelated. To ensure text remains crisp regardless of scale, you can enable "
"MSDF font rendering by enabling [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"default_font_multichannel_signed_distance_field] (applies to the default "
"project font only), or enabling [b]Multichannel Signed Distance Field[/b] in "
"the import options of a DynamicFont for custom fonts. On system fonts, "
"[member SystemFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field] can be enabled in the "
"inspector.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the Control node is a child of a [Container] node, the scale "
"will be reset to [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] when the scene is instantiated. "
"To set the Control's scale when it's instantiated, wait for one frame using "
"[code]await get_tree().process_frame[/code] then set its [member scale] "
"property."
msgstr ""
"A escala do nó, em relação ao seu [member size]. Altere esta propriedade "
"para dimensionar o nó ao redor de seu [member pivot_offset]. A dica de "
"ferramenta do Control também será dimensionada de acordo com este valor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade é destinada principalmente para fins de "
"animação. Para dar suporte a múltiplas resoluções em seu projeto, use um "
"modo de ajuste de viewport apropriado conforme descrito na [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.html]documentação[/url] em vez de "
"dimensionar Controls individualmente.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [member FontFile.oversampling] [i]não[/i] leva [member scale] "
"de [Control] em consideração. Isso significa que aumentar ou diminuir a "
"escala fará com que fontes bitmap e fontes dinâmicas rasterizadas (não MSDF) "
"apareçam borradas ou pixeladas. Para garantir que o texto permaneça nítido "
"independentemente da escala, você pode habilitar a renderização de fontes "
"MSDF ativando [member ProjectSettings.gui/theme/"
"default_font_multichannel_signed_distance_field] (aplica-se apenas à fonte "
"padrão do projeto) ou habilitando [b]Multichannel Signed Distance Field[/b] "
"nas opções de importação de uma DynamicFont para fontes personalizadas. Em "
"fontes do sistema, [member SystemFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field] "
"pode ser habilitado no inspetor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se o nó Control for filho de um nó [Container], a escala será "
"redefinida para [code]Vector2(1, 1)[/code] quando a cena for instanciada. "
"Para definir a escala do Control quando ele for instanciado, aguarde um "
"frame usando [code]await get_tree().process_frame[/code] e então defina sua "
"propriedade [member scale]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The [Node] which must be a parent of the focused [Control] for the shortcut "
"to be activated. If [code]null[/code], the shortcut can be activated when "
"any control is focused (a global shortcut). This allows shortcuts to be "
"accepted only when the user has a certain area of the GUI focused."
msgstr ""
"O [Node] que deve ser pai do [Control] focado para o atalho ser ativado. Se "
"[code]null[/code], o atalho poderá ser ativado quando qualquer Control for "
"focado (um atalho global). Isso permite que os atalhos sejam aceitos apenas "
"quando o usuário tiver uma determinada área da GUI focada."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the node's bounding rectangle, in the node's coordinate system. "
"[Container] nodes update this property automatically."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho do retângulo delimitador do nó, no sistema de coordenadas do nó. "
"Os nós [Container] atualizam esta propriedade automaticamente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] nodes how they should resize and place the node "
"on the X axis. Use a combination of the [enum SizeFlags] constants to change "
"the flags. See the constants to learn what each does."
msgstr ""
"Informa aos nós [Container] pais como eles devem redimensionar e posicionar "
"o nó no eixo X. Use uma combinação das constantes [enum SizeFlags] para "
"alterar as flags. Veja as constantes para aprender o que cada uma faz."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"If the node and at least one of its neighbors uses the [constant "
"SIZE_EXPAND] size flag, the parent [Container] will let it take more or less "
"space depending on this property. If this node has a stretch ratio of 2 and "
"its neighbor a ratio of 1, this node will take two thirds of the available "
"space."
msgstr ""
"Se o nó e pelo menos um de seus vizinhos usarem o sinalizador de tamanho "
"[constant SIZE_EXPAND], o pai [Container] o deixará ocupar mais ou menos "
"espaço dependendo dessa propriedade. Se este nó tiver uma razão de extensão "
"de 2 e seu vizinho uma razão de 1, este nó ocupará dois terços do espaço "
"disponível."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] nodes how they should resize and place the node "
"on the Y axis. Use a combination of the [enum SizeFlags] constants to change "
"the flags. See the constants to learn what each does."
msgstr ""
"Informa aos nós [Container] pais como eles devem redimensionar e posicionar "
"o nó no eixo Y. Use uma combinação das constantes [enum SizeFlags] para "
"alterar as flags. Veja as constantes para aprender o que cada uma faz."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"The [Theme] resource this node and all its [Control] and [Window] children "
"use. If a child node has its own [Theme] resource set, theme items are "
"merged with child's definitions having higher priority.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Window] styles will have no effect unless the window is "
"embedded."
msgstr ""
"O recurso [Theme] deste nó e todo o seu [Control] e [Window] de seus filhos. "
"Se um nó filho tiver seu próprio conjunto de recursos [Theme], os itens do "
"tema são mesclados com as definições do filho com maior prioridade.\n"
"[b] Nota: [/b] Os estilos da [Window] não terão efeito, a menos que a janela "
"esteja incorporada."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The name of a theme type variation used by this [Control] to look up its own "
"theme items. When empty, the class name of the node is used (e.g. [code skip-"
"lint]Button[/code] for the [Button] control), as well as the class names of "
"all parent classes (in order of inheritance).\n"
"When set, this property gives the highest priority to the type of the "
"specified name. This type can in turn extend another type, forming a "
"dependency chain. See [method Theme.set_type_variation]. If the theme item "
"cannot be found using this type or its base types, lookup falls back on the "
"class names.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To look up [Control]'s own items use various [code]get_theme_*[/"
"code] methods without specifying [code]theme_type[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Theme items are looked for in the tree order, from branch to "
"root, where each [Control] node is checked for its [member theme] property. "
"The earliest match against any type/class name is returned. The project-"
"level Theme and the default Theme are checked last."
msgstr ""
"O nome de uma variação de tipo de tema usada por este [Control] para "
"pesquisar seus próprios itens de tema. Quando vazio, o nome da classe do nó "
"é usado (por exemplo, [code skip-lint]Button[/code] para o controle "
"[Button]), bem como os nomes de classe de todas as classes pai (em ordem de "
"herança).\n"
"Quando definido, esta propriedade dá a maior prioridade ao tipo do nome "
"especificado. Este tipo pode, por sua vez, estender outro tipo, formando uma "
"cadeia de dependência. Veja [method Theme.set_type_variation]. Se o item de "
"tema não puder ser encontrado usando este tipo ou seus tipos base, a "
"pesquisa recorre aos nomes de classe.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para pesquisar os próprios itens de [Control], use vários "
"métodos [code]get_theme_*[/code] sem especificar [code]theme_type[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Itens de tema são procurados na ordem da árvore, do ramo para a "
"raiz, onde cada nó [Control] é verificado quanto à sua propriedade [member "
"theme]. A primeira correspondência com qualquer nome de tipo/classe é "
"retornada. O Tema de nível de projeto e o Tema padrão são verificados por "
"último."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Defines if tooltip text should automatically change to its translated "
"version depending on the current locale. Uses the same auto translate mode "
"as this control when set to [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Tooltips customized using [method _make_custom_tooltip] do not "
"use this auto translate mode automatically."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The default tooltip text. The tooltip appears when the user's mouse cursor "
"stays idle over this control for a few moments, provided that the [member "
"mouse_filter] property is not [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]. The time "
"required for the tooltip to appear can be changed with the [member "
"ProjectSettings.gui/timers/tooltip_delay_sec] setting.\n"
"This string is the default return value of [method get_tooltip]. Override "
"[method _get_tooltip] to generate tooltip text dynamically. Override [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip] to customize the tooltip interface and behavior.\n"
"The tooltip popup will use either a default implementation, or a custom one "
"that you can provide by overriding [method _make_custom_tooltip]. The "
"default tooltip includes a [PopupPanel] and [Label] whose theme properties "
"can be customized using [Theme] methods with the [code]\"TooltipPanel\"[/"
"code] and [code]\"TooltipLabel\"[/code] respectively. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var style_box = StyleBoxFlat.new()\n"
"style_box.set_bg_color(Color(1, 1, 0))\n"
"style_box.set_border_width_all(2)\n"
"# We assume here that the `theme` property has been assigned a custom Theme "
"beforehand.\n"
"theme.set_stylebox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", style_box)\n"
"theme.set_color(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", Color(0, 1, 1))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var styleBox = new StyleBoxFlat();\n"
"styleBox.SetBgColor(new Color(1, 1, 0));\n"
"styleBox.SetBorderWidthAll(2);\n"
"// We assume here that the `Theme` property has been assigned a custom Theme "
"beforehand.\n"
"Theme.SetStyleBox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", styleBox);\n"
"Theme.SetColor(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", new Color(0, 1, 1));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"O texto padrão da dica de ferramenta. A dica de ferramenta é exibida quando "
"o cursor do mouse do usuário permanece parado sobre este controle por alguns "
"instantes, desde que a propriedade [member mouse_filter] não seja [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]. O tempo necessário para que a dica de ferramenta seja "
"exibida pode ser alterado pela configuração [member ProjectSettings.gui/"
"timers/tooltip_delay_sec].\n"
"Esta string é o valor de retorno padrão de [method get_tooltip]. Substitua "
"[method _get_tooltip] para gerar o texto da dica de ferramenta "
"dinamicamente. Substitua [method _make_custom_tooltip] para personalizar a "
"interface e o comportamento da dica de ferramenta.\n"
"A janela pop-up da dica de ferramenta usará uma implementação padrão ou uma "
"implementação personalizada que você pode fornecer substituindo [method "
"_make_custom_tooltip]. A dica de ferramenta padrão inclui um [PopupPanel] e "
"um [Label], cujas propriedades de tema podem ser personalizadas usando os "
"métodos de [Theme] com [code]\"TooltipPanel\"[/code] e [code]"
"\"TooltipLabel\"[/code], respectivamente. Por exemplo:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var style_box = StyleBoxFlat.new()\n"
"style_box.set_bg_color(Color(1, 1, 0))\n"
"style_box.set_border_width_all(2)\n"
"# Assumimos aqui que a propriedade `theme` recebeu anteriormente um Theme "
"personalizado.\n"
"theme.set_stylebox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", style_box)\n"
"theme.set_color(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", Color(0, 1, 1))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var styleBox = new StyleBoxFlat();\n"
"styleBox.SetBgColor(new Color(1, 1, 0));\n"
"styleBox.SetBorderWidthAll(2);\n"
"// Assumimos aqui que a propriedade `Theme` recebeu anteriormente um Theme "
"personalizado.\n"
"Theme.SetStyleBox(\"panel\", \"TooltipPanel\", styleBox);\n"
"Theme.SetColor(\"font_color\", \"TooltipLabel\", new Color(0, 1, 1));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The translation context used when translating this control's displayed text, "
"if it has any. Also used when generating translation templates."
msgstr ""
"O contexto de tradução usado ao traduzir o texto exibido deste controle, se "
"houver. Também usado ao gerar modelos de tradução."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Emitted when the node gains focus."
msgstr "Emitido quando o nó ganha foco."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Emitted when the node loses focus."
msgstr "Emitido quando o nó perde o foco."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Emitted when the node receives an [InputEvent]."
msgstr "Emitido quando o nó recebe um [InputEvent]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Emitted when the node's maximum size changes."
msgstr "Emitido quando o tamanho máximo do nó muda."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Emitted when the node's minimum size changes."
msgstr "Emitido quando o tamanho mínimo do nó muda."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse cursor enters the control's (or any child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, "
"provided its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if "
"it's currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect, which Control "
"receives the signal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the mouse cursor leaves the control's (and all child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, "
"provided its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if "
"it's currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect, which Control "
"receives the signal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check whether the mouse truly left the area, "
"ignoring any top nodes, you can use code like this:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _on_mouse_exited():\n"
"\tif not Rect2(Vector2(), size).has_point(get_local_mouse_position()):\n"
"\t\t# Not hovering over area.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Emitted when the control changes size."
msgstr "Emitido quando o controle muda de tamanho."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when one of the size flags changes. See [member "
"size_flags_horizontal] and [member size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma das flags de tamanho muda. Veja [member "
"size_flags_horizontal] e [member size_flags_vertical]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the [constant NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] notification is sent."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a notificação [constant NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED] é enviada."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The node cannot grab focus. Use with [member focus_mode]."
msgstr "O nó não pode capturar o foco. Use com [member focus_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The node can only grab focus on mouse clicks. Use with [member focus_mode]."
msgstr ""
"O nó só pode obter foco em cliques do mouse. Use com [member focus_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The node can grab focus on mouse click, using the arrows and the Tab keys on "
"the keyboard, or using the D-pad buttons on a gamepad. Use with [member "
"focus_mode]."
msgstr ""
"O nó pode capturar o foco com o clique do mouse, usando as setas e as teclas "
"Tab no teclado, ou usando os botões do D-pad em um controle de jogo. Use com "
"[member focus_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The node can grab focus only when screen reader is active. Use with [member "
"focus_mode]."
msgstr ""
"O nó pode obter o foco apenas quando o leitor de tela estiver ativo. Use com "
"[member focus_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Inherits the [member focus_behavior_recursive] from the parent control. If "
"there is no parent control, this is the same as [constant "
"FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Herda o [member focus_behavior_recursive] do controle pai. Se não houver "
"controle pai, isso é o mesmo que [constant FOCUS_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Prevents the control from getting focused. [method "
"get_focus_mode_with_override] will return [constant FOCUS_NONE]."
msgstr ""
"Impede que o controle receba foco. [method get_focus_mode_with_override] "
"retornará [constant FOCUS_NONE]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Allows the control to be focused, depending on the [member focus_mode]. This "
"can be used to ignore the parent's [member focus_behavior_recursive]. "
"[method get_focus_mode_with_override] will return the [member focus_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que o controle receba foco, dependendo do [member focus_mode]. Isso "
"pode ser usado para ignorar o [member focus_behavior_recursive] do pai. "
"[method get_focus_mode_with_override] retornará o [member focus_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Inherits the [member mouse_behavior_recursive] from the parent control. If "
"there is no parent control, this is the same as [constant "
"MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Herda o [member mouse_behavior_recursive] do controle pai. Se não houver "
"controle pai, isso é o mesmo que [constant MOUSE_BEHAVIOR_ENABLED]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Prevents the control from receiving mouse input. [method "
"get_mouse_filter_with_override] will return [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."
msgstr ""
"Impede que o controle receba entrada do mouse. [method "
"get_mouse_filter_with_override] retornará [constant MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Allows the control to receive mouse input, depending on the [member "
"mouse_filter]. This can be used to ignore the parent's [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive]. [method get_mouse_filter_with_override] will "
"return the [member mouse_filter]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que o controle receba entrada de mouse, dependendo do [member "
"mouse_filter]. Isso pode ser usado para ignorar o [member "
"mouse_behavior_recursive] do pai. [method get_mouse_filter_with_override] "
"retornará o [member mouse_filter]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Sent when the node changes size. Use [member size] to get the new size."
msgstr ""
"Enviado quando o nó muda de tamanho. Use [member size] para obter o novo "
"tamanho."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor enters the control's (or any child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, "
"provided its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if "
"it's currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_ENTER_SELF]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor leaves the control's (and all child control's) "
"visible area, that is not occluded behind other Controls or Windows, "
"provided its [member mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if "
"it's currently focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT_SELF]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The reason this notification is sent may change in the future."
msgstr "O motivo pelo qual esta notificação é enviada pode mudar no futuro."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor enters the control's visible area, that is not "
"occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided its [member "
"mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if it's currently "
"focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_ENTER]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when the mouse cursor leaves the control's visible area, that is not "
"occluded behind other Controls or Windows, provided its [member "
"mouse_filter] lets the event reach it and regardless if it's currently "
"focused or not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member CanvasItem.z_index] doesn't affect which Control "
"receives the notification.\n"
"See also [constant NOTIFICATION_MOUSE_EXIT]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Sent when the node grabs focus."
msgstr "Enviado quando o nó obtém o foco."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when the node loses focus.\n"
"This notification is sent in reversed order."
msgstr ""
"Enviada quando o nó perde o foco.\n"
"Esta notificação é enviada em ordem inversa."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when the node needs to refresh its theme items. This happens in one of "
"the following cases:\n"
"- The [member theme] property is changed on this node or any of its "
"ancestors.\n"
"- The [member theme_type_variation] property is changed on this node.\n"
"- One of the node's theme property overrides is changed.\n"
"- The node enters the scene tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As an optimization, this notification won't be sent from "
"changes that occur while this node is outside of the scene tree. Instead, "
"all of the theme item updates can be applied at once when the node enters "
"the scene tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This notification is received alongside [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE], so if you are instantiating a scene, the "
"child nodes will not be initialized yet. You can use it to setup theming for "
"this node, child nodes created from script, or if you want to access child "
"nodes added in the editor, make sure the node is ready using [method "
"Node.is_node_ready].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _notification(what):\n"
"\tif what == NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED:\n"
"\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n"
"\t\t\tawait ready # Wait until ready signal.\n"
"\t\t$Label.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color.YELLOW)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when this node is inside a [ScrollContainer] which has begun being "
"scrolled when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a touch event[/i]. This "
"notification is [i]not[/i] sent when scrolling by dragging the scrollbar, "
"scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with keyboard/gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/"
"web platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when this node is inside a [ScrollContainer] which has stopped being "
"scrolled when dragging the scrollable area [i]with a touch event[/i]. This "
"notification is [i]not[/i] sent when scrolling by dragging the scrollbar, "
"scrolling with the mouse wheel or scrolling with keyboard/gamepad events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is only emitted on Android or iOS, or on desktop/"
"web platforms when [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse] is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sent when the control layout direction is changed from LTR or RTL or vice "
"versa. This notification is propagated to child Control nodes as result of a "
"change to [member layout_direction]."
msgstr ""
"Enviado quando a direção do layout do controle é alterada de LTR para RTL ou "
"vice-versa. Esta notificação é propagada para nós Control filhos como "
"resultado de uma alteração em [member layout_direction]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's arrow mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. Use with "
"[member mouse_default_cursor_shape]."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor de mouse em seta do sistema quando o usuário passa o mouse "
"sobre o nó. Use com [member mouse_default_cursor_shape]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's I-beam mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. The I-"
"beam pointer has a shape similar to \"I\". It tells the user they can "
"highlight or insert text."
msgstr ""
"Exibe o cursor de mouse em forma de I do sistema quando o usuário passa o "
"cursor sobre o nó. O ponteiro em formato de I tem um formato semelhante a "
"\"I\". Ele indica ao usuário que é possível destacar ou inserir texto."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's pointing hand mouse cursor when the user hovers the node."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse em formato de mão apontadora do sistema quando o "
"usuário passa o cursor sobre o nó."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Show the system's cross mouse cursor when the user hovers the node."
msgstr ""
"Exibe o cursor de mouse em cruz do sistema quando o usuário passa o mouse "
"sobre o nós."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's wait mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. Often an "
"hourglass."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de espera do sistema quando o usuário passa o mouse "
"sobre o nó. Frequentemente uma ampulheta."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's busy mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. Often an "
"arrow with a small hourglass."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor de mouse ocupado do sistema quando o usuário passa o mouse "
"sobre o nó. Geralmente uma seta com uma pequena ampulheta."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's drag mouse cursor, often a closed fist or a cross symbol, "
"when the user hovers the node. It tells the user they're currently dragging "
"an item, like a node in the Scene dock."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de arrastar do sistema, geralmente um punho fechado "
"ou um símbolo de cruz, quando o usuário passa o mouse sobre o nó. Isso "
"indica ao usuário que ele está arrastando um item no momento, como um nó na "
"doca Cena."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's drop mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. It can be "
"an open hand. It tells the user they can drop an item they're currently "
"grabbing, like a node in the Scene dock."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de soltar do sistema quando o usuário passa o mouse "
"sobre o nó. Pode ser uma mão aberta. Indica ao usuário que ele pode soltar "
"um item que está segurando no momento, como um nó na doca Cena."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's forbidden mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"Often a crossed circle."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor de mouse proibido do sistema quando o usuário passa o mouse "
"sobre o nó. Geralmente um círculo cruzado."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's vertical resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the "
"node. A double-headed vertical arrow. It tells the user they can resize the "
"window or the panel vertically."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de redimensionamento vertical do sistema quando o "
"usuário passa o mouse sobre o nó. Uma seta vertical de duas pontas. Ela "
"indica ao usuário que ele pode redimensionar a janela ou o painel "
"verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's horizontal resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the "
"node. A double-headed horizontal arrow. It tells the user they can resize "
"the window or the panel horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de redimensionamento horizontal do sistema quando o "
"usuário passa o mouse sobre o nó. Uma seta horizontal de duas pontas. Ela "
"indica ao usuário que ele pode redimensionar a janela ou o painel "
"horizontalmente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's window resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes from the bottom left to the "
"top right. It tells the user they can resize the window or the panel both "
"horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor de mouse de redimensionamento de janela do sistema quando o "
"usuário passa o mouse sobre o nó. O cursor é uma seta de duas pontas que vai "
"do canto inferior esquerdo ao canto superior direito. Ele diz ao usuário que "
"ele pode redimensionar a janela ou o painel horizontal e verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's window resize mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes from the top left to the "
"bottom right, the opposite of [constant CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. It tells the user "
"they can resize the window or the panel both horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de redimensionamento de janela do sistema quando o "
"usuário passa o mouse sobre o nó. O cursor é uma seta de duas pontas que vai "
"do canto superior esquerdo até o inferior direito, o oposto de [constant "
"CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. Ele diz ao usuário que ele pode redimensionar a janela ou "
"o painel horizontal e verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's move mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. It shows "
"2 double-headed arrows at a 90 degree angle. It tells the user they can move "
"a UI element freely."
msgstr ""
"Exibe o cursor de mouse de movimentação do sistema quando o usuário passa o "
"cursor sobre o nó. Ele mostra 2 setas de ponta dupla em um ângulo de 90 "
"graus. Ele indica ao usuário que é possível mover um elemento de interface "
"livremente."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's vertical split mouse cursor when the user hovers the node. "
"On Windows, it's the same as [constant CURSOR_VSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de divisão vertical do sistema quando o usuário "
"passa o mouse sobre o nó. No Windows, é o mesmo que [constant CURSOR_VSIZE]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's horizontal split mouse cursor when the user hovers the "
"node. On Windows, it's the same as [constant CURSOR_HSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de divisão horizontal do sistema quando o usuário "
"passa o mouse sobre o nó. No Windows, é o mesmo que [constant CURSOR_HSIZE]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Show the system's help mouse cursor when the user hovers the node, a "
"question mark."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o cursor do mouse de ajuda do sistema quando o usuário passa o mouse "
"sobre o nó, um ponto de interrogação."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the top-left of the parent control's bounds. Use with "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta todas as 4 âncoras para o canto superior esquerdo dos limites do "
"controle pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the top-right of the parent control's bounds. Use with "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta todas as 4 âncoras para o canto superior direito dos limites do "
"controle pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the bottom-left of the parent control's bounds. Use "
"with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta todas as 4 âncoras para o canto inferior esquerdo dos limites do "
"controle pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the bottom-right of the parent control's bounds. Use "
"with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta todas as 4 âncoras para o canto inferior direito dos limites do "
"controle pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the left edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Fixa todas as 4 âncoras no centro da borda esquerda dos limites do controle "
"pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the top edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Fixa todas as 4 âncoras no centro da borda superior dos limites do controle "
"pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the right edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Fixa todas as 4 âncoras no centro da borda direita dos limites do controle "
"pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the bottom edge of the parent control's "
"bounds. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Fixa todas as 4 âncoras no centro da borda inferior dos limites do controle "
"pai. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the center of the parent control's bounds. Use with "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta as 4 âncoras para o centro dos limites do controle pai. Use com "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the left edge of the parent control. The left offset "
"becomes relative to the left edge and the top offset relative to the top "
"left corner of the node's parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta todas as 4 âncoras para a borda esquerda do controle pai. O "
"deslocamento esquerdo torna-se relativo à borda esquerda e o deslocamento "
"superior relativo ao canto superior esquerdo do pai do nó. Use com [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the top edge of the parent control. The left offset "
"becomes relative to the top left corner, the top offset relative to the top "
"edge, and the right offset relative to the top right corner of the node's "
"parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Encaixa todas as 4 âncoras na borda superior do controle pai. O deslocamento "
"esquerdo torna-se relativo ao canto superior esquerdo, o deslocamento "
"superior relativo à borda superior e o deslocamento direito relativo ao "
"canto superior direito do pai do nó. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the right edge of the parent control. The right offset "
"becomes relative to the right edge and the top offset relative to the top "
"right corner of the node's parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta todas as 4 âncoras para a borda direita do controle pai. O "
"deslocamento direito torna-se relativo à borda direita e o deslocamento "
"superior relativo ao canto superior direito do pai do nó. Use com [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the bottom edge of the parent control. The left offset "
"becomes relative to the bottom left corner, the bottom offset relative to "
"the bottom edge, and the right offset relative to the bottom right corner of "
"the node's parent. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Encaixa todas as 4 âncoras na borda inferior do controle pai. O deslocamento "
"esquerdo torna-se relativo ao canto inferior esquerdo, o deslocamento "
"inferior relativo à borda inferior e o deslocamento direito relativo ao "
"canto inferior direito do pai do nó. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to a vertical line that cuts the parent control in half. "
"Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Alinha todas as 4 âncoras a uma linha vertical que corta o controle pai ao "
"meio. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to a horizontal line that cuts the parent control in "
"half. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Alinha todas as 4 âncoras a uma linha horizontal que corta o controle pai ao "
"meio. Use com [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snap all 4 anchors to the respective corners of the parent control. Set all "
"4 offsets to 0 after you applied this preset and the [Control] will fit its "
"parent control. Use with [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta todas as 4 âncoras aos respectivos cantos do controle pai. Defina "
"todas as 4 compensações (offsets) como 0 após aplicar esta predefinição e o "
"[Control] se ajustará ao seu controle pai. Use com [method "
"set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The control will be resized to its minimum size."
msgstr "O controle será redimensionado ao seu tamanho mínimo."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The control's width will not change."
msgstr "A largura do controle não irá mudar."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The control's height will not change."
msgstr "A altura do controle não irá mudar."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "The control's size will not change."
msgstr "O tamanho do controle não irá mudar."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to align the node with its start, either the "
"top or the left edge. It is mutually exclusive with [constant SIZE_FILL] and "
"other shrink size flags, but can be used with [constant SIZE_EXPAND] in some "
"containers. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and [member "
"size_flags_vertical].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this flag is equal to not having any size flags."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to expand the bounds of this node to fill all "
"the available space without pushing any other node. It is mutually exclusive "
"with shrink size flags. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and [member "
"size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"Informa ao [Container] pai para expandir os limites deste nó para preencher "
"todo o espaço disponível sem empurrar nenhum outro nó. É mutuamente "
"exclusivo com sinalizadores de tamanho de encolhimento. Use com [member "
"size_flags_horizontal] e [member size_flags_vertical]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to let this node take all the available space "
"on the axis you flag. If multiple neighboring nodes are set to expand, "
"they'll share the space based on their stretch ratio. See [member "
"size_flags_stretch_ratio]. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and "
"[member size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"Diz ao [Container] pai para permitir que este nó ocupe todo o espaço "
"disponível no eixo sinalizado. Se vários nós vizinhos estiverem configurados "
"para expandir, eles compartilharão o espaço com base em sua proporção de "
"alongamento. Veja [member size_flags_stretch_ratio]. Use com [member "
"size_flags_horizontal] e [member size_flags_vertical]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the node's size flags to both fill and expand. See [constant SIZE_FILL] "
"and [constant SIZE_EXPAND] for more information."
msgstr ""
"Define as flags de tamanho do nó para preencher e expandir. Veja [constant "
"SIZE_FILL] e [constant SIZE_EXPAND] para mais informações."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to center the node in the available space. It "
"is mutually exclusive with [constant SIZE_FILL] and other shrink size flags, "
"but can be used with [constant SIZE_EXPAND] in some containers. Use with "
"[member size_flags_horizontal] and [member size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"Diz ao [Container] pai para centralizar o nó no espaço disponível. É "
"mutuamente exclusivo com [constant SIZE_FILL] e outras flags de tamanho de "
"redução, mas pode ser usado com [constant SIZE_EXPAND] em alguns "
"contêineres. Use com [member size_flags_horizontal] e [member "
"size_flags_vertical]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Tells the parent [Container] to align the node with its end, either the "
"bottom or the right edge. It is mutually exclusive with [constant SIZE_FILL] "
"and other shrink size flags, but can be used with [constant SIZE_EXPAND] in "
"some containers. Use with [member size_flags_horizontal] and [member "
"size_flags_vertical]."
msgstr ""
"Diz ao [Container] pai para alinhar o nó com sua extremidade, seja a borda "
"inferior ou direita. É mutuamente exclusivo com [constant SIZE_FILL] e "
"outras flags de tamanho de encolhimento, mas pode ser usado com [constant "
"SIZE_EXPAND] em alguns containers. Use com [member size_flags_horizontal] e "
"[member size_flags_vertical]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The control will receive mouse movement input events and mouse button input "
"events if clicked on through [method _gui_input]. The control will also "
"receive the [signal mouse_entered] and [signal mouse_exited] signals. These "
"events are automatically marked as handled, and they will not propagate "
"further to other controls. This also results in blocking signals in other "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"O controle receberá eventos de entrada de movimento do mouse e de clique de "
"botão do mouse se for clicado por meio de [method _gui_input]. O controle "
"também receberá os sinais [signal mouse_entered] e [signal mouse_exited]. "
"Esses eventos são marcados automaticamente como tratados e não se propagarão "
"para outros controles. Isso também resulta no bloqueio de sinais em outros "
"controles."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The control will receive mouse movement input events and mouse button input "
"events if clicked on through [method _gui_input]. The control will also "
"receive the [signal mouse_entered] and [signal mouse_exited] signals.\n"
"If this control does not handle the event, the event will propagate up to "
"its parent control if it has one. The event is bubbled up the node hierarchy "
"until it reaches a non-[CanvasItem], a control with [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_STOP], or a [CanvasItem] with [member CanvasItem.top_level] "
"enabled. This will allow signals to fire in all controls it reaches. If no "
"control handled it, the event will be passed to [method "
"Node._shortcut_input] for further processing."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The control will not receive any mouse movement input events nor mouse "
"button input events through [method _gui_input]. The control will also not "
"receive the [signal mouse_entered] nor [signal mouse_exited] signals. This "
"will not block other controls from receiving these events or firing the "
"signals. Ignored events will not be handled automatically. If a child has "
"[constant MOUSE_FILTER_PASS] and an event was passed to this control, the "
"event will further propagate up to the control's parent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the control has received [signal mouse_entered] but not "
"[signal mouse_exited], changing the [member mouse_filter] to [constant "
"MOUSE_FILTER_IGNORE] will cause [signal mouse_exited] to be emitted."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The control will grow to the left or top to make up if its minimum size is "
"changed to be greater than its current size on the respective axis."
msgstr ""
"O controle crescerá para a esquerda ou para cima para compensar caso seu "
"tamanho mínimo passe a ser maior do que seu tamanho atual no respectivo eixo."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The control will grow to the right or bottom to make up if its minimum size "
"is changed to be greater than its current size on the respective axis."
msgstr ""
"O controle crescerá para a direita ou para baixo para compensar caso seu "
"tamanho mínimo passe a ser maior do que seu tamanho atual no respectivo eixo."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"The control will grow in both directions equally to make up if its minimum "
"size is changed to be greater than its current size."
msgstr ""
"O controle crescerá em ambas as direções igualmente para compensar se o seu "
"tamanho mínimo for alterado para ser maior do que o tamanho atual."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snaps one of the 4 anchor's sides to the origin of the node's [code]Rect[/"
"code], in the top left. Use it with one of the [code]anchor_*[/code] member "
"variables, like [member anchor_left]. To change all 4 anchors at once, use "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Fixa um dos 4 lados da âncora à origem do [code]Rect[/code] do nó, no canto "
"superior esquerdo. Use com uma das variáveis de membro [code]anchor_*[/"
"code], como [member anchor_left]. Para alterar todas as 4 âncoras de uma "
"vez, use [method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Snaps one of the 4 anchor's sides to the end of the node's [code]Rect[/"
"code], in the bottom right. Use it with one of the [code]anchor_*[/code] "
"member variables, like [member anchor_left]. To change all 4 anchors at "
"once, use [method set_anchors_preset]."
msgstr ""
"Fixa um dos 4 lados da âncora ao final do [code]Rect[/code] do nó, no canto "
"inferior direito. Use com uma das variáveis de membro [code]anchor_*[/code], "
"como [member anchor_left]. Para alterar todas as 4 âncoras de uma vez, use "
"[method set_anchors_preset]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Automatic layout direction, determined from the parent control layout "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"Direção de layout automática, determinada a partir da direção de layout do "
"controle pai."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Automatic layout direction, determined from the current locale. Right-to-"
"left layout direction is automatically used for languages that require it "
"such as Arabic and Hebrew, but only if a valid translation file is loaded "
"for the given language (unless said language is configured as a fallback in "
"[member ProjectSettings.internationalization/locale/fallback]). For all "
"other languages (or if no valid translation file is found by Godot), left-to-"
"right layout direction is used. If using [TextServerFallback] ([member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/text_driver]), left-to-right "
"layout direction is always used regardless of the language. Right-to-left "
"layout direction can also be forced using [member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"force_right_to_left_layout_direction]."
msgstr ""
"Direção de layout automática, determinada a partir da localidade atual. A "
"direção de layout da direita para a esquerda é usada automaticamente para "
"idiomas que a exigem, como árabe e hebraico, mas apenas se um arquivo de "
"tradução válido estiver carregado para o idioma dado (a menos que o dito "
"idioma esteja configurado como um fallback em [member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/locale/fallback]). Para todos os outros "
"idiomas (ou se nenhum arquivo de tradução válido for encontrado pelo Godot), "
"a direção de layout da esquerda para a direita é usada. Se estiver usando "
"[TextServerFallback] ([member ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"text_driver]), a direção de layout da esquerda para a direita é sempre "
"usada, independentemente do idioma. A direção de layout da direita para a "
"esquerda também pode ser forçada usando [member "
"ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"force_right_to_left_layout_direction]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "Left-to-right layout direction."
msgstr "Direção de layout da esquerda para a direita."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "Right-to-left layout direction."
msgstr "Direção de layout da direita para a esquerda."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Automatic layout direction, determined from the system locale. Right-to-left "
"layout direction is automatically used for languages that require it such as "
"Arabic and Hebrew, but only if a valid translation file is loaded for the "
"given language. For all other languages (or if no valid translation file is "
"found by Godot), left-to-right layout direction is used. If using "
"[TextServerFallback] ([member ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"text_driver]), left-to-right layout direction is always used regardless of "
"the language."
msgstr ""
"Direção de layout automática, determinada a partir da localidade do sistema. "
"A direção de layout da direita para a esquerda é usada automaticamente para "
"idiomas que a exigem, como árabe e hebraico, mas apenas se um arquivo de "
"tradução válido estiver carregado para o idioma dado. Para todos os outros "
"idiomas (ou se nenhum arquivo de tradução válido for encontrado pelo Godot), "
"a direção de layout da esquerda para a direita é usada. Se estiver usando "
"[TextServerFallback] ([member ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"text_driver]), a direção de layout da esquerda para a direita é sempre "
"usada, independentemente do idioma."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum LayoutDirection] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum LayoutDirection]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "Use [constant LAYOUT_DIRECTION_APPLICATION_LOCALE] instead."
msgstr "Em vez disso, use [constant LAYOUT_DIRECTION_APPLICATION_LOCALE]."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Text writing direction is the same as layout direction."
msgstr "A direção da escrita do texto é a mesma que a direção do layout."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid ""
"Automatic text writing direction, determined from the current locale and "
"text content."
msgstr ""
"Direção automática de escrita de texto, determinada a partir do local atual "
"e do conteúdo do texto."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Left-to-right text writing direction."
msgstr "Direção de escrita de texto da esquerda para a direita."

#: doc/classes/Control.xml
msgid "Right-to-left text writing direction."
msgstr "Direção de escrita de texto da direita para a esquerda."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] that apply transform to the bone which converted from "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"Um [SkeletonModifier3D] que aplica a transformação ao osso convertido da "
"referência."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Apply the copied transform of the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_reference_bone] to the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone] about the specific axis with remapping it "
"with some options.\n"
"There are 4 ways to apply the transform, depending on the combination of "
"[method set_relative] and [method set_additive].\n"
"[b]Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"pose.\n"
"[b]Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"rest.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and add it to the apply bone's pose.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and the apply bone's pose is replaced "
"with it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relative option is available only in the case [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.get_reference_type] is [constant "
"BoneConstraint3D.REFERENCE_TYPE_BONE]. See also [enum "
"BoneConstraint3D.ReferenceType].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If there is a rotation greater than [code]180[/code] degrees "
"with constrained axes, flipping may occur."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the axis of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "Retorna o eixo da transformação de destino de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the maximum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "Retorna o valor máximo do intervalo de destino do remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the minimum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "Retorna o valor mínimo do intervalo de destino do remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the operation of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "Retorna a operação da transformação de destino de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the axis of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "Retorna o eixo da transformação de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the maximum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "Retorna o valor máximo do intervalo de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the minimum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "Retorna o valor mínimo do intervalo de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the operation of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "Retorna a operação da transformação de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the additive option is enabled in the setting "
"at [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a opção aditiva estiver ativada na configuração "
"em [param index]."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets additive option in the setting at [param index] to [param enabled]. "
"This mainly affects the process of applying transform to the [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone].\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the processed transform is "
"added to the pose of the current apply bone.\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]false[/code], the pose of the current apply "
"bone is replaced with the processed transform. However, if set [method "
"set_relative] to [code]true[/code], the transform is relative to rest."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the axis of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "Define o eixo da transformação de destino de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "Define o valor máximo do intervalo de destino de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the minimum value of the remapping destination range."
msgstr "Define o valor mínimo do intervalo de destino de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the operation of the remapping destination transform."
msgstr "Define a operação da transformação de destino de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the axis of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "Define o eixo da transformação de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "Define o valor máximo do intervalo de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the minimum value of the remapping source range."
msgstr "Define o valor mínimo do intervalo de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the operation of the remapping source transform."
msgstr "Define a operação da transformação de origem de remapeamento."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets relative option in the setting at [param index] to [param enabled].\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the extracted and applying "
"transform is relative to the rest.\n"
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]false[/code], the extracted transform is "
"absolute."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Convert with position. Transfer the difference."
msgstr "Converte com a posição. Transfere a diferença."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Convert with rotation. The angle is the roll for the specified axis."
msgstr "Converter com rotação. O ângulo é a rolagem para o eixo especificado."

#: doc/classes/ConvertTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Convert with scale. Transfers the ratio, not the difference."
msgstr "Converte com escala. Transfere a proporção, não a diferença."

#: doc/classes/ConvexPolygonShape2D.xml
msgid "A 2D convex polygon shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Uma forma de polígono convexo 2D usada para colisão física."

#: doc/classes/ConvexPolygonShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D convex polygon shape, intended for use in physics. Used internally in "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] when it's in [constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS] "
"mode.\n"
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D] is [i]solid[/i], which means it detects collisions "
"from objects that are fully inside it, unlike [ConcavePolygonShape2D] which "
"is hollow. This makes it more suitable for both detection and physics.\n"
"[b]Convex decomposition:[/b] A concave polygon can be split up into several "
"convex polygons. This allows dynamic physics bodies to have complex concave "
"collisions (at a performance cost) and can be achieved by using several "
"[ConvexPolygonShape2D] nodes or by using the [CollisionPolygon2D] node in "
"[constant CollisionPolygon2D.BUILD_SOLIDS] mode. To generate a collision "
"polygon from a sprite, select the [Sprite2D] node, go to the [b]Sprite2D[/b] "
"menu that appears above the viewport, and choose [b]Create Polygon2D "
"Sibling[/b].\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [ConvexPolygonShape2D] is faster to check collisions "
"against compared to [ConcavePolygonShape2D], but it is slower than primitive "
"collision shapes such as [CircleShape2D] and [RectangleShape2D]. Its use "
"should generally be limited to medium-sized objects that cannot have their "
"collision accurately represented by primitive shapes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConvexPolygonShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"Based on the set of points provided, this assigns the [member points] "
"property using the convex hull algorithm, removing all unneeded points. See "
"[method Geometry2D.convex_hull] for details."
msgstr ""
"Com base no conjunto de pontos fornecido, isso atribui a propriedade [member "
"points] usando o algoritmo de envoltória convexa, removendo todos os pontos "
"desnecessários. Consulte [method Geometry2D.convex_hull] para detalhes."

#: doc/classes/ConvexPolygonShape2D.xml
msgid ""
"The polygon's list of vertices that form a convex hull. Can be in either "
"clockwise or counterclockwise order.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Only set this property to a list of points that actually "
"form a convex hull. Use [method set_point_cloud] to generate the convex hull "
"of an arbitrary set of points."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConvexPolygonShape3D.xml
msgid "A 3D convex polyhedron shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Uma forma de poliedro convexo 3D usada para colisão física."

#: doc/classes/ConvexPolygonShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D convex polyhedron shape, intended for use in physics. Usually used to "
"provide a shape for a [CollisionShape3D].\n"
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] is [i]solid[/i], which means it detects collisions "
"from objects that are fully inside it, unlike [ConcavePolygonShape3D] which "
"is hollow. This makes it more suitable for both detection and physics.\n"
"[b]Convex decomposition:[/b] A concave polyhedron can be split up into "
"several convex polyhedra. This allows dynamic physics bodies to have complex "
"concave collisions (at a performance cost) and can be achieved by using "
"several [ConvexPolygonShape3D] nodes. To generate a convex decomposition "
"from a mesh, select the [MeshInstance3D] node, go to the [b]Mesh[/b] menu "
"that appears above the viewport, and choose [b]Create Multiple Convex "
"Collision Siblings[/b]. Alternatively, [method "
"MeshInstance3D.create_multiple_convex_collisions] can be called in a script "
"to perform this decomposition at run-time.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [ConvexPolygonShape3D] is faster to check collisions "
"against compared to [ConcavePolygonShape3D], but it is slower than primitive "
"collision shapes such as [SphereShape3D] and [BoxShape3D]. Its use should "
"generally be limited to medium-sized objects that cannot have their "
"collision accurately represented by primitive shapes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ConvexPolygonShape3D.xml
msgid "The list of 3D points forming the convex polygon shape."
msgstr "A lista de pontos 3D que formam a forma de polígono convexo."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] that apply transform to the bone which copied from "
"reference."
msgstr ""
"Um [SkeletonModifier3D] que aplica a transformação ao osso que foi copiada "
"da referência."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Apply the copied transform of the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_reference_bone] to the bone set by [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.set_apply_bone] with processing it with some masks and "
"options.\n"
"There are 4 ways to apply the transform, depending on the combination of "
"[method set_relative] and [method set_additive].\n"
"[b]Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"pose.\n"
"[b]Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose relative to the rest and add it to the apply bone's "
"rest.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and add it to the apply bone's pose.\n"
"[b]Not Relative + Not Additive:[/b]\n"
"- Extract reference pose absolutely and the apply bone's pose is replaced "
"with it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relative option is available only in the case [method "
"BoneConstraint3D.get_reference_type] is [constant "
"BoneConstraint3D.REFERENCE_TYPE_BONE]. See also [enum "
"BoneConstraint3D.ReferenceType]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the axis flags of the setting at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna os sinalizadores de eixo da configuração no [param index]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the copy flags of the setting at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna os sinalizadores de cópia da configuração no [param index]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the invert flags of the setting at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna os sinalizadores de inversão da configuração no [param index]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the enable flags has the flag for the X-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_axis_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de ativação possuem a flag para o eixo "
"X na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_axis_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the invert flags has the flag for the X-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_invert_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de inversão possuem a flag para o eixo "
"X na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_invert_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the enable flags has the flag for the Y-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_axis_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de ativação possuem a flag para o eixo "
"Y na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_axis_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the invert flags has the flag for the Y-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_invert_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de inversão possuem a flag para o eixo "
"Y na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_invert_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the enable flags has the flag for the Z-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_axis_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de ativação possuem a flag para o eixo "
"Z na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_axis_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the invert flags has the flag for the Z-axis in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_invert_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de inversão possuem a flag para o eixo "
"Z na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_invert_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the copy flags has the flag for the position in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_copy_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de cópia possuem a flag para a posição "
"na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_copy_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the copy flags has the flag for the rotation in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_copy_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de cópia possuem a flag para a rotação "
"na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_copy_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the copy flags has the flag for the scale in "
"the setting at [param index]. See also [method set_copy_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as flags de cópia possuírem a flag para a "
"escala na configuração em [param index]. Veja também [method set_copy_flags]."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the flags to copy axes. If the flag is valid, the axis is copied."
msgstr ""
"Define os sinalizadores para copiar eixos. Se o sinalizador for válido, o "
"eixo é copiado."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the X-axis will be copied."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], o eixo X será copiado."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the X-axis will be inverted."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], o eixo X será invertido."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Y-axis will be copied."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], o eixo Y será copiado."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Y-axis will be inverted."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], o eixo Y será invertido."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Z-axis will be copied."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], o eixo Z será copiado."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the Z-axis will be inverted."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], o eixo Z será invertido."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the flags to process the transform operations. If the flag is valid, "
"the transform operation is processed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the rotation is valid for only one axis, it respects the "
"roll of the valid axis. If the rotation is valid for two axes, it discards "
"the roll of the invalid axis."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the position will be copied."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], a posição será copiada."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the rotation will be copied."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], a rotação será copiada."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If sets [param enabled] to [code]true[/code], the scale will be copied."
msgstr ""
"Se definir [param enabled] como [code]true[/code], a escala será copiada."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the flags to inverte axes. If the flag is valid, the axis is copied.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] An inverted scale means an inverse number, not a negative "
"scale. For example, inverting [code]2.0[/code] means [code]0.5[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] An inverted rotation flips the elements of the quaternion. For "
"example, a two-axis inversion will flip the roll of each axis, and a three-"
"axis inversion will flip the final orientation. However, be aware that "
"flipping only one axis may cause unintended rotation by the unflipped axes, "
"due to the characteristics of the quaternion."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to copy the position."
msgstr "Se definido, permite copiar a posição."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to copy the rotation."
msgstr "Se definido, permite copiar a rotação."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to copy the scale."
msgstr "Se definido, permite copiar a escala."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to copy the position/rotation/scale."
msgstr "Se definido, permite copiar a posição/rotação/escala."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to process the X-axis."
msgstr "Se definido, permite processar o eixo X."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to process the Y-axis."
msgstr "Se definido, permite processar o eixo Y."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to process the Z-axis."
msgstr "Se definido, permite processar o eixo Z."

#: doc/classes/CopyTransformModifier3D.xml
msgid "If set, allows to process the all axes."
msgstr "Se definido, permite processar todos os eixos."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "A CPU-based 2D particle emitter."
msgstr "Um emissor de partículas 2D baseado em CPU."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"CPU-based 2D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and "
"effects.\n"
"See also [GPUParticles2D], which provides the same functionality with "
"hardware acceleration, but may not run on older devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particle systems (2D)"
msgstr "Sistemas de partículas (2D)"

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets this node's properties to match a given [GPUParticles2D] node with an "
"assigned [ParticleProcessMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"Define as propriedades deste nó para corresponder a um nó [GPUParticles2D] "
"fornecido com um [ParticleProcessMaterial] atribuído."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [Curve] of the parameter specified by [enum Parameter]."
msgstr "Retorna a [Curve] do parâmetro especificado por [enum Parameter]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Returns the maximum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "Retorna o intervalo de valores máximo para o parâmetro fornecido."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Returns the minimum value range for the given parameter."
msgstr "Retorna o intervalo de valores mínimo para o parâmetro fornecido."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Returns the enabled state of the given particle flag."
msgstr "Retorna o estado ativado do sinalizador de partículas fornecido."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Requests the particles to process for extra process time during a single "
"frame.\n"
"[param process_time] defines the time that the particles will process while "
"emitting is on. [param process_time_residual] defines the time that "
"particles will process with emitting turned off for the simulation. When "
"combined with [member speed_scale] set to [code]0.0[/code], this is useful "
"to be able to seek a particle system timeline."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Restarts the particle emitter.\n"
"If [param keep_seed] is [code]true[/code], the current random seed will be "
"preserved. Useful for seeking and playback."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Curve] of the parameter specified by [enum Parameter]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"Define o [Curve] do parâmetro especificado por [enum Parameter]. Deve ser um "
"[Curve] unitário."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum value for the given parameter."
msgstr "Define o valor máximo para o parâmetro fornecido."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Sets the minimum value for the given parameter."
msgstr "Define o valor mínimo para o parâmetro fornecido."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Enables or disables the given particle flag."
msgstr "Ativa ou desativa o sinalizador de partículas fornecido."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Number of particles emitted in one emission cycle."
msgstr "Número de partículas emitidas em um ciclo de emissão."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's rotation will be animated along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A rotação de cada partícula será animada ao longo desta [Curve]. Deve ser "
"uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Maximum initial rotation applied to each particle, in degrees."
msgstr "Rotação inicial máxima aplicada a cada partícula, em graus."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member angle_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member angle_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's angular velocity will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade angular de cada partícula variará ao longo desta [Curve]. Deve "
"ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial angular velocity (rotation speed) applied to each particle "
"in [i]degrees[/i] per second."
msgstr ""
"Velocidade angular inicial máxima (velocidade de rotação) aplicada a cada "
"partícula em [i]graus[/i] por segundo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member angular_velocity_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member angular_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's animation offset will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"O deslocamento de animação de cada partícula variará ao longo desta [Curve]. "
"Deve ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum animation offset that corresponds to frame index in the texture. "
"[code]0[/code] is the first frame, [code]1[/code] is the last one. See "
"[member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation]."
msgstr ""
"Deslocamento máximo da animação que corresponde ao índice do quadro na "
"textura. [code]0[/code] é o primeiro quadro, [code]1[/code] é o último. Veja "
"[member CanvasItemMaterial.particles_animation]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member anim_offset_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member anim_offset_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's animation speed will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade de animação de cada partícula variará ao longo desta [Curve]. "
"Deve ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum particle animation speed. Animation speed of [code]1[/code] means "
"that the particles will make full [code]0[/code] to [code]1[/code] offset "
"cycle during lifetime, [code]2[/code] means [code]2[/code] cycles etc.\n"
"With animation speed greater than [code]1[/code], remember to enable [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.particles_anim_loop] property if you want the animation "
"to repeat."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member anim_speed_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member anim_speed_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color. If [member texture] is defined, it will be "
"multiplied by this color."
msgstr ""
"Cor inicial de cada partícula. Se [member texture] estiver definido, ela "
"será multiplicada por esta cor."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color will vary along this [Gradient] (multiplied "
"with [member color])."
msgstr ""
"A cor inicial de cada partícula variará ao longo deste [Gradient] "
"(multiplicada com [member color])."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's color will vary along this [Gradient] over its lifetime "
"(multiplied with [member color])."
msgstr ""
"A cor de cada partícula varia ao longo deste [Gradient] durante seu tempo de "
"vida (multiplicada por [member color])."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Damping will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"O amortecimento variará ao longo desta [Curve]. Deve ser uma [Curve] "
"unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum rate at which particles lose velocity. For example value of "
"[code]100[/code] means that the particle will go from [code]100[/code] "
"velocity to [code]0[/code] in [code]1[/code] second."
msgstr ""
"A taxa máxima na qual as partículas perdem velocidade. Por exemplo, um valor "
"de [code]100[/code] significa que a partícula passará de uma velocidade de "
"[code]100[/code] para [code]0[/code] em [code]1[/code] segundo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member damping_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member damping_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Unit vector specifying the particles' emission direction."
msgstr "Vetor unitário que especifica a direção de emissão das partículas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particle draw order."
msgstr "Ordem de desenho de partículas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Color]s to modulate particles by when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"Define as [Color]s para modular as partículas ao usar [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] ou [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the direction the particles will be emitted in when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"Define a direção em que as partículas serão emitidas ao usar [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the initial positions to spawn particles when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."
msgstr ""
"Define as posições iniciais para gerar partículas ao usar [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] ou [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The rectangle's extents if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RECTANGLE]."
msgstr ""
"As extensões do retângulo se [member emission_shape] estiver definido como "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RECTANGLE]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The ring's inner radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"O raio interno do anel se [member emission_shape] estiver definido como "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"The ring's outer radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"O raio externo do anel se [member emission_shape] estiver definido como "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted inside this region."
msgstr "Partículas serão emitidas dentro desta região."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The sphere's radius if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."
msgstr ""
"O raio da esfera se [member emission_shape] estiver definido como [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles are being emitted. [member emitting] can be "
"used to start and stop particles from emitting. However, if [member "
"one_shot] is [code]true[/code] setting [member emitting] to [code]true[/"
"code] will not restart the emission cycle until after all active particles "
"finish processing. You can use the [signal finished] signal to be notified "
"once all active particles finish processing."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as partículas estão sendo emitidas. [member emitting] "
"pode ser usado para iniciar e parar a emissão de partículas. No entanto, se "
"[member one_shot] for [code]true[/code], definir [member emitting] como "
"[code]true[/code] não reiniciará o ciclo de emissão até que todas as "
"partículas ativas terminem de processar. Você pode usar o sinal [signal "
"finished] para ser notificado assim que todas as partículas ativas "
"terminarem de processar."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"How rapidly particles in an emission cycle are emitted. If greater than "
"[code]0[/code], there will be a gap in emissions before the next cycle "
"begins."
msgstr ""
"Quão rapidamente as partículas em um ciclo de emissão são emitidas. Se for "
"maior que [code]0[/code], haverá um intervalo nas emissões antes que o "
"próximo ciclo comece."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The particle system's frame rate is fixed to a value. For example, changing "
"the value to 2 will make the particles render at 2 frames per second. Note "
"this does not slow down the simulation of the particle system itself."
msgstr ""
"A taxa de quadros do sistema de partículas é fixa em um valor. Por exemplo, "
"alterar o valor para 2 fará com que as partículas sejam renderizadas a 2 "
"quadros por segundo. Observe que isso não desacelera a simulação do próprio "
"sistema de partículas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], results in fractional delta calculation which has a "
"smoother particles display effect."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], resulta em cálculo de delta fracionário, que tem um "
"efeito de exibição de partículas mais suave."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Gravity applied to every particle."
msgstr "Gravidade aplicada a cada partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's hue will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A matiz de cada partícula vai variar ao longo deste [Curve]. Deve ser um "
"[Curve] unitário."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial hue variation applied to each particle. It will shift the "
"particle color's hue."
msgstr ""
"Variação de matiz inicial máxima aplicada a cada partícula. Ela deslocará o "
"matiz da cor da partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member hue_variation_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member hue_variation_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum initial velocity magnitude for each particle. Direction comes from "
"[member direction] and [member spread]."
msgstr ""
"Magnitude máxima da velocidade inicial para cada partícula. A direção vem de "
"[member direction] e [member spread]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member initial_velocity_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member initial_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Amount of time each particle will exist."
msgstr "Quantidade de tempo que cada partícula existirá."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Particle lifetime randomness ratio."
msgstr "Razão de aleatoriedade de tempo de vida da partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's linear acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should be "
"a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A aceleração linear de cada partícula variará ao longo desta [Curve]. Deve "
"ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum linear acceleration applied to each particle in the direction of "
"motion."
msgstr ""
"Aceleração linear máxima aplicada a cada partícula na direção do movimento."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member linear_accel_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member linear_accel_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space "
"(known as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate "
"along the [CPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated. If [code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will "
"not move or rotate along the [CPUParticles2D] node (and its parents) when it "
"is moved or rotated."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as partículas usam o espaço de coordenadas do nó pai "
"(conhecido como coordenadas locais). Isso fará com que as partículas se "
"movam e girem junto com o nó [CPUParticles2D] (e seus pais) quando ele for "
"movido ou girado. Se [code]false[/code], as partículas usam coordenadas "
"globais; elas não se moverão ou girarão junto com o nó [CPUParticles2D] (e "
"seus pais) quando ele for movido ou girado."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], only one emission cycle occurs. If set [code]true[/"
"code] during a cycle, emission will stop at the cycle's end."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ocorre apenas um ciclo de emissão. Se definido como "
"[code]true[/code] durante um ciclo, a emissão parará no final do ciclo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's orbital velocity will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade orbital de cada partícula variará ao longo desta [Curve]. Deve "
"ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum orbital velocity applied to each particle. Makes the particles "
"circle around origin. Specified in number of full rotations around origin "
"per second."
msgstr ""
"Velocidade orbital máxima aplicada a cada partícula. Faz com que as "
"partículas circundem a origem. Especificada em número de rotações completas "
"em torno da origem por segundo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member orbit_velocity_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member orbit_velocity_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Align Y axis of particle with the direction of its velocity."
msgstr "Alinha o eixo Y da partícula com a direção de sua velocidade."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Particle system starts as if it had already run for this many seconds."
msgstr ""
"O sistema de partículas começa como se já estivesse rodando há tantos "
"segundos."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's radial acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should be "
"a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A aceleração radial de cada partícula variará ao longo desta [Curve]. Deve "
"ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum radial acceleration applied to each particle. Makes particle "
"accelerate away from the origin or towards it if negative."
msgstr ""
"Aceleração radial máxima aplicada a cada partícula. Faz com que a partícula "
"acelere para longe da origem ou em direção a ela se for negativa."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member radial_accel_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member radial_accel_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Emission lifetime randomness ratio."
msgstr "Razão de aleatoriedade de tempo de vida de emissão."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A escala de cada partícula vai variar ao longo deste [Curve]. Deve ser um "
"[Curve] unitário."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Maximum initial scale applied to each particle."
msgstr "Escala inicial máxima aplicada a cada partícula."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member scale_amount_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member scale_amount_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's horizontal scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] must be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's vertical scale will vary along this [Curve]. Should be a "
"unit [Curve].\n"
"[member split_scale] must be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the random seed used by the particle system. Only effective if [member "
"use_fixed_seed] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Define a semente aleatória usada pelo sistema de partículas. Só é efetivo se "
"[member use_fixed_seed] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particle system's running speed scaling ratio. A value of [code]0[/code] can "
"be used to pause the particles."
msgstr ""
"Taxa de escala da velocidade de execução do sistema de partículas. Um valor "
"de [code]0[/code] pode ser usado para pausar as partículas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scale curve will be split into x and y components. "
"See [member scale_curve_x] and [member scale_curve_y]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a curva de escala será dividida em componentes x e y. "
"Veja [member scale_curve_x] e [member scale_curve_y]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial direction range from [code]+spread[/code] to [code]-"
"spread[/code] degrees."
msgstr ""
"A faixa de direção inicial de cada partícula varia de [code]+spread[/code] a "
"[code]-spread[/code] graus."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's tangential acceleration will vary along this [Curve]. Should "
"be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A aceleração tangencial de cada partícula variará ao longo desta [Curve]. "
"Deve ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum tangential acceleration applied to each particle. Tangential "
"acceleration is perpendicular to the particle's velocity giving the "
"particles a swirling motion."
msgstr ""
"Aceleração tangencial máxima aplicada a cada partícula. A aceleração "
"tangencial é perpendicular à velocidade da partícula, dando às partículas um "
"movimento espiralado."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Minimum equivalent of [member tangential_accel_max]."
msgstr "Equivalente mínimo de [member tangential_accel_max]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particle texture. If [code]null[/code], particles will be squares."
msgstr ""
"A textura das partículas. Se [code]null[/code], as partículas serão "
"quadrados."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles will use the same seed for every simulation "
"using the seed defined in [member seed]. This is useful for situations where "
"the visual outcome should be consistent across replays, for example when "
"using Movie Maker mode."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as partículas usarão a mesma semente para cada "
"simulação usando a semente definida em [member seed]. Isso é útil para "
"situações em que o resultado visual deve ser consistente entre repetições, "
"por exemplo, ao usar o modo Movie Maker."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when all active particles have finished processing. When [member "
"one_shot] is disabled, particles will process continuously, so this is never "
"emitted."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando todas as partículas ativas concluem o processamento. Quando "
"[member one_shot] está desativado, as partículas são processadas "
"continuamente, portanto, isso nunca é emitido."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Particles are drawn in the order emitted."
msgstr "As partículas são desenhadas na ordem em que foram emitidas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/GPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles are drawn in order of remaining lifetime. In other words, the "
"particle with the highest lifetime is drawn at the front."
msgstr ""
"As partículas são desenhadas na ordem de tempo de vida restante. Em outras "
"palavras, a partícula com o maior tempo de vida é desenhada na frente."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set initial velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de velocidade inicial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set angular velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de velocidade angular."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set orbital velocity properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de velocidade orbital."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set linear acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de aceleração linear."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set radial acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de aceleração radial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set tangential acceleration properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de aceleração tangencial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set damping properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de amortecimento."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set angle properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de ângulo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set scale properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de escala."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set hue variation properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de variação de tonalidade."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set animation speed properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de velocidade de animação."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max], and [method "
"set_param_curve] to set animation offset properties."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_param_min], [method set_param_max] e [method "
"set_param_curve] para definir propriedades de deslocamento de animação."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Parameter] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho do enum [enum Parameter]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Use with [method set_particle_flag] to set [member particle_flag_align_y]."
msgstr ""
"Use com [method set_particle_flag] para definir [member "
"particle_flag_align_y]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Present for consistency with 3D particle nodes, not used in 2D."
msgstr "Presente por consistência com nós de partículas 3D, não usado em 2D."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum ParticleFlags] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum ParticleFlags]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "All particles will be emitted from a single point."
msgstr "Todas as partículas serão emitidas de um único ponto."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted in the volume of a sphere flattened to two "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"As partículas serão emitidas no volume de uma esfera achatada em duas "
"dimensões."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted on the surface of a sphere flattened to two "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"As partículas serão emitidas na superfície de uma esfera achatada em duas "
"dimensões."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid "Particles will be emitted in the area of a rectangle."
msgstr "As partículas serão emitidas na área do retângulo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position chosen randomly among [member "
"emission_points]. Particle color will be modulated by [member "
"emission_colors]."
msgstr ""
"As partículas serão emitidas em uma posição escolhida aleatoriamente entre "
"[member emission_points]. A cor das partículas será modulada por [member "
"emission_colors]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted at a position chosen randomly among [member "
"emission_points]. Particle velocity and rotation will be set based on "
"[member emission_normals]. Particle color will be modulated by [member "
"emission_colors]."
msgstr ""
"As partículas serão emitidas em uma posição escolhida aleatoriamente entre "
"[member emission_points]. A velocidade e a rotação das partículas serão "
"definidas com base em [member emission_normals]. A cor da partícula será "
"modulada por [member emission_colors]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml
msgid ""
"Particles will be emitted in the area of a ring parameterized by its outer "
"and inner radius."
msgstr ""
"As partículas serão emitidas na área de um anel parametrizado pelo seu raio "
"externo e interno."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles2D.xml doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum EmissionShape] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho do enum [enum EmissionShape]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "A CPU-based 3D particle emitter."
msgstr "Um emissor de partículas 3D baseado em CPU."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"CPU-based 3D particle node used to create a variety of particle systems and "
"effects.\n"
"See also [GPUParticles3D], which provides the same functionality with "
"hardware acceleration, but may not run on older devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
#: doc/classes/RibbonTrailMesh.xml doc/classes/TubeTrailMesh.xml
msgid "Particle systems (3D)"
msgstr "Sistemas de partículas (3D)"

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/GPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the axis-aligned bounding box that contains all the particles that "
"are active in the current frame."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a caixa delimitadora alinhada aos eixos que contém todas as "
"partículas que estão ativas no frame atual."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets this node's properties to match a given [GPUParticles3D] node with an "
"assigned [ParticleProcessMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"Define as propriedades deste nó para corresponder a um nó [GPUParticles3D] "
"fornecido com um [ParticleProcessMaterial] atribuído."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum angle."
msgstr "Ângulo máximo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum angle."
msgstr "Ângulo mínimo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's angular velocity (rotation speed) will vary along this "
"[Curve] over its lifetime. Should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade angular (velocidade de rotação) de cada partícula variará ao "
"longo desta [Curve] durante o seu tempo de vida. Deve ser uma [Curve] "
"unitária."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum initial angular velocity (rotation speed) applied to each particle "
"in [i]degrees[/i] per second."
msgstr ""
"Velocidade angular inicial mínima (velocidade de rotação) aplicada a cada "
"partícula em [i]graus[/i] por segundo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum animation offset."
msgstr "Deslocamento máximo de animação."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum animation offset."
msgstr "Deslocamento mínimo de animação."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum particle animation speed."
msgstr "Velocidade máxima de animação de partículas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum particle animation speed."
msgstr "Velocidade mínima de animação de partículas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex colors. To "
"have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member color] "
"will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's initial color will vary along this [Gradient] (multiplied "
"with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_initial_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's "
"vertex colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"color_initial_ramp] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Each particle's color will vary along this [Gradient] over its lifetime "
"(multiplied with [member color]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member color_ramp] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"color_ramp] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum damping."
msgstr "Amortecimento máximo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum damping."
msgstr "Amortecimento mínimo."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The rectangle's extents if [member emission_shape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX]."
msgstr ""
"As extensões do retângulo se [member emission_shape] estiver definido como "
"[constant EMISSION_SHAPE_BOX]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Color]s to modulate particles by when using [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_POINTS] or [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_DIRECTED_POINTS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member emission_colors] multiplies the particle mesh's vertex "
"colors. To have a visible effect on a [BaseMaterial3D], [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.vertex_color_use_as_albedo] [i]must[/i] be [code]true[/code]. "
"For a [ShaderMaterial], [code]ALBEDO *= COLOR.rgb;[/code] must be inserted "
"in the shader's [code]fragment()[/code] function. Otherwise, [member "
"emission_colors] will have no visible effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The axis of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr "O eixo do anel ao usar o emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The angle of the cone when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]. "
"The default angle of 90 degrees results in a ring, while an angle of 0 "
"degrees results in a cone. Intermediate values will result in a ring where "
"one end is larger than the other.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on [member emission_ring_height], the angle may be "
"clamped if the ring's end is reached to form a perfect cone."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The height of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr "A altura do anel ao usar o emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The inner radius of the ring when using the emitter [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr ""
"O raio interno do anel ao usar o emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml doc/classes/ParticleProcessMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The radius of the ring when using the emitter [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."
msgstr "O raio do anel ao usar o emissor [constant EMISSION_SHAPE_RING]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The sphere's radius if [enum EmissionShape] is set to [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."
msgstr ""
"O raio da esfera se [enum EmissionShape] estiver definido como [constant "
"EMISSION_SHAPE_SPHERE]."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"The particle system's frame rate is fixed to a value. For example, changing "
"the value to 2 will make the particles render at 2 frames per second. Note "
"this does not slow down the particle system itself."
msgstr ""
"A taxa de quadros do sistema de partículas é fixa em um valor. Por exemplo, "
"alterar o valor para 2 fará com que as partículas sejam renderizadas a 2 "
"quadros por segundo. Note que isso não desacelera o próprio sistema de "
"partículas."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"Amount of [member spread] in Y/Z plane. A value of [code]1[/code] restricts "
"particles to X/Z plane."
msgstr ""
"Quantidade de [member spread] no plano Y/Z. Um valor de [code]1[/code] "
"restringe as partículas ao plano X/Z."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum hue variation."
msgstr "Variação máxima de matiz."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum hue variation."
msgstr "Variação mínima de matiz."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum value of the initial velocity."
msgstr "Valor máximo da velocidade inicial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum value of the initial velocity."
msgstr "Valor mínimo da velocidade inicial."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Maximum linear acceleration."
msgstr "Aceleração linear máxima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid "Minimum linear acceleration."
msgstr "Aceleração linear mínima."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], particles use the parent node's coordinate space "
"(known as local coordinates). This will cause particles to move and rotate "
"along the [CPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it is moved or "
"rotated. If [code]false[/code], particles use global coordinates; they will "
"not move or rotate along the [CPUParticles3D] node (and its parents) when it "
"is moved or rotated."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as partículas usam o espaço de coordenadas do nó pai "
"(conhecido como coordenadas locais). Isso fará com que as partículas se "
"movam e girem junto com o nó [CPUParticles3D] (e seus pais) quando ele for "
"movido ou girado. Se [code]false[/code], as partículas usam coordenadas "
"globais; elas não se moverão ou girarão junto com o nó [CPUParticles3D] (e "
"seus pais) quando ele for movido ou girado."

#: doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml
