#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml
msgid "An automatically scalable [Texture2D] based on an SVG image."
msgstr "Um [Texture2D] escalável automaticamente baseado em uma imagem SVG."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml
msgid ""
"An automatically scalable [Texture2D] based on an SVG image. [DPITexture]s "
"are used to automatically re-rasterize icons and other texture based UI "
"theme elements to match viewport scale and font oversampling. See also "
"[member ProjectSettings.display/window/stretch/mode] (\"canvas_items\" mode) "
"and [member Viewport.oversampling_override]."
msgstr ""
"Um [Texture2D] escalável automaticamente baseado em uma imagem SVG. "
"[DPITexture]s são usados para re-rasterizar automaticamente ícones e outros "
"elementos de tema de IU baseados em textura para corresponder à escala da "
"viewport e ao oversampling de fontes. Veja também [member "
"ProjectSettings.display/window/stretch/mode] (modo \"canvas_items\") e "
"[member Viewport.oversampling_override]."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [DPITexture] and initializes it by allocating and setting the "
"SVG data to [param source]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo [DPITexture] e o inicializa alocando e definindo os dados SVG "
"para [param source]."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] of the texture rasterized to match the oversampling of the "
"currently drawn canvas item."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] da textura rasterizada para corresponder ao oversampling do "
"item de canvas desenhado no momento."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml
msgid "Returns this SVG texture's source code."
msgstr "Retorna o código-fonte desta textura SVG."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml doc/classes/ImageTexture.xml
msgid "Resizes the texture to the specified dimensions."
msgstr "Redimensiona a textura para as dimensões especificadas."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml
msgid "Sets this SVG texture's source code."
msgstr "Define o código-fonte desta textura SVG."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporterSVG.xml
msgid ""
"Texture scale. [code]1.0[/code] is the original SVG size. Higher values "
"result in a larger image."
msgstr ""
"Escala da textura. [code]1.0[/code] é o tamanho original do SVG. Valores "
"mais altos resultam em uma imagem maior."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporterSVG.xml
msgid "If set, remaps texture colors according to [Color]-[Color] map."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, remapeia as cores da textura de acordo com o mapa [Color]-"
"[Color]."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporterSVG.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], puts pixels of the same surrounding color in "
"transition from transparent to opaque areas. For textures displayed with "
"bilinear filtering, this helps to reduce the outline effect when exporting "
"images from an image editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], coloca pixels da mesma cor ao redor na transição de "
"áreas transparentes para opacas. Para texturas exibidas com filtragem "
"bilinear, isso ajuda a reduzir o efeito de contorno ao exportar imagens de "
"um editor de imagens."

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporterSVG.xml
msgid ""
"An alternative to fixing darkened borders with [member fix_alpha_border] is "
"to use premultiplied alpha. By enabling this option, the texture will be "
"converted to this format. A premultiplied alpha texture requires specific "
"materials to be displayed correctly:\n"
"- In 2D, a [CanvasItemMaterial] will need to be created and configured to "
"use the [constant CanvasItemMaterial.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] blend mode on "
"[CanvasItem]s that use this texture. In custom [code]canvas_item[/code] "
"shaders, [code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code] should be used.\n"
"- In 3D, a [BaseMaterial3D] will need to be created and configured to use "
"the [constant BaseMaterial3D.BLEND_MODE_PREMULT_ALPHA] blend mode on "
"materials that use this texture. In custom [code]spatial[/code] shaders, "
"[code]render_mode blend_premul_alpha;[/code] should be used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/DPITexture.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporterSVG.xml
msgid "Overrides texture saturation."
msgstr "Sobrepõe a saturação da textura."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid "A 2D texture that supports drawing to itself via Blit calls."
msgstr ""
"Uma textura 2D que suporta desenho em si mesma por meio de chamadas de Blit."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D texture that can be modified via blit calls, copying from a target "
"texture to itself. Primarily intended to be managed in code, a user must "
"call [method setup] to initialize the state before drawing. Each [method "
"blit_rect] call takes at least a rectangle, the area to draw to, and another "
"texture, what to be drawn. The draw calls use a Texture_Blit Shader to "
"process and calculate the result, pixel by pixel. Users can supply their own "
"ShaderMaterial with custom Texture_Blit shaders for more complex behaviors."
msgstr ""
"Uma textura 2D que pode ser modificada por meio de chamadas de blit, "
"copiando de uma textura de destino para si mesma. Primariamente destinada a "
"ser gerenciada em código, o usuário deve chamar [method setup] para "
"inicializar o estado antes de desenhar. Cada chamada [method blit_rect] pega "
"pelo menos um retângulo, a área para desenhar e outra textura, o que deve "
"ser desenhado. As chamadas de desenho usam um shader Texture_Blit para "
"processar e calcular o resultado, pixel por pixel. Os usuários podem "
"fornecer seu próprio ShaderMaterial com shaders Texture_Blit personalizados "
"para comportamentos mais complexos."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Draws to given [param rect] on this texture by copying from the given [param "
"source]. A [param modulate] color can be passed in for the shader to use, "
"but defaults to White. The [param mipmap] value can specify a draw to a "
"lower mipmap level. The [param material] parameter can take a ShaderMaterial "
"with a TextureBlit Shader for custom drawing behavior."
msgstr ""
"Desenha no [param rect] fornecido nesta textura copiando a partir da [param "
"source] fornecida. Uma cor de [param modulate] pode ser passada para o "
"shader usar, mas o padrão é Branco. O valor de [param mipmap] pode "
"especificar um desenho para um nível de mipmap inferior. O parâmetro [param "
"material] pode receber um ShaderMaterial com um Shader TextureBlit para "
"comportamento de desenho personalizado."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Draws to the given [param rect] on this texture, as well as on up to 3 "
"DrawableTexture [param extra_targets]. All [param extra_targets] must be the "
"same size and DrawableFormat as the original target, otherwise the Shader "
"may fail. Expects up to 4 Texture [param sources], but will replace missing "
"[param sources] with default Black Textures."
msgstr ""
"Desenha no [param rect] fornecido nesta textura, bem como em até 3 "
"DrawableTexture [param extra_targets]. Todos os [param extra_targets] devem "
"ter o mesmo tamanho e DrawableFormat que o alvo original, caso contrário, o "
"Shader poderá falhar. Espera até 4 Texture [param sources], mas substituirá "
"[param sources] ausentes por Texturas Pretas padrão."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid "Re-calculates the mipmaps for this texture on demand."
msgstr "Recalcula os mipmaps para esta textura sob demanda."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if mipmaps are set to be used on this "
"DrawableTexture."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se os mipmaps estiverem configurados para serem "
"usados neste DrawableTexture."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid "Sets the format of this DrawableTexture."
msgstr "Define o formato deste DrawableTexture."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid "Sets if mipmaps should be used on this DrawableTexture."
msgstr "Define se mipmaps devem ser usados neste DrawableTexture."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the DrawableTexture to a White texture of the given [param "
"width], [param height], and [param format]."
msgstr ""
"Inicializa o DrawableTexture para uma textura branca com os [param width], "
"[param height] e [param format] fornecidos."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format RGBA with four components, each with a bitdepth of 8."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL RGBA com quatro componentes, cada um com uma "
"profundidade de bit de 8."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format RGBA with four components, each with a bitdepth of 8.\n"
"When drawn to, an sRGB to linear color space conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format GL_RGBA16F where there are four components, each a 16-"
"bit \"half-precision\" floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL GL_RGBA16F onde há quatro componentes, cada um "
"sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de 16 bits de \"precisão metade\"."

#: doc/classes/DrawableTexture2D.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format GL_RGBA32F where there are four components, each a 32-"
"bit floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL GL_RGBA32F onde há quatro componentes, cada um "
"sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de 32 bits."

#: doc/classes/DTLSServer.xml
msgid "Helper class to implement a DTLS server."
msgstr "Classe auxiliar para implementar um servidor DTLS."

#: doc/classes/DTLSServer.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used to store the state of a DTLS server. Upon [method setup] "
"it converts connected [PacketPeerUDP] to [PacketPeerDTLS] accepting them via "
"[method take_connection] as DTLS clients. Under the hood, this class is used "
"to store the DTLS state and cookies of the server. The reason of why the "
"state and cookies are needed is outside of the scope of this documentation.\n"
"Below a small example of how to use it:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# server_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = DTLSServer.new()\n"
"var server = UDPServer.new()\n"
"var peers = []\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tserver.listen(4242)\n"
"\tvar key = load(\"key.key\") # Your private key.\n"
"\tvar cert = load(\"cert.crt\") # Your X509 certificate.\n"
"\tdtls.setup(TlsOptions.server(key, cert))\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\twhile server.is_connection_available():\n"
"\t\tvar peer = server.take_connection()\n"
"\t\tvar dtls_peer = dtls.take_connection(peer)\n"
"\t\tif dtls_peer.get_status() != PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_HANDSHAKING:\n"
"\t\t\tcontinue # It is normal that 50% of the connections fails due to "
"cookie exchange.\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Peer connected!\")\n"
"\t\tpeers.append(dtls_peer)\n"
"\n"
"\tfor p in peers:\n"
"\t\tp.poll() # Must poll to update the state.\n"
"\t\tif p.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\t\twhile p.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Received message from client: %s\" % "
"p.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\t\tp.put_packet(\"Hello DTLS client\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ServerNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ServerNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate DtlsServer _dtls = new DtlsServer();\n"
"\tprivate UdpServer _server = new UdpServer();\n"
"\tprivate Godot.Collections.Array<PacketPeerDtls> _peers = [];\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_server.Listen(4242);\n"
"\t\tvar key = GD.Load<CryptoKey>(\"key.key\"); // Your private key.\n"
"\t\tvar cert = GD.Load<X509Certificate>(\"cert.crt\"); // Your X509 "
"certificate.\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Setup(TlsOptions.Server(key, cert));\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\twhile (_server.IsConnectionAvailable())\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerUdp peer = _server.TakeConnection();\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerDtls dtlsPeer = _dtls.TakeConnection(peer);\n"
"\t\t\tif (dtlsPeer.GetStatus() != PacketPeerDtls.Status.Handshaking)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tcontinue; // It is normal that 50% of the connections fails due to "
"cookie exchange.\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Peer connected!\");\n"
"\t\t\t_peers.Add(dtlsPeer);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tforeach (var p in _peers)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tp.Poll(); // Must poll to update the state.\n"
"\t\t\tif (p.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\twhile (p.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Received Message From Client: "
"{p.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tp.PutPacket(\"Hello DTLS Client\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# client_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = PacketPeerDTLS.new()\n"
"var udp = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"var connected = false\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tudp.connect_to_host(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242)\n"
"\tdtls.connect_to_peer(udp, false) # Use true in production for certificate "
"validation!\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tdtls.poll()\n"
"\tif dtls.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\tif !connected:\n"
"\t\t\t# Try to contact server\n"
"\t\t\tdtls.put_packet(\"The answer is... 42!\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\t\twhile dtls.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Connected: %s\" % dtls.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\tconnected = true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ClientNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Text;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ClientNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerDtls _dtls = new PacketPeerDtls();\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerUdp _udp = new PacketPeerUdp();\n"
"\tprivate bool _connected = false;\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_udp.ConnectToHost(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242);\n"
"\t\t_dtls.ConnectToPeer(_udp, validateCerts: false); // Use true in "
"production for certificate validation!\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Poll();\n"
"\t\tif (_dtls.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (!_connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t// Try to contact server\n"
"\t\t\t\t_dtls.PutPacket(\"The Answer Is..42!\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\twhile (_dtls.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Connected: {_dtls.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t_connected = true;\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Esta classe é usada para armazenar o estado de um servidor DTLS. Após "
"[method setup], ela converte [PacketPeerUDP] conectados em [PacketPeerDTLS], "
"aceitando-os via [method take_connection] como clientes DTLS. Por baixo dos "
"panos, esta classe é usada para armazenar o estado DTLS e os cookies do "
"servidor. O motivo pelo qual o estado e os cookies são necessários está fora "
"do escopo desta documentação.\n"
"Abaixo está um pequeno exemplo de como usá-la:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# server_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = DTLSServer.new()\n"
"var server = UDPServer.new()\n"
"var peers = []\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tserver.listen(4242)\n"
"\tvar key = load(\"key.key\") # Sua chave privada.\n"
"\tvar cert = load(\"cert.crt\") # Seu certificado X509.\n"
"\tdtls.setup(TlsOptions.server(key, cert))\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\twhile server.is_connection_available():\n"
"\t\tvar peer = server.take_connection()\n"
"\t\tvar dtls_peer = dtls.take_connection(peer)\n"
"\t\tif dtls_peer.get_status() != PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_HANDSHAKING:\n"
"\t\t\tcontinue # É normal que 50% das conexões falhem devido à troca de "
"cookies.\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Peer connected!\")\n"
"\t\tpeers.append(dtls_peer)\n"
"\n"
"\tfor p in peers:\n"
"\t\tp.poll() # É necessário chamar poll para atualizar o estado.\n"
"\t\tif p.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\t\twhile p.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Received message from client: %s\" % "
"p.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\t\tp.put_packet(\"Hello DTLS client\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ServerNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ServerNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate DtlsServer _dtls = new DtlsServer();\n"
"\tprivate UdpServer _server = new UdpServer();\n"
"\tprivate Godot.Collections.Array<PacketPeerDtls> _peers = [];\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_server.Listen(4242);\n"
"\t\tvar key = GD.Load<CryptoKey>(\"key.key\"); // Sua chave privada.\n"
"\t\tvar cert = GD.Load<X509Certificate>(\"cert.crt\"); // Seu certificado "
"X509.\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Setup(TlsOptions.Server(key, cert));\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\twhile (_server.IsConnectionAvailable())\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerUdp peer = _server.TakeConnection();\n"
"\t\t\tPacketPeerDtls dtlsPeer = _dtls.TakeConnection(peer);\n"
"\t\t\tif (dtlsPeer.GetStatus() != PacketPeerDtls.Status.Handshaking)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tcontinue; // É normal que 50% das conexões falhem devido à troca de "
"cookies.\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\tGD.Print(\"Peer connected!\");\n"
"\t\t\t_peers.Add(dtlsPeer);\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tforeach (var p in _peers)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tp.Poll(); // É necessário chamar Poll para atualizar o estado.\n"
"\t\t\tif (p.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\twhile (p.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Received Message From Client: "
"{p.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tp.PutPacket(\"Hello DTLS Client\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# client_node.gd\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var dtls = PacketPeerDTLS.new()\n"
"var udp = PacketPeerUDP.new()\n"
"var connected = false\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tudp.connect_to_host(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242)\n"
"\tdtls.connect_to_peer(udp, false) # Use true em produção para validação de "
"certificado!\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tdtls.poll()\n"
"\tif dtls.get_status() == PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_CONNECTED:\n"
"\t\tif !connected:\n"
"\t\t\t# Tenta contatar o servidor\n"
"\t\t\tdtls.put_packet(\"The answer is... 42!\".to_utf8_buffer())\n"
"\t\twhile dtls.get_available_packet_count() > 0:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Connected: %s\" % dtls.get_packet().get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\t\t\tconnected = true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// ClientNode.cs\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Text;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class ClientNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerDtls _dtls = new PacketPeerDtls();\n"
"\tprivate PacketPeerUdp _udp = new PacketPeerUdp();\n"
"\tprivate bool _connected = false;\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_udp.ConnectToHost(\"127.0.0.1\", 4242);\n"
"\t\t_dtls.ConnectToPeer(_udp, validateCerts: false); // Use true em produção "
"para validação de certificado!\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t_dtls.Poll();\n"
"\t\tif (_dtls.GetStatus() == PacketPeerDtls.Status.Connected)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tif (!_connected)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t// Tenta contatar o servidor\n"
"\t\t\t\t_dtls.PutPacket(\"The Answer Is..42!\".ToUtf8Buffer());\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t\twhile (_dtls.GetAvailablePacketCount() > 0)\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tGD.Print($\"Connected: {_dtls.GetPacket().GetStringFromUtf8()}\");\n"
"\t\t\t\t_connected = true;\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/DTLSServer.xml
msgid ""
"Setup the DTLS server to use the given [param server_options]. See [method "
"TLSOptions.server]."
msgstr ""
"Configura o servidor DTLS para usar o [param server_options] fornecido. "
"Consulte [method TLSOptions.server]."

#: doc/classes/DTLSServer.xml
msgid ""
"Try to initiate the DTLS handshake with the given [param udp_peer] which "
"must be already connected (see [method PacketPeerUDP.connect_to_host]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must check that the state of the return PacketPeerUDP is "
"[constant PacketPeerDTLS.STATUS_HANDSHAKING], as it is normal that 50% of "
"the new connections will be invalid due to cookie exchange."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorCommandPalette.xml
msgid "Godot editor's command palette."
msgstr "Paleta de comandos do editor do Godot."

#: doc/classes/EditorCommandPalette.xml
msgid ""
"Object that holds all the available Commands and their shortcuts text. These "
"Commands can be accessed through [b]Editor > Command Palette[/b] menu.\n"
"Command key names use slash delimiters to distinguish sections, for example: "
"[code]\"example/command1\"[/code] then [code]example[/code] will be the "
"section name.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var command_palette = EditorInterface.get_command_palette()\n"
"# external_command is a function that will be called with the command is "
"executed.\n"
"var command_callable = Callable(self, \"external_command\").bind(arguments)\n"
"command_palette.add_command(\"command\", \"test/command\",command_callable)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EditorCommandPalette commandPalette = "
"EditorInterface.Singleton.GetCommandPalette();\n"
"// ExternalCommand is a function that will be called with the command is "
"executed.\n"
"Callable commandCallable = new Callable(this, MethodName.ExternalCommand);\n"
"commandPalette.AddCommand(\"command\", \"test/command\", commandCallable)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_command_palette]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto que armazena todos os Comandos disponíveis e seus textos de atalho. "
"Estes Comandos podem ser acessados através do menu [b]Editor > Paleta de "
"Comandos[/b].\n"
"Os nomes das chaves de Comando usam delimitadores de barra para distinguir "
"seções, por exemplo: [code]\"exemplo/comando1\"[/code], onde [code]exemplo[/"
"code] será o nome da seção.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var command_palette = EditorInterface.get_command_palette()\n"
"# external_command é uma função que será chamada quando o comando for "
"executado.\n"
"var command_callable = Callable(self, \"external_command\").bind(arguments)\n"
"command_palette.add_command(\"command\", \"test/command\",command_callable)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EditorCommandPalette commandPalette = "
"EditorInterface.Singleton.GetCommandPalette();\n"
"// ExternalCommand é uma função que será chamada quando o comando for "
"executado.\n"
"Callable commandCallable = new Callable(this, MethodName.ExternalCommand);\n"
"commandPalette.AddCommand(\"command\", \"test/command\", commandCallable)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta classe não deve ser instanciada diretamente. Em vez disso, "
"acesse o singleton usando [method EditorInterface.get_command_palette]."

#: doc/classes/EditorCommandPalette.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom command to EditorCommandPalette.\n"
"- [param command_name]: [String] (Name of the [b]Command[/b]. This is "
"displayed to the user.)\n"
"- [param key_name]: [String] (Name of the key for a particular [b]Command[/"
"b]. This is used to uniquely identify the [b]Command[/b].)\n"
"- [param binded_callable]: [Callable] (Callable of the [b]Command[/b]. This "
"will be executed when the [b]Command[/b] is selected.)\n"
"- [param shortcut_text]: [String] (Shortcut text of the [b]Command[/b] if "
"available.)"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorCommandPalette.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the custom command from EditorCommandPalette.\n"
"- [param key_name]: [String] (Name of the key for a particular [b]Command[/"
"b].)"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid "Plugin for adding custom context menus in the editor."
msgstr "Plugin para adicionar menus de contexto personalizados no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorContextMenuPlugin] allows for the addition of custom options in the "
"editor's context menu.\n"
"Currently, context menus are supported for three commonly used areas: the "
"file system, scene tree, and editor script list panel."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called when creating a context menu, custom options can be added by using "
"the [method add_context_menu_item] or [method "
"add_context_menu_item_from_shortcut] functions. [param paths] contains "
"currently selected paths (depending on menu), which can be used to "
"conditionally add options."
msgstr ""
"Chamado ao criar um menu de contexto, opções personalizadas podem ser "
"adicionadas usando as funções [method add_context_menu_item] ou [method "
"add_context_menu_item_from_shortcut]. [param paths] contém os caminhos "
"selecionados atualmente (dependendo do menu), que podem ser usados para "
"adicionar opções condicionalmente."

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Add custom option to the context menu of the plugin's specified slot. When "
"the option is activated, [param callback] will be called. Callback should "
"take single [Array] argument; array contents depend on context menu slot.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _popup_menu(paths):\n"
"\tadd_context_menu_item(\"File Custom options\", handle, ICON)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If you want to assign shortcut to the menu item, use [method "
"add_context_menu_item_from_shortcut] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Add custom option to the context menu of the plugin's specified slot. The "
"option will have the [param shortcut] assigned and reuse its callback. The "
"shortcut has to be registered beforehand with [method add_menu_shortcut].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tadd_menu_shortcut(SHORTCUT, handle)\n"
"\n"
"func _popup_menu(paths):\n"
"\tadd_context_menu_item_from_shortcut(\"File Custom options\", SHORTCUT, "
"ICON)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Add a submenu to the context menu of the plugin's specified slot. The "
"submenu is not automatically handled, you need to connect to its signals "
"yourself. Also the submenu is freed on every popup, so provide a new "
"[PopupMenu] every time.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _popup_menu(paths):\n"
"\tvar popup_menu = PopupMenu.new()\n"
"\tpopup_menu.add_item(\"Blue\")\n"
"\tpopup_menu.add_item(\"White\")\n"
"\tpopup_menu.id_pressed.connect(_on_color_submenu_option)\n"
"\n"
"\tadd_context_submenu_item(\"Set Node Color\", popup_menu)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a shortcut associated with the plugin's context menu. This method "
"should be called once (e.g. in plugin's [method Object._init]). [param "
"callback] will be called when user presses the specified [param shortcut] "
"while the menu's context is in effect (e.g. FileSystem dock is focused). "
"Callback should take single [Array] argument; array contents depend on "
"context menu slot.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tadd_menu_shortcut(SHORTCUT, handle)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Context menu of Scene dock. [method _popup_menu] will be called with a list "
"of paths to currently selected nodes, while option callback will receive the "
"list of currently selected nodes."
msgstr ""
"Menu de contexto da doca Cena. [method _popup_menu] será chamado com uma "
"lista de caminhos para os nós selecionados no momento, enquanto o retorno de "
"chamada da opção receberá a lista de nós selecionados no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Context menu of FileSystem dock. [method _popup_menu] and option callback "
"will be called with list of paths of the currently selected files."
msgstr ""
"Menu de contexto da doca FileSystem. [method _popup_menu] e o retorno de "
"chamada da opção serão chamados com a lista de caminhos dos arquivos "
"selecionados no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Context menu of Script editor's script tabs. [method _popup_menu] will be "
"called with the path to the currently edited script, while option callback "
"will receive reference to that script."
msgstr ""
"Menu de contexto das abas de script do editor de Script. [method "
"_popup_menu] será chamado com o caminho para o script atualmente editado, "
"enquanto o retorno de chamada da opção receberá referência a esse script."

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Create...\" submenu of FileSystem dock's context menu, or the \"New\" "
"section of the main context menu when empty space is clicked. [method "
"_popup_menu] and option callback will be called with the path of the "
"currently selected folder. When clicking the empty space, the list of paths "
"for popup method will be empty.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _popup_menu(paths):\n"
"    if paths.is_empty():\n"
"        add_context_menu_item(\"New Image File...\", create_image)\n"
"    else:\n"
"        add_context_menu_item(\"Image File...\", create_image)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Context menu of Script editor's code editor. [method _popup_menu] will be "
"called with the path to the [CodeEdit] node. You can fetch it using this "
"code:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _popup_menu(paths):\n"
"\tvar code_edit = Engine.get_main_loop().root.get_node(paths[0]);\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The option callback will receive reference to that node. You can use "
"[CodeEdit] methods to perform symbol lookups etc."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Context menu of scene tabs. [method _popup_menu] will be called with the "
"path of the clicked scene, or empty [PackedStringArray] if the menu was "
"opened on empty space. The option callback will receive the path of the "
"clicked scene, or empty [String] if none was clicked."
msgstr ""
"Menu de contexto das abas de cena. [method _popup_menu] será chamado com o "
"caminho da cena clicada, ou [PackedStringArray] vazio se o menu foi aberto "
"em um espaço vazio. O callback da opção receberá o caminho da cena clicada, "
"ou [String] vazio se nenhum foi clicado."

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Context menu of 2D editor's basic right-click menu. [method _popup_menu] "
"will be called with paths to all [CanvasItem] nodes under the cursor. You "
"can fetch them using this code:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _popup_menu(paths):\n"
"\tvar canvas_item = Engine.get_main_loop().root.get_node(paths[0]); # "
"Replace 0 with the desired index.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The paths array is empty if there weren't any nodes under cursor. The option "
"callback will receive a typed array of [CanvasItem] nodes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorContextMenuPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Context menu of the inspectors right-click menu. [method _popup_menu] will "
"be called with an array of two items: The first will be the object's ID, the "
"second will be the property name. An object can be retrieved from it's ID "
"via [method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id] after converting it to an int. "
"The option callback will receive the EditorProperty directly."
msgstr ""
"Menu de contexto do menu do botão direito do inspetor. [method _popup_menu] "
"será chamado com um array de dois itens: o primeiro será o ID do objeto, o "
"segundo será o nome da propriedade. Um objeto pode ser recuperado a partir "
"de seu ID via [method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id] após convertê-lo para "
"um int. O retorno de chamada da opção receberá o EditorProperty diretamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid "A base class to implement debugger plugins."
msgstr "Uma classe base para implementar plugins de depuração."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin] provides functions related to the editor side of the "
"debugger.\n"
"To interact with the debugger, an instance of this class must be added to "
"the editor via [method EditorPlugin.add_debugger_plugin].\n"
"Once added, the [method _setup_session] callback will be called for every "
"[EditorDebuggerSession] available to the plugin, and when new ones are "
"created (the sessions may be inactive during this stage).\n"
"You can retrieve the available [EditorDebuggerSession]s via [method "
"get_sessions] or get a specific one via [method get_session].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"class ExampleEditorDebugger extends EditorDebuggerPlugin:\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _has_capture(capture):\n"
"\t\t# Return true if you wish to handle messages with the prefix \"my_plugin:"
"\".\n"
"\t\treturn capture == \"my_plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _capture(message, data, session_id):\n"
"\t\tif message == \"my_plugin:ping\":\n"
"\t\t\tget_session(session_id).send_message(\"my_plugin:echo\", data)\n"
"\t\t\treturn true\n"
"\t\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _setup_session(session_id):\n"
"\t\t# Add a new tab in the debugger session UI containing a label.\n"
"\t\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\t\tlabel.name = \"Example plugin\" # Will be used as the tab title.\n"
"\t\tlabel.text = \"Example plugin\"\n"
"\t\tvar session = get_session(session_id)\n"
"\t\t# Listens to the session started and stopped signals.\n"
"\t\tsession.started.connect(func (): print(\"Session started\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.stopped.connect(func (): print(\"Session stopped\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.add_session_tab(label)\n"
"\n"
"var debugger = ExampleEditorDebugger.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tadd_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To connect on the running game side, use the [EngineDebugger] singleton:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.register_message_capture(\"my_plugin\", _capture)\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.send_message(\"my_plugin:ping\", [\"test\"])\n"
"\n"
"func _capture(message, data):\n"
"\t# Note that the \"my_plugin:\" prefix is not used here.\n"
"\tif message == \"echo\":\n"
"\t\tprints(\"Echo received:\", data)\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] While the game is running, [method @GlobalScope.print] and "
"similar functions [i]called in the editor[/i] do not print anything, the "
"Output Log prints only game messages."
msgstr ""
"O [EditorDebuggerPlugin] fornece funções relacionadas ao lado do editor no "
"depurador.\n"
"Para interagir com o depurador, uma instância desta classe deve ser "
"adicionada ao editor através do [method EditorPlugin.add_debugger_plugin].\n"
"Uma vez adicionada, o callback [method _setup_session] será chamado para "
"cada [EditorDebuggerSession] disponível para o plugin e quando novas sessões "
"forem criadas (as sessões podem estar inativas durante esta etapa).\n"
"Você pode recuperar as [EditorDebuggerSession]s disponíveis via [method "
"get_sessions] ou obter uma específica via [method get_session].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"class ExampleEditorDebugger extends EditorDebuggerPlugin:\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _has_capture(capture):\n"
"\t\t# Retorna true se desejar manipular mensagens com o prefixo \"my_plugin:"
"\".\n"
"\t\treturn capture == \"my_plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _capture(message, data, session_id):\n"
"\t\tif message == \"my_plugin:ping\":\n"
"\t\t\tget_session(session_id).send_message(\"my_plugin:echo\", data)\n"
"\t\t\treturn true\n"
"\t\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _setup_session(session_id):\n"
"\t\t# Adiciona uma nova aba na UI da sessão do depurador contendo um "
"rótulo.\n"
"\t\tvar label = Label.new()\n"
"\t\tlabel.name = \"Example plugin\" # Será usado como o título da aba.\n"
"\t\tlabel.text = \"Example plugin\"\n"
"\t\tvar session = get_session(session_id)\n"
"\t\t# Escuta os sinais de início e término da sessão.\n"
"\t\tsession.started.connect(func (): print(\"Session started\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.stopped.connect(func (): print(\"Session stopped\"))\n"
"\t\tsession.add_session_tab(label)\n"
"\n"
"var debugger = ExampleEditorDebugger.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tadd_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_debugger_plugin(debugger)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Para se conectar no lado do jogo em execução, use o singleton "
"[EngineDebugger]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.register_message_capture(\"my_plugin\", _capture)\n"
"\tEngineDebugger.send_message(\"my_plugin:ping\", [\"test\"])\n"
"\n"
"func _capture(message, data):\n"
"\t# Observe que o prefixo \"my_plugin:\" não é usado aqui.\n"
"\tif message == \"echo\":\n"
"\t\tprints(\"Echo received:\", data)\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Enquanto o jogo estiver em execução, o [method "
"@GlobalScope.print] e funções similares [i]chamadas no editor[/i] não "
"imprimem nada; o Registro de Saída imprime apenas mensagens do jogo."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified when a breakpoint is set in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para ser notificado quando um ponto de interrupção for "
"definido no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified when all breakpoints are cleared in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para ser notificado quando todos os pontos de "
"interrupção forem limpos no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to process incoming messages. The [param session_id] is "
"the ID of the [EditorDebuggerSession] that received the [param message]. Use "
"[method get_session] to retrieve the session. This method should return "
"[code]true[/code] if the message is recognized."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para processar mensagens recebidas. O [param "
"session_id] é o ID do [EditorDebuggerSession] que recebeu a [param message]. "
"Use [method get_session] para recuperar a sessão. Este método deve retornar "
"[code]true[/code] se a mensagem for reconhecida."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified when a breakpoint line has been clicked "
"in the debugger breakpoint panel."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para ser notificado quando uma linha de ponto de "
"interrupção for clicada no painel de pontos de interrupção do depurador."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to enable receiving messages from the debugger. If "
"[param capture] is \"my_message\" then messages starting with \"my_message:"
"\" will be passed to the [method _capture] method."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para habilitar o recebimento de mensagens do "
"depurador. Se [param capture] for \"my_message\", as mensagens começando com "
"\"my_message:\" serão passadas para o método [method _capture]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to be notified whenever a new [EditorDebuggerSession] "
"is created. Note that the session may be inactive during this stage."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para ser notificado sempre que uma nova "
"[EditorDebuggerSession] for criada. Observe que a sessão pode estar inativa "
"durante este estágio."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid "Returns the [EditorDebuggerSession] with the given [param id]."
msgstr "Retorna a [EditorDebuggerSession] com o [param id] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of [EditorDebuggerSession] currently available to this "
"debugger plugin.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Sessions in the array may be inactive, check their state via "
"[method EditorDebuggerSession.is_active]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid "A class to interact with the editor debugger."
msgstr "Uma classe para interagir com o depurador do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"This class cannot be directly instantiated and must be retrieved via an "
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin].\n"
"You can add tabs to the session UI via [method add_session_tab], send "
"messages via [method send_message], and toggle [EngineProfiler]s via [method "
"toggle_profiler]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given [param control] to the debug session UI in the debugger "
"bottom panel. The [param control]'s node name will be used as the tab title."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona o [param control] fornecido à IU da sessão de depuração no painel "
"inferior do depurador. O nome do nó do [param control] será usado como o "
"título da aba."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the debug session is currently attached to a "
"remote instance."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a sessão de depuração estiver atualmente "
"anexada a uma instância remota."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the attached remote instance is currently in "
"the debug loop."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a instância remota anexada estiver atualmente "
"no loop de depuração."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the attached remote instance can be debugged."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a instância remota anexada puder ser depurada."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given [param control] from the debug session UI in the debugger "
"bottom panel."
msgstr ""
"Remove o [param control] fornecido da interface de usuário da sessão de "
"depuração no painel inferior do depurador."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Sends the given [param message] to the attached remote instance, optionally "
"passing additionally [param data]. See [EngineDebugger] for how to retrieve "
"those messages."
msgstr ""
"Envia a [param message] fornecida à instância remota anexada, opcionalmente "
"passando [param data] adicional. Consulte [EngineDebugger] para saber como "
"recuperar essas mensagens."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Enables or disables a specific breakpoint based on [param enabled], updating "
"the Editor Breakpoint Panel accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Habilita ou desabilita um ponto de interrupção específico com base em [param "
"enabled], atualizando o Painel de Pontos de Interrupção do Editor de acordo."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Toggle the given [param profiler] on the attached remote instance, "
"optionally passing additionally [param data]. See [EngineProfiler] for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Alterna o [param profiler] fornecido na instância remota conectada, "
"opcionalmente passando [param data] adicionais. Consulte [EngineProfiler] "
"para obter mais detalhes."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the attached remote instance enters a break state. If [param "
"can_debug] is [code]true[/code], the remote instance will enter the debug "
"loop."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a instância remota anexada entra em um estado de pausa. Se "
"[param can_debug] for [code]true[/code], a instância remota entrará no loop "
"de depuração."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid "Emitted when the attached remote instance exits a break state."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a instância remota anexada sai de um estado de interrupção."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a remote instance is attached to this session (i.e. the session "
"becomes active)."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma instância remota é anexada a esta sessão (ou seja, a "
"sessão se torna ativa)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDebuggerSession.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a remote instance is detached from this session (i.e. the "
"session becomes inactive)."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma instância remota é desconectada desta sessão (ou seja, a "
"sessão se torna inativa)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Dockable container for the editor."
msgstr "Recipiente acoplável para o editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"EditorDock is a [Container] node that can be docked in one of the editor's "
"dock slots. Docks are added by plugins to provide space for controls related "
"to an [EditorPlugin]. The editor comes with a few built-in docks, such as "
"the Scene dock, FileSystem dock, etc.\n"
"You can add a dock by using [method EditorPlugin.add_dock]. The dock can be "
"customized by changing its properties.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"# Dock reference.\n"
"var dock\n"
"\n"
"# Plugin initialization.\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tdock = EditorDock.new()\n"
"\tdock.title = \"My Dock\"\n"
"\tdock.dock_icon = preload(\"./dock_icon.png\")\n"
"\tdock.default_slot = EditorDock.DOCK_SLOT_RIGHT_UL\n"
"\tvar dock_content = preload(\"./dock_content.tscn\").instantiate()\n"
"\tdock.add_child(dock_content)\n"
"\tadd_dock(dock)\n"
"\n"
"# Plugin clean-up.\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_dock(dock)\n"
"\tdock.queue_free()\n"
"\tdock = null\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Making plugins"
msgstr "Criando plugins"

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this method to handle loading this dock's layout. It's equivalent "
"to [method EditorPlugin._set_window_layout]. [param section] is a unique "
"section based on [member layout_key]."
msgstr ""
"Implemente este método para lidar com o carregamento do layout desta doca. É "
"equivalente a [method EditorPlugin._set_window_layout]. [param section] é "
"uma seção única baseada em [member layout_key]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this method to handle saving this dock's layout. It's equivalent "
"to [method EditorPlugin._get_window_layout]. [param section] is a unique "
"section based on [member layout_key]."
msgstr ""
"Implemente este método para lidar com o salvamento do layout desta doca. É "
"equivalente a [method EditorPlugin._get_window_layout]. [param section] é "
"uma seção única baseada em [member layout_key]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this method to handle the layout switching for this dock. [param "
"layout] is one of the [enum DockLayout] constants.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _update_layout(layout):\n"
"\tbox_container.vertical = (layout == DOCK_LAYOUT_VERTICAL)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Closes the dock, making its tab hidden."
msgstr "Fecha o painel encaixável, tornando sua aba oculta."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Focuses the dock's tab (or window if it's floating). If the dock was closed, "
"it will be opened. If it's a bottom dock, makes the bottom panel visible."
msgstr ""
"Foca a aba do dock (ou a janela se estiver flutuante). Se o dock estiver "
"fechado, ele será aberto. Se for um dock inferior, torna o painel inferior "
"visível."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the dock. It will appear in the last used dock slot. If the dock has "
"no default slot, it will be opened floating.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not focus the dock. If you want to open and focus the "
"dock, use [method make_visible]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"The available layouts for this dock, as a bitmask. By default, the dock "
"allows vertical and floating layouts."
msgstr ""
"Os layouts disponíveis para este dock, como uma máscara de bits. Por padrão, "
"o dock permite layouts verticais e flutuantes."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock can be closed with the Close button in the "
"context popup. Docks with [member global] enabled are always closable."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a doca pode ser fechada com o botão Fechar no pop-up "
"de contexto. Docas com [member global] ativado são sempre fecháveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"The default dock slot used when adding the dock with [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_dock].\n"
"After the dock is added, it can be moved to a different slot and the editor "
"will automatically remember its position between sessions. If you remove and "
"re-add the dock, it will be reset to default."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"The icon for the dock, as a texture. If specified, it will override [member "
"icon_name]."
msgstr ""
"O ícone do dock, como uma textura. Se especificado, substituirá [member "
"icon_name]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "The shortcut used to open the dock."
msgstr "O atalho usado para abrir a doca."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock will always display an icon, regardless of "
"[member EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/dock_tab_style] or [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/bottom_dock_tab_style]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o painel sempre exibirá um ícone, independentemente de "
"[member EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/dock_tab_style] ou [member "
"EditorSettings.interface/editor/docks/bottom_dock_tab_style]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock appears in the [b]Editor > Editor Docks[/b] "
"menu and can be closed. Non-global docks can still be closed using [method "
"close] or when [member closable] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o painel aparece no menu [b]Editor > Editor Docks[/b] "
"e pode ser fechado. Painéis não globais ainda podem ser fechados usando "
"[method close] ou quando [member closable] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"The icon for the dock, as a name from the [code]EditorIcons[/code] theme "
"type in the editor theme. You can find the list of available icons "
"[url=https://godot-editor-icons.github.io/]here[/url]."
msgstr ""
"O ícone para a doca, como um nome do tipo de tema [code]EditorIcons[/code] "
"no tema do editor. Você pode encontrar a lista de ícones disponíveis "
"[url=https://godot-editor-icons.github.io/]aqui[/url]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"The key representing this dock in the editor's layout file. If empty, the "
"dock's displayed name will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"A chave que representa este dock no arquivo de layout do editor. Se vazia, o "
"nome exibido do dock será usado em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"The title of the dock's tab. If empty, the dock's [member Node.name] will be "
"used. If the name is auto-generated (contains [code]@[/code]), the first "
"child's name will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"O título da aba da doca. Se vazio, o [member Node.name] da doca será usado. "
"Se o nome for gerado automaticamente (contém [code]@[/code]), o nome do "
"primeiro filho será usado em seu lugar."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"The color of the dock tab's title. If its alpha is [code]0.0[/code], the "
"default font color will be used."
msgstr ""
"A cor do título da aba do dock. Se o seu alfa for [code]0.0[/code], a cor de "
"fonte padrão será usada."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dock is not automatically opened or closed when "
"loading an editor layout, only moved. It also can't be opened using a "
"shortcut. This is meant for docks that are opened and closed in specific "
"cases, such as when selecting a [TileMap] or [AnimationTree] node."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a doca não é aberta ou fechada automaticamente ao "
"carregar um layout do editor, apenas movida. Ela também não pode ser aberta "
"usando um atalho. Isso se destina a docas que são abertas e fechadas em "
"casos específicos, como ao selecionar um nó [TileMap] ou [AnimationTree]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the dock is closed with the Close button in the context popup, "
"before it's removed from its parent. See [member closable]."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o painel (dock) é fechado com o botão Fechar no pop-up de "
"contexto, antes de ser removido de seu pai. Veja [member closable]."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the dock is opened via the Editor > Editor Docks menu, before "
"it's made visible."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a doca é aberta pelo menu Editor > Editor Docks, antes de se "
"tornar visível."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Allows placing the dock in the vertical dock slots on either side of the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Permite colocar o dock nos espaços verticais do dock em qualquer um dos "
"lados do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Allows placing the dock in the horizontal dock slots at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Permite colocar a doca nos slots de doca horizontais na parte inferior."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Allows making the dock floating (opened as a separate window)."
msgstr "Permite tornar a doca flutuante (aberta como uma janela separada)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Allows placing the dock in all available slots."
msgstr "Permite colocar o painel encaixável em todos os slots disponíveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "The dock is closed."
msgstr "A doca está fechada."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Dock slot, left side, upper-left (empty in default layout)."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca, lado esquerdo, superior esquerdo (vazio no layout padrão)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Dock slot, left side, bottom-left (empty in default layout)."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca, lado esquerdo, inferior esquerdo (vazio no layout padrão)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Dock slot, left side, upper-right (in default layout includes Scene and "
"Import docks)."
msgstr ""
"Espaço de encaixe, lado esquerdo, superior direito (no layout padrão inclui "
"os docks Cena e Importar)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Dock slot, left side, bottom-right (in default layout includes FileSystem "
"and History docks)."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca, lado esquerdo, inferior direito (no layout padrão inclui as "
"docas FileSystem e History)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid ""
"Dock slot, right side, upper-left (in default layout includes Inspector, "
"Signal, and Group docks)."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca, lado direito, superior esquerdo (no layout padrão inclui as "
"docas Inspector, Signal e Group)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Dock slot, right side, bottom-left (empty in default layout)."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca, lado direito, inferior esquerdo (vazio no layout padrão)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Dock slot, right side, upper-right (empty in default layout)."
msgstr "Slot de doca, lado direito, superior direito (vazio no layout padrão)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Dock slot, right side, bottom-right (empty in default layout)."
msgstr "Slot de doca, lado direito, inferior direito (vazio no layout padrão)."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Bottom panel."
msgstr "Painel inferior."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Dock slot at the bottom, below bottom panel, on the left side."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca na parte inferior, abaixo do painel inferior, no lado esquerdo."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml
msgid "Dock slot at the bottom, below bottom panel, on the right side."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca na parte inferior, abaixo do painel inferior, no lado direito."

#: doc/classes/EditorDock.xml doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DockSlot] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum DockSlot]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Identifies a supported export platform, and internally provides the "
"functionality of exporting to that platform."
msgstr ""
"Identifica uma plataforma de exportação suportada e fornece internamente a "
"funcionalidade de exportação para essa plataforma."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Base resource that provides the functionality of exporting a release build "
"of a project to a platform, from the editor. Stores platform-specific "
"metadata such as the name and supported features of the platform, and "
"performs the exporting of projects, PCK files, and ZIP files. Uses an export "
"template for the platform provided at the time of project exporting.\n"
"Used in scripting by [EditorExportPlugin] to configure platform-specific "
"customization of scenes and resources. See [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._begin_customize_scenes] and [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._begin_customize_resources] for more details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a message to the export log that will be displayed when exporting ends."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma mensagem ao log de exportação que será exibida quando a "
"exportação terminar."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Clears the export log."
msgstr "Limpa o registro de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Create a new preset for this platform."
msgstr "Cria um novo predefinido para esta plataforma."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Creates a PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um arquivo PCK em [param path] para o [param preset] especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a patch PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param "
"preset], containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param patches] is an optional override of the set of patches "
"defined in the export preset. When empty the patches defined in the export "
"preset will be used instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a full project at [param path] for the specified [param preset]. If "
"[param notify] is [code]true[/code], plugins using [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._export_begin] will be called during the process."
msgstr ""
"Cria um projeto completo em [param path] para a [param preset] especificada. "
"Se [param notify] for [code]true[/code], plugins que usam [method "
"EditorExportPlugin._export_begin] serão chamados durante o processo."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Exports project files for the specified preset. This method can be used to "
"implement custom export format, other than PCK and ZIP. One of the callbacks "
"is called for each exported file.\n"
"[param save_cb] is called for all exported files and have the following "
"arguments: [code]file_path: String[/code], [code]file_data: PackedByteArray[/"
"code], [code]file_index: int[/code], [code]file_count: int[/code], "
"[code]encryption_include_filters: PackedStringArray[/code], "
"[code]encryption_exclude_filters: PackedStringArray[/code], "
"[code]encryption_key: PackedByteArray[/code].\n"
"[param shared_cb] is called for exported native shared/static libraries and "
"have the following arguments: [code]file_path: String[/code], [code]tags: "
"PackedStringArray[/code], [code]target_folder: String[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]file_index[/code] and [code]file_count[/code] are "
"intended for progress tracking only and aren't necessarily unique and "
"precise."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Create a ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um arquivo ZIP em [param path] para o [param preset] especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Create a patch ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset], "
"containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param patches] is an optional override of the set of patches "
"defined in the export preset. When empty the patches defined in the export "
"preset will be used instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Locates export template for the platform, and returns [Dictionary] with the "
"following keys: [code]path: String[/code] and [code]error: String[/code]. "
"This method is provided for convenience and custom export platforms aren't "
"required to use it or keep export templates stored in the same way official "
"templates are."
msgstr ""
"Localiza o modelo de exportação para a plataforma e retorna um [Dictionary] "
"com as seguintes chaves: [code]path: String[/code] e [code]error: String[/"
"code]. Este método é fornecido por conveniência, e plataformas de exportação "
"personalizadas não são obrigadas a usá-lo ou a manter os modelos de "
"exportação armazenados da mesma forma que os modelos oficiais."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Generates array of command line arguments for the default export templates "
"for the debug flags and editor settings."
msgstr ""
"Gera um array de argumentos de linha de comando para os modelos de "
"exportação padrão para as flags de depuração e configurações do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Returns array of [EditorExportPreset]s for this platform."
msgstr "Retorna a matriz de [EditorExportPreset]s para esta plataforma."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Returns array of core file names that always should be exported regardless "
"of preset config."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma matriz de nomes de arquivos principais que sempre devem ser "
"exportados, independentemente da configuração da predefinição."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Returns additional files that should always be exported regardless of preset "
"configuration, and are not part of the project source. The returned "
"[Dictionary] contains filename keys ([String]) and their corresponding raw "
"data ([PackedByteArray])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna arquivos adicionais que devem ser sempre exportados, "
"independentemente da configuração predefinida, e não fazem parte do código-"
"fonte do projeto. O [Dictionary] retornado contém chaves de nomes de arquivo "
"([String]) e seus dados brutos correspondentes ([PackedByteArray])."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the message category for the message with the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a categoria da mensagem para a mensagem com o [param index] dado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Returns the number of messages in the export log."
msgstr "Retorna o número de mensagens no log de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Returns the text for the message with the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o texto para a mensagem com o [param index] dado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Returns the type for the message with the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o tipo para a mensagem com o [param index] dado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the export operating system handled by this "
"[EditorExportPlatform] class, as a friendly string. Possible return values "
"are [code]Windows[/code], [code]Linux[/code], [code]macOS[/code], "
"[code]Android[/code], [code]iOS[/code], and [code]Web[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do sistema operacional de exportação tratado por esta classe "
"[EditorExportPlatform], como uma string amigável. Os valores de retorno "
"possíveis são [code]Windows[/code], [code]Linux[/code], [code]macOS[/code], "
"[code]Android[/code], [code]iOS[/code] e [code]Web[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Returns most severe message type currently present in the export log."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo de mensagem mais grave presente atualmente no log de "
"exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Saves PCK archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the "
"shared/static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code]).\n"
"If [param embed] is [code]true[/code], PCK content is appended to the end of "
"[param path] file and return [Dictionary] additionally include following "
"keys: [code]embedded_start: int[/code] (embedded PCK offset) and "
"[code]embedded_size: int[/code] (embedded PCK size)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Saves patch PCK archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the "
"shared/static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Salva o arquivo PCK de patch e retorna [Dictionary] com as seguintes chaves: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array dos objetos "
"compartilhados/estáticos que contém dicionários com as seguintes chaves: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code] e "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Saves ZIP archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the "
"shared/static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Salva o arquivo ZIP e retorna [Dictionary] com as seguintes chaves: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array dos objetos "
"compartilhados/estáticos que contém dicionários com as seguintes chaves: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code] e "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Saves patch ZIP archive and returns [Dictionary] with the following keys: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array of the "
"shared/static objects which contains dictionaries with the following keys: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code], and "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Salva o arquivo ZIP de patch e retorna [Dictionary] com as seguintes chaves: "
"[code]result: Error[/code], [code]so_files: Array[/code] (array de objetos "
"compartilhados/estáticos que contém dicionários com as seguintes chaves: "
"[code]path: String[/code], [code]tags: PackedStringArray[/code] e "
"[code]target_folder: String[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid "Uploads specified file over SCP protocol to the remote host."
msgstr ""
"Envia o arquivo especificado por meio do protocolo SCP para o host remoto."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Executes specified command on the remote host via SSH protocol and returns "
"command output in the [param output]."
msgstr ""
"Executa o comando especificado no host remoto via protocolo SSH e retorna a "
"saída do comando em [param output]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Executes specified command on the remote host via SSH protocol and returns "
"process ID (on the remote host) without waiting for command to finish."
msgstr ""
"Executa o comando especificado no host remoto via protocolo SSH e retorna o "
"ID do processo (no host remoto) sem esperar o comando terminar."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Invalid message type used as the default value when no type is specified."
msgstr ""
"Tipo de mensagem inválido usado como valor padrão quando nenhum tipo é "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Message type for informational messages that have no effect on the export."
msgstr ""
"Tipo de mensagem para mensagens informativas que não têm efeito sobre a "
"exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Message type for warning messages that should be addressed but still allow "
"to complete the export."
msgstr ""
"Tipo de mensagem para mensagens de aviso que devem ser tratadas, mas ainda "
"permitem concluir a exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Message type for error messages that must be addressed and fail the export."
msgstr ""
"Tipo de mensagem para mensagens de erro que devem ser tratadas e causam "
"falha na exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if the remotely debugged project is expected to use the remote "
"file system. If set, [method gen_export_flags] will append [code]--remote-"
"fs[/code] and [code]--remote-fs-password[/code] (if [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/file_server/password] is defined) command line "
"arguments to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"A flag será definida se o projeto depurado remotamente precisar usar o "
"sistema de arquivos remoto. Se definida, [method gen_export_flags] anexará "
"os argumentos de linha de comando [code]--remote-fs[/code] e [code]--remote-"
"fs-password[/code] (se [member EditorSettings.filesystem/file_server/"
"password] estiver definido) à lista retornada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if remote debug is enabled. If set, [method gen_export_flags] "
"will append [code]--remote-debug[/code] and [code]--breakpoints[/code] (if "
"breakpoints are selected in the script editor or added by the plugin) "
"command line arguments to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"A flag é definida se a depuração remota estiver ativada. Se definida, "
"[method gen_export_flags] adicionará os argumentos de linha de comando "
"[code]--remote-debug[/code] e [code]--breakpoints[/code] (se os pontos de "
"interrupção forem selecionados no editor de scripts ou adicionados pelo plug-"
"in) à lista retornada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if remotely debugged project is running on the localhost. If "
"set, [method gen_export_flags] will use [code]localhost[/code] instead of "
"[member EditorSettings.network/debug/remote_host] as remote debugger host."
msgstr ""
"A flag é definida se o projeto depurado remotamente estiver rodando no "
"localhost. Se definido, [method gen_export_flags] usará [code]localhost[/"
"code] em vez de [member EditorSettings.network/debug/remote_host] como host "
"do depurador remoto."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if the \"Visible Collision Shapes\" remote debug option is "
"enabled. If set, [method gen_export_flags] will append the [code]--debug-"
"collisions[/code] command line argument to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"O sinalizador será ativado se a opção de depuração remota \"Visible "
"Collision Shapes\" estiver ativada. Se ativado, [method gen_export_flags] "
"anexará o argumento de linha de comando [code]--debug-collisions[/code] à "
"lista retornada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatform.xml
msgid ""
"Flag is set if the \"Visible Navigation\" remote debug option is enabled. If "
"set, [method gen_export_flags] will append the [code]--debug-navigation[/"
"code] command line argument to the returned list."
msgstr ""
"O sinalizador será ativado se a opção de depuração remota \"Visible "
"Navigation\" estiver ativada. Se ativado, [method gen_export_flags] anexará "
"o argumento de linha de comando [code]--debug-navigation[/code] à lista "
"retornada."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Exporter for Android."
msgstr "Exportador para Android."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Exporting for Android"
msgstr "Exportando para Android"

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Gradle builds for Android"
msgstr "Builds do Gradle para Android"

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Android plugins documentation index"
msgstr "Índice da documentação de plugins para Android"

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]arm64[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], binários [code]arm64[/code] são incluídos no projeto "
"exportado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]arm32[/code] binaries are included into exported "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], binários [code]arm32[/code] são incluídos no projeto "
"exportado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]x86_32[/code] binaries are included into "
"exported project."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], binários [code]x86_32[/code] são incluídos no projeto "
"exportado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [code]x86_64[/code] binaries are included into "
"exported project."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], binários [code]x86_64[/code] são incluídos no projeto "
"exportado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"A list of additional command line arguments, separated by space, which the "
"exported project will receive when started."
msgstr ""
"Uma lista de argumentos adicionais de linha de comando, separados por "
"espaço, que o projeto exportado receberá ao ser iniciado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to an APK file to use as a custom export template for debug exports. If "
"left empty, default template is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to an APK file to use as a custom export template for release exports. "
"If left empty, default template is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [url=https://developer.android.com/design/ui/wear/"
"guides/components/swipe-to-dismiss]Swipe to dismiss[/url] will be enabled.\n"
"This functionality is intended for smartwatches and is generally ignored on "
"standard Android devices. However, some devices may not ignore it. "
"Therefore, it is recommended to keep this feature disabled for standard "
"Android apps to avoid unexpected behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [code]false[/code] by default. To enable this behavior, "
"[member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is "
"required."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to a ZIP file holding the source for the export template used in a "
"Gradle build. If left empty, the default template is used."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para um arquivo ZIP contendo a fonte do modelo de exportação usado "
"em uma compilação do Gradle. Se deixado vazio, o modelo padrão é usado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], native libraries are compressed when performing a "
"Gradle build.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] While enabling compression can reduce the size of the binary, "
"it may result in slower application startup because the native libraries "
"must be extracted before use, rather than being loaded directly.\n"
"If you're distributing your app via the Play Store, it's generally "
"recommended to keep this option [code]false[/code], see [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/build/releases/past-releases/agp-3-6-0-release-"
"notes#extractNativeLibs]official documentation[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"A dictionary of custom theme attributes to include in the exported Android "
"project. Each entry defines a theme attribute name and its value, and will "
"be added to the [b]GodotAppMainTheme[/b].\n"
"For example, the key [code]android:windowSwipeToDismiss[/code] with the "
"value [code]false[/code] is resolved to [code]<item "
"name=\"android:windowSwipeToDismiss\">false</item>[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To add a custom attribute to the [b]GodotAppSplashTheme[/b], "
"prefix the attribute name with [code][splash][/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Reserved attributes configured via other export options or "
"project settings cannot be overridden by [code]custom_theme_attributes[/"
"code] and are skipped during export."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Application export format (*.apk or *.aab)."
msgstr "Formato de exportação de aplicativo (*.apk ou *.aab)."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the Gradle build directory. If left empty, then [code]res://android[/"
"code] will be used."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para o diretório de build do Gradle. Se deixado vazio, [code]res://"
"android[/code] será usado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum Android API level required for the application to run (used during "
"Gradle build). See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/"
"uses-sdk-element#uses]android:minSdkVersion[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Nível mínimo da API do Android necessário para a execução do aplicativo "
"(usado durante a compilação do Gradle). Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/uses-sdk-"
"element#uses]android:minSdkVersion[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"The Android API level on which the application is designed to run (used "
"during Gradle build). See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/"
"manifest/uses-sdk-element#uses]android:targetSdkVersion[/url]."
msgstr ""
"O nível da API do Android no qual o aplicativo foi projetado para ser "
"executado (usado durante a compilação do Gradle). Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/uses-sdk-"
"element#uses]android:targetSdkVersion[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], Gradle build is used instead of pre-built APK."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a compilação do Gradle é usada em vez do APK pré-"
"compilado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], OpenGL ES debug context will be created (additional "
"runtime checking, validation, and logging)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o contexto de depuração do OpenGL ES será criado "
"(verificação de tempo de execução adicional, validação e registro de logs)."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path of the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PATH[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore[/code] if "
"empty."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Password for the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_PASSWORD[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_pass[/code] "
"if both it and [member keystore/debug] are empty."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"User name for the debug keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_DEBUG_USER[/code].\n"
"Fallbacks to [code]EditorSettings.export/android/debug_keystore_user[/code] "
"if both it and [member keystore/debug] are empty."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Path of the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PATH[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Password for the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"User name for the release keystore file.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_ANDROID_KEYSTORE_RELEASE_USER[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Background layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de ícone adaptativo da camada de fundo do aplicativo. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"icon_design_adaptive#design-adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Foreground layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de ícone adaptativo da camada de primeiro plano do aplicativo. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"icon_design_adaptive#design-adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Monochrome layer of the application adaptive icon file. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/icon_design_adaptive#design-"
"adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de ícone adaptativo da camada monocromática do aplicativo. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"icon_design_adaptive#design-adaptive-icons]Design adaptive icons[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Application icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de ícone do aplicativo. Se deixado vazio, ele usará como fallback "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Application category for the Google Play Store. Only define this if your "
"application fits one of the categories well. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#appCategory]android:appCategory[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Categoria do aplicativo para a Google Play Store. Defina isso apenas se o "
"seu aplicativo se encaixar bem em uma das categorias. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#appCategory]android:appCategory[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], task initiated by main activity will be excluded from "
"the list of recently used applications. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/activity-"
"element#exclude]android:excludeFromRecents[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a tarefa iniciada pela atividade principal será "
"excluída da lista de aplicativos usados recentemente. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/activity-"
"element#exclude]android:excludeFromRecents[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Name of the application."
msgstr "Nome do aplicativo."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when the user uninstalls an app, a prompt to keep the "
"app's data will be shown. See [url=https://developer.android.com/guide/"
"topics/manifest/application-"
"element#fragileuserdata]android:hasFragileUserData[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], quando o usuário desinstalar um aplicativo, um aviso "
"para manter os dados do aplicativo será exibido. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/guide/topics/manifest/application-"
"element#fragileuserdata]android:hasFragileUserData[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the user will be able to set this app as the system "
"launcher in Android preferences."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o usuário poderá definir este aplicativo como o "
"inicializador do sistema nas preferências do Android."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], this app will show in Android TV launcher UI."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], este aplicativo será exibido na IU do inicializador do "
"Android TV."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this app will show in the device's app library.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [code]true[/code] by default."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], package signing is enabled."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], a assinatura de pacotes está ativada."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Unique application identifier in a reverse-DNS format. The reverse DNS "
"format should preferably match a domain name you control, but this is not "
"strictly required. For instance, if you own [code]example.com[/code], your "
"package unique name should preferably be of the form "
"[code]com.example.mygame[/code]. This identifier can only contain lowercase "
"alphanumeric characters ([code]a-z[/code], and [code]0-9[/code]), "
"underscores ([code]_[/code]), and periods ([code].[/code]). Each component "
"of the reverse DNS format must start with a letter: for instance, "
"[code]com.example.8game[/code] is not valid.\n"
"If [code]$genname[/code] is present in the value, it will be replaced by the "
"project name converted to lowercase. If there are invalid characters in the "
"project name, they will be stripped. If all characters in the project name "
"are stripped, [code]$genname[/code] is replaced by [code]noname[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing the package name will cause the package to be "
"considered as a new package, with its own installation and data paths. The "
"new package won't be usable to update existing installations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When publishing to Google Play, the package name must be "
"[i]globally[/i] unique. This means no other apps published on Google Play "
"must be using the same package name as yours. Otherwise, you'll be prevented "
"from publishing your app on Google Play."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read/write access to the \"properties\" table in the checkin "
"database. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES]ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso de leitura/gravação à tabela \"properties\" no banco de dados "
"de check-in. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES]ACCESS_CHECKIN_PROPERTIES[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the approximate location information. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION]ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso às informações de localização aproximada. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION]ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the precise location information. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION]ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso às informações de localização precisa. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION]ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the extra location provider commands. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS]ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso aos comandos extras do provedor de localização. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS]ACCESS_LOCATION_EXTRA_COMMANDS[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to access any geographic locations persisted in the "
"user's shared collection. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION]ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo acesse quaisquer localizações geográficas "
"armazenadas na coleção compartilhada do usuário. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION]ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to create mock location providers for testing."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo crie provedores de localização simulados para "
"testes."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the information about networks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE]ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso às informações sobre redes. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE]ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to use SurfaceFlinger's low level features."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo use os recursos de baixo nível do SurfaceFlinger."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the information about Wi-Fi networks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_WIFI_STATE]ACCESS_WIFI_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso às informações sobre redes Wi-Fi. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCESS_WIFI_STATE]ACCESS_WIFI_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to call into AccountAuthenticators. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCOUNT_MANAGER]ACCOUNT_MANAGER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos chamem AccountAuthenticators. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ACCOUNT_MANAGER]ACCOUNT_MANAGER[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to add voicemails into the system. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ADD_VOICEMAIL]ADD_VOICEMAIL[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo adicione correios de voz ao sistema. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#ADD_VOICEMAIL]ADD_VOICEMAIL[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to act as an AccountAuthenticator for the "
"AccountManager."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo atue como um AccountAuthenticator para o "
"AccountManager."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to collect battery statistics. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BATTERY_STATS]BATTERY_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo colete estatísticas de bateria. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BATTERY_STATS]BATTERY_STATS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by an AccessibilityService, to ensure that only the system "
"can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE]BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um AccessibilityService para garantir que apenas o "
"sistema possa se vincular a ele. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE]BIND_ACCESSIBILITY_SERVICE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to tell the AppWidget service which application can "
"access AppWidget's data. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BIND_APPWIDGET]BIND_APPWIDGET[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo diga ao serviço AppWidget qual aplicativo pode "
"acessar os dados do AppWidget. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_APPWIDGET]BIND_APPWIDGET[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by device administration receiver, to ensure that only the "
"system can interact with it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN]BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido pelo receptor de administração do dispositivo, para "
"garantir que apenas o sistema possa interagir com ele. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN]BIND_DEVICE_ADMIN[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by an InputMethodService, to ensure that only the system "
"can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_INPUT_METHOD]BIND_INPUT_METHOD[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um InputMethodService, para garantir que apenas o "
"sistema possa se vincular a ele. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_INPUT_METHOD]BIND_INPUT_METHOD[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a HostApduService or OffHostApduService to ensure that "
"only the system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_NFC_SERVICE]BIND_NFC_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um HostApduService ou OffHostApduService para garantir "
"que apenas o sistema possa se vincular a ele. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NFC_SERVICE]BIND_NFC_SERVICE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a NotificationListenerService, to ensure that only the "
"system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE]BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um NotificationListenerService, para garantir que "
"apenas o sistema possa se vincular a ele. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE]BIND_NOTIFICATION_LISTENER_SERVICE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a PrintService, to ensure that only the system can bind "
"to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_PRINT_SERVICE]BIND_PRINT_SERVICE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um PrintService, para garantir que apenas o sistema "
"possa se vincular a ele. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_PRINT_SERVICE]BIND_PRINT_SERVICE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a RemoteViewsService, to ensure that only the system can "
"bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_REMOTEVIEWS]BIND_REMOTEVIEWS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um RemoteViewsService, para garantir que apenas o "
"sistema possa se vincular a ele. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_REMOTEVIEWS]BIND_REMOTEVIEWS[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a TextService (e.g. SpellCheckerService) to ensure that "
"only the system can bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_TEXT_SERVICE]BIND_TEXT_SERVICE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um TextService (por exemplo, SpellCheckerService) para "
"garantir que apenas o sistema possa se vincular a ele. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_TEXT_SERVICE]BIND_TEXT_SERVICE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a VpnService, to ensure that only the system can bind to "
"it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_VPN_SERVICE]BIND_VPN_SERVICE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um VpnService, para garantir que apenas o sistema possa "
"se vincular a ele. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#BIND_VPN_SERVICE]BIND_VPN_SERVICE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Must be required by a WallpaperService, to ensure that only the system can "
"bind to it. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BIND_WALLPAPER]BIND_WALLPAPER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Deve ser exigido por um WallpaperService, para garantir que apenas o sistema "
"possa se vincular a ele. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#BIND_WALLPAPER]BIND_WALLPAPER[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to connect to paired bluetooth devices. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH]BLUETOOTH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos se conectem a dispositivos bluetooth emparelhados. "
"Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH]BLUETOOTH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to discover and pair bluetooth devices. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_ADMIN]BLUETOOTH_ADMIN[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos descubram e pareiem dispositivos bluetooth. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_ADMIN]BLUETOOTH_ADMIN[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to pair bluetooth devices without user interaction, and "
"to allow or disallow phonebook access or message access. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED]BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos pareiem dispositivos bluetooth sem a interação do "
"usuário e permitam ou proíbam o acesso à agenda telefônica ou a mensagens. "
"Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED]BLUETOOTH_PRIVILEGED[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Required to be able to disable the device (very dangerous!)."
msgstr "Necessário para poder desativar o dispositivo (muito perigoso!)."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast a notification that an application "
"package has been removed. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED]BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo transmita uma notificação de que um pacote de "
"aplicativo foi removido. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED]BROADCAST_PACKAGE_REMOVED[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast an SMS receipt notification. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_SMS]BROADCAST_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo transmita uma notificação de recibo de SMS. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_SMS]BROADCAST_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast sticky intents. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_STICKY]BROADCAST_STICKY[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo envie intenções persistentes. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_STICKY]BROADCAST_STICKY[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast a WAP PUSH receipt notification. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH]BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo transmita uma notificação de recebimento WAP PUSH. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH]BROADCAST_WAP_PUSH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to initiate a phone call without going through the "
"Dialer user interface. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#CALL_PHONE]CALL_PHONE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo inicie uma chamada telefônica sem passar pela "
"interface de usuário do discador. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PHONE]CALL_PHONE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to call any phone number, including emergency numbers, "
"without going through the Dialer user interface. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PRIVILEGED]CALL_PRIVILEGED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo disque para qualquer número de telefone, incluindo "
"números de emergência, sem passar pela interface do usuário do Discador. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CALL_PRIVILEGED]CALL_PRIVILEGED[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Required to be able to access the camera device. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#CAMERA]CAMERA[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Necessário para poder acessar o dispositivo de câmera. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#CAMERA]CAMERA[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to capture audio output. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT]CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo capture a saída de áudio. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT]CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to capture secure video output."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo capture saída de vídeo segura."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to capture video output."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo capture a saída de vídeo."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to change whether an application component (other than "
"its own) is enabled or not. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE]CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo altere se um componente de aplicativo (diferente "
"do seu próprio) está ativado ou não. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE]CHANGE_COMPONENT_ENABLED_STATE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify the current configuration, such as locale. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_CONFIGURATION]CHANGE_CONFIGURATION[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo modifique a configuração atual, como a localidade. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_CONFIGURATION]CHANGE_CONFIGURATION[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to change network connectivity state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE]CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos alterem o estado de conectividade de rede. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE]CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to enter Wi-Fi Multicast mode. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que os aplicativos entrem no modo Wi-Fi Multicast. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to change Wi-Fi connectivity state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos alterem o estado de conectividade Wi-Fi. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CHANGE_WIFI_STATE]CHANGE_WIFI_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to clear the caches of all installed applications on "
"the device. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CLEAR_APP_CACHE]CLEAR_APP_CACHE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo limpe os caches de todos os aplicativos instalados "
"no dispositivo. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#CLEAR_APP_CACHE]CLEAR_APP_CACHE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to clear user data."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo limpe os dados do usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows enabling/disabling location update notifications from the radio. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES]CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite ativar/desativar notificações de atualização de localização do "
"rádio. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES]CONTROL_LOCATION_UPDATES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Array of custom permission strings."
msgstr "Array de strings de permissão personalizada."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to delete packages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DELETE_PACKAGES]DELETE_PACKAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo exclua pacotes. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DELETE_PACKAGES]DELETE_PACKAGES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows low-level access to power management."
msgstr "Permite acesso de baixo nível ao gerenciamento de energia."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to RW to diagnostic resources. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DIAGNOSTIC]DIAGNOSTIC[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que os aplicativos leiam e gravem em recursos de diagnóstico. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DIAGNOSTIC]DIAGNOSTIC[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to disable the keyguard if it is not secure. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DISABLE_KEYGUARD]DISABLE_KEYGUARD[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que os aplicativos desativem a tela de bloqueio se ela não for "
"segura. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DISABLE_KEYGUARD]DISABLE_KEYGUARD[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to retrieve state dump information from system "
"services. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#DUMP]DUMP[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo recupere informações de despejo de estado de "
"serviços do sistema. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#DUMP]DUMP[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to expand or collapse the status bar. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#EXPAND_STATUS_BAR]EXPAND_STATUS_BAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo expanda ou recolha a barra de status. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#EXPAND_STATUS_BAR]EXPAND_STATUS_BAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Run as a manufacturer test application, running as the root user. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#FACTORY_TEST]FACTORY_TEST[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Executar como um aplicativo de teste do fabricante, rodando como o usuário "
"root. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#FACTORY_TEST]FACTORY_TEST[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows access to the flashlight."
msgstr "Permite acesso à lanterna."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to force a BACK operation on whatever is the top "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo force uma operação BACK em qualquer que seja a "
"atividade principal."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the list of accounts in the Accounts Service. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_ACCOUNTS]GET_ACCOUNTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso à lista de contas no Serviço de Contas. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_ACCOUNTS]GET_ACCOUNTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to find out the space used by any package. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_PACKAGE_SIZE]GET_PACKAGE_SIZE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo descubra o espaço usado por qualquer pacote. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GET_PACKAGE_SIZE]GET_PACKAGE_SIZE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 21."
msgstr "Descontinuado no nível de API 21."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to retrieve private information about the current top "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo recupere informações privadas sobre a atividade "
"principal atual."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Used on content providers to allow the global search system to access their "
"data. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#GLOBAL_SEARCH]GLOBAL_SEARCH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Usado em provedores de conteúdo para permitir que o sistema de pesquisa "
"global acesse seus dados. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#GLOBAL_SEARCH]GLOBAL_SEARCH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows access to hardware peripherals."
msgstr "Permite acesso a periféricos de hardware."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to inject user events (keys, touch, trackball) into "
"the event stream and deliver them to ANY window."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo injete eventos do usuário (teclas, toque, "
"trackball) no fluxo de eventos e os entregue a QUALQUER janela."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to install a location provider into the Location "
"Manager. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER]INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo instale um provedor de localização no Gerenciador "
"de Localização. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER]INSTALL_LOCATION_PROVIDER[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to install packages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_PACKAGES]INSTALL_PACKAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo instale pacotes. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_PACKAGES]INSTALL_PACKAGES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to install a shortcut in Launcher. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_SHORTCUT]INSTALL_SHORTCUT[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo instale um atalho no Launcher. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INSTALL_SHORTCUT]INSTALL_SHORTCUT[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to open windows that are for use by parts of the "
"system user interface."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo abra janelas destinadas ao uso por partes da "
"interface de usuário do sistema."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to open network sockets. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INTERNET]INTERNET[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos abram sockets de rede. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#INTERNET]INTERNET[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to call "
"ActivityManager.killBackgroundProcesses(String). See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES]KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo chame "
"ActivityManager.killBackgroundProcesses(String). Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES]KILL_BACKGROUND_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to use location features in hardware, such as the "
"geofencing api. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#LOCATION_HARDWARE]LOCATION_HARDWARE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo use recursos de localização no hardware, como a "
"API de geofencing. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#LOCATION_HARDWARE]LOCATION_HARDWARE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage the list of accounts in the AccountManager."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo gerencie a lista de contas no AccountManager."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage (create, destroy, Z-order) application "
"tokens in the window manager."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo gerencie (crie, destrua, ordem Z) tokens de "
"aplicativo no gerenciador de janelas."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to manage access to documents, usually as part of a "
"document picker. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_DOCUMENTS]MANAGE_DOCUMENTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo gerencie o acesso a documentos, geralmente como "
"parte de um seletor de documentos. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_DOCUMENTS]MANAGE_DOCUMENTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application a broad access to external storage in scoped storage. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite a um aplicativo acesso amplo ao armazenamento externo no "
"armazenamento com escopo (scoped storage). Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify and delete media files on this device or any "
"connected storage device without user confirmation. Applications must "
"already be granted the [code]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] or "
"[code]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] permissions for this permission to take "
"effect. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_MEDIA]MANAGE_MEDIA[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo modifique e exclua arquivos de mídia neste "
"dispositivo ou em qualquer dispositivo de armazenamento conectado sem a "
"confirmação do usuário. Os aplicativos já devem ter recebido as permissões "
"[code]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] ou [code]MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/code] "
"para que esta permissão entre em vigor. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MANAGE_MEDIA]MANAGE_MEDIA[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MASTER_CLEAR]MASTER_CLEAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MASTER_CLEAR]MASTER_CLEAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to know what content is playing and control its "
"playback. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL]MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo saiba qual conteúdo está sendo reproduzido e "
"controle sua reprodução. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL]MEDIA_CONTENT_CONTROL[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify global audio settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS]MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo modifique as configurações globais de áudio. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS]MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows modification of the telephony state - power on, mmi, etc. Does not "
"include placing calls. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#MODIFY_PHONE_STATE]MODIFY_PHONE_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite a modificação do estado de telefonia - ligar, mmi, etc. Não inclui "
"fazer chamadas. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MODIFY_PHONE_STATE]MODIFY_PHONE_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows formatting file systems for removable storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite formatar sistemas de arquivos para armazenamento removível. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_FORMAT_FILESYSTEMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows mounting and unmounting file systems for removable storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite montar e desmontar sistemas de arquivos para armazenamento "
"removível. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS]MOUNT_UNMOUNT_FILESYSTEMS[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to perform I/O operations over NFC. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#NFC]NFC[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos realizem operações de I/O por NFC. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#NFC]NFC[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 15."
msgstr "Descontinuado no nível de API 15."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to make its activities persistent."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo torne suas atividades persistentes."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to post notifications. Added in API level 33. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/"
"notification-permission]Notification runtime permission[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo envie notificações. Adicionado no nível de API 33. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/"
"notification-permission]Permissão de tempo de execução de notificação[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 29."
msgstr "Descontinuado no nível de API 29."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to see the number being dialed during an outgoing call "
"with the option to redirect the call to a different number or abort the call "
"altogether. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS]PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo veja o número sendo discado durante uma chamada de "
"saída com a opção de redirecionar a chamada para um número diferente ou "
"abortar a chamada completamente. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS]PROCESS_OUTGOING_CALLS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's calendar data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALENDAR]READ_CALENDAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia os dados de calendário do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALENDAR]READ_CALENDAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's call log. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALL_LOG]READ_CALL_LOG[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia o registro de chamadas do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CALL_LOG]READ_CALL_LOG[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the user's contacts data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CONTACTS]READ_CONTACTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia os dados de contatos do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_CONTACTS]READ_CONTACTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 33."
msgstr "Descontinuado no nível de API 33."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read from external storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia de armazenamento externo. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to take screen shots and more generally get access to "
"the frame buffer data."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo tire capturas de tela e, de forma mais geral, "
"obtenha acesso aos dados do buffer de quadros."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read (but not write) the user's browsing history "
"and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia (mas não escreva) o histórico de navegação e "
"os favoritos do usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Deprecated in API level 16."
msgstr "Descontinuado no nível de API 16."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read the low-level system log files. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_LOGS]READ_LOGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia os arquivos de log do sistema de baixo nível. "
"Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_LOGS]READ_LOGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read audio files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_AUDIO]READ_MEDIA_AUDIO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia arquivos de áudio do armazenamento externo. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_AUDIO]READ_MEDIA_AUDIO[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read image files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_IMAGES]READ_MEDIA_IMAGES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia arquivos de imagem do armazenamento externo. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_IMAGES]READ_MEDIA_IMAGES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read video files from external storage. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VIDEO]READ_MEDIA_VIDEO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia arquivos de vídeo do armazenamento externo. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VIDEO]READ_MEDIA_VIDEO[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read image or video files from external storage "
"that a user has selected via the permission prompt photo picker. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED]READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia arquivos de imagem ou vídeo de armazenamento "
"externo que o usuário selecionou por meio do seletor de fotos de prompt de "
"permissão. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED]READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read only access to phone state. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_PHONE_STATE]READ_PHONE_STATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso somente leitura ao estado do telefone. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_PHONE_STATE]READ_PHONE_STATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to read the user's personal profile data."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo leia os dados do perfil pessoal do usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SMS]READ_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia mensagens SMS. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SMS]READ_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to read from the user's social stream."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo leia o fluxo social do usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to read the sync settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_SETTINGS]READ_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos leiam as configurações de sincronização. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_SETTINGS]READ_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to read the sync stats. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_STATS]READ_SYNC_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos leiam as estatísticas de sincronização. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#READ_SYNC_STATS]READ_SYNC_STATS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to read the user dictionary."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo leia o dicionário do usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Required to be able to reboot the device. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#REBOOT]REBOOT[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Necessário para poder reiniciar o dispositivo. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#REBOOT]REBOOT[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive the Intent.ACTION_BOOT_COMPLETED that is "
"broadcast after the system finishes booting. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED]RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo receba o Intent.ACTION_BOOT_COMPLETED que é "
"transmitido após o término da inicialização do sistema. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED]RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to monitor incoming MMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_MMS]RECEIVE_MMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo monitore mensagens MMS recebidas. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_MMS]RECEIVE_MMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_SMS]RECEIVE_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que os aplicativos recebam mensagens SMS. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_SMS]RECEIVE_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to receive WAP push messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH]RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo receba mensagens WAP push. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH]RECEIVE_WAP_PUSH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to record audio. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO]RECORD_AUDIO[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo grave áudio. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#RECORD_AUDIO]RECORD_AUDIO[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to change the Z-order of tasks. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REORDER_TASKS]REORDER_TASKS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo altere a ordem Z das tarefas. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#REORDER_TASKS]REORDER_TASKS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application (Phone) to send a request to other applications to "
"handle the respond-via-message action during incoming calls. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE]SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo (Telefone) envie uma solicitação para outros "
"aplicativos para manipular a ação de responder por mensagem durante chamadas "
"recebidas. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE]SEND_RESPOND_VIA_MESSAGE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to send SMS messages. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_SMS]SEND_SMS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo envie mensagens SMS. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SEND_SMS]SEND_SMS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to watch and control how activities are started "
"globally in the system."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo monitore e controle como as atividades são "
"iniciadas globalmente no sistema."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to broadcast an Intent to set an alarm for the user. "
"See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALARM]SET_ALARM[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo transmita uma Intent para definir um alarme para o "
"usuário. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALARM]SET_ALARM[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to control whether activities are immediately finished "
"when put in the background. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#SET_ALWAYS_FINISH]SET_ALWAYS_FINISH[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo controle se as atividades são finalizadas "
"imediatamente quando colocadas em segundo plano. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ALWAYS_FINISH]SET_ALWAYS_FINISH[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows to modify the global animation scaling factor. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ANIMATION_SCALE]SET_ANIMATION_SCALE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite modificar o fator de escala de animação global. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_ANIMATION_SCALE]SET_ANIMATION_SCALE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Configure an application for debugging. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_DEBUG_APP]SET_DEBUG_APP[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Configura um aplicativo para depuração. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_DEBUG_APP]SET_DEBUG_APP[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows low-level access to setting the orientation (actually rotation) of "
"the screen."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso de baixo nível para definir a orientação (na verdade, a "
"rotação) da tela."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows low-level access to setting the pointer speed."
msgstr "Permite acesso de baixo nível para definir a velocidade do ponteiro."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to set the maximum number of (not needed) application "
"processes that can be running. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#SET_PROCESS_LIMIT]SET_PROCESS_LIMIT[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo defina o número máximo de processos de aplicativo "
"(não necessários) que podem estar em execução. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_PROCESS_LIMIT]SET_PROCESS_LIMIT[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the system time directly. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME]SET_TIME[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que os aplicativos definam o horário do sistema diretamente. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME]SET_TIME[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the system time zone directly. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME_ZONE]SET_TIME_ZONE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos definam o fuso horário do sistema diretamente. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_TIME_ZONE]SET_TIME_ZONE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the wallpaper. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER]SET_WALLPAPER[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que os aplicativos definam o papel de parede. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER]SET_WALLPAPER[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to set the wallpaper hints. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS]SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos definam as dicas de papel de parede. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS]SET_WALLPAPER_HINTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allow an application to request that a signal be sent to all persistent "
"processes. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES]SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo solicite o envio de um sinal para todos os "
"processos persistentes. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/"
"Manifest.permission#SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES]SIGNAL_PERSISTENT_PROCESSES[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to open, close, or disable the status bar and its "
"icons. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#STATUS_BAR]STATUS_BAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo abra, feche ou desative a barra de status e seus "
"ícones. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#STATUS_BAR]STATUS_BAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to allow access the subscribed feeds ContentProvider."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo permita o acesso ao ContentProvider de feeds "
"assinados."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an app to create windows using the type "
"WindowManager.LayoutParams.TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY, shown on top of all "
"other apps. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW]SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo crie janelas usando o tipo "
"WindowManager.LayoutParams.TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY, exibidas no topo de "
"todos os outros aplicativos. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW]SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows using the device's IR transmitter, if available. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#TRANSMIT_IR]TRANSMIT_IR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite usar o transmissor IR do dispositivo, se disponível. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#TRANSMIT_IR]TRANSMIT_IR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to update device statistics. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS]UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo atualize estatísticas do dispositivo. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS]UPDATE_DEVICE_STATS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to request authtokens from the AccountManager."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo solicite tokens de autenticação do AccountManager."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to use SIP service. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#USE_SIP]USE_SIP[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo use o serviço SIP. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/Manifest.permission#USE_SIP]USE_SIP[/"
"url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows access to the vibrator. See [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#VIBRATE]VIBRATE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso ao vibrador. Veja [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"reference/android/Manifest.permission#VIBRATE]VIBRATE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows using PowerManager WakeLocks to keep processor from sleeping or "
"screen from dimming. See [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#WAKE_LOCK]WAKE_LOCK[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite usar WakeLocks do PowerManager para impedir que o processador entre "
"em modo de suspensão ou que a tela escureça. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WAKE_LOCK]WAKE_LOCK[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to write the apn settings and read sensitive fields of "
"an existing apn settings like user and password. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_APN_SETTINGS]WRITE_APN_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que os aplicativos gravem as configurações de APN e leiam campos "
"confidenciais de configurações de APN existentes, como usuário e senha. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_APN_SETTINGS]WRITE_APN_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write the user's calendar data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALENDAR]WRITE_CALENDAR[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo grave os dados de calendário do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALENDAR]WRITE_CALENDAR[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's call log data. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALL_LOG]WRITE_CALL_LOG[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo grave (mas não leia) os dados do registro de "
"chamadas do usuário. Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/Manifest.permission#WRITE_CALL_LOG]WRITE_CALL_LOG[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write the user's contacts data. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CONTACTS]WRITE_CONTACTS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo grave os dados de contatos do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_CONTACTS]WRITE_CONTACTS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write to external storage. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo grave em armazenamento externo. Consulte "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE]WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to modify the Google service map. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_GSERVICES]WRITE_GSERVICES[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo modifique o mapa de serviços do Google. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_GSERVICES]WRITE_GSERVICES[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's browsing history "
"and bookmarks."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo escreva (mas não leia) o histórico de navegação e "
"os favoritos do usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's personal profile "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo grave (mas não leia) os dados do perfil pessoal do "
"usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read or write the secure system settings. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia ou grave as configurações de sistema seguras. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to read or write the system settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo leia ou escreva as configurações do sistema. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SETTINGS]WRITE_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to write SMS messages."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo grave mensagens SMS."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows an application to write (but not read) the user's social stream data."
msgstr ""
"Permite que um aplicativo grave (mas não leia) os dados do fluxo social do "
"usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Allows applications to write the sync settings. See [url=https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS]WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que aplicativos gravem as configurações de sincronização. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/reference/android/"
"Manifest.permission#WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS]WRITE_SYNC_SETTINGS[/url]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Allows an application to write to the user dictionary."
msgstr "Permite que um aplicativo escreva no dicionário do usuário."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"The background color used for the root window. By default it's [constant "
"Color.BLACK]."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo usada para a janela raiz. Por padrão, é [constant "
"Color.BLACK]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this makes the navigation and status bars translucent "
"and allows the application content to extend edge to edge.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You should ensure that none of the application content is "
"occluded by system elements by using the [method "
"DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area] and [method "
"DisplayServer.get_display_cutouts] methods."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], torna as barras de navegação e de status "
"translúcidas e permite que o conteúdo do aplicativo se estenda de ponta a "
"ponta da tela.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Você deve garantir que nenhum conteúdo do aplicativo fique "
"encoberto por elementos do sistema, utilizando os métodos [method "
"DisplayServer.get_display_safe_area] e [method "
"DisplayServer.get_display_cutouts]."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hides the navigation and status bar. Set [method "
"DisplayServer.window_set_mode] to change this at runtime."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], oculta a barra de navegação e de status. Defina "
"[method DisplayServer.window_set_mode] to change this at runtime. -> Defina "
"[method DisplayServer.window_set_mode] para alterar isso em tempo de "
"execução."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Indicates whether the application supports larger screen form-factors."
msgstr ""
"Indica se o aplicativo oferece suporte a fatores de forma de tela maiores."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Indicates whether an application supports the \"normal\" screen form-factors."
msgstr ""
"Indica se um aplicativo oferece suporte aos fatores de forma de tela "
"\"normais\"."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "Indicates whether the application supports smaller screen form-factors."
msgstr ""
"Indica se o aplicativo oferece suporte a fatores de forma de tela menores."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Indicates whether the application supports extra large screen form-factors."
msgstr ""
"Indica se o aplicativo oferece suporte a fatores de forma de tela extra "
"grandes."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shaders will be compiled and embedded in the "
"application. This option is only supported when using the Forward+ or Mobile "
"renderers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting as a dedicated server, the shader baker is "
"always disabled since no rendering is performed."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os shaders serão compilados e incorporados ao "
"aplicativo. Esta opção é suportada apenas ao usar os renderizadores Forward+ "
"ou Mobile.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao exportar como um servidor dedicado, o compilador de shaders "
"é sempre desabilitado, pois nenhuma renderização é realizada."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"The background color used for the system splash screen window.\n"
"If not set, it will fallback to [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/adaptive_background_432x432].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only applied if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"System splash screen branding image file. If left empty, no branding image "
"will be used. See [url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/"
"splash-screen#dimensions]splash-screen dimensions[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Can be used to set an image to be shown at the bottom of the "
"splash screen."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Godot's boot splash will not be shown, and the system "
"boot splash will remain visible for a longer time, until the mainloop starts."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a tela de inicialização do Godot não será exibida e a "
"tela de inicialização do sistema permanecerá visível por mais tempo, até que "
"o loop principal seja iniciado."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"System splash screen icon file. If left empty, it will fall back to [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/adaptive_foreground_432x432]. See "
"[url=https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/launch/splash-"
"screen#dimensions]splash-screen dimensions[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You can provide an [url=https://developer.android.com/reference/"
"android/graphics/drawable/AnimatedVectorDrawable]AnimatedVectorDrawable (AVD)"
"[/url] XML. However, the XML file will only be used if [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] is enabled. If "
"not, it will fall back to [member EditorExportPlatformAndroid.launcher_icons/"
"adaptive_background_432x432]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows the application to participate in the backup "
"and restore infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite que o aplicativo participe da infraestrutura "
"de backup e restauração."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Machine-readable application version. This must be incremented for every new "
"release pushed to the Play Store."
msgstr ""
"Versão do aplicativo legível por máquina. Isso deve ser incrementado para "
"cada novo lançamento enviado para a Play Store."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid ""
"Application version visible to the user. Falls back to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] if left empty."
msgstr ""
"Versão do aplicativo visível para o usuário. Recorre a [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] se deixado vazio."

#: platform/android/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformAndroid.xml
msgid "The extended reality (XR) mode for this application."
msgstr "O modo de realidade estendida (XR) para este aplicativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformAppleEmbedded.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for the Apple embedded platform exporters (iOS and visionOS)."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para os exportadores de plataformas embarcadas da Apple (iOS e "
"visionOS)."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformAppleEmbedded.xml
msgid ""
"The base class for Apple embedded platform exporters. These include iOS and "
"visionOS, but not macOS. See the classes inheriting from this one for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"A classe base para exportadores de plataformas embarcadas da Apple. Isso "
"inclui iOS e visionOS, mas não o macOS. Veja as classes que herdam desta "
"para mais detalhes."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformAppleEmbedded.xml
#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid "Exporting for iOS"
msgstr "Exportando para iOS"

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformAppleEmbedded.xml
#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid "iOS plugins documentation index"
msgstr "Índice da documentação de plugins para iOS"

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Base class for custom [EditorExportPlatform] implementations (plugins)."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para implementações personalizadas de [EditorExportPlatform] "
"(plugins)."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"External [EditorExportPlatform] implementations should inherit from this "
"class.\n"
"To use [EditorExportPlatform], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_export_platform] method first."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param preset] is valid and can "
"be exported. Use [method set_config_error] and [method "
"set_config_missing_templates] to set error details.\n"
"Usual implementations call [method _has_valid_export_configuration] and "
"[method _has_valid_project_configuration] to determine if exporting is "
"possible."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Called by the editor before platform is unregistered."
msgstr "Chamado pelo editor antes que a plataforma seja desregistrada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset].\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the "
"export dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" disabled, and PCK is selected as a "
"file type."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a patch PCK archive at [param path] for the specified [param "
"preset], containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the "
"export dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" enabled, and PCK is selected as a "
"file type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The patches provided in [param patches] have already been "
"loaded when this method is called and are merely provided as context. When "
"empty the patches defined in the export preset have been loaded instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a full project at [param path] for the specified [param preset].\n"
"This method is called when \"Export\" button is pressed in the export "
"dialog.\n"
"This method implementation can call [method EditorExportPlatform.save_pack] "
"or [method EditorExportPlatform.save_zip] to use default PCK/ZIP export "
"process, or calls [method EditorExportPlatform.export_project_files] and "
"implement custom callback for processing each exported file."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Create a ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset].\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the "
"export dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" disabled, and ZIP is selected as a "
"file type."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Create a ZIP archive at [param path] for the specified [param preset], "
"containing only the files that have changed since the last patch.\n"
"This method is called when \"Export PCK/ZIP\" button is pressed in the "
"export dialog, with \"Export as Patch\" enabled, and ZIP is selected as a "
"file type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The patches provided in [param patches] have already been "
"loaded when this method is called and are merely provided as context. When "
"empty the patches defined in the export preset have been loaded instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns array of supported binary extensions for the full project export."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um array de extensões binárias suportadas para a exportação completa "
"do projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns protocol used for remote debugging. Default implementation return "
"[code]tcp://[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o protocolo usado para depuração remota. A implementação padrão "
"retorna [code]tcp://[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns device architecture for one-click deploy."
msgstr "Retorna a arquitetura do dispositivo para implantação com um clique."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns visibility for the specified [param "
"preset]. Default implementation return [code]true[/code] for all options."
msgstr ""
"Valida [param option] e retorna a visibilidade para o [param preset] "
"especificado. A implementação padrão retorna [code]true[/code] para todas as "
"opções."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns warning message for the specified "
"[param preset]. Default implementation return empty string for all options."
msgstr ""
"Valida [param option] e retorna a mensagem de aviso para o [param preset] "
"especificado. A implementação padrão retorna uma string vazia para todas as "
"opções."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a property list, as an [Array] of dictionaries. Each [Dictionary] "
"must at least contain the [code]name: StringName[/code] and [code]type: "
"Variant.Type[/code] entries.\n"
"Additionally, the following keys are supported:\n"
"- [code]hint: PropertyHint[/code]\n"
"- [code]hint_string: String[/code]\n"
"- [code]usage: PropertyUsageFlags[/code]\n"
"- [code]class_name: StringName[/code]\n"
"- [code]default_value: Variant[/code], default value of the property.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility: bool[/code], if set to [code]true[/code], [method "
"_get_export_option_visibility] is called for each property when this "
"property is changed.\n"
"- [code]required: bool[/code], if set to [code]true[/code], this property "
"warnings are critical, and should be resolved to make export possible. This "
"value is a hint for the [method _has_valid_export_configuration] "
"implementation, and not used by the engine directly.\n"
"See also [method Object._get_property_list]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the platform logo displayed in the export dialog. The logo should be "
"32×32 pixels, adjusted for the current editor scale (see [method "
"EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o logotipo da plataforma exibido na caixa de diálogo de exportação. "
"O logotipo deve ter 32×32 pixels, ajustado para a escala atual do editor "
"(veja [method EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns export platform name."
msgstr "Retorna o nome da plataforma de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the item icon for the specified [param device] in the one-click "
"deploy menu. The icon should be 16×16 pixels, adjusted for the current "
"editor scale (see [method EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ícone de item para o [param device] especificado no menu de "
"implantação de um clique. O ícone deve ter 16×16 pixels, ajustado para a "
"escala atual do editor (consulte [method EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns one-click deploy menu item label for the specified [param device]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o rótulo do item de menu de implantação em um clique para o [param "
"device] especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns one-click deploy menu item tooltip for the specified [param device]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a dica de ferramenta do item de menu de implantação em um clique "
"para o [param device] especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of devices (or other options) available in the one-click "
"deploy menu."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de dispositivos (ou outras opções) disponíveis no menu de "
"implantação com um clique."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns tooltip of the one-click deploy menu button."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a dica de ferramenta do botão do menu de implantação de um clique."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns target OS name."
msgstr "Retorna o nome do SO de destino."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns array of platform specific features."
msgstr "Retorna um array de recursos específicos da plataforma."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns array of platform specific features for the specified [param preset]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um array de recursos específicos de plataforma para o [param preset] "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the icon of the one-click deploy menu button. The icon should be "
"16×16 pixels, adjusted for the current editor scale (see [method "
"EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ícone do botão do menu de implantação de um clique. O ícone deve "
"ter 16×16 pixels, ajustado para a escala atual do editor (veja [method "
"EditorInterface.get_editor_scale])."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if export configuration is valid."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se a configuração de exportação for válida."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if project configuration is valid."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se a configuração do projeto for válida."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the plugin. Called by the editor when platform is registered."
msgstr ""
"Inicializa o plugin. Chamado pelo editor quando a plataforma é registrada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if specified file is a valid executable (native "
"executable or script) for the target platform."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o arquivo especificado for um executável válido "
"(executável nativo ou script) para a plataforma de destino."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if one-click deploy options are changed and editor "
"interface should be updated."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se as opções de implantação com um clique forem "
"alteradas e a interface do editor precisar ser atualizada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"This method is called when [param device] one-click deploy menu option is "
"selected.\n"
"Implementation should export project to a temporary location, upload and run "
"it on the specific [param device], or perform another action associated with "
"the menu item."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if export options list is changed and presets "
"should be updated."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a lista de opções de exportação for alterada e "
"as predefinições precisarem ser atualizadas."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns current configuration error message text. This method should be "
"called only from the [method _can_export], [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration], or [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o texto da mensagem de erro de configuração atual. Este método deve "
"ser chamado apenas a partir das implementações de [method _can_export], "
"[method _has_valid_export_configuration] ou [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] is export templates are missing from the current "
"configuration. This method should be called only from the [method "
"_can_export], [method _has_valid_export_configuration], or [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se os modelos de exportação estiverem faltando na "
"configuração atual. Este método deve ser chamado apenas a partir das "
"implementações de [method _can_export], [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration] ou [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Sets current configuration error message text. This method should be called "
"only from the [method _can_export], [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration], or [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"Define o texto da mensagem de erro de configuração atual. Este método deve "
"ser chamado apenas a partir das implementações de [method _can_export], "
"[method _has_valid_export_configuration] ou [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Set to [code]true[/code] is export templates are missing from the current "
"configuration. This method should be called only from the [method "
"_can_export], [method _has_valid_export_configuration], or [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration] implementations."
msgstr ""
"Definido como [code]true[/code] se os modelos de exportação estiverem "
"faltando na configuração atual. Este método deve ser chamado apenas a partir "
"das implementações de [method _can_export], [method "
"_has_valid_export_configuration] ou [method "
"_has_valid_project_configuration]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid "Exporter for iOS."
msgstr "Exportador para iOS."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Additional data added to the root [code]<dict>[/code] section of the "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"information_property_list]Info.plist[/url] file. The value should be an XML "
"section with pairs of key-value elements, e.g.:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"<key>key_name</key>\n"
"<string>value</string>\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Apple Team ID, unique 10-character string. To locate your Team ID check "
"\"Membership details\" section in your Apple developer account dashboard, or "
"\"Organizational Unit\" of your code signing certificate. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-your-team/locate-your-team-id]Locate "
"your Team ID[/url]."
msgstr ""
"ID da equipe da Apple, string exclusiva de 10 caracteres. Para localizar seu "
"ID de equipe, verifique a seção \"Detalhes da associação\" (Membership "
"details) no painel da sua conta de desenvolvedor da Apple ou a \"Unidade "
"Organizacional\" (Organizational Unit) do seu certificado de assinatura de "
"código. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-your-team/"
"locate-your-team-id]Localizar seu ID de equipe[/url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Unique application identifier in a reverse-DNS format, can only contain "
"alphanumeric characters ([code]A-Z[/code], [code]a-z[/code], and [code]0-9[/"
"code]), hyphens ([code]-[/code]), and periods ([code].[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Identificador de aplicativo exclusivo em formato DNS reverso, pode conter "
"apenas caracteres alfanuméricos ([code]A-Z[/code], [code]a-z[/code] e "
"[code]0-9[/code]), hifens ([code]-[/code]) e pontos ([code].[/code])."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\", or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used for debug export."
msgstr ""
"O \"Nome Completo\", \"Nome Comum\" ou o hash SHA-1 da identidade de "
"assinatura usada para exportação de depuração."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\", or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used for release export."
msgstr ""
"O \"Nome Completo\", \"Nome Comum\" ou o hash SHA-1 da identidade de "
"assinatura usada para exportação de lançamento."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], existing \"project name\" and \"project "
"name.xcodeproj\" in the export destination directory will be unconditionally "
"deleted during export."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o \"project name\" e \"project name.xcodeproj\" "
"existentes no diretório de destino da exportação serão excluídos "
"incondicionalmente durante a exportação."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid "Application distribution target (debug export)."
msgstr "Alvo de distribuição de aplicativo (exportação de depuração)."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid "Application distribution target (release export)."
msgstr "Alvo de distribuição do aplicativo (exportação de lançamento)."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], exports iOS project files without building an "
"XCArchive or [code].ipa[/code] file. If [code]false[/code], exports iOS "
"project files and builds an XCArchive and [code].ipa[/code] file at the same "
"time. When combining Godot with Fastlane or other build pipelines, you may "
"want to set this to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exporta arquivos de projeto iOS sem compilar um "
"arquivo XCArchive ou [code].ipa[/code]. Se [code]false[/code], exporta "
"arquivos de projeto iOS e compila um arquivo XCArchive e [code].ipa[/code] "
"ao mesmo tempo. Ao combinar o Godot com o Fastlane ou outras pipelines de "
"compilação, você pode querer definir isso como [code]true[/code]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "Interpolation method used to resize application icon."
msgstr "Método de interpolação usado para redimensionar o ícone do aplicativo."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum version of iOS required for this application to run in the "
"[code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/code] format, can only "
"contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and periods ([code].[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Versão mínima do iOS necessária para este aplicativo ser executado no "
"formato [code]major.minor.patch[/code] ou [code]major.minor[/code], podendo "
"conter apenas caracteres numéricos ([code]0-9[/code]) e pontos ([code].[/"
"code])."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"Name of the provisioning profile. Sets Xcode PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER "
"for debug. [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/build-"
"settings-reference#Provisioning-Profile]Used for manual provisioning[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROFILE_SPECIFIER_DEBUG[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"Name of the provisioning profile. Sets Xcode PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER "
"for release. [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/build-"
"settings-reference#Provisioning-Profile]Used for manual provisioning[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROFILE_SPECIFIER_RELEASE[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"UUID of the provisioning profile. If left empty, Xcode will download or "
"create a provisioning profile automatically. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-download-or-delete-"
"profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID_DEBUG[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"UUID of the provisioning profile. If left empty, Xcode will download or "
"create a provisioning profile automatically. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-download-or-delete-"
"profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID_RELEASE[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Application version visible to the user. Can only contain numeric characters "
"([code]0-9[/code]) and periods ([code].[/code]). Falls back to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] if left empty.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is used for the [i]Identity > Version[/i] value in "
"the generated Xcode project."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid "A four-character creator code that is specific to the bundle. Optional."
msgstr ""
"Um código de criador de quatro caracteres que é específico para o pacote. "
"Opcional."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid "Supported device family."
msgstr "Família de dispositivos suportada."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Machine-readable application version in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] "
"format. Can only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and periods "
"([code].[/code]). This must be incremented with every new release pushed to "
"the App Store. Falls back to [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"version] if left empty.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is used for the [i]Identity > Build[/i] value in the "
"generated Xcode project."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], networking features related to Wi-Fi access are "
"enabled. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/support/required-device-"
"capabilities/]Required Device Capabilities[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os recursos de rede relacionados ao acesso Wi-Fi são "
"ativados. Consulte [url=https://developer.apple.com/support/required-device-"
"capabilities/]Required Device Capabilities[/url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Additional data added to the [code]UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities[/code] array "
"of the [code]Info.plist[/code] file."
msgstr ""
"Dados adicionais adicionados ao array [code]UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities[/"
"code] do arquivo [code]Info.plist[/code]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"Requires the graphics performance and features of the A12 Bionic and later "
"chips (devices supporting all Vulkan renderer features).\n"
"Enabling this option limits supported devices to: iPhone XS, iPhone XR, iPad "
"Mini (5th gen.), iPad Air (3rd gen.), iPad (8th gen), and newer."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Requires the graphics performance and features of the A17 Pro and later "
"chips.\n"
"Enabling this option limits supported devices to: iPhone 15 Pro and newer."
msgstr ""

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
