"A message displayed when requesting access to the device's microphone "
"(localized)."
msgstr ""
"Uma mensagem exibida ao solicitar acesso ao microfone do dispositivo "
"(localizada)."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's photo library (in "
"English)."
msgstr ""
"Uma mensagem exibida ao solicitar acesso à biblioteca de fotos do usuário "
"(em inglês)."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"A message displayed when requesting access to the user's photo library "
"(localized)."
msgstr ""
"Uma mensagem exibida ao solicitar acesso à biblioteca de fotos do usuário "
"(localizada)."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"The reasons your app use system boot time / absolute time API. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"privacy_manifest_files/describing_use_of_required_reason_api]Describing use "
"of required reason API[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Os motivos pelos quais seu aplicativo usa a API de tempo de inicialização do "
"sistema / tempo absoluto. Consulte [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_use_of_required_reason_api]Descrevendo o uso da API de razão "
"necessária[/url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"The list of internet domains your app connects to that engage in tracking. "
"See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"privacy_manifest_files]Privacy manifest files[/url]."
msgstr ""
"A lista de domínios de internet aos quais seu aplicativo se conecta e que "
"realizam rastreamento. Consulte [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files]Privacy manifest files[/"
"url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Indicates whether your app uses data for tracking. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"privacy_manifest_files]Privacy manifest files[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Indica se o seu aplicativo usa dados para rastreamento. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"privacy_manifest_files]Privacy manifest files[/url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"The reasons your app use user defaults API. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/privacy_manifest_files/"
"describing_use_of_required_reason_api]Describing use of required reason API[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Os motivos pelos quais seu aplicativo usa a API de padrões do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"privacy_manifest_files/describing_use_of_required_reason_api]Describing use "
"of required reason API[/url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid "A custom background color of the storyboard launch screen."
msgstr "Uma cor de fundo personalizada da tela de inicialização do storyboard."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"Application launch screen image file (2x DPI). If left empty, it will "
"fallback to [member ProjectSettings.application/boot_splash/image]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de imagem da tela de carregamento do aplicativo (2x DPI). Se deixado "
"vazio, recorrerá a [member ProjectSettings.application/boot_splash/image]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"Application launch screen image file (3x DPI). If left empty, it will "
"fallback to [member ProjectSettings.application/boot_splash/image]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de imagem da tela de carregamento do aplicativo (3x DPI). Se deixado "
"vazio, recorrerá a [member ProjectSettings.application/boot_splash/image]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid "Launch screen image scaling mode."
msgstr "Modo de dimensionamento de imagem da tela de carregamento."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member storyboard/custom_bg_color] is used as a "
"launch screen background color, otherwise [code]application/boot_splash/"
"bg_color[/code] project setting is used."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], [member storyboard/custom_bg_color] é usado como a cor "
"de fundo da tela de carregamento; caso contrário, a configuração de projeto "
"[code]application/boot_splash/bg_color[/code] é usada."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the app \"Documents\" folder can be accessed via "
"\"Files\" app. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/information_property_list/"
"lssupportsopeningdocumentsinplace]LSSupportsOpeningDocumentsInPlace[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a pasta \"Documents\" do aplicativo pode ser acessada "
"via aplicativo \"Files\". Consulte [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/information_property_list/"
"lssupportsopeningdocumentsinplace]LSSupportsOpeningDocumentsInPlace[/url]."

#: platform/ios/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformIOS.xml
#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the app \"Documents\" folder can be accessed via "
"iTunes file sharing. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/information_property_list/"
"uifilesharingenabled]UIFileSharingEnabled[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a pasta \"Documents\" do aplicativo pode ser acessada "
"via compartilhamento de arquivos do iTunes. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/information_property_list/"
"uifilesharingenabled]UIFileSharingEnabled[/url]."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
msgid "Exporter for Linux/BSD."
msgstr "Exportador para Linux/BSD."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformPC.xml
msgid "Exporting for Linux"
msgstr "Exportando para Linux"

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
msgid ""
"Application executable architecture.\n"
"Supported architectures: [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], "
"[code]arm64[/code], [code]arm32[/code], [code]rv64[/code], [code]ppc64[/"
"code], and [code]loongarch64[/code].\n"
"Official export templates include [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], "
"[code]arm32[/code], and [code]arm64[/code] binaries only."
msgstr ""

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project resources are embedded into the executable."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os recursos do projeto são embutidos no executável."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a console wrapper is exported alongside the main "
"executable, which allows running the project with enabled console output."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], um wrapper de console é exportado junto com o "
"executável principal, o que permite executar o projeto com a saída de "
"console ativada."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Script code to execute on the remote host when app is finished.\n"
"The following variables can be used in the script:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - Path of temporary folder on the remote, used to "
"upload app and scripts to.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - Name of the ZIP containing uploaded "
"application.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - Name of application executable.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - Array of the command line argument for the "
"application."
msgstr ""

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "Enables remote deploy using SSH/SCP."
msgstr "Ativa implantação remota usando SSH/SCP."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the SCP."
msgstr ""
"Matriz dos argumentos de linha de comando adicionais passados para o SCP."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the SSH."
msgstr ""
"Matriz dos argumentos de linha de comando adicionais passados para o SSH."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Remote host SSH user name and address, in [code]user@address[/code] format."
msgstr ""
"Nome de usuário e endereço SSH do host remoto, no formato "
"[code]user@address[/code]."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "Remote host SSH port number."
msgstr "Número da porta SSH do host remoto."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Script code to execute on the remote host when running the app.\n"
"The following variables can be used in the script:\n"
"- [code]{temp_dir}[/code] - Path of temporary folder on the remote, used to "
"upload app and scripts to.\n"
"- [code]{archive_name}[/code] - Name of the ZIP containing uploaded "
"application.\n"
"- [code]{exe_name}[/code] - Name of application executable.\n"
"- [code]{cmd_args}[/code] - Array of the command line argument for the "
"application."
msgstr ""

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project textures are exported in the ETC2/ASTC format."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as texturas do projeto são exportadas no formato ETC2/"
"ASTC."

#: platform/linuxbsd/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformLinuxBSD.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], project textures are exported in the S3TC/BPTC format."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as texturas do projeto são exportadas no formato S3TC/"
"BPTC."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Exporter for macOS."
msgstr "Exportador para macOS."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Exporting for macOS"
msgstr "Exportando para macOS"

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Running Godot apps on macOS"
msgstr "Executando aplicativos Godot no macOS"

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Application category for the App Store."
msgstr "Categoria de aplicativo para a App Store."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user (in English)."
msgstr ""
"Aviso de direitos autorais do pacote visível para o usuário (em inglês)."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user (localized)."
msgstr ""
"Aviso de direitos autorais do pacote visível para o usuário (localizado)."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]1[/code], ANGLE libraries are exported with the exported "
"application. If set to [code]0[/code], ANGLE libraries are exported only if "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/gl_compatibility/driver] is set to [code]"
"\"opengl3_angle\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]1[/code], as bibliotecas ANGLE são exportadas com o "
"aplicativo exportado. Se definido como [code]0[/code], as bibliotecas ANGLE "
"são exportadas apenas se [member ProjectSettings.rendering/gl_compatibility/"
"driver] estiver definido como [code]\"opengl3_angle\"[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Application icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/macos_native_icon], and then to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de ícone do aplicativo. Se deixado vazio, ele usará como padrão "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/config/macos_native_icon] e, em seguida, "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"macOS 26 Liquid Glass icon source file. Use [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"icon-composer/]Icon Composer[/url] to create Liquid Glass icons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Supported when exporting from macOS only, Xcode 26+ required.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Liquid Glass icons are supported on macOS 26 only, use [member "
"application/icon] to set the icon for older macOS versions."
msgstr ""

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum version of macOS required for this application to run on Apple "
"Silicon Macs, in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/"
"code] format, can only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and "
"periods ([code].[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Versão mínima do macOS necessária para este aplicativo ser executado em Macs "
"Apple Silicon, no formato [code]major.minor.patch[/code] ou "
"[code]major.minor[/code], podendo conter apenas caracteres numéricos "
"([code]0-9[/code]) e pontos ([code].[/code])."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum version of macOS required for this application to run on Intel Macs, "
"in the [code]major.minor.patch[/code] or [code]major.minor[/code] format, "
"can only contain numeric characters ([code]0-9[/code]) and periods ([code].[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"Versão mínima do macOS necessária para este aplicativo ser executado em Macs "
"Intel, no formato [code]major.minor.patch[/code] ou [code]major.minor[/"
"code], podendo conter apenas caracteres numéricos ([code]0-9[/code]) e "
"pontos ([code].[/code])."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Application executable architecture.\n"
"Supported architectures: [code]x86_64[/code], [code]arm64[/code], and "
"[code]universal[/code] ([code]x86_64 + arm64[/code]).\n"
"Official export templates include [code]universal[/code] binaries only."
msgstr ""

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"PKCS #12 certificate file used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_FILE[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Password for the certificate file used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle.\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Tool to use for code signing."
msgstr "Ferramenta a ser usada para assinatura de código."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the code signing "
"tool."
msgstr ""
"Array de argumentos de linha de comando adicionais passados para a "
"ferramenta de assinatura de código."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow access to contacts in the user's address book, if it's "
"enabled you should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"address_book_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_addressbook]com.apple.security.personal-information.addressbook[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir o acesso aos contatos no catálogo de endereços do "
"usuário; se ativado, você também deve fornecer uma mensagem de uso na opção "
"[member privacy/address_book_usage_description]. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_addressbook]com.apple.security.personal-information.addressbook[/"
"url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows app to use dynamic linker environment variables to inject code. If "
"you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable "
"them according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_allow-dyld-environment-"
"variables]com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que o aplicativo use variáveis de ambiente do vinculador dinâmico "
"para injetar código. Se você estiver usando suplementos com código nativo "
"dinâmico ou auto-modificável, ative-os de acordo com a documentação do "
"suplemento. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-dyld-environment-"
"variables]com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory for JIT code. If you are "
"using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them "
"according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-"
"jit]com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite criar memória gravável e executável para código JIT. Se você estiver "
"usando add-ons com código nativo dinâmico ou auto-modificável, ative-os de "
"acordo com a documentação do add-on. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_allow-"
"jit]com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows creating writable and executable memory without JIT restrictions. If "
"you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable "
"them according to the add-on documentation. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_allow-unsigned-executable-"
"memory]com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite criar memória gravável e executável sem restrições de JIT. Se você "
"estiver usando suplementos com código nativo dinâmico ou auto-modificável, "
"ative-os de acordo com a documentação do suplemento. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_cs_allow-unsigned-executable-"
"memory]com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to interact with Bluetooth devices. This entitlement is "
"required to use wireless controllers. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_bluetooth]com.apple.security.device.bluetooth[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir que o aplicativo interaja com dispositivos Bluetooth. "
"Esse direito é necessário para usar controles sem fio. Veja [url=https://"
"apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_bluetooth]com.apple.security.device.bluetooth[/"
"url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to interact with USB devices. This entitlement is "
"required to use wired controllers. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_usb]com.apple.security.device.usb[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir que o aplicativo interaja com dispositivos USB. Esta "
"permissão é necessária para usar controles com fio. Consulte [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_usb]com.apple.security.device.usb[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enables App Sandbox. The App Sandbox restricts access to user data, "
"networking, and devices. Sandboxed apps can't access most of the file "
"system, can't use custom file dialogs and execute binaries outside the .app "
"bundle. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/"
"app_sandbox]App Sandbox[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To distribute an app through the App Store, you must enable the "
"App Sandbox."
msgstr ""

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Downloads\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_files_downloads_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.downloads.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso de leitura ou gravação à pasta \"Downloads\" do usuário. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/com_apple_security_files_downloads_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.downloads.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Movies\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_movies_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.movies.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso de leitura ou gravação à pasta \"Movies\" do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_movies_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.movies.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Music\" folder. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_music_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.music.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso de leitura ou gravação à pasta \"Música\" do usuário. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_music_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.music.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the user's \"Pictures\" folder. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_assets_pictures_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.pictures.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso de leitura ou gravação à pasta \"Pictures\" do usuário. "
"Consulte [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/com_apple_security_assets_pictures_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.pictures.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows read or write access to the locations the user has selected using a "
"native file dialog. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_files_user-selected_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-write[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite acesso de leitura ou gravação aos locais que o usuário selecionou "
"usando uma caixa de diálogo de arquivo nativa. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_files_user-selected_read-"
"write]com.apple.security.files.user-selected.read-write[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"List of helper executables to embedded to the app bundle. Sandboxed app are "
"limited to execute only these executable. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-"
"sandboxed-app]Embedding a command-line tool in a sandboxed app[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Lista de executáveis auxiliares para incorporar ao pacote do aplicativo. "
"Aplicativos em sandbox são limitados a executar apenas esses executáveis. "
"Veja [url=https://apple.com/documentation/xcode/embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-"
"sandboxed-app]Embedding a command-line tool in a sandboxed app[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to establish outgoing network connections. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_client]com.apple.security.network.client[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir que o aplicativo estabeleça conexões de rede de saída. "
"Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_client]com.apple.security.network.client[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to listen for incoming network connections. See "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_server]com.apple.security.network.server[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir que o aplicativo ouça conexões de rede de entrada. Veja "
"[url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_network_server]com.apple.security.network.server[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow app to send Apple events to other apps. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_automation_apple-"
"events]com.apple.security.automation.apple-events[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir que o aplicativo envie eventos da Apple para outros "
"aplicativos. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_automation_apple-"
"events]com.apple.security.automation.apple-events[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use the microphone or other audio input sources, if "
"it's enabled you should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"microphone_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_device_audio-"
"input]com.apple.security.device.audio-input[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative se precisar usar o microfone ou outras fontes de entrada de áudio; se "
"ativado, você também deve fornecer uma mensagem de uso na opção [member "
"privacy/microphone_usage_description]. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_device_audio-"
"input]com.apple.security.device.audio-input[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow access to the user's calendar, if it's enabled you should "
"also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"calendar_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_calendars]com.apple.security.personal-information.calendars[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir o acesso ao calendário do usuário; se ativado, você "
"também deve fornecer uma mensagem de uso na opção [member privacy/"
"calendar_usage_description]. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_calendars]com.apple.security.personal-information.calendars[/"
"url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use the camera, if it's enabled you should also "
"provide usage message in the [member privacy/camera_usage_description] "
"option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_camera]com.apple.security.device.camera[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative se precisar usar a câmera; se estiver ativada, você também deve "
"fornecer uma mensagem de uso na opção [member privacy/"
"camera_usage_description]. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_device_camera]com.apple.security.device.camera[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Custom entitlements [code].plist[/code] file, if specified the rest of "
"entitlements in the export config are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo [code].plist[/code] de privilégios personalizados; se especificado, "
"o restante dos privilégios na configuração de exportação é ignorado."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"You can temporarily enable this entitlement to use native debugger (GDB, "
"LLDB) with the exported app. This entitlement should be disabled for "
"production export. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/"
"embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-sandboxed-app]Embedding a command-line tool in "
"a sandboxed app[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Você pode habilitar temporariamente este direito (entitlement) para usar o "
"depurador nativo (GDB, LLDB) com o aplicativo exportado. Este direito deve "
"ser desabilitado para a exportação de produção. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/embedding-a-helper-tool-in-a-"
"sandboxed-app]Integrando uma ferramenta de linha de comando em um aplicativo "
"em sandbox[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Allows app to load arbitrary libraries and frameworks (not signed with the "
"same Team ID as the main executable or by Apple). Enable it if you are using "
"GDExtension add-ons or ad-hoc signing, or want to support user-provided "
"external add-ons. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/"
"bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_disable-library-"
"validation]com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que o aplicativo carregue bibliotecas e frameworks arbitrários (não "
"assinados com o mesmo ID de equipe do executável principal ou pela Apple). "
"Ative-o se você estiver usando complementos do GDExtension ou assinatura ad-"
"hoc, ou se quiser dar suporte a complementos externos fornecidos pelo "
"usuário. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/"
"entitlements/com_apple_security_cs_disable-library-"
"validation]com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable if you need to use location information from Location Services, if "
"it's enabled you should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"location_usage_description] option. See [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_location]com.apple.security.personal-information.location[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative se precisar usar informações de localização dos Serviços de "
"Localização; se ativado, você também deve fornecer uma mensagem de uso na "
"opção [member privacy/location_usage_description]. Veja [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_personal-information_location]com.apple.security.personal-"
"information.location[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Enable to allow access to the user's Photos library, if it's enabled you "
"should also provide usage message in the [member privacy/"
"photos_library_usage_description] option. See [url=https://"
"developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/"
"com_apple_security_personal-information_photos-"
"library]com.apple.security.personal-information.photos-library[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Ative para permitir o acesso à biblioteca de Fotos do usuário; se ativado, "
"você também deve fornecer uma mensagem de uso na opção [member privacy/"
"photos_library_usage_description]. Veja [url=https://developer.apple.com/"
"documentation/bundleresources/entitlements/com_apple_security_personal-"
"information_photos-library]com.apple.security.personal-information.photos-"
"library[/url]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\" or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used to sign [code].app[/code] bundle."
msgstr ""
"O \"Nome Completo\", \"Nome Comum\" ou hash SHA-1 da identidade de "
"assinatura usada para assinar o pacote [code].app[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\" or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used to sign [code].pkg[/code] installer package for App Store distribution, "
"use [code]3rd Party Mac Developer Installer: Name.[/code] identity."
msgstr ""
"O \"Nome Completo\", \"Nome Comum\" ou hash SHA-1 da identidade de "
"assinatura usada para assinar o pacote instalador [code].pkg[/code] para "
"distribuição na App Store, use a identidade [code]3rd Party Mac Developer "
"Installer: Name.[/code]."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"Provisioning profile file downloaded from Apple developer account dashboard. "
"See [url=https://developer.apple.com/help/account/manage-profiles/edit-"
"download-or-delete-profiles]Edit, download, or delete provisioning profiles[/"
"url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_MACOS_CODESIGN_PROVISIONING_PROFILE[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, a wrapper that can be used to run the application with console "
"output is created alongside the exported application."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, um wrapper que pode ser usado para executar o aplicativo com "
"saída de console é criado junto com o aplicativo exportado."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application is rendered at native display "
"resolution, otherwise it is always rendered at loDPI resolution and upscaled "
"by OS when required."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o aplicativo é renderizado na resolução de exibição "
"nativa; caso contrário, é sempre renderizado na resolução loDPI e ampliado "
"pelo SO quando necessário."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid "Application distribution target."
msgstr "Alvo de distribuição de aplicativo."

#: platform/macos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformMacOS.xml
msgid ""
