#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformPC.xml
msgid "Base class for the desktop platform exporter (Windows and Linux/BSD)."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para o exportador da plataforma de desktop (Windows e Linux/BSD)."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformPC.xml
msgid ""
"The base class for the desktop platform exporters. These include Windows and "
"Linux/BSD, but not macOS. See the classes inheriting from this one for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"A classe base para os exportadores da plataforma de desktop. Isso inclui "
"Windows e Linux/BSD, mas não o macOS. Veja as classes que herdam desta para "
"mais detalhes."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlatformPC.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "Exporting for Windows"
msgstr "Exportando para o Windows"

#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid "Exporter for visionOS."
msgstr "Exportador para visionOS."

#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\" or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used for debug export."
msgstr ""
"O \"Nome Completo\", \"Nome Comum\" ou hash SHA-1 da identidade de "
"assinatura usada para exportação de depuração."

#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"The \"Full Name\", \"Common Name\" or SHA-1 hash of the signing identity "
"used for release export."
msgstr ""
"O \"Nome Completo\", \"Nome Comum\" ou hash SHA-1 da identidade de "
"assinatura usada para exportação de lançamento."

#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Name of the provisioning profile. Sets XCode PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER "
"for debug. [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/build-"
"settings-reference#Provisioning-Profile]Used for manual provisioning[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROFILE_SPECIFIER_DEBUG[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Name of the provisioning profile. Sets XCode PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER "
"for release. [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/build-"
"settings-reference#Provisioning-Profile]Used for manual provisioning[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_APPLE_PLATFORM_PROFILE_SPECIFIER_RELEASE[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
msgid ""
"Requires the graphics performance and features of the A12 Bionic and later "
"chips (devices supporting all Vulkan renderer features).\n"
"Enabling this option limits supported devices to: iPhone XS, iPhone XR, iPad "
"Mini (5th gen.), iPad Air (3rd gen.), iPad (8th gen) and newer."
msgstr ""

#: platform/visionos/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformVisionOS.xml
#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shaders will be compiled and embedded in the "
"application. This option is only supported when using the Forward+ and "
"Mobile renderers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting as a dedicated server, the shader baker is "
"always disabled since no rendering is performed."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os shaders serão compilados e incorporados ao "
"aplicativo. Esta opção é suportada apenas ao usar os renderizadores Forward+ "
"e Mobile.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao exportar como um servidor dedicado, o compilador de shaders "
"é sempre desabilitado, pois nenhuma renderização é realizada."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid "Exporter for the Web."
msgstr "Exportador para a Web."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"The Web exporter customizes how a web build is handled. In the editor's "
"\"Export\" window, it is created when adding a new \"Web\" preset.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot on Web is rendered inside a [code]<canvas>[/code] tag. "
"Normally, the canvas cannot be positioned or resized manually, but otherwise "
"acts as the main [Window] of the application."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid "Exporting for the Web"
msgstr "Exportando para a Web"

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid "Web documentation index"
msgstr "Índice da documentação da web"

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"File path to the custom export template used for debug builds. If left "
"empty, the default template is used."
msgstr ""
"Caminho de arquivo para o modelo de exportação personalizado usado para "
"builds de depuração. Se deixado vazio, o modelo padrão é usado."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"File path to the custom export template used for release builds. If left "
"empty, the default template is used."
msgstr ""
"Caminho de arquivo para o modelo de exportação personalizado usado para "
"builds de lançamento. Se deixado vazio, o modelo padrão é usado."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"Determines how the canvas should be resized by Godot.\n"
"- [b]None:[/b] The canvas is not automatically resized.\n"
"- [b]Project:[/b] The size of the canvas is dependent on the "
"[ProjectSettings].\n"
"- [b]Adaptive:[/b] The canvas is automatically resized to fit as much of the "
"web page as possible."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"The custom HTML page that wraps the exported web build. If left empty, the "
"default HTML shell is used.\n"
"For more information, see the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/platform/web/"
"customizing_html5_shell.html]Customizing HTML5 Shell[/url] tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], embeds support for a virtual keyboard into the web "
"page, which is shown when necessary on touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], incorpora suporte a um teclado virtual na página web, "
"que é exibido quando necessário em dispositivos com tela sensível ao toque."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the project icon will be used as the favicon for this "
"application's web page."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o ícone do projeto será usado como o favicon para a "
"página web deste aplicativo."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the canvas will be focused as soon as the application "
"is loaded, if the browser window is already in focus."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o canvas receberá foco assim que o aplicativo for "
"carregado, se a janela do navegador já estiver em foco."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"Additional HTML tags to include inside the [code]<head>[/code], such as "
"[code]<meta>[/code] tags.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You do not need to add a [code]<title>[/code] tag, as it is "
"automatically included based on the project's name."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid "The background color used behind the web application."
msgstr "A cor de fundo usada atrás da aplicação web."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"The [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Manifest/"
"display/]display mode[/url] to use for this progressive web application. "
"Different browsers and platforms may not behave the same.\n"
"- [b]Fullscreen:[/b] Displays the app in fullscreen and hides all of the "
"browser's UI elements.\n"
"- [b]Standalone:[/b] Displays the app in a separate window and hides all of "
"the browser's UI elements.\n"
"- [b]Minimal UI:[/b] Displays the app in a separate window and only shows "
"the browser's UI elements for navigation.\n"
"- [b]Browser:[/b] Displays the app as a normal web page."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], turns this web build into a [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progressive_web_app]progressive web application[/url] "
"(PWA)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], transforma esta compilação web em um [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Progressive_web_app]aplicativo web progressivo[/url] "
"(PWA)."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"When enabled, the progressive web app will make sure that each request has "
"cross-origin isolation headers (COEP/COOP).\n"
"This can simplify the setup to serve the exported game."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"File path to the smallest icon for this web application. If not defined, "
"defaults to the project icon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the icon is not 144×144, it will be automatically resized "
"for the final build."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"File path to the small icon for this web application. If not defined, "
"defaults to the project icon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the icon is not 180×180, it will be automatically resized "
"for the final build."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"File path to the largest icon for this web application. If not defined, "
"defaults to the project icon.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the icon is not 512×512, it will be automatically resized "
"for the final build."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"The page to display, should the server hosting the page not be available. "
"This page is saved in the client's machine."
msgstr ""
"A página a ser exibida caso o servidor que hospeda a página não esteja "
"disponível. Esta página é salva na máquina do cliente."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"The orientation to use when the web application is run through a mobile "
"device.\n"
"- [b]Any:[/b] No orientation is forced.\n"
"- [b]Landscape:[/b] Forces a horizontal layout (wider than it is taller).\n"
"- [b]Portrait:[/b] Forces a vertical layout (taller than it is wider)."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"The number of threads that emscripten will allocate at startup. A smaller "
"value will allocate fewer threads and consume fewer system resources, but "
"you may run the risk of running out of threads in the pool and needing to "
"allocate more threads at run time which may cause a deadlock.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some browsers have a hard cap on the number of threads that can "
"be allocated, so it is best to be cautious and keep this number low."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"Override for the default size of the [WorkerThreadPool]. This setting is "
"used when [member ProjectSettings.threading/worker_pool/max_threads] size is "
"set to [code]-1[/code] (which it is by default). This size must be smaller "
"than [member threads/emscripten_pool_size] otherwise deadlocks may occur.\n"
"When using threads, this size needs to be large enough to accommodate "
"features that rely on having a dedicated thread like [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/run_on_separate_thread] or [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/driver/threads/thread_model]. In general, it is "
"best to ensure that this is at least [code]4[/code] and is at least [code]2[/"
"code] or [code]3[/code] less than [member threads/emscripten_pool_size]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code] enables [GDExtension] support for this web build."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa o suporte ao [GDExtension] para esta compilação "
"web."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the exported game will support threads. It requires "
"[url=https://web.dev/articles/coop-coep]a \"cross-origin isolated\" website[/"
"url], which may be difficult to set up and is limited for security reasons "
"(such as not being able to communicate with third-party websites).\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the exported game will not support threads. As a "
"result, it is more prone to performance and audio issues, but will only "
"require to be run on an HTTPS website."
msgstr ""

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows textures to be optimized for desktop through "
"the S3TC/BPTC algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite que as texturas sejam otimizadas para desktop "
"através do algoritmo S3TC/BPTC."

#: platform/web/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWeb.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] allows textures to be optimized for mobile through the "
"ETC2/ASTC algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite que as texturas sejam otimizadas para "
"dispositivos móveis através do algoritmo ETC2/ASTC."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "Exporter for Windows."
msgstr "Exportador para o Windows."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"The Windows exporter customizes how a Windows build is handled. In the "
"editor's \"Export\" window, it is created when adding a new \"Windows\" "
"preset."
msgstr ""
"O exportador do Windows personaliza como uma compilação do Windows é "
"tratada. Na janela \"Export\" do editor, ele é criado ao adicionar um novo "
"\"Windows\" predefinido."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Company that produced the application. Required. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Empresa que produziu o aplicativo. Obrigatório. Consulte [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Console wrapper icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"application/icon], then to [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"windows_native_icon], and lastly, [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"icon]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de ícone do wrapper de console. Se deixado vazio, ele usará como "
"fallback [member application/icon], depois [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/windows_native_icon] e, por fim, [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Copyright notice for the bundle visible to the user. Optional. See "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Aviso de direitos autorais para o pacote visível ao usuário. Opcional. Veja "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and [member application/export_d3d12] is set, the "
"Agility SDK DLLs will be stored in arch-specific subdirectories."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code] e [member application/export_d3d12] estiver definido, "
"as DLLs do Agility SDK serão armazenadas em subdiretórios específicos de "
"arquitetura."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]1[/code], the Direct3D 12 runtime libraries (Agility SDK, "
"PIX) are exported with the exported application. If set to [code]0[/code], "
"Direct3D 12 libraries are exported only if [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"rendering_device/driver] is set to [code]\"d3d12\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]1[/code], as bibliotecas de tempo de execução do "
"Direct3D 12 (Agility SDK, PIX) são exportadas com o aplicativo exportado. Se "
"definido como [code]0[/code], as bibliotecas do Direct3D 12 são exportadas "
"apenas se [member ProjectSettings.rendering/rendering_device/driver] estiver "
"definido como [code]\"d3d12\"[/code]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"File description to be presented to users. Required. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Descrição do arquivo a ser apresentada aos usuários. Obrigatório. Veja "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Version number of the file. Falls back to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] if left empty. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Número de versão do arquivo. Retorna para [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] se deixado vazio. Veja "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Application icon file. If left empty, it will fallback to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/windows_native_icon], and then to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de ícone do aplicativo. Se deixado vazio, ele usará como padrão "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/config/windows_native_icon] e, em "
"seguida, [member ProjectSettings.application/config/icon]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, icon and metadata of the exported executable is set according to "
"the other [code]application/*[/code] values."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, o ícone e os metadados do executável exportado são definidos de "
"acordo com os outros valores de [code]application/*[/code]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Name of the application. Required. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Nome do aplicativo. Obrigatório. Consulte [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/"
"en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Application version visible to the user. Falls back to [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] if left empty. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Versão do aplicativo visível para o usuário. Retorna para [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] se deixado vazio. Veja "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Trademarks and registered trademarks that apply to the file. Optional. See "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/stringfileinfo-"
"block]StringFileInfo[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Marcas comerciais e marcas registradas que se aplicam ao arquivo. Opcional. "
"Veja [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/menurc/"
"stringfileinfo-block]StringFileInfo[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Application executable architecture.\n"
"Supported architectures: [code]x86_32[/code], [code]x86_64[/code], and "
"[code]arm64[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Array of the additional command line arguments passed to the code signing "
"tool. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/"
"signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Array de argumentos de linha de comando adicionais passados para a "
"ferramenta de assinatura de código. Veja [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Description of the signed content. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Descrição do conteúdo assinado. Veja [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Digest algorithm to use for creating signature. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Algoritmo de resumo a ser usado para criar a assinatura. Consulte "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], executable signing is enabled."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], a assinatura de executáveis está ativada."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"PKCS #12 certificate file used to sign executable or certificate SHA-1 hash "
"(if [member codesign/identity_type] is set to \"Use certificate store\"). "
"See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_IDENTITY[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Type of identity to use. See [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/"
"framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_IDENTITY_TYPE[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"Password for the certificate file used to sign executable. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/"
"url].\n"
"Can be overridden with the environment variable "
"[code]GODOT_WINDOWS_CODESIGN_PASSWORD[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], time-stamp is added to the signature. See [url=https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/"
"url]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], um carimbo de data/hora é adicionado à assinatura. "
"Consulte [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/"
"signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"URL of the time stamp server. If left empty, the default server is used. See "
"[url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/signtool-"
"exe]Sign Tool[/url]."
msgstr ""
"URL do servidor de carimbo de data/hora. Se deixado vazio, o servidor padrão "
"é usado. Veja [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/tools/"
"signtool-exe]Sign Tool[/url]."

#: platform/windows/doc_classes/EditorExportPlatformWindows.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a console wrapper executable is exported alongside the "
"main executable, which allows running the project with enabled console "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], um executável de wrapper de console é exportado junto "
"com o executável principal, o que permite executar o projeto com a saída do "
"console ativada."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "A script that is executed when exporting the project."
msgstr "Um script que é executado ao exportar o projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorExportPlugin]s are automatically invoked whenever the user exports "
"the project. They can be used to modify scenes and resources during project "
"export based on what [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/"
"feature_tags.html]Feature Tags[/url] are set. For each plugin, [method "
"_export_begin] is called at the beginning of the export process and then "
"[method _export_file] is called for each exported file.\n"
"Register a [EditorExportPlugin] by creating a new [EditorPlugin] and calling "
"its [method EditorPlugin.add_export_plugin] method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Export Android plugins"
msgstr "Exportar plugins do Android"

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if this plugin will customize resources based on "
"the platform and features used.\n"
"When enabled, [method _get_customization_configuration_hash] and [method "
"_customize_resource] will be called and must be implemented."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if this plugin will customize scenes based on the "
"platform and features used.\n"
"When enabled, [method _get_customization_configuration_hash] and [method "
"_customize_scene] will be called and must be implemented.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _customize_scene] will only be called for scenes that "
"have been modified since the last export."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Customize a resource. If changes are made to it, return the same or a new "
"resource. Otherwise, return [code]null[/code]. When a new resource is "
"returned, [param resource] will be replaced by a copy of the new resource.\n"
"The [param path] argument is only used when customizing an actual file, "
"otherwise this means that this resource is part of another one and it will "
"be empty.\n"
"Implementing this method is required if [method _begin_customize_resources] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When customizing any of the following types and returning "
"another resource, the other resource should not be skipped using [method "
"skip] in [method _export_file]:\n"
"- [AtlasTexture]\n"
"- [CompressedCubemap]\n"
"- [CompressedCubemapArray]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture2D]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture2DArray]\n"
"- [CompressedTexture3D]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Customize a scene. If changes are made to it, return the same or a new "
"scene. Otherwise, return [code]null[/code]. If a new scene is returned, it "
"is up to you to dispose of the old one.\n"
"Implementing this method is required if [method _begin_customize_scenes] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To change a variable in your scene, use the [code]@export[/"
"code] annotation when declaring it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "This is called when the customization process for resources ends."
msgstr ""
"Isto é chamado quando o processo de personalização de recursos termina."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "This is called when the customization process for scenes ends."
msgstr "Isto é chamado quando o processo de personalização de cenas termina."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This is called after Xcode project generation, but before it is built.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on iOS and visionOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. It is called when the export "
"starts and provides all information about the export. [param features] is "
"the list of features for the export, [param is_debug] is [code]true[/code] "
"for debug builds, [param path] is the target path for the exported project. "
"[param flags] is only used when running a runnable profile, e.g. when using "
"native run on Android."
msgstr ""
"Método virtual a ser substituído pelo usuário. Ele é chamado quando a "
"exportação começa e fornece todas as informações sobre a exportação. [param "
"features] é a lista de recursos para a exportação, [param is_debug] é "
"[code]true[/code] para compilações de depuração, [param path] é o caminho de "
"destino para o projeto exportado. [param flags] é usado apenas ao executar "
"um perfil executável, por exemplo, ao usar a execução nativa no Android."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. Called when the export is "
"finished."
msgstr ""
"Método virtual a ser substituído pelo usuário. Chamado quando a exportação é "
"concluída."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. Called for each exported file "
"before [method _customize_resource] and [method _customize_scene]. The "
"arguments can be used to identify the file. [param path] is the path of the "
"file, [param type] is the [Resource] represented by the file (e.g. "
"[PackedScene]), and [param features] is the list of features for the "
"export.\n"
"Calling [method skip] inside this callback will make the file not included "
"in the export."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is called to retrieve the "
"set of Android dependencies provided by this plugin. Each returned Android "
"dependency should have the format of an Android remote binary dependency: "
"[code]org.godot.example:my-plugin:0.0.0[/code]\n"
"For more information see [url=https://developer.android.com/build/"
"dependencies?agpversion=4.1#dependency-types]Android documentation on "
"dependencies[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is called to retrieve the "
"URLs of Maven repositories for the set of Android dependencies provided by "
"this plugin.\n"
"For more information see [url=https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/"
"dependency_management.html#sec:maven_repo]Gradle documentation on dependency "
"management[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Google's Maven repo and the Maven Central repo are already "
"included by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is called to retrieve the "
"local paths of the Android libraries archive (AAR) files provided by this "
"plugin.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relative paths [b]must[/b] be relative to Godot's [code]res://"
"addons/[/code] directory. For example, an AAR file located under [code]res://"
"addons/hello_world_plugin/HelloWorld.release.aar[/code] can be returned as "
"an absolute path using [code]res://addons/hello_world_plugin/"
"HelloWorld.release.aar[/code] or a relative path using "
"[code]hello_world_plugin/HelloWorld.release.aar[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is used at export time to "
"update the contents of the [code]activity[/code] element in the generated "
"Android manifest.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is used at export time to "
"update the contents of the [code]application[/code] element in the generated "
"Android manifest.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be overridden by the user. This is used at export time to "
"update the contents of the [code]manifest[/code] element in the generated "
"Android manifest.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported on Android and requires [member "
"EditorExportPlatformAndroid.gradle_build/use_gradle_build] to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return a hash based on the configuration passed (for both scenes and "
"resources). This helps keep separate caches for separate export "
"configurations.\n"
"Implementing this method is required if [method _begin_customize_resources] "
"returns [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _customize_resource] and [method _customize_scene] will "
"not be called when the [EditorExportPlugin] script is modified unless this "
"hash changes too."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return a [PackedStringArray] of additional features this preset, for the "
"given [param platform], should have."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [PackedStringArray] de recursos adicionais que esta predefinição, "
"para a [param platform] fornecida, deve ter."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Validates [param option] and returns the visibility for the specified [param "
"platform]. The default implementation returns [code]true[/code] for all "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Valida [param option] e retorna a visibilidade para a [param platform] "
"especificada. A implementação padrão retorna [code]true[/code] para todas as "
"opções."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Check the requirements for the given [param option] and return a non-empty "
"warning string if they are not met.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use [method get_option] to check the value of the export "
"options."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return a list of export options that can be configured for this export "
"plugin.\n"
"Each element in the return value is a [Dictionary] with the following keys:\n"
"- [code]option[/code]: A dictionary with the structure documented by [method "
"Object.get_property_list], but all keys are optional.\n"
"- [code]default_value[/code]: The default value for this option.\n"
"- [code]update_visibility[/code]: An optional boolean value. If set to "
"[code]true[/code], the preset will emit [signal "
"Object.property_list_changed] when the option is changed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return a [Dictionary] of override values for export options, that will be "
"used instead of user-provided values. Overridden options will be hidden from "
"the user interface.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"class MyExportPlugin extends EditorExportPlugin:\n"
"\tfunc _get_name() -> String:\n"
"\t\treturn \"MyExportPlugin\"\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _supports_platform(platform) -> bool:\n"
"\t\tif platform is EditorExportPlatformPC:\n"
"\t\t\t# Run on all desktop platforms including Windows, MacOS and Linux.\n"
"\t\t\treturn true\n"
"\t\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _get_export_options_overrides(platform) -> Dictionary:\n"
"\t\t# Override \"Embed PCK\" to always be enabled.\n"
"\t\treturn {\n"
"\t\t\t\"binary_format/embed_pck\": true,\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return the name identifier of this plugin (for future identification by the "
"exporter). The plugins are sorted by name before exporting.\n"
"Implementing this method is required."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if the result of [method _get_export_options] has "
"changed and the export options of the preset corresponding to [param "
"platform] should be updated."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o resultado de [method _get_export_options] "
"tiver mudado e as opções de exportação da predefinição correspondente a "
"[param platform] devem ser atualizadas."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if the plugin supports the given [param platform]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o plugin suportar a [param platform] fornecida."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Provide access to the Android prebuilt manifest and allows the plugin to "
"modify it if needed.\n"
"Implementers of this virtual method should take the binary manifest data "
"from [param manifest_data], copy it, modify it, and then return it with the "
"modifications.\n"
"If no modifications are needed, then an empty [PackedByteArray] should be "
"returned."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an Apple embedded platform bundle file from the given [param path] to "
"the exported project."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um arquivo de pacote de plataforma incorporada da Apple do [param "
"path] fornecido ao projeto exportado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds C++ code to the Apple embedded platform export. The final code is "
"created from the code appended by each active export plugin."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona código C++ à exportação da plataforma embutida da Apple. O código "
"final é criado a partir do código anexado por cada plugin de exportação "
"ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to the Linking Phase in the "
"Apple embedded platform's Xcode project and embeds it into the resulting "
"binary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For static libraries (*.a), this works in the same way as "
"[method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should not be used for System libraries as they are "
"already present on the device."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a static library (*.a) or a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to "
"the Linking Phase to the Apple embedded platform's Xcode project."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma biblioteca estática (*.a) ou dinâmica (*.dylib, *.framework) à "
"Fase de Vinculação no projeto do Xcode da plataforma embarcada da Apple."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Adds linker flags for the Apple embedded platform export."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona flags de linker para a exportação de plataforma embarcada da Apple."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds additional fields to the Apple embedded platform's project Info.plist "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona campos adicionais ao arquivo Info.plist do projeto da plataforma "
"embarcada da Apple."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a static library from the given [param path] to the Apple embedded "
"platform project."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma biblioteca estática do [param path] fornecido ao projeto de "
"plataforma embarcada da Apple."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom file to be exported. [param path] is the virtual path that can "
"be used to load the file, [param file] is the binary data of the file.\n"
"When called inside [method _export_file] and [param remap] is [code]true[/"
"code], the current file will not be exported, but instead remapped to this "
"custom file. [param remap] is ignored when called in other places.\n"
"[param file] will not be imported, so consider using [method "
"_customize_resource] to remap imported resources."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_bundle_file] instead."
msgstr "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_bundle_file] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an iOS bundle file from the given [param path] to the exported project."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um arquivo de pacote (bundle) do iOS do [param path] fornecido ao "
"projeto exportado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_cpp_code] instead."
msgstr "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_cpp_code] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds C++ code to the iOS export. The final code is created from the code "
"appended by each active export plugin."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona código C++ à exportação para iOS. O código final é criado a partir "
"do código anexado por cada plugin de exportação ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_embedded_framework] instead."
msgstr ""
"Em vez disso, use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_embedded_framework]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to Linking Phase in iOS's "
"Xcode project and embeds it into resulting binary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For static libraries (*.a), this works the in same way as "
"[method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should not be used for System libraries as they are "
"already present on the device."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework] instead."
msgstr "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_framework] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a static library (*.a) or a dynamic library (*.dylib, *.framework) to "
"the Linking Phase to the iOS Xcode project."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma biblioteca estática (*.a) ou dinâmica (*.dylib, *.framework) à "
"Fase de Vínculo no projeto Xcode do iOS."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_linker_flags] instead."
msgstr "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_linker_flags] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Adds linker flags for the iOS export."
msgstr "Adiciona sinalizadores de vinculador para a exportação do iOS."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_plist_content] instead."
msgstr "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_plist_content] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Adds additional fields to the iOS project Info.plist file."
msgstr "Adiciona campos adicionais ao arquivo Info.plist do projeto iOS."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_project_static_lib] instead."
msgstr ""
"Em vez disso, use [method add_apple_embedded_platform_project_static_lib]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Adds a static library from the given [param path] to the iOS project."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma biblioteca estática do [param path] fornecido ao projeto iOS."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds file or directory matching [param path] to [code]PlugIns[/code] "
"directory of macOS app bundle.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is useful only for macOS exports."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a shared object or a directory containing only shared objects with the "
"given [param tags] and destination [param path].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In case of macOS exports, those shared objects will be added to "
"[code]Frameworks[/code] directory of app bundle.\n"
"In case of a directory code-sign will error if you place non code object in "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Returns currently used export platform."
msgstr "Retorna a plataforma de exportação usada no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid "Returns currently used export preset."
msgstr "Retorna o predefinido de exportação usado no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current value of an export option supplied by [method "
"_get_export_options]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor atual de uma opção de exportação fornecida por [method "
"_get_export_options]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"To be called inside [method _export_file]. Skips the current file, so it's "
"not included in the export."
msgstr ""
"Para ser chamado dentro de [method _export_file]. Pula o arquivo atual para "
"que ele não seja incluído na exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Export preset configuration."
msgstr "Configuração de predefinição de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Represents the configuration of an export preset, as created by the editor's "
"export dialog. An [EditorExportPreset] instance is intended to be used a "
"read-only configuration passed to the [EditorExportPlatform] methods when "
"exporting the project."
msgstr ""
"Representa a configuração de uma predefinição de exportação, conforme criada "
"pela caixa de diálogo de exportação do editor. Uma instância de "
"[EditorExportPreset] destina-se a ser usada como uma configuração somente "
"leitura passada para os métodos de [EditorExportPlatform] ao exportar o "
"projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the \"Advanced\" toggle is enabled in the "
"export dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a opção \"Avançado\" estiver ativada na caixa "
"de diálogo de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a comma-separated list of custom features added to this preset, as a "
"string. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]Feature tags[/"
"url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma lista separada por vírgulas de recursos personalizados "
"adicionados a esta predefinição, como uma string. Consulte [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]Tags de recursos[/url] na documentação "
"para obter mais informações."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary of files selected in the \"Resources\" tab of the "
"export dialog. The dictionary's keys are file paths, and its values are the "
"corresponding export modes: [code]\"strip\"[/code], [code]\"keep\"[/code], "
"or [code]\"remove\"[/code]. See also [method get_file_export_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um dicionário de arquivos selecionados na aba \"Resources\" da caixa "
"de diálogo de exportação. As chaves do dicionário são caminhos de arquivos e "
"seus valores são os modos de exportação correspondentes: [code]\"strip\"[/"
"code], [code]\"keep\"[/code] ou [code]\"remove\"[/code]. Veja também [method "
"get_file_export_mode]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of files selected in the \"Resources\" tab of the export "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de arquivos selecionados na aba \"Recursos\" do diálogo de "
"exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if PCK directory encryption is enabled in the "
"export dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a criptografia de diretório PCK estiver ativada "
"na caixa de diálogo de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if PCK encryption is enabled in the export dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a criptografia PCK estiver habilitada no "
"diálogo de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns file filters to exclude during PCK encryption."
msgstr ""
"Retorna filtros de arquivo a serem excluídos durante a criptografia de PCK."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns file filters to include during PCK encryption."
msgstr ""
"Retorna filtros de arquivo a serem incluídos durante a criptografia de PCK."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns PCK encryption key."
msgstr "Retorna a chave de criptografia PCK."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns file filters to exclude during export."
msgstr "Retorna filtros de arquivo para excluir durante a exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns export file filter mode selected in the \"Resources\" tab of the "
"export dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o modo de filtro de arquivo de exportação selecionado na aba "
"\"Recursos\" do diálogo de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns export target path."
msgstr "Retorna o caminho de destino da exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns file export mode for the specified file."
msgstr "Retorna o modo de exportação de arquivo para o arquivo especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns array of files to export."
msgstr "Retorna um array de arquivos para exportar."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns file filters to include during export."
msgstr "Retorna filtros de arquivo para incluir durante a exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns export option value or value of environment variable if it is set."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor da opção de exportação ou o valor da variável de ambiente se "
"estiver definida."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns the list of packs on which to base a patch export on."
msgstr "Retorna a lista de pacotes nos quais basear a exportação de um patch."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid "Returns this export preset's name."
msgstr "Retorna o nome deste predefinido de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the setting identified by [param name] using export "
"preset feature tag overrides instead of current OS features."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor da configuração identificada por [param name] usando "
"substituições de tag de recurso de predefinição de exportação em vez dos "
"recursos atuais do SO."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the export mode used by GDScript files. [code]0[/code] for \"Text\", "
"[code]1[/code] for \"Binary tokens\", and [code]2[/code] for \"Compressed "
"binary tokens (smaller files)\"."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o modo de exportação usado pelos arquivos GDScript. [code]0[/code] "
"para \"Texto\", [code]1[/code] para \"Tokens binários\" e [code]2[/code] "
"para \"Tokens binários compactados (arquivos menores)\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the preset's version number, or fall back to the [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/version] project setting if set to an "
"empty string.\n"
"If [param windows_version] is [code]true[/code], formats the returned "
"version number to be compatible with Windows executable metadata."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the preset has the property named [param "
"property]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a predefinição possuir a propriedade chamada "
"[param property]."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file at the specified [param path] will be "
"exported."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o arquivo no [param path] especificado for "
"exportado."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the dedicated server export mode is selected in "
"the export dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o modo de exportação de servidor dedicado "
"estiver selecionado na caixa de diálogo de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorExportPreset.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the \"Runnable\" toggle is enabled in the "
"export dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a opção \"Executável\" estiver ativada na caixa "
"de diálogo de exportação."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"An editor feature profile which can be used to disable specific features."
msgstr ""
"Um perfil de recursos do editor que pode ser usado para desativar recursos "
"específicos."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"An editor feature profile can be used to disable specific features of the "
"Godot editor. When disabled, the features won't appear in the editor, which "
"makes the editor less cluttered. This is useful in education settings to "
"reduce confusion or when working in a team. For example, artists and level "
"designers could use a feature profile that disables the script editor to "
"avoid accidentally making changes to files they aren't supposed to edit.\n"
"To manage editor feature profiles visually, use [b]Editor > Manage Feature "
"Profiles...[/b] at the top of the editor window."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid "Returns the specified [param feature]'s human-readable name."
msgstr "Retorna o nome legível do [param feature] especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the class specified by [param class_name] is "
"disabled. When disabled, the class won't appear in the Create New Node "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a classe especificada por [param class_name] "
"estiver desativada. Quando desativada, a classe não aparecerá na caixa de "
"diálogo Criar Novo Nó."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if editing for the class specified by [param "
"class_name] is disabled. When disabled, the class will still appear in the "
"Create New Node dialog but the Inspector will be read-only when selecting a "
"node that extends the class."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a edição para a classe especificada por [param "
"class_name] estiver desativada. Quando desativada, a classe ainda aparecerá "
"na caixa de diálogo Criar Novo Nó, mas o Inspetor será somente leitura ao "
"selecionar um nó que estende a classe."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param property] is disabled in the class "
"specified by [param class_name]. When a property is disabled, it won't "
"appear in the Inspector when selecting a node that extends the class "
"specified by [param class_name]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se [param property] estiver desativado na classe "
"especificada por [param class_name]. Quando uma propriedade é desativada, "
"ela não aparece no Inspetor ao selecionar um nó que estende a classe "
"especificada por [param class_name]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param feature] is disabled. When a feature "
"is disabled, it will disappear from the editor entirely."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param feature] estiver desativado. Quando um "
"recurso é desativado, ele desaparece do editor inteiramente."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an editor feature profile from a file. The file must follow the JSON "
"format obtained by using the feature profile manager's [b]Export[/b] button "
"or the [method save_to_file] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Feature profiles created via the user interface are loaded from "
"the [code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the "
"[code].profile[/code] extension. The editor configuration folder can be "
"found by using [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the editor feature profile to a file in JSON format. It can then be "
"imported using the feature profile manager's [b]Import[/b] button or the "
"[method load_from_file] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Feature profiles created via the user interface are saved in "
"the [code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the "
"[code].profile[/code] extension. The editor configuration folder can be "
"found by using [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables the class specified by "
"[param class_name]. When disabled, the class won't appear in the Create New "
"Node dialog."
msgstr ""
"Se [param disable] for [code]true[/code], desativa a classe especificada por "
"[param class_name]. Quando desativada, a classe não aparecerá na caixa de "
"diálogo Criar Novo Nó."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables editing for the class "
"specified by [param class_name]. When disabled, the class will still appear "
"in the Create New Node dialog but the Inspector will be read-only when "
"selecting a node that extends the class."
msgstr ""
"Se [param disable] for [code]true[/code], desativa a edição para a classe "
"especificada por [param class_name]. Quando desativada, a classe ainda "
"aparecerá na caixa de diálogo Criar Novo Nó, mas o Inspetor será somente "
"leitura ao selecionar um nó que estende a classe."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables editing for [param "
"property] in the class specified by [param class_name]. When a property is "
"disabled, it won't appear in the Inspector when selecting a node that "
"extends the class specified by [param class_name]."
msgstr ""
"Se [param disable] for [code]true[/code], desativa a edição para [param "
"property] na classe especificada por [param class_name]. Quando uma "
"propriedade é desativada, ela não aparecerá no Inspetor ao selecionar um nó "
"que estende a classe especificada por [param class_name]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"If [param disable] is [code]true[/code], disables the editor feature "
"specified in [param feature]. When a feature is disabled, it will disappear "
"from the editor entirely."
msgstr ""
"Se [param disable] for [code]true[/code], desativa o recurso do editor "
"especificado em [param feature]. Quando um recurso é desativado, ele "
"desaparece totalmente do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor. If this feature is disabled, the 3D editor won't display but "
"3D nodes will still display in the Create New Node dialog."
msgstr ""
"O editor 3D. Se este recurso estiver desativado, o editor 3D não será "
"exibido, mas os nós 3D ainda serão exibidos na caixa de diálogo Criar Novo "
"Nó."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The Script tab, which contains the script editor and class reference "
"browser. If this feature is disabled, the Script tab won't display."
msgstr ""
"A aba Script, que contém o editor de script e o navegador de referência de "
"classe. Se este recurso estiver desativado, a aba Script não será exibida."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The Asset Store tab. If this feature is disabled, the Asset Store tab won't "
"display."
msgstr ""
"A aba Loja de Ativos. Se esse recurso estiver desativado, a aba Loja de "
"Ativos não será exibida."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"Scene tree editing. If this feature is disabled, the Scene tree dock will "
"still be visible but will be read-only."
msgstr ""
"Edição da árvore de cena. Se esse recurso estiver desativado, o painel da "
"árvore de cena ainda estará visível, mas será somente leitura."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid "Replaced by the Signals and Groups docks."
msgstr "Substituído pelos painéis de Sinais e Grupos."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The Node dock. If this feature is disabled, signals and groups won't be "
"visible and modifiable from the editor."
msgstr ""
"O painel Nó. Se esse recurso estiver desativado, sinais e grupos não ficarão "
"visíveis e modificáveis a partir do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The FileSystem dock. If this feature is disabled, the FileSystem dock won't "
"be visible."
msgstr ""
"O dock Sistema de Arquivos. Se esse recurso estiver desativado, o dock "
"Sistema de Arquivos não ficará visível."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The Import dock. If this feature is disabled, the Import dock won't be "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"O painel Importar. Se este recurso estiver desativado, o painel Importar não "
"ficará visível."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The History dock. If this feature is disabled, the History dock won't be "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"O dock Histórico. Se este recurso estiver desativado, o dock Histórico não "
"ficará visível."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The Game tab, which allows embedding the game window and selecting nodes by "
"clicking inside of it. If this feature is disabled, the Game tab won't "
"display."
msgstr ""
"A aba Jogo, que permite embutir a janela do jogo e selecionar nós clicando "
"dentro dela. Se esse recurso estiver desativado, a aba Jogo não será exibida."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The Signals dock. If this feature is disabled, signals won't be visible and "
"modifiable from the editor."
msgstr ""
"O painel de Sinais. Se esse recurso estiver desativado, os sinais não "
"estarão visíveis e modificáveis a partir do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorFeatureProfile.xml
msgid ""
"The Groups dock. If this feature is disabled, groups won't be visible and "
"modifiable from the editor."
msgstr ""
"O painel de Grupos. Se esse recurso estiver desativado, os grupos não "
"estarão visíveis e modificáveis a partir do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileDialog.xml
msgid "A modified version of [FileDialog] used by the editor."
msgstr "Uma versão modificada de [FileDialog] usada pelo editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorFileDialog] is a [FileDialog] tweaked to work in the editor. It "
"automatically handles favorite and recent directory lists, and synchronizes "
"some properties with their corresponding editor settings.\n"
"[EditorFileDialog] will automatically show a native dialog based on the "
"[member EditorSettings.interface/editor/appearance/use_native_file_dialogs] "
"editor setting and ignores [member FileDialog.use_native_dialog].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [EditorFileDialog] is invisible by default. To make it visible, "
"call one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such "
"as [method Window.popup_centered_clamped].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux and macOS, sandboxed apps always use native dialogs to "
"access the host file system."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorFileDialog.xml
msgid "This feature is no longer supported."
msgstr "Este recurso não é mais suportado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"This method is kept for compatibility and does nothing. As an alternative, "
"you can display another dialog after showing the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"Este método é mantido para compatibilidade e não faz nada. Como alternativa, "
"você pode exibir outro diálogo após mostrar o diálogo de arquivo."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileDialog.xml
msgid "Use [member FileDialog.overwrite_warning_enabled] instead."
msgstr "Use [member FileDialog.overwrite_warning_enabled] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [EditorFileDialog] will not warn the user before "
"overwriting files."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [EditorFileDialog] não avisará o usuário antes de "
"sobrescrever arquivos."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Resource filesystem, as the editor sees it."
msgstr "O sistema de arquivos de recursos, da forma que o editor o vê."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid ""
"This object holds information of all resources in the filesystem, their "
"types, etc.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_resource_filesystem]."
msgstr ""
"Este objeto contém informações de todos os recursos no sistema de arquivos, "
"seus tipos, etc.\n"
"[b]Obs.:[/b] Esta classe não deve ser instanciada diretamente. Em vez disso, "
"acesse o singleton usando [method EditorInterface.get_resource_filesystem]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the resource type of the file, given the full path. This returns a "
"string such as [code]\"Resource\"[/code] or [code]\"GDScript\"[/code], "
"[i]not[/i] a file extension such as [code]\".gd\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo de recurso do arquivo, dado o caminho completo. Isso retorna "
"uma string, por exemplo [code]\"Resource\"[/code] ou [code]\"GDScript\"[/"
"code], e [i]não[/i] uma extensão de arquivo como [code]\".gd\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Gets the root directory object."
msgstr "Obtém o objeto de diretório raiz."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Returns a view into the filesystem at [param path]."
msgstr "Retorna um objeto de diretório no caminho [param path]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Returns the scan progress for 0 to 1 if the FS is being scanned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o progresso de scan de 0 a 1 se o sistema de arquivos está sendo "
"escaneado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if resources are currently being imported."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se os recursos estiverem sendo importados no "
"momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the filesystem is being scanned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o sistema de arquivos está sendo escaneado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid ""
"Reimports a set of files. Call this if these files or their [code].import[/"
"code] files were directly edited by script or an external program.\n"
"If the file type changed or the file was newly created, use [method "
"update_file] or [method scan].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function blocks until the import is finished. However, the "
"main loop iteration, including timers and [method Node._process], will occur "
"during the import process due to progress bar updates. Avoid calls to "
"[method reimport_files] or [method scan] while an import is in progress."
msgstr ""
"Reimporta um conjunto de arquivos. Chame isso se esses arquivos ou seus "
"arquivos [code].import[/code] foram diretamente editados por script ou um "
"programa externo.\n"
"Se o tipo de arquivo mudou ou o arquivo tiver sido recém criado, use [method "
"update_file] ou [method scan].\n"
"[b]Obs.:[/b] Esta função bloqueia até que a importação seja concluída. No "
"entanto, o loop principal, incluindo timers e [method Node._process], ainda "
"ocorrerá durante o processo de importação devido a atualizações da barra de "
"progresso. Evite executar [method reimport_files] ou [method scan] enquanto "
"uma importação está em andamento."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Scan the filesystem for changes."
msgstr "Escaneia alterações no sistema de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Check if the source of any imported resource changed."
msgstr "Verifica se a fonte de qualquer recurso importado mudou."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid ""
"Add a file in an existing directory, or schedule file information to be "
"updated on editor restart. Can be used to update text files saved by an "
"external program.\n"
"This will not import the file. To reimport, call [method reimport_files] or "
"[method scan] methods."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um arquivo em um diretório existente, ou programa as informações do "
"arquivo para serem atualizadas ao reiniciar o editor. Pode ser usado para "
"atualizar arquivos de texto salvos por um programa externo.\n"
"Isso não vai importar o arquivo. Para reimportar, execute [method "
"reimport_files] ou [method scan]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Emitted if the filesystem changed."
msgstr "Emite se o sistema de arquivos mudou."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Emitted if a resource is reimported."
msgstr "Emite se um recurso é reimportado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Emitted before a resource is reimported."
msgstr "Emite antes de um recurso ser reimportado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted if at least one resource is reloaded when the filesystem is scanned."
msgstr ""
"Emite se pelo menos um recurso foi recarregado quando o sistema de arquivos "
"for escaneado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Emitted when the list of global script classes gets updated."
msgstr "Emite quando a lista de classes de script global é atualizada."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystem.xml
msgid "Emitted if the source of any imported file changed."
msgstr "Emite se a fonte de qualquer arquivo importado mudou."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "A directory for the resource filesystem."
msgstr "Um diretório para o sistema de arquivos de recursos."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "A more generalized, low-level variation of the directory concept."
msgstr ""
"Uma variação mais generalizada e de baixo nível do conceito de diretório."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the directory with name [param name] or [code]-1[/code] "
"if not found."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice do diretório com o nome [param name] ou [code]-1[/code] se "
"não for encontrado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the file with name [param name] or [code]-1[/code] if "
"not found."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice do arquivo com o nome [param name] ou [code]-1[/code] se "
"não for encontrado."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "Returns the name of the file at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o nome do arquivo no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "Returns the number of files in this directory."
msgstr "Retorna o número de arquivos neste diretório."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file at index [param idx] imported properly."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o arquivo no índice [param idx] foi importado "
"corretamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "Returns the path to the file at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o caminho para o arquivo no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the base class of the script class defined in the file at index "
"[param idx]. If the file doesn't define a script class using the "
"[code]class_name[/code] syntax, this will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a classe base da classe de script definida no arquivo no índice "
"[param idx]. Se o arquivo não definir uma classe de script usando a sintaxe "
"[code]class_name[/code], isso retornará uma string vazia."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the script class defined in the file at index [param "
"idx]. If the file doesn't define a script class using the [code]class_name[/"
"code] syntax, this will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome da classe de script definida no arquivo no índice [param "
"idx]. Se o arquivo não definir uma classe de script usando a sintaxe "
"[code]class_name[/code], isso retornará uma string vazia."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the resource type of the file at index [param idx]. This returns a "
"string such as [code]\"Resource\"[/code] or [code]\"GDScript\"[/code], "
"[i]not[/i] a file extension such as [code]\".gd\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo de recurso do arquivo no índice [param idx]. Isso retorna uma "
"string como [code]\"Resource\"[/code] ou [code]\"GDScript\"[/code], [i]não[/"
"i] uma extensão de arquivo como [code]\".gd\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "Returns the name of this directory."
msgstr "Retorna o nome deste diretório."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the parent directory for this directory or [code]null[/code] if "
"called on a directory at [code]res://[/code] or [code]user://[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o diretório pai para este diretório ou [code]null[/code] se chamado "
"em um diretório em [code]res://[/code] ou [code]user://[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "Returns the path to this directory."
msgstr "Retorna o caminho para este diretório."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "Returns the subdirectory at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o subdiretório no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemDirectory.xml
msgid "Returns the number of subdirectories in this directory."
msgstr "Retorna o número de subdiretórios neste diretório."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemImportFormatSupportQuery.xml
msgid "Used to query and configure import format support."
msgstr "Usado para consultar e configurar o suporte a formatos de importação."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemImportFormatSupportQuery.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used to query and configure a certain import format. It is "
"used in conjunction with asset format import plugins."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe é usada para consultar e configurar um determinado formato de "
"importação. É usada em conjunto com plugins de importação de formato de "
"assets."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemImportFormatSupportQuery.xml
msgid "Return the file extensions supported."
msgstr "Retorna as extensões de arquivo suportadas."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemImportFormatSupportQuery.xml
msgid "Return whether this importer is active."
msgstr "Retorna se este importador está ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorFileSystemImportFormatSupportQuery.xml
msgid "Query support. Return [code]false[/code] if import must not continue."
msgstr ""
"Suporte a consultas. Retorna [code]false[/code] se a importação não deve "
"continuar."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a custom resource importer in the editor. Use the class to parse "
"any file and import it as a new resource type."
msgstr ""
"Registra um importador de recursos personalizado no editor. Use a classe "
"para analisar qualquer arquivo e importá-lo como um novo tipo de recurso."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorImportPlugin]s provide a way to extend the editor's resource import "
"functionality. Use them to import resources from custom files or to provide "
"alternatives to the editor's existing importers.\n"
"EditorImportPlugins work by associating with specific file extensions and a "
"resource type. See [method _get_recognized_extensions] and [method "
"_get_resource_type]. They may optionally specify some import presets that "
"affect the import process. EditorImportPlugins are responsible for creating "
"the resources and saving them in the [code].godot/imported[/code] directory "
"(see [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory]).\n"
"Below is an example EditorImportPlugin that imports a [Mesh] from a file "
"with the extension \".special\" or \".spec\":\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorImportPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _get_importer_name():\n"
"\treturn \"my.special.plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_visible_name():\n"
"\treturn \"Special Mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"]\n"
"\n"
"func _get_save_extension():\n"
"\treturn \"mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_resource_type():\n"
"\treturn \"Mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_count():\n"
"\treturn 1\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_name(preset_index):\n"
"\treturn \"Default\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_import_options(path, preset_index):\n"
"\treturn [{\"name\": \"my_option\", \"default_value\": false}]\n"
"\n"
"func _import(source_file, save_path, options, platform_variants, "
"gen_files):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(source_file, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tif file == null:\n"
"\t\treturn FAILED\n"
"\tvar mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"\t# Fill the Mesh with data read in \"file\", left as an exercise to the "
"reader.\n"
"\n"
"\tvar filename = save_path + \".\" + _get_save_extension()\n"
"\treturn ResourceSaver.save(mesh, filename)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MySpecialPlugin : EditorImportPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetImporterName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"my.special.plugin\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetVisibleName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Special Mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetSaveExtension()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetResourceType()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override int _GetPresetCount()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetPresetName(int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Default\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetImportOptions(string path, int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\t\t[\n"
"\t\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"myOption\" },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"default_value\", false },\n"
"\t\t\t},\n"
"\t\t];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Error _Import(string sourceFile, string savePath, "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary options, Godot.Collections.Array<string> "
"platformVariants, Godot.Collections.Array<string> genFiles)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(sourceFile, "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tif (file.GetError() != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\treturn Error.Failed;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tvar mesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"\t\t// Fill the Mesh with data read in \"file\", left as an exercise to the "
"reader.\n"
"\t\tstring filename = $\"{savePath}.{_GetSaveExtension()}\";\n"
"\t\treturn ResourceSaver.Save(mesh, filename);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To use [EditorImportPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_import_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorImportPlugin]s fornecem uma maneira de estender a funcionalidade de "
"importação de recursos do editor. Use-os para importar recursos de arquivos "
"personalizados ou para fornecer alternativas aos importadores existentes do "
"editor.\n"
"EditorImportPlugins funcionam associando-se a extensões de arquivo "
"específicas e a um tipo de recurso. Veja [method _get_recognized_extensions] "
"e [method _get_resource_type]. Opcionalmente, eles podem especificar algumas "
"predefinições de importação que afetam o processo de importação. Os "
"EditorImportPlugins são responsáveis por criar os recursos e salvá-los no "
"diretório [code].godot/imported[/code] (veja [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/config/use_hidden_project_data_directory]).\n"
"Abaixo está um exemplo de EditorImportPlugin que importa uma [Mesh] a partir "
"de um arquivo com a extensão \".special\" ou \".spec\":\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorImportPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _get_importer_name():\n"
"\treturn \"my.special.plugin\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_visible_name():\n"
"\treturn \"Special Mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"]\n"
"\n"
"func _get_save_extension():\n"
"\treturn \"mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_resource_type():\n"
"\treturn \"Mesh\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_count():\n"
"\treturn 1\n"
"\n"
"func _get_preset_name(preset_index):\n"
"\treturn \"Default\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_import_options(path, preset_index):\n"
"\treturn [{\"name\": \"my_option\", \"default_value\": false}]\n"
"\n"
"func _import(source_file, save_path, options, platform_variants, "
"gen_files):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(source_file, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tif file == null:\n"
"\t\treturn FAILED\n"
"\tvar mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"\t# Preenche a Mesh com os dados lidos em \"file\", deixado como um "
"exercício para o leitor.\n"
"\n"
"\tvar filename = save_path + \".\" + _get_save_extension()\n"
"\treturn ResourceSaver.save(mesh, filename)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MySpecialPlugin : EditorImportPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetImporterName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"my.special.plugin\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetVisibleName()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Special Mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn [\"special\", \"spec\"];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetSaveExtension()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetResourceType()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Mesh\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override int _GetPresetCount()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn 1;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string _GetPresetName(int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn \"Default\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetImportOptions(string path, int presetIndex)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\t\t[\n"
"\t\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"myOption\" },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"default_value\", false },\n"
"\t\t\t},\n"
"\t\t];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Error _Import(string sourceFile, string savePath, "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary options, Godot.Collections.Array<string> "
"platformVariants, Godot.Collections.Array<string> genFiles)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(sourceFile, "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tif (file.GetError() != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\treturn Error.Failed;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\tvar mesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"\t\t// Preenche a Mesh com os dados lidos em \"file\", deixado como um "
"exercício para o leitor.\n"
"\t\tstring filename = $\"{savePath}.{_GetSaveExtension()}\";\n"
"\t\treturn ResourceSaver.Save(mesh, filename);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Para usar o [EditorImportPlugin], registre-o usando o método [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_import_plugin] primeiro."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporter.xml
msgid "Import plugins"
msgstr "Importar plugins"

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Tells whether this importer can be run in parallel on threads, or, on the "
"contrary, it's only safe for the editor to call it from the main thread, for "
"one file at a time.\n"
"If this importer's implementation is thread-safe and can be run in parallel, "
"override this with [code]true[/code] to optimize for concurrency.\n"
"If not overridden, returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the format version of this importer. Increment this version when making "
"incompatible changes to the format of the imported resources.\n"
"If not overridden, the format version is [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the options and default values for the preset at this index. Returns an "
"Array of Dictionaries with the following keys: [code]name[/code], "
"[code]default_value[/code], [code]property_hint[/code] (optional), "
"[code]hint_string[/code] (optional), [code]usage[/code] (optional)."
msgstr ""
"Obtém as opções e os valores padrão para a predefinição neste índice. "
"Retorna um Array de Dicionários com as seguintes chaves: [code]name[/code], "
"[code]default_value[/code], [code]property_hint[/code] (opcional), "
"[code]hint_string[/code] (opcional), [code]usage[/code] (opcional)."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the order of this importer to be run when importing resources. "
"Importers with [i]lower[/i] import orders will be called first, and higher "
"values will be called later. Use this to ensure the importer runs after the "
"dependencies are already imported. The default import order is [code]0[/"
"code] unless overridden by a specific importer. See [enum "
"ResourceImporter.ImportOrder] for some predefined values."
msgstr ""
"Obtém a ordem deste importador a ser executada ao importar recursos. Os "
"importadores com ordens de importação [i]mais baixas[/i] serão chamados "
"primeiro, e os valores mais altos serão chamados posteriormente. Use isso "
"para garantir que o importador seja executado após as dependências já terem "
"sido importadas. A ordem de importação padrão é [code]0[/code], a menos que "
"seja substituída por um importador específico. Veja [enum "
"ResourceImporter.ImportOrder] para alguns valores pré-definidos."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid "Gets the unique name of the importer."
msgstr "Obtém o nome exclusivo do importador."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets whether the import option specified by [param option_name] should be "
"visible in the Import dock. The default implementation always returns "
"[code]true[/code], making all options visible. This is mainly useful for "
"hiding options that depend on others if one of them is disabled.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_option_visibility(path, option_name, options):\n"
"\t# Only show the lossy quality setting if the compression mode is set to "
"\"Lossy\".\n"
"\tif option_name == \"compress/lossy_quality\" and options.has(\"compress/"
"mode\"):\n"
"\t\treturn int(options[\"compress/mode\"]) == COMPRESS_LOSSY # This is a "
"constant that you set\n"
"\n"
"\treturn true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _GetOptionVisibility(string path, StringName "
"optionName, Godot.Collections.Dictionary options)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Only show the lossy quality setting if the compression mode is set to "
"\"Lossy\".\n"
"\tif (optionName == \"compress/lossy_quality\" && "
"options.ContainsKey(\"compress/mode\"))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn (int)options[\"compress/mode\"] == CompressLossy; // This is a "
"constant you set\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\treturn true;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Obtém se a opção de importação especificada por [param option_name] deve "
"ficar visível no painel Importar. A implementação padrão sempre retorna "
"[code]true[/code], tornando todas as opções visíveis. Isso é útil "
"principalmente para ocultar opções que dependem de outras se uma delas "
"estiver desativada.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_option_visibility(path, option_name, options):\n"
"\t# Exibe a configuração de qualidade com perdas apenas se o modo de "
"compressão estiver definido como \"Lossy\".\n"
"\tif option_name == \"compress/lossy_quality\" and options.has(\"compress/"
"mode\"):\n"
"\t\treturn int(options[\"compress/mode\"]) == COMPRESS_LOSSY # Esta é uma "
"constante que você define\n"
"\n"
"\treturn true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override bool _GetOptionVisibility(string path, StringName "
"optionName, Godot.Collections.Dictionary options)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Exibe a configuração de qualidade com perdas apenas se o modo de "
"compressão estiver definido como \"Lossy\".\n"
"\tif (optionName == \"compress/lossy_quality\" && "
"options.ContainsKey(\"compress/mode\"))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn (int)options[\"compress/mode\"] == CompressLossy; // Esta é uma "
"constante que você define\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\treturn true;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the number of initial presets defined by the plugin. Use [method "
"_get_import_options] to get the default options for the preset and [method "
"_get_preset_name] to get the name of the preset.\n"
"By default, there are no presets."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid "Gets the name of the options preset at this index."
msgstr "Obtém o nome da predefinição de opções neste índice."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the priority of this plugin for the recognized extension. Higher "
"priority plugins will be preferred. The default priority is [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém a prioridade deste plugin para a extensão reconhecida. Plugins com "
"maior prioridade serão preferidos. A prioridade padrão é [code]1.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the list of file extensions to associate with this loader (case-"
"insensitive). e.g. [code][\"obj\"][/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém a lista de extensões de arquivo a serem associadas a este carregador "
"(insensível a maiúsculas e minúsculas). Ex.: [code][\"obj\"][/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the Godot resource type associated with this loader. e.g. [code]"
"\"Mesh\"[/code] or [code]\"Animation\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o tipo de recurso Godot associado a este carregador. ex.: [code]"
"\"Mesh\"[/code] ou [code]\"Animation\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the extension used to save this resource in the [code].godot/imported[/"
"code] directory (see [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory])."
msgstr ""
"Obtém a extensão usada para salvar este recurso no diretório [code].godot/"
"imported[/code] (veja [member ProjectSettings.application/config/"
"use_hidden_project_data_directory])."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the name to display in the import window. You should choose this name "
"as a continuation to \"Import as\", e.g. \"Import as Special Mesh\"."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o nome a ser exibido na janela de importação. Você deve escolher este "
"nome como continuação de \"Import as\", por exemplo, \"Import as Special "
"Mesh\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Imports [param source_file] with the import [param options] specified. "
"Should return [constant @GlobalScope.OK] if the import is successful, other "
"values indicate failure.\n"
"The imported resource is expected to be saved to [code]save_path + \".\" + "
"_get_save_extension()[/code]. If a different variant is preferred for a "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]feature tag[/url], save "
"the variant to [code]save_path + \".\" + tag + \".\" + _get_save_extension()"
"[/code] and add the feature tag to [param platform_variants].\n"
"If additional resource files are generated in the resource filesystem "
"([code]res://[/code]), add their full path to [param gen_files] so that the "
"editor knows they depend on [param source_file].\n"
"This method must be overridden to do the actual importing work. See this "
"class' description for an example of overriding this method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This function can only be called during the [method _import] callback and it "
"allows manually importing resources from it. This is useful when the "
"imported file generates external resources that require importing (as "
"example, images). Custom parameters for the \".import\" file can be passed "
"via the [param custom_options]. Additionally, in cases where multiple "
"importers can handle a file, the [param custom_importer] can be specified to "
"force a specific one. This function performs a resource import and returns "
"immediately with a success or error code. [param generator_parameters] "
"defines optional extra metadata which will be stored as [code skip-"
"lint]generator_parameters[/code] in the [code]remap[/code] section of the "
"[code].import[/code] file, for example to store a md5 hash of the source "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Esta função só pode ser chamada durante o retorno de chamada [method "
"_import] e permite importar manualmente recursos a partir dele. Isso é útil "
"quando o arquivo importado gera recursos externos que exigem importação "
"(como exemplo, imagens). Parâmetros personalizados para o arquivo "
"\".import\" podem ser passados via [param custom_options]. Além disso, em "
"casos onde múltiplos importadores podem lidar com um arquivo, o [param "
"custom_importer] pode ser especificado para forçar um específico. Esta "
"função realiza uma importação de recurso e retorna imediatamente com um "
"código de sucesso ou erro. [param generator_parameters] define metadados "
"extras opcionais que serão armazenados como [code skip-"
"lint]generator_parameters[/code] na seção [code]remap[/code] do arquivo "
"[code].import[/code], por exemplo, para armazenar um hash md5 dos dados de "
"origem."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "A control used to edit properties of an object."
msgstr "Um controle usado para editar propriedades de um objeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"This is the control that implements property editing in the editor's "
"Settings dialogs, the Inspector dock, etc. To get the [EditorInspector] used "
"in the editor's Inspector dock, use [method EditorInterface.get_inspector].\n"
"[EditorInspector] will show properties in the same order as the array "
"returned by [method Object.get_property_list].\n"
"If a property's name is path-like (i.e. if it contains forward slashes), "
"[EditorInspector] will create nested sections for \"directories\" along the "
"path. For example, if a property is named [code]highlighting/gdscript/"
"node_path_color[/code], it will be shown as \"Node Path Color\" inside the "
"\"GDScript\" section nested inside the \"Highlighting\" section.\n"
"If a property has [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_GROUP] usage, it will group "
"subsequent properties whose name starts with the property's hint string. The "
"group ends when a property does not start with that hint string or when a "
"new group starts. An empty group name effectively ends the current group. "
"[EditorInspector] will create a top-level section for each group. For "
"example, if a property with group usage is named [code]Collide With[/code] "
"and its hint string is [code]collide_with_[/code], a subsequent "
"[code]collide_with_area[/code] property will be shown as \"Area\" inside the "
"\"Collide With\" section. There is also a special case: when the hint string "
"contains the name of a property, that property is grouped too. This is "
"mainly to help grouping properties like [code]font[/code], [code]font_color[/"
"code] and [code]font_size[/code] (using the hint string [code]font_[/"
"code]).\n"
"If a property has [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_SUBGROUP] usage, a subgroup will "
"be created in the same way as a group, and a second-level section will be "
"created for each subgroup.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike sections created from path-like property names, "
"[EditorInspector] won't capitalize the name for sections created from "
"groups. So properties with group usage usually use capitalized names instead "
"of snake_cased names."
msgstr ""
"Este é o controle que implementa a edição de propriedades nas caixas de "
"diálogo de Configurações do editor, no painel do Inspetor (Inspector), etc. "
"Para obter o [EditorInspector] usado no painel do Inspetor do editor, use "
"[method EditorInterface.get_inspector].\n"
"O [EditorInspector] mostrará as propriedades na mesma ordem que a matriz "
"retornada por [method Object.get_property_list].\n"
"Se o nome de uma propriedade for semelhante a um caminho (ou seja, se "
"contiver barras diagonais), o [EditorInspector] criará seções aninhadas para "
"\"diretórios\" ao longo do caminho. Por exemplo, se uma propriedade for "
"nomeada [code]highlighting/gdscript/node_path_color[/code], ela será exibida "
"como \"Node Path Color\" dentro da seção \"GDScript\" aninhada dentro da "
"seção \"Highlighting\".\n"
"Se uma propriedade tiver o uso [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_GROUP], ela agrupará "
"as propriedades subsequentes cujo nome comece com a string de dica (hint "
"string) da propriedade. O grupo termina quando uma propriedade não começa "
"com essa string de dica ou quando um novo grupo começa. Um nome de grupo "
"vazio efetivamente encerra o grupo atual. O [EditorInspector] criará uma "
"seção de nível superior para cada grupo. Por exemplo, se uma propriedade com "
"uso de grupo for nomeada [code]Collide With[/code] e sua string de dica for "
"[code]collide_with_[/code], uma propriedade subsequente "
"[code]collide_with_area[/code] será exibida como \"Area\" dentro da seção "
"\"Collide With\". Há também um caso especial: quando a string de dica contém "
"o nome de uma propriedade, essa propriedade também é agrupada. Isso serve "
"principalmente para ajudar a agrupar propriedades como [code]font[/code], "
"[code]font_color[/code] e [code]font_size[/code] (usando a string de dica "
"[code]font_[/code]).\n"
"Se uma propriedade tiver o uso [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_SUBGROUP], um "
"subgrupo será criado da mesma forma que um grupo, e uma seção de segundo "
"nível será criada para cada subgrupo.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao contrário das seções criadas a partir de nomes de "
"propriedades semelhantes a caminhos, o [EditorInspector] não colocará em "
"letras maiúsculas (capitalizará) o nome para seções criadas a partir de "
"grupos. Portanto, propriedades com uso de grupo geralmente usam nomes "
"capitalizados em vez de nomes no estilo snake_case."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Collapses all foldable sections."
msgstr "Recolhe todas as seções dobráveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an inspector with the same configuration as the one used in the "
"editor's Inspector dock. When passing a [LineEdit] into [param "
"filter_line_edit], the inspector will filter its properties based on [member "
"LineEdit.text] whenever [signal LineEdit.text_changed] is emitted."
msgstr ""
"Cria um inspetor com a mesma configuração daquele usado na doca do Inspetor "
"do editor. Ao passar um [LineEdit] para [param filter_line_edit], o inspetor "
"filtrará suas propriedades com base em [member LineEdit.text] sempre que o "
"[signal LineEdit.text_changed] for emitido."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Shows the properties of the given [param object] in this inspector for "
"editing. To clear the inspector, call this method with [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to edit an object in the editor's main inspector, "
"use the [code]edit_*[/code] methods in [EditorInterface] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Expands all foldable sections."
msgstr "Expande todas as seções dobráveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Expands only the foldable sections that contain a revertable (i.e. non-"
"default) property."
msgstr ""
"Expande apenas as seções dobráveis que contêm uma propriedade reversível (ou "
"seja, não padrão)."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Returns the object currently selected in this inspector."
msgstr "Retorna o objeto atualmente selecionado neste inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Gets the path of the currently selected property."
msgstr "Obtém o caminho da propriedade selecionada no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a property editor that can be used by plugin UI to edit the "
"specified property of an [param object]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um editor de propriedades que pode ser usado pela interface do usuário "
"do plugin para editar a propriedade especificada de um [param object]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Emitted when the object being edited by the inspector has changed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o objeto sendo editado pelo inspetor foi alterado."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the Edit button of an [Object] has been pressed in the "
"inspector. This is mainly used in the remote scene tree Inspector."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o botão Editar de um [Object] é pressionado no inspetor. Isso "
"é usado principalmente na árvore de cena remota do Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Emitted when a property is removed from the inspector."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma propriedade é removida do inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Emitted when a property is edited in the inspector."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma propriedade é editada no inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a property is keyed in the inspector. Properties can be keyed "
"by clicking the \"key\" icon next to a property when the Animation panel is "
"toggled."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma propriedade é chaveada no inspetor. As propriedades podem "
"ser chaveadas clicando no ícone de \"chave\" ao lado de uma propriedade "
"quando o painel Animação estiver ativado."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Emitted when a property is selected in the inspector."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma propriedade é selecionada no inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a boolean property is toggled in the inspector.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal is never emitted if the internal [code]autoclear[/"
"code] property enabled. Since this property is always enabled in the editor "
"inspector, this signal is never emitted by the editor itself."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid "Emitted when a resource is selected in the inspector."
msgstr "Emitido quando um recurso é selecionado no inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspector.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a property that requires a restart to be applied is edited in "
"the inspector. This is only used in the Project Settings and Editor Settings."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma propriedade que requer uma reinicialização para ser "
"aplicada é editada no inspetor. Isso é usado apenas nas Configurações do "
"Projeto e Configurações do Editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid "Plugin for adding custom property editors on the inspector."
msgstr ""
"Plugin para adicionar editores de propriedades personalizados no inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorInspectorPlugin] allows adding custom property editors to "
"[EditorInspector].\n"
"When an object is edited, the [method _can_handle] function is called and "
"must return [code]true[/code] if the object type is supported.\n"
"If supported, the function [method _parse_begin] will be called, allowing to "
"place custom controls at the beginning of the class.\n"
"Subsequently, the [method _parse_category] and [method _parse_property] are "
"called for every category and property. They offer the ability to add custom "
"controls to the inspector too.\n"
"Finally, [method _parse_end] will be called.\n"
"On each of these calls, the \"add\" functions can be called.\n"
"To use [EditorInspectorPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_inspector_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid "Inspector plugins"
msgstr "Plugins do inspetor"

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this object can be handled by this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este objeto puder ser manipulado por este "
"plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the beginning of the property list for "
"[param object]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado para permitir a adição de controles no início da lista de "
"propriedades para [param object]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the beginning of a category in the "
"property list for [param object]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado para permitir adicionar controles no início de uma categoria na "
"lista de propriedades para [param object]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the end of the property list for [param "
"object]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado para permitir a adição de controles no final da lista de "
"propriedades para [param object]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called to allow adding controls at the beginning of a group or a sub-group "
"in the property list for [param object]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado para permitir a adição de controles no início de um grupo ou "
"subgrupo na lista de propriedades para [param object]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called to allow adding property-specific editors to the property list for "
"[param object]. The added editor control must extend [EditorProperty]. "
"Returning [code]true[/code] removes the built-in editor for this property, "
"otherwise allows to insert a custom editor before the built-in one."
msgstr ""
"Chamado para permitir a adição de editores específicos de propriedade à "
"lista de propriedades para [param object]. O controle de editor adicionado "
"deve estender [EditorProperty]. Retornar [code]true[/code] remove o editor "
"integrado para esta propriedade; caso contrário, permite inserir um editor "
"personalizado antes do integrado."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid "Adds a custom control, which is not necessarily a property editor."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um controle personalizado, que não é necessariamente um editor de "
"propriedades."

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a property editor for an individual property. The [param editor] "
"control must extend [EditorProperty].\n"
"There can be multiple property editors for a property. If [param add_to_end] "
"is [code]true[/code], this newly added editor will be displayed after all "
"the other editors of the property whose [param add_to_end] is [code]false[/"
"code]. For example, the editor uses this parameter to add an \"Edit Region\" "
"button for [member Sprite2D.region_rect] below the regular [Rect2] editor.\n"
"[param label] can be used to choose a custom label for the property editor "
"in the inspector. If left empty, the label is computed from the name of the "
"property instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInspectorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an editor that allows modifying multiple properties. The [param editor] "
"control must extend [EditorProperty]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um editor que permite modificar várias propriedades. O controle "
"[param editor] deve estender [EditorProperty]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Godot editor's interface."
msgstr "Interface do editor do Godot."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorInterface] gives you control over Godot editor's window. It allows "
"customizing the window, saving and (re-)loading scenes, rendering mesh "
"previews, inspecting and editing resources and objects, and provides access "
"to [EditorSettings], [EditorFileSystem], [EditorResourcePreview], "
"[ScriptEditor], the editor viewport, and information about scenes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton directly by its name.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var editor_settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// In C# you can access it via the static Singleton property.\n"
"EditorSettings settings = EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorSettings();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"O [EditorInterface] dá a você controle sobre a janela do editor do Godot. "
"Ele permite personalizar a janela, salvar e (re)carregar cenas, renderizar "
"pré-visualizações de malhas, inspecionar e editar recursos e objetos, e "
"fornece acesso às [EditorSettings], ao [EditorFileSystem], ao "
"[EditorResourcePreview], ao [ScriptEditor], à viewport do editor e a "
"informações sobre cenas.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta classe não deve ser instanciada diretamente. Em vez disso, "
"acesse o singleton diretamente pelo seu nome.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var editor_settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Em C# você pode acessá-lo através da propriedade estática Singleton.\n"
"EditorSettings settings = EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorSettings();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid ""
"Makes [param node] root of the currently opened scene. Only works if the "
"scene is empty. If the [param node] is a scene instance, an inheriting scene "
"will be created."
msgstr ""
"Torna [param node] a raiz da cena aberta no momento. Funciona apenas se a "
"cena estiver vazia. Se o [param node] for uma instância de cena, uma cena "
"herdada será criada."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Closes the currently active scene, discarding any pending changes in the "
"process. Returns [constant OK] on success or [constant ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST] "
"if there is no scene to close."
msgstr ""
"Fecha a cena atualmente ativa, descartando quaisquer alterações pendentes no "
"processo. Retorna [constant OK] em caso de sucesso ou [constant "
"ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST] se não houver cena para fechar."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Edits the given [Node]. The node will be also selected if it's inside the "
"scene tree."
msgstr ""
"Edita o [Node] fornecido. O nó também será selecionado se estiver dentro da "
"árvore de cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Edits the given [Resource]. If the resource is a [Script] you can also edit "
"it with [method edit_script] to specify the line and column position."
msgstr ""
"Edita o [Resource] fornecido. Se o recurso for um [Script], você também pode "
"editá-lo com [method edit_script] para especificar a posição da linha e da "
"coluna."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Edits the given [Script]. The line and column on which to open the script "
"can also be specified. The script will be open with the user-configured "
"editor for the script's language which may be an external editor."
msgstr ""
"Edita o [Script] fornecido. A linha e a coluna nas quais abrir o script "
"também podem ser especificadas. O script será aberto com o editor "
"configurado pelo usuário para a linguagem do script, que pode ser um editor "
"externo."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the main container of Godot editor's window. For example, you can "
"use it to retrieve the size of the container and place your controls "
"accordingly.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render the editor "
"useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [EditorCommandPalette] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current directory being viewed in the [FileSystemDock]. If a "
"file is selected, its base directory will be returned using [method "
"String.get_base_dir] instead."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o diretório atual que está sendo visualizado no [FileSystemDock]. Se "
"um arquivo estiver selecionado, seu diretório base será retornado usando "
"[method String.get_base_dir] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the currently activated feature profile. If the default "
"profile is currently active, an empty string is returned instead.\n"
"In order to get a reference to the [EditorFeatureProfile], you must load the "
"feature profile using [method EditorFeatureProfile.load_from_file].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Feature profiles created via the user interface are loaded from "
"the [code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the "
"[code].profile[/code] extension. The editor configuration folder can be "
"found by using [method EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the current path being viewed in the [FileSystemDock]."
msgstr "Retorna o caminho atual sendo visualizado no [FileSystemDock]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the edited (current) scene's root [Node]."
msgstr "Retorna o [Node] raiz da cena editada (atual)."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the language currently used for the editor interface."
msgstr "Retorna o idioma atualmente usado para a interface do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the editor control responsible for main screen plugins and tools. "
"Use it with plugins that implement [method EditorPlugin._has_main_screen].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This node is a [VBoxContainer], which means that if you add a "
"[Control] child to it, you need to set the child's [member "
"Control.size_flags_vertical] to [constant Control.SIZE_EXPAND_FILL] to make "
"it use the full available space.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the [EditorPaths] singleton."
msgstr "Retorna o singleton [EditorPaths]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the actual scale of the editor UI ([code]1.0[/code] being 100% "
"scale). This can be used to adjust position and dimensions of the UI added "
"by plugins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is set via the [member EditorSettings.interface/"
"editor/appearance/display_scale] and [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/"
"appearance/custom_display_scale] settings. The editor must be restarted for "
"changes to be properly applied."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorSettings] instance."
msgstr "Retorna a instância de [EditorSettings] do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [Theme].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating custom editor UI, prefer accessing theme items "
"directly from your GUI nodes using the [code]get_theme_*[/code] methods."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorToaster]."
msgstr "Retorna o [EditorToaster] do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorUndoRedoManager]."
msgstr "Retorna o [EditorUndoRedoManager] do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the 2D editor [SubViewport]. It does not have a camera. Instead, the "
"view transforms are done directly and can be accessed with [member "
"Viewport.global_canvas_transform]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [SubViewport] do editor 2D. Ele não possui uma câmera. Em vez "
"disso, as transformações de visualização são feitas diretamente e podem ser "
"acessadas com [member Viewport.global_canvas_transform]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the specified 3D editor [SubViewport], from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]3[/code]. The viewport can be used to access the active editor cameras "
"with [method Viewport.get_camera_3d]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [SubViewport] do editor 3D especificado, de [code]0[/code] a "
"[code]3[/code]. A viewport pode ser usada para acessar as câmeras ativas do "
"editor com [method Viewport.get_camera_3d]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [FileSystemDock] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [EditorInspector] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the amount of degrees the 3D editor's rotational snapping is set to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade de graus para a qual o ajuste de rotação do editor 3D "
"está configurado."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the amount of units the 3D editor's scale snapping is set to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade de unidades para a qual o ajuste de escala do editor 3D "
"está definido."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the amount of units the 3D editor's translation snapping is set to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade de unidades para a qual o ajuste de translação do "
"editor 3D está configurado."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array with references to the root nodes of the currently opened "
"scenes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um array com referências aos nós raiz das cenas abertas atualmente."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns an array with the file paths of the currently opened scenes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um array com os caminhos de arquivo das cenas abertas no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the scene that is being played. If no scene is currently "
"being played, returns an empty string."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome da cena que está sendo reproduzida. Se nenhuma cena estiver "
"sendo reproduzida no momento, retorna uma string vazia."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorFileSystem] instance."
msgstr "Retorna a instância do [EditorFileSystem] do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorResourcePreview] instance."
msgstr "Retorna a instância do [EditorResourcePreview] do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the editor's [ScriptEditor] instance.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array containing the paths of the currently selected files (and "
"directories) in the [FileSystemDock]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma matriz contendo os caminhos dos arquivos (e diretórios) "
"atualmente selecionados no [FileSystemDock]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the editor's [EditorSelection] instance."
msgstr "Retorna a instância de [EditorSelection] do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Returns an array of file paths of currently unsaved scenes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma matriz de caminhos de arquivo de cenas não salvas no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Shows the given property on the given [param object] in the editor's "
"Inspector dock. If [param inspector_only] is [code]true[/code], plugins will "
"not attempt to edit [param object]."
msgstr ""
"Mostra a propriedade fornecida no [param object] fornecido no painel "
"Inspetor do editor. Se [param inspector_only] for [code]true[/code], os "
"plugins não tentarão editar o [param object]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if multiple window support is enabled in the "
"editor. Multiple window support is enabled if [i]all[/i] of these statements "
"are true:\n"
"- [member EditorSettings.interface/multi_window/enable] is [code]true[/"
"code].\n"
"- [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/single_window_mode] is "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"- [member Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows] is [code]false[/code]. This is "
"forced to [code]true[/code] on platforms that don't support multiple windows "
"such as Web, or when the [code]--single-window[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url] is "
"used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the 3D editor currently has snapping mode "
"enabled, and [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o editor 3D estiver com o modo de ajuste "
"ativado no momento, e [code]false[/code] caso contrário."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the object has been marked as edited through "
"[method set_object_edited]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o objeto foi marcado como editado por meio de "
"[method set_object_edited]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a scene is currently being played, [code]false[/"
"code] otherwise. Paused scenes are considered as being played."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se uma cena estiver sendo executada no momento, "
"[code]false[/code] caso contrário. Cenas pausadas são consideradas como "
"sendo executadas."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param plugin] is enabled. The "
"plugin name is the same as its directory name."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param plugin] especificado estiver ativado. "
"O nome do plugin é o mesmo que o nome do seu diretório."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns mesh previews rendered at the given size as an [Array] of "
"[Texture2D]s."
msgstr ""
"Retorna pré-visualizações de malha renderizadas no tamanho fornecido como um "
"[Array] de [Texture2D]s."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Marks the current scene tab as unsaved."
msgstr "Marca a aba da cena atual como não salva."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the scene at the given path. If [param set_inherited] is [code]true[/"
"code], creates a new inherited scene."
msgstr ""
"Abre a cena no caminho fornecido. Se [param set_inherited] for [code]true[/"
"code], cria uma nova cena herdada."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Plays the currently active scene."
msgstr "Reproduz a cena atualmente ativa."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Plays the scene specified by its filepath."
msgstr "Reproduz a cena especificada pelo caminho de arquivo dela."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Plays the main scene."
msgstr "Reproduz a cena principal."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for creating an object.\n"
"The [param callback] must take a single argument of type [String], which "
"will contain the type name of the selected object (or the script path of the "
"type, if the type is created from a script), or be an empty string if no "
"item is selected.\n"
"The [param base_type] specifies the base type of objects to display. For "
"example, if you set this to \"Resource\", all types derived from [Resource] "
"will display in the create dialog.\n"
"The [param current_type] will be passed in the search box of the create "
"dialog, and the specified type can be immediately selected when the dialog "
"pops up. If the [param current_type] is not derived from [param base_type], "
"there will be no result of the type in the dialog.\n"
"The [param dialog_title] allows you to define a custom title for the dialog. "
"This is useful if you want to accurately hint the usage of the dialog. If "
"the [param dialog_title] is an empty string, the dialog will use \"Create "
"New 'Base Type'\" as the default title.\n"
"The [param type_blocklist] contains a list of type names, and the types in "
"the blocklist will be hidden from the create dialog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Trying to list the base type in the [param type_blocklist] will "
"hide all types derived from the base type from the create dialog."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive]. The dialog must have no current parent, otherwise "
"the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered]. The dialog must have no current parent, "
"otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered_clamped]. The dialog must have no current "
"parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up the [param dialog] in the editor UI with [method "
"Window.popup_exclusive_centered_ratio]. The dialog must have no current "
"parent, otherwise the method fails.\n"
"See also [method Window.set_unparent_when_invisible]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for selecting a method from [param object]. The "
"[param callback] must take a single argument of type [String] which will "
"contain the name of the selected method or be empty if the dialog is "
"canceled. If [param current_value] is provided, the method will be selected "
"automatically in the method list, if it exists."
msgstr ""
"Abre um diálogo de editor para selecionar um método de [param object]. O "
"[param callback] deve aceitar um único argumento do tipo [String] que "
"conterá o nome do método selecionado ou estará vazio se o diálogo for "
"cancelado. Se [param current_value] for fornecido, o método será selecionado "
"automaticamente na lista de métodos, caso exista."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for selecting a [Node] from the edited scene. The "
"[param callback] must take a single argument of type [NodePath]. It is "
"called on the selected [NodePath] or the empty path [code]^\"\"[/code] if "
"the dialog is canceled. If [param valid_types] is provided, the dialog will "
"only show Nodes that match one of the listed Node types. If [param "
"current_value] is provided, the Node will be automatically selected in the "
"tree, if it exists.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Display the node selection dialog as soon as this node is "
"added to the tree for the first time:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\t\tEditorInterface.popup_node_selector(_on_node_selected, [\"Button\"])\n"
"\n"
"func _on_node_selected(node_path):\n"
"\tif node_path.is_empty():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"node selection canceled\")\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"selected \", node_path)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for selecting properties from [param object]. The "
"[param callback] must take a single argument of type [NodePath]. It is "
"called on the selected property path (see [method "
"NodePath.get_as_property_path]) or the empty path [code]^\"\"[/code] if the "
"dialog is canceled. If [param type_filter] is provided, the dialog will only "
"show properties that match one of the listed [enum Variant.Type] values. If "
"[param current_value] is provided, the property will be selected "
"automatically in the property list, if it exists.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tif Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\t\tEditorInterface.popup_property_selector(this, _on_property_selected, "
"[TYPE_INT])\n"
"\n"
"func _on_property_selected(property_path):\n"
"\tif property_path.is_empty():\n"
"\t\tprint(\"property selection canceled\")\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"selected \", property_path)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up an editor dialog for quick selecting a resource file. The [param "
"callback] must take a single argument of type [String] which will contain "
"the path of the selected resource or be empty if the dialog is canceled. If "
"[param base_types] is provided, the dialog will only show resources that "
"match these types. Only types deriving from [Resource] are supported."
msgstr ""
"Exibe um diálogo do editor para seleção rápida de um arquivo de recurso. O "
"[param callback] deve aceitar um único argumento do tipo [String] que "
"conterá o caminho do recurso selecionado ou estará vazio se o diálogo for "
"cancelado. Se [param base_types] for fornecido, o diálogo mostrará apenas "
"recursos que correspondam a esses tipos. Apenas tipos que derivam de "
"[Resource] são suportados."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Reloads the scene at the given path. Fails if the scene is not open."
msgstr ""
"Recarrega a cena no caminho fornecido. Falha se a cena não estiver aberta."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Restarts the editor. This closes the editor and then opens the same project. "
"If [param save] is [code]true[/code], the project will be saved before "
"restarting."
msgstr ""
"Reinicia o editor. Isso fecha o editor e depois abre o mesmo projeto. Se "
"[param save] é [code]true[/code], o projeto será salvo antes de reiniciar."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Saves all opened scenes in the editor."
msgstr "Salva todas as cenas abertas no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the currently active scene. Returns either [constant OK] or [constant "
"ERR_CANT_CREATE]."
msgstr ""
"Salva a cena ativa no momento. Retorna [constant OK] ou [constant "
"ERR_CANT_CREATE]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Saves the currently active scene as a file at [param path]."
msgstr "Salva a cena ativa atualmente como um arquivo no [param path]."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Selects the file, with the path provided by [param file], in the FileSystem "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"Seleciona o arquivo, com o caminho fornecido por [param file], no dock "
"Sistema de Arquivos (FileSystem)."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Selects and activates the specified feature profile with the given [param "
"profile_name]. Set [param profile_name] to an empty string to reset to the "
"default feature profile.\n"
"A feature profile can be created programmatically using the "
"[EditorFeatureProfile] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The feature profile that gets activated must be located in the "
"[code]feature_profiles[/code] directory, as a file with the [code].profile[/"
"code] extension. If a profile could not be found, an error occurs. The "
"editor configuration folder can be found by using [method "
"EditorPaths.get_config_dir]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the editor's current main screen to the one specified in [param name]. "
"[param name] must match the title of the tab in question exactly (e.g. "
"[code]2D[/code], [code]3D[/code], [code skip-lint]Script[/code], [code]Game[/"
"code], or [code]Asset Store[/code] for default tabs)."
msgstr ""
"Define a tela principal atual do editor para a especificada em [param name]. "
"[param name] deve corresponder exatamente ao título da aba em questão (por "
"exemplo, [code]2D[/code], [code]3D[/code], [code skip-lint]Script[/code], "
"[code]Game[/code] ou [code]Asset Store[/code] para abas padrão)."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If [param edited] is [code]true[/code], the object is marked as edited.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is primarily used by the editor for [Resource] based "
"objects to track their modified state. For example, any changes to an open "
"scene, a resource in the inspector, or an edited script will cause this "
"method to be called with [code]true[/code]. Saving the scene, script, or "
"resource resets the edited state by calling this method with [code]false[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each call to this method increments the object's edited "
"version. This is used to track changes in the editor and to trigger when "
"thumbnails should be regenerated for resources."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the enabled status of a plugin. The plugin name is the same as its "
"directory name."
msgstr ""
"Define o status de habilitação de um plugin. O nome do plugin é o mesmo que "
"o nome do seu diretório."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid "Stops the scene that is currently playing."
msgstr "Interrompe a cena que estiver sendo executada no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables distraction-free mode which hides side docks "
"to increase the space available for the main view."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa o modo sem distrações, que oculta os docks "
"laterais para aumentar o espaço disponível para a visão principal."

#: doc/classes/EditorInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Movie Maker mode is enabled in the editor. See "
"[MovieWriter] for more information."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o modo Movie Maker é ativado no editor. Veja "
"[MovieWriter] para obter mais informações."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid "Gizmo for editing [Node3D] objects."
msgstr "Gizmo para editar objetos [Node3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Gizmo that is used for providing custom visualization and editing (handles "
"and subgizmos) for [Node3D] objects. Can be overridden to create custom "
"gizmos, but for simple gizmos creating an [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] is "
"usually recommended."
msgstr ""
"Gizmo usado para fornecer visualização e edição personalizadas (alças e "
"subgizmos) para objetos [Node3D]. Pode ser substituído para criar gizmos "
"personalizados, mas para gizmos simples, criar um [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] "
"geralmente é recomendado."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a handle being edited (handles must have been "
"previously added by [method add_handles]). This usually means creating an "
"[UndoRedo] action for the change, using the current handle value as \"do\" "
"and the [param restore] argument as \"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restore] "
"value should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the committed "
"handle is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a group of subgizmos being edited (see "
"[method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). This usually means creating an [UndoRedo] "
"action for the change, using the current transforms as \"do\" and the [param "
"restores] transforms as \"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restores] "
"transforms should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return the name of an edited handle (handles must "
"have been previously added by [method add_handles]). Handles can be named "
"for reference to the user when editing.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested "
"handle is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current value of a handle. This value "
"will be requested at the start of an edit and used as the [code]restore[/"
"code] argument in [method _commit_handle].\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested "
"handle is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current transform of a subgizmo. This "
"transform will be requested at the start of an edit and used as the "
"[code]restore[/code] argument in [method _commit_subgizmos]."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para retornar a transformação atual de um subgizmo. "
"Esta transformação será solicitada no início de uma edição e usada como o "
"argumento [code]restore[/code] em [method _commit_subgizmos]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return [code]true[/code] whenever the given handle "
"should be highlighted in the editor.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested "
"handle is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to add all the gizmo elements whenever a gizmo update "
"is requested. It's common to call [method clear] at the beginning of this "
"method and then add visual elements depending on the node's properties."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para adicionar todos os elementos de gizmo sempre que "
"uma atualização de gizmo for solicitada. É comum chamar [method clear] no "
"início deste método e, em seguida, adicionar elementos visuais dependendo "
"das propriedades do nó."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node properties when the user drags a "
"gizmo handle (previously added with [method add_handles]). The provided "
"[param point] is the mouse position in screen coordinates and the [param "
"camera] can be used to convert it to raycasts.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the edited handle "
"is secondary (see [method add_handles] for more information)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node properties during subgizmo editing "
"(see [method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). The [param transform] is given in the "
"[Node3D]'s local coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para atualizar as propriedades do nó durante a edição "
"de subgizmos (veja [method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] e [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). O [param transform] é fornecido no sistema "
"de coordenadas locais do [Node3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse drag box "
"selection. Given a [param camera] and a [param frustum], this method should "
"return which subgizmos are contained within the frustum. The [param frustum] "
"argument consists of an array with all the [Plane]s that make up the "
"selection frustum. The returned value should contain a list of unique "
"subgizmo identifiers, which can have any non-negative value and will be used "
"in other virtual methods like [method _get_subgizmo_transform] or [method "
"_commit_subgizmos]."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para permitir a seleção de subgizmos usando a seleção "
"de caixa de arrasto do mouse. Dados um [param camera] e um [param frustum], "
"este método deve retornar quais subgizmos estão contidos dentro do frustum. "
"O argumento [param frustum] consiste em um array com todos os [Plane]s que "
"compõem o frustum de seleção. O valor retornado deve conter uma lista de "
"identificadores de subgizmo exclusivos, que podem ter qualquer valor não "
"negativo e serão usados em outros métodos virtuais como [method "
"_get_subgizmo_transform] ou [method _commit_subgizmos]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse clicks. Given "
"a [param camera] and a [param point] in screen coordinates, this method "
"should return which subgizmo should be selected. The returned value should "
"be a unique subgizmo identifier, which can have any non-negative value and "
"will be used in other virtual methods like [method _get_subgizmo_transform] "
"or [method _commit_subgizmos]."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para permitir a seleção de subgizmos usando cliques do "
"mouse. Dado um [param camera] e um [param point] em coordenadas de tela, "
"este método deve retornar qual subgizmo deve ser selecionado. O valor "
"retornado deve ser um identificador de subgizmo exclusivo, que pode ter "
"qualquer valor não negativo e será usado em outros métodos virtuais como "
"[method _get_subgizmo_transform] ou [method _commit_subgizmos]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the specified [param segments] to the gizmo's collision shape for "
"picking. Call this method during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona os [param segments] especificados à forma de colisão do gizmo para "
"seleção. Chame este método durante [method _redraw]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Adds collision triangles to the gizmo for picking. A [TriangleMesh] can be "
"generated from a regular [Mesh] too. Call this method during [method "
"_redraw]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona triângulos de colisão ao gizmo para seleção. Um [TriangleMesh] "
"também pode ser gerado a partir de um [Mesh] regular. Chame este método "
"durante [method _redraw]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a list of handles (points) which can be used to edit the properties of "
"the gizmo's [Node3D]. The [param ids] argument can be used to specify a "
"custom identifier for each handle, if an empty array is passed, the ids will "
"be assigned automatically from the [param handles] argument order.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument marks the added handles as secondary, meaning "
"they will normally have lower selection priority than regular handles. When "
"the user is holding the shift key secondary handles will switch to have "
"higher priority than regular handles. This change in priority can be used to "
"place multiple handles at the same point while still giving the user control "
"on their selection.\n"
"There are virtual methods which will be called upon editing of these "
"handles. Call this method during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Adds lines to the gizmo (as sets of 2 points), with a given material. The "
"lines are used for visualizing the gizmo. Call this method during [method "
"_redraw]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona linhas ao gizmo (como conjuntos de 2 pontos), com um material "
"fornecido. As linhas são usadas para visualizar o gizmo. Chame este método "
"durante [method _redraw]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a mesh to the gizmo with the specified [param material], local [param "
"transform] and [param skeleton]. Call this method during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma malha ao gizmo com o [param material], a [param transform] "
"local e o [param skeleton] especificados. Chame este método durante [method "
"_redraw]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an unscaled billboard for visualization and selection. Call this method "
"during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um billboard não escalado para visualização e seleção. Chame este "
"método durante [method _redraw]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Removes everything in the gizmo including meshes, collisions and handles."
msgstr "Remove tudo no gizmo, incluindo malhas, colisões e alças."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid "Returns the [Node3D] node associated with this gizmo."
msgstr "Retorna o nó [Node3D] associado a este gizmo."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] that owns this gizmo. It's useful to "
"retrieve materials using [method EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.get_material]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] que possui este gizmo. É útil para "
"recuperar materiais usando [method EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.get_material]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of the currently selected subgizmos. Can be used to highlight "
"selected elements during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma lista dos subgizmos selecionados no momento. Pode ser usado para "
"destacar elementos selecionados durante [method _redraw]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given subgizmo is currently selected. Can "
"be used to highlight selected elements during [method _redraw]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o subgizmo fornecido estiver selecionado no "
"momento. Pode ser usado para destacar elementos selecionados durante [method "
"_redraw]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the gizmo's hidden state. If [code]true[/code], the gizmo will be "
"hidden. If [code]false[/code], it will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Define o estado oculto do gizmo. Se [code]true[/code], o gizmo será "
"ocultado. Se [code]false[/code], será exibido."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the reference [Node3D] node for the gizmo. [param node] must inherit "
"from [Node3D]."
msgstr ""
"Define o nó [Node3D] de referência para o gizmo. [param node] deve herdar de "
"[Node3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid "A class used by the editor to define Node3D gizmo types."
msgstr "Uma classe usada pelo editor para definir tipos de gizmo de Node3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] allows you to define a new type of Gizmo. There "
"are two main ways to do so: extending [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin] for the "
"simpler gizmos, or creating a new [EditorNode3DGizmo] type. See the tutorial "
"in the documentation for more info.\n"
"To use [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_node_3d_gizmo_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid "Node3D gizmo plugins"
msgstr "Plugins de gizmo Node3D"

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define whether the gizmos handled by this plugin can "
"be hidden or not. Returns [code]true[/code] if not overridden."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para definir se os gizmos manipulados por este plugin "
"podem ser ocultados ou não. Retorna [code]true[/code] se não for substituído."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define whether the gizmos should commit when the "
"final handle position is the same as the initial one. Returns [code]false[/"
"code] if not overridden."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para definir se os gizmos devem ser efetivados quando "
"a posição final da alça for igual à inicial. Retorna [code]false[/code] se "
"não for substituído."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a handle being edited (handles must have been "
"previously added by [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] during [method "
"_redraw]). This usually means creating an [UndoRedo] action for the change, "
"using the current handle value as \"do\" and the [param restore] argument as "
"\"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restore] "
"value should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the committed "
"handle is secondary (see [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more "
"information).\n"
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to commit a group of subgizmos being edited (see "
"[method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). This usually means creating an [UndoRedo] "
"action for the change, using the current transforms as \"do\" and the [param "
"restores] transforms as \"undo\".\n"
"If the [param cancel] argument is [code]true[/code], the [param restores] "
"transforms should be directly set, without any [UndoRedo] action. As with "
"all subgizmo methods, transforms are given in local space respect to the "
"gizmo's Node3D. Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return a custom [EditorNode3DGizmo] for the 3D nodes "
"of your choice, return [code]null[/code] for the rest of nodes. See also "
"[method _has_gizmo]."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para retornar um [EditorNode3DGizmo] personalizado "
"para os nós 3D de sua escolha, retorne [code]null[/code] para o restante dos "
"nós. Veja também [method _has_gizmo]."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to provide the name that will appear in the gizmo "
"visibility menu."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para fornecer o nome que aparecerá no menu de "
"visibilidade do gizmo."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to provide gizmo's handle names. The [param secondary] "
"argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested handle is secondary (see "
"[method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more information). Called for "
"this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para fornecer nomes de alças de gizmo. O argumento "
"[param secondary] é [code]true[/code] quando a alça solicitada for "
"secundária (consulte [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] para obter mais "
"informações). Chamado para os gizmos ativos deste plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current value of a handle. This value "
"will be requested at the start of an edit and used as the [code]restore[/"
"code] argument in [method _commit_handle].\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the requested "
"handle is secondary (see [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more "
"information).\n"
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to set the gizmo's priority. Gizmos with higher "
"priority will have precedence when processing inputs like handles or "
"subgizmos selection.\n"
"All built-in editor gizmos return a priority of [code]-1[/code]. If not "
"overridden, this method will return [code]0[/code], which means custom "
"gizmos will automatically get higher priority than built-in gizmos."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return the current transform of a subgizmo. As with "
"all subgizmo methods, the transform should be in local space respect to the "
"gizmo's Node3D. This transform will be requested at the start of an edit and "
"used in the [code]restore[/code] argument in [method _commit_subgizmos]. "
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para retornar a transformação atual de um subgizmo. "
"Assim como em todos os métodos de subgizmo, a transformação deve estar no "
"espaço local em relação ao Node3D do gizmo. Esta transformação será "
"solicitada no início de uma edição e usada no argumento [code]restore[/code] "
"em [method _commit_subgizmos]. Chamado para os gizmos ativos deste plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define which Node3D nodes have a gizmo from this "
"plugin. Whenever a [Node3D] node is added to a scene this method is called, "
"if it returns [code]true[/code] the node gets a generic [EditorNode3DGizmo] "
"assigned and is added to this plugin's list of active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para definir quais nós Node3D têm um gizmo deste "
"plugin. Sempre que um nó [Node3D] é adicionado a uma cena, este método é "
"chamado; se ele retornar [code]true[/code], o nó recebe um "
"[EditorNode3DGizmo] genérico atribuído e é adicionado à lista de gizmos "
"ativos deste plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to return [code]true[/code] whenever to given handle "
"should be highlighted in the editor. The [param secondary] argument is "
"[code]true[/code] when the requested handle is secondary (see [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more information). Called for this "
"plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para retornar [code]true[/code] sempre que a alça "
"fornecida deva ser destacada no editor. O argumento [param secondary] é "
"[code]true[/code] quando a alça solicitada é secundária (veja [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] para mais informações). Chamado para os "
"gizmos ativos deste plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define whether Node3D with this gizmo should be "
"selectable even when the gizmo is hidden."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para definir se Node3D com este gizmo deve ser "
"selecionável mesmo quando o gizmo estiver oculto."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to add all the gizmo elements whenever a gizmo update "
"is requested. It's common to call [method EditorNode3DGizmo.clear] at the "
"beginning of this method and then add visual elements depending on the "
"node's properties."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para adicionar todos os elementos do gizmo sempre que "
"uma atualização do gizmo for solicitada. É comum chamar [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.clear] no início deste método e, em seguida, adicionar "
"elementos visuais dependendo das propriedades do nó."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node's properties when the user drags a "
"gizmo handle (previously added with [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles]). "
"The provided [param screen_pos] is the mouse position in screen coordinates "
"and the [param camera] can be used to convert it to raycasts.\n"
"The [param secondary] argument is [code]true[/code] when the edited handle "
"is secondary (see [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles] for more "
"information).\n"
"Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to update the node properties during subgizmo editing "
"(see [method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] and [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). The [param transform] is given in the "
"Node3D's local coordinate system. Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para atualizar as propriedades do nó durante a edição "
"do subgizmo (veja [method _subgizmos_intersect_ray] e [method "
"_subgizmos_intersect_frustum]). O [param transform] é fornecido no sistema "
"de coordenadas locais do Node3D. Chamado para os gizmos ativos deste plug-in."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse drag box "
"selection. Given a [param camera] and [param frustum_planes], this method "
"should return which subgizmos are contained within the frustums. The [param "
"frustum_planes] argument consists of an array with all the [Plane]s that "
"make up the selection frustum. The returned value should contain a list of "
"unique subgizmo identifiers, these identifiers can have any non-negative "
"value and will be used in other virtual methods like [method "
"_get_subgizmo_transform] or [method _commit_subgizmos]. Called for this "
"plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para permitir a seleção de subgizmos usando a seleção "
"de caixa de arrasto do mouse. Dado um [param camera] e [param "
"frustum_planes], este método deve retornar quais subgizmos estão contidos "
"dentro dos frustuns. O argumento [param frustum_planes] consiste em um array "
"com todos os [Plane]s que compõem o frustum de seleção. O valor retornado "
"deve conter uma lista de identificadores de subgizmo exclusivos, esses "
"identificadores podem ter qualquer valor não negativo e serão usados em "
"outros métodos virtuais como [method _get_subgizmo_transform] ou [method "
"_commit_subgizmos]. Chamado para os gizmos ativos deste plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to allow selecting subgizmos using mouse clicks. Given "
"a [param camera] and a [param screen_pos] in screen coordinates, this method "
"should return which subgizmo should be selected. The returned value should "
"be a unique subgizmo identifier, which can have any non-negative value and "
"will be used in other virtual methods like [method _get_subgizmo_transform] "
"or [method _commit_subgizmos]. Called for this plugin's active gizmos."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para permitir a seleção de subgizmos usando cliques do "
"mouse. Dados um [param camera] e um [param screen_pos] em coordenadas de "
"tela, este método deve retornar qual subgizmo deve ser selecionado. O valor "
"retornado deve ser um identificador de subgizmo exclusivo, que pode ter "
"qualquer valor não negativo e será usado em outros métodos virtuais como "
"[method _get_subgizmo_transform] ou [method _commit_subgizmos]. Chamado para "
"os gizmos ativos deste plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new material to the internal material list for the plugin. It can "
"then be accessed with [method get_material]. Should not be overridden."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um novo material à lista de materiais internos do plugin. Ele pode "
"então ser acessado com [method get_material]. Não deve ser substituído."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a handle material with its variants (selected and/or editable) and "
"adds them to the internal material list. They can then be accessed with "
"[method get_material] and used in [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_handles]. "
"Should not be overridden.\n"
"You can optionally provide a texture to use instead of the default icon."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an icon material with its variants (selected and/or editable) and "
"adds them to the internal material list. They can then be accessed with "
"[method get_material] and used in [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_unscaled_billboard]. Should not be overridden."
msgstr ""
"Cria um material de ícone com suas variantes (selecionado e/ou editável) e "
"os adiciona à lista interna de materiais. Eles podem então ser acessados com "
"[method get_material] e usados em [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_unscaled_billboard]. Não deve ser substituído."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an unshaded material with its variants (selected and/or editable) "
"and adds them to the internal material list. They can then be accessed with "
"[method get_material] and used in [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_mesh] and "
"[method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_lines]. Should not be overridden."
msgstr ""
"Cria um material não sombreado com suas variantes (selecionado e/ou "
"editável) e as adiciona à lista interna de materiais. Elas podem então ser "
"acessadas com [method get_material] e usadas em [method "
"EditorNode3DGizmo.add_mesh] e [method EditorNode3DGizmo.add_lines]. Não deve "
"ser sobrescrito."

#: doc/classes/EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets material from the internal list of materials. If an [EditorNode3DGizmo] "
"is provided, it will try to get the corresponding variant (selected and/or "
"editable)."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o material da lista interna de materiais. Se um [EditorNode3DGizmo] "
"for fornecido, ele tentará obter a variante correspondente (selecionada e/ou "
"editável)."

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"Editor-only singleton that returns paths to various OS-specific data folders "
"and files."
msgstr ""
"Singleton exclusivo do editor que retorna caminhos para várias pastas e "
"arquivos de dados específicos do SO."

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"This editor-only singleton returns OS-specific paths to various data folders "
"and files. It can be used in editor plugins to ensure files are saved in the "
"correct location on each operating system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This singleton is not accessible in exported projects. "
"Attempting to access it in an exported project will result in a script error "
"as the singleton won't be declared. To prevent script errors in exported "
"projects, use [method Engine.has_singleton] to check whether the singleton "
"is available before using it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Linux/BSD platform, Godot complies with the [url=https://"
"specifications.freedesktop.org/basedir-spec/basedir-spec-latest.html]XDG "
"Base Directory Specification[/url]. You can override environment variables "
"following the specification to change the editor and project data paths."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid "File paths in Godot projects"
msgstr "Caminhos de arquivo em projetos Godot"

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the user's cache folder. This folder should be "
"used for temporary data that can be removed safely whenever the editor is "
"closed (such as generated resource thumbnails).\n"
"[b]Default paths per platform:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Godot\\\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Caches/Godot/\n"
"- Linux: ~/.cache/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the user's configuration folder. This folder "
"should be used for [i]persistent[/i] user configuration files.\n"
"[b]Default paths per platform:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %APPDATA%\\Godot\\                    (same as `get_data_dir()`)\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Application Support/Godot/  (same as `get_data_dir()`)\n"
"- Linux: ~/.config/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the user's data folder. This folder should be "
"used for [i]persistent[/i] user data files such as installed export "
"templates.\n"
"[b]Default paths per platform:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- Windows: %APPDATA%\\Godot\\                    (same as "
"`get_config_dir()`)\n"
"- macOS: ~/Library/Application Support/Godot/  (same as `get_config_dir()`)\n"
"- Linux: ~/.local/share/godot/\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the relative path to the editor settings for this project. This is "
"usually [code]\"res://.godot/editor\"[/code]. Projects all have a unique "
"subdirectory inside the settings path where project-specific editor settings "
"are saved."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho relativo para as configurações do editor para este "
"projeto. Geralmente é [code]\"res://.godot/editor\"[/code]. Todos os "
"projetos possuem um subdiretório exclusivo dentro do caminho de "
"configurações onde as configurações do editor específicas do projeto são "
"salvas."

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the absolute path to the self-contained file that makes the current "
"Godot editor instance be considered as self-contained. Returns an empty "
"string if the current Godot editor instance isn't self-contained. See also "
"[method is_self_contained]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho absoluto para o arquivo autossuficiente que faz com que a "
"instância atual do editor do Godot seja considerada autossuficiente. Retorna "
"uma string vazia se a instância atual do editor do Godot não for "
"autossuficiente. Consulte também [method is_self_contained]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPaths.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the editor is marked as self-contained, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise. When self-contained mode is enabled, user "
"configuration, data and cache files are saved in an [code]editor_data/[/"
"code] folder next to the editor binary. This makes portable usage easier and "
"ensures the Godot editor minimizes file writes outside its own folder. Self-"
"contained mode is not available for exported projects.\n"
"Self-contained mode can be enabled by creating a file named [code]._sc_[/"
"code] or [code]_sc_[/code] in the same folder as the editor binary or "
"macOS .app bundle while the editor is not running. See also [method "
"get_self_contained_file].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, quarantine flag should be manually removed before "
"using self-contained mode, see [url=https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/"
"tutorials/export/running_on_macos.html]Running on macOS[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, placing [code]_sc_[/code] or any other file "
"inside .app bundle will break digital signature and make it non-portable, "
"consider placing it in the same folder as the .app bundle instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Steam release of Godot uses self-contained mode by default."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Used by the editor to extend its functionality."
msgstr "Usado pelo editor para estender sua funcionalidade."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Plugins are used by the editor to extend functionality. The most common "
"types of plugins are those which edit a given node or resource type, import "
"plugins and export plugins. See also [EditorScript] to add functions to the "
"editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some names in this class contain \"left\" or \"right\" (e.g. "
"[constant DOCK_SLOT_LEFT_UL]). These APIs assume left-to-right layout, and "
"would be backwards when using right-to-left layout. These names are kept for "
"compatibility reasons."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Editor plugins documentation index"
msgstr "Índice de documentação de plugins do editor"

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This method is called when the editor is about to save the project, switch "
"to another tab, etc. It asks the plugin to apply any pending state changes "
"to ensure consistency.\n"
"This is used, for example, in shader editors to let the plugin know that it "
"must apply the shader code being written by the user to the object."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This method is called when the editor is about to run the project. The "
"plugin can then perform required operations before the project runs.\n"
"This method must return a boolean. If this method returns [code]false[/"
"code], the project will not run. The run is aborted immediately, so this "
"also prevents all other plugins' [method _build] methods from running."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Clear all the state and reset the object being edited to zero. This ensures "
"your plugin does not keep editing a currently existing node, or a node from "
"the wrong scene."
msgstr ""
"Limpa todo o estado e redefine o objeto sendo editado para zero. Isso "
"garante que seu plugin não continue editando um nó atualmente existente ou "
"um nó da cena errada."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the user disables the [EditorPlugin] in the Plugin "
"tab of the project settings window."
msgstr ""
"Chamado pelo engine quando o usuário ativa o [EditorPlugin] na aba Plugin da "
"janela de configurações do projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This function is used for plugins that edit specific object types (nodes or "
"resources). It requests the editor to edit the given object.\n"
"[param object] can be [code]null[/code] if the plugin was editing an object, "
"but there is no longer any selected object handled by this plugin. It can be "
"used to cleanup editing state."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the user enables the [EditorPlugin] in the Plugin "
"tab of the project settings window."
msgstr ""
"Chamado pelo engine quando o usuário ativa o [EditorPlugin] na aba Plugin da "
"janela de configurações do projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the 3D editor's viewport is updated. [param "
"viewport_control] is an overlay on top of the viewport and it can be used "
"for drawing. You can update the viewport manually by calling [method "
"update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_3d_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"\t\t# Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tupdate_overlays()\n"
"\t\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Forward3DDrawOverViewport(Control viewportControl)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\tviewportControl.DrawCircle(viewportControl.GetLocalMousePosition(), 64, "
"Colors.White);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"viewportCamera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tUpdateOverlays();\n"
"\t\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Pass;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Chamado pela engine quando a viewport do editor 3D é atualizada. [param "
"viewport_control] é uma sobreposição no topo da viewport e pode ser usado "
"para desenho. Você pode atualizar a viewport manualmente chamando [method "
"update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_3d_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# Desenha um círculo na posição do cursor.\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"\t\t# Redesenha a viewport quando o cursor é movido.\n"
"\t\tupdate_overlays()\n"
"\t\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Forward3DDrawOverViewport(Control viewportControl)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Desenha um círculo na posição do cursor.\n"
"\tviewportControl.DrawCircle(viewportControl.GetLocalMousePosition(), 64, "
"Colors.White);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"viewportCamera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Redesenha a viewport quando o cursor é movido.\n"
"\t\tUpdateOverlays();\n"
"\t\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Pass;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This method is the same as [method _forward_3d_draw_over_viewport], except "
"it draws on top of everything. Useful when you need an extra layer that "
"shows over anything else.\n"
"You need to enable calling of this method by using [method "
"set_force_draw_over_forwarding_enabled]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called when there is a root node in the current edited scene, [method "
"_handles] is implemented, and an [InputEvent] happens in the 3D viewport. "
"The return value decides whether the [InputEvent] is consumed or forwarded "
"to other [EditorPlugin]s. See [enum AfterGUIInput] for options.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"camera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This method must return [constant AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS] in order to forward "
"the [InputEvent] to other Editor classes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP if event is InputEventMouseMotion "
"else EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"camera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn @event is InputEventMouseMotion ? EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop : "
"EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Pass;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando há um nó raiz na cena editada atual, o [method _handles] está "
"implementado e um [InputEvent] ocorre na viewport 3D. O valor retornado "
"decide se o [InputEvent] é consumido ou reencaminhado para outros "
"[EditorPlugin]s. Veja [enum AfterGUIInput] para as opções.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Impede que o InputEvent alcance outras classes do Editor.\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Impede que o InputEvent alcance outras classes do Editor.\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"camera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Este método deve retornar [constant AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS] para reencaminhar "
"o [InputEvent] para outras classes do Editor.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Consume o InputEventMouseMotion e reencaminha outros tipos de InputEvent.\n"
"func _forward_3d_gui_input(camera, event):\n"
"\treturn EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_STOP if event is InputEventMouseMotion "
"else EditorPlugin.AFTER_GUI_INPUT_PASS\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Consume o InputEventMouseMotion e reencaminha outros tipos de "
"InputEvent.\n"
"public override EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput _Forward3DGuiInput(Camera3D "
"camera, InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn @event is InputEventMouseMotion ? EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Stop : "
"EditorPlugin.AfterGuiInput.Pass;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called by the engine when the 2D editor's viewport is updated. [param "
"viewport_control] is an overlay on top of the viewport and it can be used "
"for drawing. You can update the viewport manually by calling [method "
"update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"\t\t# Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tupdate_overlays()\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _ForwardCanvasDrawOverViewport(Control "
"viewportControl)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Draw a circle at the cursor's position.\n"
"\tviewportControl.DrawCircle(viewportControl.GetLocalMousePosition(), 64, "
"Colors.White);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override bool _ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Redraw the viewport when the cursor is moved.\n"
"\t\tUpdateOverlays();\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Chamado pelo motor quando a viewport do editor 2D é atualizada. O [param "
"viewport_control] é um overlay sobre a viewport e pode ser usado para "
"desenhar. Você pode atualizar a viewport manualmente chamando [method "
"update_overlays].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport(overlay):\n"
"\t# Desenha um círculo na posição do cursor.\n"
"\toverlay.draw_circle(overlay.get_local_mouse_position(), 64, Color.WHITE)\n"
"\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"\t\t# Redesenha a viewport quando o cursor é movido.\n"
"\t\tupdate_overlays()\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _ForwardCanvasDrawOverViewport(Control "
"viewportControl)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Desenha um círculo na posição do cursor.\n"
"\tviewportControl.DrawCircle(viewportControl.GetLocalMousePosition(), 64, "
"Colors.White);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override bool _ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Redesenha a viewport quando o cursor é movido.\n"
"\t\tUpdateOverlays();\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This method is the same as [method _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport], "
"except it draws on top of everything. Useful when you need an extra layer "
"that shows over anything else.\n"
"You need to enable calling of this method by using [method "
"set_force_draw_over_forwarding_enabled]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called when there is a root node in the current edited scene, [method "
"_handles] is implemented, and an [InputEvent] happens in the 2D viewport. If "
"this method returns [code]true[/code], [param event] is intercepted by this "
"[EditorPlugin], otherwise [param event] is forwarded to other Editor "
"classes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\treturn true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Prevents the InputEvent from reaching other Editor classes.\n"
"public override bool ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn true;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This method must return [code]false[/code] in order to forward the "
"[InputEvent] to other Editor classes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif (event is InputEventMouseMotion):\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Consumes InputEventMouseMotion and forwards other InputEvent types.\n"
"public override bool _ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando há um nó raiz na cena editada atual, o [method _handles] está "
"implementado e um [InputEvent] ocorre na viewport 2D. Se este método "
"retornar [code]true[/code], o [param event] é interceptado por este "
"[EditorPlugin], caso contrário, o [param event] é reencaminhado para outras "
"classes do Editor.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Impede que o InputEvent alcance outras classes do Editor.\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\treturn true\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Impede que o InputEvent alcance outras classes do Editor.\n"
"public override bool ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn true;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Este método deve retornar [code]false[/code] para reencaminhar o "
"[InputEvent] para outras classes do Editor.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Consume o InputEventMouseMotion e reencaminha outros tipos de InputEvent.\n"
"func _forward_canvas_gui_input(event):\n"
"\tif (event is InputEventMouseMotion):\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Consume o InputEventMouseMotion e reencaminha outros tipos de "
"InputEvent.\n"
"public override bool _ForwardCanvasGuiInput(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseMotion)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This is for editors that edit script-based objects. You can return a list of "
"breakpoints in the format ([code]script:line[/code]), for example: "
"[code]res://path_to_script.gd:25[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Isto é para editores que editam objetos baseados em script. Você pode "
"retornar uma lista de pontos de interrupção no formato ([code]script:line[/"
"code]), por exemplo: [code]res://path_to_script.gd:25[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method in your plugin to return a [Texture2D] in order to give "
"it an icon.\n"
"For main screen plugins, this appears at the top of the screen, to the right "
"of the \"2D\", \"3D\", \"Script\", \"Game\", and \"Asset Store\" buttons.\n"
"Ideally, the plugin icon should be white with a transparent background and "
"16×16 pixels in size.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_plugin_icon():\n"
"\t# You can use a custom icon:\n"
"\treturn preload(\"res://addons/my_plugin/my_plugin_icon.svg\")\n"
"\t# Or use a built-in icon:\n"
"\treturn EditorInterface.get_editor_theme().get_icon(\"Node\", "
"\"EditorIcons\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Texture2D _GetPluginIcon()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// You can use a custom icon:\n"
"\treturn ResourceLoader.Load<Texture2D>(\"res://addons/my_plugin/"
"my_plugin_icon.svg\");\n"
"\t// Or use a built-in icon:\n"
"\treturn EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorTheme().GetIcon(\"Node\", "
"\"EditorIcons\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Sobrescreva este método no seu plugin para retornar um [Texture2D] para dar "
"a ele um ícone.\n"
"Para plugins de tela principal, isso aparece na parte superior da tela, à "
"direita dos botões \"2D\", \"3D\", \"Script\", \"Game\" e \"Asset Store\".\n"
"Idealmente, o ícone do plugin deve ser branco com um fundo transparente e "
"tamanho de 16×16 pixels.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get_plugin_icon():\n"
"\t# Você pode usar um ícone personalizado:\n"
"\treturn preload(\"res://addons/my_plugin/my_plugin_icon.svg\")\n"
"\t# Ou usar um ícone integrado:\n"
"\treturn EditorInterface.get_editor_theme().get_icon(\"Node\", "
"\"EditorIcons\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Texture2D _GetPluginIcon()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Você pode usar um ícone personalizado:\n"
"\treturn ResourceLoader.Load<Texture2D>(\"res://addons/my_plugin/"
"my_plugin_icon.svg\");\n"
"\t// Ou usar um ícone integrado:\n"
"\treturn EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorTheme().GetIcon(\"Node\", "
"\"EditorIcons\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method in your plugin to provide the name of the plugin when "
"displayed in the Godot editor.\n"
"For main screen plugins, this appears at the top of the screen, to the right "
"of the \"2D\", \"3D\", \"Script\", \"Game\", and \"Asset Store\" buttons."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to provide a state data you want to be saved, like view "
"position, grid settings, folding, etc. This is used when saving the scene "
"(so state is kept when opening it again) and for switching tabs (so state "
"can be restored when the tab returns). This data is automatically saved for "
"each scene in an [code]editstate[/code] file in the editor metadata folder. "
"If you want to store global (scene-independent) editor data for your plugin, "
"you can use [method _get_window_layout] instead.\n"
"Use [method _set_state] to restore your saved state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should not be used to save important settings that "
"should persist with the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must implement [method _get_plugin_name] for the state to "
"be stored and restored correctly.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_state():\n"
"\tvar state = { \"zoom\": zoom, \"preferred_color\": my_color }\n"
"\treturn state\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to provide a custom message that lists unsaved changes. "
"The editor will call this method when exiting or when closing a scene, and "
"display the returned string in a confirmation dialog. Return empty string if "
"the plugin has no unsaved changes.\n"
"When closing a scene, [param for_scene] is the path to the scene being "
"closed. You can use it to handle built-in resources in that scene.\n"
"If the user confirms saving, [method _save_external_data] will be called, "
"before closing the editor.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_unsaved_status(for_scene):\n"
"\tif not unsaved:\n"
"\t\treturn \"\"\n"
"\n"
"\tif for_scene.is_empty():\n"
"\t\treturn \"Save changes in MyCustomPlugin before closing?\"\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\treturn \"Scene %s has changes from MyCustomPlugin. Save before closing?"
"\" % for_scene.get_file()\n"
"\n"
"func _save_external_data():\n"
"\tunsaved = false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If the plugin has no scene-specific changes, you can ignore the calls when "
"closing scenes:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_unsaved_status(for_scene):\n"
"\tif not for_scene.is_empty():\n"
"\t\treturn \"\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to provide the GUI layout of the plugin or any other "
"data you want to be stored. This is used to save the project's editor layout "
"when [method queue_save_layout] is called or the editor layout was changed "
"(for example changing the position of a dock). The data is stored in the "
"[code]editor_layout.cfg[/code] file in the editor metadata directory.\n"
"Use [method _set_window_layout] to restore your saved layout.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _get_window_layout(configuration):\n"
"\tconfiguration.set_value(\"MyPlugin\", \"window_position\", "
"$Window.position)\n"
"\tconfiguration.set_value(\"MyPlugin\", \"icon_color\", $Icon.modulate)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Implement this function if your plugin edits a specific type of object "
"(Resource or Node). If you return [code]true[/code], then you will get the "
"functions [method _edit] and [method _make_visible] called when the editor "
"requests them. If you have declared the methods [method "
"_forward_canvas_gui_input] and [method _forward_3d_gui_input] these will be "
"called too.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each plugin should handle only one type of objects at a time. "
"If a plugin handles more types of objects and they are edited at the same "
"time, it will result in errors."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this is a main screen editor plugin (it goes in "
"the workspace selector together with [b]2D[/b], [b]3D[/b], [b]Script[/b], "
"[b]Game[/b], and [b]Asset Store[/b]).\n"
"When the plugin's workspace is selected, other main screen plugins will be "
"hidden, but your plugin will not appear automatically. It needs to be added "
"as a child of [method EditorInterface.get_editor_main_screen] and made "
"visible inside [method _make_visible].\n"
"Use [method _get_plugin_name] and [method _get_plugin_icon] to customize the "
"plugin button's appearance.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var plugin_control\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tplugin_control = preload(\"my_plugin_control.tscn\").instantiate()\n"
"\tEditorInterface.get_editor_main_screen().add_child(plugin_control)\n"
"\tplugin_control.hide()\n"
"\n"
"func _has_main_screen():\n"
"\treturn true\n"
"\n"
"func _make_visible(visible):\n"
"\tplugin_control.visible = visible\n"
"\n"
"func _get_plugin_name():\n"
"\treturn \"My Super Cool Plugin 3000\"\n"
"\n"
"func _get_plugin_icon():\n"
"\treturn EditorInterface.get_editor_theme().get_icon(\"Node\", "
"\"EditorIcons\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This function will be called when the editor is requested to become visible. "
"It is used for plugins that edit a specific object type.\n"
"Remember that you have to manage the visibility of all your editor controls "
"manually."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This function is called when an individual scene is about to be played in "
"the editor. [param args] is a list of command line arguments that will be "
"passed to the new Godot instance, which will be replaced by the list "
"returned by this function.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _run_scene(scene, args):\n"
"\targs.append(\"--an-extra-argument\")\n"
"\treturn args\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Text that is printed in this method will not be visible in the "
"editor's Output panel unless [member EditorSettings.run/output/"
"always_clear_output_on_play] is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This method is called after the editor saves the project or when it's "
"closed. It asks the plugin to save edited external scenes/resources."
msgstr ""
"Este método é chamado após o editor salvar o projeto ou quando ele é "
"fechado. Ele solicita que o plugin salve cenas/recursos externos editados."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Restore the state saved by [method _get_state]. This method is called when "
"the current scene tab is changed in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Your plugin must implement [method _get_plugin_name], otherwise "
"it will not be recognized and this method will not be called.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _set_state(data):\n"
"\tzoom = data.get(\"zoom\", 1.0)\n"
"\tpreferred_color = data.get(\"my_color\", Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Restore the plugin GUI layout and data saved by [method _get_window_layout]. "
"This method is called for every plugin on editor startup. Use the provided "
"[param configuration] file to read your saved data.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _set_window_layout(configuration):\n"
"\t$Window.position = configuration.get_value(\"MyPlugin\", "
"\"window_position\", Vector2())\n"
"\t$Icon.modulate = configuration.get_value(\"MyPlugin\", \"icon_color\", "
"Color.WHITE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Adds a script at [param path] to the Autoload list as [param name]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um script em [param path] à lista de Inicialização Automática como "
"[param name]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a plugin to the context menu. [param slot] is the context menu where "
"the plugin will be added.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A plugin instance can belong only to a single context menu slot."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method add_dock] instead, with [member EditorDock.default_slot] set to "
"[constant DOCK_SLOT_BOTTOM]."
msgstr ""
"Use [method add_dock] em vez disso, com [member EditorDock.default_slot] "
"definido como [constant DOCK_SLOT_BOTTOM]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a control to the bottom panel (together with Output, Debug, Animation, "
"etc.). Returns a reference to a button that is outside the scene tree. It's "
"up to you to hide/show the button when needed. When your plugin is "
"deactivated, make sure to remove your custom control with [method "
"remove_control_from_bottom_panel] and free it with [method "
"Node.queue_free].\n"
"[param shortcut] is a shortcut that, when activated, will toggle the bottom "
"panel's visibility. The shortcut object is only set when this control is "
"added to the bottom panel.\n"
"[b]Note[/b] See the default editor bottom panel shortcuts in the Editor "
"Settings for inspiration. By convention, they all use [kbd]Alt[/kbd] "
"modifier."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom control to a container in the editor UI.\n"
"Please remember that you have to manage the visibility of your custom "
"controls yourself (and likely hide it after adding it).\n"
"When your plugin is deactivated, make sure to remove your custom control "
"with [method remove_control_from_container] and free it with [method "
"Node.queue_free]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method add_dock] instead."
msgstr "Use [method add_dock] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the control to a specific dock slot.\n"
"If the dock is repositioned and as long as the plugin is active, the editor "
"will save the dock position on further sessions.\n"
"When your plugin is deactivated, make sure to remove your custom control "
"with [method remove_control_from_docks] and free it with [method "
"Node.queue_free].\n"
"Optionally, you can specify a shortcut parameter. When pressed, this "
"shortcut will open and focus the dock."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom type, which will appear in the list of nodes or resources.\n"
"When a given node or resource is selected, the base type will be "
"instantiated (e.g. \"Node3D\", \"Control\", \"Resource\"), then the script "
"will be loaded and set to this object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The base type is the base engine class which this type's class "
"hierarchy inherits, not any custom type parent classes.\n"
"You can use the virtual method [method _handles] to check if your custom "
"object is being edited by checking the script or using the [code]is[/code] "
"keyword.\n"
"During run-time, this will be a simple object with a script so this function "
"does not need to be called then.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom types added this way are not true classes. They are just "
"a helper to create a node with specific script."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a [Script] as debugger plugin to the Debugger. The script must extend "
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um [Script] como plugin de depuração ao Depurador. O script deve "
"estender [EditorDebuggerPlugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new dock.\n"
"When your plugin is deactivated, make sure to remove your custom dock with "
"[method remove_dock] and free it with [method Node.queue_free]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorExportPlatform]. Export platforms provides "
"functionality of exporting to the specific platform."
msgstr ""
"Registra um novo [EditorExportPlatform]. Plataformas de exportação fornecem "
"a funcionalidade de exportar para a plataforma específica."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorExportPlugin]. Export plugins are used to perform "
"tasks when the project is being exported.\n"
"See [method add_inspector_plugin] for an example of how to register a plugin."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorImportPlugin]. Import plugins are used to import "
"custom and unsupported assets as a custom [Resource] type.\n"
"If [param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], the new import plugin is "
"inserted first in the list and takes precedence over pre-existing plugins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to import custom 3D asset formats use [method "
"add_scene_format_importer_plugin] instead.\n"
"See [method add_inspector_plugin] for an example of how to register a plugin."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorInspectorPlugin]. Inspector plugins are used to "
"extend [EditorInspector] and provide custom configuration tools for your "
"object's properties.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Always use [method remove_inspector_plugin] to remove the "
"registered [EditorInspectorPlugin] when your [EditorPlugin] is disabled to "
"prevent leaks and an unexpected behavior.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const MyInspectorPlugin = preload(\"res://addons/your_addon/path/to/your/"
"script.gd\")\n"
"var inspector_plugin = MyInspectorPlugin.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tadd_inspector_plugin(inspector_plugin)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_inspector_plugin(inspector_plugin)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Registra um novo [EditorInspectorPlugin]. Os plugins do inspetor são usados "
"para estender [EditorInspector] e fornecer ferramentas de configuração "
"personalizadas para as propriedades do seu objeto.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Sempre use [method remove_inspector_plugin] para remover o "
"[EditorInspectorPlugin] registrado quando o seu [EditorPlugin] for "
"desativado para evitar vazamentos e comportamento inesperado.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const MyInspectorPlugin = preload(\"res://addons/your_addon/path/to/your/"
"script.gd\")\n"
"var inspector_plugin = MyInspectorPlugin.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tadd_inspector_plugin(inspector_plugin)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tremove_inspector_plugin(inspector_plugin)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorNode3DGizmoPlugin]. Gizmo plugins are used to add "
"custom gizmos to the 3D preview viewport for a [Node3D].\n"
"See [method add_inspector_plugin] for an example of how to register a plugin."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorResourceConversionPlugin]. Resource conversion "
"plugins are used to add custom resource converters to the editor inspector.\n"
"See [EditorResourceConversionPlugin] for an example of how to create a "
"resource conversion plugin."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a new [EditorSceneFormatImporter]. Scene importers are used to "
"import custom 3D asset formats as scenes.\n"
"If [param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], the new import plugin is "
"inserted first in the list and takes precedence over pre-existing plugins."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Add an [EditorScenePostImportPlugin]. These plugins allow customizing the "
"import process of 3D assets by adding new options to the import dialogs.\n"
"If [param first_priority] is [code]true[/code], the new import plugin is "
"inserted first in the list and takes precedence over pre-existing plugins."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom menu item to [b]Project > Tools[/b] named [param name]. When "
"clicked, the provided [param callable] will be called."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um item de menu personalizado a [b]Project > Tools[/b] chamado "
"[param name]. Quando clicado, o [param callable] fornecido será chamado."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom [PopupMenu] submenu under [b]Project > Tools >[/b] [param "
"name]. Use [method remove_tool_menu_item] on plugin clean up to remove the "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um submenu [PopupMenu] personalizado em [b]Project > Tools >[/b] "
"[param name]. Use [method remove_tool_menu_item] na limpeza do plugin para "
"remover o menu."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a custom translation parser plugin for extracting translatable "
"strings from custom files."
msgstr ""
"Registra um plugin analisador de tradução personalizado para extrair strings "
"traduzíveis de arquivos personalizados."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Hooks a callback into the undo/redo action creation when a property is "
"modified in the inspector. This allows, for example, to save other "
"properties that may be lost when a given property is modified.\n"
"The callback should have 4 arguments: [Object] [code]undo_redo[/code], "
"[Object] [code]modified_object[/code], [String] [code]property[/code] and "
"[Variant] [code]new_value[/code]. They are, respectively, the [UndoRedo] "
"object used by the inspector, the currently modified object, the name of the "
"modified property and the new value the property is about to take."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorInterface] is a global singleton and can be accessed directly by its "
"name."
msgstr ""
"[EditorInterface] é um singleton global e pode ser acessado diretamente pelo "
"seu nome."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid "Returns the [EditorInterface] singleton instance."
msgstr "Retorna a instância singleton do [EditorInterface]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Returns the [PopupMenu] under [b]Scene > Export As...[/b]."
msgstr "Retorna o [PopupMenu] em [b]Scene > Export As...[/b]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Provide the version of the plugin declared in the [code]plugin.cfg[/code] "
"config file."
msgstr ""
"Fornece a versão do plugin declarada no arquivo de configuração "
"[code]plugin.cfg[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the Editor's dialog used for making scripts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Users can configure it before use.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Removing and freeing this node will render a part of the "
"editor useless and may cause a crash."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the undo/redo object. Most actions in the editor can be undoable, so "
"use this object to make sure this happens when it's worth it."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o objeto de desfazer/refazer (undo/redo). A maioria das ações no "
"editor pode ter a opção de desfazer, então use este objeto para garantir que "
"isso aconteça quando valer a pena."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Minimizes the bottom panel."
msgstr "Minimiza o painel inferior."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Makes a specific item in the bottom panel visible."
msgstr "Torna um item específico no painel inferior visível."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Queue save the project's editor layout."
msgstr "Enfileira o salvamento do layout do editor do projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes an Autoload [param name] from the list."
msgstr "Remove um Autoload [param name] da lista."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes the specified context menu plugin."
msgstr "Remove o plugin de menu de contexto especificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [method remove_dock] instead."
msgstr "Use [method remove_dock] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the control from the bottom panel. You have to manually [method "
"Node.queue_free] the control."
msgstr ""
"Remove o controle do painel inferior. Você precisa chamar [method "
"Node.queue_free] manualmente no controle."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the control from the specified container. You have to manually "
"[method Node.queue_free] the control."
msgstr ""
"Remove o controle do container especificado. Você deve chamar [method "
"Node.queue_free] manualmente no controle."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the control from the dock. You have to manually [method "
"Node.queue_free] the control."
msgstr ""
"Remove o controle da doca. Você deve chamar manualmente [method "
"Node.queue_free] no controle."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes a custom type added by [method add_custom_type]."
msgstr "Remove um tipo personalizado adicionado por [method add_custom_type]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes the debugger plugin with given script from the Debugger."
msgstr "Remove o plugin de depurador com o script dado do Depurador."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes [param dock] from the available docks. You should manually call "
"[method Node.queue_free] to free it."
msgstr ""
"Remove [param dock] dos docks disponíveis. Você deve chamar manualmente "
"[method Node.queue_free] para liberá-lo."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes an export platform registered by [method add_export_platform]."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma plataforma de exportação registrada por [method "
"add_export_platform]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes an export plugin registered by [method add_export_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um plugin de exportação registrado por [method add_export_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes an import plugin registered by [method add_import_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um plugin de importação registrado por [method add_import_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes an inspector plugin registered by [method add_inspector_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um plugin de inspetor registrado por [method add_inspector_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes a gizmo plugin registered by [method add_node_3d_gizmo_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um plugin de gizmo registrado por [method add_node_3d_gizmo_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a resource conversion plugin registered by [method "
"add_resource_conversion_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um plugin de conversão de recursos registrado por [method "
"add_resource_conversion_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a scene format importer registered by [method "
"add_scene_format_importer_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um importador de formato de cena registrado por [method "
"add_scene_format_importer_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Remove the [EditorScenePostImportPlugin], added with [method "
"add_scene_post_import_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove o [EditorScenePostImportPlugin], adicionado com [method "
"add_scene_post_import_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Removes a menu [param name] from [b]Project > Tools[/b]."
msgstr "Remove um [param name] de menu de [b]Project > Tools[/b]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a custom translation parser plugin registered by [method "
"add_translation_parser_plugin]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um plugin analisador de tradução personalizado registrado por [method "
"add_translation_parser_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a callback previously added by [method "
"add_undo_redo_inspector_hook_callback]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um retorno de chamada adicionado anteriormente por [method "
"add_undo_redo_inspector_hook_callback]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [member EditorDock.dock_icon] instead."
msgstr "Use [member EditorDock.dock_icon] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the tab icon for the given control in a dock slot. Setting to "
"[code]null[/code] removes the icon."
msgstr ""
"Define o ícone da aba para o controle dado em um slot de doca. Definir como "
"[code]null[/code] remove o ícone."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Enables calling of [method _forward_canvas_force_draw_over_viewport] for the "
"2D editor and [method _forward_3d_force_draw_over_viewport] for the 3D "
"editor when their viewports are updated. You need to call this method only "
"once and it will work permanently for this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Habilita a chamada de [method _forward_canvas_force_draw_over_viewport] para "
"o editor 2D e [method _forward_3d_force_draw_over_viewport] para o editor 3D "
"quando suas viewports são atualizadas. Você precisa chamar este método "
"apenas uma vez e ele funcionará permanentemente para este plug-in."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Use this method if you always want to receive inputs from 3D view screen "
"inside [method _forward_3d_gui_input]. It might be especially usable if your "
"plugin will want to use raycast in the scene."
msgstr ""
"Use este método se você sempre quiser receber entradas da tela de "
"visualização 3D dentro de [method _forward_3d_gui_input]. Pode ser "
"especialmente útil se o seu plugin quiser usar raycast na cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the overlays of the 2D and 3D editor viewport. Causes methods "
"[method _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport], [method "
"_forward_canvas_force_draw_over_viewport], [method "
"_forward_3d_draw_over_viewport] and [method "
"_forward_3d_force_draw_over_viewport] to be called."
msgstr ""
"Atualiza as sobreposições da viewport do editor 2D e 3D. Faz com que os "
"métodos [method _forward_canvas_draw_over_viewport], [method "
"_forward_canvas_force_draw_over_viewport], [method "
"_forward_3d_draw_over_viewport] e [method "
"_forward_3d_force_draw_over_viewport] sejam chamados."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when user changes the workspace ([b]2D[/b], [b]3D[/b], [b]Script[/"
"b], [b]Game[/b], [b]Asset Store[/b]). Also works with custom screens defined "
"by plugins."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o usuário altera o espaço de trabalho ([b]2D[/b], [b]3D[/b], "
"[b]Script[/b], [b]Game[/b], [b]Asset Store[/b]). Também funciona com telas "
"personalizadas definidas por plug-ins."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Use [signal ProjectSettings.settings_changed] instead."
msgstr "Use [signal ProjectSettings.settings_changed] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Emitted when any project setting has changed."
msgstr "Emitido quando qualquer configuração de projeto é alterada."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the given [param resource] was saved on disc. See also [signal "
"scene_saved]."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o [param resource] fornecido foi salvo em disco. Veja também "
"[signal scene_saved]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the scene is changed in the editor. The argument will return "
"the root node of the scene that has just become active. If this scene is new "
"and empty, the argument will be [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a cena é alterada no editor. O argumento retornará o nó raiz "
"da cena que acabou de se tornar ativa. Se esta cena for nova e vazia, o "
"argumento será [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when user closes a scene. The argument is a file path to the closed "
"scene."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o usuário fecha uma cena. O argumento é o caminho do arquivo "
"para a cena fechada."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a scene was saved on disc. The argument is a file path to the "
"saved scene. See also [signal resource_saved]."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma cena foi salva em disco. O argumento é um caminho de "
"arquivo para a cena salva. Veja também [signal resource_saved]."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Main editor toolbar, next to play buttons."
msgstr ""
"Barra de ferramentas principal do editor, ao lado dos botões de reprodução."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "The toolbar that appears when 3D editor is active."
msgstr "A barra de ferramentas que aparece quando o editor 3D está ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Left sidebar of the 3D editor."
msgstr "Barra lateral esquerda do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Right sidebar of the 3D editor."
msgstr "Barra lateral direita do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Bottom panel of the 3D editor."
msgstr "Painel inferior do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "The toolbar that appears when 2D editor is active."
msgstr "A barra de ferramentas que aparece quando o editor 2D está ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Left sidebar of the 2D editor."
msgstr "Barra lateral esquerda do editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Right sidebar of the 2D editor."
msgstr "Barra lateral direita do editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Bottom panel of the 2D editor."
msgstr "Painel inferior do editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Bottom section of the inspector."
msgstr "Seção inferior do inspector."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Tab of Project Settings dialog, to the left of other tabs."
msgstr ""
"Aba da caixa de diálogo de Configurações do Projeto, à esquerda de outras "
"abas."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Tab of Project Settings dialog, to the right of other tabs."
msgstr ""
"Aba da caixa de diálogo de Configurações do Projeto, à direita de outras "
"abas."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Dock slot, left side, bottom-right (in default layout includes FileSystem "
"dock)."
msgstr ""
"Espaço do dock, lado esquerdo, inferior direito (no layout padrão, inclui o "
"dock Sistema de Arquivos)."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Dock slot, right side, upper-left (in default layout includes Inspector, "
"Node, and History docks)."
msgstr ""
"Slot de doca, lado direito, superior esquerdo (no layout padrão inclui as "
"docas Inspector, Node e History)."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Forwards the [InputEvent] to other EditorPlugins."
msgstr "Encaminha o [InputEvent] para outros EditorPlugins."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid "Prevents the [InputEvent] from reaching other Editor classes."
msgstr "Impede que o [InputEvent] alcance outras classes do Editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Pass the [InputEvent] to other editor plugins except the main [Node3D] one. "
"This can be used to prevent node selection changes and work with sub-gizmos "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Passa o [InputEvent] para outros plug-ins do editor, exceto o principal "
"[Node3D]. Isso pode ser usado para evitar alterações na seleção de nós e "
"trabalhar com sub-gizmos em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Custom control for editing properties that can be added to the "
"[EditorInspector]."
msgstr ""
"Controle personalizado para editar propriedades que podem ser adicionadas ao "
"[EditorInspector]."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"A custom control for editing properties that can be added to the "
"[EditorInspector]. It is added via [EditorInspectorPlugin]."
msgstr ""
"Um controle personalizado para editar propriedades que podem ser adicionadas "
"ao [EditorInspector]. É adicionado via [EditorInspectorPlugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the read-only status of the property is changed. It may be used "
"to change custom controls into a read-only or modifiable state."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o status somente leitura da propriedade é alterado. Pode ser "
"usado para alterar controles personalizados para um estado somente leitura "
"ou modificável."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "When this virtual function is called, you must update your editor."
msgstr "Quando esta função virtual é chamada, você deve atualizar seu editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"If any of the controls added can gain keyboard focus, add it here. This "
"ensures that focus will be restored if the inspector is refreshed."
msgstr ""
"Se algum dos controles adicionados puder obter o foco do teclado, adicione-o "
"aqui. Isso garante que o foco seja restaurado se o inspetor for atualizado."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Draw property as not selected. Used by the inspector."
msgstr "Desenha a propriedade como não selecionada. Usado pelo inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"If one or several properties have changed, this must be called. [param "
"field] is used in case your editor can modify fields separately (as an "
"example, Vector3.x). The [param changing] argument avoids the editor "
"requesting this property to be refreshed (leave as [code]false[/code] if "
"unsure)."
msgstr ""
"Se uma ou várias propriedades tiverem sido alteradas, isso deve ser chamado. "
"O [param field] é usado caso seu editor possa modificar campos separadamente "
"(como exemplo, Vector3.x). O argumento [param changing] evita que o editor "
"solicite que esta propriedade seja atualizada (deixe como [code]false[/code] "
"se não tiver certeza)."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the edited object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method could return [code]null[/code] if the editor has "
"not yet been associated with a property. However, in [method "
"_update_property] and [method _set_read_only], this value is [i]guaranteed[/"
"i] to be non-[code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the edited property. If your editor is for a single property (added "
"via [method EditorInspectorPlugin._parse_property]), then this will return "
"the property.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method could return [code]null[/code] if the editor has "
"not yet been associated with a property. However, in [method "
"_update_property] and [method _set_read_only], this value is [i]guaranteed[/"
"i] to be non-[code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if property is drawn as selected. Used by the "
"inspector."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a propriedade for desenhada como selecionada. "
"Usado pelo inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Draw property as selected. Used by the inspector."
msgstr "Desenha a propriedade como selecionada. Usado pelo inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Puts the [param editor] control below the property label. The control must "
"be previously added using [method Node.add_child]."
msgstr ""
"Coloca o controle [param editor] abaixo do rótulo da propriedade. O controle "
"deve ter sido adicionado anteriormente usando [method Node.add_child]."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to a control that will be used as a reference to "
"calculate the size of the label."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como um controle que será usado como "
"referência para calcular o tamanho do label."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Assigns object and property to edit."
msgstr "Atribui objeto e propriedade a editar."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Forces a refresh of the property display."
msgstr "Força uma atualização da exibição de propriedades."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is "
"checkable."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade é "
"verificável."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is checked."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade "
"está marcada."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property can be "
"deleted by the user."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade "
"pode ser excluída pelo usuário."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property background "
"is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando o fundo da "
"propriedade é desenhado."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property label is "
"drawn."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando o rótulo da "
"propriedade é desenhado."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is drawn "
"with the editor theme's warning color. This is used for editable children's "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade é "
"desenhada com a cor de aviso do tema do editor. Isso é usado para "
"propriedades de filhos editáveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property can add "
"keys for animation."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade "
"pode adicionar chaves para animação."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Set this property to change the label (if you want to show one)."
msgstr "Defina esta propriedade para alterar o rótulo (se desejar exibir um)."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Space distribution ratio between the label and the editing field."
msgstr ""
"Proporção de distribuição de espaço entre o rótulo e o campo de edição."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is read-"
"only."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade é "
"somente leitura."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is "
"selectable."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade "
"for selecionável."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Used by the inspector, set to [code]true[/code] when the property is using "
"folding."
msgstr ""
"Usado pelo inspetor, definido como [code]true[/code] quando a propriedade "
"está usando dobramento."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Emit it if you want multiple properties modified at the same time. Do not "
"use if added via [method EditorInspectorPlugin._parse_property]."
msgstr ""
"Emita-o se quiser que várias propriedades sejam modificadas ao mesmo tempo. "
"Não use se adicionado via [method EditorInspectorPlugin._parse_property]."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Used by sub-inspectors. Emit it if what was selected was an Object ID."
msgstr ""
"Usado por subinsetores. Emita-o se o que foi selecionado foi um Object ID."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the revertability (i.e., whether it has a non-default value and "
"thus is displayed with a revert icon) of a property has changed."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a capacidade de reversão (ou seja, se possui um valor não "
"padrão e, portanto, é exibido com um ícone de reversão) de uma propriedade "
"foi alterada."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Do not emit this manually, use the [method emit_changed] method instead."
msgstr ""
"Não emita isso manualmente; use o método [method emit_changed] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Emitted when a property was checked. Used internally."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma propriedade é checada. Usado internamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Emitted when a property was deleted. Used internally."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma propriedade é excluída. Usado internamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Emit it if you want to mark a property as favorited, making it appear at the "
"top of the inspector."
msgstr ""
"Emita-o se quiser marcar uma propriedade como favorita, fazendo-a aparecer "
"no topo do inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Emit it if you want to add this value as an animation key (check for keying "
"being enabled first)."
msgstr ""
"Emita-o se quiser adicionar este valor como uma chave de animação (verifique "
"primeiro se a criação de chaves está ativada)."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Emit it if you want to key a property with a single value."
msgstr "Emita isto se você quiser chavear uma propriedade com um único valor."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Emitted when a setting override for the current project is requested."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma substituição de configuração para o projeto atual é "
"solicitada."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"Emit it if you want to mark (or unmark) the value of a property for being "
"saved regardless of being equal to the default value.\n"
"The default value is the one the property will get when the node is just "
"instantiated and can come from an ancestor scene in the inheritance/"
"instantiation chain, a script or a builtin class."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid ""
"If you want a sub-resource to be edited, emit this signal with the resource."
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser que um subrecurso seja editado, emita este sinal com o "
"recurso."

#: doc/classes/EditorProperty.xml
msgid "Emitted when selected. Used internally."
msgstr "Emitido quando selecionado. Usado internamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceConversionPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Plugin for adding custom converters from one resource format to another in "
"the editor resource picker context menu; for example, converting a "
"[StandardMaterial3D] to a [ShaderMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"Plugin para adicionar conversores personalizados de um formato de recurso "
"para outro no menu de contexto do seletor de recursos do editor; por "
"exemplo, convertendo um [StandardMaterial3D] para um [ShaderMaterial]."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceConversionPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorResourceConversionPlugin] is invoked when the context menu is brought "
"up for a resource in the editor inspector. Relevant conversion plugins will "
"appear as menu options to convert the given resource to a target type.\n"
"Below shows an example of a basic plugin that will convert an [ImageTexture] "
"to a [PortableCompressedTexture2D].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends EditorResourceConversionPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _handles(resource: Resource):\n"
"\treturn resource is ImageTexture\n"
"\n"
"func _converts_to():\n"
"\treturn \"PortableCompressedTexture2D\"\n"
"\n"
"func _convert(itex: Resource):\n"
"\tvar ptex = PortableCompressedTexture2D.new()\n"
"\tptex.create_from_image(itex.get_image(), "
"PortableCompressedTexture2D.COMPRESSION_MODE_LOSSLESS)\n"
"\treturn ptex\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To use an [EditorResourceConversionPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_resource_conversion_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorResourceConversionPlugin] é invocado quando o menu de contexto é "
"aberto para um recurso no inspetor do editor. Os plugins de conversão "
"relevantes aparecerão como opções de menu para converter o recurso fornecido "
"em um tipo de destino.\n"
"Abaixo é mostrado um exemplo de um plugin básico que converterá um "
"[ImageTexture] em um [PortableCompressedTexture2D].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends EditorResourceConversionPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _handles(resource: Resource):\n"
"\treturn resource is ImageTexture\n"
"\n"
"func _converts_to():\n"
"\treturn \"PortableCompressedTexture2D\"\n"
"\n"
"func _convert(itex: Resource):\n"
"\tvar ptex = PortableCompressedTexture2D.new()\n"
"\tptex.create_from_image(itex.get_image(), "
"PortableCompressedTexture2D.COMPRESSION_MODE_LOSSLESS)\n"
"\treturn ptex\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Para usar um [EditorResourceConversionPlugin], registre-o primeiro usando o "
"método [method EditorPlugin.add_resource_conversion_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceConversionPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Takes an input [Resource] and converts it to the type given in [method "
"_converts_to]. The returned [Resource] is the result of the conversion, and "
"the input [Resource] remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Aceita um [Resource] de entrada e o converte para o tipo fornecido em "
"[method _converts_to]. O [Resource] retornado é o resultado da conversão, e "
"o [Resource] de entrada permanece inalterado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceConversionPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the class name of the target type of [Resource] that this plugin "
"converts source resources to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome da classe do tipo de destino do [Resource] para o qual este "
"plugin converte recursos de origem."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceConversionPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called to determine whether a particular [Resource] can be converted to the "
"target resource type by this plugin."
msgstr ""
"Chamado para determinar se um determinado [Resource] pode ser convertido "
"para o tipo de recurso de destino por este plugin."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid "Godot editor's control for selecting [Resource] type properties."
msgstr ""
"Controle do editor do Godot para selecionar propriedades do tipo [Resource]."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"This [Control] node is used in the editor's Inspector dock to allow editing "
"of [Resource] type properties. It provides options for creating, loading, "
"saving and converting resources. Can be used with [EditorInspectorPlugin] to "
"recreate the same behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This [Control] does not include any editor for the resource, as "
"editing is controlled by the Inspector dock itself or sub-Inspectors."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"This virtual method can be implemented to handle context menu items not "
"handled by default. See [method _set_create_options]."
msgstr ""
"Este método virtual pode ser implementado para lidar com itens de menu de "
"contexto não tratados por padrão. Veja [method _set_create_options]."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"This virtual method is called when updating the context menu of an [member "
"editable] [EditorResourcePicker]. Implement this method to override the "
"\"New\" items section with your own options. [param menu_node] is a "
"reference to the [PopupMenu] node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Implement [method _handle_menu_selected] to handle these custom "
"items.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Relevant built-in options (\"Load\", \"Copy\", \"Paste\", etc.) "
"are automatically added to the [param menu_node] afterwards, using their "
"hard-coded IDs starting from [code]0[/code]. Custom options need to use non-"
"colliding IDs to be handled properly. Using [code]id = 100 + "
"custom_option_index[/code] is safe (this is what the default items in the "
"\"New\" section use)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of all allowed types and subtypes corresponding to the "
"[member base_type]. If the [member base_type] is empty, an empty list is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma lista de todos os tipos e subtipos permitidos correspondentes a "
"[member base_type]. Se [member base_type] estiver vazio, uma lista vazia "
"será retornada."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the toggle mode state for the main button. Works only if [member "
"toggle_mode] is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Define o estado do modo de alternância para o botão principal. Funciona "
"apenas se [member toggle_mode] estiver definido como [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"The base type of allowed resource types. Can be a comma-separated list of "
"several options."
msgstr ""
"O tipo base dos tipos de recurso permitidos. Pode ser uma lista separada por "
"vírgulas de várias opções."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the value can be selected and edited."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o valor pode ser selecionado e editado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid "The edited resource value."
msgstr "O valor do recurso editado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the main button with the resource preview works in the "
"toggle mode. Use [method set_toggle_pressed] to manually set the state."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o botão principal com a pré-visualização de recursos "
"funciona no modo de alternância. Use [method set_toggle_pressed] para "
"definir manualmente o estado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid "Emitted when the value of the edited resource was changed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o valor do recurso editado foi alterado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePicker.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the resource value was set and user clicked to edit it. When "
"[param inspect] is [code]true[/code], the signal was caused by the context "
"menu \"Edit\" or \"Inspect\" option."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o valor do recurso foi definido e o usuário clicou para editá-"
"lo. Quando [param inspect] for [code]true[/code], o sinal foi causado pela "
"opção \"Editar\" ou \"Inspecionar\" do menu de contexto."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid "A node used to generate previews of resources or files."
msgstr "Um nó usado para gerar pré-visualizações de recursos ou arquivos."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid ""
"This node is used to generate previews for resources or files.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_resource_previewer]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid "Create an own, custom preview generator."
msgstr "Cria um gerador de pré-visualização próprio e personalizado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid ""
"Check if the resource changed, if so, it will be invalidated and the "
"corresponding signal emitted."
msgstr ""
"Verifica se o recurso mudou; se sim, ele será invalidado e o sinal "
"correspondente será emitido."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid ""
"Queue the [param resource] being edited for preview. Once the preview is "
"ready, the [param receiver]'s [param receiver_func] will be called. The "
"[param receiver_func] must take the following four arguments: [String] path, "
"[Texture2D] preview, [Texture2D] thumbnail_preview, [Variant] userdata. "
"[param userdata] can be anything, and will be returned when [param "
"receiver_func] is called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If it was not possible to create the preview the [param "
"receiver_func] will still be called, but the preview will be [code]null[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid ""
"Queue a resource file located at [param path] for preview. Once the preview "
"is ready, the [param receiver]'s [param receiver_func] will be called. The "
"[param receiver_func] must take the following four arguments: [String] path, "
"[Texture2D] preview, [Texture2D] thumbnail_preview, [Variant] userdata. "
"[param userdata] can be anything, and will be returned when [param "
"receiver_func] is called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If it was not possible to create the preview the [param "
"receiver_func] will still be called, but the preview will be [code]null[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid "Removes a custom preview generator."
msgstr "Remove um gerador de visualização personalizado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreview.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted if a preview was invalidated (changed). [param path] corresponds to "
"the path of the preview."
msgstr ""
"Emitido se uma pré-visualização foi invalidada (alterada). [param path] "
"corresponde ao caminho da pré-visualização."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid "Custom generator of previews."
msgstr "Gerador personalizado de visualizações."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Custom code to generate previews. Check [member EditorSettings.filesystem/"
"file_dialog/thumbnail_size] to find a proper size to generate previews at."
msgstr ""
"Código personalizado para gerar pré-visualizações. Verifique [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/file_dialog/thumbnail_size] para encontrar um "
"tamanho adequado para gerar pré-visualizações."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"If this function returns [code]true[/code], the generator will call [method "
"_generate] or [method _generate_from_path] for small previews as well.\n"
"By default, it returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a preview from a given resource with the specified size. This must "
"always be implemented.\n"
"Returning [code]null[/code] is an OK way to fail and let another generator "
"take care.\n"
"Care must be taken because this function is always called from a thread (not "
"the main thread).\n"
"[param metadata] dictionary can be modified to store file-specific metadata "
"that can be used in [method "
"EditorResourceTooltipPlugin._make_tooltip_for_path] (like image size, sample "
"length etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Generate a preview directly from a path with the specified size. "
"Implementing this is optional, as default code will load and call [method "
"_generate].\n"
"Returning [code]null[/code] is an OK way to fail and let another generator "
"take care.\n"
"Care must be taken because this function is always called from a thread (not "
"the main thread).\n"
"[param metadata] dictionary can be modified to store file-specific metadata "
"that can be used in [method "
"EditorResourceTooltipPlugin._make_tooltip_for_path] (like image size, sample "
"length etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"If this function returns [code]true[/code], the generator will automatically "
"generate the small previews from the normal preview texture generated by the "
"methods [method _generate] or [method _generate_from_path].\n"
"By default, it returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if your generator supports the resource of type "
"[param type]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o seu gerador suporta o recurso do tipo [param "
"type]."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourcePreviewGenerator.xml
msgid ""
"Call from within [method _generate] to request the rendering server draw to "
"the [param viewport]."
msgstr ""
"Chame de dentro de [method _generate] para solicitar que o servidor de "
"renderização desenhe no [param viewport]."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceTooltipPlugin.xml
msgid "A plugin that advanced tooltip for its handled resource type."
msgstr ""
"Um plugin que fornece dica de ferramenta avançada para seu tipo de recurso "
"manipulado."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceTooltipPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Resource tooltip plugins are used by [FileSystemDock] to generate customized "
"tooltips for specific resources. E.g. tooltip for a [Texture2D] displays a "
"bigger preview and the texture's dimensions.\n"
"A plugin must be first registered with [method "
"FileSystemDock.add_resource_tooltip_plugin]. When the user hovers a resource "
"in filesystem dock which is handled by the plugin, [method "
"_make_tooltip_for_path] is called to create the tooltip. It works similarly "
"to [method Control._make_custom_tooltip]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceTooltipPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if the plugin is going to handle the given "
"[Resource] [param type]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o plugin for manipular o [Resource] de [param "
"type] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceTooltipPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Create and return a tooltip that will be displayed when the user hovers a "
"resource under the given [param path] in filesystem dock.\n"
"The [param metadata] dictionary is provided by preview generator (see "
"[method EditorResourcePreviewGenerator._generate]).\n"
"[param base] is the base default tooltip, which is a [VBoxContainer] with a "
"file name, type and size labels. If another plugin handled the same file "
"type, [param base] will be output from the previous plugin. For best result, "
"make sure the base tooltip is part of the returned [Control].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's unadvised to use [method ResourceLoader.load], especially "
"with heavy resources like models or textures, because it will make the "
"editor unresponsive when creating the tooltip. You can use [method "
"request_thumbnail] if you want to display a preview in your tooltip.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you decide to discard the [param base], make sure to call "
"[method Node.queue_free], because it's not freed automatically.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _make_tooltip_for_path(path, metadata, base):\n"
"\tvar t_rect = TextureRect.new()\n"
"\trequest_thumbnail(path, t_rect)\n"
"\tbase.add_child(t_rect) # The TextureRect will appear at the bottom of the "
"tooltip.\n"
"\treturn base\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorResourceTooltipPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Requests a thumbnail for the given [TextureRect]. The thumbnail is created "
"asynchronously by [EditorResourcePreview] and automatically set when "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Solicita uma miniatura para o [TextureRect] fornecido. A miniatura é criada "
"de forma assíncrona por [EditorResourcePreview] e definida automaticamente "
"quando disponível."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid "Imports scenes from third-parties' 3D files."
msgstr "Importa cenas de arquivos 3D de terceiros."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorSceneFormatImporter] allows to define an importer script for a third-"
"party 3D format.\n"
"To use [EditorSceneFormatImporter], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_scene_format_importer_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid "Return supported file extensions for this scene importer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna as extensões de arquivo suportadas para este importador de cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid ""
"Override to add general import options. These will appear in the main import "
"dock on the editor. Add options via [method add_import_option] and [method "
"add_import_option_advanced].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All [EditorSceneFormatImporter] and "
"[EditorScenePostImportPlugin] instances will add options for all files. It "
"is good practice to check the file extension when [param path] is non-"
"empty.\n"
"When the user is editing project settings, [param path] will be empty. It is "
"recommended to add all options when [param path] is empty to allow the user "
"to customize Import Defaults."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Should return [code]true[/code] to show the given option, [code]false[/code] "
"to hide the given option, or [code]null[/code] to ignore."
msgstr ""
"Deve retornar [code]true[/code] para mostrar a opção dada, [code]false[/"
"code] para ocultar a opção dada, ou [code]null[/code] para ignorar."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid ""
"Perform the bulk of the scene import logic here, for example using "
"[GLTFDocument] or [FBXDocument]."
msgstr ""
"Execute a maior parte da lógica de importação de cena aqui, por exemplo, "
"usando [GLTFDocument] ou [FBXDocument]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid ""
"Add a specific import option (name and default value only). This function "
"can only be called from [method _get_import_options]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma opção de importação específica (apenas nome e valor padrão). "
"Esta função só pode ser chamada a partir de [method _get_import_options]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid ""
"Add a specific import option. This function can only be called from [method "
"_get_import_options]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma opção de importação específica. Esta função só pode ser chamada "
"a partir de [method _get_import_options]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid "Unused flag (this has no effect when enabled)."
msgstr "Sinalizador não utilizado (não tem efeito quando ativado)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
msgid ""
"Import animations from the 3D scene. When importing a scene as an "
"[AnimationLibrary], this flag is always enabled."
msgstr ""
"Importa animações da cena 3D. Ao importar uma cena como um "
"[AnimationLibrary], esta flag está sempre ativada."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
#: doc/classes/ResourceImporterScene.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], generate vertex tangents using [url=http://"
"www.mikktspace.com/]Mikktspace[/url] if the input meshes don't have tangent "
"data. When possible, it's recommended to let the 3D modeling software "
"generate tangents on export instead of relying on this option. Tangents are "
"required for correct display of normal and height maps, along with any "
"material/shader features that require tangents.\n"
"If you don't need material features that require tangents, disabling this "
"can reduce output file size and speed up importing if the source 3D file "
"doesn't contain tangents."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"If checked, use named [Skin]s for animation. The [MeshInstance3D] node "
"contains 3 properties of relevance here: a skeleton [NodePath] pointing to "
"the [Skeleton3D] node (usually [code]..[/code]), a mesh, and a skin:\n"
"- The [Skeleton3D] node contains a list of bones with names, their pose and "
"rest, a name, and a parent bone.\n"
"- The mesh is all of the raw vertex data needed to display a mesh. In terms "
"of the mesh, it knows how vertices are weight-painted and uses some internal "
"numbering often imported from 3D modeling software.\n"
"- The skin contains the information necessary to bind this mesh onto this "
"Skeleton3D. For each of the internal bone IDs chosen by the 3D modeling "
"software, it contains two things. Firstly, a matrix known as the Bind Pose "
"Matrix, Inverse Bind Matrix, or IBM for short. Secondly, the [Skin] contains "
"each bone's name (if this flag is enabled), or the bone's index within the "
"[Skeleton3D] list (if this flag is disabled).\n"
"Together, this information is enough to tell Godot how to use the bone poses "
"in the [Skeleton3D] node to render the mesh from each [MeshInstance3D]. Note "
"that each [MeshInstance3D] may share binds, as is common in models exported "
"from Blender, or each [MeshInstance3D] may use a separate [Skin] object, as "
"is common in models exported from other tools such as Maya."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
msgid ""
"Ignore meshes and materials on import. When importing a scene as an "
"[AnimationLibrary], this flag is always enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ignora malhas e materiais na importação. Ao importar uma cena como "
"[AnimationLibrary], essa flag está sempre ativada."

#: doc/classes/EditorSceneFormatImporter.xml
#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/GLTFDocument.xml
#: doc/classes/ResourceImporterOBJ.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporterScene.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], mesh compression will not be used. Consider enabling "
"if you notice blocky artifacts in your mesh normals or UVs, or if you have "
"meshes that are larger than a few thousand meters in each direction."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a compactação de malha não será usada. Considere "
"ativar se notar artefatos em bloco nas normais ou UVs da sua malha, ou se "
"você tiver malhas maiores que alguns milhares de metros em cada direção."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/EditorSceneFormatImporterBlend.xml
msgid "Importer for Blender's [code].blend[/code] scene file format."
msgstr ""
"Importador para o formato de arquivo de cena [code].blend[/code] do Blender."

#: modules/gltf/doc_classes/EditorSceneFormatImporterBlend.xml
msgid ""
"Imports Blender scenes in the [code].blend[/code] file format through the "
"glTF 2.0 3D import pipeline. This importer requires Blender to be installed "
"by the user, so that it can be used to export the scene as glTF 2.0.\n"
"The location of the Blender binary is set via the [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/blender/blender_path] setting.\n"
"This importer is only used if [member ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/"
"blender/enabled] is enabled, otherwise [code].blend[/code] files present in "
"the project folder are not imported.\n"
"Blend import requires Blender 3.0.\n"
"Internally, the EditorSceneFormatImporterBlend uses the Blender glTF \"Use "
"Original\" mode to reference external textures."
msgstr ""

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/EditorSceneFormatImporterFBX2GLTF.xml
msgid "Importer for the [code].fbx[/code] scene file format."
msgstr "Importador para o formato de arquivo de cena [code].fbx[/code]."

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/EditorSceneFormatImporterFBX2GLTF.xml
msgid ""
"Imports Autodesk FBX 3D scenes by way of converting them to glTF 2.0 using "
"the FBX2glTF command line tool.\n"
"The location of the FBX2glTF binary is set via the [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/fbx/fbx2gltf_path] editor setting.\n"
"This importer is only used if [member ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/"
"fbx2gltf/enabled] is set to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/EditorSceneFormatImporterUFBX.xml
msgid "Import FBX files using the ufbx library."
msgstr "Importa arquivos FBX usando a biblioteca ufbx."

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/EditorSceneFormatImporterUFBX.xml
msgid ""
"EditorSceneFormatImporterUFBX is designed to load FBX files and supports "
"both binary and ASCII FBX files from version 3000 onward. This class "
"supports various 3D object types like meshes, skins, blend shapes, "
"materials, and rigging information. The class aims for feature parity with "
"the official FBX SDK and supports FBX 7.4 specifications."
msgstr ""
"O EditorSceneFormatImporterUFBX foi projetado para carregar arquivos FBX e "
"suporta arquivos FBX binários e ASCII a partir da versão 3000. Esta classe "
"suporta vários tipos de objetos 3D, como malhas, skins, formas de mesclagem "
"(blend shapes), materiais e informações de rigging. A classe visa a paridade "
"de recursos com o SDK oficial do FBX e suporta as especificações do FBX 7.4."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImport.xml
msgid "Post-processes scenes after import."
msgstr "Pós-processa cenas após a importação."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImport.xml
msgid ""
"Imported scenes can be automatically modified right after import by setting "
"their [b]Custom Script[/b] Import property to a [code]tool[/code] script "
"that inherits from this class.\n"
"The [method _post_import] callback receives the imported scene's root node "
"and returns the modified version of the scene:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool # Needed so it runs in editor.\n"
"extends EditorScenePostImport\n"
"\n"
"# This sample changes all node names.\n"
"# Called right after the scene is imported and gets the root node.\n"
"func _post_import(scene):\n"
"\t# Change all node names to \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\titerate(scene)\n"
"\treturn scene # Remember to return the imported scene\n"
"\n"
"func iterate(node):\n"
"\tif node != null:\n"
"\t\tnode.name = \"modified_\" + node.name\n"
"\t\tfor child in node.get_children():\n"
"\t\t\titerate(child)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"// This sample changes all node names.\n"
"// Called right after the scene is imported and gets the root node.\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class NodeRenamer : EditorScenePostImport\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override GodotObject _PostImport(Node scene)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Change all node names to \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\t\tIterate(scene);\n"
"\t\treturn scene; // Remember to return the imported scene\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic void Iterate(Node node)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (node != null)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tnode.Name = $\"modified_{node.Name}\";\n"
"\t\t\tforeach (Node child in node.GetChildren())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tIterate(child);\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Cenas importadas podem ser modificadas automaticamente logo após a "
"importação, definindo a propriedade de importação [b]Custom Script[/b] como "
"um script [code]tool[/code] que herda desta classe.\n"
"O retorno de chamada [method _post_import] recebe o nó raiz da cena "
"importada e retorna a versão modificada da cena:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool # Necessário para rodar no editor.\n"
"extends EditorScenePostImport\n"
"\n"
"# Este exemplo altera todos os nomes de nós.\n"
"# Chamado logo após a cena ser importada e obtém o nó raiz.\n"
"func _post_import(scene):\n"
"\t# Altera todos os nomes de nós para \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\titerate(scene)\n"
"\treturn scene # Lembre-se de retornar a cena importada\n"
"\n"
"func iterate(node):\n"
"\tif node != null:\n"
"\t\tnode.name = \"modified_\" + node.name\n"
"\t\tfor child in node.get_children():\n"
"\t\t\titerate(child)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"// Este exemplo altera todos os nomes de nós.\n"
"// Chamado logo após a cena ser importada e obtém o nó raiz.\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class NodeRenamer : EditorScenePostImport\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override GodotObject _PostImport(Node scene)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Altera todos os nomes de nós para \"modified_[oldnodename]\"\n"
"\t\tIterate(scene);\n"
"\t\treturn scene; // Lembre-se de retornar a cena importada\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic void Iterate(Node node)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (node != null)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tnode.Name = $\"modified_{node.Name}\";\n"
"\t\t\tforeach (Node child in node.GetChildren())\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\tIterate(child);\n"
"\t\t\t}\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImport.xml
msgid "Importing 3D scenes: Configuration: Using import scripts for automation"
msgstr ""
"Importando cenas 3D: Configuração: Usando scripts de importação para "
"automação"

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImport.xml
msgid ""
"Called after the scene was imported. This method must return the modified "
"version of the scene."
msgstr ""
"Chamado após a importação da cena. Este método deve retornar a versão "
"modificada da cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImport.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the source file path which got imported (e.g. [code]res://scene.dae[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho do arquivo de origem que foi importado (por exemplo, "
"[code]res://scene.dae[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid "Plugin to control and modifying the process of importing a scene."
msgstr ""
"Plugin para controlar e modificar o processo de importação de uma cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"This plugin type exists to modify the process of importing scenes, allowing "
"to change the content as well as add importer options at every stage of the "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Este tipo de plug-in existe para modificar o processo de importação de "
"cenas, permitindo alterar o conteúdo bem como adicionar opções de importador "
"em cada estágio do processo."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override to add general import options. These will appear in the main import "
"dock on the editor. Add options via [method add_import_option] and [method "
"add_import_option_advanced]."
msgstr ""
"Substitua para adicionar opções gerais de importação. Elas aparecerão no "
"painel de importação principal no editor. Adicione opções via [method "
"add_import_option] e [method add_import_option_advanced]."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override to add internal import options. These will appear in the 3D scene "
"import dialog. Add options via [method add_import_option] and [method "
"add_import_option_advanced]."
msgstr ""
"Substitua para adicionar opções de importação internas. Elas aparecerão na "
"caixa de diálogo de importação de cena 3D. Adicione opções por meio de "
"[method add_import_option] e [method add_import_option_advanced]."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Should return [code]true[/code] if the 3D view of the import dialog needs to "
"update when changing the given option."
msgstr ""
"Deve retornar [code]true[/code] se a visualização 3D da caixa de diálogo de "
"importação precisar ser atualizada ao alterar a opção fornecida."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid "Process a specific node or resource for a given category."
msgstr "Processa um nó ou recurso específico para uma categoria dada."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Post-process the scene. This function is called after the final scene has "
"been configured."
msgstr ""
"Pós-processa a cena. Esta função é chamada após a cena final ter sido "
"configurada."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Pre-process the scene. This function is called right after the scene format "
"loader loaded the scene and no changes have been made.\n"
"Pre-process may be used to adjust internal import options in the [code]"
"\"nodes\"[/code], [code]\"meshes\"[/code], [code]\"animations\"[/code] or "
"[code]\"materials\"[/code] keys inside "
"[code]get_option_value(\"_subresources\")[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Add a specific import option (name and default value only). This function "
"can only be called from [method _get_import_options] and [method "
"_get_internal_import_options]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma opção de importação específica (apenas nome e valor padrão). "
"Esta função só pode ser chamada a partir de [method _get_import_options] e "
"[method _get_internal_import_options]."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Add a specific import option. This function can only be called from [method "
"_get_import_options] and [method _get_internal_import_options]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma opção de importação específica. Esta função só pode ser chamada "
"a partir de [method _get_import_options] e [method "
"_get_internal_import_options]."

#: doc/classes/EditorScenePostImportPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Query the value of an option. This function can only be called from those "
"querying visibility, or processing."
msgstr ""
"Consulta o valor de uma opção. Esta função só pode ser chamada a partir "
"daqueles que consultam a visibilidade ou processamento."

#: doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid "Base script that can be used to add extension functions to the editor."
msgstr ""
"Script base que pode ser usado para adicionar funções de extensão ao editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid ""
"Scripts extending this class and implementing its [method _run] method can "
"be executed from the Script Editor's [b]File > Run[/b] menu option (or by "
"pressing [kbd]Ctrl + Shift + X[/kbd]) while the editor is running. This is "
"useful for adding custom in-editor functionality to Godot. For more complex "
"additions, consider using [EditorPlugin]s instead.\n"
"If a script extending this class also has a global class name, it will be "
"included in the editor's command palette.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extending scripts need to have [code]tool[/code] mode enabled.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Running the following script prints \"Hello from the Godot "
"Editor!\":\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorScript\n"
"\n"
"func _run():\n"
"\tprint(\"Hello from the Godot Editor!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class HelloEditor : EditorScript\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override void _Run()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Hello from the Godot Editor!\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] EditorScript is [RefCounted], meaning it is destroyed when "
"nothing references it. This can cause errors during asynchronous operations "
"if there are no references to the script."
msgstr ""
"Scripts que estendem esta classe e implementam seu método [method _run] "
"podem ser executados a partir da opção de menu [b]File > Run[/b] do Editor "
"de Scripts (ou pressionando [kbd]Ctrl + Shift + X[/kbd]) enquanto o editor "
"está em execução. Isso é útil para adicionar funcionalidade personalizada "
"dentro do editor ao Godot. Para adições mais complexas, considere usar "
"[EditorPlugin]s em vez disso.\n"
"Se um script que estende esta classe também tiver um nome de classe global, "
"ele será incluído na paleta de comandos do editor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Scripts de extensão precisam ter o modo [code]tool[/code] "
"ativado.\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Executar o script a seguir imprime \"Hello from the Godot "
"Editor!\":\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorScript\n"
"\n"
"func _run():\n"
"\tprint(\"Hello from the Godot Editor!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class HelloEditor : EditorScript\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override void _Run()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Hello from the Godot Editor!\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] EditorScript é [RefCounted], o que significa que ele é "
"destruído quando nada o referencia. Isso pode causar erros durante operações "
"assíncronas se não houver referências ao script."

#: doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid "This method is executed by the Editor when [b]File > Run[/b] is used."
msgstr "Este método é executado pelo Editor quando [b]File > Run[/b] é usado."

#: doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid "Use [method EditorInterface.add_root_node] instead."
msgstr "Use [method EditorInterface.add_root_node] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid "Use [method EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root] instead."
msgstr "Use [method EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorScript.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the edited (current) scene's root [Node]. Equivalent of [method "
"EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a [Node] raiz da cena editada (atual). Equivalente a [method "
"EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root]."

#: doc/classes/EditorScriptPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Godot editor's control for selecting the [code]script[/code] property of a "
"[Node]."
msgstr ""
"Controle do editor do Godot para selecionar a propriedade [code]script[/"
"code] de um [Node]."

#: doc/classes/EditorScriptPicker.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [EditorResourcePicker] this [Control] node is used in the "
"editor's Inspector dock, but only to edit the [code]script[/code] property "
"of a [Node]. Default options for creating new resources of all possible "
"subtypes are replaced with dedicated buttons that open the \"Attach Node "
"Script\" dialog. Can be used with [EditorInspectorPlugin] to recreate the "
"same behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must set the [member script_owner] for the custom context "
"menu items to work."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorScriptPicker.xml
msgid "The owner [Node] of the script property that holds the edited resource."
msgstr ""
"O [Node] proprietário da propriedade de script que contém o recurso editado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid "Manages the SceneTree selection in the editor."
msgstr "Gerencia a seleção da SceneTree no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid ""
"This object manages the SceneTree selection in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_selection]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a node to the selection.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The newly selected node will not be automatically edited in the "
"inspector. If you want to edit a node, use [method "
"EditorInterface.edit_node]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid "Clear the selection."
msgstr "Limpa a seleção."

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid "Returns the list of selected nodes."
msgstr "Retorna a lista de nós selecionados."

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of top selected nodes only, excluding any children. This is "
"useful for performing transform operations (moving them, rotating, etc.).\n"
"For example, if there is a node A with a child B and a sibling C, then "
"selecting all three will cause this method to return only A and C. Changing "
"the global transform of A will affect the global transform of B, so there is "
"no need to change B separately."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid "Use [method get_top_selected_nodes] instead."
msgstr "Use [method get_top_selected_nodes] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of top selected nodes only, excluding any children. This is "
"useful for performing transform operations (moving them, rotating, etc.). "
"See [method get_top_selected_nodes]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna apenas a lista de nós superiores selecionados, excluindo quaisquer "
"filhos. Isso é útil para executar operações de transformação (movê-los, girá-"
"los, etc.). Consulte [method get_top_selected_nodes]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid "Removes a node from the selection."
msgstr "Remove um nó da seleção."

#: doc/classes/EditorSelection.xml
msgid "Emitted when the selection changes."
msgstr "Emitido quando a seleção muda."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Object that holds the project-independent editor settings."
msgstr ""
"Objeto que armazena as configurações do editor independentes do projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Object that holds the project-independent editor settings. These settings "
"are generally visible in the [b]Editor > Editor Settings[/b] menu.\n"
"Property names use slash delimiters to distinguish sections. Setting values "
"can be of any [Variant] type. It's recommended to use [code]snake_case[/"
"code] for editor settings to be consistent with the Godot editor itself.\n"
"Editor settings are saved automatically when changed.\n"
"Accessing the settings can be done using the following methods, such as:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"# `settings.set(\"some/property\", 10)` also works as this class overrides "
"`_set()` internally.\n"
"settings.set_setting(\"some/property\", 10)\n"
"# `settings.get(\"some/property\")` also works as this class overrides "
"`_get()` internally.\n"
"settings.get_setting(\"some/property\")\n"
"var list_of_settings = settings.get_property_list()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EditorSettings settings = EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorSettings();\n"
"// `settings.set(\"some/property\", value)` also works as this class "
"overrides `_set()` internally.\n"
"settings.SetSetting(\"some/property\", Value);\n"
"// `settings.get(\"some/property\", value)` also works as this class "
"overrides `_get()` internally.\n"
"settings.GetSetting(\"some/property\");\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> listOfSettings = "
"settings.GetPropertyList();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_editor_settings]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto que armazena as configurações do editor independentes do projeto. "
"Essas configurações geralmente são visíveis no menu [b]Editor > Editor "
"Settings[/b].\n"
"Os nomes das propriedades usam delimitadores de barra para distinguir "
"seções. Os valores das configurações podem ser de qualquer tipo [Variant]. É "
"recomendado usar [code]snake_case[/code] para as configurações do editor "
"para manter a consistência com o próprio editor do Godot.\n"
"As configurações do editor são salvas automaticamente quando alteradas.\n"
"O acesso às configurações pode ser feito usando os seguintes métodos, como:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"# `settings.set(\"some/property\", 10)` também funciona, pois esta classe "
"sobrescreve `_set()` internamente.\n"
"settings.set_setting(\"some/property\", 10)\n"
"# `settings.get(\"some/property\")` também funciona, pois esta classe "
"sobrescreve `_get()` internamente.\n"
"settings.get_setting(\"some/property\")\n"
"var list_of_settings = settings.get_property_list()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EditorSettings settings = EditorInterface.Singleton.GetEditorSettings();\n"
"// `settings.set(\"some/property\", value)` também funciona, pois esta "
"classe sobrescreve `_set()` internamente.\n"
"settings.SetSetting(\"some/property\", Value);\n"
"// `settings.get(\"some/property\", value)` também funciona, pois esta "
"classe sobrescreve `_get()` internamente.\n"
"settings.GetSetting(\"some/property\");\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> listOfSettings = "
"settings.GetPropertyList();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta classe não deve ser instanciada diretamente. Em vez disso, "
"acesse o singleton usando [method EditorInterface.get_editor_settings]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom property info to a property. The dictionary must contain:\n"
"- [code]name[/code]: [String] (the name of the property)\n"
"- [code]type[/code]: [int] (see [enum Variant.Type])\n"
"- optionally [code]hint[/code]: [int] (see [enum PropertyHint]) and "
"[code]hint_string[/code]: [String]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"settings.set(\"category/property_name\", 0)\n"
"\n"
"var property_info = {\n"
"\t\"name\": \"category/property_name\",\n"
"\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\"hint_string\": \"one,two,three\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"settings.add_property_info(property_info)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var settings = GetEditorInterface().GetEditorSettings();\n"
"settings.Set(\"category/property_name\", 0);\n"
"\n"
"var propertyInfo = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"name\", \"category/propertyName\" },\n"
"\t{ \"type\", Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t{ \"hint\", PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t{ \"hint_string\", \"one,two,three\" },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"settings.AddPropertyInfo(propertyInfo);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Adiciona informações de propriedade personalizadas a uma propriedade. O "
"dicionário deve conter:\n"
"- [code]name[/code]: [String] (o nome da propriedade)\n"
"- [code]type[/code]: [int] (consulte [enum Variant.Type])\n"
"- opcionalmente [code]hint[/code]: [int] (consulte [enum PropertyHint]) e "
"[code]hint_string[/code]: [String]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var settings = EditorInterface.get_editor_settings()\n"
"settings.set(\"category/property_name\", 0)\n"
"\n"
"var property_info = {\n"
"\t\"name\": \"category/property_name\",\n"
"\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\"hint_string\": \"one,two,three\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"settings.add_property_info(property_info)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var settings = GetEditorInterface().GetEditorSettings();\n"
"settings.Set(\"category/property_name\", 0);\n"
"\n"
"var propertyInfo = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"name\", \"category/propertyName\" },\n"
"\t{ \"type\", Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t{ \"hint\", PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t{ \"hint_string\", \"one,two,three\" },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"settings.AddPropertyInfo(propertyInfo);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a [param shortcut] whose path is specified by [param path].\n"
"The [param path] determines how the shortcut is organized and displayed in "
"the editor's shortcut settings. The path format affects the display as "
"follows:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code] (no slash): Creates a category named [code]name[/"
"code] with the shortcut displayed as [code]name[/code].\n"
"- [code]\"category/name\"[/code] (single slash): Displays as [code]name[/"
"code] in the [code]category[/code] section.\n"
"- [code]\"category/name/extra\"[/code] (multiple slashes): Extra path "
"components are ignored, so this behaves the same as [code]\"category/name\"[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Shortcuts are only saved to the editor settings if they differ "
"from their original/default state. This means empty shortcuts that were "
"originally empty will not persist between editor sessions and must be re-"
"added. If a shortcut with the same [param path] already exists, this method "
"will update it with the new [param shortcut] instead of creating a "
"duplicate.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Add a custom shortcut for a plugin action.\n"
"var my_shortcut = Shortcut.new()\n"
"var input_event = InputEventKey.new()\n"
"input_event.keycode = KEY_F5\n"
"input_event.ctrl_pressed = true\n"
"my_shortcut.events.append(input_event)\n"
"\n"
"# This will appear under the \"My Plugin\" category as \"Reload Data\".\n"
"EditorInterface.get_editor_settings().add_shortcut(\"my_plugin/"
"reload_data\", my_shortcut)\n"
"\n"
"# This will appear under the \"Test Action\" category as \"Test Action\".\n"
"EditorInterface.get_editor_settings().add_shortcut(\"test_action\", "
"my_shortcut)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Checks if any settings with the prefix [param setting_prefix] exist in the "
"set of changed settings. See also [method get_changed_settings]."
msgstr ""
"Verifica se existem configurações com o prefixo [param setting_prefix] no "
"conjunto de configurações alteradas. Veja também [method "
"get_changed_settings]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Erases the setting whose name is specified by [param property]."
msgstr "Apaga a configuração cujo nome é especificado por [param property]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Gets an array of the settings which have been changed since the last save. "
"Note that internally [code]changed_settings[/code] is cleared after a "
"successful save, so generally the most appropriate place to use this method "
"is when processing [constant NOTIFICATION_EDITOR_SETTINGS_CHANGED]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém um array das configurações que foram alteradas desde o último "
"salvamento. Note que internamente [code]changed_settings[/code] é limpo após "
"um salvamento bem-sucedido, então geralmente o lugar mais apropriado para "
"usar este método é ao processar [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_EDITOR_SETTINGS_CHANGED]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Returns the list of favorite files and directories for this project."
msgstr "Retorna a lista de arquivos e diretórios favoritos para este projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns project-specific metadata for the [param section] and [param key] "
"specified. If the metadata doesn't exist, [param default] will be returned "
"instead. See also [method set_project_metadata]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna metadados específicos do projeto para a [param section] e [param "
"key] especificadas. Se os metadados não existirem, [param default] será "
"retornado em vez disso. Consulte também [method set_project_metadata]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of recently visited folders in the file dialog for this "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de pastas visitadas recentemente no diálogo de arquivos para "
"este projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the setting specified by [param name]. This is "
"equivalent to using [method Object.get] on the EditorSettings instance."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor da configuração especificada por [param name]. Isso é "
"equivalente a usar [method Object.get] na instância EditorSettings."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the shortcut specified by [param path]. Tries to find a built-in "
"action if no shortcut with the provided path is found in the shortcut list. "
"If found, adds it to the list and returns it, otherwise returns [code]null[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o atalho especificado por [param path]. Tenta encontrar uma ação "
"integrada se nenhum atalho com o caminho fornecido for encontrado na lista "
"de atalhos. Se encontrado, adiciona-o à lista e o retorna; caso contrário, "
"retorna [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Returns the list of stored shortcut paths."
msgstr "Retorna a lista de caminhos de atalho armazenados."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the setting specified by [param name] exists, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a configuração especificada por [param name] "
"existir, [code]false[/code] caso contrário."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the shortcut specified by [param path] exists, "
"[code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o atalho especificado por [param path] existir, "
"[code]false[/code] caso contrário."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the shortcut specified by [param path] matches "
"the event specified by [param event], [code]false[/code] otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o atalho especificado por [param path] "
"corresponder ao evento especificado por [param event], [code]false[/code] "
"caso contrário."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Marks the passed editor setting as being changed, see [method "
"get_changed_settings]. Only settings which exist (see [method has_setting]) "
"will be accepted."
msgstr ""
"Marca a configuração do editor passada como alterada; consulte [method "
"get_changed_settings]. Apenas configurações que existem (consulte [method "
"has_setting]) serão aceitas."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Removes the shortcut specified by [param path]."
msgstr "Remove o atalho especificado por [param path]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides the built-in editor action [param name] with the input actions "
"defined in [param actions_list]."
msgstr ""
"Substitui a ação de editor integrada [param name] pelas ações de entrada "
"definidas em [param actions_list]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Sets the list of favorite files and directories for this project."
msgstr "Define a lista de arquivos e diretórios favoritos para este projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the initial value of the setting specified by [param name] to [param "
"value]. This is used to provide a value for the Revert button in the Editor "
"Settings. If [param update_current] is [code]true[/code], the setting is "
"reset to [param value] as well."
msgstr ""
"Define o valor inicial da configuração especificada por [param name] para "
"[param value]. Isso é usado para fornecer um valor para o botão Reverter nas "
"Configurações do Editor. Se [param update_current] for [code]true[/code], a "
"configuração também é redefinida para [param value]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets project-specific metadata with the [param section], [param key] and "
"[param data] specified. This metadata is stored outside the project folder "
"and therefore won't be checked into version control. See also [method "
"get_project_metadata]."
msgstr ""
"Define metadados específicos do projeto com a [param section], [param key] e "
"[param data] especificados. Esses metadados são armazenados fora da pasta do "
"projeto e, portanto, não serão incluídos no controle de versão. Consulte "
"também [method get_project_metadata]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the list of recently visited folders in the file dialog for this "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Define a lista de pastas visitadas recentemente no diálogo de arquivos para "
"este projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [param value] of the setting specified by [param name]. This is "
"equivalent to using [method Object.set] on the EditorSettings instance."
msgstr ""
"Define o [param value] da configuração especificada por [param name]. Isso é "
"equivalente a usar [method Object.set] na instância EditorSettings."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"A list of the available URLs that can be chosen in the Asset Store to fetch "
"asset data. With the key being the name, and the value being the URL."
msgstr ""
"Uma lista das URLs disponíveis que podem ser escolhidas na Loja de Ativos "
"para buscar dados de ativos. Sendo a chave o nome e o valor a URL."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Asset Store uses multiple threads for its HTTP "
"requests. This prevents the Asset Store from blocking the main thread for "
"every loaded asset."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a Asset Store usa múltiplas threads para suas "
"solicitações HTTP. Isso evita que a Asset Store bloqueie a thread principal "
"para cada ativo carregado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically switches to the [b]Remote[/b] scene tree "
"when running the project from the editor. If [code]false[/code], stays on "
"the [b]Local[/b] scene tree when running the project from the editor.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Enabling this setting can cause stuttering when running a "
"project with a large amount of nodes (typically a few thousands of nodes or "
"more), even if the editor window isn't focused. This is due to the remote "
"scene tree being updated every second regardless of whether the editor is "
"focused."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically switches to the [b]Stack Trace[/b] panel "
"when the debugger hits a breakpoint or steps."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], alterna automaticamente para o painel [b]Stack Trace[/"
"b] quando o depurador atinge um ponto de interrupção ou executa uma etapa."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The limit of how many remote nodes can be selected at once.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Increasing this value is not recommended, as selecting too "
"many can make the editing and inspection of remote properties unreliable."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables collection of profiling data from non-GDScript "
"Godot functions, such as engine class methods. Enabling this slows execution "
"while profiling further."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa a coleta de dados de perfil de funções do Godot "
"que não são GDScript, como métodos de classe do mecanismo. Ativar isso "
"diminui a velocidade de execução durante a criação de perfis."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the profiler's frame history. The default value (3600) allows "
"seeing up to 60 seconds of profiling if the project renders at a constant 60 "
"FPS. Higher values allow viewing longer periods of profiling in the graphs, "
"especially when the project is running at high framerates."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho do histórico de quadros do criador de perfil. O valor padrão "
"(3600) permite ver até 60 segundos de perfil se o projeto renderizar a "
"constantes 60 FPS. Valores mais altos permitem visualizar períodos mais "
"longos de perfil nos gráficos, especialmente quando o projeto está rodando "
"em altas taxas de quadros."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of script functions that can be displayed per frame in "
"the profiler. If there are more script functions called in a given profiler "
"frame, these functions will be discarded from the profiling results "
"entirely.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only read when the profiler is first started, "
"so changing it during profiling will have no effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The target frame rate shown in the visual profiler graph, in frames per "
"second."
msgstr ""
"A taxa de quadros alvo exibida no gráfico do criador de perfil visual, em "
"quadros por segundo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The refresh interval for the remote inspector's properties (in seconds). "
"Lower values are more reactive, but may cause stuttering while the project "
"is running from the editor and the [b]Remote[/b] scene tree is selected in "
"the Scene tree dock."
msgstr ""
"O intervalo de atualização para as propriedades do inspetor remoto (em "
"segundos). Valores mais baixos são mais reativos, mas podem causar "
"travamentos enquanto o projeto está sendo executado a partir do editor e a "
"árvore de cena [b]Remote[/b] está selecionada no dock da árvore de cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The refresh interval for the remote scene tree (in seconds). Lower values "
"are more reactive, but may cause stuttering while the project is running "
"from the editor and the [b]Remote[/b] scene tree is selected in the Scene "
"tree dock."
msgstr ""
"O intervalo de atualização para a árvore de cenas remota (em segundos). "
"Valores mais baixos são mais reativos, mas podem causar travamentos enquanto "
"o projeto está em execução a partir do editor e a árvore de cenas [b]Remote[/"
"b] está selecionada no dock da árvore de cenas."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays folders in the FileSystem dock's bottom pane "
"when split mode is enabled. If [code]false[/code], only files will be "
"displayed in the bottom pane. Split mode can be toggled by pressing the icon "
"next to the [code]res://[/code] folder path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect when split mode is disabled (which "
"is the default)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a confirmation dialog when moving or "
"duplicating items in the FileSystem dock. This dialog can also be bypassed "
"by holding [kbd]Shift[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe uma caixa de diálogo de confirmação ao mover ou "
"duplicar itens no dock FileSystem. Esta caixa de diálogo também pode ser "
"ignorada mantendo pressionado [kbd]Shift[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], scripts created in FileSystem dock will be "
"automatically edited."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os scripts criados na doca do Sistema de Arquivos "
"serão editados automaticamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"A comma separated list of unsupported file extensions to show in the "
"FileSystem dock, e.g. [code]\"ico,icns\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Uma lista separada por vírgulas de extensões de arquivo não suportadas para "
"exibir na doca FileSystem, por exemplo [code]\"ico,icns\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"A comma separated list of file extensions to consider as editable text files "
"in the FileSystem dock (by double-clicking on the files), e.g. [code]"
"\"txt,md,cfg,ini,log,json,yml,yaml,toml,xml\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Uma lista separada por vírgulas de extensões de arquivo a serem consideradas "
"como arquivos de texto editáveis no painel FileSystem (clicando duas vezes "
"nos arquivos), por exemplo, [code]"
"\"txt,md,cfg,ini,log,json,yml,yaml,toml,xml\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The thumbnail size to use in the FileSystem dock (in pixels). See also "
"[member filesystem/file_dialog/thumbnail_size]."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da miniatura a ser usado no dock FileSystem (em pixels). Veja "
"também [member filesystem/file_dialog/thumbnail_size]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The refresh interval to use for the Inspector dock's properties. The effect "
"of this setting is mainly noticeable when adjusting gizmos in the 2D/3D "
"editor and looking at the inspector at the same time. Lower values make the "
"inspector refresh more often, but take up more CPU time."
msgstr ""
"O intervalo de atualização a ser usado para as propriedades da doca do "
"Inspetor. O efeito dessa configuração é principalmente perceptível ao "
"ajustar gizmos no editor 2D/3D e olhar para o inspetor ao mesmo tempo. "
"Valores mais baixos fazem o inspetor atualizar com mais frequência, mas "
"consomem mais tempo de CPU."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The tint intensity to use for the subresources background in the Inspector "
"dock. The tint is used to distinguish between different subresources in the "
"inspector. Higher values result in a more noticeable background color "
"difference."
msgstr ""
"A intensidade da tonalidade a ser usada para o fundo dos subrecursos no dock "
"do Inspetor. A tonalidade é usada para distinguir entre diferentes "
"subrecursos no inspetor. Valores mais altos resultam em uma diferença de cor "
"de fundo mais perceptível."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], accessibility related warnings are displayed alongside "
"other configuration warnings."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], avisos relacionados a acessibilidade serão exibidos "
"junto com outros avisos de configuração."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when a node is deleted with animation tracks "
"referencing it, a confirmation dialog appears before the tracks are deleted. "
"The dialog will appear even when using the \"Delete (No Confirm)\" shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], quando um nó for excluído com trilhas de animação "
"fazendo referência a ele, uma caixa de diálogo de confirmação aparecerá "
"antes que as trilhas sejam excluídas. A caixa de diálogo aparecerá mesmo ao "
"usar o atalho \"Delete (No Confirm)\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a confirmation dialog after left-clicking the "
"\"percent\" icon next to a node name in the Scene tree dock. When clicked, "
"this icon revokes the node's scene-unique name, which can impact the "
"behavior of scripts that rely on this scene-unique name due to identifiers "
"not being found anymore."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe uma caixa de diálogo de confirmação após clicar "
"com o botão esquerdo no ícone de \"porcentagem\" ao lado de um nome de nó na "
"doca da árvore de cena. Quando clicado, este ícone revoga o nome exclusivo "
"de cena do nó, o que pode impactar o comportamento de scripts que dependem "
"desse nome exclusivo de cena devido aos identificadores não serem mais "
"encontrados."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scene tree dock will automatically unfold nodes "
"when a node that has folded parents is selected."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o dock da árvore de cenas desdobrará automaticamente "
"os nós quando um nó que possui pais dobrados for selecionado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], new node created when reparenting node(s) will be "
"positioned at the average position of the selected node(s)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o novo nó criado ao alterar o(s) pai(s) do(s) nó(s) "
"será posicionado na posição média do(s) nó(s) selecionado(s)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scene tree dock will only show nodes that match "
"the filter, without showing parents that don't. This settings can also be "
"changed in the Scene dock's top menu."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a doca da árvore de cenas mostrará apenas nós que "
"correspondem ao filtro, sem mostrar os pais que não correspondem. Essa "
"configuração também pode ser alterada no menu superior da doca Cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Create dialog (Create New Node/Create New "
"Resource) will start with all its sections expanded. Otherwise, sections "
"will be collapsed until the user starts searching (which will automatically "
"expand sections as needed)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a caixa de diálogo de criação (Criar Novo Nó/Criar "
"Novo Recurso) começará com todas as suas seções expandidas. Caso contrário, "
"as seções ficarão recolhidas até que o usuário comece a pesquisar (o que "
"expandirá automaticamente as seções conforme necessário)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Delay time for automatic resampling in the 2D editor (in seconds)."
msgstr ""
"Tempo de atraso para reamostragem automática no editor 2D (em segundos)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The \"start\" stop of the color gradient to use for bones in the 2D skeleton "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"A parada \"inicial\" do gradiente de cores a ser usada para ossos no editor "
"de esqueleto 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The \"end\" stop of the color gradient to use for bones in the 2D skeleton "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"A parada \"final\" do gradiente de cor a ser usado para ossos no editor de "
"esqueleto 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for inverse kinematics-enabled bones in the 2D skeleton "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para ossos com cinemática inversa habilitada no editor de "
"esqueleto 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The outline color to use for non-selected bones in the 2D skeleton editor. "
"See also [member editors/2d/bone_selected_color]."
msgstr ""
"A cor de contorno a ser usada para ossos não selecionados no editor de "
"esqueletos 2D. Veja também [member editors/2d/bone_selected_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The outline size in the 2D skeleton editor (in pixels). See also [member "
"editors/2d/bone_width].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this value only apply after modifying a [Bone2D] "
"node in any way, or closing and reopening the scene."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for selected bones in the 2D skeleton editor. See also "
"[member editors/2d/bone_outline_color]."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para ossos selecionados no editor de esqueletos 2D. Veja "
"também [member editors/2d/bone_outline_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The bone width in the 2D skeleton editor (in pixels). See also [member "
"editors/2d/bone_outline_size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this value only apply after modifying a [Bone2D] "
"node in any way, or closing and reopening the scene."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The grid color to use in the 2D editor."
msgstr "A cor da grade a ser usada no editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The guides color to use in the 2D editor. Guides can be created by dragging "
"the mouse cursor from the rulers."
msgstr ""
"A cor das guias a ser usada no editor 2D. Guias podem ser criadas arrastando "
"o cursor do mouse a partir das réguas."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the selection rectangle that surrounds selected locked "
"nodes in the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para o retângulo de seleção que envolve nós bloqueados "
"selecionados no viewport do editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The thickness of the coordinate ruler in the 2D editor. Increasing this will "
"also increase the size of the ruler font, improving readability when using a "
"lower editor scale. The editor may force a minimum size to keep the ruler "
"numbers legible."
msgstr ""
"A espessura da régua de coordenadas no editor 2D. Aumentar isso também "
"aumentará o tamanho da fonte da régua, melhorando a legibilidade ao usar uma "
"escala de editor menor. O editor pode forçar um tamanho mínimo para manter "
"os números da régua legíveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the selection rectangle outlines that surrounds "
"selected nodes in the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para os contornos do retângulo de seleção que envolvem os "
"nós selecionados no viewport do editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use when drawing smart snapping lines in the 2D editor. The "
"smart snapping lines will automatically display when moving 2D nodes if "
"smart snapping is enabled in the Snapping Options menu at the top of the 2D "
"editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada ao desenhar linhas de alinhamento inteligente no editor "
"2D. As linhas de alinhamento inteligente serão exibidas automaticamente ao "
"mover nós 2D se o alinhamento inteligente estiver ativado no menu Opções de "
"Alinhamento na parte superior da viewport do editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the 2D editor will snap to integer zoom values when "
"not holding the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] key. If [code]false[/code], this behavior is "
"swapped."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o editor 2D se ajustará a valores de zoom inteiros "
"quando a tecla [kbd]Alt[/kbd] não estiver pressionada. Se [code]false[/"
"code], esse comportamento é invertido."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of the viewport border in the 2D editor. This border represents "
"the viewport's size at the base resolution defined in the Project Settings. "
"Objects placed outside this border will not be visible unless a [Camera2D] "
"node is used, or unless the window is resized and the stretch mode is set to "
"[code]disabled[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A cor da borda da viewport no editor 2D. Esta borda representa o tamanho da "
"viewport na resolução base definida nas Configurações do Projeto. Objetos "
"colocados fora desta borda não serão visíveis, a menos que um nó [Camera2D] "
"seja usado ou a janela seja redimensionada e o modo de estiramento esteja "
"definido como [code]disabled[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The factor to use when zooming in or out in the 2D editor. For example, "
"[code]1.1[/code] will zoom in by 10% with every step. If set to [code]2.0[/"
"code], zooming will only cycle through powers of two."
msgstr ""
"O fator a ser usado ao aplicar zoom in ou zoom out no editor 2D. Por "
"exemplo, [code]1.1[/code] dará zoom in em 10% a cada passo. Se definido como "
"[code]2.0[/code], o zoom alternará apenas entre potências de dois."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the active selection box that surrounds selected nodes "
"in the 3D editor viewport.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The term \"active\" indicates that this object is the primary "
"selection used as the basis for certain operations. This is the last "
"selected [Node3D], which can be reordered with [kbd]Shift + Left mouse "
"button[/kbd]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default camera vertical field of view to use in the 3D editor (in "
"degrees). The camera field of view can be adjusted on a per-scene basis "
"using the [b]View[/b] menu at the top of the 3D editor. If a scene had its "
"camera field of view adjusted using the [b]View[/b] menu, this setting is "
"ignored in the scene in question. This setting is also ignored while a "
"[Camera3D] node is being previewed in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The editor camera always uses the [b]Keep Height[/b] aspect "
"mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default camera far clip distance to use in the 3D editor (in degrees). "
"Higher values make it possible to view objects placed further away from the "
"camera, at the cost of lower precision in the depth buffer (which can result "
"in visible Z-fighting in the distance). The camera far clip distance can be "
"adjusted on a per-scene basis using the [b]View[/b] menu at the top of the "
"3D editor. If a scene had its camera far clip distance adjusted using the "
"[b]View[/b] menu, this setting is ignored in the scene in question. This "
"setting is also ignored while a [Camera3D] node is being previewed in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"A distância de corte distante padrão da câmera a ser usada no editor 3D (em "
"graus). Valores mais altos tornam possível visualizar objetos colocados mais "
"longe da câmera, ao custo de menor precisão no buffer de profundidade (o que "
"pode resultar em Z-fighting visível à distância). A distância de corte "
"distante da câmera pode ser ajustada por cena usando o menu [b]Exibir[/b] na "
"parte superior do editor 3D. Se uma cena teve sua distância de corte "
"distante da câmera ajustada usando o menu [b]Exibir[/b], esta configuração é "
"ignorada na cena em questão. Esta configuração também é ignorada enquanto um "
"nó [Camera3D] está sendo visualizado no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default camera near clip distance to use in the 3D editor (in degrees). "
"Lower values make it possible to view objects placed closer to the camera, "
"at the cost of lower precision in the depth buffer (which can result in "
"visible Z-fighting in the distance). The camera near clip distance can be "
"adjusted on a per-scene basis using the [b]View[/b] menu at the top of the "
"3D editor. If a scene had its camera near clip distance adjusted using the "
"[b]View[/b] menu, this setting is ignored in the scene in question. This "
"setting is also ignored while a [Camera3D] node is being previewed in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"A distância de corte próximo padrão da câmera a ser usada no editor 3D (em "
"graus). Valores mais baixos tornam possível visualizar objetos colocados "
"mais perto da câmera, ao custo de menor precisão no buffer de profundidade "
"(o que pode resultar em Z-fighting visível à distância). A distância de "
"corte próximo da câmera pode ser ajustada por cena usando o menu [b]Exibir[/"
"b] na parte superior do editor 3D. Se uma cena teve sua distância de corte "
"próximo da câmera ajustada usando o menu [b]Exibir[/b], esta configuração é "
"ignorada na cena em questão. Esta configuração também é ignorada enquanto um "
"nó [Camera3D] está sendo visualizado no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The modifier key to use to enable freelook in the 3D editor (on top of "
"pressing the right mouse button).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of this setting, the freelook toggle keyboard "
"shortcut ([kbd]Shift + F[/kbd] by default) is always available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On certain window managers on Linux, the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] key "
"will be intercepted by the window manager when clicking a mouse button at "
"the same time. This means Godot will not see the modifier key as being "
"pressed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The base 3D freelook speed in units per second. This can be adjusted by "
"using the mouse wheel while in freelook mode, or by holding down the "
"\"fast\" or \"slow\" modifier keys ([kbd]Shift[/kbd] and [kbd]Alt[/kbd] by "
"default, respectively)."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade básica de voo livre 3D em unidades por segundo. Isso pode ser "
"ajustado usando a roda do mouse enquanto estiver no modo de voo livre, ou "
"mantendo pressionadas as teclas modificadoras \"fast\" ou \"slow\" "
"([kbd]Shift[/kbd] e [kbd]Alt[/kbd] por padrão, respectivamente)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The inertia of the 3D freelook camera. Higher values make the camera start "
"and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr ""
"A inércia da câmera de voo livre 3D. Valores mais altos fazem a câmera "
"iniciar e parar mais devagar, o que parece mais suave, mas adiciona latência."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], invert the vertical mouse axis when using freelook "
"mode in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], inverte o eixo vertical do mouse ao usar o modo de "
"visualização livre (freelook) no editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The navigation scheme to use when freelook is enabled in the 3D editor. Some "
"of the navigation schemes below may be more convenient when designing "
"specific levels in the 3D editor.\n"
"- [b]Default:[/b] The \"Freelook Forward\", \"Freelook Backward\", "
"\"Freelook Up\" and \"Freelook Down\" keys will move relative to the camera, "
"taking its pitch angle into account for the movement.\n"
"- [b]Partially Axis-Locked:[/b] The \"Freelook Forward\" and \"Freelook "
"Backward\" keys will move relative to the camera, taking its pitch angle "
"into account for the movement. The \"Freelook Up\" and \"Freelook Down\" "
"keys will move in an \"absolute\" manner, [i]not[/i] taking the camera's "
"pitch angle into account for the movement.\n"
"- [b]Fully Axis-Locked:[/b] The \"Freelook Forward\", \"Freelook Backward\", "
"\"Freelook Up\" and \"Freelook Down\" keys will move in an \"absolute\" "
"manner, [i]not[/i] taking the camera's pitch angle into account for the "
"movement.\n"
"See also [member editors/3d/navigation/navigation_scheme]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse sensitivity to use while freelook mode is active in the 3D editor. "
"See also [member editors/3d/navigation_feel/orbit_sensitivity]."
msgstr ""
"A sensibilidade do mouse a ser usada enquanto o modo de visão livre estiver "
"ativo no editor 3D. Veja também [member editors/3d/navigation_feel/"
"orbit_sensitivity]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], freelook speed is linked to the zoom value used in the "
"camera orbit mode in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a velocidade de voo livre é vinculada ao valor de zoom "
"usado no modo de órbita da câmera no editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The grid division bias to use in the 3D editor. Negative values will cause "
"small grid divisions to appear earlier, whereas positive values will cause "
"small grid divisions to appear later."
msgstr ""
"O viés de divisão de grade a ser usado no editor 3D. Valores negativos farão "
"com que pequenas divisões de grade apareçam mais cedo, enquanto valores "
"positivos farão com que pequenas divisões de grade apareçam mais tarde."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The largest grid division to use in the 3D editor. Together with [member "
"editors/3d/primary_grid_steps], this determines how large the grid divisions "
"can be. The grid divisions will not be able to get larger than "
"[code]primary_grid_steps ^ grid_division_level_max[/code] units. By default, "
"when [member editors/3d/primary_grid_steps] is [code]8[/code], this means "
"grid divisions cannot get larger than [code]64[/code] units each (so primary "
"grid lines are [code]512[/code] units apart), no matter how far away the "
"camera is from the grid."
msgstr ""
"A maior divisão de grade a ser usada no editor 3D. Junto com [member editors/"
"3d/primary_grid_steps], isso determina quão grandes as divisões de grade "
"podem ser. As divisões de grade não poderão ficar maiores do que unidades "
"[code]primary_grid_steps ^ grid_division_level_max[/code]. Por padrão, "
"quando [member editors/3d/primary_grid_steps] é [code]8[/code], isso "
"significa que as divisões de grade não podem ficar maiores do que [code]64[/"
"code] unidades cada (então as linhas de grade primárias estão a [code]512[/"
"code] unidades de distância), não importa quão longe a câmera esteja da "
"grade."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The smallest grid division to use in the 3D editor. Together with [member "
"editors/3d/primary_grid_steps], this determines how small the grid divisions "
"can be. The grid divisions will not be able to get smaller than "
"[code]primary_grid_steps ^ grid_division_level_min[/code] units. By default, "
"this means grid divisions cannot get smaller than 1 unit each, no matter how "
"close the camera is from the grid."
msgstr ""
"A menor divisão de grade a ser usada no editor 3D. Juntamente com [member "
"editors/3d/primary_grid_steps], isso determina quão pequenas as divisões da "
"grade podem ser. As divisões da grade não poderão ser menores que "
"[code]primary_grid_steps ^ grid_division_level_min[/code] unidades. Por "
"padrão, isso significa que as divisões da grade não podem ser menores que 1 "
"unidade cada, não importa quão perto a câmera esteja da grade."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The grid size in units. Higher values prevent the grid from appearing \"cut "
"off\" at certain angles, but make the grid more demanding to render. "
"Depending on the camera's position, the grid may not be fully visible since "
"a shader is used to fade it progressively."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da grade em unidades. Valores mais altos evitam que a grade pareça "
"\"cortada\" em determinados ângulos, mas tornam a grade mais pesada para "
"renderizar. Dependendo da posição da câmera, a grade pode não estar "
"totalmente visível, pois um shader é usado para desvanecê-la "
"progressivamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders the grid on the XY plane in perspective view. "
"This can be useful for 3D side-scrolling games."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], renderiza a grade no plano XY em visão perspectiva. "
"Isso pode ser útil para jogos 3D de rolagem lateral."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders the grid on the XZ plane in perspective view."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], renderiza a grade no plano XZ em visão em perspectiva."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], renders the grid on the YZ plane in perspective view. "
"This can be useful for 3D side-scrolling games."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], renderiza a grade no plano YZ em visão perspectiva. "
"Isso pode ser útil para jogos 3D de rolagem lateral."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Opacity of the default gizmo for moving, rotating, and scaling 3D nodes."
msgstr "Opacidade do gizmo padrão para mover, rotacionar e dimensionar nós 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Size of the default gizmo for moving, rotating, and scaling 3D nodes."
msgstr "Tamanho do gizmo padrão para mover, rotacionar e escalar nós 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables 3-button mouse emulation mode. This is useful "
"on laptops when using a trackpad.\n"
"When 3-button mouse emulation mode is enabled, the pan, zoom and orbit "
"modifiers can always be used in the 3D editor viewport, even when not "
"holding down any mouse button."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows using the top row [kbd]0[/kbd]-[kbd]9[/kbd] "
"keys to function as their equivalent numpad keys for 3D editor navigation. "
"This should be enabled on keyboards that have no numeric keypad available."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite que as teclas da linha superior [kbd]0[/kbd]-"
"[kbd]9[/kbd] funcionem como suas teclas de teclado numérico equivalentes "
"para navegação no editor 3D. Isso deve ser ativado em teclados que não "
"possuem um teclado numérico disponível."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], invert the horizontal mouse axis when panning or "
"orbiting in the 3D editor. This setting does [i]not[/i] apply to freelook "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], inverte o eixo horizontal do mouse ao mover ou orbitar "
"no editor 3D. Esta configuração [i]não[/i] se aplica ao modo de visão livre."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], invert the vertical mouse axis when panning or "
"orbiting in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], inverte o eixo vertical do mouse ao mover ou orbitar "
"no editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The navigation scheme preset to use in the 3D editor. Changing this setting "
"will affect the mouse button and modifier keys used to navigate the 3D "
"editor viewport.\n"
"All schemes can use [kbd]Mouse wheel[/kbd] to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Godot:[/b] [kbd]Middle mouse button[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Shift + Middle "
"mouse button[/kbd] to pan. [kbd]Ctrl + Middle mouse button[/kbd] to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Maya:[/b] [kbd]Alt + Left mouse button[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Middle "
"mouse button[/kbd] to pan, [kbd]Shift + Middle mouse button[/kbd] to pan 10 "
"times faster. [kbd]Alt + Right mouse button[/kbd] to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Modo:[/b] [kbd]Alt + Left mouse button[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Alt + Shift "
"+ Left mouse button[/kbd] to pan. [kbd]Ctrl + Alt + Left mouse button[/kbd] "
"to zoom.\n"
"- [b]Tablet/Trackpad:[/b] [kbd]Alt[/kbd] to orbit. [kbd]Shift[/kbd] to pan. "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] to zoom. Enables 3-button mouse emulation mode.\n"
"See also [member editors/3d/navigation/orbit_mouse_button], [member editors/"
"3d/navigation/pan_mouse_button], [member editors/3d/navigation/"
"zoom_mouse_button], [member editors/3d/freelook/freelook_navigation_scheme], "
"and [member editors/3d/navigation/emulate_3_button_mouse].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On certain window managers on Linux, the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] key "
"will be intercepted by the window manager when clicking a mouse button at "
"the same time. This means Godot will not see the modifier key as being "
"pressed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse button that needs to be held down to orbit in the 3D editor "
"viewport."
msgstr ""
"O botão do mouse que precisa ser mantido pressionado para orbitar na "
"viewport do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse button that needs to be held down to pan in the 3D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"O botão do mouse que precisa ser mantido pressionado para mover a câmera "
"(pan) na viewport do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows gizmos for moving and rotating the camera in the "
"bottom corners of the 3D editor's viewport. Useful for devices that use "
"touch screen."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe gizmos para mover e rotacionar a câmera nos "
"cantos inferiores da viewport do editor 3D. Útil para dispositivos que usam "
"tela sensível ao toque."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows a small orientation gizmo in the top-right "
"corner of the 3D editor's viewports."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe um pequeno gizmo de orientação no canto superior "
"direito dos viewports do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], warps the mouse around the 3D viewport while panning "
"in the 3D editor. This makes it possible to pan over a large area without "
"having to exit panning and adjust the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], move o cursor do mouse (warp) ao redor da viewport 3D "
"ao fazer panorâmica no editor 3D. Isso torna possível fazer panorâmica em "
"uma grande área sem precisar sair do modo de panorâmica e ajustar o cursor "
"do mouse."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse button that needs to be held down to zoom in the 3D editor "
"viewport."
msgstr ""
"O botão do mouse que precisa ser mantido pressionado para aplicar zoom na "
"viewport do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse cursor movement direction to use when zooming by moving the mouse. "
"This does not affect zooming with the mouse wheel."
msgstr ""
"A direção do movimento do cursor do mouse a ser usada ao aplicar zoom "
"movendo o mouse. Isso não afeta o zoom com a roda do mouse."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The angle threshold for snapping camera rotation to 45-degree angles while "
"orbiting with [kbd]Alt[/kbd] held."
msgstr ""
"O limite de ângulo para o encaixe da rotação da câmera em ângulos de 45 "
"graus ao orbitar com [kbd]Alt[/kbd] pressionado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The inertia to use when orbiting in the 3D editor. Higher values make the "
"camera start and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr ""
"A inércia a ser usada ao orbitar a câmera no editor 3D. Valores mais altos "
"fazem a câmera começar e parar mais devagar, o que parece mais suave, mas "
"adiciona latência."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse sensitivity to use when orbiting in the 3D editor. See also "
"[member editors/3d/freelook/freelook_sensitivity]."
msgstr ""
"A sensibilidade do mouse a ser usada ao orbitar no editor 3D. Veja também "
"[member editors/3d/freelook/freelook_sensitivity]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The inertia to use when panning in the 3D editor. Higher values make the "
"camera start and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr ""
"A inércia a ser usada ao mover a câmera (panning) no editor 3D. Valores mais "
"altos fazem a câmera começar e parar mais devagar, o que parece mais suave, "
"mas adiciona latência."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The mouse sensitivity to use when panning in the 3D editor."
msgstr ""
"A sensibilidade do mouse a ser usada ao mover panoramicamente no editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The inertia to use when zooming in the 3D editor. Higher values make the "
"camera start and stop slower, which looks smoother but adds latency."
msgstr ""
"A inércia a ser usada ao aplicar zoom no editor 3D. Valores mais altos fazem "
"a câmera começar e parar mais devagar, o que parece mais suave, mas adiciona "
"latência."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the primary 3D grid. The color's alpha channel affects "
"the grid's opacity."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para a grade 3D primária. O canal alfa da cor afeta a "
"opacidade da grade."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If set above 0, where a primary grid line should be drawn. By default, "
"primary lines are configured to be more visible than secondary lines. This "
"helps with measurements in the 3D editor. See also [member editors/3d/"
"primary_grid_color] and [member editors/3d/secondary_grid_color]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido acima de 0, onde uma linha de grade primária deve ser desenhada. "
"Por padrão, as linhas primárias são configuradas para serem mais visíveis do "
"que as linhas secundárias. Isso ajuda nas medições no editor 3D. Veja também "
"[member editors/3d/primary_grid_color] e [member editors/3d/"
"secondary_grid_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the secondary 3D grid. This is generally a less visible "
"color than [member editors/3d/primary_grid_color]. The color's alpha channel "
"affects the grid's opacity."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para a grade 3D secundária. Esta é geralmente uma cor "
"menos visível do que [member editors/3d/primary_grid_color]. O canal alfa da "
"cor afeta a opacidade da grade."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the selection box that surrounds selected nodes in the "
"3D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para a caixa de seleção que envolve os nós selecionados na "
"viewport do editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If checked, the transform gizmo remains visible during rotation in that "
"transform mode."
msgstr ""
"Se marcado, o gizmo de transformação permanece visível durante a rotação "
"nesse modo de transformação."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The scale of the outer circle of the rotation gizmo as view plane rotation "
"in the 3D editor. If set to [code]2.0[/code], the outer circle has twice the "
"radius of the XYZ rotation gizmo sphere."
msgstr ""
"A escala do círculo externo do gizmo de rotação como rotação do plano de "
"visualização no editor 3D. Se definido como [code]2.0[/code], o círculo "
"externo tem o dobro do raio da esfera do gizmo de rotação XYZ."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the AABB gizmo that displays the [GeometryInstance3D]'s "
"custom [AABB]."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para o gizmo AABB que exibe o [AABB] personalizado do "
"[GeometryInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [Camera3D]s."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D para [Camera3D]s."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color for CSG nodes (such as [CSGShape3D] or [CSGBox3D])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do gizmo do editor 3D para nós CSG (como [CSGShape3D] ou [CSGBox3D])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [Decal] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D para nós [Decal]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [FogVolume] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D para nós [FogVolume]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for the [GridMap] grid."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D para a grade do [GridMap]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for the [IKModifier3D] guides."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D para as guias do [IKModifier3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color override to use for 3D editor gizmos if the [Node3D] in question "
"is part of an instantiated scene file (from the perspective of the current "
"scene)."
msgstr ""
"A substituição de cor a ser usada para gizmos do editor 3D se o [Node3D] em "
"questão fizer parte de uma cena instanciada (da perspectiva da cena atual)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color for [Joint3D]s and [PhysicalBone3D]s."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D para [Joint3D]s e [PhysicalBone3D]s."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color for representing [member Joint3D.node_a] for some [Joint3D] types."
msgstr ""
"Cor para representar [member Joint3D.node_a] para alguns tipos de [Joint3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color for representing [member Joint3D.node_b] for some [Joint3D] types."
msgstr ""
"Cor para representar [member Joint3D.node_b] para alguns tipos de [Joint3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Color of lines displayed in baked [LightmapGI] node's grid."
msgstr "Cor das linhas exibidas na malha do nó [LightmapGI] gerado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [LightmapProbe] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [LightmapProbe]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [OccluderInstance3D] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [OccluderInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [GPUParticlesAttractor3D] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [GPUParticlesAttractor3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [GPUParticlesCollision3D] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [GPUParticlesCollision3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [CPUParticles3D] and [GPUParticles3D] "
"nodes."
msgstr ""
"A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [CPUParticles3D] e "
"[GPUParticles3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [Path3D] tilt circles, which indicate the "
"direction the [Curve3D] is tilted towards."
msgstr ""
"A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para círculos de inclinação de [Path3D], "
"que indicam a direção para a qual o [Curve3D] está inclinado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [ReflectionProbe] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [ReflectionProbe]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for the currently selected [Skeleton3D] bone."
msgstr ""
"A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para o osso [Skeleton3D] atualmente "
"selecionado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [Skeleton3D] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [Skeleton3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [SpringBoneCollision3D] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [SpringBoneCollision3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [SpringBoneCollision3D] nodes with inside "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [SpringBoneCollision3D] com o "
"modo interno."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [SpringBoneSimulator3D] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [SpringBoneSimulator3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [AudioStreamPlayer3D]'s emission angle."
msgstr ""
"A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para o ângulo de emissão do "
"[AudioStreamPlayer3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D editor gizmo color used for [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] and "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D] nodes."
msgstr ""
"A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para os nós [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D] e "
"[VisibleOnScreenEnabler3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The 3D editor gizmo color used for [VoxelGI] nodes."
msgstr "A cor do gizmo do editor 3D usada para nós [VoxelGI]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The length of [Skeleton3D] bone gizmos in the 3D editor."
msgstr "O comprimento dos gizmos de osso do [Skeleton3D] no editor 3D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The shape of [Skeleton3D] bone gizmos in the 3D editor. [b]Wire[/b] is a "
"thin line, while [b]Octahedron[/b] is a set of lines that represent a "
"thicker hollow line pointing in a specific direction (similar to most 3D "
"animation software)."
msgstr ""
"A forma dos gizmos de ossos do [Skeleton3D] no editor 3D. [b]Wire[/b] é uma "
"linha fina, enquanto [b]Octahedron[/b] é um conjunto de linhas que "
"representam uma linha oca mais espessa apontando em uma direção específica "
"(semelhante à maioria dos softwares de animação 3D)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Size of probe gizmos displayed when editing [LightmapGI] and [LightmapProbe] "
"nodes. Setting this to [code]0.0[/code] will hide the probe spheres of "
"[LightmapGI] and wireframes of [LightmapProbe] nodes, but will keep the "
"wireframes linking probes from [LightmapGI] and billboard icons from "
"[LightmapProbe] intact."
msgstr ""
"Tamanho dos gizmos de sonda exibidos ao editar nós [LightmapGI] e "
"[LightmapProbe]. Definir isso como [code]0.0[/code] ocultará as esferas de "
"sonda de [LightmapGI] e os wireframes de nós [LightmapProbe], mas manterá "
"intactos os wireframes que unem sondas de [LightmapGI] e os ícones de cartaz "
"(billboard) de [LightmapProbe]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Size of the disk gizmo displayed when editing [Path3D]'s tilt handles."
msgstr ""
"Tamanho do gizmo de disco exibido ao editar as alças de inclinação de "
"[Path3D]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], collision shapes in the 3D editor are visible only "
"when selected. If [code]false[/code], collision shapes are always visible."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as formas de colisão no editor 3D ficam visíveis "
"apenas quando selecionadas. Se [code]false[/code], as formas de colisão "
"estão sempre visíveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically updates animation tracks' target paths "
"when renaming or reparenting nodes in the Scene tree dock."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], atualiza automaticamente os caminhos de destino das "
"trilhas de animação ao renomear ou alterar o pai de nós na doca da árvore de "
"Cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display a confirmation dialog when adding a new track "
"to an animation by pressing the \"key\" icon next to a property. Holding "
"Shift will bypass the dialog.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the behavior is reversed, i.e. the dialog only "
"appears when Shift is held."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default step used when creating a new [Animation] in the Animation bottom "
"panel. Only affects the first animation created in the [AnimationPlayer]. By "
"default, other newly created animations will use the step from the previous "
"ones.\n"
"This value is always expressed in seconds. If you want e.g. [code]10[/code] "
"FPS to be the default, you need to set the default step to [code]0.1[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], create a Bezier track instead of a standard track when "
"pressing the \"key\" icon next to a property. Bezier tracks provide more "
"control over animation curves, but are more difficult to adjust quickly."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], cria uma trilha de Bézier em vez de uma trilha padrão "
"ao pressionar o ícone de \"chave\" ao lado de uma propriedade. Trilhas de "
"Bézier fornecem mais controle sobre curvas de animação, mas são mais "
"difíceis de ajustar rapidamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], create a [code]RESET[/code] track when creating a new "
"animation track. This track can be used to restore the animation to a "
"\"default\" state."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], cria uma trilha [code]RESET[/code] ao criar uma nova "
"trilha de animação. Esta trilha pode ser usada para restaurar a animação "
"para um estado \"padrão\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls whether [AnimationPlayer] will apply snapping to nearest integer "
"FPS when snapping is in Seconds mode. The option is remembered locally for a "
"scene and this option only determines the default value when scene doesn't "
"have local state yet."
msgstr ""
"Controla se o [AnimationPlayer] aplicará alinhamento ao FPS inteiro mais "
"próximo quando o alinhamento estiver no modo Segundos. A opção é lembrada "
"localmente para uma cena e esta opção determina apenas o valor padrão quando "
"a cena ainda não possui estado local."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default step mode for [AnimationPlayer] (seconds or FPS). The option is "
"remembered locally for a scene and this option only determines the default "
"value when scene doesn't have local state yet."
msgstr ""
"Modo de passo padrão para [AnimationPlayer] (segundos ou FPS). A opção é "
"lembrada localmente para uma cena e esta opção determina apenas o valor "
"padrão quando a cena ainda não possui estado local."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], animation keys and markers are inserted at the current "
"time in the animation.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], they are inserted at the mouse cursor's position."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The modulate color to use for \"future\" frames displayed in the animation "
"editor's onion skinning feature."
msgstr ""
"A cor de modulação a ser usada para quadros \"futuros\" exibidos no recurso "
"de onion skinning do editor de animação."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The modulate color to use for \"past\" frames displayed in the animation "
"editor's onion skinning feature."
msgstr ""
"A cor de modulação a ser usada para quadros \"passados\" exibidos no recurso "
"de onion skinning do editor de animação."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color at the top of the VU meter gradient when it is active."
msgstr "A cor no topo do gradiente do medidor VU quando ele está ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color at the bottom of the VU meter gradient when it is active."
msgstr ""
"A cor na parte inferior do gradiente do medidor VU quando ele está ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color at 0 dB of the VU meter gradient when it is active."
msgstr "A cor em 0 dB do gradiente do medidor VU quando ele está ativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color at the top of the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr "A cor no topo do gradiente do medidor VU quando ele está inativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color at the bottom of the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr ""
"A cor na parte inferior do gradiente do medidor VU quando ele está inativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color at 0 dB of the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr "A cor em 0 dB do gradiente do medidor VU quando ele está inativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The multiplier color for the VU meter gradient when it is inactive."
msgstr ""
"A cor multiplicadora para o gradiente do medidor VU quando ele está inativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The multiplier color for the VU meter gradient where audio is not reaching."
msgstr ""
"A cor multiplicadora para o gradiente do medidor VU onde o áudio não está "
"alcançando."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum distance at which tiles can be placed on a GridMap, relative to "
"the camera position (in 3D units)."
msgstr ""
"A distância máxima na qual os tiles podem ser colocados em um GridMap, em "
"relação à posição da câmera (em unidades 3D)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Texture size of mesh previews generated for GridMap's MeshLibrary."
msgstr ""
"Tamanho da textura das pré-visualizações de malha geradas para a MeshLibrary "
"do GridMap."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The panning speed when using the mouse wheel or touchscreen events in the 2D "
"editor. This setting does not apply to panning by holding down the middle or "
"right mouse buttons."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade de movimentação ao usar a roda do mouse ou eventos de tela "
"sensível ao toque no editor 2D. Esta configuração não se aplica à "
"movimentação mantendo pressionado o botão do meio ou o botão direito do "
"mouse."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls whether the mouse wheel scroll zooms or pans in the 2D editor. See "
"also [member editors/panning/sub_editors_panning_scheme] and [member editors/"
"panning/animation_editors_panning_scheme]."
msgstr ""
"Controla se a rolagem da roda do mouse aplica zoom ou panorâmica no editor "
"2D. Consulte também [member editors/panning/sub_editors_panning_scheme] e "
"[member editors/panning/animation_editors_panning_scheme]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls whether the mouse wheel scroll zooms or pans in the animation track "
"and Bezier editors. See also [member editors/panning/"
"2d_editor_panning_scheme] and [member editors/panning/"
"sub_editors_panning_scheme] (which controls the animation blend tree "
"editor's pan behavior)."
msgstr ""
"Controla se a rolagem da roda do mouse aplica zoom ou panorâmica na trilha "
"de animação e nos editores de Bezier. Veja também [member editors/panning/"
"2d_editor_panning_scheme] e [member editors/panning/"
"sub_editors_panning_scheme] (que controla o comportamento de panorâmica do "
"editor de árvore de mesclagem de animação)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows panning by holding down [kbd]Space[/kbd] in the "
"2D editor viewport (in addition to panning with the middle or right mouse "
"buttons). If [code]false[/code], the left mouse button must be held down "
"while holding down [kbd]Space[/kbd] to pan in the 2D editor viewport."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite panoramizar mantendo pressionada a tecla "
"[kbd]Space[/kbd] na viewport do editor 2D (além de panoramizar com os botões "
"do meio ou direito do mouse). Se [code]false[/code], o botão esquerdo do "
"mouse deve ser mantido pressionado enquanto se segura [kbd]Space[/kbd] para "
"panoramizar na viewport do editor 2D."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls whether the mouse wheel scroll zooms or pans in subeditors. The "
"list of affected subeditors is: animation blend tree editor, [Polygon2D] "
"editor, tileset editor, texture region editor and visual shader editor. See "
"also [member editors/panning/2d_editor_panning_scheme] and [member editors/"
"panning/animation_editors_panning_scheme]."
msgstr ""
"Controla se a rolagem da roda do mouse aplica zoom ou panorâmica em "
"subeditores. A lista de subeditores afetados é: editor de árvore de "
"mesclagem de animação, editor [Polygon2D], editor de tileset, editor de "
"região de textura e editor de shader visual. Veja também [member editors/"
"panning/2d_editor_panning_scheme] e [member editors/panning/"
"animation_editors_panning_scheme]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], warps the mouse around the 2D viewport while panning "
"in the 2D editor. This makes it possible to pan over a large area without "
"having to exit panning and adjust the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], move o cursor do mouse (warp) ao redor da viewport 2D "
"ao fazer panorâmica no editor 2D. Isso torna possível fazer panorâmica em "
"uma grande área sem precisar sair do modo de panorâmica e ajustar o cursor "
"do mouse."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse cursor movement direction to use when drag-zooming in any editor "
"(except 3D scene editor) by moving the mouse. This does not affect zooming "
"with the mouse wheel."
msgstr ""
"A direção do movimento do cursor do mouse a ser usada ao aplicar zoom por "
"arraste em qualquer editor (exceto no editor de cenas 3D) movendo o mouse. "
"Isso não afeta o zoom com a roda do mouse."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The delay in seconds until more complex and performance costly polygon "
"editors commit their outlines, e.g. the 2D navigation polygon editor rebakes "
"the navigation mesh polygons. A negative value stops the auto bake."
msgstr ""
"O atraso em segundos até que editores de polígonos mais complexos e custosos "
"em desempenho confirmem seus contornos, por exemplo, o editor de polígonos "
"de navegação 2D recompila os polígonos da malha de navegação. Um valor "
"negativo interrompe o cozimento automático."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The radius in which points can be selected in the [Polygon2D] and "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] editors (in pixels). Higher values make it easier to "
"select points quickly, but can make it more difficult to select the expected "
"point when several points are located close to each other."
msgstr ""
"O raio em que os pontos podem ser selecionados nos editores [Polygon2D] e "
"[CollisionPolygon2D] (em pixels). Valores mais altos facilitam a seleção "
"rápida de pontos, mas podem dificultar a seleção do ponto esperado quando "
"vários pontos estão localizados próximos uns dos outros."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays the polygon's previous shape in the 2D "
"polygon editors with an opaque gray outline. This outline is displayed while "
"dragging a point until the left mouse button is released."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe a forma anterior do polígono nos editores de "
"polígono 2D com um contorno cinza opaco. Este contorno é exibido ao arrastar "
"um ponto até que o botão esquerdo do mouse seja solto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reopens shader files that were open in the shader "
"editor when the project was last closed."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], reabre os arquivos de shader que estavam abertos no "
"editor de shaders quando o projeto foi fechado pela última vez."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a grid while the TileMap editor is active. "
"See also [member editors/tiles_editor/grid_color]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe uma grade enquanto o editor do TileMap estiver "
"ativo. Veja também [member editors/tiles_editor/grid_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for the TileMap editor's grid.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member editors/tiles_editor/display_grid] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Highlight the currently selected TileMapLayer by dimming the other ones in "
"the scene."
msgstr ""
"Destaca o TileMapLayer atualmente selecionado, esmaecendo os outros na cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Color\" category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Color\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Conditional\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Conditional\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Input\" category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Input\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Output\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Output\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Particle\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Particle\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Scalar\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Scalar\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Special\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Special\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Textures\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Textures\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Transform\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Transform\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Utility\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Utility\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a graph node's header when it belongs to the \"Vector\" "
"category."
msgstr ""
"A cor do cabeçalho de um nó de gráfico quando ele pertence à categoria "
"\"Vector\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color theme to use in the visual shader editor."
msgstr "O tema de cores a ser usado no editor de shader visual."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color of a port/connection of boolean type."
msgstr "A cor de uma porta/conexão do tipo booleano."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color of a port/connection of sampler type."
msgstr "A cor de uma porta/conexão do tipo sampler."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of a port/connection of scalar type (float, int, unsigned int)."
msgstr "A cor de uma porta/conexão de tipo escalar (float, int, unsigned int)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color of a port/connection of transform type."
msgstr "A cor de uma porta/conexão do tipo transform."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color of a port/connection of Vector2 type."
msgstr "A cor de uma porta/conexão do tipo Vector2."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color of a port/connection of Vector3 type."
msgstr "A cor de uma porta/conexão do tipo Vector3."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The color of a port/connection of Vector4 type."
msgstr "A cor de uma porta/conexão do tipo Vector4."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The pattern used for the background grid."
msgstr "O padrão usado para a grade de fundo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The curvature to use for connection lines in the visual shader editor. "
"Higher values will make connection lines appear more curved, with values "
"above [code]0.5[/code] resulting in more \"angular\" turns in the middle of "
"connection lines."
msgstr ""
"A curvatura a ser usada para linhas de conexão no editor de shader visual. "
"Valores mais altos farão com que as linhas de conexão pareçam mais curvas, "
"com valores acima de [code]0.5[/code] resultando em curvas mais "
"\"angulares\" no meio das linhas de conexão."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The opacity of the minimap displayed in the bottom-right corner of the "
"visual shader editor."
msgstr ""
"A opacidade do minimapa exibido no canto inferior direito do editor de "
"shaders visuais."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size to use for port previews in the visual shader uniforms (toggled by "
"clicking the \"eye\" icon next to an output). The value is defined in pixels "
"at 100% zoom, and will scale with zoom automatically."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho a ser usado para visualizações de porta nos uniforms do shader "
"visual (ativado clicando no ícone de \"olho\" ao lado de uma saída). O valor "
"é definido em pixels a 100% de zoom e será dimensionado com o zoom "
"automaticamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the SCP (secure copy) executable (used for remote deploy to desktop "
"platforms). If left empty, the editor will attempt to run [code]scp[/code] "
"from [code]PATH[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SCP is not the same as SFTP. Specifying the SFTP executable "
"here will not work."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the SSH executable (used for remote deploy to desktop platforms). If "
"left empty, the editor will attempt to run [code]ssh[/code] from [code]PATH[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para o executável SSH (usado para implantação remota em plataformas "
"de desktop). Se deixado vazio, o editor tentará executar [code]ssh[/code] a "
"partir do [code]PATH[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The folder where projects should be scanned for (recursively), in a way "
"similar to the project manager's [b]Scan[/b] button. This can be set to the "
"same value as [member filesystem/directories/default_project_path] for "
"convenience.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this path to a folder with very large amounts of files/"
"folders can slow down the project manager startup significantly. To keep the "
"project manager quick to start up, it is recommended to set this value to a "
"folder as \"specific\" as possible."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The folder where new projects should be created by default when clicking the "
"project manager's [b]New Project[/b] button. This can be set to the same "
"value as [member filesystem/directories/autoscan_project_path] for "
"convenience."
msgstr ""
"A pasta onde novos projetos devem ser criados por padrão ao clicar no botão "
"[b]New Project[/b] do gerenciador de projetos. Isso pode ser definido com o "
"mesmo valor de [member filesystem/directories/autoscan_project_path] por "
"conveniência."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The program that opens 3D model scene files when clicking \"Open in External "
"Program\" option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be "
"opened in the system's default program."
msgstr ""
"O programa que abre arquivos de cena de modelo 3D ao clicar na opção \"Abrir "
"em Programa Externo\" na Doca do Sistema de Arquivos. Se não especificado, o "
"arquivo será aberto no programa padrão do sistema."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The program that opens audio files when clicking \"Open in External "
"Program\" option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be "
"opened in the system's default program."
msgstr ""
"O programa que abre arquivos de áudio ao clicar na opção \"Abrir em Programa "
"Externo\" no Painel do Sistema de Arquivos. Se não especificado, o arquivo "
"será aberto no programa padrão do sistema."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The program that opens raster image files when clicking \"Open in External "
"Program\" option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be "
"opened in the system's default program."
msgstr ""
"O programa que abre arquivos de imagem rasterizada ao clicar na opção "
"\"Abrir em Programa Externo\" na Doca do Sistema de Arquivos. Se não "
"especificado, o arquivo será aberto no programa padrão do sistema."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The terminal emulator program to use when using [b]Open in Terminal[/b] "
"context menu action in the FileSystem dock. You can enter an absolute path "
"to a program binary, or a path to a program that is present in the "
"[code]PATH[/code] environment variable.\n"
"If left empty, Godot will use the default terminal emulator for the system:\n"
"- [b]Windows:[/b] PowerShell\n"
"- [b]macOS:[/b] Terminal.app\n"
"- [b]Linux:[/b] The first terminal found on the system in this order: gnome-"
"terminal, konsole, xfce4-terminal, lxterminal, kitty, alacritty, urxvt, "
"xterm.\n"
"To use Command Prompt (cmd) instead of PowerShell on Windows, enter "
"[code]cmd[/code] in this field and the correct flags will automatically be "
"used.\n"
"On macOS, make sure to point to the actual program binary located within the "
"[code]Programs/MacOS[/code] folder of the .app bundle, rather than the .app "
"bundle directory.\n"
"If specifying a custom terminal emulator, you may need to override [member "
"filesystem/external_programs/terminal_emulator_flags] so it opens in the "
"correct folder."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The command-line arguments to pass to the terminal emulator that is run when "
"using [b]Open in Terminal[/b] context menu action in the FileSystem dock. "
"See also [member filesystem/external_programs/terminal_emulator].\n"
"If left empty, the default flags are [code]{directory}[/code], which is "
"replaced by the absolute path to the directory that is being opened in the "
"terminal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the terminal emulator is set to PowerShell, cmd, or Konsole, "
"Godot will automatically prepend arguments to this list, as these terminals "
"require nonstandard arguments to open in the correct folder."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The program that opens vector image files when clicking \"Open in External "
"Program\" option in Filesystem Dock. If not specified, the file will be "
"opened in the system's default program."
msgstr ""
"O programa que abre arquivos de imagem vetorial ao clicar na opção \"Abrir "
"em Programa Externo\" na Doca do Sistema de Arquivos. Se não especificado, o "
"arquivo será aberto no programa padrão do sistema."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The display mode to use in the editor's file dialogs.\n"
"- [b]Thumbnails[/b] takes more space, but displays dynamic resource "
"thumbnails, making resources easier to preview without having to open them.\n"
"- [b]List[/b] is more compact but doesn't display dynamic resource "
"thumbnails. Instead, it displays static icons based on the file extension."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display hidden files in the editor's file dialogs. "
"Files that have names starting with [code].[/code] are considered hidden "
"(e.g. [code].hidden_file[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe arquivos ocultos nas caixas de diálogo de "
"arquivo do editor. Arquivos cujos nomes começam com [code].[/code] são "
"considerados ocultos (ex: [code].hidden_file[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The thumbnail size to use in the editor's file dialogs (in pixels). See also "
"[member docks/filesystem/thumbnail_size]."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da miniatura a ser usado nas caixas de diálogo de arquivo do "
"editor (em pixels). Veja também [member docks/filesystem/thumbnail_size]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Password used for file server when exporting project with remote file system."
msgstr ""
"Senha usada para o servidor de arquivos ao exportar projeto com sistema de "
"arquivos remoto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Port used for file server when exporting project with remote file system."
msgstr ""
"Porta usada para servidor de arquivos ao exportar projeto com sistema de "
"arquivos remoto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The path to the Blender executable used for converting the Blender 3D scene "
"files [code].blend[/code] to glTF 2.0 format during import. Blender 3.0 or "
"later is required.\n"
"To enable this feature for your specific project, use [member "
"ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/blender/enabled].\n"
"If this setting is empty, Blender's default paths will be detected and used "
"automatically if present in this order:\n"
"[b]Windows:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- C:\\Program Files\\Blender Foundation\\blender.exe\n"
"- C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Blender Foundation\\blender.exe\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]macOS:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- /opt/homebrew/bin/blender\n"
"- /opt/local/bin/blender\n"
"- /usr/local/bin/blender\n"
"- /usr/local/opt/blender\n"
"- /Applications/Blender.app/Contents/MacOS/Blender\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Linux/*BSD:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"- /usr/bin/blender\n"
"- /usr/local/bin/blender\n"
"- /opt/blender/bin/blender\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The port number used for Remote Procedure Call (RPC) communication with "
"Godot's created process of the blender executable.\n"
"Setting this to 0 effectively disables communication with Godot and the "
"blender process, making performance slower."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum idle uptime (in seconds) of the Blender process.\n"
"This prevents Godot from having to create a new process for each import "
"within the given seconds."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The path to the FBX2glTF executable used for converting Autodesk FBX 3D "
"scene files [code].fbx[/code] to glTF 2.0 format during import.\n"
"To enable this feature for your specific project, use [member "
"ProjectSettings.filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], uses lossless compression for binary resources."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa compressão sem perdas para recursos binários."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when saving a file, the editor will rename the old "
"file to a different name, save a new file, then only remove the old file "
"once the new file has been saved. This makes loss of data less likely to "
"happen if the editor or operating system exits unexpectedly while saving "
"(e.g. due to a crash or power outage).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, this feature can interact negatively with certain "
"antivirus programs. In this case, you may have to set this to [code]false[/"
"code] to prevent file locking issues."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a warning toast message when saving a text-"
"based scene or resource that is larger than 500 KiB on disk. This is "
"typically caused by binary subresources being embedded as text, which "
"results in slow and inefficient conversion to text. This in turn impacts "
"scene saving and loading times.\n"
"This should usually be resolved by moving the embedded binary subresource to "
"its own binary resource file ([code].res[/code] extension instead of "
"[code].tres[/code]). This is the preferred approach. Alternatively, the "
"entire scene can be saved with the binary [code].scn[/code] format as "
"opposed to [code].tscn[/code], but this will make it less friendly to "
"version control systems."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]Adaptive[/code], the dialog opens in list view or grid view "
"depending on the requested type. If set to [code]Last Used[/code], the "
"display mode will always open the way you last used it."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]Adaptive[/code], o diálogo é aberto em modo de lista "
"ou de grade dependendo do tipo solicitado. Se definido como [code]Last Used[/"
"code], o modo de exibição sempre será aberto da maneira que você o usou por "
"último."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], together with exact matches of a filename, the dialog "
"includes approximate matches.\n"
"This is useful for finding the correct files even when there are typos in "
"the search query; for example, searching \"nprmal\" will find \"normal\". "
"Additionally, it allows you to write shorter search queries; for example, "
"searching \"nml\" will also find \"normal\".\n"
"See also [member filesystem/quick_open_dialog/max_fuzzy_misses]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], results will include files located in the "
"[code]addons[/code] folder."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os resultados incluirão arquivos localizados na pasta "
"[code]addons[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlighting a resource will preview it quickly "
"without confirming the selection or closing the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], destacar um recurso fará uma pré-visualização rápida "
"dele sem confirmar a seleção ou fechar a caixa de diálogo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of missed query characters allowed in a match when fuzzy matching "
"is enabled. For example, with the default value of [code]2[/code], [code]"
"\"normal\"[/code] would match [code]\"narmal\"[/code] and [code]\"norma\"[/"
"code] but not [code]\"nor\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O número de caracteres de consulta perdidos permitidos em uma "
"correspondência quando a correspondência difusa está habilitada. Por "
"exemplo, com o valor padrão de [code]2[/code], [code]\"normal\"[/code] "
"corresponderia a [code]\"narmal\"[/code] e [code]\"norma\"[/code], mas não a "
"[code]\"nor\"[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Maximum number of matches to show in dialog."
msgstr "Número máximo de correspondências a serem mostradas no diálogo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], results will be highlighted with their search matches."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os resultados serão destacados com suas "
"correspondências de pesquisa."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The path to the directory containing the Open Image Denoise (OIDN) "
"executable, used optionally for denoising lightmaps. It can be downloaded "
"from [url=https://www.openimagedenoise.org/"
"downloads.html]openimagedenoise.org[/url].\n"
"To enable this feature for your specific project, use [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], input events will be flushed just before every idle "
"and physics frame.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], these events will be flushed only once per process "
"frame, between iterations of the engine.\n"
"Enabling this setting can greatly improve input responsiveness, especially "
"in devices that struggle to run at the project's intended frame rate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], similar input events sent by the operating system are "
"accumulated. When input accumulation is enabled, all input events generated "
"during a frame will be merged and emitted when the frame is done rendering. "
"Therefore, this limits the number of input method calls per second to the "
"rendering FPS.\n"
"Input accumulation can be disabled to get slightly more precise/reactive "
"input at the cost of increased CPU usage.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Input accumulation is [i]enabled[/i] by default."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Editor accessibility support mode:\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] ([code]0[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, but "
"updates to the accessibility information are processed only if an assistive "
"app (such as a screen reader or a Braille display) is active (default).\n"
"- [b]Always Active[/b] ([code]1[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, "
"and updates to the accessibility information are always processed, "
"regardless of the status of assistive apps.\n"
"- [b]Disabled[/b] ([code]2[/code]): Accessibility support is fully "
"disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessibility debugging tools, such as Accessibility Insights "
"for Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS), or AT-SPI Browser (Linux/BSD), "
"do not count as assistive apps. To test the editor with these tools, use "
"[b]Always Active[/b]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], editor inspector uses property documentation as an "
"accessible description of the property."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o inspetor do editor usa a documentação da propriedade "
"como uma descrição acessível da propriedade."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"How to position the Cancel and OK buttons in the editor's [AcceptDialog] "
"windows. Different platforms have different conventions for this, which can "
"be overridden through this setting to avoid accidental clicks when using "
"Godot on multiple platforms.\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] follows the platform convention: OK first on Windows, KDE, and "
"LXQt; Cancel first on macOS and other Linux desktop environments.\n"
"- [b]Cancel First[/b] forces the Cancel/OK ordering.\n"
"- [b]OK First[/b] forces the OK/Cancel ordering.\n"
"To check if these buttons are swapped at runtime, use [method "
"DisplayServer.get_swap_cancel_ok]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the main menu collapses into a [MenuButton].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is only applicable on macOS when [member interface/"
"editor/appearance/use_embedded_menu] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on the Android editor."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The custom editor scale factor to use. This can be used for displays with "
"very high DPI where a scale factor of 200% is not sufficient.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member interface/editor/appearance/"
"display_scale] is set to [b]Custom[/b]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The display scale factor to use for the editor interface. Higher values are "
"more suited to hiDPI/Retina displays.\n"
"If set to [b]Auto[/b], the editor scale is automatically determined based on "
"the screen resolution and reported display DPI. This heuristic is not always "
"ideal, which means you can get better results by setting the editor scale "
"manually.\n"
"If set to [b]Custom[/b], the scaling value in [member interface/editor/"
"appearance/custom_display_scale] will be used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The preferred monitor to display the editor. If [b]Auto[/b], the editor will "
"remember the last screen it was displayed on across multiple sessions."
msgstr ""
"O monitor preferido para exibir o editor. Se [b]Auto[/b], o editor lembrará "
"da última tela em que foi exibido em várias sessões."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Expanding main editor window content to the title, if supported by "
"[DisplayServer]. See [constant DisplayServer.WINDOW_FLAG_EXTEND_TO_TITLE].\n"
"Specific to the macOS platform."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The preferred monitor to display the project manager."
msgstr "O monitor preferido para exibir o gerenciador de projetos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a renderer selector that can be used to change the "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/rendering_method] project setting "
"will be shown in the top right of the main editor window."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], um seletor de renderizador que pode ser usado para "
"alterar a configuração do projeto [member ProjectSettings.rendering/renderer/"
"rendering_method] será exibido no canto superior direito da janela principal "
"do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays an icon in the top-right corner of the editor that "
"spins when the editor redraws a frame. This can be used to diagnose "
"situations where the engine is constantly redrawing, which should be avoided "
"as this increases CPU and GPU utilization for no good reason. To further "
"troubleshoot these situations, start the editor with the [code]--debug-"
"canvas-item-redraw[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url].\n"
"Consider enabling this if you are developing editor plugins to ensure they "
"only make the editor redraw when required.\n"
"The default [b]Auto[/b] value will only enable this if the editor was "
"compiled with the [code]dev_build=yes[/code] SCons option (the default is "
"[code]dev_build=no[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member interface/editor/display/update_continuously] is "
"[code]true[/code], the spinner icon displays in red.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the editor was started with the [code]--debug-canvas-item-"
"redraw[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url], the update spinner "
"will [i]never[/i] display regardless of this setting's value. This is to "
"avoid confusion with what would cause redrawing in real world scenarios."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], editor main menu is using embedded [MenuBar] instead "
"of system global menu.\n"
"Specific to the macOS platform."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], editor UI uses OS native file/directory selection "
"dialogs."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a interface do editor usa diálogos de seleção de "
"arquivo/diretório nativos do SO."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically opens screenshots with the default "
"program associated to [code].png[/code] files after a screenshot is taken "
"using the [b]Editor > Take Screenshot[/b] action."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], abre automaticamente as capturas de tela com o "
"programa padrão associado aos arquivos [code].png[/code] após uma captura de "
"tela ser tirada usando a ação [b]Editor > Take Screenshot[/b]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], (re)imports resources even if the editor window is "
"unfocused or minimized. If [code]false[/code], resources are only "
"(re)imported when the editor window is focused. This can be set to "
"[code]true[/code] to speed up iteration by starting the import process "
"earlier when saving files in the project folder. This also allows getting "
"visual feedback on changes without having to click the editor window, which "
"is useful with multi-monitor setups. The downside of setting this to "
"[code]true[/code] is that it increases idle CPU usage and may steal CPU time "
"from other applications when importing resources."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], (re)importa recursos mesmo se a janela do editor "
"estiver sem foco ou minimizada. Se [code]false[/code], os recursos são "
"(re)importados apenas quando a janela do editor está em foco. Isso pode ser "
"definido como [code]true[/code] para acelerar a iteração iniciando o "
"processo de importação mais cedo ao salvar arquivos na pasta do projeto. "
"Isso também permite obter feedback visual sobre as alterações sem precisar "
"clicar na janela do editor, o que é útil com configurações de vários "
"monitores. A desvantagem de definir isso como [code]true[/code] é que "
"aumenta o uso ocioso da CPU e pode roubar tempo de CPU de outros aplicativos "
"ao importar recursos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], the editor will save all scenes when confirming the "
"[b]Save[/b] action when quitting the editor or quitting to the project list. "
"If [code]true[/code], the editor will ask to save each scene individually."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]false[/code], o editor salvará todas as cenas ao confirmar a ação "
"[b]Save[/b] ao sair do editor ou ao retornar à lista de projetos. Se "
"[code]true[/code], o editor pedirá para salvar cada cena individualmente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], scenes and scripts are saved when the editor loses "
"focus. Depending on the work flow, this behavior can be less intrusive than "
"[member text_editor/behavior/files/autosave_interval_secs] or remembering to "
"save manually."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], cenas e scripts são salvos quando o editor perde o "
"foco. Dependendo do fluxo de trabalho, esse comportamento pode ser menos "
"intrusivo do que [member text_editor/behavior/files/autosave_interval_secs] "
"ou lembrar de salvar manualmente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the editor's Script tab will have a separate "
"distraction mode setting from the 2D/3D/Game/AssetLib tabs. If [code]false[/"
"code], the distraction-free mode toggle is shared between all tabs."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a aba Script do editor terá uma configuração de modo "
"de distração separada das abas 2D/3D/Jogo/AssetLib. Se [code]false[/code], a "
"alternância do modo sem distração é compartilhada entre todas as abas."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays internal engine errors in toast notifications "
"(toggleable by clicking the \"bell\" icon at the bottom of the editor). No "
"matter the value of this setting, non-internal engine errors will always be "
"visible in toast notifications.\n"
"The default [b]Auto[/b] value will only enable this if the editor was "
"compiled with the [code]dev_build=yes[/code] SCons option (the default is "
"[code]dev_build=no[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], keeps the screen on (even in case of inactivity), so "
"the screensaver does not take over. Works on desktop and mobile platforms."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], mantém a tela ligada (mesmo em caso de inatividade), "
"para que o protetor de tela não seja ativado. Funciona em plataformas de "
"desktop e móveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], embed modal windows such as docks inside the main "
"editor window. When single-window mode is enabled, tooltips will also be "
"embedded inside the main editor window, which means they can't be displayed "
"outside of the editor window. Single-window mode can be faster as it does "
"not need to create a separate window for every popup and tooltip, which can "
"be a slow operation depending on the operating system and rendering method "
"in use.\n"
"This is equivalent to [member ProjectSettings.display/window/subwindows/"
"embed_subwindows] in the running project, except the setting's value is "
"inverted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To query whether the editor can use multiple windows in an "
"editor plugin, use [method EditorInterface.is_multi_window_enabled] instead "
"of querying the value of this editor setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [code]true[/code], game embedding is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], redraws the editor every frame even if nothing has "
"changed on screen. When this setting is enabled, the update spinner displays "
"in red (see [member interface/editor/appearance/show_update_spinner]).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This greatly increases CPU and GPU utilization, leading to "
"increased power usage. This should only be enabled for troubleshooting "
"purposes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the V-Sync mode for the editor. Does not affect the project when run "
"from the editor (this is controlled by [member ProjectSettings.display/"
"window/vsync/vsync_mode]).\n"
"Depending on the platform and used renderer, the engine will fall back to "
"[b]Enabled[/b] if the desired mode is not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] V-Sync modes other than [b]Enabled[/b] are only supported in "
"the Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Tab style of editor docks located at the bottom."
msgstr "Estilo de aba das docas do editor localizadas na parte inferior."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Tab style of editor docks, except bottom docks."
msgstr "Estilo de aba das docas do editor, exceto as docas inferiores."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The font to use for the script editor. Must be a resource of a [Font] type "
"such as a [code].ttf[/code] or [code].otf[/code] font file."
msgstr ""
"A fonte a ser usada para o editor de script. Deve ser um recurso do tipo "
"[Font], como um arquivo de fonte [code].ttf[/code] ou [code].otf[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The font ligatures to enable for the currently configured code font. Not all "
"fonts include support for ligatures.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor code font ([url=https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/"
"mono/]JetBrains Mono[/url]) has contextual ligatures in its font file."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"List of custom OpenType features to use, if supported by the currently "
"configured code font. Not all fonts include support for custom OpenType "
"features. The string should follow the OpenType specification.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor code font ([url=https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/"
"mono/]JetBrains Mono[/url]) has custom OpenType features in its font file, "
"but there is no documented list yet."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"List of alternative characters to use, if supported by the currently "
"configured code font. Not all fonts include support for custom variations. "
"The string should follow the OpenType specification.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor code font ([url=https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/"
"mono/]JetBrains Mono[/url]) has alternate characters in its font file, but "
"there is no documented list yet."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the font in the script editor. This setting does not impact the "
"font size of the Output panel (see [member run/output/font_size])."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da fonte no editor de scripts. Esta configuração não afeta o "
"tamanho da fonte do painel de Saída (consulte [member run/output/font_size])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], MSDF font rendering will be used for the visual "
"shader graph editor. You may need to set this to [code]false[/code] when "
"using a custom main font, as some fonts will look broken due to the use of "
"self-intersecting outlines in their font data. Downloading the font from the "
"font maker's official website as opposed to a service like Google Fonts can "
"help resolve this issue."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], a renderização de fontes MSDF será usada "
"para o editor de gráfico de shader visual. Pode ser necessário definir isso "
"como [code]false[/code] ao usar uma fonte principal personalizada, pois "
"algumas fontes parecerão quebradas devido ao uso de contornos auto-"
"intersectantes em seus dados de fonte. Baixar a fonte no site oficial do "
"criador da fonte, em vez de em um serviço como o Google Fonts, pode ajudar a "
"resolver esse problema."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"FreeType's font anti-aliasing mode used to render the editor fonts. Most "
"fonts are not designed to look good with anti-aliasing disabled, so it's "
"recommended to leave this enabled unless you're using a pixel art font."
msgstr ""
"Modo de anti-aliasing de fontes do FreeType usado para renderizar as fontes "
"do editor. A maioria das fontes não foi projetada para ficar bonita com o "
"anti-aliasing desativado, portanto, é recomendável deixar isso ativado, a "
"menos que você esteja usando uma fonte pixel art."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml doc/classes/FontFile.xml
#: doc/classes/ResourceImporterDynamicFont.xml doc/classes/SystemFont.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServer.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], embedded font bitmap loading is disabled "
"(bitmap-only and color fonts ignore this property)."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], o carregamento de bitmaps de fontes "
"embutidas é desativado (fontes apenas de bitmap e coloridas ignoram esta "
"propriedade)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The font hinting mode to use for the editor fonts. FreeType supports the "
"following font hinting modes:\n"
"- [b]None:[/b] Don't use font hinting when rasterizing the font. This "
"results in a smooth font, but it can look blurry.\n"
"- [b]Light:[/b] Use hinting on the X axis only. This is a compromise between "
"font sharpness and smoothness.\n"
"- [b]Normal:[/b] Use hinting on both X and Y axes. This results in a sharp "
"font, but it doesn't look very smooth.\n"
"If set to [b]Auto[/b], the font hinting mode will be set to match the "
"current operating system in use. This means the [b]Light[/b] hinting mode "
"will be used on Windows and Linux, and the [b]None[/b] hinting mode will be "
"used on macOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The subpixel positioning mode to use when rendering editor font glyphs. This "
"affects both the main and code fonts. [b]Disabled[/b] is the fastest to "
"render and uses the least memory. [b]Auto[/b] only uses subpixel positioning "
"for small font sizes (where the benefit is the most noticeable). [b]One Half "
"of a Pixel[/b] and [b]One Quarter of a Pixel[/b] force the same subpixel "
"positioning mode for all editor fonts, regardless of their size (with [b]One "
"Quarter of a Pixel[/b] being the highest-quality option)."
msgstr ""
"O modo de posicionamento de subpíxel a ser usado ao renderizar glifos de "
"fontes do editor. Isso afeta as fontes principais e de código. [b]Disabled[/"
"b] é o mais rápido para renderizar e usa menos memória. [b]Auto[/b] usa "
"apenas o posicionamento de subpíxel para tamanhos de fonte pequenos (onde o "
"benefício é mais perceptível). [b]One Half of a Pixel[/b] e [b]One Quarter "
"of a Pixel[/b] forçam o mesmo modo de posicionamento de subpíxel para todas "
"as fontes do editor, independentemente de seu tamanho (sendo [b]One Quarter "
"of a Pixel[/b] a opção de mais alta qualidade)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The font to use for the editor interface. Must be a resource of a [Font] "
"type such as a [code].ttf[/code] or [code].otf[/code] font file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the provided font is variable, a weight of 400 (normal) will "
"be used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The font to use for bold text in the editor interface. Must be a resource of "
"a [Font] type such as a [code].ttf[/code] or [code].otf[/code] font file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the provided font is variable, a weight of 700 (bold) will "
"be used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"List of custom OpenType features to use, if supported by the currently "
"configured main font. Check what OpenType features are supported by your "
"font first.\n"
"The string should follow the OpenType specification, e.g. "
"[code]ss01,tnum,calt=false[/code]. Microsoft's documentation contains a list "
"of [url=https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/"
"featurelist]all registered features[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor main font ([url=https://rsms.me/inter]Inter[/"
"url]) has custom OpenType features in its font file, with [code]ss04[/code] "
"and [code]tnum[/code] enabled and [code]calt[/code] disabled by default. "
"Supported features can be found at its website."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The size of the font in the editor interface."
msgstr "O tamanho da fonte na interface do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the mouse's additional side buttons will be usable to "
"navigate in the script editor's file history. Set this to [code]false[/code] "
"if you're using the side buttons for other purposes (such as a push-to-talk "
"button in a VoIP program)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os botões laterais adicionais do mouse poderão ser "
"usados para navegar no histórico de arquivos do editor de scripts. Defina "
"como [code]false[/code] se você estiver usando os botões laterais para "
"outros fins (como um botão de apertar para falar em um programa VoIP)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Overrides the tablet driver used by the editor."
msgstr "Substitui o driver de tablet usado pelo editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The language to use for the editor interface. If set to [b]Auto[/b], the "
"language is automatically determined based on the system locale. See also "
"[method EditorInterface.get_editor_language].\n"
"Translations are provided by the community. If you spot a mistake, "
"[url=https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/documentation/"
"translation/index.html]contribute to editor translations on Weblate![/url]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], setting names in the editor are localized when "
"possible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting affects most [EditorInspector]s in the editor UI, "
"primarily Project Settings and Editor Settings. To control names displayed "
"in the Inspector dock, use [member interface/inspector/"
"default_property_name_style] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Editor UI default layout direction."
msgstr "Direção de layout padrão da interface do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"During a drag-and-drop, this is how long to wait over a UI element before it "
"triggers a reaction (e.g. a section unfolds to show nested items)."
msgstr ""
"Durante um arrastar e soltar, este é o tempo que se deve esperar sobre um "
"elemento de IU antes que ele dispare uma reação (por exemplo, uma seção se "
"desdobra para mostrar itens aninhados)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of sleeping between frames in the editor (in microseconds). "
"Higher values will result in lower CPU/GPU usage, which can improve battery "
"life on laptops. However, higher values will result in a less responsive "
"editor. The default value is set to allow for maximum smoothness on monitors "
"up to 144 Hz. See also [member interface/editor/timers/"
"unfocused_low_processor_mode_sleep_usec].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored if [member interface/editor/display/"
"update_continuously] is [code]true[/code], as enabling that setting disables "
"low-processor mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When the editor window is unfocused, the amount of sleeping between frames "
"when the low-processor usage mode is enabled (in microseconds). Higher "
"values will result in lower CPU/GPU usage, which can improve battery life on "
"laptops (in addition to improving the running project's performance if the "
"editor has to redraw continuously). However, higher values will result in a "
"less responsive editor. The default value is set to limit the editor to 10 "
"FPS when the editor window is unfocused. See also [member interface/editor/"
"timers/low_processor_mode_sleep_usec].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored if [member interface/editor/display/"
"update_continuously] is [code]true[/code], as enabling that setting disables "
"low-processor mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when extending a script, the global class name of the "
"script is inserted in the script creation dialog, if it exists. If "
"[code]false[/code], the script's file path is always inserted."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ao estender um script, o nome da classe global do "
"script é inserido no diálogo de criação de script, se existir. Se "
"[code]false[/code], o caminho do arquivo do script é sempre inserido."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically unfolds Inspector property groups "
"containing modified values when opening a scene for the first time. Only "
"affects scenes without saved folding preferences and only unfolds groups "
"with properties that have been changed from their default values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only works in specific scenarios: when opening a "
"scene brought in from another project, or when opening a new scene that "
"already has modified properties (e.g., from version control). Duplicated "
"scenes are not considered foreign, so this setting will not affect them."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], show the intensity slider in the [ColorPicker]s opened "
"in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], mostra o controle deslizante de intensidade nos "
"[ColorPicker]s abertos no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default color picker mode to use when opening [ColorPicker]s in the "
"editor. This mode can be temporarily adjusted on the color picker itself."
msgstr ""
"O modo padrão do seletor de cores a ser usado ao abrir [ColorPicker]s no "
"editor. Este modo pode ser ajustado temporariamente no próprio seletor de "
"cores."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default color picker shape to use when opening [ColorPicker]s in the "
"editor. This shape can be temporarily adjusted on the color picker itself."
msgstr ""
"A forma padrão do seletor de cores a ser usada ao abrir [ColorPicker]s no "
"editor. Esta forma pode ser ajustada temporariamente no próprio seletor de "
"cores."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The floating-point precision to use for properties that don't define an "
"explicit precision step. Lower values allow entering more precise values."
msgstr ""
"A precisão de ponto flutuante a ser usada para propriedades que não definem "
"um passo de precisão explícito. Valores mais baixos permitem inserir valores "
"mais precisos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default property name style to display in the Inspector dock. This style "
"can be temporarily adjusted in the Inspector dock's menu.\n"
"- [b]Raw:[/b] Displays properties in [code]snake_case[/code].\n"
"- [b]Capitalized:[/b] Displays properties capitalized.\n"
"- [b]Localized:[/b] Displays the localized string for the current editor "
"language if a translation is available for the given property. If no "
"translation is available, falls back to [b]Capitalized[/b].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To display translated setting names in Project Settings and "
"Editor Settings, use [member interface/editor/localization/"
"localize_settings] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], add a margin around Array, Dictionary, and Resource "
"Editors that are not already colored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member interface/inspector/nested_color_mode] is set to "
"[b]Containers & Resources[/b] this parameter will have no effect since those "
"editors will already be colored."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], forces all property groups to be expanded in the "
"Inspector dock and prevents collapsing them."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], força todos os grupos de propriedades a serem "
"expandidos no painel Inspetor e impede que sejam recolhidos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Base speed for increasing/decreasing float values by dragging them in the "
"inspector."
msgstr ""
"Velocidade base para aumentar/diminuir valores de ponto flutuante arrastando-"
"os no inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [Vector2] and [Vector2i] properties are shown on a "
"single line in the inspector instead of two lines. This is overall more "
"compact, but it can be harder to view and edit large values without "
"expanding the inspector horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as propriedades [Vector2] e [Vector2i] são mostradas "
"em uma única linha no inspetor em vez de duas linhas. No geral, isso é mais "
"compacto, mas pode ser mais difícil visualizar e editar valores grandes sem "
"expandir o inspetor horizontalmente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], [Vector4i], [Rect2], "
"[Rect2i], [Plane], and [Quaternion] properties are shown on a single line in "
"the inspector instead of multiple lines. This is overall more compact, but "
"it can be harder to view and edit large values without expanding the "
"inspector horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as propriedades [Vector3], [Vector3i], [Vector4], "
"[Vector4i], [Rect2], [Rect2i], [Plane] e [Quaternion] são exibidas em uma "
"única linha no inspetor em vez de várias linhas. No geral, isso é mais "
"compacto, mas pode ser mais difícil visualizar e editar valores grandes sem "
"expandir o inspetor horizontalmente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Base speed for increasing/decreasing integer values by dragging them in the "
"inspector."
msgstr ""
"Velocidade base para aumentar/diminuir valores inteiros arrastando-os no "
"inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of [Array] or [Dictionary] items to display on each \"page\" in "
"the inspector. Higher values allow viewing more values per page, but take "
"more time to load. This increased load time is noticeable when selecting "
"nodes that have array or dictionary properties in the editor."
msgstr ""
"O número de itens de [Array] ou [Dictionary] a serem exibidos em cada "
"\"página\" no inspetor. Valores mais altos permitem visualizar mais valores "
"por página, mas levam mais tempo para carregar. Esse aumento no tempo de "
"carregamento é perceptível ao selecionar nós que possuem propriedades de "
"array ou dicionário no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Control which property editors are colored when they are opened.\n"
"- [b]Containers & Resources:[/b] Color all Array, Dictionary, and Resource "
"Editors.\n"
"- [b]Resources:[/b] Color all Resource Editors.\n"
"- [b]External Resources:[/b] Color Resource Editors that edits an external "
"resource."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], subresources can be edited in the current inspector "
"view. If the resource type is defined in [member interface/inspector/"
"resources_to_open_in_new_inspector] or if this setting is [code]false[/"
"code], attempting to edit a subresource always opens a new inspector view."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os subrecursos podem ser editados na visualização "
"atual do inspetor. Se o tipo de recurso estiver definido em [member "
"interface/inspector/resources_to_open_in_new_inspector] ou se esta "
"configuração for [code]false[/code], tentar editar um subrecurso sempre abre "
"uma nova visualização do inspetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"List of resources that should always be opened in a new inspector view, even "
"if [member interface/inspector/open_resources_in_current_inspector] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Lista de recursos que devem sempre ser abertos em uma nova visualização do "
"inspetor, mesmo que [member interface/inspector/"
"open_resources_in_current_inspector] seja [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display OpenType features marked as [code]hidden[/"
"code] by the font file in the [Font] editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe recursos OpenType marcados como [code]hidden[/"
"code] pelo arquivo de fonte no editor de [Font]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], multiple window support in editor is enabled. The "
"following panels can become dedicated windows (i.e. made floating): Docks, "
"Script editor, Shader editor, and Game Workspace.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member interface/editor/display/single_window_mode] is "
"[code]true[/code], the multi window support is always disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To query whether the editor can use multiple windows in an "
"editor plugin, use [method EditorInterface.is_multi_window_enabled] instead "
"of querying the value of this editor setting."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when panels are made floating they will be maximized.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], when panels are made floating their position and size "
"will match the ones when they are attached (excluding window border) to the "
"editor window."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the floating panel position, size, and screen will be "
"saved on editor exit. On next launch the panels that were floating will be "
"made floating in the saved positions, sizes and screens, if possible."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a posição, o tamanho e a tela do painel flutuante "
"serão salvos ao sair do editor. Na próxima inicialização, os painéis que "
"estavam flutuantes ficarão flutuantes nas posições, tamanhos e telas salvos, "
"se possível."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the FileSystem dock will automatically navigate to the "
"currently selected scene tab."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a doca do Sistema de Arquivos navegará automaticamente "
"para a aba de cena selecionada no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls when the Close (X) button is displayed on scene tabs at the top of "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"Controla quando o botão Fechar (X) é exibido nas abas de cena na parte "
"superior do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The maximum width of each scene tab at the top editor (in pixels)."
msgstr "A largura máxima de cada aba de cena no editor superior (em pixels)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when a project is loaded, restores scenes that were "
"opened on the last editor session.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With many opened scenes, the editor may take longer to become "
"usable. If starting the editor quickly is necessary, consider setting this "
"to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], show a button next to each scene tab that opens the "
"scene's \"dominant\" script when clicked. The \"dominant\" script is the one "
"that is at the highest level in the scene's hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe um botão ao lado de cada aba de cena que abre o "
"script \"dominante\" da cena quando clicado. O script \"dominante\" é aquele "
"que está no nível mais alto na hierarquia da cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], display an automatically-generated thumbnail when "
"hovering scene tabs with the mouse. Scene thumbnails are generated when "
"saving the scene."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe uma miniatura gerada automaticamente ao passar o "
"mouse sobre as abas de cena. Miniaturas de cena são geradas ao salvar a cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for \"highlighted\" user interface elements in the editor "
"(pressed and hovered items)."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para elementos de interface de usuário \"destacados\" no "
"editor (itens pressionados e com o mouse em cima)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The extra spacing to add to various GUI elements in the editor (in pixels). "
"Increasing this value is useful to improve usability on touch screens, at "
"the cost of reducing the amount of usable screen real estate.\n"
"See also [member interface/theme/spacing_preset]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The base color to use for user interface elements in the editor. Secondary "
"colors (such as darker/lighter variants) are derived from this color."
msgstr ""
"A cor base a ser usada para elementos de interface do usuário no editor. "
"Cores secundárias (como variantes mais escuras/claras) são derivadas desta "
"cor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The base spacing used by various GUI elements in the editor (in pixels). See "
"also [member interface/theme/spacing_preset]."
msgstr ""
"O espaçamento base usado por vários elementos de GUI no editor (em pixels). "
"Veja também [member interface/theme/spacing_preset]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The border size to use for interface elements (in pixels)."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da borda a ser usado para elementos de interface (em pixels)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The editor color preset to use."
msgstr "O predefinição de cor do editor a ser usada."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The contrast factor to use when deriving the editor theme's base color (see "
"[member interface/theme/base_color]). When using positive values, the "
"derived colors will be [i]darker[/i] than the base color. This contrast "
"factor can be set to a negative value, which will make the derived colors "
"[i]brighter[/i] than the base color. Negative contrast rates often look "
"better for light themes."
msgstr ""
"O fator de contraste a ser usado ao derivar a cor base do tema do editor "
"(veja [member interface/theme/base_color]). Ao usar valores positivos, as "
"cores derivadas serão [i]mais escuras[/i] que a cor base. Este fator de "
"contraste pode ser definido como um valor negativo, o que tornará as cores "
"derivadas [i]mais brilhantes[/i] que a cor base. Taxas de contraste "
"negativas geralmente ficam melhores para temas claros."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The corner radius to use for interface elements (in pixels). [code]0[/code] "
"is square."
msgstr ""
"O raio de canto a ser usado para elementos de interface (em pixels). "
"[code]0[/code] é quadrado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The custom theme resource to use for the editor. Must be a Godot theme "
"resource in [code].tres[/code] or [code].res[/code] format."
msgstr ""
"O recurso de tema personalizado a ser usado para o editor. Deve ser um "
"recurso de tema do Godot em formato [code].tres[/code] ou [code].res[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], draws additional borders around interactive UI "
"elements in the editor. This is automatically enabled when using the "
"[b]Black (OLED)[/b] theme preset, as this theme preset uses a fully black "
"background."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], desenha bordas adicionais ao redor de elementos de "
"interface interativos no editor. Isso é ativado automaticamente ao usar a "
"predefinição de tema [b]Black (OLED)[/b], pois esta predefinição de tema usa "
"um fundo totalmente preto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"What relationship lines to draw in the editor's [Tree]-based GUIs (such as "
"the Scene tree dock).\n"
"- [b]None[/b] will make it so that no relationship lines are drawn.\n"
"- [b]Selected Only[/b] will only draw them for selected items.\n"
"- [b]All[/b] will always draw them for all items."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the editor theme preset will attempt to automatically "
"match the system theme."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a predefinição do tema do editor tentará corresponder "
"automaticamente ao tema do sistema."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The icon and font color scheme to use in the editor.\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] determines the color scheme to use automatically based on "
"[member interface/theme/base_color].\n"
"- [b]Dark[/b] makes fonts and icons dark (suitable for light themes). Icon "
"colors are automatically converted by the editor following the set of rules "
"defined in [url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/"
"themes/editor_theme_manager.cpp]this file[/url].\n"
"- [b]Light[/b] makes fonts and icons light (suitable for dark themes)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The saturation to use for editor icons. Higher values result in more vibrant "
"colors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default editor icon saturation was increased by 30% in "
"Godot 4.0 and later. To get Godot 3.x's icon saturation back, set [member "
"interface/theme/icon_saturation] to [code]0.77[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The opacity to use when drawing relationship lines in the editor's [Tree]-"
"based GUIs (such as the Scene tree dock)."
msgstr ""
"A opacidade a ser usada ao desenhar linhas de relacionamento nas GUIs "
"baseadas em [Tree] do editor (como o painel da árvore de cena)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The editor theme spacing preset to use. See also [member interface/theme/"
"base_spacing] and [member interface/theme/additional_spacing]."
msgstr ""
"A predefinição de espaçamento do tema do editor a ser usada. Veja também "
"[member interface/theme/base_spacing] e [member interface/theme/"
"additional_spacing]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The editor theme style to use."
msgstr "O estilo de tema do editor a ser usado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], use the monospace font for some labels in the editor "
"that display code symbols, such as signals, properties, and methods."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa a fonte monoespaçada para alguns rótulos no editor "
"que exibem símbolos de código, como sinais, propriedades e métodos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], set accent color based on system settings.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is effective on Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], define a cor de destaque com base nas configurações do "
"sistema.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta configuração é válida no Windows, macOS, Linux e Android."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], long press on touchscreen is treated as right click.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enable two finger pan and scale gestures on "
"touchscreen devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], increases the scrollbar touch area, enables a larger "
"dragger for split containers, and increases PopupMenu vertical separation to "
"improve usability on touchscreen devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the device will vibrate when a long-press gesture "
"triggers a right-click context menu in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only has an effect on devices with haptic feedback hardware. "
"Defaults to [code]true[/code] on touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specify the multiplier to apply to the scale for the editor gizmo handles to "
"improve usability on touchscreen devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Defaults to [code]1[/code] on non-touchscreen devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"A touch-friendly panel that provides easy access to common actions such as "
"save, delete, undo, and redo without requiring a keyboard.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in the Android and XR editor."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies how the engine should check for updates.\n"
"- [b]Disable Update Checks[/b] will block the engine from checking updates "
"(see also [member network/connection/network_mode]).\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] (default) will check for newest stable or unstable version, "
"depending on which version are you currently using. Switch to another option "
"if you want to lock in.\n"
"- [b]Check Newest Preview[/b] will check for the newest available "
"development snapshot.\n"
"- [b]Check Newest Stable[/b] will check for the newest available stable "
"version.\n"
"- [b]Check Newest Patch[/b] will check for the latest available stable "
"version, but only within the same minor version. E.g. if your version is "
"[code]4.3.stable[/code], you will be notified about [code]4.3.1.stable[/"
"code], but not [code]4.4.stable[/code].\n"
"All update modes will ignore builds with different major versions (e.g. "
"Godot 4 -> Godot 5)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Determines whether online features, such as the Asset Store or update "
"checks, are enabled in the editor. If this is a privacy concern, disabling "
"these online features prevents the editor from making HTTP requests to the "
"Godot website or third-party platforms hosting assets from the Asset Store.\n"
"Editor plugins and tool scripts are recommended to follow this setting. "
"However, Godot can't prevent them from violating this rule."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The address to listen to when starting the remote debugger. This can be set "
"to this device's local IP address to allow external clients to connect to "
"the remote debugger (instead of restricting the remote debugger to "
"connections from [code]localhost[/code])."
msgstr ""
"O endereço para escutar ao iniciar o depurador remoto. Isso pode ser "
"definido para o endereço IP local deste dispositivo para permitir que "
"clientes externos se conectem ao depurador remoto (em vez de restringir o "
"depurador remoto a conexões de [code]localhost[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The port to listen to when starting the remote debugger. Godot will try to "
"use port numbers above the configured number if the configured number is "
"already taken by another application."
msgstr ""
"A porta para escutar ao iniciar o depurador remoto. O Godot tentará usar "
"números de porta acima do número configurado se o número configurado já "
"estiver em uso por outro aplicativo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The host to use to contact the HTTP and HTTPS proxy in the editor (for the "
"asset store and export template downloads). See also [member network/"
"http_proxy/port].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot currently doesn't automatically use system proxy "
"settings, so you have to enter them manually here if needed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The port number to use to contact the HTTP and HTTPS proxy in the editor "
"(for the asset store and export template downloads). See also [member "
"network/http_proxy/host].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot currently doesn't automatically use system proxy "
"settings, so you have to enter them manually here if needed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the language server will try to provide additional "
"results when resolving symbols at the cost of showing wrong results. All "
"symbols in the project are checked and resolved just based on their name, "
"without taking context into account.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func untyped(param):\n"
"\tparam.print() # Will resolve to the global print method for e.g. hover "
"hints.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"When using static typing it is recommended to disable this setting, since it "
"will mostly add false positives for typed code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting also influences how symbols are resolved when "
"using renaming capabilities.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of this setting might change in future "
"versions."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The upper limit of time, that the language server spends for IO each poll."
msgstr ""
"O limite superior de tempo que o servidor de linguagem gasta para E/S a cada "
"ciclo de polling."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The host used to listen for language server clients."
msgstr "O host usado para escutar clientes de servidores de linguagem."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The port used to listen for language server clients.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A port configured with command-line options will take priority "
"over this setting: [code]--lsp-port <port>[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The declaration of native symbols can't be resolved to a position in the "
"file system. If [code]true[/code] the language server will instead open the "
"documentation for native symbols in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The VSCode plugin adds additional functionality which allows "
"viewing Godot documentation directly in VSCode, so this option is usually "
"not needed in VSCode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] the language server will run in a separate thread, if "
"[code]false[/code] it will run on the main thread."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o servidor de idioma será executado em uma thread "
"separada; se [code]false[/code], ele será executado na thread principal."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The TLS certificate bundle to use for HTTP requests made within the editor "
"(e.g. from the Asset Store tab). If left empty, the [url=https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/certs/ca-bundle.crt]included "
"Mozilla certificate bundle[/url] will be used."
msgstr ""
"O pacote de certificados TLS a ser usado para solicitações HTTP feitas "
"dentro do editor (por exemplo, na aba Asset Store). Se deixado vazio, o "
"[url=https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/certs/ca-"
"bundle.crt]pacote de certificados da Mozilla incluído[/url] será usado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enable TLSv1.3 negotiation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using Mbed TLS 3.0 or later (Linux "
"distribution packages may be compiled against older system Mbed TLS "
"packages), otherwise the maximum supported TLS version is always TLSv1.2."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The renderer type that will be checked off by default when creating a new "
"project. Accepted strings are \"forward_plus\", \"mobile\" or "
"\"gl_compatibility\"."
msgstr ""
"O tipo de renderizador que será selecionado por padrão ao criar um novo "
"projeto. As strings aceitas são \"forward_plus\", \"mobile\" ou "
"\"gl_compatibility\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Directory naming convention for the project manager. Options are \"No "
"Convention\" (project name is directory name), \"kebab-case\" (default), "
"\"snake_case\", \"camelCase\", \"PascalCase\", or \"Title Case\"."
msgstr ""
"Convenção de nomenclatura de diretórios para o gerenciador de projetos. As "
"opções são \"No Convention\" (o nome do projeto é o nome do diretório), "
"\"kebab-case\" (padrão), \"snake_case\", \"camelCase\", \"PascalCase\" ou "
"\"Title Case\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The sorting order to use in the project manager. When changing the sorting "
"order in the project manager, this setting is set permanently in the editor "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"A ordem de classificação a ser usada no gerenciador de projetos. Ao alterar "
"a ordem de classificação no gerenciador de projetos, esta configuração é "
"definida permanentemente nas configurações do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], saves all scenes and scripts automatically before "
"running the project. Setting this to [code]false[/code] prevents the editor "
"from saving if there are no changes which can speed up the project startup "
"slightly, but it makes it possible to run a project that has unsaved "
"changes. (Unsaved changes will not be visible in the running project.)"
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], salva todas as cenas e scripts automaticamente antes "
"de executar o projeto. Definir isso como [code]false[/code] impede que o "
"editor salve se não houver alterações, o que pode acelerar um pouco a "
"inicialização do projeto, mas torna possível executar um projeto que possui "
"alterações não salvas. (As alterações não salvas não estarão visíveis no "
"projeto em execução.)"

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The action to execute on the bottom panel when running the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option won't do anything if the bottom panel switching is "
"locked using the pin button in the corner of the bottom panel."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The action to execute on the bottom panel when stopping the project.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option won't do anything if the bottom panel switching is "
"locked using the pin button in the corner of the bottom panel."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the editor will clear the Output panel when running "
"the project."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o editor limpará o painel de Saída ao executar o "
"projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the font in the [b]Output[/b] panel at the bottom of the editor. "
"This setting does not impact the font size of the script editor (see [member "
"interface/editor/fonts/code_font_size])."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da fonte no painel [b]Output[/b] na parte inferior do editor. Esta "
"configuração não afeta o tamanho da fonte do editor de scripts (veja [member "
"interface/editor/fonts/code_font_size])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Maximum number of lines to show at any one time in the Output panel."
msgstr "Número máximo de linhas a serem exibidas de uma vez no painel Saída."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], on Linux/BSD, the editor will check for Wayland first "
"instead of X11 (if available)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], no Linux/BSD, o editor verificará o Wayland primeiro "
"em vez do X11 (se disponível)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies how the Play window is launched relative to the Android editor.\n"
"- [b]Auto (based on screen size)[/b] (default) will automatically choose how "
"to launch the Play window based on the device and screen metrics. Defaults "
"to [b]Same as Editor[/b] on phones and [b]Side-by-side with Editor[/b] on "
"tablets.\n"
"- [b]Same as Editor[/b] will launch the Play window in the same window as "
"the Editor.\n"
"- [b]Side-by-side with Editor[/b] will launch the Play window side-by-side "
"with the Editor window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in the Android editor."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Overrides game embedding setting for all newly opened projects. If enabled, "
"game embedding settings are not saved."
msgstr ""
"Substitui a configuração de incorporação de jogos para todos os projetos "
"recém-abertos. Se ativado, as configurações de incorporação de jogos não são "
"salvas."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The window mode to use to display the project when starting the project from "
"the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Game embedding is not available for [b]\"Force Maximized\"[/b] "
"or [b]\"Force Fullscreen\"[/b]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The custom position to use when starting the project from the editor (in "
"pixels from the top-left corner). Only effective if [member run/"
"window_placement/rect] is set to [b]Custom Position[/b]."
msgstr ""
"A posição personalizada a ser usada ao iniciar o projeto a partir do editor "
"(em pixels a partir do canto superior esquerdo). Só é eficaz se [member run/"
"window_placement/rect] estiver definido como [b]Custom Position[/b]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The monitor to display the project on when starting the project from the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"O monitor no qual o projeto deve ser exibido ao iniciar o projeto a partir "
"do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], makes the caret blink according to [member text_editor/"
"appearance/caret/caret_blink_interval]. Disabling this setting can improve "
"battery life on laptops if you spend long amounts of time in the script "
"editor, since it will reduce the frequency at which the editor needs to be "
"redrawn."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], faz o cursor piscar de acordo com [member text_editor/"
"appearance/caret/caret_blink_interval]. Desativar esta configuração pode "
"melhorar a vida útil da bateria em laptops se você passar longos períodos de "
"tempo no editor de scripts, pois reduzirá a frequência com que o editor "
"precisa ser redesenhado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The interval at which the caret will blink (in seconds). See also [member "
"text_editor/appearance/caret/caret_blink]."
msgstr ""
"O intervalo em que o cursor piscará (em segundos). Veja também [member "
"text_editor/appearance/caret/caret_blink]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlights all occurrences of the currently selected "
"text in the script editor. See also [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"word_highlighted_color]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], destaca todas as ocorrências do texto selecionado no "
"momento no editor de scripts. Veja também [member text_editor/theme/"
"highlighting/word_highlighted_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], colors the background of the line the caret is "
"currently on with [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], colore o fundo da linha em que o cursor está "
"atualmente com [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The shape of the caret to use in the script editor. [b]Line[/b] displays a "
"vertical line to the left of the current character, whereas [b]Block[/b] "
"displays an outline over the current character."
msgstr ""
"A forma do cursor a ser usada no editor de scripts. [b]Line[/b] exibe uma "
"linha vertical à esquerda do caractere atual, enquanto [b]Block[/b] exibe um "
"contorno sobre o caractere atual."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows an info label listing available drop options "
"when dragging an object into the script text editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe um rótulo de informações listando as opções de "
"soltura disponíveis ao arrastar um objeto para o editor de texto de script."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a colored button before any [Color] "
"constructor in the script editor. Clicking on them allows the color to be "
"modified through a color picker."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe um botão colorido antes de qualquer construtor "
"[Color] no editor de scripts. Clicar neles permite que a cor seja modificada "
"por meio de um seletor de cores."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The column at which to display a subtle line as a line length guideline for "
"scripts. This should generally be greater than [member text_editor/"
"appearance/guidelines/line_length_guideline_soft_column]."
msgstr ""
"A coluna na qual exibir uma linha sutil como diretriz de comprimento de "
"linha para scripts. Isso deve geralmente ser maior que [member text_editor/"
"appearance/guidelines/line_length_guideline_soft_column]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The column at which to display a [i]very[/i] subtle line as a line length "
"guideline for scripts. This should generally be lower than [member "
"text_editor/appearance/guidelines/line_length_guideline_hard_column]."
msgstr ""
"A coluna na qual exibir uma linha [i]muito[/i] sutil como uma diretriz de "
"comprimento de linha para scripts. Isso geralmente deve ser menor que "
"[member text_editor/appearance/guidelines/line_length_guideline_hard_column]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays line length guidelines to help you keep line "
"lengths in check. See also [member text_editor/appearance/guidelines/"
"line_length_guideline_soft_column] and [member text_editor/appearance/"
"guidelines/line_length_guideline_hard_column]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe diretrizes de comprimento de linha para ajudar a "
"manter os comprimentos de linha sob controle. Veja também [member "
"text_editor/appearance/guidelines/line_length_guideline_soft_column] e "
"[member text_editor/appearance/guidelines/line_length_guideline_hard_column]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], highlights type-safe lines by displaying their line "
"number color with [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"safe_line_number_color] instead of [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"line_number_color]. Type-safe lines are lines of code where the type of all "
"variables is known at compile-time. These type-safe lines may run faster "
"thanks to typed instructions."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], destaca linhas seguras quanto ao tipo exibindo a cor "
"do número da linha com [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"safe_line_number_color] em vez de [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"line_number_color]. Linhas seguras quanto ao tipo são linhas de código onde "
"o tipo de todas as variáveis é conhecido em tempo de compilação. Essas "
"linhas seguras quanto ao tipo podem ser executadas mais rapidamente graças a "
"instruções tipadas."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays line numbers with zero padding (e.g. "
"[code]007[/code] instead of [code]7[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe números de linha com preenchimento de zero (ex: "
"[code]007[/code] em vez de [code]7[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a gutter at the left containing icons for "
"methods with signal connections and for overridden methods."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe uma medianiz (gutter) à esquerda contendo ícones "
"para métodos com conexões de sinal e para métodos substituídos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], displays line numbers in a gutter at the left."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe os números das linhas em uma calha à esquerda."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [member text_editor/appearance/lines/word_wrap] is set to [code]1[/code], "
"sets text wrapping mode. To see how each mode behaves, see [enum "
"TextServer.AutowrapMode]."
msgstr ""
"Se [member text_editor/appearance/lines/word_wrap] estiver definido como "
"[code]1[/code], define o modo de quebra de texto. Para ver como cada modo se "
"comporta, consulte [enum TextServer.AutowrapMode]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays the folding arrows next to indented code "
"sections and allows code folding. If [code]false[/code], hides the folding "
"arrows next to indented code sections and disallows code folding."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe as setas de dobramento ao lado de seções de "
"código recuadas e permite o dobramento de código. Se [code]false[/code], "
"oculta as setas de dobramento ao lado de seções de código recuadas e "
"desativa o dobramento de código."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], wraps long lines over multiple lines to avoid "
"horizontal scrolling. This is a display-only feature; it does not actually "
"insert line breaks in your scripts."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], quebra linhas longas em várias linhas para evitar a "
"rolagem horizontal. Este é um recurso apenas de exibição; ele não insere "
"quebras de linha reais em seus scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The width of the minimap in the script editor (in pixels)."
msgstr "A largura do minimapa no editor de scripts (em pixels)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], draws an overview of the script near the scroll bar. "
"The minimap can be left-clicked to scroll directly to a location in an "
"\"absolute\" manner."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], desenha uma visão geral do script perto da barra de "
"rolagem. O minimapa pode ser clicado com o botão esquerdo para rolar "
"diretamente para um local de maneira \"absoluta\"."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], draws space characters as centered points."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], desenha caracteres de espaço como pontos centralizados."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], draws tab characters as chevrons."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], desenha caracteres de tabulação como chevrons."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The space to add between lines (in pixels). Greater line spacing can help "
"improve readability at the cost of displaying fewer lines on screen. "
"Negative values allow for even more compact text, but may look broken with "
"certain fonts."
msgstr ""
"O espaço a ser adicionado entre as linhas (em pixels). Um espaçamento de "
"linha maior pode ajudar a melhorar a legibilidade ao custo de exibir menos "
"linhas na tela. Valores negativos permitem textos ainda mais compactos, mas "
"podem parecer quebrados com certas fontes."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], documentation tooltips will appear when hovering over "
"a symbol."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], dicas de ferramentas de documentação aparecerão ao "
"passar o cursor sobre um símbolo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], tool scripts will be automatically soft-reloaded after "
"they are saved."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os scripts de ferramentas serão recarregados "
"suavemente de forma automática após serem salvos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically reloads scripts and text-based shaders "
"in the editor when they have been modified and saved by external editors or "
"tools and the editor regains focus. External changes can be discarded by "
"using the Undo function after they've been loaded in the editor.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], a file conflict dialog will always be displayed when "
"the editor regains focus. This dialog allows you to choose whether to keep "
"local changes or discard them.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even when this setting is [code]true[/code], a file conflict "
"dialog is still displayed in certain situations. For instance, it will "
"display when the script editor has unsaved changes that the external editor "
"did not account for."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If set to a value greater than [code]0[/code], automatically saves the "
"current script following the specified interval (in seconds). This can be "
"used to prevent data loss if the editor crashes."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como um valor maior que [code]0[/code], salva automaticamente o "
"script atual seguindo o intervalo especificado (em segundos). Isso pode ser "
"usado para evitar a perda de dados se o editor travar."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], converts indentation to match the script editor's "
"indentation settings when saving a script. See also [member text_editor/"
"behavior/indent/type]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], converte a indentação para corresponder às "
"configurações de indentação do editor de scripts ao salvar um script. Veja "
"também [member text_editor/behavior/indent/type]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when dropping a [Resource] file to script editor while "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] is held, the resource will be preloaded with a UID. If "
"[code]false[/code], the resource will be preloaded with a path.\n"
"When you hold [kbd]Ctrl+Shift[/kbd], the behavior is reversed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], opening a scene automatically opens the script "
"attached to the root node, or the topmost node if the root has no script."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], abrir uma cena abre automaticamente o script anexado "
"ao nó raiz, ou ao nó mais acima se a raiz não tiver script."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reopens scripts that were opened in the last session "
"when the editor is reopened on a given project."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], reabre scripts que foram abertos na última sessão "
"quando o editor é reaberto em um determinado projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], trims all empty newlines after the final newline when "
"saving a script. Final newlines refer to the empty newlines found at the end "
"of files. Since these serve no practical purpose, they can and should be "
"removed to make version control diffs less noisy."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], remove todas as quebras de linha vazias após a quebra "
"de linha final ao salvar um script. Quebras de linha finais referem-se às "
"quebras de linha vazias encontradas no final dos arquivos. Como elas não têm "
"utilidade prática, podem e devem ser removidas para tornar os diffs de "
"controle de versão menos poluídos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], trims trailing whitespace when saving a script. "
"Trailing whitespace refers to tab and space characters placed at the end of "
"lines. Since these serve no practical purpose, they can and should be "
"removed to make version control diffs less noisy."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], remove os espaços em branco à direita ao salvar um "
"script. Espaços em branco à direita referem-se a caracteres de tabulação e "
"espaço colocados no final das linhas. Como eles não têm utilidade prática, "
"podem e devem ser removidos para tornar os diffs de controle de versão menos "
"poluídos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], copying or cutting without a selection is performed on "
"all lines with a caret. Otherwise, copy and cut require a selection."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], copiar ou recortar sem uma seleção é realizado em "
"todas as linhas com um cursor. Caso contrário, copiar e recortar exigem uma "
"seleção."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically indents code when pressing the "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd] key based on blocks above the new line."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], indenta automaticamente o código ao pressionar a tecla "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd] com base nos blocos acima da nova linha."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], all wrapped lines are indented to the same amount as "
"the unwrapped line."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], todas as linhas quebradas são recuadas com a mesma "
"quantidade que a linha sem quebra."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When using tab indentation, determines the length of each tab. When using "
"space indentation, determines how many spaces are inserted when pressing "
"[kbd]Tab[/kbd] and when automatic indentation is performed."
msgstr ""
"Ao usar indentação por tabulação, determina o comprimento de cada tabulação. "
"Ao usar indentação por espaços, determina quantos espaços são inseridos ao "
"pressionar [kbd]Tab[/kbd] e quando a indentação automática é realizada."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The indentation style to use (tabs or spaces).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_styleguide.html]GDScript style guide[/url] recommends using tabs "
"for indentation. It is advised to change this setting only if you need to "
"work on a project that currently uses spaces for indentation."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The characters to consider as word delimiters if [member text_editor/"
"behavior/navigation/use_custom_word_separators] is [code]true[/code]. This "
"is in addition to default characters if [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/use_default_word_separators] is [code]true[/code]. The characters "
"should be defined without separation, for example [code]_♥=[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Os caracteres a serem considerados como delimitadores de palavras se [member "
"text_editor/behavior/navigation/use_custom_word_separators] for [code]true[/"
"code]. Isso é um acréscimo aos caracteres padrão se [member text_editor/"
"behavior/navigation/use_default_word_separators] for [code]true[/code]. Os "
"caracteres devem ser definidos sem separação, por exemplo, [code]_♥=[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows drag-and-dropping text in the script editor to "
"move text. Disable this if you find yourself accidentally drag-and-dropping "
"text in the script editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite arrastar e soltar texto no editor de scripts "
"para mover texto. Desative isso se você se pegar arrastando e soltando texto "
"acidentalmente no editor de scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the caret will be moved when right-clicking somewhere "
"in the script editor (like when left-clicking or middle-clicking). If "
"[code]false[/code], the caret will only be moved when left-clicking or "
"middle-clicking somewhere."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o cursor será movido ao clicar com o botão direito em "
"algum lugar do editor de scripts (como ao clicar com o botão esquerdo ou do "
"meio). Se [code]false[/code], o cursor só será movido ao clicar com o botão "
"esquerdo ou do meio em algum lugar."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], opens the script editor when connecting a signal to an "
"existing script method from the Signals dock."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], abre o editor de scripts ao conectar um sinal a um "
"método de script existente a partir da aba Sinais."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], allows scrolling past the end of the file."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], permite a rolagem além do fim do arquivo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables a smooth scrolling animation when using the "
"mouse wheel to scroll. See [member text_editor/behavior/navigation/"
"v_scroll_speed] for the speed of this animation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member text_editor/behavior/navigation/smooth_scrolling] "
"currently behaves poorly in projects where [member ProjectSettings.physics/"
"common/physics_ticks_per_second] has been increased significantly from its "
"default value ([code]60[/code]). In this case, it is recommended to disable "
"this setting."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], prevents automatically switching between the Script "
"and 2D/3D screens when selecting a node in the Scene tree dock."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], evita a alternância automática entre as telas de "
"Script e 2D/3D ao selecionar um nó na doca da árvore de Cena."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses the characters in [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/custom_word_separators] as word separators for word navigation "
"and operations. This is in addition to the default characters if [member "
"text_editor/behavior/navigation/use_default_word_separators] is also "
"enabled. Word navigation and operations include double-clicking on a word or "
"holding [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd] on macOS) while pressing [kbd]left[/"
"kbd], [kbd]right[/kbd], [kbd]backspace[/kbd], or [kbd]delete[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa os caracteres em [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/custom_word_separators] como separadores de palavras para "
"navegação e operações de palavras. Isso se soma aos caracteres padrão se "
"[member text_editor/behavior/navigation/use_default_word_separators] também "
"estiver habilitado. A navegação e as operações de palavras incluem clicar "
"duas vezes em uma palavra ou segurar [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd] no "
"macOS) enquanto pressiona [kbd]left[/kbd], [kbd]right[/kbd], [kbd]backspace[/"
"kbd] ou [kbd]delete[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses the characters in [code]`!\"#$%&'()*+,-./:;<=>?"
"@[\\]^`{|}~[/code], the Unicode General Punctuation table, and the Unicode "
"CJK Punctuation table as word separators for word navigation and operations. "
"If [code]false[/code], a subset of these characters are used and does not "
"include the characters [code]<>$~^=+|[/code]. This is in addition to custom "
"characters if [member text_editor/behavior/navigation/"
"use_custom_word_separators] is also enabled. These characters are used to "
"determine where a word stops. Word navigation and operations include double-"
"clicking on a word or holding [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd] on macOS) "
"while pressing [kbd]left[/kbd], [kbd]right[/kbd], [kbd]backspace[/kbd], or "
"[kbd]delete[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa os caracteres em [code]`!\"#$%&'()*+,-./:;<=>?"
"@[\\]^`{|}~[/code], a tabela de Pontuação Geral do Unicode e a tabela de "
"Pontuação CJK do Unicode como separadores de palavras para navegação e "
"operações de palavras. Se [code]false[/code], um subconjunto desses "
"caracteres é usado e não inclui os caracteres [code]<>$~^=+|[/code]. Isso se "
"soma aos caracteres personalizados se [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/use_custom_word_separators] também estiver habilitado. Esses "
"caracteres são usados para determinar onde uma palavra para. A navegação e "
"as operações de palavras incluem clicar duas vezes em uma palavra ou segurar "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd] no macOS) enquanto pressiona [kbd]left[/"
"kbd], [kbd]right[/kbd], [kbd]backspace[/kbd] ou [kbd]delete[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The speed of scrolling in lines per second when [member text_editor/behavior/"
"navigation/smooth_scrolling] is [code]true[/code]. Higher values make the "
"script scroll by faster when using the mouse wheel.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You can hold down [kbd]Alt[/kbd] while using the mouse wheel to "
"temporarily scroll 5 times faster."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses [NodePath] instead of [String] when appropriate "
"for code autocompletion or for drag and dropping object properties into the "
"script editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa [NodePath] em vez de [String] quando apropriado "
"para autocompletar código ou para arrastar e soltar propriedades de objetos "
"no editor de scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses [StringName] instead of [String] when appropriate "
"for code autocompletion."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa [StringName] em vez de [String] quando apropriado "
"para o preenchimento automático de código."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically adds [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/"
"gdscript/static_typing.html]GDScript static typing[/url] (such as [code]-> "
"void[/code] and [code]: int[/code]) in many situations where it's possible "
"to, including when:\n"
"- Accepting a suggestion from code autocompletion;\n"
"- Creating a new script from a template;\n"
"- Connecting signals from the Signals dock;\n"
"- Creating variables prefixed with [annotation @GDScript.@onready], by "
"dropping nodes from the Scene dock into the script editor while holding "
"[kbd]Ctrl[/kbd]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], automatically inserts the matching closing brace when "
"the opening brace is inserted by typing or autocompletion. Also "
"automatically removes the closing brace when pressing [kbd]Backspace[/kbd] "
"on the opening brace. This includes brackets ([code]()[/code], [code][][/"
"code], [code]{}[/code]), string quotation marks ([code]''[/code], [code]"
"\"\"[/code]), and comments ([code]/**/[/code]) if the language supports it."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], insere automaticamente a chave de fechamento "
"correspondente quando a chave de abertura é inserida por digitação ou "
"autocompletar. Também remove automaticamente a chave de fechamento ao "
"pressionar [kbd]Backspace[/kbd] na chave de abertura. Isso inclui chaves, "
"colchetes e parênteses ([code]()[/code], [code][][/code], [code]{}[/code]), "
"aspas de string ([code]''[/code], [code]\"\"[/code]) e comentários ([code]/"
"**/[/code]) se a linguagem der suporte a isso."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The delay in seconds after which autocompletion suggestions should be "
"displayed when the user stops typing."
msgstr ""
"O atraso em segundos após o qual as sugestões de preenchimento automático "
"devem ser exibidas quando o usuário para de digitar."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], code completion will be triggered automatically after "
"[member text_editor/completion/code_complete_delay]. Even if [code]false[/"
"code], code completion can be triggered manually with the "
"[code]ui_text_completion_query[/code] action (by default [kbd]Ctrl + Space[/"
"kbd] or [kbd]Cmd + Space[/kbd] on macOS)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a conclusão de código será disparada automaticamente "
"após [member text_editor/completion/code_complete_delay]. Mesmo se "
"[code]false[/code], a conclusão de código pode ser disparada manualmente com "
"a ação [code]ui_text_completion_query[/code] (por padrão [kbd]Ctrl + Space[/"
"kbd] ou [kbd]Cmd + Space[/kbd] no macOS)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] enables the coloring for some items in the "
"autocompletion suggestions, like vector components."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa a coloração para alguns itens nas sugestões de "
"autocompletar, como componentes de vetor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], provides autocompletion suggestions for file paths in "
"methods such as [code]load()[/code] and [code]preload()[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], fornece sugestões de preenchimento automático para "
"caminhos de arquivo em métodos como [code]load()[/code] e [code]preload()[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The delay in seconds after which the script editor should check for errors "
"when the user stops typing."
msgstr ""
"O atraso em segundos após o qual o editor de scripts deve verificar erros "
"quando o usuário parar de digitar."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The delay used instead of [member text_editor/completion/idle_parse_delay], "
"when the parser has found errors. A lower value should feel more responsive "
"while fixing code, but may cause notable stuttering and increase CPU usage."
msgstr ""
"O atraso usado em vez de [member text_editor/completion/idle_parse_delay], "
"quando o parser encontra erros. Um valor mais baixo deve parecer mais "
"responsivo ao corrigir código, mas pode causar travamentos perceptíveis e "
"aumentar o uso da CPU."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the code completion tooltip will appear below the "
"current line unless there is no space on screen below the current line. If "
"[code]false[/code], the code completion tooltip will appear above the "
"current line."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a dica de preenchimento de código aparecerá abaixo da "
"linha atual, a menos que não haja espaço na tela abaixo da linha atual. Se "
"[code]false[/code], a dica de preenchimento de código aparecerá acima da "
"linha atual."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], performs string autocompletion with single quotes. If "
"[code]false[/code], performs string autocompletion with double quotes (which "
"matches the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_styleguide.html]GDScript style guide[/url])."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], realiza autocompletar de string com aspas simples. Se "
"[code]false[/code], realiza autocompletar de string com aspas duplas (o que "
"corresponde ao [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_styleguide.html]guia de estilo do GDScript[/url])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The command-line arguments to pass to the external text editor that is run "
"when [member text_editor/external/use_external_editor] is [code]true[/code]. "
"See also [member text_editor/external/exec_path]."
msgstr ""
"Os argumentos de linha de comando a serem passados para o editor de texto "
"externo que é executado quando [member text_editor/external/"
"use_external_editor] é [code]true[/code]. Consulte também [member "
"text_editor/external/exec_path]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The path to the text editor executable used to edit text files if [member "
"text_editor/external/use_external_editor] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O caminho para o executável do editor de texto usado para editar arquivos de "
"texto se [member text_editor/external/use_external_editor] for [code]true[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses an external editor instead of the built-in Script "
"Editor. See also [member text_editor/external/exec_path] and [member "
"text_editor/external/exec_flags]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa um editor externo em vez do Editor de Script "
"integrado. Consulte também [member text_editor/external/exec_path] e [member "
"text_editor/external/exec_flags]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Controls which multi-line code blocks should be displayed in the editor "
"help. This setting does not affect single-line code literals in the editor "
"help."
msgstr ""
"Controla quais blocos de código de várias linhas devem ser exibidos na ajuda "
"do editor. Esta configuração não afeta literais de código de uma única linha "
"na ajuda do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The font size to use for the editor help (built-in class reference)."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da fonte a ser usado para a ajuda do editor (referência de classe "
"integrada)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The font size to use for code samples in the editor help (built-in class "
"reference)."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da fonte a ser usado para exemplos de código na ajuda do editor "
"(referência de classe integrada)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The font size to use for headings in the editor help (built-in class "
"reference)."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho de fonte a ser usado para títulos na ajuda do editor (referência "
"de classe integrada)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays a table of contents at the left of the editor "
"help (at the location where the members overview would appear when editing a "
"script)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe um sumário à esquerda da ajuda do editor (no "
"local onde a visão geral dos membros apareceria ao editar um script)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the script's method list in the Script Editor is "
"sorted alphabetically."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a lista de métodos do script no Editor de Scripts é "
"ordenada alfabeticamente."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], class reference pages are grouped together at the "
"bottom of the Script Editor's script list."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as páginas de referência de classes são agrupadas na "
"parte inferior da lista de scripts do Editor de Scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scripts that are used by the current scene are "
"highlighted in the Script Editor's script list."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os scripts usados pela cena atual são destacados na "
"lista de scripts do Editor de Scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies how script paths should be displayed in Script Editor's script "
"list. If using the \"Name\" option and some scripts share the same file "
"name, more parts of their paths are revealed to avoid conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Especifica como os caminhos de script devem ser exibidos na lista de scripts "
"do Editor de Scripts. Se usar a opção \"Name\" e alguns scripts "
"compartilharem o mesmo nome de arquivo, mais partes de seus caminhos serão "
"reveladas para evitar conflitos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the names of recently opened scripts in the Script "
"Editor are highlighted with the accent color, with its intensity based on "
"how recently they were opened."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os nomes de scripts abertos recentemente no Editor de "
"Scripts são destacados com a cor de destaque, com sua intensidade baseada em "
"quão recentemente foram abertos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"How many script names can be highlighted at most, if [member text_editor/"
"script_list/script_temperature_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. Scripts older "
"than this value use the default font color."
msgstr ""
"Quantos nomes de script podem ser destacados no máximo, se [member "
"text_editor/script_list/script_temperature_enabled] for [code]true[/code]. "
"Os scripts mais antigos que esse valor usam a cor de fonte padrão."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays an overview of the current script's member "
"functions at the left of the script editor. See also [member text_editor/"
"script_list/sort_members_outline_alphabetically]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe uma visão geral das funções de membro do script "
"atual à esquerda do editor de scripts. Consulte também [member text_editor/"
"script_list/sort_members_outline_alphabetically]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], sorts the members outline (located at the left of the "
"script editor) using alphabetical order. If [code]false[/code], sorts the "
"members outline depending on the order in which members are found in the "
"script.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member text_editor/script_list/"
"show_members_overview] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Specifies sorting used for Script Editor's open script list."
msgstr ""
"Especifica a ordenação usada para a lista de scripts abertos do Editor de "
"Scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The syntax theme to use in the script editor.\n"
"You can save your own syntax theme from your current settings by using "
"[b]File > Theme > Save As...[/b] at the top of the script editor. The syntax "
"theme will then be available locally in the list of color themes.\n"
"You can find additional syntax themes to install in the [url=https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-syntax-themes]godot-syntax-themes[/url] "
"repository."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's background color. If set to a translucent color, the "
"editor theme's base color will be visible behind."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo do editor de scripts. Se definido como uma cor translúcida, a "
"cor base do tema do editor ficará visível por trás."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's base type color (used for types like [Vector2], "
"[Vector3], [Color], ...)."
msgstr ""
"Cor do tipo base do editor de scripts (usada para tipos como [Vector2], "
"[Vector3], [Color], ...)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's bookmark icon color (displayed in the gutter)."
msgstr "A cor do ícone de marcador do editor de script (exibido na medianil)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's brace mismatch color. Used when the caret is currently "
"on a mismatched brace, parenthesis or bracket character."
msgstr ""
"A cor de incompatibilidade de chaves do editor de script. Usada quando o "
"cursor está atualmente em um caractere de chave, parêntese ou colchete "
"incompatível."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's breakpoint icon color (displayed in the gutter)."
msgstr ""
"A cor do ícone de ponto de interrupção do editor de script (exibido na "
"medianil)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's caret background color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect as it's currently unused."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's caret color."
msgstr "A cor do cursor do editor de scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the code folding icon (displayed in the "
"gutter)."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para o ícone de compactação de código (exibido na "
"medianiz)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's comment color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, unlike Python, multiline strings are not "
"considered to be comments, and will use the string highlighting color "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's critical comment marker text color. These markers are "
"determined by [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/"
"critical_list]."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do marcador de comentário crítico do editor de scripts. Esses "
"marcadores são determinados por [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"comment_markers/critical_list]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of case-sensitive words to highlight in comments. The "
"text will be highlighted in the script editor with the [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/comment_markers/critical_color] color. These must not "
"include spaces or symbols or they will not be highlighted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only implemented in the GDScript syntax highlighter."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's notice comment marker text color. These markers are "
"determined by [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/"
"notice_list]."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do marcador de comentário de aviso do editor de scripts. "
"Esses marcadores são determinados por [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"comment_markers/notice_list]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of case-sensitive words to highlight in comments. The "
"text will be highlighted in the script editor with the [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/comment_markers/notice_color] color. These must not "
"include spaces or symbols or they will not be highlighted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only implemented in the GDScript syntax highlighter."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's warning comment marker text color. These markers are "
"determined by [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/comment_markers/"
"warning_list]."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do marcador de comentário de aviso do editor de scripts. "
"Esses marcadores são determinados por [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"comment_markers/warning_list]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of case-sensitive words to highlight in comments. The "
"text will be highlighted in the script editor with the [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/comment_markers/warning_color] color. These must not "
"include spaces or symbols or they will not be highlighted.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only implemented in the GDScript syntax highlighter."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's autocompletion box background color."
msgstr "A cor de fundo da caixa de autocompletar do editor de scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's autocompletion box background color to highlight "
"existing characters in the completion results. This should be a translucent "
"color so that [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"completion_selected_color] can be seen behind."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo da caixa de preenchimento automático do editor de scripts "
"para destacar os caracteres existentes nos resultados de preenchimento. Esta "
"deve ser uma cor translúcida para que [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"completion_selected_color] possa ser vista por trás."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's autocompletion box text color."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto da caixa de preenchimento automático do editor de scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's autocompletion box scroll bar color."
msgstr ""
"A cor da barra de rolagem da caixa de autocompletar do editor de scripts."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's autocompletion box scroll bar color when hovered or "
"pressed with the mouse."
msgstr ""
"A cor da barra de rolagem da caixa de preenchimento automático do editor de "
"scripts quando o mouse passa por cima ou é pressionado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's autocompletion box background color for the currently "
"selected line."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo da caixa de autocompletação do editor de scripts para a linha "
"selecionada no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's control flow keyword color (used for keywords like "
"[code]if[/code], [code]for[/code], [code]return[/code], ...)."
msgstr ""
"A cor da palavra-chave de fluxo de controle do editor de script (usada para "
"palavras-chave como [code]if[/code], [code]for[/code], [code]return[/"
"code], ...)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for the line the caret is currently on. "
"This should be set to a translucent color so that it can display on top of "
"other line color modifiers such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"mark_color]."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo do editor de scripts para a linha em que o cursor está "
"atualmente. Isso deve ser definido como uma cor translúcida para que possa "
"ser exibida acima de outros modificadores de cor de linha, como [member "
"text_editor/theme/highlighting/mark_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's documentation comment color. In GDScript, this is used "
"for comments starting with [code]##[/code]. In C#, this is used for comments "
"starting with [code]///[/code] or [code]/**[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A cor do comentário de documentação do editor de scripts. No GDScript, isso "
"é usado para comentários iniciados com [code]##[/code]. No C#, isso é usado "
"para comentários iniciados com [code]///[/code] ou [code]/**[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's engine type color ([Object], [Mesh], [Node], ...)."
msgstr ""
"A cor do tipo de engine do editor de scripts ([Object], [Mesh], [Node], ...)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the debugger's executing line icon (displayed "
"in the gutter)."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para o ícone da linha de execução do depurador "
"(exibido na medianiz)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's background line highlighting color for folded code "
"region."
msgstr ""
"A cor de destaque da linha de fundo do editor de scripts para região de "
"código dobrada."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's function call color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the GDScript syntax highlighter, this is only used "
"when calling some functions since function definitions and global functions "
"have their own colors [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/gdscript/"
"function_definition_color] and [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"gdscript/global_function_color]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for annotations (e.g. "
"[code]@export[/code])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do realçador de sintaxe do GDScript para anotações (por "
"exemplo, [code]@export[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for function definitions (e.g. "
"the [code]_ready[/code] in [code]func _ready():[/code])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do realçador de sintaxe GDScript para definições de função "
"(por exemplo, o [code]_ready[/code] em [code]func _ready():[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for global functions, such as the "
"ones in [@GlobalScope] (e.g. [code]preload()[/code])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do realçador de sintaxe GDScript para funções globais, como "
"aquelas em [@GlobalScope] (por exemplo, [code]preload()[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for [NodePath] literals (e.g. "
"[code]^\"position:x\"[/code])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do realçador de sintaxe do GDScript para literais [NodePath] "
"(por exemplo, [code]^\"position:x\"[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for node reference literals (e.g. "
"[code]$\"Sprite\"[/code] and [code]%\"Sprite\"[/code]])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do realçador de sintaxe GDScript para literais de referência "
"de nó (por exemplo, [code]$\"Sprite\"[/code] e [code]%\"Sprite\"[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The GDScript syntax highlighter text color for [StringName] literals (e.g. "
"[code]&\"example\"[/code])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto do resaltador de sintaxe do GDScript para literais "
"[StringName] (por exemplo, [code]&\"example\"[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's non-control flow keyword color (used for keywords like "
"[code]var[/code], [code]func[/code], [code]extends[/code], ...)."
msgstr ""
"A cor de palavra-chave sem controle de fluxo do editor de scripts (usada "
"para palavras-chave como [code]var[/code], [code]func[/code], [code]extends[/"
"code], ...)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the line length guideline. The \"hard\" line "
"length guideline will be drawn with this color, whereas the \"soft\" line "
"length guideline will be drawn with half of its opacity."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para a diretriz de comprimento de linha. A "
"diretriz de comprimento de linha \"rígida\" será desenhada com esta cor, "
"enquanto a diretriz de comprimento de linha \"flexível\" será desenhada com "
"metade de sua opacidade."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for line numbers. See also [member text_editor/"
"theme/highlighting/safe_line_number_color]."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para números de linha. Veja também [member "
"text_editor/theme/highlighting/safe_line_number_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for lines with errors. This should be "
"set to a translucent color so that it can display on top of other line color "
"modifiers such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo do editor de scripts para linhas com erros. Isso deve ser "
"definido como uma cor translúcida para que possa ser exibido sobre outros "
"modificadores de cor de linha, como [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"current_line_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for member variables on objects (e.g. "
"[code]self.some_property[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This color is not used for local variable declaration and "
"access."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's color for numbers (integer and floating-point)."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de script para números (inteiros e de ponto flutuante)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for type-safe line numbers. See also [member "
"text_editor/theme/highlighting/line_number_color].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only displayed if [member text_editor/appearance/gutters/"
"highlight_type_safe_lines] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for the border of search results. This border "
"helps bring further attention to the search result. Set this color's opacity "
"to 0 to disable the border."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para a borda dos resultados de pesquisa. Esta "
"borda ajuda a chamar mais atenção para o resultado da pesquisa. Defina a "
"opacidade desta cor como 0 para desativar a borda."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's background color for search results."
msgstr "A cor de fundo do editor de scripts para resultados de pesquisa."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's background color for the currently selected text."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo do editor de scripts para o texto selecionado no momento."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "The script editor's color for strings (single-line and multi-line)."
msgstr "A cor do editor de script para strings (de uma linha e multilinha)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for string placeholders, such as [code]%s[/code] "
"and [code]{_}[/code]. Refer to the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/"
"gdscript/gdscript_format_string.html]GDScript format strings documentation[/"
"url] for more details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only the default [code]{_}[/code] placeholder patterns are "
"highlighted for the [method String.format] method. Custom patterns still "
"appear as plain strings."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for operators ([code]( ) [ ] { } + - * /[/"
"code], ...)."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para operadores ([code]( ) [ ] { } + - * /[/"
"code], ...)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for text not highlighted by any syntax "
"highlighting rule."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para texto não destacado por nenhuma regra de "
"destaque de sintaxe."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for text. This should be set to a "
"translucent color so that it can display on top of other line color "
"modifiers such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo do editor de scripts para o texto. Isso deve ser definido "
"como uma cor translúcida para que possa ser exibido sobre outros "
"modificadores de cor de linha, como [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"current_line_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for user-defined types (using [code]class_name[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para tipos definidos pelo usuário (usando "
"[code]class_name[/code])."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's background color for lines with warnings. This should be "
"set to a translucent color so that it can display on top of other line color "
"modifiers such as [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/current_line_color]."
msgstr ""
"A cor de fundo do editor de scripts para linhas com avisos. Isso deve ser "
"definido como uma cor translúcida para que possa ser exibido sobre outros "
"modificadores de cor de linha, como [member text_editor/theme/highlighting/"
"current_line_color]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The script editor's color for words highlighted by selecting them. Only "
"visible if [member text_editor/appearance/caret/highlight_all_occurrences] "
"is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A cor do editor de scripts para palavras destacadas ao selecioná-las. "
"Visível apenas se [member text_editor/appearance/caret/"
"highlight_all_occurrences] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path to private SSH key file for the editor's Version Control integration "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para o arquivo de chave SSH privada para as credenciais de "
"integração de Controle de Versão do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path to public SSH key file for the editor's Version Control integration "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para o arquivo de chave SSH pública para as credenciais de "
"integração de Controle de Versão do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Default username for editor's Version Control integration."
msgstr ""
"Nome de usuário padrão para a integração de Controle de Versão do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid "Emitted after any editor setting has changed."
msgstr "Emitido após qualquer configuração do editor ser alterada."

#: doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted after any editor setting has changed. It's used by various editor "
"plugins to update their visuals on theme changes or logic on configuration "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Emitido após a alteração de qualquer configuração do editor. É usado por "
"vários plugins do editor para atualizar seus visuais em alterações de tema "
"ou lógica em alterações de configuração."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Godot editor's control for editing numeric values."
msgstr "O controle do editor do Godot para editar valores numéricos."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid ""
"This [Control] node is used in the editor's Inspector dock to allow editing "
"of numeric values. Can be used with [EditorInspectorPlugin] to recreate the "
"same behavior.\n"
"If the [member Range.step] value is [code]1[/code], the [EditorSpinSlider] "
"will display up/down arrows, similar to [SpinBox]. If the [member "
"Range.step] value is not [code]1[/code], a slider will be displayed instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "The state in which the control used to manipulate the value will be."
msgstr "O estado em que o controle usado para manipular o valor se encontrará."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], changing via dragging is applied only at the end of "
"the input (for example, when the user releases a mouse button)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a alteração por arrastar é aplicada apenas no final da "
"entrada (por exemplo, quando o usuário solta o botão do mouse)."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [EditorSpinSlider] is considered to be editing an "
"integer value. If [code]false[/code], the [EditorSpinSlider] is considered "
"to be editing a floating-point value. This is used to determine whether a "
"slider should be drawn by default. The slider is only drawn for floats; "
"integers use up-down arrows similar to [SpinBox] instead, unless [member "
"control_state] is set to [constant CONTROL_STATE_PREFER_SLIDER]. It will "
"also use [member EditorSettings.interface/inspector/integer_drag_speed] "
"instead of [member EditorSettings.interface/inspector/float_drag_speed] if "
"the slider is available."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [EditorSpinSlider] é considerado como editando um "
"valor inteiro. Se [code]false[/code], o [EditorSpinSlider] é considerado "
"como editando um valor de ponto flutuante. Isso é usado para determinar se "
"um controle deslizante deve ser desenhado por padrão. O controle deslizante "
"é desenhado apenas para ponto flutuante; inteiros usam setas para cima e "
"para baixo semelhantes ao [SpinBox] em vez disso, a menos que [member "
"control_state] esteja definido como [constant CONTROL_STATE_PREFER_SLIDER]. "
"Ele também usará [member EditorSettings.interface/inspector/"
"integer_drag_speed] em vez de [member EditorSettings.interface/inspector/"
"float_drag_speed] se o controle deslizante estiver disponível."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the slider will not draw background."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o controle deslizante não desenhará fundo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Use [member control_state] instead."
msgstr "Use [member control_state] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the slider and up/down arrows are hidden."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o controle deslizante e as setas para cima/para baixo "
"são ocultados."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "The text that displays to the left of the value."
msgstr "O texto que é exibido à esquerda do valor."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the slider can't be interacted with."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], não é possível interagir com o controle deslizante."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid ""
"The suffix to display after the value (in a faded color). This should "
"generally be a plural word. You may have to use an abbreviation if the "
"suffix is too long to be displayed."
msgstr ""
"O sufixo a ser exibido após o valor (em uma cor esmaecida). Geralmente, deve "
"ser uma palavra no plural. Pode ser necessário usar uma abreviação se o "
"sufixo for muito longo para ser exibido."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Emitted when the spinner/slider is grabbed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o controle deslizante/giratório é capturado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Emitted when the spinner/slider is ungrabbed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o controle deslizante ou spinner é solto."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Emitted when the updown button is pressed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o botão para cima/baixo é pressionado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Emitted when the value form gains focus."
msgstr "Emitido quando o formulário de valor ganha foco."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Emitted when the value form loses focus."
msgstr "Emitido quando o formulário de valor perde foco."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid ""
"The type of control used will depend on the value of [member "
"editing_integer]. Up-down arrows if [code]true[/code], a slider if "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O tipo de controle usado dependerá do valor de [member editing_integer]. "
"Setas para cima e para baixo se [code]true[/code], um controle deslizante se "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid ""
"A slider will always be used, even if [member editing_integer] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Um controle deslizante sempre será usado, mesmo se [member editing_integer] "
"estiver ativado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Neither the up-down arrows nor the slider will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Nem as setas para cima/baixo nem o controle deslizante serão mostrados."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid "Single texture representing both the up and down buttons."
msgstr "Textura única que representa os botões de cima e de baixo."

#: doc/classes/EditorSpinSlider.xml
msgid ""
"Single texture representing both the up and down buttons, when the control "
"is readonly or disabled."
msgstr ""
"Textura única que representa tanto os botões para cima quanto para baixo, "
"quando o controle estiver somente leitura ou desativado."

#: doc/classes/EditorSyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid "Base class for [SyntaxHighlighter] used by the [ScriptEditor]."
msgstr "Classe base para [SyntaxHighlighter] usado pelo [ScriptEditor]."

#: doc/classes/EditorSyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Base class that all [SyntaxHighlighter]s used by the [ScriptEditor] extend "
"from.\n"
"Add a syntax highlighter to an individual script by calling [method "
"ScriptEditorBase.add_syntax_highlighter]. To apply to all scripts on open, "
"call [method ScriptEditor.register_syntax_highlighter]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorSyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid "Virtual method which creates a new instance of the syntax highlighter."
msgstr "Método virtual que cria uma nova instância do destaque de sintaxe."

#: doc/classes/EditorSyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method which can be overridden to return the syntax highlighter name."
msgstr ""
"Método virtual que pode ser substituído para retornar o nome do destaque de "
"sintaxe."

#: doc/classes/EditorSyntaxHighlighter.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method which can be overridden to return the supported language "
"names."
msgstr ""
"Método virtual que pode ser substituído para retornar os nomes de linguagem "
"suportados."

#: doc/classes/EditorToaster.xml
msgid "Manages toast notifications within the editor."
msgstr "Gerencia notificações de aviso (toast) no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorToaster.xml
msgid ""
"This object manages the functionality and display of toast notifications "
"within the editor, ensuring immediate and informative alerts are presented "
"to the user.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class shouldn't be instantiated directly. Instead, access "
"the singleton using [method EditorInterface.get_editor_toaster]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorToaster.xml
msgid "Pushes a toast notification to the editor for display."
msgstr "Envia uma notificação de brinde para o editor para exibição."

#: doc/classes/EditorToaster.xml
msgid "Toast will display with an INFO severity."
msgstr "O aviso será exibido com uma severidade de INFORMAÇÃO."

#: doc/classes/EditorToaster.xml
msgid ""
"Toast will display with a WARNING severity and have a corresponding color."
msgstr ""
"O aviso será exibido com uma gravidade de AVISO (WARNING) e terá uma cor "
"correspondente."

#: doc/classes/EditorToaster.xml
msgid ""
"Toast will display with an ERROR severity and have a corresponding color."
msgstr ""
"O aviso será exibido com uma gravidade de ERRO e terá uma cor correspondente."

#: doc/classes/EditorTranslationParserPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Plugin for adding custom parsers to extract strings that are to be "
"translated from custom files (.csv, .json etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Plugin para adicionar analisadores personalizados para extrair strings que "
"devem ser traduzidas de arquivos personalizados (.csv, .json, etc.)."

#: doc/classes/EditorTranslationParserPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorTranslationParserPlugin] is invoked when a file is being parsed to "
"extract strings that require translation. To define the parsing and string "
"extraction logic, override the [method _parse_file] method in script.\n"
"The return value should be an [Array] of [PackedStringArray]s, one for each "
"extracted translatable string. Each entry should contain [code][msgid, "
"msgctxt, msgid_plural, comment, source_line][/code], where all except "
"[code]msgid[/code] are optional. Empty strings will be ignored.\n"
"The extracted strings will be written into a translation template file "
"selected by user under \"Template Generation\" in \"Localization\" tab in "
"\"Project Settings\" menu.\n"
"Below shows an example of a custom parser that extracts strings from a CSV "
"file to write into a template.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _parse_file(path):\n"
"\tvar ret: Array[PackedStringArray] = []\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar text = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\tvar split_strs = text.split(\",\", false)\n"
"\tfor s in split_strs:\n"
"\t\tret.append(PackedStringArray([s]))\n"
"\t\t#print(\"Extracted string: \" + s)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn ret\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"csv\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class CustomParser : EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<string[]> _ParseFile(string path)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGodot.Collections.Array<string[]> ret;\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(path, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tstring text = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\t\tstring[] splitStrs = text.Split(\",\", allowEmpty: false);\n"
"\t\tforeach (string s in splitStrs)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tret.Add([s]);\n"
"\t\t\t//GD.Print($\"Extracted string: {s}\");\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn ret;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn [\"csv\"];\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"To add a translatable string associated with a context, plural, comment, or "
"source line:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# This will add a message with msgid \"Test 1\", msgctxt \"context\", "
"msgid_plural \"test 1 plurals\", comment \"test 1 comment\", and source line "
"\"7\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", "
"\"test 1 comment\", \"7\"]))\n"
"# This will add a message with msgid \"A test without context\" and "
"msgid_plural \"plurals\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"A test without context\", \"\", "
"\"plurals\"]))\n"
"# This will add a message with msgid \"Only with context\" and msgctxt \"a "
"friendly context\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"Only with context\", \"a friendly "
"context\"]))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// This will add a message with msgid \"Test 1\", msgctxt \"context\", "
"msgid_plural \"test 1 plurals\", comment \"test 1 comment\", and source line "
"\"7\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", \"test 1 comment\", "
"\"7\"]);\n"
"// This will add a message with msgid \"A test without context\" and "
"msgid_plural \"plurals\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"A test without context\", \"\", \"plurals\"]);\n"
"// This will add a message with msgid \"Only with context\" and msgctxt \"a "
"friendly context\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"Only with context\", \"a friendly context\"]);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you override parsing logic for standard script types "
"(GDScript, C#, etc.), it would be better to load the [code]path[/code] "
"argument using [method ResourceLoader.load]. This is because built-in "
"scripts are loaded as [Resource] type, not [FileAccess] type. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _parse_file(path):\n"
"\tvar res = ResourceLoader.load(path, \"Script\")\n"
"\tvar text = res.source_code\n"
"\t# Parsing logic.\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"gd\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Godot.Collections.Array<string[]> _ParseFile(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar res = ResourceLoader.Load<Script>(path, \"Script\");\n"
"\tstring text = res.SourceCode;\n"
"\t// Parsing logic.\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn [\"gd\"];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Alternatively, the plugin can directly modify the final list of strings, by "
"implementing [method _customize_strings].\n"
"To use [EditorTranslationParserPlugin], register it using the [method "
"EditorPlugin.add_translation_parser_plugin] method first."
msgstr ""
"[EditorTranslationParserPlugin] é invocado quando um arquivo é analisado "
"para extrair strings que requerem tradução. Para definir a lógica de análise "
"e extração de strings, sobrescreva o método [method _parse_file] no script.\n"
"O valor de retorno deve ser um [Array] de [PackedStringArray]s, um para cada "
"string traduzível extraída. Cada entrada deve conter [code][msgid, msgctxt, "
"msgid_plural, comment, source_line][/code], onde todos, exceto [code]msgid[/"
"code], são opcionais. Strings vazias serão ignoradas.\n"
"As strings extraídas serão gravadas em um arquivo de modelo de tradução "
"selecionado pelo usuário em \"Template Generation\", na aba \"Localization\" "
"no menu \"Project Settings\".\n"
"Abaixo é mostrado um exemplo de um parser personalizado que extrai strings "
"de um arquivo CSV para gravar em um modelo.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _parse_file(path):\n"
"\tvar ret: Array[PackedStringArray] = []\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(path, FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar text = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\tvar split_strs = text.split(\",\", false)\n"
"\tfor s in split_strs:\n"
"\t\tret.append(PackedStringArray([s]))\n"
"\t\t#print(\"Extracted string: \" + s)\n"
"\n"
"\treturn ret\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"csv\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class CustomParser : EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"{\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<string[]> _ParseFile(string path)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGodot.Collections.Array<string[]> ret;\n"
"\t\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(path, FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\t\tstring text = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\t\tstring[] splitStrs = text.Split(\",\", allowEmpty: false);\n"
"\t\tforeach (string s in splitStrs)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tret.Add([s]);\n"
"\t\t\t//GD.Print($\"Extracted string: {s}\");\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn ret;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn [\"csv\"];\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Para adicionar uma string traduzível associada a um contexto, plural, "
"comentário ou linha de origem:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Isso adicionará uma mensagem com msgid \"Test 1\", msgctxt \"context\", "
"msgid_plural \"test 1 plurals\", comment \"test 1 comment\" e source line "
"\"7\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", "
"\"test 1 comment\", \"7\"]))\n"
"# Isso adicionará uma mensagem com msgid \"A test without context\" e "
"msgid_plural \"plurals\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"A test without context\", \"\", "
"\"plurals\"]))\n"
"# Isso adicionará uma mensagem com msgid \"Only with context\" e msgctxt \"a "
"friendly context\".\n"
"ret.append(PackedStringArray([\"Only with context\", \"a friendly "
"context\"]))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Isso adicionará uma mensagem com msgid \"Test 1\", msgctxt \"context\", "
"msgid_plural \"test 1 plurals\", comment \"test 1 comment\" e source line "
"\"7\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", \"test 1 comment\", "
"\"7\"]);\n"
"// Isso adicionará uma mensagem com msgid \"A test without context\" e "
"msgid_plural \"plurals\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"A test without context\", \"\", \"plurals\"]);\n"
"// Isso adicionará uma mensagem com msgid \"Only with context\" e msgctxt "
"\"a friendly context\".\n"
"ret.Add([\"Only with context\", \"a friendly context\"]);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você sobrescrever a lógica de análise para tipos de script "
"padrão (GDScript, C#, etc.), seria melhor carregar o argumento [code]path[/"
"code] usando [method ResourceLoader.load]. Isso ocorre porque scripts "
"embutidos são carregados como tipo [Resource], e não como tipo [FileAccess]. "
"Por exemplo:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _parse_file(path):\n"
"\tvar res = ResourceLoader.load(path, \"Script\")\n"
"\tvar text = res.source_code\n"
"\t# Lógica de análise.\n"
"\n"
"func _get_recognized_extensions():\n"
"\treturn [\"gd\"]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Godot.Collections.Array<string[]> _ParseFile(string path)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar res = ResourceLoader.Load<Script>(path, \"Script\");\n"
"\tstring text = res.SourceCode;\n"
"\t// Lógica de análise.\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override string[] _GetRecognizedExtensions()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn [\"gd\"];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Alternativamente, o plugin pode modificar diretamente a lista final de "
"strings implementando [method _customize_strings].\n"
"Para usar o [EditorTranslationParserPlugin], registre-o primeiro usando o "
"método [method EditorPlugin.add_translation_parser_plugin]."

#: doc/classes/EditorTranslationParserPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Called after parsing all files. You can modify the [param strings] array to "
"add or remove entries from the final list of strings, then return it after "
"modifications. Each entry is a [PackedStringArray] like explained in the "
"[EditorTranslationParserPlugin]'s description.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends EditorTranslationParserPlugin\n"
"\n"
"func _customize_strings(strings):\n"
"\t# Add new string.\n"
"\tstrings.append([\"Test 1\", \"context\", \"test 1 plurals\", \"test 1 "
"comment\"])\n"
"\n"
"\t# Remove all strings that begin with $.\n"
"\tstrings = strings.filter(func(s): return not s[0].begins_with(\"$\"))\n"
"\n"
"\treturn strings\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorTranslationParserPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the list of file extensions to associate with this parser, e.g. [code]"
"[\"csv\"][/code]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém a lista de extensões de arquivo para associar a este analisador, por "
"exemplo, [code][\"csv\"][/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorTranslationParserPlugin.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to define a custom parsing logic to extract the "
"translatable strings."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para definir uma lógica de análise personalizada para "
"extrair as strings traduzíveis."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid "Manages undo history of scenes opened in the editor."
msgstr "Gerencia o histórico de desfazer de cenas abertas no editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] is a manager for [UndoRedo] objects associated with "
"edited scenes. Each scene has its own undo history and "
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] ensures that each action performed in the editor "
"gets associated with a proper scene. For actions not related to scenes "
"([ProjectSettings] edits, external resources, etc.), a separate global "
"history is used.\n"
"The usage is mostly the same as [UndoRedo]. You create and commit actions "
"and the manager automatically decides under-the-hood what scenes it belongs "
"to. The scene is deduced based on the first operation in an action, using "
"the object from the operation. The rules are as follows:\n"
"- If the object is a [Node], use the currently edited scene;\n"
"- If the object is a built-in resource, use the scene from its path;\n"
"- If the object is external resource or anything else, use global history.\n"
"This guessing can sometimes yield false results, so you can provide a custom "
"context object when creating an action.\n"
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] is intended to be used by Godot editor plugins. You "
"can obtain it using [method EditorPlugin.get_undo_redo]. For non-editor uses "
"or plugins that don't need to integrate with the editor's undo history, use "
"[UndoRedo] instead.\n"
"The manager's API is mostly the same as in [UndoRedo], so you can refer to "
"its documentation for more examples. The main difference is that "
"[EditorUndoRedoManager] uses object + method name for actions, instead of "
"[Callable]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Register a method that will be called when the action is committed (i.e. the "
"\"do\" action).\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Register a property value change for \"do\".\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Register a reference for \"do\" that will be erased if the \"do\" history is "
"lost. This is useful mostly for new nodes created for the \"do\" call. Do "
"not use for resources."
msgstr ""
"Registra uma referência para \"fazer\" que será apagada se o histórico de "
"\"fazer\" for perdido. Isso é útil principalmente para novos nós criados "
"para a chamada \"fazer\". Não use para recursos."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Register a method that will be called when the action is undone (i.e. the "
"\"undo\" action).\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Register a property value change for \"undo\".\n"
"If this is the first operation, the [param object] will be used to deduce "
"target undo history."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Register a reference for \"undo\" that will be erased if the \"undo\" "
"history is lost. This is useful mostly for nodes removed with the \"do\" "
"call (not the \"undo\" call!)."
msgstr ""
"Registra uma referência para \"desfazer\" que será apagada se o histórico de "
"\"desfazer\" for perdido. Isso é útil principalmente para nós removidos com "
"a chamada \"fazer\" (e não com a chamada \"desfazer\"!)."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the given undo history. You can clear history for a specific scene, "
"global history, or for all histories at once (except [constant "
"REMOTE_HISTORY]) if [param id] is [constant INVALID_HISTORY].\n"
"If [param increase_version] is [code]true[/code], the undo history version "
"will be increased, marking it as unsaved. Useful for operations that modify "
"the scene, but don't support undo.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var scene_root = EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root()\n"
"var undo_redo = EditorInterface.get_editor_undo_redo()\n"
"undo_redo.clear_history(undo_redo.get_object_history_id(scene_root))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to mark an edited scene as unsaved without clearing "
"its history, use [method EditorInterface.mark_scene_as_unsaved] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Commits the action. If [param execute] is [code]true[/code] (default), all "
"\"do\" methods/properties are called/set when this function is called."
msgstr ""
"Confirma a ação. Se [param execute] for [code]true[/code] (padrão), todos os "
"métodos/propriedades \"do\" são chamados/definidos quando esta função é "
"chamada."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Create a new action. After this is called, do all your calls to [method "
"add_do_method], [method add_undo_method], [method add_do_property], and "
"[method add_undo_property], then commit the action with [method "
"commit_action].\n"
"The way actions are merged is dictated by the [param merge_mode] argument.\n"
"If [param custom_context] object is provided, it will be used for deducing "
"target history (instead of using the first operation).\n"
"The way undo operation are ordered in actions is dictated by [param "
"backward_undo_ops]. When [param backward_undo_ops] is [code]false[/code] "
"undo option are ordered in the same order they were added. Which means the "
"first operation to be added will be the first to be undone.\n"
"If [param mark_unsaved] is [code]false[/code], the action will not mark the "
"history as unsaved. This is useful for example for actions that change a "
"selection, or a setting that will be saved automatically. Otherwise, this "
"should be left to [code]true[/code] if the action requires saving by the "
"user or if it can cause data loss when left unsaved."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Forces the next operation (e.g. [method add_do_method]) to use the action's "
"history rather than guessing it from the object. This is sometimes needed "
"when a history can't be correctly determined, like for a nested resource "
"that doesn't have a path yet.\n"
"This method should only be used when absolutely necessary, otherwise it "
"might cause invalid history state. For most of complex cases, the "
"[code]custom_context[/code] parameter of [method create_action] is "
"sufficient."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [UndoRedo] object associated with the given history [param id].\n"
"[param id] above [code]0[/code] are mapped to the opened scene tabs (but it "
"doesn't match their order). [param id] of [code]0[/code] or lower have "
"special meaning (see [enum SpecialHistory]).\n"
"Best used with [method get_object_history_id]. This method is only provided "
"in case you need some more advanced methods of [UndoRedo] (but keep in mind "
"that directly operating on the [UndoRedo] object might affect editor's "
"stability)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the history ID deduced from the given [param object]. It can be used "
"with [method get_history_undo_redo]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID de histórico deduzido do [param object] fornecido. Pode ser "
"usado com [method get_history_undo_redo]."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [EditorUndoRedoManager] is currently "
"committing the action, i.e. running its \"do\" method or property change "
"(see [method commit_action])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [EditorUndoRedoManager] estiver confirmando a "
"ação no momento, ou seja, executando seu método \"do\" ou alteração de "
"propriedade (consulte [method commit_action])."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the list of actions in any history has changed, either when an "
"action is committed or a history is cleared."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a lista de ações em qualquer histórico é alterada, seja "
"quando uma ação é confirmada ou um histórico é limpo."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the version of any history has changed as a result of undo or "
"redo call."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a versão de qualquer histórico é alterada como resultado de "
"uma chamada de desfazer ou refazer."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Global history not associated with any scene, but with external resources "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Histórico global não associado a nenhuma cena, mas a recursos externos, etc."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"History associated with remote inspector. Used when live editing a running "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Histórico associado ao inspetor remoto. Usado ao editar em tempo real um "
"projeto em execução."

#: doc/classes/EditorUndoRedoManager.xml
msgid ""
"Invalid \"null\" history. It's a special value, not associated with any "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Histórico \"null\" inválido. É um valor especial, não associado a nenhum "
"objeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Version Control System (VCS) interface, which reads and writes to the local "
"VCS in use."
msgstr ""
"Interface do Sistema de Controle de Versão (VCS), que lê e grava no VCS "
"local em uso."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Defines the API that the editor uses to extract information from the "
"underlying VCS. The implementation of this API is included in VCS plugins, "
"which are GDExtension plugins that inherit [EditorVCSInterface] and are "
"attached (on demand) to the singleton instance of [EditorVCSInterface]. "
"Instead of performing the task themselves, all the virtual functions listed "
"below are calling the internally overridden functions in the VCS plugins to "
"provide a plug-n-play experience. A custom VCS plugin is supposed to inherit "
"from [EditorVCSInterface] and override each of these virtual functions."
msgstr ""
"Define a API que o editor usa para extrair informações do VCS subjacente. A "
"implementação desta API está incluída nos plugins de VCS, que são plugins "
"GDExtension que herdam [EditorVCSInterface] e estão anexados (sob demanda) à "
"instância singleton de [EditorVCSInterface]. Em vez de realizarem a tarefa "
"por si mesmos, todas as funções virtuais listadas abaixo chamam as funções "
"substituídas internamente nos plugins de VCS para fornecer uma experiência "
"plug-and-play. Um plugin de VCS personalizado deve herdar de "
"[EditorVCSInterface] e substituir cada uma dessas funções virtuais."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Version control systems"
msgstr "Sistemas de controle de versão"

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Returns whether or not the plugin allows commit amends."
msgstr "Retorna se o plugin permite ou não revisões de commit."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Checks out a [param branch_name] in the VCS."
msgstr "Alterna para um [param branch_name] no VCS."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Commits the currently staged changes and applies the commit [param msg] to "
"the resulting commit. If [param amend] is [code]true[/code] the commit will "
"modify the most recent commit instead."
msgstr ""
"Consolida as alterações atualmente preparadas e aplica o commit [param msg] "
"ao commit resultante. Se [param amend] for [code]true[/code], o commit "
"modificará o commit mais recente."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Creates a new branch named [param branch_name] in the VCS."
msgstr "Cria um novo ramo chamado [param branch_name] no VCS."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new remote destination with name [param remote_name] and points it "
"to [param remote_url]. This can be an HTTPS remote or an SSH remote."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo destino remoto com o nome [param remote_name] e o aponta para "
"[param remote_url]. Este pode ser um remoto HTTPS ou um remoto SSH."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Discards the changes made in a file present at [param file_path]."
msgstr ""
"Descarta as alterações feitas em um arquivo presente em [param file_path]."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Fetches new changes from the [param remote], but doesn't write changes to "
"the current working directory. Equivalent to [code]git fetch[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Busca novas alterações do [param remote], mas não grava as alterações no "
"diretório de trabalho atual. Equivalente a [code]git fetch[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Gets an instance of an [Array] of [String]s containing available branch "
"names in the VCS."
msgstr ""
"Obtém uma instância de um [Array] de [String]s contendo os nomes de branch "
"disponíveis no VCS."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Gets the current branch name defined in the VCS."
msgstr "Obtém o nome do branch atual definido no VCS."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_diff_file], "
"[method create_diff_hunk], [method create_diff_line], [method "
"add_line_diffs_into_diff_hunk] and [method add_diff_hunks_into_diff_file]), "
"each containing information about a diff. If [param identifier] is a file "
"path, returns a file diff, and if it is a commit identifier, then returns a "
"commit diff."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um array de itens [Dictionary] (veja [method create_diff_file], "
"[method create_diff_hunk], [method create_diff_line], [method "
"add_line_diffs_into_diff_hunk] e [method add_diff_hunks_into_diff_file]), "
"cada um contendo informações sobre um diff. Se [param identifier] for um "
"caminho de arquivo, retorna um diff de arquivo e, se for um identificador de "
"commit, retorna um diff de commit."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_diff_hunk]), "
"each containing a line diff between a file at [param file_path] and the "
"[param text] which is passed in."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Array] de itens [Dictionary] (veja [method create_diff_hunk]), "
"cada um contendo uma diferença de linha entre um arquivo em [param "
"file_path] e o [param text] que é passado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_status_file]), "
"each containing the status data of every modified file in the project folder."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Array] de itens [Dictionary] (consulte [method "
"create_status_file]), cada um contendo os dados de status de cada arquivo "
"modificado na pasta do projeto."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Dictionary] items (see [method create_commit]), each "
"containing the data for a past commit."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Array] de itens [Dictionary] (veja [method create_commit]), cada "
"um contendo os dados de um commit anterior."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [String]s, each containing the name of a remote "
"configured in the VCS."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Array] de [String]s, cada um contendo o nome de um remoto "
"configurado no VCS."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the name of the underlying VCS provider."
msgstr "Retorna o nome do provedor VCS subjacente."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the VCS plugin when called from the editor. Returns whether or "
"not the plugin was successfully initialized. A VCS project is initialized at "
"[param project_path]."
msgstr ""
"Inicializa o plugin de VCS quando chamado a partir do editor. Retorna se o "
"plugin foi inicializado com sucesso ou não. Um projeto VCS é inicializado em "
"[param project_path]."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Pulls changes from the remote. This can give rise to merge conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Puxa as alterações do repositório remoto. Isso pode dar origem a conflitos "
"de mesclagem."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pushes changes to the [param remote]. If [param force] is [code]true[/code], "
"a force push will override the change history already present on the remote."
msgstr ""
"Envia alterações para o [param remote]. Se [param force] for [code]true[/"
"code], um push forçado substituirá o histórico de alterações já presente no "
"repositório remoto."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Remove a branch from the local VCS."
msgstr "Remove uma ramificação do VCS local."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Remove a remote from the local VCS."
msgstr "Remove um controle remoto do VCS local."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Set user credentials in the underlying VCS. [param username] and [param "
"password] are used only during HTTPS authentication unless not already "
"mentioned in the remote URL. [param ssh_public_key_path], [param "
"ssh_private_key_path], and [param ssh_passphrase] are only used during SSH "
"authentication."
msgstr ""
"Define as credenciais do usuário no VCS subjacente. [param username] e "
"[param password] são usados apenas durante a autenticação HTTPS, a menos que "
"já não sejam mencionados na URL remota. [param ssh_public_key_path], [param "
"ssh_private_key_path] e [param ssh_passphrase] são usados apenas durante a "
"autenticação SSH."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Shuts down VCS plugin instance. Called when the user either closes the "
"editor or shuts down the VCS plugin through the editor UI."
msgstr ""
"Desliga a instância do plugin VCS. Chamado quando o usuário fecha o editor "
"ou desliga o plugin VCS através da interface de usuário do editor."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "Stages the file present at [param file_path] to the staged area."
msgstr ""
"Prepara (stage) o arquivo presente em [param file_path] para a área de "
"preparo."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Unstages the file present at [param file_path] from the staged area to the "
"unstaged area."
msgstr ""
"Remove (unstage) o arquivo presente em [param file_path] da área de preparo "
"para a área de não preparado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Helper function to add an array of [param diff_hunks] into a [param "
"diff_file]."
msgstr ""
"Função auxiliar para adicionar um array de [param diff_hunks] em um [param "
"diff_file]."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Helper function to add an array of [param line_diffs] into a [param "
"diff_hunk]."
msgstr ""
"Função auxiliar para adicionar um array de [param line_diffs] em um [param "
"diff_hunk]."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Helper function to create a commit [Dictionary] item. [param msg] is the "
"commit message of the commit. [param author] is a single human-readable "
"string containing all the author's details, e.g. the email and name "
"configured in the VCS. [param id] is the identifier of the commit, in "
"whichever format your VCS may provide an identifier to commits. [param "
"unix_timestamp] is the UTC Unix timestamp of when the commit was created. "
"[param offset_minutes] is the timezone offset in minutes, recorded from the "
"system timezone where the commit was created."
msgstr ""
"Função auxiliar para criar um item [Dictionary] de commit. [param msg] é a "
"mensagem de commit do commit. [param author] é uma única string legível por "
"humanos contendo todos os detalhes do autor, por exemplo, o e-mail e o nome "
"configurados no VCS. [param id] é o identificador do commit, em qualquer "
"formato que o seu VCS forneça um identificador para commits. [param "
"unix_timestamp] é o timestamp Unix UTC de quando o commit foi criado. [param "
"offset_minutes] é o deslocamento de fuso horário em minutos, registrado a "
"partir do fuso horário do sistema onde o commit foi criado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] for storing old and new diff file "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"Função auxiliar para criar um [Dictionary] para armazenar caminhos de "
"arquivos de diferença antigos e novos."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] for storing diff hunk data. [param "
"old_start] is the starting line number in old file. [param new_start] is the "
"starting line number in new file. [param old_lines] is the number of lines "
"in the old file. [param new_lines] is the number of lines in the new file."
msgstr ""
"Função auxiliar para criar um [Dictionary] para armazenar dados de trecho de "
"diff. [param old_start] é o número da linha inicial no arquivo antigo. "
"[param new_start] é o número da linha inicial no novo arquivo. [param "
"old_lines] é o número de linhas no arquivo antigo. [param new_lines] é o "
"número de linhas no novo arquivo."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] for storing a line diff. [param "
"new_line_no] is the line number in the new file (can be [code]-1[/code] if "
"the line is deleted). [param old_line_no] is the line number in the old file "
"(can be [code]-1[/code] if the line is added). [param content] is the diff "
"text. [param status] is a single character string which stores the line "
"origin."
msgstr ""
"Função auxiliar para criar um [Dictionary] para armazenar um diff de linha. "
"[param new_line_no] é o número da linha no novo arquivo (pode ser [code]-1[/"
"code] se a linha for excluída). [param old_line_no] é o número da linha no "
"arquivo antigo (pode ser [code]-1[/code] se a linha for adicionada). [param "
"content] é o texto do diff. [param status] é uma string de um único "
"caractere que armazena a origem da linha."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Helper function to create a [Dictionary] used by editor to read the status "
"of a file."
msgstr ""
"Função auxiliar para criar um [Dictionary] usado pelo editor para ler o "
"status de um arquivo."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Pops up an error message in the editor which is shown as coming from the "
"underlying VCS. Use this to show VCS specific error messages."
msgstr ""
"Exibe uma mensagem de erro no editor que é mostrada como vinda do VCS "
"subjacente. Use isto para mostrar mensagens de erro específicas do VCS."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "A new file has been added."
msgstr "Um novo arquivo foi adicionado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "An earlier added file has been modified."
msgstr "Um arquivo adicionado anteriormente foi modificado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "An earlier added file has been renamed."
msgstr "Um arquivo adicionado anteriormente foi renomeado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "An earlier added file has been deleted."
msgstr "Um arquivo adicionado anteriormente foi excluído."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "An earlier added file has been typechanged."
msgstr "Un arquivo adicionado anteriormente teve seu tipo alterado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "A file is left unmerged."
msgstr "Um arquivo é deixado não mesclado."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "A commit is encountered from the commit area."
msgstr "Um commit é encontrado na área de commits."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "A file is encountered from the staged area."
msgstr "Um arquivo é encontrado na área preparatória."

#: doc/classes/EditorVCSInterface.xml
msgid "A file is encountered from the unstaged area."
msgstr "Um arquivo é encontrado na área não preparada."

#: doc/classes/EncodedObjectAsID.xml
msgid "Holds a reference to an [Object]'s instance ID."
msgstr "Mantém uma referência ao ID de instância de um [Object]."

#: doc/classes/EncodedObjectAsID.xml
msgid ""
"Utility class which holds a reference to the internal identifier of an "
"[Object] instance, as given by [method Object.get_instance_id]. This ID can "
"then be used to retrieve the object instance with [method "
"@GlobalScope.instance_from_id].\n"
"This class is used internally by the editor inspector and script debugger, "
"but can also be used in plugins to pass and display objects as their IDs."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EncodedObjectAsID.xml
msgid ""
"The [Object] identifier stored in this [EncodedObjectAsID] instance. The "
"object instance can be retrieved with [method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id]."
msgstr ""
"O identificador [Object] armazenado nesta instância [EncodedObjectAsID]. A "
"instância do objeto pode ser recuperada com [method "
"@GlobalScope.instance_from_id]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"A wrapper class for an [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"group__host.html]ENetHost[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Uma classe wrapper para um [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"group__host.html]ENetHost[/url]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"ENet's purpose is to provide a relatively thin, simple and robust network "
"communication layer on top of UDP (User Datagram Protocol)."
msgstr ""
"O objetivo do ENet é fornecer uma camada de comunicação de rede "
"relativamente fina, simples e robusta em cima do UDP (User Datagram "
"Protocol)."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "API documentation on the ENet website"
msgstr "Documentação da API no site da ENet"

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Adjusts the bandwidth limits of a host."
msgstr "Ajusta os limites de largura de banda de um host."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Queues a [param packet] to be sent to all peers associated with the host "
"over the specified [param channel]. See [ENetPacketPeer] [code]FLAG_*[/code] "
"constants for available packet flags."
msgstr ""
"Enfileira um [param packet] para ser enviado a todos os pares associados ao "
"host através do [param channel] especificado. Consulte as constantes "
"[code]FLAG_*[/code] de [ENetPacketPeer] para sinalizadores de pacote "
"disponíveis."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Limits the maximum allowed channels of future incoming connections."
msgstr "Limita os canais máximos permitidos de futuras conexões de entrada."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the compression method used for network packets. These have different "
"tradeoffs of compression speed versus bandwidth, you may need to test which "
"one works best for your use case if you use compression at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most games' network design involve sending many small packets "
"frequently (smaller than 4 KB each). If in doubt, it is recommended to keep "
"the default compression algorithm as it works best on these small packets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The compression mode must be set to the same value on both the "
"server and all its clients. Clients will fail to connect if the compression "
"mode set on the client differs from the one set on the server."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Initiates a connection to a foreign [param address] using the specified "
"[param port] and allocating the requested [param channels]. Optional [param "
"data] can be passed during connection in the form of a 32 bit integer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You must call either [method create_host] or [method "
"create_host_bound] on both ends before calling this method."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an ENetHost that allows up to [param max_peers] connected peers, "
"each allocating up to [param max_channels] channels, optionally limiting "
"bandwidth to [param in_bandwidth] and [param out_bandwidth] (if greater than "
"zero).\n"
"This method binds a random available dynamic UDP port on the host machine at "
"the [i]unspecified[/i] address. Use [method create_host_bound] to specify "
"the address and port.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is necessary to create a host in both client and server in "
"order to establish a connection."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an ENetHost bound to the given [param bind_address] and [param "
"bind_port] that allows up to [param max_peers] connected peers, each "
"allocating up to [param max_channels] channels, optionally limiting "
"bandwidth to [param in_bandwidth] and [param out_bandwidth] (if greater than "
"zero).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is necessary to create a host in both client and server in "
"order to establish a connection."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Destroys the host and all resources associated with it."
msgstr "Destrói o host e todos os recursos associados a ele."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Configure this ENetHost to use the custom Godot extension allowing DTLS "
"encryption for ENet clients. Call this before [method connect_to_host] to "
"have ENet connect using DTLS validating the server certificate against "
"[param hostname]. You can pass the optional [param client_options] parameter "
"to customize the trusted certification authorities, or disable the common "
"name verification. See [method TLSOptions.client] and [method "
"TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."
msgstr ""
"Configure este ENetHost para usar a extensão personalizada do Godot que "
"permite criptografia DTLS para clientes ENet. Chame isso antes de [method "
"connect_to_host] para fazer o ENet se conectar usando DTLS, validando o "
"certificado do servidor contra [param hostname]. Você pode passar o "
"parâmetro opcional [param client_options] para personalizar as autoridades "
"de certificação confiáveis ou desativar a verificação de nome comum. Veja "
"[method TLSOptions.client] e [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Configure this ENetHost to use the custom Godot extension allowing DTLS "
"encryption for ENet servers. Call this right after [method "
"create_host_bound] to have ENet expect peers to connect using DTLS. See "
"[method TLSOptions.server]."
msgstr ""
"Configura este ENetHost para usar a extensão personalizada do Godot que "
"permite criptografia DTLS para servidores ENet. Chame isso logo após [method "
"create_host_bound] para fazer com que o ENet espere que os pares se conectem "
"usando DTLS. Veja [method TLSOptions.server]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Sends any queued packets on the host specified to its designated peers."
msgstr ""
"Envia quaisquer pacotes na fila no host especificado para seus pares "
"designados."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml doc/classes/PacketPeerUDP.xml
#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTCP.xml
msgid "Returns the local port to which this peer is bound."
msgstr "Retorna a porta local à qual este par está vinculado."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Returns the maximum number of channels allowed for connected peers."
msgstr "Retorna o número máximo de canais permitidos para pares conectados."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of peers associated with this host.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This list might include some peers that are not fully connected "
"or are still being disconnected."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Returns and resets host statistics."
msgstr "Retorna e reinicia as estatísticas do host."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Configures the DTLS server to automatically drop new connections.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only relevant after calling [method "
"dtls_server_setup]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Waits for events on this connection and shuttles packets between the host "
"and its peers, with the given [param timeout] (in milliseconds). The "
"returned [Array] will have 4 elements. An [enum EventType], the "
"[ENetPacketPeer] which generated the event, the event associated data (if "
"any), the event associated channel (if any). If the generated event is "
"[constant EVENT_RECEIVE], the received packet will be queued to the "
"associated [ENetPacketPeer].\n"
"Call this function regularly to handle connections, disconnections, and to "
"receive new packets.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method must be called on both ends involved in the event "
"(sending and receiving hosts)."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a [param packet] toward a destination from the address and port "
"currently bound by this ENetConnection instance.\n"
"This is useful as it serves to establish entries in NAT routing tables on "
"all devices between this bound instance and the public facing internet, "
"allowing a prospective client's connection packets to be routed backward "
"through the NAT device(s) between the public internet and this host.\n"
"This requires forward knowledge of a prospective client's address and "
"communication port as seen by the public internet - after any NAT devices "
"have handled their connection request. This information can be obtained by a "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/STUN]STUN[/url] service, and must be "
"handed off to your host by an entity that is not the prospective client. "
"This will never work for a client behind a Symmetric NAT due to the nature "
"of the Symmetric NAT routing algorithm, as their IP and Port cannot be known "
"beforehand."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"No compression. This uses the most bandwidth, but has the upside of "
"requiring the fewest CPU resources. This option may also be used to make "
"network debugging using tools like Wireshark easier."
msgstr ""
"Sem compactação. Isso usa mais largura de banda, mas tem a vantagem de "
"exigir menos recursos de CPU. Esta opção também pode ser usada para "
"facilitar a depuração de rede usando ferramentas como o Wireshark."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"ENet's built-in range encoding. Works well on small packets, but is not the "
"most efficient algorithm on packets larger than 4 KB."
msgstr ""
"Codificação de intervalo integrada do ENet. Funciona bem em pacotes "
"pequenos, mas não é o algoritmo mais eficiente em pacotes maiores que 4 KB."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://fastlz.org/]FastLZ[/url] compression. This option uses less CPU "
"resources compared to [constant COMPRESS_ZLIB], at the expense of using more "
"bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Compressão [url=https://fastlz.org/]FastLZ[/url]. Esta opção usa menos "
"recursos de CPU em comparação com [constant COMPRESS_ZLIB], ao custo de usar "
"mais largura de banda."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://www.zlib.net/]Zlib[/url] compression. This option uses less "
"bandwidth compared to [constant COMPRESS_FASTLZ], at the expense of using "
"more CPU resources."
msgstr ""
"Compressão [url=https://www.zlib.net/]Zlib[/url]. Esta opção usa menos "
"largura de banda em comparação com [constant COMPRESS_FASTLZ], ao custo de "
"usar mais recursos de CPU."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://facebook.github.io/zstd/]Zstandard[/url] compression. Note that "
"this algorithm is not very efficient on packets smaller than 4 KB. "
"Therefore, it's recommended to use other compression algorithms in most "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"Compressão [url=https://facebook.github.io/zstd/]Zstandard[/url]. Observe "
"que este algoritmo não é muito eficiente em pacotes menores que 4 KB. "
"Portanto, é recomendável usar outros algoritmos de compressão na maioria dos "
"casos."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"An error occurred during [method service]. You will likely need to [method "
"destroy] the host and recreate it."
msgstr ""
"Ocorreu um erro durante [method service]. Provavelmente você precisará "
"[method destroy] o host e recriá-lo."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "No event occurred within the specified time limit."
msgstr "Nenhum evento ocorreu dentro do limite de tempo especificado."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"A connection request initiated by enet_host_connect has completed. The array "
"will contain the peer which successfully connected."
msgstr ""
"Uma solicitação de conexão iniciada por enet_host_connect foi concluída. A "
"matriz conterá o par que se conectou com sucesso."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"A peer has disconnected. This event is generated on a successful completion "
"of a disconnect initiated by [method ENetPacketPeer.peer_disconnect], if a "
"peer has timed out, or if a connection request initialized by [method "
"connect_to_host] has timed out. The array will contain the peer which "
"disconnected. The data field contains user supplied data describing the "
"disconnection, or 0, if none is available."
msgstr ""
"Um par se desconectou. Este evento é gerado na conclusão bem-sucedida de uma "
"desconexão iniciada por [method ENetPacketPeer.peer_disconnect], se o tempo "
"limite de um par esgotar, ou se uma solicitação de conexão inicializada por "
"[method connect_to_host] tiver esgotado o tempo limite. O array conterá o "
"par que se desconectou. O campo de dados contém dados fornecidos pelo "
"usuário descrevendo a desconexão, ou 0, se nenhum estiver disponível."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid ""
"A packet has been received from a peer. The array will contain the peer "
"which sent the packet and the channel number upon which the packet was "
"received. The received packet will be queued to the associated "
"[ENetPacketPeer]."
msgstr ""
"Um pacote foi recebido de um par. O array conterá o par que enviou o pacote "
"e o número do canal no qual o pacote foi recebido. O pacote recebido será "
"enfileirado para o [ENetPacketPeer] associado."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Total data sent."
msgstr "Total de dados enviados."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Total UDP packets sent."
msgstr "Total de pacotes UDP enviados."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Total data received."
msgstr "Total de dados recebidos."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetConnection.xml
msgid "Total UDP packets received."
msgstr "Total de pacotes UDP recebidos."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"A MultiplayerPeer implementation using the [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"index.html]ENet[/url] library."
msgstr ""
"Uma implementação de MultiplayerPeer usando a biblioteca [url=http://"
"enet.bespin.org/index.html]ENet[/url]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"A MultiplayerPeer implementation that should be passed to [member "
"MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] after being initialized as either a client, "
"server, or mesh. Events can then be handled by connecting to "
"[MultiplayerAPI] signals. See [ENetConnection] for more information on the "
"ENet library wrapper.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] ENet only uses UDP, not TCP. When forwarding the server port to "
"make your server accessible on the public Internet, you only need to forward "
"the server port in UDP. You can use the [UPNP] class to try to forward the "
"server port automatically when starting the server."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
#: doc/classes/MultiplayerPeer.xml
#: modules/webrtc/doc_classes/WebRTCPeerConnection.xml
msgid "High-level multiplayer"
msgstr "Multiplayer de alto-nível"

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Add a new remote peer with the given [param peer_id] connected to the given "
"[param host].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param host] must have exactly one peer in the [constant "
"ENetPacketPeer.STATE_CONNECTED] state."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Create client that connects to a server at [param address] using specified "
"[param port]. The given address needs to be either a fully qualified domain "
"name (e.g. [code]\"www.example.com\"[/code]) or an IP address in IPv4 or "
"IPv6 format (e.g. [code]\"192.168.1.1\"[/code]). The [param port] is the "
"port the server is listening on. The [param channel_count] parameter can be "
"used to specify the number of ENet channels allocated for the connection. "
"The [param in_bandwidth] and [param out_bandwidth] parameters can be used to "
"limit the incoming and outgoing bandwidth to the given number of bytes per "
"second. The default of 0 means unlimited bandwidth. Note that ENet will "
"strategically drop packets on specific sides of a connection between peers "
"to ensure the peer's bandwidth is not overwhelmed. The bandwidth parameters "
"also determine the window size of a connection which limits the amount of "
"reliable packets that may be in transit at any given time. Returns [constant "
"OK] if a client was created, [constant ERR_ALREADY_IN_USE] if this "
"ENetMultiplayerPeer instance already has an open connection (in which case "
"you need to call [method MultiplayerPeer.close] first) or [constant "
"ERR_CANT_CREATE] if the client could not be created. If [param local_port] "
"is specified, the client will also listen to the given port; this is useful "
"for some NAT traversal techniques."
msgstr ""
"Crie um cliente que se conecta a um servidor em [param address] usando "
"[param port] especificada. O endereço fornecido precisa ser um nome de "
"domínio totalmente qualificado (por exemplo, [code]\"www.example.com\"[/"
"code]) ou um endereço IP no formato IPv4 ou IPv6 (por exemplo, [code]"
"\"192.168.1.1\"[/code]). A [param port] é a porta em que o servidor está "
"escutando. O parâmetro [param channel_count] pode ser usado para especificar "
"o número de canais ENet alocados para a conexão. Os parâmetros [param "
"in_bandwidth] e [param out_bandwidth] podem ser usados para limitar a "
"largura de banda de entrada e saída para o número dado de bytes por segundo. "
"O padrão 0 significa largura de banda ilimitada. Note que o ENet descartará "
"estrategicamente pacotes em lados específicos de uma conexão entre pares "
"para garantir que a largura de banda do par não seja sobrecarregada. Os "
"parâmetros de largura de banda também determinam o tamanho da janela de uma "
"conexão, o que limita a quantidade de pacotes confiáveis que podem estar em "
"trânsito a qualquer momento dado. Retorna [constant OK] se um cliente foi "
"criado, [constant ERR_ALREADY_IN_USE] se esta instância de "
"ENetMultiplayerPeer já tiver uma conexão aberta (caso em que você precisa "
"chamar [method MultiplayerPeer.close] primeiro) ou [constant "
"ERR_CANT_CREATE] se o cliente não pôde ser criado. Se [param local_port] for "
"especificado, o cliente também escutará na porta fornecida; isso é útil para "
"algumas técnicas de travessia de NAT."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Initialize this [MultiplayerPeer] in mesh mode. The provided [param "
"unique_id] will be used as the local peer network unique ID once assigned as "
"the [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer]. In the mesh configuration you "
"will need to set up each new peer manually using [ENetConnection] before "
"calling [method add_mesh_peer]. While this technique is more advanced, it "
"allows for better control over the connection process (e.g. when dealing "
"with NAT punch-through) and for better distribution of the network load "
"(which would otherwise be more taxing on the server)."
msgstr ""
"Inicialize este [MultiplayerPeer] no modo malha. O [param unique_id] "
"fornecido será usado como o ID exclusivo da rede de pares local, uma vez "
"atribuído como o [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer]. Na configuração "
"de malha, você precisará configurar cada novo par manualmente usando "
"[ENetConnection] antes de chamar [method add_mesh_peer]. Embora esta técnica "
"seja mais avançada, ela permite um melhor controle sobre o processo de "
"conexão (por exemplo, ao lidar com NAT punch-through) e uma melhor "
"distribuição da carga de rede (o que seria mais custoso para o servidor de "
"outra forma)."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Create server that listens to connections via [param port]. The port needs "
"to be an available, unused port between 0 and 65535. Note that ports below "
"1024 are privileged and may require elevated permissions depending on the "
"platform. To change the interface the server listens on, use [method "
"set_bind_ip]. The default IP is the wildcard [code]\"*\"[/code], which "
"listens on all available interfaces. [param max_clients] is the maximum "
"number of clients that are allowed at once, any number up to 4095 may be "
"used, although the achievable number of simultaneous clients may be far "
"lower and depends on the application. For additional details on the "
"bandwidth parameters, see [method create_client]. Returns [constant OK] if a "
"server was created, [constant ERR_ALREADY_IN_USE] if this "
"ENetMultiplayerPeer instance already has an open connection (in which case "
"you need to call [method MultiplayerPeer.close] first) or [constant "
"ERR_CANT_CREATE] if the server could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Crie um servidor que escuta conexões via [param port]. A porta precisa ser "
"uma porta disponível e não utilizada entre 0 e 65535. Note que portas abaixo "
"de 1024 são privilegiadas e podem exigir permissões elevadas dependendo da "
"plataforma. Para alterar a interface em que o servidor escuta, use [method "
"set_bind_ip]. O IP padrão é o caractere curinga [code]\"*\"[/code], que "
"escuta em todas as interfaces disponíveis. [param max_clients] é o número "
"máximo de clientes permitidos de uma só vez, qualquer número até 4095 pode "
"ser usado, embora o número alcançável de clientes simultâneos possa ser "
"muito menor e dependa da aplicação. Para detalhes adicionais sobre os "
"parâmetros de largura de banda, veja [method create_client]. Retorna "
"[constant OK] se um servidor foi criado, [constant ERR_ALREADY_IN_USE] se "
"esta instância de ENetMultiplayerPeer já tiver uma conexão aberta (caso em "
"que você precisa chamar [method MultiplayerPeer.close] primeiro) ou "
"[constant ERR_CANT_CREATE] se o servidor não pôde ser criado."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the [ENetPacketPeer] associated to the given [param id]."
msgstr "Retorna o [ENetPacketPeer] associado ao [param id] dado."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The IP used when creating a server. This is set to the wildcard [code]\"*\"[/"
"code] by default, which binds to all available interfaces. The given IP "
"needs to be in IPv4 or IPv6 address format, for example: [code]"
"\"192.168.1.1\"[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O IP usado ao criar um servidor. Isso é definido como o caractere curinga "
"[code]\"*\"[/code] por padrão, que se vincula a todas as interfaces "
"disponíveis. O IP fornecido precisa estar no formato de endereço IPv4 ou "
"IPv6, por exemplo: [code]\"192.168.1.1\"[/code]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The underlying [ENetConnection] created after [method create_client] and "
"[method create_server]."
msgstr ""
"O [ENetConnection] subjacente criado após [method create_client] e [method "
"create_server]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"A wrapper class for an [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"group__peer.html]ENetPeer[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Uma classe wrapper para um [url=http://enet.bespin.org/"
"group__peer.html]ENetPeer[/url]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"A PacketPeer implementation representing a peer of an [ENetConnection].\n"
"This class cannot be instantiated directly but can be retrieved during "
"[method ENetConnection.service] or via [method ENetConnection.get_peers].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the number of channels allocated for communication with peer."
msgstr "Retorna o número de canais alocados para comunicação com o par."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ENet flags of the next packet in the received queue. See "
"[code]FLAG_*[/code] constants for available packet flags. Note that not all "
"flags are replicated from the sending peer to the receiving peer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os sinalizadores ENet do próximo pacote na fila recebida. Consulte "
"as constantes [code]FLAG_*[/code] para os sinalizadores de pacote "
"disponíveis. Note que nem todos os sinalizadores são replicados do par "
"remetente para o par receptor."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the IP address of this peer."
msgstr "Retorna o endereço IP deste par."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the remote port of this peer."
msgstr "Retorna a porta remota deste par."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the current peer state."
msgstr "Retorna o estado atual do par."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Returns the requested [param statistic] for this peer."
msgstr "Retorna a [param statistic] solicitada para este par."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the peer is currently active (i.e. the "
"associated [ENetConnection] is still valid)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o par estiver ativo no momento (ou seja, o "
"[ENetConnection] associado ainda for válido)."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Request a disconnection from a peer. An [constant "
"ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] will be generated during [method "
"ENetConnection.service] once the disconnection is complete."
msgstr ""
"Solicita uma desconexão de um par. Um [constant "
"ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] será gerado durante [method "
"ENetConnection.service] assim que a desconexão for concluída."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Request a disconnection from a peer, but only after all queued outgoing "
"packets are sent. An [constant ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] will be "
"generated during [method ENetConnection.service] once the disconnection is "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"Solicita uma desconexão de um par, mas apenas após todos os pacotes de saída "
"enfileirados serem enviados. Um [constant ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] "
"será gerado durante [method ENetConnection.service] assim que a desconexão "
"for concluída."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Force an immediate disconnection from a peer. No [constant "
"ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] will be generated. The foreign peer is not "
"guaranteed to receive the disconnect notification, and is reset immediately "
"upon return from this function."
msgstr ""
"Força uma desconexão imediata de um par. Nenhum [constant "
"ENetConnection.EVENT_DISCONNECT] será gerado. Não é garantido que o par "
"remoto receba a notificação de desconexão, e ele é redefinido imediatamente "
"após o retorno desta função."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a ping request to a peer. ENet automatically pings all connected peers "
"at regular intervals, however, this function may be called to ensure more "
"frequent ping requests."
msgstr ""
"Envia uma requisição de ping para um par. O ENet faz ping automaticamente em "
"todos os pares conectados em intervalos regulares; no entanto, esta função "
"pode ser chamada para garantir requisições de ping mais frequentes."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [param ping_interval] in milliseconds at which pings will be sent "
"to a peer. Pings are used both to monitor the liveness of the connection and "
"also to dynamically adjust the throttle during periods of low traffic so "
"that the throttle has reasonable responsiveness during traffic spikes. The "
"default ping interval is [code]500[/code] milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"Define o [param ping_interval] em milissegundos no qual os pings serão "
"enviados para um par. Os pings são usados tanto para monitorar a atividade "
"da conexão quanto para ajustar dinamicamente o limitador durante períodos de "
"tráfego baixo, para que o limitador tenha uma resposta razoável durante "
"picos de tráfego. O intervalo de ping padrão é de [code]500[/code] "
"milissegundos."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Forcefully disconnects a peer. The foreign host represented by the peer is "
"not notified of the disconnection and will timeout on its connection to the "
"local host."
msgstr ""
"Desconecta forçadamente um peer. O host estrangeiro representado pelo peer "
"não é notificado da desconexão e sofrerá timeout em sua conexão com o host "
"local."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Queues a [param packet] to be sent over the specified [param channel]. See "
"[code]FLAG_*[/code] constants for available packet flags."
msgstr ""
"Coloca um [param packet] na fila para ser enviado pelo [param channel] "
"especificado. Veja as constantes [code]FLAG_*[/code] para os sinalizadores "
"de pacote disponíveis."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the timeout parameters for a peer. The timeout parameters control how "
"and when a peer will timeout from a failure to acknowledge reliable traffic. "
"Timeout values are expressed in milliseconds.\n"
"The [param timeout] is a factor that, multiplied by a value based on the "
"average round trip time, will determine the timeout limit for a reliable "
"packet. When that limit is reached, the timeout will be doubled, and the "
"peer will be disconnected if that limit has reached [param timeout_min]. The "
"[param timeout_max] parameter, on the other hand, defines a fixed timeout "
"for which any packet must be acknowledged or the peer will be dropped."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Configures throttle parameter for a peer.\n"
"Unreliable packets are dropped by ENet in response to the varying conditions "
"of the Internet connection to the peer. The throttle represents a "
"probability that an unreliable packet should not be dropped and thus sent by "
"ENet to the peer. By measuring fluctuations in round trip times of reliable "
"packets over the specified [param interval], ENet will either increase the "
"probability by the amount specified in the [param acceleration] parameter, "
"or decrease it by the amount specified in the [param deceleration] parameter "
"(both are ratios to [constant PACKET_THROTTLE_SCALE]).\n"
"When the throttle has a value of [constant PACKET_THROTTLE_SCALE], no "
"unreliable packets are dropped by ENet, and so 100% of all unreliable "
"packets will be sent.\n"
"When the throttle has a value of [code]0[/code], all unreliable packets are "
"dropped by ENet, and so 0% of all unreliable packets will be sent.\n"
"Intermediate values for the throttle represent intermediate probabilities "
"between 0% and 100% of unreliable packets being sent. The bandwidth limits "
"of the local and foreign hosts are taken into account to determine a "
"sensible limit for the throttle probability above which it should not raise "
"even in the best of conditions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer is disconnected."
msgstr "O par está desconectado."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer is currently attempting to connect."
msgstr "O par está tentando se conectar no momento."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer has acknowledged the connection request."
msgstr "O par reconheceu a solicitação de conexão."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer is currently connecting."
msgstr "O par está se conectando no momento."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The peer has successfully connected, but is not ready to communicate with "
"yet ([constant STATE_CONNECTED])."
msgstr ""
"O peer se conectou com sucesso, mas ainda não está pronto para se comunicar "
"([constant STATE_CONNECTED])."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer is currently connected and ready to communicate with."
msgstr "O par está conectado no momento e pronto para se comunicar."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The peer is expected to disconnect after it has no more outgoing packets to "
"send."
msgstr ""
"Espera-se que o par se desconecte após não ter mais pacotes de saída para "
"enviar."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer is currently disconnecting."
msgstr "O par está se desconectando no momento."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer has acknowledged the disconnection request."
msgstr "O par reconheceu a solicitação de desconexão."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The peer has lost connection, but is not considered truly disconnected (as "
"the peer didn't acknowledge the disconnection request)."
msgstr ""
"O par perdeu a conexão, mas não é considerado verdadeiramente desconectado "
"(pois o par não reconheceu a solicitação de desconexão)."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Mean packet loss of reliable packets as a ratio with respect to the "
"[constant PACKET_LOSS_SCALE]."
msgstr ""
"Perda média de pacotes de pacotes confiáveis como uma proporção em relação a "
"[constant PACKET_LOSS_SCALE]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Packet loss variance."
msgstr "Variância de perda de pacotes."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The time at which packet loss statistics were last updated (in milliseconds "
"since the connection started). The interval for packet loss statistics "
"updates is 10 seconds, and at least one packet must have been sent since the "
"last statistics update."
msgstr ""
"O horário em que as estatísticas de perda de pacotes foram atualizadas pela "
"última vez (em milissegundos desde que a conexão começou). O intervalo para "
"atualizações de estatísticas de perda de pacotes é de 10 segundos, e pelo "
"menos um pacote deve ter sido enviado desde a última atualização de "
"estatísticas."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Mean packet round trip time for reliable packets."
msgstr "Tempo médio de ida e volta de pacotes para pacotes confiáveis."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Variance of the mean round trip time."
msgstr "Variância do tempo médio de ida e volta."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Last recorded round trip time for a reliable packet."
msgstr "Último tempo de ida e volta gravado para um pacote confiável."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Variance of the last trip time recorded."
msgstr "Variância do último tempo de viagem registrado."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "The peer's current throttle status."
msgstr "O status atual de limitação (throttle) do par."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of unreliable packets that should not be dropped. This "
"value is always greater than or equal to [code]1[/code]. The initial value "
"is equal to [constant PACKET_THROTTLE_SCALE]."
msgstr ""
"O número máximo de pacotes não confiáveis que não devem ser descartados. "
"Este valor é sempre maior ou igual a [code]1[/code]. O valor inicial é igual "
"a [constant PACKET_THROTTLE_SCALE]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Internal value used to increment the packet throttle counter. The value is "
"hardcoded to [code]7[/code] and cannot be changed. You probably want to look "
"at [constant PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_ACCELERATION] instead."
msgstr ""
"Valor interno usado para incrementar o contador de controle de fluxo de "
"pacotes. O valor é fixo em [code]7[/code] e não pode ser alterado. "
"Provavelmente você deseja consultar [constant "
"PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_ACCELERATION] em vez disso."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The time at which throttle statistics were last updated (in milliseconds "
"since the connection started). The interval for throttle statistics updates "
"is [constant PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_INTERVAL]."
msgstr ""
"O horário em que as estatísticas de limitação foram atualizadas pela última "
"vez (em milissegundos desde o início da conexão). O intervalo para "
"atualizações de estatísticas de limitação é [constant "
"PEER_PACKET_THROTTLE_INTERVAL]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The throttle's acceleration factor. Higher values will make ENet adapt to "
"fluctuating network conditions faster, causing unrelaible packets to be sent "
"[i]more[/i] often. The default value is [code]2[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O fator de aceleração do controle de fluxo (throttle). Valores mais altos "
"farão com que o ENet se adapte a condições de rede flutuantes mais "
"rapidamente, fazendo com que pacotes não confiáveis sejam enviados [i]com "
"mais[/i] frequência. O valor padrão é [code]2[/code]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The throttle's deceleration factor. Higher values will make ENet adapt to "
"fluctuating network conditions faster, causing unrelaible packets to be sent "
"[i]less[/i] often. The default value is [code]2[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O fator de desaceleração do controle de fluxo (throttle). Valores mais altos "
"farão com que o ENet se adapte a condições de rede flutuantes mais "
"rapidamente, fazendo com que pacotes não confiáveis sejam enviados [i]com "
"menos[/i] frequência. O valor padrão é [code]2[/code]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The interval over which the lowest mean round trip time should be measured "
"for use by the throttle mechanism (in milliseconds). The default value is "
"[code]5000[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O intervalo sobre o qual o menor tempo de ida e volta médio deve ser medido "
"para uso pelo mecanismo de controle de fluxo (em milissegundos). O valor "
"padrão é [code]5000[/code]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The reference scale for packet loss. See [method get_statistic] and "
"[constant PEER_PACKET_LOSS]."
msgstr ""
"A escala de referência para perda de pacotes. Veja [method get_statistic] e "
"[constant PEER_PACKET_LOSS]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"The reference value for throttle configuration. The default value is "
"[code]32[/code]. See [method throttle_configure]."
msgstr ""
"O valor de referência para a configuração do acelerador. O valor padrão é "
"[code]32[/code]. Veja [method throttle_configure]."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Mark the packet to be sent as reliable."
msgstr "Marca o pacote a ser enviado como confiável."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid "Mark the packet to be sent unsequenced (unreliable)."
msgstr "Marca o pacote para ser enviado sem sequência (não confiável)."

#: modules/enet/doc_classes/ENetPacketPeer.xml
msgid ""
"Mark the packet to be sent unreliable even if the packet is too big and "
"needs fragmentation (increasing the chance of it being dropped)."
msgstr ""
"Marca o pacote a ser enviado como não confiável, mesmo que o pacote seja "
"muito grande e precise de fragmentação (aumentando a chance de ser "
"descartado)."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid "Provides access to engine properties."
msgstr "Fornece acesso às propriedades do motor."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"The [Engine] singleton allows you to query and modify the project's run-time "
"parameters, such as frames per second, time scale, and others. It also "
"stores information about the current build of Godot, such as the current "
"version."
msgstr ""
"O singleton [Engine] permite consultar e modificar os parâmetros de tempo de "
"execução do projeto, como quadros por segundo, escala de tempo e outros. Ele "
"também armazena informações sobre a compilação atual do Godot, como a versão "
"atual."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Captures and returns backtraces from all registered script languages.\n"
"By default, the returned [ScriptBacktrace] will only contain stack frames in "
"editor builds and debug builds. To enable them for release builds as well, "
"you need to enable [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_call_stacks].\n"
"If [param include_variables] is [code]true[/code], the backtrace will also "
"include the names and values of any global variables (e.g. autoload "
"singletons) at the point of the capture, as well as local variables and "
"class member variables at each stack frame. This will however will only be "
"respected when running the game with a debugger attached, like when running "
"the game from the editor. To enable it for export builds as well, you need "
"to enable [member ProjectSettings.debug/settings/gdscript/"
"always_track_local_variables].\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] When [param include_variables] is [code]true[/code], any "
"captured variables can potentially (e.g. with GDScript backtraces) be their "
"actual values, including any object references. This means that storing such "
"a [ScriptBacktrace] will prevent those objects from being deallocated, so "
"it's generally recommended not to do so."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the CPU architecture the Godot binary was built for. "
"Possible return values include [code]\"x86_64\"[/code], [code]\"x86_32\"[/"
"code], [code]\"arm64\"[/code], [code]\"arm32\"[/code], [code]\"rv64\"[/"
"code], [code]\"ppc64\"[/code], [code]\"loongarch64\"[/code], [code]"
"\"wasm64\"[/code], and [code]\"wasm32\"[/code].\n"
"To detect whether the current build is 64-bit, or the type of architecture, "
"don't use the architecture name. Instead, use [method OS.has_feature] to "
"check for the [code]\"64\"[/code] feature tag, or tags such as [code]"
"\"x86\"[/code] or [code]\"arm\"[/code]. See the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"export/feature_tags.html]Feature Tags[/url] documentation for more details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does [i]not[/i] return the name of the system's CPU "
"architecture (like [method OS.get_processor_name]). For example, when "
"running an [code]x86_32[/code] Godot binary on an [code]x86_64[/code] "
"system, the returned value will still be [code]\"x86_32\"[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the engine author information as a [Dictionary], where each entry is "
"an [Array] of strings with the names of notable contributors to the Godot "
"Engine: [code]lead_developers[/code], [code]founders[/code], "
"[code]project_managers[/code], and [code]developers[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna as informações dos autores da engine como um [Dictionary], onde cada "
"entrada é um [Array] de strings com os nomes de colaboradores notáveis para "
"a Godot Engine: [code]lead_developers[/code], [code]founders[/code], "
"[code]project_managers[/code] e [code]developers[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of dictionaries with copyright information for every "
"component of Godot's source code.\n"
"Every [Dictionary] contains a [code]name[/code] identifier, and a "
"[code]parts[/code] array of dictionaries. It describes the component in "
"detail with the following entries:\n"
"- [code]files[/code] - [Array] of file paths from the source code affected "
"by this component;\n"
"- [code]copyright[/code] - [Array] of owners of this component;\n"
"- [code]license[/code] - The license applied to this component (such as "
"\"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"MIT_License#Ambiguity_and_variants]Expat[/url]\" or \"[url=https://"
"creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/]CC-BY-4.0[/url]\")."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] of categorized donor names. Each entry is an [Array] "
"of strings:\n"
"{[code]platinum_sponsors[/code], [code]gold_sponsors[/code], "
"[code]silver_sponsors[/code], [code]bronze_sponsors[/code], "
"[code]mini_sponsors[/code], [code]gold_donors[/code], [code]silver_donors[/"
"code], [code]bronze_donors[/code]}"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total number of frames drawn since the engine started.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On headless platforms, or if rendering is disabled with [code]--"
"disable-render-loop[/code] via command line, this method always returns "
"[code]0[/code]. See also [method get_process_frames]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the average frames rendered every second (FPS), also known as the "
"framerate."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a média de quadros renderizados por segundo (FPS), também conhecida "
"como taxa de quadros."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] of licenses used by Godot and included third party "
"components. Each entry is a license name (such as \"[url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIT_License#Ambiguity_and_variants]Expat[/url]\") and "
"its associated text."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Dictionary] de licenças usadas pelo Godot e componentes de "
"terceiros incluídos. Cada entrada é um nome de licença (como \"[url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIT_License#Ambiguity_and_variants]Expat[/url]\") e "
"seu texto associado."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid "Returns the full Godot license text."
msgstr "Retorna o texto completo da licença do Godot."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the instance of the [MainLoop]. This is usually the main [SceneTree] "
"and is the same as [method Node.get_tree].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The type instantiated as the main loop can changed with [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/main_loop_type]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total number of frames passed since the engine started. This "
"number is increased every [b]physics frame[/b]. See also [method "
"get_process_frames].\n"
"This method can be used to run expensive logic less often without relying on "
"a [Timer]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _physics_process(_delta):\n"
"\tif Engine.get_physics_frames() % 2 == 0:\n"
"\t\tpass # Run expensive logic only once every 2 physics frames here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _PhysicsProcess(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tbase._PhysicsProcess(delta);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (Engine.GetPhysicsFrames() % 2 == 0)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Run expensive logic only once every 2 physics frames here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número total de quadros passados desde que a engine foi iniciada. "
"Esse número é incrementado a cada [b]quadro de física[/b]. Veja também "
"[method get_process_frames].\n"
"Este método pode ser usado para executar lógica custosa com menos frequência "
"sem depender de um [Timer]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _physics_process(_delta):\n"
"\tif Engine.get_physics_frames() % 2 == 0:\n"
"\t\tpass # Execute lógica custosa apenas uma vez a cada 2 quadros de física "
"aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _PhysicsProcess(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tbase._PhysicsProcess(delta);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (Engine.GetPhysicsFrames() % 2 == 0)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Execute lógica custosa apenas uma vez a cada 2 quadros de física "
"aqui.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the fraction through the current physics tick we are at the time of "
"rendering the frame. This can be used to implement fixed timestep "
"interpolation."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a fração do tick de física atual em que estamos no momento da "
"renderização do quadro. Isso pode ser usado para implementar interpolação de "
"passo de tempo fixo."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total number of frames passed since the engine started. This "
"number is increased every [b]process frame[/b], regardless of whether the "
"render loop is enabled. See also [method get_frames_drawn] and [method "
"get_physics_frames].\n"
"This method can be used to run expensive logic less often without relying on "
"a [Timer]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(_delta):\n"
"\tif Engine.get_process_frames() % 5 == 0:\n"
"\t\tpass # Run expensive logic only once every 5 process (render) frames "
"here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tbase._Process(delta);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (Engine.GetProcessFrames() % 5 == 0)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Run expensive logic only once every 5 process (render) frames here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número total de quadros passados desde que a engine foi iniciada. "
"Esse número é incrementado a cada [b]quadro de processamento[/b], "
"independentemente de o loop de renderização estar ativado ou não. Veja "
"também [method get_frames_drawn] e [method get_physics_frames].\n"
"Este método pode ser usado para executar lógica custosa com menos frequência "
"sem depender de um [Timer]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _process(_delta):\n"
"\tif Engine.get_process_frames() % 5 == 0:\n"
"\t\tpass # Execute lógica custosa apenas uma vez a cada 5 quadros de "
"processamento (renderização) aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tbase._Process(delta);\n"
"\n"
"\tif (Engine.GetProcessFrames() % 5 == 0)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Execute lógica custosa apenas uma vez a cada 5 quadros de "
"processamento (renderização) aqui.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid "Returns an instance of a [ScriptLanguage] with the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma instância de um [ScriptLanguage] com o [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of available script languages. Use with [method "
"get_script_language]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de linguagens de script disponíveis. Use com [method "
"get_script_language]."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the global singleton with the given [param name], or [code]null[/"
"code] if it does not exist. Often used for plugins. See also [method "
"has_singleton] and [method get_singleton_list].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Global singletons are not the same as autoloaded nodes, which "
"are configurable in the project settings."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of names of all available global singletons. See also [method "
"get_singleton]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma lista de nomes de todos os singletons globais disponíveis. Veja "
"também [method get_singleton]."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current engine version information as a [Dictionary] containing "
"the following entries:\n"
"- [code]major[/code] - Major version number as an int;\n"
"- [code]minor[/code] - Minor version number as an int;\n"
"- [code]patch[/code] - Patch version number as an int;\n"
"- [code]hex[/code] - Full version encoded as a hexadecimal int with one byte "
"(2 hex digits) per number (see example below);\n"
"- [code]status[/code] - Status (such as \"beta\", \"rc1\", \"rc2\", "
"\"stable\", etc.) as a String;\n"
"- [code]build[/code] - Build name (e.g. \"custom_build\") as a String;\n"
"- [code]hash[/code] - Full Git commit hash as a String;\n"
"- [code]timestamp[/code] - Holds the Git commit date UNIX timestamp in "
"seconds as an int, or [code]0[/code] if unavailable;\n"
"- [code]string[/code] - [code]major[/code], [code]minor[/code], [code]patch[/"
"code], [code]status[/code], and [code]build[/code] in a single String.\n"
"The [code]hex[/code] value is encoded as follows, from left to right: one "
"byte for the major, one byte for the minor, one byte for the patch version. "
"For example, \"3.1.12\" would be [code]0x03010C[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [code]hex[/code] value is still an [int] internally, and "
"printing it will give you its decimal representation, which is not "
"particularly meaningful. Use hexadecimal literals for quick version "
"comparisons from code:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"if Engine.get_version_info().hex >= 0x040100:\n"
"\tpass # Do things specific to version 4.1 or later.\n"
"else:\n"
"\tpass # Do things specific to versions before 4.1.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"if ((int)Engine.GetVersionInfo()[\"hex\"] >= 0x040100)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Do things specific to version 4.1 or later.\n"
"}\n"
"else\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Do things specific to versions before 4.1.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna as informações da versão atual da engine como um [Dictionary] "
"contendo as seguintes entradas:\n"
"- [code]major[/code] - Número da versão principal como um int;\n"
"- [code]minor[/code] - Número da versão secundária como um int;\n"
"- [code]patch[/code] - Número da versão de correção como um int;\n"
"- [code]hex[/code] - Versão completa codificada como um int hexadecimal com "
"um byte (2 dígitos hexadecimais) por número (veja o exemplo abaixo);\n"
"- [code]status[/code] - Status (como \"beta\", \"rc1\", \"rc2\", \"stable\", "
"etc.) como uma String;\n"
"- [code]build[/code] - Nome da build (por exemplo, \"custom_build\") como "
"uma String;\n"
"- [code]hash[/code] - Hash completo do commit do Git como uma String;\n"
"- [code]timestamp[/code] - Armazena o timestamp UNIX da data do commit do "
"Git em segundos como um int, ou [code]0[/code] se indisponível;\n"
"- [code]string[/code] - [code]major[/code], [code]minor[/code], [code]patch[/"
"code], [code]status[/code] e [code]build[/code] em uma única String.\n"
"O valor [code]hex[/code] é codificado da seguinte forma, da esquerda para a "
"direita: um byte para a versão principal, um byte para a secundária, um byte "
"para a versão de correção. Por exemplo, \"3.1.12\" seria [code]0x03010C[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O valor [code]hex[/code] ainda é um [int] internamente, e "
"imprimi-lo fornecerá sua representação decimal, o que não é particularmente "
"significativo. Use literais hexadecimais para comparações rápidas de versão "
"a partir do código:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"if Engine.get_version_info().hex >= 0x040100:\n"
"\tpass # Faça coisas específicas para a versão 4.1 ou posterior.\n"
"else:\n"
"\tpass # Faça coisas específicas para versões anteriores a 4.1.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"if ((int)Engine.GetVersionInfo()[\"hex\"] >= 0x040100)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Faça coisas específicas para a versão 4.1 ou posterior.\n"
"}\n"
"else\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Faça coisas específicas para versões anteriores a 4.1.\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the path to the [MovieWriter]'s output file, or an empty string if "
"the engine wasn't started in Movie Maker mode. The default path can be "
"changed in [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/movie_file]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho para o arquivo de saída do [MovieWriter], ou uma string "
"vazia se a engine não foi iniciada no modo Movie Maker. O caminho padrão "
"pode ser alterado em [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/movie_file]."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a singleton with the given [param name] exists "
"in the global scope. See also [method get_singleton].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"OS\"))          # Prints true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"Engine\"))      # Prints true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"AudioServer\")) # Prints true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"Unknown\"))     # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"OS\"));          // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"Engine\"));      // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"AudioServer\")); // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"Unknown\"));     // Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Global singletons are not the same as autoloaded nodes, which "
"are configurable in the project settings."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se um singleton com o [param name] fornecido "
"existir no escopo global. Veja também [method get_singleton].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"OS\"))          # Imprime true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"Engine\"))      # Imprime true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"AudioServer\")) # Imprime true\n"
"print(Engine.has_singleton(\"Unknown\"))     # Imprime false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"OS\"));          // Imprime True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"Engine\"));      // Imprime True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"AudioServer\")); // Imprime True\n"
"GD.Print(Engine.HasSingleton(\"Unknown\"));     // Imprime False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Singletons globais não são o mesmo que nós carregados "
"automaticamente (autoloads), que são configuráveis nas configurações do "
"projeto."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the script is currently running inside the "
"editor, otherwise returns [code]false[/code]. This is useful for "
"[code]@tool[/code] scripts to conditionally draw editor helpers, or prevent "
"accidentally running \"game\" code that would affect the scene state while "
"in the editor:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"if Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\tdraw_gizmos()\n"
"else:\n"
"\tsimulate_physics()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"if (Engine.IsEditorHint())\n"
"\tDrawGizmos();\n"
"else\n"
"\tSimulatePhysics();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.html]Running "
"code in the editor[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To detect whether the script is running on an editor [i]build[/"
"i] (such as when pressing [kbd]F5[/kbd]), use [method OS.has_feature] with "
"the [code]\"editor\"[/code] argument instead. "
"[code]OS.has_feature(\"editor\")[/code] evaluate to [code]true[/code] both "
"when the script is running in the editor and when running the project from "
"the editor, but returns [code]false[/code] when run from an exported project."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o script estiver sendo executado atualmente "
"dentro do editor, caso contrário, retorna [code]false[/code]. Isso é útil "
"para scripts [code]@tool[/code] desenharem condicionalmente ajudantes de "
"editor ou evitarem a execução acidental de código de \"jogo\" que afetaria o "
"estado da cena enquanto estiver no editor:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"if Engine.is_editor_hint():\n"
"\tdraw_gizmos()\n"
"else:\n"
"\tsimulate_physics()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"if (Engine.IsEditorHint())\n"
"\tDrawGizmos();\n"
"else\n"
"\tSimulatePhysics();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Consulte [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/"
"running_code_in_the_editor.html]Executando código no editor[/url] na "
"documentação para mais informações.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para detectar se o script está sendo executado em uma [i]build[/"
"i] do editor (como ao pressionar [kbd]F5[/kbd]), use [method OS.has_feature] "
"com o argumento [code]\"editor\"[/code] em vez disso. "
"[code]OS.has_feature(\"editor\")[/code] avalia como [code]true[/code] tanto "
"quando o script está rodando no editor quanto quando o projeto está rodando "
"a partir do editor, mas retorna [code]false[/code] quando executado a partir "
"de um projeto exportado."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the engine is running embedded in the editor. "
"This is useful to prevent attempting to update window mode or window flags "
"that are not supported when running the project embedded in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a engine estiver rodando embutida no editor. "
"Isso é útil para evitar tentar atualizar o modo de janela ou as flags de "
"janela que não são suportadas ao executar o projeto embutido no editor."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the engine is inside the fixed physics process "
"step of the main loop.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\t# Depending on when the node is added to the tree,\n"
"\t# prints either \"true\" or \"false\".\n"
"\tprint(Engine.is_in_physics_frame())\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\tprint(Engine.is_in_physics_frame()) # Prints false\n"
"\n"
"func _physics_process(delta):\n"
"\tprint(Engine.is_in_physics_frame()) # Prints true\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a [ScriptLanguage] instance to be available with "
"[code]ScriptServer[/code].\n"
"Returns:\n"
"- [constant OK] on success;\n"
"- [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE] if [code]ScriptServer[/code] has reached the "
"limit and cannot register any new language;\n"
"- [constant ERR_ALREADY_EXISTS] if [code]ScriptServer[/code] already "
"contains a language with similar extension/name/type."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the given [Object] [param instance] as a singleton, available "
"globally under [param name]. Useful for plugins."
msgstr ""
"Registra o [Object] [param instance] fornecido como um singleton, disponível "
"globalmente sob [param name]. Útil para plugins."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Unregisters the [ScriptLanguage] instance from [code]ScriptServer[/code].\n"
"Returns:\n"
"- [constant OK] on success;\n"
"- [constant ERR_DOES_NOT_EXIST] if the language is not registered in "
"[code]ScriptServer[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the singleton registered under [param name]. The singleton object is "
"[i]not[/i] freed. Only works with user-defined singletons registered with "
"[method register_singleton]."
msgstr ""
"Remove o singleton registrado sob [param name]. O objeto singleton [i]não[/"
"i] é liberado. Funciona apenas com singletons definidos pelo usuário "
"registrados com [method register_singleton]."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of frames that can be rendered every second (FPS). A "
"value of [code]0[/code] means the framerate is uncapped.\n"
"Limiting the FPS can be useful to reduce the host machine's power "
"consumption, which reduces heat, noise emissions, and improves battery "
"life.\n"
"If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [b]Enabled[/"
"b] or [b]Adaptive[/b], the setting takes precedence and the max FPS number "
"cannot exceed the monitor's refresh rate. See also [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate].\n"
"If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [b]Enabled[/"
"b], on monitors with variable refresh rate enabled (G-Sync/FreeSync), using "
"an FPS limit a few frames lower than the monitor's refresh rate will "
"[url=https://blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-vsync-on/]reduce input lag while "
"avoiding tearing[/url]. At higher refresh rates, the difference between the "
"FPS limit and the monitor refresh rate should be increased to ensure frames "
"to account for timing inaccuracies. The optimal formula for the FPS limit "
"value in this scenario is [code]r - (r * r) / 3600.0[/code], where [code]r[/"
"code] is the monitor's refresh rate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The actual number of frames per second may still be below this "
"value if the CPU or GPU cannot keep up with the project's logic and "
"rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is "
"[b]Disabled[/b], limiting the FPS to a high value that can be consistently "
"reached on the system can reduce input lag compared to an uncapped "
"framerate. Since this works by ensuring the GPU load is lower than 100%, "
"this latency reduction is only effective in GPU-bottlenecked scenarios, not "
"CPU-bottlenecked scenarios."
msgstr ""
"O número máximo de quadros que podem ser renderizados a cada segundo (FPS). "
"Um valor de [code]0[/code] significa que a taxa de quadros é ilimitada.\n"
"Limitar o FPS pode ser útil para reduzir o consumo de energia da máquina "
"host, o que diminui o aquecimento, as emissões de ruído e melhora a duração "
"da bateria.\n"
"Se [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] estiver como "
"[b]Ativado (Enabled)[/b] ou [b]Adaptativo (Adaptive)[/b], essa configuração "
"tem precedência e o número máximo de FPS não pode exceder a taxa de "
"atualização do monitor. Veja também [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate].\n"
"Se [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] estiver como "
"[b]Ativado (Enabled)[/b], em monitores com taxa de atualização variável "
"ativada (G-Sync/FreeSync), usar um limite de FPS alguns quadros abaixo da "
"taxa de atualização do monitor irá [url=https://blurbusters.com/howto-low-"
"lag-vsync-on/]reduzir o atraso de entrada (input lag) enquanto evita o corte "
"de imagem (tearing)[/url]. Em taxas de atualização mais altas, a diferença "
"entre o limite de FPS e a taxa de atualização do monitor deve ser aumentada "
"para acomodar imprecisões de tempo nos quadros. A fórmula ideal para o valor "
"do limite de FPS neste cenário é [code]r - (r * r) / 3600.0[/code], onde "
"[code]r[/code] é a taxa de atualização do monitor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O número real de quadros por segundo ainda pode ficar abaixo "
"desse valor se a CPU ou a GPU não conseguirem acompanhar a lógica e a "
"renderização do projeto.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se [member ProjectSettings.display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] "
"estiver como [b]Desativado (Disabled)[/b], limitar o FPS a um valor alto que "
"possa ser alcançado consistentemente no sistema pode reduzir o atraso de "
"entrada em comparação a uma taxa de quadros ilimitada. Como isso funciona "
"garantindo que a carga da GPU fique abaixo de 100%, essa redução de latência "
"só é eficaz em cenários limitados pela GPU, e não em cenários limitados pela "
"CPU."

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of physics steps that can be simulated each rendered "
"frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value is tuned to prevent expensive physics "
"simulations from triggering even more expensive simulations indefinitely. "
"However, the game will appear to slow down if the rendering FPS is less than "
"[code]1 / max_physics_steps_per_frame[/code] of [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second]. This occurs even if [code]delta[/code] is "
"consistently used in physics calculations. To avoid this, increase [member "
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] if you have increased [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] significantly above its default value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"How much physics ticks are synchronized with real time. If [code]0[/code] or "
"less, the ticks are fully synchronized. Higher values cause the in-game "
"clock to deviate more from the real clock, but they smooth out framerate "
"jitters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default value of [code]0.5[/code] should be good enough for "
"most cases; values above [code]2[/code] could cause the game to react to "
"dropped frames with a noticeable delay and are not recommended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a custom physics interpolation solution, or within a "
"network game, it's recommended to disable the physics jitter fix by setting "
"this property to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"The number of fixed iterations per second. This controls how often physics "
"simulation and the [method Node._physics_process] method are run.\n"
"CPU usage scales approximately with the physics tick rate. However, at very "
"low tick rates (usually below 30), physics behavior can break down. Input "
"can also become less responsive at low tick rates as there can be a gap "
"between input being registered, and the response on the next physics tick. "
"High tick rates give more accurate physics simulation, particularly for fast "
"moving objects. For example, racing games may benefit from increasing the "
"tick rate above the default 60.\n"
"See also [member max_fps] and [member ProjectSettings.physics/common/"
"physics_ticks_per_second].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only [member max_physics_steps_per_frame] physics ticks may be "
"simulated per rendered frame at most. If more physics ticks have to be "
"simulated per rendered frame to keep up with rendering, the project will "
"appear to slow down (even if [code]delta[/code] is used consistently in "
"physics calculations). Therefore, it is recommended to also increase [member "
"max_physics_steps_per_frame] if increasing [member physics_ticks_per_second] "
"significantly above its default value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Consider enabling [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/physics/"
"interpolation/index.html]physics interpolation[/url] if you change [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] to a value that is not a multiple of [code]60[/"
"code]. Using physics interpolation will avoid jittering when the monitor "
"refresh rate and physics update rate don't exactly match."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], stops printing error and warning messages to the "
"console and editor Output log. This can be used to hide error and warning "
"messages during unit test suite runs. This property is equivalent to the "
"[member ProjectSettings.application/run/disable_stderr] project setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property does not impact the editor's Errors tab when "
"running a project from the editor.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] If set to [code]false[/code] anywhere in the project, "
"important error messages may be hidden even if they are emitted from other "
"scripts. In a [code]@tool[/code] script, this will also impact the editor "
"itself. Do [i]not[/i] report bugs before ensuring error messages are enabled "
"(as they are by default)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], stops printing messages (for example using [method "
"@GlobalScope.print]) to the console, log files, and editor Output log. This "
"property is equivalent to the [member ProjectSettings.application/run/"
"disable_stdout] project setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not stop printing errors or warnings produced by "
"scripts to the console or log files, for more details see [member "
"print_error_messages]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Engine.xml
msgid ""
"The speed multiplier at which the in-game clock updates, compared to real "
"time. For example, if set to [code]2.0[/code] the game runs twice as fast, "
"and if set to [code]0.5[/code] the game runs half as fast.\n"
"This value affects [Timer], [SceneTreeTimer], and all other simulations that "
"make use of [code]delta[/code] time (such as [method Node._process] and "
"[method Node._physics_process]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to keep this property above [code]0.0[/code], "
"as the game may behave unexpectedly otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not affect audio playback speed. Use [member "
"AudioServer.playback_speed_scale] to adjust audio playback speed "
"independently of [member Engine.time_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not automatically adjust [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second]. With values above [code]1.0[/code] physics "
"simulation may become less precise, as each physics tick will stretch over a "
"larger period of engine time. If you're modifying [member Engine.time_scale] "
"to speed up simulation by a large factor, consider also increasing [member "
"physics_ticks_per_second] to make the simulation more reliable."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Exposes the internal debugger."
msgstr "Expõe o depurador interno."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"[EngineDebugger] handles the communication between the editor and the "
"running game. It is active in the running game. Messages can be sent/"
"received through it. It also manages the profilers."
msgstr ""
"[EngineDebugger] lida com a comunicação entre o editor e o jogo em execução. "
"Ele está ativo no jogo em execução. Mensagens podem ser enviadas/recebidas "
"por meio dele. Ele também gerencia os profilers."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Clears all breakpoints."
msgstr "Limpa todos os pontos de interrupção."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Starts a debug break in script execution, optionally specifying whether the "
"program can continue based on [param can_continue] and whether the break was "
"due to a breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"Inicia uma interrupção de depuração na execução do script, especificando "
"opcionalmente se o programa pode continuar com base em [param can_continue] "
"e se a interrupção ocorreu devido a um ponto de interrupção."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Returns the current debug depth."
msgstr "Retorna a profundidade de depuração atual."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Returns the number of lines that remain."
msgstr "Retorna o número de linhas que restam."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a capture with the given name is present "
"otherwise [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se uma captura com o nome fornecido estiver "
"presente, caso contrário [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a profiler with the given name is present "
"otherwise [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se um criador de perfil com o nome fornecido "
"estiver presente, caso contrário [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Inserts a new breakpoint with the given [param source] and [param line]."
msgstr ""
"Insere um novo ponto de interrupção com o [param source] e a [param line] "
"fornecidos."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the debugger is active otherwise [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o depurador estiver ativo, caso contrário "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param source] and [param line] "
"represent an existing breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param source] e a [param line] fornecidos "
"representarem um ponto de interrupção existente."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a profiler with the given name is present and "
"active otherwise [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se um criador de perfil com o nome fornecido "
"estiver presente e ativo; caso contrário, [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the debugger is skipping breakpoints otherwise "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o depurador estiver ignorando pontos de "
"interrupção, caso contrário [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Forces a processing loop of debugger events. The purpose of this method is "
"just processing events every now and then when the script might get too "
"busy, so that bugs like infinite loops can be caught."
msgstr ""
"Força um loop de processamento de eventos do depurador. O propósito deste "
"método é apenas processar eventos eventualmente quando o script pode ficar "
"muito ocupado, para que bugs como loops infinitos possam ser capturados."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Calls the [code]add[/code] callable of the profiler with given [param name] "
"and [param data]."
msgstr ""
"Chama o callable [code]add[/code] do criador de perfil com o [param name] e "
"[param data] fornecidos."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Calls the [code]toggle[/code] callable of the profiler with given [param "
"name] and [param arguments]. Enables/Disables the same profiler depending on "
"[param enable] argument."
msgstr ""
"Chama o callable [code]toggle[/code] do profiler com o [param name] e os "
"[param arguments] fornecidos. Ativa/desativa o mesmo profiler dependendo do "
"argumento [param enable]."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a message capture with given [param name]. If [param name] is "
"\"my_message\" then messages starting with \"my_message:\" will be called "
"with the given callable.\n"
"The callable must accept a message string and a data array as argument. The "
"callable should return [code]true[/code] if the message is recognized.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The callable will receive the message with the prefix stripped, "
"unlike [method EditorDebuggerPlugin._capture]. See the "
"[EditorDebuggerPlugin] description for an example."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a profiler with the given [param name]. See [EngineProfiler] for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Registra um criador de perfil com o [param name] fornecido. Veja "
"[EngineProfiler] para mais informações."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Removes a breakpoint with the given [param source] and [param line]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um ponto de interrupção com a [param source] e a [param line] "
"fornecidas."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Sends a message with given [param message] and [param data] array."
msgstr ""
"Envia uma mensagem com o [param message] e a matriz de [param data] "
"fornecidos."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Sets the current debugging depth."
msgstr "Define a profundidade de depuração atual."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Sets the current debugging lines that remain."
msgstr "Define as linhas de depuração atuais que permanecem."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Unregisters the message capture with given [param name]."
msgstr "Desregistra a captura de mensagem com o [param name] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/EngineDebugger.xml
msgid "Unregisters a profiler with given [param name]."
msgstr "Desregistra um criador de perfil com o [param name] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/EngineProfiler.xml
msgid "Base class for creating custom profilers."
msgstr "Classe base para criar perfis personalizados."

#: doc/classes/EngineProfiler.xml
msgid ""
"This class can be used to implement custom profilers that are able to "
"interact with the engine and editor debugger.\n"
"See [EngineDebugger] and [EditorDebuggerPlugin] for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/EngineProfiler.xml
msgid ""
"Called when data is added to profiler using [method "
"EngineDebugger.profiler_add_frame_data]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando dados são adicionados ao criador de perfil usando [method "
"EngineDebugger.profiler_add_frame_data]."

#: doc/classes/EngineProfiler.xml
msgid ""
"Called once every engine iteration when the profiler is active with "
"information about the current frame. All time values are in seconds. Lower "
"values represent faster processing times and are therefore considered better."
msgstr ""
"Chamado uma vez a cada iteração do engine quando o criador de perfil está "
"ativo com informações sobre o quadro atual. Todos os valores de tempo estão "
"em segundos. Valores mais baixos representam tempos de processamento mais "
"rápidos e, portanto, são considerados melhores."

#: doc/classes/EngineProfiler.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the profiler is enabled/disabled, along with a set of [param "
"options]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o criador de perfil é ativado/desativado, juntamente com um "
"conjunto de [param options]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Resource for environment nodes (like [WorldEnvironment]) that define "
"multiple rendering options."
msgstr ""
"Recurso para nós de ambiente (como [WorldEnvironment]) que definem múltiplas "
"opções de renderização."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Resource for environment nodes (like [WorldEnvironment]) that define "
"multiple environment operations (such as background [Sky] or [Color], "
"ambient light, fog, depth-of-field...). These parameters affect the final "
"render of the scene. The order of these operations is:\n"
"- Depth of Field Blur\n"
"- Auto Exposure\n"
"- Glow\n"
"- Tonemap\n"
"- Adjustments"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/WorldEnvironment.xml
msgid "Environment and post-processing"
msgstr "Ambiente e pós-processamento"

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "High dynamic range lighting"
msgstr "Iluminação de alto alcance dinâmico"

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/Material.xml doc/classes/Mesh.xml
#: doc/classes/MeshInstance3D.xml doc/classes/WorldEnvironment.xml
msgid "3D Material Testers Demo"
msgstr "Demonstração de Testadores de Material 3D"

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "Returns the intensity of the glow level [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna a intensidade do nível de brilho [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the intensity of the glow level [param idx]. A value above [code]0.0[/"
"code] enables the level. Each level relies on the previous level. This means "
"that enabling higher glow levels will slow down the glow effect rendering, "
"even if previous levels aren't enabled."
msgstr ""
"Define a intensidade do nível de brilho [param idx]. Um valor acima de "
"[code]0.0[/code] ativa o nível. Cada nível depende do nível anterior. Isso "
"significa que ativar níveis de brilho mais altos desacelerará a renderização "
"do efeito de brilho, mesmo que os níveis anteriores não estejam ativados."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a simple brightness adjustment to the rendered image after "
"tonemaping. To adjust scene brightness use [member tonemap_exposure] "
"instead, which is applied before tonemapping and thus less prone to issues "
"with bright colors. Effective only if [member adjustment_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Aplica um ajuste simples de brilho à imagem renderizada após o mapeamento de "
"tons. Para ajustar o brilho da cena, use [member tonemap_exposure] em vez "
"disso, que é aplicado antes do mapeamento de tons e, portanto, é menos "
"suscetível a problemas com cores brilhantes. Eficaz apenas se [member "
"adjustment_enabled] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The [Texture2D] or [Texture3D] lookup table (LUT) to use for the built-in "
"post-process color grading. Can use a [GradientTexture1D] for a 1-"
"dimensional LUT, or a [Texture3D] for a more complex LUT. Effective only if "
"[member adjustment_enabled] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Color correction does not currently support HDR output due to "
"only supporting values in the SDR (0.0 to 1.0) range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Increasing [member adjustment_contrast] will make dark values darker and "
"bright values brighter. This simple adjustment is applied to the rendered "
"image after tonemaping. When set to a value greater than [code]1.0[/code], "
"[member adjustment_contrast] is prone to clipping colors that become too "
"bright or too dark. Effective only if [member adjustment_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Aumentar [member adjustment_contrast] tornará os valores escuros mais "
"escuros e os valores brilhantes mais brilhantes. Este ajuste simples é "
"aplicado à imagem renderizada após o mapeamento de tons. Quando definido "
"como um valor maior que [code]1.0[/code], [member adjustment_contrast] é "
"propenso a cortar cores que se tornam muito brilhantes ou muito escuras. "
"Eficaz apenas se [member adjustment_enabled] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables the [code]adjustment_*[/code] properties "
"provided by this resource. If [code]false[/code], modifications to the "
"[code]adjustment_*[/code] properties will have no effect on the rendered "
"scene."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa as propriedades [code]adjustment_*[/code] "
"fornecidas por este recurso. Se [code]false[/code], as modificações nas "
"propriedades [code]adjustment_*[/code] não terão efeito na cena renderizada."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a simple saturation adjustment to the rendered image after "
"tonemaping. When [member adjustment_saturation] is set to [code]0.0[/code], "
"the rendered image will be fully converted to a grayscale image. Effective "
"only if [member adjustment_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Aplica um ajuste simples de saturação à imagem renderizada após o mapeamento "
"de tom. Quando [member adjustment_saturation] é definido como [code]0.0[/"
"code], a imagem renderizada será totalmente convertida em uma imagem em tons "
"de cinza. Eficaz apenas se [member adjustment_enabled] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The ambient light's [Color]. Only effective if [member "
"ambient_light_sky_contribution] is lower than [code]1.0[/code] (exclusive)."
msgstr ""
"A [Color] da luz ambiente. Só é eficaz se [member "
"ambient_light_sky_contribution] for menor que [code]1.0[/code] (exclusivo)."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The ambient light's energy. The higher the value, the stronger the light. "
"Only effective if [member ambient_light_sky_contribution] is lower than "
"[code]1.0[/code] (exclusive)."
msgstr ""
"A energia da luz ambiente. Quanto maior o valor, mais forte a luz. Só é "
"eficaz se [member ambient_light_sky_contribution] for menor que [code]1.0[/"
"code] (exclusivo)."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Defines the amount of light that the sky brings on the scene. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] means that the sky's light emission has no effect on the "
"scene illumination, thus all ambient illumination is provided by the ambient "
"light. On the contrary, a value of [code]1.0[/code] means that [i]all[/i] "
"the light that affects the scene is provided by the sky, thus the ambient "
"light parameter has no effect on the scene.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member ambient_light_sky_contribution] is internally clamped "
"between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The ambient light source to use for rendering materials and global "
"illumination."
msgstr ""
"A fonte de luz ambiente a ser usada para renderizar materiais e iluminação "
"global."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The ID of the camera feed to show in the background."
msgstr "O ID do feed de câmera a ser exibido no fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum layer ID to display. Only effective when using the [constant "
"BG_CANVAS] background mode."
msgstr ""
"O ID máximo da camada a ser exibido. Eficaz apenas ao usar o modo de fundo "
"[constant BG_CANVAS]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The [Color] displayed for clear areas of the scene. Only effective when "
"using the [constant BG_COLOR] background mode."
msgstr ""
"A [Color] exibida para áreas limpas da cena. Só é eficaz ao usar o modo de "
"fundo [constant BG_COLOR]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplier for background energy. Increase to make background brighter, "
"decrease to make background dimmer."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador para a energia de fundo. Aumente para tornar o fundo mais "
"brilhante, diminua para tornar o fundo mais escuro."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Luminance of background measured in nits (candela per square meter). Only "
"used when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] is enabled. The default value is roughly "
"equivalent to the sky at midday."
msgstr ""
"Luminância do fundo medida em nits (candela por metro quadrado). Só é usado "
"quando [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/"
"use_physical_light_units] está ativado. O valor padrão é aproximadamente "
"equivalente ao céu ao meio-dia."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The background mode."
msgstr "O modo de plano de fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If set above [code]0.0[/code] (exclusive), blends between the fog's color "
"and the color of the background [Sky], as read from the radiance cubemap. "
"This has a small performance cost when set above [code]0.0[/code]. Must have "
"[member background_mode] set to [constant BG_SKY].\n"
"This is useful to simulate [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Aerial_perspective]aerial perspective[/url] in large scenes with low density "
"fog. However, it is not very useful for high-density fog, as the sky will "
"shine through. When set to [code]1.0[/code], the fog color comes completely "
"from the [Sky]. If set to [code]0.0[/code], aerial perspective is disabled.\n"
"Notice that this does not sample the [Sky] directly, but rather the radiance "
"cubemap. The cubemap is sampled at a mipmap level depending on the depth of "
"the rendered pixel; the farther away, the higher the resolution of the "
"sampled mipmap. This results in the actual color being a blurred version of "
"the sky, with more blur closer to the camera. The highest mipmap resolution "
"is used at a depth of [member Camera3D.far]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The fog density to be used. This is demonstrated in different ways depending "
"on the [member fog_mode] mode chosen:\n"
"[b]Exponential Fog Mode:[/b] Higher values result in denser fog. The fog "
"rendering is exponential like in real life.\n"
"[b]Depth Fog mode:[/b] The maximum intensity of the deep fog, effect will "
"appear in the distance (relative to the camera). At [code]1.0[/code] the fog "
"will fully obscure the scene, at [code]0.0[/code] the fog will not be "
"visible."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The fog's depth starting distance from the camera. Only available when "
"[member fog_mode] is set to [constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."
msgstr ""
"A distância inicial de profundidade do nevoeiro a partir da câmera. "
"Disponível apenas quando [member fog_mode] é definido como [constant "
"FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The fog depth's intensity curve. A number of presets are available in the "
"Inspector by right-clicking the curve. Only available when [member fog_mode] "
"is set to [constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."
msgstr ""
"A curva de intensidade da profundidade da névoa. Vários predefinições estão "
"disponíveis no Inspetor ao clicar com o botão direito na curva. Disponível "
"apenas quando [member fog_mode] está definido como [constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The fog's depth end distance from the camera. If this value is set to "
"[code]0[/code], it will be equal to the current camera's [member "
"Camera3D.far] value. Only available when [member fog_mode] is set to "
"[constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."
msgstr ""
"A distância final de profundidade da névoa em relação à câmera. Se este "
"valor for definido como [code]0[/code], será igual ao valor atual de [member "
"Camera3D.far] da câmera. Disponível apenas quando [member fog_mode] está "
"definido como [constant FOG_MODE_DEPTH]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], fog effects are enabled."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], os efeitos de neblina estão ativados."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The height at which the height fog effect begins."
msgstr "A altura em que o efeito de neblina de altura começa."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The density used to increase fog as height decreases. To make fog increase "
"as height increases, use a negative value."
msgstr ""
"A densidade usada para aumentar o nevoeiro à medida que a altura diminui. "
"Para fazer o nevoeiro aumentar conforme a altura aumenta, use um valor "
"negativo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The fog's color."
msgstr "A cor da névoa."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The fog's brightness. Higher values result in brighter fog."
msgstr ""
"O brilho da névoa. Valores mais altos resultam em uma névoa mais brilhante."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The fog mode."
msgstr "O modo de névoa."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The factor to use when affecting the sky with non-volumetric fog. [code]1.0[/"
"code] means that fog can fully obscure the sky. Lower values reduce the "
"impact of fog on sky rendering, with [code]0.0[/code] not affecting sky "
"rendering at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member fog_sky_affect] has no visual effect if [member "
"fog_aerial_perspective] is [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If set above [code]0.0[/code], renders the scene's directional light(s) in "
"the fog color depending on the view angle. This can be used to give the "
"impression that the sun is \"piercing\" through the fog."
msgstr ""
"Se definido acima de [code]0.0[/code], renderiza a(s) luz(es) direcional(is) "
"da cena na cor da névoa, dependendo do ângulo de visão. Isso pode ser usado "
"para dar a impressão de que o sol está \"penetrando\" através da névoa."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The glow blending mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The Compatibility renderer always uses [constant "
"GLOW_BLEND_MODE_SCREEN] and [member glow_blend_mode] will have no effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The bloom's intensity. If set to a value higher than [code]0[/code], this "
"will make glow visible in areas darker than the [member glow_hdr_threshold]."
msgstr ""
"A intensidade do bloom. Se definido como um valor maior que [code]0[/code], "
"isso tornará o brilho visível em áreas mais escuras que [member "
"glow_hdr_threshold]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the glow effect is enabled. This simulates real world "
"atmosphere and eye/camera behavior by causing bright pixels to bleed onto "
"surrounding pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, glow looks different "
"due to the lower dynamic range available in the Mobile rendering method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Compatibility rendering method, glow uses a "
"different implementation with some properties being unavailable and hidden "
"from the inspector: [code]glow_levels/*[/code], [member glow_normalized], "
"[member glow_strength], [member glow_blend_mode], [member glow_mix], [member "
"glow_map], and [member glow_map_strength]. This implementation is optimized "
"to run on low-end devices and is less flexible as a result."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The higher threshold of the HDR glow. Areas brighter than this threshold "
"will be clamped for the purposes of the glow effect."
msgstr ""
"O limite superior do brilho HDR. Áreas mais brilhantes do que este limite "
"serão limitadas para os fins do efeito de brilho."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Smooths the transition between values that are below and above [member "
"glow_hdr_threshold] by reducing the amount of glow generated by values that "
"are close to [member glow_hdr_threshold]. Values above "
"[code]glow_hdr_threshold + glow_hdr_scale[/code] will not have glow reduced "
"in this way."
msgstr ""
"Suaviza a transição entre valores que estão abaixo e acima de [member "
"glow_hdr_threshold] reduzindo a quantidade de brilho gerada por valores "
"próximos a [member glow_hdr_threshold]. Valores acima de "
"[code]glow_hdr_threshold + glow_hdr_scale[/code] não terão o brilho reduzido "
"dessa maneira."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The lower threshold of the HDR glow. When using the Mobile rendering method "
"(which only supports a lower dynamic range up to [code]2.0[/code]), this may "
"need to be below [code]1.0[/code] for glow to be visible. A value of "
"[code]0.9[/code] works well in this case. This value also needs to be "
"decreased below [code]1.0[/code] when using glow in 2D, as 2D rendering is "
"performed in SDR."
msgstr ""
"O limite inferior do brilho HDR. Ao usar o método de renderização Mobile "
"(que suporta apenas um alcance dinâmico menor de até [code]2.0[/code]), pode "
"ser necessário que isso esteja abaixo de [code]1.0[/code] para que o brilho "
"seja visível. Um valor de [code]0.9[/code] funciona bem neste caso. Este "
"valor também precisa ser diminuído abaixo de [code]1.0[/code] ao usar o "
"brilho em 2D, já que a renderização 2D é realizada em SDR."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The overall brightness multiplier that is applied to the glow effect just "
"before it is blended with the scene. When using the Mobile rendering method "
"(which only supports a lower dynamic range up to [code]2.0[/code]), this "
"should be increased to [code]1.5[/code] to compensate."
msgstr ""
"O multiplicador geral de brilho que é aplicado ao efeito de brilho logo "
"antes de ser misturado com a cena. Ao usar o método de renderização Mobile "
"(que suporta apenas um intervalo dinâmico mais baixo de até [code]2.0[/"
"code]), isso deve ser aumentado para [code]1.5[/code] para compensar."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the 1st level of glow. This is the most \"local\" level "
"(least blurry).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/1] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the 2nd level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/2] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the 3rd level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/3] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the 4th level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/4] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the 5th level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/5] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the 6th level of glow.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/6] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the 7th level of glow. This is the most \"global\" level "
"(blurriest).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_levels/7] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The texture that should be used as a glow map to [i]multiply[/i] the "
"resulting glow color according to [member glow_map_strength]. This can be "
"used to create a \"lens dirt\" effect. The texture's RGB color channels are "
"used for modulation, but the alpha channel is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The texture will be stretched to fit the screen. Therefore, "
"it's recommended to use a texture with an aspect ratio that matches your "
"project's base aspect ratio (typically 16:9).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_map] has no effect when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler glow "
"implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"How strong of an influence the [member glow_map] should have on the overall "
"glow effect. A strength of [code]0.0[/code] means the glow map has no "
"influence, while a strength of [code]1.0[/code] means the glow map has full "
"influence.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the glow map has black areas, a value of [code]1.0[/code] "
"can also turn off the glow effect entirely in specific areas of the screen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_map_strength] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"When using the [constant GLOW_BLEND_MODE_MIX] [member glow_blend_mode], this "
"controls how much the source image is blended with the glow layer. A value "
"of [code]0.0[/code] makes the glow rendering invisible, while a value of "
"[code]1.0[/code] is equivalent to [constant GLOW_BLEND_MODE_REPLACE].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_mix] has no effect when using the Compatibility "
"rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler glow "
"implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], glow levels will be normalized so that summed together "
"their intensities equal [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_normalized] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The strength that is used when blurring across the screen to generate the "
"glow effect. This affects the distance and intensity of the blur. When using "
"the Mobile rendering method, this should be increased to compensate for the "
"lower dynamic range.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member glow_strength] has no effect when using the "
"Compatibility rendering method, due to this rendering method using a simpler "
"glow implementation optimized for low-end devices."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The reflected (specular) light source."
msgstr "A fonte de luz refletida (especular)."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The energy multiplier applied to light every time it bounces from a surface "
"when using SDFGI. Values greater than [code]0.0[/code] will simulate "
"multiple bounces, resulting in a more realistic appearance. Increasing "
"[member sdfgi_bounce_feedback] generally has no performance impact. See also "
"[member sdfgi_energy].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Values greater than [code]0.5[/code] can cause infinite "
"feedback loops and should be avoided in scenes with bright materials.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member sdfgi_bounce_feedback] is [code]0.0[/code], indirect "
"lighting will not be represented in reflections as light will only bounce "
"one time."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is linked to [member sdfgi_min_cell_size] and "
"[member sdfgi_max_distance]. Changing its value will automatically change "
"those properties as well."
msgstr ""
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade está vinculada a [member sdfgi_min_cell_size] "
"e [member sdfgi_max_distance]. Alterar seu valor alterará automaticamente "
"essas propriedades também."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The number of cascades to use for SDFGI (between 1 and 8). A higher number "
"of cascades allows displaying SDFGI further away while preserving detail up "
"close, at the cost of performance. When using SDFGI on small-scale levels, "
"[member sdfgi_cascades] can often be decreased between [code]1[/code] and "
"[code]4[/code] to improve performance."
msgstr ""
"O número de cascatas a serem usadas para SDFGI (entre 1 e 8). Um número "
"maior de cascatas permite exibir SDFGI mais distante, preservando os "
"detalhes de perto, ao custo de desempenho. Ao usar SDFGI em níveis de "
"pequena escala, [member sdfgi_cascades] pode frequentemente ser diminuído "
"entre [code]1[/code] e [code]4[/code] para melhorar o desempenho."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables signed distance field global illumination for "
"meshes that have their [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] set to [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC]. SDFGI is a real-time global illumination "
"technique that works well with procedurally generated and user-built levels, "
"including in situations where geometry is created during gameplay. The "
"signed distance field is automatically generated around the camera as it "
"moves. Dynamic lights are supported, but dynamic occluders and emissive "
"surfaces are not.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SDFGI is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] SDFGI is relatively demanding on the GPU and is not "
"suited to low-end hardware such as integrated graphics (consider "
"[LightmapGI] instead). To improve SDFGI performance, enable [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/gi/use_half_resolution] in the "
"Project Settings.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Meshes should have sufficiently thick walls to avoid light "
"leaks (avoid one-sided walls). For interior levels, enclose your level "
"geometry in a sufficiently large box and bridge the loops to close the mesh."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The energy multiplier to use for SDFGI. Higher values will result in "
"brighter indirect lighting and reflections. See also [member "
"sdfgi_bounce_feedback]."
msgstr ""
"O multiplicador de energia a ser usado para SDFGI. Valores mais altos "
"resultarão em iluminação indireta e reflexos mais brilhantes. Consulte "
"também [member sdfgi_bounce_feedback]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum distance at which SDFGI is visible. Beyond this distance, "
"environment lighting or other sources of GI such as [ReflectionProbe] will "
"be used as a fallback.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is linked to [member sdfgi_min_cell_size] and "
"[member sdfgi_cascade0_distance]. Changing its value will automatically "
"change those properties as well."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The cell size to use for the closest SDFGI cascade (in 3D units). Lower "
"values allow SDFGI to be more precise up close, at the cost of making SDFGI "
"updates more demanding. This can cause stuttering when the camera moves "
"fast. Higher values allow SDFGI to cover more ground, while also reducing "
"the performance impact of SDFGI updates.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is linked to [member sdfgi_max_distance] and "
"[member sdfgi_cascade0_distance]. Changing its value will automatically "
"change those properties as well."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The normal bias to use for SDFGI probes. Increasing this value can reduce "
"visible streaking artifacts on sloped surfaces, at the cost of increased "
"light leaking."
msgstr ""
"O viés normal a ser usado para sondas SDFGI. Aumentar este valor pode "
"reduzir artefatos visíveis de listras em superfícies inclinadas, ao custo de "
"maior vazamento de luz."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The constant bias to use for SDFGI probes. Increasing this value can reduce "
"visible streaking artifacts on sloped surfaces, at the cost of increased "
"light leaking."
msgstr ""
"O viés constante a ser usado para sondas SDFGI. Aumentar este valor pode "
"reduzir artefatos visíveis de listras em superfícies inclinadas, ao custo de "
"maior vazamento de luz."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], SDFGI takes the environment lighting into account. "
"This should be set to [code]false[/code] for interior scenes."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o SDFGI leva a iluminação do ambiente em consideração. "
"Isso deve ser definido como [code]false[/code] para cenas internas."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], SDFGI uses an occlusion detection approach to reduce "
"light leaking. Occlusion may however introduce dark blotches in certain "
"spots, which may be undesired in mostly outdoor scenes. [member "
"sdfgi_use_occlusion] has a performance impact and should only be enabled "
"when needed."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o SDFGI usa uma abordagem de detecção de oclusão para "
"reduzir o vazamento de luz. No entanto, a oclusão pode introduzir manchas "
"escuras em determinados pontos, o que pode ser indesejado em cenas "
"majoritariamente externas. [member sdfgi_use_occlusion] tem um impacto no "
"desempenho e deve ser ativado apenas quando necessário."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The Y scale to use for SDFGI cells. Lower values will result in SDFGI cells "
"being packed together more closely on the Y axis. This is used to balance "
"between quality and covering a lot of vertical ground. [member "
"sdfgi_y_scale] should be set depending on how vertical your scene is (and "
"how fast your camera may move on the Y axis)."
msgstr ""
"A escala Y a ser usada para células SDFGI. Valores mais baixos resultarão em "
"células SDFGI agrupadas mais de perto no eixo Y. Isso é usado para "
"equilibrar entre qualidade e cobertura de bastante terreno vertical. O "
"[member sdfgi_y_scale] deve ser definido dependendo de quão vertical é a sua "
"cena (e quão rápido sua câmera pode se mover no eixo Y)."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The [Sky] resource used for this [Environment]."
msgstr "O recurso [Sky] usado para este [Environment]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If set to a value greater than [code]0.0[/code], overrides the field of view "
"to use for sky rendering. If set to [code]0.0[/code], the same FOV as the "
"current [Camera3D] is used for sky rendering."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como um valor maior que [code]0.0[/code], substitui o campo de "
"visão a ser usado para a renderização do céu. Se definido como [code]0.0[/"
"code], o mesmo FOV do [Camera3D] atual é usado para a renderização do céu."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The rotation to use for sky rendering."
msgstr "A rotação a ser usada para renderização de céu."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The screen-space ambient occlusion intensity on materials that have an AO "
"texture defined. Values higher than [code]0[/code] will make the SSAO effect "
"visible in areas darkened by AO textures."
msgstr ""
"A intensidade de oclusão de ambiente no espaço da tela em materiais que "
"possuem uma textura AO definida. Valores maiores que [code]0[/code] tornarão "
"o efeito SSAO visível em áreas escurecidas por texturas AO."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the strength of the additional level of detail for the screen-space "
"ambient occlusion effect. A high value makes the detail pass more prominent, "
"but it may contribute to aliasing in your final image."
msgstr ""
"Define a intensidade do nível adicional de detalhe para o efeito de oclusão "
"de ambiente no espaço da tela. Um valor alto torna a passagem de detalhe "
"mais proeminente, mas pode contribuir para o aliasing na sua imagem final."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the screen-space ambient occlusion effect is enabled. "
"This darkens objects' corners and cavities to simulate ambient light not "
"reaching the entire object as in real life. This works well for small, "
"dynamic objects, but baked lighting or ambient occlusion textures will do a "
"better job at displaying ambient occlusion on large static objects. Godot "
"uses a form of SSAO called Adaptive Screen Space Ambient Occlusion which is "
"itself a form of Horizon Based Ambient Occlusion.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSAO is only supported in the Forward+ and Compatibility "
"rendering methods, not Mobile."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The threshold for considering whether a given point on a surface is occluded "
"or not represented as an angle from the horizon mapped into the "
"[code]0.0-1.0[/code] range. A value of [code]1.0[/code] results in no "
"occlusion."
msgstr ""
"O limite para considerar se um determinado ponto em uma superfície está "
"ocluído ou não, representado como um ângulo a partir do horizonte mapeado "
"para o intervalo [code]0.0-1.0[/code]. Um valor de [code]1.0[/code] resulta "
"em nenhuma oclusão."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The primary screen-space ambient occlusion intensity. Acts as a multiplier "
"for the screen-space ambient occlusion effect. A higher value results in "
"darker occlusion."
msgstr ""
"A intensidade principal de oclusão de ambiente no espaço de tela. Atua como "
"um multiplicador para o efeito de oclusão de ambiente no espaço de tela. Um "
"valor mais alto resulta em oclusão mais escura."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The screen-space ambient occlusion intensity in direct light. In real life, "
"ambient occlusion only applies to indirect light, which means its effects "
"can't be seen in direct light. Values higher than [code]0[/code] will make "
"the SSAO effect visible in direct light."
msgstr ""
"A intensidade da oclusão de ambiente no espaço de tela na luz direta. Na "
"vida real, a oclusão de ambiente se aplica apenas à luz indireta, o que "
"significa que seus efeitos não podem ser vistos na luz direta. Valores "
"superiores a [code]0[/code] tornarão o efeito SSAO visível na luz direta."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The distribution of occlusion. A higher value results in darker occlusion, "
"similar to [member ssao_intensity], but with a sharper falloff."
msgstr ""
"A distribuição da oclusão. Um valor mais alto resulta em uma oclusão mais "
"escura, semelhante a [member ssao_intensity], mas com uma queda mais "
"acentuada."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The distance at which objects can occlude each other when calculating screen-"
"space ambient occlusion. Higher values will result in occlusion over a "
"greater distance at the cost of performance and quality."
msgstr ""
"A distância na qual os objetos podem ocluir uns aos outros ao calcular a "
"oclusão de ambiente no espaço da tela. Valores mais altos resultarão em "
"oclusão em uma distância maior ao custo de desempenho e qualidade."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The amount that the screen-space ambient occlusion effect is allowed to blur "
"over the edges of objects. Setting too high will result in aliasing around "
"the edges of objects. Setting too low will make object edges appear blurry."
msgstr ""
"A quantidade que o efeito de oclusão de ambiente no espaço de tela tem "
"permissão para desfocar sobre as bordas dos objetos. Definir muito alto "
"resultará em aliasing ao redor das bordas dos objetos. Definir muito baixo "
"fará com que as bordas dos objetos apareçam borradas."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the screen-space indirect lighting effect is enabled. "
"Screen space indirect lighting is a form of indirect lighting that allows "
"diffuse light to bounce between nearby objects. Screen-space indirect "
"lighting works very similarly to screen-space ambient occlusion, in that it "
"only affects a limited range. It is intended to be used along with a form of "
"proper global illumination like SDFGI or [VoxelGI]. Screen-space indirect "
"lighting is not affected by individual light's [member "
"Light3D.light_indirect_energy].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSIL is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The brightness multiplier for the screen-space indirect lighting effect. A "
"higher value will result in brighter light."
msgstr ""
"O multiplicador de brilho para o efeito de iluminação indireta no espaço de "
"tela. Um valor maior resultará em luz mais brilhante."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Amount of normal rejection used when calculating screen-space indirect "
"lighting. Normal rejection uses the normal of a given sample point to reject "
"samples that are facing away from the current pixel. Normal rejection is "
"necessary to avoid light leaking when only one side of an object is "
"illuminated. However, normal rejection can be disabled if light leaking is "
"desirable, such as when the scene mostly contains emissive objects that emit "
"light from faces that cannot be seen from the camera."
msgstr ""
"Quantidade de rejeição normal usada ao calcular iluminação indireta em "
"espaço de tela. A rejeição normal usa a normal de um determinado ponto de "
"amostra para rejeitar amostras que estão voltadas para longe do pixel atual. "
"A rejeição normal é necessária para evitar vazamento de luz quando apenas um "
"lado de um objeto é iluminado. No entanto, a rejeição normal pode ser "
"desativada se o vazamento de luz for desejável, como quando a cena contém "
"principalmente objetos emissivos que emitem luz de faces que não podem ser "
"vistas da câmera."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The distance that bounced lighting can travel when using the screen space "
"indirect lighting effect. A larger value will result in light bouncing "
"further in a scene, but may result in under-sampling artifacts which look "
"like long spikes surrounding light sources."
msgstr ""
"A distância que a iluminação rebatida pode percorrer ao usar o efeito de "
"iluminação indireta no espaço de tela. Um valor maior resultará em luz "
"rebatendo mais longe em uma cena, mas pode resultar em artefatos de sub-"
"amostragem que parecem longas pontas ao redor das fontes de luz."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The amount that the screen-space indirect lighting effect is allowed to blur "
"over the edges of objects. Setting too high will result in aliasing around "
"the edges of objects. Setting too low will make object edges appear blurry."
msgstr ""
"A quantidade que o efeito de iluminação indireta no espaço de tela tem "
"permissão para desfocar sobre as bordas dos objetos. Definir muito alto "
"resultará em aliasing ao redor das bordas dos objetos. Definir muito baixo "
"fará com que as bordas dos objetos apareçam borradas."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The depth tolerance for screen-space reflections."
msgstr "A tolerância de profundidade para reflexões no espaço de tela."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], screen-space reflections are enabled. Screen-space "
"reflections are more accurate than reflections from [VoxelGI]s or "
"[ReflectionProbe]s, but are slower and can't reflect surfaces occluded by "
"others.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSR is only supported in the Forward+ rendering method, not "
"Mobile or Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] SSR is not supported on viewports that have a transparent "
"background (where [member Viewport.transparent_bg] is [code]true[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The fade-in distance for screen-space reflections. Affects the area from the "
"reflected material to the screen-space reflection. Only positive values are "
"valid (negative values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code])."
msgstr ""
"A distância de surgimento gradual para reflexões no espaço de tela. Afeta a "
"área do material refletido até a reflexão no espaço de tela. Apenas valores "
"positivos são válidos (valores negativos serão limitados a [code]0.0[/code])."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The fade-out distance for screen-space reflections. Affects the area from "
"the screen-space reflection to the \"global\" reflection. Only positive "
"values are valid (negative values will be clamped to [code]0.0[/code])."
msgstr ""
"A distância de desaparecimento gradual para reflexões no espaço de tela. "
"Afeta a área da reflexão no espaço de tela até a reflexão \"global\". Apenas "
"valores positivos são válidos (valores negativos serão limitados a "
"[code]0.0[/code])."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum number of steps for screen-space reflections. Higher values are "
"slower."
msgstr ""
"O número máximo de etapas para reflexões no espaço de tela. Valores mais "
"altos são mais lentos."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Increasing [member tonemap_agx_contrast] will make dark values darker and "
"bright values brighter. Produces a higher quality result than [member "
"adjustment_contrast] without any additional performance cost, but is only "
"available when using the [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX] tonemapper."
msgstr ""
"Aumentar [member tonemap_agx_contrast] tornará os valores escuros mais "
"escuros e os valores claros mais claros. Produz um resultado de maior "
"qualidade do que [member adjustment_contrast] sem custo adicional de "
"desempenho, mas está disponível apenas ao usar o mapeador de tons [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_AGX]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The white reference value for tonemapping, which indicates where bright "
"white is located in the scale of values provided to the tonemapper. For "
"photorealistic lighting, it is recommended to set [member tonemap_agx_white] "
"to at least [code]6.0[/code]. Higher values result in less blown out "
"highlights, but may make the scene appear lower contrast. [member "
"tonemap_agx_white] is the same as [member tonemap_white], but is only "
"effective with the [constant TONE_MAPPER_AGX] tonemapper. See also [member "
"tonemap_exposure].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile renderer with [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] disabled, [member tonemap_agx_white] is ignored and a "
"white value of [code]2.0[/code] will always be used instead. Otherwise, "
"[member tonemap_agx_white] will be dynamically adjusted at runtime by "
"multiplying it by the parent window's [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] when using [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] "
"to ensure good behavior with both SDR and HDR output."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Adjusts the brightness of values before they are provided to the tonemapper. "
"Higher [member tonemap_exposure] values result in a brighter image. See also "
"[member tonemap_white].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Values provided to the tonemapper will also be multiplied by "
"[code]2.0[/code] and [code]1.8[/code] for [constant TONE_MAPPER_FILMIC] and "
"[constant TONE_MAPPER_ACES] respectively to produce a similar apparent "
"brightness as [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The tonemapping mode to use. Tonemapping is the process that \"converts\" "
"HDR values to be suitable for rendering on an LDR display. (Godot doesn't "
"support rendering on HDR displays yet.)"
msgstr ""
"O modo de mapeamento de tom a ser usado. O mapeamento de tom é o processo "
"que \"converte\" valores HDR para serem adequados para renderização em uma "
"tela LDR (o Godot ainda não suporta renderização em telas HDR.)"

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The white reference value for tonemapping, which indicates where bright "
"white is located in the scale of values provided to the tonemapper. For "
"photorealistic lighting, it is recommended to set [member tonemap_white] to "
"at least [code]6.0[/code]. Higher values result in less blown out "
"highlights, but may make the scene appear lower contrast. [member "
"tonemap_agx_white] will be used instead when using the [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_AGX] tonemapper. See also [member tonemap_exposure].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member tonemap_white] must be set to [code]2.0[/code] or lower "
"on the Mobile renderer to produce bright images.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member tonemap_white] is ignored when using [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] and will be dynamically adjusted at runtime to never be "
"less than the parent window's [method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] "
"when using [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT] with [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The [Color] of the volumetric fog when interacting with lights. Mist and fog "
"have an albedo close to [code]Color(1, 1, 1, 1)[/code] while smoke has a "
"darker albedo."
msgstr ""
"A [Color] da névoa volumétrica ao interagir com luzes. Névoa e neblina têm "
"um albedo próximo de [code]Color(1, 1, 1, 1)[/code], enquanto a fumaça tem "
"um albedo mais escuro."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Scales the strength of ambient light used in the volumetric fog. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] means that ambient light will not impact the volumetric "
"fog. [member volumetric_fog_ambient_inject] has a small performance cost "
"when set above [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This has no visible effect if [member volumetric_fog_density] "
"is [code]0.0[/code] or if [member volumetric_fog_albedo] is a fully black "
"color."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The direction of scattered light as it goes through the volumetric fog. A "
"value close to [code]1.0[/code] means almost all light is scattered forward. "
"A value close to [code]0.0[/code] means light is scattered equally in all "
"directions. A value close to [code]-1.0[/code] means light is scattered "
"mostly backward. Fog and mist scatter light slightly forward, while smoke "
"scatters light equally in all directions."
msgstr ""
"A direção da luz espalhada à medida que passa pela névoa volumétrica. Um "
"valor próximo a [code]1.0[/code] significa que quase toda a luz é espalhada "
"para a frente. Um valor próximo a [code]0.0[/code] significa que a luz é "
"espalhada igualmente em todas as direções. Um valor próximo a [code]-1.0[/"
"code] significa que a luz é espalhada principalmente para trás. A névoa e a "
"neblina espalham a luz ligeiramente para a frente, enquanto a fumaça espalha "
"a luz igualmente em todas as direções."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The base [i]exponential[/i] density of the volumetric fog. Set this to the "
"lowest density you want to have globally. [FogVolume]s can be used to add to "
"or subtract from this density in specific areas. Fog rendering is "
"exponential as in real life.\n"
"A value of [code]0.0[/code] disables global volumetric fog while allowing "
"[FogVolume]s to display volumetric fog in specific areas.\n"
"To make volumetric fog work as a volumetric [i]lighting[/i] solution, set "
"[member volumetric_fog_density] to the lowest non-zero value ([code]0.0001[/"
"code]) then increase lights' [member Light3D.light_volumetric_fog_energy] to "
"values between [code]10000[/code] and [code]100000[/code] to compensate for "
"the very low density."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The distribution of size down the length of the froxel buffer. A higher "
"value compresses the froxels closer to the camera and places more detail "
"closer to the camera."
msgstr ""
"A distribuição de tamanho ao longo do comprimento do buffer de froxels. Um "
"valor mais alto comprime os froxels mais perto da câmera e coloca mais "
"detalhes mais perto da câmera."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The emitted light from the volumetric fog. Even with emission, volumetric "
"fog will not cast light onto other surfaces. Emission is useful to establish "
"an ambient color. As the volumetric fog effect uses single-scattering only, "
"fog tends to need a little bit of emission to soften the harsh shadows."
msgstr ""
"A luz emitida pela névoa volumétrica. Mesmo com emissão, a névoa volumétrica "
"não projetará luz em outras superfícies. A emissão é útil para estabelecer "
"uma cor ambiente. Como o efeito de névoa volumétrica usa apenas dispersão "
"única, a névoa tende a precisar de um pouco de emissão para suavizar as "
"sombras fortes."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "The brightness of the emitted light from the volumetric fog."
msgstr "O brilho da luz emitida pela névoa volumétrica."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Enables the volumetric fog effect. Volumetric fog uses a screen-aligned "
"froxel buffer to calculate accurate volumetric scattering in the short to "
"medium range. Volumetric fog interacts with [FogVolume]s and lights to "
"calculate localized and global fog. Volumetric fog uses a PBR single-"
"scattering model based on extinction, scattering, and emission which it "
"exposes to users as density, albedo, and emission.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Volumetric fog is only supported in the Forward+ rendering "
"method, not Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Scales the strength of Global Illumination used in the volumetric fog's "
"albedo color. A value of [code]0.0[/code] means that Global Illumination "
"will not impact the volumetric fog. [member volumetric_fog_gi_inject] has a "
"small performance cost when set above [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This has no visible effect if [member volumetric_fog_density] "
"is [code]0.0[/code] or if [member volumetric_fog_albedo] is a fully black "
"color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only [VoxelGI] and SDFGI ([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]) "
"are taken into account when using [member volumetric_fog_gi_inject]. Global "
"illumination from [LightmapGI], [ReflectionProbe] and SSIL (see [member "
"ssil_enabled]) will be ignored by volumetric fog."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The distance over which the volumetric fog is computed. Increase to compute "
"fog over a greater range, decrease to add more detail when a long range is "
"not needed. For best quality fog, keep this as low as possible. See also "
"[member ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/volumetric_fog/volume_depth]."
msgstr ""
"A distância na qual a névoa volumétrica é computada. Aumente para computar a "
"névoa em um intervalo maior, diminua para adicionar mais detalhes quando um "
"longo alcance não for necessário. Para a névoa de melhor qualidade, mantenha "
"isso o mais baixo possível. Veja também [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"environment/volumetric_fog/volume_depth]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The factor to use when affecting the sky with volumetric fog. [code]1.0[/"
"code] means that volumetric fog can fully obscure the sky. Lower values "
"reduce the impact of volumetric fog on sky rendering, with [code]0.0[/code] "
"not affecting sky rendering at all.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member volumetric_fog_sky_affect] also affects [FogVolume]s, "
"even if [member volumetric_fog_density] is [code]0.0[/code]. If you notice "
"[FogVolume]s are disappearing when looking towards the sky, set [member "
"volumetric_fog_sky_affect] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"The amount by which to blend the last frame with the current frame. A higher "
"number results in smoother volumetric fog, but makes \"ghosting\" much "
"worse. A lower value reduces ghosting but can result in the per-frame "
"temporal jitter becoming visible."
msgstr ""
"A quantidade pela qual misturar o último quadro com o quadro atual. Um "
"número maior resulta em um nevoeiro volumétrico mais suave, mas piora muito "
"o \"ghosting\". Um valor menor reduz o \"ghosting\", mas pode tornar a "
"instabilidade temporal por quadro visível."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Enables temporal reprojection in the volumetric fog. Temporal reprojection "
"blends the current frame's volumetric fog with the last frame's volumetric "
"fog to smooth out jagged edges. The performance cost is minimal; however, it "
"leads to moving [FogVolume]s and [Light3D]s \"ghosting\" and leaving a trail "
"behind them. When temporal reprojection is enabled, try to avoid moving "
"[FogVolume]s or [Light3D]s too fast. Short-lived dynamic lighting effects "
"should have [member Light3D.light_volumetric_fog_energy] set to [code]0.0[/"
"code] to avoid ghosting."
msgstr ""
"Habilita a reprojeção temporal na névoa volumétrica. A reprojeção temporal "
"mescla a névoa volumétrica do quadro atual com a névoa volumétrica do último "
"quadro para suavizar bordas serrilhadas. O custo de desempenho é mínimo; no "
"entanto, faz com que [FogVolume]s e [Light3D]s em movimento criem efeito "
"\"fantasma\" e deixem um rastro para trás. Quando a reprojeção temporal "
"estiver habilitada, tente evitar mover [FogVolume]s ou [Light3D]s muito "
"rápido. Efeitos de iluminação dinâmica de curta duração devem ter [member "
"Light3D.light_volumetric_fog_energy] definido como [code]0.0[/code] para "
"evitar efeitos fantasma."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the background using the clear color defined in [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/defaults/default_clear_color]."
msgstr ""
"Limpa o fundo usando a cor de limpeza definida em [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/defaults/default_clear_color]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "Clears the background using a custom clear color."
msgstr "Limpa o plano de fundo usando uma cor de limpeza personalizada."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "Displays a user-defined sky in the background."
msgstr "Exibe um céu definido pelo usuário ao fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "Displays a [CanvasLayer] in the background."
msgstr "Exibe um [CanvasLayer] no fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Keeps on screen every pixel drawn in the background. This is the fastest "
"background mode, but it can only be safely used in fully-interior scenes (no "
"visible sky or sky reflections). If enabled in a scene where the background "
"is visible, \"ghost trail\" artifacts will be visible when moving the camera."
msgstr ""
"Mantém na tela cada pixel desenhado no fundo. Este é o modo de fundo mais "
"rápido, mas só pode ser usado com segurança em cenas totalmente internas "
"(sem céu visível ou reflexos do céu). Se ativado em uma cena onde o fundo é "
"visível, artefatos de \"trilha fantasma\" ficarão visíveis ao mover a câmera."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Displays a camera feed in the background."
msgstr "Exibe um feed de câmera ao fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum BGMode] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum BGMode]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Gather ambient light from whichever source is specified as the background."
msgstr "Coleta luz ambiente de qual seja a fonte especificada como fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Disable ambient light. This provides a slight performance boost over "
"[constant AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."
msgstr ""
"Desativa a luz ambiente. Isso fornece um leve ganho de desempenho em "
"comparação com [constant AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Specify a specific [Color] for ambient light. This provides a slight "
"performance boost over [constant AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."
msgstr ""
"Especifica um [Color] específico para luz ambiente. Isso fornece um leve "
"aumento de desempenho em comparação com [constant AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY]."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Gather ambient light from the [Sky] regardless of what the background is."
msgstr "Coleta luz ambiente do [Sky], independentemente de qual seja o fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Use the background for reflections."
msgstr "Usar o plano de fundo para reflexos."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Disable reflections. This provides a slight performance boost over other "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Desativa reflexões. Isso fornece um leve ganho de desempenho em relação a "
"outras opções."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Use the [Sky] for reflections regardless of what the background is."
msgstr "Usa o [Sky] para reflexões, independentemente de qual seja o fundo."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Does not modify color data, resulting in a linear tonemapping curve which "
"unnaturally clips bright values, causing bright lighting to look blown out. "
"The simplest and fastest tonemapper."
msgstr ""
"Não modifica os dados de cor, resultando em uma curva de mapeamento de tom "
"linear que corta valores brilhantes de forma não natural, fazendo com que a "
"iluminação brilhante pareça estourada. O mapeador de tom mais simples e "
"rápido."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"A simple tonemapping curve that rolls off bright values to prevent clipping. "
"This results in an image that can appear dull and low contrast. Slower than "
"[constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [member tonemap_white] is left at the default value of "
"[code]1.0[/code], [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT] produces an identical "
"image to [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Uses a film-like tonemapping curve to prevent clipping of bright values and "
"provide better contrast than [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT]. Slightly "
"slower than [constant TONE_MAPPER_REINHARDT].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapper does not support HDR output because it produces "
"output in the SDR range. It is recommended to use a different tonemapper "
"when rendering to an HDR screen."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Uses a high-contrast film-like tonemapping curve and desaturates bright "
"values for a more realistic appearance. Slightly slower than [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_FILMIC].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapping operator is called \"ACES Fitted\" in Godot "
"3.x.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This tonemapper does not support HDR output because it produces "
"output in the SDR range. It is recommended to use a different tonemapper "
"when rendering to an HDR screen."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Uses an adjustable film-like tonemapping curve and desaturates bright values "
"for a more realistic appearance. Better than other tonemappers at "
"maintaining the hue of colors as they become brighter. The slowest "
"tonemapping option."
msgstr ""
"Usa uma curva de mapeamento de tons (tonemapping) semelhante a filme "
"ajustável e dessatura valores brilhantes para uma aparência mais realista. "
"Melhor do que outros mapeadores de tons na manutenção do matiz das cores "
"conforme elas se tornam mais brilhantes. A opção de mapeamento de tons mais "
"lenta."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Adds the glow effect to the scene."
msgstr "Adiciona o efeito de brilho à cena."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the glow effect to the scene after modifying the glow influence based "
"on the scene value; dark values will be highly influenced by glow and bright "
"values will not be influenced by glow. This approach avoids bright values "
"becoming overly bright from the glow effect. [member tonemap_white] is used "
"to determine the maximum scene value where the glow should have no "
"influence. When [member tonemap_mode] is set to [constant "
"TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] and [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] is [code]true[/code], "
"the parent window's [method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] will be used "
"as the maximum scene value."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona o efeito de brilho à cena após modificar a influência do brilho com "
"base no valor da cena; valores escuros serão fortemente influenciados pelo "
"brilho e valores claros não serão influenciados pelo brilho. Esta abordagem "
"evita que valores claros fiquem excessivamente brilhantes devido ao efeito "
"de brilho. [member tonemap_white] é usado para determinar o valor máximo da "
"cena onde o brilho não deve ter influência. Quando [member tonemap_mode] é "
"definido como [constant TONE_MAPPER_LINEAR] e [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] é "
"[code]true[/code], o [method Window.get_output_max_linear_value] da janela "
"pai será usado como o valor máximo da cena."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the glow effect to the tonemapped image after modifying the glow "
"influence based on the image value; dark values and bright values will not "
"be influenced by glow and mid-range values will be highly influenced by "
"glow. This approach avoids bright values becoming overly bright from the "
"glow effect. The glow will have the largest influence on image values of "
"[code]0.25[/code] and will have no influence when applied to image values "
"greater than [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This blend mode does not support HDR output because expects a "
"maximum output value of [code]1.0[/code]. It is recommended to use a "
"different blend mode when rendering to an HDR screen."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces all pixels' color by the glow effect. This can be used to simulate "
"a full-screen blur effect by tweaking the glow parameters to match the "
"original image's brightness or to preview glow configuration in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Substitui a cor de todos os pixels pelo efeito de brilho. Isso pode ser "
"usado para simular um efeito de desfoque em tela cheia, ajustando os "
"parâmetros de brilho para corresponder ao brilho da imagem original ou para "
"pré-visualizar a configuração de brilho no editor."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml
msgid ""
"Mixes the glow image with the scene image. Best used with [member "
"glow_bloom] to avoid darkening the scene."
msgstr ""
"Mistura a imagem de brilho com a imagem da cena. Melhor usado com [member "
"glow_bloom] para evitar o escurecimento da cena."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Use a physically-based fog model defined primarily by fog density."
msgstr ""
"Usa um modelo de névoa baseado em física definido principalmente pela "
"densidade da névoa."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Use a simple fog model defined by start and end positions and a custom "
"curve. While not physically accurate, this model can be useful when you need "
"more artistic control."
msgstr ""
"Usa um modelo de névoa simples definido por posições inicial e final e uma "
"curva personalizada. Embora não seja fisicamente preciso, este modelo pode "
"ser útil quando você precisa de mais controle artístico."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Use 50% scale for SDFGI on the Y (vertical) axis. SDFGI cells will be twice "
"as short as they are wide. This allows providing increased GI detail and "
"reduced light leaking with thin floors and ceilings. This is usually the "
"best choice for scenes that don't feature much verticality."
msgstr ""
"Use uma escala de 50% para o SDFGI no eixo Y (vertical). As células do SDFGI "
"serão duas vezes mais baixas do que largas. Isso permite fornecer maior "
"detalhe de GI e redução de vazamento de luz com pisos e tetos finos. Esta é "
"geralmente a melhor escolha para cenas que não apresentam muita "
"verticalidade."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Use 75% scale for SDFGI on the Y (vertical) axis. This is a balance between "
"the 50% and 100% SDFGI Y scales."
msgstr ""
"Usa escala de 75% para SDFGI no eixo Y (vertical). Este é um equilíbrio "
"entre as escalas SDFGI Y de 50% e 100%."

#: doc/classes/Environment.xml doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid ""
"Use 100% scale for SDFGI on the Y (vertical) axis. SDFGI cells will be as "
"tall as they are wide. This is usually the best choice for highly vertical "
"scenes. The downside is that light leaking may become more noticeable with "
"thin floors and ceilings."
msgstr ""
"Usa escala de 100% para SDFGI no eixo Y (vertical). As células SDFGI serão "
"tão altas quanto largas. Esta é geralmente a melhor escolha para cenas "
"altamente verticais. A desvantagem é que o vazamento de luz pode se tornar "
"mais perceptível com pisos e tetos finos."

#: doc/classes/Expression.xml
msgid "A class that stores an expression you can execute."
msgstr "Uma classe que armazena uma expressão que você pode executar."

#: doc/classes/Expression.xml
msgid ""
"An expression can be made of any arithmetic operation, built-in math "
"function call, method call of a passed instance, or built-in type "
"construction call.\n"
"An example expression text using the built-in math functions could be "
"[code]sqrt(pow(3, 2) + pow(4, 2))[/code].\n"
"In the following example we use a [LineEdit] node to write our expression "
"and show the result.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var expression = Expression.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t$LineEdit.text_submitted.connect(self._on_text_submitted)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_text_submitted(command):\n"
"\tvar error = expression.parse(command)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tprint(expression.get_error_text())\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\tvar result = expression.execute()\n"
"\tif not expression.has_execute_failed():\n"
"\t\t$LineEdit.text = str(result)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private Expression _expression = new Expression();\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").TextSubmitted += OnTextEntered;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnTextEntered(string command)\n"
"{\n"
"\tError error = _expression.Parse(command);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(_expression.GetErrorText());\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tVariant result = _expression.Execute();\n"
"\tif (!_expression.HasExecuteFailed())\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").Text = result.ToString();\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Uma expressão pode ser composta por qualquer operação aritmética, chamada de "
"função matemática nativa, chamada de método de uma instância passada ou "
"chamada de construção de tipo nativo.\n"
"Um exemplo de texto de expressão usando as funções matemáticas nativas pode "
"ser [code]sqrt(pow(3, 2) + pow(4, 2))[/code].\n"
"No exemplo a seguir, usamos um nó [LineEdit] para escrever nossa expressão e "
"mostrar o resultado.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var expression = Expression.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t$LineEdit.text_submitted.connect(self._on_text_submitted)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_text_submitted(command):\n"
"\tvar error = expression.parse(command)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tprint(expression.get_error_text())\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\tvar result = expression.execute()\n"
"\tif not expression.has_execute_failed():\n"
"\t\t$LineEdit.text = str(result)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private Expression _expression = new Expression();\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").TextSubmitted += OnTextEntered;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void OnTextEntered(string command)\n"
"{\n"
"\tError error = _expression.Parse(command);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(_expression.GetErrorText());\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tVariant result = _expression.Execute();\n"
"\tif (!_expression.HasExecuteFailed())\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGetNode<LineEdit>(\"LineEdit\").Text = result.ToString();\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Expression.xml
msgid "Evaluating Expressions"
msgstr "Avaliando Expressões"

#: doc/classes/Expression.xml
msgid ""
"Executes the expression that was previously parsed by [method parse] and "
"returns the result. Before you use the returned object, you should check if "
"the method failed by calling [method has_execute_failed].\n"
"If you defined input variables in [method parse], you can specify their "
"values in the inputs array, in the same order."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Expression.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the error text if [method parse] or [method execute] has failed."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o texto do erro se [method parse] ou [method execute] falharem."

#: doc/classes/Expression.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if [method execute] has failed."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se [method execute] falhou."

#: doc/classes/Expression.xml
msgid ""
"Parses the expression and returns an [enum Error] code.\n"
"You can optionally specify names of variables that may appear in the "
"expression with [param input_names], so that you can bind them when it gets "
"executed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ExternalTexture.xml
msgid "Texture which displays the content of an external buffer."
msgstr "Textura que exibe o conteúdo de um buffer externo."

#: doc/classes/ExternalTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Displays the content of an external buffer provided by the platform.\n"
"Requires the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/extensions/OES/"
"OES_EGL_image_external.txt]OES_EGL_image_external[/url] extension (OpenGL) "
"or [url=https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.1-extensions/html/"
"vkspec.html#VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer]VK_ANDROID_external_memory_android_hardware_buffer[/"
"url] extension (Vulkan).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is currently only supported in Android builds."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ExternalTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the external texture ID.\n"
"Depending on your use case, you may need to pass this to platform APIs, for "
"example, when creating an [code]android.graphics.SurfaceTexture[/code] on "
"Android."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ExternalTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the external buffer ID.\n"
"Depending on your use case, you may need to call this with data received "
"from a platform API, for example, [code]SurfaceTexture.getHardwareBuffer()[/"
"code] on Android."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ExternalTexture.xml
msgid "External texture size."
msgstr "Tamanho da textura externa."

#: doc/classes/FABRIK3D.xml
msgid "Position based forward and backward reaching inverse kinematics solver."
msgstr ""
"Solucionador de cinemática inversa de alcance anterior e posterior baseado "
"em posição."

#: doc/classes/FABRIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"[FABRIK3D] is position based IK, allowing precise and accurate tracking of "
"targets. It's ideal for simple chains without limitations.\n"
"The resulting twist around the forward vector will always be kept from the "
"previous pose.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the target is close to the root, it tends to produce zig-"
"zag patterns, resulting in unnatural visual movement."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FABRIK3D.xml doc/classes/IKModifier3D.xml
msgid "Inverse Kinematics Returns to Godot 4.6 - IKModifier3D"
msgstr "Cinemática inversa retorna ao Godot 4.6 - IKModifier3D"

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Generates noise using the FastNoiseLite library."
msgstr "Gera ruído usando a biblioteca FastNoiseLite."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"This class generates noise using the FastNoiseLite library, which is a "
"collection of several noise algorithms including Cellular, Perlin, Value, "
"and more.\n"
"Most generated noise values are in the range of [code][-1, 1][/code], but "
"not always. Some of the cellular noise algorithms return results above "
"[code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Determines how the distance to the nearest/second-nearest point is computed."
msgstr ""
"Determina como a distância até o ponto mais próximo/segundo mais próximo é "
"calculada."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum distance a point can move off of its grid position. Set to [code]0[/"
"code] for an even grid."
msgstr ""
"Distância máxima que um ponto pode se mover de sua posição na grade. Defina "
"como [code]0[/code] para uma grade uniforme."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Return type from cellular noise calculations."
msgstr "Tipo de retorno dos cálculos de ruído celular."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum warp distance from the origin."
msgstr "Define a distância máxima de warp a partir da origem."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, another FastNoiseLite instance is used to warp the space, "
"resulting in a distortion of the noise."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, outra instância do FastNoiseLite é usada para distorcer o "
"espaço, resultando em uma distorção do ruído."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Determines the strength of each subsequent layer of the noise which is used "
"to warp the space.\n"
"A low value places more emphasis on the lower frequency base layers, while a "
"high value puts more emphasis on the higher frequency layers."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The change in frequency between octaves, also known as \"lacunarity\", of "
"the fractal noise which warps the space. Increasing this value results in "
"higher octaves, producing noise with finer details and a rougher appearance."
msgstr ""
"A mudança na frequência entre oitavas, também conhecida como "
"\"lacunaridade\", do ruído fractal que deforma o espaço. Aumentar este valor "
"resulta em oitavas mais altas, produzindo ruído com detalhes mais finos e "
"uma aparência mais áspera."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The number of noise layers that are sampled to get the final value for the "
"fractal noise which warps the space."
msgstr ""
"O número de camadas de ruído que são amostradas para obter o valor final do "
"ruído fractal que deforma o espaço."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The method for combining octaves into a fractal which is used to warp the "
"space."
msgstr ""
"O método para combinar oitavas em um fractal que é usado para distorcer o "
"espaço."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Frequency of the noise which warps the space. Low frequency results in "
"smooth noise while high frequency results in rougher, more granular noise."
msgstr ""
"Frequência do ruído que distorce o espaço. Baixa frequência resulta em um "
"ruído suave, enquanto alta frequência resulta em um ruído mais áspero e "
"granular."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "The warp algorithm."
msgstr "O algoritmo de deformação."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Determines the strength of each subsequent layer of noise in fractal noise.\n"
"A low value places more emphasis on the lower frequency base layers, while a "
"high value puts more emphasis on the higher frequency layers."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Frequency multiplier between subsequent octaves. Increasing this value "
"results in higher octaves producing noise with finer details and a rougher "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador de frequência entre oitavas subsequentes. O aumento desse "
"valor resulta em oitavas superiores produzindo ruído com detalhes mais finos "
"e uma aparência mais áspera."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The number of noise layers that are sampled to get the final value for "
"fractal noise types."
msgstr ""
"O número de camadas de ruído que são amostradas para obter o valor final "
"para tipos de ruído fractal."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Sets the strength of the fractal ping pong type."
msgstr "Define a intensidade do tipo fractal pingue-pongue."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "The method for combining octaves into a fractal."
msgstr "O método para combinar oitavas em um fractal."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Higher weighting means higher octaves have less impact if lower octaves have "
"a large impact."
msgstr ""
"Uma ponderação maior significa que oitavas mais altas têm menos impacto se "
"oitavas mais baixas tiverem um grande impacto."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The frequency for all noise types. Low frequency results in smooth noise "
"while high frequency results in rougher, more granular noise."
msgstr ""
"A frequência para todos os tipos de ruído. Baixa frequência resulta em ruído "
"suave, enquanto alta frequência resulta em ruído mais áspero e granulado."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "The noise algorithm used."
msgstr "O algoritmo de ruído usado."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Translate the noise input coordinates by the given [Vector3]."
msgstr ""
"Transladar as coordenadas de entrada de ruído pelo [Vector3] fornecido."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "The random number seed for all noise types."
msgstr "A semente de número aleatório para todos os tipos de ruído."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"A lattice of points are assigned random values then interpolated based on "
"neighboring values."
msgstr ""
"A uma rede de pontos são atribuídos valores aleatórios e, em seguida, "
"interpolados com base nos valores vizinhos."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to value noise ([constant TYPE_VALUE]), but slower. Has more "
"variance in peaks and valleys.\n"
"Cubic noise can be used to avoid certain artifacts when using value noise to "
"create a bumpmap. In general, you should always use this mode if the value "
"noise is being used for a heightmap or bumpmap."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"A lattice of random gradients. Their dot products are interpolated to obtain "
"values in between the lattices."
msgstr ""
"Uma rede de gradientes aleatórios. Seus produtos escalares são interpolados "
"para obter valores intermediários às redes."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Cellular includes both Worley noise and Voronoi diagrams which creates "
"various regions of the same value."
msgstr ""
"O celular inclui tanto o ruído Worley quanto os diagramas de Voronoi, o que "
"cria várias regiões do mesmo valor."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"As opposed to [constant TYPE_PERLIN], gradients exist in a simplex lattice "
"rather than a grid lattice, avoiding directional artifacts. Internally uses "
"FastNoiseLite's OpenSimplex2 noise type."
msgstr ""
"Ao contrário de [constant TYPE_PERLIN], os gradientes existem em uma rede "
"simplex em vez de uma rede em grade, evitando artefatos direcionais. Usa "
"internamente o tipo de ruído OpenSimplex2 do FastNoiseLite."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Modified, higher quality version of [constant TYPE_SIMPLEX], but slower. "
"Internally uses FastNoiseLite's OpenSimplex2S noise type."
msgstr ""
"Versão modificada e de maior qualidade de [constant TYPE_SIMPLEX], mas mais "
"lenta. Usa internamente o tipo de ruído OpenSimplex2S do FastNoiseLite."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "No fractal noise."
msgstr "Sem ruído fractal."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Method using Fractional Brownian Motion to combine octaves into a fractal."
msgstr ""
"Método usando Movimento Browniano Fracionário para combinar oitavas em um "
"fractal."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Method of combining octaves into a fractal resulting in a \"ridged\" look."
msgstr ""
"Método de combinar oitavas em um fractal resultando em uma aparência rugosa."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Method of combining octaves into a fractal with a ping pong effect."
msgstr ""
"Método de combinação de oitavas em um fractal com um efeito pingue-pongue."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Euclidean distance to the nearest point."
msgstr "Distância euclidiana até o ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Squared Euclidean distance to the nearest point."
msgstr "Distância euclidiana ao quadrado até o ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "Manhattan distance (taxicab metric) to the nearest point."
msgstr "Distância de Manhattan (métrica de táxi) até o ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Blend of [constant DISTANCE_EUCLIDEAN] and [constant DISTANCE_MANHATTAN] to "
"give curved cell boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Mistura de [constant DISTANCE_EUCLIDEAN] e [constant DISTANCE_MANHATTAN] "
"para dar limites de célula curvos."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The cellular distance function will return the same value for all points "
"within a cell."
msgstr ""
"A função de distância celular retornará o mesmo valor para todos os pontos "
"dentro de uma célula."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The cellular distance function will return a value determined by the "
"distance to the nearest point."
msgstr ""
"A função de distância celular retornará um valor determinado pela distância "
"até o ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The cellular distance function returns the distance to the second-nearest "
"point."
msgstr ""
"A função de distância celular retorna a distância para o segundo ponto mais "
"próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is added to the distance to the second-"
"nearest point."
msgstr ""
"A distância até o ponto mais próximo é adicionada à distância até o segundo "
"ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is subtracted from the distance to the "
"second-nearest point."
msgstr ""
"A distância até o ponto mais próximo é subtraída da distância até o segundo "
"ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is multiplied with the distance to the "
"second-nearest point."
msgstr ""
"A distância até o ponto mais próximo é multiplicada pela distância até o "
"segundo ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest point is divided by the distance to the second-"
"nearest point."
msgstr ""
"A distância até o ponto mais próximo é dividida pela distância até o segundo "
"ponto mais próximo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "The domain is warped using the simplex noise algorithm."
msgstr "O domínio é distorcido usando o algoritmo de ruído simplex."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The domain is warped using a simplified version of the simplex noise "
"algorithm."
msgstr ""
"O domínio é distorcido usando uma versão simplificada do algoritmo de ruído "
"simplex."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"The domain is warped using a simple noise grid (not as smooth as the other "
"methods, but more performant)."
msgstr ""
"O domínio é deformado usando uma grade de ruído simples (não tão suave "
"quanto os outros métodos, mas com melhor desempenho)."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid "No fractal noise for warping the space."
msgstr "Sem ruído fractal para deformar o espaço."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Warping the space progressively, octave for octave, resulting in a more "
"\"liquified\" distortion."
msgstr ""
"Deformando o espaço progressivamente, oitava por oitava, resultando em uma "
"distorção mais \"liquidificada\"."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/FastNoiseLite.xml
msgid ""
"Warping the space independently for each octave, resulting in a more chaotic "
"distortion."
msgstr ""
"Deforma o espaço de forma independente para cada oitava, resultando em uma "
"distorção mais caótica."

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/FBXDocument.xml
msgid "Handles FBX documents."
msgstr "Lida com documentos FBX."

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/FBXDocument.xml
msgid ""
"The FBXDocument handles FBX documents. It provides methods to append data "
"from buffers or files, generate scenes, and register/unregister document "
"extensions.\n"
"When exporting FBX from Blender, use the \"FBX Units Scale\" option. The "
"\"FBX Units Scale\" option sets the correct scale factor and avoids manual "
"adjustments when re-importing into Blender, such as through glTF export."
msgstr ""

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/FBXState.xml
msgid "The FBXState handles the state data imported from FBX files."
msgstr "O FBXState manipula os dados de estado importados de arquivos FBX."

#: modules/fbx/doc_classes/FBXState.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the import process used auxiliary nodes called "
"geometry helper nodes. These nodes help preserve the pivots and "
"transformations of the original 3D model during import."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o processo de importação usou nós auxiliares chamados "
"nós auxiliares de geometria. Esses nós ajudam a preservar os pivôs e "
"transformações do modelo 3D original durante a importação."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Provides methods for file reading and writing operations."
msgstr "Fornece métodos para operações de leitura e escrita de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"This class can be used to permanently store data in the user device's file "
"system and to read from it. This is useful for storing game save data or "
"player configuration files.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] How to write and read from a file. The file named [code]"
"\"save_game.dat\"[/code] will be stored in the user data folder, as "
"specified in the [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]Data paths[/"
"url] documentation:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func save_to_file(content):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE)\n"
"\tfile.store_string(content)\n"
"\n"
"func load_from_file():\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar content = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\treturn content\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void SaveToFile(string content)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Write);\n"
"\tfile.StoreString(content);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public string LoadFromFile()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\tstring content = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\treturn content;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"A [FileAccess] instance has its own file cursor, which is the position in "
"bytes in the file where the next read/write operation will occur. Functions "
"such as [method get_8], [method get_16], [method store_8], and [method "
"store_16] will move the file cursor forward by the number of bytes read/"
"written. The file cursor can be moved to a specific position using [method "
"seek] or [method seek_end], and its position can be retrieved using [method "
"get_position].\n"
"A [FileAccess] instance will close its file when the instance is freed. "
"Since it inherits [RefCounted], this happens automatically when it is no "
"longer in use. [method close] can be called to close it earlier. In C#, the "
"reference must be disposed manually, which can be done with the [code]using[/"
"code] statement or by calling the [code]Dispose[/code] method directly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To access project resources once exported, it is recommended to "
"use [ResourceLoader] instead of [FileAccess], as some files are converted to "
"engine-specific formats and their original source files might not be present "
"in the exported PCK package. If using [FileAccess], make sure the file is "
"included in the export by changing its import mode to [b]Keep File (exported "
"as is)[/b] in the Import dock, or, for files where this option is not "
"available, change the non-resource export filter in the Export dialog to "
"include the file's extension (e.g. [code]*.txt[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Files are automatically closed only if the process exits "
"\"normally\" (such as by clicking the window manager's close button or "
"pressing [kbd]Alt + F4[/kbd]). If you stop the project execution by pressing "
"[kbd]F8[/kbd] while the project is running, the file won't be closed as the "
"game process will be killed. You can work around this by calling [method "
"flush] at regular intervals."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe pode ser usada para armazenar permanentemente dados no sistema "
"de arquivos do dispositivo do usuário e para ler a partir dele. Isso é útil "
"para armazenar dados de salvamento de jogos ou arquivos de configuração de "
"jogadores.\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Como escrever e ler de um arquivo. O arquivo chamado [code]"
"\"save_game.dat\"[/code] será armazenado na pasta de dados do usuário, "
"conforme especificado na documentação [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/"
"data_paths.html]Caminhos de dados[/url]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func save_to_file(content):\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE)\n"
"\tfile.store_string(content)\n"
"\n"
"func load_from_file():\n"
"\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"user://save_game.dat\", FileAccess.READ)\n"
"\tvar content = file.get_as_text()\n"
"\treturn content\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public void SaveToFile(string content)\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Write);\n"
"\tfile.StoreString(content);\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public string LoadFromFile()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var file = FileAccess.Open(\"user://save_game.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.Read);\n"
"\tstring content = file.GetAsText();\n"
"\treturn content;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Uma instância de [FileAccess] possui seu próprio cursor de arquivo, que é a "
"posição em bytes no arquivo onde a próxima operação de leitura/escrita "
"ocorrerá. Funções como [method get_8], [method get_16], [method store_8] e "
"[method store_16] moverão o cursor do arquivo para frente pelo número de "
"bytes lidos/escritos. O cursor do arquivo pode ser movido para uma posição "
"específica usando [method seek] ou [method seek_end], e sua posição pode ser "
"recuperada usando [method get_position].\n"
"Uma instância de [FileAccess] fechará seu arquivo quando a instância for "
"liberada. Como ela herda [RefCounted], isso acontece automaticamente quando "
"ela não está mais em uso. [method close] pode ser chamada para fechá-la mais "
"cedo. Em C#, a referência deve ser descartada manualmente, o que pode ser "
"feito com a instrução [code]using[/code] ou chamando o método [code]Dispose[/"
"code] diretamente.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para acessar recursos do projeto após a exportação, é "
"recomendado usar [ResourceLoader] em vez de [FileAccess], pois alguns "
"arquivos são convertidos para formatos específicos do motor e seus arquivos "
"de origem originais podem não estar presentes no pacote PCK exportado. Se "
"usar [FileAccess], certifique-se de que o arquivo esteja incluído na "
"exportação alterando seu modo de importação para [b]Manter arquivo "
"(exportado como está)[/b] no painel de Importação, ou, para arquivos onde "
"esta opção não está disponível, altere o filtro de exportação de não "
"recursos no diálogo de Exportação para incluir a extensão do arquivo (por "
"exemplo, [code]*.txt[/code]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Os arquivos são fechados automaticamente apenas se o processo "
"for encerrado \"normalmente\" (como ao clicar no botão de fechar do "
"gerenciador de janelas ou pressionar [kbd]Alt + F4[/kbd]). Se você "
"interromper a execução do projeto pressionando [kbd]F8[/kbd] enquanto o "
"projeto estiver rodando, o arquivo não será fechado, pois o processo do jogo "
"será eliminado. Você pode contornar isso chamando [method flush] em "
"intervalos regulares."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Binary serialization API"
msgstr "API de serialização binária"

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Closes the currently opened file and prevents subsequent read/write "
"operations. Use [method flush] to persist the data to disk without closing "
"the file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileAccess] will automatically close when it's freed, which "
"happens when it goes out of scope or when it gets assigned with [code]null[/"
"code]. In C# the reference must be disposed after we are done using it, this "
"can be done with the [code]using[/code] statement or calling the "
"[code]Dispose[/code] method directly."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a temporary file. This file will be freed when the returned "
"[FileAccess] is freed.\n"
"If [param prefix] is not empty, it will be prefixed to the file name, "
"separated by a [code]-[/code].\n"
"If [param extension] is not empty, it will be appended to the temporary file "
"name.\n"
"If [param keep] is [code]true[/code], the file is not deleted when the "
"returned [FileAccess] is freed.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file cursor has already read past the end "
"of the file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]eof_reached() == false[/code] cannot be used to check "
"whether there is more data available. To loop while there is more data "
"available, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"while file.get_position() < file.get_length():\n"
"\t# Read data\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"while (file.GetPosition() < file.GetLength())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Read data\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o cursor do arquivo já tiver lido além do final "
"do arquivo.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [code]eof_reached() == false[/code] não pode ser usado para "
"verificar se há mais dados disponíveis. Para fazer um loop enquanto houver "
"mais dados disponíveis, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"while file.get_position() < file.get_length():\n"
"\t# Ler dados\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"while (file.GetPosition() < file.GetLength())\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Ler dados\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the file exists in the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Many resources types are imported (e.g. textures or sound "
"files), and their source asset will not be included in the exported game, as "
"only the imported version is used. See [method ResourceLoader.exists] for an "
"alternative approach that takes resource remapping into account.\n"
"For a non-static, relative equivalent, use [method DirAccess.file_exists]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Writes the file's buffer to disk. Flushing is automatically performed when "
"the file is closed. This means you don't need to call [method flush] "
"manually before closing a file. Still, calling [method flush] can be used to "
"ensure the data is safe even if the project crashes instead of being closed "
"gracefully.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only call [method flush] when you actually need it. Otherwise, "
"it will decrease performance due to constant disk writes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next 8 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 1 byte. See [method store_8] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos 8 bits do arquivo como um inteiro. Isso avança o cursor "
"do arquivo em 1 byte. Consulte [method store_8] para detalhes sobre quais "
"valores podem ser armazenados e recuperados desta forma."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next 16 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 2 bytes. See [method store_16] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos 16 bits do arquivo como um inteiro. Isso avança o cursor "
"do arquivo em 2 bytes. Consulte [method store_16] para detalhes sobre quais "
"valores podem ser armazenados e recuperados desta forma."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next 32 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 4 bytes. See [method store_32] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos 32 bits do arquivo como um inteiro. Isso avança o cursor "
"do arquivo em 4 bytes. Consulte [method store_32] para detalhes sobre quais "
"valores podem ser armazenados e recuperados desta forma."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next 64 bits from the file as an integer. This advances the file "
"cursor by 8 bytes. See [method store_64] for details on what values can be "
"stored and retrieved this way."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos 64 bits do arquivo como um inteiro. Isso avança o cursor "
"do arquivo em 8 bytes. Consulte [method store_64] para detalhes sobre quais "
"valores podem ser armazenados e recuperados desta forma."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last time the [param file] was accessed in Unix timestamp "
"format, or [code]0[/code] on error. This Unix timestamp can be converted to "
"another format using the [Time] singleton."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a última vez que o [param file] foi acessado no formato de carimbo "
"de data/hora Unix, ou [code]0[/code] em caso de erro. Este carimbo de data/"
"hora Unix pode ser convertido para outro formato usando o singleton [Time]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the whole file as a [String]. Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 "
"encoded. This ignores the file cursor and does not affect it."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o arquivo inteiro como uma [String]. O texto é interpretado como "
"codificado em UTF-8. Isso ignora o cursor do arquivo e não o afeta."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns next [param length] bytes of the file as a [PackedByteArray]. This "
"advances the file cursor by [param length] bytes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos [param length] bytes do arquivo como um "
"[PackedByteArray]. Isso avança o cursor do arquivo em [param length] bytes."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next value of the file in CSV (Comma-Separated Values) format. "
"You can pass a different delimiter [param delim] to use other than the "
"default [code]\",\"[/code] (comma). This delimiter must be one-character "
"long, and cannot be a double quotation mark.\n"
"Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded. Text values must be enclosed in "
"double quotes if they include the delimiter character. Double quotes within "
"a text value can be escaped by doubling their occurrence. This advances the "
"file cursor to after the newline character at the end of the line.\n"
"For example, the following CSV lines are valid and will be properly parsed "
"as two strings each:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"Alice,\"Hello, Bob!\"\n"
"Bob,Alice! What a surprise!\n"
"Alice,\"I thought you'd reply with \"\"Hello, world\"\".\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Note how the second line can omit the enclosing quotes as it does not "
"include the delimiter. However it [i]could[/i] very well use quotes, it was "
"only written without for demonstration purposes. The third line must use "
"[code]\"\"[/code] for each quotation mark that needs to be interpreted as "
"such instead of the end of a text value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next 64 bits from the file as a floating-point number. This "
"advances the file cursor by 8 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos 64 bits do arquivo como um número de ponto flutuante. "
"Isso avança o cursor do arquivo em 8 bytes."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last error that happened when trying to perform operations. "
"Compare with the [code]ERR_FILE_*[/code] constants from [enum Error]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o último erro ocorrido ao tentar realizar operações. Compare com as "
"constantes [code]ERR_FILE_*[/code] do [enum Error]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Reads the file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a byte "
"array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Reads the file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a "
"UTF-8 encoded string.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of file extended attributes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the whole [param path] file contents as a [PackedByteArray] without "
"any decoding.\n"
"Returns an empty [PackedByteArray] if an error occurred while opening the "
"file. You can use [method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the whole [param path] file contents as a [String]. Text is "
"interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded.\n"
"Returns an empty [String] if an error occurred while opening the file. You "
"can use [method get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next 32 bits from the file as a floating-point number. This "
"advances the file cursor by 4 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos 32 bits do arquivo como um número de ponto flutuante. "
"Isso avança o cursor do arquivo em 4 bytes."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next 16 bits from the file as a half-precision floating-point "
"number. This advances the file cursor by 2 bytes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os próximos 16 bits do arquivo como um número de ponto flutuante de "
"precisão metade. Isso avança o cursor do arquivo em 2 bytes."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [b]hidden[/b] attribute is set on the file "
"at the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o atributo [b]hidden[/b] estiver definido no "
"arquivo localizado no caminho fornecido.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no iOS, BSD, macOS e Windows."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the size of the file in bytes. For a pipe, returns the number of "
"bytes available for reading from the pipe."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho do arquivo em bytes. Para um pipe, retorna o número de "
"bytes disponíveis para leitura no pipe."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next line of the file as a [String]. The returned string doesn't "
"include newline ([code]\\n[/code]) or carriage return ([code]\\r[/code]) "
"characters, but does include any other leading or trailing whitespace. This "
"advances the file cursor to after the newline character at the end of the "
"line.\n"
"Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an MD5 String representing the file at the given path or an empty "
"[String] on failure."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma String MD5 representando o arquivo no caminho fornecido ou um "
"[String] vazio em caso de falha."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last time the [param file] was modified in Unix timestamp "
"format, or [code]0[/code] on error. This Unix timestamp can be converted to "
"another format using the [Time] singleton."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a última vez que o [param file] foi modificado no formato de carimbo "
"de data/hora Unix, ou [code]0[/code] em caso de erro. Este carimbo de data/"
"hora Unix pode ser convertido para outro formato usando o singleton [Time]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [String] saved in Pascal format from the file, meaning that the "
"length of the string is explicitly stored at the start. See [method "
"store_pascal_string]. This may include newline characters. The file cursor "
"is advanced after the bytes read.\n"
"Text is interpreted as being UTF-8 encoded."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Returns the path as a [String] for the current open file."
msgstr "Retorna o caminho como um [String] para o arquivo aberto atual."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Returns the absolute path as a [String] for the current open file."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho absoluto como uma [String] para o arquivo aberto atual."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the file cursor's position in bytes from the beginning of the file. "
"This is the file reading/writing cursor set by [method seek] or [method "
"seek_end] and advanced by read/write operations."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a posição do cursor do arquivo em bytes a partir do início do "
"arquivo. Este é o cursor de leitura/gravação de arquivo definido por [method "
"seek] ou [method seek_end] e avançado por operações de leitura/gravação."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [b]read only[/b] attribute is set on the "
"file at the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o atributo [b]read only[/b] estiver definido no "
"arquivo localizado no caminho fornecido.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no iOS, BSD, macOS e Windows."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next bits from the file as a floating-point number. This "
"advances the file cursor by either 4 or 8 bytes, depending on the precision "
"used by the Godot build that saved the file.\n"
"If the file was saved by a Godot build compiled with the "
"[code]precision=single[/code] option (the default), the number of read bits "
"for that file is 32. Otherwise, if compiled with the [code]precision=double[/"
"code] option, the number of read bits is 64."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an SHA-256 [String] representing the file at the given path or an "
"empty [String] on failure."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma [String] SHA-256 representando o arquivo no caminho dado ou uma "
"[String] vazia em caso de falha."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the size of the file at the given path, in bytes, or [code]-1[/code] "
"on error."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho do arquivo no caminho fornecido, em bytes, ou [code]-1[/"
"code] em caso de erro."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the UNIX permissions of the file at the given path.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, Linux/BSD, and macOS."
msgstr ""
"Retorna as permissões UNIX do arquivo localizado no caminho fornecido.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no iOS, Linux/BSD e macOS."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the next [Variant] value from the file. If [param allow_objects] is "
"[code]true[/code], decoding objects is allowed. This advances the file "
"cursor by the number of bytes read.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same decoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.bytes_to_var] method, as described in the [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.html]Binary serialization API[/url] "
"documentation.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Deserialized objects can contain code which gets executed. "
"Do not use this option if the serialized object comes from untrusted sources "
"to avoid potential security threats such as remote code execution."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o próximo valor [Variant] do arquivo. Se [param allow_objects] for "
"[code]true[/code], a decodificação de objetos será permitida. Isso avança o "
"cursor do arquivo pelo número de bytes lidos.\n"
"Internamente, isso usa o mesmo mecanismo de decodificação que o método "
"[method @GlobalScope.bytes_to_var], conforme descrito na documentação da "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.html]API de "
"serialização binária[/url].\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] Objetos desserializados podem conter código que é executado. "
"Não use esta opção se o objeto serializado vier de fontes não confiáveis "
"para evitar possíveis ameaças de segurança, como execução remota de código."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the file is currently opened."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o arquivo estiver aberto no momento."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens the file for writing or reading, "
"depending on the flags.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens a compressed file for reading or "
"writing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method open_compressed] can only read files that were saved by "
"Godot, not third-party compression formats. See [url=https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/issues/28999]GitHub issue #28999[/url] for a workaround.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens an encrypted file in write or "
"read mode. You need to pass a binary key to encrypt/decrypt it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The provided key must be 32 bytes long.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FileAccess] object and opens an encrypted file in write or "
"read mode. You need to pass a password to encrypt/decrypt it.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if opening the file failed. You can use [method "
"get_open_error] to check the error that occurred."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Removes file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Resizes the file to a specified length. The file must be open in a mode that "
"permits writing. If the file is extended, NUL characters are appended. If "
"the file is truncated, all data from the end file to the original length of "
"the file is lost."
msgstr ""
"Redimensiona o arquivo para um comprimento especificado. O arquivo deve "
"estar aberto em um modo que permita gravação. Se o arquivo for estendido, "
"caracteres NUL serão anexados. Se o arquivo for truncado, todos os dados do "
"final do arquivo até o comprimento original do arquivo serão perdidos."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the file cursor to the specified position in bytes, from the beginning "
"of the file. This changes the value returned by [method get_position]."
msgstr ""
"Define o cursor de arquivo para a posição especificada em bytes, a partir do "
"início do arquivo. Isso altera o valor retornado por [method get_position]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the file cursor to the specified position in bytes, from the end of the "
"file. This changes the value returned by [method get_position].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an offset, so you should use negative numbers otherwise "
"the file cursor will move past the end of the file."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Writes file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a byte "
"array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Writes file extended attribute with name [param attribute_name] as a UTF-8 "
"encoded string.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Extended attributes support depends on the file system. "
"Attributes will be lost when the file is moved between incompatible file "
"systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux, only \"user\" namespace attributes are accessible, "
"namespace prefix should not be included.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Windows, alternate data streams are used to store extended "
"attributes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Sets file [b]hidden[/b] attribute.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Define o atributo [b]hidden[/b] do arquivo.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no iOS, BSD, macOS e Windows."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Sets file [b]read only[/b] attribute.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, BSD, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Define o atributo [b]read only[/b] do arquivo.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no iOS, BSD, macOS e Windows."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Sets file UNIX permissions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on iOS, Linux/BSD, and macOS."
msgstr ""
"Define as permissões UNIX do arquivo.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no iOS, Linux/BSD e macOS."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 8 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 1 "
"byte. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] should lie in the interval [code][0, 255][/"
"code]. Any other value will overflow and wrap around.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate.\n"
"To store a signed integer, use [method store_64], or convert it manually "
"(see [method store_16] for an example)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 16 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 2 "
"bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] should lie in the interval [code][0, 2^16 - 1]"
"[/code]. Any other value will overflow and wrap around.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate.\n"
"To store a signed integer, use [method store_64] or store a signed integer "
"from the interval [code][-2^15, 2^15 - 1][/code] (i.e. keeping one bit for "
"the signedness) and compute its sign manually when reading. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const MAX_15B = 1 << 15\n"
"const MAX_16B = 1 << 16\n"
"\n"
"func unsigned16_to_signed(unsigned):\n"
"\treturn (unsigned + MAX_15B) % MAX_16B - MAX_15B\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar f = FileAccess.open(\"user://file.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE_READ)\n"
"\tf.store_16(-42) # This wraps around and stores 65494 (2^16 - 42).\n"
"\tf.store_16(121) # In bounds, will store 121.\n"
"\tf.seek(0) # Go back to start to read the stored value.\n"
"\tvar read1 = f.get_16() # 65494\n"
"\tvar read2 = f.get_16() # 121\n"
"\tvar converted1 = unsigned16_to_signed(read1) # -42\n"
"\tvar converted2 = unsigned16_to_signed(read2) # 121\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var f = FileAccess.Open(\"user://file.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.WriteRead);\n"
"\tf.Store16(unchecked((ushort)-42)); // This wraps around and stores 65494 "
"(2^16 - 42).\n"
"\tf.Store16(121); // In bounds, will store 121.\n"
"\tf.Seek(0); // Go back to start to read the stored value.\n"
"\tushort read1 = f.Get16(); // 65494\n"
"\tushort read2 = f.Get16(); // 121\n"
"\tshort converted1 = (short)read1; // -42\n"
"\tshort converted2 = (short)read2; // 121\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Armazena um inteiro como 16 bits no arquivo. Isso avança o cursor do arquivo "
"em 2 bytes. Retorna [code]true[/code] se a operação for bem-sucedida.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O [param value] deve estar no intervalo [code][0, 2^16 - 1][/"
"code]. Qualquer outro valor causará overflow e voltará ao início.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se ocorrer um erro, o valor resultante do indicador de posição "
"do arquivo será indeterminado.\n"
"Para armazenar um inteiro com sinal, use [method store_64] ou armazene um "
"inteiro com sinal do intervalo [code][-2^15, 2^15 - 1][/code] (ou seja, "
"mantendo um bit para o sinal) e calcule seu sinal manualmente ao ler. Por "
"exemplo:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const MAX_15B = 1 << 15\n"
"const MAX_16B = 1 << 16\n"
"\n"
"func unsigned16_to_signed(unsigned):\n"
"\treturn (unsigned + MAX_15B) % MAX_16B - MAX_15B\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar f = FileAccess.open(\"user://file.dat\", FileAccess.WRITE_READ)\n"
"\tf.store_16(-42) # Isso causa overflow e armazena 65494 (2^16 - 42).\n"
"\tf.store_16(121) # Dentro dos limites, armazenará 121.\n"
"\tf.seek(0) # Volta ao início para ler o valor armazenado.\n"
"\tvar read1 = f.get_16() # 65494\n"
"\tvar read2 = f.get_16() # 121\n"
"\tvar converted1 = unsigned16_to_signed(read1) # -42\n"
"\tvar converted2 = unsigned16_to_signed(read2) # 121\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tusing var f = FileAccess.Open(\"user://file.dat\", "
"FileAccess.ModeFlags.WriteRead);\n"
"\tf.Store16(unchecked((ushort)-42)); // Isso causa overflow e armazena 65494 "
"(2^16 - 42).\n"
"\tf.Store16(121); // Dentro dos limites, armazenará 121.\n"
"\tf.Seek(0); // Volta ao início para ler o valor armazenado.\n"
"\tushort read1 = f.Get16(); // 65494\n"
"\tushort read2 = f.Get16(); // 121\n"
"\tshort converted1 = (short)read1; // -42\n"
"\tshort converted2 = (short)read2; // 121\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 32 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 4 "
"bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] should lie in the interval [code][0, 2^32 - 1]"
"[/code]. Any other value will overflow and wrap around.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate.\n"
"To store a signed integer, use [method store_64], or convert it manually "
"(see [method store_16] for an example)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores an integer as 64 bits in the file. This advances the file cursor by 8 "
"bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param value] must lie in the interval [code][-2^63, 2^63 - "
"1][/code] (i.e. be a valid [int] value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores the given array of bytes in the file. This advances the file cursor "
"by the number of bytes written. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation "
"is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores the given [PackedStringArray] in the file as a line formatted in the "
"CSV (Comma-Separated Values) format. You can pass a different delimiter "
"[param delim] to use other than the default [code]\",\"[/code] (comma). This "
"delimiter must be one-character long.\n"
"Text will be encoded as UTF-8. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is "
"successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores a floating-point number as 64 bits in the file. This advances the "
"file cursor by 8 bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is "
"successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores a floating-point number as 32 bits in the file. This advances the "
"file cursor by 4 bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is "
"successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores a half-precision floating-point number as 16 bits in the file. This "
"advances the file cursor by 2 bytes. Returns [code]true[/code] if the "
"operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores [param line] in the file followed by a newline character ([code]\\n[/"
"code]), encoding the text as UTF-8. This advances the file cursor by the "
"length of the line, after the newline character. The amount of bytes written "
"depends on the UTF-8 encoded bytes, which may be different from [method "
"String.length] which counts the number of UTF-32 codepoints. Returns "
"[code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores the given [String] as a line in the file in Pascal format (i.e. also "
"store the length of the string). Text will be encoded as UTF-8. This "
"advances the file cursor by the number of bytes written depending on the "
"UTF-8 encoded bytes, which may be different from [method String.length] "
"which counts the number of UTF-32 codepoints. Returns [code]true[/code] if "
"the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores a floating-point number in the file. This advances the file cursor by "
"either 4 or 8 bytes, depending on the precision used by the current Godot "
"build.\n"
"If using a Godot build compiled with the [code]precision=single[/code] "
"option (the default), this method will save a 32-bit float. Otherwise, if "
"compiled with the [code]precision=double[/code] option, this will save a 64-"
"bit float. Returns [code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores [param string] in the file without a newline character ([code]\\n[/"
"code]), encoding the text as UTF-8. This advances the file cursor by the "
"length of the string in UTF-8 encoded bytes, which may be different from "
"[method String.length] which counts the number of UTF-32 codepoints. Returns "
"[code]true[/code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used to write text files. The "
"string is stored as a UTF-8 encoded buffer without string length or "
"terminating zero, which means that it can't be loaded back easily. If you "
"want to store a retrievable string in a binary file, consider using [method "
"store_pascal_string] instead. For retrieving strings from a text file, you "
"can use [code]get_buffer(length).get_string_from_utf8()[/code] (if you know "
"the length) or [method get_as_text].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Stores any Variant value in the file. If [param full_objects] is [code]true[/"
"code], encoding objects is allowed (and can potentially include code). This "
"advances the file cursor by the number of bytes written. Returns [code]true[/"
"code] if the operation is successful.\n"
"Internally, this uses the same encoding mechanism as the [method "
"@GlobalScope.var_to_bytes] method, as described in the [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/io/binary_serialization_api.html]Binary serialization API[/url] "
"documentation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not all properties are included. Only properties that are "
"configured with the [constant PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE] flag set will be "
"serialized. You can add a new usage flag to a property by overriding the "
"[method Object._get_property_list] method in your class. You can also check "
"how property usage is configured by calling [method "
"Object._get_property_list]. See [enum PropertyUsageFlags] for the possible "
"usage flags.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If an error occurs, the resulting value of the file position "
"indicator is indeterminate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the file is read with big-endian [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endianness]endianness[/url]. If [code]false[/code], "
"the file is read with little-endian endianness. If in doubt, leave this to "
"[code]false[/code] as most files are written with little-endian endianness.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is always reset to system endianness, which is little-"
"endian on all supported platforms, whenever you open the file. Therefore, "
"you must set [member big_endian] [i]after[/i] opening the file, not before."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the file for read operations. The file cursor is positioned at the "
"beginning of the file."
msgstr ""
"Abre o arquivo para operações de leitura. O cursor do arquivo está "
"posicionado no início do arquivo."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the file for write operations. If the file exists, it is truncated to "
"zero length and its contents are cleared. Otherwise, it is created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating a file it must be in an already existing "
"directory. To recursively create directories for a file path, see [method "
"DirAccess.make_dir_recursive]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the file for read and write operations. Does not truncate the file. "
"The file cursor is positioned at the beginning of the file."
msgstr ""
"Abre o arquivo para operações de leitura e escrita. Não trunca o arquivo. O "
"cursor do arquivo é posicionado no início do arquivo."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Opens the file for read and write operations. If the file exists, it is "
"truncated to zero length and its contents are cleared. Otherwise, it is "
"created. The file cursor is positioned at the beginning of the file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating a file it must be in an already existing "
"directory. To recursively create directories for a file path, see [method "
"DirAccess.make_dir_recursive]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Uses the [url=https://fastlz.org/]FastLZ[/url] compression method."
msgstr "Usa o método de compressão [url=https://fastlz.org/]FastLZ[/url]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEFLATE]DEFLATE[/url] "
"compression method."
msgstr ""
"Usa o método de compressão [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"DEFLATE]DEFLATE[/url]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the [url=https://facebook.github.io/zstd/]Zstandard[/url] compression "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Usa o método de compressão [url=https://facebook.github.io/zstd/]Zstandard[/"
"url]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Uses the [url=https://www.gzip.org/]gzip[/url] compression method."
msgstr "Usa o método de compressão [url=https://www.gzip.org/]gzip[/url]."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the [url=https://github.com/google/brotli]brotli[/url] compression "
"method (only decompression is supported)."
msgstr ""
"Usa o método de compressão [url=https://github.com/google/brotli]brotli[/"
"url] (apenas a descompressão é suportada)."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Read for owner bit."
msgstr "Bit de leitura para o proprietário."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Write for owner bit."
msgstr "Bit de gravação para o proprietário."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Execute for owner bit."
msgstr "Executar para o bit do proprietário."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Read for group bit."
msgstr "Bit de leitura para o grupo."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Write for group bit."
msgstr "Bit de gravação para o grupo."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Execute for group bit."
msgstr "Executa para o bit de grupo."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Read for other bit."
msgstr "Ler para outro bit."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Write for other bit."
msgstr "Escrever para outro bit."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Execute for other bit."
msgstr "Executar para outro bit."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Set user id on execution bit."
msgstr "Definir o id do usuário no bit de execução."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Set group id on execution bit."
msgstr "Definir id de grupo no bit de execução."

#: doc/classes/FileAccess.xml
msgid "Restricted deletion (sticky) bit."
msgstr "Bit de exclusão restrita (sticky)."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "A dialog for selecting files or directories in the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Uma caixa de diálogo para selecionar arquivos ou diretórios no sistema de "
"arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"[FileDialog] is a preset dialog used to choose files and directories in the "
"filesystem. It supports filter masks. [FileDialog] automatically sets its "
"window title according to the [member file_mode]. If you want to use a "
"custom title, disable this by setting [member mode_overrides_title] to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileDialog] is invisible by default. To make it visible, call "
"one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such as "
"[method Window.popup_centered_clamped]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a comma-separated file extension [param filter] and comma-separated "
"MIME type [param mime_type] option to the [FileDialog] with an optional "
"[param description], which restricts what files can be picked.\n"
"A [param filter] should be of the form [code]\"filename.extension\"[/code], "
"where filename and extension can be [code]*[/code] to match any string. "
"Filters starting with [code].[/code] (i.e. empty filenames) are not "
"allowed.\n"
"For example, a [param filter] of [code]\"*.png, *.jpg\"[/code], a [param "
"mime_type] of [code]image/png, image/jpeg[/code], and a [param description] "
"of [code]\"Images\"[/code] results in filter text \"Images (*.png, *.jpg)"
"\".\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only "
"file extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support "
"MIME types."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an additional [OptionButton] to the file dialog. If [param values] is "
"empty, a [CheckBox] is added instead.\n"
"[param default_value_index] should be an index of the value in the [param "
"values]. If [param values] is empty it should be either [code]1[/code] "
"(checked), or [code]0[/code] (unchecked)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Clear the filter for file names."
msgstr "Limpa o filtro para nomes de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Clear all the added filters in the dialog."
msgstr "Limpa todos os filtros adicionados na caixa de diálogo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Clear all currently selected items in the dialog."
msgstr "Limpa todos os itens selecionados no momento na caixa de diálogo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of favorite directories, which is shared by all "
"[FileDialog] nodes. Useful to store the list of favorites between project "
"sessions. This method can be called only from the main thread."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de diretórios favoritos, que é compartilhada por todos os "
"nós [FileDialog]. Útil para armazenar a lista de favoritos entre sessões do "
"projeto. Este método só pode ser chamado a partir da thread principal."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the LineEdit for the selected file.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the default value index of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with "
"index [param option]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice do valor padrão do [OptionButton] ou [CheckBox] com o "
"índice [param option]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with index [param "
"option]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do [OptionButton] ou [CheckBox] com o índice [param option]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of values of the [OptionButton] with index [param option]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma matriz de valores do [OptionButton] com o índice [param option]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of recent directories, which is shared by all [FileDialog] "
"nodes. Useful to store the list of recents between project sessions. This "
"method can be called only from the main thread."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de diretórios recentes, que é compartilhada por todos os nós "
"[FileDialog]. Útil para armazenar a lista de itens recentes entre sessões do "
"projeto. Este método só pode ser chamado a partir da thread principal."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] with the selected values of the additional "
"[OptionButton]s and/or [CheckBox]es. [Dictionary] keys are names and values "
"are selected value indices."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Dictionary] com os valores selecionados dos [OptionButton]s e/ou "
"[CheckBox]es adicionais. As chaves do [Dictionary] são nomes e os valores "
"são os índices dos valores selecionados."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the vertical box container of the dialog, custom controls can be "
"added to it.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changes to this node are ignored by native file dialogs, use "
"[method add_option] to add custom elements to the dialog instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Invalidates and updates this dialog's content list.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does nothing on native file dialogs."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [param flag] is enabled."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se a [param flag] fornecida estiver ativada."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Shows the [FileDialog] using the default size and position for file dialogs, "
"and selects the file name if there is a current file."
msgstr ""
"Mostra o [FileDialog] usando o tamanho e a posição padrão para diálogos de "
"arquivo e seleciona o nome do arquivo se houver um arquivo atual."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the specified customization [param flag], allowing to customize the "
"features available in this [FileDialog]."
msgstr ""
"Define a [param flag] de personalização especificada, permitindo "
"personalizar os recursos disponíveis neste [FileDialog]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the list of favorite directories, which is shared by all [FileDialog] "
"nodes. Useful to restore the list of favorites saved with [method "
"get_favorite_list]. This method can be called only from the main thread.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileDialog] will update its internal [ItemList] of favorites "
"when its visibility changes. Be sure to call this method earlier if you want "
"your changes to have effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the callback used by the [FileDialog] nodes to get a file icon, when "
"[constant DISPLAY_LIST] mode is used. The callback should take a single "
"[String] argument (file path), and return a [Texture2D]. If an invalid "
"texture is returned, the [theme_item file] icon will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"Define a função de retorno usada pelos nós [FileDialog] para obter um ícone "
"de arquivo, quando o modo [constant DISPLAY_LIST] é usado. A função de "
"retorno deve aceitar um único argumento [String] (caminho do arquivo) e "
"retornar um [Texture2D]. Se uma textura inválida for retornada, o ícone "
"[theme_item file] será usado em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the callback used by the [FileDialog] nodes to get a file icon, when "
"[constant DISPLAY_THUMBNAILS] mode is used. The callback should take a "
"single [String] argument (file path), and return a [Texture2D]. If an "
"invalid texture is returned, the [theme_item file_thumbnail] icon will be "
"used instead.\n"
"Thumbnails are usually more complex and may take a while to load. To avoid "
"stalling the application, you can use [ImageTexture] to asynchronously "
"create the thumbnail.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tFileDialog.set_get_thumbnail_callback(thumbnail_method)\n"
"\n"
"func thumbnail_method(path):\n"
"\tvar image_texture = ImageTexture.new()\n"
"\tmake_thumbnail_async(path, image_texture)\n"
"\treturn image_texture\n"
"\n"
"func make_thumbnail_async(path, image_texture):\n"
"\tvar thumbnail_texture = await generate_thumbnail(path) # Some method that "
"generates a thumbnail.\n"
"\timage_texture.set_image(thumbnail_texture.get_image())\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the default value index of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with index "
"[param option]."
msgstr ""
"Define o índice do valor padrão do [OptionButton] ou [CheckBox] com o índice "
"[param option]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the name of the [OptionButton] or [CheckBox] with index [param option]."
msgstr ""
"Define o nome do [OptionButton] ou [CheckBox] com o índice [param option]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Sets the option values of the [OptionButton] with index [param option]."
msgstr ""
"Define os valores de opção do [OptionButton] com o índice [param option]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the list of recent directories, which is shared by all [FileDialog] "
"nodes. Useful to restore the list of recents saved with [method "
"set_recent_list]. This method can be called only from the main thread.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FileDialog] will update its internal [ItemList] of recent "
"directories when its visibility changes. Be sure to call this method earlier "
"if you want your changes to have effect."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The file system access scope.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] In Web builds, FileDialog cannot access the host file "
"system. In sandboxed Linux and macOS environments, [member "
"use_native_dialog] is automatically used to allow limited access to host "
"file system."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The current working directory of the file dialog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For native file dialogs, this property is only treated as a "
"hint and may not be respected by specific OS implementations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The currently selected file of the file dialog."
msgstr "O arquivo selecionado no momento da caixa de diálogo de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The currently selected file path of the file dialog."
msgstr ""
"O caminho de arquivo selecionado atualmente na caixa de diálogo de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the context menu will show the \"Delete\" option, "
"which allows moving files and folders to trash."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o menu de contexto mostrará a opção \"Excluir\", o que "
"permite mover arquivos e pastas para a lixeira."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Display mode of the dialog's file list."
msgstr "Modo de exibição da lista de arquivos do diálogo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the toggle favorite button and favorite list on "
"the left side of the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], mostra o botão de alternar favorito e a lista de "
"favoritos no lado esquerdo da caixa de diálogo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows the toggle file filter button."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], mostra o botão de alternar filtro de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The dialog's open or save mode, which affects the selection behavior."
msgstr ""
"O modo de abertura ou salvamento da caixa de diálogo, que afeta o "
"comportamento de seleção."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows the file sorting options button."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], mostra o botão de opções de ordenação de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The filter for file names (case-insensitive). When set to a non-empty "
"string, only files that contains the substring will be shown. [member "
"filename_filter] can be edited by the user with the filter button at the top "
"of the file dialog.\n"
"See also [member filters], which should be used to restrict the file types "
"that can be selected instead of [member filename_filter] which is meant to "
"be set by the user."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The available file type filters. Each filter string in the array should be "
"formatted like this: [code]*.png,*.jpg,*.jpeg;Image Files;image/png,image/"
"jpeg[/code]. The description text of the filter is optional and can be "
"omitted. Both file extensions and MIME type should be always set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Embedded file dialogs and Windows file dialogs support only "
"file extensions, while Android, Linux, and macOS file dialogs also support "
"MIME types."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the button for creating new directories (when "
"using [constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_DIR], [constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_ANY], or "
"[constant FILE_MODE_SAVE_FILE]), and the context menu will have the \"New "
"Folder...\" option."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], mostra o botão para criar novos diretórios (ao usar "
"[constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_DIR], [constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_ANY] ou [constant "
"FILE_MODE_SAVE_FILE]), e o menu de contexto terá a opção \"Nova Pasta...\"."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], shows the toggle hidden files button."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], mostra o botão de alternar arquivos ocultos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the layout switch buttons (list/thumbnails)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe os botões de alternância de layout (lista/"
"miniaturas)."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], changing the [member file_mode] property will set the "
"window title accordingly (e.g. setting [member file_mode] to [constant "
"FILE_MODE_OPEN_FILE] will change the window title to \"Open a File\")."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], alterar a propriedade [member file_mode] definirá o "
"título da janela de acordo (por exemplo, definir [member file_mode] como "
"[constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_FILE] alterará o título da janela para \"Open a "
"File\")."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The number of additional [OptionButton]s and [CheckBox]es in the dialog."
msgstr ""
"O número de [OptionButton]s e [CheckBox]es adicionais na caixa de diálogo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The default value for the option at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. option_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The name of the option at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. option_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The list of values for the option at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. option_count - "
"1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [FileDialog] will warn the user before overwriting "
"files in save mode."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [FileDialog] avisará o usuário antes de sobrescrever "
"arquivos no modo de salvamento."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows the recent directories list on the left side of "
"the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], mostra a lista de diretórios recentes no lado esquerdo "
"da caixa de diálogo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If non-empty, the given sub-folder will be \"root\" of this [FileDialog], "
"i.e. user won't be able to go to its parent directory.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored by native file dialogs."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the dialog will show hidden files.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored by native file dialogs on Android and "
"Linux."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o diálogo exibirá arquivos ocultos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade é ignorada pelos diálogos de arquivo nativos "
"no Android e Linux."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], and if supported by the current [DisplayServer], OS "
"native dialog will be used instead of custom one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, it is only supported when using [constant "
"ACCESS_FILESYSTEM]. For access mode [constant ACCESS_RESOURCES] and "
"[constant ACCESS_USERDATA], the system will fall back to custom FileDialog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Linux and macOS, sandboxed apps always use native dialogs to "
"access the host file system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed apps will save security-scoped bookmarks to "
"retain access to the opened folders across multiple sessions. Use [method "
"OS.get_granted_permissions] to get a list of saved bookmarks.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Native dialogs are isolated from the base process, file dialog "
"properties can't be modified once the dialog is shown.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored in [EditorFileDialog]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user selects a directory."
msgstr "Emitido quando o usuário seleciona um diretório."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user selects a file by double-clicking it or pressing the "
"[b]OK[/b] button."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o usuário seleciona um arquivo clicando duas vezes nele ou "
"pressionando o botão [b]OK[/b]."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Emitted when the filter for file names changes."
msgstr "Emitido quando o filtro para nomes de arquivos muda."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "Emitted when the user selects multiple files."
msgstr "Emitido quando o usuário seleciona múltiplos arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The dialog allows selecting one, and only one file."
msgstr "A caixa de diálogo permite selecionar um, e apenas um arquivo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The dialog allows selecting multiple files."
msgstr "A caixa de diálogo permite selecionar vários arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The dialog only allows selecting a directory, disallowing the selection of "
"any file."
msgstr ""
"O diálogo permite apenas selecionar um diretório, impedindo a seleção de "
"qualquer arquivo."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The dialog allows selecting one file or directory."
msgstr "A caixa de diálogo permite selecionar um arquivo ou diretório."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The dialog will warn when a file exists."
msgstr "A caixa de diálogo avisará quando um arquivo existir."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The dialog only allows accessing files under the [Resource] path "
"([code]res://[/code])."
msgstr ""
"O diálogo permite apenas acessar arquivos sob o caminho [Resource] "
"([code]res://[/code])."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The dialog only allows accessing files under user data path ([code]user://[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""
"O diálogo permite apenas acessar arquivos sob o caminho de dados do usuário "
"([code]user://[/code])."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The dialog allows accessing files on the whole file system."
msgstr ""
"A caixa de diálogo permite acessar arquivos em todo o sistema de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"The dialog displays files as a grid of thumbnails. Use [theme_item "
"thumbnail_size] to adjust their size."
msgstr ""
"O diálogo exibe arquivos como uma grade de miniaturas. Use [theme_item "
"thumbnail_size] to adjust their size."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid "The dialog displays files as a list of filenames."
msgstr "A caixa de diálogo exibe arquivos como uma lista de nomes de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"Toggles visibility of the favorite button, and the favorite list on the left "
"side of the dialog.\n"
"Equivalent to [member hidden_files_toggle_enabled]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the button for creating new directories (when using "
"[constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_DIR], [constant FILE_MODE_OPEN_ANY], or [constant "
"FILE_MODE_SAVE_FILE]).\n"
"Equivalent to [member folder_creation_enabled]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FileDialog.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, shows the toggle file filter button.\n"
