msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a seleção muda. Use [method "
"EditorInterface.get_selected_paths] no método conectado para obter os "
"caminhos selecionados."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "A built-in type for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Um tipo interno para números de ponto flutuante."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"The [float] built-in type is a 64-bit double-precision floating-point "
"number, equivalent to [code]double[/code] in C++. This type has 14 reliable "
"decimal digits of precision. The maximum value of [float] is approximately "
"[code]1.79769e308[/code], and the minimum is approximately "
"[code]-1.79769e308[/code].\n"
"Many methods and properties in the engine use 32-bit single-precision "
"floating-point numbers instead, equivalent to [code skip-lint]float[/code] "
"in C++, which have 6 reliable decimal digits of precision. For data "
"structures such as [Vector2] and [Vector3], Godot uses 32-bit floating-point "
"numbers by default, but it can be changed to use 64-bit doubles if Godot is "
"compiled with the [code]precision=double[/code] option.\n"
"Math done using the [float] type is not guaranteed to be exact and will "
"often result in small errors. You should usually use the [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] and [method @GlobalScope.is_zero_approx] "
"methods instead of [code]==[/code] to compare [float] values for equality.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a [float] will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it's exactly equal to [code]0.0[/code], and to [code]true[/code] "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Wikipedia: Double-precision floating-point format"
msgstr "Wikipedia: Formato de ponto flutuante de dupla precisão"

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Wikipedia: Single-precision floating-point format"
msgstr "Wikipedia: Formato de ponto flutuante de precisão simples"

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Constructs a default-initialized [float] set to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Constrói um [float] inicializado por padrão definido como [code]0.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Constructs a [float] as a copy of the given [float]."
msgstr "Constrói um [float] como uma cópia do [float] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Converts a [String] to a [float], following the same rules as [method "
"String.to_float]."
msgstr ""
"Converte uma [String] em um [float], seguindo as mesmas regras de [method "
"String.to_float]."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Cast a [bool] value to a floating-point value, [code]float(true)[/code] will "
"be equal to 1.0 and [code]float(false)[/code] will be equal to 0.0."
msgstr ""
"Converte um valor [bool] em um valor de ponto flutuante, [code]float(true)[/"
"code] será igual a 1.0 e [code]float(false)[/code] será igual a 0.0."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Cast an [int] value to a floating-point value, [code]float(1)[/code] will be "
"equal to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Converte um valor [int] em um valor de ponto flutuante, [code]float(1)[/"
"code] será igual a [code]1.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if two floats are different from each other.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the integer has different value than the float."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o número inteiro tiver um valor diferente do "
"float."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Color], including the alpha, by the given "
"[float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(1.5 * Color(0.5, 0.5, 0.5)) # Prints (0.75, 0.75, 0.75, 1.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente da [Color], incluindo o alpha, pelo [float] "
"fornecido.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(1.5 * Color(0.5, 0.5, 0.5)) # Imprime (0.75, 0.75, 0.75, 1.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the given [float]. This "
"operation is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of a "
"larger expression."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente do [Quaternion] pelo [float] fornecido. Esta "
"operação não tem significado por si só, mas pode ser usada como parte de uma "
"expressão maior."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector2] by the given [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2.5 * Vector2(1, 3)) # Prints (2.5, 7.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente do [Vector2] pelo [float] fornecido.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2.5 * Vector2(1, 3)) # Imprime (2.5, 7.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector2i] by the given [float]. Returns a "
"[Vector2].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector2i(10, 15)) # Prints (9.0, 13.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente do [Vector2i] pelo [float] fornecido. Retorna um "
"[Vector2].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector2i(10, 15)) # Imprime (9.0, 13.5)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/float.xml doc/classes/Vector3.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector3] by the given [float]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Vector3] pelo [float] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector3i] by the given [float]. Returns a "
"[Vector3].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector3i(10, 15, 20)) # Prints (9.0, 13.5, 18.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente do [Vector3i] pelo [float] fornecido. Retorna um "
"[Vector3].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector3i(10, 15, 20)) # Imprime (9.0, 13.5, 18.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector4] by the given [float]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Vector4] pelo [float] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the given [float]. Returns a "
"[Vector4].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector4i(10, 15, 20, -10)) # Prints (9.0, 13.5, 18.0, -9.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente do [Vector4i] pelo [float] fornecido. Retorna um "
"[Vector4].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9 * Vector4i(10, 15, 20, -10)) # Imprime (9.0, 13.5, 18.0, -9.0)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Multiplies two [float]s."
msgstr "Multiplica dois [float]s."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Multiplies a [float] and an [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "Multiplica um [float] e um [int]. O resultado é um [float]."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Raises a [float] to a power of a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(39.0625**0.25) # 2.5\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Raises a [float] to a power of an [int]. The result is a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0.9**3) # 0.729\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Adds two floats."
msgstr "Adiciona dois pontos flutuantes."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Adds a [float] and an [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "Adiciona um [float] e um [int]. O resultado é um [float]."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Subtracts a float from a float."
msgstr "Subtrai um ponto flutuante de um ponto flutuante."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Subtracts an [int] from a [float]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "Subtrai um [int] de um [float]. O resultado é um [float]."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Divides two floats."
msgstr "Divide dois números de ponto flutuante."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Divides a [float] by an [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "Divide um [float] por um [int]. O resultado é um [float]."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is less than the right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is less than the given [int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este [float] for menor que o [int] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is less than or equal to the "
"right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is less than or equal to the given "
"[int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este [float] for menor ou igual ao [int] "
"fornecido."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if both floats are exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] or [method @GlobalScope.is_zero_approx] "
"instead, which are more reliable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se ambos os valores float forem exatamente "
"iguais.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Devido a erros de precisão de ponto flutuante, considere usar "
"[method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] ou [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_zero_approx] em vez disso, pois são mais confiáveis.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] não se comporta da mesma forma que "
"outros números. Portanto, os resultados deste operador podem não ser "
"precisos se valores NaN estiverem incluídos."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [float] and the given [int] are equal."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [float] e o [int] fornecido forem iguais."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is greater than the right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is greater than the given [int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este [float] for maior que o [int] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left float is greater than or equal to the "
"right one.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [constant @GDScript.NAN] doesn't behave the same as other "
"numbers. Therefore, the results from this operator may not be accurate if "
"NaNs are included."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [float] is greater than or equal to the "
"given [int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este [float] for maior ou igual ao [int] "
"fornecido."

#: doc/classes/float.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [float]. If positive, turns the number "
"negative. If negative, turns the number positive. With floats, the number "
"zero can be either positive or negative."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor negativo do [float]. Se for positivo, torna o número "
"negativo. Se for negativo, torna o número positivo. Com floats, o número "
"zero pode ser positivo ou negativo."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that arranges its child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"wraps them around at the borders."
msgstr ""
"Um container que organiza seus controles filhos horizontalmente ou "
"verticalmente e os envolve nas bordas."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that arranges its child controls horizontally or vertically and "
"wraps them around at the borders. This is similar to how text in a book "
"wraps around when no more words can fit on a line."
msgstr ""
"Um contêiner que organiza seus controles filhos horizontalmente ou "
"verticalmente e os envolve nas bordas. Isso é semelhante a como o texto em "
"um livro se envolve quando não há mais palavras que caibam em uma linha."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid "Returns the current line count."
msgstr "Retorna a contagem atual de linhas."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The wrap behavior of the last, partially filled row or column (must be one "
"of [constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_INHERIT], [constant "
"LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_BEGIN], [constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_CENTER], or "
"[constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_END])."
msgstr ""
"O comportamento de quebra da última linha ou coluna preenchida parcialmente "
"(deve ser um de [constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_INHERIT], [constant "
"LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_BEGIN], [constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_CENTER] ou "
"[constant LAST_WRAP_ALIGNMENT_END])."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reverses fill direction. Horizontal [FlowContainer]s "
"will fill rows bottom to top, vertical [FlowContainer]s will fill columns "
"right to left.\n"
"When using a vertical [FlowContainer] with a right to left [member "
"Control.layout_direction], columns will fill left to right instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [FlowContainer] will arrange its children "
"vertically, rather than horizontally.\n"
"Can't be changed when using [HFlowContainer] and [VFlowContainer]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the previous "
"row or column in accordance with [member alignment]."
msgstr ""
"A última linha ou coluna parcialmente preenchida fará a quebra alinhada à "
"linha ou coluna anterior de acordo com [member alignment]."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the beginning "
"of the previous row or column."
msgstr ""
"A última linha ou coluna parcialmente preenchida será ajustada alinhando-se "
"ao início da linha ou coluna anterior."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the center of "
"the previous row or column."
msgstr ""
"A última linha ou coluna parcialmente preenchida será ajustada alinhando-se "
"ao centro da linha ou coluna anterior."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The last partially filled row or column will wrap aligned to the end of the "
"previous row or column."
msgstr ""
"A última linha ou coluna parcialmente preenchida será ajustada alinhando-se "
"ao final da linha ou coluna anterior."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml doc/classes/GridContainer.xml
msgid "The horizontal separation of child nodes."
msgstr "A separação horizontal dos nós filhos."

#: doc/classes/FlowContainer.xml doc/classes/GridContainer.xml
msgid "The vertical separation of child nodes."
msgstr "A separação vertical dos nós filhos."

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A material that controls how volumetric fog is rendered, to be assigned to a "
"[FogVolume]."
msgstr ""
"Um material que controla como o nevoeiro volumétrico é renderizado, a ser "
"atribuído a um [FogVolume]."

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"A [Material] resource that can be used by [FogVolume]s to draw volumetric "
"effects.\n"
"If you need more advanced effects, use a custom [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.html]fog shader[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The single-scattering [Color] of the [FogVolume]. Internally, [member "
"albedo] is converted into single-scattering, which is additively blended "
"with other [FogVolume]s and the [member Environment.volumetric_fog_albedo]."
msgstr ""
"O [Color] de espalhamento único do [FogVolume]. Internamente, o [member "
"albedo] é convertido em espalhamento único, que é misturado de forma aditiva "
"com outros [FogVolumes] e o [member Environment.volumetric_fog_albedo]."

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The density of the [FogVolume]. Denser objects are more opaque, but may "
"suffer from under-sampling artifacts that look like stripes. Negative values "
"can be used to subtract fog from other [FogVolume]s or global volumetric "
"fog.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited precision, [member density] values between "
"[code]-0.001[/code] and [code]0.001[/code] (exclusive) act like [code]0.0[/"
"code]. This does not apply to [member Environment.volumetric_fog_density]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The 3D texture that is used to scale the [member density] of the "
"[FogVolume]. This can be used to vary fog density within the [FogVolume] "
"with any kind of static pattern. For animated effects, consider using a "
"custom [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.html]fog "
"shader[/url]."
msgstr ""
"A textura 3D usada para dimensionar a [member density] do [FogVolume]. Isso "
"pode ser usado para variar a densidade da névoa dentro do [FogVolume] com "
"qualquer tipo de padrão estático. Para efeitos animados, considere usar um "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/fog_shader.html]shader de "
"névoa[/url] personalizado."

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The hardness of the edges of the [FogVolume]. A higher value will result in "
"softer edges, while a lower value will result in harder edges."
msgstr ""
"A dureza das bordas do [FogVolume]. Um valor mais alto resultará em bordas "
"mais suaves, enquanto um valor mais baixo resultará em bordas mais duras."

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The [Color] of the light emitted by the [FogVolume]. Emitted light will not "
"cast light or shadows on other objects, but can be useful for modulating the "
"[Color] of the [FogVolume] independently from light sources."
msgstr ""
"A [Color] da luz emitida pelo [FogVolume]. A luz emitida não projetará luz "
"ou sombras em outros objetos, mas pode ser útil para modular a [Color] do "
"[FogVolume] independentemente das fontes de luz."

#: doc/classes/FogMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The rate by which the height-based fog decreases in density as height "
"increases in world space. A high falloff will result in a sharp transition, "
"while a low falloff will result in a smoother transition. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] results in uniform-density fog. The height threshold is "
"determined by the height of the associated [FogVolume]."
msgstr ""
"A taxa pela qual o nevoeiro baseado em altura diminui em densidade à medida "
"que a altura aumenta no espaço do mundo. Uma queda acentuada (high falloff) "
"resultará em uma transição abrupta, enquanto uma queda suave resultará em "
"uma transição mais suave. Um valor de [code]0.0[/code] resulta em um "
"nevoeiro de densidade uniforme. O limite de altura é determinado pela altura "
"do [FogVolume] associado."

#: doc/classes/FogVolume.xml
msgid ""
"A region that contributes to the default volumetric fog from the world "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Uma região que contribui para o nevoeiro volumétrico padrão do ambiente "
"mundial."

#: doc/classes/FogVolume.xml
msgid ""
"[FogVolume]s are used to add localized fog into the global volumetric fog "
"effect. [FogVolume]s can also remove volumetric fog from specific areas if "
"using a [FogMaterial] with a negative [member FogMaterial.density].\n"
"Performance of [FogVolume]s is directly related to their relative size on "
"the screen and the complexity of their attached [FogMaterial]. It is best to "
"keep [FogVolume]s relatively small and simple where possible.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [FogVolume]s only have a visible effect if [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. If you don't want "
"fog to be globally visible (but only within [FogVolume] nodes), set [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_density] to [code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FogVolume.xml
msgid "Volumetric fog and fog volumes"
msgstr "Névoa volumétrica e volumes de névoa"

#: doc/classes/FogVolume.xml
msgid ""
"The [Material] used by the [FogVolume]. Can be either a built-in "
"[FogMaterial] or a custom [ShaderMaterial]."
msgstr ""
"O [Material] usado pelo [FogVolume]. Pode ser um [FogMaterial] embutido ou "
"um [ShaderMaterial] personalizado."

#: doc/classes/FogVolume.xml
msgid ""
"The shape of the [FogVolume]. This can be set to either [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_WORLD]."
msgstr ""
"A forma do [FogVolume]. Isso pode ser definido como [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX] ou [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_WORLD]."

#: doc/classes/FogVolume.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the [FogVolume] when [member shape] is [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_ELLIPSOID], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE], [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_BOX].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Thin fog volumes may appear to flicker when the camera moves or "
"rotates. This can be alleviated by increasing [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/environment/volumetric_fog/volume_depth] (at a "
"performance cost) or by decreasing [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_length] (at no performance cost, but at the cost "
"of lower fog range). Alternatively, the [FogVolume] can be made thicker and "
"use a lower density in the [member material].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member shape] is [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CONE] or [constant "
"RenderingServer.FOG_VOLUME_SHAPE_CYLINDER], the cone/cylinder will be "
"adjusted to fit within the size. Non-uniform scaling of cone/cylinder shapes "
"via the [member size] property is not supported, but you can scale the "
"[FogVolume] node instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "A container that can be expanded/collapsed."
msgstr "Um contêiner que pode ser expandido/recolhido."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that can be expanded/collapsed, with a title that can be filled "
"with controls, such as buttons. This is also called an accordion.\n"
"The title can be positioned at the top or bottom of the container. The "
"container can be expanded or collapsed by clicking the title or by pressing "
"[code]ui_accept[/code] when focused. Child control nodes are hidden when the "
"container is collapsed. Ignores non-control children.\n"
"A FoldableContainer can be grouped with other FoldableContainers so that "
"only one of them can be opened at a time; see [member foldable_group] and "
"[FoldableGroup]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a [Control] that will be placed next to the container's title, "
"obscuring the clickable area. Prime usage is adding [Button] nodes, but it "
"can be any [Control].\n"
"The control will be added as a child of this container and removed from "
"previous parent if necessary. The controls will be placed aligned to the "
"right, with the first added control being the leftmost one."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Expands the container and emits [signal folding_changed]."
msgstr "Expande o contêiner e emite [signal folding_changed]."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Folds the container and emits [signal folding_changed]."
msgstr "Fecha o contêiner e emite [signal folding_changed]."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a [Control] added with [method add_title_bar_control]. The node is "
"not freed automatically, you need to use [method Node.queue_free]."
msgstr ""
"Remove um [Control] adicionado com [method add_title_bar_control]. O nó não "
"é liberado automaticamente; você precisa usar [method Node.queue_free]."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The [FoldableGroup] associated with the container. When multiple "
"[FoldableContainer] nodes share the same group, only one of them is allowed "
"to be unfolded."
msgstr ""
"O [FoldableGroup] associado ao container. Quando vários nós "
"[FoldableContainer] compartilham o mesmo grupo, apenas um deles pode ser "
"desdobrado."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the container will become folded and will hide all its "
"children."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o contêiner será recolhido e ocultará todos os seus "
"filhos."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Language code used for text shaping algorithms. If left empty, the current "
"locale is used instead."
msgstr ""
"Código de idioma usado para algoritmos de modelagem de texto. Se deixado "
"vazio, o local atual é usado em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The container's title text."
msgstr "O texto do título do contenedor."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Title's horizontal text alignment."
msgstr "Alinhamento de texto horizontal do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Title's position."
msgstr "Posição do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Title text writing direction."
msgstr "Direção de escrita do texto do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Defines the behavior of the title when the text is longer than the available "
"space."
msgstr ""
"Define o comportamento do título quando o texto é mais longo que o espaço "
"disponível."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Emitted when the container is folded/expanded."
msgstr "Emitido quando o contêiner é recolhido/expandido."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Makes the title appear at the top of the container."
msgstr "Faz o título aparecer no topo do contêiner."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the title appear at the bottom of the container. Also makes all "
"StyleBoxes flipped vertically."
msgstr ""
"Faz com que o título apareça na parte inferior do container. Também faz com "
"que todas as StyleBoxes sejam invertidas verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's font color when collapsed."
msgstr "A cor da fonte do título quando recolhida."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's font color when expanded."
msgstr "A cor da fonte do título quando expandida."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's font outline color."
msgstr "A cor do contorno da fonte do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's font hover color."
msgstr "A cor ao passar o mouse da fonte do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"The horizontal separation between the title's icon and text, and between "
"title bar controls."
msgstr ""
"A separação horizontal entre o ícone e o texto do título, e entre os "
"controles da barra de título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's font outline size."
msgstr "O tamanho do contorno da fonte do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's font."
msgstr "A fonte do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's font size."
msgstr "O tamanho da fonte do título."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's icon used when expanded."
msgstr "O ícone do título usado quando expandido."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's icon used when expanded (for bottom title)."
msgstr "O ícone do título usado quando expandido (para título inferior)."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's icon used when folded (for left-to-right layouts)."
msgstr ""
"O ícone do título usado quando recolhido (para layouts da esquerda para a "
"direita)."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "The title's icon used when collapsed (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr ""
"O ícone do título usado quando recolhido (para layouts da direita para a "
"esquerda)."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Background used when [FoldableContainer] has GUI focus. The [theme_item "
"focus] [StyleBox] is displayed [i]over[/i] the base [StyleBox], so a "
"partially transparent [StyleBox] should be used to ensure the base "
"[StyleBox] remains visible. A [StyleBox] that represents an outline or an "
"underline works well for this purpose. To disable the focus visual effect, "
"assign a [StyleBoxEmpty] resource. Note that disabling the focus visual "
"effect will harm keyboard/controller navigation usability, so this is not "
"recommended for accessibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"Plano de fundo usado quando o [FoldableContainer] tem o foco da GUI. O "
"[StyleBox] de [theme_item focus] é exibido [i]sobre[/i] o [StyleBox] base, "
"portanto, um [StyleBox] parcialmente transparente deve ser usado para "
"garantir que o [StyleBox] base permaneça visível. Um [StyleBox] que "
"representa um contorno ou um sublinhado funciona bem para este propósito. "
"Para desativar o efeito visual de foco, atribua um recurso [StyleBoxEmpty]. "
"Note que desativar o efeito visual de foco prejudicará a usabilidade da "
"navegação por teclado/controle, portanto, isso não é recomendado por motivos "
"de acessibilidade."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Default background for the [FoldableContainer]."
msgstr "Fundo padrão para o [FoldableContainer]."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Background used when the mouse cursor enters the title's area when collapsed."
msgstr ""
"Fundo usado quando o cursor do mouse entra na área do título quando "
"recolhido."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Default background for the [FoldableContainer]'s title when collapsed."
msgstr "Fundo padrão para o título de [FoldableContainer] quando recolhido."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid ""
"Background used when the mouse cursor enters the title's area when expanded."
msgstr ""
"Fundo usado quando o cursor do mouse entra na área do título quando "
"expandido."

#: doc/classes/FoldableContainer.xml
msgid "Default background for the [FoldableContainer]'s title when expanded."
msgstr "Fundo padrão para o título do [FoldableContainer] quando expandido."

#: doc/classes/FoldableGroup.xml
msgid ""
"A group of foldable containers that doesn't allow more than one container to "
"be expanded at a time."
msgstr ""
"Um grupo de containers dobráveis que não permite que mais de um container "
"seja expandido por vez."

#: doc/classes/FoldableGroup.xml
msgid ""
"A group of [FoldableContainer]-derived nodes. Only one container can be "
"expanded at a time."
msgstr ""
"Um grupo de nós derivados de [FoldableContainer]. Apenas um contêiner pode "
"ser expandido por vez."

#: doc/classes/FoldableGroup.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [FoldableContainer]s that have this as their "
"FoldableGroup (see [member FoldableContainer.foldable_group]). This is "
"equivalent to [ButtonGroup] but for FoldableContainers."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Array] de [FoldableContainer]s que têm este como seu "
"FoldableGroup (veja [member FoldableContainer.foldable_group]). Isso é "
"equivalente ao [ButtonGroup], mas para FoldableContainers."

#: doc/classes/FoldableGroup.xml
msgid "Returns the current expanded container."
msgstr "Retorna o recipiente expandido atual."

#: doc/classes/FoldableGroup.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it is possible to fold all containers in this "
"FoldableGroup."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], é possível recolher todos os contêineres neste "
"FoldableGroup."

#: doc/classes/FoldableGroup.xml
msgid "Emitted when one of the containers of the group is expanded."
msgstr "Emitido quando um dos containers do grupo é expandido."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for fonts and font variations."
msgstr "Classe base abstrata para fontes e variações de fontes."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for different font types. It has methods for drawing "
"text and font character introspection."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstrata para diferentes tipos de fonte. Possui métodos para "
"desenhar texto e introspecção de caracteres de fonte."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Draw a single Unicode character [param char] into a canvas item using the "
"font, at a given position, with [param modulate] color. [param pos] "
"specifies the baseline, not the top. To draw from the top, [i]ascent[/i] "
"must be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] is greater than zero, "
"it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport oversampling "
"settings are used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not use this function to draw strings character by "
"character, use [method draw_string] or [TextLine] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Draw a single Unicode character [param char] outline into a canvas item "
"using the font, at a given position, with [param modulate] color and [param "
"size] outline size. [param pos] specifies the baseline, not the top. To draw "
"from the top, [i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If [param "
"oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, "
"otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not use this function to draw strings character by "
"character, use [method draw_string] or [TextLine] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Breaks [param text] into lines using rules specified by [param brk_flags] "
"and draws it into a canvas item using the font, at a given position, with "
"[param modulate] color, optionally clipping the width and aligning "
"horizontally. [param pos] specifies the baseline of the first line, not the "
"top. To draw from the top, [i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If "
"[param oversampling] is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling "
"factor, otherwise viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_multiline_string]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Breaks [param text] to the lines using rules specified by [param brk_flags] "
"and draws text outline into a canvas item using the font, at a given "
"position, with [param modulate] color and [param size] outline size, "
"optionally clipping the width and aligning horizontally. [param pos] "
"specifies the baseline of the first line, not the top. To draw from the top, "
"[i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] is "
"greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise "
"viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_multiline_string_outline]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Draw [param text] into a canvas item using the font, at a given position, "
"with [param modulate] color, optionally clipping the width and aligning "
"horizontally. [param pos] specifies the baseline, not the top. To draw from "
"the top, [i]ascent[/i] must be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] "
"is greater than zero, it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise "
"viewport oversampling settings are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_string]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Draw [param text] outline into a canvas item using the font, at a given "
"position, with [param modulate] color and [param size] outline size, "
"optionally clipping the width and aligning horizontally. [param pos] "
"specifies the baseline, not the top. To draw from the top, [i]ascent[/i] "
"must be added to the Y axis. If [param oversampling] is greater than zero, "
"it is used as font oversampling factor, otherwise viewport oversampling "
"settings are used.\n"
"See also [method CanvasItem.draw_string_outline]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid "Returns [TextServer] RID of the font cache for specific variation."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o RID de [TextServer] do cache de fonte para uma variação específica."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum font ascent (number of pixels above the baseline) of "
"this font and all fallback fonts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real ascent of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use it "
"only as rough estimate (e.g. as the ascent of empty line)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the size of a character. Does not take kerning into account.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Do not use this function to calculate width of the string "
"character by character, use [method get_string_size] or [TextLine] instead. "
"The height returned is the font height (see also [method get_height]) and "
"has no relation to the glyph height."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum font descent (number of pixels below the baseline) of "
"this font and all fallback fonts.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real descent of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use it "
"only as rough estimate (e.g. as the descent of empty line)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid "Returns number of faces in the TrueType / OpenType collection."
msgstr "Retorna o número de faces na coleção TrueType / OpenType."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid "Returns font family name."
msgstr "Retorna o nome da família de fontes."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns font stretch amount, compared to a normal width. A percentage value "
"between [code]50%[/code] and [code]200%[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade de estiramento de fonte, comparada a uma largura "
"normal. Um valor percentual entre [code]50%[/code] e [code]200%[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid "Returns font style flags."
msgstr "Retorna os sinalizadores de estilo da fonte."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid "Returns font style name."
msgstr "Retorna o nome do estilo da fonte."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns weight (boldness) of the font. A value in the [code]100...999[/code] "
"range, normal font weight is [code]400[/code], bold font weight is "
"[code]700[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o peso da fonte. Um valor no intervalo [code]100...999[/code], o "
"peso de fonte normal é [code]400[/code], o peso de fonte em negrito é "
"[code]700[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total average font height (ascent plus descent) in pixels.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real height of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use it "
"only as rough estimate (e.g. as the height of empty line)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the size of a bounding box of a string broken into the lines, taking "
"kerning and advance into account.\n"
"See also [method draw_multiline_string]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a set of OpenType feature tags. More info: [url=https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/featuretags]OpenType "
"feature tags[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um conjunto de tags de recursos OpenType. Mais informações: "
"[url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/"
"featuretags]Tags de recursos OpenType[/url]."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [Dictionary] with OpenType font name strings (localized font names, "
"version, description, license information, sample text, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Dictionary] com strings de nomes de fontes OpenType (nomes de "
"fontes localizados, versão, descrição, informações de licença, texto de "
"exemplo, etc.)."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the array in the predefined color palette at [param index]. Palette "
"contains all colors used to render font glyphs. Each palette has the same "
"number of colors. Colors can be overridden using [FontVariation]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o array na paleta de cores predefinida em [param index]. A paleta "
"contém todas as cores usadas para renderizar glifos de fontes. Cada paleta "
"tem o mesmo número de cores. As cores podem ser substituídas usando "
"[FontVariation]."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of predefined color palettes. Palette contains all colors "
"used to render font glyphs. Each palette has the same number of colors."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de paletas de cores predefinidas. A paleta contém todas as "
"cores usadas para renderizar glifos de fontes. Cada paleta tem o mesmo "
"número de cores."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the predefined color palette at [param index]. Palette "
"contains all colors used to render font glyphs. Each palette has the same "
"number of colors."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome da paleta de cores predefinida em [param index]. A paleta "
"contém todas as cores usadas para renderizar glifos de fonte. Cada paleta "
"tem o mesmo número de cores."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [Array] of valid [Font] [RID]s, which can be passed to the "
"[TextServer] methods."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Array] de [RID]s de [Font] válidos, que podem ser passados para "
"os métodos do [TextServer]."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid "Returns the amount of spacing for the given [param spacing] type."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade de espaçamento para o tipo de [param spacing] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the size of a bounding box of a single-line string, taking kerning, "
"advance and subpixel positioning into account. See also [method "
"get_multiline_string_size] and [method draw_string].\n"
"For example, to get the string size as displayed by a single-line Label, "
"use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var string_size = "
"$Label.get_theme_font(\"font\").get_string_size($Label.text, "
"HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1, $Label.get_theme_font_size(\"font_size\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Label label = GetNode<Label>(\"Label\");\n"
"Vector2 stringSize = label.GetThemeFont(\"font\").GetStringSize(label.Text, "
"HorizontalAlignment.Left, -1, label.GetThemeFontSize(\"font_size\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since kerning, advance and subpixel positioning are taken into "
"account by [method get_string_size], using separate [method get_string_size] "
"calls on substrings of a string then adding the results together will return "
"a different result compared to using a single [method get_string_size] call "
"on the full string.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real height of the string is context-dependent and can be "
"significantly different from the value returned by [method get_height]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho de uma caixa delimitadora de uma string de linha única, "
"levando em consideração o kerning, o avanço e o posicionamento de subpíxeis. "
"Veja também [method get_multiline_string_size] e [method draw_string].\n"
"Por exemplo, para obter o tamanho da string conforme exibido por um Label de "
"linha única, use:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var string_size = "
"$Label.get_theme_font(\"font\").get_string_size($Label.text, "
"HORIZONTAL_ALIGNMENT_LEFT, -1, $Label.get_theme_font_size(\"font_size\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Label label = GetNode<Label>(\"Label\");\n"
"Vector2 stringSize = label.GetThemeFont(\"font\").GetStringSize(label.Text, "
"HorizontalAlignment.Left, -1, label.GetThemeFontSize(\"font_size\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Como o kerning, o avanço e o posicionamento de subpíxeis são "
"levados em consideração por [method get_string_size], o uso de chamadas "
"separadas de [method get_string_size] em substrings de uma string e a "
"posterior soma dos resultados retornarão um resultado diferente em "
"comparação ao uso de uma única chamada de [method get_string_size] na string "
"completa.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A altura real da string depende do contexto e pode ser "
"significativamente diferente do valor retornado por [method get_height]."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a string containing all the characters available in the font.\n"
"If a given character is included in more than one font data source, it "
"appears only once in the returned string."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid "Returns list of OpenType features supported by font."
msgstr "Retorna a lista de recursos OpenType suportados pela fonte."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns list of supported [url=https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/"
"opentype/spec/dvaraxisreg]variation coordinates[/url], each coordinate is "
"returned as [code]tag: Vector3i(min_value,max_value,default_value)[/code].\n"
"Font variations allow for continuous change of glyph characteristics along "
"some given design axis, such as weight, width or slant.\n"
"To print available variation axes of a variable font:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var fv = FontVariation.new()\n"
"fv.base_font = load(\"res://RobotoFlex.ttf\")\n"
"var variation_list = fv.get_supported_variation_list()\n"
"for tag in variation_list:\n"
"\tvar name = TextServerManager.get_primary_interface().tag_to_name(tag)\n"
"\tvar values = variation_list[tag]\n"
"\tprint(\"variation axis: %s (%d)\\n\\tmin, max, default: %s\" % [name, tag, "
"values])\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To set and get variation coordinates of a [FontVariation], use "
"[member FontVariation.variation_opentype]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns average pixel offset of the underline below the baseline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real underline position of the string is context-dependent and "
"can be significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use "
"it only as rough estimate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Returns average thickness of the underline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Real underline thickness of the string is context-dependent and "
"can be significantly different from the value returned by this function. Use "
"it only as rough estimate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a Unicode [param char] is available in the font."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se um [param char] Unicode estiver disponível na "
"fonte."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the font supports the given language (as a "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639-1]ISO 639[/url] code)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a fonte suportar o idioma fornecido (como um "
"código [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_639-1]ISO 639[/url])."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the font supports the given script (as a "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15924]ISO 15924[/url] code)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a fonte suportar o script fornecido (como um "
"código [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_15924]ISO 15924[/url])."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid "Sets LRU cache capacity for [code]draw_*[/code] methods."
msgstr "Define a capacidade do cache LRU para métodos [code]draw_*[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Font.xml
msgid ""
"Array of fallback [Font]s to use as a substitute if a glyph is not found in "
"this current [Font].\n"
"If this array is empty in a [FontVariation], the [member "
"FontVariation.base_font]'s fallbacks are used instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FontFile.xml
msgid ""
"Holds font source data and prerendered glyph cache, imported from a dynamic "
"or a bitmap font."
msgstr ""
"Armazena dados de fonte de origem e cache de glyphs pré-renderizados, "
"importados de uma fonte dinâmica ou bitmap."

#: doc/classes/FontFile.xml
msgid ""
"[FontFile] contains a set of glyphs to represent Unicode characters imported "
"from a font file, as well as a cache of rasterized glyphs, and a set of "
"fallback [Font]s to use.\n"
"Use [FontVariation] to access specific OpenType variation of the font, "
"create simulated bold / slanted version, and draw lines of text.\n"
"For more complex text processing, use [FontVariation] in conjunction with "
"[TextLine] or [TextParagraph].\n"
"Supported font formats:\n"
"- Dynamic font importer: TrueType (.ttf), TrueType collection (.ttc), "
"OpenType (.otf), OpenType collection (.otc), WOFF (.woff), WOFF2 (.woff2), "
"Type 1 (.pfb, .pfm).\n"
"- Bitmap font importer: AngelCode BMFont (.fnt, .font), text and binary "
"(version 3) format variants.\n"
"- Monospace image font importer: All supported image formats.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A character is a symbol that represents an item (letter, digit "
"etc.) in an abstract way.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A glyph is a bitmap or a shape used to draw one or more "
"characters in a context-dependent manner. Glyph indices are bound to the "
"specific font data source.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If none of the font data sources contain glyphs for a character "
"used in a string, the character in question will be replaced with a box "
"displaying its hexadecimal code.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var f = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\")\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_override(\"font\", f)\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_size_override(\"font_size\", 64)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var f = ResourceLoader.Load<FontFile>(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\");\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontOverride(\"font\", f);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontSizeOverride(\"font_size\", 64);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"[FontFile] contém um conjunto de glifos para representar caracteres Unicode "
"importados de um arquivo de fonte, bem como um cache de glifos rasterizados "
"e um conjunto de [Font]s de fallback para usar.\n"
"Use [FontVariation] para acessar uma variação OpenType específica da fonte, "
"criar versões em negrito / inclinação simuladas e desenhar linhas de texto.\n"
"Para processamento de texto mais complexo, use [FontVariation] em conjunto "
"com [TextLine] ou [TextParagraph].\n"
"Formatos de fonte suportados:\n"
"- Importador de fontes dinâmicas: TrueType (.ttf), TrueType collection "
"(.ttc), OpenType (.otf), OpenType collection (.otc), WOFF (.woff), WOFF2 "
"(.woff2), Type 1 (.pfb, .pfm).\n"
"- Importador de fontes bitmap: AngelCode BMFont (.fnt, .font), variantes de "
"formato de texto e binário (versão 3).\n"
"- Importador de fontes de imagem monoespaçadas: Todos os formatos de imagem "
"suportados.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Um caractere é um símbolo que representa um item (letra, "
"dígito, etc.) de forma abstrata.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Um glifo é um bitmap ou uma forma usada para desenhar um ou "
"mais caracteres de maneira dependente do contexto. Os índices de glifos "
"estão vinculados à fonte de dados específica da fonte.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se nenhuma das fontes de dados da fonte contiver glifos para um "
"caractere usado em uma string, o caractere em questão será substituído por "
"uma caixa exibindo seu código hexadecimal.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var f = load(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\")\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_override(\"font\", f)\n"
"$Label.add_theme_font_size_override(\"font_size\", 64)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var f = ResourceLoader.Load<FontFile>(\"res://BarlowCondensed-Bold.ttf\");\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontOverride(\"font\", f);\n"
"GetNode(\"Label\").AddThemeFontSizeOverride(\"font_size\", 64);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/FontFile.xml
msgid "Removes all font cache entries."
msgstr "Remove todas as entradas de cache de fontes."

#: doc/classes/FontFile.xml
msgid ""
"Removes all rendered glyph information from the cache entry.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function will not remove textures associated with the "
"glyphs, use [method remove_texture] to remove them manually."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/FontFile.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
msgid "Removes all kerning overrides."
msgstr "Remove todas as sobreposições de kerning."

#: doc/classes/FontFile.xml doc/classes/TextServer.xml
#: doc/classes/TextServerExtension.xml
