msgstr ""
"Inicia um novo cálculo de hash do [param type] fornecido (por exemplo, "
"[constant HASH_SHA256] para iniciar o cálculo de um SHA-256)."

#: doc/classes/HashingContext.xml
msgid "Updates the computation with the given [param chunk] of data."
msgstr "Atualiza o cálculo com o [param chunk] de dados fornecido."

#: doc/classes/HashingContext.xml
msgid "Hashing algorithm: MD5."
msgstr "Algoritmo de hash: MD5."

#: doc/classes/HashingContext.xml
msgid "Hashing algorithm: SHA-1."
msgstr "Algoritmo de hash: SHA-1."

#: doc/classes/HashingContext.xml
msgid "Hashing algorithm: SHA-256."
msgstr "Algoritmo de hash: SHA-256."

#: doc/classes/HBoxContainer.xml
msgid "A container that arranges its child controls horizontally."
msgstr "Um contêiner que organiza seus controles filhos horizontalmente."

#: doc/classes/HBoxContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A variant of [BoxContainer] that can only arrange its child controls "
"horizontally. Child controls are rearranged automatically when their minimum "
"size changes."
msgstr ""
"Uma variante de [BoxContainer] que só pode organizar seus controles filhos "
"horizontalmente. Os controles filhos são reorganizados automaticamente "
"quando seu tamanho mínimo muda."

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid "A 3D heightmap shape used for physics collision."
msgstr "Uma forma de mapa de altura 3D usada para colisão física."

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"A 3D heightmap shape, intended for use in physics to provide a shape for a "
"[CollisionShape3D]. This type is most commonly used for terrain with "
"vertices placed in a fixed-width grid.\n"
"The heightmap is represented as a 2D grid of height values, which represent "
"the position of grid points on the Y axis. Grid points are spaced 1 unit "
"apart on the X and Z axes, and the grid is centered on the origin of the "
"[CollisionShape3D] node. Internally, each grid square is divided into two "
"triangles.\n"
"Due to the nature of the heightmap, it cannot be used to model overhangs or "
"caves, which would require multiple vertices at the same vertical location. "
"Holes can be punched through the collision by assigning [constant "
"@GDScript.NAN] to the height of the desired vertices (this is supported in "
"both GodotPhysics3D and Jolt Physics). You could then insert meshes with "
"their own separate collision to provide overhangs, caves, and so on.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [HeightMapShape3D] is faster to check collisions against "
"than [ConcavePolygonShape3D], but it is significantly slower than primitive "
"shapes like [BoxShape3D].\n"
"A heightmap collision shape can also be built by using an [Image] "
"reference:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var heightmap_texture = ResourceLoader.load(\"res://heightmap_image.exr\")\n"
"var heightmap_image = heightmap_texture.get_image()\n"
"heightmap_image.convert(Image.FORMAT_RF)\n"
"\n"
"var height_min = 0.0\n"
"var height_max = 10.0\n"
"\n"
"update_map_data_from_image(heightmap_image, height_min, height_max)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you need to use a spacing different than 1 unit, you can "
"adjust the [member Node3D.scale] of the shape. However, keep in mind that "
"GodotPhysics3D does not support non-uniform scaling: you'll need to scale "
"the Y axis by the same amount as the X and Z axes, which means the values in "
"[member map_data] will need to be pre-scaled by the inverse of that scale. "
"Also note that GodotPhysics3D does not support scaling at all for dynamic "
"bodies (that is, non-frozen [RigidBody3D] nodes); to use a scaled "
"[HeightMapShape3D] with those, you will need to use Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Uma forma de mapa de altura 3D, destinada ao uso na física para fornecer uma "
"forma para um [CollisionShape3D]. Esse tipo é mais comumente usado para "
"terrenos com vértices colocados em uma grade de largura fixa.\n"
"O mapa de altura é representado como uma grade 2D de valores de altura, que "
"representam a posição dos pontos da grade no eixo Y. Os pontos da grade são "
"espaçados por 1 unidade nos eixos X e Z, e a grade é centralizada na origem "
"do nó [CollisionShape3D]. Internamente, cada quadrado da grade é dividido em "
"dois triângulos.\n"
"Devido à natureza do mapa de altura, ele não pode ser usado para modelar "
"saliências ou cavernas, o que exigiria vários vértices na mesma localização "
"vertical. Buracos podem ser feitos na colisão atribuindo [constant "
"@GDScript.NAN] à altura dos vértices desejados (isso é suportado tanto no "
"GodotPhysics3D quanto no Jolt Physics). Você pode então inserir malhas com "
"sua própria colisão separada para fornecer saliências, cavernas e assim por "
"diante.\n"
"[b]Desempenho:[/b] [HeightMapShape3D] é mais rápido para verificar colisões "
"do que [ConcavePolygonShape3D], mas é significativamente mais lento do que "
"formas primitivas como [BoxShape3D].\n"
"Uma forma de colisão de mapa de altura também pode ser construída usando uma "
"referência de [Image]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var heightmap_texture = ResourceLoader.load(\"res://heightmap_image.exr\")\n"
"var heightmap_image = heightmap_texture.get_image()\n"
"heightmap_image.convert(Image.FORMAT_RF)\n"
"\n"
"var height_min = 0.0\n"
"var height_max = 10.0\n"
"\n"
"update_map_data_from_image(heightmap_image, height_min, height_max)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se precisar usar um espaçamento diferente de 1 unidade, você "
"pode ajustar o [member Node3D.scale] da forma. No entanto, tenha em mente "
"que o GodotPhysics3D não suporta escala não uniforme: você precisará escalar "
"o eixo Y pela mesma quantidade que os eixos X e Z, o que significa que os "
"valores em [member map_data] precisarão ser pré-escalados pelo inverso dessa "
"escala. Observe também que o GodotPhysics3D não oferece suporte a escala "
"para corpos dinâmicos (ou seja, nós [RigidBody3D] não congelados); para usar "
"um [HeightMapShape3D] escalado com eles, você precisará usar o Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the largest height value found in [member map_data]. Recalculates "
"only when [member map_data] changes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o maior valor de altura encontrado em [member map_data]. Recalcula "
"apenas quando [member map_data] muda."

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the smallest height value found in [member map_data]. Recalculates "
"only when [member map_data] changes."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o menor valor de altura encontrado em [member map_data]. Recalcula "
"apenas quando [member map_data] muda."

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Updates [member map_data] with data read from an [Image] reference. "
"Automatically resizes heightmap [member map_width] and [member map_depth] to "
"fit the full image width and height.\n"
"The image needs to be in either [constant Image.FORMAT_RF] (32 bit), "
"[constant Image.FORMAT_RH] (16 bit), or [constant Image.FORMAT_R8] (8 bit).\n"
"Each image pixel is read in as a float on the range from [code]0.0[/code] "
"(black pixel) to [code]1.0[/code] (white pixel). This range value gets "
"remapped to [param height_min] and [param height_max] to form the final "
"height value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a heightmap with 16-bit or 32-bit data, stored in EXR or "
"HDR format is recommended. Using 8-bit height data, or a format like PNG "
"that Godot imports as 8-bit, will result in a terraced terrain."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Heightmap data. The array's size must be equal to [member map_width] "
"multiplied by [member map_depth]."
msgstr ""
"Dados do mapa de altura. O tamanho do array deve ser igual a [member "
"map_width] multiplicado por [member map_depth]."

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Number of vertices in the depth of the heightmap. Changing this will resize "
"the [member map_data]."
msgstr ""
"Número de vértices na profundidade do mapa de altura. Alterar isso "
"redimensionará o [member map_data]."

#: doc/classes/HeightMapShape3D.xml
msgid ""
"Number of vertices in the width of the heightmap. Changing this will resize "
"the [member map_data]."
msgstr ""
"Número de vértices na largura do mapa de altura. Alterar isso redimensionará "
"o [member map_data]."

#: doc/classes/HFlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that arranges its child controls horizontally and wraps them "
"around at the borders."
msgstr ""
"Um contêiner que organiza seus controles filhos horizontalmente e os quebra "
"nas bordas."

#: doc/classes/HFlowContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A variant of [FlowContainer] that can only arrange its child controls "
"horizontally, wrapping them around at the borders. This is similar to how "
"text in a book wraps around when no more words can fit on a line."
msgstr ""
"Uma variante de [FlowContainer] que pode apenas organizar seus controles "
"filhos horizontalmente, envolvendo-os nas bordas. Isso é semelhante a como o "
"texto em um livro se envolve quando não há mais palavras que caibam em uma "
"linha."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that restricts the rotation of a 3D physics body around an "
"axis relative to another physics body."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta de física que restringe a rotação de um corpo físico 3D em torno "
"de um eixo em relação a outro corpo físico."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that restricts the rotation of a 3D physics body around an "
"axis relative to another physics body. For example, Body A can be a "
"[StaticBody3D] representing a door hinge that a [RigidBody3D] rotates around."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta física que restringe a rotação de um corpo físico 3D em torno de "
"um eixo em relação a outro corpo físico. Por exemplo, o Corpo A pode ser um "
"[StaticBody3D] representando uma dobradiça de porta em torno da qual um "
"[RigidBody3D] gira."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml doc/classes/Label3D.xml
#: doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "Returns the value of the specified flag."
msgstr "Retorna o valor do sinalizador especificado."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], enables the specified flag."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], ativa a flag especificada."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The speed with which the rotation across the axis perpendicular to the hinge "
"gets corrected."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade com que a rotação através do eixo perpendicular à dobradiça é "
"corrigida."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the hinges maximum and minimum rotation, defined by "
"[member angular_limit/lower] and [member angular_limit/upper] has effects."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a rotação máxima e mínima das dobradiças, definida por "
"[member angular_limit/lower] e [member angular_limit/upper], terá efeitos."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum rotation. Only active if [member angular_limit/enable] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A rotação mínima. Só fica ativa se [member angular_limit/enable] for "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid "The lower this value, the more the rotation gets slowed down."
msgstr "Quanto menor esse valor, mais a rotação é desacelerada."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"This property is never set by the engine and is kept for compatibility "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Esta propriedade nunca é definida pelo motor e é mantida para fins de "
"compatibilidade."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum rotation. Only active if [member angular_limit/enable] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A rotação máxima. Só fica ativa se [member angular_limit/enable] for "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid "When activated, a motor turns the hinge."
msgstr "Quando ativado, um motor gira a dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Maximum acceleration for the motor."
msgstr "Aceleração máxima para o motor."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Target speed for the motor."
msgstr "Velocidade alvo para o motor."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The speed with which the two bodies get pulled together when they move in "
"different directions."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade com que os dois corpos são puxados um para o outro quando se "
"movem em direções diferentes."

#: doc/classes/HingeJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"This property is never used by the engine and is kept for compatibility "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"Esta propriedade nunca é usada pelo motor e é mantida para fins de "
"compatibilidade."

#: doc/classes/HMACContext.xml
msgid "Used to create an HMAC for a message using a key."
msgstr "Usado para criar um HMAC para uma mensagem usando uma chave."

#: doc/classes/HMACContext.xml
msgid ""
"The HMACContext class is useful for advanced HMAC use cases, such as "
"streaming the message as it supports creating the message over time rather "
"than providing it all at once.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"var ctx = HMACContext.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar key = \"supersecret\".to_utf8_buffer()\n"
"\tvar err = ctx.start(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, key)\n"
"\tassert(err == OK)\n"
"\tvar msg1 = \"this is \".to_utf8_buffer()\n"
"\tvar msg2 = \"super duper secret\".to_utf8_buffer()\n"
"\terr = ctx.update(msg1)\n"
"\tassert(err == OK)\n"
"\terr = ctx.update(msg2)\n"
"\tassert(err == OK)\n"
"\tvar hmac = ctx.finish()\n"
"\tprint(hmac.hex_encode())\n"
"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Diagnostics;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate HmacContext _ctx = new HmacContext();\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tbyte[] key = \"supersecret\".ToUtf8Buffer();\n"
"\t\tError err = _ctx.Start(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, key);\n"
"\t\tDebug.Assert(err == Error.Ok);\n"
"\t\tbyte[] msg1 = \"this is \".ToUtf8Buffer();\n"
"\t\tbyte[] msg2 = \"super duper secret\".ToUtf8Buffer();\n"
"\t\terr = _ctx.Update(msg1);\n"
"\t\tDebug.Assert(err == Error.Ok);\n"
"\t\terr = _ctx.Update(msg2);\n"
"\t\tDebug.Assert(err == Error.Ok);\n"
"\t\tbyte[] hmac = _ctx.Finish();\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(hmac.HexEncode());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"A classe HMACContext é útil para casos de uso avançados de HMAC, como "
"transmitir a mensagem em fluxo, pois suporta a criação da mensagem ao longo "
"do tempo em vez de fornecê-la toda de uma vez.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"var ctx = HMACContext.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar key = \"supersecret\".to_utf8_buffer()\n"
"\tvar err = ctx.start(HashingContext.HASH_SHA256, key)\n"
"\tassert(err == OK)\n"
"\tvar msg1 = \"this is \".to_utf8_buffer()\n"
"\tvar msg2 = \"super duper secret\".to_utf8_buffer()\n"
"\terr = ctx.update(msg1)\n"
"\tassert(err == OK)\n"
"\terr = ctx.update(msg2)\n"
"\tassert(err == OK)\n"
"\tvar hmac = ctx.finish()\n"
"\tprint(hmac.hex_encode())\n"
"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"using Godot;\n"
"using System.Diagnostics;\n"
"\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate HmacContext _ctx = new HmacContext();\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _Ready()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tbyte[] key = \"supersecret\".ToUtf8Buffer();\n"
"\t\tError err = _ctx.Start(HashingContext.HashType.Sha256, key);\n"
"\t\tDebug.Assert(err == Error.Ok);\n"
"\t\tbyte[] msg1 = \"this is \".ToUtf8Buffer();\n"
"\t\tbyte[] msg2 = \"super duper secret\".ToUtf8Buffer();\n"
"\t\terr = _ctx.Update(msg1);\n"
"\t\tDebug.Assert(err == Error.Ok);\n"
"\t\terr = _ctx.Update(msg2);\n"
"\t\tDebug.Assert(err == Error.Ok);\n"
"\t\tbyte[] hmac = _ctx.Finish();\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(hmac.HexEncode());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/HMACContext.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the resulting HMAC. If the HMAC failed, an empty [PackedByteArray] "
"is returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o HMAC resultante. Se o HMAC falhar, um [PackedByteArray] vazio será "
"retornado."

#: doc/classes/HMACContext.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the HMACContext. This method cannot be called again on the same "
"HMACContext until [method finish] has been called."
msgstr ""
"Inicializa o HMACContext. Este método não pode ser chamado novamente no "
"mesmo HMACContext até que [method finish] tenha sido chamado."

#: doc/classes/HMACContext.xml
msgid ""
"Updates the message to be HMACed. This can be called multiple times before "
"[method finish] is called to append [param data] to the message, but cannot "
"be called until [method start] has been called."
msgstr ""
"Atualiza a mensagem a ser gerada por HMAC. Isso pode ser chamado várias "
"vezes antes que [method finish] seja chamado para anexar [param data] à "
"mensagem, mas não pode ser chamado até que [method start] tenha sido chamado."

#: doc/classes/HScrollBar.xml
msgid "A horizontal scrollbar that goes from left (min) to right (max)."
msgstr ""
"Uma barra de rolagem horizontal que vai da esquerda (mín) para a direita "
"(máx)."

#: doc/classes/HScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"A horizontal scrollbar, typically used to navigate through content that "
"extends beyond the visible width of a control. It is a [Range]-based control "
"and goes from left (min) to right (max)."
msgstr ""
"Uma barra de rolagem horizontal, normalmente usada para navegar por conteúdo "
"que se estende além da largura visível de um controle. É um controle baseado "
"em [Range] e vai da esquerda (mín) à direita (máx)."

#: doc/classes/HScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"Padding between the bottom of the [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] element and "
"the [theme_item ScrollBar.grabber].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To apply horizontal padding, modify the left/right content "
"margins of [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HScrollBar.xml
msgid ""
"Padding between the top of the [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] element and the "
"[theme_item ScrollBar.grabber].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To apply horizontal padding, modify the left/right content "
"margins of [theme_item ScrollBar.scroll] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HSeparator.xml
msgid "A horizontal line used for separating other controls."
msgstr "Uma linha horizontal usada para separar outros controles."

#: doc/classes/HSeparator.xml
msgid ""
"A horizontal separator used for separating other controls that are arranged "
"[b]vertically[/b]. [HSeparator] is purely visual and normally drawn as a "
"[StyleBoxLine]."
msgstr ""
"Um separador horizontal usado para separar outros controles que são "
"dispostos [b]verticalmente[/b]. [HSeparator] é puramente visual e "
"normalmente desenhado como um [StyleBoxLine]."

#: doc/classes/HSlider.xml
msgid "A horizontal slider that goes from left (min) to right (max)."
msgstr ""
"Um controle deslizante horizontal que vai da esquerda (mín) para a direita "
"(máx)."

#: doc/classes/HSlider.xml
msgid ""
"A horizontal slider, used to adjust a value by moving a grabber along a "
"horizontal axis. It is a [Range]-based control and goes from left (min) to "
"right (max)."
msgstr ""
"Um controle deslizante horizontal, usado para ajustar um valor movendo um "
"controle deslizante ao longo de um eixo horizontal. É um controle baseado em "
"[Range] e vai da esquerda (mín) para a direita (máx)."

#: doc/classes/HSplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that splits two child controls horizontally and provides a "
"grabber for adjusting the split ratio."
msgstr ""
"Um container que divide dois controles filhos horizontalmente e fornece um "
"puxador para ajustar a proporção de divisão."

#: doc/classes/HSplitContainer.xml
msgid ""
"A container that accepts only two child controls, then arranges them "
"horizontally and creates a divisor between them. The divisor can be dragged "
"around to change the size relation between the child controls."
msgstr ""
"Um contêiner que aceita apenas dois controles filhos, organizando-os "
"horizontalmente e criando um divisor entre eles. O divisor pode ser "
"arrastado para alterar a relação de tamanho entre os controles filhos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Low-level hyper-text transfer protocol client."
msgstr "Cliente de protocolo de transferência hipertexto de baixo nível."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Hyper-text transfer protocol client (sometimes called \"User Agent\"). Used "
"to make HTTP requests to download web content, upload files and other data "
"or to communicate with various services, among other use cases.\n"
"See the [HTTPRequest] node for a higher-level alternative.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This client only needs to connect to a host once (see [method "
"connect_to_host]) to send multiple requests. Because of this, methods that "
"take URLs usually take just the part after the host instead of the full URL, "
"as the client is already connected to a host. See [method request] for a "
"full example and to get started.\n"
"An [HTTPClient] should be reused between multiple requests or to connect to "
"different hosts instead of creating one client per request. Supports "
"Transport Layer Security (TLS), including server certificate verification. "
"HTTP status codes in the 2xx range indicate success, 3xx redirection (i.e. "
"\"try again, but over here\"), 4xx something was wrong with the request, and "
"5xx something went wrong on the server's side.\n"
"For more information on HTTP, see [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"docs/Web/HTTP]MDN's documentation on HTTP[/url] (or read [url=https://"
"tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2616]RFC 2616[/url] to get it straight from the "
"source).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to use transport encryption (TLS) and to avoid "
"sending sensitive information (such as login credentials) in HTTP GET URL "
"parameters. Consider using HTTP POST requests or HTTP headers for such "
"information instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When performing HTTP requests from a project exported to Web, "
"keep in mind the remote server may not allow requests from foreign origins "
"due to [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/CORS]CORS[/"
"url]. If you host the server in question, you should modify its backend to "
"allow requests from foreign origins by adding the [code]Access-Control-Allow-"
"Origin: *[/code] HTTP header.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] TLS support is currently limited to TLSv1.2 and TLSv1.3. "
"Attempting to connect to a server that only supports older (insecure) TLS "
"versions will return an error.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] TLS certificate revocation and certificate pinning are "
"currently not supported. Revoked certificates are accepted as long as they "
"are otherwise valid. If this is a concern, you may want to use automatically "
"managed certificates with a short validity period."
msgstr ""
"Cliente de protocolo de transferência de hipertexto (às vezes chamado de "
"\"User Agent\"). Usado para fazer solicitações HTTP para baixar conteúdo da "
"web, enviar arquivos e outros dados, ou para se comunicar com vários "
"serviços, entre outros casos de uso.\n"
"Consulte o nó [HTTPRequest] para obter uma alternativa de nível superior.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este cliente só precisa se conectar a um host uma vez (consulte "
"[method connect_to_host]) para enviar várias solicitações. Por causa disso, "
"os métodos que recebem URLs geralmente aceitam apenas a parte após o host em "
"vez da URL completa, pois o cliente já está conectado a um host. Consulte "
"[method request] para ver um exemplo completo e começar.\n"
"Um [HTTPClient] deve ser reutilizado entre várias solicitações ou para se "
"conectar a diferentes hosts, em vez de criar um cliente por solicitação. "
"Suporta Transport Layer Security (TLS), incluindo verificação de certificado "
"do servidor. Os códigos de status HTTP na faixa de 2xx indicam sucesso, 3xx "
"redirecionamento (ou seja, \"tente novamente, mas por aqui\"), 4xx algo "
"estava errado com a solicitação e 5xx algo deu errado do lado do servidor.\n"
"Para obter mais informações sobre HTTP, consulte a [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP]documentação da MDN sobre HTTP[/"
"url] (ou leia a [url=https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2616]RFC 2616[/url] para "
"obter direto da fonte).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao exportar para o Android, certifique-se de habilitar a "
"permissão [code]INTERNET[/code] no predefinição de exportação do Android "
"antes de exportar o projeto ou usar a implantação em um clique. Caso "
"contrário, qualquer tipo de comunicação de rede será bloqueada pelo "
"Android.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] É recomendável usar criptografia de transporte (TLS) e evitar o "
"envio de informações confidenciais (como credenciais de login) em parâmetros "
"de URL HTTP GET. Considere usar solicitações HTTP POST ou cabeçalhos HTTP "
"para essas informações.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao realizar solicitações HTTP a partir de um projeto exportado "
"para a Web, tenha em mente que o servidor remoto pode não permitir "
"solicitações de origens estrangeiras devido ao [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/CORS]CORS[/url]. Se você hospedar "
"o servidor em questão, deverá modificar o backend dele para permitir "
"solicitações de origens estrangeiras adicionando o cabeçalho HTTP "
"[code]Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O suporte a TLS está atualmente limitado a TLSv1.2 e TLSv1.3. "
"Tentar se conectar a um servidor que suporta apenas versões TLS mais antigas "
"(inseguras) retornará um erro.\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] A revogação de certificados TLS e o encapsulamento (pinning) "
"de certificados atualmente não são suportados. Certificados revogados são "
"aceitos desde que sejam válidos de outra forma. Se isso for uma preocupação, "
"você pode querer usar certificados gerenciados automaticamente com um curto "
"período de validade."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "HTTP client class"
msgstr "Classe de cliente HTTP"

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
#: doc/classes/StreamPeerTLS.xml
msgid "TLS certificates"
msgstr "Certificados TLS"

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Closes the current connection, allowing reuse of this [HTTPClient]."
msgstr "Fecha a conexão atual, permitindo a reutilização deste [HTTPClient]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Connects to a host. This needs to be done before any requests are sent.\n"
"If no [param port] is specified (or [code]-1[/code] is used), it is "
"automatically set to 80 for HTTP and 443 for HTTPS. You can pass the "
"optional [param tls_options] parameter to customize the trusted "
"certification authorities, or the common name verification when using HTTPS. "
"See [method TLSOptions.client] and [method TLSOptions.client_unsafe]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the response's body length.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some Web servers may not send a body length. In this case, the "
"value returned will be [code]-1[/code]. If using chunked transfer encoding, "
"the body length will also be [code]-1[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function always returns [code]-1[/code] on the Web "
"platform due to browsers limitations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Returns the response's HTTP status code."
msgstr "Retorna o código de status HTTP da resposta."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Returns the response headers."
msgstr "Retorna os cabeçalhos de resposta."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all response headers as a [Dictionary]. Each entry is composed by "
"the header name, and a [String] containing the values separated by [code]\"; "
"\"[/code]. The casing is kept the same as the headers were received.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"content-length\": 12,\n"
"\t\"Content-Type\": \"application/json; charset=UTF-8\",\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [enum Status] constant. Need to call [method poll] in order to get "
"status updates."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma constante [enum Status]. É necessário chamar [method poll] para "
"obter atualizações de status."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], this [HTTPClient] has a response available."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], este [HTTPClient] tem uma resposta disponível."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], this [HTTPClient] has a response that is chunked."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], este [HTTPClient] possui uma resposta fragmentada."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"This needs to be called in order to have any request processed. Check "
"results with [method get_status]."
msgstr ""
"Isto precisa ser chamado para que qualquer requisição seja processada. "
"Verifique os resultados com [method get_status]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Generates a GET/POST application/x-www-form-urlencoded style query string "
"from a provided dictionary, e.g.:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fields = { \"username\": \"user\", \"password\": \"pass\" }\n"
"var query_string = http_client.query_string_from_dict(fields)\n"
"# Returns \"username=user&password=pass\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fields = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"username\", \"user\" }, "
"{ \"password\", \"pass\" } };\n"
"string queryString = httpClient.QueryStringFromDict(fields);\n"
"// Returns \"username=user&password=pass\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Furthermore, if a key has a [code]null[/code] value, only the key itself is "
"added, without equal sign and value. If the value is an array, for each "
"value in it a pair with the same key is added.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fields = { \"single\": 123, \"not_valued\": null, \"multiple\": [22, 33, "
"44] }\n"
"var query_string = http_client.query_string_from_dict(fields)\n"
"# Returns \"single=123&not_valued&multiple=22&multiple=33&multiple=44\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fields = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"single\", 123 },\n"
"\t{ \"notValued\", default },\n"
"\t{ \"multiple\", new Godot.Collections.Array { 22, 33, 44 } },\n"
"};\n"
"string queryString = httpClient.QueryStringFromDict(fields);\n"
"// Returns \"single=123&not_valued&multiple=22&multiple=33&multiple=44\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Gera uma string de consulta no estilo GET/POST application/x-www-form-"
"urlencoded a partir de um dicionário fornecido, por exemplo:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fields = { \"username\": \"user\", \"password\": \"pass\" }\n"
"var query_string = http_client.query_string_from_dict(fields)\n"
"# Retorna \"username=user&password=pass\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fields = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"username\", \"user\" }, "
"{ \"password\", \"pass\" } };\n"
"string queryString = httpClient.QueryStringFromDict(fields);\n"
"// Retorna \"username=user&password=pass\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Além disso, se uma chave tiver um valor [code]null[/code], apenas a chave em "
"si é adicionada, sem o sinal de igual e o valor. Se o valor for uma matriz, "
"para cada valor nela, um par com a mesma chave é adicionado.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fields = { \"single\": 123, \"not_valued\": null, \"multiple\": [22, 33, "
"44] }\n"
"var query_string = http_client.query_string_from_dict(fields)\n"
"# Retorna \"single=123&not_valued&multiple=22&multiple=33&multiple=44\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fields = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"single\", 123 },\n"
"\t{ \"notValued\", default },\n"
"\t{ \"multiple\", new Godot.Collections.Array { 22, 33, 44 } },\n"
"};\n"
"string queryString = httpClient.QueryStringFromDict(fields);\n"
"// Retorna \"single=123&not_valued&multiple=22&multiple=33&multiple=44\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Reads one chunk from the response."
msgstr "Lê um bloco da resposta."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Sends an HTTP request to the connected host with the given [param method].\n"
"The URL parameter is usually just the part after the host, so for "
"[code]https://example.com/index.php[/code], it is [code]/index.php[/code]. "
"When sending requests to an HTTP proxy server, it should be an absolute URL. "
"For [constant HTTPClient.METHOD_OPTIONS] requests, [code]*[/code] is also "
"allowed. For [constant HTTPClient.METHOD_CONNECT] requests, it should be the "
"authority component ([code]host:port[/code]).\n"
"[param headers] are HTTP request headers.\n"
"To create a POST request with query strings to push to the server, do:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fields = { \"username\": \"user\", \"password\": \"pass\" }\n"
"var query_string = http_client.query_string_from_dict(fields)\n"
"var headers = [\"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\", "
"\"Content-Length: \" + str(query_string.length())]\n"
"var result = http_client.request(http_client.METHOD_POST, \"/index.php\", "
"headers, query_string)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fields = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"username\", \"user\" }, "
"{ \"password\", \"pass\" } };\n"
"string queryString = new HttpClient().QueryStringFromDict(fields);\n"
"string[] headers = [\"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\", $"
"\"Content-Length: {queryString.Length}\"];\n"
"var result = new HttpClient().Request(HttpClient.Method.Post, \"index.php\", "
"headers, queryString);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param body] parameter is ignored if [param method] is "
"[constant HTTPClient.METHOD_GET]. This is because GET methods can't contain "
"request data. As a workaround, you can pass request data as a query string "
"in the URL. See [method String.uri_encode] for an example."
msgstr ""
"Envia uma requisição HTTP para o host conectado com o [param method] "
"fornecido.\n"
"O parâmetro URL costuma ser apenas a parte após o host, portanto para "
"[code]https://example.com/index.php[/code], ele é [code]/index.php[/code]. "
"Ao enviar requisições para um servidor proxy HTTP, ele deve ser uma URL "
"absoluta. Para requisições [constant HTTPClient.METHOD_OPTIONS], [code]*[/"
"code] também é permitido. Para requisições [constant "
"HTTPClient.METHOD_CONNECT], ele deve ser o componente de autoridade "
"([code]host:port[/code]).\n"
"[param headers] são os cabeçalhos de requisição HTTP.\n"
"Para criar uma requisição POST com strings de consulta para enviar ao "
"servidor, faça:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var fields = { \"username\": \"user\", \"password\": \"pass\" }\n"
"var query_string = http_client.query_string_from_dict(fields)\n"
"var headers = [\"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\", "
"\"Content-Length: \" + str(query_string.length())]\n"
"var result = http_client.request(http_client.METHOD_POST, \"/index.php\", "
"headers, query_string)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fields = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary { { \"username\", \"user\" }, "
"{ \"password\", \"pass\" } };\n"
"string queryString = new HttpClient().QueryStringFromDict(fields);\n"
"string[] headers = [\"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\", $"
"\"Content-Length: {queryString.Length}\"];\n"
"var result = new HttpClient().Request(HttpClient.Method.Post, \"index.php\", "
"headers, queryString);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O parâmetro [param body] é ignorado se [param method] for "
"[constant HTTPClient.METHOD_GET]. Isso ocorre porque os métodos GET não "
"podem conter dados de requisição. Como alternativa, você pode passar os "
"dados da requisição como uma string de consulta na URL. Veja [method "
"String.uri_encode] para um exemplo."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a raw HTTP request to the connected host with the given [param "
"method].\n"
"The URL parameter is usually just the part after the host, so for "
"[code]https://example.com/index.php[/code], it is [code]/index.php[/code]. "
"When sending requests to an HTTP proxy server, it should be an absolute URL. "
"For [constant HTTPClient.METHOD_OPTIONS] requests, [code]*[/code] is also "
"allowed. For [constant HTTPClient.METHOD_CONNECT] requests, it should be the "
"authority component ([code]host:port[/code]).\n"
"[param headers] are HTTP request headers.\n"
"Sends the body data raw, as a byte array and does not encode it in any way."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the proxy server for HTTP requests.\n"
"The proxy server is unset if [param host] is empty or [param port] is -1."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the proxy server for HTTPS requests.\n"
"The proxy server is unset if [param host] is empty or [param port] is -1."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], execution will block until all data is read from the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a execução será bloqueada até que todos os dados sejam "
"lidos da resposta."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "The connection to use for this client."
msgstr "A conexão a ser usada para este cliente."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the buffer used and maximum bytes to read per iteration. See "
"[method read_response_body_chunk]."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho do buffer usado e o máximo de bytes a serem lidos por iteração. "
"Consulte [method read_response_body_chunk]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP GET method. The GET method requests a representation of the specified "
"resource. Requests using GET should only retrieve data."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP GET. O método GET solicita uma representação do recurso "
"especificado. Solicitações usando GET devem apenas recuperar dados."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP HEAD method. The HEAD method asks for a response identical to that of a "
"GET request, but without the response body. This is useful to request "
"metadata like HTTP headers or to check if a resource exists."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP HEAD. O método HEAD solicita uma resposta idêntica à de uma "
"solicitação GET, mas sem o corpo da resposta. Isso é útil para solicitar "
"metadados, como cabeçalhos HTTP, ou para verificar se um recurso existe."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP POST method. The POST method is used to submit an entity to the "
"specified resource, often causing a change in state or side effects on the "
"server. This is often used for forms and submitting data or uploading files."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP POST. O método POST é usado para enviar uma entidade para o "
"recurso especificado, frequentemente causando uma mudança de estado ou "
"efeitos colaterais no servidor. Isso é frequentemente usado para formulários "
"e envio de dados ou upload de arquivos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP PUT method. The PUT method asks to replace all current representations "
"of the target resource with the request payload. (You can think of POST as "
"\"create or update\" and PUT as \"update\", although many services tend to "
"not make a clear distinction or change their meaning)."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP PUT. O método PUT solicita a substituição de todas as "
"representações atuais do recurso de destino com o payload da requisição. "
"(Você pode pensar em POST como \"criar ou atualizar\" e PUT como "
"\"atualizar\", embora muitos serviços tendam a não fazer uma distinção clara "
"ou mudar seu significado)."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP DELETE method. The DELETE method requests to delete the specified "
"resource."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP DELETE. O método DELETE solicita a exclusão do recurso "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP OPTIONS method. The OPTIONS method asks for a description of the "
"communication options for the target resource. Rarely used."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP OPTIONS. O método OPTIONS solicita uma descrição das opções de "
"comunicação para o recurso de destino. Raramente usado."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP TRACE method. The TRACE method performs a message loop-back test along "
"the path to the target resource. Returns the entire HTTP request received in "
"the response body. Rarely used."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP TRACE. O método TRACE realiza um teste de loop-back de mensagem "
"ao longo do caminho até o recurso de destino. Retorna toda a solicitação "
"HTTP recebida no corpo da resposta. Raramente usado."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP CONNECT method. The CONNECT method establishes a tunnel to the server "
"identified by the target resource. Rarely used."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP CONNECT. O método CONNECT estabelece um túnel para o servidor "
"identificado pelo recurso de destino. Raramente usado."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP PATCH method. The PATCH method is used to apply partial modifications "
"to a resource."
msgstr ""
"Método HTTP PATCH. O método PATCH é usado para aplicar modificações parciais "
"a um recurso."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Method] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum Method]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Disconnected from the server."
msgstr "Status: Desconectado do servidor."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Currently resolving the hostname for the given URL into an IP."
msgstr ""
"Status: Resolvendo atualmente o nome de host para o URL fornecido em um IP."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: DNS failure: Can't resolve the hostname for the given URL."
msgstr ""
"Status: Falha de DNS: Não foi possível resolver o nome do host para a URL "
"fornecida."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Currently connecting to server."
msgstr "Status: Conectando-se ao servidor no momento."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Can't connect to the server."
msgstr "Status: Não foi possível conectar ao servidor."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Connection established."
msgstr "Status: Conexão estabelecida."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Currently sending request."
msgstr "Status: Enviando solicitação no momento."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: HTTP body received."
msgstr "Status: Corpo HTTP recebido."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Error in HTTP connection."
msgstr "Status: Erro na conexão HTTP."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "Status: Error in TLS handshake."
msgstr "Status: Erro no handshake TLS."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]100 Continue[/code]. Interim response that indicates "
"everything so far is OK and that the client should continue with the request "
"(or ignore this status if already finished)."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]100 Continue[/code]. Resposta provisória que "
"indica que tudo está OK até o momento e que o cliente deve continuar com a "
"solicitação (ou ignorar este status se já tiver terminado)."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]101 Switching Protocol[/code]. Sent in response to an "
"[code]Upgrade[/code] request header by the client. Indicates the protocol "
"the server is switching to."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]101 Switching Protocol[/code]. Enviado em "
"resposta a um cabeçalho de requisição [code]Upgrade[/code] pelo cliente. "
"Indica o protocolo para o qual o servidor está mudando."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]102 Processing[/code] (WebDAV). Indicates that the "
"server has received and is processing the request, but no response is "
"available yet."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]102 Processing[/code] (WebDAV). Indica que o "
"servidor recebeu e está processando a solicitação, mas nenhuma resposta está "
"disponível ainda."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]200 OK[/code]. The request has succeeded. Default "
"response for successful requests. Meaning varies depending on the request:\n"
"- [constant METHOD_GET]: The resource has been fetched and is transmitted in "
"the message body.\n"
"- [constant METHOD_HEAD]: The entity headers are in the message body.\n"
"- [constant METHOD_POST]: The resource describing the result of the action "
"is transmitted in the message body.\n"
"- [constant METHOD_TRACE]: The message body contains the request message as "
"received by the server."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]201 Created[/code]. The request has succeeded and a "
"new resource has been created as a result of it. This is typically the "
"response sent after a PUT request."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]201 Created[/code]. A solicitação foi bem-"
"sucedida e um novo recurso foi criado como resultado dela. Esta é "
"tipicamente a resposta enviada após uma solicitação PUT."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]202 Accepted[/code]. The request has been received "
"but not yet acted upon. It is non-committal, meaning that there is no way in "
"HTTP to later send an asynchronous response indicating the outcome of "
"processing the request. It is intended for cases where another process or "
"server handles the request, or for batch processing."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]202 Accepted[/code]. A requisição foi recebida, "
"mas ainda não foi processada. Ela não é definitiva, o que significa que não "
"há nenhuma maneira em HTTP de enviar posteriormente uma resposta assíncrona "
"indicando o resultado do processamento da requisição. Destina-se a casos em "
"que outro processo ou servidor lida com a requisição, ou para processamento "
"em lote."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]203 Non-Authoritative Information[/code]. This "
"response code means returned meta-information set is not exact set as "
"available from the origin server, but collected from a local or a third "
"party copy. Except this condition, 200 OK response should be preferred "
"instead of this response."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]203 Non-Authoritative Information[/code]. Este "
"código de resposta significa que o conjunto de metainformações retornado não "
"é o conjunto exato disponível no servidor de origem, mas coletado de uma "
"cópia local ou de terceiros. Exceto por esta condição, a resposta 200 OK "
"deve ser preferida em vez desta resposta."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]204 No Content[/code]. There is no content to send "
"for this request, but the headers may be useful. The user-agent may update "
"its cached headers for this resource with the new ones."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]204 No Content[/code]. Não há conteúdo para "
"enviar para esta solicitação, mas os cabeçalhos podem ser úteis. O agente de "
"usuário pode atualizar seus cabeçalhos em cache para este recurso com os "
"novos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]205 Reset Content[/code]. The server has fulfilled "
"the request and desires that the client resets the \"document view\" that "
"caused the request to be sent to its original state as received from the "
"origin server."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]205 Reset Content[/code]. O servidor cumpriu a "
"solicitação e deseja que o cliente redefina a \"visão do documento\" que "
"causou o envio da solicitação para seu estado original, conforme recebido do "
"servidor de origem."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]206 Partial Content[/code]. This response code is "
"used because of a range header sent by the client to separate download into "
"multiple streams."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]206 Partial Content[/code]. Este código de "
"resposta é usado devido a um cabeçalho de intervalo enviado pelo cliente "
"para separar o download em vários fluxos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]207 Multi-Status[/code] (WebDAV). A Multi-Status "
"response conveys information about multiple resources in situations where "
"multiple status codes might be appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]207 Multi-Status[/code] (WebDAV). Uma resposta "
"Multi-Status transmite informações sobre vários recursos em situações em que "
"vários códigos de status podem ser apropriados."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]208 Already Reported[/code] (WebDAV). Used inside a "
"DAV: propstat response element to avoid enumerating the internal members of "
"multiple bindings to the same collection repeatedly."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]208 Already Reported[/code] (WebDAV). Usado "
"dentro de um elemento de resposta DAV: propstat para evitar enumerar "
"repetidamente os membros internos de múltiplos vínculos para a mesma coleção."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]226 IM Used[/code] (WebDAV). The server has fulfilled "
"a GET request for the resource, and the response is a representation of the "
"result of one or more instance-manipulations applied to the current instance."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]226 IM Used[/code] (WebDAV). O servidor atendeu "
"a uma solicitação GET para o recurso, e a resposta é uma representação do "
"resultado de uma ou mais manipulações de instâncias aplicadas à instância "
"atual."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]300 Multiple Choice[/code]. The request has more than "
"one possible responses and there is no standardized way to choose one of the "
"responses. User-agent or user should choose one of them."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]300 Multiple Choice[/code]. A solicitação tem "
"mais de uma resposta possível e não há uma maneira padronizada de escolher "
"uma das respostas. O agente de usuário ou o usuário deve escolher uma delas."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]301 Moved Permanently[/code]. Redirection. This "
"response code means the URI of requested resource has been changed. The new "
"URI is usually included in the response."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]301 Moved Permanently[/code]. Redirecionamento. "
"Este código de resposta significa que o URI do recurso solicitado foi "
"alterado. O novo URI geralmente é incluído na resposta."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]302 Found[/code]. Temporary redirection. This "
"response code means the URI of requested resource has been changed "
"temporarily. New changes in the URI might be made in the future. Therefore, "
"this same URI should be used by the client in future requests."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]302 Found[/code]. Redirecionamento temporário. "
"Este código de resposta significa que o URI do recurso solicitado foi "
"alterado temporariamente. Novas alterações no URI podem ser feitas no "
"futuro. Portanto, este mesmo URI deve ser usado pelo cliente em solicitações "
"futuras."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]303 See Other[/code]. The server is redirecting the "
"user agent to a different resource, as indicated by a URI in the Location "
"header field, which is intended to provide an indirect response to the "
"original request."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]303 See Other[/code]. O servidor está "
"redirecionando o agente de usuário para um recurso diferente, conforme "
"indicado por um URI no campo de cabeçalho Location, que visa fornecer uma "
"resposta indireta à solicitação original."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]304 Not Modified[/code]. A conditional GET or HEAD "
"request has been received and would have resulted in a 200 OK response if it "
"were not for the fact that the condition evaluated to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]304 Not Modified[/code]. Uma solicitação GET ou "
"HEAD condicional foi recebida e teria resultado em uma resposta 200 OK se "
"não fosse pelo fato de que a condição foi avaliada como [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"Many clients ignore this response code for security reasons. It is also "
"deprecated by the HTTP standard."
msgstr ""
"Muitos clientes ignoram este código de resposta por motivos de segurança. "
"Ele também está descontinuado pelo padrão HTTP."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "HTTP status code [code]305 Use Proxy[/code]."
msgstr "Código de status HTTP [code]305 Use Proxy[/code]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid "HTTP status code [code]306 Switch Proxy[/code]."
msgstr "Código de status HTTP [code]306 Switch Proxy[/code]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]307 Temporary Redirect[/code]. The target resource "
"resides temporarily under a different URI and the user agent MUST NOT change "
"the request method if it performs an automatic redirection to that URI."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]307 Temporary Redirect[/code]. O recurso de "
"destino reside temporariamente sob um URI diferente e o agente do usuário "
"NÃO DEVE alterar o método de solicitação se ele realizar um redirecionamento "
"automático para esse URI."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]308 Permanent Redirect[/code]. The target resource "
"has been assigned a new permanent URI and any future references to this "
"resource ought to use one of the enclosed URIs."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]308 Permanent Redirect[/code]. O recurso de "
"destino recebeu um novo URI permanente e quaisquer referências futuras a "
"este recurso devem usar um dos URIs inclusos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]400 Bad Request[/code]. The request was invalid. The "
"server cannot or will not process the request due to something that is "
"perceived to be a client error (e.g., malformed request syntax, invalid "
"request message framing, invalid request contents, or deceptive request "
"routing)."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]400 Bad Request[/code]. A solicitação foi "
"inválida. O servidor não pode ou não processará a solicitação devido a algo "
"que é percebido como um erro do cliente (por exemplo, sintaxe de solicitação "
"malformada, enquadramento de mensagem de solicitação inválido, conteúdos de "
"solicitação inválidos ou roteamento de solicitação enganoso)."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]401 Unauthorized[/code]. Credentials required. The "
"request has not been applied because it lacks valid authentication "
"credentials for the target resource."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]401 Unauthorized[/code]. Credenciais "
"necessárias. A requisição não foi aplicada porque faltam credenciais de "
"autenticação válidas para o recurso de destino."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]402 Payment Required[/code]. This response code is "
"reserved for future use. Initial aim for creating this code was using it for "
"digital payment systems, however this is not currently used."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]402 Payment Required[/code]. Este código de "
"resposta está reservado para uso futuro. O objetivo inicial da criação deste "
"código era usá-lo para sistemas de pagamento digital, no entanto, ele não é "
"usado atualmente."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]403 Forbidden[/code]. The client does not have access "
"rights to the content, i.e. they are unauthorized, so server is rejecting to "
"give proper response. Unlike [code]401[/code], the client's identity is "
"known to the server."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]403 Forbidden[/code]. O cliente não tem direitos "
"de acesso ao conteúdo, ou seja, não está autorizado, portanto o servidor "
"está recusando fornecer uma resposta adequada. Ao contrário de [code]401[/"
"code], a identidade do cliente é conhecida pelo servidor."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]404 Not Found[/code]. The server can not find "
"requested resource. Either the URL is not recognized or the endpoint is "
"valid but the resource itself does not exist. May also be sent instead of "
"403 to hide existence of a resource if the client is not authorized."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]404 Not Found[/code]. O servidor não consegue "
"encontrar o recurso solicitado. Ou a URL não é reconhecida ou o endpoint é "
"válido, mas o recurso em si não existe. Também pode ser enviado em vez de "
"403 para ocultar a existência de um recurso se o cliente não estiver "
"autorizado."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]405 Method Not Allowed[/code]. The request's HTTP "
"method is known by the server but has been disabled and cannot be used. For "
"example, an API may forbid DELETE-ing a resource. The two mandatory methods, "
"GET and HEAD, must never be disabled and should not return this error code."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]405 Method Not Allowed[/code]. O método HTTP da "
"solicitação é conhecido pelo servidor, mas foi desativado e não pode ser "
"usado. Por exemplo, uma API pode proibir a exclusão de um recurso. Os dois "
"métodos obrigatórios, GET e HEAD, nunca devem ser desativados e não devem "
"retornar este código de erro."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]406 Not Acceptable[/code]. The target resource does "
"not have a current representation that would be acceptable to the user "
"agent, according to the proactive negotiation header fields received in the "
"request. Used when negotiation content."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]406 Not Acceptable[/code]. O recurso de destino "
"não tem uma representação atual que seja aceitável para o agente do usuário, "
"de acordo com os campos de cabeçalho de negociação proativa recebidos na "
"solicitação. Usado ao negociar conteúdo."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]407 Proxy Authentication Required[/code]. Similar to "
"401 Unauthorized, but it indicates that the client needs to authenticate "
"itself in order to use a proxy."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]407 Proxy Authentication Required[/code]. "
"Semelhante ao 401 Unauthorized, mas indica que o cliente precisa se "
"autenticar para usar um proxy."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]408 Request Timeout[/code]. The server did not "
"receive a complete request message within the time that it was prepared to "
"wait."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]408 Request Timeout[/code]. O servidor não "
"recebeu uma mensagem de solicitação completa dentro do tempo que estava "
"preparado para esperar."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]409 Conflict[/code]. The request could not be "
"completed due to a conflict with the current state of the target resource. "
"This code is used in situations where the user might be able to resolve the "
"conflict and resubmit the request."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]409 Conflict[/code]. A solicitação não pôde ser "
"concluída devido a um conflito com o estado atual do recurso de destino. "
"Este código é usado em situações em que o usuário pode ser capaz de resolver "
"o conflito e reenviar a solicitação."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]410 Gone[/code]. The target resource is no longer "
"available at the origin server and this condition is likely permanent."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]410 Gone[/code]. O recurso de destino não está "
"mais disponível no servidor de origem e essa condição provavelmente é "
"permanente."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]411 Length Required[/code]. The server refuses to "
"accept the request without a defined Content-Length header."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]411 Length Required[/code]. O servidor recusa-se "
"a aceitar o pedido sem um cabeçalho Content-Length definido."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]412 Precondition Failed[/code]. One or more "
"conditions given in the request header fields evaluated to [code]false[/"
"code] when tested on the server."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]412 Precondition Failed[/code]. Uma ou mais "
"condições fornecidas nos campos de cabeçalho da requisição foram avaliadas "
"como [code]false[/code] ao serem testadas no servidor."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]413 Entity Too Large[/code]. The server is refusing "
"to process a request because the request payload is larger than the server "
"is willing or able to process."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]413 Entity Too Large[/code]. O servidor está "
"recusando a processar uma solicitação porque a carga útil da solicitação é "
"maior do que o servidor está disposto ou capaz de processar."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]414 Request-URI Too Long[/code]. The server is "
"refusing to service the request because the request-target is longer than "
"the server is willing to interpret."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]414 Request-URI Too Long[/code]. O servidor está "
"recusando a atender à solicitação porque o destino da solicitação é mais "
"longo do que o servidor está disposto a interpretar."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]415 Unsupported Media Type[/code]. The origin server "
"is refusing to service the request because the payload is in a format not "
"supported by this method on the target resource."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]415 Unsupported Media Type[/code]. O servidor de "
"origem está recusando atender à solicitação porque a carga útil está em um "
"formato não suportado por este método no recurso de destino."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]416 Requested Range Not Satisfiable[/code]. None of "
"the ranges in the request's Range header field overlap the current extent of "
"the selected resource or the set of ranges requested has been rejected due "
"to invalid ranges or an excessive request of small or overlapping ranges."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]416 Requested Range Not Satisfiable[/code]. "
"Nenhum dos intervalos no campo de cabeçalho Range da solicitação se sobrepõe "
"à extensão atual do recurso selecionado ou o conjunto de intervalos "
"solicitados foi rejeitado devido a intervalos inválidos ou a uma solicitação "
"excessiva de intervalos pequenos ou sobrepostos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]417 Expectation Failed[/code]. The expectation given "
"in the request's Expect header field could not be met by at least one of the "
"inbound servers."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]417 Expectation Failed[/code]. A expectativa "
"fornecida no campo de cabeçalho Expect da requisição não pôde ser atendida "
"por pelo menos um dos servidores de entrada."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]418 I'm A Teapot[/code]. Any attempt to brew coffee "
"with a teapot should result in the error code \"418 I'm a teapot\". The "
"resulting entity body MAY be short and stout."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]418 I'm A Teapot[/code]. Qualquer tentativa de "
"preparar café com um bule deve resultar no código de erro \"418 I'm a "
"teapot\". O corpo da entidade resultante PODE ser curto e robusto."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]421 Misdirected Request[/code]. The request was "
"directed at a server that is not able to produce a response. This can be "
"sent by a server that is not configured to produce responses for the "
"combination of scheme and authority that are included in the request URI."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]421 Misdirected Request[/code]. A solicitação "
"foi direcionada a um servidor que não é capaz de produzir uma resposta. Isso "
"pode ser enviado por um servidor que não está configurado para produzir "
"respostas para a combinação de esquema e autoridade incluídas no URI da "
"solicitação."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]422 Unprocessable Entity[/code] (WebDAV). The server "
"understands the content type of the request entity (hence a 415 Unsupported "
"Media Type status code is inappropriate), and the syntax of the request "
"entity is correct (thus a 400 Bad Request status code is inappropriate) but "
"was unable to process the contained instructions."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]422 Unprocessable Entity[/code] (WebDAV). O "
"servidor entende o tipo de conteúdo da entidade da requisição (portanto, um "
"código de status 415 Unsupported Media Type é inadequado) e a sintaxe da "
"entidade da requisição está correta (portanto, um código de status 400 Bad "
"Request é inadequado), mas não conseguiu processar as instruções contidas."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]423 Locked[/code] (WebDAV). The source or destination "
"resource of a method is locked."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]423 Locked[/code] (WebDAV). O recurso de origem "
"ou destino de um método está bloqueado."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]424 Failed Dependency[/code] (WebDAV). The method "
"could not be performed on the resource because the requested action depended "
"on another action and that action failed."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]424 Failed Dependency[/code] (WebDAV). O método "
"não pôde ser executado no recurso porque a ação solicitada dependia de outra "
"ação e essa ação falhou."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]426 Upgrade Required[/code]. The server refuses to "
"perform the request using the current protocol but might be willing to do so "
"after the client upgrades to a different protocol."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]426 Upgrade Required[/code]. O servidor se "
"recusa a executar a solicitação usando o protocolo atual, mas pode estar "
"disposto a fazê-lo depois que o cliente atualizar para um protocolo "
"diferente."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]428 Precondition Required[/code]. The origin server "
"requires the request to be conditional."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]428 Precondition Required[/code]. O servidor de "
"origem exige que a solicitação seja condicional."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]429 Too Many Requests[/code]. The user has sent too "
"many requests in a given amount of time (see \"rate limiting\"). Back off "
"and increase time between requests or try again later."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]429 Too Many Requests[/code]. O usuário enviou "
"muitas solicitações em um determinado período de tempo (consulte \"limitação "
"de taxa\"). Recue e aumente o tempo entre as solicitações ou tente novamente "
"mais tarde."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]431 Request Header Fields Too Large[/code]. The "
"server is unwilling to process the request because its header fields are too "
"large. The request MAY be resubmitted after reducing the size of the request "
"header fields."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]431 Request Header Fields Too Large[/code]. O "
"servidor não quer processar a solicitação porque seus campos de cabeçalho "
"são muito grandes. A solicitação PODE ser reenviada após reduzir o tamanho "
"dos campos de cabeçalho da solicitação."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]451 Response Unavailable For Legal Reasons[/code]. "
"The server is denying access to the resource as a consequence of a legal "
"demand."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]451 Response Unavailable For Legal Reasons[/"
"code]. O servidor está negando o acesso ao recurso como consequência de uma "
"demanda jurídica."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]500 Internal Server Error[/code]. The server "
"encountered an unexpected condition that prevented it from fulfilling the "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]500 Internal Server Error[/code]. O servidor "
"encontrou uma condição inesperada que o impediu de atender à solicitação."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]501 Not Implemented[/code]. The server does not "
"support the functionality required to fulfill the request."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]501 Not Implemented[/code]. O servidor não "
"suporta a funcionalidade necessária para atender à solicitação."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]502 Bad Gateway[/code]. The server, while acting as a "
"gateway or proxy, received an invalid response from an inbound server it "
"accessed while attempting to fulfill the request. Usually returned by load "
"balancers or proxies."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]502 Bad Gateway[/code]. O servidor, atuando como "
"gateway ou proxy, recebeu uma resposta inválida de um servidor de entrada "
"que ele acessou ao tentar atender à solicitação. Geralmente retornado por "
"balanceadores de carga ou proxies."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]503 Service Unavailable[/code]. The server is "
"currently unable to handle the request due to a temporary overload or "
"scheduled maintenance, which will likely be alleviated after some delay. Try "
"again later."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]503 Service Unavailable[/code]. O servidor está "
"atualmente incapaz de lidar com a solicitação devido a uma sobrecarga "
"temporária ou manutenção agendada, o que provavelmente será aliviado após "
"algum atraso. Tente novamente mais tarde."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]504 Gateway Timeout[/code]. The server, while acting "
"as a gateway or proxy, did not receive a timely response from an upstream "
"server it needed to access in order to complete the request. Usually "
"returned by load balancers or proxies."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]504 Gateway Timeout[/code]. O servidor, atuando "
"como gateway ou proxy, não recebeu uma resposta em tempo hábil de um "
"servidor upstream que precisava acessar para concluir a solicitação. "
"Geralmente retornado por balanceadores de carga ou proxies."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]505 HTTP Version Not Supported[/code]. The server "
"does not support, or refuses to support, the major version of HTTP that was "
"used in the request message."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]505 HTTP Version Not Supported[/code]. O "
"servidor não suporta ou se recusa a suportar a versão principal do HTTP que "
"foi usada na mensagem de requisição."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]506 Variant Also Negotiates[/code]. The server has an "
"internal configuration error: the chosen variant resource is configured to "
"engage in transparent content negotiation itself, and is therefore not a "
"proper end point in the negotiation process."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]506 Variant Also Negotiates[/code]. O servidor "
"tem um erro de configuração interna: o recurso variante escolhido está "
"configurado para participar da negociação de conteúdo transparente por si só "
"e, portanto, não é um ponto final adequado no processo de negociação."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]507 Insufficient Storage[/code]. The method could not "
"be performed on the resource because the server is unable to store the "
"representation needed to successfully complete the request."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]507 Insufficient Storage[/code]. O método não "
"pôde ser executado no recurso porque o servidor não consegue armazenar a "
"representação necessária para concluir com sucesso a solicitação."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]508 Loop Detected[/code]. The server terminated an "
"operation because it encountered an infinite loop while processing a request "
"with \"Depth: infinity\". This status indicates that the entire operation "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]508 Loop Detected[/code]. O servidor encerrou "
"uma operação porque encontrou um loop infinito ao processar uma solicitação "
"com \"Depth: infinity\". Este status indica que toda a operação falhou."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]510 Not Extended[/code]. The policy for accessing the "
"resource has not been met in the request. The server should send back all "
"the information necessary for the client to issue an extended request."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]510 Not Extended[/code]. A política para acessar "
"o recurso não foi atendida na solicitação. O servidor deve enviar de volta "
"todas as informações necessárias para o cliente emitir uma solicitação "
"estendida."

#: doc/classes/HTTPClient.xml
msgid ""
"HTTP status code [code]511 Network Authentication Required[/code]. The "
"client needs to authenticate to gain network access."
msgstr ""
"Código de status HTTP [code]511 Network Authentication Required[/code]. O "
"cliente precisa se autenticar para obter acesso à rede."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "A node with the ability to send HTTP(S) requests."
msgstr "Um nó com a capacidade de enviar solicitações HTTP(S)."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"A node with the ability to send HTTP requests. Uses [HTTPClient] "
"internally.\n"
"Can be used to make HTTP requests, i.e. download or upload files or web "
"content via HTTP.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] See the notes and warnings on [HTTPClient] for limitations, "
"especially regarding TLS security.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When exporting to Android, make sure to enable the "
"[code]INTERNET[/code] permission in the Android export preset before "
"exporting the project or using one-click deploy. Otherwise, network "
"communication of any kind will be blocked by Android.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Contact a REST API and print one of its returned fields:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Create an HTTP request node and connect its completion signal.\n"
"\tvar http_request = HTTPRequest.new()\n"
"\tadd_child(http_request)\n"
"\thttp_request.request_completed.connect(self._http_request_completed)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Perform a GET request. The URL below returns JSON as of writing.\n"
"\tvar error = http_request.request(\"https://httpbin.org/get\")\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"An error occurred in the HTTP request.\")\n"
"\n"
"\t# Perform a POST request. The URL below returns JSON as of writing.\n"
"\t# Note: Don't make simultaneous requests using a single HTTPRequest node.\n"
"\t# The snippet below is provided for reference only.\n"
"\tvar body = JSON.stringify({\"name\": \"Godette\"})\n"
"\terror = http_request.request(\"https://httpbin.org/post\", [], "
"HTTPClient.METHOD_POST, body)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"An error occurred in the HTTP request.\")\n"
"\n"
"# Called when the HTTP request is completed.\n"
"func _http_request_completed(result, response_code, headers, body):\n"
"\tvar json = JSON.new()\n"
"\tjson.parse(body.get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\tvar response = json.get_data()\n"
"\n"
"\t# Will print the user agent string used by the HTTPRequest node (as "
"recognized by httpbin.org).\n"
"\tprint(response.headers[\"User-Agent\"])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Create an HTTP request node and connect its completion signal.\n"
"\tvar httpRequest = new HttpRequest();\n"
"\tAddChild(httpRequest);\n"
"\thttpRequest.RequestCompleted += HttpRequestCompleted;\n"
"\n"
"\t// Perform a GET request. The URL below returns JSON as of writing.\n"
"\tError error = httpRequest.Request(\"https://httpbin.org/get\");\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"An error occurred in the HTTP request.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t// Perform a POST request. The URL below returns JSON as of writing.\n"
"\t// Note: Don't make simultaneous requests using a single HTTPRequest "
"node.\n"
"\t// The snippet below is provided for reference only.\n"
"\tstring body = Json.Stringify(new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\", \"Godette\" }\n"
"\t});\n"
"\terror = httpRequest.Request(\"https://httpbin.org/post\", null, "
"HttpClient.Method.Post, body);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"An error occurred in the HTTP request.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Called when the HTTP request is completed.\n"
"private void HttpRequestCompleted(long result, long responseCode, string[] "
"headers, byte[] body)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar json = new Json();\n"
"\tjson.Parse(body.GetStringFromUtf8());\n"
"\tvar response = json.GetData().AsGodotDictionary();\n"
"\n"
"\t// Will print the user agent string used by the HTTPRequest node (as "
"recognized by httpbin.org).\n"
"\tGD.Print((response[\"headers\"].AsGodotDictionary())[\"User-Agent\"]);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Load an image using [HTTPRequest] and display it:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Create an HTTP request node and connect its completion signal.\n"
"\tvar http_request = HTTPRequest.new()\n"
"\tadd_child(http_request)\n"
"\thttp_request.request_completed.connect(self._http_request_completed)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Perform the HTTP request. The URL below returns a PNG image as of "
"writing.\n"
"\tvar error = http_request.request(\"https://placehold.co/512.png\")\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"An error occurred in the HTTP request.\")\n"
"\n"
"# Called when the HTTP request is completed.\n"
"func _http_request_completed(result, response_code, headers, body):\n"
"\tif result != HTTPRequest.RESULT_SUCCESS:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"Image couldn't be downloaded. Try a different image.\")\n"
"\n"
"\tvar image = Image.new()\n"
"\tvar error = image.load_png_from_buffer(body)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"Couldn't load the image.\")\n"
"\n"
"\tvar texture = ImageTexture.create_from_image(image)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Display the image in a TextureRect node.\n"
"\tvar texture_rect = TextureRect.new()\n"
"\tadd_child(texture_rect)\n"
"\ttexture_rect.texture = texture\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Create an HTTP request node and connect its completion signal.\n"
"\tvar httpRequest = new HttpRequest();\n"
"\tAddChild(httpRequest);\n"
"\thttpRequest.RequestCompleted += HttpRequestCompleted;\n"
"\n"
"\t// Perform the HTTP request. The URL below returns a PNG image as of "
"writing.\n"
"\tError error = httpRequest.Request(\"https://placehold.co/512.png\");\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"An error occurred in the HTTP request.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Called when the HTTP request is completed.\n"
"private void HttpRequestCompleted(long result, long responseCode, string[] "
"headers, byte[] body)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (result != (long)HttpRequest.Result.Success)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"Image couldn't be downloaded. Try a different image.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvar image = new Image();\n"
"\tError error = image.LoadPngFromBuffer(body);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"Couldn't load the image.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tvar texture = ImageTexture.CreateFromImage(image);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Display the image in a TextureRect node.\n"
"\tvar textureRect = new TextureRect();\n"
"\tAddChild(textureRect);\n"
"\ttextureRect.Texture = texture;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [HTTPRequest] nodes will automatically handle decompression of "
"response bodies. An [code]Accept-Encoding[/code] header will be "
"automatically added to each of your requests, unless one is already "
"specified. Any response with a [code]Content-Encoding: gzip[/code] header "
"will automatically be decompressed and delivered to you as uncompressed "
"bytes."
msgstr ""
"Um nó com a capacidade de enviar requisições HTTP. Usa [HTTPClient] "
"internamente.\n"
"Pode ser usado para fazer requisições HTTP, ou seja, baixar ou enviar "
"arquivos ou conteúdo da web via HTTP.\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] Veja as notas e avisos em [HTTPClient] para limitações, "
"especialmente no que diz respeito à segurança TLS.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao exportar para o Android, certifique-se de habilitar a "
"permissão [code]INTERNET[/code] na predefinição de exportação do Android "
"antes de exportar o projeto ou usar o deploy com um clique. Caso contrário, "
"a comunicação de rede de qualquer tipo será bloqueada pelo Android.\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Contate uma API REST e imprima um dos campos retornados por "
"ela:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Criar um nó de requisição HTTP e conectar seu sinal de conclusão.\n"
"\tvar http_request = HTTPRequest.new()\n"
"\tadd_child(http_request)\n"
"\thttp_request.request_completed.connect(self._http_request_completed)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Realizar uma requisição GET. A URL abaixo retorna JSON no momento da "
"escrita.\n"
"\tvar error = http_request.request(\"https://httpbin.org/get\")\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"Ocorreu um erro na requisição HTTP.\")\n"
"\n"
"\t# Realizar uma requisição POST. A URL abaixo retorna JSON no momento da "
"escrita.\n"
"\t# Nota: Não faça requisições simultâneas usando um único nó HTTPRequest.\n"
"\t# O trecho abaixo é fornecido apenas para referência.\n"
"\tvar body = JSON.stringify({\"name\": \"Godette\"})\n"
"\terror = http_request.request(\"https://httpbin.org/post\", [], "
"HTTPClient.METHOD_POST, body)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"Ocorreu um erro na requisição HTTP.\")\n"
"\n"
"# Chamado quando a requisição HTTP é concluída.\n"
"func _http_request_completed(result, response_code, headers, body):\n"
"\tvar json = JSON.new()\n"
"\tjson.parse(body.get_string_from_utf8())\n"
"\tvar response = json.get_data()\n"
"\n"
"\t# Vai imprimir a string do user agent usada pelo nó HTTPRequest (conforme "
"reconhecido por httpbin.org).\n"
"\tprint(response.headers[\"User-Agent\"])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Criar um nó de requisição HTTP e conectar seu sinal de conclusão.\n"
"\tvar httpRequest = new HttpRequest();\n"
"\tAddChild(httpRequest);\n"
"\thttpRequest.RequestCompleted += HttpRequestCompleted;\n"
"\n"
"\t// Realizar uma requisição GET. A URL abaixo retorna JSON no momento da "
"escrita.\n"
"\tError error = httpRequest.Request(\"https://httpbin.org/get\");\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"Ocorreu um erro na requisição HTTP.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t// Realizar uma requisição POST. A URL abaixo retorna JSON no momento da "
"escrita.\n"
"\t// Nota: Não faça requisições simultâneas usando um único nó HTTPRequest.\n"
"\t// O trecho abaixo é fornecido apenas para referência.\n"
"\tstring body = Json.Stringify(new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\", \"Godette\" }\n"
"\t});\n"
"\terror = httpRequest.Request(\"https://httpbin.org/post\", null, "
"HttpClient.Method.Post, body);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"Ocorreu um erro na requisição HTTP.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Chamado quando a requisição HTTP é concluída.\n"
"private void HttpRequestCompleted(long result, long responseCode, string[] "
"headers, byte[] body)\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar json = new Json();\n"
"\tjson.Parse(body.GetStringFromUtf8());\n"
"\tvar response = json.GetData().AsGodotDictionary();\n"
"\n"
"\t// Vai imprimir a string do user agent usada pelo nó HTTPRequest (conforme "
"reconhecido por httpbin.org).\n"
"\tGD.Print((response[\"headers\"].AsGodotDictionary())[\"User-Agent\"]);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Carregue uma imagem usando [HTTPRequest] e exiba-a:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Criar um nó de requisição HTTP e conectar seu sinal de conclusão.\n"
"\tvar http_request = HTTPRequest.new()\n"
"\tadd_child(http_request)\n"
"\thttp_request.request_completed.connect(self._http_request_completed)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Realizar a requisição HTTP. A URL abaixo retorna uma imagem PNG no "
"momento da escrita.\n"
"\tvar error = http_request.request(\"https://placehold.co/512.png\")\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"Ocorreu um erro na requisição HTTP.\")\n"
"\n"
"# Chamado quando a requisição HTTP é concluída.\n"
"func _http_request_completed(result, response_code, headers, body):\n"
"\tif result != HTTPRequest.RESULT_SUCCESS:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"A imagem não pôde ser baixada. Tente uma imagem diferente."
"\")\n"
"\n"
"\tvar image = Image.new()\n"
"\tvar error = image.load_png_from_buffer(body)\n"
"\tif error != OK:\n"
"\t\tpush_error(\"Não foi possível carregar a imagem.\")\n"
"\n"
"\tvar texture = ImageTexture.create_from_image(image)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Exibir a imagem em um nó TextureRect.\n"
"\tvar texture_rect = TextureRect.new()\n"
"\tadd_child(texture_rect)\n"
"\ttexture_rect.texture = texture\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Criar um nó de requisição HTTP e conectar seu sinal de conclusão.\n"
"\tvar httpRequest = new HttpRequest();\n"
"\tAddChild(httpRequest);\n"
"\thttpRequest.RequestCompleted += HttpRequestCompleted;\n"
"\n"
"\t// Realizar a requisição HTTP. A URL abaixo retorna uma imagem PNG no "
"momento da escrita.\n"
"\tError error = httpRequest.Request(\"https://placehold.co/512.png\");\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"Ocorreu um erro na requisição HTTP.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"// Chamado quando a requisição HTTP é concluída.\n"
"private void HttpRequestCompleted(long result, long responseCode, string[] "
"headers, byte[] body)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (result != (long)HttpRequest.Result.Success)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"A imagem não pôde ser baixada. Tente uma imagem diferente."
"\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tvar image = new Image();\n"
"\tError error = image.LoadPngFromBuffer(body);\n"
"\tif (error != Error.Ok)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.PushError(\"Não foi possível carregar a imagem.\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tvar texture = ImageTexture.CreateFromImage(image);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Exibir a imagem em um nó TextureRect.\n"
"\tvar textureRect = new TextureRect();\n"
"\tAddChild(textureRect);\n"
"\ttextureRect.Texture = texture;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Os nós [HTTPRequest] lidarão automaticamente com a "
"descompactação dos corpos de resposta. Um cabeçalho [code]Accept-Encoding[/"
"code] será adicionado automaticamente a cada uma de suas requisições, a "
"menos que um já esteja especificado. Qualquer resposta com um cabeçalho "
"[code]Content-Encoding: gzip[/code] será descompactada automaticamente e "
"entregue a você como bytes descompactados."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Making HTTP requests"
msgstr "Fazendo solicitações HTTP"

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Cancels the current request."
msgstr "Cancela a solicitação atual."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the response body length.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some Web servers may not send a body length. In this case, the "
"value returned will be [code]-1[/code]. If using chunked transfer encoding, "
"the body length will also be [code]-1[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Returns the number of bytes this HTTPRequest downloaded."
msgstr "Retorna o número de bytes que este HTTPRequest baixou."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Returns the current status of the underlying [HTTPClient]."
msgstr "Retorna o status atual do [HTTPClient] subjacente."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Creates request on the underlying [HTTPClient]. If there is no configuration "
"errors, it tries to connect using [method HTTPClient.connect_to_host] and "
"passes parameters onto [method HTTPClient.request].\n"
"Returns [constant OK] if request is successfully created. (Does not imply "
"that the server has responded), [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] if not in the "
"tree, [constant ERR_BUSY] if still processing previous request, [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if given string is not a valid URL format, or "
"[constant ERR_CANT_CONNECT] if not using thread and the [HTTPClient] cannot "
"connect to host.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [param method] is [constant HTTPClient.METHOD_GET], the "
"payload sent via [param request_data] might be ignored by the server or even "
"cause the server to reject the request (check [url=https://"
"datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7231#section-4.3.1]RFC 7231 section 4.3.1[/"
"url] for more details). As a workaround, you can send data as a query string "
"in the URL (see [method String.uri_encode] for an example).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It's recommended to use transport encryption (TLS) and to avoid "
"sending sensitive information (such as login credentials) in HTTP GET URL "
"parameters. Consider using HTTP POST requests or HTTP headers for such "
"information instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Creates request on the underlying [HTTPClient] using a raw array of bytes "
"for the request body. If there is no configuration errors, it tries to "
"connect using [method HTTPClient.connect_to_host] and passes parameters onto "
"[method HTTPClient.request].\n"
"Returns [constant OK] if request is successfully created. (Does not imply "
"that the server has responded), [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] if not in the "
"tree, [constant ERR_BUSY] if still processing previous request, [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if given string is not a valid URL format, or "
"[constant ERR_CANT_CONNECT] if not using thread and the [HTTPClient] cannot "
"connect to host."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [TLSOptions] to be used when connecting to an HTTPS server. See "
"[method TLSOptions.client]."
msgstr ""
"Define as [TLSOptions] a serem usadas ao conectar a um servidor HTTPS. "
"Consulte [method TLSOptions.client]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this header will be added to each request: "
"[code]Accept-Encoding: gzip, deflate[/code] telling servers that it's okay "
"to compress response bodies.\n"
"Any Response body declaring a [code]Content-Encoding[/code] of either "
"[code]gzip[/code] or [code]deflate[/code] will then be automatically "
"decompressed, and the uncompressed bytes will be delivered via [signal "
"request_completed].\n"
"If the user has specified their own [code]Accept-Encoding[/code] header, "
"then no header will be added regardless of [member accept_gzip].\n"
"If [code]false[/code] no header will be added, and no decompression will be "
"performed on response bodies. The raw bytes of the response body will be "
"returned via [signal request_completed]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum allowed size for response bodies. If the response body is "
"compressed, this will be used as the maximum allowed size for the "
"decompressed body."
msgstr ""
"Tamanho máximo permitido para corpos de resposta. Se o corpo da resposta "
"estiver compactado, este será usado como o tamanho máximo permitido para o "
"corpo descompactado."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the buffer used and maximum bytes to read per iteration. See "
"[member HTTPClient.read_chunk_size].\n"
"Set this to a lower value (e.g. 4096 for 4 KiB) when downloading small files "
"to decrease memory usage at the cost of download speeds."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "The file to download into. Will output any received file into it."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo para o qual baixar. Irá gerar qualquer arquivo recebido nele."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Maximum number of allowed redirects."
msgstr "Número máximo de redirecionamentos permitidos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"The duration to wait before a request times out, in seconds (independent of "
"[member Engine.time_scale]). If [member timeout] is set to [code]0.0[/code], "
"the request will never time out.\n"
"For simple requests, such as communication with a REST API, it is "
"recommended to set [member timeout] to a value suitable for the server "
"response time (commonly between [code]1.0[/code] and [code]10.0[/code]). "
"This will help prevent unwanted timeouts caused by variation in response "
"times while still allowing the application to detect when a request has "
"timed out. For larger requests such as file downloads, it is recommended to "
"set [member timeout] to [code]0.0[/code], disabling the timeout "
"functionality. This will help prevent large transfers from failing due to "
"exceeding the timeout value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], multithreading is used to improve performance."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], multithreading é usado para melhorar o desempenho."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Emitted when a request is completed."
msgstr "Emitido quando uma solicitação é concluída."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request successful."
msgstr "Solicitação bem-sucedida."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Request failed due to a mismatch between the expected and actual chunked "
"body size during transfer. Possible causes include network errors, server "
"misconfiguration, or issues with chunked encoding."
msgstr ""
"A solicitação falhou devido a uma incompatibilidade entre o tamanho do corpo "
"em blocos esperado e o real durante a transferência. As causas possíveis "
"incluem erros de rede, configuração incorreta do servidor ou problemas com a "
"codificação em blocos."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request failed while connecting."
msgstr "A solicitação falhou ao conectar."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request failed while resolving."
msgstr "A solicitação falhou durante a resolução."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request failed due to connection (read/write) error."
msgstr "A solicitação falhou devido a um erro de conexão (leitura/escrita)."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request failed on TLS handshake."
msgstr "A solicitação falhou no handshake TLS."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request does not have a response (yet)."
msgstr "A solicitação não tem uma resposta (ainda)."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request exceeded its maximum size limit, see [member body_size_limit]."
msgstr ""
"A requisição excedeu seu limite máximo de tamanho, consulte [member "
"body_size_limit]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Request failed due to an error while decompressing the response body. "
"Possible causes include unsupported or incorrect compression format, "
"corrupted data, or incomplete transfer."
msgstr ""
"Falha na requisição devido a um erro ao descompactar o corpo da resposta. As "
"possíveis causas incluem formato de compactação sem suporte ou incorreto, "
"dados corrompidos ou transferência incompleta."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request failed (currently unused)."
msgstr "A solicitação falhou (não utilizada no momento)."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "HTTPRequest couldn't open the download file."
msgstr "O HTTPRequest não pôde abrir o arquivo de download."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "HTTPRequest couldn't write to the download file."
msgstr "O HTTPRequest não pôde gravar no arquivo de download."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid "Request reached its maximum redirect limit, see [member max_redirects]."
msgstr ""
"A requisição atingiu seu limite máximo de redirecionamento, consulte [member "
"max_redirects]."

#: doc/classes/HTTPRequest.xml
msgid ""
"Request failed due to a timeout. If you expect requests to take a long time, "
"try increasing the value of [member timeout] or setting it to [code]0.0[/"
"code] to remove the timeout completely."
msgstr ""
"A solicitação falhou devido a um tempo limite (timeout). Se você espera que "
"as solicitações demorem muito, tente aumentar o valor de [member timeout] ou "
"defini-lo como [code]0.0[/code] para remover o tempo limite completamente."

#: doc/classes/IKModifier3D.xml
msgid "A node for inverse kinematics which may modify more than one bone."
msgstr "Um nó para cinemática inversa que pode modificar mais de um osso."

#: doc/classes/IKModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Base class of [SkeletonModifier3D]s that has some joint lists and applies "
"inverse kinematics. This class has some structs, enums, and helper methods "
"which are useful to solve inverse kinematics."
msgstr ""
"Classe base de [SkeletonModifier3D]s que possui algumas listas de juntas e "
"aplica cinemática inversa. Esta classe possui algumas estruturas, enums e "
"métodos auxiliares que são úteis para resolver a cinemática inversa."

#: doc/classes/IKModifier3D.xml
msgid "Returns the number of settings."
msgstr "Retorna o número de configurações."

#: doc/classes/IKModifier3D.xml
msgid "Resets a state with respect to the current bone pose."
msgstr "Redefine um estado em relação à pose óssea atual."

#: doc/classes/IKModifier3D.xml
msgid "Sets the number of settings."
msgstr "Define o número de configurações."

#: doc/classes/IKModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone pose "
"every frame.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the solver retrieves the bone axis from the bone rest "
"and caches it, which increases performance slightly, but position changes in "
"the bone pose made before processing this [IKModifier3D] are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Image datatype."
msgstr "Tipo de dados de imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Native image datatype. Contains image data which can be converted to an "
"[ImageTexture] and provides commonly used [i]image processing[/i] methods. "
"The maximum width and height for an [Image] are [constant MAX_WIDTH] and "
"[constant MAX_HEIGHT].\n"
"An [Image] cannot be assigned to a texture property of an object directly "
"(such as [member Sprite2D.texture]), and has to be converted manually to an "
"[ImageTexture] first.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Methods that modify the image data cannot be used on VRAM-"
"compressed images. Use [method decompress] to convert the image to an "
"uncompressed format first.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum image size is 16384×16384 pixels due to graphics "
"hardware limitations. Larger images may fail to import."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml doc/classes/ImageTexture.xml
#: doc/classes/ResourceImporterBitMap.xml doc/classes/ResourceImporterImage.xml
#: doc/classes/ResourceImporterLayeredTexture.xml
#: doc/classes/ResourceImporterTexture.xml
msgid "Importing images"
msgstr "Importando imagens"

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Adjusts this image's [param brightness], [param contrast], and [param "
"saturation] by the given values. Does not work if the image is compressed "
"(see [method is_compressed])."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta o [param brightness], o [param contrast] e a [param saturation] desta "
"imagem pelos valores fornecidos. Não funciona se a imagem estiver compactada "
"(veja [method is_compressed])."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Alpha-blends [param src_rect] from [param src] image to this image at "
"coordinates [param dst], clipped accordingly to both image bounds. This "
"image and [param src] image [b]must[/b] have the same format. [param "
"src_rect] with non-positive size is treated as empty."
msgstr ""
"Faz a mesclagem alfa de [param src_rect] da imagem [param src] para esta "
"imagem nas coordenadas [param dst], recortada de acordo com os limites de "
"ambas as imagens. Esta imagem e a imagem [param src] [b]devem[/b] ter o "
"mesmo formato. [param src_rect] com tamanho não positivo é tratado como "
"vazio."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Alpha-blends [param src_rect] from [param src] image to this image using "
"[param mask] image at coordinates [param dst], clipped accordingly to both "
"image bounds. Alpha channels are required for both [param src] and [param "
"mask]. [param dst] pixels and [param src] pixels will blend if the "
"corresponding mask pixel's alpha value is not 0. This image and [param src] "
"image [b]must[/b] have the same format. [param src] image and [param mask] "
"image [b]must[/b] have the same size (width and height) but they can have "
"different formats. [param src_rect] with non-positive size is treated as "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"Mescla o canal alfa de [param src_rect] da imagem [param src] para esta "
"imagem usando a imagem [param mask] nas coordenadas [param dst], recortada "
"de acordo com os limites de ambas as imagens. Canais alfa são necessários "
"para [param src] e [param mask]. Os pixels de [param dst] e os pixels de "
"[param src] se misturarão se o valor alfa do pixel da máscara correspondente "
"não for 0. Esta imagem e a imagem [param src] [b]devem[/b] ter o mesmo "
"formato. A imagem [param src] e a imagem [param mask] [b]devem[/b] ter o "
"mesmo tamanho (largura e altura), mas podem ter formatos diferentes. [param "
"src_rect] com tamanho não positivo é tratado como vazio."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Copies [param src_rect] from [param src] image to this image at coordinates "
"[param dst], clipped accordingly to both image bounds. This image and [param "
"src] image [b]must[/b] have the same format. [param src_rect] with non-"
"positive size is treated as empty.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The alpha channel data in [param src] will overwrite the "
"corresponding data in this image at the target position. To blend alpha "
"channels, use [method blend_rect] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Blits [param src_rect] area from [param src] image to this image at the "
"coordinates given by [param dst], clipped accordingly to both image bounds. "
"[param src] pixel is copied onto [param dst] if the corresponding [param "
"mask] pixel's alpha value is not 0. This image and [param src] image "
"[b]must[/b] have the same format. [param src] image and [param mask] image "
"[b]must[/b] have the same size (width and height) but they can have "
"different formats. [param src_rect] with non-positive size is treated as "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"Copia (blits) a área [param src_rect] da imagem [param src] para esta imagem "
"nas coordenadas dadas por [param dst], recortada de acordo com os limites de "
"ambas as imagens. O pixel de [param src] é copiado para [param dst] se o "
"valor alfa do pixel da máscara [param mask] correspondente não for 0. Esta "
"imagem e a imagem [param src] [b]devem[/b] ter o mesmo formato. A imagem "
"[param src] e a imagem [param mask] [b]devem[/b] ter o mesmo tamanho "
"(largura e altura), mas podem ter formatos diferentes. [param src_rect] com "
"tamanho não positivo é tratado como vazio."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Converts a bump map to a normal map. A bump map provides a height offset per-"
"pixel, while a normal map provides a normal direction per pixel."
msgstr ""
"Converte um mapa de relevo (bump map) em um mapa de normais. Um mapa de "
"relevo fornece um deslocamento de altura por pixel, enquanto um mapa de "
"normais fornece uma direção normal por pixel."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Removes the image's mipmaps."
msgstr "Remove os mipmaps da imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Compresses the image with a VRAM-compressed format to use less memory. Can "
"not directly access pixel data while the image is compressed. Returns error "
"if the chosen compression mode is not available.\n"
"The [param source] parameter helps to pick the best compression method for "
"DXT and ETC2 formats. It is ignored for ASTC compression.\n"
"The [param astc_format] parameter is only taken into account when using ASTC "
"compression; it is ignored for all other formats.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method compress] is only supported in editor builds. When run "
"in an exported project, this method always returns [constant "
"ERR_UNAVAILABLE]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Compresses the image with a VRAM-compressed format to use less memory. Can "
"not directly access pixel data while the image is compressed. Returns error "
"if the chosen compression mode is not available.\n"
"This is an alternative to [method compress] that lets the user supply the "
"channels used in order for the compressor to pick the best DXT and ETC2 "
"formats. For other formats (non DXT or ETC2), this argument is ignored.\n"
"The [param astc_format] parameter is only taken into account when using ASTC "
"compression; it is ignored for all other formats.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method compress_from_channels] is only supported in editor "
"builds. When run in an exported project, this method always returns "
"[constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Compute image metrics on the current image and the compared image. This can "
"be used to calculate the similarity between two images.\n"
"The dictionary contains [code]max[/code], [code]mean[/code], "
"[code]mean_squared[/code], [code]root_mean_squared[/code] and "
"[code]peak_snr[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Converts this image's format to the given [param format]."
msgstr "Converte o formato desta imagem para o [param format] dado."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Copies [param src] image to this image."
msgstr "Copia a imagem [param src] para esta imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Use [method create_empty]."
msgstr "Use [method create_empty]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an empty image of the given size and format. If [param use_mipmaps] "
"is [code]true[/code], generates mipmaps for this image (see [method "
"generate_mipmaps])."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma imagem vazia do tamanho e formato dados. Se [param use_mipmaps] for "
"[code]true[/code], gera mipmaps para esta imagem (veja [method "
"generate_mipmaps])."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new image of the given size and format. Fills the image with the "
"given raw data. If [param use_mipmaps] is [code]true[/code], loads the "
"mipmaps for this image from [param data]. See [method generate_mipmaps]."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma nova imagem do tamanho e formato fornecidos. Preenche a imagem com "
"os dados brutos fornecidos. Se [param use_mipmaps] for [code]true[/code], "
"carrega os mipmaps para esta imagem de [param data]. Veja [method "
"generate_mipmaps]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Crops the image to the given [param width] and [param height]. If the "
"specified size is larger than the current size, the extra area is filled "
"with black pixels."
msgstr ""
"Corta a imagem para a [param width] e [param height] fornecidas. Se o "
"tamanho especificado for maior que o tamanho atual, a área extra é "
"preenchida com pixels pretos."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Decompresses the image if it is VRAM-compressed in a supported format. This "
"increases memory utilization, but allows modifying the image. Returns "
"[constant OK] if the format is supported, otherwise [constant "
"ERR_UNAVAILABLE]. All VRAM-compressed formats supported by Godot can be "
"decompressed with this method, except [constant FORMAT_ETC2_R11S], [constant "
"FORMAT_ETC2_RG11S], and [constant FORMAT_ETC2_RGB8A1]."
msgstr ""
"Descomprime a imagem se ela estiver compactada em VRAM em um formato "
"suportado. Isso aumenta a utilização de memória, mas permite modificar a "
"imagem. Retorna [constant OK] se o formato for suportado, caso contrário, "
"[constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE]. Todos os formatos compactados em VRAM suportados "
"pelo Godot podem ser descompactados com este método, exceto [constant "
"FORMAT_ETC2_R11S], [constant FORMAT_ETC2_RG11S] e [constant "
"FORMAT_ETC2_RGB8A1]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [constant ALPHA_BLEND] if the image has data for alpha values. "
"Returns [constant ALPHA_BIT] if all the alpha values are stored in a single "
"bit. Returns [constant ALPHA_NONE] if no data for alpha values is found."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [constant ALPHA_BLEND] se a imagem tiver dados para valores alfa. "
"Retorna [constant ALPHA_BIT] se todos os valores alfa estiverem armazenados "
"em um único bit. Retorna [constant ALPHA_NONE] se nenhum dado para valores "
"alfa for encontrado."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color channels used by this image. If the image is compressed, "
"the original [param source] must be specified."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os canais de cor usados por esta imagem. Se a imagem estiver "
"compactada, o [param source] original deve ser especificado."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Fills the image with [param color]."
msgstr "Preenche a imagem com [param color]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Fills [param rect] with [param color]."
msgstr "Preenche [param rect] com [param color]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Blends low-alpha pixels with nearby pixels."
msgstr "Mescla pixels de alfa baixo com pixels próximos."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Flips the image horizontally."
msgstr "Inverte a imagem horizontalmente."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Flips the image vertically."
msgstr "Inverte a imagem verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Generates mipmaps for the image. Mipmaps are precalculated lower-resolution "
"copies of the image that are automatically used if the image needs to be "
"scaled down when rendered. They help improve image quality and performance "
"when rendering. This method returns an error if the image is compressed, in "
"a custom format, or if the image's width/height is [code]0[/code]. Enabling "
"[param renormalize] when generating mipmaps for normal map textures will "
"make sure all resulting vector values are normalized.\n"
"It is possible to check if the image has mipmaps by calling [method "
"has_mipmaps] or [method get_mipmap_count]. Calling [method generate_mipmaps] "
"on an image that already has mipmaps will replace existing mipmaps in the "
"image."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns a copy of the image's raw data."
msgstr "Retorna uma cópia dos dados brutos da imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns size (in bytes) of the image's raw data."
msgstr "Retorna o tamanho (em bytes) dos dados brutos da imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns this image's format."
msgstr "Retorna o formato desta imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns the image's height."
msgstr "Retorna a altura da imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of mipmap levels or 0 if the image has no mipmaps. The "
"largest main level image is not counted as a mipmap level by this method, so "
"if you want to include it you can add 1 to this count."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de níveis de mipmap ou 0 se a imagem não tiver mipmaps. A "
"maior imagem de nível principal não é contada como um nível de mipmap por "
"este método, portanto, se você quiser incluí-la, pode adicionar 1 a esta "
"contagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the offset where the image's mipmap with index [param mipmap] is "
"stored in the [member data] dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o deslocamento onde o mipmap da imagem com o índice [param mipmap] "
"está armazenado no dicionário [member data]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color of the pixel at [code](x, y)[/code].\n"
"This is the same as [method get_pixelv], but with two integer arguments "
"instead of a [Vector2i] argument."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the color of the pixel at [param point].\n"
"This is the same as [method get_pixel], but with a [Vector2i] argument "
"instead of two integer arguments."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new [Image] that is a copy of this [Image]'s area specified with "
"[param region]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um novo [Image] que é uma cópia da área deste [Image] especificada "
"com [param region]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns the image's size (width and height)."
msgstr "Retorna o tamanho da imagem (largura e altura)."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Rect2i] enclosing the visible portion of the image, considering "
"each pixel with a non-zero alpha channel as visible."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Rect2i] envolvendo a porção visível da imagem, considerando cada "
"pixel com um canal alfa diferente de zero como visível."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns the image's width."
msgstr "Retorna a largura da imagem."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the image has generated mipmaps."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se a imagem gerou mipmaps."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the image is compressed."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se a imagem estiver compactada."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the image has no data."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se a imagem não tiver dados."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if all the image's pixels have an alpha value of "
"0. Returns [code]false[/code] if any pixel has an alpha value higher than 0."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se todos os pixels da imagem tiverem um valor alfa "
"de 0. Retorna [code]false[/code] se algum pixel tiver um valor alfa maior "
"que 0."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the entire image from linear encoding to nonlinear sRGB encoding by "
"using a lookup table. Only works on images with [constant FORMAT_RGB8] or "
"[constant FORMAT_RGBA8] formats."
msgstr ""
"Converte a imagem inteira de codificação linear para codificação sRGB não "
"linear usando uma tabela de consulta. Funciona apenas em imagens com "
"formatos [constant FORMAT_RGB8] ou [constant FORMAT_RGBA8]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an image from file [param path]. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"assets_pipeline/importing_images.html#supported-image-formats]Supported "
"image formats[/url] for a list of supported image formats and limitations.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This method should only be used in the editor or in cases "
"when you need to load external images at run-time, such as images located at "
"the [code]user://[/code] directory, and may not work in exported projects.\n"
"See also [ImageTexture] description for usage examples."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an image from the binary contents of a BMP file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot's BMP module doesn't support 16-bit per pixel images. "
"Only 1-bit, 4-bit, 8-bit, 24-bit, and 32-bit per pixel images are "
"supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only available in engine builds with the BMP "
"module enabled. By default, the BMP module is enabled, but it can be "
"disabled at build-time using the [code]module_bmp_enabled=no[/code] SCons "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an image from the binary contents of a DDS file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only available in engine builds with the DDS "
"module enabled. By default, the DDS module is enabled, but it can be "
"disabled at build-time using the [code]module_dds_enabled=no[/code] SCons "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Loads an image from the binary contents of an OpenEXR file."
msgstr "Carrega uma imagem a partir do conteúdo binário de um arquivo OpenEXR."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Creates a new [Image] and loads data from the specified file."
msgstr "Cria um novo [Image] e carrega dados do arquivo especificado."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Loads an image from the binary contents of a JPEG file."
msgstr "Carrega uma imagem a partir do conteúdo binário de um arquivo JPEG."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an image from the binary contents of a [url=https://github.com/"
"KhronosGroup/KTX-Software]KTX[/url] file. Unlike most image formats, KTX can "
"store VRAM-compressed data and embed mipmaps.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot's libktx implementation only supports 2D images. "
"Cubemaps, texture arrays, and de-padding are not supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only available in engine builds with the KTX "
"module enabled. By default, the KTX module is enabled, but it can be "
"disabled at build-time using the [code]module_ktx_enabled=no[/code] SCons "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Loads an image from the binary contents of a PNG file."
msgstr "Carrega uma imagem a partir do conteúdo binário de um arquivo PNG."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an image from the UTF-8 binary contents of an [b]uncompressed[/b] SVG "
"file ([b].svg[/b]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Beware when using compressed SVG files (like [b].svgz[/b]), "
"they need to be [code]decompressed[/code] before loading.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only available in engine builds with the SVG "
"module enabled. By default, the SVG module is enabled, but it can be "
"disabled at build-time using the [code]module_svg_enabled=no[/code] SCons "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an image from the string contents of an SVG file ([b].svg[/b]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only available in engine builds with the SVG "
"module enabled. By default, the SVG module is enabled, but it can be "
"disabled at build-time using the [code]module_svg_enabled=no[/code] SCons "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Loads an image from the binary contents of a TGA file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only available in engine builds with the TGA "
"module enabled. By default, the TGA module is enabled, but it can be "
"disabled at build-time using the [code]module_tga_enabled=no[/code] SCons "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Loads an image from the binary contents of a WebP file."
msgstr "Carrega uma imagem a partir do conteúdo binário de um arquivo WebP."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the image's data to represent coordinates on a 3D plane. This is "
"used when the image represents a normal map. A normal map can add lots of "
"detail to a 3D surface without increasing the polygon count."
msgstr ""
"Converte os dados da imagem para representar coordenadas em um plano 3D. "
"Isso é usado quando a imagem representa um mapa de normais. Um mapa de "
"normais pode adicionar muitos detalhes a uma superfície 3D sem aumentar a "
"contagem de polígonos."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies color values with alpha values. Resulting color values for a "
"pixel are [code](color * alpha)/256[/code]. See also [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.blend_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica valores de cor por valores alfa. Os valores de cor resultantes "
"para um pixel são [code](color * alpha)/256[/code]. Veja também [member "
"CanvasItemMaterial.blend_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Resizes the image to the given [param width] and [param height]. New pixels "
"are calculated using the [param interpolation] mode defined via [enum "
"Interpolation] constants.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the image's format is [constant FORMAT_RGBA4444], [constant "
"FORMAT_RGB565], or [constant FORMAT_RGBE9995], it will be temporarily "
"converted to either [constant FORMAT_RGBA8] or [constant FORMAT_RGBAH]. This "
"can affect the quality of the resized image."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Resizes the image to the nearest power of 2 for the width and height. If "
"[param square] is [code]true[/code], sets width and height to be the same. "
"New pixels are calculated using the [param interpolation] mode defined via "
"[enum Interpolation] constants."
msgstr ""
"Redimensiona a imagem para a potência de 2 mais próxima para a largura e "
"altura. Se [param square] for [code]true[/code], define a largura e a altura "
"para serem iguais. Novos pixels são calculados usando o modo [param "
"interpolation] definido via constantes [enum Interpolation]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Converts a standard linear RGBE (Red Green Blue Exponent) image to an image "
"that uses nonlinear sRGB encoding."
msgstr ""
"Converte uma imagem linear padrão RGBE (Red Green Blue Exponent) em uma "
"imagem que usa codificação sRGB não linear."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates the image in the specified [param direction] by [code]90[/code] "
"degrees. The width and height of the image must be greater than [code]1[/"
"code]. If the width and height are not equal, the image will be resized."
msgstr ""
"Rotaciona a imagem na [param direction] especificada em [code]90[/code] "
"graus. A largura e a altura da imagem devem ser maiores que [code]1[/code]. "
"Se a largura e a altura não forem iguais, a imagem será redimensionada."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates the image by [code]180[/code] degrees. The width and height of the "
"image must be greater than [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Rotaciona a imagem em [code]180[/code] graus. A largura e a altura da imagem "
"devem ser maiores que [code]1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as a DDS (DirectDraw Surface) file to [param path]. DDS is a "
"container format that can store textures in various compression formats, "
"such as DXT1, DXT5, or BC7. This function will return [constant "
"ERR_UNAVAILABLE] if Godot was compiled without the DDS module.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The DDS module may be disabled in certain builds, which means "
"[method save_dds] will return [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE] when it is called "
"from an exported project."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as a DDS (DirectDraw Surface) file to a byte array. DDS is a "
"container format that can store textures in various compression formats, "
"such as DXT1, DXT5, or BC7. This function will return an empty byte array if "
"Godot was compiled without the DDS module.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The DDS module may be disabled in certain builds, which means "
"[method save_dds_to_buffer] will return an empty byte array when it is "
"called from an exported project."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as an EXR file to [param path]. If [param grayscale] is "
"[code]true[/code] and the image has only one channel, it will be saved "
"explicitly as monochrome rather than one red channel. Set [param "
"color_image] to [code]true[/code] when saving a color image, such as a "
"screenshot. Negative values will be included when [param color_image] is "
"[code]false[/code], which may be useful for saving raw floating point data "
"such as a lightmap that includes negative light information. Color component "
"values in the resulting EXR file will not exceed [param max_linear_value] if "
"[param max_linear_value] is not negative. This function will return "
"[constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE] if Godot was compiled without the TinyEXR "
"module.\n"
"When saving screenshots of a project that uses HDR output, use [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] for [param max_linear_value]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as an EXR file to a byte array. If [param grayscale] is "
"[code]true[/code] and the image has only one channel, it will be saved "
"explicitly as monochrome rather than one red channel. Set [param "
"color_image] to [code]true[/code] when saving a color image, such as a "
"screenshot. Negative values will be included when [param color_image] is "
"[code]false[/code], which may be useful for saving raw floating point data "
"such as a lightmap that includes negative light information. Color component "
"values in the resulting EXR file will not exceed [param max_linear_value] if "
"[param max_linear_value] is not negative. This function will return an empty "
"byte array if Godot was compiled without the TinyEXR module.\n"
"When saving screenshots of a project that uses HDR output, use [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] for [param max_linear_value]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as a JPEG file to [param path] with the specified [param "
"quality] between [code]0.01[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Higher "
"[param quality] values result in better-looking output at the cost of larger "
"file sizes. Recommended [param quality] values are between [code]0.75[/code] "
"and [code]0.90[/code]. Even at quality [code]1.00[/code], JPEG compression "
"remains lossy.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] JPEG does not save an alpha channel. If the [Image] contains an "
"alpha channel, the image will still be saved, but the resulting JPEG file "
"won't contain the alpha channel."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as a JPEG file to a byte array with the specified [param "
"quality] between [code]0.01[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Higher "
"[param quality] values result in better-looking output at the cost of larger "
"byte array sizes (and therefore memory usage). Recommended [param quality] "
"values are between [code]0.75[/code] and [code]0.90[/code]. Even at quality "
"[code]1.00[/code], JPEG compression remains lossy.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] JPEG does not save an alpha channel. If the [Image] contains an "
"alpha channel, the image will still be saved, but the resulting byte array "
"won't contain the alpha channel."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Saves the image as a PNG file to the file at [param path]."
msgstr "Salva a imagem como um arquivo PNG no arquivo em [param path]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Saves the image as a PNG file to a byte array."
msgstr "Salva a imagem como um arquivo PNG em uma matriz de bytes."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as a WebP (Web Picture) file to the file at [param path]. By "
"default it will save lossless. If [param lossy] is [code]true[/code], the "
"image will be saved lossy, using the [param quality] setting between "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Lossless WebP offers more "
"efficient compression than PNG.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The WebP format is limited to a size of 16383×16383 pixels, "
"while PNG can save larger images."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the image as a WebP (Web Picture) file to a byte array. By default it "
"will save lossless. If [param lossy] is [code]true[/code], the image will be "
"saved lossy, using the [param quality] setting between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Lossless WebP offers more efficient "
"compression than PNG.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The WebP format is limited to a size of 16383×16383 pixels, "
"while PNG can save larger images."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Overwrites data of an existing [Image]. Non-static equivalent of [method "
"create_from_data]."
msgstr ""
"Sobrescreve os dados de um [Image] existente. Equivalente não estático de "
"[method create_from_data]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Color] of the pixel at [code](x, y)[/code] to [param color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var img_width = 10\n"
"var img_height = 5\n"
"var img = Image.create(img_width, img_height, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n"
"\n"
"img.set_pixel(1, 2, Color.RED) # Sets the color at (1, 2) to red.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int imgWidth = 10;\n"
"int imgHeight = 5;\n"
"var img = Image.Create(imgWidth, imgHeight, false, Image.Format.Rgba8);\n"
"\n"
"img.SetPixel(1, 2, Colors.Red); // Sets the color at (1, 2) to red.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This is the same as [method set_pixelv], but with a two integer arguments "
"instead of a [Vector2i] argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on the image's format, the color set here may be "
"clamped or lose precision. Do not assume the color returned by [method "
"get_pixel] to be identical to the one set here; any comparisons will likely "
"need to use an approximation like [method Color.is_equal_approx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On grayscale image formats, only the red channel of [param "
"color] is used (and alpha if relevant). The green and blue channels are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Define a [Color] do pixel em [code](x, y)[/code] para [param color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var img_width = 10\n"
"var img_height = 5\n"
"var img = Image.create(img_width, img_height, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n"
"\n"
"img.set_pixel(1, 2, Color.RED) # Define a cor em (1, 2) como vermelho.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int imgWidth = 10;\n"
"int imgHeight = 5;\n"
"var img = Image.Create(imgWidth, imgHeight, false, Image.Format.Rgba8);\n"
"\n"
"img.SetPixel(1, 2, Colors.Red); // Define a cor em (1, 2) como vermelho.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Isto é o mesmo que [method set_pixelv], mas com dois argumentos inteiros em "
"vez de um argumento [Vector2i].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Dependendo do formato da imagem, a cor definida aqui pode ser "
"limitada (clamped) ou perder precisão. Não assuma que a cor retornada por "
"[method get_pixel] seja idêntica à definida aqui; quaisquer comparações "
"provavelmente precisarão usar uma aproximação como [method "
"Color.is_equal_approx].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em formatos de imagem em escala de cinza, apenas o canal "
"vermelho de [param color] é usado (e o alfa, se relevante). Os canais verde "
"e azul são ignorados."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [Color] of the pixel at [param point] to [param color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var img_width = 10\n"
"var img_height = 5\n"
"var img = Image.create(img_width, img_height, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n"
"\n"
"img.set_pixelv(Vector2i(1, 2), Color.RED) # Sets the color at (1, 2) to "
"red.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int imgWidth = 10;\n"
"int imgHeight = 5;\n"
"var img = Image.Create(imgWidth, imgHeight, false, Image.Format.Rgba8);\n"
"\n"
"img.SetPixelv(new Vector2I(1, 2), Colors.Red); // Sets the color at (1, 2) "
"to red.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This is the same as [method set_pixel], but with a [Vector2i] argument "
"instead of two integer arguments.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on the image's format, the color set here may be "
"clamped or lose precision. Do not assume the color returned by [method "
"get_pixelv] to be identical to the one set here; any comparisons will likely "
"need to use an approximation like [method Color.is_equal_approx].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On grayscale image formats, only the red channel of [param "
"color] is used (and alpha if relevant). The green and blue channels are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Define a [Color] do pixel em [param point] para [param color].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var img_width = 10\n"
"var img_height = 5\n"
"var img = Image.create(img_width, img_height, false, Image.FORMAT_RGBA8)\n"
"\n"
"img.set_pixelv(Vector2i(1, 2), Color.RED) # Define a cor em (1, 2) como "
"vermelho.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int imgWidth = 10;\n"
"int imgHeight = 5;\n"
"var img = Image.Create(imgWidth, imgHeight, false, Image.Format.Rgba8);\n"
"\n"
"img.SetPixelv(new Vector2I(1, 2), Colors.Red); // Define a cor em (1, 2) "
"como vermelho.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Isto é o mesmo que [method set_pixel], mas com um argumento [Vector2i] em "
"vez de dois argumentos inteiros.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Dependendo do formato da imagem, a cor definida aqui pode ser "
"limitada (clamped) ou perder precisão. Não assuma que a cor retornada por "
"[method get_pixelv] seja idêntica à definida aqui; quaisquer comparações "
"provavelmente precisarão usar uma aproximação como [method "
"Color.is_equal_approx].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em formatos de imagem em escala de cinza, apenas o canal "
"vermelho de [param color] é usado (e o alfa, se relevante). Os canais verde "
"e azul são ignorados."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Shrinks the image by a factor of 2 on each axis (this divides the pixel "
"count by 4)."
msgstr ""
"Reduz a imagem por um fator de 2 em cada eixo (isso divide a contagem de "
"pixels por 4)."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the raw data from nonlinear sRGB encoding to linear encoding using "
"a lookup table. Only works on images with [constant FORMAT_RGB8] or "
"[constant FORMAT_RGBA8] formats.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The 8-bit formats required by this method are not suitable for "
"storing linearly encoded values; a significant amount of color information "
"will be lost in darker values. To maintain image quality, this method should "
"not be used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Holds all the image's color data in a given format. See [enum Format] "
"constants."
msgstr ""
"Contém todos os dados de cores da imagem em um determinado formato. Consulte "
"as constantes [enum Format]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The maximal width allowed for [Image] resources."
msgstr "A largura máxima permitida para recursos de [Image]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The maximal height allowed for [Image] resources."
msgstr "A altura máxima permitida para recursos [Image]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Texture format with a single 8-bit depth representing luminance."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura com uma única profundidade de 8 bits representando "
"luminância."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format with two values, luminance and alpha each stored with "
"8 bits."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL com dois valores, luminância e alfa, cada um "
"armazenado com 8 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]RED[/code] with a single component and a "
"bitdepth of 8."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]RED[/code] com um único componente e "
"profundidade de bits de 8."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]RG[/code] with two components and a bitdepth of "
"8 for each."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]RG[/code] com dois componentes e uma "
"profundidade de bits de 8 para cada um."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]RGB[/code] with three components, each with a "
"bitdepth of 8.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]RGBA[/code] with four components, each with a "
"bitdepth of 8.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]RGBA[/code] with four components, each with a "
"bitdepth of 4."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]RGBA[/code] com quatro componentes, cada um "
"com uma profundidade de bits de 4."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]RGB[/code] with three components. Red and blue "
"have a bitdepth of 5, and green has a bitdepth of 6."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]RGB[/code] com três componentes. Vermelho e "
"azul têm uma profundidade de bit de 5, e verde tem uma profundidade de bit "
"de 6."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_R32F[/code] where there's one component, a 32-"
"bit floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_R32F[/code] onde há um componente, um "
"valor de ponto flutuante de 32 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RG32F[/code] where there are two components, "
"each a 32-bit floating-point values."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RG32F[/code], onde há dois componentes, "
"cada um sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de 32 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGB32F[/code] where there are three "
"components, each a 32-bit floating-point values."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RGB32F[/code], onde há três componentes, "
"cada um sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de 32 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGBA32F[/code] where there are four "
"components, each a 32-bit floating-point values."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RGBA32F[/code], onde há quatro "
"componentes, cada um sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de 32 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_R16F[/code] where there's one component, a 16-"
"bit \"half-precision\" floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_R16F[/code] onde há um componente, um "
"valor de ponto flutuante de 16 bits de \"precisão metade\"."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RG16F[/code] where there are two components, "
"each a 16-bit \"half-precision\" floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RG16F[/code] onde há dois componentes, "
"cada um sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de \"meia precisão\" de 16 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGB16F[/code] where there are three "
"components, each a 16-bit \"half-precision\" floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RGB16F[/code] onde há três componentes, "
"cada um sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de \"meia precisão\" de 16 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGBA16F[/code] where there are four "
"components, each a 16-bit \"half-precision\" floating-point value."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura OpenGL [code]GL_RGBA16F[/code] onde há quatro "
"componentes, cada um sendo um valor de ponto flutuante de \"meia precisão\" "
"de 16 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"A special OpenGL texture format where the three color components have 9 bits "
"of precision and all three share a single 5-bit exponent."
msgstr ""
"Um formato especial de textura OpenGL onde os três componentes de cor têm 9 "
"bits de precisão e todos os três compartilham um único expoente de 5 bits."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S3_Texture_Compression]S3TC[/url] "
"texture format that uses Block Compression 1, and is the smallest variation "
"of S3TC, only providing 1 bit of alpha and color data being premultiplied "
"with alpha.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S3_Texture_Compression]S3TC[/url] "
"texture format that uses Block Compression 2, and color data is interpreted "
"as not having been premultiplied by alpha. Well suited for images with sharp "
"alpha transitions between translucent and opaque areas.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S3_Texture_Compression]S3TC[/url] "
"texture format also known as Block Compression 3 or BC3 that contains 64 "
"bits of alpha channel data followed by 64 bits of DXT1-encoded color data. "
"Color data is not premultiplied by alpha, same as DXT3. DXT5 generally "
"produces superior results for transparent gradients compared to DXT3.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Texture format that uses [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/"
"Red_Green_Texture_Compression]Red Green Texture Compression[/url], "
"normalizing the red channel data using the same compression algorithm that "
"DXT5 uses for the alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura que usa [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/"
"Red_Green_Texture_Compression]Red Green Texture Compression[/url], "
"normalizando os dados do canal vermelho usando o mesmo algoritmo de "
"compressão que o DXT5 usa para o canal alfa."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Texture format that uses [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/"
"Red_Green_Texture_Compression]Red Green Texture Compression[/url], "
"normalizing the red and green channel data using the same compression "
"algorithm that DXT5 uses for the alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura que usa [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/"
"Red_Green_Texture_Compression]Red Green Texture Compression[/url], "
"normalizando os dados dos canais vermelho e verde usando o mesmo algoritmo "
"de compressão que o DXT5 usa para o canal alfa."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Texture format that uses [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/"
"BPTC_Texture_Compression]BPTC[/url] compression with unsigned normalized "
"RGBA components.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Texture format that uses [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/"
"BPTC_Texture_Compression]BPTC[/url] compression with signed floating-point "
"RGB components."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura que usa compressão [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/"
"wiki/BPTC_Texture_Compression]BPTC[/url] com componentes RGB de ponto "
"flutuante com sinal."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Texture format that uses [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/wiki/"
"BPTC_Texture_Compression]BPTC[/url] compression with unsigned floating-point "
"RGB components."
msgstr ""
"Formato de textura que usa compressão [url=https://www.khronos.org/opengl/"
"wiki/BPTC_Texture_Compression]BPTC[/url] com componentes RGB de ponto "
"flutuante sem sinal."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC1]Ericsson Texture Compression format 1[/"
"url], also referred to as \"ETC1\", and is part of the OpenGL ES graphics "
"standard. This format cannot store an alpha channel."
msgstr ""
"Formato de compactação de textura [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC1]Ericsson Texture Compression format 1[/"
"url], também conhecido como \"ETC1\", e faz parte do padrão gráfico OpenGL "
"ES. Este formato não pode armazenar um canal alfa."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]R11_EAC[/code] variant), which provides one channel of "
"unsigned data."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Formato 2 de Compactação de "
"Textura Ericsson[/url] (variante [code]R11_EAC[/code]), que fornece um canal "
"de dados não assinados."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]SIGNED_R11_EAC[/code] variant), which provides one "
"channel of signed data."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Formato 2 de Compactação de "
"Textura Ericsson[/url] (variante [code]SIGNED_R11_EAC[/code]), que fornece "
"um canal de dados com sinal."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]RG11_EAC[/code] variant), which provides two channels "
"of unsigned data."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Formato 2 de Compactação de "
"Textura Ericsson[/url] (variante [code]RG11_EAC[/code]), que fornece dois "
"canais de dados não assinados."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]SIGNED_RG11_EAC[/code] variant), which provides two "
"channels of signed data."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Formato 2 de Compactação de "
"Textura Ericsson[/url] (variante [code]SIGNED_RG11_EAC[/code]), que fornece "
"dois canais de dados com sinal."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]RGB8[/code] variant), which is a follow-up of ETC1 and "
"compresses RGB888 data.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]RGBA8[/code]variant), which compresses RGBA8888 data "
"with full alpha support.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]RGB8_PUNCHTHROUGH_ALPHA1[/code] variant), which "
"compresses RGBA data to make alpha either fully transparent or fully "
"opaque.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When creating an [ImageTexture], a nonlinear sRGB to linear "
"encoding conversion is performed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Ericsson Texture Compression "
"format 2[/url] ([code]RGBA8[/code] variant), which compresses RA data and "
"interprets it as two channels (red and green). See also [constant "
"FORMAT_ETC2_RGBA8]."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Ericsson_Texture_Compression#ETC2_and_EAC]Formato Ericsson Texture "
"Compression 2[/url] (variante [code]RGBA8[/code]), que compacta dados RA e "
"os interpreta como dois canais (vermelho e verde). Veja também [constant "
"FORMAT_ETC2_RGBA8]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"The [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S3_Texture_Compression]S3TC[/url] "
"texture format also known as Block Compression 3 or BC3, which compresses RA "
"data and interprets it as two channels (red and green). See also [constant "
"FORMAT_DXT5]."
msgstr ""
"O formato de textura [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"S3_Texture_Compression]S3TC[/url], também conhecido como Block Compression 3 "
"ou BC3, que compacta dados RA e os interpreta como dois canais (vermelho e "
"verde). Consulte também [constant FORMAT_DXT5]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Adaptive_scalable_texture_compression]Adaptive Scalable Texture Compression[/"
"url]. This implements the 4×4 (high quality) mode."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Adaptive_scalable_texture_compression]Adaptive Scalable Texture Compression[/"
"url]. Isso implementa o modo 4×4 (alta qualidade)."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Same format as [constant FORMAT_ASTC_4x4], but with the hint to let the GPU "
"know it is used for HDR."
msgstr ""
"Mesmo formato que [constant FORMAT_ASTC_4x4], mas com a dica para informar à "
"GPU que ele é usado para HDR."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Adaptive_scalable_texture_compression]Adaptive Scalable Texture Compression[/"
"url]. This implements the 8×8 (low quality) mode."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Adaptive_scalable_texture_compression]Adaptive Scalable Texture Compression[/"
"url]. Isso implementa o modo 8×8 (baixa qualidade)."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Same format as [constant FORMAT_ASTC_8x8], but with the hint to let the GPU "
"know it is used for HDR."
msgstr ""
"Mesmo formato que [constant FORMAT_ASTC_8x8], mas com a dica para informar à "
"GPU que ele é usado para HDR."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_R16[/code] where there's one component, a 16-"
"bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value is normalized, each "
"component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] "
"(inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RF]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RG16[/code] where there are two components, "
"each a 16-bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value is "
"normalized, each component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RGF]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGB16[/code] where there are three "
"components, each a 16-bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value "
"is normalized, each component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RGBF]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGBA16[/code] where there are four "
"components, each a 16-bit unsigned normalized integer value. Since the value "
"is normalized, each component is clamped between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to limited hardware support, it is mainly recommended to be "
"used on desktop or console devices. It may be unsupported on mobile or web, "
"and will consequently be converted to [constant FORMAT_RGBAF]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_R16UI[/code] where there's one component, a "
"16-bit unsigned integer value. Each component is clamped between [code]0[/"
"code] and [code]65535[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in a shader, the texture requires usage of "
"[code]usampler[/code] samplers. Additionally, it only supports nearest-"
"neighbor filtering under the Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When sampling using [method Image.get_pixel], returned [Color]s "
"have to be divided by [code]65535[/code] to get the correct color value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RG16UI[/code] where there are two components, "
"each a 16-bit unsigned integer value. Each component is clamped between "
"[code]0[/code] and [code]65535[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in a shader, the texture requires usage of "
"[code]usampler[/code] samplers. Additionally, it only supports nearest-"
"neighbor filtering under the Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When sampling using [method Image.get_pixel], returned [Color]s "
"have to be divided by [code]65535[/code] to get the correct color value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGB16UI[/code] where there are three "
"components, each a 16-bit unsigned integer value. Each component is clamped "
"between [code]0[/code] and [code]65535[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in a shader, the texture requires usage of "
"[code]usampler[/code] samplers. Additionally, it only supports nearest-"
"neighbor filtering under the Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When sampling using [method Image.get_pixel], returned [Color]s "
"have to be divided by [code]65535[/code] to get the correct color value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"OpenGL texture format [code]GL_RGBA16UI[/code] where there are four "
"components, each a 16-bit unsigned integer value. Each component is clamped "
"between [code]0[/code] and [code]65535[/code] (inclusive).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in a shader, the texture requires usage of "
"[code]usampler[/code] samplers. Additionally, it only supports nearest-"
"neighbor filtering under the Compatibility renderer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When sampling using [method Image.get_pixel], returned [Color]s "
"have to be divided by [code]65535[/code] to get the correct color value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum Format] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum Format]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Performs nearest-neighbor interpolation. If the image is resized, it will be "
"pixelated."
msgstr ""
"Executa a interpolação do vizinho mais próximo. Se a imagem for "
"redimensionada, ela ficará pixelada."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Performs bilinear interpolation. If the image is resized, it will be blurry. "
"This mode is faster than [constant INTERPOLATE_CUBIC], but it results in "
"lower quality."
msgstr ""
"Executa interpolação bilinear. Se a imagem for redimensionada, ela ficará "
"borrada. Este modo é mais rápido que [constant INTERPOLATE_CUBIC], mas "
"resulta em menor qualidade."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Performs cubic interpolation. If the image is resized, it will be blurry. "
"This mode often gives better results compared to [constant "
"INTERPOLATE_BILINEAR], at the cost of being slower."
msgstr ""
"Realiza interpolação cúbica. Se a imagem for redimensionada, ela ficará "
"borrada. Este modo geralmente oferece melhores resultados em comparação com "
"[constant INTERPOLATE_BILINEAR], ao custo de ser mais lento."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Performs bilinear separately on the two most-suited mipmap levels, then "
"linearly interpolates between them.\n"
"It's slower than [constant INTERPOLATE_BILINEAR], but produces higher-"
"quality results with far fewer aliasing artifacts.\n"
"If the image does not have mipmaps, they will be generated and used "
"internally, but no mipmaps will be generated on the resulting image.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you intend to scale multiple copies of the original image, "
"it's better to call [method generate_mipmaps]] on it in advance, to avoid "
"wasting processing power in generating them again and again.\n"
"On the other hand, if the image already has mipmaps, they will be used, and "
"a new set will be generated for the resulting image."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Performs Lanczos interpolation. This is the slowest image resizing mode, but "
"it typically gives the best results, especially when downscaling images."
msgstr ""
"Realiza interpolação de Lanczos. Este é o modo de redimensionamento de "
"imagem mais lento, mas normalmente oferece os melhores resultados, "
"especialmente ao reduzir imagens."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Image is fully opaque. It does not store alpha data."
msgstr "A imagem é totalmente opaca. Ela não armazena dados de alfa."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Image stores either fully opaque or fully transparent pixels. Also known as "
"punchthrough alpha."
msgstr ""
"A imagem armazena pixels totalmente opacos ou totalmente transparentes. "
"Também conhecido como alfa punch-through."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Image stores alpha data with values varying between [code]0.0[/code] and "
"[code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A imagem armazena dados alfa com valores que variam entre [code]0.0[/code] e "
"[code]1.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Use S3TC compression."
msgstr "Use a compressão S3TC."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Use ETC compression."
msgstr "Use a compressão ETC."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Use ETC2 compression."
msgstr "Use a compressão ETC2."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Use BPTC compression."
msgstr "Usar compressão BPTC."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Use ASTC compression."
msgstr "Usar compressão ASTC."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum CompressMode] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum CompressMode]."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The image only uses one channel for luminance (grayscale)."
msgstr "A imagem usa apenas um canal para luminância (escala de cinza)."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The image uses two channels for luminance and alpha, respectively."
msgstr "A imagem usa dois canais para luminância e alfa, respectivamente."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The image only uses the red channel."
msgstr "A imagem usa apenas o canal vermelho."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The image uses two channels for red and green."
msgstr "A imagem usa dois canais para vermelho e verde."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The image uses three channels for red, green, and blue."
msgstr "A imagem usa três canais para vermelho, verde e azul."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "The image uses four channels for red, green, blue, and alpha."
msgstr "A imagem usa quatro canais para vermelho, verde, azul e alfa."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Source texture (before compression) is a regular texture. Default for all "
"textures."
msgstr ""
"A textura de origem (antes da compactação) é uma textura comum. Padrão para "
"todas as texturas."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid "Source texture (before compression) uses nonlinear sRGB encoding."
msgstr ""
"A textura de origem (antes da compressão) usa codificação sRGB não linear."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Source texture (before compression) is a normal texture (e.g. it can be "
"compressed into two channels)."
msgstr ""
"A textura de origem (antes da compressão) é uma textura normal (por exemplo, "
"pode ser comprimida em dois canais)."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Hint to indicate that the high quality 4×4 ASTC compression format should be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Dica para indicar que o formato de compressão ASTC 4×4 de alta qualidade "
"deve ser usado."

#: doc/classes/Image.xml
msgid ""
"Hint to indicate that the low quality 8×8 ASTC compression format should be "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Dica para indicar que o formato de compactação ASTC 8×8 de baixa qualidade "
"deve ser usado."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoader.xml
msgid "Base class to add support for specific image formats."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para adicionar suporte para formatos de imagem específicos."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoader.xml
msgid ""
"The engine supports multiple image formats out of the box (PNG, SVG, JPEG, "
"WebP to name a few), but you can choose to implement support for additional "
"image formats by extending [ImageFormatLoaderExtension]."
msgstr ""
"O motor dá suporte a vários formatos de imagem nativamente (PNG, SVG, JPEG, "
"WebP, para citar alguns), mas você pode optar por implementar suporte a "
"formatos de imagem adicionais estendendo [ImageFormatLoaderExtension]."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoader.xml
msgid "Default loading behavior. No processing is applied to the image."
msgstr ""
"Comportamento de carregamento padrão. Nenhum processamento é aplicado à "
"imagem."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoader.xml
msgid "If set, the image is converted from sRGB to linear encoding."
msgstr "Se definido, a imagem é convertida de sRGB para codificação linear."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoader.xml
msgid ""
"If set, a predefined color map is applied to the image. Used when [member "
"ResourceImporterTexture.editor/convert_colors_with_editor_theme] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, um mapa de cores predefinido é aplicado à imagem. Usado quando "
"[member ResourceImporterTexture.editor/convert_colors_with_editor_theme] é "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoaderExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for creating [ImageFormatLoader] extensions (adding support for "
"extra image formats)."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para criar extensões [ImageFormatLoader] (adicionando suporte "
"para formatos de imagem extras)."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoaderExtension.xml
msgid ""
"The engine supports multiple image formats out of the box (PNG, SVG, JPEG, "
"WebP to name a few), but you can choose to implement support for additional "
"image formats by extending this class.\n"
"Be sure to respect the documented return types and values. You should create "
"an instance of it, and call [method add_format_loader] to register that "
"loader during the initialization phase."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoaderExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of file extensions for this image format. Files with the "
"given extensions will be treated as image file and loaded using this class."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de extensões de arquivo para este formato de imagem. "
"Arquivos com as extensões fornecidas serão tratados como arquivos de imagem "
"e carregados usando esta classe."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoaderExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Loads the content of [param fileaccess] into the provided [param image]."
msgstr "Carrega o conteúdo de [param fileaccess] na [param image] fornecida."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoaderExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Add this format loader to the engine, allowing it to recognize the file "
"extensions returned by [method _get_recognized_extensions]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona este carregador de formato ao engine, permitindo que ele reconheça "
"as extensões de arquivo retornadas por [method _get_recognized_extensions]."

#: doc/classes/ImageFormatLoaderExtension.xml
msgid "Remove this format loader from the engine."
msgstr "Remove este carregador de formato da engine."

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture.xml
msgid "A [Texture2D] based on an [Image]."
msgstr "Um [Texture2D] baseado em uma [Image]."

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture.xml
msgid ""
"A [Texture2D] based on an [Image]. For an image to be displayed, an "
"[ImageTexture] has to be created from it using the [method "
"create_from_image] method:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var image = Image.load_from_file(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var texture = ImageTexture.create_from_image(image)\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This way, textures can be created at run-time by loading images both from "
"within the editor and externally.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Prefer to load imported textures with [method "
"@GDScript.load] over loading them from within the filesystem dynamically "
"with [method Image.load], as it may not work in exported projects:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This is because images have to be imported as a [CompressedTexture2D] first "
"to be loaded with [method @GDScript.load]. If you'd still like to load an "
"image file just like any other [Resource], import it as an [Image] resource "
"instead, and then load it normally using the [method @GDScript.load] "
"method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The image can be retrieved from an imported texture using the "
"[method Texture2D.get_image] method, which returns a copy of the image:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var image = texture.get_image()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"An [ImageTexture] is not meant to be operated from within the editor "
"interface directly, and is mostly useful for rendering images on screen "
"dynamically via code. If you need to generate images procedurally from "
"within the editor, consider saving and importing images as custom texture "
"resources implementing a new [EditorImportPlugin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The maximum texture size is 16384×16384 pixels due to graphics "
"hardware limitations."
msgstr ""
"Um [Texture2D] baseado em um [Image]. Para que uma imagem seja exibida, um "
"[ImageTexture] deve ser criado a partir dela usando o método [method "
"create_from_image]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var image = Image.load_from_file(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var texture = ImageTexture.create_from_image(image)\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Dessa forma, texturas podem ser criadas em tempo de execução carregando "
"imagens tanto de dentro do editor quanto externamente.\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] Prefira carregar texturas importadas com [method "
"@GDScript.load] em vez de carregá-las de dentro do sistema de arquivos "
"dinamicamente com [method Image.load], pois isso pode não funcionar em "
"projetos exportados:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"$Sprite2D.texture = texture\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Isso ocorre porque as imagens precisam primeiro ser importadas como um "
"[CompressedTexture2D] para serem carregadas com [method @GDScript.load]. Se "
"você ainda quiser carregar um arquivo de imagem como qualquer outro "
"[Resource], importe-o como um recurso [Image] e, em seguida, carregue-o "
"normalmente usando o método [method @GDScript.load].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A imagem pode ser obtida de uma textura importada usando o "
"método [method Texture2D.get_image], que retorna uma cópia da imagem:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = load(\"res://icon.svg\")\n"
"var image = texture.get_image()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Um [ImageTexture] não foi feito para ser operado diretamente a partir da "
"interface do editor, sendo mais útil para renderizar imagens na tela "
"dinamicamente via código. Se você precisar gerar imagens proceduralmente a "
"partir de dentro do editor, considere salvar e importar imagens como "
"recursos de textura personalizados implementando um novo "
"[EditorImportPlugin].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O tamanho máximo da textura é 16384×16384 pixels devido a "
"limitações de hardware gráfico."

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [ImageTexture] and initializes it by allocating and setting "
"the data from an [Image]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo [ImageTexture] e o inicializa alocando e definindo os dados de "
"um [Image]."

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the texture's data with a new [Image]. This will re-allocate new "
"memory for the texture.\n"
"If you want to update the image, but don't need to change its parameters "
"(format, size), use [method update] instead for better performance."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the texture's data with a new [Image].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The texture has to be created using [method create_from_image] "
"or initialized first with the [method set_image] method before it can be "
"updated. The new image dimensions, format, and mipmaps configuration should "
"match the existing texture's image configuration.\n"
"Use this method over [method set_image] if you need to update the texture "
"frequently, which is faster than allocating additional memory for a new "
"texture each time."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture3D.xml
msgid "Texture with 3 dimensions."
msgstr "Textura com 3 dimensões."

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"[ImageTexture3D] is a 3-dimensional [ImageTexture] that has a width, height, "
"and depth. See also [ImageTextureLayered].\n"
"3D textures are typically used to store density maps for [FogMaterial], "
"color correction LUTs for [Environment], vector fields for "
"[GPUParticlesAttractorVectorField3D] and collision maps for "
"[GPUParticlesCollisionSDF3D]. 3D textures can also be used in custom shaders."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates the [ImageTexture3D] with specified [param format], [param width], "
"[param height], and [param depth]. If [param use_mipmaps] is [code]true[/"
"code], generates mipmaps for the [ImageTexture3D]."
msgstr ""
"Cria o [ImageTexture3D] com o [param format], [param width], [param height] "
"e [param depth] especificados. Se [param use_mipmaps] for [code]true[/code], "
"gera mipmaps para o [ImageTexture3D]."

#: doc/classes/ImageTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the texture's existing data with the layers specified in [param "
"data]. The size of [param data] must match the parameters that were used for "
"[method create]. In other words, the texture cannot be resized or have its "
"format changed by calling [method update]."
msgstr ""
"Substitui os dados existentes da textura pelas camadas especificadas em "
"[param data]. O tamanho de [param data] deve corresponder aos parâmetros que "
"foram usados para [method create]. Em outras palavras, a textura não pode "
"ter seu tamanho alterado ou seu formato modificado chamando [method update]."

#: doc/classes/ImageTextureLayered.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for texture types which contain the data of multiple "
"[ImageTexture]s. Each image is of the same size and format."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para tipos de textura que contêm os dados de vários "
"[ImageTexture]s. Cada imagem é do mesmo tamanho e formato."

#: doc/classes/ImageTextureLayered.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for [Texture2DArray], [Cubemap] and [CubemapArray]. Cannot be "
"used directly, but contains all the functions necessary for accessing the "
"derived resource types. See also [Texture3D]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para [Texture2DArray], [Cubemap] e [CubemapArray]. Não pode ser "
"usada diretamente, mas contém todas as funções necessárias para acessar os "
"tipos de recursos derivados. Veja também [Textura3D]."

#: doc/classes/ImageTextureLayered.xml
msgid ""
"Creates an [ImageTextureLayered] from an array of [Image]s. See [method "
"Image.create] for the expected data format. The first image decides the "
"width, height, image format and mipmapping setting. The other images "
"[i]must[/i] have the same width, height, image format and mipmapping "
"setting.\n"
"Each [Image] represents one [code]layer[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Fill in an array of Images with different colors.\n"
"var images = []\n"
"const LAYERS = 6\n"
"for i in LAYERS:\n"
"\tvar image = Image.create_empty(128, 128, false, Image.FORMAT_RGB8)\n"
"\tif i % 3 == 0:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.RED)\n"
"\telif i % 3 == 1:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.GREEN)\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.BLUE)\n"
"\timages.push_back(image)\n"
"\n"
"# Create and save a 2D texture array. The array of images must have at least "
"1 Image.\n"
"var texture_2d_array = Texture2DArray.new()\n"
"texture_2d_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(texture_2d_array, \"res://texture_2d_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# Create and save a cubemap. The array of images must have exactly 6 "
"Images.\n"
"# The cubemap's images are specified in this order: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z-\n"
"# (in Godot's coordinate system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\").\n"
"var cubemap = Cubemap.new()\n"
"cubemap.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap, \"res://cubemap.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# Create and save a cubemap array. The array of images must have a multiple "
"of 6 Images.\n"
"# Each cubemap's images are specified in this order: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, Z-\n"
"# (in Godot's coordinate system, so Y+ is \"up\" and Z- is \"forward\").\n"
"var cubemap_array = CubemapArray.new()\n"
"cubemap_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap_array, \"res://cubemap_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Cria um [ImageTextureLayered] a partir de uma matriz (array) de [Image]s. "
"Consulte [method Image.create] para o formato de dados esperado. A primeira "
"imagem define a largura, altura, formato de imagem e configuração de "
"mipmapping. As outras imagens [i]devem[/i] ter a mesma largura, altura, "
"formato de imagem e configuração de mipmapping.\n"
"Cada [Image] representa uma [code]layer[/code] (camada).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Preenche uma matriz de Imagens com cores diferentes.\n"
"var images = []\n"
"const LAYERS = 6\n"
"for i in LAYERS:\n"
"\tvar image = Image.create_empty(128, 128, false, Image.FORMAT_RGB8)\n"
"\tif i % 3 == 0:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.RED)\n"
"\telif i % 3 == 1:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.GREEN)\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\timage.fill(Color.BLUE)\n"
"\timages.push_back(image)\n"
"\n"
"# Cria e salva uma matriz de texturas 2D. A matriz de imagens deve ter pelo "
"menos 1 Imagem.\n"
"var texture_2d_array = Texture2DArray.new()\n"
"texture_2d_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(texture_2d_array, \"res://texture_2d_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# Cria e salva um cubemap. A matriz de imagens deve ter exatamente 6 "
"Imagens.\n"
"# As imagens do cubemap são especificadas nesta ordem: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, Z+, "
"Z-\n"
"# (no sistema de coordenadas do Godot, então Y+ é \"para cima\" e Z- é "
"\"para frente\").\n"
"var cubemap = Cubemap.new()\n"
"cubemap.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap, \"res://cubemap.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"\n"
"# Cria e salva uma matriz de cubemaps. A matriz de imagens deve ter um "
"múltiplo de 6 Imagens.\n"
"# As imagens de cada cubemap são especificadas nesta ordem: X+, X-, Y+, Y-, "
"Z+, Z-\n"
"# (no sistema de coordenadas do Godot, então Y+ é \"para cima\" e Z- é "
"\"para frente\").\n"
"var cubemap_array = CubemapArray.new()\n"
"cubemap_array.create_from_images(images)\n"
"ResourceSaver.save(cubemap_array, \"res://cubemap_array.res\", "
"ResourceSaver.FLAG_COMPRESS)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/ImageTextureLayered.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the existing [Image] data at the given [param layer] with this new "
"image.\n"
"The given [Image] must have the same width, height, image format, and "
"mipmapping flag as the rest of the referenced images.\n"
"If the image format is unsupported, it will be decompressed and converted to "
"a similar and supported [enum Image.Format].\n"
"The update is immediate: it's synchronized with drawing."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Mesh optimized for creating geometry manually."
msgstr "Malha otimizada para criar geometria manualmente."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid ""
"A mesh type optimized for creating geometry manually, similar to OpenGL 1.x "
"immediate mode.\n"
"Here's a sample on how to generate a triangular face:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var mesh = ImmediateMesh.new()\n"
"mesh.surface_begin(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.LEFT)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.FORWARD)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.ZERO)\n"
"mesh.surface_end()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var mesh = new ImmediateMesh();\n"
"mesh.SurfaceBegin(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Left);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Forward);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Zero);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceEnd();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Generating complex geometries with [ImmediateMesh] is highly "
"inefficient. Instead, it is designed to generate simple geometry that "
"changes often."
msgstr ""
"Um tipo de malha otimizado para criar geometria manualmente, semelhante ao "
"modo imediato do OpenGL 1.x.\n"
"Aqui está um exemplo de como gerar uma face triangular:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var mesh = ImmediateMesh.new()\n"
"mesh.surface_begin(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.LEFT)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.FORWARD)\n"
"mesh.surface_add_vertex(Vector3.ZERO)\n"
"mesh.surface_end()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var mesh = new ImmediateMesh();\n"
"mesh.SurfaceBegin(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Left);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Forward);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceAddVertex(Vector3.Zero);\n"
"mesh.SurfaceEnd();\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Gerar geometrias complexas com [ImmediateMesh] é altamente "
"ineficiente. Em vez disso, ele foi projetado para gerar geometria simples "
"que muda com frequência."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Using ImmediateMesh"
msgstr "Usando o ImmediateMesh"

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Clear all surfaces."
msgstr "Limpar todas as superfícies."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Add a 3D vertex using the current attributes previously set."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um vértice 3D usando os atributos atuais definidos anteriormente."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Add a 2D vertex using the current attributes previously set."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um vértice 2D usando os atributos atuais definidos anteriormente."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Begin a new surface."
msgstr "Inicia uma nova superfície."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid ""
"End and commit current surface. Note that surface being created will not be "
"visible until this function is called."
msgstr ""
"Finaliza e confirma a superfície atual. Observe que a superfície sendo "
"criada não estará visível até que esta função seja chamada."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Set the color attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "Define o atributo de cor que será enviado com o próximo vértice."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Set the normal attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "Define o atributo de normal que será enviado com o próximo vértice."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Set the tangent attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Even though [param tangent] is a [Plane], it does not directly "
"represent the tangent plane. Its [member Plane.x], [member Plane.y], and "
"[member Plane.z] represent the tangent vector and [member Plane.d] should be "
"either [code]-1[/code] or [code]1[/code]. See also [constant "
"Mesh.ARRAY_TANGENT]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Set the UV attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "Define o atributo UV que será enviado com o próximo vértice."

#: doc/classes/ImmediateMesh.xml
msgid "Set the UV2 attribute that will be pushed with the next vertex."
msgstr "Define o atributo UV2 que será enviado com o próximo vértice."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"A [Resource] that contains vertex array-based geometry during the import "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Um [Resource] que contém geometria baseada em array de vértices durante o "
"processo de importação."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"ImporterMesh is a type of [Resource] analogous to [ArrayMesh]. It contains "
"vertex array-based geometry, divided in [i]surfaces[/i]. Each surface "
"contains a completely separate array and a material used to draw it. Design "
"wise, a mesh with multiple surfaces is preferred to a single surface, "
"because objects created in 3D editing software commonly contain multiple "
"materials.\n"
"Unlike its runtime counterpart, [ImporterMesh] contains mesh data before "
"various import steps, such as LOD and shadow mesh generation, have taken "
"place. Modify surface data by calling [method clear], followed by [method "
"add_surface] for each surface."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Adds name for a blend shape that will be added with [method add_surface]. "
"Must be called before surface is added."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona o nome para uma forma de mistura que será adicionada com [method "
"add_surface]. Deve ser chamado antes que a superfície seja adicionada."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Removes all surfaces and blend shapes from this [ImporterMesh]."
msgstr ""
"Remove todas as superfícies e formas de mesclagem deste [ImporterMesh]."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Converts the given [Mesh] into an [ImporterMesh] by copying all its "
"surfaces, blend shapes, materials, and metadata into a new [ImporterMesh] "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Converte o [Mesh] fornecido em um [ImporterMesh] copiando todas as suas "
"superfícies, formas de mistura, materiais e metadados para um novo objeto "
"[ImporterMesh]."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Generates all lods for this ImporterMesh.\n"
"[param normal_merge_angle] is in degrees and used in the same way as the "
"importer settings in [code]lods[/code].\n"
"[param normal_split_angle] is not used and only remains for compatibility "
"with older versions of the API.\n"
"The number of generated lods can be accessed using [method "
"get_surface_lod_count], and each LOD is available in [method "
"get_surface_lod_size] and [method get_surface_lod_indices].\n"
"[param bone_transform_array] is an [Array] which can be either empty or "
"contain [Transform3D]s which, for each of the mesh's bone IDs, will apply "
"mesh skinning when generating the LOD mesh variations. This is usually used "
"to account for discrepancies in scale between the mesh itself and its "
"skinning data."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the number of blend shapes that the mesh holds."
msgstr "Retorna o número de formas de mistura que a malha possui."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the blend shape mode for this Mesh."
msgstr "Retorna o modo de forma de mesclagem para esta Mesh."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the size hint of this mesh for lightmap-unwrapping in UV-space."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a dica de tamanho desta malha para desdobramento de lightmap no "
"espaço UV."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the mesh data represented by this [ImporterMesh] as a usable "
"[ArrayMesh].\n"
"This method caches the returned mesh, and subsequent calls will return the "
"cached data until [method clear] is called.\n"
"If not yet cached and [param base_mesh] is provided, [param base_mesh] will "
"be used and mutated."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the arrays for the vertices, normals, UVs, etc. that make up the "
"requested surface. See [method add_surface]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os arrays para os vértices, normais, UVs, etc. que compõem a "
"superfície solicitada. Veja [method add_surface]."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a single set of blend shape arrays for the requested blend shape "
"index for a surface."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um único conjunto de matrizes de formas de mesclagem para o índice "
"de forma de mesclagem solicitado para uma superfície."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the number of surfaces that the mesh holds."
msgstr "Retorna o número de superfícies que a malha possui."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the format of the surface that the mesh holds."
msgstr "Retorna o formato da superfície que a malha possui."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the number of lods that the mesh holds on a given surface."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de lods que a malha possui em uma determinada superfície."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the index buffer of a lod for a surface."
msgstr "Retorna o buffer de índice de um lod para uma superfície."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Returns the screen ratio which activates a lod for a surface."
msgstr "Retorna a proporção da tela que ativa um lod para uma superfície."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Material] in a given surface. Surface is rendered using this "
"material."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Material] em uma determinada superfície. A superfície é "
"renderizada usando este material."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the primitive type of the requested surface (see [method "
"add_surface])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo primitivo da superfície solicitada (veja [method "
"add_surface])."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Merges multiple [ImporterMesh]es into a single [ImporterMesh]. Each input "
"mesh is transformed by the corresponding [Transform3D] in the [param "
"relative_transforms] array, which must be the same size as [param "
"importer_meshes]. Negative scales are supported, and the winding order in "
"the mesh data will be corrected to account for this.\n"
"If [param deduplicate_surfaces] is [code]true[/code] and multiple meshes "
"have surfaces with the same names and formats, the surfaces will be merged "
"together when the meshes are merged, and will use the material from the "
"first matching surface. This is useful for reducing the number of surfaces "
"in the resulting mesh, and avoids duplicating materials. Surfaces with bone "
"weights will never be deduplicated. If [param deduplicate_surfaces] is "
"[code]false[/code], the surfaces will always be kept separate, and will be "
"given unique names.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Blend shapes and LODs are not supported and will be "
"discarded. Do not use this function to discard blend shapes and LODs, as "
"support for these may be added in the future."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Sets the blend shape mode."
msgstr "Define o modo de forma de mesclagem (blend shape)."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid "Sets the size hint of this mesh for lightmap-unwrapping in UV-space."
msgstr ""
"Define a dica de tamanho desta malha para desdobramento de mapa de luz no "
"espaço UV."

#: doc/classes/ImporterMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a [Material] for a given surface. Surface will be rendered using this "
"material."
msgstr ""
"Define um [Material] para uma determinada superfície. A superfície será "
"renderizada usando este material."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "A singleton for handling inputs."
msgstr "Um singleton para gerenciar entradas."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"The [Input] singleton handles key presses, mouse buttons and movement, "
"gamepads, and input actions. Actions and their events can be set in the "
"[b]Input Map[/b] tab in [b]Project > Project Settings[/b], or with the "
"[InputMap] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Input]'s methods reflect the global input state and are not "
"affected by [method Control.accept_event] or [method "
"Viewport.set_input_as_handled], as those methods only deal with the way "
"input is propagated in the [SceneTree]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Inputs documentation index"
msgstr "Índice de documentação de entradas"

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"This will simulate pressing the specified action.\n"
"The strength can be used for non-boolean actions, it's ranged between 0 and "
"1 representing the intensity of the given action.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will not cause any [method Node._input] calls. It "
"is intended to be used with [method is_action_pressed] and [method "
"is_action_just_pressed]. If you want to simulate [code]_input[/code], use "
"[method parse_input_event] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "If the specified action is already pressed, this will release it."
msgstr "Se a ação especificada já estiver pressionada, isso a liberará."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new mapping entry (in SDL2 format) to the mapping database. "
"Optionally update already connected devices."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma nova entrada de mapeamento (no formato SDL2) ao banco de dados "
"de mapeamento. Opcionalmente, atualiza dispositivos já conectados."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the calibration information for the specified joypad's motion "
"sensors, if it has any and if they were calibrated.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sends all input events which are in the current buffer to the game loop. "
"These events may have been buffered as a result of accumulated input "
"([member use_accumulated_input]) or agile input flushing ([member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/buffering/agile_event_flushing]).\n"
"The engine will already do this itself at key execution points (at least "
"once per frame). However, this can be useful in advanced cases where you "
"want precise control over the timing of event handling."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the acceleration in m/s² of the device's accelerometer sensor, if "
"the device has one. Otherwise, the method returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"Note this method returns an empty [Vector3] when running from the editor "
"even when your device has an accelerometer. You must export your project to "
"a supported device to read values from the accelerometer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_accelerometer] must be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a value between 0 and 1 representing the raw intensity of the given "
"action, ignoring the action's deadzone. In most cases, you should use "
"[method get_action_strength] instead.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a value between 0 and 1 representing the intensity of the given "
"action. In a joypad, for example, the further away the axis (analog sticks "
"or L2, R2 triggers) is from the dead zone, the closer the value will be to "
"1. If the action is mapped to a control that has no axis such as the "
"keyboard, the value returned will be 0 or 1.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Get axis input by specifying two actions, one negative and one positive.\n"
"This is a shorthand for writing "
"[code]Input.get_action_strength(\"positive_action\") - "
"Input.get_action_strength(\"negative_action\")[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] containing the device IDs of all currently connected "
"joypads.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The order of connected joypads can not be guaranteed to be the "
"same after a project and/or the editor is restarted, because Godot doesn't "
"save the order of joypad connections. Joypads are registered in the order "
"they are discovered by Godot."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Returns the currently assigned cursor shape."
msgstr "Retorna a forma de cursor atualmente atribuída."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the gravity in m/s² of the device's accelerometer sensor, if the "
"device has one. Otherwise, the method returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gravity] must be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the rotation rate in rad/s around a device's X, Y, and Z axes of the "
"gyroscope sensor, if the device has one. Otherwise, the method returns "
"[constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_gyroscope] must be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the acceleration, including the force of gravity, in m/s² of the "
"joypad's accelerometer sensor, if the joypad has one and it's currently "
"enabled. Otherwise, the method returns [constant Vector3.ZERO]. See also "
"[method get_joy_gravity] and [method set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled].\n"
"For a joypad held in front of you, the returned axes are defined as "
"follows:\n"
"+X ... -X: left ... right;\n"
"+Y ... -Y: bottom ... top;\n"
"+Z ... -Z: farther ... closer.\n"
"The gravity part value is measured as a vector with length of [code]9.8[/"
"code] away from the center of the Earth, which is a negative Y value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, and macOS. On "
"iOS, joypad accelerometer sensor reading is not supported due to OS "
"limitations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Returns the current value of the joypad axis at index [param axis]."
msgstr "Retorna o valor atual do eixo do controle no índice [param axis]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the gravity in m/s² of the joypad's accelerometer sensor, if the "
"joypad has one and it's currently enabled. Otherwise, the method returns "
"[constant Vector3.ZERO]. See also [method get_joy_accelerometer] and [method "
"set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled].\n"
"For a joypad held in front of you, the returned axes are defined as "
"follows:\n"
"+X ... -X: left ... right;\n"
"+Y ... -Y: bottom ... top;\n"
"+Z ... -Z: farther ... closer.\n"
"The gravity part value is measured as a vector with length of [code]9.8[/"
"code] away from the center of the Earth, which is a negative Y value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, and macOS. On "
"iOS, joypad accelerometer sensor reading is not supported due to OS "
"limitations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an SDL-compatible device GUID on platforms that use gamepad "
"remapping, e.g. [code]030000004c050000c405000000010000[/code]. Returns an "
"empty string if it cannot be found. Godot uses SDL's internal mappings, "
"supplemented by community-contributed mappings, to determine gamepad names "
"and mappings based on this GUID.\n"
"On Windows, all XInput joypad GUIDs will be overridden by Godot to "
"[code]__XINPUT_DEVICE__[/code], because their mappings are the same."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the rotation rate in rad/s around a joypad's X, Y, and Z axes of the "
"gyroscope sensor, if the joypad has one and it's currently enabled. "
"Otherwise, the method returns [constant Vector3.ZERO]. See also [method "
"set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled].\n"
"The rotation is positive in the counter-clockwise direction.\n"
"For a joypad held in front of you, the returned axes are defined as "
"follows:\n"
"X: Angular speed around the X axis (pitch);\n"
"Y: Angular speed around the Y axis (yaw);\n"
"Z: Angular speed around the Z axis (roll).\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad gyroscope and gyroscope calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary with extra platform-specific information about the "
"device, e.g. the raw gamepad name from the OS or the Steam Input index.\n"
"On Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS, the dictionary contains the following "
"fields:\n"
"[code]raw_name[/code]: The name of the controller as it came from the OS, "
"before getting renamed by the controller database.\n"
"[code]vendor_id[/code]: The USB vendor ID of the device.\n"
"[code]product_id[/code]: The USB product ID of the device.\n"
"[code]serial_number[/code]: The serial number of the device. This key won't "
"be present if the serial number is unavailable.\n"
"The dictionary can also include the following fields under selected "
"platforms:\n"
"[code]steam_input_index[/code]: The Steam Input gamepad index (Windows, "
"Linux, and macOS only). If the device is not a Steam Input device this key "
"won't be present.\n"
"[code]xinput_index[/code]: The index of the controller in the XInput system "
"(Windows only). This key won't be present for devices not handled by "
"XInput.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned dictionary is always empty on Android and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the calibration information about the specified joypad's motion "
"sensors in the form of a [Dictionary], if it has any and if they have been "
"calibrated, otherwise returns an empty [Dictionary].\n"
"The dictionary contains the following fields:\n"
"[code]gyroscope_offset[/code]: average offset in gyroscope values from "
"[constant Vector2.ZERO] in rad/s.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the joypad's motion sensor rate in Hz, if the joypad has motion "
"sensors and they're currently enabled. See also [method "
"set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the joypad at the specified device index, e.g. [code]PS4 "
"Controller[/code]. Godot uses the [url=https://github.com/gabomdq/"
"SDL_GameControllerDB]SDL2 game controller database[/url] to determine "
"gamepad names."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do joypad no índice de dispositivo especificado, ex.: "
"[code]PS4 Controller[/code]. O Godot usa o [url=https://github.com/gabomdq/"
"SDL_GameControllerDB]banco de dados de controles de jogos do SDL2[/url] para "
"determinar os nomes dos gamepads."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the duration of the current vibration effect in seconds.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns the same value that was passed to [method "
"start_joy_vibration], and this value does [b]not[/b] change when the "
"joypad's vibration runs out, it only gets reset after a call to [method "
"stop_joy_vibration].\n"
"If you want to check if a joypad is still vibrating, use [method "
"is_joy_vibrating] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the remaining duration of the current vibration effect in seconds."
msgstr "Retorna a duração restante do efeito de vibração atual em segundos."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the strength of the joypad vibration: x is the strength of the weak "
"motor, and y is the strength of the strong motor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method returns the same values that were passed to [method "
"start_joy_vibration], and these values do [b]not[/b] change when the "
"joypad's vibration runs out, they only get reset after a call to [method "
"stop_joy_vibration].\n"
"If you want to check if a joypad is still vibrating, use [method "
"is_joy_vibrating] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last mouse velocity in screen coordinates. To provide a precise "
"and jitter-free velocity, mouse velocity is only calculated every 0.1s. "
"Therefore, mouse velocity will lag mouse movements."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a última velocidade do mouse em coordenadas de tela. Para fornecer "
"uma velocidade precisa e sem tremores, a velocidade do mouse é calculada "
"apenas a cada 0,1s. Portanto, a velocidade do mouse atrasará em relação aos "
"movimentos do mouse."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the last mouse velocity. To provide a precise and jitter-free "
"velocity, mouse velocity is only calculated every 0.1s. Therefore, mouse "
"velocity will lag mouse movements."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a última velocidade do mouse. Para fornecer uma velocidade precisa e "
"sem tremores, a velocidade do mouse é calculada apenas a cada 0,1s. "
"Portanto, a velocidade do mouse atrasará em relação aos movimentos do mouse."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the magnetic field strength in micro-Tesla for all axes of the "
"device's magnetometer sensor, if the device has one. Otherwise, the method "
"returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android and iOS. On other platforms, "
"it always returns [constant Vector3.ZERO].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/sensors/"
"enable_magnetometer] must be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns mouse buttons as a bitmask. If multiple mouse buttons are pressed at "
"the same time, the bits are added together. Equivalent to [method "
"DisplayServer.mouse_get_button_state]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os botões do mouse como uma máscara de bits. Se vários botões do "
"mouse forem pressionados ao mesmo tempo, os bits são somados. Equivalente a "
"[method DisplayServer.mouse_get_button_state]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Gets an input vector by specifying four actions for the positive and "
"negative X and Y axes.\n"
"This method is useful when getting vector input, such as from a joystick, "
"directional pad, arrows, or WASD. The vector has its length limited to 1 and "
"has a circular deadzone, which is useful for using vector input as "
"movement.\n"
"By default, the deadzone is automatically calculated from the average of the "
"action deadzones. However, you can override the deadzone to be whatever you "
"want (on the range of 0 to 1)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad has an LED light that can change "
"colors and/or brightness. See also [method set_joy_light].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o controle tiver uma luz LED que possa alterar "
"cores e/ou brilho. Consulte também [method set_joy_light].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este recurso é suportado apenas no Windows, Linux, macOS e iOS."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad has motion sensors (accelerometer "
"and gyroscope).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On iOS, joypad accelerometer sensor reading is not supported "
"due to OS limitations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad supports vibration. See also [method "
"start_joy_vibration].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For macOS, vibration is only supported in macOS 11 and later. "
"When connected via USB, vibration is only supported for major brand "
"controllers (except Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S controllers) due to macOS "
"limitations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user has [i]started[/i] pressing the "
"action event in the current frame or physics tick. It will only return "
"[code]true[/code] on the frame or tick that the user pressed down the "
"button.\n"
"This is useful for code that needs to run only once when an action is "
"pressed, instead of every frame while it's pressed.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] pressed. An action can be pressed and released again rapidly, "
"and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_just_pressed] may "
"return [code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] During input handling (e.g. [method Node._input]), use [method "
"InputEvent.is_action_pressed] instead to query the action state of the "
"current event. See also [method is_action_just_pressed_by_event]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user has [i]started[/i] pressing the "
"action event in the current frame or physics tick, and the first event that "
"triggered action press in the current frame/physics tick was [param event]. "
"It will only return [code]true[/code] on the frame or tick that the user "
"pressed down the button.\n"
"This is useful for code that needs to run only once when an action is "
"pressed, and the action is processed during input handling (e.g. [method "
"Node._input]).\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] pressed. An action can be pressed and released again rapidly, "
"and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_just_pressed] may "
"return [code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user [i]stops[/i] pressing the action "
"event in the current frame or physics tick. It will only return [code]true[/"
"code] on the frame or tick that the user releases the button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] not pressed. An action can be released and pressed again "
"rapidly, and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss "
"input.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] During input handling (e.g. [method Node._input]), use [method "
"InputEvent.is_action_released] instead to query the action state of the "
"current event. See also [method is_action_just_released_by_event]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the user [i]stops[/i] pressing the action "
"event in the current frame or physics tick, and the first event that "
"triggered action release in the current frame/physics tick was [param "
"event]. It will only return [code]true[/code] on the frame or tick that the "
"user releases the button.\n"
"This is useful when an action is processed during input handling (e.g. "
"[method Node._input]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returning [code]true[/code] does not imply that the action is "
"[i]still[/i] not pressed. An action can be released and pressed again "
"rapidly, and [code]true[/code] will still be returned so as not to miss "
"input.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the action event.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if any action, key, joypad button, or mouse button "
"is being pressed. This will also return [code]true[/code] if any action is "
"simulated via code by calling [method action_press]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se alguma ação, tecla, botão de joypad ou botão do "
"mouse estiver sendo pressionado. Isso também retornará [code]true[/code] se "
"alguma ação for simulada via código chamando [method action_press]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the joypad button at index "
"[param button].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a joypad button was just pressed, use "
"Godot's input action system with [method is_action_just_pressed] or use the "
"[method Node._input] method like this instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventJoypadButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == JOY_BUTTON_A:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventJoypadButton eventButton && eventButton.Pressed && "
"eventButton.ButtonIndex == JoyButton.A)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se você estiver pressionando o botão do controle "
"no índice [param button].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você quiser verificar se um botão do controle acabou de ser "
"pressionado, use o sistema de ações de entrada do Godot com [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] ou use o método [method Node._input] desta forma:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventJoypadButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == JOY_BUTTON_A:\n"
"\t\tpass # Seu código aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventJoypadButton eventButton && eventButton.Pressed && "
"eventButton.ButtonIndex == JoyButton.A)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Seu código aqui.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the system knows the specified device. This "
"means that it sets all button and axis indices. Unknown joypads are not "
"expected to match these constants, but you can still retrieve events from "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o sistema conhece o dispositivo especificado. "
"Isso significa que ele define todos os índices de botões e eixos. Joysticks "
"desconhecidos não devem corresponder a essas constantes, mas você ainda pode "
"recuperar eventos deles."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad's motion sensors have been "
"calibrated.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad's motion sensors are currently being "
"calibrated.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the requested joypad has motion sensors "
"(accelerometer and gyroscope) and they are currently enabled. See also "
"[method set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled] and [method "
"has_joy_motion_sensors].\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the joypad is still vibrating after a call to "
"[method start_joy_vibration].\n"
"Unlike [method get_joy_vibration_strength] and [method "
"get_joy_vibration_duration], this method returns [code]false[/code] after "
"the joypad's vibration runs out."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the key with the [param "
"keycode] printed on it. You can pass a [enum Key] constant or any Unicode "
"character code.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a key was just pressed by using its "
"label, use Godot's input action system with [method is_action_just_pressed] "
"or use the [method Node._input] method like this instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.key_label == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.KeyLabel == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se você estiver pressionando a tecla com o [param "
"keycode] impresso nela. Você pode passar uma constante [enum Key] ou "
"qualquer código de caractere Unicode.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você quiser verificar se uma tecla acabou de ser pressionada "
"usando sua etiqueta, use o sistema de ações de entrada do Godot com [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] ou use o método [method Node._input] desta forma:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.key_label == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Seu código aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.KeyLabel == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Seu código aqui.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the Latin key in the current "
"keyboard layout. You can pass a [enum Key] constant.\n"
"[method is_key_pressed] is only recommended over [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed] in non-game applications. This ensures that "
"shortcut keys behave as expected depending on the user's keyboard layout, as "
"keyboard shortcuts are generally dependent on the keyboard layout in non-"
"game applications. If in doubt, use [method is_physical_key_pressed].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_key_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a key was just pressed by using its "
"keycode, use Godot's input action system with [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] or use the [method Node._input] method like this "
"instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.Keycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se você estiver pressionando a tecla latina no "
"layout de teclado atual. Você pode passar uma constante [enum Key].\n"
"[method is_key_pressed] só é recomendado em vez de [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed] em aplicativos que não são jogos. Isso garante que "
"as teclas de atalho se comportem conforme o esperado, dependendo do layout "
"de teclado do usuário, já que os atalhos de teclado geralmente dependem do "
"layout do teclado em aplicativos que não são jogos. Se houver dúvida, use "
"[method is_physical_key_pressed].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Devido ao efeito fantasma do teclado (ghosting), [method "
"is_key_pressed] pode retornar [code]false[/code] mesmo se uma das teclas da "
"ação estiver pressionada. Veja [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/"
"input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Exemplos de entrada[/url] na "
"documentação para mais informações.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você quiser verificar se uma tecla acabou de ser pressionada "
"usando seu código de tecla, use o sistema de ações de entrada do Godot com "
"[method is_action_just_pressed] ou use o método [method Node._input] desta "
"forma:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Seu código aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.Keycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Seu código aqui.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the mouse button specified "
"with [enum MouseButton].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a mouse button was just pressed, use "
"Godot's input action system with [method is_action_just_pressed] or use the "
"[method Node._input] method like this instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton eventMouseButton && "
"eventMouseButton.Pressed && eventMouseButton.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se você estiver pressionando o botão do mouse "
"especificado com [enum MouseButton].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você quiser verificar se um botão do mouse acabou de ser "
"pressionado, use o sistema de ações de entrada do Godot com [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] ou use o método [method Node._input] desta forma:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMouseButton and event.is_pressed() and "
"event.button_index == MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT:\n"
"\t\tpass # Seu código aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventMouseButton eventMouseButton && "
"eventMouseButton.Pressed && eventMouseButton.ButtonIndex == "
"MouseButton.Left)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Seu código aqui.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if you are pressing the key in the physical "
"location on the 101/102-key US QWERTY keyboard. You can pass a [enum Key] "
"constant.\n"
"[method is_physical_key_pressed] is recommended over [method is_key_pressed] "
"for in-game actions, as it will make [kbd]W[/kbd]/[kbd]A[/kbd]/[kbd]S[/kbd]/"
"[kbd]D[/kbd] layouts work regardless of the user's keyboard layout. [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed] will also ensure that the top row number keys work "
"on any keyboard layout. If in doubt, use [method is_physical_key_pressed].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_physical_key_pressed] may "
"return [code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to check if a key was just pressed by using its "
"physical keycode, use Godot's input action system with [method "
"is_action_just_pressed] or use the [method Node._input] method like this "
"instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.physical_keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Your code here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.PhysicalKeycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Your code here.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se você estiver pressionando a tecla na "
"localização física do teclado US QWERTY de 101/102 teclas. Você pode passar "
"uma constante [enum Key].\n"
"[method is_physical_key_pressed] é recomendado em vez de [method "
"is_key_pressed] para ações em jogos, pois fará com que os layouts [kbd]W[/"
"kbd]/[kbd]A[/kbd]/[kbd]S[/kbd]/[kbd]D[/kbd] funcionem independentemente do "
"layout de teclado do usuário. [method is_physical_key_pressed] também "
"garantirá que as teclas numéricas da linha superior funcionem em qualquer "
"layout de teclado. Se houver dúvida, use [method is_physical_key_pressed].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Devido ao efeito fantasma do teclado (ghosting), [method "
"is_physical_key_pressed] pode retornar [code]false[/code] mesmo se uma das "
"teclas da ação estiver pressionada. Veja [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/"
"input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Exemplos de entrada[/url] na "
"documentação para mais informações.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você quiser verificar se uma tecla acabou de ser pressionada "
"usando seu código de tecla físico, use o sistema de ações de entrada do "
"Godot com [method is_action_just_pressed] ou use o método [method "
"Node._input] desta forma:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey and not event.is_echo() and event.is_pressed() "
"and event.physical_keycode == KEY_SPACE:\n"
"\t\tpass # Seu código aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey eventKey && !eventKey.IsEcho() && "
"eventKey.Pressed && eventKey.PhysicalKeycode == Key.Space)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Seu código aqui.\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Feeds an [InputEvent] to the game. Can be used to artificially trigger input "
"events from code. Also generates [method Node._input] calls.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var cancel_event = InputEventAction.new()\n"
"cancel_event.action = \"ui_cancel\"\n"
"cancel_event.pressed = true\n"
"Input.parse_input_event(cancel_event)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var cancelEvent = new InputEventAction();\n"
"cancelEvent.Action = \"ui_cancel\";\n"
"cancelEvent.Pressed = true;\n"
"Input.ParseInputEvent(cancelEvent);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling this function has no influence on the operating system. "
"So for example sending an [InputEventMouseMotion] will not move the OS mouse "
"cursor to the specified position (use [method warp_mouse] instead) and "
"sending [kbd]Alt/Cmd + Tab[/kbd] as [InputEventKey] won't toggle between "
"active windows."
msgstr ""
"Alimenta um [InputEvent] para o jogo. Pode ser usado para disparar "
"artificialmente eventos de entrada a partir do código. Também gera chamadas "
"[method Node._input].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var cancel_event = InputEventAction.new()\n"
"cancel_event.action = \"ui_cancel\"\n"
"cancel_event.pressed = true\n"
"Input.parse_input_event(cancel_event)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var cancelEvent = new InputEventAction();\n"
"cancelEvent.Action = \"ui_cancel\";\n"
"cancelEvent.Pressed = true;\n"
"Input.ParseInputEvent(cancelEvent);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Chamar esta função não tem influência sobre o sistema "
"operacional. Portanto, por exemplo, enviar um [InputEventMouseMotion] não "
"moverá o cursor do mouse do SO para a posição especificada (use [method "
"warp_mouse] em vez disso) e enviar [kbd]Alt/Cmd + Tab[/kbd] como "
"[InputEventKey] não alternará entre as janelas ativas."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Removes all mappings from the internal database that match the given GUID. "
"All currently connected joypads that use this GUID will become unmapped.\n"
"On Android, Godot will map to an internal fallback mapping."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the acceleration value of the accelerometer sensor. Can be used for "
"debugging on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor on "
"a PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware "
"sensor value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a custom mouse cursor image, which is only visible inside the game "
"window, for the given mouse [param shape]. The hotspot can also be "
"specified. Passing [code]null[/code] to the image parameter resets to the "
"system cursor.\n"
"[param image] can be either [Texture2D] or [Image] and its size must be "
"lower than or equal to 256×256. To avoid rendering issues, sizes lower than "
"or equal to 128×128 are recommended.\n"
"[param hotspot] must be within [param image]'s size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [AnimatedTexture]s aren't supported as custom mouse cursors. If "
"using an [AnimatedTexture], only the first frame will be displayed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [b]Lossless[/b], [b]Lossy[/b] or [b]Uncompressed[/b] "
"compression modes are recommended. The [b]Video RAM[/b] compression mode can "
"be used, but it will be decompressed on the CPU, which means loading times "
"are slowed down and no memory is saved compared to lossless modes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the web platform, the maximum allowed cursor image size is "
"128×128. Cursor images larger than 32×32 will also only be displayed if the "
"mouse cursor image is entirely located within the page for [url=https://"
"chromestatus.com/feature/5825971391299584]security reasons[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the default cursor shape to be used in the viewport instead of "
"[constant CURSOR_ARROW].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want to change the default cursor shape for [Control]'s "
"nodes, use [member Control.mouse_default_cursor_shape] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method generates an [InputEventMouseMotion] to update "
"cursor immediately."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the gravity value of the accelerometer sensor. Can be used for "
"debugging on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor on "
"a PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware "
"sensor value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the value of the rotation rate of the gyroscope sensor. Can be used for "
"debugging on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor on "
"a PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware "
"sensor value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the joypad's LED light, if available, to the specified color. See also "
"[method has_joy_light].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] There is no way to get the color of the light from a joypad. If "
"you need to know the assigned color, store it separately.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the specified joypad's calibration information. See also [method "
"get_joy_motion_sensors_calibration].\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Enables or disables the motion sensors (accelerometer and gyroscope), if "
"available, on the specified joypad.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"It's recommended to disable the motion sensors when they're no longer being "
"used, because otherwise it might drain the controller battery faster.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the value of the magnetic field of the magnetometer sensor. Can be used "
"for debugging on devices without a hardware sensor, for example in an editor "
"on a PC.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value can be immediately overwritten by the hardware "
"sensor value on Android and iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Queries whether an input device should be ignored or not. Devices can be "
"ignored by setting the environment variable "
"[code]SDL_GAMECONTROLLER_IGNORE_DEVICES[/code]. Read the [url=https://"
"wiki.libsdl.org/SDL2]SDL documentation[/url] for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some 3rd party tools can contribute to the list of ignored "
"devices. For example, [i]SteamInput[/i] creates virtual devices from "
"physical devices for remapping purposes. To avoid handling the same input "
"device twice, the original device is added to the ignore list."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Starts the process of calibrating the specified joypad's gyroscope, if it "
"has one.\n"
"Once a joypad's gyroscope has been calibrated correctly (e.g. laying still "
"on a table without being rotated), [method get_joy_gyroscope] will return "
"values close or equal to [constant Vector3.ZERO] when the joypad is not "
"being rotated.\n"
"Here's an example of how to use joypad gyroscope and gyroscope calibration "
"in your games:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const GYRO_SENSITIVITY = 10.0\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# In this example we only use the first connected joypad (id 0).\n"
"\tif 0 not in Input.get_connected_joypads():\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"\tif not Input.has_joy_motion_sensors(0):\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"\t# We must enable the motion sensors before using them.\n"
"\tInput.set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled(0, true)\n"
"\n"
"\t# (Tell the users here that they need to put their joypads on a flat "
"surface and wait for confirmation.)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Start the calibration process.\n"
"\tcalibrate_motion()\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\t# Only move the object if the joypad motion sensors are calibrated.\n"
"\tif Input.is_joy_motion_sensors_calibrated(0):\n"
"\t\tmove_object(delta)\n"
"\n"
"func calibrate_motion():\n"
"\tInput.start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration(0)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Wait for some time.\n"
"\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n"
"\n"
"\tInput.stop_joy_motion_sensors_calibration(0)\n"
"\t# The joypad is now calibrated.\n"
"\n"
"func move_object(delta):\n"
"\tvar node: Node3D = ... # Put your node here.\n"
"\n"
"\tvar gyro := Input.get_joy_gyroscope(0)\n"
"\tnode.rotation.x -= -gyro.y * GYRO_SENSITIVITY * delta # Use rotation "
"around the Y axis (yaw) here.\n"
"\tnode.rotation.y += -gyro.x * GYRO_SENSITIVITY * delta # Use rotation "
"around the X axis (pitch) here.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private const float GyroSensitivity = 10.0;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// In this example we only use the first connected joypad (id 0).\n"
"\tif (!Input.GetConnectedJoypads().Contains(0))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tif (!Input.HasJoyMotionSensors(0))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t// We must enable the accelerometer and the gyroscope before using them.\n"
"\tInput.SetJoyMotionSensorsEnabled(0, true);\n"
"\n"
"\t// (Tell the users here that they need to put their joypads on a flat "
"surface and wait for confirmation.)\n"
"\n"
"\t// Start the calibration process.\n"
"\tCalibrateMotion();\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Only move the object if the joypad motion sensors are calibrated.\n"
"\tif (Input.IsJoyMotionSensorsCalibrated(0))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tMoveObject(delta);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private async Task CalibrateMotion()\n"
"{\n"
"\tInput.StartJoyMotionSensorsCalibration(0);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Wait for some time.\n"
"\tawait ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(1.0), "
"SceneTreeTimer.SignalName.Timeout);\n"
"\n"
"\tInput.StopJoyMotionSensorsCalibration(0);\n"
"\t// The joypad is now calibrated.\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void MoveObject(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tNode3D node = ... ; // Put your object here.\n"
"\tVector3 gyro = Input.GetJoyGyroscope(0);\n"
"\tVector3 rotation = node.Rotation;\n"
"\trotation.X -= -gyro.Y * GyroSensitivity * (float)delta; // Use rotation "
"around the Y axis (yaw) here.\n"
"\trotation.Y += -gyro.X * GyroSensitivity * (float)delta; // Use rotation "
"around the X axis (pitch) here.\n"
"\tnode.Rotation = rotation;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accelerometer sensor doesn't usually require calibration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""
"Inicia o processo de calibração do giroscópio do controle especificado, caso "
"ele possua um.\n"
"Uma vez que o giroscópio de um controle tenha sido calibrado corretamente "
"(por exemplo, repousando imóvel sobre uma mesa sem ser rotacionado), [method "
"get_joy_gyroscope] retornará valores próximos ou iguais a [constant "
"Vector3.ZERO] quando o controle não estiver sendo rotacionado.\n"
"Aqui está um exemplo de como usar o giroscópio do controle e a calibração do "
"giroscópio em seus jogos:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"const GYRO_SENSITIVITY = 10.0\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\t# Neste exemplo, usamos apenas o primeiro controle conectado (id 0).\n"
"\tif 0 not in Input.get_connected_joypads():\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"\tif not Input.has_joy_motion_sensors(0):\n"
"\t\treturn\n"
"\n"
"\t# Devemos habilitar os sensores de movimento antes de usá-los.\n"
"\tInput.set_joy_motion_sensors_enabled(0, true)\n"
"\n"
"\t# (Diga aos usuários aqui que eles precisam colocar seus controles em uma "
"superfície plana e aguardar a confirmação.)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Iniciar o processo de calibração.\n"
"\tcalibrate_motion()\n"
"\n"
"func _process(delta):\n"
"\t# Mover o objeto apenas se os sensores de movimento do controle estiverem "
"calibrados.\n"
"\tif Input.is_joy_motion_sensors_calibrated(0):\n"
"\t\tmove_object(delta)\n"
"\n"
"func calibrate_motion():\n"
"\tInput.start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration(0)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Aguardar por algum tempo.\n"
"\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n"
"\n"
"\tInput.stop_joy_motion_sensors_calibration(0)\n"
"\t# O controle agora está calibrado.\n"
"\n"
"func move_object(delta):\n"
"\tvar node: Node3D = ... # Coloque seu nó aqui.\n"
"\n"
"\tvar gyro := Input.get_joy_gyroscope(0)\n"
"\tnode.rotation.x -= -gyro.y * GYRO_SENSITIVITY * delta # Use a rotação em "
"torno do eixo Y (yaw) aqui.\n"
"\tnode.rotation.y += -gyro.x * GYRO_SENSITIVITY * delta # Use a rotação em "
"torno do eixo X (pitch) aqui.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private const float GyroSensitivity = 10.0;\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Neste exemplo, usamos apenas o primeiro controle conectado (id 0).\n"
"\tif (!Input.GetConnectedJoypads().Contains(0))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tif (!Input.HasJoyMotionSensors(0))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\treturn;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t// Devemos habilitar o acelerômetro e o giroscópio antes de usá-los.\n"
"\tInput.SetJoyMotionSensorsEnabled(0, true);\n"
"\n"
"\t// (Diga aos usuários aqui que eles precisam colocar seus controles em uma "
"superfície plana e aguardar a confirmação.)\n"
"\n"
"\t// Iniciar o processo de calibração.\n"
"\tCalibrateMotion();\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Process(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\t// Mover o objeto apenas se os sensores de movimento do controle estiverem "
"calibrados.\n"
"\tif (Input.IsJoyMotionSensorsCalibrated(0))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tMoveObject(delta);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private async Task CalibrateMotion()\n"
"{\n"
"\tInput.StartJoyMotionSensorsCalibration(0);\n"
"\n"
"\t// Aguardar por algum tempo.\n"
"\tawait ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(1.0), "
"SceneTreeTimer.SignalName.Timeout);\n"
"\n"
"\tInput.StopJoyMotionSensorsCalibration(0);\n"
"\t// O controle agora está calibrado.\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void MoveObject(double delta)\n"
"{\n"
"\tNode3D node = ... ; // Coloque seu objeto aqui.\n"
"\tVector3 gyro = Input.GetJoyGyroscope(0);\n"
"\tVector3 rotation = node.Rotation;\n"
"\trotation.X -= -gyro.Y * GyroSensitivity * (float)delta; // Use a rotação "
"em torno do eixo Y (yaw) aqui.\n"
"\trotation.Y += -gyro.X * GyroSensitivity * (float)delta; // Use a rotação "
"em torno do eixo X (pitch) aqui.\n"
"\tnode.Rotation = rotation;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O sensor acelerômetro geralmente não requer calibração.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este recurso é suportado apenas no Windows, Linux, macOS e iOS."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Starts to vibrate the joypad. See also [method has_joy_vibration] and "
"[method is_joy_vibrating].\n"
"Joypads usually come with two rumble motors, a strong and a weak one.\n"
"[param weak_magnitude] is the strength of the weak motor (between [code]0.0[/"
"code] and [code]1.0[/code]).\n"
"[param strong_magnitude] is the strength of the strong motor (between "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]).\n"
"[param duration] is the duration of the effect in seconds (a duration of "
"[code]0.0[/code] will try to play the vibration as long as possible, which "
"is about 65 seconds).\n"
"The vibration can be stopped early by calling [method stop_joy_vibration].\n"
"See also [method get_joy_vibration_strength] and [method "
"get_joy_vibration_duration].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For macOS, vibration is only supported in macOS 11 and later. "
"When connected via USB, vibration is only supported for major brand "
"controllers (except Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S controllers) due to macOS "
"limitations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Stops the calibration process of the specified joypad's motion sensors.\n"
"See [method start_joy_motion_sensors_calibration] for an example on how to "
"use joypad motion sensors and calibration in your games.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This feature is only supported on Windows, Linux, macOS, and "
"iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Stops the vibration of the joypad started with [method start_joy_vibration]."
msgstr "Para a vibração do joypad iniciada com [method start_joy_vibration]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Vibrate the handheld device for the specified duration in milliseconds.\n"
"[param amplitude] is the strength of the vibration, as a value between "
"[code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]. If set to [code]-1.0[/code], the "
"default vibration strength of the device is used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, and Web. It has no "
"effect on other platforms.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Android, [method vibrate_handheld] requires enabling the "
"[code]VIBRATE[/code] permission in the export preset. Otherwise, [method "
"vibrate_handheld] will have no effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For iOS, specifying the duration is only supported in iOS 13 "
"and later.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For Web, the amplitude cannot be changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some web browsers such as Safari and Firefox for Android do not "
"support [method vibrate_handheld].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Device settings such as vibration on/off, \"do not disturb\" "
"mode or specific haptic feedback on/off may prevent [method "
"vibrate_handheld] effects."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the mouse position to the specified vector, provided in pixels and "
"relative to an origin at the upper left corner of the currently focused "
"Window Manager game window.\n"
"Mouse position is clipped to the limits of the screen resolution, or to the "
"limits of the game window if [enum MouseMode] is set to [constant "
"MOUSE_MODE_CONFINED] or [constant MOUSE_MODE_CONFINED_HIDDEN].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method warp_mouse] is only supported on Windows, macOS and "
"Linux. It has no effect on Android, iOS and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], sends mouse input events when tapping or swiping on "
"the touchscreen. See also [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_mouse_from_touch]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], envia eventos de entrada de mouse ao tocar ou deslizar "
"na tela sensível ao toque. Veja também [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/"
"pointing/emulate_mouse_from_touch]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], sends touch input events when clicking or dragging the "
"mouse. See also [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], envia eventos de entrada de toque ao clicar ou "
"arrastar o mouse. Veja também [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/"
"emulate_touch_from_mouse]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], joypad input (including motion sensors) and LED light "
"changes will be ignored and joypad vibration will be stopped when the "
"application is not focused."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a entrada do controle (incluindo sensores de "
"movimento) e as alterações de luz LED serão ignoradas e a vibração do "
"controle será interrompida quando o aplicativo não estiver em foco."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Controls the mouse mode."
msgstr "Controla o modo do mouse."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], similar input events sent by the operating system are "
"accumulated. When input accumulation is enabled, all input events generated "
"during a frame will be merged and emitted when the frame is done rendering. "
"Therefore, this limits the number of input method calls per second to the "
"rendering FPS.\n"
"Input accumulation can be disabled to get slightly more precise/reactive "
"input at the cost of increased CPU usage. In applications where drawing "
"freehand lines is required, input accumulation should generally be disabled "
"while the user is drawing the line to get results that closely follow the "
"actual input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Input accumulation is [i]enabled[/i] by default."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Emitted when a joypad device has been connected or disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando um dispositivo de controle foi conectado ou desconectado."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Arrow cursor. Standard, default pointing cursor."
msgstr "Cursor de seta. Cursor apontador padrão e comum."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"I-beam cursor. Usually used to show where the text cursor will appear when "
"the mouse is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Cursor em barra I. Geralmente usado para mostrar onde o cursor de texto "
"aparecerá quando o mouse for clicado."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Pointing hand cursor. Usually used to indicate the pointer is over a link or "
"other interactable item."
msgstr ""
"Cursor de mão apontando. Geralmente usado para indicar que o ponteiro está "
"sobre um link ou outro item interativo."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Cross cursor. Typically appears over regions in which a drawing operation "
"can be performed or for selections."
msgstr ""
"Cursor de cruz. Normalmente aparece sobre regiões em que uma operação de "
"desenho pode ser realizada ou para seleções."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Wait cursor. Indicates that the application is busy performing an operation, "
"and that it cannot be used during the operation (e.g. something is blocking "
"its main thread)."
msgstr ""
"Cursor de espera. Indica que o aplicativo está ocupado realizando uma "
"operação e que não pode ser usado durante a operação (por exemplo, algo está "
"bloqueando sua thread principal)."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Busy cursor. Indicates that the application is busy performing an operation, "
"and that it is still usable during the operation."
msgstr ""
"Cursor ocupado. Indica que o aplicativo está ocupado realizando uma operação "
"e que ainda pode ser usado durante a operação."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Drag cursor. Usually displayed when dragging something.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Windows lacks a dragging cursor, so [constant CURSOR_DRAG] is "
"the same as [constant CURSOR_MOVE] for this platform."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Can drop cursor. Usually displayed when dragging something to indicate that "
"it can be dropped at the current position."
msgstr ""
"Pode soltar cursor. Geralmente exibido ao arrastar algo para indicar que "
"pode ser solto na posição atual."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Forbidden cursor. Indicates that the current action is forbidden (for "
"example, when dragging something) or that the control at a position is "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Cursor proibido. Indica que a ação atual é proibida (por exemplo, ao "
"arrastar algo) ou que o controle em uma posição está desativado."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Vertical resize mouse cursor. A double-headed vertical arrow. It tells the "
"user they can resize the window or the panel vertically."
msgstr ""
"Cursor do mouse de redimensionamento vertical. Uma seta dupla vertical. "
"Informa ao usuário que ele pode redimensionar a janela ou o painel "
"verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Horizontal resize mouse cursor. A double-headed horizontal arrow. It tells "
"the user they can resize the window or the panel horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Cursor de mouse de redimensionamento horizontal. Uma seta horizontal de duas "
"pontas. Informa ao usuário que ele pode redimensionar a janela ou o painel "
"horizontalmente."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Window resize mouse cursor. The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes "
"from the bottom left to the top right. It tells the user they can resize the "
"window or the panel both horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"Cursor do mouse de redimensionamento de janela. O cursor é uma seta de duas "
"pontas que vai do canto inferior esquerdo ao canto superior direito. Ele diz "
"ao usuário que ele pode redimensionar a janela ou o painel horizontal e "
"verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Window resize mouse cursor. The cursor is a double-headed arrow that goes "
"from the top left to the bottom right, the opposite of [constant "
"CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. It tells the user they can resize the window or the panel "
"both horizontally and vertically."
msgstr ""
"Cursor de mouse de redimensionamento de janela. O cursor é uma seta de duas "
"pontas que vai do canto superior esquerdo ao canto inferior direito, o "
"oposto de [constant CURSOR_BDIAGSIZE]. Ele diz ao usuário que ele pode "
"redimensionar a janela ou o painel horizontal e verticalmente."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Move cursor. Indicates that something can be moved."
msgstr "Mover cursor. Indica que algo pode ser movido."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Vertical split mouse cursor. On Windows, it's the same as [constant "
"CURSOR_VSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"Cursor do mouse de divisão vertical. No Windows, é o mesmo que [constant "
"CURSOR_VSIZE]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid ""
"Horizontal split mouse cursor. On Windows, it's the same as [constant "
"CURSOR_HSIZE]."
msgstr ""
"Cursor do mouse de divisão horizontal. No Windows, é o mesmo que [constant "
"CURSOR_HSIZE]."

#: doc/classes/Input.xml
msgid "Help cursor. Usually a question mark."
msgstr "Cursor de ajuda. Geralmente um ponto de interrogação."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for input events."
msgstr "Classe base abstrata para eventos de entrada."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class of all types of input events. See [method Node._input]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstrata de todos os tipos de eventos de entrada. Consulte "
"[method Node._input]."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml doc/classes/InputEventGesture.xml
#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadButton.xml
#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadMotion.xml doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
#: doc/classes/InputEventMagnifyGesture.xml doc/classes/InputEventMouse.xml
#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
#: doc/classes/InputEventPanGesture.xml doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid "Using InputEvent"
msgstr "Usando InputEvent"

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given input event and this input event can "
"be added together (only for events of type [InputEventMouseMotion]).\n"
"The given input event's position, global position and speed will be copied. "
"The resulting [code]relative[/code] is a sum of both events. Both events' "
"modifiers have to be identical."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid "Returns a [String] representation of the event."
msgstr "Retorna uma representação em [String] do evento."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a value between 0.0 and 1.0 depending on the given actions' state. "
"Useful for getting the value of events of type [InputEventJoypadMotion].\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event matches a pre-defined action "
"of any type.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given action matches this event and is "
"being pressed (and is not an echo event for [InputEventKey] events, unless "
"[param allow_echo] is [code]true[/code]). Not relevant for events of type "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given action matches this event and is "
"released (i.e. not pressed). Not relevant for events of type "
"[InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event's type is one that can be "
"assigned to an input action: [InputEventKey], [InputEventMouseButton], "
"[InputEventJoypadButton], [InputEventJoypadMotion], [InputEventAction]. "
"Returns [code]false[/code] for all other input event types."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o tipo deste evento de entrada for um que pode "
"ser atribuído a uma ação de entrada: [InputEventKey], "
"[InputEventMouseButton], [InputEventJoypadButton], [InputEventJoypadMotion], "
"[InputEventAction]. Retorna [code]false[/code] para todos os outros tipos de "
"evento de entrada."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event has been canceled."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se este evento de entrada foi cancelado."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event is an echo event (only for "
"events of type [InputEventKey]). An echo event is a repeated key event sent "
"when the user is holding down the key. Any other event type returns "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rate at which echo events are sent is typically around 20 "
"events per second (after holding down the key for roughly half a second). "
"However, the key repeat delay/speed can be changed by the user or disabled "
"entirely in the operating system settings. To ensure your project works "
"correctly on all configurations, do not assume the user has a specific key "
"repeat configuration in your project's behavior."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param event] matches this event. "
"Only valid for action events, which include key ([InputEventKey]), button "
"([InputEventMouseButton] or [InputEventJoypadButton]), axis "
"[InputEventJoypadMotion], and action ([InputEventAction]) events.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], the check ignores additional "
"input modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and "
"the direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only considers the event configuration (such as the "
"keyboard key or the joypad axis), not state information like [method "
"is_pressed], [method is_released], [method is_echo], or [method is_canceled]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event is pressed. Not relevant for "
"events of type [InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_pressed] may return "
"[code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input "
"examples[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input event is released. Not relevant for "
"events of type [InputEventMouseMotion] or [InputEventScreenDrag]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este evento de entrada for liberado. Não "
"relevante para eventos do tipo [InputEventMouseMotion] ou "
"[InputEventScreenDrag]."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the given input event which has been offset by [param "
"local_ofs] and transformed by [param xform]. Relevant for events of type "
"[InputEventMouseButton], [InputEventMouseMotion], [InputEventScreenTouch], "
"[InputEventScreenDrag], [InputEventMagnifyGesture] and "
"[InputEventPanGesture]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma cópia do evento de entrada fornecido que foi deslocada por "
"[param local_ofs] e transformada por [param xform]. Relevante para eventos "
"do tipo [InputEventMouseButton], [InputEventMouseMotion], "
"[InputEventScreenTouch], [InputEventScreenDrag], [InputEventMagnifyGesture] "
"e [InputEventPanGesture]."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"The event's device ID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member device] can be negative for special use cases that "
"don't refer to devices physically present on the system. See [constant "
"DEVICE_ID_EMULATION]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Device ID used for emulated mouse input from a touchscreen, or for emulated "
"touch input from a mouse. This can be used to distinguish emulated mouse "
"input from physical mouse input, or emulated touch input from physical touch "
"input."
msgstr ""
"ID do dispositivo usado para entrada de mouse emulada a partir de uma tela "
"sensível ao toque, ou para entrada de toque emulada a partir de um mouse. "
"Isso pode ser usado para distinguir a entrada de mouse emulada da entrada de "
"mouse física, ou a entrada de toque emulada da entrada de toque física."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Device ID used for input from a keyboard. This can be used to distinguish "
"keyboard input events from joypad input events."
msgstr ""
"ID de dispositivo usado para entrada de um teclado. Isso pode ser usado para "
"distinguir eventos de entrada de teclado de eventos de entrada de joypad."

#: doc/classes/InputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"Device ID used for input from a mouse. This can be used to distinguish mouse "
"input events from joypad input events."
msgstr ""
"ID de dispositivo usado para entrada de um mouse. Pode ser usado para "
"distinguir eventos de entrada de mouse de eventos de entrada de joypad."

#: doc/classes/InputEventAction.xml
msgid "An input event type for actions."
msgstr "Um tipo de evento de entrada para ações."

#: doc/classes/InputEventAction.xml
msgid ""
"Contains a generic action which can be targeted from several types of "
"inputs. Actions and their events can be set in the [b]Input Map[/b] tab in "
"[b]Project > Project Settings[/b], or with the [InputMap] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike the other [InputEvent] subclasses which map to unique "
"physical events, this virtual one is not emitted by the engine. This class "
"is useful to emit actions manually with [method Input.parse_input_event], "
"which are then received in [method Node._input]. To check if a physical "
"event matches an action from the Input Map, use [method "
"InputEvent.is_action] and [method InputEvent.is_action_pressed]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventAction.xml
msgid "Using InputEvent: Actions"
msgstr "Usando InputEvent: Ações"

#: doc/classes/InputEventAction.xml
msgid ""
"The action's name. This is usually the name of an existing action in the "
"[InputMap] which you want this custom event to match."
msgstr ""
"O nome da ação. Este é geralmente o nome de uma ação existente no [InputMap] "
"que você deseja que este evento personalizado corresponda."

#: doc/classes/InputEventAction.xml
msgid ""
"The real event index in action this event corresponds to (from events "
"defined for this action in the [InputMap]). If [code]-1[/code], a unique ID "
"will be used and actions pressed with this ID will need to be released with "
"another [InputEventAction]."
msgstr ""
"O índice de evento real na ação à qual este evento corresponde (a partir dos "
"eventos definidos para esta ação no [InputMap]). Se [code]-1[/code], um ID "
"exclusivo será usado e as ações pressionadas com este ID precisarão ser "
"liberadas com outro [InputEventAction]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventAction.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the action's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], "
"the action's state is released."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o estado da ação está pressionado. Se [code]false[/"
"code], o estado da ação está liberado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventAction.xml
msgid ""
"The action's strength between 0 and 1. This value is considered as equal to "
"0 if pressed is [code]false[/code]. The event strength allows faking analog "
"joypad motion events, by specifying how strongly the joypad axis is bent or "
"pressed."
msgstr ""
"A força da ação entre 0 e 1. Esse valor é considerado igual a 0 se "
"pressionado for [code]false[/code]. A força do evento permite simular "
"eventos de movimento de joypad analógico, especificando quão fortemente o "
"eixo do joypad é inclinado ou pressionado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventFromWindow.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for [Viewport]-based input events."
msgstr "Classe base abstrata para eventos de entrada baseados em [Viewport]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventFromWindow.xml
msgid ""
"InputEventFromWindow represents events specifically received by windows. "
"This includes mouse events, keyboard events in focused windows or touch "
"screen actions."
msgstr ""
"InputEventFromWindow representa eventos recebidos especificamente por "
"janelas. Isso inclui eventos de mouse, eventos de teclado em janelas focadas "
"ou ações de tela sensível ao toque."

#: doc/classes/InputEventFromWindow.xml
msgid "The ID of a [Window] that received this event."
msgstr "O ID de uma [Window] que recebeu este evento."

#: doc/classes/InputEventGesture.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for touch gestures."
msgstr "Classe base abstrata para gestos de toque."

#: doc/classes/InputEventGesture.xml
msgid ""
"InputEventGestures are sent when a user performs a supported gesture on a "
"touch screen. Gestures can't be emulated using mouse, because they typically "
"require multi-touch."
msgstr ""
"InputEventGestures são enviados quando um usuário realiza um gesto suportado "
"em uma tela sensível ao toque. Gestos não podem ser emulados usando o mouse, "
"pois normalmente exigem multitoque."

#: doc/classes/InputEventGesture.xml
msgid ""
"The local gesture position relative to the [Viewport]. If used in [method "
"Control._gui_input], the position is relative to the current [Control] that "
"received this gesture."
msgstr ""
"A posição local do gesto em relação ao [Viewport]. Se usado em [method "
"Control._gui_input], a posição é relativa ao [Control] atual que recebeu "
"este gesto."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadButton.xml
msgid "Represents a gamepad button being pressed or released."
msgstr "Representa um botão de gamepad sendo pressionado ou liberado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadButton.xml
msgid ""
"Input event type for gamepad buttons. For gamepad analog sticks and "
"joysticks, see [InputEventJoypadMotion]."
msgstr ""
"Tipo de evento de entrada para botões de gamepad. Para direcionais "
"analógicos e joysticks de gamepad, consulte [InputEventJoypadMotion]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadButton.xml
msgid "Button identifier. One of the [enum JoyButton] button constants."
msgstr ""
"Identificador de botão. Uma das constantes de botão do [enum JoyButton]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the button's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], "
"the button's state is released."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o estado do botão está pressionado. Se [code]false[/"
"code], o estado do botão está liberado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadButton.xml
msgid "This property is never set by the engine and is always [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Esta propriedade nunca é definida pela engine e é sempre [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadMotion.xml
msgid ""
"Represents axis motions (such as joystick or analog triggers) from a gamepad."
msgstr ""
"Representa movimentos de eixo (como joystick ou gatilhos analógicos) de um "
"gamepad."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadMotion.xml
msgid ""
"Stores information about joystick motions. One [InputEventJoypadMotion] "
"represents one axis at a time. For gamepad buttons, see "
"[InputEventJoypadButton]."
msgstr ""
"Armazena informações sobre movimentos do joystick. Um "
"[InputEventJoypadMotion] representa um eixo por vez. Para botões de gamepad, "
"consulte [InputEventJoypadButton]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadMotion.xml
msgid "Axis identifier."
msgstr "Identificador de eixo."

#: doc/classes/InputEventJoypadMotion.xml
msgid ""
"Current position of the joystick on the given axis. The value ranges from "
"[code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]. A value of [code]0[/code] means the "
"axis is in its resting position."
msgstr ""
"Posição atual do joystick no eixo fornecido. O valor varia de [code]-1.0[/"
"code] a [code]1.0[/code]. Um valor de [code]0[/code] significa que o eixo "
"está em sua posição de repouso."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid "Represents a key on a keyboard being pressed or released."
msgstr "Representa uma tecla em um teclado sendo pressionada ou solta."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"An input event for keys on a keyboard. Supports key presses, key releases "
"and [member echo] events. It can also be received in [method "
"Node._unhandled_key_input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Events received from the keyboard usually have all properties "
"set. Event mappings should have only one of the [member keycode], [member "
"physical_keycode] or [member unicode] set.\n"
"When events are compared, properties are checked in the following priority - "
"[member keycode], [member physical_keycode] and [member unicode]. Events "
"with the first matching value will be considered equal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member key_label] and "
"modifiers."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma representação em [String] do [member key_label] e dos "
"modificadores do evento."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member keycode] and "
"modifiers."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma representação em [String] do [member keycode] do evento e "
"modificadores."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member location]. This "
"will be a blank string if the event is not specific to a location."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma representação em [String] da [member location] do evento. Esta "
"será uma string em branco se o evento não for específico para um local."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representation of the event's [member physical_keycode] "
"and modifiers."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma representação em [String] do [member physical_keycode] e dos "
"modificadores do evento."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the localized key label combined with modifier keys such as "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See also [InputEventWithModifiers].\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey] with "
"modifiers, use "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_key_label_with_modifiers())[/code] "
"where [code]event[/code] is the [InputEventKey]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the Latin keycode combined with modifier keys such as [kbd]Shift[/"
"kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See also [InputEventWithModifiers].\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey] with "
"modifiers, use "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_keycode_with_modifiers())[/code] where "
"[code]event[/code] is the [InputEventKey]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the physical keycode combined with modifier keys such as [kbd]Shift[/"
"kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See also [InputEventWithModifiers].\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey] with "
"modifiers, use "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.get_physical_keycode_with_modifiers())[/"
"code] where [code]event[/code] is the [InputEventKey]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the key was already pressed before this event. An echo "
"event is a repeated key event sent when the user is holding down the key.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rate at which echo events are sent is typically around 20 "
"events per second (after holding down the key for roughly half a second). "
"However, the key repeat delay/speed can be changed by the user or disabled "
"entirely in the operating system settings. To ensure your project works "
"correctly on all configurations, do not assume the user has a specific key "
"repeat configuration in your project's behavior."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Represents the localized label printed on the key in the current keyboard "
"layout, which corresponds to one of the [enum Key] constants or any valid "
"Unicode character. Key labels are meant for key prompts.\n"
"For keyboard layouts with a single label on the key, it is equivalent to "
"[member keycode].\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey], use "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.key_label)[/code] where [code]event[/code] "
"is the [InputEventKey].\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"+-----+ +-----+\n"
"| Q   | | Q   | - \"Q\" - keycode\n"
"|   Й | |  ض | - \"Й\" and \"ض\" - key_label\n"
"+-----+ +-----+\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Latin label printed on the key in the current keyboard layout, which "
"corresponds to one of the [enum Key] constants. Key codes are meant for "
"shortcuts expressed with a standard Latin keyboard, such as [kbd]Ctrl + S[/"
"kbd] for a \"Save\" shortcut.\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey], use "
"[code]OS.get_keycode_string(event.keycode)[/code] where [code]event[/code] "
"is the [InputEventKey].\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"+-----+ +-----+\n"
"| Q   | | Q   | - \"Q\" - keycode\n"
"|   Й | |  ض | - \"Й\" and \"ض\" - key_label\n"
"+-----+ +-----+\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Represents the location of a key which has both left and right versions, "
"such as [kbd]Shift[/kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"Representa a localização de uma tecla que possui versões à esquerda e à "
"direita, como [kbd]Shift[/kbd] ou [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"Represents the physical location of a key on the 101/102-key US QWERTY "
"keyboard, which corresponds to one of the [enum Key] constants. Physical key "
"codes meant for game input, such as WASD movement, where only the location "
"of the keys is important.\n"
"To get a human-readable representation of the [InputEventKey], use [method "
"OS.get_keycode_string] in combination with [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_keycode_from_physical] or [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey:\n"
"\t\tvar keycode = "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_keycode_from_physical(event.physical_keycode)\n"
"\t\tvar label = "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical(event.physical_keycode)\n"
"\t\tprint(OS.get_keycode_string(keycode))\n"
"\t\tprint(OS.get_keycode_string(label))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey inputEventKey)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tvar keycode = "
"DisplayServer.KeyboardGetKeycodeFromPhysical(inputEventKey.PhysicalKeycode);\n"
"\t\tvar label = "
"DisplayServer.KeyboardGetLabelFromPhysical(inputEventKey.PhysicalKeycode);\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(keycode));\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(label));\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Representa a localização física de uma tecla no teclado US QWERTY de 101/102 "
"teclas, que corresponde a uma das constantes [enum Key]. Os códigos de tecla "
"físicos são destinados a entradas de jogos, como a movimentação WASD, onde "
"apenas a localização das teclas é importante.\n"
"Para obter uma representação legível por humanos do [InputEventKey], use "
"[method OS.get_keycode_string] em combinação com [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_keycode_from_physical] ou [method "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventKey:\n"
"\t\tvar keycode = "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_keycode_from_physical(event.physical_keycode)\n"
"\t\tvar label = "
"DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical(event.physical_keycode)\n"
"\t\tprint(OS.get_keycode_string(keycode))\n"
"\t\tprint(OS.get_keycode_string(label))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent @event)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (@event is InputEventKey inputEventKey)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tvar keycode = "
"DisplayServer.KeyboardGetKeycodeFromPhysical(inputEventKey.PhysicalKeycode);\n"
"\t\tvar label = "
"DisplayServer.KeyboardGetLabelFromPhysical(inputEventKey.PhysicalKeycode);\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(keycode));\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(label));\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the key's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], the "
"key's state is released."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o estado da tecla está pressionado. Se [code]false[/"
"code], o estado da tecla está liberado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventKey.xml
msgid ""
"The key Unicode character code (when relevant), shifted by modifier keys. "
"Unicode character codes for composite characters and complex scripts may not "
"be available unless IME input mode is active. See [method "
"Window.set_ime_active] for more information. Unicode character codes are "
"meant for text input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is set by the engine only for a pressed event. If "
"the event is sent by an IME or a virtual keyboard, no corresponding key "
"released event is sent."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMagnifyGesture.xml
msgid "Represents a magnifying touch gesture."
msgstr "Representa um gesto de toque de ampliação."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMagnifyGesture.xml
msgid ""
"Stores the factor of a magnifying touch gesture. This is usually performed "
"when the user pinches the touch screen and used for zooming in/out.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, this requires the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/android/"
"enable_pan_and_scale_gestures] project setting to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMagnifyGesture.xml
msgid ""
"The amount (or delta) of the event. This value is closer to [code]1.0[/code] "
"the slower the gesture is performed."
msgstr ""
"A quantidade (ou delta) do evento. Este valor fica mais próximo de "
"[code]1.0[/code] quanto mais devagar o gesto for realizado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a MIDI message from a MIDI device, such as a musical keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Representa uma mensagem MIDI de um dispositivo MIDI, como um teclado musical."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"InputEventMIDI stores information about messages from [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIDI]MIDI[/url] (Musical Instrument Digital Interface) "
"devices. These may include musical keyboards, synthesizers, and drum "
"machines.\n"
"MIDI messages can be received over a 5-pin MIDI connector or over USB. If "
"your device supports both be sure to check the settings in the device to see "
"which output it is using.\n"
"By default, Godot does not detect MIDI devices. You need to call [method "
"OS.open_midi_inputs], first. You can check which devices are detected with "
"[method OS.get_connected_midi_inputs], and close the connection with [method "
"OS.close_midi_inputs].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tOS.open_midi_inputs()\n"
"\tprint(OS.get_connected_midi_inputs())\n"
"\n"
"func _input(input_event):\n"
"\tif input_event is InputEventMIDI:\n"
"\t\t_print_midi_info(input_event)\n"
"\n"
"func _print_midi_info(midi_event):\n"
"\tprint(midi_event)\n"
"\tprint(\"Channel \", midi_event.channel)\n"
"\tprint(\"Message \", midi_event.message)\n"
"\tprint(\"Pitch \", midi_event.pitch)\n"
"\tprint(\"Velocity \", midi_event.velocity)\n"
"\tprint(\"Instrument \", midi_event.instrument)\n"
"\tprint(\"Pressure \", midi_event.pressure)\n"
"\tprint(\"Controller number: \", midi_event.controller_number)\n"
"\tprint(\"Controller value: \", midi_event.controller_value)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tOS.OpenMidiInputs();\n"
"\tGD.Print(OS.GetConnectedMidiInputs());\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent inputEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (inputEvent is InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tPrintMIDIInfo(midiEvent);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void PrintMIDIInfo(InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(midiEvent);\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Channel {midiEvent.Channel}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Message {midiEvent.Message}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Pitch {midiEvent.Pitch}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Velocity {midiEvent.Velocity}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Instrument {midiEvent.Instrument}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Pressure {midiEvent.Pressure}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Controller number: {midiEvent.ControllerNumber}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Controller value: {midiEvent.ControllerValue}\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot does not support MIDI output, so there is no way to emit "
"MIDI messages from Godot. Only MIDI input is supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Web platform, using MIDI input requires a browser "
"permission to be granted first. This permission request is performed when "
"calling [method OS.open_midi_inputs]. MIDI input will not work until the "
"user accepts the permission request."
msgstr ""
"InputEventMIDI armazena informações sobre mensagens de dispositivos "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MIDI]MIDI[/url] (Musical Instrument "
"Digital Interface). Estes podem incluir teclados musicais, sintetizadores e "
"baterias eletrônicas.\n"
"As mensagens MIDI podem ser recebidas por meio de um conector MIDI de 5 "
"pinos ou via USB. Se o seu dispositivo suporta ambos, certifique-se de "
"verificar as configurações no dispositivo para ver qual saída ele está "
"usando.\n"
"Por padrão, o Godot não detecta dispositivos MIDI. Você precisa chamar "
"[method OS.open_midi_inputs] primeiro. Você pode verificar quais "
"dispositivos são detectados com [method OS.get_connected_midi_inputs] e "
"fechar a conexão com [method OS.close_midi_inputs].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tOS.open_midi_inputs()\n"
"\tprint(OS.get_connected_midi_inputs())\n"
"\n"
"func _input(input_event):\n"
"\tif input_event is InputEventMIDI:\n"
"\t\t_print_midi_info(input_event)\n"
"\n"
"func _print_midi_info(midi_event):\n"
"\tprint(midi_event)\n"
"\tprint(\"Channel \", midi_event.channel)\n"
"\tprint(\"Message \", midi_event.message)\n"
"\tprint(\"Pitch \", midi_event.pitch)\n"
"\tprint(\"Velocity \", midi_event.velocity)\n"
"\tprint(\"Instrument \", midi_event.instrument)\n"
"\tprint(\"Pressure \", midi_event.pressure)\n"
"\tprint(\"Controller number: \", midi_event.controller_number)\n"
"\tprint(\"Controller value: \", midi_event.controller_value)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tOS.OpenMidiInputs();\n"
"\tGD.Print(OS.GetConnectedMidiInputs());\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override void _Input(InputEvent inputEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (inputEvent is InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tPrintMIDIInfo(midiEvent);\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"private void PrintMIDIInfo(InputEventMidi midiEvent)\n"
"{\n"
"\tGD.Print(midiEvent);\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Channel {midiEvent.Channel}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Message {midiEvent.Message}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Pitch {midiEvent.Pitch}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Velocity {midiEvent.Velocity}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Instrument {midiEvent.Instrument}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Pressure {midiEvent.Pressure}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Controller number: {midiEvent.ControllerNumber}\");\n"
"\tGD.Print($\"Controller value: {midiEvent.ControllerValue}\");\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O Godot não oferece suporte a saída MIDI, portanto, não há como "
"emitir mensagens MIDI a partir do Godot. Apenas a entrada MIDI é suportada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Na plataforma Web, o uso de entrada MIDI requer que uma "
"permissão do navegador seja concedida primeiro. Esta solicitação de "
"permissão é realizada ao chamar [method OS.open_midi_inputs]. A entrada MIDI "
"não funcionará até que o usuário aceite a solicitação de permissão."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid "MIDI Message Status Byte List"
msgstr "Lista de bytes de status de mensagem MIDI"

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid "Wikipedia General MIDI Instrument List"
msgstr "Lista de Instrumentos MIDI Gerais da Wikipédia"

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid "Wikipedia Piano Key Frequencies List"
msgstr "Lista de Frequências de Teclas de Piano da Wikipédia"

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"The MIDI channel of this message, ranging from [code]0[/code] to [code]15[/"
"code]. MIDI channel [code]9[/code] is reserved for percussion instruments."
msgstr ""
"O canal MIDI desta mensagem, variando de [code]0[/code] a [code]15[/code]. O "
"canal MIDI [code]9[/code] é reservado para instrumentos de percussão."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"The unique number of the controller, if [member message] is [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], otherwise this is [code]0[/code]. This value "
"can be used to identify sliders for volume, balance, and panning, as well as "
"switches and pedals on the MIDI device. See the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_MIDI#Controller_events]General MIDI "
"specification[/url] for a small list."
msgstr ""
"O número exclusivo do controlador, se [member message] for [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], caso contrário, é [code]0[/code]. Este valor "
"pode ser usado para identificar controles deslizantes de volume, balanço e "
"panorama, bem como chaves e pedais no dispositivo MIDI. Veja a [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_MIDI#Controller_events]especificação do "
"General MIDI[/url] para uma pequena lista."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"The value applied to the controller. If [member message] is [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], this value ranges from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]127[/code], otherwise it is [code]0[/code]. See also [member "
"controller_value]."
msgstr ""
"O valor aplicado ao controlador. Se [member message] for [constant "
"MIDI_MESSAGE_CONTROL_CHANGE], este valor varia de [code]0[/code] a "
"[code]127[/code], caso contrário, é [code]0[/code]. Veja também [member "
"controller_value]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"The instrument (also called [i]program[/i] or [i]preset[/i]) used on this "
"MIDI message. This value ranges from [code]0[/code] to [code]127[/code].\n"
"To see what each value means, refer to the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/General_MIDI#Program_change_events]General MIDI's instrument list[/"
"url]. Keep in mind that the list is off by 1 because it does not begin from "
"0. A value of [code]0[/code] corresponds to the acoustic grand piano."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"Represents the type of MIDI message (see the [enum MIDIMessage] enum).\n"
"For more information, see the [url=https://www.midi.org/specifications-old/"
"item/table-2-expanded-messages-list-status-bytes]MIDI message status byte "
"list chart[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"The pitch index number of this MIDI message. This value ranges from [code]0[/"
"code] to [code]127[/code].\n"
"On a piano, the [b]middle C[/b] is [code]60[/code], followed by a [b]C-"
"sharp[/b] ([code]61[/code]), then a [b]D[/b] ([code]62[/code]), and so on. "
"Each octave is split in offsets of 12. See the \"MIDI note number\" column "
"of the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piano_key_frequencies]piano key "
"frequency chart[/url] a full list."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"The strength of the key being pressed. This value ranges from [code]0[/code] "
"to [code]127[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For many devices, this value is always [code]0[/code]. Other "
"devices such as musical keyboards may simulate pressure by changing the "
"[member velocity], instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMIDI.xml
msgid ""
"The velocity of the MIDI message. This value ranges from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]127[/code]. For a musical keyboard, this corresponds to how quickly "
"the key was pressed, and is rarely above [code]110[/code] in practice.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some MIDI devices may send a [constant MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_ON] "
"message with [code]0[/code] velocity and expect it to be treated the same as "
"a [constant MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_OFF] message. If necessary, this can be "
"handled with a few lines of code:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _input(event):\n"
"\tif event is InputEventMIDI:\n"
"\t\tif event.message == MIDI_MESSAGE_NOTE_ON and event.velocity > 0:\n"
"\t\t\tprint(\"Note pressed!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouse.xml
msgid "Base input event type for mouse events."
msgstr "Tipo de evento de entrada base para eventos de mouse."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouse.xml
msgid "Stores general information about mouse events."
msgstr "Armazena informações gerais sobre eventos de mouse."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouse.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse button mask identifier, one of or a bitwise combination of the "
"[enum MouseButton] button masks."
msgstr ""
"O identificador de máscara de botão do mouse, uma ou uma combinação bit a "
"bit das máscaras de botão [enum MouseButton]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouse.xml
msgid ""
"When received in [method Node._input] or [method Node._unhandled_input], "
"returns the mouse's position in the root [Viewport] using the coordinate "
"system of the root [Viewport].\n"
"When received in [method Control._gui_input], returns the mouse's position "
"in the [CanvasLayer] that the [Control] is in using the coordinate system of "
"the [CanvasLayer]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouse.xml
msgid ""
"When received in [method Node._input] or [method Node._unhandled_input], "
"returns the mouse's position in the [Viewport] this [Node] is in using the "
"coordinate system of this [Viewport].\n"
"When received in [method Control._gui_input], returns the mouse's position "
"in the [Control] using the local coordinate system of the [Control]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml
msgid "Represents a mouse button being pressed or released."
msgstr "Representa um botão do mouse sendo pressionado ou liberado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml
msgid ""
"Stores information about mouse click events. See [method Node._input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Wear OS devices, rotary input is mapped to [constant "
"MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP] and [constant MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN]. This can be "
"changed to [constant MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_LEFT] and [constant "
"MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_RIGHT] with the [member ProjectSettings.input_devices/"
"pointing/android/rotary_input_scroll_axis] setting."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid "Mouse and input coordinates"
msgstr "Mouse e coordenadas de entrada"

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse button identifier, one of the [enum MouseButton] button or button "
"wheel constants."
msgstr ""
"O identificador do botão do mouse, uma das constantes de botão ou roda de "
"botão de [enum MouseButton]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the mouse button event has been canceled."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o evento de botão do mouse foi cancelado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the mouse button's state is a double-click."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o estado do botão do mouse é um clique duplo."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml
msgid ""
"The amount (or delta) of the event. When used for high-precision scroll "
"events, this indicates the scroll amount (vertical or horizontal). This is "
"only supported on some platforms; the reported sensitivity varies depending "
"on the platform. May be [code]0[/code] if not supported."
msgstr ""
"A quantidade (ou delta) do evento. Quando usado para eventos de rolagem de "
"alta precisão, isso indica a quantidade de rolagem (vertical ou horizontal). "
"Isso é suportado apenas em algumas plataformas; a sensibilidade relatada "
"varia dependendo da plataforma. Pode ser [code]0[/code] se não for suportado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the mouse button's state is pressed. If [code]false[/"
"code], the mouse button's state is released."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o estado do botão do mouse está pressionado. Se "
"[code]false[/code], o estado do botão do mouse está solto."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid "Represents a mouse or a pen movement."
msgstr "Representa um movimento de mouse ou caneta."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid ""
"Stores information about a mouse or a pen motion. This includes relative "
"position, absolute position, and velocity. See [method Node._input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, this event is only emitted once per frame rendered "
"at most. If you need more precise input reporting, set [member "
"Input.use_accumulated_input] to [code]false[/code] to make events emitted as "
"often as possible. If you use InputEventMouseMotion to draw lines, consider "
"using [method Geometry2D.bresenham_line] as well to avoid visible gaps in "
"lines if the user is moving the mouse quickly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This event may be emitted even when the mouse hasn't moved, "
"either by the operating system or by Godot itself. If you really need to "
"know if the mouse has moved (e.g. to suppress displaying a tooltip), you "
"should check that [code]relative.is_zero_approx()[/code] is [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when using the eraser end of a stylus pen.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented on Linux, macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid ""
"Represents the pressure the user puts on the pen. Ranges from [code]0.0[/"
"code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Representa a pressão que o usuário exerce na caneta. Varia de [code]0.0[/"
"code] a [code]1.0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse position relative to the previous position (position at the last "
"frame).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since [InputEventMouseMotion] may only be emitted when the "
"mouse moves, it is not possible to reliably detect when the mouse has "
"stopped moving by checking this property. A separate, short timer may be "
"necessary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member relative] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. This means mouse sensitivity will appear different depending on "
"resolution when using [member relative] in a script that handles mouse "
"aiming with the [constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode. To avoid "
"this, use [member screen_relative] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid ""
"The unscaled mouse position relative to the previous position in the "
"coordinate system of the screen (position at the last frame).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since [InputEventMouseMotion] may only be emitted when the "
"mouse moves, it is not possible to reliably detect when the mouse has "
"stopped moving by checking this property. A separate, short timer may be "
"necessary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This coordinate is [i]not[/i] scaled according to the content "
"scale factor or calls to [method InputEvent.xformed_by]. This should be "
"preferred over [member relative] for mouse aiming when using the [constant "
"Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode, regardless of the project's stretch "
"mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid ""
"The unscaled mouse velocity in pixels per second in screen coordinates. This "
"velocity is [i]not[/i] scaled according to the content scale factor or calls "
"to [method InputEvent.xformed_by].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mode, [member "
"screen_velocity] returns [code](0, 0)[/code] because the mouse cursor is "
"hidden and locked. Use [member screen_relative] for mouse aiming using the "
"[constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid ""
"Represents the angles of tilt of the pen. Positive X-coordinate value "
"indicates a tilt to the right. Positive Y-coordinate value indicates a tilt "
"toward the user. Ranges from [code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code] for both "
"axes."
msgstr ""
"Representa os ângulos de inclinação da caneta. Um valor de coordenada X "
"positivo indica uma inclinação para a direita. Um valor de coordenada Y "
"positivo indica uma inclinação em direção ao usuário. Varia de [code]-1.0[/"
"code] a [code]1.0[/code] para ambos os eixos."

#: doc/classes/InputEventMouseMotion.xml
msgid ""
"The mouse velocity in pixels per second.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member velocity] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. That means mouse sensitivity may appear different depending on "
"resolution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In [constant Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mode, [member velocity] "
"returns [code](0, 0)[/code] because the mouse cursor is hidden and locked. "
"Use [member screen_relative] for mouse aiming using the [constant "
"Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED] mouse mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventPanGesture.xml
msgid "Represents a panning touch gesture."
msgstr "Representa um gesto de toque de panorâmica."

#: doc/classes/InputEventPanGesture.xml
msgid ""
"Stores information about pan gestures. A pan gesture is performed when the "
"user swipes the touch screen with two fingers. It's typically used for "
"panning/scrolling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, this requires the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input_devices/pointing/android/"
"enable_pan_and_scale_gestures] project setting to be enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventPanGesture.xml
msgid "Panning amount since last pan event."
msgstr ""
"Quantidade de movimentação panorâmica desde o último evento de movimento."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid "Represents a screen drag event."
msgstr "Representa um evento de arrasto de tela."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid "Stores information about screen drag events. See [method Node._input]."
msgstr ""
"Armazena informações sobre eventos de arrastar tela. Consulte [method "
"Node._input]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid "The drag event index in the case of a multi-drag event."
msgstr ""
"O índice do evento de arrastar no caso de um evento de arrastar múltiplo."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] when using the eraser end of a stylus pen."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] ao usar a extremidade da borracha de uma caneta "
"stylus."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid ""
"The drag position in the viewport the node is in, using the coordinate "
"system of this viewport."
msgstr ""
"A posição de arrasto na viewport em que o nó está, usando o sistema de "
"coordenadas desta viewport."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid ""
"The drag position relative to the previous position (position at the last "
"frame).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member relative] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. This means touch sensitivity will appear different depending on "
"resolution when using [member relative] in a script that handles touch "
"aiming. To avoid this, use [member screen_relative] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid ""
"The unscaled drag position relative to the previous position in screen "
"coordinates (position at the last frame). This position is [i]not[/i] scaled "
"according to the content scale factor or calls to [method "
"InputEvent.xformed_by]. This should be preferred over [member relative] for "
"touch aiming regardless of the project's stretch mode."
msgstr ""
"A posição de arrasto não dimensionada em relação à posição anterior nas "
"coordenadas de tela (posição no último quadro). Esta posição [i]não[/i] é "
"dimensionada de acordo com o fator de escala de conteúdo ou chamadas para "
"[method InputEvent.xformed_by]. Isso deve ser preferido em relação a [member "
"relative] para mira por toque, independentemente do modo de estiramento do "
"projeto."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid ""
"The unscaled drag velocity in pixels per second in screen coordinates. This "
"velocity is [i]not[/i] scaled according to the content scale factor or calls "
"to [method InputEvent.xformed_by]. This should be preferred over [member "
"velocity] for touch aiming regardless of the project's stretch mode."
msgstr ""
"A velocidade de arrasto não escalada em pixels por segundo nas coordenadas "
"da tela. Esta velocidade [i]não[/i] é escalada de acordo com o fator de "
"escala do conteúdo ou chamadas para [method InputEvent.xformed_by]. Isso "
"deve ser preferido em detrimento de [member velocity] para mira por toque, "
"independentemente do modo de estiramento do projeto."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenDrag.xml
msgid ""
"The drag velocity.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member velocity] is automatically scaled according to the "
"content scale factor, which is defined by the project's stretch mode "
"settings. This means touch sensitivity will appear different depending on "
"resolution when using [member velocity] in a script that handles touch "
"aiming. To avoid this, use [member screen_velocity] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
msgid "Represents a screen touch event."
msgstr "Representa um evento de toque na tela."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
msgid ""
"Stores information about multi-touch press/release input events. Supports "
"touch press, touch release and [member index] for multi-touch count and "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Armazena informações sobre eventos de entrada de pressionamento/liberação de "
"multitoque. Suporta pressionamento de toque, liberação de toque e [member "
"index] para contagem e ordem de multitoque."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the touch event has been canceled."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o evento de toque foi cancelado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the touch's state is a double tap."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o estado do toque é um toque duplo."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
msgid ""
"The touch index in the case of a multi-touch event. One index = one finger."
msgstr ""
"O índice de toque no caso de um evento de multitoque. Um índice = um dedo."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
msgid ""
"The touch position in the viewport the node is in, using the coordinate "
"system of this viewport."
msgstr ""
"A posição de toque na viewport em que o nó está, usando o sistema de "
"coordenadas desta viewport."

#: doc/classes/InputEventScreenTouch.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the touch's state is pressed. If [code]false[/code], "
"the touch's state is released."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o estado do toque está pressionado. Se [code]false[/"
"code], o estado do toque está liberado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventShortcut.xml
msgid "Represents a triggered keyboard [Shortcut]."
msgstr "Representa um [Shortcut] de teclado acionado."

#: doc/classes/InputEventShortcut.xml
msgid ""
"InputEventShortcut is a special event that can be received in [method "
"Node._input], [method Node._shortcut_input], and [method "
"Node._unhandled_input]. It is typically sent by the editor's Command Palette "
"to trigger actions, but can also be sent manually using [method "
"Viewport.push_input]."
msgstr ""
"InputEventShortcut é um evento especial que pode ser recebido em [method "
"Node._input], [method Node._shortcut_input] e [method "
"Node._unhandled_input]. Ele é tipicamente enviado pela Paleta de Comandos do "
"editor para disparar ações, mas também pode ser enviado manualmente usando "
"[method Viewport.push_input]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventShortcut.xml
msgid ""
"The [Shortcut] represented by this event. Its [method "
"Shortcut.matches_event] method will always return [code]true[/code] for this "
"event."
msgstr ""
"O [Shortcut] representado por este evento. Seu método [method "
"Shortcut.matches_event] sempre retornará [code]true[/code] para este evento."

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for input events affected by modifier keys like "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd] and [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstrata para eventos de entrada afetados por teclas "
"modificadoras como [kbd]Shift[/kbd] e [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid ""
"Stores information about mouse, keyboard, and touch gesture input events. "
"This includes information about which modifier keys are pressed, such as "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd] or [kbd]Alt[/kbd]. See [method Node._input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Modifier keys are considered modifiers only when used in "
"combination with another key. As a result, their corresponding member "
"variables, such as [member ctrl_pressed], will return [code]false[/code] if "
"the key is pressed on its own."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid "Returns the keycode combination of modifier keys."
msgstr "Retorna a combinação de códigos de tecla das teclas modificadoras."

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid ""
"On macOS, returns [code]true[/code] if [kbd]Meta[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd]) is "
"pressed.\n"
"On other platforms, returns [code]true[/code] if [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] is pressed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid "State of the [kbd]Alt[/kbd] modifier."
msgstr "Estado do modificador [kbd]Alt[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid ""
"Automatically use [kbd]Meta[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd]) on macOS and [kbd]Ctrl[/"
"kbd] on other platforms. If [code]true[/code], [member ctrl_pressed] and "
"[member meta_pressed] cannot be set."
msgstr ""
"Usa automaticamente [kbd]Meta[/kbd] ([kbd]Cmd[/kbd]) no macOS e [kbd]Ctrl[/"
"kbd] em outras plataformas. Se [code]true[/code], [member ctrl_pressed] e "
"[member meta_pressed] não podem ser definidos."

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid "State of the [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] modifier."
msgstr "Estado do modificador [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid ""
"State of the [kbd]Meta[/kbd] modifier. On Windows and Linux, this represents "
"the Windows key (sometimes called \"meta\" or \"super\" on Linux). On macOS, "
"this represents the Command key."
msgstr ""
"Estado do modificador [kbd]Meta[/kbd]. No Windows e Linux, isso representa a "
"tecla Windows (às vezes chamada de \"meta\" ou \"super\" no Linux). No "
"macOS, isso representa a tecla Command."

#: doc/classes/InputEventWithModifiers.xml
msgid "State of the [kbd]Shift[/kbd] modifier."
msgstr "Estado do modificador [kbd]Shift[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "A singleton that manages all [InputEventAction]s."
msgstr "Um singleton que gerencia todos os [InputEventAction]s."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Manages all [InputEventAction] which can be created/modified from the "
"project settings menu [b]Project > Project Settings > Input Map[/b] or in "
"code with [method add_action] and [method action_add_event]. See [method "
"Node._input]."
msgstr ""
"Gerencia todo [InputEventAction] que pode ser criado/modificado no menu de "
"configurações do projeto [b]Projeto > Configurações do Projeto > Mapa de "
"Entrada[/b] ou em código com [method add_action] e [method "
"action_add_event]. Veja [method Node._input]."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Using InputEvent: InputMap"
msgstr "Usando InputEvent: InputMap"

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an [InputEvent] to an action. This [InputEvent] will trigger the action."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um [InputEvent] a uma ação. Este [InputEvent] acionará a ação."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Removes an [InputEvent] from an action."
msgstr "Remove um [InputEvent] de uma ação."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Removes all events from an action."
msgstr "Remove todos os eventos de uma ação."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Returns a deadzone value for the action."
msgstr "Retorna um valor de zona morta para a ação."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of [InputEvent]s associated with a given action.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When used in the editor (e.g. a tool script or [EditorPlugin]), "
"this method will return events for the editor action. If you want to access "
"your project's input binds from the editor, read the [code]input/*[/code] "
"settings from [ProjectSettings]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the action has the given [InputEvent] "
"associated with it."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a ação tiver o [InputEvent] fornecido associado "
"a ela."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Sets a deadzone value for the action."
msgstr "Define um valor de zona morta para a ação."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an empty action to the [InputMap] with a configurable [param "
"deadzone].\n"
"An [InputEvent] can then be added to this action with [method "
"action_add_event]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Removes an action from the [InputMap]."
msgstr "Remove uma ação do [InputMap]."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given event is part of an existing action. "
"This method ignores keyboard modifiers if the given [InputEvent] is not "
"pressed (for proper release detection). See [method action_has_event] if you "
"don't want this behavior.\n"
"If [param exact_match] is [code]false[/code], it ignores additional input "
"modifiers for [InputEventKey] and [InputEventMouseButton] events, and the "
"direction for [InputEventJoypadMotion] events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Returns the human-readable description of the given action."
msgstr "Retorna a descrição legível da ação fornecida."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Returns an array of all actions in the [InputMap]."
msgstr "Retorna um array de todas as ações no [InputMap]."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [InputMap] has a registered action with the "
"given name."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [InputMap] tiver uma ação registrada com o "
"nome fornecido."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid ""
"Clears all [InputEventAction] in the [InputMap] and load it anew from "
"[ProjectSettings]."
msgstr ""
"Limpa todos os [InputEventAction] no [InputMap] e o carrega novamente a "
"partir de [ProjectSettings]."

#: doc/classes/InputMap.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [ProjectSettings] [InputMap] has been loaded."
msgstr "Emitido quando o [InputMap] de [ProjectSettings] foi carregado."

#: doc/classes/InstancePlaceholder.xml
msgid "Placeholder for the root [Node] of a [PackedScene]."
msgstr "Espaço reservado para o [Node] raiz de uma [PackedScene]."

#: doc/classes/InstancePlaceholder.xml
msgid ""
"Turning on the option [b]Load As Placeholder[/b] for an instantiated scene "
"in the editor causes it to be replaced by an [InstancePlaceholder] when "
"running the game, this will not replace the node in the editor. This makes "
"it possible to delay actually loading the scene until calling [method "
"create_instance]. This is useful to avoid loading large scenes all at once "
"by loading parts of it selectively.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Like [Node], [InstancePlaceholder] does not have a transform. "
"This causes any child nodes to be positioned relatively to the [Viewport] "
"origin, rather than their parent as displayed in the editor. Replacing the "
"placeholder with a scene with a transform will transform children relatively "
"to their parent again."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InstancePlaceholder.xml
msgid ""
"Call this method to actually load in the node. The created node will be "
"placed as a sibling [i]above[/i] the [InstancePlaceholder] in the scene "
"tree. The [Node]'s reference is also returned for convenience.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method create_instance] is not thread-safe. Use [method "
"Object.call_deferred] if calling from a thread."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/InstancePlaceholder.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the path to the [PackedScene] resource file that is loaded by default "
"when calling [method create_instance]. Not thread-safe. Use [method "
"Object.call_deferred] if calling from a thread."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o caminho para o arquivo de recurso [PackedScene] que é carregado por "
"padrão ao chamar [method create_instance]. Não é seguro para threads. Use "
"[method Object.call_deferred] se for chamar a partir de uma thread."

#: doc/classes/InstancePlaceholder.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of properties that will be applied to the node when [method "
"create_instance] is called.\n"
"If [param with_order] is [code]true[/code], a key named [code].order[/code] "
"(note the leading period) is added to the dictionary. This [code].order[/"
"code] key is an [Array] of [String] property names specifying the order in "
"which properties will be applied (with index 0 being the first)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "A built-in type for integers."
msgstr "Um tipo interno para inteiros."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Signed 64-bit integer type. This means that it can take values from "
"[code]-2^63[/code] to [code]2^63 - 1[/code], i.e. from "
"[code]-9223372036854775808[/code] to [code]9223372036854775807[/code]. When "
"it exceeds these bounds, it will wrap around.\n"
"[int]s can be automatically converted to [float]s when necessary, for "
"example when passing them as arguments in functions. The [float] will be as "
"close to the original integer as possible.\n"
"Likewise, [float]s can be automatically converted into [int]s. This will "
"truncate the [float], discarding anything after the floating-point.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, an [int] will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it equals [code]0[/code], and to [code]true[/code] otherwise.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var x: int = 1 # x is 1\n"
"x = 4.2 # x is 4, because 4.2 gets truncated\n"
"var max_int = 9223372036854775807 # Biggest value an int can store\n"
"max_int += 1 # max_int is -9223372036854775808, because it wrapped around\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int x = 1; // x is 1\n"
"x = (int)4.2; // x is 4, because 4.2 gets truncated\n"
"// We use long below, because GDScript's int is 64-bit while C#'s int is 32-"
"bit.\n"
"long maxLong = 9223372036854775807; // Biggest value a long can store\n"
"maxLong++; // maxLong is now -9223372036854775808, because it wrapped "
"around.\n"
"\n"
"// Alternatively with C#'s 32-bit int type, which has a smaller maximum "
"value.\n"
"int maxInt = 2147483647; // Biggest value an int can store\n"
"maxInt++; // maxInt is now -2147483648, because it wrapped around\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"You can use the [code]0b[/code] literal for binary representation, the "
"[code]0x[/code] literal for hexadecimal representation, and the [code]_[/"
"code] symbol to separate long numbers and improve readability.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var x = 0b1001 # x is 9\n"
"var y = 0xF5 # y is 245\n"
"var z = 10_000_000 # z is 10000000\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int x = 0b1001; // x is 9\n"
"int y = 0xF5; // y is 245\n"
"int z = 10_000_000; // z is 10000000\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Tipo inteiro de 64 bits com sinal. Isso significa que ele pode assumir "
"valores de [code]-2^63[/code] a [code]2^63 - 1[/code], ou seja, de "
"[code]-9223372036854775808[/code] a [code]9223372036854775807[/code]. Quando "
"excede esses limites, ele sofre um \"wrap around\" (reinicia a contagem a "
"partir do outro extremo).\n"
"[int]s podem ser convertidos automaticamente para [float]s quando "
"necessário, por exemplo, ao passá-los como argumentos em funções. O [float] "
"será o mais próximo possível do inteiro original.\n"
"Da mesma forma, [float]s podem ser convertidos automaticamente em [int]s. "
"Isso truncará o [float], descartando qualquer valor após o ponto flutuante.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em um contexto booleano, um [int] será avaliado como "
"[code]false[/code] se for igual a [code]0[/code], e como [code]true[/code] "
"caso contrário.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var x: int = 1 # x é 1\n"
"x = 4.2 # x é 4, porque 4.2 é truncado\n"
"var max_int = 9223372036854775807 # Maior valor que um int pode armazenar\n"
"max_int += 1 # max_int é -9223372036854775808, porque ele sofreu wrap "
"around\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int x = 1; // x é 1\n"
"x = (int)4.2; // x é 4, porque 4.2 é truncado\n"
"// Usamos long abaixo, porque o int do GDScript é de 64 bits, enquanto o int "
"do C# é de 32 bits.\n"
"long maxLong = 9223372036854775807; // Maior valor que um long pode "
"armazenar\n"
"maxLong++; // maxLong agora é -9223372036854775808, porque ele sofreu wrap "
"around.\n"
"\n"
"// Alternativamente com o tipo int de 32 bits do C#, que possui um valor "
"máximo menor.\n"
"int maxInt = 2147483647; // Maior valor que um int pode armazenar\n"
"maxInt++; // maxInt agora é -2147483648, porque ele sofreu wrap around\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Você pode usar o literal [code]0b[/code] para representação binária, o "
"literal [code]0x[/code] para representação hexadecimal e o símbolo [code]_[/"
"code] para separar números longos e melhorar a legibilidade.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var x = 0b1001 # x é 9\n"
"var y = 0xF5 # y é 245\n"
"var z = 10_000_000 # z é 10000000\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"int x = 0b1001; // x é 9\n"
"int y = 0xF5; // y é 245\n"
"int z = 10_000_000; // z é 10000000\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Constructs an [int] set to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr "Constrói um [int] definido como [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Constructs an [int] as a copy of the given [int]."
msgstr "Constrói um [int] como uma cópia do [int] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a new [int] from a [String], following the same rules as [method "
"String.to_int]."
msgstr ""
"Constrói um novo [int] a partir de uma [String], seguindo as mesmas regras "
"de [method String.to_int]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a new [int] from a [bool]. [code]true[/code] is converted to "
"[code]1[/code] and [code]false[/code] is converted to [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Constrói um novo [int] a partir de um [bool]. [code]true[/code] é convertido "
"para [code]1[/code] e [code]false[/code] é convertido para [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a new [int] from a [float]. This will truncate the [float], "
"discarding anything after the floating point."
msgstr ""
"Constrói um novo [int] a partir de um [float]. Isso truncará o [float], "
"descartando qualquer coisa após o ponto flutuante."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is not equivalent to the [float]."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] não for equivalente ao [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int]s are not equal."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se os [int]s não forem iguais."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the remainder after dividing two [int]s. Uses truncated division, "
"which returns a negative number if the dividend is negative. If this is not "
"desired, consider using [method @GlobalScope.posmod].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(6 % 2) # Prints 0\n"
"print(11 % 4) # Prints 3\n"
"print(-5 % 3) # Prints -2\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]AND[/code] operation.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 & 0b1010) # Prints 8 (binary 1000)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This is useful for retrieving binary flags from a variable.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var flags = 0b101\n"
"# Check if the first or second bit are enabled.\n"
"if flags & 0b011:\n"
"\tdo_stuff() # This line will run.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Color] by the [int]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Color] pelo [int]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Quaternion] by the [int]. This operation "
"is not meaningful on its own, but it can be used as a part of a larger "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente do [Quaternion] pelo [int]. Esta operação não tem "
"significado por si só, mas pode ser usada como parte de uma expressão maior."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplies each component of the [Vector2] by the [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 * Vector2(1, 4)) # Prints (2, 8)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Multiplica cada componente do [Vector2] pelo [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 * Vector2(1, 4)) # Imprime (2, 8)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector2i] by the [int]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Vector2i] pelo [int]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector3] by the [int]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Vector3] pelo [int]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector3i] by the [int]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Vector3i] pelo [int]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector4] by the [int]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Vector4] pelo [int]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies each component of the [Vector4i] by the [int]."
msgstr "Multiplica cada componente do [Vector4i] pelo [int]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies the [float] by the [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "Multiplica o [float] pelo [int]. O resultado é um [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Multiplies the two [int]s."
msgstr "Multiplica os dois [int]s."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Raises an [int] to a power of a [float]. The result is a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 ** 0.5) # Prints 1.4142135623731\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Eleva um [int] à potência de um [float]. O resultado é um [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(2 ** 0.5) # Imprime 1.4142135623731\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Raises the left [int] to a power of the right [int].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(3 ** 4) # Prints 81\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Eleva o [int] da esquerda a uma potência do [int] da direita.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(3 ** 4) # Imprime 81\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Adds the [int] and the [float]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "Adiciona o [int] e o [float]. O resultado é um [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Adds the two [int]s."
msgstr "Adiciona os dois [int]s."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Subtracts the [float] from the [int]. The result is a [float]."
msgstr "Subtrai o [float] do [int]. O resultado é um [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Subtracts the two [int]s."
msgstr "Subtrai os dois [int]s."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Divides the [int] by the [float]. The result is a [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(10 / 3.0) # Prints 3.33333333333333\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Divide o [int] pelo [float]. O resultado é um [float].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(10 / 3.0) # Imprime 3.33333333333333\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Divides the two [int]s. The result is an [int]. This will truncate the "
"[float], discarding anything after the floating point.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(6 / 2) # Prints 3\n"
"print(5 / 3) # Prints 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Divide os dois [int]s. O resultado é um [int]. Isso truncará o [float], "
"descartando qualquer valor após o ponto flutuante.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(6 / 2) # Imprime 3\n"
"print(5 / 3) # Imprime 1\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is less than the [float]."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] for menor que o [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is less than the right [int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] esquerdo for menor que o [int] direito."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise shift left operation. Effectively the same as "
"multiplying by a power of 2.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1010 << 1) # Prints 20 (binary 10100)\n"
"print(0b1010 << 3) # Prints 80 (binary 1010000)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is less than or equal to the [float]."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] for menor ou igual ao [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is less than or equal to the "
"right [int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] esquerdo for menor ou igual ao [int] "
"direito."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is equal to the [float]."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] for igual ao [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the two [int]s are equal."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se os dois [int]s forem iguais."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is greater than the [float]."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] for maior que o [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is greater than the right [int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] esquerdo for maior que o [int] direito."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [int] is greater than or equal to the "
"[float]."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] for maior ou igual ao [float]."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the left [int] is greater than or equal to the "
"right [int]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [int] esquerdo for maior ou igual ao [int] "
"direito."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise shift right operation. Effectively the same as dividing "
"by a power of 2.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1010 >> 1) # Prints 5 (binary 101)\n"
"print(0b1010 >> 2) # Prints 2 (binary 10)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]XOR[/code] operation.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 ^ 0b1010) # Prints 6 (binary 110)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Realiza a operação [code]XOR[/code] bit a bit.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 ^ 0b1010) # Imprime 6 (binário 110)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the negated value of the [int]. If positive, turns the number "
"negative. If negative, turns the number positive. If zero, does nothing."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor negado do [int]. Se for positivo, torna o número negativo. "
"Se for negativo, torna o número positivo. Se for zero, não faz nada."

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]OR[/code] operation.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(0b1100 | 0b1010) # Prints 14 (binary 1110)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"This is useful for storing binary flags in a variable.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var flags = 0\n"
"flags |= 0b101 # Turn the first and third bits on.\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/int.xml
msgid ""
"Performs the bitwise [code]NOT[/code] operation on the [int]. Due to "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two%27s_complement]2's complement[/url], "
"it's effectively equal to [code]-(int + 1)[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(~4) # Prints -5\n"
"print(~(-7)) # Prints 6\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Executa a operação bit a bit [code]NOT[/code] no [int]. Devido ao "
"[url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two%27s_complement]complemento de 2[/"
"url], ela é efetivamente igual a [code]-(int + 1)[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"print(~4) # Imprime -5\n"
"print(~(-7)) # Imprime 6\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/IntervalTweener.xml
msgid "Creates an idle interval in a [Tween] animation."
msgstr "Cria um intervalo ocioso em uma animação [Tween]."

#: doc/classes/IntervalTweener.xml
msgid ""
"[IntervalTweener] is used to make delays in a tweening sequence. See [method "
"Tween.tween_interval] for more usage information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method Tween.tween_interval] is the only correct way to create "
"[IntervalTweener]. Any [IntervalTweener] created manually will not function "
"correctly."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "Internet protocol (IP) support functions such as DNS resolution."
msgstr ""
"Funções de suporte ao protocolo de internet (IP), como resolução de DNS."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"IP contains support functions for the Internet Protocol (IP). TCP/IP support "
"is in different classes (see [StreamPeerTCP] and [TCPServer]). IP provides "
"DNS hostname resolution support, both blocking and threaded."
msgstr ""
"IP contém funções de suporte para o Protocolo de Internet (IP). O suporte a "
"TCP/IP está em classes diferentes (consulte [StreamPeerTCP] e [TCPServer]). "
"IP fornece suporte a resolução de nomes de host DNS, tanto bloqueante quanto "
"por thread."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Removes all of a [param hostname]'s cached references. If no [param "
"hostname] is given, all cached IP addresses are removed."
msgstr ""
"Remove todas as referências em cache de um [param hostname]. Se nenhum "
"[param hostname] for fornecido, todos os endereços IP em cache serão "
"removidos."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a given item [param id] from the queue. This should be used to free "
"a queue after it has completed to enable more queries to happen."
msgstr ""
"Remove um determinado item [param id] da fila. Isso deve ser usado para "
"liberar uma fila após a conclusão para permitir que mais consultas ocorram."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "Returns all the user's current IPv4 and IPv6 addresses as an array."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os endereços IPv4 e IPv6 atuais do usuário como uma matriz."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all network adapters as an array.\n"
"Each adapter is a dictionary of the form:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"index\": \"1\", # Interface index.\n"
"\t\"name\": \"eth0\", # Interface name.\n"
"\t\"friendly\": \"Ethernet One\", # A friendly name (might be empty).\n"
"\t\"addresses\": [\"192.168.1.101\"], # An array of IP addresses associated "
"to this interface.\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a queued hostname's IP address, given its queue [param id]. Returns "
"an empty string on error or if resolution hasn't happened yet (see [method "
"get_resolve_item_status])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o endereço IP de um nome de host em fila, dado seu [param id] de "
"fila. Retorna uma string vazia em caso de erro ou se a resolução ainda não "
"tiver ocorrido (veja [method get_resolve_item_status])."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns resolved addresses, or an empty array if an error happened or "
"resolution didn't happen yet (see [method get_resolve_item_status])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna endereços resolvidos ou um array vazio se ocorreu um erro ou a "
"resolução ainda não aconteceu (veja [method get_resolve_item_status])."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a queued hostname's status as a [enum ResolverStatus] constant, "
"given its queue [param id]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o status do nome de host enfileirado como uma constante [enum "
"ResolverStatus], dado o seu [param id] na fila."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a given hostname's IPv4 or IPv6 address when resolved (blocking-type "
"method). The address type returned depends on the [enum Type] constant given "
"as [param ip_type]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o endereço IPv4 ou IPv6 de um determinado nome de host quando "
"resolvido (método do tipo bloqueante). O tipo de endereço retornado depende "
"da constante [enum Type] fornecida como [param ip_type]."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Resolves a given hostname in a blocking way. Addresses are returned as an "
"[Array] of IPv4 or IPv6 addresses depending on [param ip_type]."
msgstr ""
"Resolve um nome de host fornecido de forma bloqueante. Os endereços são "
"retornados como um [Array] de endereços IPv4 ou IPv6, dependendo de [param "
"ip_type]."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a queue item to resolve a hostname to an IPv4 or IPv6 address "
"depending on the [enum Type] constant given as [param ip_type]. Returns the "
"queue ID if successful, or [constant RESOLVER_INVALID_ID] on error."
msgstr ""
"Cria um item de fila para resolver um nome de host para um endereço IPv4 ou "
"IPv6 dependendo da constante [enum Type] fornecida como [param ip_type]. "
"Retorna o ID da fila se for bem-sucedido, ou [constant RESOLVER_INVALID_ID] "
"em caso de erro."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: No status."
msgstr "Status do resolvedor de nome de host DNS: Sem status."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: Waiting."
msgstr "Status do resolvedor de nome de host DNS: Aguardando."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: Done."
msgstr "Status do resolvedor de nome de host DNS: Concluído."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "DNS hostname resolver status: Error."
msgstr "Status do resolvedor de nome de host DNS: Erro."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of concurrent DNS resolver queries allowed, [constant "
"RESOLVER_INVALID_ID] is returned if exceeded."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de consultas de resolução de DNS concorrentes permitidas; "
"[constant RESOLVER_INVALID_ID] será retornado se excedido."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid ""
"Invalid ID constant. Returned if [constant RESOLVER_MAX_QUERIES] is exceeded."
msgstr ""
"Constante de ID inválido. Retornada se [constant RESOLVER_MAX_QUERIES] for "
"excedido."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "Address type: None."
msgstr "Tipo de endereço: Nenhum."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "Address type: Internet protocol version 4 (IPv4)."
msgstr "Tipo de endereço: Protocolo de Internet versão 4 (IPv4)."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "Address type: Internet protocol version 6 (IPv6)."
msgstr "Tipo de endereço: Protocolo de Internet versão 6 (IPv6)."

#: doc/classes/IP.xml
msgid "Address type: Any."
msgstr "Tipo de endereço: Qualquer."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "A vertical list of selectable items with one or multiple columns."
msgstr "Uma lista vertical de itens selecionáveis com uma ou várias colunas."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"This control provides a vertical list of selectable items that may be in a "
"single or in multiple columns, with each item having options for text and an "
"icon. Tooltips are supported and may be different for every item in the "
"list.\n"
"Selectable items in the list may be selected or deselected and multiple "
"selection may be enabled. Selection with right mouse button may also be "
"enabled to allow use of popup context menus. Items may also be \"activated\" "
"by double-clicking them or by pressing [kbd]Enter[/kbd].\n"
"Item text only supports single-line strings. Newline characters (e.g. [code]"
"\\n[/code]) in the string won't produce a newline. Text wrapping is enabled "
"in [constant ICON_MODE_TOP] mode, but the column's width is adjusted to "
"fully fit its content by default. You need to set [member "
"fixed_column_width] greater than zero to wrap the text.\n"
"All [code]set_*[/code] methods allow negative item indices, i.e. [code]-1[/"
"code] to access the last item, [code]-2[/code] to select the second-to-last "
"item, and so on.\n"
"[b]Incremental search:[/b] Like [PopupMenu] and [Tree], [ItemList] supports "
"searching within the list while the control is focused. Press a key that "
"matches the first letter of an item's name to select the first item starting "
"with the given letter. After that point, there are two ways to perform "
"incremental search: 1) Press the same key again before the timeout duration "
"to select the next item starting with the same letter. 2) Press letter keys "
"that match the rest of the word before the timeout duration to match to "
"select the item in question directly. Both of these actions will be reset to "
"the beginning of the list if the timeout duration has passed since the last "
"keystroke was registered. You can adjust the timeout duration by changing "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/incremental_search_max_interval_msec]."
msgstr ""
"Este controle fornece uma lista vertical de itens selecionáveis que podem "
"estar em uma única coluna ou em várias colunas, sendo que cada item possui "
"opções de texto e um ícone. Dicas de ferramentas (tooltips) são suportadas e "
"podem ser diferentes para cada item da lista.\n"
"Os itens selecionáveis na lista podem ser selecionados ou deselecionados, e "
"a seleção múltipla pode ser habilitada. A seleção com o botão direito do "
"mouse também pode ser habilitada para permitir o uso de menus de contexto "
"pop-up. Os itens também podem ser \"ativados\" clicando duas vezes neles ou "
"pressionando [kbd]Enter[/kbd].\n"
"O texto do item suporta apenas strings de linha única. Caracteres de nova "
"linha (por exemplo, [code]\\n[/code]) na string não produzirão uma nova "
"linha. A quebra de texto é habilitada no modo [constant ICON_MODE_TOP], mas "
"a largura da coluna é ajustada para acomodar totalmente o seu conteúdo por "
"padrão. Você precisa definir [member fixed_column_width] maior que zero para "
"quebrar o texto.\n"
"Todos os métodos [code]set_*[/code] permitem índices de itens negativos, ou "
"seja, [code]-1[/code] para acessar o último item, [code]-2[/code] para "
"selecionar o penúltimo item, e assim por diante.\n"
"[b]Busca incremental:[/b] Assim como o [PopupMenu] e o [Tree], o [ItemList] "
"suporta busca dentro da lista enquanto o controle está focado. Pressione uma "
"tecla que corresponda à primeira letra do nome de um item para selecionar o "
"primeiro item que começa com a letra fornecida. A partir desse ponto, "
"existem duas maneiras de realizar a busca incremental: 1) Pressione a mesma "
"tecla novamente antes do tempo limite para selecionar o próximo item que "
"começa com a mesma letra. 2) Pressione teclas de letras que correspondam ao "
"resto da palavra antes do tempo limite para selecionar o item em questão "
"diretamente. Ambas as ações serão redefinidas para o início da lista se o "
"tempo limite tiver passado desde que a última tecla foi registrada. Você "
"pode ajustar a duração do tempo limite alterando [member ProjectSettings.gui/"
"timers/incremental_search_max_interval_msec]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an item to the item list with no text, only an icon. Returns the index "
"of an added item."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um item à lista de itens sem texto, apenas com um ícone. Retorna o "
"índice de um item adicionado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an item to the item list with specified text. Returns the index of an "
"added item.\n"
"Specify an [param icon], or use [code]null[/code] as the [param icon] for a "
"list item with no icon.\n"
"If [param selectable] is [code]true[/code], the list item will be selectable."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Ensures the currently selected item (the first selected item if multiple "
"selection is enabled) is visible, adjusting the scroll position as necessary "
"to place the item at the center of the list if possible. See also [method "
"ensure_current_is_visible].\n"
"Fails and prints an error if both arguments are [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Removes all items from the list."
msgstr "Remove todos os itens da lista."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Ensures the item associated with the specified index is not selected."
msgstr ""
"Garante que o item associado ao índice especificado não esteja selecionado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Ensures there are no items selected."
msgstr "Garante que não há nenhum item selecionado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Ensures the currently selected item (the first selected item if multiple "
"selection is enabled) is visible, adjusting the scroll position as "
"necessary. See also [method center_on_current]."
msgstr ""
"Garante que o item atualmente selecionado (o primeiro item selecionado se a "
"seleção múltipla estiver ativada) esteja visível, ajustando a posição de "
"rolagem conforme necessário. Consulte também [method center_on_current]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Forces an update to the list size based on its items. This happens "
"automatically whenever size of the items, or other relevant settings like "
"[member auto_height], change. The method can be used to trigger the update "
"ahead of next drawing pass."
msgstr ""
"Força uma atualização no tamanho da lista com base em seus itens. Isso "
"acontece automaticamente sempre que o tamanho dos itens ou outras "
"configurações relevantes, como [member auto_height], mudam. O método pode "
"ser usado para acionar a atualização antes da próxima etapa de desenho."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the horizontal scrollbar.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the item index at the given [param position].\n"
"When there is no item at that point, -1 will be returned if [param exact] is "
"[code]true[/code], and the closest item index will be returned otherwise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value is unreliable if called right after "
"modifying the [ItemList], before it redraws in the next frame."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns item's auto translate mode."
msgstr "Retorna o modo de tradução automática do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the custom background color of the item specified by [param idx] "
"index."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a cor de fundo personalizada do item especificado pelo índice [param "
"idx]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the custom foreground color of the item specified by [param idx] "
"index."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a cor de primeiro plano personalizada do item especificado pelo "
"índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns the icon associated with the specified index."
msgstr "Retorna o ícone associado ao índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns a [Color] modulating item's icon at the specified index."
msgstr "Retorna um [Color] que modula o ícone do item no índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the region of item's icon used. The whole icon will be used if the "
"region has no area."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a região do ícone do item usada. O ícone inteiro será usado se a "
"região não tiver área."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml doc/classes/TreeItem.xml
msgid "Returns item's text language code."
msgstr "Retorna o código de idioma do texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns the metadata value of the specified index."
msgstr "Retorna o valor de metadados do índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the position and size of the item with the specified index, in the "
"coordinate system of the [ItemList] node. If [param expand] is [code]true[/"
"code] the last column expands to fill the rest of the row.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value is unreliable if called right after "
"modifying the [ItemList], before it redraws in the next frame."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns the text associated with the specified index."
msgstr "Retorna o texto associado ao índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml doc/classes/TreeItem.xml
msgid "Returns item's text base writing direction."
msgstr "Retorna a direção base de escrita do texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns the tooltip hint associated with the specified index."
msgstr "Retorna a dica de ferramenta associada ao índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns an array with the indexes of the selected items."
msgstr "Retorna uma matriz com os índices dos itens selecionados."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the vertical scrollbar.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member CanvasItem.visible] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if one or more items are selected."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se um ou mais itens estiverem selecionados."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the specified index is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o item no índice especificado estiver "
"desativado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item icon will be drawn transposed, i.e. "
"the X and Y axes are swapped."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o ícone do item for desenhado transposto, ou "
"seja, os eixos X e Y são invertidos."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the specified index is selectable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o item no índice especificado for selecionável."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the tooltip is enabled for specified item index."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a dica de ferramenta estiver ativada para o "
"índice de item especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the specified index is currently "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o item no índice especificado estiver "
"selecionado no momento."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Moves item from index [param from_idx] to [param to_idx]."
msgstr "Move o item do índice [param from_idx] para [param to_idx]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Removes the item specified by [param idx] index from the list."
msgstr "Remove o item especificado pelo índice [param idx] da lista."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Selects the item at the specified index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does not trigger the item selection signal."
msgstr ""
"Seleciona o item no índice especificado.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método não aciona o sinal de seleção do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the auto translate mode of the item associated with the specified "
"index.\n"
"Items use [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT] by default, which uses "
"the same auto translate mode as the [ItemList] itself."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the background color of the item specified by [param idx] index to the "
"specified [Color]."
msgstr ""
"Define a cor de fundo do item especificado pelo índice [param idx] para a "
"[Color] especificada."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the foreground color of the item specified by [param idx] index to the "
"specified [Color]."
msgstr ""
"Define a cor de primeiro plano do item especificado pelo índice [param idx] "
"para a [Color] especificada."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Disables (or enables) the item at the specified index.\n"
"Disabled items cannot be selected and do not trigger activation signals "
"(when double-clicking or pressing [kbd]Enter[/kbd])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Sets (or replaces) the icon's [Texture2D] associated with the specified "
"index."
msgstr ""
"Define (ou substitui) a [Texture2D] do ícone associada ao índice "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a modulating [Color] of the item associated with the specified index."
msgstr ""
"Define um [Color] de modulação do item associado ao índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the region of item's icon used. The whole icon will be used if the "
"region has no area."
msgstr ""
"Define a região do ícone do item usada. O ícone inteiro será usado se a "
"região não tiver área."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Sets whether the item icon will be drawn transposed."
msgstr "Define se o ícone do item será desenhado transposto."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the language code of the text for the item at the given index to [param "
"language]. This is used for line-breaking and text shaping algorithms. If "
"[param language] is empty, the current locale is used."
msgstr ""
"Define o código de idioma do texto para o item no índice fornecido como "
"[param language]. Isso é usado para algoritmos de quebra de linha e "
"formatação de texto. Se [param language] estiver vazio, a localidade atual "
"será usada."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a value (of any type) to be stored with the item associated with the "
"specified index."
msgstr ""
"Define um valor (de qualquer tipo) a ser armazenado com o item associado ao "
"índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Allows or disallows selection of the item associated with the specified "
"index."
msgstr "Permite ou proíbe a seleção do item associado ao índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Sets text of the item associated with the specified index."
msgstr "Define o texto do item associado ao índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml doc/classes/TreeItem.xml
msgid "Sets item's text base writing direction."
msgstr "Define a direção base de escrita do texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Sets the tooltip hint for the item associated with the specified index."
msgstr ""
"Define a dica de ferramenta para o item associado ao índice especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Sets whether the tooltip hint is enabled for specified item index."
msgstr ""
"Define se a dica de ferramenta está ativada para o índice de item "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Sorts items in the list by their text."
msgstr "Classifica os itens na lista pelo texto deles."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the currently selected item can be selected again."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o item selecionado atualmente pode ser selecionado "
"novamente."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], right mouse button click can select items."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o clique do botão direito do mouse pode selecionar "
"itens."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows navigating the [ItemList] with letter keys "
"through incremental search."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite navegar pelo [ItemList] com teclas de letras "
"por meio de busca incremental."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the control will automatically resize the height to "
"fit its content."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o controle redimensionará automaticamente a altura "
"para caber em seu conteúdo."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the control will automatically resize the width to fit "
"its content."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o controle redimensionará automaticamente a largura "
"para ajustar seu conteúdo."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"The width all columns will be adjusted to.\n"
"A value of zero disables the adjustment, each item will have a width equal "
"to the width of its content and the columns will have an uneven width."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"The size all icons will be adjusted to.\n"
"If either X or Y component is not greater than zero, icon size won't be "
"affected."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"The icon position, whether above or to the left of the text. See the [enum "
"IconMode] constants."
msgstr ""
"A posição do ícone, se acima ou à esquerda do texto. Veja as constantes "
"[enum IconMode]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"The scale of icon applied after [member fixed_icon_size] and transposing "
"takes effect."
msgstr ""
"A escala do ícone aplicada após [member fixed_icon_size] e a transposição "
"entrarem em vigor."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/MenuButton.xml
#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "The number of items currently in the list."
msgstr "O número de itens atualmente na lista."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/MenuButton.xml
#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the item at [code]index[/code] is disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/MenuButton.xml
#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"The icon of the item at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the item at [code]index[/code] is selectable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/MenuButton.xml
#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"The text of the item at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. item_count - 1[/"
"code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum columns the list will have.\n"
"If greater than zero, the content will be split among the specified "
"columns.\n"
"A value of zero means unlimited columns, i.e. all items will be put in the "
"same row."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum lines of text allowed in each item. Space will be reserved even when "
"there is not enough lines of text to display.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property takes effect only when [member icon_mode] is "
"[constant ICON_MODE_TOP]. To make the text wrap, [member fixed_column_width] "
"should be greater than zero."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Whether all columns will have the same width.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the width is equal to the largest column width of all "
"columns."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid ""
"The way which scroll hints (indicators that show that the content can still "
"be scrolled in a certain direction) will be shown."
msgstr ""
"A forma como as dicas de rolagem (indicadores que mostram que o conteúdo "
"ainda pode ser rolado em uma determinada direção) serão exibidas."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Allows single or multiple item selection. See the [enum SelectMode] "
"constants."
msgstr ""
"Permite seleção de item única ou múltipla. Consulte as constantes de [enum "
"SelectMode]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"The clipping behavior when the text exceeds an item's bounding rectangle."
msgstr ""
"O comportamento de recorte quando o texto excede o retângulo delimitador de "
"um item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
#: doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the scroll hint texture will be tiled instead of "
"stretched. See [member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a textura de dica de rolagem será colocada em "
"ladrilhos em vez de esticada. Veja [member scroll_hint_mode]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the control will automatically move items into a new "
"row to fit its content. See also [HFlowContainer] for this behavior.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the control will add a horizontal scrollbar to make "
"all items visible."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when any mouse click is issued within the rect of the list but on "
"empty space.\n"
"[param at_position] is the click position in this control's local coordinate "
"system."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when specified list item is activated via double-clicking or by "
"pressing [kbd]Enter[/kbd]."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o item de lista especificado é ativado por clique duplo ou "
"pressionando [kbd]Enter[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when specified list item has been clicked with any mouse button.\n"
"[param at_position] is the click position in this control's local coordinate "
"system."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when specified item has been selected. Only applicable in single "
"selection mode.\n"
"[member allow_reselect] must be enabled to reselect an item."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a multiple selection is altered on a list allowing multiple "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma seleção múltipla é alterada em uma lista que permite "
"seleção múltipla."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Icon is drawn above the text."
msgstr "O ícone é desenhado por cima do texto."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Icon is drawn to the left of the text."
msgstr "O ícone é desenhado à esquerda do texto."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Only allow selecting a single item."
msgstr "Permite que somente um item seja selecionado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"Allows selecting multiple items by holding [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] or [kbd]Shift[/"
"kbd]."
msgstr ""
"Permite selecionar vários itens mantendo pressionado [kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] ou "
"[kbd]Shift[/kbd]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Allows selecting multiple items by toggling them on and off."
msgstr ""
"Permite selecionar vários itens alternando-os entre ligados e desligados."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/ScrollContainer.xml
#: doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Scroll hints will never be shown."
msgstr "As dicas de rolagem nunca serão mostradas."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Scroll hints will be shown at the top and bottom."
msgstr "Dicas de rolagem serão mostradas na parte superior e inferior."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Only the top scroll hint will be shown."
msgstr "Apenas a dica de rolagem superior será exibida."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Only the bottom scroll hint will be shown."
msgstr "Apenas a dica de rolagem inferior será exibida."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Default text [Color] of the item."
msgstr "[Color] padrão do texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Text [Color] used when the item is hovered and not selected yet."
msgstr ""
"[Color] do texto usada quando o item está com o cursor sobre ele e ainda não "
"foi selecionado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Text [Color] used when the item is hovered and selected."
msgstr ""
"[Color] do texto usado quando o item está com o cursor por cima e "
"selecionado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "The tint of text outline of the item."
msgstr "O tom do contorno do texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "Text [Color] used when the item is selected, but not hovered."
msgstr ""
"[Color] do texto usada quando o item está selecionado, mas sem o cursor "
"sobre ele."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"[Color] of the guideline. The guideline is a line drawn between each row of "
"items."
msgstr ""
"[Color] da linha guia. A linha guia é uma linha desenhada entre cada linha "
"de itens."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "[Color] used to modulate the [theme_item scroll_hint] texture."
msgstr "[Color] usada para modular a textura [theme_item scroll_hint]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "The horizontal spacing between items."
msgstr "O espaço horizontal entre os itens."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "The spacing between item's icon and text."
msgstr "O espaço entre o ícone e o texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "The vertical spacing between each line of text."
msgstr "O espaço vertical entre cada linha de texto."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the item text outline.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a font with [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] enabled, its [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the value of "
"[theme_item outline_size] for outline rendering to look correct. Otherwise, "
"the outline may appear to be cut off earlier than intended."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "The vertical spacing between items."
msgstr "O espaço vertical entre os itens."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "[Font] of the item's text."
msgstr "[Font] do texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid "Font size of the item's text."
msgstr "Tamanho da fonte do texto do item."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml doc/classes/Tree.xml
msgid ""
"The indicator that will be shown when the content can still be scrolled. See "
"[member scroll_hint_mode]."
msgstr ""
"O indicador que será exibido quando o conteúdo ainda puder ser rolado. "
"Consulte [member scroll_hint_mode]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "[StyleBox] used for the cursor, when the [ItemList] is being focused."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] usado para o cursor, quando o [ItemList] está recebendo foco."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used for the cursor, when the [ItemList] is not being focused."
msgstr "[StyleBox] usado para o cursor, quando o [ItemList] não está focado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "The focused style for the [ItemList], drawn on top of everything."
msgstr "O estilo com foco para o [ItemList], desenhado por cima de tudo."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "[StyleBox] for the hovered, but not selected items."
msgstr "[StyleBox] para os itens com o cursor por cima, mas não selecionados."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the hovered and selected items, used when the [ItemList] is "
"not being focused."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] para os itens com o cursor sobre eles e selecionados, usado "
"quando o [ItemList] não está focado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the hovered and selected items, used when the [ItemList] is "
"being focused."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] para os itens com o cursor sobre eles e selecionados, usado "
"quando o [ItemList] está focado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid "The background style for the [ItemList]."
msgstr "O estilo de fundo para o [ItemList]."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the selected items, used when the [ItemList] is not being "
"focused."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] para os itens selecionados, usado quando o [ItemList] não está "
"focado."

#: doc/classes/ItemList.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the selected items, used when the [ItemList] is being focused."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] para os itens selecionados, usado quando o [ItemList] está focado."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"A [SkeletonModifier3D] to approach the goal by repeating small rotations."
msgstr ""
"Um [SkeletonModifier3D] para se aproximar do objetivo repetindo pequenas "
"rotações."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Base class of [SkeletonModifier3D] to approach the goal by repeating small "
"rotations.\n"
"Each bone chain (setting) has one effector, which is processed in order of "
"the setting list. You can set some limitations for each joint.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] All the methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] "
"parameter. This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if "
"the IK has multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/target_node[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the joint limitation at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a limitação da junta em [param joint] na lista de juntas da cadeia "
"de ossos."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the joint limitation right axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's "
"joint list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o eixo direito de limitação de junta em [param joint] na lista de "
"juntas da cadeia de ossos."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the joint limitation right axis vector at [param joint] in the bone "
"chain's joint list.\n"
"If [method get_joint_limitation_right_axis] is [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.SECONDARY_DIRECTION_NONE], this method returns "
"[code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the joint limitation rotation offset at [param joint] in the bone "
"chain's joint list.\n"
"Rotation is done in the local space which is constructed by the bone "
"direction (in general parent to child) as the +Y axis and [method "
"get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] as the +X axis.\n"
"If the +X and +Y axes are not orthogonal, the +X axis is implicitly modified "
"to make it orthogonal.\n"
"Also, if the length of [method get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] is "
"zero, the space is created by rotating the reference pose using the shortest "
"arc that rotates the +Y axis of the reference pose to match the bone "
"direction.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before processing "
"IK."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o eixo de rotação em [param joint] na lista de juntas da cadeia de "
"ossos."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the rotation axis vector for the specified joint in the bone chain. "
"This vector represents the axis around which the joint can rotate. It is "
"determined based on the rotation axis set for the joint.\n"
"If [method get_joint_rotation_axis] is [constant "
"SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL], this method returns [code]Vector3(0, "
"0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml doc/classes/TwoBoneIK3D.xml
msgid "Returns the target node that the end bone is trying to reach."
msgstr "Retorna o nó de destino que o osso final está tentando alcançar."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the joint limitation at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list."
msgstr ""
"Define a limitação da junta em [param joint] na lista de juntas da cadeia de "
"ossos."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the joint limitation right axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's "
"joint list."
msgstr ""
"Define o eixo direito de limitação de junta em [param joint] na lista de "
"juntas da cadeia de ossos."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the optional joint limitation right axis vector at [param joint] in the "
"bone chain's joint list."
msgstr ""
"Define o vetor opcional do eixo direito de limitação de junta em [param "
"joint] na lista de juntas da cadeia de ossos."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the joint limitation rotation offset at [param joint] in the bone "
"chain's joint list.\n"
"Rotation is done in the local space which is constructed by the bone "
"direction (in general parent to child) as the +Y axis and [method "
"get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] as the +X axis.\n"
"If the +X and +Y axes are not orthogonal, the +X axis is implicitly modified "
"to make it orthogonal.\n"
"Also, if the length of [method get_joint_limitation_right_axis_vector] is "
"zero, the space is created by rotating the reference pose using the shortest "
"arc that rotates the +Y axis of the reference pose to match the bone "
"direction.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before processing "
"IK."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis at [param joint] in the bone chain's joint list.\n"
"The axes are based on the reference pose's space, if [param axis] is "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_CUSTOM], you can specify any "
"axis.\n"
"In here, the reference pose is the bone pose immediately before processing "
"IK.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The rotation axis and the forward vector shouldn't be colinear "
"to avoid unintended rotation since [ChainIK3D] does not factor in twisting "
"forces."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml doc/classes/SpringBoneSimulator3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the rotation axis vector for the specified joint in the bone chain.\n"
"This vector is normalized by an internal process and represents the axis "
"around which the bone chain can rotate.\n"
"If the vector length is [code]0[/code], it is considered synonymous with "
"[constant SkeletonModifier3D.ROTATION_AXIS_ALL]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml doc/classes/TwoBoneIK3D.xml
msgid "Sets the target node that the end bone is trying to reach."
msgstr "Define o nó de destino que o osso final está tentando alcançar."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum amount each bone can rotate in a single iteration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This limitation is applied during each iteration. For example, "
"if [member max_iterations] is [code]4[/code] and [member "
"angular_delta_limit] is [code]5[/code] degrees, the maximum rotation "
"possible in a single frame is [code]20[/code] degrees."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], the result is calculated from the previous frame's "
"[IterateIK3D] result as the initial state.\n"
"If [code]true[/code], the previous frame's [IterateIK3D] result is "
"discarded. At this point, the new result is calculated from the bone pose "
"excluding the [IterateIK3D] as the initial state. This means the result will "
"be always equal as long as the target position and the previous bone pose "
"are the same. However, if [member angular_delta_limit] and [member "
"max_iterations] are set too small, the end bone of the chain will never "
"reach the target."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"The number of iteration loops used by the IK solver to produce more accurate "
"results."
msgstr ""
"O número de loops de iteração usados pelo solucionador de IK para produzir "
"resultados mais precisos."

#: doc/classes/IterateIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum distance between the end bone and the target. If the distance is "
"below this value, the IK solver stops any further iterations."
msgstr ""
"A distância mínima entre o osso final e o alvo. Se a distância estiver "
"abaixo desse valor, o resolvedor de IK para quaisquer iterações adicionais."

#: doc/classes/JacobianIK3D.xml
msgid "Jacobian transpose based inverse kinematics solver."
msgstr "Solver de cinemática inversa baseado em transposição jacobiana."

#: doc/classes/JacobianIK3D.xml
msgid ""
"[JacobianIK3D] calculates rotations for all joints simultaneously, producing "
"natural and smooth movement. It is particularly suited for biological "
"animations.\n"
"The resulting twist around the forward vector will always be kept from the "
"previous pose.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It converges more slowly than other IK solvers, leading to "
"gentler and less immediate tracking of targets."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaClass.xml
msgid "Represents a class from the Java Native Interface."
msgstr "Representa uma classe da Java Native Interface."

#: doc/classes/JavaClass.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a class from the Java Native Interface. It is returned from "
"[method JavaClassWrapper.wrap].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class only works on Android. On any other platform, this "
"class does nothing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not to be confused with [JavaScriptObject]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaClass.xml
msgid "Returns the Java class name."
msgstr "Retorna o nome da classe Java."

#: doc/classes/JavaClass.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the object's Java methods and their signatures as an [Array] of "
"dictionaries, in the same format as [method Object.get_method_list]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os métodos Java do objeto e suas assinaturas como um [Array] de "
"dicionários, no mesmo formato que [method Object.get_method_list]."

#: doc/classes/JavaClass.xml
msgid "Returns a [JavaClass] representing the Java parent class of this class."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [JavaClass] representando a classe pai em Java desta classe."

#: doc/classes/JavaClass.xml doc/classes/JavaObject.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param method] name exists in the "
"object's Java methods."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nome do [param method] fornecido existir nos "
"métodos Java do objeto."

#: doc/classes/JavaClassWrapper.xml
msgid "Provides access to the Java Native Interface."
msgstr "Fornece acesso à Java Native Interface."

#: doc/classes/JavaClassWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"The JavaClassWrapper singleton provides a way for the Godot application to "
"send and receive data through the [url=https://developer.android.com/"
"training/articles/perf-jni]Java Native Interface[/url] (JNI).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This singleton is only available in Android builds.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var LocalDateTime = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"java.time.LocalDateTime\")\n"
"var DateTimeFormatter = "
"JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"java.time.format.DateTimeFormatter\")\n"
"\n"
"var datetime = LocalDateTime.now()\n"
"var formatter = DateTimeFormatter.ofPattern(\"dd-MM-yyyy HH:mm:ss\")\n"
"\n"
"print(datetime.format(formatter))\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] When calling Java methods, be sure to check [method "
"JavaClassWrapper.get_exception] to check if the method threw an exception."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaClassWrapper.xml
msgid "Integrating with Android APIs"
msgstr "Integrando com APIs do Android"

#: doc/classes/JavaClassWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a [JavaObject] implementing the given Java interfaces using the "
"given [Object] as the implementation.\n"
"The [param object] must contain methods signatures matching the methods "
"signatures from the passed Java [param interfaces]. Invoking methods from "
"the Java [param interfaces] will route to the matching [param object] "
"method.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"class PrintProxy:\n"
"\tfunc println(content: String) -> void:\n"
"\t\tprint(content)\n"
"\n"
"var print_proxy = PrintProxy.new()\n"
"var printer_object = JavaClassWrapper.create_proxy(print_proxy, "
"[\"android.util.Printer\"])\n"
"printer_object.println(\"Hello Godot World!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, "
"this method will always return [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaClassWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a [JavaObject] implementing the Java Single Abstract Method (SAM) "
"interface using the Godot [Callable] as the implementation.\n"
"The [param sam_interface] [b]must be[/b] a Java SAM interface, meaning it "
"must only have a single abstract method to implement.\n"
"The [param callable] must be able to handle the same parameter types as the "
"SAM interface method, and must provide the same return type. The [param "
"callable] will be invoked as a callback, passing the arguments from the Java "
"SAM interface method.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var cb = func (content: String) -> void:\n"
"\tprint(content)\n"
"var callback = "
"JavaClassWrapper.create_sam_callback(\"android.util.Printer\", cb)\n"
"callback.println(\"Hello Godot World!\")\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, "
"this method will always return [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaClassWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the Java exception from the last call into a Java class. If there "
"was no exception, it will return [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, "
"this method will always return [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a exceção Java da última chamada a uma classe Java. Se não houve "
"nenhuma exceção, retornará [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método funciona apenas no Android. Em todas as outras "
"plataformas, este método sempre retornará [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/JavaClassWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Wraps a class defined in Java, and returns it as a [JavaClass] [Object] type "
"that Godot can interact with.\n"
"When wrapping inner (nested) classes, use [code]$[/code] instead of [code].[/"
"code] to separate them. For example, "
"[code]JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"android.view.WindowManager$LayoutParams\")[/"
"code] wraps the [b]WindowManager.LayoutParams[/b] class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To invoke a constructor, call a method with the same name as "
"the class. For example:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var Intent = JavaClassWrapper.wrap(\"android.content.Intent\")\n"
"var intent = Intent.Intent()\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works on Android. On every other platform, "
"this method does nothing and returns an empty [JavaClass]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaObject.xml
msgid "Represents an object from the Java Native Interface."
msgstr "Representa um objeto da Java Native Interface."

#: doc/classes/JavaObject.xml
msgid ""
"Represents an object from the Java Native Interface. It can be returned from "
"Java methods called on [JavaClass] or other [JavaObject]s. See "
"[JavaClassWrapper] for an example.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class only works on Android. On any other platform, this "
"class does nothing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not to be confused with [JavaScriptObject]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaObject.xml
msgid "Returns the [JavaClass] that this object is an instance of."
msgstr "Retorna a [JavaClass] da qual este objeto é uma instância."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Singleton that connects the engine with the browser's JavaScript context in "
"Web export."
msgstr ""
"Singleton que conecta o mecanismo ao contexto JavaScript do navegador na "
"exportação Web."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"The JavaScriptBridge singleton is implemented only in the Web export. It's "
"used to access the browser's JavaScript context. This allows interaction "
"with embedding pages or calling third-party JavaScript APIs.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This singleton can be disabled at build-time to improve "
"security. By default, the JavaScriptBridge singleton is enabled. Official "
"export templates also have the JavaScriptBridge singleton enabled. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/engine_details/development/compiling/"
"compiling_for_web.html]Compiling for the Web[/url] in the documentation for "
"more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid "The JavaScriptBridge singleton"
msgstr "O singleton JavaScriptBridge"

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a reference to a [Callable] that can be used as a callback by "
"JavaScript. The reference must be kept until the callback happens, or it "
"won't be called at all. See [JavaScriptObject] for usage.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The callback function must take exactly one [Array] argument, "
"which is going to be the JavaScript [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/arguments]arguments object[/url] "
"converted to an array."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new JavaScript object using the [code]new[/code] constructor. The "
"[param object] must a valid property of the JavaScript [code]window[/code]. "
"See [JavaScriptObject] for usage."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo objeto JavaScript usando o construtor [code]new[/code]. O "
"[param object] deve ser uma propriedade válida do [code]window[/code] do "
"JavaScript. Consulte [JavaScriptObject] para uso."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Prompts the user to download a file containing the specified [param buffer]. "
"The file will have the given [param name] and [param mime] type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The browser may override the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Media_type]MIME type[/url] provided based on the file [param name]'s "
"extension.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Browsers might block the download if [method download_buffer] "
"is not being called from a user interaction (e.g. button click).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Browsers might ask the user for permission or block the "
"download if multiple download requests are made in a quick succession."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Execute the string [param code] as JavaScript code within the browser "
"window. This is a call to the actual global JavaScript function [code skip-"
"lint]eval()[/code].\n"
"If [param use_global_execution_context] is [code]true[/code], the code will "
"be evaluated in the global execution context. Otherwise, it is evaluated in "
"the execution context of a function within the engine's runtime environment."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Force synchronization of the persistent file system (when enabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only useful for modules or extensions that can't use "
"[FileAccess] to write files."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an interface to a JavaScript object that can be used by scripts. The "
"[param interface] must be a valid property of the JavaScript [code]window[/"
"code]. The callback must accept a single [Array] argument, which will "
"contain the JavaScript [code]arguments[/code]. See [JavaScriptObject] for "
"usage."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma interface para um objeto JavaScript que pode ser usado por "
"scripts. O [param interface] deve ser uma propriedade válida do "
"[code]window[/code] do JavaScript. O retorno de chamada deve aceitar um "
"único argumento [Array], que conterá os [code]arguments[/code] do "
"JavaScript. Veja [JavaScriptObject] para uso."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param javascript_object] is of type "
"[url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/"
"Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer]ArrayBuffer[/url], [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"DataView]DataView[/url], or one of the many [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"TypedArray]typed array objects[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param javascript_object] fornecido for do "
"tipo [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/"
"Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer]ArrayBuffer[/url], [url=https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"DataView]DataView[/url] ou um dos vários [url=https://developer.mozilla.org/"
"en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/TypedArray]objetos de "
"array tipado[/url]."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of [param javascript_buffer]'s contents as a "
"[PackedByteArray]. See also [method is_js_buffer]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma cópia do conteúdo de [param javascript_buffer] como um "
"[PackedByteArray]. Consulte também [method is_js_buffer]."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a new version of the progressive web app is "
"waiting to be activated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only relevant when exported as a Progressive Web App."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Performs the live update of the progressive web app. Forcing the new version "
"to be installed and the page to be reloaded.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Your application will be [b]reloaded in all browser tabs[/b].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only relevant when exported as a Progressive Web App and "
"[method pwa_needs_update] returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptBridge.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when an update for this progressive web app has been detected but is "
"waiting to be activated because a previous version is active. See [method "
"pwa_update] to force the update to take place immediately."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando uma atualização para este aplicativo web progressivo foi "
"detectada, mas está aguardando para ser ativada porque uma versão anterior "
"está ativa. Consulte [method pwa_update] para forçar a atualização a ocorrer "
"imediatamente."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptObject.xml
msgid "A wrapper class for web native JavaScript objects."
msgstr "Uma classe wrapper para objetos JavaScript nativos da Web."

#: doc/classes/JavaScriptObject.xml
msgid ""
"JavaScriptObject is used to interact with JavaScript objects retrieved or "
"created via [method JavaScriptBridge.get_interface], [method "
"JavaScriptBridge.create_object], or [method "
"JavaScriptBridge.create_callback].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"var _my_js_callback = JavaScriptBridge.create_callback(myCallback) # This "
"reference must be kept\n"
"var console = JavaScriptBridge.get_interface(\"console\")\n"
"\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tvar buf = JavaScriptBridge.create_object(\"ArrayBuffer\", 10) # new "
"ArrayBuffer(10)\n"
"\tprint(buf) # Prints [JavaScriptObject:OBJECT_ID]\n"
"\tvar uint8arr = JavaScriptBridge.create_object(\"Uint8Array\", buf) # new "
"Uint8Array(buf)\n"
"\tuint8arr[1] = 255\n"
"\tprints(uint8arr[1], uint8arr.byteLength) # Prints \"255 10\"\n"
"\n"
"\t# Prints \"Uint8Array(10) [ 0, 255, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0 ]\" in the "
"browser's console.\n"
"\tconsole.log(uint8arr)\n"
"\n"
"\t# Equivalent of JavaScriptBridge: "
"Array.from(uint8arr).forEach(myCallback)\n"
"\tJavaScriptBridge.get_interface(\"Array\").from(uint8arr).forEach(_my_js_callback)\n"
"\n"
"func myCallback(args):\n"
"\t# Will be called with the parameters passed to the \"forEach\" callback\n"
"\t# [0, 0, [JavaScriptObject:1173]]\n"
"\t# [255, 1, [JavaScriptObject:1173]]\n"
"\t# ...\n"
"\t# [0, 9, [JavaScriptObject:1180]]\n"
"\tprint(args)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only available in the Web platform."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JNISingleton.xml
msgid ""
"Singleton that connects the engine with Android plugins to interface with "
"native Android code."
msgstr ""
"Singleton que conecta o motor com plugins do Android para fazer interface "
"com o código nativo do Android."

#: doc/classes/JNISingleton.xml
msgid ""
"The JNISingleton is implemented only in the Android export. It's used to "
"call methods and connect signals from an Android plugin written in Java or "
"Kotlin. Methods and signals can be called and connected to the JNISingleton "
"as if it is a Node. See [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Java_Native_Interface]Java Native Interface - Wikipedia[/url] for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"O JNISingleton é implementado apenas na exportação para Android. Ele é usado "
"para chamar métodos e conectar sinais de um plugin do Android escrito em "
"Java ou Kotlin. Métodos e sinais podem ser chamados e conectados ao "
"JNISingleton como se ele fosse um Nó. Veja [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Java_Native_Interface]Java Native Interface - Wikipedia[/url] para mais "
"informações."

#: doc/classes/JNISingleton.xml
msgid "Creating Android plugins"
msgstr "Criando plugins para Android"

#: doc/classes/JNISingleton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param method] name exists in the "
"JNISingleton's Java methods."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nome do [param method] fornecido existe nos "
"métodos Java do JNISingleton."

#: doc/classes/Joint2D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for all 2D physics joints."
msgstr "Classe base abstrata para todas as articulações de física 2D."

#: doc/classes/Joint2D.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all joints in 2D physics. 2D joints bind together "
"two physics bodies ([member node_a] and [member node_b]) and apply a "
"constraint."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstrata para todas as juntas em física 2D. As juntas 2D unem "
"dois corpos físicos ([member node_a] e [member node_b]) e aplicam uma "
"restrição."

#: doc/classes/Joint2D.xml
msgid "Returns the joint's internal [RID] from the [PhysicsServer2D]."
msgstr "Retorna o [RID] interno da junta do [PhysicsServer2D]."

#: doc/classes/Joint2D.xml
msgid ""
"When [member node_a] and [member node_b] move in different directions the "
"[member bias] controls how fast the joint pulls them back to their original "
"position. The lower the [member bias] the more the two bodies can pull on "
"the joint.\n"
"When set to [code]0[/code], the default value from [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/2d/solver/default_constraint_bias] is used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Joint2D.xml doc/classes/Joint3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the two bodies bound together do not collide with each "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os dois corpos unidos não colidem um com o outro."

#: doc/classes/Joint2D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the first body (A) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody2D]."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para o primeiro corpo (A) anexado à articulação. O nó deve herdar "
"[PhysicsBody2D]."

#: doc/classes/Joint2D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the second body (B) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody2D]."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para o segundo corpo (B) anexado à articulação. O nó deve herdar "
"[PhysicsBody2D]."

#: doc/classes/Joint3D.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for all 3D physics joints."
msgstr "Classe base abstrata para todas as articulações de física 3D."

#: doc/classes/Joint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Abstract base class for all joints in 3D physics. 3D joints bind together "
"two physics bodies ([member node_a] and [member node_b]) and apply a "
"constraint. If only one body is defined, it is attached to a fixed "
"[StaticBody3D] without collision shapes."
msgstr ""
"Classe base abstrata para todas as juntas em física 3D. Juntas 3D unem dois "
"corpos físicos ([member node_a] e [member node_b]) e aplicam uma restrição. "
"Se apenas um corpo for definido, ele é anexado a um [StaticBody3D] fixo sem "
"formas de colisão."

#: doc/classes/Joint3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
#: doc/classes/VehicleBody3D.xml doc/classes/VehicleWheel3D.xml
msgid "3D Truck Town Demo"
msgstr "Demonstração 3D Truck Town"

#: doc/classes/Joint3D.xml
msgid "Returns the joint's internal [RID] from the [PhysicsServer3D]."
msgstr "Retorna o [RID] interno da junta do [PhysicsServer3D]."

#: doc/classes/Joint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the first node (A) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody3D].\n"
"If left empty and [member node_b] is set, the body is attached to a fixed "
"[StaticBody3D] without collision shapes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Joint3D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the second node (B) attached to the joint. The node must inherit "
"[PhysicsBody3D].\n"
"If left empty and [member node_a] is set, the body is attached to a fixed "
"[StaticBody3D] without collision shapes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Joint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The priority used to define which solver is executed first for multiple "
"joints. The lower the value, the higher the priority.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This property is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JointLimitation3D.xml
msgid "A base class of the limitation that interacts with [ChainIK3D]."
msgstr "Uma classe base da limitação que interage com [ChainIK3D]."

#: doc/classes/JointLimitation3D.xml
msgid ""
"The limitation is attached to each joint and limits the rotation of the bone."
msgstr "A limitação é anexada a cada junta e limita a rotação do osso."

#: doc/classes/JointLimitationCone3D.xml
msgid "A cone shape limitation that interacts with [ChainIK3D]."
msgstr "Uma limitação de formato de cone que interage com [ChainIK3D]."

#: doc/classes/JointLimitationCone3D.xml
msgid ""
"The radius range of the hole made by the cone.\n"
"[code]0[/code] degrees makes a sphere without hole, [code]180[/code] degrees "
"makes a hemisphere, and [code]360[/code] degrees become empty (no "
"limitation)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid "Helper class for creating and parsing JSON data."
msgstr "Classe auxiliar para criar e analisar dados JSON."

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"The [JSON] class enables all data types to be converted to and from a JSON "
"string. This is useful for serializing data, e.g. to save to a file or send "
"over the network.\n"
"[method stringify] is used to convert any data type into a JSON string.\n"
"[method parse] is used to convert any existing JSON data into a [Variant] "
"that can be used within Godot. If successfully parsed, use [member data] to "
"retrieve the [Variant], and use [method @GlobalScope.typeof] to check if the "
"Variant's type is what you expect. JSON Objects are converted into a "
"[Dictionary], but JSON data can be used to store [Array]s, numbers, "
"[String]s and even just a boolean.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data_to_send = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]\n"
"var json_string = JSON.stringify(data_to_send)\n"
"# Save data\n"
"# ...\n"
"# Retrieve data\n"
"var json = JSON.new()\n"
"var error = json.parse(json_string)\n"
"if error == OK:\n"
"\tvar data_received = json.data\n"
"\tif typeof(data_received) == TYPE_ARRAY:\n"
"\t\tprint(data_received) # Prints the array.\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Unexpected data\")\n"
"else:\n"
"\tprint(\"JSON Parse Error: \", json.get_error_message(), \" in \", "
"json_string, \" at line \", json.get_error_line())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Alternatively, you can parse strings using the static [method parse_string] "
"method, but it doesn't handle errors.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data = JSON.parse_string(json_string) # Returns null if parsing failed.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Both parse methods do not fully comply with the JSON "
"specification:\n"
"- Trailing commas in arrays or objects are ignored, instead of causing a "
"parser error.\n"
"- New line and tab characters are accepted in string literals, and are "
"treated like their corresponding escape sequences [code]\\n[/code] and [code]"
"\\t[/code].\n"
"- Numbers are parsed using [method String.to_float] which is generally more "
"lax than the JSON specification.\n"
"- Certain errors, such as invalid Unicode sequences, do not cause a parser "
"error. Instead, the string is cleaned up and an error is logged to the "
"console."
msgstr ""
"A classe [JSON] permite que todos os tipos de dados sejam convertidos para e "
"de uma string JSON. Isso é útil para serializar dados, por exemplo, para "
"salvar em um arquivo ou enviar pela rede.\n"
"O [method stringify] é usado para converter qualquer tipo de dado em uma "
"string JSON.\n"
"O [method parse] é usado para converter qualquer dado JSON existente em um "
"[Variant] que pode ser usado dentro do Godot. Se analisado com sucesso, use "
"[member data] para recuperar o [Variant] e use [method @GlobalScope.typeof] "
"para verificar se o tipo do Variant é o que você espera. Objetos JSON são "
"convertidos em um [Dictionary], mas dados JSON podem ser usados para "
"armazenar [Array]s, números, [String]s e até mesmo apenas um booleano.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data_to_send = [\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]\n"
"var json_string = JSON.stringify(data_to_send)\n"
"# Salvar dados\n"
"# ...\n"
"# Recuperar dados\n"
"var json = JSON.new()\n"
"var error = json.parse(json_string)\n"
"if error == OK:\n"
"\tvar data_received = json.data\n"
"\tif typeof(data_received) == TYPE_ARRAY:\n"
"\t\tprint(data_received) # Imprime a matriz.\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Dados inesperados\")\n"
"else:\n"
"\tprint(\"Erro de análise JSON: \", json.get_error_message(), \" em \", "
"json_string, \" na linha \", json.get_error_line())\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Alternativamente, você pode analisar strings usando o método estático "
"[method parse_string], mas ele não lida com erros.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var data = JSON.parse_string(json_string) # Retorna null se a análise "
"falhar.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ambos os métodos de análise não cumprem totalmente com a "
"especificação JSON:\n"
"- Vírgulas finais em matrizes (arrays) ou objetos são ignoradas, em vez de "
"causarem um erro de análise.\n"
"- Caracteres de nova linha e tabulação são aceitos em literais de string e "
"são tratados como suas sequências de escape correspondentes [code]\\n[/code] "
"e [code]\\t[/code].\n"
"- Os números são analisados usando [method String.to_float], que geralmente "
"é mais flexível do que a especificação JSON.\n"
"- Certos erros, como sequências Unicode inválidas, não causam um erro de "
"análise. Em vez disso, a string é limpa e um erro é registrado no console."

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Converts a native engine type to a JSON-compliant value.\n"
"By default, objects are ignored for security reasons, unless [param "
"full_objects] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"You can convert a native value to a JSON string like this:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func encode_data(value, full_objects = false):\n"
"\treturn JSON.stringify(JSON.from_native(value, full_objects))\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]0[/code] if the last call to [method parse] was successful, or "
"the line number where the parse failed."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]0[/code] se a última chamada para [method parse] foi bem-"
"sucedida, ou o número da linha onde a análise falhou."

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an empty string if the last call to [method parse] was successful, "
"or the error message if it failed."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma string vazia se a última chamada para [method parse] foi bem-"
"sucedida, ou a mensagem de erro se falhou."

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Return the text parsed by [method parse] (requires passing [code]keep_text[/"
"code] to [method parse])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o texto analisado por [method parse] (requer passar [code]keep_text[/"
"code] para [method parse])."

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Attempts to parse the [param json_text] provided.\n"
"Returns an [enum Error]. If the parse was successful, it returns [constant "
"OK] and the result can be retrieved using [member data]. If unsuccessful, "
"use [method get_error_line] and [method get_error_message] to identify the "
"source of the failure.\n"
"Non-static variant of [method parse_string], if you want custom error "
"handling.\n"
"The optional [param keep_text] argument instructs the parser to keep a copy "
"of the original text. This text can be obtained later by using the [method "
"get_parsed_text] function and is used when saving the resource (instead of "
"generating new text from [member data])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Attempts to parse the [param json_string] provided and returns the parsed "
"data. Returns [code]null[/code] if parse failed."
msgstr ""
"Tenta analisar a [param json_string] fornecida e retorna os dados "
"analisados. Retorna [code]null[/code] se a análise falhou."

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Converts a [Variant] var to JSON text and returns the result. Useful for "
"serializing data to store or send over the network.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The JSON specification does not define integer or float types, "
"but only a [i]number[/i] type. Therefore, converting a Variant to JSON text "
"will convert all numerical values to [float] types.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [param full_precision] is [code]true[/code], when "
"stringifying floats, the unreliable digits are stringified in addition to "
"the reliable digits to guarantee exact decoding.\n"
"The [param indent] parameter controls if and how something is indented; its "
"contents will be used where there should be an indent in the output. Even "
"spaces like [code]\"   \"[/code] will work. [code]\\t[/code] and [code]\\n[/"
"code] can also be used for a tab indent, or to make a newline for each "
"indent respectively.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Non-finite numbers are not supported in JSON. Any "
"occurrences of [constant @GDScript.INF] will be replaced with [code]1e99999[/"
"code], and negative [constant @GDScript.INF] will be replaced with "
"[code]-1e99999[/code], but they will be interpreted correctly as infinity by "
"most JSON parsers. [constant @GDScript.NAN] will be replaced with "
"[code]null[/code], and it will not be interpreted as NaN in JSON parsers. If "
"you expect non-finite numbers, consider passing your data through [method "
"from_native] first.\n"
"[b]Example output:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"## JSON.stringify(my_dictionary)\n"
"{\"name\":\"my_dictionary\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":"
"\"entity_0\",\"value\":\"value_0\"},{\"name\":\"entity_1\",\"value\":"
"\"value_1\"}]}\n"
"\n"
"## JSON.stringify(my_dictionary, \"\\t\")\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"name\": \"my_dictionary\",\n"
"\t\"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"\t\"entities\": [\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"name\": \"entity_0\",\n"
"\t\t\t\"value\": \"value_0\"\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"name\": \"entity_1\",\n"
"\t\t\t\"value\": \"value_1\"\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t]\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"## JSON.stringify(my_dictionary, \"...\")\n"
"{\n"
"...\"name\": \"my_dictionary\",\n"
"...\"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"...\"entities\": [\n"
"......{\n"
".........\"name\": \"entity_0\",\n"
".........\"value\": \"value_0\"\n"
"......},\n"
"......{\n"
".........\"name\": \"entity_1\",\n"
".........\"value\": \"value_1\"\n"
"......}\n"
"...]\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Converte uma variável [Variant] em texto JSON e retorna o resultado. Útil "
"para serializar dados para armazenamento ou envio pela rede.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A especificação do JSON não define tipos de inteiros ou de "
"ponto flutuante, mas apenas um tipo [i]number[/i] (número). Portanto, "
"converter um Variant em texto JSON converterá todos os valores numéricos "
"para tipos [float].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se [param full_precision] for [code]true[/code], ao converter "
"floats em strings, os dígitos não confiáveis são incluídos além dos dígitos "
"confiáveis para garantir a decodificação exata.\n"
"O parâmetro [param indent] controla se e como algo é indentado; seu conteúdo "
"será usado onde houver necessidade de indentação na saída. Espaços simples "
"como [code]\"   \"[/code] também funcionarão. [code]\\t[/code] e [code]\\n[/"
"code] também podem ser usados para uma indentação de tabulação ou para criar "
"uma nova linha para cada indentação, respectivamente.\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] Números não finitos não são suportados em JSON. Quaisquer "
"ocorrências de [constant @GDScript.INF] serão substituídas por "
"[code]1e99999[/code], e o [constant @GDScript.INF] negativo será substituído "
"por [code]-1e99999[/code], mas eles serão interpretados corretamente como "
"infinito pela maioria dos analisadores JSON. O [constant @GDScript.NAN] será "
"substituído por [code]null[/code] e não será interpretado como NaN nos "
"analisadores JSON. Se você espera números não finitos, considere passar seus "
"dados por [method from_native] primeiro.\n"
"[b]Exemplo de saída:[/b]\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"## JSON.stringify(my_dictionary)\n"
"{\"name\":\"my_dictionary\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"entities\":[{\"name\":"
"\"entity_0\",\"value\":\"value_0\"},{\"name\":\"entity_1\",\"value\":"
"\"value_1\"}]}\n"
"\n"
"## JSON.stringify(my_dictionary, \"\\t\")\n"
"{\n"
"\t\"name\": \"my_dictionary\",\n"
"\t\"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"\t\"entities\": [\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"name\": \"entity_0\",\n"
"\t\t\t\"value\": \"value_0\"\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\"name\": \"entity_1\",\n"
"\t\t\t\"value\": \"value_1\"\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t]\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"## JSON.stringify(my_dictionary, \"...\")\n"
"{\n"
"...\"name\": \"my_dictionary\",\n"
"...\"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n"
"...\"entities\": [\n"
"......{\n"
".........\"name\": \"entity_0\",\n"
".........\"value\": \"value_0\"\n"
"......},\n"
"......{\n"
".........\"name\": \"entity_1\",\n"
".........\"value\": \"value_1\"\n"
"......}\n"
"...]\n"
"}\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid ""
"Converts a JSON-compliant value that was created with [method from_native] "
"back to native engine types.\n"
"By default, objects are ignored for security reasons, unless [param "
"allow_objects] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"You can convert a JSON string back to a native value like this:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func decode_data(string, allow_objects = false):\n"
"\treturn JSON.to_native(JSON.parse_string(string), allow_objects)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSON.xml
msgid "Contains the parsed JSON data in [Variant] form."
msgstr "Contém os dados JSON analisados em formato de [Variant]."

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid "A helper to handle dictionaries which look like JSONRPC documents."
msgstr ""
"Um auxiliar para manipular dicionários que se parecem com documentos JSONRPC."

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"[url=https://www.jsonrpc.org/]JSON-RPC[/url] is a standard which wraps a "
"method call in a [JSON] object. The object has a particular structure and "
"identifies which method is called, the parameters to that function, and "
"carries an ID to keep track of responses. This class implements that "
"standard on top of [Dictionary]; you will have to convert between a "
"[Dictionary] and [JSON] with other functions."
msgstr ""
"[url=https://www.jsonrpc.org/]JSON-RPC[/url] é um padrão que envolve uma "
"chamada de método em um objeto [JSON]. O objeto tem uma estrutura específica "
"e identifica qual método é chamado, os parâmetros para essa função e carrega "
"um ID para acompanhar as respostas. Esta classe implementa esse padrão em "
"cima de [Dictionary]; você precisará converter entre um [Dictionary] e "
"[JSON] com outras funções."

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary in the form of a JSON-RPC notification. Notifications "
"are one-shot messages which do not expect a response.\n"
"- [param method]: Name of the method being called.\n"
"- [param params]: An array or dictionary of parameters being passed to the "
"method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary in the form of a JSON-RPC request. Requests are sent to "
"a server with the expectation of a response. The ID field is used for the "
"server to specify which exact request it is responding to.\n"
"- [param method]: Name of the method being called.\n"
"- [param params]: An array or dictionary of parameters being passed to the "
"method.\n"
"- [param id]: Uniquely identifies this request. The server is expected to "
"send a response with the same ID."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"When a server has received and processed a request, it is expected to send a "
"response. If you did not want a response then you need to have sent a "
"Notification instead.\n"
"- [param result]: The return value of the function which was called.\n"
"- [param id]: The ID of the request this response is targeted to."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a response which indicates a previous reply has failed in some way.\n"
"- [param code]: The error code corresponding to what kind of error this is. "
"See the [enum ErrorCode] constants.\n"
"- [param message]: A custom message about this error.\n"
"- [param id]: The request this error is a response to."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"Given a Dictionary which takes the form of a JSON-RPC request: unpack the "
"request and run it. Methods are resolved by looking at the field called "
"\"method\" and looking for an equivalently named function in the JSONRPC "
"object. If one is found that method is called.\n"
"To add new supported methods extend the JSONRPC class and call [method "
"process_action] on your subclass.\n"
"[param action]: The action to be run, as a Dictionary in the form of a JSON-"
"RPC request or notification."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a callback for the given method name.\n"
"- [param name]: The name that clients can use to access the callback.\n"
"- [param callback]: The callback which will handle the specified method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"The request could not be parsed as it was not valid by JSON standard "
"([method JSON.parse] failed)."
msgstr ""
"A solicitação não pôde ser analisada por não ser válida de acordo com o "
"padrão JSON ([method JSON.parse] falhou)."

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid "A method call was requested but the request's format is not valid."
msgstr ""
"Uma chamada de método foi solicitada, mas o formato da solicitação não é "
"válido."

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"A method call was requested but no function of that name existed in the "
"JSONRPC subclass."
msgstr ""
"Foi solicitada uma chamada de método, mas nenhuma função com esse nome "
"existia na subclasse JSONRPC."

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"A method call was requested but the given method parameters are not valid. "
"Not used by the built-in JSONRPC."
msgstr ""
"Uma chamada de método foi solicitada, mas os parâmetros de método fornecidos "
"não são válidos. Não usado pelo JSONRPC embutido."

#: doc/classes/JSONRPC.xml
msgid ""
"An internal error occurred while processing the request. Not used by the "
"built-in JSONRPC."
msgstr ""
"Ocorreu um erro interno ao processar a solicitação. Não usado pelo JSONRPC "
"interno."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody2D]."
msgstr "Armazena dados de colisão do movimento de um [PhysicsBody2D]."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid ""
"Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody2D], usually from "
"[method PhysicsBody2D.move_and_collide]. When a [PhysicsBody2D] is moved, it "
"stops if it detects a collision with another body. If a collision is "
"detected, a [KinematicCollision2D] object is returned.\n"
"The collision data includes the colliding object, the remaining motion, and "
"the collision position. This data can be used to determine a custom response "
"to the collision."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision angle according to [param up_direction], which is "
"[constant Vector2.UP] by default. This value is always positive."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ângulo de colisão de acordo com [param up_direction], que é "
"[constant Vector2.UP] por padrão. Este valor é sempre positivo."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the colliding body's attached [Object]."
msgstr "Retorna o [Object] anexado ao corpo colisor."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object]. "
"See [method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID de instância exclusivo do [Object] anexado do corpo colidente. "
"Consulte [method Object.get_instance_id]."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer2D]."
msgstr "Retorna o [RID] do corpo em colisão usado pelo [PhysicsServer2D]."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the colliding body's shape."
msgstr "Retorna a forma do corpo colisor."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the colliding body's shape index. See [CollisionObject2D]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice da forma do corpo em colisão. Consulte [CollisionObject2D]."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the colliding body's velocity."
msgstr "Retorna a velocidade do corpo colisor."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's length of overlap along the collision normal."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o comprimento de sobreposição do corpo colidente ao longo da normal "
"da colisão."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the moving object's colliding shape."
msgstr "Retorna a forma de colisão do objeto em movimento."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision."
msgstr "Retorna a normal da forma do corpo colidente no ponto de colisão."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml
msgid "Returns the point of collision in global coordinates."
msgstr "Retorna o ponto de colisão em coordenadas globais."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid "Returns the moving object's remaining movement vector."
msgstr "Retorna o vetor de movimento restante do objeto em movimento."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision2D.xml doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid "Returns the moving object's travel before collision."
msgstr "Retorna o deslocamento do objeto em movimento antes da colisão."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid "Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody3D]."
msgstr "Contém dados de colisão do movimento de um [PhysicsBody3D]."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Holds collision data from the movement of a [PhysicsBody3D], usually from "
"[method PhysicsBody3D.move_and_collide]. When a [PhysicsBody3D] is moved, it "
"stops if it detects a collision with another body. If a collision is "
"detected, a [KinematicCollision3D] object is returned.\n"
"The collision data includes the colliding object, the remaining motion, and "
"the collision position. This data can be used to determine a custom response "
"to the collision."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision angle according to [param up_direction], which is "
"[constant Vector3.UP] by default. This value is always positive."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ângulo de colisão de acordo com [param up_direction], que é "
"[constant Vector3.UP] por padrão. Este valor é sempre positivo."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's attached [Object] given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [Object] anexado do corpo colidente dado um índice de colisão (a "
"colisão mais profunda por padrão)."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object] "
"given a collision index (the deepest collision by default). See [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID de instância exclusivo do [Object] anexado do corpo colidente, "
"dado um índice de colisão (a colisão mais profunda por padrão). Veja [method "
"Object.get_instance_id]."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer3D] given a "
"collision index (the deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] do corpo em colisão usado pelo [PhysicsServer3D] dado um "
"índice de colisão (a colisão mais profunda por padrão)."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a forma do corpo em colisão dado um índice de colisão (a colisão "
"mais profunda por padrão)."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape index given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default). See [CollisionObject3D]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice de forma do corpo em colisão dado um índice de colisão (a "
"colisão mais profunda por padrão). Veja [CollisionObject3D]."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's velocity given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a velocidade do corpo em colisão dado um índice de colisão (a "
"colisão mais profunda por padrão)."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid "Returns the number of detected collisions."
msgstr "Retorna o número de colisões detectadas."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the moving object's colliding shape given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a forma colidente do objeto em movimento dado um índice de colisão "
"(a colisão mais profunda por padrão)."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision given "
"a collision index (the deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a normal da forma do corpo em colisão no ponto de colisão dado um "
"índice de colisão (a colisão mais profunda por padrão)."

#: doc/classes/KinematicCollision3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the point of collision in global coordinates given a collision index "
"(the deepest collision by default)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto de colisão em coordenadas globais dado um índice de colisão "
"(a colisão mais profunda por padrão)."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "A control for displaying plain text."
msgstr "Um controle para exibir texto simples."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"A control for displaying plain text. It gives you control over the "
"horizontal and vertical alignment and can wrap the text inside the node's "
"bounding rectangle. It doesn't support bold, italics, or other rich text "
"formatting. For that, use [RichTextLabel] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A single Label node is not designed to display huge amounts of "
"text. To display large amounts of text in a single node, consider using "
"[RichTextLabel] instead as it supports features like an integrated scroll "
"bar and threading. [RichTextLabel] generally performs better when displaying "
"large amounts of text (several pages or more)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the bounding rectangle of the character at position [param pos] in "
"the label's local coordinate system. If the character is a non-visual "
"character or [param pos] is outside the valid range, an empty [Rect2] is "
"returned. If the character is a part of a composite grapheme, the bounding "
"rectangle of the whole grapheme is returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o retângulo delimitador do caractere na posição [param pos] no "
"sistema de coordenadas locais do rótulo. Se o caractere for um caractere não "
"visual ou [param pos] estiver fora do intervalo válido, um [Rect2] vazio "
"será retornado. Se o caractere for parte de um grafema composto, o retângulo "
"delimitador de todo o grafema é retornado."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "Returns the number of lines of text the Label has."
msgstr "Retorna o número de linhas de texto que o Label possui."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the height of the line [param line].\n"
"If [param line] is set to [code]-1[/code], returns the biggest line height.\n"
"If there are no lines, returns font size in pixels."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the total number of printable characters in the text (excluding "
"spaces and newlines)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número total de caracteres imprimíveis no texto (excluindo espaços "
"e quebras de linha)."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of lines shown. Useful if the [Label]'s height cannot "
"currently display all lines."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de linhas exibidas. Útil se a altura do [Label] não puder "
"exibir todas as linhas no momento."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"If set to something other than [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], the text "
"gets wrapped inside the node's bounding rectangle. If you resize the node, "
"it will change its height automatically to show all the text.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Labels with autowrapping enabled must have a custom maximum "
"width configured to work correctly, either through the Label's own [member "
"Control.custom_maximum_size] or as a result of a propagated maximum size "
"from a parent Control with [member Control.propagate_maximum_size] enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the Label only shows the text that fits inside its "
"bounding rectangle and will clip text horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o Label exibe apenas o texto que couber dentro de seu "
"retângulo delimitador e recortará o texto horizontalmente."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/LinkButton.xml doc/classes/TextLine.xml
#: doc/classes/TextParagraph.xml
msgid "Ellipsis character used for text clipping."
msgstr "Caractere de reticências usado para corte de texto."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
#: doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the text's horizontal alignment. Supports left, center, right, and "
"fill (also known as justify)."
msgstr ""
"Controla o alinhamento horizontal do texto. Suporta esquerda, centro, "
"direita e preenchimento (também conhecido como justificado)."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
#: doc/classes/TextMesh.xml doc/classes/TextParagraph.xml
msgid "Line fill alignment rules."
msgstr "Regras de alinhamento de preenchimento de linha."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"A [LabelSettings] resource that can be shared between multiple [Label] "
"nodes. Takes priority over theme properties."
msgstr ""
"Um recurso [LabelSettings] que pode ser compartilhado entre vários nós "
"[Label]. Tem prioridade sobre as propriedades de tema."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"The number of the lines ignored and not displayed from the start of the "
"[member text] value."
msgstr ""
"O número de linhas ignoradas e não exibidas a partir do início do valor de "
"[member text]."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "Limits the lines of text the node shows on screen."
msgstr "Limita as linhas de texto que o nó mostra na tela."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"String used as a paragraph separator. Each paragraph is processed "
"independently, in its own BiDi context."
msgstr ""
"String usada como separador de parágrafo. Cada parágrafo é processado "
"independentemente, em seu próprio contexto BiDi."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
#: doc/classes/LinkButton.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid "Set BiDi algorithm override for the structured text."
msgstr "Define a sobrescrita do algoritmo BiDi para o texto estruturado."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
#: doc/classes/LinkButton.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid "Set additional options for BiDi override."
msgstr "Definir opções adicionais para substituição de BiDi."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml doc/classes/TextLine.xml
msgid "Aligns text to the given tab-stops."
msgstr "Alinha o texto às paradas de tabulação fornecidas."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "The text to display on screen."
msgstr "O texto a ser exibido na tela."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"The clipping behavior when the text exceeds the node's bounding rectangle."
msgstr ""
"O comportamento de recorte quando o texto excede o retângulo delimitador do "
"nó."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], all the text displays as UPPERCASE."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], todo o texto é exibido em MAIÚSCULAS."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the text's vertical alignment. Supports top, center, bottom, and "
"fill."
msgstr ""
"Controla o alinhamento vertical do texto. Suporta topo, centro, fundo e "
"preenchimento."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid ""
"The number of characters to display. If set to [code]-1[/code], all "
"characters are displayed. This can be useful when animating the text "
"appearing in a dialog box.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates [member visible_ratio] "
"accordingly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Characters are counted as Unicode codepoints. A single visible "
"grapheme may contain multiple codepoints (e.g. certain emoji use three "
"codepoints). A single codepoint may contain two UTF-16 characters, which are "
"used in C# strings."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid ""
"The clipping behavior when [member visible_characters] or [member "
"visible_ratio] is set."
msgstr ""
"O comportamento de recorte quando [member visible_characters] ou [member "
"visible_ratio] é definido."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid ""
"The fraction of characters to display, relative to the total number of "
"characters (see [method get_total_character_count]). If set to [code]1.0[/"
"code], all characters are displayed. If set to [code]0.5[/code], only half "
"of the characters will be displayed. This can be useful when animating the "
"text appearing in a dialog box.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting this property updates [member visible_characters] "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "Default text [Color] of the [Label]."
msgstr "[Color] padrão do texto do [Label]."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "The color of text outline."
msgstr "A cor do contorno do texto."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "[Color] of the text's shadow effect."
msgstr "[Color] do efeito de sombra do texto."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"Text outline size.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a font with [member "
"FontFile.multichannel_signed_distance_field] enabled, its [member "
"FontFile.msdf_pixel_range] must be set to at least [i]twice[/i] the value of "
"[theme_item outline_size] for outline rendering to look correct. Otherwise, "
"the outline may appear to be cut off earlier than intended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using a value that is larger than half the font size is not "
"recommended, as the font outline may fail to be fully closed in this case."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"Vertical space between paragraphs. Added on top of [theme_item line_spacing]."
msgstr ""
"Espaço vertical entre parágrafos. Adicionado no topo de [theme_item "
"line_spacing]."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "The horizontal offset of the text's shadow."
msgstr "O deslocamento horizontal da sombra do texto."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "The vertical offset of the text's shadow."
msgstr "O deslocamento vertical da sombra do texto."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid "The size of the shadow outline."
msgstr "O tamanho do contorno da sombra."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "[Font] used for the [Label]'s text."
msgstr "[Font] usada para o texto do [Label]."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "Font size of the [Label]'s text."
msgstr "Tamanho da fonte do texto do [Label]."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] used when the [Label] is focused (when used with assistive apps)."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] usado quando o [Label] está focado (quando usado com aplicativos "
"assistivos)."

#: doc/classes/Label.xml
msgid "Background [StyleBox] for the [Label]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] de fundo para o [Label]."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "A node for displaying plain text in 3D space."
msgstr "Um nó para exibir texto simples no espaço 3D."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"A node for displaying plain text in 3D space. By adjusting various "
"properties of this node, you can configure things such as the text's "
"appearance and whether it always faces the camera."
msgstr ""
"Um nó para exibir texto simples em espaço 3D. Ajustando várias propriedades "
"deste nó, você pode configurar coisas como a aparência do texto e se ele "
"sempre fica voltado para a câmera."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid "3D text"
msgstr "Texto 3D"

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [TriangleMesh] with the label's vertices following its current "
"configuration (such as its [member pixel_size])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [TriangleMesh] com os vértices do rótulo seguindo sua "
"configuração atual (como seu [member pixel_size])."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the specified [param flag] will be enabled."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], a [param flag] especificada será ativada."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "The alpha cutting mode to use for the sprite."
msgstr "O modo de corte alfa a ser usado para o sprite."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "Threshold at which the alpha scissor will discard values."
msgstr "Limiar no qual a tesoura alfa descartará os valores."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid ""
"If set to something other than [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], the text "
"gets wrapped inside the node's bounding rectangle. If you resize the node, "
"it will change its height automatically to show all the text."
msgstr ""
"Se definido para algo diferente de [constant TextServer.AUTOWRAP_OFF], o "
"texto é quebrado dentro do retângulo delimitador do nó. Se você "
"redimensionar o nó, ele alterará sua altura automaticamente para mostrar "
"todo o texto."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "The billboard mode to use for the label."
msgstr "O modo billboard a ser usado para o rótulo."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], text can be seen from the back as well, if "
"[code]false[/code], it is invisible when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o texto também pode ser visto por trás; se "
"[code]false[/code], fica invisível ao olhar para ele por trás."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the label is rendered at the same size regardless of "
"distance. The label's size on screen is the same as if the camera was "
"[code]1.0[/code] units away from the label's origin, regardless of the "
"actual distance from the camera. The [Camera3D]'s field of view (or [member "
"Camera3D.size] when in orthogonal/frustum mode) still affects the size the "
"label is drawn at."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o rótulo é renderizado no mesmo tamanho, "
"independentemente da distância. O tamanho do rótulo na tela é o mesmo que se "
"a câmera estivesse a [code]1.0[/code] unidades de distância da origem do "
"rótulo, independentemente da distância real da câmera. O campo de visão da "
"[Camera3D] (ou [member Camera3D.size] no modo ortogonal/frustum) ainda afeta "
"o tamanho em que o rótulo é desenhado."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid "Font configuration used to display text."
msgstr "Configuração de fonte usada para exibir texto."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"Font size of the [Label3D]'s text. To make the font look more detailed when "
"up close, increase [member font_size] while decreasing [member pixel_size] "
"at the same time.\n"
"Higher font sizes require more time to render new characters, which can "
"cause stuttering during gameplay."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "Text [Color] of the [Label3D]."
msgstr "[Color] do texto do [Label3D]."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "The text drawing offset (in pixels)."
msgstr "O deslocamento de desenho do texto (em pixels)."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "The tint of text outline."
msgstr "O tom do contorno do texto."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the render priority for the text outline. Higher priority objects will "
"be sorted in front of lower priority objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies if [member alpha_cut] is set to [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (default value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to sorting of transparent objects. This will "
"not impact how transparent objects are sorted relative to opaque objects. "
"This is because opaque objects are not sorted, while transparent objects are "
"sorted from back to front (subject to priority)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Text outline size."
msgstr "Tamanho do contorno do texto."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"The size of one pixel's width on the label to scale it in 3D. To make the "
"font look more detailed when up close, increase [member font_size] while "
"decreasing [member pixel_size] at the same time."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da largura de um pixel no rótulo para dimensioná-lo em 3D. Para "
"fazer a fonte parecer mais detalhada quando vista de perto, aumente [member "
"font_size] enquanto diminui [member pixel_size] ao mesmo tempo."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the render priority for the text. Higher priority objects will be "
"sorted in front of lower priority objects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies if [member alpha_cut] is set to [constant "
"ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] (default value).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only applies to sorting of transparent objects. This will "
"not impact how transparent objects are sorted relative to opaque objects. "
"This is because opaque objects are not sorted, while transparent objects are "
"sorted from back to front (subject to priority)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [Light3D] in the [Environment] has effects on the "
"label."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [Light3D] no [Environment] terá efeitos no rótulo."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "Filter flags for the texture."
msgstr "Sinalizadores de filtro para a textura."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/TextMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the text's vertical alignment. Supports top, center, and bottom."
msgstr "Controla o alinhamento vertical do texto. Suporta topo, centro e base."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "Text width (in pixels), used for autowrap and fill alignment."
msgstr ""
"Largura do texto (em pixels), usada para quebra automática de linha e "
"alinhamento de preenchimento."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid "If set, lights in the environment affect the label."
msgstr "Se definido, as luzes no ambiente afetam o rótulo."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set, text can be seen from the back as well. If not, the text is "
"invisible when looking at it from behind."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, o texto também pode ser visto de trás. Caso contrário, o texto "
"fica invisível ao olhar para ele por trás."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"Disables the depth test, so this object is drawn on top of all others. "
"However, objects drawn after it in the draw order may cover it."
msgstr ""
"Desativa o teste de profundidade, para que este objeto seja desenhado em "
"cima de todos os outros. No entanto, objetos desenhados depois dele na ordem "
"de desenho podem cobri-lo."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"Label is scaled by depth so that it always appears the same size on screen."
msgstr ""
"O rótulo é dimensionado pela profundidade para que sempre apareça com o "
"mesmo tamanho na tela."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum DrawFlags] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho do enum [enum DrawFlags]."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"This mode performs standard alpha blending. It can display translucent "
"areas, but transparency sorting issues may be visible when multiple "
"transparent materials are overlapping. [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.cast_shadow] has no effect when this transparency mode is "
"used; the [Label3D] will never cast shadows."
msgstr ""
"Este modo realiza mistura alfa padrão. Ele pode exibir áreas translúcidas, "
"mas problemas de ordenação de transparência podem ser visíveis quando vários "
"materiais transparentes estão se sobrepondo. [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.cast_shadow] não tem efeito quando este modo de "
"transparência é usado; o [Label3D] nunca projetará sombras."

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"This mode only allows fully transparent or fully opaque pixels. Harsh edges "
"will be visible unless some form of screen-space antialiasing is enabled "
"(see [member ProjectSettings.rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/"
"screen_space_aa]). This mode is also known as [i]alpha testing[/i] or [i]1-"
"bit transparency[/i].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This mode might have issues with anti-aliased fonts and "
"outlines, try adjusting [member alpha_scissor_threshold] or using MSDF "
"font.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using text with overlapping glyphs (e.g., cursive "
"scripts), this mode might have transparency sorting issues between the main "
"text and the outline."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml
msgid ""
"This mode draws fully opaque pixels in the depth prepass. This is slower "
"than [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISABLED] or [constant ALPHA_CUT_DISCARD], but it "
"allows displaying translucent areas and smooth edges while using proper "
"sorting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using text with overlapping glyphs (e.g., cursive "
"scripts), this mode might have transparency sorting issues between the main "
"text and the outline."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Label3D.xml doc/classes/SpriteBase3D.xml
msgid ""
"This mode draws cuts off all values below a spatially-deterministic "
"threshold, the rest will remain opaque."
msgstr ""
"Este modo descarta todos os valores abaixo de um limite espacialmente "
"determinístico; o restante permanecerá opaco."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Provides common settings to customize the text in a [Label]."
msgstr "Fornece configurações comuns para personalizar o texto em um [Label]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"[LabelSettings] is a resource that provides common settings to customize the "
"text in a [Label]. It will take priority over the properties defined in "
"[member Control.theme]. The resource can be shared between multiple labels "
"and changed on the fly, so it's convenient and flexible way to setup text "
"style."
msgstr ""
"[LabelSettings] é um recurso que fornece configurações comuns para "
"personalizar o texto em um [Label]. Ele terá prioridade sobre as "
"propriedades definidas em [member Control.theme]. O recurso pode ser "
"compartilhado entre vários rótulos e alterado em tempo execução, por isso é "
"uma maneira conveniente e flexível de configurar o estilo do texto."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new stacked outline to the label at the given [param index]. If "
"[param index] is [code]-1[/code], the new stacked outline will be added at "
"the end of the list."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um novo contorno empilhado ao rótulo no [param index] fornecido. Se "
"[param index] for [code]-1[/code], o novo contorno empilhado será adicionado "
"no final da lista."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new stacked shadow to the label at the given [param index]. If [param "
"index] is [code]-1[/code], the new stacked shadow will be added at the end "
"of the list."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma nova sombra empilhada ao rótulo no [param index] fornecido. Se "
"[param index] for [code]-1[/code], a nova sombra empilhada será adicionada "
"no final da lista."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Returns the color of the stacked outline at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna a cor do contorno empilhado no [param index]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Returns the size of the stacked outline at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o tamanho do contorno empilhado no [param index]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Returns the color of the stacked shadow at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna a cor da sombra empilhada no [param index]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Returns the offset of the stacked shadow at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o deslocamento da sombra empilhada no [param index]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Returns the outline size of the stacked shadow at [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o tamanho do contorno da sombra empilhada em [param index]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the stacked outline at index [param from_index] to the given position "
"[param to_position] in the array."
msgstr ""
"Move o contorno empilhado no índice [param from_index] para a posição [param "
"to_position] fornecida na matriz."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the stacked shadow at index [param from_index] to the given position "
"[param to_position] in the array."
msgstr ""
"Move a sombra empilhada no índice [param from_index] para a posição dada "
"[param to_position] no array."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Removes the stacked outline at index [param index]."
msgstr "Remove o contorno empilhado no índice [param index]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Removes the stacked shadow at index [param index]."
msgstr "Remove a sombra empilhada no índice [param index]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the color of the stacked outline identified by the given [param index] "
"to [param color]."
msgstr ""
"Define a cor do contorno empilhado identificado pelo [param index] fornecido "
"para [param color]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the stacked outline identified by the given [param index] "
"to [param size]."
msgstr ""
"Define o tamanho do contorno empilhado identificado pelo [param index] "
"fornecido para [param size]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the color of the stacked shadow identified by the given [param index] "
"to [param color]."
msgstr ""
"Define a cor da sombra empilhada identificada pelo [param index] fornecido "
"para [param color]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the offset of the stacked shadow identified by the given [param index] "
"to [param offset]."
msgstr ""
"Define o deslocamento da sombra empilhada identificada pelo [param index] "
"fornecido para [param offset]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the outline size of the stacked shadow identified by the given [param "
"index] to [param size]."
msgstr ""
"Define o tamanho do contorno da sombra empilhada identificada pelo [param "
"index] fornecido para [param size]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "[Font] used for the text."
msgstr "[Font] usado para o texto."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Color of the text."
msgstr "Cor do texto."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Size of the text."
msgstr "Tamanho do texto."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "The color of the outline."
msgstr "A cor do contorno."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Vertical space between paragraphs. Added on top of [member line_spacing]."
msgstr ""
"Espaço vertical entre parágrafos. Adicionado no topo de [member "
"line_spacing]."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the shadow effect. If alpha is [code]0[/code], no shadow will be "
"drawn."
msgstr ""
"Cor do efeito de sombra. Se o alfa for [code]0[/code], nenhuma sombra será "
"desenhada."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Offset of the shadow effect, in pixels."
msgstr "Deslocamento do efeito de sombra, em pixels."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "Size of the shadow effect."
msgstr "Tamanho do efeito de sombra."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "The number of stacked outlines."
msgstr "O número de contornos empilhados."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of the outline at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_outline_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the outline at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_outline_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid "The number of stacked shadows."
msgstr "O número de sombras empilhadas."

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The color of the shadow at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_shadow_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The offset of the shadow at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_shadow_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LabelSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the shadow outline at [code]index[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]index[/code] is a value in the [code]0 .. "
"stacked_shadow_count - 1[/code] range."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "Casts light in a 2D environment."
msgstr "Emite luz em um ambiente 2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Casts light in a 2D environment. A light is defined as a color, an energy "
"value, a mode (see constants), and various other parameters (range and "
"shadows-related)."
msgstr ""
"Projeta luz em um ambiente 2D. Uma luz é definida como uma cor, um valor de "
"energia, um modo (veja as constantes) e vários outros parâmetros "
"(relacionados a alcance e sombras)."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the light's height, which is used in 2D normal mapping. See [member "
"PointLight2D.height] and [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."
msgstr ""
"Define a altura da luz, que é usada no mapeamento de normais em 2D. Veja "
"[member PointLight2D.height] e [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the light's height, which is used in 2D normal mapping. See [member "
"PointLight2D.height] and [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."
msgstr ""
"Define a altura da luz, que é usada no mapeamento de normais em 2D. Veja "
"[member PointLight2D.height] e [member DirectionalLight2D.height]."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "The Light2D's blend mode."
msgstr "O modo de mesclagem Light2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "The Light2D's [Color]."
msgstr "O [Color] do Light2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], Light2D will only appear when editing the scene."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], Light2D aparecerá apenas ao editar a cena."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], Light2D will emit light."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o Light2D emitirá luz."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"The Light2D's energy value. The larger the value, the stronger the light."
msgstr ""
"O valor de energia do Light2D. Quanto maior o valor, mais forte é a luz."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"The layer mask. Only objects with a matching [member CanvasItem.light_mask] "
"will be affected by the Light2D. See also [member shadow_item_cull_mask], "
"which affects which objects can cast shadows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member range_item_cull_mask] is ignored by "
"[DirectionalLight2D], which will always light a 2D node regardless of the 2D "
"node's [member CanvasItem.light_mask]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "Maximum layer value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "Valor máximo de camada dos objetos afetados pelo Light2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "Minimum layer value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "Valor mínimo de camada dos objetos afetados pelo Light2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum [code]z[/code] value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "Valor máximo de [code]z[/code] dos objetos afetados pelo Light2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum [code]z[/code] value of objects that are affected by the Light2D."
msgstr "Valor mínimo de [code]z[/code] dos objetos afetados pelo Light2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "[Color] of shadows cast by the Light2D."
msgstr "[Color] das sombras projetadas pelo Light2D."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the Light2D will cast shadows."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o Light2D projetará sombras."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid "Shadow filter type."
msgstr "Tipo de filtro de sombra."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Smoothing value for shadows. Higher values will result in softer shadows, at "
"the cost of visible streaks that can appear in shadow rendering. [member "
"shadow_filter_smooth] only has an effect if [member shadow_filter] is "
"[constant SHADOW_FILTER_PCF5] or [constant SHADOW_FILTER_PCF13]."
msgstr ""
"Valor de suavização para sombras. Valores mais altos resultarão em sombras "
"mais suaves, ao custo de faixas visíveis que podem aparecer na renderização "
"de sombras. [member shadow_filter_smooth] só tem efeito se [member "
"shadow_filter] for [constant SHADOW_FILTER_PCF5] ou [constant "
"SHADOW_FILTER_PCF13]."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"The shadow mask. Used with [LightOccluder2D] to cast shadows. Only occluders "
"with a matching [member CanvasItem.light_mask] will cast shadows. See also "
"[member range_item_cull_mask], which affects which objects can [i]receive[/"
"i] the light."
msgstr ""
"A máscara de sombra. Usada com [LightOccluder2D] para projetar sombras. "
"Apenas oclusores com um [member CanvasItem.light_mask] correspondente "
"projetarão sombras. Veja também [member range_item_cull_mask], que afeta "
"quais objetos podem [i]receber[/i] a luz."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"No filter applies to the shadow map. This provides hard shadow edges and is "
"the fastest to render. See [member shadow_filter]."
msgstr ""
"Nenhum filtro é aplicado ao mapa de sombras. Isso fornece bordas de sombra "
"rígidas e é o mais rápido de renderizar. Veja [member shadow_filter]."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Percentage closer filtering (5 samples) applies to the shadow map. This is "
"slower compared to hard shadow rendering. See [member shadow_filter]."
msgstr ""
"Filtragem mais próxima por porcentagem (5 amostras) aplica-se ao mapa de "
"sombras. Isso é mais lento em comparação com a renderização de sombras "
"duras. Veja [member shadow_filter]."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Percentage closer filtering (13 samples) applies to the shadow map. This is "
"the slowest shadow filtering mode, and should be used sparingly. See [member "
"shadow_filter]."
msgstr ""
"A filtragem de proximidade por porcentagem (13 amostras) é aplicada ao mapa "
"de sombras. Este é o modo de filtragem de sombras mais lento e deve ser "
"usado com moderação. Veja [member shadow_filter]."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the value of pixels corresponding to the Light2D to the values of "
"pixels under it. This is the common behavior of a light."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona o valor dos pixels correspondentes à Light2D aos valores dos pixels "
"abaixo dela. Este é o comportamento comum de uma luz."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Subtracts the value of pixels corresponding to the Light2D to the values of "
"pixels under it, resulting in inversed light effect."
msgstr ""
"Subtrai o valor dos pixels correspondentes à Light2D dos valores dos pixels "
"abaixo dela, resultando em um efeito de luz invertida."

#: doc/classes/Light2D.xml
msgid ""
"Mix the value of pixels corresponding to the Light2D to the values of pixels "
"under it by linear interpolation."
msgstr ""
"Mistura o valor dos pixels correspondentes à Light2D com os valores dos "
"pixels abaixo dela por interpolação linear."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Provides a base class for different kinds of light nodes."
msgstr "Fornece uma classe base para diferentes tipos de nós de iluminação."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Light3D is the [i]abstract[/i] base class for light nodes. As it can't be "
"instantiated, it shouldn't be used directly. Other types of light nodes "
"inherit from it. Light3D contains the common variables and parameters used "
"for lighting."
msgstr ""
"Light3D é a classe base [i]abstract[/i] para nós de luz. Como não pode ser "
"instanciado, não deve ser usado diretamente. Outros tipos de nós de luz "
"herdam dele. Light3D contém as variáveis e parâmetros comuns usados para "
"iluminação."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Color] of an idealized blackbody at the given [member "
"light_temperature]. This value is calculated internally based on the [member "
"light_temperature]. This [Color] is multiplied by [member light_color] "
"before being sent to the [RenderingServer]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a [Color] de um corpo negro idealizado na [member light_temperature] "
"fornecida. Este valor é calculado internamente com base na [member "
"light_temperature]. Esta [Color] é multiplicada por [member light_color] "
"antes de ser enviada ao [RenderingServer]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Returns the value of the specified [enum Light3D.Param] parameter."
msgstr "Retorna o valor do parâmetro [enum Light3D.Param] especificado."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Sets the value of the specified [enum Light3D.Param] parameter."
msgstr "Define o valor do parâmetro [enum Light3D.Param] especificado."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from the camera at which the light begins to fade away (in 3D "
"units).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light will smoothly fade away when far from the "
"active [Camera3D] starting at [member distance_fade_begin]. This acts as a "
"form of level of detail (LOD). The light will fade out over [member "
"distance_fade_begin] + [member distance_fade_length], after which it will be "
"culled and not sent to the shader at all. Use this to reduce the number of "
"active lights in a scene and thus improve performance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Distance over which the light and its shadow fades. The light's energy and "
"shadow's opacity is progressively reduced over this distance and is "
"completely invisible at the end.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from the camera at which the light's shadow cuts off (in 3D "
"units). Set this to a value lower than [member distance_fade_begin] + "
"[member distance_fade_length] to further improve performance, as shadow "
"rendering is often more expensive than light rendering itself.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective for [OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D], and only "
"when [member shadow_enabled] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light only appears in the editor and will not be "
"visible at runtime. If [code]true[/code], the light will never be baked in "
"[LightmapGI] regardless of its [member light_bake_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a luz aparece apenas no editor e não estará visível em "
"tempo de execução. Se [code]true[/code], a luz nunca será cozida em "
"[LightmapGI], independentemente de seu [member light_bake_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The light's angular size in degrees. Increasing this will make shadows "
"softer at greater distances (also called percentage-closer soft shadows, or "
"PCSS). Only available for [DirectionalLight3D]s. For reference, the Sun from "
"the Earth is approximately [code]0.5[/code]. Increasing this value above "
"[code]0.0[/code] for lights with shadows enabled will have a noticeable "
"performance cost due to PCSS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member light_angular_distance] is not affected by [member "
"Node3D.scale] (the light's scale or its parent's scale).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] PCSS for directional lights is only supported in the Forward+ "
"rendering method, not Mobile or Compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The light's bake mode. This will affect the global illumination techniques "
"that have an effect on the light's rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Meshes' global illumination mode will also affect the global "
"illumination rendering. See [member GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The light's color in nonlinear sRGB encoding. An [i]overbright[/i] color can "
"be used to achieve a result equivalent to increasing the light's [member "
"light_energy]."
msgstr ""
"A cor da luz na codificação sRGB não linear. Uma cor [i]super brilhante[/i] "
"pode ser usada para obter um resultado equivalente a aumentar o [member "
"light_energy] da luz."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The light will affect objects in the selected layers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The light cull mask is ignored by [VoxelGI], SDFGI, "
"[LightmapGI], and volumetric fog. These will always render lights in a way "
"that ignores the cull mask. See also [member VisualInstance3D.layers]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The light's strength multiplier (this is not a physical unit). For "
"[OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D], changing this value will only change the "
"light color's intensity, not the light's radius."
msgstr ""
"O multiplicador de força da luz (esta não é uma unidade física). Para "
"[OmniLight3D] e [SpotLight3D], alterar este valor alterará apenas a "
"intensidade da cor da luz, não o raio da luz."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Secondary multiplier used with indirect light (light bounces). Used with "
"[VoxelGI] and SDFGI (see [member Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is ignored if [member light_energy] is equal to "
"[code]0.0[/code], as the light won't be present at all in the GI shader."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Used by positional lights ([OmniLight3D] and [SpotLight3D]) when [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is "
"[code]true[/code]. Sets the intensity of the light source measured in "
"Lumens. Lumens are a measure of luminous flux, which is the total amount of "
"visible light emitted by a light source per unit of time.\n"
"For [SpotLight3D]s, we assume that the area outside the visible cone is "
"surrounded by a perfect light absorbing material. Accordingly, the apparent "
"brightness of the cone area does not change as the cone increases and "
"decreases in size.\n"
"A typical household lightbulb can range from around 600 lumens to 1,200 "
"lumens, a candle is about 13 lumens, while a streetlight can be "
"approximately 60,000 lumens."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Used by [DirectionalLight3D]s when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is [code]true[/code]. Sets the "
"intensity of the light source measured in Lux. Lux is a measure of luminous "
"flux per unit area, it is equal to one lumen per square meter. Lux is the "
"measure of how much light hits a surface at a given time.\n"
"On a clear sunny day a surface in direct sunlight may be approximately "
"100,000 lux, a typical room in a home may be approximately 50 lux, while the "
"moonlit ground may be approximately 0.1 lux."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light's effect is reversed, darkening areas and "
"casting bright shadows."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o efeito da luz é invertido, escurecendo áreas e "
"projetando sombras brilhantes."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] projected by light. [member shadow_enabled] must be on for the "
"projector to work. Light projectors make the light appear as if it is "
"shining through a colored but transparent object, almost like light shining "
"through stained-glass.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [BaseMaterial3D] whose filter mode can be adjusted on a "
"per-material basis, the filter mode for light projector textures is set "
"globally with [member ProjectSettings.rendering/textures/light_projectors/"
"filter].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Light projector textures are only supported in the Forward+ and "
"Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The simulated size of the light in Godot units, affecting shading and "
"shadows. For [OmniLight3D]s and [SpotLight3D]s, increasing this value "
"simulates a spherical area light, expanding the size of specular highlights. "
"If shadows are enabled, a penumbra is rendered, making shadows appear "
"blurrier. For [AreaLight3D]s, only the shadows are affected. Penumbras are "
"simulated with percentage-closer soft shadows, or PCSS, which has a "
"noticeable performance cost for values above [code]0.0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member light_size] is not affected by [member Node3D.scale] "
"(the light's scale or its parent's scale).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] PCSS for positional lights is only supported in the Forward+ "
"and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The intensity of the specular blob in objects affected by the light. At "
"[code]0[/code], the light becomes a pure diffuse light. When not baking "
"emission, this can be used to avoid unrealistic reflections when placing "
"lights above an emissive surface."
msgstr ""
"A intensidade da bolha especular em objetos afetados pela luz. Em [code]0[/"
"code], a luz se torna uma luz puramente difusa. Quando não estiver assando "
"emissão, isso pode ser usado para evitar reflexos irreais ao colocar luzes "
"acima de uma superfície emissiva."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the color temperature of the light source, measured in Kelvin. This is "
"used to calculate a correlated color temperature which tints the [member "
"light_color].\n"
"The sun on a cloudy day is approximately 6500 Kelvin, on a clear day it is "
"between 5500 to 6000 Kelvin, and on a clear day at sunrise or sunset it "
"ranges to around 1850 Kelvin."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Secondary multiplier multiplied with [member light_energy] then used with "
"the [Environment]'s volumetric fog (if enabled). If set to [code]0.0[/code], "
"computing volumetric fog will be skipped for this light, which can improve "
"performance for large amounts of lights when volumetric fog is enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To prevent short-lived dynamic light effects from poorly "
"interacting with volumetric fog, lights used in those effects should have "
"[member light_volumetric_fog_energy] set to [code]0.0[/code] unless [member "
"Environment.volumetric_fog_temporal_reprojection_enabled] is disabled (or "
"unless the reprojection amount is significantly lowered)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Used to adjust shadow appearance. Too small a value results in self-"
"shadowing (\"shadow acne\"), while too large a value causes shadows to "
"separate from casters (\"peter-panning\"). Adjust as needed."
msgstr ""
"Usado para ajustar a aparência das sombras. Um valor muito pequeno resulta "
"em autossumbreamento (\"acne de sombra\"), enquanto um valor muito grande "
"faz com que as sombras se separam dos projetores (\"peter-panning\"). Ajuste "
"conforme necessário."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Blurs the edges of the shadow. Can be used to hide pixel artifacts in low-"
"resolution shadow maps. A high value can impact performance, make shadows "
"appear grainy and can cause other unwanted artifacts. Try to keep as near "
"default as possible."
msgstr ""
"Desfoca as bordas da sombra. Pode ser usado para ocultar artefatos de pixel "
"em mapas de sombras de baixa resolução. Um valor alto pode impactar o "
"desempenho, fazer com que as sombras pareçam granuladas e causar outros "
"artefatos indesejados. Tente manter o mais próximo possível do padrão."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "The light will only cast shadows using objects in the selected layers."
msgstr ""
"A luz projetará sombras apenas usando objetos nas camadas selecionadas."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the light will cast real-time shadows. This has a "
"significant performance cost. Only enable shadow rendering when it makes a "
"noticeable difference in the scene's appearance, and consider using [member "
"distance_fade_enabled] to hide the light when far away from the [Camera3D]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a luz projetará sombras em tempo real. Isso tem um "
"custo de desempenho significativo. Ative a renderização de sombras apenas "
"quando fizer uma diferença perceptível na aparência da cena e considere usar "
"[member distance_fade_enabled] para ocultar a luz quando estiver longe da "
"[Camera3D]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Offsets the lookup into the shadow map by the object's normal. This can be "
"used to reduce self-shadowing artifacts without using [member shadow_bias]. "
"In practice, this value should be tweaked along with [member shadow_bias] to "
"reduce artifacts as much as possible."
msgstr ""
"Desloca a busca no mapa de sombras pela normal do objeto. Isso pode ser "
"usado para reduzir artefatos de auto-sombreamento sem usar [member "
"shadow_bias]. Na prática, esse valor deve ser ajustado junto com [member "
"shadow_bias] para reduzir os artefatos o máximo possível."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"The opacity to use when rendering the light's shadow map. Values lower than "
"[code]1.0[/code] make the light appear through shadows. This can be used to "
"fake global illumination at a low performance cost."
msgstr ""
"A opacidade a ser usada ao renderizar o mapa de sombras da luz. Valores "
"menores que [code]1.0[/code] fazem a luz aparecer através das sombras. Isso "
"pode ser usado para simular iluminação global a um baixo custo de desempenho."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], reverses the backface culling of the mesh. This can be "
"useful when you have a flat mesh that has a light behind it. If you need to "
"cast a shadow on both sides of the mesh, set the mesh to use double-sided "
"shadows with [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.SHADOW_CASTING_SETTING_DOUBLE_SIDED]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], inverte o culling de face traseira da malha. Isso pode "
"ser útil quando você tem uma malha plana que tem uma luz atrás dela. Se você "
"precisar projetar uma sombra em ambos os lados da malha, defina a malha para "
"usar sombras de dois lados com [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.SHADOW_CASTING_SETTING_DOUBLE_SIDED]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_energy]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member light_energy]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_indirect_energy]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member light_indirect_energy]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_volumetric_fog_energy]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member light_volumetric_fog_energy]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_specular]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member light_specular]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member OmniLight3D.omni_range] or [member "
"SpotLight3D.spot_range]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member OmniLight3D.omni_range] ou [member "
"SpotLight3D.spot_range]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member light_size]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member light_size]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member OmniLight3D.omni_attenuation] or [member "
"SpotLight3D.spot_attenuation]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member OmniLight3D.omni_attenuation] ou [member "
"SpotLight3D.spot_attenuation]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member SpotLight3D.spot_angle]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member SpotLight3D.spot_angle]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member SpotLight3D.spot_angle_attenuation]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member SpotLight3D.spot_angle_attenuation]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_split_1]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_split_1]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_split_2]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_split_2]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_split_3]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_split_3]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_fade_start]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_fade_start]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member shadow_normal_bias]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member shadow_normal_bias]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member shadow_bias]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member shadow_bias]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_pancake_size]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_pancake_size]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member shadow_opacity]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member shadow_opacity]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member shadow_blur]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member shadow_blur]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid "Constant for accessing [member shadow_transmittance_bias]."
msgstr "Constante para acessar [member shadow_transmittance_bias]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for accessing [member light_intensity_lumens] and [member "
"light_intensity_lux]. Only used when [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Constante para acessar [member light_intensity_lumens] e [member "
"light_intensity_lux]. Usado apenas quando [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lights_and_shadows/use_physical_light_units] é [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Light is ignored when baking. This is the fastest mode, but the light will "
"not be taken into account when baking global illumination. This mode should "
"generally be used for dynamic lights that change quickly, as the effect of "
"global illumination is less noticeable on those lights.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Hiding a light does [i]not[/i] affect baking [LightmapGI]. "
"Hiding a light will still affect baking [VoxelGI] and SDFGI (see [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Light is taken into account in static baking ([VoxelGI], [LightmapGI], SDFGI "
"([member Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). The light can be moved around or "
"modified, but its global illumination will not update in real-time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The light is not baked in [LightmapGI] if [member editor_only] "
"is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using [LightmapGI], both the direct and indirect light are "
"baked. Since direct light is baked, the light doesn't display a specular "
"lobe on static lightmapped meshes. Shadows on static lightmapped meshes will "
"also look less detailed, but the light still casts shadows that can be "
"displayed on dynamic objects. Since real-time light computations are skipped "
"on static lightmapped meshes, this bake mode improves runtime performance "
"compared to [constant BAKE_DYNAMIC] and [constant BAKE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Light3D.xml
msgid ""
"Light is taken into account in dynamic baking ([VoxelGI] and SDFGI ([member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled])). The light can be moved around or modified with "
"global illumination updating in real-time. The light's global illumination "
"appearance will be slightly different compared to [constant BAKE_STATIC]. "
"This has a greater performance cost compared to [constant BAKE_STATIC]. When "
"using SDFGI, the update speed of dynamic lights is affected by [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/global_illumination/sdfgi/"
"frames_to_update_lights].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using [LightmapGI], the light's indirect light is baked, "
"but direct light and shadows remain real-time. This mode allows performing "
"[i]subtle[/i] changes to a light's color, energy, and position while still "
"looking fairly correct. For example, you can use this to create flickering "
"static torches that have their indirect light baked."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Computes and stores baked lightmaps for fast global illumination."
msgstr "Calcula e armazena mapas de luz gerados para iluminação global rápida."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The [LightmapGI] node is used to compute and store baked lightmaps. "
"Lightmaps are used to provide high-quality indirect lighting with very "
"little light leaking. [LightmapGI] can also provide rough reflections using "
"spherical harmonics if [member directional] is enabled. Dynamic objects can "
"receive indirect lighting thanks to [i]light probes[/i], which can be "
"automatically placed by setting [member generate_probes_subdiv] to a value "
"other than [constant GENERATE_PROBES_DISABLED]. Additional lightmap probes "
"can also be added by creating [LightmapProbe] nodes. The downside is that "
"lightmaps are fully static and cannot be baked in an exported project. "
"Baking a [LightmapGI] node is also slower compared to [VoxelGI].\n"
"[b]Procedural generation:[/b] Lightmap baking functionality is only "
"available in the editor. This means [LightmapGI] is not suited to "
"procedurally generated or user-built levels. For procedurally generated or "
"user-built levels, use [VoxelGI] or SDFGI instead (see [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] [LightmapGI] provides the best possible run-time "
"performance for global illumination. It is suitable for low-end hardware "
"including integrated graphics and mobile devices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to how lightmaps work, most properties only have a visible "
"effect once lightmaps are baked again.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Lightmap baking on [CSGShape3D]s and [PrimitiveMesh]es is not "
"supported, as these cannot store UV2 data required for baking.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If no custom lightmappers are installed, [LightmapGI] can only "
"be baked from devices that support the Forward+ or Mobile renderers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [LightmapGI] node only bakes light data for child nodes of "
"its parent. Nodes further up the hierarchy of the scene will not be baked."
msgstr ""
"O nó [LightmapGI] é usado para calcular e armazenar lightmaps (mapas de luz) "
"gerados (baked). Lightmaps são usados para fornecer iluminação indireta de "
"alta qualidade com muito pouco vazamento de luz. O [LightmapGI] também pode "
"fornecer reflexos aproximados usando harmônicos esféricos se [member "
"directional] estiver habilitado. Objetos dinâmicos podem receber iluminação "
"indireta graças às [i]sondas de luz[/i] (light probes), que podem ser "
"posicionadas automaticamente definindo [member generate_probes_subdiv] para "
"um valor diferente de [constant GENERATE_PROBES_DISABLED]. Sondas de "
"lightmap adicionais também podem ser adicionadas criando nós "
"[LightmapProbe]. A desvantagem é que os lightmaps são totalmente estáticos e "
"não podem ser gerados em um projeto exportado. Gerar um nó [LightmapGI] "
"também é mais lento em comparação ao [VoxelGI].\n"
"[b]Geração procedural:[/b] A funcionalidade de geração de lightmaps está "
"disponível apenas no editor. Isso significa que o [LightmapGI] não é "
"adequado para níveis gerados proceduralmente ou construídos pelo usuário. "
"Para níveis gerados proceduralmente ou construídos pelo usuário, use o "
"[VoxelGI] ou SDFGI em vez disso (consulte [member "
"Environment.sdfgi_enabled]).\n"
"[b]Desempenho:[/b] O [LightmapGI] fornece o melhor desempenho de execução "
"possível para iluminação global. Ele é adequado para hardware de baixo "
"desempenho, incluindo gráficos integrados e dispositivos móveis.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Devido ao funcionamento dos lightmaps, a maioria das "
"propriedades só terá um efeito visível após os lightmaps serem gerados "
"novamente.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A geração de lightmaps em [CSGShape3D]s e [PrimitiveMesh]es não "
"é suportada, pois eles não podem armazenar dados de UV2 necessários para a "
"geração.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se nenhum gerador de lightmap personalizado estiver instalado, "
"o [LightmapGI] só poderá ser gerado a partir de dispositivos que suportem os "
"renderizadores Forward+ ou Mobile.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O nó [LightmapGI] gera apenas dados de luz para nós filhos de "
"seu pai. Nós mais acima na hierarquia da cena não serão gerados."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Using Lightmap global illumination"
msgstr "Usando iluminação global Lightmap"

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The bias to use when computing shadows. Increasing [member bias] can fix "
"shadow acne on the resulting baked lightmap, but can introduce peter-panning "
"(shadows not connecting to their casters). Real-time [Light3D] shadows are "
"not affected by this [member bias] property."
msgstr ""
"O viés a ser usado ao computar sombras. Aumentar [member bias] pode corrigir "
"acne de sombra no lightmap gerado no bake, mas pode introduzir peter-panning "
"(sombras que não se conectam aos seus emissores). As sombras em tempo real "
"de [Light3D] não são afetadas por esta propriedade [member bias]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The energy multiplier for each bounce. Higher values will make indirect "
"lighting brighter. A value of [code]1.0[/code] represents physically "
"accurate behavior, but higher values can be used to make indirect lighting "
"propagate more visibly when using a low number of bounces. This can be used "
"to speed up bake times by lowering the number of [member bounces] then "
"increasing [member bounce_indirect_energy].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member bounce_indirect_energy] only has an effect if [member "
"bounces] is set to a value greater than or equal to [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Number of light bounces that are taken into account during baking. Higher "
"values result in brighter, more realistic lighting, at the cost of longer "
"bake times. If set to [code]0[/code], only environment lighting, direct "
"light and emissive lighting is baked."
msgstr ""
"Número de rebatimentos de luz que são levados em consideração durante o "
"bake. Valores mais altos resultam em uma iluminação mais brilhante e "
"realista, ao custo de tempos de bake mais longos. Se definido como [code]0[/"
"code], apenas a iluminação do ambiente, luz direta e luz emissiva são "
"geradas no bake."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The [CameraAttributes] resource that specifies exposure levels to bake at. "
"Auto-exposure and non exposure properties will be ignored. Exposure settings "
"should be used to reduce the dynamic range present when baking. If exposure "
"is too high, the [LightmapGI] will have banding artifacts or may have over-"
"exposure artifacts."
msgstr ""
"O recurso [CameraAttributes] que especifica os níveis de exposição para o "
"cozimento. Propriedades de exposição automática e sem exposição serão "
"ignoradas. Configurações de exposição devem ser usadas para reduzir a faixa "
"dinâmica presente durante o cozimento. Se a exposição for muito alta, o "
"[LightmapGI] terá artefatos de bandagem ou poderá ter artefatos de sobre-"
"exposição."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The distance in pixels from which the denoiser samples. Lower values "
"preserve more details, but may give blotchy results if the lightmap quality "
"is not high enough. Only effective if [member use_denoiser] is [code]true[/"
"code] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] "
"is set to JNLM."
msgstr ""
"A distância em pixels a partir da qual o desnoidalizador (denoiser) amostra. "
"Valores mais baixos preservam mais detalhes, mas podem dar resultados "
"manchados se a qualidade do mapa de luz não for alta o suficiente. Eficaz "
"apenas se [member use_denoiser] for [code]true[/code] e [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] estiver definido "
"como JNLM."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The strength of denoising step applied to the generated lightmaps. Only "
"effective if [member use_denoiser] is [code]true[/code] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] is set to JNLM."
msgstr ""
"A intensidade da etapa de redução de ruído aplicada aos lightmaps gerados. "
"Só é eficaz se [member use_denoiser] for [code]true[/code] e [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/denoising/denoiser] estiver definido "
"como JNLM."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], bakes lightmaps to contain directional information as "
"spherical harmonics. This results in more realistic lighting appearance, "
"especially with normal mapped materials and for lights that have their "
"direct light baked ([member Light3D.light_bake_mode] set to [constant "
"Light3D.BAKE_STATIC] and with [member Light3D.editor_only] set to "
"[code]false[/code]). The directional information is also used to provide "
"rough reflections for static and dynamic objects. This has a small run-time "
"performance cost as the shader has to perform more work to interpret the "
"direction information from the lightmap. Directional lightmaps also take "
"longer to bake and result in larger file sizes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The property's name has no relationship with "
"[DirectionalLight3D]. [member directional] works with all light types."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The color to use for environment lighting. Only effective if [member "
"environment_mode] is [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."
msgstr ""
"A cor a ser usada para a iluminação do ambiente. Só é eficaz se [member "
"environment_mode] for [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The color multiplier to use for environment lighting. Only effective if "
"[member environment_mode] is [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."
msgstr ""
"O multiplicador de cor a ser usado para a iluminação do ambiente. Só é "
"eficaz se [member environment_mode] for [constant "
"ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_COLOR]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The sky to use as a source of environment lighting. Only effective if "
"[member environment_mode] is [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_SKY]."
msgstr ""
"O céu a ser usado como fonte de iluminação do ambiente. Só é eficaz se "
"[member environment_mode] for [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_CUSTOM_SKY]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "The environment mode to use when baking lightmaps."
msgstr "O modo de ambiente a usar ao fazer o bake de lightmaps."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The level of subdivision to use when automatically generating "
"[LightmapProbe]s for dynamic object lighting. Higher values result in more "
"accurate indirect lighting on dynamic objects, at the cost of longer bake "
"times and larger file sizes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Automatically generated [LightmapProbe]s are not visible as "
"nodes in the Scene tree dock, and cannot be modified this way after they are "
"generated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of [member generate_probes_subdiv], direct lighting "
"on dynamic objects is always applied using [Light3D] nodes in real-time."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], ignore environment lighting when baking lightmaps."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ignora a iluminação do ambiente ao gerar lightmaps."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The [LightmapGIData] associated to this [LightmapGI] node. This resource is "
"automatically created after baking, and is not meant to be created manually."
msgstr ""
"O [LightmapGIData] associado a este nó [LightmapGI]. Este recurso é criado "
"automaticamente após a geração de mapas de luz, e não deve ser criado "
"manualmente."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum texture size for the generated texture atlas. Higher values will "
"result in fewer slices being generated, but may not work on all hardware as "
"a result of hardware limitations on texture sizes. Leave [member "
"max_texture_size] at its default value of [code]16384[/code] if unsure."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho máximo de textura para o atlas de textura gerado. Valores mais "
"altos resultarão em menos fatias sendo geradas, mas podem não funcionar em "
"todo o hardware como resultado de limitações de hardware nos tamanhos de "
"textura. Deixe [member max_texture_size] em seu valor padrão de [code]16384[/"
"code] se não tiver certeza."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The quality preset to use when baking lightmaps. This affects bake times, "
"but output file sizes remain mostly identical across quality levels.\n"
"To further speed up bake times, decrease [member bounces], disable [member "
"use_denoiser] and/or decrease [member texel_scale].\n"
"To further increase quality, enable [member supersampling] and/or increase "
"[member texel_scale]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The shadowmasking policy to use for directional shadows on static objects "
"that are baked with this [LightmapGI] instance.\n"
"Shadowmasking allows [DirectionalLight3D] nodes to cast shadows even outside "
"the range defined by their [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance] property. This is done "
"by baking a texture that contains a shadowmap for the directional light, "
"then using this texture according to the current shadowmask mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The shadowmask texture is only created if [member "
"shadowmask_mode] is not [constant LightmapGIData.SHADOWMASK_MODE_NONE]. To "
"see a difference, you need to bake lightmaps again after switching from "
"[constant LightmapGIData.SHADOWMASK_MODE_NONE] to any other mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], lightmaps are baked with the texel scale multiplied "
"with [member supersampling_factor] and downsampled before saving the "
"lightmap (so the effective texel density is identical to having "
"supersampling disabled).\n"
"Supersampling provides increased lightmap quality with less noise, smoother "
"shadows and better shadowing of small-scale features in objects. However, it "
"may result in significantly increased bake times and memory usage while "
"baking lightmaps. Padding is automatically adjusted to avoid increasing "
"light leaking."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The factor by which the texel density is multiplied for supersampling. For "
"best results, use an integer value. While fractional values are allowed, "
"they can result in increased light leaking and a blurry lightmap.\n"
"Higher values may result in better quality, but also increase bake times and "
"memory usage while baking.\n"
"See [member supersampling] for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Scales the lightmap texel density of all meshes for the current bake. This "
"is a multiplier that builds upon the existing lightmap texel size defined in "
"each imported 3D scene, along with the per-mesh density multiplier (which is "
"designed to be used when the same mesh is used at different scales). Lower "
"values will result in faster bake times.\n"
"For example, doubling [member texel_scale] doubles the lightmap texture "
"resolution for all objects [i]on each axis[/i], so it will [i]quadruple[/i] "
"the texel count."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], uses a GPU-based denoising algorithm on the generated "
"lightmap. This eliminates most noise within the generated lightmap at the "
"cost of longer bake times. File sizes are generally not impacted "
"significantly by the use of a denoiser, although lossless compression may do "
"a better job at compressing a denoised image."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], usa um algoritmo de desruído baseado em GPU no "
"lightmap gerado. Isso elimina a maior parte do ruído dentro do lightmap "
"gerado ao custo de tempos de cozimento mais longos. O tamanho dos arquivos "
"geralmente não é afetado significativamente pelo uso de um desruidor, embora "
"a compressão sem perda possa fazer um trabalho melhor ao comprimir uma "
"imagem desruída."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a texture with the lighting information will be "
"generated to speed up the generation of indirect lighting at the cost of "
"some accuracy. The geometry might exhibit extra light leak artifacts when "
"using low resolution lightmaps or UVs that stretch the lightmap "
"significantly across surfaces. Leave [member use_texture_for_bounces] at its "
"default value of [code]true[/code] if unsure.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member use_texture_for_bounces] only has an effect if [member "
"bounces] is set to a value greater than or equal to [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Low bake quality (fastest bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/low_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/low_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"Baixa qualidade de bake (tempos de bake mais rápidos). A qualidade desta "
"predefinição pode ser ajustada alterando [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/low_quality_ray_count] e [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"low_quality_probe_ray_count]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Medium bake quality (fast bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/medium_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/medium_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"Média qualidade de bake (tempos de bake rápidos). A qualidade desta "
"predefinição pode ser ajustada alterando [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/medium_quality_ray_count] e [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"medium_quality_probe_ray_count]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"High bake quality (slow bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/high_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/high_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"Alta qualidade de bake (tempos de bake lentos). A qualidade desta "
"predefinição pode ser ajustada alterando [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/high_quality_ray_count] e [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"high_quality_probe_ray_count]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Highest bake quality (slowest bake times). The quality of this preset can be "
"adjusted by changing [member ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/"
"bake_quality/ultra_quality_ray_count] and [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/ultra_quality_probe_ray_count]."
msgstr ""
"Maior qualidade de bake (tempos de bake mais lentos). A qualidade desta "
"predefinição pode ser ajustada alterando [member ProjectSettings.rendering/"
"lightmapping/bake_quality/ultra_quality_ray_count] e [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/lightmapping/bake_quality/"
"ultra_quality_probe_ray_count]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Don't generate lightmap probes for lighting dynamic objects."
msgstr "Não gere sondas de mapa de luz para iluminar objetos dinâmicos."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Lowest level of subdivision (fastest bake times, smallest file sizes)."
msgstr ""
"Nível mais baixo de subdivisão (tempos de \"bake\" mais rápidos, menores "
"tamanhos de arquivo)."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Low level of subdivision (fast bake times, small file sizes)."
msgstr ""
"Baixo nível de subdivisão (tempos de cozimento rápidos, tamanhos de arquivo "
"pequenos)."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "High level of subdivision (slow bake times, large file sizes)."
msgstr ""
"Alto nível de subdivisão (tempos de cozimento lentos, tamanhos de arquivo "
"grandes)."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Highest level of subdivision (slowest bake times, largest file sizes)."
msgstr ""
"Nível mais alto de subdivisão (tempos de \"bake\" mais lentos, maiores "
"tamanhos de arquivo)."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Lightmap baking was successful."
msgstr "O cozimento do lightmap foi bem-sucedido."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed because the root node for the edited scene could not "
"be accessed."
msgstr ""
"O \"bake\" de lightmap falhou porque o nó raiz da cena editada não pôde ser "
"acessado."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the lightmap data resource is embedded in a "
"foreign resource."
msgstr ""
"O \"bake\" de lightmap falhou porque o recurso de dados de lightmap está "
"embutido em um recurso externo."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as there is no lightmapper available in this Godot "
"build."
msgstr ""
"O baking do lightmap falhou porque não há um lightmapper disponível nesta "
"compilação do Godot."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the [LightmapGIData] save path isn't configured in "
"the resource."
msgstr ""
"O \"bake\" de lightmap falhou porque o caminho de salvamento de "
"[LightmapGIData] não está configurado no recurso."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as there are no meshes whose [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] is [constant GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC] "
"and with valid UV2 mapping in the current scene. You may need to select 3D "
"scenes in the Import dock and change their global illumination mode "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"O bake do lightmap falhou porque não há malhas cujo [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] seja [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_STATIC] e com mapeamento UV2 válido na cena "
"atual. Pode ser necessário selecionar cenas 3D na doca Importar e alterar o "
"modo de iluminação global de acordo."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the lightmapper failed to analyze some of the "
"meshes marked as static for baking."
msgstr ""
"O bake do lightmap falhou porque o lightmapper não conseguiu analisar "
"algumas das malhas marcadas como estáticas para o bake."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the resulting image couldn't be saved or imported "
"by Godot after it was saved."
msgstr ""
"O bake do lightmap falhou porque a imagem resultante não pôde ser salva ou "
"importada pelo Godot após ser salva."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"The user aborted the lightmap baking operation (typically by clicking the "
"[b]Cancel[/b] button in the progress dialog)."
msgstr ""
"O usuário abortou a operação de geração de mapas de luz (tipicamente "
"clicando no botão [b]Cancelar[/b] na caixa de diálogo de progresso)."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Lightmap baking failed as the maximum texture size is too small to fit some "
"of the meshes marked for baking."
msgstr ""
"O bake do lightmap falhou porque o tamanho máximo da textura é muito pequeno "
"para acomodar algumas das malhas marcadas para bake."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Lightmap baking failed as the lightmap is too small."
msgstr "O bake do lightmap falhou porque o lightmap é muito pequeno."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Lightmap baking failed as the lightmap was unable to fit into an atlas."
msgstr ""
"O baking do lightmap falhou porque o lightmap não pôde ser ajustado a um "
"atlas."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid "Ignore environment lighting when baking lightmaps."
msgstr "Ignora a iluminação do ambiente ao fazer o bake de lightmaps."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Use the scene's environment lighting when baking lightmaps.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If baking lightmaps in a scene with no [WorldEnvironment] node, "
"this will act like [constant ENVIRONMENT_MODE_DISABLED]. The editor's "
"preview sky and sun is [i]not[/i] taken into account by [LightmapGI] when "
"baking lightmaps."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Use [member environment_custom_sky] as a source of environment lighting when "
"baking lightmaps."
msgstr ""
"Use [member environment_custom_sky] como fonte de iluminação de ambiente ao "
"fazer o bake de lightmaps."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGI.xml
msgid ""
"Use [member environment_custom_color] multiplied by [member "
"environment_custom_energy] as a constant source of environment lighting when "
"baking lightmaps."
msgstr ""
"Usa [member environment_custom_color] multiplicado por [member "
"environment_custom_energy] como uma fonte constante de iluminação de "
"ambiente ao gerar lightmaps."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid "Contains baked lightmap and dynamic object probe data for [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"Contém dados de lightmap gerados e de sonda de objetos dinâmicos para "
"[LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"[LightmapGIData] contains baked lightmap and dynamic object probe data for "
"[LightmapGI]. It is replaced every time lightmaps are baked in [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"[LightmapGIData] contém dados de lightmap gerado e de sonda de objeto "
"dinâmico para [LightmapGI]. Ele é substituído toda vez que os lightmaps são "
"gerados em [LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid "Adds an object that is considered baked within this [LightmapGIData]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um objeto que é considerado gerado por cozimento dentro deste "
"[LightmapGIData]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"Clear all objects that are considered baked within this [LightmapGIData]."
msgstr ""
"Limpa todos os objetos considerados gerados (\"baked\") dentro deste "
"[LightmapGIData]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of objects that are considered baked within this "
"[LightmapGIData]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de objetos considerados bakeados dentro deste "
"[LightmapGIData]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid "Returns the [NodePath] of the baked object at index [param user_idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o [NodePath] do objeto assado no índice [param user_idx]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], lightmaps were baked with directional information. See "
"also [member LightmapGI.directional]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], os lightmaps foram gerados com informações "
"direcionais. Veja também [member LightmapGI.directional]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"If [param uses_spherical_harmonics] is [code]true[/code], tells the engine "
"to treat the lightmap data as if it was baked with directional information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value on already baked lightmaps will not cause "
"them to be baked again. This means the material appearance will look "
"incorrect until lightmaps are baked again, in which case the value set here "
"is discarded as the entire [LightmapGIData] resource is replaced by the "
"lightmapper."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"The lightmap atlas can now contain multiple textures. See [member "
"lightmap_textures]."
msgstr ""
"O atlas de lightmap agora pode conter várias texturas. Consulte [member "
"lightmap_textures]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid "The lightmap atlas texture generated by the lightmapper."
msgstr "A textura do atlas do mapa de luz gerada pelo mapeador de luz."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid "The lightmap atlas textures generated by the lightmapper."
msgstr "As texturas do atlas do mapa de luz geradas pelo mapeador de luz."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid "The shadowmask atlas textures generated by the lightmapper."
msgstr ""
"As texturas do atlas de máscara de sombra geradas pelo mapeador de luz."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"Shadowmasking is disabled. No shadowmask texture will be created when baking "
"lightmaps. Existing shadowmask textures will be removed during baking."
msgstr ""
"A máscara de sombra está desativada. Nenhuma textura de máscara de sombra "
"será criada ao criar mapas de luz. Texturas de máscara de sombra existentes "
"serão removidas durante a criação."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"Shadowmasking is enabled. Directional shadows that are outside the [member "
"DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance] will be rendered using "
"the shadowmask texture. Shadows that are inside the range will be rendered "
"using real-time shadows exclusively. This mode allows for more precise real-"
"time shadows up close, without the potential \"smearing\" effect that can "
"occur when using lightmaps with a high texel size. The downside is that when "
"the camera moves fast, the transition between the real-time light and "
"shadowmask can be obvious. Also, objects that only have shadows baked in the "
"shadowmask (and no real-time shadows) won't display any shadows up close."
msgstr ""
"O mascaramento de sombra está habilitado. Sombras direcionais que estão fora "
"de [member DirectionalLight3D.directional_shadow_max_distance] serão "
"renderizadas usando a textura de máscara de sombra. Sombras que estão dentro "
"do intervalo serão renderizadas usando sombras em tempo real exclusivamente. "
"Este modo permite sombras em tempo real mais precisas de perto, sem o "
"potencial efeito de \"borrão\" que pode ocorrer ao usar mapas de luz com um "
"tamanho de texel alto. A desvantagem é que, quando a câmera se move rápido, "
"a transição entre a luz em tempo real e a máscara de sombra pode ser óbvia. "
"Além disso, objetos que têm apenas sombras baking na máscara de sombra (e "
"nenhuma sombra em tempo real) não exibirão nenhuma sombra de perto."

#: doc/classes/LightmapGIData.xml
msgid ""
"Shadowmasking is enabled. Directional shadows will be rendered with real-"
"time shadows overlaid on top of the shadowmask texture. This mode makes for "
"smoother shadow transitions when the camera moves fast, at the cost of a "
"potential smearing effect for directional shadows that are up close (due to "
"the real-time shadow being mixed with a low-resolution shadowmask). Objects "
"that only have shadows baked in the shadowmask (and no real-time shadows) "
"will keep their shadows up close."
msgstr ""
"O mascaramento de sombra está habilitado. As sombras direcionais serão "
"renderizadas com sombras em tempo real sobrepostas à textura de máscara de "
"sombra. Este modo proporciona transições de sombra mais suaves quando a "
"câmera se move rapidamente, ao custo de um potencial efeito de borrão para "
"sombras direcionais que estão de perto (devido à sombra em tempo real ser "
"misturada com uma máscara de sombra de baixa resolução). Os objetos que têm "
"apenas sombras em bake na máscara de sombra (e nenhuma sombra em tempo real) "
"manterão suas sombras de perto."

#: doc/classes/Lightmapper.xml
msgid "Abstract class extended by lightmappers, for use in [LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"Classe abstrata estendida por mapeadores de luz, para uso em [LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/Lightmapper.xml
msgid ""
"This class should be extended by custom lightmapper classes. Lightmappers "
"can then be used with [LightmapGI] to provide fast baked global illumination "
"in 3D.\n"
"Godot contains a built-in GPU-based lightmapper [LightmapperRD] that uses "
"compute shaders, but custom lightmappers can be implemented by C++ modules."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapperRD.xml
msgid "The built-in GPU-based lightmapper for use with [LightmapGI]."
msgstr "O mapeador de luz baseado em GPU embutido para uso com [LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapperRD.xml
msgid ""
"LightmapperRD (\"RD\" stands for [RenderingDevice]) is the built-in GPU-"
"based lightmapper for use with [LightmapGI]. On most dedicated GPUs, it can "
"bake lightmaps much faster than most CPU-based lightmappers. LightmapperRD "
"uses compute shaders to bake lightmaps, so it does not require CUDA or "
"OpenCL libraries to be installed to be usable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This lightmapper requires the GPU to support the "
"[RenderingDevice] backend (Forward+ and Mobile renderers). When using the "
"Compatibility renderer, baking will use a temporary [RenderingDevice]. "
"Support for [RenderingDevice] is not required to [i]render[/i] lightmaps "
"that were already baked beforehand."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightmapProbe.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a single manually placed probe for dynamic object lighting with "
"[LightmapGI]."
msgstr ""
"Representa uma única sonda colocada manualmente para iluminação de objetos "
"dinâmicos com [LightmapGI]."

#: doc/classes/LightmapProbe.xml
msgid ""
"[LightmapProbe] represents the position of a single manually placed probe "
"for dynamic object lighting with [LightmapGI]. Lightmap probes affect the "
"lighting of [GeometryInstance3D]-derived nodes that have their [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.gi_mode] set to [constant "
"GeometryInstance3D.GI_MODE_DYNAMIC].\n"
"Typically, [LightmapGI] probes are placed automatically by setting [member "
"LightmapGI.generate_probes_subdiv] to a value other than [constant "
"LightmapGI.GENERATE_PROBES_DISABLED]. By creating [LightmapProbe] nodes "
"before baking lightmaps, you can add more probes in specific areas for "
"greater detail, or disable automatic generation and rely only on manually "
"placed probes instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [LightmapProbe] nodes that are placed after baking lightmaps "
"are ignored by dynamic objects. You must bake lightmaps again after creating "
"or modifying [LightmapProbe]s for the probes to be effective."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LightOccluder2D.xml
msgid "Occludes light cast by a Light2D, casting shadows."
msgstr "Oclui a luz projetada por um Light2D, projetando sombras."

#: doc/classes/LightOccluder2D.xml
msgid ""
"Occludes light cast by a Light2D, casting shadows. The LightOccluder2D must "
"be provided with an [OccluderPolygon2D] in order for the shadow to be "
"computed."
msgstr ""
"Oclui a luz projetada por um Light2D, projetando sombras. O LightOccluder2D "
"deve ser fornecido com um [OccluderPolygon2D] para que a sombra seja "
"calculada."

#: doc/classes/LightOccluder2D.xml
msgid "The [OccluderPolygon2D] used to compute the shadow."
msgstr "O [OccluderPolygon2D] usado para computar a sombra."

#: doc/classes/LightOccluder2D.xml
msgid ""
"The LightOccluder2D's occluder light mask. The LightOccluder2D will cast "
"shadows only from Light2D(s) that have the same light mask(s)."
msgstr ""
"A máscara de luz do oclusor do LightOccluder2D. O LightOccluder2D projetará "
"sombras apenas de Light2D(s) que possuem a mesma máscara de luz."

#: doc/classes/LightOccluder2D.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, the occluder will be part of a real-time generated signed "
"distance field that can be used in custom shaders."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, o oclusor fará parte de um campo de distância sinalizada gerado "
"em tempo real que pode ser usado em shaders personalizados."

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid "Limit bone rotation angular velocity."
msgstr "Limita a velocidade angular de rotação do osso."

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"This modifier limits bone rotation angular velocity by comparing poses "
"between previous and current frame.\n"
"You can add bone chains by specifying their root and end bones, then add the "
"bones between them to a list. Modifier processes either that list or the "
"bones excluding those in the list depending on the option [member exclude].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most methods in this class take an [code]index[/code] "
"parameter. This parameter specifies which setting list entry to return if "
"the IK has multiple entries (e.g. [code]settings/<index>/root_bone_name[/"
"code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid "Clear all chains."
msgstr "Limpar todas as correntes."

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the reference pose for angle comparison to the current pose with the "
"influence of constraints removed. This function is automatically triggered "
"when joints change or upon activation."
msgstr ""
"Define a pose de referência para comparação de ângulo para a pose atual com "
"a influência das restrições removida. Esta função é acionada automaticamente "
"quando as juntas mudam ou após a ativação."

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the end bone name of the bone chain.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] End bone must be the root bone or a child of the root bone."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid "The number of chains."
msgstr "O número de correntes."

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the modifier processes bones not included in the bone "
"list.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], the bones processed by the modifier are equal to the "
"bone list."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid "The number of joints in the list which created by chains dynamically."
msgstr ""
"O número de articulações na lista que são criadas por correntes "
"dinamicamente."

#: doc/classes/LimitAngularVelocityModifier3D.xml
msgid "The maximum angular velocity per second."
msgstr "A velocidade angular máxima por segundo."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "A 2D polyline that can optionally be textured."
msgstr "Uma polilinhas 2D que pode opcionalmente receber textura."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"This node draws a 2D polyline, i.e. a shape consisting of several points "
"connected by segments. [Line2D] is not a mathematical polyline, i.e. the "
"segments are not infinitely thin. It is intended for rendering and it can be "
"colored and optionally textured.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Certain configurations may be impossible to draw nicely, "
"such as very sharp angles. In these situations, the node uses fallback "
"drawing logic to look decent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Line2D] is drawn using a 2D mesh."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a point with the specified [param position] relative to the polyline's "
"own position. If no [param index] is provided, the new point will be added "
"to the end of the points array.\n"
"If [param index] is given, the new point is inserted before the existing "
"point identified by index [param index]. The indices of the points after the "
"new point get increased by 1. The provided [param index] must not exceed the "
"number of existing points in the polyline. See [method get_point_count]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "Removes all points from the polyline, making it empty."
msgstr "Remove todos os pontos da polilinha, tornando-a vazia."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "Returns the number of points in the polyline."
msgstr "Retorna o número de pontos na polilinha."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "Returns the position of the point at index [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna a posição do ponto no índice [param index]."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "Removes the point at index [param index] from the polyline."
msgstr "Remove o ponto no índice [param index] da polilinha."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Overwrites the position of the point at the given [param index] with the "
"supplied [param position]."
msgstr ""
"Sobrescreve a posição do ponto no índice [param index] fornecido com a "
"[param position] fornecida."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the polyline's border will be anti-aliased.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Line2D] is not accelerated by batching when being anti-aliased."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"The style of the beginning of the polyline, if [member closed] is "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O estilo do início da polilinha, se [member closed] for [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and the polyline has more than 2 points, the last point "
"and the first one will be connected by a segment.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The shape of the closing segment is not guaranteed to be "
"seamless if a [member width_curve] is provided.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The joint between the closing segment and the first segment is "
"drawn first and it samples the [member gradient] and the [member "
"width_curve] at the beginning. This is an implementation detail that might "
"change in a future version."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "The color of the polyline. Will not be used if a gradient is set."
msgstr "A cor da polilinhas. Não será usada se um gradiente estiver definido."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"The style of the end of the polyline, if [member closed] is [code]false[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"O estilo da extremidade da polilinha, se [member closed] for [code]false[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"The gradient is drawn through the whole line from start to finish. The "
"[member default_color] will not be used if this property is set."
msgstr ""
"O gradiente é desenhado em toda a linha do início ao fim. A [member "
"default_color] não será usada se esta propriedade estiver definida."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "The style of the connections between segments of the polyline."
msgstr "O estilo das conexões entre os segmentos da polilinha."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"The points of the polyline, interpreted in local 2D coordinates. Segments "
"are drawn between the adjacent points in this array."
msgstr ""
"Os pontos da polilinha, interpretados em coordenadas 2D locais. Os segmentos "
"são desenhados entre os pontos adjacentes nesta matriz."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"The smoothness used for rounded joints and caps. Higher values result in "
"smoother corners, but are more demanding to render and update."
msgstr ""
"A suavidade usada para juntas e extremidades arredondadas. Valores mais "
"altos resultam em cantos mais suaves, mas são mais exigentes para renderizar "
"e atualizar."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Determines the miter limit of the polyline. Normally, when [member "
"joint_mode] is set to [constant LINE_JOINT_SHARP], sharp angles fall back to "
"using the logic of [constant LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] joints to prevent very long "
"miters. Higher values of this property mean that the fallback to a bevel "
"joint will happen at sharper angles."
msgstr ""
"Determina o limite de miter da polilinha. Normalmente, quando [member "
"joint_mode] é definido como [constant LINE_JOINT_SHARP], ângulos agudos "
"recorrem ao uso da lógica de juntas [constant LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] para evitar "
"pontas muito longas. Valores mais altos desta propriedade significam que a "
"reversão para uma junta chanfrada acontecerá em ângulos mais agudos."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"The texture used for the polyline. Uses [member texture_mode] for drawing "
"style."
msgstr ""
"A textura usada para a polilinha. Usa [member texture_mode] para o estilo de "
"desenho."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "The style to render the [member texture] of the polyline."
msgstr "O estilo para renderizar o [member texture] da polilinha."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "The polyline's width."
msgstr "A largura da polilinha."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"The polyline's width curve. The width of the polyline over its length will "
"be equivalent to the value of the width curve over its domain. The width "
"curve should be a unit [Curve]."
msgstr ""
"A curva de largura da polilinhas. A largura da polilinhas ao longo de seu "
"comprimento será equivalente ao valor da curva de largura ao longo de seu "
"domínio. A curva de largura deve ser uma [Curve] unitária."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the polyline's joints pointy, connecting the sides of the two segments "
"by extending them until they intersect. If the rotation of a joint is too "
"big (based on [member sharp_limit]), the joint falls back to [constant "
"LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] to prevent very long miters."
msgstr ""
"Torna as junções da polilinhas pontiagudas, conectando os lados dos dois "
"segmentos ao estendê-los até que se cruzem. Se a rotação de uma junção for "
"muito grande (com base em [member sharp_limit]), a junção recorre a "
"[constant LINE_JOINT_BEVEL] para evitar mitres muito longos."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the polyline's joints bevelled/chamfered, connecting the sides of the "
"two segments with a simple line."
msgstr ""
"Faz com que as junções da polilinhas sejam chanfradas, conectando os lados "
"dos dois segmentos com uma linha simples."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Makes the polyline's joints rounded, connecting the sides of the two "
"segments with an arc. The detail of this arc depends on [member "
"round_precision]."
msgstr ""
"Torna as juntas da polilinha arredondadas, conectando os lados dos dois "
"segmentos com um arco. O detalhe deste arco depende de [member "
"round_precision]."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "Draws no line cap."
msgstr "Não desenha nenhuma extremidade de linha."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "Draws the line cap as a box, slightly extending the first/last segment."
msgstr ""
"Desenha a ponta da linha como uma caixa, estendendo ligeiramente o primeiro/"
"último segmento."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid "Draws the line cap as a semicircle attached to the first/last segment."
msgstr ""
"Desenha a ponta da linha como um semicírculo anexado ao primeiro/último "
"segmento."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Takes the left pixels of the texture and renders them over the whole "
"polyline."
msgstr ""
"Pega os pixels esquerdos da textura e os renderiza sobre toda a polilinha."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Tiles the texture over the polyline. [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat] of "
"the [Line2D] node must be [constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED] or "
"[constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_MIRROR] for it to work properly."
msgstr ""
"Repete a textura sobre a polilinha. O [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat] do "
"nó [Line2D] deve ser [constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_ENABLED] ou "
"[constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_MIRROR] para funcionar corretamente."

#: doc/classes/Line2D.xml
msgid ""
"Stretches the texture across the polyline. [member "
"CanvasItem.texture_repeat] of the [Line2D] node must be [constant "
"CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_DISABLED] for best results."
msgstr ""
"Estica a textura ao longo da polilinha. [member CanvasItem.texture_repeat] "
"do nó [Line2D] deve ser [constant CanvasItem.TEXTURE_REPEAT_DISABLED] para "
"obter melhores resultados."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "An input field for single-line text."
msgstr "Um campo de entrada para texto de linha única."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"[LineEdit] provides an input field for editing a single line of text.\n"
"- When the [LineEdit] control is focused using the keyboard arrow keys, it "
"will only gain focus and not enter edit mode.\n"
"- To enter edit mode, click on the control with the mouse, see also [member "
"keep_editing_on_text_submit].\n"
"- To exit edit mode, press [code]ui_text_submit[/code] or [code]ui_cancel[/"
"code] (by default [kbd]Escape[/kbd]) actions.\n"
"- Check [method edit], [method unedit], [method is_editing], and [signal "
"editing_toggled] for more information.\n"
"While entering text, it is possible to insert special characters using "
"Unicode, OEM or Windows alt codes:\n"
"- To enter Unicode codepoints, hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type the codepoint on "
"the numpad. For example, to enter the character [code]á[/code] (U+00E1), "
"hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type [kbd]+E1[/kbd] on the numpad (the leading "
"zeroes can be omitted).\n"
"- To enter OEM codepoints, hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type the code on the "
"numpad. For example, to enter the character [code]á[/code] (OEM 160), hold "
"[kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type [code]160[/code] on the numpad.\n"
"- To enter Windows codepoints, hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type the code on the "
"numpad. For example, to enter the character [code]á[/code] (Windows 0225), "
"hold [kbd]Alt[/kbd] and type [kbd]0[/kbd], [kbd]2[/kbd], [kbd]2[/kbd], "
"[kbd]5[/kbd] on the numpad. The leading zero here must [b]not[/b] be "
"omitted, as this is how Windows codepoints are distinguished from OEM "
"codepoints.\n"
"[b]Important:[/b]\n"
"- Focusing the [LineEdit] with [code]ui_focus_next[/code] (by default "
"[kbd]Tab[/kbd]) or [code]ui_focus_prev[/code] (by default [kbd]Shift + Tab[/"
"kbd]) or [method Control.grab_focus] still enters edit mode (for "
"compatibility).\n"
"[LineEdit] features many built-in shortcuts that are always available "
"([kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] here maps to [kbd]Cmd[/kbd] on macOS):\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd]: Copy\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + X[/kbd]: Cut\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + V[/kbd] or [kbd]Ctrl + Y[/kbd]: Paste/\"yank\"\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + Z[/kbd]: Undo\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + ~[/kbd]: Swap input direction.\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + Shift + Z[/kbd]: Redo\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + U[/kbd]: Delete text from the caret position to the beginning "
"of the line\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + K[/kbd]: Delete text from the caret position to the end of the "
"line\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]: Select all text\n"
"- [kbd]Up Arrow[/kbd]/[kbd]Down Arrow[/kbd]: Move the caret to the beginning/"
"end of the line\n"
"On macOS, some extra keyboard shortcuts are available:\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + F[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Right Arrow[/kbd], move the caret one "
"character right\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + B[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Left Arrow[/kbd], move the caret one "
"character left\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + P[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Up Arrow[/kbd], move the caret to the "
"previous line\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + N[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Down Arrow[/kbd], move the caret to the "
"next line\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + D[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Delete[/kbd], delete the character on the "
"right side of caret\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + H[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Backspace[/kbd], delete the character on "
"the left side of the caret\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + A[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Home[/kbd], move the caret to the "
"beginning of the line\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + E[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]End[/kbd], move the caret to the end of "
"the line\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + Left Arrow[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]Home[/kbd], move the caret to "
"the beginning of the line\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + Right Arrow[/kbd]: Same as [kbd]End[/kbd], move the caret to "
"the end of the line\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Caret movement shortcuts listed above are not affected by "
"[member shortcut_keys_enabled]."
msgstr ""
"[LineEdit] fornece um campo de entrada para editar uma única linha de "
"texto.\n"
"- Quando o controle [LineEdit] recebe foco usando as setas do teclado, ele "
"apenas ganha foco e não entra no modo de edição.\n"
"- Para entrar no modo de edição, clique no controle com o mouse; veja também "
"[member keep_editing_on_text_submit].\n"
"- Para sair do modo de edição, pressione as ações [code]ui_text_submit[/"
"code] ou [code]ui_cancel[/code] (por padrão, [kbd]Escape[/kbd]).\n"
"- Consulte [method edit], [method unedit], [method is_editing] e [signal "
"editing_toggled] para obter mais informações.\n"
"Ao inserir texto, é possível inserir caracteres especiais usando códigos Alt "
"em Unicode, OEM ou Windows:\n"
"- Para inserir pontos de código Unicode, mantenha [kbd]Alt[/kbd] pressionado "
"e digite o ponto de código no teclado numérico. Por exemplo, para inserir o "
"caractere [code]á[/code] (U+00E1), mantenha [kbd]Alt[/kbd] pressionado e "
"digite [kbd]+E1[/kbd] no teclado numérico (os zeros à esquerda podem ser "
"omitidos).\n"
"- Para inserir pontos de código OEM, mantenha [kbd]Alt[/kbd] pressionado e "
"digite o código no teclado numérico. Por exemplo, para inserir o caractere "
"[code]á[/code] (OEM 160), mantenha [kbd]Alt[/kbd] pressionado e digite "
"[code]160[/code] no teclado numérico.\n"
"- Para inserir pontos de código do Windows, mantenha [kbd]Alt[/kbd] "
"pressionado e digite o código no teclado numérico. Por exemplo, para inserir "
"o caractere [code]á[/code] (Windows 0225), mantenha [kbd]Alt[/kbd] "
"pressionado e digite [kbd]0[/kbd], [kbd]2[/kbd], [kbd]2[/kbd], [kbd]5[/kbd] "
"no teclado numérico. O zero à esquerda aqui [b]não[/b] deve ser omitido, "
"pois é assim que os pontos de código do Windows são distinguidos dos pontos "
"de código OEM.\n"
"[b]Importante:[/b]\n"
"- Focar o [LineEdit] com [code]ui_focus_next[/code] (por padrão [kbd]Tab[/"
"kbd]), [code]ui_focus_prev[/code] (por padrão [kbd]Shift + Tab[/kbd]) ou "
"[method Control.grab_focus] ainda entra no modo de edição (por "
"compatibilidade).\n"
"O [LineEdit] possui vários atalhos integrados que estão sempre disponíveis "
"([kbd]Ctrl[/kbd] aqui mapeia para [kbd]Cmd[/kbd] no macOS):\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + C[/kbd]: Copiar\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + X[/kbd]: Recortar\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + V[/kbd] ou [kbd]Ctrl + Y[/kbd]: Colar / \"yank\"\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + Z[/kbd]: Desfazer\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + ~[/kbd]: Alternar direção de entrada.\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + Shift + Z[/kbd]: Refazer\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + U[/kbd]: Excluir texto da posição do cursor até o início da "
"linha\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + K[/kbd]: Excluir texto da posição do cursor até o final da "
"linha\n"
"- [kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]: Selecionar todo o texto\n"
"- [kbd]Seta para Cima[/kbd]/[kbd]Seta para Baixo[/kbd]: Mover o cursor para "
"o início/fim da linha\n"
"No macOS, alguns atalhos de teclado extras estão disponíveis:\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + F[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Seta para Direita[/kbd], move o "
"cursor um caractere para a direita\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + B[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Seta para Esquerda[/kbd], move o "
"cursor um caractere para a esquerda\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + P[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Seta para Cima[/kbd], move o cursor "
"para a linha anterior\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + N[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Seta para Baixo[/kbd], move o cursor "
"para a próxima linha\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + D[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Delete[/kbd], exclui o caractere à "
"direita do cursor\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + H[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Backspace[/kbd], exclui o caractere à "
"esquerda do cursor\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + A[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Home[/kbd], move o cursor para o "
"início da linha\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + E[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]End[/kbd], move o cursor para o final "
"da linha\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + Seta para Esquerda[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]Home[/kbd], move o "
"cursor para o início da linha\n"
"- [kbd]Cmd + Seta para Direita[/kbd]: O mesmo que [kbd]End[/kbd], move o "
"cursor para o final da linha\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Os atalhos de movimento do cursor listados acima não são "
"afetados por [member shortcut_keys_enabled]."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Applies text from the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input "
"Method Editor[/url] (IME) and closes the IME if it is open."
msgstr ""
"Aplica o texto do [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Editor de "
"Método de Entrada (IME)[/url] e fecha o IME se ele estiver aberto."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Closes the [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method "
"Editor[/url] (IME) if it is open. Any text in the IME will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Fecha o [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Editor de Método de "
"Entrada (IME)[/url] se ele estiver aberto. Qualquer texto no IME será "
"perdido."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Erases the [LineEdit]'s [member text]."
msgstr "Apaga o [member text] do [LineEdit]."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Deletes one character at the caret's current position (equivalent to "
"pressing [kbd]Delete[/kbd])."
msgstr ""
"Exclui um caractere na posição atual do cursor de inserção (equivalente a "
"pressionar [kbd]Delete[/kbd])."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Deletes a section of the [member text] going from position [param "
"from_column] to [param to_column]. Both parameters should be within the "
"text's length."
msgstr ""
"Exclui uma seção do [member text] que vai da posição [param from_column] até "
"[param to_column]. Ambos os parâmetros devem estar dentro do comprimento do "
"texto."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid "Clears the current selection."
msgstr "Limpa a seleção atual."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Allows entering edit mode whether the [LineEdit] is focused or not. If "
"[param hide_focus] is [code]true[/code], the focused state will not be shown "
"(see [method Control.grab_focus]).\n"
"See also [member keep_editing_on_text_submit]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [PopupMenu] of this [LineEdit]. By default, this menu is "
"displayed when right-clicking on the [LineEdit].\n"
"You can add custom menu items or remove standard ones. Make sure your IDs "
"don't conflict with the standard ones (see [enum MenuItems]). For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar menu = get_menu()\n"
"\t# Remove all items after \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.item_count = menu.get_item_index(MENU_REDO) + 1\n"
"\t# Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.add_separator()\n"
"\tmenu.add_item(\"Insert Date\", MENU_MAX + 1)\n"
"\t# Connect callback.\n"
"\tmenu.id_pressed.connect(_on_item_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_item_pressed(id):\n"
"\tif id == MENU_MAX + 1:\n"
"\t\tinsert_text_at_caret(Time.get_date_string_from_system())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar menu = GetMenu();\n"
"\t// Remove all items after \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.ItemCount = menu.GetItemIndex(LineEdit.MenuItems.Redo) + 1;\n"
"\t// Add custom items.\n"
"\tmenu.AddSeparator();\n"
"\tmenu.AddItem(\"Insert Date\", LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1);\n"
"\t// Add event handler.\n"
"\tmenu.IdPressed += OnItemPressed;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void OnItemPressed(int id)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (id == LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInsertTextAtCaret(Time.GetDateStringFromSystem());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This is a required internal node, removing and freeing it "
"may cause a crash. If you wish to hide it or any of its children, use their "
"[member Window.visible] property."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [PopupMenu] deste [LineEdit]. Por padrão, este menu é exibido ao "
"clicar com o botão direito no [LineEdit].\n"
"Você pode adicionar itens de menu personalizados ou remover os padrão. "
"Certifique-se de que seus IDs não entrem em conflito com os padrão (consulte "
"[enum MenuItems]). Por exemplo:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar menu = get_menu()\n"
"\t# Remove todos os itens após \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.item_count = menu.get_item_index(MENU_REDO) + 1\n"
"\t# Adiciona itens personalizados.\n"
"\tmenu.add_separator()\n"
"\tmenu.add_item(\"Insert Date\", MENU_MAX + 1)\n"
"\t# Conecta o callback.\n"
"\tmenu.id_pressed.connect(_on_item_pressed)\n"
"\n"
"func _on_item_pressed(id):\n"
"\tif id == MENU_MAX + 1:\n"
"\t\tinsert_text_at_caret(Time.get_date_string_from_system())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Ready()\n"
"{\n"
"\tvar menu = GetMenu();\n"
"\t// Remove todos os itens após \"Redo\".\n"
"\tmenu.ItemCount = menu.GetItemIndex(LineEdit.MenuItems.Redo) + 1;\n"
"\t// Adiciona itens personalizados.\n"
"\tmenu.AddSeparator();\n"
"\tmenu.AddItem(\"Insert Date\", LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1);\n"
"\t// Adiciona o manipulador de eventos.\n"
"\tmenu.IdPressed += OnItemPressed;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public void OnItemPressed(int id)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (id == LineEdit.MenuItems.Max + 1)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tInsertTextAtCaret(Time.GetDateStringFromSystem());\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] Este é um nó interno obrigatório; removê-lo e liberá-lo da "
"memória pode causar uma falha. Se você deseja ocultá-lo ou a qualquer um de "
"seus filhos, utilize a propriedade [member Window.visible] deles."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the correct column at the end of a composite character like ❤️‍🩹 "
"(mending heart; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) which is "
"comprised of more than one Unicode code point, if the caret is at the start "
"of the composite character. Also returns the correct column with the caret "
"at mid grapheme and for non-composite characters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To check at caret location use "
"[code]get_next_composite_character_column(get_caret_column())[/code]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the correct column at the start of a composite character like ❤️‍🩹 "
"(mending heart; Unicode: [code]U+2764 U+FE0F U+200D U+1FA79[/code]) which is "
"comprised of more than one Unicode code point, if the caret is at the end of "
"the composite character. Also returns the correct column with the caret at "
"mid grapheme and for non-composite characters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To check at caret location use "
"[code]get_previous_composite_character_column(get_caret_column())[/code]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the scroll offset due to [member caret_column], as a number of "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o deslocamento de rolagem devido a [member caret_column], como um "
"número de caracteres."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the text inside the selection."
msgstr "Retorna o texto dentro da seleção."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the selection begin column."
msgstr "Retorna a coluna de início da seleção."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Returns the selection end column."
msgstr "Retorna a coluna de término da seleção."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the user has text in the [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Input Method Editor[/url] (IME)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o usuário tiver texto no [url=https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method]Editor de Método de Entrada[/url] (IME)."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml doc/classes/UndoRedo.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a \"redo\" action is available."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se uma ação de \"refazer\" estiver disponível."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the user has selected text."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o usuário selecionou texto."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml doc/classes/UndoRedo.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if an \"undo\" action is available."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se uma ação de \"desfazer\" estiver disponível."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Inserts [param text] at the caret. If the resulting value is longer than "
"[member max_length], nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"Insere o [param text] no cursor. Se o valor resultante for mais longo que "
"[member max_length], nada acontece."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Returns whether the [LineEdit] is being edited."
msgstr "Retorna se o [LineEdit] está sendo editado."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the menu is visible. Use this instead of "
"[code]get_menu().visible[/code] to improve performance (so the creation of "
"the menu is avoided)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna se o menu está visível. Use isso em vez de [code]get_menu().visible[/"
"code] para melhorar o desempenho (evitando assim a criação do menu)."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Executes a given action as defined in the [enum MenuItems] enum."
msgstr "Executa uma dada ação conforme definido no enum [enum MenuItems]."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Selects characters inside [LineEdit] between [param from] and [param to]. By "
"default, [param from] is at the beginning and [param to] at the end.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Welcome\"\n"
"select() # Will select \"Welcome\".\n"
"select(4) # Will select \"ome\".\n"
"select(2, 5) # Will select \"lco\".\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Welcome\";\n"
"Select(); // Will select \"Welcome\".\n"
"Select(4); // Will select \"ome\".\n"
"Select(2, 5); // Will select \"lco\".\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Seleciona caracteres dentro do [LineEdit] entre [param from] e [param to]. "
"Por padrão, [param from] está no início e [param to] no final.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Welcome\"\n"
"select() # Selecionará \"Welcome\".\n"
"select(4) # Selecionará \"ome\".\n"
"select(2, 5) # Selecionará \"lco\".\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Welcome\";\n"
"Select(); // Selecionará \"Welcome\".\n"
"Select(4); // Selecionará \"ome\".\n"
"Select(2, 5); // Selecionará \"lco\".\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Selects the whole [String]."
msgstr "Seleciona a [String] inteira."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Allows exiting edit mode while preserving focus."
msgstr "Permite sair do modo de edição preservando o foco."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "The text's horizontal alignment."
msgstr "O alinhamento horizontal do texto."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] and [member caret_mid_grapheme] is [code]false[/code], "
"backspace deletes an entire composite character such as ❤️‍🩹, instead of "
"deleting part of the composite character."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code] e [member caret_mid_grapheme] for [code]false[/code], o "
"backspace exclui um caractere composto inteiro, como ❤️‍🩹, em vez de excluir "
"parte do caractere composto."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], makes the caret blink."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], faz o cursor piscar."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "The interval at which the caret blinks (in seconds)."
msgstr "O intervalo no qual o cursor piscante pisca (em segundos)."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"The caret's column position inside the [LineEdit]. When set, the text may "
"scroll to accommodate it."
msgstr ""
"A posição da coluna do cursor dentro do [LineEdit]. Quando definido, o texto "
"pode rolar para acompanhá-lo."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will always show the caret, even if not "
"editing or focus is lost."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [LineEdit] sempre mostrará o cursor, mesmo se não "
"estiver editando ou se o foco for perdido."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Allow moving caret, selecting and removing the individual composite "
"character components.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [kbd]Backspace[/kbd] is always removing individual composite "
"character components."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will show a clear button if [member "
"text] is not empty, which can be used to clear the text quickly."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [LineEdit] mostrará um botão de limpeza se [member "
"text] não estiver vazio, o que pode ser usado para limpar o texto "
"rapidamente."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the context menu will appear when right-clicked."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o menu de contexto aparecerá ao clicar com o botão "
"direito."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the selected text will be deselected when focus is "
"lost."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o texto selecionado deixará de ser selecionado quando "
"o foco for perdido."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], allow drag and drop of selected text."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite o arrastar e soltar do texto selecionado."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], control characters are displayed."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], caracteres de controle são exibidos."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], existing text cannot be modified and new text cannot "
"be added."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]false[/code], o texto existente não pode ser modificado e novos "
"textos não podem ser adicionados."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], \"Emoji and Symbols\" menu is enabled."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o menu \"Emoji e Símbolos\" estará ativado."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] width will increase to stay longer than "
"the [member text]. It will [b]not[/b] compress if the [member text] is "
"shortened."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a largura do [LineEdit] aumentará para ficar maior que "
"o [member text]. Ele [b]não[/b] comprimirá se o [member text] for encurtado."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] doesn't display decoration."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], o [LineEdit] não exibe decoração."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Define the scaling behavior of the [member right_icon]."
msgstr "Define o comportamento de escala de [member right_icon]."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will not exit edit mode when text is "
"submitted by pressing [code]ui_text_submit[/code] action (by default: "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd] or [kbd]Kp Enter[/kbd])."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [LineEdit] não sairá do modo de edição quando o "
"texto for enviado pressionando a ação [code]ui_text_submit[/code] (por "
"padrão: [kbd]Enter[/kbd] ou [kbd]Kp Enter[/kbd])."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of characters that can be entered inside the [LineEdit]. If "
"[code]0[/code], there is no limit.\n"
"When a limit is defined, characters that would exceed [member max_length] "
"are truncated. This happens both for existing [member text] contents when "
"setting the max length, or for new text inserted in the [LineEdit], "
"including pasting.\n"
"If any input text is truncated, the [signal text_change_rejected] signal is "
"emitted with the truncated substring as a parameter:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Hello world\"\n"
"max_length = 5\n"
"# `text` becomes \"Hello\".\n"
"max_length = 10\n"
"text += \" goodbye\"\n"
"# `text` becomes \"Hello good\".\n"
"# `text_change_rejected` is emitted with \"bye\" as a parameter.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Hello world\";\n"
"MaxLength = 5;\n"
"// `Text` becomes \"Hello\".\n"
"MaxLength = 10;\n"
"Text += \" goodbye\";\n"
"// `Text` becomes \"Hello good\".\n"
"// `text_change_rejected` is emitted with \"bye\" as a parameter.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de caracteres que podem ser inseridos dentro do [LineEdit]. Se "
"[code]0[/code], não há limite.\n"
"Quando um limite é definido, os caracteres que excederem [member max_length] "
"são truncados. Isso acontece tanto para conteúdos existentes em [member "
"text] ao definir o comprimento máximo quanto para novos textos inseridos no "
"[LineEdit], incluindo colar.\n"
"Se qualquer texto de entrada for truncado, o sinal [signal "
"text_change_rejected] é emitido com a substring truncada como parâmetro:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"text = \"Hello world\"\n"
"max_length = 5\n"
"# `text` se torna \"Hello\".\n"
"max_length = 10\n"
"text += \" goodbye\"\n"
"# `text` se torna \"Hello good\".\n"
"# `text_change_rejected` é emitido com \"bye\" como parâmetro.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Text = \"Hello world\";\n"
"MaxLength = 5;\n"
"// `Text` se torna \"Hello\".\n"
"MaxLength = 10;\n"
"Text += \" goodbye\";\n"
"// `Text` se torna \"Hello good\".\n"
"// `text_change_rejected` é emitido com \"bye\" como parâmetro.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], using middle mouse button to paste clipboard will be "
"disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Linux."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Text shown when the [LineEdit] is empty. It is [b]not[/b] the [LineEdit]'s "
"default value (see [member text])."
msgstr ""
"Texto exibido quando o [LineEdit] está vazio. [b]Não[/b] é o valor padrão do "
"[LineEdit] (consulte [member text])."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the icon that will appear in the right end of the [LineEdit] if there's "
"no [member text], or always, if [member clear_button_enabled] is set to "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Define o ícone que aparecerá na extremidade direita do [LineEdit] se não "
"houver [member text], ou sempre, se [member clear_button_enabled] estiver "
"definido como [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Scale ratio of the icon when [member icon_expand_mode] is set to [constant "
"EXPAND_MODE_FIT_TO_LINE_EDIT]."
msgstr ""
"Taxa de escala do ícone quando [member icon_expand_mode] está definido como "
"[constant EXPAND_MODE_FIT_TO_LINE_EDIT]."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], every character is replaced with the secret character "
"(see [member secret_character])."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], cada caractere é substituído pelo caractere secreto "
"(consulte [member secret_character])."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"The character to use to mask secret input. Only a single character can be "
"used as the secret character. If it is longer than one character, only the "
"first one will be used. If it is empty, a space will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"O caractere a ser usado para mascarar a entrada secreta. Apenas um único "
"caractere pode ser usado como o caractere secreto. Se for mais longo do que "
"um caractere, apenas o primeiro será usado. Se estiver vazio, um espaço será "
"usado em seu lugar."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the [LineEdit] will select the whole text when it "
"gains focus."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [LineEdit] selecionará todo o texto quando ganhar "
"foco."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], it's impossible to select the text using mouse nor "
"keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]false[/code], é impossível selecionar o texto usando o mouse ou o "
"teclado."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/RichTextLabel.xml
#: doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shortcut keys for context menu items are enabled, even "
"if the context menu is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as teclas de atalho para itens do menu de contexto são "
"ativadas, mesmo que o menu de contexto esteja desativado."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"String value of the [LineEdit].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing text using this property won't emit the [signal "
"text_changed] signal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the native virtual keyboard is enabled on platforms "
"that support it."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o teclado virtual nativo será ativado em plataformas "
"que o suportam."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the native virtual keyboard is shown on focus events "
"on platforms that support it."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o teclado virtual nativo é exibido em eventos de foco "
"em plataformas que o suportam."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Specifies the type of virtual keyboard to show."
msgstr "Especifica o tipo de teclado virtual a ser exibido."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid "Emitted when the [LineEdit] switches in or out of edit mode."
msgstr "Emitido quando o [LineEdit] entra ou sai do modo de edição."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when appending text that overflows the [member max_length]. The "
"appended text is truncated to fit [member max_length], and the part that "
"couldn't fit is passed as the [param rejected_substring] argument."
msgstr ""
"Emitido ao anexar texto que ultrapassa o [member max_length]. O texto "
"anexado é truncado para caber em [member max_length], e a parte que não "
"coube é passada como o argumento [param rejected_substring]."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml doc/classes/TextEdit.xml
msgid "Emitted when the text changes."
msgstr "Emitido quando o texto muda."

#: doc/classes/LineEdit.xml
