msgstr "Notifica quando o [NavigationMesh] mudou."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid "A server interface for low-level 2D navigation access."
msgstr "Uma interface de servidor para acesso à navegação 2D de baixo nível."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"NavigationServer2D is the server that handles navigation maps, regions and "
"agents. It does not handle A* navigation from [AStar2D] or [AStarGrid2D].\n"
"Maps are divided into regions, which are composed of navigation polygons. "
"Together, they define the traversable areas in the 2D world.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most [NavigationServer2D] changes take effect after the next "
"physics frame and not immediately. This includes all changes made to maps, "
"regions or agents by navigation-related nodes in the scene tree or made "
"through scripts.\n"
"For two regions to be connected to each other, they must share a similar "
"edge. An edge is considered connected to another if both of its two vertices "
"are at a distance less than [code]edge_connection_margin[/code] to the "
"respective other edge's vertex.\n"
"You may assign navigation layers to regions with [method "
"NavigationServer2D.region_set_navigation_layers], which then can be checked "
"upon when requesting a path with [method NavigationServer2D.map_get_path]. "
"This can be used to allow or deny certain areas for some objects.\n"
"To use the collision avoidance system, you may use agents. You can set an "
"agent's target velocity, then the servers will emit a callback with a "
"modified velocity.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The collision avoidance system ignores regions. Using the "
"modified velocity directly may move an agent outside of the traversable "
"area. This is a limitation of the collision avoidance system, any more "
"complex situation may require the use of the physics engine.\n"
"This server keeps tracks of any call and executes them during the sync "
"phase. This means that you can request any change to the map, using any "
"thread, without worrying."
msgstr ""
"O [NavigationServer2D] é o servidor responsável por gerenciar mapas, regiões "
"e agentes de navegação. Ele não lida com navegação A* do [AStar2D] ou do "
"[AStarGrid2D].\n"
"Os mapas são divididos em regiões, que são compostas por polígonos de "
"navegação. Juntos, eles definem as áreas navegáveis no mundo 2D.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A maioria das alterações no [NavigationServer2D] entra em vigor "
"após o próximo quadro de física e não imediatamente. Isso inclui todas as "
"alterações feitas em mapas, regiões ou agentes por nós relacionados à "
"navegação na árvore de cena ou feitas por meio de scripts.\n"
"Para que duas regiões sejam conectadas entre si, elas devem compartilhar uma "
"aresta semelhante. Uma aresta é considerada conectada a outra se ambos os "
"seus dois vértices estiverem a uma distância menor que "
"[code]edge_connection_margin[/code] do vértice da outra aresta "
"correspondente.\n"
"Você pode atribuir camadas de navegação a regiões com [method "
"NavigationServer2D.region_set_navigation_layers], que podem ser verificadas "
"ao solicitar um caminho com [method NavigationServer2D.map_get_path]. Isso "
"pode ser usado para permitir ou negar certas áreas para alguns objetos.\n"
"Para usar o sistema de prevenção de colisões (collision avoidance), você "
"pode usar agentes. Você pode definir a velocidade alvo de um agente, e os "
"servidores emitirão um retorno de chamada (callback) com uma velocidade "
"modificada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O sistema de prevenção de colisões ignora as regiões. Usar a "
"velocidade modificada diretamente pode mover um agente para fora da área "
"navegável. Esta é uma limitação do sistema de prevenção de colisões; "
"qualquer situação mais complexa pode exigir o uso do motor de física.\n"
"Este servidor rastreia todas as chamadas e as executa durante a fase de "
"sincronização. Isso significa que você pode solicitar qualquer alteração no "
"mapa, usando qualquer thread, sem preocupações."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Using NavigationServer"
msgstr "Usando o NavigationServer"

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Creates the agent."
msgstr "Cria o agente."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid "Return [code]true[/code] if the specified [param agent] uses avoidance."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param agent] especificado usar evasão."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]avoidance_layers[/code] bitmask of the specified [param "
"agent]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a máscara de bits [code]avoidance_layers[/code] do [param agent] "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]avoidance_mask[/code] bitmask of the specified [param "
"agent]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a máscara de bits [code]avoidance_mask[/code] do [param agent] "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]avoidance_priority[/code] of the specified [param agent]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a [code]avoidance_priority[/code] do [param agent] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation map [RID] the requested [param agent] is currently "
"assigned to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] do mapa de navegação ao qual o [param agent] solicitado está "
"atribuído no momento."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum number of other agents the specified [param agent] takes "
"into account in the navigation."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número máximo de outros agentes que o [param agent] especificado "
"leva em consideração na navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the maximum speed of the specified [param agent]."
msgstr "Retorna a velocidade máxima do [param agent] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum distance to other agents the specified [param agent] "
"takes into account in the navigation."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a distância máxima até outros agentes que o [param agent] "
"especificado leva em consideração na navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param agent] is paused."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param agent] especificado estiver pausado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the position of the specified [param agent] in world space."
msgstr "Retorna a posição do [param agent] especificado no espaço mundial."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the radius of the specified [param agent]."
msgstr "Retorna o raio do [param agent] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the minimal amount of time for which the specified [param agent]'s "
"velocities that are computed by the simulation are safe with respect to "
"other agents."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade mínima de tempo para a qual as velocidades do [param "
"agent] especificado calculadas pela simulação são seguras em relação a "
"outros agentes."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the minimal amount of time for which the specified [param agent]'s "
"velocities that are computed by the simulation are safe with respect to "
"static avoidance obstacles."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade mínima de tempo para a qual as velocidades do [param "
"agent] especificado que são computadas pela simulação são seguras em relação "
"aos obstáculos estáticos de desvio."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the velocity of the specified [param agent]."
msgstr "Retorna a velocidade do [param agent] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if the specified [param agent] has an avoidance "
"callback."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param agent] especificado tiver um retorno "
"de chamada de evasão."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the map got changed the previous frame."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o mapa foi alterado no quadro anterior."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the callback [Callable] that gets called after each avoidance "
"processing step for the [param agent]. The calculated [code]safe_velocity[/"
"code] will be dispatched with a signal to the object just before the physics "
"calculations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Created callbacks are always processed independently of the "
"SceneTree state as long as the agent is on a navigation map and not freed. "
"To disable the dispatch of a callback from an agent use [method "
"agent_set_avoidance_callback] again with an empty [Callable]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the specified [param agent] uses "
"avoidance."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], o [param agent] especificado usa "
"esquiva (avoidance)."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Set the agent's [code]avoidance_layers[/code] bitmask."
msgstr "Define a máscara de bits [code]avoidance_layers[/code] do agente."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Set the agent's [code]avoidance_mask[/code] bitmask."
msgstr "Define a máscara de bits [code]avoidance_mask[/code] do agente."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the agent's [code]avoidance_priority[/code] with a [param priority] "
"between 0.0 (lowest priority) to 1.0 (highest priority).\n"
"The specified [param agent] does not adjust the velocity for other agents "
"that would match the [code]avoidance_mask[/code] but have a lower "
"[code]avoidance_priority[/code]. This in turn makes the other agents with "
"lower priority adjust their velocities even more to avoid collision with "
"this agent."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Puts the agent in the map."
msgstr "Coloca o agente no mapa."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of other agents the agent takes into account in the "
"navigation. The larger this number, the longer the running time of the "
"simulation. If the number is too low, the simulation will not be safe."
msgstr ""
"Define o número máximo de outros agentes que o agente leva em conta na "
"navegação. Quanto maior esse número, maior será o tempo de execução da "
"simulação. Se o número for muito baixo, a simulação não será segura."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the maximum speed of the agent. Must be positive."
msgstr "Define a velocidade máxima do agente. Deve ser positiva."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum distance to other agents this agent takes into account in "
"the navigation. The larger this number, the longer the running time of the "
"simulation. If the number is too low, the simulation will not be safe."
msgstr ""
"Define a distância máxima para outros agentes que este agente leva em conta "
"na navegação. Quanto maior esse número, maior será o tempo de execução da "
"simulação. Se o número for muito baixo, a simulação não será segura."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param paused] is [code]true[/code] the specified [param agent] will not "
"be processed. For example, it will not calculate avoidance velocities or "
"receive avoidance callbacks."
msgstr ""
"Se [param paused] for [code]true[/code], o [param agent] especificado não "
"será processado. Por exemplo, ele não calculará velocidades de esquiva ou "
"receberá callbacks de esquiva."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the position of the agent in world space."
msgstr "Define a posição do agente no espaço mundial."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the radius of the agent."
msgstr "Define o raio do agente."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimal amount of time for which the agent's velocities that are "
"computed by the simulation are safe with respect to other agents. The larger "
"this number, the sooner this agent will respond to the presence of other "
"agents, but the less freedom this agent has in choosing its velocities. A "
"too high value will slow down agents movement considerably. Must be positive."
msgstr ""
"A quantidade mínima de tempo durante a qual as velocidades do agente "
"calculadas pela simulação são seguras em relação a outros agentes. Quanto "
"maior esse número, mais cedo esse agente responderá à presença de outros "
"agentes, mas menor será a liberdade desse agente na escolha de suas "
"velocidades. Um valor muito alto desacelerará consideravelmente o movimento "
"dos agentes. Deve ser positivo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimal amount of time for which the agent's velocities that are "
"computed by the simulation are safe with respect to static avoidance "
"obstacles. The larger this number, the sooner this agent will respond to the "
"presence of static avoidance obstacles, but the less freedom this agent has "
"in choosing its velocities. A too high value will slow down agents movement "
"considerably. Must be positive."
msgstr ""
"A quantidade mínima de tempo durante a qual as velocidades do agente "
"calculadas pela simulação são seguras em relação aos obstáculos estáticos de "
"desvio. Quanto maior esse número, mais cedo esse agente responderá à "
"presença de obstáculos estáticos de desvio, mas menor será a liberdade desse "
"agente na escolha de suas velocidades. Um valor muito alto desacelerará "
"consideravelmente o movimento dos agentes. Deve ser positivo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets [param velocity] as the new wanted velocity for the specified [param "
"agent]. The avoidance simulation will try to fulfill this velocity if "
"possible but will modify it to avoid collision with other agent's and "
"obstacles. When an agent is teleported to a new position far away use "
"[method agent_set_velocity_forced] instead to reset the internal velocity "
"state."
msgstr ""
"Define [param velocity] como a nova velocidade desejada para o [param agent] "
"especificado. A simulação de desvio tentará cumprir esta velocidade se "
"possível, mas a modificará para evitar colisão com outros agentes e "
"obstáculos. Quando um agente for teletransportado para uma nova posição "
"distante, use [method agent_set_velocity_forced] em vez disso para redefinir "
"o estado de velocidade interno."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the internal velocity in the collision avoidance simulation with "
"[param velocity] for the specified [param agent]. When an agent is "
"teleported to a new position far away this function should be used in the "
"same frame. If called frequently this function can get agents stuck."
msgstr ""
"Substitui a velocidade interna na simulação de desvio de colisão por [param "
"velocity] para o [param agent] especificado. Quando um agente é "
"teletransportado para uma nova posição distante, esta função deve ser usada "
"no mesmo quadro. Se chamada com frequência, esta função pode fazer com que "
"os agentes fiquem presos."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Bakes the provided [param navigation_polygon] with the data from the "
"provided [param source_geometry_data]. After the process is finished the "
"optional [param callback] will be called."
msgstr ""
"Gera a [param navigation_polygon] fornecida com os dados do [param "
"source_geometry_data] fornecido. Após a conclusão do processo, o [param "
"callback] opcional será chamado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Bakes the provided [param navigation_polygon] with the data from the "
"provided [param source_geometry_data] as an async task running on a "
"background thread. After the process is finished the optional [param "
"callback] will be called."
msgstr ""
"Faz o bake do [param navigation_polygon] fornecido com os dados do [param "
"source_geometry_data] fornecido como uma tarefa assíncrona executada em uma "
"thread em segundo plano. Após o término do processo, o [param callback] "
"opcional será chamado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Destroys the given RID."
msgstr "Destrói o RID fornecido."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] when the NavigationServer has debug enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] quando o NavigationServer está com a depuração "
"ativada."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all created navigation map [RID]s on the NavigationServer. This "
"returns both 2D and 3D created navigation maps as there is technically no "
"distinction between them."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os [RID]s de mapas de navegação criados no NavigationServer. "
"Isso retorna mapas de navegação criados em 2D e 3D, pois tecnicamente não há "
"distinção entre eles."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns information about the current state of the NavigationServer."
msgstr "Retorna informações sobre o estado atual do NavigationServer."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the provided navigation polygon is being "
"baked on a background thread."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] quando o polígono de navegação fornecido está "
"sendo gerado em uma thread em segundo plano."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Create a new link between two positions on a map."
msgstr "Cria um novo link entre duas posições em um mapa."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param link] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param link] especificado estiver ativado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the ending position of this [param link]."
msgstr "Retorna a posição final deste [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the enter cost of this [param link]."
msgstr "Retorna o custo de entrada deste [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current iteration ID of the navigation link. Every time the "
"navigation link changes and synchronizes, the iteration ID increases. An "
"iteration ID of [code]0[/code] means the navigation link has never "
"synchronized.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The iteration ID will wrap around to [code]1[/code] after "
"reaching its range limit."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation map [RID] the requested [param link] is currently "
"assigned to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] do mapa de navegação ao qual o [param link] solicitado está "
"atribuído no momento."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the navigation layers for this [param link]."
msgstr "Retorna as camadas de navegação para este [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]ObjectID[/code] of the object which manages this link."
msgstr "Retorna o [code]ObjectID[/code] do objeto que gerencia este link."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the starting position of this [param link]."
msgstr "Retorna a posição inicial deste [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the travel cost of this [param link]."
msgstr "Retorna o custo de viagem deste [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns whether this [param link] can be travelled in both directions."
msgstr "Retorna se este [param link] pode ser percorrido em ambas as direções."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets whether this [param link] can be travelled in both directions."
msgstr "Define se este [param link] pode ser percorrido em ambas as direções."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the specified [param link] will "
"contribute to its current navigation map."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], o [param link] especificado "
"contribuirá para seu mapa de navegação atual."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the exit position for the [param link]."
msgstr "Define a posição de saída para o [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the [param enter_cost] for this [param link]."
msgstr "Define o [param enter_cost] para este [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the navigation map [RID] for the link."
msgstr "Define o [RID] do mapa de navegação para o link."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the links's navigation layers. This allows selecting links from a path "
"request (when using [method NavigationServer2D.map_get_path])."
msgstr ""
"Define as camadas de navegação dos links. Isso permite selecionar links de "
"uma solicitação de caminho (ao usar [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_get_path])."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Set the [code]ObjectID[/code] of the object which manages this link."
msgstr "Define o [code]ObjectID[/code] do objeto que gerencia este link."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the entry position for this [param link]."
msgstr "Define a posição de entrada para este [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the [param travel_cost] for this [param link]."
msgstr "Define o [param travel_cost] para este [param link]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Create a new map."
msgstr "Criar um novo mapa."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"This method is no longer supported, as it is incompatible with asynchronous "
"updates. It can only be used in a single-threaded context, at your own risk."
msgstr ""
"Este método não é mais suportado, pois é incompatível com atualizações "
"assíncronas. Ele só pode ser usado em um contexto de thread única, por sua "
"conta e risco."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"This function immediately forces synchronization of the specified navigation "
"[param map] [RID]. By default navigation maps are only synchronized at the "
"end of each physics frame. This function can be used to immediately "
"(re)calculate all the navigation meshes and region connections of the "
"navigation map. This makes it possible to query a navigation path for a "
"changed map immediately and in the same frame (multiple times if needed).\n"
"Due to technical restrictions the current NavigationServer command queue "
"will be flushed. This means all already queued update commands for this "
"physics frame will be executed, even those intended for other maps, regions "
"and agents not part of the specified map. The expensive computation of the "
"navigation meshes and region connections of a map will only be done for the "
"specified map. Other maps will receive the normal synchronization at the end "
"of the physics frame. Should the specified map receive changes after the "
"forced update it will update again as well when the other maps receive their "
"update.\n"
"Avoidance processing and dispatch of the [code]safe_velocity[/code] signals "
"is unaffected by this function and continues to happen for all maps and "
"agents at the end of the physics frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With great power comes great responsibility. This function "
"should only be used by users that really know what they are doing and have a "
"good reason for it. Forcing an immediate update of a navigation map requires "
"locking the NavigationServer and flushing the entire NavigationServer "
"command queue. Not only can this severely impact the performance of a game "
"but it can also introduce bugs if used inappropriately without much "
"foresight."
msgstr ""
"Esta função força imediatamente a sincronização do [RID] do [param map] de "
"navegação especificado. Por padrão, os mapas de navegação são sincronizados "
"apenas no final de cada quadro de física. Esta função pode ser usada para "
"(re)calcular imediatamente todas as malhas de navegação (navigation meshes) "
"e conexões de regiões do mapa de navegação. Isso torna possível consultar um "
"caminho de navegação para um mapa alterado imediatamente e no mesmo quadro "
"(várias vezes, se necessário).\n"
"Devido a restrições técnicas, a fila de comandos atual do NavigationServer "
"será descarregada (flushed). Isso significa que todos os comandos de "
"atualização já enfileirados para este quadro de física serão executados, "
"mesmo aqueles destinados a outros mapas, regiões e agentes que não fazem "
"parte do mapa especificado. O cálculo custoso das malhas de navegação e "
"conexões de região de um mapa será feito apenas para o mapa especificado. "
"Outros mapas receberão a sincronização normal no final do quadro de física. "
"Caso o mapa especificado receba alterações após a atualização forçada, ele "
"será atualizado novamente quando os outros mapas receberem sua atualização.\n"
"O processamento de desvio (avoidance) e o disparo dos sinais "
"[code]safe_velocity[/code] não são afetados por esta função e continuam "
"ocorrendo para todos os mapas e agentes no final do quadro de física.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Com grandes poderes vêm grandes responsabilidades. Esta função "
"deve ser usada apenas por usuários que realmente sabem o que estão fazendo e "
"têm um bom motivo para isso. Forçar uma atualização imediata de um mapa de "
"navegação requer o bloqueio do NavigationServer e o descarregamento de toda "
"a fila de comandos do NavigationServer. Isso não apenas pode impactar "
"gravemente o desempenho de um jogo, mas também pode introduzir bugs se usado "
"de forma inadequada, sem muita cautela."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all navigation agents [RID]s that are currently assigned to the "
"requested navigation [param map]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os [RID]s de agentes de navegação atualmente atribuídos ao "
"[param map] de navegação solicitado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the map cell size used to rasterize the navigation mesh vertices."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho da célula do mapa usado para rasterizar os vértices da "
"malha de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation mesh surface point closest to the provided [param "
"to_point] on the navigation [param map]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto da superfície da malha de navegação mais próximo do [param "
"to_point] fornecido no [param map] de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the owner region RID for the navigation mesh surface point closest "
"to the provided [param to_point] on the navigation [param map]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o RID da região proprietária para o ponto da superfície da malha de "
"navegação mais próximo do [param to_point] fornecido no [param map] de "
"navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the edge connection margin of the map. The edge connection margin is "
"a distance used to connect two regions."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a margem de conexão de borda do mapa. A margem de conexão de borda é "
"uma distância usada para conectar duas regiões."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current iteration id of the navigation map. Every time the "
"navigation map changes and synchronizes the iteration id increases. An "
"iteration id of 0 means the navigation map has never synchronized.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The iteration id will wrap back to 1 after reaching its range "
"limit."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the link connection radius of the map. This distance is the maximum "
"range any link will search for navigation mesh polygons to connect to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o raio de conexão de link do mapa. Essa distância é o alcance máximo "
"que qualquer link pesquisará por polígonos de malha de navegação para se "
"conectar."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all navigation link [RID]s that are currently assigned to the "
"requested navigation [param map]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os [RID]s de links de navegação que estão atribuídos "
"atualmente ao [param map] de navegação solicitado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns map's internal merge rasterizer cell scale."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a escala da célula do rasterizador de mesclagem interno do mapa."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all navigation obstacle [RID]s that are currently assigned to the "
"requested navigation [param map]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os [RID]s de obstáculos de navegação atualmente atribuídos ao "
"[param map] de navegação solicitado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation path to reach the destination from the origin. [param "
"navigation_layers] is a bitmask of all region navigation layers that are "
"allowed to be in the path."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho de navegação para alcançar o destino a partir da origem. "
"[param navigation_layers] é uma máscara de bits de todas as camadas de "
"navegação de região que têm permissão para estar no caminho."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a random position picked from all map region polygons with matching "
"[param navigation_layers].\n"
"If [param uniformly] is [code]true[/code], all map regions, polygons, and "
"faces are weighted by their surface area (slower).\n"
"If [param uniformly] is [code]false[/code], just a random region and a "
"random polygon are picked (faster)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all navigation regions [RID]s that are currently assigned to the "
"requested navigation [param map]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os [RID]s de regiões de navegação atualmente atribuídos ao "
"[param map] de navegação solicitado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param map] synchronization uses an async "
"process that runs on a background thread."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a sincronização do [param map] usar um processo "
"assíncrono que roda em uma thread em segundo plano."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the navigation [param map] allows navigation regions to use "
"edge connections to connect with other navigation regions within proximity "
"of the navigation map edge connection margin."
msgstr ""
"Retorna se o [param map] de navegação permite que as regiões de navegação "
"usem conexões de borda para se conectar com outras regiões de navegação "
"dentro da proximidade da margem de conexão de borda do mapa de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the map is active."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o mapa estiver ativo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the map active."
msgstr "Define o mapa como ativo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the map cell size used to rasterize the navigation mesh vertices. Must "
"match with the cell size of the used navigation meshes."
msgstr ""
"Define o tamanho da célula do mapa usado para rasterizar os vértices da "
"malha de navegação. Deve corresponder ao tamanho da célula das malhas de "
"navegação usadas."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the map edge connection margin used to weld the compatible region edges."
msgstr ""
"Define a margem de conexão de borda de mapa usada para soldar as bordas de "
"regiões compatíveis."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the map's link connection radius used to connect links to navigation "
"polygons."
msgstr ""
"Define o raio de conexão de link do mapa usado para conectar links a "
"polígonos de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the map's internal merge rasterizer cell scale used to control merging "
"sensitivity."
msgstr ""
"Define a escala de rasterizador de mesclagem interna do mapa usada para "
"controlar a sensibilidade de mesclagem."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code] the [param map] synchronization uses "
"an async process that runs on a background thread."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], a sincronização do [param map] usa "
"um processo assíncrono que é executado em uma thread de segundo plano."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the navigation [param map] edge connection use. If [param enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code], the navigation map allows navigation regions to use edge "
"connections to connect with other navigation regions within proximity of the "
"navigation map edge connection margin."
msgstr ""
"Define o uso de conexão de borda do [param map] de navegação. Se [param "
"enabled] for [code]true[/code], o mapa de navegação permite que regiões de "
"navegação usem conexões de borda para se conectar com outras regiões de "
"navegação dentro da proximidade da margem de conexão de borda do mapa de "
"navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid "Creates a new navigation obstacle."
msgstr "Cria um novo obstáculo de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [param obstacle] has avoidance "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param obstacle] fornecido tiver a evasão "
"ativada."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]avoidance_layers[/code] bitmask of the specified [param "
"obstacle]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a máscara de bits [code]avoidance_layers[/code] do [param obstacle] "
"especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation map [RID] the requested [param obstacle] is currently "
"assigned to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] do mapa de navegação ao qual o [param obstacle] solicitado "
"está atribuído no momento."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param obstacle] is paused."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param obstacle] especificado estiver pausado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the position of the specified [param obstacle] in world space."
msgstr "Retorna a posição do [param obstacle] especificado no espaço mundial."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the radius of the specified dynamic [param obstacle]."
msgstr "Retorna o raio do [param obstacle] dinâmico especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the velocity of the specified dynamic [param obstacle]."
msgstr "Retorna a velocidade do [param obstacle] dinâmico especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the outline vertices for the specified [param obstacle]."
msgstr "Retorna os vértices de contorno para o [param obstacle] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the provided [param obstacle] "
"affects avoidance using agents."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], o [param obstacle] fornecido afeta "
"a esquiva usando agentes."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Set the obstacles's [code]avoidance_layers[/code] bitmask."
msgstr "Define a máscara de bits [code]avoidance_layers[/code] do obstáculo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid "Sets the navigation map [RID] for the obstacle."
msgstr "Define o [RID] do mapa de navegação para o obstáculo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param paused] is [code]true[/code] the specified [param obstacle] will "
"not be processed. For example, it will no longer affect avoidance velocities."
msgstr ""
"Se [param paused] for [code]true[/code], o [param obstacle] especificado não "
"será processado. Por exemplo, ele não afetará mais as velocidades de esquiva."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid "Sets the position of the obstacle in world space."
msgstr "Define a posição do obstáculo no espaço mundial."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the radius of the dynamic obstacle."
msgstr "Define o raio do obstáculo dinâmico."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets [param velocity] of the dynamic [param obstacle]. Allows other agents "
"to better predict the movement of the dynamic obstacle. Only works in "
"combination with the radius of the obstacle."
msgstr ""
"Define o [param velocity] do [param obstacle] dinâmico. Permite que outros "
"agentes prevejam melhor o movimento do obstáculo dinâmico. Funciona apenas "
"em combinação com o raio do obstáculo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the outline vertices for the obstacle. If the vertices are winded in "
"clockwise order agents will be pushed in by the obstacle, else they will be "
"pushed out."
msgstr ""
"Define os vértices de contorno para o obstáculo. Se os vértices estiverem "
"dispostos em sentido horário, os agentes serão empurrados para dentro pelo "
"obstáculo; caso contrário, serão empurrados para fora."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Parses the [SceneTree] for source geometry according to the properties of "
"[param navigation_polygon]. Updates the provided [param "
"source_geometry_data] resource with the resulting data. The resource can "
"then be used to bake a navigation mesh with [method "
"bake_from_source_geometry_data]. After the process is finished the optional "
"[param callback] will be called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function needs to run on the main thread or with a "
"deferred call as the SceneTree is not thread-safe.\n"
"[b]Performance:[/b] While convenient, reading data arrays from [Mesh] "
"resources can affect the frame rate negatively. The data needs to be "
"received from the GPU, stalling the [RenderingServer] in the process. For "
"performance prefer the use of e.g. collision shapes or creating the data "
"arrays entirely in code."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Queries a path in a given navigation map. Start and target position and "
"other parameters are defined through [NavigationPathQueryParameters2D]. "
"Updates the provided [NavigationPathQueryResult2D] result object with the "
"path among other results requested by the query. After the process is "
"finished the optional [param callback] will be called."
msgstr ""
"Consulta um caminho em um determinado mapa de navegação. A posição inicial, "
"de destino e outros parâmetros são definidos por meio de "
"[NavigationPathQueryParameters2D]. Atualiza o objeto de resultado "
"[NavigationPathQueryResult2D] fornecido com o caminho, entre outros "
"resultados solicitados pela consulta. Após a conclusão do processo, o [param "
"callback] opcional será chamado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Creates a new region."
msgstr "Cria uma nova região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the axis-aligned rectangle for the [param region]'s transformed "
"navigation mesh."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o retângulo alinhado aos eixos para a malha de navegação "
"transformada da [param region]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation mesh surface point closest to the provided [param "
"to_point] on the navigation [param region]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto da superfície da malha de navegação mais próximo do [param "
"to_point] fornecido na [param region] de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ending point of a connection door. [param connection] is an "
"index between 0 and the return value of [method "
"region_get_connections_count]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto final de uma porta de conexão. [param connection] é um "
"índice entre 0 e o valor de retorno de [method region_get_connections_count]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the starting point of a connection door. [param connection] is an "
"index between 0 and the return value of [method "
"region_get_connections_count]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto inicial de uma porta de conexão. [param connection] é um "
"índice entre 0 e o valor de retorno de [method region_get_connections_count]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns how many connections this [param region] has with other regions in "
"the map."
msgstr ""
"Retorna quantas conexões esta [param region] tem com outras regiões no mapa."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified [param region] is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a [param region] especificada estiver ativada."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the enter cost of this [param region]."
msgstr "Retorna o custo de entrada deste [param region]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current iteration ID of the navigation region. Every time the "
"navigation region changes and synchronizes, the iteration ID increases. An "
"iteration ID of [code]0[/code] means the navigation region has never "
"synchronized.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The iteration ID will wrap around to [code]1[/code] after "
"reaching its range limit."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation map [RID] the requested [param region] is currently "
"assigned to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] do mapa de navegação ao qual o [param region] solicitado "
"está atribuído no momento."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the region's navigation layers."
msgstr "Retorna as camadas de navegação da região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [code]ObjectID[/code] of the object which manages this region."
msgstr "Retorna o [code]ObjectID[/code] do objeto que gerencia esta região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a random position picked from all region polygons with matching "
"[param navigation_layers].\n"
"If [param uniformly] is [code]true[/code], all region polygons and faces are "
"weighted by their surface area (slower).\n"
"If [param uniformly] is [code]false[/code], just a random polygon and face "
"is picked (faster)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the global transformation of this [param region]."
msgstr "Retorna a transformação global deste [param region]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the travel cost of this [param region]."
msgstr "Retorna o custo de viagem deste [param region]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param region] uses an async "
"synchronization process that runs on a background thread."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a [param region] usar um processo de "
"sincronização assíncrono que roda em uma thread em segundo plano."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the navigation [param region] is set to use edge connections "
"to connect with other navigation regions within proximity of the navigation "
"map edge connection margin."
msgstr ""
"Retorna se a [param region] de navegação está definida para usar conexões de "
"aresta para se conectar com outras regiões de navegação dentro da "
"proximidade da margem de conexão de aresta do mapa de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [param point] in world space is "
"currently owned by the provided navigation [param region]. Owned in this "
"context means that one of the region's navigation mesh polygon faces has a "
"possible position at the closest distance to this point compared to all "
"other navigation meshes from other navigation regions that are also "
"registered on the navigation map of the provided region.\n"
"If multiple navigation meshes have positions at equal distance the "
"navigation region whose polygons are processed first wins the ownership. "
"Polygons are processed in the same order that navigation regions were "
"registered on the NavigationServer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If navigation meshes from different navigation regions overlap "
"(which should be avoided in general) the result might not be what is "
"expected."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code] the specified [param region] will "
"contribute to its current navigation map."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], a [param region] especificada "
"contribuirá para seu mapa de navegação atual."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the [param enter_cost] for this [param region]."
msgstr "Define o [param enter_cost] para esta [param region]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the map for the region."
msgstr "Define o mapa para a região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the region's navigation layers. This allows selecting regions from a "
"path request (when using [method NavigationServer2D.map_get_path])."
msgstr ""
"Define as camadas de navegação da região. Isso permite selecionar regiões de "
"uma solicitação de caminho (ao usar [method "
"NavigationServer2D.map_get_path])."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid "Sets the [param navigation_polygon] for the region."
msgstr "Define o [param navigation_polygon] para a região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Set the [code]ObjectID[/code] of the object which manages this region."
msgstr "Define o [code]ObjectID[/code] do objeto que gerencia esta região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the global transformation for the region."
msgstr "Define a transformação global para a região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the [param travel_cost] for this [param region]."
msgstr "Define o [param travel_cost] para esta [param region]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code] the [param region] uses an async "
"synchronization process that runs on a background thread."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], a [param region] usa um processo "
"de sincronização assíncrono que é executado em uma thread de segundo plano."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the navigation [param region] will "
"use edge connections to connect with other navigation regions within "
"proximity of the navigation map edge connection margin."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], a [param region] de navegação "
"usará conexões de borda para se conectar a outras regiões de navegação "
"dentro da proximidade da margem de conexão de borda do mapa de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Control activation of this server."
msgstr "Controle a ativação deste servidor."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code] enables debug mode on the NavigationServer."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], ativa o modo de depuração no NavigationServer."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a simplified version of [param path] with less critical path points "
"removed. The simplification amount is in worlds units and controlled by "
"[param epsilon]. The simplification uses a variant of Ramer-Douglas-Peucker "
"algorithm for curve point decimation.\n"
"Path simplification can be helpful to mitigate various path following issues "
"that can arise with certain agent types and script behaviors. E.g. "
"\"steering\" agents or avoidance in \"open fields\"."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new source geometry parser. If a [Callable] is set for the parser "
"with [method source_geometry_parser_set_callback] the callback will be "
"called for every single node that gets parsed whenever [method "
"parse_source_geometry_data] is used."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo analisador de geometria de fonte. Se um [Callable] for definido "
"para o analisador com [method source_geometry_parser_set_callback], o "
"callback será chamado para cada nó individual que for analisado sempre que "
"[method parse_source_geometry_data] for usado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [param callback] [Callable] for the specific source geometry [param "
"parser]. The [Callable] will receive a call with the following parameters:\n"
"- [code]navigation_mesh[/code] - The [NavigationPolygon] reference used to "
"define the parse settings. Do NOT edit or add directly to the navigation "
"mesh.\n"
"- [code]source_geometry_data[/code] - The "
"[NavigationMeshSourceGeometryData2D] reference. Add custom source geometry "
"for navigation mesh baking to this object.\n"
"- [code]node[/code] - The [Node] that is parsed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when avoidance debug settings are changed. Only available in debug "
"builds."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando as configurações de depuração de desvio são alteradas. "
"Disponível apenas em builds de depuração."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a navigation map is updated, when a region moves or is modified."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando um mapa de navegação é atualizado, quando uma região se move "
"ou é modificada."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when navigation debug settings are changed. Only available in debug "
"builds."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando as configurações de depuração de navegação são alteradas. "
"Disponível apenas em builds de depuração."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to get the number of active navigation maps."
msgstr "Constante para obter o número de mapas de navegação ativos."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to get the number of active navigation regions."
msgstr "Constante para obter o número de regiões de navegação ativas."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to get the number of active navigation agents processing avoidance."
msgstr ""
"Constante para obter o número de agentes de navegação ativos processando "
"desvio."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to get the number of active navigation links."
msgstr "Constante para obter o número de links de navegação ativos."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to get the number of navigation mesh polygons."
msgstr "Constante para obter o número de polígonos da malha de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to get the number of navigation mesh polygon edges."
msgstr ""
"Constante para obter o número de arestas do polígono da malha de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to get the number of navigation mesh polygon edges that were merged "
"due to edge key overlap."
msgstr ""
"Constante para obter o número de arestas de polígono de malha de navegação "
"que foram mescladas devido à sobreposição de chaves de aresta."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to get the number of navigation mesh polygon edges that are "
"considered connected by edge proximity."
msgstr ""
"Constante para obter o número de arestas de polígono de malha de navegação "
"que são consideradas conectadas por proximidade de aresta."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to get the number of navigation mesh polygon edges that could not "
"be merged but may be still connected by edge proximity or with links."
msgstr ""
"Constante para obter o número de arestas de polígonos de malha de navegação "
"que não puderam ser mescladas, mas ainda podem estar conectadas por "
"proximidade de arestas ou com links."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2D.xml doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to get the number of active navigation obstacles."
msgstr "Constante para obter o número de obstáculos de navegação ativos."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2DManager.xml
msgid "A singleton for managing [NavigationServer2D] implementations."
msgstr "Um singleton para gerenciar implementações de [NavigationServer2D]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2DManager.xml
msgid ""
"[NavigationServer2DManager] is the API for registering [NavigationServer2D] "
"implementations and setting the default implementation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not possible to switch servers at runtime. This class is "
"only used on startup at the server initialization level."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2DManager.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a [NavigationServer2D] implementation by passing a [param name] "
"and a [Callable] that returns a [NavigationServer2D] object."
msgstr ""
"Registra uma implementação de [NavigationServer2D] passando um [param name] "
"e um [Callable] que retorna um objeto [NavigationServer2D]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer2DManager.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the default [NavigationServer2D] implementation to the one identified "
"by [param name], if [param priority] is greater than the priority of the "
"current default implementation."
msgstr ""
"Define a implementação padrão de [NavigationServer2D] para aquela "
"identificada por [param name], se [param priority] for maior que a "
"prioridade da implementação padrão atual."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "A server interface for low-level 3D navigation access."
msgstr "Uma interface de servidor para acesso à navegação 3D de baixo nível."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"NavigationServer3D is the server that handles navigation maps, regions and "
"agents. It does not handle A* navigation from [AStar3D].\n"
"Maps are divided into regions, which are composed of navigation meshes. "
"Together, they define the navigable areas in the 3D world.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most [NavigationServer3D] changes take effect after the next "
"physics frame and not immediately. This includes all changes made to maps, "
"regions or agents by navigation-related nodes in the scene tree or made "
"through scripts.\n"
"For two regions to be connected to each other, they must share a similar "
"edge. An edge is considered connected to another if both of its two vertices "
"are at a distance less than [code]edge_connection_margin[/code] to the "
"respective other edge's vertex.\n"
"You may assign navigation layers to regions with [method "
"NavigationServer3D.region_set_navigation_layers], which then can be checked "
"upon when requesting a path with [method NavigationServer3D.map_get_path]. "
"This can be used to allow or deny certain areas for some objects.\n"
"To use the collision avoidance system, you may use agents. You can set an "
"agent's target velocity, then the servers will emit a callback with a "
"modified velocity.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The collision avoidance system ignores regions. Using the "
"modified velocity directly may move an agent outside of the traversable "
"area. This is a limitation of the collision avoidance system, any more "
"complex situation may require the use of the physics engine.\n"
"This server keeps tracks of any call and executes them during the sync "
"phase. This means that you can request any change to the map, using any "
"thread, without worrying."
msgstr ""
"O [NavigationServer3D] é o servidor responsável por gerenciar mapas, regiões "
"e agentes de navegação. Ele não lida com navegação A* do [AStar3D].\n"
"Os mapas são divididos em regiões, que são compostas por malhas de navegação "
"(navigation meshes). Juntos, eles definem as áreas navegáveis no mundo 3D.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A maioria das alterações no [NavigationServer3D] entra em vigor "
"após o próximo quadro de física e não imediatamente. Isso inclui todas as "
"alterações feitas em mapas, regiões ou agentes por nós relacionados à "
"navegação na árvore de cena ou feitas por meio de scripts.\n"
"Para que duas regiões sejam conectadas entre si, elas devem compartilhar uma "
"aresta semelhante. Uma aresta é considerada conectada a outra se ambos os "
"seus dois vértices estiverem a uma distância menor que "
"[code]edge_connection_margin[/code] do vértice da outra aresta "
"correspondente.\n"
"Você pode atribuir camadas de navegação a regiões com [method "
"NavigationServer3D.region_set_navigation_layers], que podem ser verificadas "
"ao solicitar um caminho com [method NavigationServer3D.map_get_path]. Isso "
"pode ser usado para permitir ou negar certas áreas para alguns objetos.\n"
"Para usar o sistema de prevenção de colisões (collision avoidance), você "
"pode usar agentes. Você pode definir a velocidade alvo de um agente, e os "
"servidores emitirão um retorno de chamada (callback) com uma velocidade "
"modificada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O sistema de prevenção de colisões ignora as regiões. Usar a "
"velocidade modificada diretamente pode mover um agente para fora da área "
"navegável. Esta é uma limitação do sistema de prevenção de colisões; "
"qualquer situação mais complexa pode exigir o uso do motor de física.\n"
"Este servidor rastreia todas as chamadas e as executa durante a fase de "
"sincronização. Isso significa que você pode solicitar qualquer alteração no "
"mapa, usando qualquer thread, sem preocupações."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [param agent] has avoidance "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param agent] fornecido tiver evasão "
"habilitada."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [code]height[/code] of the specified [param agent]."
msgstr "Retorna a [code]height[/code] do [param agent] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [param agent] uses avoidance in 3D "
"space Vector3(x,y,z) instead of horizontal 2D Vector2(x,y) / "
"Vector3(x,0.0,z)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param agent] fornecido usar desvio no espaço "
"3D Vector3(x,y,z) em vez de Vector2(x,y) / Vector3(x,0.0,z) 2D horizontal."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the provided [param agent] "
"calculates avoidance."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], o [param agent] fornecido calcula "
"a esquiva."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Updates the provided [param agent] [param height]."
msgstr "Atualiza a [param height] do [param agent] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets if the agent uses the 2D avoidance or the 3D avoidance while avoidance "
"is enabled.\n"
"If [code]true[/code] the agent calculates avoidance velocities in 3D for the "
"xyz-axis, e.g. for games that take place in air, underwater or space. The 3D "
"using agent only avoids other 3D avoidance using agent's. The 3D using agent "
"only reacts to radius based avoidance obstacles. The 3D using agent ignores "
"any vertices based obstacles. The 3D using agent only avoids other 3D using "
"agent's.\n"
"If [code]false[/code] the agent calculates avoidance velocities in 2D along "
"the xz-axis ignoring the y-axis. The 2D using agent only avoids other 2D "
"avoidance using agent's. The 2D using agent reacts to radius avoidance "
"obstacles. The 2D using agent reacts to vertices based avoidance obstacles. "
"The 2D using agent only avoids other 2D using agent's. 2D using agents will "
"ignore other 2D using agents or obstacles that are below their current "
"position or above their current position including the agents height in 2D "
"avoidance."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets [param velocity] as the new wanted velocity for the specified [param "
"agent]. The avoidance simulation will try to fulfill this velocity if "
"possible but will modify it to avoid collision with other agent's and "
"obstacles. When an agent is teleported to a new position use [method "
"agent_set_velocity_forced] as well to reset the internal simulation velocity."
msgstr ""
"Define [param velocity] como a nova velocidade desejada para o [param agent] "
"especificado. A simulação de desvio tentará cumprir esta velocidade se "
"possível, mas a modificará para evitar colisão com outros agentes e "
"obstáculos. Quando um agente é teletransportado para uma nova posição, use "
"[method agent_set_velocity_forced] também para redefinir a velocidade "
"interna da simulação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces the internal velocity in the collision avoidance simulation with "
"[param velocity] for the specified [param agent]. When an agent is "
"teleported to a new position this function should be used in the same frame. "
"If called frequently this function can get agents stuck."
msgstr ""
"Substitui a velocidade interna na simulação de desvio de colisão por [param "
"velocity] para o [param agent] especificado. Quando um agente é "
"teletransportado para uma nova posição, esta função deve ser usada no mesmo "
"quadro. Se chamada com frequência, esta função pode fazer com que os agentes "
"fiquem presos."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Bakes the provided [param navigation_mesh] with the data from the provided "
"[param source_geometry_data] as an async task running on a background "
"thread. After the process is finished the optional [param callback] will be "
"called."
msgstr ""
"Faz o bake do [param navigation_mesh] fornecido com os dados do [param "
"source_geometry_data] fornecido como uma tarefa assíncrona executada em uma "
"thread em segundo plano. Após o término do processo, o [param callback] "
"opcional será chamado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] when the provided navigation mesh is being baked "
"on a background thread."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] quando a malha de navegação fornecida está sendo "
"gerada em uma thread em segundo plano."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the links's navigation layers. This allows selecting links from a path "
"request (when using [method NavigationServer3D.map_get_path])."
msgstr ""
"Define as camadas de navegação dos links. Isso permite selecionar links de "
"uma solicitação de caminho (ao usar [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_get_path])."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the map cell height used to rasterize the navigation mesh vertices "
"on the Y axis."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a altura da célula do mapa usada para rasterizar os vértices da "
"malha de navegação no eixo Y."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the map cell size used to rasterize the navigation mesh vertices on "
"the XZ plane."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho da célula do mapa usado para rasterizar os vértices da "
"malha de navegação no plano XZ."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation mesh surface normal closest to the provided [param "
"to_point] on the navigation [param map]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a normal da superfície da malha de navegação mais próxima do [param "
"to_point] fornecido no [param map] de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation mesh surface point closest to the provided [param "
"start] and [param end] segment on the navigation [param map].\n"
"If [param use_collision] is [code]true[/code], a closest point test is only "
"done when the segment intersects with the navigation mesh surface."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the edge connection margin of the map. This distance is the minimum "
"vertex distance needed to connect two edges from different regions."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a margem de conexão de arestas do mapa. Essa distância é a distância "
"mínima entre vértices necessária para conectar duas arestas de regiões "
"diferentes."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the map's up direction."
msgstr "Retorna a direção para cima do mapa."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the navigation [param map] allows navigation "
"regions to use edge connections to connect with other navigation regions "
"within proximity of the navigation map edge connection margin."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param map] de navegação permitir que regiões "
"de navegação usem conexões de borda para se conectar com outras regiões de "
"navegação dentro da proximidade da margem de conexão de borda do mapa de "
"navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the map cell height used to rasterize the navigation mesh vertices on "
"the Y axis. Must match with the cell height of the used navigation meshes."
msgstr ""
"Define a altura da célula do mapa usada para rasterizar os vértices da malha "
"de navegação no eixo Y. Deve corresponder à altura da célula das malhas de "
"navegação usadas."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the map cell size used to rasterize the navigation mesh vertices on the "
"XZ plane. Must match with the cell size of the used navigation meshes."
msgstr ""
"Define o tamanho da célula do mapa usado para rasterizar os vértices da "
"malha de navegação no plano XZ. Deve corresponder ao tamanho da célula das "
"malhas de navegação usadas."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the map up direction."
msgstr "Define a direção para cima do mapa."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Creates a new obstacle."
msgstr "Cria um novo obstáculo."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [code]height[/code] of the specified [param obstacle]."
msgstr "Retorna a [code]height[/code] do [param obstacle] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [param obstacle] uses avoidance in "
"3D space Vector3(x,y,z) instead of horizontal 2D Vector2(x,y) / "
"Vector3(x,0.0,z)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param obstacle] fornecido usar desvio em "
"espaço 3D Vector3(x,y,z) em vez de 2D horizontal Vector2(x,y) / "
"Vector3(x,0.0,z)."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [param height] for the [param obstacle]. In 3D agents will ignore "
"obstacles that are above or below them while using 2D avoidance."
msgstr ""
"Define a [param height] para o [param obstacle]. Em 3D, os agentes ignorarão "
"obstáculos que estão acima ou abaixo deles ao usar a esquiva 2D."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Assigns the [param obstacle] to a navigation map."
msgstr "Atribui o [param obstacle] a um mapa de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Updates the [param position] in world space for the [param obstacle]."
msgstr "Atualiza a [param position] no espaço mundial para o [param obstacle]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets if the [param obstacle] uses the 2D avoidance or the 3D avoidance while "
"avoidance is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Define se o [param obstacle] usa a desviação 2D ou a desviação 3D enquanto a "
"desviação está ativada."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Queries a path in a given navigation map. Start and target position and "
"other parameters are defined through [NavigationPathQueryParameters3D]. "
"Updates the provided [NavigationPathQueryResult3D] result object with the "
"path among other results requested by the query. After the process is "
"finished the optional [param callback] will be called."
msgstr ""
"Consulta um caminho em um determinado mapa de navegação. A posição inicial, "
"de destino e outros parâmetros são definidos por meio de "
"[NavigationPathQueryParameters3D]. Atualiza o objeto de resultado "
"[NavigationPathQueryResult3D] fornecido com o caminho, entre outros "
"resultados solicitados pela consulta. Após a conclusão do processo, o [param "
"callback] opcional será chamado."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Bakes the [param navigation_mesh] with bake source geometry collected "
"starting from the [param root_node]."
msgstr ""
"Faz o bake do [param navigation_mesh] com a geometria de origem de bake "
"coletada a partir do [param root_node]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the axis-aligned bounding box for the [param region]'s transformed "
"navigation mesh."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a caixa delimitadora alinhada aos eixos para a malha de navegação "
"transformada da [param region]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation mesh surface normal closest to the provided [param "
"to_point] on the navigation [param region]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a normal da superfície da malha de navegação mais próxima do [param "
"to_point] fornecido na [param region] de navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the navigation mesh surface point closest to the provided [param "
"start] and [param end] segment on the navigation [param region].\n"
"If [param use_collision] is [code]true[/code], a closest point test is only "
"done when the segment intersects with the navigation mesh surface."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the navigation [param region] is set to use "
"edge connections to connect with other navigation regions within proximity "
"of the navigation map edge connection margin."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a [param region] de navegação estiver "
"configurada para usar conexões de borda para se conectar com outras regiões "
"de navegação dentro da proximidade da margem de conexão de borda do mapa de "
"navegação."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], the specified [param region] will "
"contribute to its current navigation map."
msgstr ""
"Se [param enabled] for [code]true[/code], a [param region] especificada "
"contribuirá para seu mapa de navegação atual."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Set the region's navigation layers. This allows selecting regions from a "
"path request (when using [method NavigationServer3D.map_get_path])."
msgstr ""
"Define as camadas de navegação da região. Isso permite selecionar regiões de "
"uma solicitação de caminho (ao usar [method "
"NavigationServer3D.map_get_path])."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the navigation mesh for the region."
msgstr "Define a malha de navegação para a região."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [param callback] [Callable] for the specific source geometry [param "
"parser]. The [Callable] will receive a call with the following parameters:\n"
"- [code]navigation_mesh[/code] - The [NavigationMesh] reference used to "
"define the parse settings. Do NOT edit or add directly to the navigation "
"mesh.\n"
"- [code]source_geometry_data[/code] - The "
"[NavigationMeshSourceGeometryData3D] reference. Add custom source geometry "
"for navigation mesh baking to this object.\n"
"- [code]node[/code] - The [Node] that is parsed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3DManager.xml
msgid "A singleton for managing [NavigationServer3D] implementations."
msgstr "Um singleton para gerenciar implementações de [NavigationServer3D]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3DManager.xml
msgid ""
"[NavigationServer3DManager] is the API for registering [NavigationServer3D] "
"implementations and setting the default implementation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not possible to switch servers at runtime. This class is "
"only used on startup at the server initialization level."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3DManager.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a [NavigationServer3D] implementation by passing a [param name] "
"and a [Callable] that returns a [NavigationServer3D] object."
msgstr ""
"Registra uma implementação de [NavigationServer3D] passando um [param name] "
"e um [Callable] que retorna um objeto [NavigationServer3D]."

#: doc/classes/NavigationServer3DManager.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the default [NavigationServer3D] implementation to the one identified "
"by [param name], if [param priority] is greater than the priority of the "
"current default implementation."
msgstr ""
"Define a implementação padrão de [NavigationServer3D] para aquela "
"identificada por [param name], se [param priority] for maior que a "
"prioridade da implementação padrão atual."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"A control that displays a texture by keeping its corners intact, but tiling "
"its edges and center."
msgstr ""
"Um controle que exibe uma textura mantendo seus cantos intactos, mas "
"repetindo suas bordas e centro."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"Also known as 9-slice panels, [NinePatchRect] produces clean panels of any "
"size based on a small texture. To do so, it splits the texture in a 3×3 "
"grid. When you scale the node, it tiles the texture's edges horizontally or "
"vertically, tiles the center on both axes, and leaves the corners unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Também conhecidos como painéis de 9 fatias, o [NinePatchRect] produz painéis "
"limpos de qualquer tamanho com base em uma textura pequena. Para fazer isso, "
"ele divide a textura em uma grade 3×3. Quando você dimensiona o nó, ele "
"preenche as bordas da textura horizontalmente ou verticalmente, preenche o "
"centro em ambos os eixos e deixa os cantos inalterados."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid "Returns the size of the margin on the specified [enum Side]."
msgstr "Retorna o tamanho da margem no [enum Side] especificado."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the size of the margin on the specified [enum Side] to [param value] "
"pixels."
msgstr ""
"Define o tamanho da margem no [enum Side] especificado para [param value] "
"pixels."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid "The stretch mode to use for horizontal stretching/tiling."
msgstr "O modo de estiramento a ser usado para estiramento/tile horizontal."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid "The stretch mode to use for vertical stretching/tiling."
msgstr "O modo de estiramento a ser usado para estiramento/tile vertical."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], draw the panel's center. Else, only draw the 9-slice's "
"borders."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], desenha o centro do painel. Caso contrário, desenha "
"apenas as bordas do 9-slice."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"The height of the 9-slice's bottom row. A margin of 16 means the 9-slice's "
"bottom corners and side will have a height of 16 pixels. You can set all 4 "
"margin values individually to create panels with non-uniform borders."
msgstr ""
"A altura da linha inferior do 9-slice. Uma margem de 16 significa que os "
"cantos inferiores e o lado do 9-slice terão uma altura de 16 pixels. Você "
"pode definir todos os 4 valores de margem individualmente para criar painéis "
"com bordas não uniformes."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"The width of the 9-slice's left column. A margin of 16 means the 9-slice's "
"left corners and side will have a width of 16 pixels. You can set all 4 "
"margin values individually to create panels with non-uniform borders."
msgstr ""
"A largura da coluna esquerda do 9-slice. Uma margem de 16 significa que os "
"cantos esquerdos e o lado do 9-slice terão uma largura de 16 pixels. Você "
"pode definir todos os 4 valores de margem individualmente para criar painéis "
"com bordas não uniformes."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"The width of the 9-slice's right column. A margin of 16 means the 9-slice's "
"right corners and side will have a width of 16 pixels. You can set all 4 "
"margin values individually to create panels with non-uniform borders."
msgstr ""
"A largura da coluna direita do 9-slice. Uma margem de 16 significa que os "
"cantos direitos e o lado do 9-slice terão uma largura de 16 pixels. Você "
"pode definir todos os 4 valores de margem individualmente para criar painéis "
"com bordas não uniformes."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"The height of the 9-slice's top row. A margin of 16 means the 9-slice's top "
"corners and side will have a height of 16 pixels. You can set all 4 margin "
"values individually to create panels with non-uniform borders."
msgstr ""
"A altura da linha superior do 9-slice. Uma margem de 16 significa que os "
"cantos superiores e o lado do 9-slice terão uma altura de 16 pixels. Você "
"pode definir todos os 4 valores de margem individualmente para criar painéis "
"com bordas não uniformes."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"Rectangular region of the texture to sample from. If you're working with an "
"atlas, use this property to define the area the 9-slice should use. All "
"other properties are relative to this one. If the rect is empty, "
"NinePatchRect will use the whole texture."
msgstr ""
"Região retangular da textura a ser amostrada. Se você estiver trabalhando "
"com um atlas, use esta propriedade para definir a área que o 9-slice deve "
"usar. Todas as outras propriedades são relativas a esta. Se o retângulo "
"estiver vazio, NinePatchRect usará toda a textura."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid "The node's texture resource."
msgstr "O recurso de textura do nó."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid "Emitted when the node's texture changes."
msgstr "Emitido quando a textura de um nó muda."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"Stretches the center texture across the NinePatchRect. This may cause the "
"texture to be distorted."
msgstr ""
"Estica a textura central ao longo do NinePatchRect. Isso pode fazer com que "
"a textura seja distorcida."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"Repeats the center texture across the NinePatchRect. This won't cause any "
"visible distortion. The texture must be seamless for this to work without "
"displaying artifacts between edges."
msgstr ""
"Repete a textura central ao longo do NinePatchRect. Isso não causará nenhuma "
"distorção visível. A textura deve ser sem costura para que isso funcione sem "
"exibir artefatos entre as bordas."

#: doc/classes/NinePatchRect.xml
msgid ""
"Repeats the center texture across the NinePatchRect, but will also stretch "
"the texture to make sure each tile is visible in full. This may cause the "
"texture to be distorted, but less than [constant AXIS_STRETCH_MODE_STRETCH]. "
"The texture must be seamless for this to work without displaying artifacts "
"between edges."
msgstr ""
"Repete a textura central em todo o NinePatchRect, mas também estica a "
"textura para garantir que cada bloco seja visível por completo. Isso pode "
"fazer com que a textura seja distorcida, mas menos do que [constant "
"AXIS_STRETCH_MODE_STRETCH]. A textura deve ser sem costura para que isso "
"funcione sem exibir artefatos entre as bordas."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Base class for all scene objects."
msgstr "Classe base para todos os objetos de cena."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Nodes are Godot's building blocks. They can be assigned as the child of "
"another node, resulting in a tree arrangement. A given node can contain any "
"number of nodes as children with the requirement that all siblings (direct "
"children of a node) should have unique names.\n"
"A tree of nodes is called a [i]scene[/i]. Scenes can be saved to the disk "
"and then instantiated into other scenes. This allows for very high "
"flexibility in the architecture and data model of Godot projects.\n"
"[b]Scene tree:[/b] The [SceneTree] contains the active tree of nodes. When a "
"node is added to the scene tree, it receives the [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] notification and its [method _enter_tree] callback "
"is triggered. Child nodes are always added [i]after[/i] their parent node, "
"i.e. the [method _enter_tree] callback of a parent node will be triggered "
"before its child's.\n"
"Once all nodes have been added in the scene tree, they receive the [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_READY] notification and their respective [method _ready] "
"callbacks are triggered. For groups of nodes, the [method _ready] callback "
"is called in reverse order, starting with the children and moving up to the "
"parent nodes.\n"
"This means that when adding a node to the scene tree, the following order "
"will be used for the callbacks: [method _enter_tree] of the parent, [method "
"_enter_tree] of the children, [method _ready] of the children and finally "
"[method _ready] of the parent (recursively for the entire scene tree).\n"
"[b]Processing:[/b] Nodes can override the \"process\" state, so that they "
"receive a callback on each frame requesting them to process (do something). "
"Normal processing (callback [method _process], toggled with [method "
"set_process]) happens as fast as possible and is dependent on the frame "
"rate, so the processing time [i]delta[/i] (in seconds) is passed as an "
"argument. Physics processing (callback [method _physics_process], toggled "
"with [method set_physics_process]) happens a fixed number of times per "
"second (60 by default) and is useful for code related to the physics "
"engine.\n"
"Nodes can also process input events. When present, the [method _input] "
"function will be called for each input that the program receives. In many "
"cases, this can be overkill (unless used for simple projects), and the "
"[method _unhandled_input] function might be preferred; it is called when the "
"input event was not handled by anyone else (typically, GUI [Control] nodes), "
"ensuring that the node only receives the events that were meant for it.\n"
"To keep track of the scene hierarchy (especially when instantiating scenes "
"into other scenes), an \"owner\" can be set for the node with the [member "
"owner] property. This keeps track of who instantiated what. This is mostly "
"useful when writing editors and tools, though.\n"
"Finally, when a node is freed with [method Object.free] or [method "
"queue_free], it will also free all its children.\n"
"[b]Groups:[/b] Nodes can be added to as many groups as you want to be easy "
"to manage, you could create groups like \"enemies\" or \"collectables\" for "
"example, depending on your game. See [method add_to_group], [method "
"is_in_group] and [method remove_from_group]. You can then retrieve all nodes "
"in these groups, iterate them and even call methods on groups via the "
"methods on [SceneTree].\n"
"[b]Networking with nodes:[/b] After connecting to a server (or making one, "
"see [ENetMultiplayerPeer]), it is possible to use the built-in RPC (remote "
"procedure call) system to communicate over the network. By calling [method "
"rpc] with a method name, it will be called locally and in all connected "
"peers (peers = clients and the server that accepts connections). To identify "
"which node receives the RPC call, Godot will use its [NodePath] (make sure "
"node names are the same on all peers). Also, take a look at the high-level "
"networking tutorial and corresponding demos.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [code]script[/code] property is part of the [Object] class, "
"not [Node]. It isn't exposed like most properties but does have a setter and "
"getter (see [method Object.set_script] and [method Object.get_script])."
msgstr ""
"Nodes (nós) são os blocos de construção da Godot. Eles podem ser atribuídos "
"como filhos de outro nó, resultando em uma estrutura de árvore. Um "
"determinado nó pode conter qualquer quantidade de nós como filhos, com o "
"requisito de que todos os irmãos (filhos diretos de um nó) devem ter nomes "
"únicos.\n"
"Uma árvore de nós é chamada de [i]scene[/i] (cena). Cenas podem ser salvas "
"no disco e depois instanciadas em outras cenas. Isso permite uma "
"flexibilidade muito alta na arquitetura e no modelo de dados dos projetos da "
"Godot.\n"
"[b]Scene tree (Árvore de cena):[/b] A [SceneTree] contém a árvore ativa de "
"nós. Quando um nó é adicionado à árvore de cena, ele recebe a notificação "
"[constant NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] e seu callback [method _enter_tree] é "
"acionado. Nós filhos são sempre adicionados [i]depois[/i] de seu nó pai, ou "
"seja, o callback [method _enter_tree] de um nó pai será acionado antes do "
"seu filho.\n"
"Assim que todos os nós forem adicionados à árvore de cena, eles recebem a "
"notificação [constant NOTIFICATION_READY] e seus respectivos callbacks "
"[method _ready] são acionados. Para grupos de nós, o callback [method "
"_ready] é chamado em ordem inversa, começando pelos filhos e subindo até os "
"nós pais.\n"
"Isso significa que, ao adicionar um nó à árvore de cena, a seguinte ordem "
"será usada para os callbacks: [method _enter_tree] do pai, [method "
"_enter_tree] dos filhos, [method _ready] dos filhos e finalmente [method "
"_ready] do pai (recursivamente para toda a árvore de cena).\n"
"[b]Processing (Processamento):[/b] Nós podem sobrescrever o estado de "
"\"processamento\", de modo que recebam um callback a cada quadro solicitando "
"que processem (façam algo). O processamento normal (callback [method "
"_process], alternado com [method set_process]) ocorre o mais rápido possível "
"e depende da taxa de quadros, portanto o tempo de processamento [i]delta[/i] "
"(em segundos) é passado como argumento. O processamento de física (callback "
"[method _physics_process], alternado com [method set_physics_process]) "
"ocorre um número fixo de vezes por segundo (60 por padrão) e é útil para "
"códigos relacionados ao motor de física.\n"
"Nós também podem processar eventos de entrada (input). Quando presente, a "
"função [method _input] será chamada para cada entrada que o programa "
"receber. Em muitos casos, isso pode ser um exagero (a menos que seja usado "
"para projetos simples), e a função [method _unhandled_input] pode ser "
"preferível; ela é chamada quando o evento de entrada não foi tratado por "
"mais ninguém (tipicamente, nós de GUI [Control]), garantindo que o nó receba "
"apenas os eventos destinados a ele.\n"
"Para manter o controle da hierarquia da cena (especialmente ao instanciar "
"cenas dentro de outras cenas), um \"proprietário\" (owner) pode ser definido "
"para o nó com a propriedade [member owner]. Isso mantém o controle de quem "
"instanciou o quê. No entanto, isso é mais útil ao escrever editores e "
"ferramentas.\n"
"Por fim, quando um nó é liberado com [method Object.free] ou [method "
"queue_free], ele também liberará todos os seus filhos.\n"
"[b]Groups (Grupos):[/b] Nós podem ser adicionados a quantos grupos você "
"quiser para facilitar o gerenciamento; você pode criar grupos como "
"\"enemies\" (inimigos) ou \"collectables\" (coletáveis), por exemplo, "
"dependendo do seu jogo. Veja [method add_to_group], [method is_in_group] e "
"[method remove_from_group]. Você pode então recuperar todos os nós nesses "
"grupos, iterar sobre eles e até mesmo chamar métodos em grupos por meio dos "
"métodos em [SceneTree].\n"
"[b]Networking with nodes (Rede com nós):[/b] Após conectar-se a um servidor "
"(ou criar um, veja [ENetMultiplayerPeer]), é possível usar o sistema de RPC "
"(remote procedure call / chamada de procedimento remoto) integrado para se "
"comunicar pela rede. Ao chamar [method rpc] com o nome de um método, ele "
"será chamado localmente e em todos os pares conectados (pares = clientes e o "
"servidor que aceita conexões). Para identificar qual nó recebe a chamada "
"RPC, a Godot usará seu [NodePath] (garanta que os nomes dos nós sejam os "
"mesmos em todos os pares). Além disso, dê uma olhada no tutorial de rede de "
"alto nível e nas demonstrações correspondentes.\n"
"[b]Note (Nota):[/b] A propriedade [code]script[/code] faz parte da classe "
"[Object], não da classe [Node]. Ela não é exposta como a maioria das "
"propriedades, mas possui um setter e um getter (veja [method "
"Object.set_script] e [method Object.get_script])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Nodes and scenes"
msgstr "Nós e cenas"

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "All Demos"
msgstr "Todas as Demos"

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the node enters the [SceneTree] (e.g. upon instantiating, scene "
"changing, or after calling [method add_child] in a script). If the node has "
"children, its [method _enter_tree] callback will be called first, and then "
"that of the children.\n"
"Corresponds to the [constant NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] notification in "
"[method Object._notification]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the node is about to leave the [SceneTree] (e.g. upon freeing, "
"scene changing, or after calling [method remove_child] in a script). If the "
"node has children, its [method _exit_tree] callback will be called last, "
"after all its children have left the tree.\n"
"Corresponds to the [constant NOTIFICATION_EXIT_TREE] notification in [method "
"Object._notification] and signal [signal tree_exiting]. To get notified when "
"the node has already left the active tree, connect to the [signal "
"tree_exited]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The elements in the array returned from this method are displayed as "
"warnings in the Scene dock if the script that overrides it is a [code]tool[/"
"code] script, and accessibility warnings are enabled in the editor "
"settings.\n"
"Returning an empty array produces no warnings."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The elements in the array returned from this method are displayed as "
"warnings in the Scene dock if the script that overrides it is a [code]tool[/"
"code] script.\n"
"Returning an empty array produces no warnings.\n"
"Call [method update_configuration_warnings] when the warnings need to be "
"updated for this node.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"@export var energy = 0:\n"
"\tset(value):\n"
"\t\tenergy = value\n"
"\t\tupdate_configuration_warnings()\n"
"\n"
"func _get_configuration_warnings():\n"
"\tif energy < 0:\n"
"\t\treturn [\"Energy must be 0 or greater.\"]\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\treturn []\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called during accessibility information updates to determine the currently "
"focused sub-element, should return a sub-element RID or the value returned "
"by [method get_accessibility_element]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado durante atualizações de informações de acessibilidade para "
"determinar o subelemento atualmente focado; deve retornar um RID de "
"subelemento ou o valor retornado por [method get_accessibility_element]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called when there is an input event. The input event propagates up through "
"the node tree until a node consumes it.\n"
"It is only called if input processing is enabled, which is done "
"automatically if this method is overridden, and can be toggled with [method "
"set_process_input].\n"
"To consume the input event and stop it propagating further to other nodes, "
"[method Viewport.set_input_as_handled] can be called.\n"
"For gameplay input, [method _unhandled_input] and [method "
"_unhandled_key_input] are usually a better fit as they allow the GUI to "
"intercept the events first.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only called if the node is present in the scene "
"tree (i.e. if it's not an orphan)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called once on each physics tick, and allows Nodes to synchronize their "
"logic with physics ticks. [param delta] is the logical time between physics "
"ticks in seconds and is equal to [member Engine.time_scale] / [member "
"Engine.physics_ticks_per_second].\n"
"It is only called if physics processing is enabled for this Node, which is "
"done automatically if this method is overridden, and can be toggled with "
"[method set_physics_process].\n"
"Processing happens in order of [member process_physics_priority], lower "
"priority values are called first. Nodes with the same priority are processed "
"in tree order, or top to bottom as seen in the editor (also known as pre-"
"order traversal).\n"
"Corresponds to the [constant NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS] notification in "
"[method Object._notification].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only called if the node is present in the scene "
"tree (i.e. if it's not an orphan).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accumulated [param delta] may diverge from real world seconds."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called on each idle frame, prior to rendering, and after physics ticks have "
"been processed. [param delta] is the time between frames in seconds.\n"
"It is only called if processing is enabled for this Node, which is done "
"automatically if this method is overridden, and can be toggled with [method "
"set_process].\n"
"Processing happens in order of [member process_priority], lower priority "
"values are called first. Nodes with the same priority are processed in tree "
"order, or top to bottom as seen in the editor (also known as pre-order "
"traversal).\n"
"Corresponds to the [constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS] notification in [method "
"Object._notification].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only called if the node is present in the scene "
"tree (i.e. if it's not an orphan).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the engine is struggling and the frame rate is lowered, "
"[param delta] will increase. When [param delta] is increased, it's capped at "
"a maximum of [member Engine.time_scale] * [member "
"Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] / [member "
"Engine.physics_ticks_per_second]. As a result, accumulated [param delta] may "
"not represent real world time.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [code]--fixed-fps[/code] is enabled or the engine is "
"running in Movie Maker mode (see [MovieWriter]), process [param delta] will "
"always be the same for every frame, regardless of how much time the frame "
"took to render.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Frame delta may be post-processed by [member "
"OS.delta_smoothing] if this is enabled for the project."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the node is \"ready\", i.e. when both the node and its children "
"have entered the scene tree. If the node has children, their [method _ready] "
"callbacks get triggered first, and the parent node will receive the ready "
"notification afterwards.\n"
"Corresponds to the [constant NOTIFICATION_READY] notification in [method "
"Object._notification]. See also the [code]@onready[/code] annotation for "
"variables.\n"
"Usually used for initialization. For even earlier initialization, [method "
"Object._init] may be used. See also [method _enter_tree].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method may be called only once for each node. After "
"removing a node from the scene tree and adding it again, [method _ready] "
"will [b]not[/b] be called a second time. This can be bypassed by requesting "
"another call with [method request_ready], which may be called anywhere "
"before adding the node again."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called when an [InputEventKey], [InputEventShortcut], or "
"[InputEventJoypadButton] hasn't been consumed by [method _input] or any GUI "
"[Control] item. It is called before [method _unhandled_key_input] and "
"[method _unhandled_input]. The input event propagates up through the node "
"tree until a node consumes it.\n"
"It is only called if shortcut processing is enabled, which is done "
"automatically if this method is overridden, and can be toggled with [method "
"set_process_shortcut_input].\n"
"To consume the input event and stop it propagating further to other nodes, "
"[method Viewport.set_input_as_handled] can be called.\n"
"This method can be used to handle shortcuts. For generic GUI events, use "
"[method _input] instead. Gameplay events should usually be handled with "
"either [method _unhandled_input] or [method _unhandled_key_input].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only called if the node is present in the scene "
"tree (i.e. if it's not orphan)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called when an [InputEvent] hasn't been consumed by [method _input] or any "
"GUI [Control] item. It is called after [method _shortcut_input] and after "
"[method _unhandled_key_input]. The input event propagates up through the "
"node tree until a node consumes it.\n"
"It is only called if unhandled input processing is enabled, which is done "
"automatically if this method is overridden, and can be toggled with [method "
"set_process_unhandled_input].\n"
"To consume the input event and stop it propagating further to other nodes, "
"[method Viewport.set_input_as_handled] can be called.\n"
"For gameplay input, this method is usually a better fit than [method "
"_input], as GUI events need a higher priority. For keyboard shortcuts, "
"consider using [method _shortcut_input] instead, as it is called before this "
"method. Finally, to handle keyboard events, consider using [method "
"_unhandled_key_input] for performance reasons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only called if the node is present in the scene "
"tree (i.e. if it's not an orphan)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Called when an [InputEventKey] hasn't been consumed by [method _input] or "
"any GUI [Control] item. It is called after [method _shortcut_input] but "
"before [method _unhandled_input]. The input event propagates up through the "
"node tree until a node consumes it.\n"
"It is only called if unhandled key input processing is enabled, which is "
"done automatically if this method is overridden, and can be toggled with "
"[method set_process_unhandled_key_input].\n"
"To consume the input event and stop it propagating further to other nodes, "
"[method Viewport.set_input_as_handled] can be called.\n"
"This method can be used to handle Unicode character input with [kbd]Alt[/"
"kbd], [kbd]Alt + Ctrl[/kbd], and [kbd]Alt + Shift[/kbd] modifiers, after "
"shortcuts were handled.\n"
"For gameplay input, this and [method _unhandled_input] are usually a better "
"fit than [method _input], as GUI events should be handled first. This method "
"also performs better than [method _unhandled_input], since unrelated events "
"such as [InputEventMouseMotion] are automatically filtered. For shortcuts, "
"consider using [method _shortcut_input] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only called if the node is present in the scene "
"tree (i.e. if it's not an orphan)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a child [param node]. Nodes can have any number of children, but every "
"child must have a unique name. Child nodes are automatically deleted when "
"the parent node is deleted, so an entire scene can be removed by deleting "
"its topmost node.\n"
"If [param force_readable_name] is [code]true[/code], improves the "
"readability of the added [param node]. If not named, the [param node] is "
"renamed to its type, and if it shares [member name] with a sibling, a number "
"is suffixed more appropriately. This operation is very slow. As such, it is "
"recommended leaving this to [code]false[/code], which assigns a dummy name "
"featuring [code]@[/code] in both situations.\n"
"If [param internal] is different than [constant INTERNAL_MODE_DISABLED], the "
"child will be added as internal node. These nodes are ignored by methods "
"like [method get_children], unless their parameter [code]include_internal[/"
"code] is [code]true[/code]. It also prevents these nodes being duplicated "
"with their parent. The intended usage is to hide the internal nodes from the "
"user, so the user won't accidentally delete or modify them. Used by some GUI "
"nodes, e.g. [ColorPicker].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [param node] already has a parent, this method will fail. "
"Use [method remove_child] first to remove [param node] from its current "
"parent. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var child_node = get_child(0)\n"
"if child_node.get_parent():\n"
"\tchild_node.get_parent().remove_child(child_node)\n"
"add_child(child_node)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Node childNode = GetChild(0);\n"
"if (childNode.GetParent() != null)\n"
"{\n"
"\tchildNode.GetParent().RemoveChild(childNode);\n"
"}\n"
"AddChild(childNode);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If you need the child node to be added below a specific node in the list of "
"children, use [method add_sibling] instead of this method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want a child to be persisted to a [PackedScene], you "
"must set [member owner] in addition to calling [method add_child]. This is "
"typically relevant for [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/"
"running_code_in_the_editor.html]tool scripts[/url] and [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/plugins/editor/index.html]editor plugins[/url]. If [method "
"add_child] is called without setting [member owner], the newly added [Node] "
"will not be visible in the scene tree, though it will be visible in the 2D/"
"3D view."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um [param node] filho. Os nós podem ter qualquer número de filhos, "
"mas cada filho deve ter um nome exclusivo. Os nós filhos são excluídos "
"automaticamente quando o nó pai é excluído, portanto, uma cena inteira pode "
"ser removida excluindo seu nó mais alto.\n"
"Se [param force_readable_name] for [code]true[/code], melhora a legibilidade "
"do [param node] adicionado. Se não tiver nome, o [param node] é renomeado "
"para o seu tipo, e se ele compartilhar um [member name] com um irmão, um "
"número é adicionado como sufixo de forma mais apropriada. Essa operação é "
"muito lenta. Como tal, é recomendado deixar isso como [code]false[/code], o "
"que atribui um nome fictício contendo [code]@[/code] em ambas as situações.\n"
"Se [param internal] for diferente de [constant INTERNAL_MODE_DISABLED], o "
"filho será adicionado como um nó interno. Esses nós são ignorados por "
"métodos como [method get_children], a menos que seu parâmetro "
"[code]include_internal[/code] seja [code]true[/code]. Isso também evita que "
"esses nós sejam duplicados com seu pai. O uso pretendido é ocultar os nós "
"internos do usuário, para que o usuário não os exclua ou modifique "
"acidentalmente. Usado por alguns nós de GUI, por exemplo, [ColorPicker].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se o [param node] já tiver um pai, este método falhará. Use "
"[method remove_child] primeiro para remover o [param node] de seu pai atual. "
"Por exemplo:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var child_node = get_child(0)\n"
"if child_node.get_parent():\n"
"\tchild_node.get_parent().remove_child(child_node)\n"
"add_child(child_node)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Node childNode = GetChild(0);\n"
"if (childNode.GetParent() != null)\n"
"{\n"
"\tchildNode.GetParent().RemoveChild(childNode);\n"
"}\n"
"AddChild(childNode);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Se você precisar que o nó filho seja adicionado abaixo de um nó específico "
"na lista de filhos, use [method add_sibling] em vez deste método.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você quiser que um filho seja persistido em uma "
"[PackedScene], você deve definir o [member owner] além de chamar [method "
"add_child]. Isso geralmente é relevante para [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.html]scripts de ferramenta[/url] e "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/editor/index.html]plug-ins de editor[/url]. "
"Se [method add_child] for chamado sem definir o [member owner], o [Node] "
"recém-adicionado não ficará visível na árvore de cenas, embora fique visível "
"na visualização 2D/3D."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a [param sibling] node to this node's parent, and moves the added "
"sibling right below this node.\n"
"If [param force_readable_name] is [code]true[/code], improves the "
"readability of the added [param sibling]. If not named, the [param sibling] "
"is renamed to its type, and if it shares [member name] with a sibling, a "
"number is suffixed more appropriately. This operation is very slow. As such, "
"it is recommended leaving this to [code]false[/code], which assigns a dummy "
"name featuring [code]@[/code] in both situations.\n"
"Use [method add_child] instead of this method if you don't need the child "
"node to be added below a specific node in the list of children.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If this node is internal, the added sibling will be internal "
"too (see [method add_child]'s [code]internal[/code] parameter)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the node to the [param group]. Groups can be helpful to organize a "
"subset of nodes, for example [code]\"enemies\"[/code] or [code]"
"\"collectables\"[/code]. See notes in the description, and the group methods "
"in [SceneTree].\n"
"If [param persistent] is [code]true[/code], the group will be stored when "
"saved inside a [PackedScene]. All groups created and displayed in the Groups "
"dock are persistent.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To improve performance, the order of group names is [i]not[/i] "
"guaranteed and may vary between project runs. Therefore, do not rely on the "
"group order.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [SceneTree]'s group methods will [i]not[/i] work on this node "
"if not inside the tree (see [method is_inside_tree])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Translates a [param message], using the translation catalogs configured in "
"the Project Settings. Further [param context] can be specified to help with "
"the translation. Note that most [Control] nodes automatically translate "
"their strings, so this method is mostly useful for formatted strings or "
"custom drawn text.\n"
"This method works the same as [method Object.tr], with the addition of "
"respecting the [member auto_translate_mode] state.\n"
"If [method Object.can_translate_messages] is [code]false[/code], or no "
"translation is available, this method returns the [param message] without "
"changes. See [method Object.set_message_translation].\n"
"For detailed examples, see [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/i18n/"
"internationalizing_games.html]Internationalizing games[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Translates a [param message] or [param plural_message], using the "
"translation catalogs configured in the Project Settings. Further [param "
"context] can be specified to help with the translation.\n"
"This method works the same as [method Object.tr_n], with the addition of "
"respecting the [member auto_translate_mode] state.\n"
"If [method Object.can_translate_messages] is [code]false[/code], or no "
"translation is available, this method returns [param message] or [param "
"plural_message], without changes. See [method "
"Object.set_message_translation].\n"
"The [param n] is the number, or amount, of the message's subject. It is used "
"by the translation system to fetch the correct plural form for the current "
"language.\n"
"For detailed examples, see [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/i18n/"
"localization_using_gettext.html]Localization using gettext[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Negative and [float] numbers may not properly apply to some "
"countable subjects. It's recommended to handle these cases with [method atr]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"This function is similar to [method Object.call_deferred] except that the "
"call will take place when the node thread group is processed. If the node "
"thread group processes in sub-threads, then the call will be done on that "
"thread, right before [constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS] or [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS], the [method _process] or [method "
"_physics_process] or their internal versions are called."
msgstr ""
"Esta função é semelhante a [method Object.call_deferred], exceto que a "
"chamada ocorrerá quando o grupo de threads do nó for processado. Se o grupo "
"de threads do nó for processado em sub-threads, a chamada será feita nessa "
"thread, logo antes de [constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS] ou [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS], e de [method _process] ou [method "
"_physics_process] ou suas versões internas serem chamadas."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"This function ensures that the calling of this function will succeed, no "
"matter whether it's being done from a thread or not. If called from a thread "
"that is not allowed to call the function, the call will become deferred. "
"Otherwise, the call will go through directly."
msgstr ""
"Esta função garante que a chamada desta função terá sucesso, "
"independentemente de estar sendo feita a partir de uma thread ou não. Se "
"chamada de uma thread que não tem permissão para chamar a função, a chamada "
"se tornará adiada. Caso contrário, a chamada ocorrerá diretamente."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this node can automatically translate messages "
"depending on the current locale. See [member auto_translate_mode], [method "
"atr], and [method atr_n]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este nó puder traduzir mensagens "
"automaticamente dependendo da localidade atual. Veja [member "
"auto_translate_mode], [method atr] e [method atr_n]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node can receive processing notifications "
"and input callbacks ([constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS], [method _input], etc.) "
"from the [SceneTree] and [Viewport]. The returned value depends on [member "
"process_mode]:\n"
"- If set to [constant PROCESS_MODE_PAUSABLE], returns [code]true[/code] when "
"the game is processing, i.e. [member SceneTree.paused] is [code]false[/"
"code];\n"
"- If set to [constant PROCESS_MODE_WHEN_PAUSED], returns [code]true[/code] "
"when the game is paused, i.e. [member SceneTree.paused] is [code]true[/"
"code];\n"
"- If set to [constant PROCESS_MODE_ALWAYS], always returns [code]true[/"
"code];\n"
"- If set to [constant PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED], always returns [code]false[/"
"code];\n"
"- If set to [constant PROCESS_MODE_INHERIT], use the parent node's [member "
"process_mode] to determine the result.\n"
"If the node is not inside the tree, returns [code]false[/code] no matter the "
"value of [member process_mode]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Tween] and binds it to this node.\n"
"This is the equivalent of doing:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_tree().create_tween().bind_node(self)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetTree().CreateTween().BindNode(this);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"The Tween will start automatically on the next process frame or physics "
"frame (depending on [enum Tween.TweenProcessMode]). See [method "
"Tween.bind_node] for more info on Tweens bound to nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The method can still be used when the node is not inside "
"[SceneTree]. It can fail in an unlikely case of using a custom [MainLoop]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo [Tween] e o vincula a este nó.\n"
"Isto é o equivalente a fazer:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_tree().create_tween().bind_node(self)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetTree().CreateTween().BindNode(this);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"O Tween iniciará automaticamente no próximo quadro de processo ou quadro de "
"física (dependendo de [enum Tween.TweenProcessMode]). Consulte [method "
"Tween.bind_node] para mais informações sobre Tweens vinculados a nós.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O método ainda pode ser usado quando o nó não está dentro de "
"[SceneTree]. Ele pode falhar no caso improvável de usar um [MainLoop] "
"personalizado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicates the node, returning a new node with all of its properties, "
"signals, groups, and children copied from the original, recursively. The "
"behavior can be tweaked through the [param flags] (see [enum "
"DuplicateFlags]). Internal nodes are not duplicated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For nodes with a [Script] attached, if [method Object._init] "
"has been defined with required parameters, the duplicated node will not have "
"a [Script].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, this method will duplicate only properties marked "
"for serialization (i.e. using [constant "
"@GlobalScope.PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE], or in GDScript, [annotation "
"@GDScript.@export]). If you want to duplicate all properties, use [constant "
"DUPLICATE_INTERNAL_STATE]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Finds the first descendant of this node whose [member name] matches [param "
"pattern], returning [code]null[/code] if no match is found. The matching is "
"done against node names, [i]not[/i] their paths, through [method "
"String.match]. As such, it is case-sensitive, [code]\"*\"[/code] matches "
"zero or more characters, and [code]\"?\"[/code] matches any single "
"character.\n"
"If [param recursive] is [code]false[/code], only this node's direct children "
"are checked. Nodes are checked in tree order, so this node's first direct "
"child is checked first, then its own direct children, etc., before moving to "
"the second direct child, and so on. Internal children are also included in "
"the search (see [code]internal[/code] parameter in [method add_child]).\n"
"If [param owned] is [code]true[/code], only descendants with a valid [member "
"owner] node are checked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method can be very slow. Consider storing a reference to "
"the found node in a variable. Alternatively, use [method get_node] with "
"unique names (see [member unique_name_in_owner]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To find all descendant nodes matching a pattern or a class "
"type, see [method find_children]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Finds all descendants of this node whose names match [param pattern], "
"returning an empty [Array] if no match is found. The matching is done "
"against node names, [i]not[/i] their paths, through [method String.match]. "
"As such, it is case-sensitive, [code]\"*\"[/code] matches zero or more "
"characters, and [code]\"?\"[/code] matches any single character.\n"
"If [param type] is not empty, only descendants inheriting from [param type] "
"are included (see [method Object.is_class]).\n"
"If [param recursive] is [code]false[/code], only this node's direct children "
"are checked. Nodes are checked in tree order, so this node's first direct "
"child is checked first, then its own direct children, etc., before moving to "
"the second direct child, and so on. Internal children are also included in "
"the search (see [code]internal[/code] parameter in [method add_child]).\n"
"If [param owned] is [code]true[/code], only descendants with a valid [member "
"owner] node are checked.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method can be very slow. Consider storing references to "
"the found nodes in a variable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To find a single descendant node matching a pattern, see "
"[method find_child]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Finds the first ancestor of this node whose [member name] matches [param "
"pattern], returning [code]null[/code] if no match is found. The matching is "
"done through [method String.match]. As such, it is case-sensitive, [code]"
"\"*\"[/code] matches zero or more characters, and [code]\"?\"[/code] matches "
"any single character. See also [method find_child] and [method "
"find_children].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] As this method walks upwards in the scene tree, it can be slow "
"in large, deeply nested nodes. Consider storing a reference to the found "
"node in a variable. Alternatively, use [method get_node] with unique names "
"(see [member unique_name_in_owner])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns main accessibility element RID.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should be called only during accessibility "
"information updates ([constant NOTIFICATION_ACCESSIBILITY_UPDATE])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Fetches a child node by its index. Each child node has an index relative to "
"its siblings (see [method get_index]). The first child is at index 0. "
"Negative values can also be used to start from the end of the list. This "
"method can be used in combination with [method get_child_count] to iterate "
"over this node's children. If no child exists at the given index, this "
"method returns [code]null[/code] and an error is generated.\n"
"If [param include_internal] is [code]false[/code], internal children are "
"ignored (see [method add_child]'s [code]internal[/code] parameter).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Assuming the following are children of this node, in order:\n"
"# First, Middle, Last.\n"
"\n"
"var a = get_child(0).name  # a is \"First\"\n"
"var b = get_child(1).name  # b is \"Middle\"\n"
"var b = get_child(2).name  # b is \"Last\"\n"
"var c = get_child(-1).name # c is \"Last\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To fetch a node by [NodePath], use [method get_node]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of children of this node.\n"
"If [param include_internal] is [code]false[/code], internal children are not "
"counted (see [method add_child]'s [code]internal[/code] parameter)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all children of this node inside an [Array].\n"
"If [param include_internal] is [code]false[/code], excludes internal "
"children from the returned array (see [method add_child]'s [code]internal[/"
"code] parameter)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of group names that the node has been added to.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To improve performance, the order of group names is [i]not[/i] "
"guaranteed and may vary between project runs. Therefore, do not rely on the "
"group order.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method may also return some group names starting with an "
"underscore ([code]_[/code]). These are internally used by the engine. To "
"avoid conflicts, do not use custom groups starting with underscores. To "
"exclude internal groups, see the following code snippet:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Stores the node's non-internal groups only (as an array of StringNames).\n"
"var non_internal_groups = []\n"
"for group in get_groups():\n"
"\tif not str(group).begins_with(\"_\"):\n"
"\t\tnon_internal_groups.push_back(group)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Stores the node's non-internal groups only (as a List of StringNames).\n"
"List<string> nonInternalGroups = new List<string>();\n"
"foreach (string group in GetGroups())\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (!group.BeginsWith(\"_\"))\n"
"\t\tnonInternalGroups.Add(group);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Array] de nomes de grupos aos quais o nó foi adicionado.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para melhorar o desempenho, a ordem dos nomes dos grupos "
"[i]não[/i] é garantida e pode variar entre as execuções do projeto. "
"Portanto, não confie na ordem dos grupos.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método também pode retornar alguns nomes de grupos que "
"começam com um sublinhado ([code]_[/code]). Eles são usados internamente "
"pelo motor. Para evitar conflitos, não use grupos personalizados que comecem "
"com sublinhados. Para excluir grupos internos, veja o seguinte trecho de "
"código:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# Armazena apenas os grupos não internos do nó (como um array de "
"StringNames).\n"
"var non_internal_groups = []\n"
"for group in get_groups():\n"
"\tif not str(group).begins_with(\"_\"):\n"
"\t\tnon_internal_groups.push_back(group)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// Armazena apenas os grupos não internos do nó (como uma List de "
"StringNames).\n"
"List<string> nonInternalGroups = new List<string>();\n"
"foreach (string group in GetGroups())\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (!group.BeginsWith(\"_\"))\n"
"\t\tnonInternalGroups.Add(group);\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns this node's order among its siblings. The first node's index is "
"[code]0[/code]. See also [method get_child].\n"
"If [param include_internal] is [code]false[/code], returns the index "
"ignoring internal children. The first, non-internal child will have an index "
"of [code]0[/code] (see [method add_child]'s [code]internal[/code] parameter)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Window] that contains this node, or the last exclusive child in "
"a chain of windows starting with the one that contains this node."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a [Window] que contém este nó ou o último filho exclusivo em uma "
"cadeia de janelas começando com aquela que contém este nó."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the peer ID of the multiplayer authority for this node. See [method "
"set_multiplayer_authority]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID de par da autoridade multiplayer para este nó. Consulte [method "
"set_multiplayer_authority]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Fetches a node. The [NodePath] can either be a relative path (from this "
"node), or an absolute path (from the [member SceneTree.root]) to a node. If "
"[param path] does not point to a valid node, generates an error and returns "
"[code]null[/code]. Attempts to access methods on the return value will "
"result in an [i]\"Attempt to call <method> on a null instance.\"[/i] error.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Fetching by absolute path only works when the node is inside "
"the scene tree (see [method is_inside_tree]).\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Assume this method is called from the Character node, inside "
"the following tree:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
" ┖╴root\n"
"    ┠╴Character (you are here!)\n"
"    ┃  ┠╴Sword\n"
"    ┃  ┖╴Backpack\n"
"    ┃     ┖╴Dagger\n"
"    ┠╴MyGame\n"
"    ┖╴Swamp\n"
"       ┠╴Alligator\n"
"       ┠╴Mosquito\n"
"       ┖╴Goblin\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"The following calls will return a valid node:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_node(\"Sword\")\n"
"get_node(\"Backpack/Dagger\")\n"
"get_node(\"../Swamp/Alligator\")\n"
"get_node(\"/root/MyGame\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetNode(\"Sword\");\n"
"GetNode(\"Backpack/Dagger\");\n"
"GetNode(\"../Swamp/Alligator\");\n"
"GetNode(\"/root/MyGame\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Obtém um nó. O [NodePath] pode ser um caminho relativo (a partir deste nó) "
"ou um caminho absoluto (a partir de [member SceneTree.root]) para um nó. Se "
"[param path] não apontar para um nó válido, gera um erro e retorna "
"[code]null[/code]. Tentativas de acessar métodos no valor de retorno "
"resultarão em um erro [i]\"Attempt to call <method> on a null instance.\"[/"
"i].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A busca por caminho absoluto só funciona quando o nó está "
"dentro da árvore de cena (veja [method is_inside_tree]).\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Assuma que este método seja chamado a partir do nó "
"Character, dentro da seguinte árvore:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
" ┖╴root\n"
"    ┠╴Character (você está aqui!)\n"
"    ┃  ┠╴Sword\n"
"    ┃  ┖╴Backpack\n"
"    ┃     ┖╴Dagger\n"
"    ┠╴MyGame\n"
"    ┖╴Swamp\n"
"       ┠╴Alligator\n"
"       ┠╴Mosquito\n"
"       ┖╴Goblin\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"As seguintes chamadas retornarão um nó válido:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"get_node(\"Sword\")\n"
"get_node(\"Backpack/Dagger\")\n"
"get_node(\"../Swamp/Alligator\")\n"
"get_node(\"/root/MyGame\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GetNode(\"Sword\");\n"
"GetNode(\"Backpack/Dagger\");\n"
"GetNode(\"../Swamp/Alligator\");\n"
"GetNode(\"/root/MyGame\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Fetches a node and its most nested resource as specified by the [NodePath]'s "
"subname. Returns an [Array] of size [code]3[/code] where:\n"
"- Element [code]0[/code] is the [Node], or [code]null[/code] if not found;\n"
"- Element [code]1[/code] is the subname's last nested [Resource], or "
"[code]null[/code] if not found;\n"
"- Element [code]2[/code] is the remaining [NodePath], referring to an "
"existing, non-[Resource] property (see [method Object.get_indexed]).\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Assume that the child's [member Sprite2D.texture] has been "
"assigned an [AtlasTexture]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = get_node_and_resource(\"Area2D/Sprite2D\")\n"
"print(a[0].name) # Prints Sprite2D\n"
"print(a[1])      # Prints <null>\n"
"print(a[2])      # Prints ^\"\"\n"
"\n"
"var b = get_node_and_resource(\"Area2D/Sprite2D:texture:atlas\")\n"
"print(b[0].name)        # Prints Sprite2D\n"
"print(b[1].get_class()) # Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"print(b[2])             # Prints ^\"\"\n"
"\n"
"var c = get_node_and_resource(\"Area2D/Sprite2D:texture:atlas:region\")\n"
"print(c[0].name)        # Prints Sprite2D\n"
"print(c[1].get_class()) # Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"print(c[2])             # Prints ^\":region\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = GetNodeAndResource(NodePath(\"Area2D/Sprite2D\"));\n"
"GD.Print(a[0].Name); // Prints Sprite2D\n"
"GD.Print(a[1]);      // Prints <null>\n"
"GD.Print(a[2]);      // Prints ^\"\n"
"\n"
"var b = GetNodeAndResource(NodePath(\"Area2D/Sprite2D:texture:atlas\"));\n"
"GD.Print(b[0].name);        // Prints Sprite2D\n"
"GD.Print(b[1].get_class()); // Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"GD.Print(b[2]);             // Prints ^\"\"\n"
"\n"
"var c = GetNodeAndResource(NodePath(\"Area2D/"
"Sprite2D:texture:atlas:region\"));\n"
"GD.Print(c[0].name);        // Prints Sprite2D\n"
"GD.Print(c[1].get_class()); // Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"GD.Print(c[2]);             // Prints ^\":region\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Obtém um nó e seu recurso mais aninhado conforme especificado pelo subnome "
"do [NodePath]. Retorna um [Array] de tamanho [code]3[/code] onde:\n"
"- O elemento [code]0[/code] é o [Node], ou [code]null[/code] se não for "
"encontrado;\n"
"- O elemento [code]1[/code] é o último [Resource] aninhado do subnome, ou "
"[code]null[/code] se não for encontrado;\n"
"- O elemento [code]2[/code] é o [NodePath] restante, referindo-se a uma "
"propriedade existente que não seja um [Resource] (veja [method "
"Object.get_indexed]).\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Assuma que ao [member Sprite2D.texture] do filho foi "
"atribuído um [AtlasTexture]:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var a = get_node_and_resource(\"Area2D/Sprite2D\")\n"
"print(a[0].name) # Prints Sprite2D\n"
"print(a[1])      # Prints <null>\n"
"print(a[2])      # Prints ^\"\"\n"
"\n"
"var b = get_node_and_resource(\"Area2D/Sprite2D:texture:atlas\")\n"
"print(b[0].name)        # Prints Sprite2D\n"
"print(b[1].get_class()) # Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"print(b[2])             # Prints ^\"\"\n"
"\n"
"var c = get_node_and_resource(\"Area2D/Sprite2D:texture:atlas:region\")\n"
"print(c[0].name)        # Prints Sprite2D\n"
"print(c[1].get_class()) # Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"print(c[2])             # Prints ^\":region\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var a = GetNodeAndResource(NodePath(\"Area2D/Sprite2D\"));\n"
"GD.Print(a[0].Name); // Prints Sprite2D\n"
"GD.Print(a[1]);      // Prints <null>\n"
"GD.Print(a[2]);      // Prints ^\"\n"
"\n"
"var b = GetNodeAndResource(NodePath(\"Area2D/Sprite2D:texture:atlas\"));\n"
"GD.Print(b[0].name);        // Prints Sprite2D\n"
"GD.Print(b[1].get_class()); // Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"GD.Print(b[2]);             // Prints ^\"\"\n"
"\n"
"var c = GetNodeAndResource(NodePath(\"Area2D/"
"Sprite2D:texture:atlas:region\"));\n"
"GD.Print(c[0].name);        // Prints Sprite2D\n"
"GD.Print(c[1].get_class()); // Prints AtlasTexture\n"
"GD.Print(c[2]);             // Prints ^\":region\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Fetches a node by [NodePath]. Similar to [method get_node], but does not "
"generate an error if [param path] does not point to a valid node."
msgstr ""
"Busca um nó por [NodePath]. Semelhante a [method get_node], mas não gera um "
"erro se [param path] não apontar para um nó válido."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] mapping method names to their RPC configuration "
"defined for this node using [method rpc_config].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only returns the RPC configuration assigned via "
"[method rpc_config]. See [method Script.get_rpc_config] to retrieve the RPCs "
"defined by the [Script]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns object IDs of all orphan nodes (nodes outside the [SceneTree]). Used "
"for debugging.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method get_orphan_node_ids] only works in debug builds. When "
"called in a project exported in release mode, [method get_orphan_node_ids] "
"will return an empty array."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns this node's parent node, or [code]null[/code] if the node doesn't "
"have a parent."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nó pai deste nó, ou [code]null[/code] se o nó não tiver um pai."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the node's absolute path, relative to the [member SceneTree.root]. "
"If the node is not inside the scene tree, this method fails and returns an "
"empty [NodePath]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho absoluto do nó, relativo ao [member SceneTree.root]. Se o "
"nó não estiver dentro da árvore de cena, este método falha e retorna um "
"[NodePath] vazio."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the relative [NodePath] from this node to the specified [param "
"node]. Both nodes must be in the same [SceneTree] or scene hierarchy, "
"otherwise this method fails and returns an empty [NodePath].\n"
"If [param use_unique_path] is [code]true[/code], returns the shortest path "
"accounting for this node's unique name (see [member unique_name_in_owner]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you get a relative path which starts from a unique node, the "
"path may be longer than a normal relative path, due to the addition of the "
"unique node's name."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the time elapsed (in seconds) since the last physics callback. This "
"value is identical to [method _physics_process]'s [code]delta[/code] "
"parameter, and is often consistent at run-time, unless [member "
"Engine.physics_ticks_per_second] is changed. See also [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value will be larger than expected if running at a "
"framerate lower than [member Engine.physics_ticks_per_second] / [member "
"Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] FPS. This is done to avoid \"spiral of "
"death\" scenarios where performance would plummet due to an ever-increasing "
"number of physics steps per frame. This behavior affects both [method "
"_process] and [method _physics_process]. As a result, avoid using "
"[code]delta[/code] for time measurements in real-world seconds. Use the "
"[Time] singleton's methods for this purpose instead, such as [method "
"Time.get_ticks_usec]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the time elapsed (in seconds) since the last process callback. This "
"value is identical to [method _process]'s [code]delta[/code] parameter, and "
"may vary from frame to frame. See also [constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The returned value will be larger than expected if running at a "
"framerate lower than [member Engine.physics_ticks_per_second] / [member "
"Engine.max_physics_steps_per_frame] FPS. This is done to avoid \"spiral of "
"death\" scenarios where performance would plummet due to an ever-increasing "
"number of physics steps per frame. This behavior affects both [method "
"_process] and [method _physics_process]. As a result, avoid using "
"[code]delta[/code] for time measurements in real-world seconds. Use the "
"[Time] singleton's methods for this purpose instead, such as [method "
"Time.get_ticks_usec]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this node is an instance load placeholder. See "
"[InstancePlaceholder] and [method set_scene_instance_load_placeholder]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este nó for um espaço reservado de carregamento "
"de instância. Veja [InstancePlaceholder] e [method "
"set_scene_instance_load_placeholder]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [SceneTree] that contains this node. If this node is not inside "
"the tree, generates an error and returns [code]null[/code]. See also [method "
"is_inside_tree]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a [SceneTree] que contém este nó. Se este nó não estiver dentro da "
"árvore, gera um erro e retorna [code]null[/code]. Veja também [method "
"is_inside_tree]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the tree as a [String]. Used mainly for debugging purposes. This "
"version displays the path relative to the current node, and is good for copy/"
"pasting into the [method get_node] function. It also can be used in game UI/"
"UX.\n"
"May print, for example:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"TheGame\n"
"TheGame/Menu\n"
"TheGame/Menu/Label\n"
"TheGame/Menu/Camera2D\n"
"TheGame/SplashScreen\n"
"TheGame/SplashScreen/Camera2D\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [method get_tree_string], this returns the tree as a [String]. "
"This version displays a more graphical representation similar to what is "
"displayed in the Scene Dock. It is useful for inspecting larger trees.\n"
"May print, for example:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
" ┖╴TheGame\n"
"    ┠╴Menu\n"
"    ┃  ┠╴Label\n"
"    ┃  ┖╴Camera2D\n"
"    ┖╴SplashScreen\n"
"       ┖╴Camera2D\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the node's closest [Viewport] ancestor, if the node is inside the "
"tree. Otherwise, returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ancestral [Viewport] mais próximo do nó, se o nó estiver dentro da "
"árvore. Caso contrário, retorna [code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Window] that contains this node. If the node is in the main "
"window, this is equivalent to getting the root node "
"([code]get_tree().get_root()[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [Window] que contém este nó. Se o nó estiver na janela principal, "
"isso é equivalente a obter o nó raiz ([code]get_tree().get_root()[/code])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [param path] points to a valid node. See "
"also [method get_node]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param path] aponta para um nó válido. Veja "
"também [method get_node]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param path] points to a valid node and its "
"subnames point to a valid [Resource], e.g. [code]Area2D/"
"CollisionShape2D:shape[/code]. Properties that are not [Resource] types "
"(such as nodes or other [Variant] types) are not considered. See also "
"[method get_node_and_resource]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se [param path] aponta para um nó válido e seus "
"subnomes apontam para um [Resource] válido, por exemplo, [code]Area2D/"
"CollisionShape2D:shape[/code]. Propriedades que não são tipos [Resource] "
"(como nós ou outros tipos [Variant]) não são consideradas. Veja também "
"[method get_node_and_resource]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param node] is a direct or indirect "
"child of this node."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param node] fornecido for um filho direto ou "
"indireto deste nó."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is folded (collapsed) in the Scene "
"dock. This method is intended to be used in editor plugins and tools. See "
"also [method set_display_folded]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó estiver dobrado (recolhido) na doca Cena. "
"Este método destina-se a ser usado em plugins e ferramentas do editor. Veja "
"também [method set_display_folded]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param node] has editable children enabled "
"relative to this node. This method is intended to be used in editor plugins "
"and tools. See also [method set_editable_instance]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param node] tiver filhos editáveis "
"habilitados em relação a este nó. Este método destina-se a ser usado em "
"plugins de editor e ferramentas. Consulte também [method "
"set_editable_instance]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param node] occurs later in the "
"scene hierarchy than this node. A node occurring later is usually processed "
"last."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [param node] fornecido ocorrer mais tarde na "
"hierarquia da cena do que este nó. Um nó que ocorre mais tarde geralmente é "
"processado por último."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this node has been added to the given [param "
"group]. See [method add_to_group] and [method remove_from_group]. See also "
"notes in the description, and the [SceneTree]'s group methods."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este nó foi adicionado ao [param group] "
"fornecido. Consulte [method add_to_group] e [method remove_from_group]. "
"Consulte também as notas na descrição e os métodos de grupo do [SceneTree]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this node is currently inside a [SceneTree]. "
"See also [method get_tree]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este nó estiver atualmente dentro de uma "
"[SceneTree]. Veja também [method get_tree]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the local system is the multiplayer authority "
"of this node."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o sistema local for a autoridade multiplayer "
"deste nó."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is ready, i.e. it's inside scene tree "
"and all its children are initialized.\n"
"[method request_ready] resets it back to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó estiver pronto, ou seja, se estiver dentro "
"da árvore de cena e todos os seus filhos estiverem inicializados.\n"
"[method request_ready] redefine para [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is part of the scene currently opened "
"in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó faz parte da cena atualmente aberta no "
"editor."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if physics interpolation is enabled for this node "
"(see [member physics_interpolation_mode]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Interpolation will only be active if both the flag is set "
"[b]and[/b] physics interpolation is enabled within the [SceneTree]. This can "
"be tested using [method is_physics_interpolated_and_enabled]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if physics interpolation is enabled (see [member "
"physics_interpolation_mode]) [b]and[/b] enabled in the [SceneTree].\n"
"This is a convenience version of [method is_physics_interpolated] that also "
"checks whether physics interpolation is enabled globally.\n"
"See [member SceneTree.physics_interpolation] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.physics/common/physics_interpolation]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if physics processing is enabled (see [method "
"set_physics_process])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o processamento de física estiver ativado "
"(consulte [method set_physics_process])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if internal physics processing is enabled (see "
"[method set_physics_process_internal])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o processamento físico interno estiver ativado "
"(veja [method set_physics_process_internal])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if processing is enabled (see [method "
"set_process])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o processamento estiver ativado (consulte "
"[method set_process])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is processing input (see [method "
"set_process_input])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó estiver processando entrada (consulte "
"[method set_process_input])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if internal processing is enabled (see [method "
"set_process_internal])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o processamento interno estiver ativado "
"(consulte [method set_process_internal])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is processing shortcuts (see [method "
"set_process_shortcut_input])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó estiver processando atalhos (veja [method "
"set_process_shortcut_input])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is processing unhandled input (see "
"[method set_process_unhandled_input])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó estiver processando entrada não tratada "
"(veja [method set_process_unhandled_input])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node is processing unhandled key input (see "
"[method set_process_unhandled_key_input])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó estiver processando entrada de teclas não "
"tratada (veja [method set_process_unhandled_key_input])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Moves [param child_node] to the given index. A node's index is the order "
"among its siblings. If [param to_index] is negative, the index is counted "
"from the end of the list. See also [method get_child] and [method "
"get_index].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The processing order of several engine callbacks ([method "
"_ready], [method _process], etc.) and notifications sent through [method "
"propagate_notification] is affected by tree order. [CanvasItem] nodes are "
"also rendered in tree order. See also [member process_priority]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Similar to [method call_deferred_thread_group], but for notifications."
msgstr ""
"Semelhante a [method call_deferred_thread_group], mas para notificações."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Similar to [method call_thread_safe], but for notifications."
msgstr "Semelhante a [method call_thread_safe], mas para notificações."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Prints all orphan nodes (nodes outside the [SceneTree]). Useful for "
"debugging.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only works in debug builds. It does nothing in a "
"project exported in release mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Prints the node and its children to the console, recursively. The node does "
"not have to be inside the tree. This method outputs [NodePath]s relative to "
"this node, and is good for copy/pasting into [method get_node]. See also "
"[method print_tree_pretty].\n"
"May print, for example:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
".\n"
"Menu\n"
"Menu/Label\n"
"Menu/Camera2D\n"
"SplashScreen\n"
"SplashScreen/Camera2D\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Prints the node and its children to the console, recursively. The node does "
"not have to be inside the tree. Similar to [method print_tree], but the "
"graphical representation looks like what is displayed in the editor's Scene "
"dock. It is useful for inspecting larger trees.\n"
"May print, for example:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
" ┖╴TheGame\n"
"    ┠╴Menu\n"
"    ┃  ┠╴Label\n"
"    ┃  ┖╴Camera2D\n"
"    ┖╴SplashScreen\n"
"       ┖╴Camera2D\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Calls the given [param method] name, passing [param args] as arguments, on "
"this node and all of its children, recursively.\n"
"If [param parent_first] is [code]true[/code], the method is called on this "
"node first, then on all of its children. If [code]false[/code], the "
"children's methods are called first."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Calls [method Object.notification] with [param what] on this node and all of "
"its children, recursively."
msgstr ""
"Chama [method Object.notification] com [param what] neste nó e em todos os "
"seus filhos, recursivamente."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Queues an accessibility information update for this node."
msgstr ""
"Coloca na fila uma atualização de informações de acessibilidade para este nó."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Queues this node to be deleted at the end of the current frame. When "
"deleted, all of its children are deleted as well, and all references to the "
"node and its children become invalid.\n"
"Unlike with [method Object.free], the node is not deleted instantly, and it "
"can still be accessed before deletion. It is also safe to call [method "
"queue_free] multiple times. Use [method Object.is_queued_for_deletion] to "
"check if the node will be deleted at the end of the frame.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The node will only be freed after all other deferred calls are "
"finished. Using this method is not always the same as calling [method "
"Object.free] through [method Object.call_deferred]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a child [param node]. The [param node], along with its children, are "
"[b]not[/b] deleted. To delete a node, see [method queue_free].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When this node is inside the tree, this method sets the [member "
"owner] of the removed [param node] (or its descendants) to [code]null[/"
"code], if their [member owner] is no longer an ancestor (see [method "
"is_ancestor_of])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the node from the given [param group]. Does nothing if the node is "
"not in the [param group]. See also notes in the description, and the "
"[SceneTree]'s group methods."
msgstr ""
"Remove o nó do [param group] fornecido. Não faz nada se o nó não estiver no "
"[param group]. Veja também as notas na descrição e os métodos de grupo da "
"[SceneTree]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the parent of this [Node] to the [param new_parent]. The node needs "
"to already have a parent. The node's [member owner] is preserved if its "
"owner is still reachable from the new location (i.e., the node is still a "
"descendant of the new parent after the operation).\n"
"If [param keep_global_transform] is [code]true[/code], the node's global "
"transform will be preserved if supported. [Node2D], [Node3D] and [Control] "
"support this argument (but [Control] keeps only position).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] If [member ProjectSettings.physics/common/"
"physics_interpolation] is enabled and reparenting causes a large change in "
"global transform, the object may appear to move from its old position to its "
"new one over the next physics tick. To avoid this, call [method "
"reset_physics_interpolation] after reparenting."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Replaces this node by the given [param node]. All children of this node are "
"moved to [param node].\n"
"If [param keep_groups] is [code]true[/code], the [param node] is added to "
"the same groups that the replaced node is in (see [method add_to_group]).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] The replaced node is removed from the tree, but it is "
"[b]not[/b] deleted. To prevent memory leaks, store a reference to the node "
"in a variable, or use [method Object.free]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Requests [method _ready] to be called again the next time the node enters "
"the tree. Does [b]not[/b] immediately call [method _ready].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only affects the current node. If the node's "
"children also need to request ready, this method needs to be called for each "
"one of them. When the node and its children enter the tree again, the order "
"of [method _ready] callbacks will be the same as normal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"When physics interpolation is active, moving a node to a radically different "
"transform (such as placement within a level) can result in a visible glitch "
"as the object is rendered moving from the old to new position over the "
"physics tick.\n"
"That glitch can be prevented by calling this method, which temporarily "
"disables interpolation until the physics tick is complete.\n"
"The notification [constant NOTIFICATION_RESET_PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION] will be "
"received by the node and all children recursively.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function should be called [b]after[/b] moving the node, "
"rather than before."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a remote procedure call request for the given [param method] to peers "
"on the network (and locally), sending additional arguments to the method "
"called by the RPC. The call request will only be received by nodes with the "
"same [NodePath], including the exact same [member name]. Behavior depends on "
"the RPC configuration for the given [param method] (see [method rpc_config] "
"and [annotation @GDScript.@rpc]). By default, methods are not exposed to "
"RPCs.\n"
"May return [constant OK] if the call is successful, [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if the arguments passed in the [param method] do not "
"match, [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] if the node's [member multiplayer] cannot "
"be fetched (such as when the node is not inside the tree), [constant "
"ERR_CONNECTION_ERROR] if [member multiplayer]'s connection is not "
"available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] You can only safely use RPCs on clients after you received the "
"[signal MultiplayerAPI.connected_to_server] signal from the "
"[MultiplayerAPI]. You also need to keep track of the connection state, "
"either by the [MultiplayerAPI] signals like [signal "
"MultiplayerAPI.server_disconnected] or by checking "
"([code]get_multiplayer().peer.get_connection_status() == "
"CONNECTION_CONNECTED[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the RPC configuration for the given [param method]. [param config] "
"should either be [code]null[/code] to disable the feature (as by default), "
"or a [Dictionary] containing the following entries:\n"
"- [code]rpc_mode[/code]: see [enum MultiplayerAPI.RPCMode];\n"
"- [code]transfer_mode[/code]: see [enum MultiplayerPeer.TransferMode];\n"
"- [code]call_local[/code]: if [code]true[/code], the method will also be "
"called locally;\n"
"- [code]channel[/code]: an [int] representing the channel to send the RPC "
"on.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, this method corresponds to the [annotation "
"@GDScript.@rpc] annotation, with various parameters passed ([code]@rpc(any)[/"
"code], [code]@rpc(authority)[/code]...). See also the [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/networking/high_level_multiplayer.html]high-level multiplayer[/"
"url] tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Sends a [method rpc] to a specific peer identified by [param peer_id] (see "
"[method MultiplayerPeer.set_target_peer]).\n"
"May return [constant OK] if the call is successful, [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] if the arguments passed in the [param method] do not "
"match, [constant ERR_UNCONFIGURED] if the node's [member multiplayer] cannot "
"be fetched (such as when the node is not inside the tree), [constant "
"ERR_CONNECTION_ERROR] if [member multiplayer]'s connection is not available."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [method call_deferred_thread_group], but for setting properties."
msgstr ""
"Semelhante a [method call_deferred_thread_group], mas para definir "
"propriedades."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the node appears folded in the Scene dock. As a "
"result, all of its children are hidden. This method is intended to be used "
"in editor plugins and tools, but it also works in release builds. See also "
"[method is_displayed_folded]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], o nó aparece recolhido no dock de Cenas. "
"Como resultado, todos os seus filhos ficam ocultos. Este método destina-se a "
"ser usado em plug-ins e ferramentas do editor, mas também funciona em builds "
"de lançamento. Veja também [method is_displayed_folded]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Set to [code]true[/code] to allow all nodes owned by [param node] to be "
"available, and editable, in the Scene dock, even if their [member owner] is "
"not the scene root. This method is intended to be used in editor plugins and "
"tools, but it also works in release builds. See also [method "
"is_editable_instance]."
msgstr ""
"Defina como [code]true[/code] para permitir que todos os nós pertencentes a "
"[param node] fiquem disponíveis e editáveis na doca Cena, mesmo que seu "
"[member owner] não seja a raiz da cena. Este método destina-se a ser usado "
"em plugins e ferramentas do editor, mas também funciona em builds de "
"lançamento. Veja também [member is_editable_instance]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the node's multiplayer authority to the peer with the given peer [param "
"id]. The multiplayer authority is the peer that has authority over the node "
"on the network. Defaults to peer ID 1 (the server). Useful in conjunction "
"with [method rpc_config] and the [MultiplayerAPI].\n"
"If [param recursive] is [code]true[/code], the given peer is recursively set "
"as the authority for all children of this node.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This does [b]not[/b] automatically replicate the new "
"authority to other peers. It is the developer's responsibility to do so. You "
"may replicate the new authority's information using [member "
"MultiplayerSpawner.spawn_function], an RPC, or a [MultiplayerSynchronizer]. "
"Furthermore, the parent's authority does [b]not[/b] propagate to newly added "
"children."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables physics (fixed framerate) processing. "
"When a node is being processed, it will receive a [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS] at a fixed (usually 60 FPS, see [member "
"Engine.physics_ticks_per_second] to change) interval (and the [method "
"_physics_process] callback will be called if it exists).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [method _physics_process] is overridden, this will be "
"automatically enabled before [method _ready] is called."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables internal physics for this node. "
"Internal physics processing happens in isolation from the normal [method "
"_physics_process] calls and is used by some nodes internally to guarantee "
"proper functioning even if the node is paused or physics processing is "
"disabled for scripting ([method set_physics_process]).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Built-in nodes rely on internal processing for their "
"internal logic. Disabling it is unsafe and may lead to unexpected behavior. "
"Use this method if you know what you are doing."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables processing. When a node is being "
"processed, it will receive a [constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS] on every drawn "
"frame (and the [method _process] callback will be called if it exists).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [method _process] is overridden, this will be automatically "
"enabled before [method _ready] is called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method only affects the [method _process] callback, i.e. "
"it has no effect on other callbacks like [method _physics_process]. If you "
"want to disable all processing for the node, set [member process_mode] to "
"[constant PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables input processing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [method _input] is overridden, this will be automatically "
"enabled before [method _ready] is called. Input processing is also already "
"enabled for GUI controls, such as [Button] and [TextEdit]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables internal processing for this node. "
"Internal processing happens in isolation from the normal [method _process] "
"calls and is used by some nodes internally to guarantee proper functioning "
"even if the node is paused or processing is disabled for scripting ([method "
"set_process]).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Built-in nodes rely on internal processing for their "
"internal logic. Disabling it is unsafe and may lead to unexpected behavior. "
"Use this method if you know what you are doing."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables shortcut processing for this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [method _shortcut_input] is overridden, this will be "
"automatically enabled before [method _ready] is called."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables unhandled input processing. It enables "
"the node to receive all input that was not previously handled (usually by a "
"[Control]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [method _unhandled_input] is overridden, this will be "
"automatically enabled before [method _ready] is called. Unhandled input "
"processing is also already enabled for GUI controls, such as [Button] and "
"[TextEdit]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], enables unhandled key input processing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [method _unhandled_key_input] is overridden, this will be "
"automatically enabled before [method _ready] is called."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the node becomes an [InstancePlaceholder] when "
"packed and instantiated from a [PackedScene]. See also [method "
"get_scene_instance_load_placeholder]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], o nó se torna um [InstancePlaceholder] "
"quando empacotado e instanciado a partir de uma [PackedScene]. Veja também "
"[method get_scene_instance_load_placeholder]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Similar to [method call_thread_safe], but for setting properties."
msgstr "Semelhante a [method call_thread_safe], mas para definir propriedades."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Makes this node inherit the translation domain from its parent node. If this "
"node has no parent, the main translation domain will be used.\n"
"This is the default behavior for all nodes. Calling [method "
"Object.set_translation_domain] disables this behavior."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Refreshes the warnings displayed for this node in the Scene dock. Use "
"[method _get_configuration_warnings] to customize the warning messages to "
"display."
msgstr ""
"Atualiza os avisos exibidos para este nó no dock Cena. Use [method "
"_get_configuration_warnings] para personalizar as mensagens de aviso a serem "
"exibidas."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Defines if any text should automatically change to its translated version "
"depending on the current locale (for nodes such as [Label], [RichTextLabel], "
"[Window], etc.). Also decides if the node's strings should be parsed for "
"translation template generation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For the root node, auto translate mode can also be set via "
"[member ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"root_node_auto_translate]."
msgstr ""
"Define se qualquer texto deve mudar automaticamente para sua versão "
"traduzida com base na língua atual (para nós como [Label], [RichTextLabel], "
"[Window], etc.). Também determina se as strings do nó devem ser analisadas "
"para a geração de modelos de tradução.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para o nó raiz, o modo de tradução automática também pode ser "
"definido via [member ProjectSettings.internationalization/rendering/"
"root_node_auto_translate]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"An optional description to the node. It will be displayed as a tooltip when "
"hovering over the node in the editor's Scene dock."
msgstr ""
"Uma descrição opcional para o nó. Ela será exibida como uma dica ao passar o "
"cursor sobre o nó na aba Cena do editor."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The [MultiplayerAPI] instance associated with this node. See [method "
"SceneTree.get_multiplayer].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Renaming the node, or moving it in the tree, will not move the "
"[MultiplayerAPI] to the new path, you will have to update this manually."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The name of the node. This name must be unique among the siblings (other "
"child nodes from the same parent). When set to an existing sibling's name, "
"the node is automatically renamed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When changing the name, the following characters will be "
"replaced with an underscore: ([code].[/code] [code]:[/code] [code]@[/code] "
"[code]/[/code] [code]\"[/code] [code]%[/code]). In particular, the [code]@[/"
"code] character is reserved for auto-generated names. See also [method "
"String.validate_node_name]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The owner of this node. The owner must be an ancestor of this node. When "
"packing the owner node in a [PackedScene], all the nodes it owns are also "
"saved with it. See also [member unique_name_in_owner].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In the editor, nodes not owned by the scene root are usually "
"not displayed in the Scene dock, and will [b]not[/b] be saved. To prevent "
"this, remember to set the owner after calling [method add_child].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The owner needs to be the current scene root. See "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.html#instancing-"
"scenes]Instancing scenes[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The physics interpolation mode to use for this node. Only effective if "
"[member ProjectSettings.physics/common/physics_interpolation] or [member "
"SceneTree.physics_interpolation] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"By default, nodes inherit the physics interpolation mode from their parent. "
"This property can enable or disable physics interpolation individually for "
"each node, regardless of their parents' physics interpolation mode.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some node types like [VehicleWheel3D] have physics "
"interpolation disabled by default, as they rely on their own custom "
"solution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When teleporting a node to a distant position, it's recommended "
"to temporarily disable interpolation with [method "
"Node.reset_physics_interpolation] [i]after[/i] moving the node. This avoids "
"creating a visual streak between the old and new positions."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The node's processing behavior. To check if the node can process in its "
"current mode, use [method can_process]."
msgstr ""
"O comportamento de processamento do nó. Para verificar se o nó pode "
"processar em seu modo atual, use [method can_process]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [member process_priority] but for [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS], [method _physics_process], or [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS]."
msgstr ""
"Semelhante a [member process_priority], mas para [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS], [method _physics_process] ou [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PHYSICS_PROCESS]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The node's execution order of the process callbacks ([method _process], "
"[constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS], and [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS]). Nodes whose priority value is [i]lower[/i] "
"call their process callbacks first, regardless of tree order."
msgstr ""
"A ordem de execução dos callbacks de processo do nó ([method _process], "
"[constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS] e [constant NOTIFICATION_INTERNAL_PROCESS]). "
"Nós cujo valor de prioridade for [i]inferior[/i] chamam seus callbacks de "
"processo primeiro, independentemente da ordem na árvore."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Set the process thread group for this node (basically, whether it receives "
"[constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS], [constant NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS], "
"[method _process] or [method _physics_process] (and the internal versions) "
"on the main thread or in a sub-thread.\n"
"By default, the thread group is [constant PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_INHERIT], "
"which means that this node belongs to the same thread group as the parent "
"node. The thread groups means that nodes in a specific thread group will "
"process together, separate to other thread groups (depending on [member "
"process_thread_group_order]). If the value is set is [constant "
"PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_SUB_THREAD], this thread group will occur on a sub "
"thread (not the main thread), otherwise if set to [constant "
"PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_MAIN_THREAD] it will process on the main thread. If "
"there is not a parent or grandparent node set to something other than "
"inherit, the node will belong to the [i]default thread group[/i]. This "
"default group will process on the main thread and its group order is 0.\n"
"During processing in a sub-thread, accessing most functions in nodes outside "
"the thread group is forbidden (and it will result in an error in debug "
"mode). Use [method Object.call_deferred], [method call_thread_safe], [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] and the likes in order to communicate from the "
"thread groups to the main thread (or to other thread groups).\n"
"To better understand process thread groups, the idea is that any node set to "
"any other value than [constant PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_INHERIT] will include "
"any child (and grandchild) nodes set to inherit into its process thread "
"group. This means that the processing of all the nodes in the group will "
"happen together, at the same time as the node including them."
msgstr ""
"Define o grupo de threads de processo para este nó (basicamente, se ele "
"recebe [constant NOTIFICATION_PROCESS], [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_PHYSICS_PROCESS], [method _process] ou [method "
"_physics_process] (e as versões internas) na thread principal ou em uma sub-"
"thread).\n"
"Por padrão, o grupo de threads é [constant PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_INHERIT], o "
"que significa que este nó pertence ao mesmo grupo de threads que o nó pai. "
"Os grupos de threads significam que os nós em um grupo de threads específico "
"processarão juntos, separados de outros grupos de threads (dependendo de "
"[member process_thread_group_order]). Se o valor definido for [constant "
"PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_SUB_THREAD], este grupo de threads ocorrerá em uma sub-"
"thread (e não na thread principal); caso contrário, se definido como "
"[constant PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_MAIN_THREAD], ele será processado na thread "
"principal. Se não houver um nó pai ou avô definido como algo diferente de "
"herdar, o nó pertencerá ao [i]grupo de threads padrão[/i]. Este grupo padrão "
"será processado na thread principal e sua ordem de grupo é 0.\n"
"Durante o processamento em uma sub-thread, o acesso à maioria das funções em "
"nós fora do grupo de threads é proibido (e resultará em um erro no modo de "
"depuração). Use [method Object.call_deferred], [method call_thread_safe], "
"[method call_deferred_thread_group] e semelhantes para se comunicar dos "
"grupos de threads para a thread principal (ou para outros grupos de "
"threads).\n"
"Para entender melhor os grupos de threads de processo, a ideia é que "
"qualquer nó definido com um valor diferente de [constant "
"PROCESS_THREAD_GROUP_INHERIT] incluirá quaisquer nós filhos (e netos) "
"definidos como herdar em seu grupo de threads de processo. Isso significa "
"que o processamento de todos os nós do grupo ocorrerá junto, ao mesmo tempo "
"que o nó que os inclui."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Change the process thread group order. Groups with a lesser order will "
"process before groups with a greater order. This is useful when a large "
"amount of nodes process in sub thread and, afterwards, another group wants "
"to collect their result in the main thread, as an example."
msgstr ""
"Altera a ordem do grupo de threads de processo. Grupos com uma ordem menor "
"serão processados antes de grupos com uma ordem maior. Isso é útil quando "
"uma grande quantidade de nós é processada em uma subthread e, "
"posteriormente, outro grupo deseja coletar o resultado na thread principal, "
"por exemplo."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Set whether the current thread group will process messages (calls to [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] on threads), and whether it wants to receive "
"them during regular process or physics process callbacks."
msgstr ""
"Define se o grupo de threads atual processará mensagens (chamadas para "
"[method call_deferred_thread_group] em threads) e se deseja recebê-las "
"durante os retornos de chamada de processo regular ou de processo de física."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The original scene's file path, if the node has been instantiated from a "
"[PackedScene] file. Only scene root nodes contains this."
msgstr ""
"O caminho do arquivo da cena original, se o nó tiver sido instanciado a "
"partir de um arquivo [PackedScene]. Apenas os nós raiz de cena contêm isso."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node can be accessed from any node sharing the "
"same [member owner] or from the [member owner] itself, with special [code]"
"%Name[/code] syntax in [method get_node].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If another node with the same [member owner] shares the same "
"[member name] as this node, the other node will no longer be accessible as "
"unique."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the child [param node] enters the [SceneTree], usually because "
"this node entered the tree (see [signal tree_entered]), or [method "
"add_child] has been called.\n"
"This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the child node's own [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] and [signal tree_entered]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the child [param node] is about to exit the [SceneTree], "
"usually because this node is exiting the tree (see [signal tree_exiting]), "
"or because the child [param node] is being removed or freed.\n"
"When this signal is received, the child [param node] is still accessible "
"inside the tree. This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the child node's own "
"[signal tree_exiting] and [constant NOTIFICATION_EXIT_TREE]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the list of children is changed. This happens when child nodes "
"are added, moved or removed."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a lista de filhos é alterada. Isso acontece quando nós filhos "
"são adicionados, movidos ou removidos."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Emitted when the node's editor description field changed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o campo de descrição do editor do nó é alterado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when an attribute of the node that is relevant to the editor is "
"changed. Only emitted in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando um atributo do nó que é relevante para o editor é alterado. "
"Emitido apenas no editor."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the node is considered ready, after [method _ready] is called."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o nó é considerado pronto, após [method _ready] ser chamado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the node's [member name] is changed, if the node is inside the "
"tree."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o [member name] do nó é alterado, se o nó estiver dentro da "
"árvore."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when this node is being replaced by the [param node], see [method "
"replace_by].\n"
"This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] [param node] has been added as a child "
"of the original parent node, but [i]before[/i] all original child nodes have "
"been reparented to [param node]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the node enters the tree.\n"
"This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the related [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE] notification."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted after the node exits the tree and is no longer active.\n"
"This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the related [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_EXIT_TREE] notification."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the node is just about to exit the tree. The node is still "
"valid. As such, this is the right place for de-initialization (or a "
"\"destructor\", if you will).\n"
"This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the node's [method _exit_tree], and "
"[i]before[/i] the related [constant NOTIFICATION_EXIT_TREE]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node enters a [SceneTree]. See [method "
"_enter_tree].\n"
"This notification is received [i]before[/i] the related [signal "
"tree_entered] signal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node is about to exit a [SceneTree]. See "
"[method _exit_tree].\n"
"This notification is received [i]after[/i] the related [signal tree_exiting] "
"signal.\n"
"This notification is sent in reversed order."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"This notification is no longer sent by the engine. Use [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_CHILD_ORDER_CHANGED] instead."
msgstr ""
"Esta notificação não é mais enviada pelo motor. Use [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_CHILD_ORDER_CHANGED] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Notification received when the node is ready. See [method _ready]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o nó está pronto. Consulte [method _ready]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node is paused. See [member process_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o nó é pausado. Veja [member process_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node is unpaused. See [member process_mode]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o nó é despausado. Veja [member process_mode]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the tree every physics frame when [method "
"is_physics_processing] returns [code]true[/code]. See [method "
"_physics_process]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida da árvore a cada quadro de física quando [method "
"is_physics_processing] retorna [code]true[/code]. Consulte [method "
"_physics_process]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the tree every rendered frame when [method "
"is_processing] returns [code]true[/code]. See [method _process]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida da árvore a cada quadro renderizado quando [method "
"is_processing] retorna [code]true[/code]. Veja [method _process]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node is set as a child of another node (see "
"[method add_child] and [method add_sibling]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does [i]not[/i] mean that the node entered the [SceneTree]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the parent node calls [method remove_child] on "
"this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does [i]not[/i] mean that the node exited the [SceneTree]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received [i]only[/i] by the newly instantiated scene root node, "
"when [method PackedScene.instantiate] is completed."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida [i]apenas[/i] pelo nó raiz da cena recém-instanciado, "
"quando [method PackedScene.instantiate] for concluído."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when a drag operation begins. All nodes receive this "
"notification, not only the dragged one.\n"
"Can be triggered either by dragging a [Control] that provides drag data (see "
"[method Control._get_drag_data]) or using [method Control.force_drag].\n"
"Use [method Viewport.gui_get_drag_data] to get the dragged data."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when a drag operation ends.\n"
"Use [method Viewport.gui_is_drag_successful] to check if the drag succeeded."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node's [member name] or one of its ancestors' "
"[member name] is changed. This notification is [i]not[/i] received when the "
"node is removed from the [SceneTree]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o [member name] do nó ou o [member name] de um "
"de seus ancestrais é alterado. Esta notificação [i]não[/i] é recebida quando "
"o nó é removido do [SceneTree]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the list of children is changed. This happens "
"when child nodes are added, moved or removed."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando a lista de filhos é alterada. Isso acontece "
"quando nós filhos são adicionados, movidos ou removidos."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the tree every rendered frame when [method "
"is_processing_internal] returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida da árvore a cada quadro renderizado quando [method "
"is_processing_internal] retorna [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the tree every physics frame when [method "
"is_physics_processing_internal] returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida da árvore a cada quadro de física quando [method "
"is_physics_processing_internal] retorna [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node enters the tree, just before [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_READY] may be received. Unlike the latter, it is sent every "
"time the node enters tree, not just once."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o nó entra na árvore, pouco antes de [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_READY] poder ser recebido. Ao contrário deste último, ela é "
"enviada toda vez que o nó entra na árvore, e não apenas uma vez."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node is disabled. See [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o nó é desativado. Consulte [constant "
"PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the node is enabled again after being disabled. "
"See [constant PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o nó é ativado novamente após ter sido "
"desativado. Veja [constant PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when [method reset_physics_interpolation] is called on "
"the node or its ancestors."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando [method reset_physics_interpolation] é chamado "
"no nó ou em seus ancestrais."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received right before the scene with the node is saved in the "
"editor. This notification is only sent in the Godot editor and will not "
"occur in exported projects."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida logo após a cena com o nó ser salva no editor. Esta "
"notificação é enviada apenas no editor do Godot e não ocorrerá em projetos "
"exportados."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received right after the scene with the node is saved in the "
"editor. This notification is only sent in the Godot editor and will not "
"occur in exported projects."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida logo após a cena com o nó ser salva no editor. Esta "
"notificação é enviada apenas no editor do Godot e não ocorrerá em projetos "
"exportados."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the mouse enters the window.\n"
"Implemented for embedded windows and on desktop and web platforms."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the mouse leaves the window.\n"
"Implemented for embedded windows and on desktop and web platforms."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the node's [Window] ancestor is "
"focused. This may be a change of focus between two windows of the same "
"engine instance, or from the OS desktop or a third-party application to a "
"window of the game (in which case [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_FOCUS_IN] is also received).\n"
"A [Window] node receives this notification when it is focused."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the node's [Window] ancestor is "
"defocused. This may be a change of focus between two windows of the same "
"engine instance, or from a window of the game to the OS desktop or a third-"
"party application (in which case [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_FOCUS_OUT] is also received).\n"
"A [Window] node receives this notification when it is defocused."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when a close request is sent (e.g. closing "
"the window with a \"Close\" button or [kbd]Alt + F4[/kbd]).\n"
"Implemented on desktop platforms."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when a go back request is sent (e.g. "
"pressing the \"Back\" button on Android).\n"
"Implemented only on Android."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida do sistema operacional quando uma solicitação de voltar "
"é enviada (por exemplo, ao pressionar o botão \"Voltar\" no Android).\n"
"Implementado apenas no Android."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the window is resized.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only the resized [Window] node receives this notification, and "
"it's not propagated to the child nodes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the screen's dots per inch (DPI) "
"scale is changed. Only implemented on macOS."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida do SO quando a escala de pontos por polegada (DPI) da "
"tela é alterada. Implementado apenas no macOS."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the mouse cursor enters the [Viewport]'s visible "
"area, that is not occluded behind other [Control]s or [Window]s, provided "
"its [member Viewport.gui_disable_input] is [code]false[/code] and regardless "
"if it's currently focused or not."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o cursor do mouse entra na área visível da "
"[Viewport], que não está ocluída atrás de outros [Control]s ou [Window]s, "
"desde que seu [member Viewport.gui_disable_input] seja [code]false[/code] e "
"independentemente de estar focada no momento ou não."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the mouse cursor leaves the [Viewport]'s visible "
"area, that is not occluded behind other [Control]s or [Window]s, provided "
"its [member Viewport.gui_disable_input] is [code]false[/code] and regardless "
"if it's currently focused or not."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o cursor do mouse sai da área visível da "
"[Viewport], que não está ocluída atrás de outros [Control]s ou [Window]s, "
"desde que seu [member Viewport.gui_disable_input] seja [code]false[/code] e "
"independentemente de estar focada no momento ou não."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Notification received when the window is moved."
msgstr "Notificação recebida quando a janela é movida."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the output max linear value returned by [method "
"Window.get_output_max_linear_value] has changed.\n"
"This occurs when HDR output is enabled or disabled and when any HDR output "
"luminance values of the window have changed, such as when the player adjusts "
"their screen brightness setting or moves the window to a different screen."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when the application is exceeding its "
"allocated memory.\n"
"Implemented only on iOS."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida do sistema operacional quando o aplicativo está "
"excedendo a memória alocada.\n"
"Implementado apenas no iOS."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when translations may have changed. Can be triggered "
"by the user changing the locale, changing [member auto_translate_mode] or "
"when the node enters the scene tree. Can be used to respond to language "
"changes, for example to change the UI strings on the fly. Useful when "
"working with the built-in translation support, like [method Object.tr].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This notification is received alongside [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE], so if you are instantiating a scene, the child "
"nodes will not be initialized yet. You can use it to setup translations for "
"this node, child nodes created from script, or if you want to access child "
"nodes added in the editor, make sure the node is ready using [method "
"is_node_ready].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _notification(what):\n"
"\tif what == NOTIFICATION_TRANSLATION_CHANGED:\n"
"\t\tif not is_node_ready():\n"
"\t\t\tawait ready # Wait until ready signal.\n"
"\t\t$Label.text = atr(\"%d Bananas\") % banana_counter\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from the OS when a request for \"About\" information "
"is sent.\n"
"Implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida do sistema operacional quando uma solicitação de "
"informações \"Sobre\" é enviada.\n"
"Implementado apenas no macOS."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received from Godot's crash handler when the engine is about to "
"crash.\n"
"Implemented on desktop platforms, if the crash handler is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Notification received when the [TextServer] is changed."
msgstr "Notificação recebida quando o [TextServer] é alterado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when an accessibility information update is required."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando uma atualização de informações de acessibilidade "
"é necessária."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when accessibility elements are invalidated. All node "
"accessibility elements are automatically deleted after receiving this "
"message, therefore all existing references to such elements should be "
"discarded."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando elementos de acessibilidade são invalidados. "
"Todos os elementos de acessibilidade de nós são excluídos automaticamente "
"após o recebimento desta mensagem, portanto, todas as referências existentes "
"a tais elementos devem ser descartadas."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Inherits [member process_mode] from the node's parent. This is the default "
"for any newly created node."
msgstr ""
"Herda [member process_mode] do pai do nó. Este é o padrão para qualquer nó "
"recriado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Processes when [member SceneTree.paused] is [code]false[/code]. This is the "
"inverse of [constant PROCESS_MODE_WHEN_PAUSED], and the default for the root "
"node."
msgstr ""
"Processa quando [member SceneTree.paused] é [code]false[/code]. Este é o "
"inverso de [constant PROCESS_MODE_WHEN_PAUSED] e o padrão para o nó raiz."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Processes [b]only[/b] when [member SceneTree.paused] is [code]true[/code]. "
"This is the inverse of [constant PROCESS_MODE_PAUSABLE]."
msgstr ""
"Processa [b]apenas[/b] quando [member SceneTree.paused] for [code]true[/"
"code]. Este é o inverso de [constant PROCESS_MODE_PAUSABLE]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Always processes. Keeps processing, ignoring [member SceneTree.paused]. This "
"is the inverse of [constant PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."
msgstr ""
"Sempre processa. Continua processando, ignorando [member SceneTree.paused]. "
"Este é o inverso de [constant PROCESS_MODE_DISABLED]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Never processes. Completely disables processing, ignoring [member "
"SceneTree.paused]. This is the inverse of [constant PROCESS_MODE_ALWAYS]."
msgstr ""
"Nunca processa. Desativa completamente o processamento, ignorando [member "
"SceneTree.paused]. Este é o inverso de [constant PROCESS_MODE_ALWAYS]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Process this node based on the thread group mode of the first parent (or "
"grandparent) node that has a thread group mode that is not inherit. See "
"[member process_thread_group] for more information."
msgstr ""
"Processa este nó com base no modo de grupo de threads do primeiro nó pai (ou "
"avô) que possui um modo de grupo de threads diferente de inherit. Consulte "
"[member process_thread_group] para obter mais informações."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Process this node (and child nodes set to inherit) on the main thread. See "
"[member process_thread_group] for more information."
msgstr ""
"Processa este nó (e os nós filhos definidos para herdar) na thread "
"principal. Veja [member process_thread_group] para mais informações."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Process this node (and child nodes set to inherit) on a sub-thread. See "
"[member process_thread_group] for more information."
msgstr ""
"Processa este nós (e nós filhos definidos para herdar) em uma subthread. "
"Veja [member process_thread_group] para mais informações."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Allows this node to process threaded messages created with [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] right before [method _process] is called."
msgstr ""
"Permite que este nó processe mensagens em thread criadas com [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] logo antes de [method _process] ser chamado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Allows this node to process threaded messages created with [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] right before [method _physics_process] is called."
msgstr ""
"Permite que este nó processe mensagens em threads criadas com [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] logo antes de [method _physics_process] ser "
"chamado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Allows this node to process threaded messages created with [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] right before either [method _process] or [method "
"_physics_process] are called."
msgstr ""
"Permite que este nó processe mensagens em thread criadas com [method "
"call_deferred_thread_group] logo antes de [method _process] ou [method "
"_physics_process] serem chamados."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Inherits [member physics_interpolation_mode] from the node's parent. This is "
"the default for any newly created node."
msgstr ""
"Herda [member physics_interpolation_mode] do pai do nó. Este é o padrão para "
"qualquer nó recém-criado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Enables physics interpolation for this node and for children set to "
"[constant PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_MODE_INHERIT]. This is the default for the "
"root node."
msgstr ""
"Ativa a interpolação de física para este nó e para os filhos definidos como "
"[constant PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_MODE_INHERIT]. Este é o padrão para o nó "
"raiz."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Disables physics interpolation for this node and for children set to "
"[constant PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_MODE_INHERIT]."
msgstr ""
"Desativa a interpolação física para este nó e para os filhos definidos como "
"[constant PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_MODE_INHERIT]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicate the node's signal connections that are connected with the "
"[constant Object.CONNECT_PERSIST] flag."
msgstr ""
"Duplica as conexões de sinal do nó que estão conectadas com o sinalizador "
"[constant Object.CONNECT_PERSIST]."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "Duplicate the node's groups."
msgstr "Duplica os grupos do nó."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicate the node's script (also overriding the duplicated children's "
"scripts, if combined with [constant DUPLICATE_USE_INSTANTIATION])."
msgstr ""
"Duplica o script do nó (também substituindo os scripts dos filhos "
"duplicados, se combinado com [constant DUPLICATE_USE_INSTANTIATION])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicate using [method PackedScene.instantiate]. If the node comes from a "
"scene saved on disk, reuses [method PackedScene.instantiate] as the base for "
"the duplicated node and its children."
msgstr ""
"Duplica usando [method PackedScene.instantiate]. Se o nó vier de uma cena "
"salva em disco, reutiliza [method PackedScene.instantiate] como a base para "
"o nó duplicado e seus filhos."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicate also non-serializable variables (i.e. without [constant "
"@GlobalScope.PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE])."
msgstr ""
"Duplica também variáveis não serializáveis (ou seja, sem [constant "
"@GlobalScope.PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE])."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Duplicate using default flags. This constant is useful to add or remove a "
"single flag.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Duplicate non-exported variables.\n"
"var dupe = duplicate(DUPLICATE_DEFAULT | DUPLICATE_INTERNAL_STATE)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid "The node will not be internal."
msgstr "O nó não será interno."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The node will be placed at the beginning of the parent's children, before "
"any non-internal sibling."
msgstr ""
"O nó será colocado no início dos filhos do pai, antes de qualquer irmão não "
"interno."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"The node will be placed at the end of the parent's children, after any non-"
"internal sibling."
msgstr ""
"O nó será colocado no final dos filhos do pai, após qualquer irmão não "
"interno."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Inherits [member auto_translate_mode] from the node's parent. This is the "
"default for any newly created node."
msgstr ""
"Herda [member auto_translate_mode] do nó pai. Este é o padrão para qualquer "
"nó recém-criado."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Always automatically translate. This is the inverse of [constant "
"AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_DISABLED], and the default for the root node."
msgstr ""
"Sempre traduzir automaticamente. Este é o inverso de [constant "
"AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_DISABLED] e o padrão para o nó raiz."

#: doc/classes/Node.xml
msgid ""
"Never automatically translate. This is the inverse of [constant "
"AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_ALWAYS].\n"
"String parsing for translation template generation will be skipped for this "
"node and children that are set to [constant AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D game object, inherited by all 2D-related nodes. Has a position, "
"rotation, scale, and skew."
msgstr ""
"Um objeto de jogo 2D, herdado por todos os nós relacionados a 2D. Possui "
"posição, rotação, escala e cisalhamento."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"A 2D game object, with a transform (position, rotation, and scale). All 2D "
"nodes, including physics objects and sprites, inherit from Node2D. Use "
"Node2D as a parent node to move, scale and rotate children in a 2D project. "
"Also gives control of the node's render order.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Since both [Node2D] and [Control] inherit from [CanvasItem], "
"they share several concepts from the class such as the [member "
"CanvasItem.z_index] and [member CanvasItem.visible] properties."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml doc/classes/Vector2.xml
msgid "All 2D Demos"
msgstr "Todas as demonstrações 2D"

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Multiplies the current scale by the [param ratio] vector."
msgstr "Multiplica a escala atual pelo vetor [param ratio]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the angle between the node and the [param point] in radians. See "
"also [method look_at].\n"
"[url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/godotengine/godot-docs/master/img/"
"node2d_get_angle_to.png]Illustration of the returned angle.[/url]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Returns the [Transform2D] relative to this node's parent."
msgstr "Retorna o [Transform2D] relativo ao pai deste nó."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Adds the [param offset] vector to the node's global position."
msgstr "Adiciona o vetor [param offset] à posição global do nó."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates the node so that its local +X axis points towards the [param point], "
"which is expected to use global coordinates. This method is a combination of "
"both [method rotate] and [method get_angle_to].\n"
"[param point] should not be the same as the node's position, otherwise the "
"node always looks to the right."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a local translation on the node's X axis with the amount specified "
"in [param delta]. If [param scaled] is [code]false[/code], normalizes the "
"movement to occur independently of the node's [member scale]."
msgstr ""
"Aplica uma translação local no eixo X do nó com a quantidade especificada em "
"[param delta]. Se [param scaled] for [code]false[/code], normaliza o "
"movimento para ocorrer independentemente da [member scale] do nó."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a local translation on the node's Y axis with the amount specified "
"in [param delta]. If [param scaled] is [code]false[/code], normalizes the "
"movement to occur independently of the node's [member scale]."
msgstr ""
"Aplica uma translação local no eixo Y do nó com a quantidade especificada em "
"[param delta]. Se [param scaled] for [code]false[/code], normaliza o "
"movimento para ocorrer independentemente da [member scale] do nó."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a rotation to the node, in radians, starting from its current "
"rotation. This is equivalent to [code]rotation += radians[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Aplica uma rotação ao nó, em radianos, a partir de sua rotação atual. Isso é "
"equivalente a [code]rotation += radians[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Transforms the provided local position into a position in global coordinate "
"space. The input is expected to be local relative to the [Node2D] it is "
"called on. e.g. Applying this method to the positions of child nodes will "
"correctly transform their positions into the global coordinate space, but "
"applying it to a node's own position will give an incorrect result, as it "
"will incorporate the node's own transformation into its global position."
msgstr ""
"Transforma a posição local fornecida em uma posição no espaço de coordenadas "
"globais. Espera-se que a entrada seja local em relação ao [Node2D] no qual é "
"chamada. Por exemplo, aplicar este método às posições de nós filhos "
"transformará corretamente suas posições no espaço de coordenadas globais, "
"mas aplicá-lo à própria posição de um nó dará um resultado incorreto, pois "
"incorporará a própria transformação do nó em sua posição global."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Transforms the provided global position into a position in local coordinate "
"space. The output will be local relative to the [Node2D] it is called on. "
"e.g. It is appropriate for determining the positions of child nodes, but it "
"is not appropriate for determining its own position relative to its parent."
msgstr ""
"Transforma a posição global fornecida em uma posição no espaço de "
"coordenadas locais. A saída será local em relação ao [Node2D] em que é "
"chamada. Por exemplo, é apropriado para determinar as posições de nós "
"filhos, mas não é apropriado para determinar sua própria posição em relação "
"ao seu pai."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Translates the node by the given [param offset] in local coordinates. This "
"is equivalent to [code]position += offset[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Translada o nó pelo [param offset] fornecido em coordenadas locais. Isso é "
"equivalente a [code]position += offset[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Global position. See also [member position]."
msgstr "Posição global. Veja também [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Global rotation in radians. See also [member rotation]."
msgstr "Rotação global em radianos. Veja também [member rotation]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Helper property to access [member global_rotation] in degrees instead of "
"radians. See also [member rotation_degrees]."
msgstr ""
"Propriedade auxiliar para acessar [member global_rotation] em graus em vez "
"de radianos. Veja também [member rotation_degrees]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Global scale. See also [member scale]."
msgstr "Escala global. Veja também [member scale]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Global skew in radians. See also [member skew]."
msgstr "Inclinação global em radianos. Veja também [member skew]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid "Global [Transform2D]. See also [member transform]."
msgstr "[Transform2D] global. Veja também [member transform]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Position, relative to the node's parent. See also [member global_position]."
msgstr "Posição, relativa ao pai do nó. Veja também [member global_position]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotation in radians, relative to the node's parent. See also [member "
"global_rotation].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is edited in the inspector in degrees. If you "
"want to use degrees in a script, use [member rotation_degrees]."
msgstr ""
"Rotação em radianos, em relação ao pai do nó. Veja também [member "
"global_rotation].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade é editada no inspetor em graus. Se você quiser "
"usar graus em um script, use [member rotation_degrees]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"Helper property to access [member rotation] in degrees instead of radians. "
"See also [member global_rotation_degrees]."
msgstr ""
"Propriedade auxiliar para acessar [member rotation] em graus em vez de "
"radianos. Veja também [member global_rotation_degrees]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"The node's scale, relative to the node's parent. Unscaled value: [code](1, 1)"
"[/code]. See also [member global_scale].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Negative X scales in 2D are not decomposable from the "
"transformation matrix. Due to the way scale is represented with "
"transformation matrices in Godot, negative scales on the X axis will be "
"changed to negative scales on the Y axis and a rotation of 180 degrees when "
"decomposed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to a non-zero value, slants the node in one direction or another. "
"This can be used for pseudo-3D effects. See also [member global_skew].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Skew is performed on the X axis only, and [i]between[/i] "
"rotation and scaling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is edited in the inspector in degrees. If you "
"want to use degrees in a script, use [code]skew = "
"deg_to_rad(value_in_degrees)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como um valor diferente de zero, inclina o nó em uma direção ou "
"outra. Isso pode ser usado para efeitos pseudo-3D. Veja também [member "
"global_skew].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A inclinação é realizada apenas no eixo X e [i]entre[/i] a "
"rotação e a escala.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade é editada no inspetor em graus. Se quiser usar "
"graus em um script, use [code]skew = deg_to_rad(value_in_degrees)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node2D.xml
msgid ""
"The node's [Transform2D], relative to the node's parent. See also [member "
"global_transform]."
msgstr ""
"O [Transform2D] do nó, relativo ao pai do nó. Veja também [member "
"global_transform]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid "Base object in 3D space, inherited by all 3D nodes."
msgstr "Objeto base no espaço 3D, herdado por todos os nós 3D."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Node3D] node is the base representation of a node in 3D space. All "
"other 3D nodes inherit from this class.\n"
"Affine operations (translation, rotation, scale) are calculated in the "
"coordinate system relative to the parent, unless the [Node3D]'s [member "
"top_level] is [code]true[/code]. In this coordinate system, affine "
"operations correspond to direct affine operations on the [Node3D]'s [member "
"transform]. The term [i]parent space[/i] refers to this coordinate system. "
"The coordinate system that is attached to the [Node3D] itself is referred to "
"as object-local coordinate system, or [i]local space[/i].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unless otherwise specified, all methods that need angle "
"parameters must receive angles in [i]radians[/i]. To convert degrees to "
"radians, use [method @GlobalScope.deg_to_rad].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In Godot 3 and older, [Node3D] was named [i]Spatial[/i]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid "Introduction to 3D"
msgstr "Introdução ao 3D"

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml doc/classes/Vector3.xml
msgid "All 3D Demos"
msgstr "Todas as demonstrações 3D"

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Attaches the given [param gizmo] to this node. Only works in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [param gizmo] should be an [EditorNode3DGizmo]. The argument "
"type is [Node3DGizmo] to avoid depending on editor classes in [Node3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Clears all [EditorNode3DGizmo] objects attached to this node. Only works in "
"the editor."
msgstr ""
"Limpa todos os objetos [EditorNode3DGizmo] anexados a este nó. Funciona "
"apenas no editor."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Deselects all subgizmos for this node. Useful to call when the selected "
"subgizmo may no longer exist after a property change. Only works in the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"Desseleciona todos os subgizmos para este nó. Útil para chamar quando o "
"subgizmo selecionado pode não existir mais após uma alteração de "
"propriedade. Funciona apenas no editor."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Forces the node's [member global_transform] to update, by sending [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED]. Fails if the node is not inside the tree.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For performance reasons, transform changes are usually "
"accumulated and applied [i]once[/i] at the end of the frame. The update "
"propagates through [Node3D] children, as well. Therefore, use this method "
"only when you need an up-to-date transform (such as during physics "
"operations)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all the [EditorNode3DGizmo] objects attached to this node. Only "
"works in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os objetos [EditorNode3DGizmo] anexados a este nó. Funciona "
"apenas no editor."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"When using physics interpolation, there will be circumstances in which you "
"want to know the interpolated (displayed) transform of a node rather than "
"the standard transform (which may only be accurate to the most recent "
"physics tick).\n"
"This is particularly important for frame-based operations that take place in "
"[method Node._process], rather than [method Node._physics_process]. Examples "
"include [Camera3D]s focusing on a node, or finding where to fire lasers from "
"on a frame rather than physics tick.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function creates an interpolation pump on the [Node3D] the "
"first time it is called, which can respond to physics interpolation resets. "
"If you get problems with \"streaking\" when initially following a [Node3D], "
"be sure to call [method get_global_transform_interpolated] at least once "
"[i]before[/i] resetting the [Node3D] physics interpolation."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the parent [Node3D] that directly affects this node's [member "
"global_transform]. Returns [code]null[/code] if no parent exists, the parent "
"is not a [Node3D], or [member top_level] is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not always equivalent to [method "
"Node.get_parent], which does not take [member top_level] into account."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [World3D] this node is registered to.\n"
"Usually, this is the same as the world used by this node's viewport (see "
"[method Node.get_viewport] and [method Viewport.find_world_3d])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates this node's [member global_basis] around the global [param axis] by "
"the given [param angle], in radians. This operation is calculated in global "
"space (relative to the world) and preserves the [member global_position]."
msgstr ""
"Rotaciona o [member global_basis] deste nó em torno do [param axis] global "
"pelo [param angle] fornecido, em radianos. Esta operação é calculada no "
"espaço global (em relação ao mundo) e preserva a [member global_position]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Scales this node's [member global_basis] by the given [param scale] factor. "
"This operation is calculated in global space (relative to the world) and "
"preserves the [member global_position].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not to be confused with the [member scale] "
"property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given translation [param offset] to the node's [member "
"global_position] in global space (relative to the world)."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona o [param offset] de translação fornecido ao [member "
"global_position] do nó no espaço global (relativo ao mundo)."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Prevents this node from being rendered. Equivalent to setting [member "
"visible] to [code]false[/code]. This is the opposite of [method show]."
msgstr ""
"Impede que este nó seja renderizado. Equivalente a definir [member visible] "
"como [code]false[/code]. Este é o oposto de [method show]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node receives [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever [member transform] changes. "
"This is enabled with [method set_notify_local_transform]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó receber [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] sempre que [member transform] mudar. "
"Isso é ativado com [method set_notify_local_transform]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this node's [member global_transform] is "
"automatically orthonormalized. This results in this node not appearing "
"distorted, as if its global scale were set to [constant Vector3.ONE] (or its "
"negative counterpart). See also [method set_disable_scale] and [method "
"orthonormalize].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member transform] is not affected by this setting."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node receives [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever [member global_transform] changes. "
"This is enabled with [method set_notify_transform]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nó receber [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] sempre que [member global_transform] mudar. "
"Isso é ativado com [method set_notify_transform]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this node is inside the scene tree and the "
"[member visible] property is [code]true[/code] for this node and all of its "
"[Node3D] ancestors [i]in sequence[/i]. An ancestor of any other type (such "
"as [Node] or [Node2D]) breaks the sequence. See also [method "
"Node.get_parent].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method cannot take [member VisualInstance3D.layers] into "
"account, so even if this method returns [code]true[/code], the node may not "
"be rendered."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates the node so that the local forward axis (-Z, [constant "
"Vector3.FORWARD]) points toward the [param target] position. This operation "
"is calculated in global space (relative to the world).\n"
"The local up axis (+Y) points as close to the [param up] vector as possible "
"while staying perpendicular to the local forward axis. The resulting "
"transform is orthogonal, and the scale is preserved. Non-uniform scaling may "
"not work correctly.\n"
"The [param target] position cannot be the same as the node's position, the "
"[param up] vector cannot be [constant Vector3.ZERO]. Furthermore, the "
"direction from the node's position to the [param target] position cannot be "
"parallel to the [param up] vector, to avoid an unintended rotation around "
"the local Z axis.\n"
"If [param use_model_front] is [code]true[/code], the +Z axis (asset front) "
"is treated as forward (implies +X is left) and points toward the [param "
"target] position. By default, the -Z axis (camera forward) is treated as "
"forward (implies +X is right).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method fails if the node is not in the scene tree. If "
"necessary, use [method look_at_from_position] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the node to the specified [param position], then rotates the node to "
"point toward the [param target] position, similar to [method look_at]. This "
"operation is calculated in global space (relative to the world)."
msgstr ""
"Move o nó para a [param position] especificada, depois rotaciona o nó para "
"apontar em direção à posição [param target], de forma semelhante ao [method "
"look_at]. Esta operação é calculada no espaço global (em relação ao mundo)."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Orthonormalizes this node's [member basis]. This method sets this node's "
"[member scale] to [constant Vector3.ONE] (or its negative counterpart), but "
"preserves the [member position] and [member rotation]. See also [method "
"Transform3D.orthonormalized]."
msgstr ""
"Ortonormaliza a [member basis] deste nó. Este método define a [member scale] "
"deste nó como [constant Vector3.ONE] (ou seu equivalente negativo), mas "
"preserva a [member position] e a [member rotation]. Consulte também [method "
"Transform3D.orthonormalized]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates this node's [member basis] around the [param axis] by the given "
"[param angle], in radians. This operation is calculated in parent space "
"(relative to the parent) and preserves the [member position]."
msgstr ""
"Gira a [member basis] deste nó em torno do [param axis] pelo [param angle] "
"fornecido, em radianos. Esta operação é calculada no espaço pai (em relação "
"ao pai) e preserva a [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates this node's [member basis] around the [param axis] by the given "
"[param angle], in radians. This operation is calculated in local space "
"(relative to this node) and preserves the [member position]."
msgstr ""
"Gira a [member basis] deste nó em torno do [param axis] pelo [param angle] "
"fornecido, em radianos. Esta operação é calculada no espaço local (em "
"relação a este nó) e preserva a [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates this node's [member basis] around the X axis by the given [param "
"angle], in radians. This operation is calculated in parent space (relative "
"to the parent) and preserves the [member position]."
msgstr ""
"Gira a [member basis] deste nó em torno do eixo X pelo [param angle] "
"fornecido, em radianos. Esta operação é calculada no espaço pai (em relação "
"ao pai) e preserva a [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates this node's [member basis] around the Y axis by the given [param "
"angle], in radians. This operation is calculated in parent space (relative "
"to the parent) and preserves the [member position]."
msgstr ""
"Gira a [member basis] deste nó em torno do eixo Y pelo [param angle] "
"fornecido, em radianos. Esta operação é calculada no espaço pai (em relação "
"ao pai) e preserva a [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotates this node's [member basis] around the Z axis by the given [param "
"angle], in radians. This operation is calculated in parent space (relative "
"to the parent) and preserves the [member position]."
msgstr ""
"Gira a [member basis] deste nó em torno do eixo Z pelo [param angle] "
"fornecido, em radianos. Esta operação é calculada no espaço pai (em relação "
"ao pai) e preserva a [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Scales this node's [member basis] by the given [param scale] factor. This "
"operation is calculated in local space (relative to this node) and preserves "
"the [member position]."
msgstr ""
"Redimensiona a [member basis] deste nó pelo fator [param scale] fornecido. "
"Esta operação é calculada no espaço local (em relação a este nó) e preserva "
"a [member position]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this node's [member global_transform] is automatically "
"orthonormalized. This results in this node not appearing distorted, as if "
"its global scale were set to [constant Vector3.ONE] (or its negative "
"counterpart). See also [method is_scale_disabled] and [method "
"orthonormalize].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member transform] is not affected by this setting."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets this node's [member transform] to [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY], "
"which resets all transformations in parent space ([member position], [member "
"rotation], and [member scale])."
msgstr ""
"Define a [member transform] deste nó como [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY], o "
"que redefine todas as transformações no espaço pai ([member position], "
"[member rotation] e [member scale])."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node will not receive [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] or [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED].\n"
"It may useful to call this method when handling these notifications to "
"prevent infinite recursion."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node will receive [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_LOCAL_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever [member transform] changes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some 3D nodes such as [CSGShape3D] or [CollisionShape3D] "
"automatically enable this to function correctly."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node will receive [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED] whenever [member global_transform] changes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most 3D nodes such as [VisualInstance3D] or [CollisionObject3D] "
"automatically enable this to function correctly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In the editor, nodes will propagate this notification to their "
"children if a gizmo is attached (see [method add_gizmo])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Selects the [param gizmo]'s subgizmo with the given [param id] and sets its "
"transform. Only works in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The gizmo object would typically be an instance of "
"[EditorNode3DGizmo], but the argument type is kept generic to avoid creating "
"a dependency on editor classes in [Node3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Allows this node to be rendered. Equivalent to setting [member visible] to "
"[code]true[/code]. This is the opposite of [method hide]."
msgstr ""
"Permite que este nó seja renderizado. Equivalente a definir [member visible] "
"como [code]true[/code]. Este é o oposto de [method hide]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [param local_point] converted from this node's local space to "
"global space. This is the opposite of [method to_local]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [param local_point] convertido do espaço local deste nó para o "
"espaço global. Este é o oposto de [method to_local]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [param global_point] converted from global space to this node's "
"local space. This is the opposite of [method to_global]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [param global_point] convertido do espaço global para o espaço "
"local deste nó. Este é o oposto de [method to_global]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given translation [param offset] to the node's position, in local "
"space (relative to this node).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Prefer using [method translate_object_local], instead, as this "
"method may be changed in a future release.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Despite the naming convention, this operation is [b]not[/b] "
"calculated in parent space for compatibility reasons. To translate in parent "
"space, add [param offset] to the [member position] ([code]node_3d.position "
"+= offset[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds the given translation [param offset] to the node's position, in local "
"space (relative to this node)."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona o [param offset] de translação fornecido à posição do nó, em espaço "
"local (relativo a este nó)."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Updates all the [EditorNode3DGizmo] objects attached to this node. Only "
"works in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Atualiza todos os objetos [EditorNode3DGizmo] anexados a este nó. Funciona "
"apenas no editor."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Basis of the [member transform] property. Represents the rotation, scale, "
"and shear of this node in parent space (relative to the parent node)."
msgstr ""
"Base da propriedade [member transform]. Representa a rotação, escala e "
"cisalhamento deste nó no espaço pai (relativo ao nó pai)."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Basis of the [member global_transform] property. Represents the rotation, "
"scale, and shear of this node in global space (relative to the world).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the node is not inside the tree, getting this property fails "
"and returns [constant Basis.IDENTITY]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Global position (translation) of this node in global space (relative to the "
"world). This is equivalent to the [member global_transform]'s [member "
"Transform3D.origin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the node is not inside the tree, getting this property fails "
"and returns [constant Vector3.ZERO]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Global rotation of this node as [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], in radians and in global space (relative to "
"the world). This value is obtained from [member global_basis]'s rotation.\n"
"- The [member Vector3.x] is the angle around the global X axis (pitch);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.y] is the angle around the global Y axis (yaw);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.z] is the angle around the global Z axis (roll).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike [member rotation], this property always follows the YXZ "
"convention ([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the node is not inside the tree, getting this property fails "
"and returns [constant Vector3.ZERO]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [member global_rotation] of this node, in degrees instead of radians.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the node is not inside the tree, getting this property fails "
"and returns [constant Vector3.ZERO]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The transformation of this node, in global space (relative to the world). "
"Contains and represents this node's [member global_position], [member "
"global_rotation], and global scale.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the node is not inside the tree, getting this property fails "
"and returns [constant Transform3D.IDENTITY]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Position (translation) of this node in parent space (relative to the parent "
"node). This is equivalent to the [member transform]'s [member "
"Transform3D.origin]."
msgstr ""
"Posição deste nó no espaço pai (relativo ao nó pai). Isto é equivalente a "
"[member transform] de [member Transform3D.origin]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotation of this node represented as a [Quaternion] in parent space "
"(relative to the parent node). This value is obtained from [member basis]'s "
"rotation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Quaternions are much more suitable for 3D math but are less "
"intuitive. Setting this property can be useful for interpolation (see "
"[method Quaternion.slerp])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Rotation of this node as [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url], in radians and in parent space (relative to "
"the parent node). This value is obtained from [member basis]'s rotation.\n"
"- The [member Vector3.x] is the angle around the local X axis (pitch);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.y] is the angle around the local Y axis (yaw);\n"
"- The [member Vector3.z] is the angle around the local Z axis (roll).\n"
"The order of each consecutive rotation can be changed with [member "
"rotation_order] (see [enum EulerOrder] constants). In Godot, Euler angles "
"always use intrinsic order. By default, the intrinsic YXZ convention is used "
"([constant EULER_ORDER_YXZ]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is edited in degrees in the inspector. If you "
"want to use degrees in a script, use [member rotation_degrees]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [member rotation] of this node, in degrees instead of radians.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is [b]not[/b] the property available in the Inspector dock."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid "How this node's rotation and scale are displayed in the Inspector dock."
msgstr "Como a rotação e a escala deste nó são exibidas no painel Inspetor."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The axis rotation order of the [member rotation] property. In Godot, Euler "
"angles always use intrinsic order, meaning that the final orientation is "
"calculated by rotating around the local axes in this order."
msgstr ""
"A ordem de rotação dos eixos da propriedade [member rotation]. No Godot, os "
"ângulos de Euler sempre usam ordem intrínseca, o que significa que a "
"orientação final é calculada girando em torno dos eixos locais nesta ordem."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Scale of this node in local space (relative to this node). This value is "
"obtained from [member basis]'s scale.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The behavior of some 3D node types is not affected by this "
"property. These include [Light3D], [Camera3D], [AudioStreamPlayer3D], and "
"more.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] The scale's components must either be all positive or all "
"negative, and [b]not[/b] exactly [code]0.0[/code]. Otherwise, it won't be "
"possible to obtain the scale from the [member basis]. This may cause the "
"intended scale to be lost when reloaded from disk, and potentially other "
"unstable behavior."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the node does not inherit its transformations from its "
"parent. As such, node transformations will only be in global space, which "
"also means that [member global_transform] and [member transform] will be "
"identical."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o nó não herda suas transformações de seu pai. Como "
"tal, as transformações do nó estarão apenas no espaço global, o que também "
"significa que [member global_transform] e [member transform] serão idênticos."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The local transformation of this node, in parent space (relative to the "
"parent node). Contains and represents this node's [member position], [member "
"rotation], and [member scale]."
msgstr ""
"A transformação local deste nó, no espaço pai (relativo ao nó pai). Contém e "
"representa a [member position], [member rotation] e [member scale] deste nó."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to the visibility range parent for this node and its descendants. The "
"visibility parent must be a [GeometryInstance3D].\n"
"Any visual instance will only be visible if the visibility parent (and all "
"of its visibility ancestors) is hidden by being closer to the camera than "
"its own [member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin]. Nodes hidden via "
"the [member Node3D.visible] property are essentially removed from the "
"visibility dependency tree, so dependent instances will not take the hidden "
"node or its descendants into account."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], this node can be visible. The node is only rendered "
"when all of its ancestors are visible, as well. That means [method "
"is_visible_in_tree] must return [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], este nó pode estar visível. O nó só é renderizado "
"quando todos os seus ancestrais também estão visíveis. Isso significa que "
"[method is_visible_in_tree] deve retornar [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when this node's visibility changes (see [member visible] and "
"[method is_visible_in_tree]).\n"
"This signal is emitted [i]after[/i] the related [constant "
"NOTIFICATION_VISIBILITY_CHANGED] notification."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when this node's [member global_transform] changes, if "
"[method is_transform_notification_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. See also "
"[method set_notify_transform].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Most 3D nodes such as [VisualInstance3D] or [CollisionObject3D] "
"automatically enable this to function correctly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In the editor, nodes will propagate this notification to their "
"children if a gizmo is attached (see [method add_gizmo])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when this node is registered to a new [World3D] (see "
"[method get_world_3d])."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando este nó é registrado em um novo [World3D] (veja "
"[method get_world_3d])."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when this node is unregistered from the current "
"[World3D] (see [method get_world_3d]).\n"
"This notification is sent in reversed order."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando este nó é desregistrado do [World3D] atual (veja "
"[method get_world_3d]).\n"
"Esta notificação é enviada em ordem inversa."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when this node's [member transform] changes, if "
"[method is_local_transform_notification_enabled] is [code]true[/code]. This "
"is not received when a parent [Node3D]'s [member transform] changes. See "
"also [method set_notify_local_transform].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Some 3D nodes such as [CSGShape3D] or [CollisionShape3D] "
"automatically enable this to function correctly."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The rotation is edited using a [Vector3] in [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Euler_angles]Euler angles[/url]. In Godot, Euler angles always use "
"intrinsic order, meaning that rotation happens around the local axes of the "
"object."
msgstr ""
"A rotação é editada usando um [Vector3] em [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Euler_angles]ângulos de Euler[/url]. No Godot, os ângulos de Euler "
"sempre usam ordem intrínseca, o que significa que a rotação ocorre em torno "
"dos eixos locais do objeto."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The rotation is edited using a [Quaternion]. Quaternions avoid "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/using_transforms.html]gimbal lock[/url] and "
"having to choose an order of rotation, but are less intuitive. Quaternion "
"rotation is mostly the same as rotors in 3D geometric algebra, except that "
"the numbers are labeled differently."
msgstr ""
"A rotação é editada usando um [Quaternion]. Quatérnios evitam o "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/3d/using_transforms.html]gimbal lock[/url] e a "
"necessidade de escolher uma ordem de rotação, mas são menos intuitivos. A "
"rotação por quatérnio é quase a mesma que rotores em álgebra geométrica 3D, "
"exceto que os números são rotulados de forma diferente."

#: doc/classes/Node3D.xml
msgid ""
"The rotation is edited using a [Basis]. In this mode, the raw [member "
"basis]'s axes can be freely modified, but the [member scale] property is not "
"available."
msgstr ""
"A rotação é editada usando um [Basis]. Nesse modo, os eixos brutos do "
"[member basis] podem ser modificados livremente, mas a propriedade [member "
"scale] não está disponível."

#: doc/classes/Node3DGizmo.xml
msgid "Abstract class to expose editor gizmos for [Node3D]."
msgstr "Classe abstrata para expor gizmos do editor para [Node3D]."

#: doc/classes/Node3DGizmo.xml
msgid ""
"This abstract class helps connect the [Node3D] scene with the editor-"
"specific [EditorNode3DGizmo] class.\n"
"[Node3DGizmo] by itself has no exposed API, refer to [method "
"Node3D.add_gizmo] and pass it an [EditorNode3DGizmo] instance."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid "A pre-parsed scene tree path."
msgstr "Um caminho de árvore de cena pré-analisado."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"The [NodePath] built-in [Variant] type represents a path to a node or "
"property in a hierarchy of nodes. It is designed to be efficiently passed "
"into many built-in methods (such as [method Node.get_node], [method "
"Object.set_indexed], [method Tween.tween_property], etc.) without a hard "
"dependence on the node or property they point to.\n"
"A node path is represented as a [String] composed of slash-separated ([code]/"
"[/code]) node names and colon-separated ([code]:[/code]) property names "
"(also called \"subnames\"). Similar to a filesystem path, [code]\"..\"[/"
"code] and [code]\".\"[/code] are special node names. They refer to the "
"parent node and the current node, respectively.\n"
"The following examples are paths relative to the current node:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"^\"A\"     # Points to the direct child A.\n"
"^\"A/B\"   # Points to A's child B.\n"
"^\".\"     # Points to the current node.\n"
"^\"..\"    # Points to the parent node.\n"
"^\"../C\"  # Points to the sibling node C.\n"
"^\"../..\" # Points to the grandparent node.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"A leading slash means the path is absolute, and begins from the "
"[SceneTree]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"^\"/root\"            # Points to the SceneTree's root Window.\n"
"^\"/root/Title\"      # May point to the main scene's root node named "
"\"Title\".\n"
"^\"/root/Global\"     # May point to an autoloaded node or scene named "
"\"Global\".\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Despite their name, node paths may also point to a property:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"^\":position\"           # Points to this object's position.\n"
"^\":position:x\"         # Points to this object's position in the x axis.\n"
"^\"Camera3D:rotation:y\" # Points to the child Camera3D and its y rotation.\n"
"^\"/root:size:x\"        # Points to the root Window and its width.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"In some situations, it's possible to omit the leading [code]:[/code] when "
"pointing to an object's property. As an example, this is the case with "
"[method Object.set_indexed] and [method Tween.tween_property], as those "
"methods call [method NodePath.get_as_property_path] under the hood. However, "
"it's generally recommended to keep the [code]:[/code] prefix.\n"
"Node paths cannot check whether they are valid and may point to nodes or "
"properties that do not exist. Their meaning depends entirely on the context "
"in which they're used.\n"
"You usually do not have to worry about the [NodePath] type, as strings are "
"automatically converted to the type when necessary. There are still times "
"when defining node paths is useful. For example, exported [NodePath] "
"properties allow you to easily select any node within the currently edited "
"scene. They are also automatically updated when moving, renaming or deleting "
"nodes in the scene tree editor. See also [annotation "
"@GDScript.@export_node_path].\n"
"See also [StringName], which is a similar type designed for optimized "
"strings.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a [NodePath] will evaluate to "
"[code]false[/code] if it is empty ([code]NodePath(\"\")[/code]). Otherwise, "
"a [NodePath] will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O tipo embutido [Variant] [NodePath] representa um caminho para um nó ou "
"propriedade em uma hierarquia de nós. Ele foi projetado para ser passado de "
"forma eficiente para vários métodos embutidos (como [method Node.get_node], "
"[method Object.set_indexed], [method Tween.tween_property], etc.) sem uma "
"dependência rígida do nó ou propriedade para a qual apontam.\n"
"Um caminho de nó é representado como uma [String] composta por nomes de nós "
"separados por barra ([code]/[/code]) e nomes de propriedades separados por "
"dois-pontos ([code]:[/code]) (também chamados de \"subnomes\"). Semelhante a "
"um caminho de sistema de arquivos, [code]\"..\"[/code] e [code]\".\"[/code] "
"são nomes de nós especiais. Eles se referem ao nó pai e ao nó atual, "
"respectivamente.\n"
"Os exemplos a seguir são caminhos relativos ao nó atual:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"^\"A\"     # Aponta para o filho direto A.\n"
"^\"A/B\"   # Aponta para o filho B de A.\n"
"^\".\"     # Aponta para o nó atual.\n"
"^\"..\"    # Aponta para o nó pai.\n"
"^\"../C\"  # Aponta para o nó irmão C.\n"
"^\"../..\" # Aponta para o nó avô.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Uma barra inicial significa que o caminho é absoluto e começa a partir da "
"[SceneTree]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"^\"/root\"          # Aponta para a Window raiz da SceneTree.\n"
"^\"/root/Title\"    # Pode apontar para o nó raiz da cena principal chamado "
"\"Title\".\n"
"^\"/root/Global\"   # Pode apontar para um nó carregado automaticamente "
"(autoload) ou cena chamada \"Global\".\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Apesar do nome, os caminhos de nós também podem apontar para uma "
"propriedade:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"^\":position\"          # Aponta para a posição deste objeto.\n"
"^\":position:x\"        # Aponta para a posição deste objeto no eixo x.\n"
"^\"Camera3D:rotation:y\" # Aponta para o Camera3D filho e sua rotação no "
"eixo y.\n"
"^\"/root:size:x\"        # Aponta para a Window raiz e sua largura.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Em algumas situações, é possível omitir os dois-pontos iniciais ([code]:[/"
"code]) ao apontar para a propriedade de um objeto. Por exemplo, este é o "
"caso de [method Object.set_indexed] e [method Tween.tween_property], já que "
"esses métodos chamam [method NodePath.get_as_property_path] por baixo dos "
"panos. No entanto, geralmente é recomendado manter o prefixo [code]:[/"
"code].\n"
"Caminhos de nós não conseguem verificar se são válidos e podem apontar para "
"nós ou propriedades que não existem. O significado deles depende "
"inteiramente do contexto em que são usados.\n"
"Normalmente, você não precisa se preocupar com o tipo [NodePath], pois as "
"strings são convertidas automaticamente para o tipo quando necessário. Ainda "
"há momentos em que definir caminhos de nós é útil. Por exemplo, propriedades "
"[NodePath] exportadas permitem que você selecione facilmente qualquer nó "
"dentro da cena atualmente editada. Eles também são atualizados "
"automaticamente ao mover, renomear ou excluir nós no editor da árvore de "
"cena. Veja também [annotation @GDScript.@export_node_path].\n"
"Veja também [StringName], que é um tipo semelhante projetado para strings "
"otimizadas.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em um contexto booleano, um [NodePath] será avaliado como "
"[code]false[/code] se estiver vazio ([code]NodePath(\"\")[/code]). Caso "
"contrário, um [NodePath] sempre será avaliado como [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml doc/classes/PackedScene.xml doc/classes/Panel.xml
#: doc/classes/PanelContainer.xml doc/classes/TileMap.xml
#: doc/classes/TileMapLayer.xml doc/classes/TileSet.xml
msgid "2D Role Playing Game (RPG) Demo"
msgstr "Demonstração de RPG (Role Playing Game) 2D"

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid "Constructs an empty [NodePath]."
msgstr "Constrói um [NodePath] vazio."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid "Constructs a [NodePath] as a copy of the given [NodePath]."
msgstr "Constrói um [NodePath] como uma cópia do [NodePath] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [NodePath] from a [String]. The created path is absolute if "
"prefixed with a slash (see [method is_absolute]).\n"
"The \"subnames\" optionally included after the path to the target node can "
"point to properties, and can also be nested.\n"
"The following strings can be valid node paths:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Points to the Sprite2D node.\n"
"\"Level/RigidBody2D/Sprite2D\"\n"
"\n"
"# Points to the Sprite2D node and its \"texture\" resource.\n"
"# get_node() would retrieve the Sprite2D, while get_node_and_resource()\n"
"# would retrieve both the Sprite2D node and the \"texture\" resource.\n"
"\"Level/RigidBody2D/Sprite2D:texture\"\n"
"\n"
"# Points to the Sprite2D node and its \"position\" property.\n"
"\"Level/RigidBody2D/Sprite2D:position\"\n"
"\n"
"# Points to the Sprite2D node and the \"x\" component of its \"position\" "
"property.\n"
"\"Level/RigidBody2D/Sprite2D:position:x\"\n"
"\n"
"# Points to the RigidBody2D node as an absolute path beginning from the "
"SceneTree.\n"
"\"/root/Level/RigidBody2D\"\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, it's also possible to convert a constant string "
"into a node path by prefixing it with [code]^[/code]. [code]^\"path/to/"
"node\"[/code] is equivalent to [code]NodePath(\"path/to/node\")[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this node path with a colon character ([code]:[/code]) "
"prefixed, transforming it to a pure property path with no node names "
"(relative to the current node).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# node_path points to the \"x\" property of the child node named "
"\"position\".\n"
"var node_path = ^\"position:x\"\n"
"\n"
"# property_path points to the \"position\" in the \"x\" axis of this node.\n"
"var property_path = node_path.get_as_property_path()\n"
"print(property_path) # Prints \":position:x\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// nodePath points to the \"x\" property of the child node named "
"\"position\".\n"
"var nodePath = new NodePath(\"position:x\");\n"
"\n"
"// propertyPath points to the \"position\" in the \"x\" axis of this node.\n"
"NodePath propertyPath = nodePath.GetAsPropertyPath();\n"
"GD.Print(propertyPath); // Prints \":position:x\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma cópia deste caminho de nó com um caractere de dois-pontos "
"([code]:[/code]) como prefixo, transformando-o em um caminho de propriedade "
"puro sem nomes de nós (relativo ao nó atual).\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"# node_path aponta para a propriedade \"x\" do nó filho chamado "
"\"position\".\n"
"var node_path = ^\"position:x\"\n"
"\n"
"# property_path aponta para a \"position\" no eixo \"x\" deste nó.\n"
"var property_path = node_path.get_as_property_path()\n"
"print(property_path) # Prints \":position:x\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"// nodePath aponta para a propriedade \"x\" do nó filho chamado "
"\"position\".\n"
"var nodePath = new NodePath(\"position:x\");\n"
"\n"
"// propertyPath aponta para a \"position\" no eixo \"x\" deste nó.\n"
"NodePath propertyPath = nodePath.GetAsPropertyPath();\n"
"GD.Print(propertyPath); // Prints \":position:x\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all node names concatenated with a slash character ([code]/[/code]) "
"as a single [StringName]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os nomes de nós concatenados com um caractere de barra ([code]/"
"[/code]) como um único [StringName]."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns all property subnames concatenated with a colon character ([code]:[/"
"code]) as a single [StringName].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node_path = ^\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\"\n"
"print(node_path.get_concatenated_subnames()) # Prints "
"\"texture:resource_name\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var nodePath = new NodePath(\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\");\n"
"GD.Print(nodePath.GetConcatenatedSubnames()); // Prints "
"\"texture:resource_name\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna todos os subnomes de propriedades concatenados com um caractere de "
"dois-pontos ([code]:[/code]) como um único [StringName].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node_path = ^\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\"\n"
"print(node_path.get_concatenated_subnames()) # Imprime "
"\"texture:resource_name\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var nodePath = new NodePath(\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\");\n"
"GD.Print(nodePath.GetConcatenatedSubnames()); // Imprime "
"\"texture:resource_name\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the node name indicated by [param idx], starting from 0. If [param "
"idx] is out of bounds, an error is generated. See also [method "
"get_subname_count] and [method get_name_count].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var sprite_path = NodePath(\"../RigidBody2D/Sprite2D\")\n"
"print(sprite_path.get_name(0)) # Prints \"..\"\n"
"print(sprite_path.get_name(1)) # Prints \"RigidBody2D\"\n"
"print(sprite_path.get_name(2)) # Prints \"Sprite\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var spritePath = new NodePath(\"../RigidBody2D/Sprite2D\");\n"
"GD.Print(spritePath.GetName(0)); // Prints \"..\"\n"
"GD.Print(spritePath.GetName(1)); // Prints \"PathFollow2D\"\n"
"GD.Print(spritePath.GetName(2)); // Prints \"Sprite\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do nó indicado por [param idx], começando de 0. Se [param "
"idx] estiver fora dos limites, um erro é gerado. Veja também [method "
"get_subname_count] e [method get_name_count].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var sprite_path = NodePath(\"../RigidBody2D/Sprite2D\")\n"
"print(sprite_path.get_name(0)) # Imprime \"..\"\n"
"print(sprite_path.get_name(1)) # Imprime \"RigidBody2D\"\n"
"print(sprite_path.get_name(2)) # Imprime \"Sprite\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var spritePath = new NodePath(\"../RigidBody2D/Sprite2D\");\n"
"GD.Print(spritePath.GetName(0)); // Imprime \"..\"\n"
"GD.Print(spritePath.GetName(1)); // Imprime \"PathFollow2D\"\n"
"GD.Print(spritePath.GetName(2)); // Imprime \"Sprite\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of node names in the path. Property subnames are not "
"included.\n"
"For example, [code]\"../RigidBody2D/Sprite2D:texture\"[/code] contains 3 "
"node names."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the property name indicated by [param idx], starting from 0. If "
"[param idx] is out of bounds, an error is generated. See also [method "
"get_subname_count].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var path_to_name = NodePath(\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\")\n"
"print(path_to_name.get_subname(0)) # Prints \"texture\"\n"
"print(path_to_name.get_subname(1)) # Prints \"resource_name\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var pathToName = new NodePath(\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\");\n"
"GD.Print(pathToName.GetSubname(0)); // Prints \"texture\"\n"
"GD.Print(pathToName.GetSubname(1)); // Prints \"resource_name\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome da propriedade indicada por [param idx], começando de 0. Se "
"[param idx] estiver fora dos limites, um erro é gerado. Veja também [method "
"get_subname_count].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var path_to_name = NodePath(\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\")\n"
"print(path_to_name.get_subname(0)) # Imprime \"texture\"\n"
"print(path_to_name.get_subname(1)) # Imprime \"resource_name\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var pathToName = new NodePath(\"Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\");\n"
"GD.Print(pathToName.GetSubname(0)); // Imprime \"texture\"\n"
"GD.Print(pathToName.GetSubname(1)); // Imprime \"resource_name\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of property names (\"subnames\") in the path. Each "
"subname in the node path is listed after a colon character ([code]:[/"
"code]).\n"
"For example, [code]\"Level/RigidBody2D/Sprite2D:texture:resource_name\"[/"
"code] contains 2 subnames."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the 32-bit hash value representing the node path's contents.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Node paths with equal hash values are [i]not[/i] guaranteed to "
"be the same, as a result of hash collisions. Node paths with different hash "
"values are guaranteed to be different."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node path is absolute. Unlike a relative "
"path, an absolute path is represented by a leading slash character ([code]/[/"
"code]) and always begins from the [SceneTree]. It can be used to reliably "
"access nodes from the root node (e.g. [code]\"/root/Global\"[/code] if an "
"autoload named \"Global\" exists)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o caminho do nó for absoluto. Ao contrário de "
"um caminho relativo, um caminho absoluto é representado por um caractere de "
"barra inicial ([code]/[/code]) e sempre começa a partir da [SceneTree]. Ele "
"pode ser usado para acessar nós de forma confiável a partir do nó raiz (por "
"exemplo, [code]\"/root/Global\"[/code] se existir um autoload chamado "
"\"Global\")."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the node path has been constructed from an "
"empty [String] ([code]\"\"[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o caminho do nó foi construído a partir de um "
"[String] vazio ([code]\"\"[/code])."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the slice of the [NodePath], from [param begin] (inclusive) to "
"[param end] (exclusive), as a new [NodePath].\n"
"The absolute value of [param begin] and [param end] will be clamped to the "
"sum of [method get_name_count] and [method get_subname_count], so the "
"default value for [param end] makes it slice to the end of the [NodePath] by "
"default (i.e. [code]path.slice(1)[/code] is a shorthand for "
"[code]path.slice(1, path.get_name_count() + path.get_subname_count())[/"
"code]).\n"
"If either [param begin] or [param end] are negative, they will be relative "
"to the end of the [NodePath] (i.e. [code]path.slice(0, -2)[/code] is a "
"shorthand for [code]path.slice(0, path.get_name_count() + "
"path.get_subname_count() - 2)[/code])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if two node paths are not equal."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se dois caminhos de nó não forem iguais."

#: doc/classes/NodePath.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if two node paths are equal, that is, they are "
"composed of the same node names and subnames in the same order."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se dois caminhos de nós forem iguais, ou seja, se "
"forem compostos pelos mesmos nomes de nós e subnomes na mesma ordem."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid "Abstract base class for noise generators."
msgstr "Classe base abstrata para geradores de ruído."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid ""
"This class defines the interface for noise generation libraries to inherit "
"from.\n"
"A default [method get_seamless_image] implementation is provided for "
"libraries that do not provide seamless noise. This function requests a "
"larger image from the [method get_image] method, reverses the quadrants of "
"the image, then uses the strips of extra width to blend over the seams.\n"
"Inheriting noise classes can optionally override this function to provide a "
"more optimal algorithm."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Image] containing 2D noise values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With [param normalize] set to [code]false[/code], the default "
"implementation expects the noise generator to return values in the range "
"[code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Image]s containing 3D noise values for use with "
"[method ImageTexture3D.create].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With [param normalize] set to [code]false[/code], the default "
"implementation expects the noise generator to return values in the range "
"[code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid "Returns the 1D noise value at the given (x) coordinate."
msgstr "Retorna o valor de ruído 1D na coordenada (x) fornecida."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid "Returns the 2D noise value at the given position."
msgstr "Retorna o valor de ruído 2D na posição fornecida."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid "Returns the 3D noise value at the given position."
msgstr "Retorna o valor de ruído 3D na posição fornecida."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Image] containing seamless 2D noise values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With [param normalize] set to [code]false[/code], the default "
"implementation expects the noise generator to return values in the range "
"[code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/Noise.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of [Image]s containing seamless 3D noise values for use "
"with [method ImageTexture3D.create].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] With [param normalize] set to [code]false[/code], the default "
"implementation expects the noise generator to return values in the range "
"[code]-1.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid "A 2D texture filled with noise generated by a [Noise] object."
msgstr "Uma textura 2D preenchida com ruído gerado por um objeto [Noise]."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the [FastNoiseLite] library or other noise generators to fill the "
"texture data of your desired size. [NoiseTexture2D] can also generate normal "
"map textures.\n"
"The class uses [Thread]s to generate the texture data internally, so [method "
"Texture2D.get_image] may return [code]null[/code] if the generation process "
"has not completed yet. In that case, you need to wait for the texture to be "
"generated before accessing the image and the generated byte data:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = NoiseTexture2D.new()\n"
"texture.noise = FastNoiseLite.new()\n"
"await texture.changed\n"
"var image = texture.get_image()\n"
"var data = image.get_data()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the resulting texture contains a normal map created "
"from the original noise interpreted as a bump map."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a textura resultante contém um mapa de normais criado "
"a partir do ruído original interpretado como um mapa de relevo."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Strength of the bump maps used in this texture. A higher value will make the "
"bump maps appear larger while a lower value will make them appear softer."
msgstr ""
"Força dos mapas de relevo usados nesta textura. Um valor mais alto fará com "
"que os mapas de relevo pareçam maiores, enquanto um valor mais baixo os fará "
"parecer mais suaves."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"A [Gradient] which is used to map the luminance of each pixel to a color "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Um [Gradient] usado para mapear a luminância de cada pixel para um valor de "
"cor."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Determines whether mipmaps are generated for this texture. Enabling this "
"results in less texture aliasing in the distance, at the cost of increasing "
"memory usage by roughly 33% and making the noise texture generation take "
"longer.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member generate_mipmaps] requires mipmap filtering to be "
"enabled on the material using the [NoiseTexture2D] to have an effect."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid "Height of the generated texture (in pixels)."
msgstr "Altura da textura gerada (em pixels)."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Determines whether the noise image is calculated in 3D space. May result in "
"reduced contrast."
msgstr ""
"Determina se a imagem de ruído é calculada no espaço 3D. Pode resultar em "
"contraste reduzido."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], inverts the noise texture. White becomes black, black "
"becomes white."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], inverte a textura de ruído. O branco se torna preto, o "
"preto se torna branco."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid "The instance of the [Noise] object."
msgstr "A instância do objeto [Noise]."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the noise image coming from the noise generator is "
"normalized to the range [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code].\n"
"Turning normalization off can affect the contrast and allows you to generate "
"non repeating tileable noise textures."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a seamless texture is requested from the [Noise] "
"resource.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Seamless noise textures may take longer to generate and/or can "
"have a lower contrast compared to non-seamless noise depending on the used "
"[Noise] resource. This is because some implementations use higher dimensions "
"for generating seamless noise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default [FastNoiseLite] implementation uses the fallback "
"path for seamless generation. If using a [member width] or [member height] "
"lower than the default, you may need to increase [member "
"seamless_blend_skirt] to make seamless blending more effective."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Used for the default/fallback implementation of the seamless texture "
"generation. It determines the distance over which the seams are blended. "
"High values may result in less details and contrast. See [Noise] for further "
"details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a [member width] or [member height] lower than the "
"default, you may need to increase [member seamless_blend_skirt] to make "
"seamless blending more effective."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture2D.xml
#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid "Width of the generated texture (in pixels)."
msgstr "Largura da textura gerada (em pixels)."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid "A 3D texture filled with noise generated by a [Noise] object."
msgstr "Uma textura 3D preenchida com ruído gerado por um objeto [Noise]."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"Uses the [FastNoiseLite] library or other noise generators to fill the "
"texture data of your desired size.\n"
"The class uses [Thread]s to generate the texture data internally, so [method "
"Texture3D.get_data] may return [code]null[/code] if the generation process "
"has not completed yet. In that case, you need to wait for the texture to be "
"generated before accessing the image:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var texture = NoiseTexture3D.new()\n"
"texture.noise = FastNoiseLite.new()\n"
"await texture.changed\n"
"var data = texture.get_data()\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid "Depth of the generated texture (in pixels)."
msgstr "Profundidade da textura gerada (em pixels)."

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], a seamless texture is requested from the [Noise] "
"resource.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Seamless noise textures may take longer to generate and/or can "
"have a lower contrast compared to non-seamless noise depending on the used "
"[Noise] resource. This is because some implementations use higher dimensions "
"for generating seamless noise.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The default [FastNoiseLite] implementation uses the fallback "
"path for seamless generation. If using a [member width], [member height] or "
"[member depth] lower than the default, you may need to increase [member "
"seamless_blend_skirt] to make seamless blending more effective."
msgstr ""

#: modules/noise/doc_classes/NoiseTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"Used for the default/fallback implementation of the seamless texture "
"generation. It determines the distance over which the seams are blended. "
"High values may result in less details and contrast. See [Noise] for further "
"details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If using a [member width], [member height] or [member depth] "
"lower than the default, you may need to increase [member "
"seamless_blend_skirt] to make seamless blending more effective."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid "Base class for all other classes in the engine."
msgstr "Classe base para todas as outras classes da engine."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"An advanced [Variant] type. All classes in the engine inherit from Object. "
"Each class may define new properties, methods or signals, which are "
"available to all inheriting classes. For example, a [Sprite2D] instance is "
"able to call [method Node.add_child] because it inherits from [Node].\n"
"You can create new instances, using [code]Object.new()[/code] in GDScript, "
"or [code]new GodotObject[/code] in C#.\n"
"To delete an Object instance, call [method free]. This is necessary for most "
"classes inheriting Object, because they do not manage memory on their own, "
"and will otherwise cause memory leaks when no longer in use. There are a few "
"classes that perform memory management. For example, [RefCounted] (and by "
"extension [Resource]) deletes itself when no longer referenced, and [Node] "
"deletes its children when freed.\n"
"Objects can have a [Script] attached to them. Once the [Script] is "
"instantiated, it effectively acts as an extension to the base class, "
"allowing it to define and inherit new properties, methods and signals.\n"
"Inside a [Script], [method _get_property_list] may be overridden to "
"customize properties in several ways. This allows them to be available to "
"the editor, display as lists of options, sub-divide into groups, save on "
"disk, etc. Scripting languages offer easier ways to customize properties, "
"such as with the [annotation @GDScript.@export] annotation.\n"
"Godot is very dynamic. An object's script, and therefore its properties, "
"methods and signals, can be changed at run-time. Because of this, there can "
"be occasions where, for example, a property required by a method may not "
"exist. To prevent run-time errors, see methods such as [method set], [method "
"get], [method call], [method has_method], [method has_signal], etc. Note "
"that these methods are [b]much[/b] slower than direct references.\n"
"In GDScript, you can also check if a given property, method, or signal name "
"exists in an object with the [code]in[/code] operator:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var node = Node.new()\n"
"print(\"name\" in node)         # Prints true\n"
"print(\"get_parent\" in node)   # Prints true\n"
"print(\"tree_entered\" in node) # Prints true\n"
"print(\"unknown\" in node)      # Prints false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Notifications are [int] constants commonly sent and received by objects. For "
"example, on every rendered frame, the [SceneTree] notifies nodes inside the "
"tree with a [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_PROCESS]. The nodes receive it and "
"may call [method Node._process] to update. To make use of notifications, see "
"[method notification] and [method _notification].\n"
"Lastly, every object can also contain metadata (data about data). [method "
"set_meta] can be useful to store information that the object itself does not "
"depend on. To keep your code clean, making excessive use of metadata is "
"discouraged.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike references to a [RefCounted], references to an object "
"stored in a variable can become invalid without being set to [code]null[/"
"code]. To check if an object has been deleted, do [i]not[/i] compare it "
"against [code]null[/code]. Instead, use [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_instance_valid]. It's also recommended to inherit from "
"[RefCounted] for classes storing data instead of [Object].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [code]script[/code] is not exposed like most properties. To "
"set or get an object's [Script] in code, use [method set_script] and [method "
"get_script], respectively.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, an [Object] will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if it is equal to [code]null[/code] or it has been freed. Otherwise, "
"an [Object] will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]. See also [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_instance_valid]."
msgstr ""
"Um tipo avançado de [Variant]. Todas as classes na engine herdam de Object. "
"Cada classe pode definir novas propriedades, métodos ou sinais, que ficam "
"disponíveis para todas as classes que herdam dela. Por exemplo, uma "
"instância de [Sprite2D] pode chamar o método [Node.add_child] porque ele "
"herda de [Node].\n"
"Você pode criar novas instâncias usando [code]Object.new()[/code] em "
"GDScript ou [code]new GodotObject[/code] em C#.\n"
"Para excluir uma instância de Object, chame o método [method free]. Você "
"precisa fazer isso para a maioria das classes que herdam de Object, pois "
"elas não gerenciam a memória por conta própria e, se não forem liberadas, "
"causarão vazamentos de memória quando não estiverem mais em uso. Existem "
"algumas classes que realizam o gerenciamento de memória. Por exemplo, "
"[RefCounted] (e, por extensão, [Resource]) se exclui quando não é mais "
"referenciado, e [Node] exclui seus filhos quando liberado.\n"
"Objetos podem ter um [Script] anexado a eles. Uma vez que o [Script] é "
"instanciado, ele efetivamente atua como uma extensão da classe base, "
"permitindo que ela defina e herde novas propriedades, métodos e sinais.\n"
"Dentro de um [Script], o método [method _get_property_list] pode ser "
"sobrescrito para personalizar as propriedades de várias maneiras. Isso "
"permite mostrar certas propriedades ao editor, exibí-las como listas de "
"opções, dividí-las em grupos, salvar em disco, etc. Linguagens de script "
"oferecem maneiras mais fáceis de personalizar propriedades, por exemplo "
"usando [annotation @GDScript.@export].\n"
"O Godot é muito dinâmico. O script de um objeto e, portanto, suas "
"propriedades, métodos e sinais, podem ser alterados em tempo de execução. "
"Por causa disso, pode haver ocasiões em que, por exemplo, uma propriedade "
"exigida por um método pode não existir. Para evitar erros em tempo de "
"execução, consulte métodos como [method set], [method get], [method call], "
"[method has_method], [method has_signal], etc. Observe que esses métodos são "
"[b]muito[/b] mais lentos do que referências diretas.\n"
"Em GDScript, você também pode verificar se uma determinada propriedade, "
"método ou nome de sinal existe em um objeto com o operador [code]in[/code]:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var node = Node.new()\n"
"print(\"name\" in node) # Exibe true\n"
"print(\"get_parent\" in node) # Exibe true\n"
"print(\"tree_entered\" in node) # Exibe true\n"
"print(\"unknown\" in node) # Exibe false\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Notificações são constantes [int] enviadas e recebidas por objetos. Por "
"exemplo, a cada quadro renderizado, a [SceneTree] notifica os nós dentro da "
"árvore com uma [constant Node.NOTIFICATION_PROCESS]. Os nós a recebem e "
"podem chamar o [method Node._process] para se atualizar. Para usar "
"notificações, consulte [method notification] e [method _notification].\n"
"Por fim, todo objeto também pode conter metadados (dados sobre dados). O "
"método [method set_meta] pode ser útil para armazenar informações das quais "
"o próprio objeto não depende. Evite usar metadados de forma excessiva para "
"deixar o seu código limpo.\n"
"[b]Obs.:[/b] Ao contrário das referências a um [RefCounted], as referências "
"a um objeto armazenado em uma variável podem se tornar inválidas sem serem "
"definidas como [code]null[/code]. Para verificar se um objeto foi excluído, "
"[i]não[/i] o compare com [code]null[/code]. Em vez disso, use "
"[@GlobalScope.is_instance_valid]. Também é recomendável herdar de "
"[RefCounted] para classes que armazenam dados em vez de [Object].\n"
"[b]Obs.:[/b] [code]script[/code] não é exposto como a maioria das "
"propriedades. Para definir ou obter o [Script] de um objeto no código, use "
"[method set_script] e [method get_script], respectivamente.\n"
"[b]Obs.:[/b] Se usado como booleano, um [Objeto] será avaliado como "
"[code]false[/code] se for igual a [code]null[/code] ou se tiver sido "
"liberado. Caso contrário, um [Objeto] sempre será avaliado como [code]true[/"
"code]. Veja também [method @GlobalScope.is_instance_valid]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid "Object class introduction"
msgstr "Introdução da classe Object"

#: doc/classes/Object.xml doc/classes/RefCounted.xml doc/classes/Resource.xml
msgid "When and how to avoid using nodes for everything"
msgstr "Quando e como evitar o uso de nós para tudo"

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid "Object notifications"
msgstr "Notificações de objeto"

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the behavior of [method get]. Should "
"return the given [param property]'s value, or [code]null[/code] if the "
"[param property] should be handled normally.\n"
"Combined with [method _set] and [method _get_property_list], this method "
"allows defining custom properties, which is particularly useful for editor "
"plugins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not called when getting built-in properties of "
"an object, including properties defined with [annotation "
"@GDScript.@export].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get(property):\n"
"\tif property == \"fake_property\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Getting my property!\")\n"
"\t\treturn 4\n"
"\treturn null\n"
"\n"
"func _get_property_list():\n"
"\treturn [\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\": \"fake_property\", \"type\": TYPE_INT }\n"
"\t]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Variant _Get(StringName property)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (property == \"FakeProperty\")\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Getting my property!\");\n"
"\t\treturn 4;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn default;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetPropertyList()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\t[\n"
"\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"FakeProperty\" },\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike other virtual methods, this method is called "
"automatically for every script that overrides it. This means that the base "
"implementation should not be called via [code]super[/code] in GDScript or "
"its equivalents in other languages. The bottom-most sub-class will be called "
"first, with subsequent calls ascending the class hierarchy. The call chain "
"will stop on the first class that returns a non-[code]null[/code] value.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This method must be [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/performance/"
"thread_safe_apis.html]thread-safe[/url] if overridden. Otherwise, the engine "
"may crash when trying to save a resource containing the object."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para personalizar o comportamento de [method get]. "
"Deve retornar o valor da [param property] fornecida, ou [code]null[/code] se "
"a [param property] deve ser tratada normalmente.\n"
"Combinado com [method _set] e [method _get_property_list], este método "
"permite definir propriedades personalizadas, o que é particularmente útil "
"para plugins de editor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método não é chamado ao obter propriedades integradas de "
"um objeto, incluindo propriedades definidas com [annotation "
"@GDScript.@export].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _get(property):\n"
"\tif property == \"fake_property\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Obtendo minha propriedade!\")\n"
"\t\treturn 4\n"
"\treturn null\n"
"\n"
"func _get_property_list():\n"
"\treturn [\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\": \"fake_property\", \"type\": TYPE_INT }\n"
"\t]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override Variant _Get(StringName property)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (property == \"FakeProperty\")\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Obtendo minha propriedade!\");\n"
"\t\treturn 4;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\treturn default;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetPropertyList()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\t[\n"
"\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"FakeProperty\" },\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Diferente de outros métodos virtuais, este método é chamado "
"automaticamente para cada script que o sobrescreve. Isso significa que a "
"implementação base não deve ser chamada via [code]super[/code] em GDScript "
"ou equivalentes em outras linguagens. A subclasse mais profunda será chamada "
"primeiro, com as chamadas subsequentes ascendendo na hierarquia de classes. "
"A cadeia de chamadas parará na primeira classe que retornar um valor não-"
"[code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] Este método deve ser [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/performance/"
"thread_safe_apis.html]thread-safe[/url] se sobrescrito. Caso contrário, a "
"engine pode travar ao tentar salvar um recurso contendo o objeto."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to provide a custom list of additional properties to "
"handle by the engine.\n"
"Should return a property list, as an [Array] of dictionaries. The result is "
"added to the array of [method get_property_list], and should be formatted in "
"the same way. Each [Dictionary] must at least contain the [code]name[/code] "
"and [code]type[/code] entries.\n"
"You can use [method _property_can_revert] and [method _property_get_revert] "
"to customize the default values of the properties added by this method.\n"
"The example below displays a list of numbers shown as words going from "
"[code]ZERO[/code] to [code]FIVE[/code], with [code]number_count[/code] "
"controlling the size of the list:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@export var number_count = 3:\n"
"\tset(nc):\n"
"\t\tnumber_count = nc\n"
"\t\tnumbers.resize(number_count)\n"
"\t\tnotify_property_list_changed()\n"
"\n"
"var numbers = PackedInt32Array([0, 0, 0])\n"
"\n"
"func _get_property_list():\n"
"\tvar properties: Array[Dictionary] = []\n"
"\n"
"\tfor i in range(number_count):\n"
"\t\tproperties.append({\n"
"\t\t\t\"name\": \"number_%d\" % i,\n"
"\t\t\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\t\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\t\t\"hint_string\": \"ZERO,ONE,TWO,THREE,FOUR,FIVE\",\n"
"\t\t})\n"
"\n"
"\treturn properties\n"
"\n"
"func _get(property):\n"
"\tif property.begins_with(\"number_\"):\n"
"\t\tvar index = property.get_slice(\"_\", 1).to_int()\n"
"\t\treturn numbers[index]\n"
"\treturn null\n"
"\n"
"func _set(property, value):\n"
"\tif property.begins_with(\"number_\"):\n"
"\t\tvar index = property.get_slice(\"_\", 1).to_int()\n"
"\t\tnumbers[index] = value\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate int _numberCount;\n"
"\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic int NumberCount\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tget => _numberCount;\n"
"\t\tset\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t_numberCount = value;\n"
"\t\t\t_numbers.Resize(_numberCount);\n"
"\t\t\tNotifyPropertyListChanged();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tprivate Godot.Collections.Array<int> _numbers = [];\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetPropertyList()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGodot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> properties = [];\n"
"\n"
"\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < _numberCount; i++)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tproperties.Add(new Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"name\", $\"number_{i}\" },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"hint\", (int)PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"hint_string\", \"Zero,One,Two,Three,Four,Five\" },\n"
"\t\t\t});\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\treturn properties;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Variant _Get(StringName property)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tstring propertyName = property.ToString();\n"
"\t\tif (propertyName.StartsWith(\"number_\"))\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tint index = int.Parse(propertyName.Substring(\"number_\".Length));\n"
"\t\t\treturn _numbers[index];\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn default;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override bool _Set(StringName property, Variant value)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tstring propertyName = property.ToString();\n"
"\t\tif (propertyName.StartsWith(\"number_\"))\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tint index = int.Parse(propertyName.Substring(\"number_\".Length));\n"
"\t\t\t_numbers[index] = value.As<int>();\n"
"\t\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn false;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended for advanced purposes. For most common "
"use cases, the scripting languages offer easier ways to handle properties. "
"See [annotation @GDScript.@export], [annotation @GDScript.@export_enum], "
"[annotation @GDScript.@export_group], etc. If you want to customize exported "
"properties, use [method _validate_property].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the object's script is not [annotation @GDScript.@tool], "
"this method will not be called in the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike other virtual methods, this method is called "
"automatically for every script that overrides it. This means that the base "
"implementation should not be called via [code]super[/code] in GDScript or "
"its equivalents in other languages. The bottom-most sub-class will be called "
"first, with subsequent calls ascending the class hierarchy.\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] This method must be [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/performance/"
"thread_safe_apis.html]thread-safe[/url] if overridden. Otherwise, the engine "
"may crash when trying to save a resource containing the object."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para fornecer uma lista personalizada de propriedades "
"adicionais a serem tratadas pela engine.\n"
"Deve retornar uma lista de propriedades, como um [Array] de dicionários. O "
"resultado é adicionado ao array de [method get_property_list] e deve ser "
"formatado da mesma maneira. Cada [Dictionary] deve conter pelo menos as "
"entradas [code]name[/code] e [code]type[/code].\n"
"Você pode usar [method _property_can_revert] e [method _property_get_revert] "
"para personalizar os valores padrão das propriedades adicionadas por este "
"método.\n"
"O exemplo abaixo exibe uma lista de números mostrados como palavras indo de "
"[code]ZERO[/code] a [code]FIVE[/code], com [code]number_count[/code] "
"controlando o tamanho da lista:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@export var number_count = 3:\n"
"\tset(nc):\n"
"\t\tnumber_count = nc\n"
"\t\tnumbers.resize(number_count)\n"
"\t\tnotify_property_list_changed()\n"
"\n"
"var numbers = PackedInt32Array([0, 0, 0])\n"
"\n"
"func _get_property_list():\n"
"\tvar properties: Array[Dictionary] = []\n"
"\n"
"\tfor i in range(number_count):\n"
"\t\tproperties.append({\n"
"\t\t\t\"name\": \"number_%d\" % i,\n"
"\t\t\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\t\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\t\t\"hint_string\": \"ZERO,ONE,TWO,THREE,FOUR,FIVE\",\n"
"\t\t})\n"
"\n"
"\treturn properties\n"
"\n"
"func _get(property):\n"
"\tif property.begins_with(\"number_\"):\n"
"\t\tvar index = property.get_slice(\"_\", 1).to_int()\n"
"\t\treturn numbers[index]\n"
"\treturn null\n"
"\n"
"func _set(property, value):\n"
"\tif property.begins_with(\"number_\"):\n"
"\t\tvar index = property.get_slice(\"_\", 1).to_int()\n"
"\t\tnumbers[index] = value\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate int _numberCount;\n"
"\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic int NumberCount\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tget => _numberCount;\n"
"\t\tset\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t_numberCount = value;\n"
"\t\t\t_numbers.Resize(_numberCount);\n"
"\t\t\tNotifyPropertyListChanged();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tprivate Godot.Collections.Array<int> _numbers = [];\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetPropertyList()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGodot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> properties = [];\n"
"\n"
"\t\tfor (int i = 0; i < _numberCount; i++)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tproperties.Add(new Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"name\", $\"number_{i}\" },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"hint\", (int)PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t\t\t\t{ \"hint_string\", \"Zero,One,Two,Three,Four,Five\" },\n"
"\t\t\t});\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t\treturn properties;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override Variant _Get(StringName property)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tstring propertyName = property.ToString();\n"
"\t\tif (propertyName.StartsWith(\"number_\"))\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tint index = int.Parse(propertyName.Substring(\"number_\".Length));\n"
"\t\t\treturn _numbers[index];\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn default;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override bool _Set(StringName property, Variant value)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tstring propertyName = property.ToString();\n"
"\t\tif (propertyName.StartsWith(\"number_\"))\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tint index = int.Parse(propertyName.Substring(\"number_\".Length));\n"
"\t\t\t_numbers[index] = value.As<int>();\n"
"\t\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t\treturn false;\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método destina-se a fins avançados. Para a maioria dos "
"casos de uso comuns, as linguagens de script oferecem maneiras mais fáceis "
"de lidar com propriedades. Veja [annotation @GDScript.@export], [annotation "
"@GDScript.@export_enum], [annotation @GDScript.@export_group], etc. Se você "
"deseja personalizar propriedades exportadas, use [method "
"_validate_property].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se o script do objeto não for [annotation @GDScript.@tool], "
"este método não será chamado no editor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Diferente de outros métodos virtuais, este método é chamado "
"automaticamente para cada script que o sobrescreve. Isso significa que a "
"implementação base não deve ser chamada via [code]super[/code] em GDScript "
"ou equivalentes em outras linguagens. A subclasse mais profunda será chamada "
"primeiro, com as chamadas subsequentes ascendendo na hierarquia de classes.\n"
"[b]Aviso:[/b] Este método deve ser [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/performance/"
"thread_safe_apis.html]thread-safe[/url] se sobrescrito. Caso contrário, a "
"engine pode travar ao tentar salvar um recurso contendo o objeto."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the object's script is instantiated, oftentimes after the object "
"is initialized in memory (through [code]Object.new()[/code] in GDScript, or "
"[code]new GodotObject[/code] in C#). It can be also defined to take in "
"parameters. This method is similar to a constructor in most programming "
"languages.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [method _init] is defined with [i]required[/i] parameters, "
"the Object with script may only be created directly. If any other means "
"(such as [method PackedScene.instantiate] or [method Node.duplicate]) are "
"used, the script's initialization will fail."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current iterable value. [param iter] stores the iteration state, "
"but unlike [method _iter_init] and [method _iter_next] the state is supposed "
"to be read-only, so there is no [Array] wrapper.\n"
"[b]Tip:[/b] In GDScript, you can use a subtype of [Variant] as the return "
"type for [method _iter_get]. The specified type will be used to set the type "
"of the iterator variable in [code]for[/code] loops, enhancing type safety."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the iterator. [param iter] stores the iteration state. Since "
"GDScript does not support passing arguments by reference, a single-element "
"array is used as a wrapper. Returns [code]true[/code] so long as the "
"iterator has not reached the end.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"class MyRange:\n"
"\tvar _from\n"
"\tvar _to\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _init(from, to):\n"
"\t\tassert(from <= to)\n"
"\t\t_from = from\n"
"\t\t_to = to\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _iter_init(iter):\n"
"\t\titer[0] = _from\n"
"\t\treturn iter[0] < _to\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _iter_next(iter):\n"
"\t\titer[0] += 1\n"
"\t\treturn iter[0] < _to\n"
"\n"
"\tfunc _iter_get(iter):\n"
"\t\treturn iter\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tvar my_range = MyRange.new(2, 5)\n"
"\tfor x in my_range:\n"
"\t\tprint(x) # Prints 2, 3, 4.\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Avoid storing iterator state in a member variable, use the "
"[param iter] parameter instead. Otherwise, you won't be able to reuse the "
"same iterator instance in nested loops.\n"
"See also [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/"
"gdscript_advanced.html#custom-iterators]online docs[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the iterator to the next iteration. [param iter] stores the iteration "
"state. Since GDScript does not support passing arguments by reference, a "
"single-element array is used as a wrapper. Returns [code]true[/code] so long "
"as the iterator has not reached the end."
msgstr ""
"Move o iterador para a próxima iteração. [param iter] armazena o estado da "
"iteração. Como o GDScript não oferece suporte à passagem de argumentos por "
"referência, uma matriz de elemento único é usada como um wrapper. Retorna "
"[code]true[/code] enquanto o iterador não alcançar o final."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the object receives a notification, which can be identified in "
"[param what] by comparing it with a constant. See also [method "
"notification].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _notification(what):\n"
"\tif what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Goodbye!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Notification(int what)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (what == NotificationPredelete)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Goodbye!\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The base [Object] defines a few notifications ([constant "
"NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE] and [constant NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE]). "
"Inheriting classes such as [Node] define a lot more notifications, which are "
"also received by this method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike other virtual methods, this method is called "
"automatically for every script that overrides it. This means that the base "
"implementation should not be called via [code]super[/code] in GDScript or "
"its equivalents in other languages. Call order depends on the "
"[code]reversed[/code] argument of [method notification] and varies between "
"different notifications. Most notifications are sent in the forward order "
"(i.e. Object class first, most derived class last)."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o objeto recebe uma notificação, que pode ser identificada em "
"[param what] comparando-a com uma constante. Veja também [method "
"notification].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"func _notification(what):\n"
"\tif what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Adeus!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"public override void _Notification(int what)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (what == NotificationPredelete)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Adeus!\");\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O [Object] base define algumas notificações ([constant "
"NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE] e [constant NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE]). Classes "
"herdadas, como [Node], definem muito mais notificações, que também são "
"recebidas por este método.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao contrário de outros métodos virtuais, este método é chamado "
"automaticamente para cada script que o sobrescreve. Isso significa que a "
"implementação base não deve ser chamada via [code]super[/code] no GDScript "
"ou seus equivalentes em outras linguagens. A ordem de chamada depende do "
"argumento [code]reversed[/code] de [method notification] e varia entre "
"diferentes notificações. A maioria das notificações é enviada na ordem "
"direta (ou seja, a classe Object primeiro, a classe mais derivada por "
"último)."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the given [param property]'s revert "
"behavior. Should return [code]true[/code] if the [param property] has a "
"custom default value and is revertible in the Inspector dock. Use [method "
"_property_get_revert] to specify the [param property]'s default value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method must return consistently, regardless of the current "
"value of the [param property].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike other virtual methods, this method is called "
"automatically for every script that overrides it. This means that the base "
"implementation should not be called via [code]super[/code] in GDScript or "
"its equivalents in other languages. The bottom-most sub-class will be called "
"first, with subsequent calls ascending the class hierarchy. The call chain "
"will stop on the first class that returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the given [param property]'s revert "
"behavior. Should return the default value for the [param property]. If the "
"default value differs from the [param property]'s current value, a revert "
"icon is displayed in the Inspector dock.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method _property_can_revert] must also be overridden for this "
"method to be called.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike other virtual methods, this method is called "
"automatically for every script that overrides it. This means that the base "
"implementation should not be called via [code]super[/code] in GDScript or "
"its equivalents in other languages. The bottom-most sub-class will be called "
"first, with subsequent calls ascending the class hierarchy. The call chain "
"will stop on the first class that returns a non-[code]null[/code] value."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the behavior of [method set]. Should set "
"the [param property] to [param value] and return [code]true[/code], or "
"[code]false[/code] if the [param property] should be handled normally. The "
"[i]exact[/i] way to set the [param property] is up to this method's "
"implementation.\n"
"Combined with [method _get] and [method _get_property_list], this method "
"allows defining custom properties, which is particularly useful for editor "
"plugins.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not called when setting built-in properties of "
"an object, including properties defined with [annotation "
"@GDScript.@export].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var internal_data = {}\n"
"\n"
"func _set(property, value):\n"
"\tif property == \"fake_property\":\n"
"\t\t# Storing the value in the fake property.\n"
"\t\tinternal_data[\"fake_property\"] = value\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"func _get_property_list():\n"
"\treturn [\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\": \"fake_property\", \"type\": TYPE_INT }\n"
"\t]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private Godot.Collections.Dictionary _internalData = new "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"\n"
"public override bool _Set(StringName property, Variant value)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (property == \"FakeProperty\")\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Storing the value in the fake property.\n"
"\t\t_internalData[\"FakeProperty\"] = value;\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetPropertyList()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\t[\n"
"\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"FakeProperty\" },\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike other virtual methods, this method is called "
"automatically for every script that overrides it. This means that the base "
"implementation should not be called via [code]super[/code] in GDScript or "
"its equivalents in other languages. The bottom-most sub-class will be called "
"first, with subsequent calls ascending the class hierarchy. The call chain "
"will stop on the first class that returns [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Sobreponha este método para personalizar o comportamento de [method set]. "
"Deve definir a [param property] para [param value] e retornar [code]true[/"
"code], ou [code]false[/code] se a [param property] deve ser tratada "
"normalmente. A maneira [i]exata[/i] de definir a [param property] depende da "
"implementação deste método.\n"
"Combinado com [method _get] e [method _get_property_list], este método "
"permite definir propriedades personalizadas, o que é particularmente útil "
"para plugins de editor.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método não é chamado ao definir propriedades embutidas de "
"um objeto, incluindo propriedades definidas com [annotation "
"@GDScript.@export].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var internal_data = {}\n"
"\n"
"func _set(property, value):\n"
"\tif property == \"fake_property\":\n"
"\t\t# Armazenando o valor na propriedade falsa.\n"
"\t\tinternal_data[\"fake_property\"] = value\n"
"\t\treturn true\n"
"\treturn false\n"
"\n"
"func _get_property_list():\n"
"\treturn [\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\": \"fake_property\", \"type\": TYPE_INT }\n"
"\t]\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"private Godot.Collections.Dictionary _internalData = new "
"Godot.Collections.Dictionary();\n"
"\n"
"public override bool _Set(StringName property, Variant value)\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (property == \"FakeProperty\")\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Armazenando o valor na propriedade falsa.\n"
"\t\t_internalData[\"FakeProperty\"] = value;\n"
"\t\treturn true;\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\treturn false;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"public override Godot.Collections.Array<Godot.Collections.Dictionary> "
"_GetPropertyList()\n"
"{\n"
"\treturn\n"
"\t[\n"
"\t\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"name\", \"FakeProperty\" },\n"
"\t\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t\t},\n"
"\t];\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Ao contrário de outros métodos virtuais, este método é chamado "
"automaticamente para cada script que o sobrescreve. Isso significa que a "
"implementação base não deve ser chamada via [code]super[/code] no GDScript "
"ou seus equivalentes em outras linguagens. A subclasse mais inferior será "
"chamada primeiro, com chamadas subsequentes ascendendo na hierarquia de "
"classes. A cadeia de chamadas irá parar na primeira classe que retornar "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to customize the return value of [method to_string], "
"and therefore the object's representation as a [String].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _to_string():\n"
"\treturn \"Welcome to Godot 4!\"\n"
"\n"
"func _init():\n"
"\tprint(self)       # Prints \"Welcome to Godot 4!\"\n"
"\tvar a = str(self) # a is \"Welcome to Godot 4!\"\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to customize existing properties. Every property info "
"goes through this method, except properties added with [method "
"_get_property_list]. The dictionary contents is the same as in [method "
"_get_property_list].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@export var is_number_editable: bool:\n"
"\tset(value):\n"
"\t\tis_number_editable = value\n"
"\t\tnotify_property_list_changed()\n"
"@export var number: int\n"
"\n"
"func _validate_property(property: Dictionary):\n"
"\tif property.name == \"number\" and not is_number_editable:\n"
"\t\tproperty.usage |= PROPERTY_USAGE_READ_ONLY\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate bool _isNumberEditable;\n"
"\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic bool IsNumberEditable\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tget => _isNumberEditable;\n"
"\t\tset\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t_isNumberEditable = value;\n"
"\t\t\tNotifyPropertyListChanged();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic int Number { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _ValidateProperty(Godot.Collections.Dictionary "
"property)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (property[\"name\"].AsStringName() == PropertyName.Number && !"
"IsNumberEditable)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tvar usage = property[\"usage\"].As<PropertyUsageFlags>() | "
"PropertyUsageFlags.ReadOnly;\n"
"\t\t\tproperty[\"usage\"] = (int)usage;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Sobreponha este método para personalizar propriedades existentes. Todas as "
"informações de propriedades passam por este método, exceto as propriedades "
"adicionadas com [method _get_property_list]. O conteúdo do dicionário é o "
"mesmo que em [method _get_property_list].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"@tool\n"
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@export var is_number_editable: bool:\n"
"\tset(value):\n"
"\t\tis_number_editable = value\n"
"\t\tnotify_property_list_changed()\n"
"@export var number: int\n"
"\n"
"func _validate_property(property: Dictionary):\n"
"\tif property.name == \"number\" and not is_number_editable:\n"
"\t\tproperty.usage |= PROPERTY_USAGE_READ_ONLY\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"[Tool]\n"
"public partial class MyNode : Node\n"
"{\n"
"\tprivate bool _isNumberEditable;\n"
"\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic bool IsNumberEditable\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tget => _isNumberEditable;\n"
"\t\tset\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\t_isNumberEditable = value;\n"
"\t\t\tNotifyPropertyListChanged();\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"\n"
"\t[Export]\n"
"\tpublic int Number { get; set; }\n"
"\n"
"\tpublic override void _ValidateProperty(Godot.Collections.Dictionary "
"property)\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tif (property[\"name\"].AsStringName() == PropertyName.Number && !"
"IsNumberEditable)\n"
"\t\t{\n"
"\t\t\tvar usage = property[\"usage\"].As<PropertyUsageFlags>() | "
"PropertyUsageFlags.ReadOnly;\n"
"\t\t\tproperty[\"usage\"] = (int)usage;\n"
"\t\t}\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a user-defined signal named [param signal]. Optional arguments for the "
"signal can be added as an [Array] of dictionaries, each defining a "
"[code]name[/code] [String] and a [code]type[/code] [int] (see [enum "
"Variant.Type]). See also [method has_user_signal] and [method "
"remove_user_signal].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"add_user_signal(\"hurt\", [\n"
"\t{ \"name\": \"damage\", \"type\": TYPE_INT },\n"
"\t{ \"name\": \"source\", \"type\": TYPE_OBJECT }\n"
"])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"AddUserSignal(\"Hurt\",\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\", \"damage\" },\n"
"\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t},\n"
"\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\", \"source\" },\n"
"\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Object },\n"
"\t},\n"
"]);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um sinal definido pelo usuário chamado [param signal]. Argumentos "
"opcionais para o sinal podem ser adicionados como um [Array] de dicionários, "
"cada um definindo um [code]name[/code] [String] e um [code]type[/code] [int] "
"(veja [enum Variant.Type]). Veja também [method has_user_signal] e [method "
"remove_user_signal].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"add_user_signal(\"hurt\", [\n"
"\t{ \"name\": \"damage\", \"type\": TYPE_INT },\n"
"\t{ \"name\": \"source\", \"type\": TYPE_OBJECT }\n"
"])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"AddUserSignal(\"Hurt\",\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\", \"damage\" },\n"
"\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t},\n"
"\tnew Godot.Collections.Dictionary()\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t{ \"name\", \"source\" },\n"
"\t\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Object },\n"
"\t},\n"
"]);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Calls the [param method] on the object and returns the result. This method "
"supports a variable number of arguments, so parameters can be passed as a "
"comma separated list.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"node.call(\"rotate\", Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node3D();\n"
"node.Call(Node3D.MethodName.Rotate, new Vector3(1f, 0f, 0f), 1.571f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param method] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]MethodName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""
"Chama o [param method] no objeto e retorna o resultado. Este método suporta "
"um número variável de argumentos, portanto, os parâmetros podem ser passados "
"como uma lista separada por vírgulas.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"node.call(\"rotate\", Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node3D();\n"
"node.Call(Node3D.MethodName.Rotate, new Vector3(1f, 0f, 0f), 1.571f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param method] deve estar em snake_case ao se referir a "
"métodos nativos do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na classe "
"[code]MethodName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a cada "
"chamada."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Calls the [param method] on the object during idle time. Always returns "
"[code]null[/code], [b]not[/b] the method's result.\n"
"Idle time happens mainly at the end of process and physics frames. In it, "
"deferred calls will be run until there are none left, which means you can "
"defer calls from other deferred calls and they'll still be run in the "
"current idle time cycle. This means you should not call a method deferred "
"from itself (or from a method called by it), as this causes infinite "
"recursion the same way as if you had called the method directly.\n"
"This method supports a variable number of arguments, so parameters can be "
"passed as a comma separated list.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"node.call_deferred(\"rotate\", Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node3D();\n"
"node.CallDeferred(Node3D.MethodName.Rotate, new Vector3(1f, 0f, 0f), "
"1.571f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"For methods that are deferred from the same thread, the order of execution "
"at idle time is identical to the order in which [code skip-"
"lint]call_deferred[/code] was called.\n"
"See also [method Callable.call_deferred].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param method] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]MethodName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you're looking to delay the function call by a frame, refer "
"to the [signal SceneTree.process_frame] and [signal SceneTree.physics_frame] "
"signals.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"# Make a Callable and bind the arguments to the node's rotate() call.\n"
"var callable = node.rotate.bind(Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571)\n"
"# Connect the callable to the process_frame signal, so it gets called in the "
"next process frame.\n"
"# CONNECT_ONE_SHOT makes sure it only gets called once instead of every "
"frame.\n"
"get_tree().process_frame.connect(callable, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""
"Chama o [param method] no objeto durante o tempo ocioso. Sempre retorna "
"[code]null[/code], [b]não[/b] o resultado do método.\n"
"O tempo ocioso ocorre principalmente no final dos quadros de processamento e "
"física. Nele, chamadas adiadas serão executadas até que não sobre nenhuma, o "
"que significa que você pode adiar chamadas a partir de outras chamadas "
"adiadas e elas ainda serão executadas no ciclo de tempo ocioso atual. Isso "
"significa que você não deve chamar um método adiado a partir de si mesmo (ou "
"de um método chamado por ele), pois isso causa recursão infinita da mesma "
"forma que se você tivesse chamado o método diretamente.\n"
"Este método suporta um número variável de argumentos, portanto, os "
"parâmetros podem ser passados como uma lista separada por vírgulas.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"node.call_deferred(\"rotate\", Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node3D();\n"
"node.CallDeferred(Node3D.MethodName.Rotate, new Vector3(1f, 0f, 0f), "
"1.571f);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Para métodos que são adiados a partir da mesma thread, a ordem de execução "
"no tempo ocioso é idêntica à ordem em que [code skip-lint]call_deferred[/"
"code] foi chamado.\n"
"Veja também [method Callable.call_deferred].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param method] deve estar em snake_case ao se referir a "
"métodos nativos do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na classe "
"[code]MethodName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a cada "
"chamada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se você deseja atrasar a chamada da função em um quadro, "
"consulte os sinais [signal SceneTree.process_frame] e [signal "
"SceneTree.physics_frame].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"# Cria um Callable e vincula os argumentos à chamada rotate() do nó.\n"
"var callable = node.rotate.bind(Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571)\n"
"# Conecta o callable ao sinal process_frame, para que ele seja chamado no "
"próximo quadro de processamento.\n"
"# O CONNECT_ONE_SHOT garante que ele seja chamado apenas uma vez em vez de a "
"cada quadro.\n"
"get_tree().process_frame.connect(callable, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n"
"[/codeblock]"

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Calls the [param method] on the object and returns the result. Unlike "
"[method call], this method expects all parameters to be contained inside "
"[param arg_array].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"node.callv(\"rotate\", [Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node3D();\n"
"node.Callv(Node3D.MethodName.Rotate, [new Vector3(1f, 0f, 0f), 1.571f]);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param method] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]MethodName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""
"Chama o [param method] no objeto e retorna o resultado. Ao contrário de "
"[method call], este método espera que todos os parâmetros estejam contidos "
"dentro de [param arg_array].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node3D.new()\n"
"node.callv(\"rotate\", [Vector3(1.0, 0.0, 0.0), 1.571])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node3D();\n"
"node.Callv(Node3D.MethodName.Rotate, [new Vector3(1f, 0f, 0f), 1.571f]);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param method] deve estar em snake_case ao se referir a "
"métodos nativos do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na classe "
"[code]MethodName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a cada "
"chamada."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the object is allowed to translate messages "
"with [method tr] and [method tr_n]. See also [method "
"set_message_translation]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o objeto tiver permissão para traduzir "
"mensagens com [method tr] e [method tr_n]. Veja também [method "
"set_message_translation]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"If this method is called during [constant NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE], this "
"object will reject being freed and will remain allocated. This is mostly an "
"internal function used for error handling to avoid the user from freeing "
"objects when they are not intended to."
msgstr ""
"Se este método for chamado durante [constant NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE], este "
"objeto rejeitará ser liberado e permanecerá alocado. Esta é principalmente "
"uma função interna usada para tratamento de erros para evitar que o usuário "
"libere objetos quando eles não devem ser liberados."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Connects a [param signal] by name to a [param callable]. Optional [param "
"flags] can be also added to configure the connection's behavior (see [enum "
"ConnectFlags] constants).\n"
"A signal can only be connected once to the same [Callable]. If the signal is "
"already connected, this method returns [constant ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] and "
"generates an error, unless the signal is connected with [constant "
"CONNECT_REFERENCE_COUNTED]. To prevent this, use [method is_connected] first "
"to check for existing connections.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the [param callable]'s object is freed, the connection will "
"be lost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, it is generally recommended to connect signals "
"with [method Signal.connect] instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method, and all other signal-related methods, are thread-"
"safe."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Disconnects a [param signal] by name from a given [param callable]. If the "
"connection does not exist, generates an error. Use [method is_connected] to "
"make sure that the connection exists."
msgstr ""
"Desconecta um [param signal] por nome de um [param callable] fornecido. Se a "
"conexão não existir, gera um erro. Use [method is_connected] para garantir "
"que a conexão exista."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Emits the given [param signal] by name. The signal must exist, so it should "
"be a built-in signal of this class or one of its inherited classes, or a "
"user-defined signal (see [method add_user_signal]). This method supports a "
"variable number of arguments, so parameters can be passed as a comma "
"separated list.\n"
"Returns [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE] if [param signal] does not exist or the "
"parameters are invalid.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"emit_signal(\"hit\", \"sword\", 100)\n"
"emit_signal(\"game_over\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EmitSignal(SignalName.Hit, \"sword\", 100);\n"
"EmitSignal(SignalName.GameOver);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param signal] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot signals. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]SignalName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""
"Emite o [param signal] fornecido por nome. O sinal deve existir, portanto, "
"deve ser um sinal nativo desta classe ou de uma de suas classes herdadas, ou "
"um sinal definido pelo usuário (consulte [method add_user_signal]). Este "
"método suporta um número variável de argumentos, portanto, os parâmetros "
"podem ser passados como uma lista separada por vírgulas.\n"
"Retorna [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE] se o [param signal] não existir ou se os "
"parâmetros forem inválidos.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"emit_signal(\"hit\", \"sword\", 100)\n"
"emit_signal(\"game_over\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"EmitSignal(SignalName.Hit, \"sword\", 100);\n"
"EmitSignal(SignalName.GameOver);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param signal] deve estar em snake_case ao se referir a "
"sinais nativos do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na classe "
"[code]SignalName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a cada "
"chamada."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Deletes the object from memory. Pre-existing references to the object become "
"invalid, and any attempt to access them will result in a runtime error. "
"Checking the references with [method @GlobalScope.is_instance_valid] will "
"return [code]false[/code]. This is equivalent to the [code]memdelete[/code] "
"function in GDExtension C++."
msgstr ""
"Exclui o objeto da memória. Referências pré-existentes para o objeto tornam-"
"se inválidas, e qualquer tentativa de acessá-las resultará em um erro de "
"tempo de execução. Verificar as referências com [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_instance_valid] retornará [code]false[/code]. Isso é "
"equivalente à função [code]memdelete[/code] em GDExtension C++."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Variant] value of the given [param property]. If the [param "
"property] does not exist, this method returns [code]null[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.rotation = 1.5\n"
"var a = node.get(\"rotation\") # a is 1.5\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Rotation = 1.5f;\n"
"var a = node.Get(Node2D.PropertyName.Rotation); // a is 1.5\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param property] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot properties. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on "
"each call."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor [Variant] da [param property] fornecida. Se a [param "
"property] não existir, este método retorna [code]null[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.rotation = 1.5\n"
"var a = node.get(\"rotation\") # a é 1.5\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Rotation = 1.5f;\n"
"var a = node.Get(Node2D.PropertyName.Rotation); // a é 1.5\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param property] deve estar em snake_case ao se referir "
"a propriedades nativas do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na classe "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a cada "
"chamada."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the object's built-in class name, as a [String]. See also [method "
"is_class].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method ignores [code]class_name[/code] declarations. If "
"this object's script has defined a [code]class_name[/code], the base, built-"
"in class name is returned instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of signal connections received by this object. Each "
"connection is represented as a [Dictionary] that contains three entries:\n"
"- [code]signal[/code] is a reference to the [Signal];\n"
"- [code]callable[/code] is a reference to the [Callable];\n"
"- [code]flags[/code] is a combination of [enum ConnectFlags]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the object's property indexed by the given [param property_path]. The "
"path should be a [NodePath] relative to the current object and can use the "
"colon character ([code]:[/code]) to access nested properties.\n"
"[b]Examples:[/b] [code]\"position:x\"[/code] or [code]"
"\"material:next_pass:blend_mode\"[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.position = Vector2(5, -10)\n"
"var a = node.get_indexed(\"position\")   # a is Vector2(5, -10)\n"
"var b = node.get_indexed(\"position:y\") # b is -10\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Position = new Vector2(5, -10);\n"
"var a = node.GetIndexed(\"position\");   // a is Vector2(5, -10)\n"
"var b = node.GetIndexed(\"position:y\"); // b is -10\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param property_path] must be in snake_case when "
"referring to built-in Godot properties. Prefer using the names exposed in "
"the [code]PropertyName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] "
"on each call.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does not support actual paths to nodes in the "
"[SceneTree], only sub-property paths. In the context of nodes, use [method "
"Node.get_node_and_resource] instead."
msgstr ""
"Obtém a propriedade do objeto indexada pelo [param property_path] fornecido. "
"O caminho deve ser um [NodePath] relativo ao objeto atual e pode usar o "
"caractere dois-pontos ([code]:[/code]) para acessar propriedades aninhadas.\n"
"[b]Exemplos:[/b] [code]\"position:x\"[/code] ou [code]"
"\"material:next_pass:blend_mode\"[/code].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.position = Vector2(5, -10)\n"
"var a = node.get_indexed(\"position\")    # a é Vector2(5, -10)\n"
"var b = node.get_indexed(\"position:y\") # b é -10\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Position = new Vector2(5, -10);\n"
"var a = node.GetIndexed(\"position\");   // a é Vector2(5, -10)\n"
"var b = node.GetIndexed(\"position:y\"); // b é -10\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param property_path] deve estar em snake_case ao se "
"referir a propriedades nativas do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na "
"classe [code]PropertyName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a "
"cada chamada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método não suporta caminhos reais para nós na [SceneTree], "
"apenas caminhos de subpropriedades. No contexto de nós, use [method "
"Node.get_node_and_resource] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the object's unique instance ID. This ID can be saved in "
"[EncodedObjectAsID], and can be used to retrieve this object instance with "
"[method @GlobalScope.instance_from_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This ID is only useful during the current session. It won't "
"correspond to a similar object if the ID is sent over a network, or loaded "
"from a file at a later time."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the object's metadata value for the given entry [param name]. If the "
"entry does not exist, returns [param default]. If [param default] is "
"[code]null[/code], an error is also generated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A metadata's name must be a valid identifier as per [method "
"StringName.is_valid_identifier] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Metadata that has a name starting with an underscore ([code]_[/"
"code]) is considered editor-only. Editor-only metadata is not displayed in "
"the Inspector and should not be edited, although it can still be found by "
"this method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the object's metadata entry names as an [Array] of [StringName]s."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os nomes das entradas de metadados do objeto como um [Array] de "
"[StringName]s."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of arguments of the given [param method] by name.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param method] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]MethodName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns this object's methods and their signatures as an [Array] of "
"dictionaries. Each [Dictionary] contains the following entries:\n"
"- [code]name[/code] is the name of the method, as a [String];\n"
"- [code]args[/code] is an [Array] of dictionaries representing the "
"arguments;\n"
"- [code]default_args[/code] is the default arguments as an [Array] of "
"variants;\n"
"- [code]flags[/code] is a combination of [enum MethodFlags];\n"
"- [code]id[/code] is the method's internal identifier [int];\n"
"- [code]return[/code] is the returned value, as a [Dictionary];\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The dictionaries of [code]args[/code] and [code]return[/code] "
"are formatted identically to the results of [method get_property_list], "
"although not all entries are used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the object's property list as an [Array] of dictionaries. Each "
"[Dictionary] contains the following entries:\n"
"- [code]name[/code] is the property's name, as a [String];\n"
"- [code]class_name[/code] is an empty [StringName], unless the property is "
"[constant TYPE_OBJECT] and it inherits from a class;\n"
"- [code]type[/code] is the property's type, as an [int] (see [enum "
"Variant.Type]);\n"
"- [code]hint[/code] is [i]how[/i] the property is meant to be edited (see "
"[enum PropertyHint]);\n"
"- [code]hint_string[/code] depends on the hint (see [enum PropertyHint]);\n"
"- [code]usage[/code] is a combination of [enum PropertyUsageFlags].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In GDScript, all class members are treated as properties. In C# "
"and GDExtension, it may be necessary to explicitly mark class members as "
"Godot properties using decorators or attributes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the object's [Script] instance, or [code]null[/code] if no script is "
"attached."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a instância de [Script] do objeto ou [code]null[/code] se nenhum "
"script estiver anexado."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of connections for the given [param signal] name. Each "
"connection is represented as a [Dictionary] that contains three entries:\n"
"- [code skip-lint]signal[/code] is a reference to the [Signal];\n"
"- [code]callable[/code] is a reference to the connected [Callable];\n"
"- [code]flags[/code] is a combination of [enum ConnectFlags]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of existing signals as an [Array] of dictionaries.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to the implementation, each [Dictionary] is formatted very "
"similarly to the returned values of [method get_method_list]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the translation domain used by [method tr] and [method "
"tr_n]. See also [TranslationServer]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do domínio de tradução usado por [method tr] e [method tr_n]. "
"Veja também [TranslationServer]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if any connection exists on the given [param "
"signal] name.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param signal] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]SignalName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a metadata entry is found with the given [param "
"name]. See also [method get_meta], [method set_meta] and [method "
"remove_meta].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A metadata's name must be a valid identifier as per [method "
"StringName.is_valid_identifier] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Metadata that has a name starting with an underscore ([code]_[/"
"code]) is considered editor-only. Editor-only metadata is not displayed in "
"the Inspector and should not be edited, although it can still be found by "
"this method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param method] name exists in the "
"object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param method] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot methods. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]MethodName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param signal] name exists in the "
"object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param signal] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot signals. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]SignalName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given user-defined [param signal] name "
"exists. Only signals added with [method add_user_signal] are included. See "
"also [method remove_user_signal]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o nome de [param signal] definido pelo usuário "
"fornecido existir. Apenas os sinais adicionados com [method add_user_signal] "
"são incluídos. Veja também [method remove_user_signal]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the object is blocking its signals from being "
"emitted. See [method set_block_signals]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o objeto estiver bloqueando a emissão de seus "
"sinais. Veja [method set_block_signals]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the object inherits from the given [param "
"class]. See also [method get_class].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var sprite2d = Sprite2D.new()\n"
"sprite2d.is_class(\"Sprite2D\") # Returns true\n"
"sprite2d.is_class(\"Node\")     # Returns true\n"
"sprite2d.is_class(\"Node3D\")   # Returns false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var sprite2D = new Sprite2D();\n"
"sprite2D.IsClass(\"Sprite2D\"); // Returns true\n"
"sprite2D.IsClass(\"Node\");     // Returns true\n"
"sprite2D.IsClass(\"Node3D\");   // Returns false\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method ignores [code]class_name[/code] declarations in the "
"object's script."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o objeto herda da [param class] fornecida. Veja "
"também [method get_class].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var sprite2d = Sprite2D.new()\n"
"sprite2d.is_class(\"Sprite2D\") # Retorna true\n"
"sprite2d.is_class(\"Node\")     # Retorna true\n"
"sprite2d.is_class(\"Node3D\")   # Retorna false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var sprite2D = new Sprite2D();\n"
"sprite2D.IsClass(\"Sprite2D\"); // Retorna true\n"
"sprite2D.IsClass(\"Node\");     // Retorna true\n"
"sprite2D.IsClass(\"Node3D\");   // Retorna false\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método ignora declarações de [code]class_name[/code] no "
"script do objeto."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a connection exists between the given [param "
"signal] name and [param callable].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param signal] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot signals. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]SignalName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on each "
"call."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the methods [method Node.queue_free] or [method "
"SceneTree.queue_delete] was called for the object.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method does not return [code]true[/code] on children of "
"the node that [method Node.queue_free] has been called on, even though they "
"will be freed together with the parent."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Sends the given [param what] notification to all classes inherited by the "
"object, triggering calls to [method _notification], starting from the "
"highest ancestor (the [Object] class) and going down to the object's "
"script.\n"
"If [param reversed] is [code]true[/code], the call order is reversed.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var player = Node2D.new()\n"
"player.set_script(load(\"res://player.gd\"))\n"
"\n"
"player.notification(NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE)\n"
"# The call order is Object -> Node -> Node2D -> player.gd.\n"
"\n"
"player.notification(NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE, true)\n"
"# The call order is player.gd -> Node2D -> Node -> Object.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var player = new Node2D();\n"
"player.SetScript(GD.Load(\"res://player.gd\"));\n"
"\n"
"player.Notification(NotificationEnterTree);\n"
"// The call order is GodotObject -> Node -> Node2D -> player.gd.\n"
"\n"
"player.Notification(NotificationEnterTree, true);\n"
"// The call order is player.gd -> Node2D -> Node -> GodotObject.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Envia a notificação [param what] fornecida para todas as classes herdadas "
"pelo objeto, disparando chamadas para [method _notification], começando do "
"ancestral mais alto (a classe [Object]) e descendo até o script do objeto.\n"
"Se [param reversed] for [code]true[/code], a ordem da chamada é invertida.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var player = Node2D.new()\n"
"player.set_script(load(\"res://player.gd\"))\n"
"\n"
"player.notification(NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE)\n"
"# A ordem da chamada é Object -> Node -> Node2D -> player.gd.\n"
"\n"
"player.notification(NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE, true)\n"
"# A ordem da chamada é player.gd -> Node2D -> Node -> Object.\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var player = new Node2D();\n"
"player.SetScript(GD.Load(\"res://player.gd\"));\n"
"\n"
"player.Notification(NotificationEnterTree);\n"
"// A ordem da chamada é GodotObject -> Node -> Node2D -> player.gd.\n"
"\n"
"player.Notification(NotificationEnterTree, true);\n"
"// A ordem da chamada é player.gd -> Node2D -> Node -> GodotObject.\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Emits the [signal property_list_changed] signal. This is mainly used to "
"refresh the editor, so that the Inspector and editor plugins are properly "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"Emite o sinal [signal property_list_changed]. Isso é usado principalmente "
"para atualizar o editor, para que o Inspetor e os plugins do editor sejam "
"atualizados adequadamente."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the given [param property] has a custom default "
"value. Use [method property_get_revert] to get the [param property]'s "
"default value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is used by the Inspector dock to display a revert "
"icon. The object must implement [method _property_can_revert] to customize "
"the default value. If [method _property_can_revert] is not implemented, this "
"method returns [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the custom default value of the given [param property]. Use [method "
"property_can_revert] to check if the [param property] has a custom default "
"value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is used by the Inspector dock to display a revert "
"icon. The object must implement [method _property_get_revert] to customize "
"the default value. If [method _property_get_revert] is not implemented, this "
"method returns [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given entry [param name] from the object's metadata. See also "
"[method has_meta], [method get_meta] and [method set_meta].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A metadata's name must be a valid identifier as per [method "
"StringName.is_valid_identifier] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Metadata that has a name starting with an underscore ([code]_[/"
"code]) is considered editor-only. Editor-only metadata is not displayed in "
"the Inspector and should not be edited, although it can still be found by "
"this method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given user signal [param signal] from the object. See also "
"[method add_user_signal] and [method has_user_signal]."
msgstr ""
"Remove o sinal de usuário [param signal] dado do objeto. Veja também [method "
"add_user_signal] e [method has_user_signal]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Assigns [param value] to the given [param property]. If the property does "
"not exist or the given [param value]'s type doesn't match, nothing happens.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.set(\"global_scale\", Vector2(8, 2.5))\n"
"print(node.global_scale) # Prints (8.0, 2.5)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Set(Node2D.PropertyName.GlobalScale, new Vector2(8, 2.5f));\n"
"GD.Print(node.GlobalScale); // Prints (8, 2.5)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param property] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot properties. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on "
"each call."
msgstr ""
"Atribui [param value] à [param property] fornecida. Se a propriedade não "
"existir ou o tipo do [param value] fornecido não corresponder, nada "
"acontece.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.set(\"global_scale\", Vector2(8, 2.5))\n"
"print(node.global_scale) # Imprime (8.0, 2.5)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Set(Node2D.PropertyName.GlobalScale, new Vector2(8, 2.5f));\n"
"GD.Print(node.GlobalScale); // Imprime (8, 2.5)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param property] deve estar em snake_case ao se referir "
"a propriedades nativas do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na classe "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a cada "
"chamada."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the object becomes unable to emit signals. As "
"such, [method emit_signal] and signal connections will not work, until it is "
"set to [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], o objeto fica incapaz de emitir sinais. "
"Como tal, [method emit_signal] e conexões de sinal não funcionarão até que "
"seja definido como [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Assigns [param value] to the given [param property], at the end of the "
"current frame. This is equivalent to calling [method set] through [method "
"call_deferred].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"add_child(node)\n"
"\n"
"node.rotation = 1.5\n"
"node.set_deferred(\"rotation\", 3.0)\n"
"print(node.rotation) # Prints 1.5\n"
"\n"
"await get_tree().process_frame\n"
"print(node.rotation) # Prints 3.0\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Rotation = 1.5f;\n"
"node.SetDeferred(Node2D.PropertyName.Rotation, 3f);\n"
"GD.Print(node.Rotation); // Prints 1.5\n"
"\n"
"await ToSignal(GetTree(), SceneTree.SignalName.ProcessFrame);\n"
"GD.Print(node.Rotation); // Prints 3.0\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param property] must be in snake_case when referring to "
"built-in Godot properties. Prefer using the names exposed in the "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] on "
"each call."
msgstr ""
"Atribui [param value] à [param property] fornecida, no final do quadro "
"atual. Isso é equivalente a chamar [method set] através de [method "
"call_deferred].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"add_child(node)\n"
"\n"
"node.rotation = 1.5\n"
"node.set_deferred(\"rotation\", 3.0)\n"
"print(node.rotation) # Imprime 1.5\n"
"\n"
"await get_tree().process_frame\n"
"print(node.rotation) # Imprime 3.0\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.Rotation = 1.5f;\n"
"node.SetDeferred(Node2D.PropertyName.Rotation, 3f);\n"
"GD.Print(node.Rotation); // Imprime 1.5\n"
"\n"
"await ToSignal(GetTree(), SceneTree.SignalName.ProcessFrame);\n"
"GD.Print(node.Rotation); // Imprime 3.0\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param property] deve estar em snake_case ao se referir "
"a propriedades nativas do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na classe "
"[code]PropertyName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a cada "
"chamada."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Assigns a new [param value] to the property identified by the [param "
"property_path]. The path should be a [NodePath] relative to this object, and "
"can use the colon character ([code]:[/code]) to access nested properties.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.set_indexed(\"position\", Vector2(42, 0))\n"
"node.set_indexed(\"position:y\", -10)\n"
"print(node.position) # Prints (42.0, -10.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.SetIndexed(\"position\", new Vector2(42, 0));\n"
"node.SetIndexed(\"position:y\", -10);\n"
"GD.Print(node.Position); // Prints (42, -10)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, [param property_path] must be in snake_case when "
"referring to built-in Godot properties. Prefer using the names exposed in "
"the [code]PropertyName[/code] class to avoid allocating a new [StringName] "
"on each call."
msgstr ""
"Atribui um novo [param value] à propriedade identificada pelo [param "
"property_path]. O caminho deve ser um [NodePath] relativo a este objeto e "
"pode usar o caractere dois-pontos ([code]:[/code]) para acessar propriedades "
"aninhadas.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var node = Node2D.new()\n"
"node.set_indexed(\"position\", Vector2(42, 0))\n"
"node.set_indexed(\"position:y\", -10)\n"
"print(node.position) # Imprime (42.0, -10.0)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var node = new Node2D();\n"
"node.SetIndexed(\"position\", new Vector2(42, 0));\n"
"node.SetIndexed(\"position:y\", -10);\n"
"GD.Print(node.Position); // Imprime (42, -10)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em C#, [param property_path] deve estar em snake_case ao se "
"referir a propriedades nativas do Godot. Prefira usar os nomes expostos na "
"classe [code]PropertyName[/code] para evitar alocar um novo [StringName] a "
"cada chamada."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], allows the object to translate messages with "
"[method tr] and [method tr_n]. Enabled by default. See also [method "
"can_translate_messages]."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], permite que o objeto traduza mensagens "
"com [method tr] e [method tr_n]. Ativado por padrão. Veja também [member "
"can_translate_messages]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Adds or changes the entry [param name] inside the object's metadata. The "
"metadata [param value] can be any [Variant], although some types cannot be "
"serialized correctly.\n"
"If [param value] is [code]null[/code], the entry is removed. This is the "
"equivalent of using [method remove_meta]. See also [method has_meta] and "
"[method get_meta].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] A metadata's name must be a valid identifier as per [method "
"StringName.is_valid_identifier] method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Metadata that has a name starting with an underscore ([code]_[/"
"code]) is considered editor-only. Editor-only metadata is not displayed in "
"the Inspector and should not be edited, although it can still be found by "
"this method."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Attaches [param script] to the object, and instantiates it. As a result, the "
"script's [method _init] is called. A [Script] is used to extend the object's "
"functionality.\n"
"If a script already exists, its instance is detached, and its property "
"values and state are lost. Built-in property values are still kept."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the name of the translation domain used by [method tr] and [method "
"tr_n]. See also [TranslationServer]."
msgstr ""
"Define o nome do domínio de tradução usado por [method tr] e [method tr_n]. "
"Veja também [TranslationServer]."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [String] representing the object. Defaults to [code]"
"\"<ClassName#RID>\"[/code]. Override [method _to_string] to customize the "
"string representation of the object."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma [String] representando o objeto. O padrão é [code]"
"\"<ClassName#RID>\"[/code]. Substitua [method _to_string] para personalizar "
"a representação em string do objeto."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Translates a [param message], using the translation catalogs configured in "
"the Project Settings. Further [param context] can be specified to help with "
"the translation. Note that most [Control] nodes automatically translate "
"their strings, so this method is mostly useful for formatted strings or "
"custom drawn text.\n"
"If [method can_translate_messages] is [code]false[/code], or no translation "
"is available, this method returns the [param message] without changes. See "
"[method set_message_translation].\n"
"For detailed examples, see [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/i18n/"
"internationalizing_games.html]Internationalizing games[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method can't be used without an [Object] instance, as it "
"requires the [method can_translate_messages] method. To translate strings in "
"a static context, use [method TranslationServer.translate]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Translates a [param message] or [param plural_message], using the "
"translation catalogs configured in the Project Settings. Further [param "
"context] can be specified to help with the translation.\n"
"If [method can_translate_messages] is [code]false[/code], or no translation "
"is available, this method returns [param message] or [param plural_message], "
"without changes. See [method set_message_translation].\n"
"The [param n] is the number, or amount, of the message's subject. It is used "
"by the translation system to fetch the correct plural form for the current "
"language.\n"
"For detailed examples, see [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/i18n/"
"localization_using_gettext.html]Localization using gettext[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Negative and [float] numbers may not properly apply to some "
"countable subjects. It's recommended to handle these cases with [method "
"tr].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method can't be used without an [Object] instance, as it "
"requires the [method can_translate_messages] method. To translate strings in "
"a static context, use [method TranslationServer.translate_plural]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid "Emitted when [method notify_property_list_changed] is called."
msgstr "Emitido quando [method notify_property_list_changed] é chamado."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the object's script is changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When this signal is emitted, the new script is not initialized "
"yet. If you need to access the new script, defer connections to this signal "
"with [constant CONNECT_DEFERRED]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the object is initialized, before its script is "
"attached. Used internally."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o objeto é inicializado, antes que seu script "
"seja anexado. Usado internamente."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the object is about to be deleted. Can be used "
"like destructors in object-oriented programming languages.\n"
"This notification is sent in reversed order."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Notification received when the object finishes hot reloading. This "
"notification is only sent for extensions classes and derived."
msgstr ""
"Notificação recebida quando o objeto termina a recarga a quente (hot "
"reloading). Esta notificação é enviada apenas para classes de extensões e "
"derivadas."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Deferred connections trigger their [Callable]s on idle time (at the end of "
"the frame), rather than instantly."
msgstr ""
"Conexões adiadas disparam seus [Callable]s no tempo de ociosidade (no final "
"do frame), em vez de instantaneamente."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Persisting connections are stored when the object is serialized (such as "
"when using [method PackedScene.pack]). In the editor, connections created "
"through the Signals dock are always persisting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Connections to lambda functions (that is, when the function "
"code is embedded in the [method connect] call) cannot be made persistent."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid "One-shot connections disconnect themselves after emission."
msgstr "Conexões de uso único desconectam-se após a emissão."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"Reference-counted connections can be assigned to the same [Callable] "
"multiple times. Each disconnection decreases the internal counter. The "
"signal fully disconnects only when the counter reaches 0."
msgstr ""
"Conexões com contagem de referência podem ser atribuídas ao mesmo [Callable] "
"várias vezes. Cada desconexão diminui o contador interno. O sinal é "
"totalmente desconectado apenas quando o contador atinge 0."

#: doc/classes/Object.xml
msgid ""
"On signal emission, the source object is automatically appended after the "
"original arguments of the signal, regardless of the connected [Callable]'s "
"unbinds which affect only the original arguments of the signal (see [method "
"Callable.unbind], [method Callable.get_unbound_arguments_count]).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends Object\n"
"\n"
"signal test_signal\n"
"\n"
"func test():\n"
"\tprint(self) # Prints e.g. <Object#35332818393>\n"
"\ttest_signal.connect(prints.unbind(1), CONNECT_APPEND_SOURCE_OBJECT)\n"
"\ttest_signal.emit(\"emit_arg_1\", \"emit_arg_2\") # Prints emit_arg_1 "
"<Object#35332818393>\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Occluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"Occluder shape resource for use with occlusion culling in "
"[OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"Recurso de forma de oclusor para uso com \"occlusion culling\" em "
"[OccluderInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/Occluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"[Occluder3D] stores an occluder shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Occluder3D.xml
msgid "Returns the occluder shape's vertex indices."
msgstr "Retorna os índices de vértices da forma do oclusor."

#: doc/classes/Occluder3D.xml
msgid "Returns the occluder shape's vertex positions."
msgstr "Retorna as posições dos vértices da forma do oclusor."

#: doc/classes/OccluderInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Provides occlusion culling for 3D nodes, which improves performance in "
"closed areas."
msgstr ""
"Fornece descarte de oclusão para nós 3D, o que melhora o desempenho em áreas "
"fechadas."

#: doc/classes/OccluderInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"Occlusion culling can improve rendering performance in closed/semi-open "
"areas by hiding geometry that is occluded by other objects.\n"
"The occlusion culling system is mostly static. [OccluderInstance3D]s can be "
"moved or hidden at run-time, but doing so will trigger a background "
"recomputation that can take several frames. It is recommended to only move "
"[OccluderInstance3D]s sporadically (e.g. for procedural generation "
"purposes), rather than doing so every frame.\n"
"The occlusion culling system works by rendering the occluders on the CPU in "
"parallel using [url=https://www.embree.org/]Embree[/url], drawing the result "
"to a low-resolution buffer then using this to cull 3D nodes individually. In "
"the 3D editor, you can preview the occlusion culling buffer by choosing "
"[b]Perspective > Display Advanced... > Occlusion Culling Buffer[/b] in the "
"top-left corner of the 3D viewport. The occlusion culling buffer quality can "
"be adjusted in the Project Settings.\n"
"[b]Baking:[/b] Select an [OccluderInstance3D] node, then use the [b]Bake "
"Occluders[/b] button at the top of the 3D editor. Only opaque materials will "
"be taken into account; transparent materials (alpha-blended or alpha-tested) "
"will be ignored by the occluder generation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Occlusion culling is only effective if [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/use_occlusion_culling] is "
"[code]true[/code]. Enabling occlusion culling has a cost on the CPU. Only "
"enable occlusion culling if you actually plan to use it. Large open scenes "
"with few or no objects blocking the view will generally not benefit much "
"from occlusion culling. Large open scenes generally benefit more from mesh "
"LOD and visibility ranges ([member "
"GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] and [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_end]) compared to occlusion culling.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to memory constraints, occlusion culling is not supported "
"by default in Web export templates. It can be enabled by compiling custom "
"Web export templates with [code]module_raycast_enabled=yes[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O descarte de oclusão (occlusion culling) pode melhorar o desempenho de "
"renderização em áreas fechadas ou semiabertas, ocultando a geometria que "
"está ocluída por outros objetos.\n"
"O sistema de descarte de oclusão é majoritariamente estático. Os "
"[OccluderInstance3D]s podem ser movidos ou ocultados em tempo de execução, "
"mas fazer isso acionará uma recompilação em segundo plano que pode levar "
"vários quadros. É recomendável mover os [OccluderInstance3D]s apenas "
"esporadicamente (por exemplo, para fins de geração procedural), em vez de "
"fazê-lo a cada quadro.\n"
"O sistema de descarte de oclusão funciona renderizando os oclusores na CPU "
"em paralelo usando o [url=https://www.embree.org/]Embree[/url], desenhando o "
"resultado em um buffer de baixa resolução e, em seguida, usando-o para "
"descartar nós 3D individualmente. No editor 3D, você pode visualizar o "
"buffer de descarte de oclusão escolhendo [b]Perspective > Display "
"Advanced... > Occlusion Culling Buffer[/b] no canto superior esquerdo da "
"viewport 3D. A qualidade do buffer de descarte de oclusão pode ser ajustada "
"nas Configurações do Projeto (Project Settings).\n"
"[b]Geração (Baking):[/b] Selecione um nó [OccluderInstance3D] e use o botão "
"[b]Bake Occluders[/b] na parte superior do editor 3D. Apenas materiais "
"opacos serão levados em consideração; materiais transparentes (com mesclagem "
"alfa ou teste alfa) serão ignorados pela geração de oclusores.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O descarte de oclusão só é eficaz se [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/occlusion_culling/use_occlusion_culling] for "
"[code]true[/code]. Habilitar o descarte de oclusão tem um custo para a CPU. "
"Habilite o descarte de oclusão apenas se você realmente planeja usá-lo. "
"Cenas abertas grandes com poucos ou nenhum objeto bloqueando a visão "
"geralmente não se beneficiam muito do descarte de oclusão. Cenas abertas "
"grandes geralmente se beneficiam mais do LOD de malha e de intervalos de "
"visibilidade ([member GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_begin] e [member "
"GeometryInstance3D.visibility_range_end]) em comparação com o descarte de "
"oclusão.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Devido a restrições de memória, o descarte de oclusão não é "
"suportado por padrão nos modelos de exportação para a Web. Ele pode ser "
"habilitado compilando modelos de exportação personalizados para a Web com "
"[code]module_raycast_enabled=yes[/code]."

#: doc/classes/OccluderInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The visual layers to account for when baking for occluders. Only "
"[MeshInstance3D]s whose [member VisualInstance3D.layers] match with this "
"[member bake_mask] will be included in the generated occluder mesh. By "
"default, all objects with [i]opaque[/i] materials are taken into account for "
"the occluder baking.\n"
"To improve performance and avoid artifacts, it is recommended to exclude "
"dynamic objects, small objects and fixtures from the baking process by "
"moving them to a separate visual layer and excluding this layer in [member "
"bake_mask]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OccluderInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The simplification distance to use for simplifying the generated occluder "
"polygon (in 3D units). Higher values result in a less detailed occluder "
"mesh, which improves performance but reduces culling accuracy.\n"
"The occluder geometry is rendered on the CPU, so it is important to keep its "
"geometry as simple as possible. Since the buffer is rendered at a low "
"resolution, less detailed occluder meshes generally still work well. The "
"default value is fairly aggressive, so you may have to decrease it if you "
"run into false negatives (objects being occluded even though they are "
"visible by the camera). A value of [code]0.01[/code] will act "
"conservatively, and will keep geometry [i]perceptually[/i] unaffected in the "
"occlusion culling buffer. Depending on the scene, a value of [code]0.01[/"
"code] may still simplify the mesh noticeably compared to disabling "
"simplification entirely.\n"
"Setting this to [code]0.0[/code] disables simplification entirely, but "
"vertices in the exact same position will still be merged. The mesh will also "
"be re-indexed to reduce both the number of vertices and indices.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This uses the [url=https://meshoptimizer.org/]meshoptimizer[/"
"url] library under the hood, similar to LOD generation."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OccluderInstance3D.xml
msgid ""
"The occluder resource for this [OccluderInstance3D]. You can generate an "
"occluder resource by selecting an [OccluderInstance3D] node then using the "
"[b]Bake Occluders[/b] button at the top of the editor.\n"
"You can also draw your own 2D occluder polygon by adding a new "
"[PolygonOccluder3D] resource to the [member occluder] property in the "
"Inspector.\n"
"Alternatively, you can select a primitive occluder to use: [QuadOccluder3D], "
"[BoxOccluder3D] or [SphereOccluder3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid "Defines a 2D polygon for LightOccluder2D."
msgstr "Define um polígono 2D para o LightOccluder2D."

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Editor facility that helps you draw a 2D polygon used as resource for "
"[LightOccluder2D]."
msgstr ""
"Facilidade do editor que ajuda a desenhar um polígono 2D usado como recurso "
"para [LightOccluder2D]."

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], closes the polygon. A closed OccluderPolygon2D "
"occludes the light coming from any direction. An opened OccluderPolygon2D "
"occludes the light only at its outline's direction."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], fecha o polígono. Um OccluderPolygon2D fechado oclui a "
"luz vinda de qualquer direção. Um OccluderPolygon2D aberto oclui a luz "
"apenas na direção do seu contorno."

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid "The culling mode to use."
msgstr "O modo de descarte a ser usado."

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid "A [Vector2] array with the index for polygon's vertices positions."
msgstr ""
"Uma matriz [Vector2] com o índice para as posições dos vértices do polígono."

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid "Culling is disabled. See [member cull_mode]."
msgstr "O descarte (culling) está desativado. Veja [member cull_mode]."

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Culling is performed in the clockwise direction. See [member cull_mode]."
msgstr ""
"O descarte é realizado no sentido horário. Consulte [member cull_mode]."

#: doc/classes/OccluderPolygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Culling is performed in the counterclockwise direction. See [member "
"cull_mode]."
msgstr ""
"O \"culling\" é realizado no sentido anti-horário. Consulte [member "
"cull_mode]."

#: modules/multiplayer/doc_classes/OfflineMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid "A [MultiplayerPeer] which is always connected and acts as a server."
msgstr ""
"Um [MultiplayerPeer] que está sempre conectado e atua como um servidor."

#: modules/multiplayer/doc_classes/OfflineMultiplayerPeer.xml
msgid ""
"This is the default [member MultiplayerAPI.multiplayer_peer] for the [member "
"Node.multiplayer]. It mimics the behavior of a server with no peers "
"connected.\n"
"This means that the [SceneTree] will act as the multiplayer authority by "
"default. Calls to [method MultiplayerAPI.is_server] will return [code]true[/"
"code], and calls to [method MultiplayerAPI.get_unique_id] will return "
"[constant MultiplayerPeer.TARGET_PEER_SERVER]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/ogg/doc_classes/OggPacketSequence.xml
msgid "A sequence of Ogg packets."
msgstr "Uma sequência de pacotes Ogg."

#: modules/ogg/doc_classes/OggPacketSequence.xml
msgid "The length of this stream, in seconds."
msgstr "O comprimento deste fluxo, em segundos."

#: modules/ogg/doc_classes/OggPacketSequence.xml
msgid "Contains the granule positions for each page in this packet sequence."
msgstr ""
"Contém as posições de granulação para cada página nesta sequência de pacotes."

#: modules/ogg/doc_classes/OggPacketSequence.xml
msgid "Contains the raw packets that make up this OggPacketSequence."
msgstr "Contém os pacotes brutos que compõem esta OggPacketSequence."

#: modules/ogg/doc_classes/OggPacketSequence.xml
msgid ""
"Holds sample rate information about this sequence. Must be set by another "
"class that actually understands the codec."
msgstr ""
"Mantém informações de taxa de amostragem sobre esta sequência. Deve ser "
"definido por outra classe que realmente entenda o codec."

#: doc/classes/OmniLight3D.xml
msgid "Omnidirectional light, such as a light bulb or a candle."
msgstr "Luz onidirecional, como uma lâmpada ou uma vela."

#: doc/classes/OmniLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"An Omnidirectional light is a type of [Light3D] that emits light in all "
"directions. The light is attenuated by distance and this attenuation can be "
"configured by changing its energy, radius, and attenuation parameters.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile rendering method, only 8 omni lights can "
"be displayed on each mesh resource. Attempting to display more than 8 omni "
"lights on a single mesh resource will result in omni lights flickering in "
"and out as the camera moves. When using the Compatibility rendering method, "
"only 8 omni lights can be displayed on each mesh resource by default, but "
"this can be increased by adjusting [member ProjectSettings.rendering/limits/"
"opengl/max_lights_per_object].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Mobile or Compatibility rendering methods, omni "
"lights will only correctly affect meshes whose visibility AABB intersects "
"with the light's AABB. If using a shader to deform the mesh in a way that "
"makes it go outside its AABB, [member GeometryInstance3D.extra_cull_margin] "
"must be increased on the mesh. Otherwise, the light may not be visible on "
"the mesh."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OmniLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Controls the distance attenuation function for omnilights.\n"
"A value of [code]0.0[/code] will maintain a constant brightness through most "
"of the range, but smoothly attenuate the light at the edge of the range. Use "
"a value of [code]2.0[/code] for physically accurate lights as it results in "
"the proper inverse square attenutation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting attenuation to [code]2.0[/code] or higher may result in "
"distant objects receiving minimal light, even within range. For example, "
"with a range of [code]4096[/code], an object at [code]100[/code] units is "
"attenuated by a factor of [code]0.0001[/code]. With a default brightness of "
"[code]1[/code], the light would not be visible at that distance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Using negative or values higher than [code]10.0[/code] may lead "
"to unexpected results."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OmniLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"The light's radius. Note that the effectively lit area may appear to be "
"smaller depending on the [member omni_attenuation] in use. No matter the "
"[member omni_attenuation] in use, the light will never reach anything "
"outside this radius.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member omni_range] is not affected by [member Node3D.scale] "
"(the light's scale or its parent's scale)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OmniLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Shadows are rendered to a dual-paraboloid texture. Faster than [constant "
"SHADOW_CUBE], but lower-quality."
msgstr ""
"As sombras são renderizadas para uma textura de parabolóide duplo. Mais "
"rápido que [constant SHADOW_CUBE], mas de menor qualidade."

#: doc/classes/OmniLight3D.xml
msgid ""
"Shadows are rendered to a cubemap. Slower than [constant "
"SHADOW_DUAL_PARABOLOID], but higher-quality."
msgstr ""
"As sombras são renderizadas para um cubemap. Mais lento que [constant "
"SHADOW_DUAL_PARABOLOID], mas de maior qualidade."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid "An OpenXR action."
msgstr "Uma ação OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid ""
"This resource defines an OpenXR action. Actions can be used both for inputs "
"(buttons, joysticks, triggers, etc.) and outputs (haptics).\n"
"OpenXR performs automatic conversion between action type and input type "
"whenever possible. An analog trigger bound to a boolean action will thus "
"return [code]false[/code] if the trigger is depressed and [code]true[/code] "
"if pressed fully.\n"
"Actions are not directly bound to specific devices, instead OpenXR "
"recognizes a limited number of top level paths that identify devices by "
"usage. We can restrict which devices an action can be bound to by these top "
"level paths. For instance an action that should only be used for hand held "
"controllers can have the top level paths \"/user/hand/left\" and \"/user/"
"hand/right\" associated with them. See the [url=https://www.khronos.org/"
"registry/OpenXR/specs/1.0/html/xrspec.html#semantic-path-reserved]reserved "
"path section in the OpenXR specification[/url] for more info on the top "
"level paths.\n"
"Note that the name of the resource is used to register the action with."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid "The type of action."
msgstr "O tipo de ação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid "The localized description of this action."
msgstr "A descrição localizada desta ação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid "A collections of toplevel paths to which this action can be bound."
msgstr ""
"Uma coleção de caminhos de nível superior aos quais esta ação pode ser "
"vinculada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid "This action provides a boolean value."
msgstr "Esta ação fornece um valor booleano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid ""
"This action provides a float value between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/"
"code] for any analog input such as triggers."
msgstr ""
"Esta ação fornece um valor de ponto flutuante entre [code]0.0[/code] e "
"[code]1.0[/code] para qualquer entrada analógica, como gatilhos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAction.xml
msgid ""
"This action provides a [Vector2] value and can be bound to embedded "
"trackpads and joysticks."
msgstr ""
"Esta ação fornece um valor [Vector2] e pode ser vinculada a trackpads e "
"joysticks embutidos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"Binding modifier that applies on individual actions related to an "
"interaction profile."
msgstr ""
"Modificador de vinculação que se aplica a ações individuais relacionadas a "
"um perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid ""
"Collection of [OpenXRActionSet] and [OpenXRInteractionProfile] resources for "
"the OpenXR module."
msgstr ""
"Coleção de recursos [OpenXRActionSet] e [OpenXRInteractionProfile] para o "
"módulo OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid ""
"OpenXR uses an action system similar to Godots Input map system to bind "
"inputs and outputs on various types of XR controllers to named actions. "
"OpenXR specifies more detail on these inputs and outputs than Godot "
"supports.\n"
"Another important distinction is that OpenXR offers no control over these "
"bindings. The bindings we register are suggestions, it is up to the XR "
"runtime to offer users the ability to change these bindings. This allows the "
"XR runtime to fill in the gaps if new hardware becomes available.\n"
"The action map therefore needs to be loaded at startup and can't be changed "
"afterwards. This resource is a container for the entire action map."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Add an action set."
msgstr "Adicionar um conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Add an interaction profile."
msgstr "Adicione um perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Setup this action set with our default actions."
msgstr "Configura este conjunto de ações com nossas ações padrão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Retrieve an action set by name."
msgstr "Recuperar um conjunto de ações por nome."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Find an interaction profile by its name (path)."
msgstr "Encontra um perfil de interação pelo seu nome (caminho)."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Retrieve the action set at this index."
msgstr "Recupera o conjunto de ações neste índice."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Retrieve the number of actions sets in our action map."
msgstr "Recupera o número de conjuntos de ações em nosso mapa de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Get the interaction profile at this index."
msgstr "Obtém o perfil de interação neste índice."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Retrieve the number of interaction profiles in our action map."
msgstr "Recupera o número de perfis de interação em nosso mapa de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Remove an action set."
msgstr "Remove um conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Remove an interaction profile."
msgstr "Remove um perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid "Collection of [OpenXRActionSet]s that are part of this action map."
msgstr ""
"Coleção de recursos [OpenXRActionSet] que fazem parte deste mapa de ação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionMap.xml
msgid ""
"Collection of [OpenXRInteractionProfile]s that are part of this action map."
msgstr ""
"Coleção de [OpenXRInteractionProfile]s que fazem parte deste mapa de ação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid "Collection of [OpenXRAction] resources that make up an action set."
msgstr "Coleção de recursos [OpenXRAction] que compõem um conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid ""
"Action sets in OpenXR define a collection of actions that can be activated "
"in unison. This allows games to easily change between different states that "
"require different inputs or need to reinterpret inputs. For instance we "
"could have an action set that is active when a menu is open, an action set "
"that is active when the player is freely walking around and an action set "
"that is active when the player is controlling a vehicle.\n"
"Action sets can contain the same action with the same name, if such action "
"sets are active at the same time the action set with the highest priority "
"defines which binding is active."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid "Add an action to this action set."
msgstr "Adiciona uma ação a este conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid "Retrieve the number of actions in our action set."
msgstr "Recupera o número de ações em nosso conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid "Remove an action from this action set."
msgstr "Remove uma ação deste conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid "Collection of actions for this action set."
msgstr "Coleção de ações para este conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid "The localized name of this action set."
msgstr "O nome localizado deste conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRActionSet.xml
msgid "The priority for this action set."
msgstr "A prioridade para este conjunto de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnalogThresholdModifier.xml
msgid ""
"The analog threshold binding modifier can modify a float input to a boolean "
"input with specified thresholds."
msgstr ""
"O modificador de binding de limite analógico pode modificar uma entrada de "
"ponto flutuante para uma entrada booleana com limites especificados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnalogThresholdModifier.xml
msgid ""
"The analog threshold binding modifier can modify a float input to a boolean "
"input with specified thresholds.\n"
"See [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/"
"xrspec.html#XR_VALVE_analog_threshold]XR_VALVE_analog_threshold[/url] for in-"
"depth details."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnalogThresholdModifier.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid "Haptic pulse to emit when the user releases the input."
msgstr "Pulso háptico a ser emitido quando o usuário libera a entrada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnalogThresholdModifier.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"When our input value falls below this, our output becomes [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Quando nosso valor de entrada cai abaixo disso, nossa saída se torna "
"[code]false[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnalogThresholdModifier.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid "Haptic pulse to emit when the user presses the input."
msgstr "Pulso háptico a ser emitido quando o usuário pressiona a entrada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnalogThresholdModifier.xml
msgid ""
"When our input value is equal or larger than this value, our output becomes "
"[code]true[/code]. It stays [code]true[/code] until it falls under the "
"[member off_threshold] value."
msgstr ""
"Quando nosso valor de entrada for igual ou maior que este valor, nossa saída "
"se tornará [code]true[/code]. Ela permanece [code]true[/code] até cair "
"abaixo do valor de [member off_threshold]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnchorTracker.xml
msgid "Positional tracker for our spatial entity anchor extension."
msgstr ""
"Rastreador posicional para nossa extensão de âncora de entidade espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnchorTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Positional tracker for our OpenXR spatial entity anchor extension, it tracks "
"a user defined location in real space and maps it to our virtual space."
msgstr ""
"Rastreador posicional para nossa extensão de âncora de entidade espacial "
"OpenXR, ele rastreia um local definido pelo usuário no espaço real e o "
"mapeia para o nosso espaço virtual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnchorTracker.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if a non-zero UUID is set."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se um UUID diferente de zero estiver definido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnchorTracker.xml
msgid "The UUID provided for persistent anchors."
msgstr "O UUID fornecido para âncoras persistentes."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAnchorTracker.xml
msgid "Emitted when the UUID for this anchor was changed."
msgstr "Emitido quando o UUID para esta âncora foi alterado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Wraps the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/"
"xrspec.html#XR_KHR_android_thread_settings]XR_KHR_android_thread_settings[/"
"url] extension."
msgstr ""
"Envolve a extensão [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/"
"xrspec.html#XR_KHR_android_thread_settings]XR_KHR_android_thread_settings[/"
"url]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"For XR to be comfortable, it is important for applications to deliver frames "
"quickly and consistently. In order to make sure the important application "
"threads get their full share of time, these threads must be identified to "
"the system, which will adjust their scheduling priority accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Para que o XR seja confortável, é importante que os aplicativos entreguem "
"quadros de forma rápida e consistente. Para garantir que as threads "
"importantes do aplicativo recebam sua parcela completa de tempo, essas "
"threads devem ser identificadas ao sistema, que ajustará sua prioridade de "
"agendamento de acordo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the thread type of the given thread, so that the XR runtime can adjust "
"its scheduling priority accordingly.\n"
"[param thread_id] refers to the OS thread id (ie from [code]gettid()[/"
"code]). When [param thread_id] is [code]0[/code], it will set the thread "
"type of the current thread.\n"
"[b]NOTE:[/b] The id returned by [method Thread.get_id] is incompatible with "
"[param thread_id]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing time critical CPU tasks."
msgstr ""
"Dá dicas ao tempo de execução XR de que a thread está realizando tarefas de "
"CPU críticas para o tempo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid "Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing background CPU tasks."
msgstr ""
"Dá dicas ao tempo de execução XR de que a thread está realizando tarefas de "
"CPU em segundo plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing time critical graphics "
"device tasks."
msgstr ""
"Indica ao tempo de execução XR que a thread está realizando tarefas de "
"dispositivos gráficos críticos para o tempo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAndroidThreadSettingsExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Hints to the XR runtime that the thread is doing background graphics device "
"tasks."
msgstr ""
"Indica ao tempo de execução XR que a thread está realizando tarefas de "
"dispositivos gráficos em segundo plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Makes the OpenXR API available for GDExtension."
msgstr "Torna a API do OpenXR disponível para GDExtension."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"[OpenXRAPIExtension] makes OpenXR available for GDExtension. It provides the "
"OpenXR API to GDExtension through the [method get_instance_proc_addr] "
"method, and the OpenXR instance through [method get_instance].\n"
"It also provides methods for querying the status of OpenXR initialization, "
"and helper methods for ease of use of the API with GDExtension."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "XrResult documentation"
msgstr "Documentação do XrResult"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "XrInstance documentation"
msgstr "Documentação do XrInstance"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "XrSpace documentation"
msgstr "Documentação do XrSpace"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "XrSession documentation"
msgstr "Documentação do XrSession"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "XrSystemId documentation"
msgstr "Documentação do XrSystemId"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "xrBeginSession documentation"
msgstr "Documentação do xrBeginSession"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "XrPosef documentation"
msgstr "Documentação do XrPosef"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the corresponding [code]XrAction[/code] OpenXR handle for the given "
"action RID."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o identificador OpenXR correspondente [code]XrAction[/code] para o "
"RID de ação fornecido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Begins a new debug label region, this label will be reported in debug "
"messages for any calls following this until [method end_debug_label_region] "
"is called. Debug labels can be stacked."
msgstr ""
"Inicia uma nova região de rótulo de depuração; este rótulo será relatado em "
"mensagens de depuração para quaisquer chamadas seguintes até que [method "
"end_debug_label_region] seja chamado. Rótulos de depuração podem ser "
"empilhados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR is initialized for rendering with an XR "
"viewport."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o OpenXR estiver inicializado para renderização "
"com uma viewport XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Marks the end of a debug label region. Removes the latest debug label region "
"added by calling [method begin_debug_label_region]."
msgstr ""
"Marca o fim de uma região de rótulo de depuração. Remove a última região de "
"rótulo de depuração adicionada chamando [method begin_debug_label_region]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [RID] corresponding to an [code]Action[/code] of a matching "
"name, optionally limited to a specified action set."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] correspondente a uma [code]Action[/code] de um nome "
"correspondente, opcionalmente limitada a um conjunto de ações especificado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an error string for the given [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrResult.html]XrResult[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma string de erro para o [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/man/html/XrResult.html]XrResult[/url] fornecido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the corresponding [code]XRHandTrackerEXT[/code] handle for the given "
"hand index value."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o identificador [code]XRHandTrackerEXT[/code] correspondente para o "
"valor de índice de mão fornecido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/"
"XrInstance.html]XrInstance[/url] created during the initialization of the "
"OpenXR API."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/"
"XrInstance.html]XrInstance[/url] criado durante a inicialização da API "
"OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the function pointer of the OpenXR function with the specified name, "
"cast to an integer. If the function with the given name does not exist, the "
"method returns [code]0[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [code]openxr/util.h[/code] contains utility macros for "
"acquiring OpenXR functions, e.g. "
"[code]GDEXTENSION_INIT_XR_FUNC_V(xrCreateAction)[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the predicted display timing for the next frame."
msgstr "Retorna o tempo de exibição previsto para o próximo quadro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the version of OpenXR that was initialized. Only valid after the "
"OpenXR instance has been created. See [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/xrspec.html#XR_MAKE_VERSION]XR_MAKE_VERSION[/url] for "
"how the version is calculated."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a versão do OpenXR que foi inicializada. Válido apenas após a "
"criação da instância do OpenXR. Consulte [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/xrspec.html#XR_MAKE_VERSION]XR_MAKE_VERSION[/url] para "
"saber como a versão é calculada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the play space, which is an [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/man/html/XrSpace.html]XrSpace[/url] cast to an integer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o espaço de reprodução, que é um [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrSpace.html]XrSpace[/url] convertido para um "
"inteiro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the predicted display timing for the current frame."
msgstr "Retorna o tempo de exibição previsto para o quadro atual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a pointer to the render state's [code]XrCompositionLayerProjection[/"
"code] struct.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should only be called from the rendering thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the far boundary value of the camera frustum.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only accessible in the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the near boundary value of the camera frustum.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is only accessible in the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the OpenXR session, which is an [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrSession.html]XrSession[/url] cast to an integer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a sessão OpenXR, que é um [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/man/html/XrSession.html]XrSession[/url] convertido para um inteiro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns an array of supported swapchain formats."
msgstr "Retorna um array de formatos de swapchain suportados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the name of the specified swapchain format."
msgstr "Retorna o nome do formato de cadeia de trocas especificado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the system, which is an [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrSystemId.html]XrSystemId[/url] cast to an "
"integer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID do sistema, que é um [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/man/html/XrSystemId.html]XrSystemId[/url] convertido para um "
"inteiro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the view configuration type, which is an [url=https://"
"registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/"
"XrViewConfigurationType.html]XrViewConfigurationType[/url] cast to an "
"integer."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo de configuração de exibição, que é um [url=https://"
"registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/"
"XrViewConfigurationType.html]XrViewConfigurationType[/url] convertido para "
"um inteiro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of views. It is usually two, one for each eye, but may "
"differ with different view configurations."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de visões. Geralmente são duas, uma para cada olho, mas "
"pode diferir com diferentes configurações de visão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Inserts a debug label, this label is reported in any debug message resulting "
"from the OpenXR calls that follows, until any of [method "
"begin_debug_label_region], [method end_debug_label_region], or [method "
"insert_debug_label] is called."
msgstr ""
"Insere um rótulo de depuração; este rótulo é relatado em qualquer mensagem "
"de depuração resultante das chamadas do OpenXR que se seguem, até que "
"qualquer um de [method begin_debug_label_region], [method "
"end_debug_label_region] ou [method insert_debug_label] seja chamado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [enum OpenXRAPIExtension.OpenXRAlphaBlendModeSupport] denoting if "
"[constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] is really supported, "
"emulated or not supported at all."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [enum OpenXRAPIExtension.OpenXRAlphaBlendModeSupport] denotando se "
"[constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] é realmente suportado, "
"emulado ou não suportado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR is initialized."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o OpenXR estiver inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR is running ([url=https://"
"registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/"
"xrBeginSession.html]xrBeginSession[/url] was successfully called and the "
"swapchains were created)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o OpenXR estiver em execução ([url=https://"
"registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/"
"xrBeginSession.html]xrBeginSession[/url] foi chamado com sucesso e os "
"swapchains foram criados)."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR is enabled."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se o OpenXR estiver ativado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Acquires the image of the provided swapchain."
msgstr "Adquire a imagem do swapchain fornecido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a pointer to a new swapchain created using the provided parameters."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um ponteiro para uma nova swapchain criada usando os parâmetros "
"fornecidos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Destroys the provided swapchain and frees it from memory."
msgstr "Destriói a cadeia de trocas fornecida e a libera da memória."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the RID of the provided swapchain's image."
msgstr "Retorna o RID da imagem do swapchain fornecida."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the [code]XrSwapchain[/code] handle of the provided swapchain."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o identificador [code]XrSwapchain[/code] do swapchain fornecido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Releases the image of the provided swapchain."
msgstr "Libera a imagem do swapchain fornecido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the given extension as a composition layer provider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called after the OpenXR session has started. "
"However, it can be called in [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper._on_session_created]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the given extension as modifying frame info via the [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper._set_frame_wait_info_and_get_next_pointer], [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper._set_view_locate_info_and_get_next_pointer], or "
"[method OpenXRExtensionWrapper._set_frame_end_info_and_get_next_pointer] "
"virtual methods.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called after the OpenXR session has started. "
"However, it can be called in [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper._on_session_created]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the given extension as modifying "
"[code]XrCompositionLayerProjection[/code] via the [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper._set_projection_layer_and_get_next_pointer] virtual "
"method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called after the OpenXR session has started. "
"However, it can be called in [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper._on_session_created]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the given extension as a provider of additional data structures to "
"projections views.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called after the OpenXR session has started. "
"However, it can be called in [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper._on_session_created]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the reference space used by OpenXR to the given [url=https://"
"registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrSpace.html]XrSpace[/url] "
"(cast to a [code]void *[/code])."
msgstr ""
"Define o espaço de referência usado pelo OpenXR para o [url=https://"
"registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrSpace.html]XrSpace[/url] "
"fornecido (convertido para um [code]void *[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], an OpenXR extension is loaded which is capable "
"of emulating the [constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] blend "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code], uma extensão OpenXR é carregada, capaz "
"de emular o modo de mesclagem [constant "
"XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Set the object name of an OpenXR object, used for debug output. [param "
"object_type] must be a valid OpenXR [code]XrObjectType[/code] enum and "
"[param object_handle] must be a valid OpenXR object handle."
msgstr ""
"Define o nome de objeto de um objeto OpenXR, usado para saída de depuração. "
"[param object_type] deve ser um enum [code]XrObjectType[/code] válido do "
"OpenXR e [param object_handle] deve ser um identificador de objeto OpenXR "
"válido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the render region to [param render_region], overriding the normal "
"render target's rect."
msgstr ""
"Define a região de renderização para [param render_region], substituindo o "
"retângulo normal do alvo de renderização."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Sets the render target of the velocity depth texture."
msgstr ""
"Define o alvo de renderização da textura de profundidade de velocidade."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Sets the target size of the velocity and velocity depth textures."
msgstr ""
"Define o tamanho alvo das texturas de velocidade e profundidade de "
"velocidade."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid "Sets the render target of the velocity texture."
msgstr "Define o alvo de renderização da textura de velocidade."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a [Transform3D] from an [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/man/html/XrPosef.html]XrPosef[/url]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um [Transform3D] a partir de um [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrPosef.html]XrPosef[/url]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Unregisters the given extension as a composition layer provider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called while the OpenXR session is still running."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Unregisters the given extension as modifying frame info.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called while the OpenXR session is still running."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Unregisters the given extension as modifying "
"[code]XrCompositionLayerProjection[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called while the OpenXR session is still running."
msgstr ""
"Desregistra a extensão fornecida como modificadora de "
"[code]XrCompositionLayerProjection[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso não pode ser chamado enquanto a sessão do OpenXR ainda "
"estiver em execução."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Unregisters the given extension as a provider of additional data structures "
"to projections views.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called while the OpenXR session is still running."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Request the recommended resolution from the OpenXR runtime and update the "
"main swapchain size if it has changed."
msgstr ""
"Solicita a resolução recomendada do tempo de execução do OpenXR e atualiza o "
"tamanho da cadeia de troca principal caso tenha mudado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the provided [url=https://registry.khronos.org/"
"OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/XrResult.html]XrResult[/url] (cast to an integer) "
"is successful. Otherwise returns [code]false[/code] and prints the "
"[url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/html/"
"XrResult.html]XrResult[/url] converted to a string, with the specified "
"additional information."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/man/html/XrResult.html]XrResult[/url] fornecido (convertido para "
"um número inteiro) for bem-sucedido. Caso contrário, retorna [code]false[/"
"code] e imprime o [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.0/man/"
"html/XrResult.html]XrResult[/url] convertido para uma string, com as "
"informações adicionais especificadas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Means that [constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] isn't "
"supported at all."
msgstr ""
"Significa que [constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] não é "
"suportado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Means that [constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] is really "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"Significa que [constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] é "
"realmente suportado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRAPIExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Means that [constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] is emulated."
msgstr ""
"Significa que [constant XRInterface.XR_ENV_BLEND_MODE_ALPHA_BLEND] é emulado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifier.xml
msgid "Binding modifier base class."
msgstr "Classe base do modificador de vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"Binding modifier base class. Subclasses implement various modifiers that "
"alter how an OpenXR runtime processes inputs."
msgstr ""
"Classe base de modificadores de vínculo. As subclasses implementam vários "
"modificadores que alteram a forma como um tempo de execução OpenXR processa "
"entradas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"Return the description of this class that is used for the title bar of the "
"binding modifier editor."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a descrição desta classe que é usada para a barra de título do "
"editor de modificadores de vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the data that is sent to OpenXR when submitting the suggested "
"interacting bindings this modifier is a part of.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This must be data compatible with an "
"[code]XrBindingModificationBaseHeaderKHR[/code] structure."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifierEditor.xml
msgid "Binding modifier editor."
msgstr "Editor de modificadores de atalho."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifierEditor.xml
msgid ""
"This is the default binding modifier editor used in the OpenXR action map."
msgstr ""
"Este é o editor de modificadores de vinculação padrão usado no mapa de ações "
"do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifierEditor.xml
msgid "Returns the [OpenXRBindingModifier] currently being edited."
msgstr "Retorna o [OpenXRBindingModifier] sendo editado no momento."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifierEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Setup this editor for the provided [param action_map] and [param "
"binding_modifier]."
msgstr ""
"Configura este editor para o [param action_map] e o [param binding_modifier] "
"fornecidos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRBindingModifierEditor.xml
msgid ""
"Signal emitted when the user presses the delete binding modifier button for "
"this modifier."
msgstr ""
"Sinal emitido quando o usuário pressiona o botão de deletar modificador de "
"atribuição para este modificador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "The parent class of all OpenXR composition layer nodes."
msgstr "A classe pai de todos os nós de camada de composição OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Composition layers allow 2D viewports to be displayed inside of the headset "
"by the XR compositor through special projections that retain their quality. "
"This allows for rendering clear text while keeping the layer at a native "
"resolution.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the OpenXR runtime doesn't support the given composition "
"layer type, a fallback mesh can be generated with a [ViewportTexture], in "
"order to emulate the composition layer."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [JavaObject] representing an [code]android.view.Surface[/code] if "
"[member use_android_surface] is enabled and OpenXR has created the surface. "
"Otherwise, this will return [code]null[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The surface can only be created during an active OpenXR "
"session. So, if [member use_android_surface] is enabled outside of an OpenXR "
"session, it won't be created until a new session fully starts."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns UV coordinates where the given ray intersects with the composition "
"layer. [param origin] and [param direction] must be in global space.\n"
"Returns [code]Vector2(-1.0, -1.0)[/code] if the ray doesn't intersect."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the OpenXR runtime natively supports this "
"composition layer type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will only return an accurate result after the OpenXR "
"session has started."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o runtime do OpenXR oferecer suporte nativo a "
"este tipo de camada de composição.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso só retornará um resultado preciso após o início da sessão "
"do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Enables the blending the layer using its alpha channel.\n"
"Can be combined with [member Viewport.transparent_bg] to give the layer a "
"transparent background."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The size of the Android surface to create if [member use_android_surface] is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"O tamanho da superfície Android a ser criada se [member use_android_surface] "
"estiver ativado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Enables a technique called \"hole punching\", which allows putting the "
"composition layer behind the main projection layer (i.e. setting [member "
"sort_order] to a negative value) while \"punching a hole\" through "
"everything rendered by Godot so that the layer is still visible.\n"
"This can be used to create the illusion that the composition layer exists in "
"the same 3D space as everything rendered by Godot, allowing objects to "
"appear to pass both behind or in front of the composition layer."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The eye(s) the composition layer is visible to.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Not all composition layer types or runtimes support restricting "
"visibility to a single eye."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "The [SubViewport] to render on the composition layer."
msgstr "O [SubViewport] a ser renderizado na camada de composição."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, the OpenXR swapchain will be created with the "
"[code]XR_SWAPCHAIN_CREATE_PROTECTED_CONTENT_BIT[/code] flag, which will "
"protect its contents from CPU access.\n"
"When used with an Android Surface, this may allow DRM content to be "
"presented, and will only take effect when the Surface is first created; "
"later changes to this property will have no effect."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The sort order for this composition layer. Higher numbers will be shown in "
"front of lower numbers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will have no effect if a fallback mesh is being used."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The swizzle value for the alpha channel of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The swizzle value for the blue channel of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The border color of the swapchain state that is used when the wrap mode "
"clamps to the border.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The swizzle value for the green channel of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The horizontal wrap mode of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The magnification filter of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The max anisotropy of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The minification filter of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The mipmap mode of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The swizzle value for the red channel of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"The vertical wrap mode of the swapchain state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property only has an effect on devices that support the "
"OpenXR XR_FB_swapchain_update_state OpenGLES/Vulkan extensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, an Android surface will be created (with the dimensions from "
"[member android_surface_size]) which will provide the 2D content for the "
"composition layer, rather than using [member layer_viewport].\n"
"See [method get_android_surface] for information about how to get the "
"surface so that your application can draw to it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This will only work in Android builds."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Perform nearest-neighbor filtering when sampling the texture."
msgstr "Executa a filtragem de vizinho mais próximo ao amostrar a textura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Perform linear filtering when sampling the texture."
msgstr "Executa filtragem linear ao amostrar a textura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Perform cubic filtering when sampling the texture."
msgstr "Executa filtragem cúbica ao amostrar a textura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Disable mipmapping.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Mipmapping can only be disabled in the Compatibility renderer."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Use the mipmap of the nearest resolution."
msgstr "Use o mipmap da resolução mais próxima."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Use linear interpolation of the two mipmaps of the nearest resolution."
msgstr "Usa interpolação linear dos dois Mipmaps da resolução mais próxima."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Clamp the texture to its specified border color."
msgstr "Limita a textura à sua cor de borda especificada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Clamp the texture to its edge color."
msgstr "Limita a textura à sua cor de borda."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Repeat the texture infinitely."
msgstr "Repete a textura infinitamente."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Repeat the texture infinitely, mirroring it on each repeat."
msgstr "Repete a textura infinitamente, espelhando-a a cada repetição."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid ""
"Mirror the texture once and then clamp the texture to its edge color.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This wrap mode is not available in the Compatibility renderer."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Maps a color channel to the value of the red channel."
msgstr "Mapeia um canal de cor para o valor do canal vermelho."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Maps a color channel to the value of the green channel."
msgstr "Mapeia um canal de cor para o valor do canal verde."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Maps a color channel to the value of the blue channel."
msgstr "Mapeia um canal de cor para o valor do canal azul."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Maps a color channel to the value of the alpha channel."
msgstr "Mapeia um canal de cor para o valor do canal alfa."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Maps a color channel to the value of zero."
msgstr "Mapeia um canal de cor para o valor de zero."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "Maps a color channel to the value of one."
msgstr "Mapeia um canal de cor para o valor de um."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "The layer is visible to both the left and right eyes."
msgstr "A camada é visível tanto para o olho esquerdo quanto para o direito."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "The layer is visible only to the left eye."
msgstr "A camada é visível apenas para o olho esquerdo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayer.xml
msgid "The layer is visible only to the right eye."
msgstr "A camada é visível apenas para o olho direito."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerCylinder.xml
msgid ""
"An OpenXR composition layer that is rendered as an internal slice of a "
"cylinder."
msgstr ""
"Uma camada de composição OpenXR que é renderizada como uma fatia interna de "
"um cilindro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerCylinder.xml
msgid ""
"An OpenXR composition layer that allows rendering a [SubViewport] on an "
"internal slice of a cylinder."
msgstr ""
"Uma camada de composição do OpenXR que permite renderizar um [SubViewport] "
"em uma fatia interna de um cilindro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerCylinder.xml
msgid ""
"The aspect ratio of the slice. Used to set the height relative to the width."
msgstr ""
"A proporção de aspecto da fatia. Usada para definir a altura em relação à "
"largura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerCylinder.xml
msgid "The central angle of the cylinder. Used to set the width."
msgstr "O ângulo central do cilindro. Usado para definir a largura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerCylinder.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerEquirect.xml
msgid "The number of segments to use in the fallback mesh."
msgstr "O número de segmentos a serem usados na malha de fallback."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerEquirect.xml
msgid ""
"An OpenXR composition layer that is rendered as an internal slice of a "
"sphere."
msgstr ""
"Uma camada de composição OpenXR que é renderizada como uma fatia interna de "
"uma esfera."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerEquirect.xml
msgid ""
"An OpenXR composition layer that allows rendering a [SubViewport] on an "
"internal slice of a sphere."
msgstr ""
"Uma camada de composição do OpenXR que permite renderizar um [SubViewport] "
"em uma fatia interna de uma esfera."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerEquirect.xml
msgid "The central horizontal angle of the sphere. Used to set the width."
msgstr "O ângulo horizontal central da esfera. Usado para definir a largura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerEquirect.xml
msgid ""
"The lower vertical angle of the sphere. Used (together with [member "
"upper_vertical_angle]) to set the height."
msgstr ""
"O ângulo vertical inferior da esfera. Usado (junto com [member "
"upper_vertical_angle]) para definir a altura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerEquirect.xml
msgid "The radius of the sphere."
msgstr "O raio da esfera."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerEquirect.xml
msgid ""
"The upper vertical angle of the sphere. Used (together with [member "
"lower_vertical_angle]) to set the height."
msgstr ""
"O ângulo vertical superior da esfera. Usado (junto com [member "
"lower_vertical_angle]) para definir a altura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerQuad.xml
msgid "An OpenXR composition layer that is rendered as a quad."
msgstr "Uma camada de composição OpenXR que é renderizada como um quadrado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerQuad.xml
msgid ""
"An OpenXR composition layer that allows rendering a [SubViewport] on a quad."
msgstr ""
"Uma camada de composição OpenXR que permite renderizar um [SubViewport] em "
"um \"quad\"."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRCompositionLayerQuad.xml
msgid "The dimensions of the quad."
msgstr "As dimensões do quadrado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid "The DPad binding modifier converts an axis input to a dpad output."
msgstr ""
"O modificador de vínculo DPad converte uma entrada de eixo em uma saída de "
"dpad."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"The DPad binding modifier converts an axis input to a dpad output, emulating "
"a DPad. New input paths for each dpad direction will be added to the "
"interaction profile. When bound to actions the DPad emulation will be "
"activated. You should [b]not[/b] combine dpad inputs with normal inputs in "
"the same action set for the same control, this will result in an error being "
"returned when suggested bindings are submitted to OpenXR.\n"
"See [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/"
"xrspec.html#XR_EXT_dpad_binding]XR_EXT_dpad_binding[/url] for in-depth "
"details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the DPad binding modifier extension is enabled, all dpad "
"binding paths will be available in the action map. Adding the modifier to an "
"interaction profile allows you to further customize the behavior."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid "Action set for which this dpad binding modifier is active."
msgstr ""
"Conjunto de ações para o qual este modificador de atalho de direcional está "
"ativo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"Center region in which our center position of our dpad return [code]true[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Região central na qual nossa posição central do nosso dpad retorna "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid "Input path for this dpad binding modifier."
msgstr "Caminho de entrada para este modificador de vinculação de direcional."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], when the joystick enters a new dpad zone this becomes "
"[code]true[/code].\n"
"If [code]true[/code], when the joystick remains in active dpad zone, this "
"remains [code]true[/code] even if we overlap with another zone."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"When our input value is equal or larger than this value, our dpad in that "
"direction becomes [code]true[/code]. It stays [code]true[/code] until it "
"falls under the [member threshold_released] value."
msgstr ""
"Quando nosso valor de entrada for igual ou maior que este valor, nosso dpad "
"nessa direção se tornará [code]true[/code]. Ele permanece [code]true[/code] "
"até cair abaixo do valor [member threshold_released]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRDpadBindingModifier.xml
msgid ""
"The angle of each wedge that identifies the 4 directions of the emulated "
"dpad."
msgstr "O ângulo de cada cunha que identifica as 4 direções do dpad emulado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension.xml
msgid "Allows implementing OpenXR extensions with GDExtension."
msgstr "Permite implementar extensões OpenXR com GDExtension."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"[OpenXRExtensionWrapper] allows implementing OpenXR extensions with "
"GDExtension. The extension should be registered with [method "
"register_extension_wrapper].\n"
"When [OpenXRInterface] is initialized as the primary interface and any "
"[Viewport] has [member Viewport.use_xr] set to [code]true[/code], OpenXR "
"will become involved in Godot's rendering process. If [member "
"ProjectSettings.rendering/driver/threads/thread_model] is set to "
"\"Separate\", Godot's renderer will run on its own thread, and special care "
"must be taken in all [OpenXRExtensionWrapper]s in order to prevent crashes "
"or unexpected behavior. Some virtual methods will be called on the render "
"thread, and any data they access should not be directly written to on the "
"main thread. This is to prevent two potential issues:\n"
"1. Changes intended for the next frame, taking effect on the current frame. "
"When using the \"Separate\" thread model, the main thread will immediately "
"start working on the next frame while the render thread may still be "
"rendering the current frame. If the main thread changes anything used by the "
"render thread directly, the change could end up being used one frame earlier "
"than intended.\n"
"2. Reading and writing to the same data at the same time from different "
"threads can lead to the render thread using data in an invalid state.\n"
"In most cases, the solution is to use [method "
"RenderingServer.call_on_render_thread] to schedule [Callable]s to write to "
"any data used on the render thread. When using the \"Separate\" thread "
"model, these [Callable]s will run after the renderer finishes the current "
"frame and before it starts rendering the next frame. When not using this "
"mode, they'll run immediately, so it's recommended to always use [method "
"RenderingServer.call_on_render_thread] in these cases, which will allow your "
"code to do the right thing regardless of the thread model.\n"
"Any virtual methods that run on the render thread will be noted below."
msgstr ""
"O [OpenXRExtensionWrapper] permite implementar extensões OpenXR com "
"GDExtension. A extensão deve ser registrada com [method "
"register_extension_wrapper].\n"
"Quando o [OpenXRInterface] é inicializado como a interface primária e "
"qualquer [Viewport] tem [member Viewport.use_xr] definido como [code]true[/"
"code], o OpenXR passará a fazer parte do processo de renderização do Godot. "
"Se [member ProjectSettings.rendering/driver/threads/thread_model] estiver "
"definido como \"Separate\", o renderizador do Godot será executado em sua "
"própria thread, e um cuidado especial deve ser tomado em todos os "
"[OpenXRExtensionWrapper]s para evitar travamentos ou comportamentos "
"inesperados. Alguns métodos virtuais serão chamados na thread de "
"renderização, e quaisquer dados acessados por eles não devem ser gravados "
"diretamente na thread principal. Isso serve para evitar dois problemas "
"potenciais:\n"
"1. Alterações destinadas ao próximo quadro entram em vigor no quadro atual. "
"Ao usar o modelo de thread \"Separate\", a thread principal começará "
"imediatamente a trabalhar no próximo quadro, enquanto a thread de "
"renderização ainda pode estar renderizando o quadro atual. Se a thread "
"principal alterar diretamente qualquer coisa usada pela thread de "
"renderização, a alteração pode acabar sendo usada um quadro antes do "
"pretendido.\n"
"2. Ler e gravar nos mesmos dados ao mesmo tempo a partir de threads "
"diferentes pode fazer com que a thread de renderização use dados em um "
"estado inválido.\n"
"Na maioria dos casos, a solução é usar [method "
"RenderingServer.call_on_render_thread] para agendar [Callable]s para gravar "
"em quaisquer dados usados na thread de renderização. Ao usar o modelo de "
"thread \"Separate\", esses [Callable]s serão executados após o renderizador "
"terminar o quadro atual e antes de começar a renderizar o próximo. Quando "
"não estiver usando esse modo, eles serão executados imediatamente, portanto, "
"é recomendável usar sempre [method RenderingServer.call_on_render_thread] "
"nesses casos, o que permitirá que seu código faça a coisa certa, "
"independentemente do modelo de thread.\n"
"Quaisquer métodos virtuais que forem executados na thread de renderização "
"serão indicados abaixo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a pointer to an [code]XrCompositionLayerBaseHeader[/code] struct to "
"provide the given composition layer.\n"
"This will only be called if the extension previously registered itself with "
"[method OpenXRAPIExtension.register_composition_layer_provider].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread. "
"Additionally, the data it returns will be used shortly after this method is "
"called, so it needs to remain valid until the next time [method "
"_on_pre_render] runs."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of composition layers this extension wrapper provides via "
"[method _get_composition_layer].\n"
"This will only be called if the extension previously registered itself with "
"[method OpenXRAPIExtension.register_composition_layer_provider].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread. "
"Additionally, the data it returns will be used shortly after this method is "
"called, so it needs to remain valid until the next time [method "
"_on_pre_render] runs."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an integer that will be used to sort the given composition layer "
"provided via [method _get_composition_layer]. Lower numbers will move the "
"layer to the front of the list, and higher numbers to the end. The default "
"projection layer has an order of [code]0[/code], so layers provided by this "
"method should probably be above or below (but not exactly) [code]0[/code].\n"
"This will only be called if the extension previously registered itself with "
"[method OpenXRAPIExtension.register_composition_layer_provider].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread. "
"Additionally, the data it returns will be used shortly after this method is "
"called, so it needs to remain valid until the next time [method "
"_on_pre_render] runs."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] of OpenXR extensions related to this extension. "
"[param xr_version] specifies the OpenXR version we're instantiating. This "
"will be zero if the editor requests this list to flag supported features. "
"The [Dictionary] should contain the name of the extension, mapped to a "
"[code]bool *[/code] cast to an integer:\n"
"- If the [code]bool *[/code] is a [code]nullptr[/code] this extension is "
"mandatory.\n"
"- If the [code]bool *[/code] points to a boolean, the boolean will be "
"updated to [code]true[/code] if the extension is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [PackedStringArray] of positional tracker names that are used "
"within the extension wrapper."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [PackedStringArray] de nomes de rastreadores posicionais que são "
"usados dentro do wrapper da extensão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Gets an array of [Dictionary]s that represent properties, just like [method "
"Object._get_property_list], that will be added to [OpenXRCompositionLayer] "
"nodes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Gets a [Dictionary] containing the default values for the properties "
"returned by [method _get_viewport_composition_layer_extension_properties]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém um [Dictionary] contendo os valores padrão para as propriedades "
"retornadas por [method _get_viewport_composition_layer_extension_properties]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called before the OpenXR instance is created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the main thread, however, "
"it will be called [i]before[/i] OpenXR becomes involved in rendering, so it "
"is safe to write to data that will be used by the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called when there is an OpenXR event to process. When implementing, return "
"[code]true[/code] if the event was handled, return [code]false[/code] "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando há um evento OpenXR para processar. Ao implementar, retorne "
"[code]true[/code] se o evento foi tratado, ou retorne [code]false[/code] "
"caso contrário."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right after the OpenXR instance is created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the main thread, however, "
"it will be called [i]before[/i] OpenXR becomes involved in rendering, so it "
"is safe to write to data that will be used by the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right before the OpenXR instance is destroyed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the main thread, however, "
"it will be called [i]after[/i] OpenXR is done being involved in rendering, "
"so it is safe to write to data that was used by the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right after the main swapchains are (re)created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread."
msgstr ""
"Chamado logo após as swapchains principais serem (re)criadas.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método virtual será chamado na thread de renderização."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right after the given viewport is rendered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The draw commands might only be queued at this point, not "
"executed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right before the given viewport is rendered.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right before the XR viewports begin their rendering step.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called as part of the OpenXR process handling. This happens right before "
"general and physics processing steps of the main loop. During this step "
"controller data is queried and made available to game logic."
msgstr ""
"Chamado como parte do tratamento do processo OpenXR. Isso acontece logo "
"antes das etapas de processamento geral e físico do loop principal. Durante "
"esta etapa, os dados do controlador são consultados e disponibilizados para "
"a lógica do jogo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Allows extensions to register additional controller metadata. This function "
"is called even when the OpenXR API is not constructed as the metadata needs "
"to be available to the editor.\n"
"Extensions should also provide metadata regardless of whether they are "
"supported on the host system. The controller data is used to setup action "
"maps for users who may have access to the relevant hardware."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right after the OpenXR session is created.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the main thread, however, "
"it will be called [i]before[/i] OpenXR becomes involved in rendering, so it "
"is safe to write to data that will be used by the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called right before the OpenXR session is destroyed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the main thread, however, "
"it will be called [i]after[/i] OpenXR is done being involved in rendering, "
"so it is safe to write to data that was used by the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to exiting."
msgstr "Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR é alterado para saindo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to focused. This state is "
"the active state when the game runs."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR é alterado para focado. Este estado "
"é o estado ativo quando o jogo está sendo executado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to idle."
msgstr "Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR muda para inativo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to loss pending."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR é alterado para perda pendente."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to ready. This means OpenXR "
"is ready to set up the session."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR é alterado para pronto. Isso "
"significa que o OpenXR está pronto para configurar a sessão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to stopping."
msgstr "Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR muda para parando."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to synchronized. OpenXR also "
"returns to this state when the application loses focus."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR é alterado para sincronizado. O "
"OpenXR também retorna a este estado quando o aplicativo perde o foco."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called when the OpenXR session state is changed to visible. This means "
"OpenXR is now ready to receive frames."
msgstr ""
"Chamado quando o estado da sessão OpenXR é alterado para visível. Isso "
"significa que o OpenXR agora está pronto para receber frames."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Called when OpenXR has performed its action sync."
msgstr "Chamado quando o OpenXR executa sua sincronização de ações."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called when a composition layer created via [OpenXRCompositionLayer] is "
"destroyed.\n"
"[param layer] is a pointer to an [code]XrCompositionLayerBaseHeader[/code] "
"struct."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called before [method _set_view_configuration_and_get_next_pointer] to allow "
"the extension to reserve data for the given number of views."
msgstr ""
"Chamado antes de [method _set_view_configuration_and_get_next_pointer] para "
"permitir que a extensão reserve dados para o número especificado de visões."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Called to allow an extension to print additional information about its view "
"configuration, if applicable. This will only be called if verbose output is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Chamado para permitir que uma extensão imprima informações adicionais sobre "
"sua configuração de visualização, se aplicável. Isso só será chamado se a "
"saída detalhada estiver ativada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures to Android surface swapchains created by "
"[OpenXRCompositionLayer].\n"
"[param property_values] contains the values of the properties returned by "
"[method _get_viewport_composition_layer_extension_properties].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures to [code]XrFrameEndInfo[/code].\n"
"This will only be called if the extension previously registered itself with "
"[method OpenXRAPIExtension.register_frame_info_extension].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread. "
"Additionally, the data it returns will be used shortly after this method is "
"called, so it needs to remain valid until the next time [method "
"_on_pre_render] runs."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures to [code]XrFrameWaitInfo[/code].\n"
"This will only be called if the extension previously registered itself with "
"[method OpenXRAPIExtension.register_frame_info_extension].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Add additional data structures when each hand tracker is created."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona estruturas de dados adicionais quando cada rastreador de mão é "
"criado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures when the OpenXR instance is created. [param "
"xr_version] specifies the OpenXR version we're instantiating."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona estruturas de dados adicionais quando a instância OpenXR é criada. "
"[param xr_version] especifica a versão do OpenXR que estamos instanciando."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Adds additional data structures to [code]XrCompositionLayerProjection[/"
"code].\n"
"This will only be called if the extension previously registered itself with "
"[method OpenXRAPIExtension.register_projection_layer_extension]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures to the projection view of the given [param "
"view_index].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread. "
"Additionally, the data it returns will be used shortly after this method is "
"called, so it needs to remain valid until the next time [method "
"_on_pre_render] runs."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures to [code]XrReferenceSpaceCreateInfo[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona estruturas de dados adicionais a [code]XrReferenceSpaceCreateInfo[/"
"code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Add additional data structures when the OpenXR session is created."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona estruturas de dados adicionais quando a sessão OpenXR é criada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Add additional data structures when creating OpenXR swapchains."
msgstr "Adiciona estruturas de dados adicionais ao criar swapchains OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Add additional data structures when querying OpenXR system abilities."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona estruturas de dados adicionais ao consultar habilidades do sistema "
"OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid "Add additional data structures when querying OpenXR view configuration."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona estruturas de dados adicionais ao consultar a configuração de visão "
"do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures to [code]XrViewLocateInfo[/code].\n"
"This will only be called if the extension previously registered itself with "
"[method OpenXRAPIExtension.register_frame_info_extension].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread. "
"Additionally, the data it returns will be used shortly after this method is "
"called, so it needs to remain valid until the next time [method "
"_on_pre_render] runs."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Add additional data structures to composition layers created by "
"[OpenXRCompositionLayer].\n"
"[param property_values] contains the values of the properties returned by "
"[method _get_viewport_composition_layer_extension_properties].\n"
"[param layer] is a pointer to an [code]XrCompositionLayerBaseHeader[/code] "
"struct.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This virtual method will be called on the render thread. "
"Additionally, the data it returns will be used shortly after this method is "
"called, so it needs to remain valid until the next time [method "
"_on_pre_render] runs."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the created [OpenXRAPIExtension], which can be used to access the "
"OpenXR API."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [OpenXRAPIExtension] criado, que pode ser usado para acessar a API "
"OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapper.xml
msgid ""
"Registers the extension. This should happen at core module initialization "
"level.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This cannot be called once OpenXR has been initialized."
msgstr ""
"Registra a extensão. Isso deve acontecer no nível de inicialização do módulo "
"principal.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso não pode ser chamado após a inicialização do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension.xml
msgid "Use [OpenXRExtensionWrapper] instead."
msgstr "Use [OpenXRExtensionWrapper] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension.xml
msgid ""
"[OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension] allows implementing OpenXR extensions with "
"GDExtension. The extension should be registered with [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper.register_extension_wrapper]."
msgstr ""
"[OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension] permite implementar extensões OpenXR com "
"GDExtension. A extensão deve ser registrada com [method "
"OpenXRExtensionWrapper.register_extension_wrapper]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFrameSynthesisExtension.xml
msgid ""
"The OpenXR Frame synthesis extension allows for advanced reprojection at "
"low(er) framerates."
msgstr ""
"A extensão de síntese de quadros do OpenXR permite reprojeção avançada em "
"taxas de quadros mais baixas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFrameSynthesisExtension.xml
msgid ""
"This class implements the [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/"
"html/xrspec.html#XR_EXT_frame_synthesis]OpenXR Frame synthesis extension[/"
"url]. When enabled in the project settings and supported by the XR runtime "
"in use, frame synthesis uses advanced reprojection techniques to inject "
"additional frames so that your XR experience hits the full frame rate of the "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe implementa a [url=https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/"
"html/xrspec.html#XR_EXT_frame_synthesis]extensão de síntese de quadros do "
"OpenXR[/url]. Quando ativada nas configurações do projeto e suportada pelo "
"tempo de execução de XR em uso, a síntese de quadros usa técnicas avançadas "
"de reprojeção para injetar quadros adicionais para que sua experiência XR "
"atinja a taxa de quadros completa do dispositivo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFrameSynthesisExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if frame synthesis is enabled in the project "
"settings and the current XR runtime supports frame synthesis. The value "
"returned will only be valid once OpenXR has been initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a síntese de quadros estiver ativada nas "
"configurações do projeto e o runtime XR atual suportar síntese de quadros. O "
"valor retornado só será válido após o OpenXR ter sido inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFrameSynthesisExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Queues the next frame to be skipped when supplying motion vector and depth "
"data. Call this after teleporting your player or a similar action has moved "
"the player to prevent incorrect reprojection results due to this movement."
msgstr ""
"Coloca na fila o próximo quadro para ser ignorado ao fornecer dados de vetor "
"de movimento e profundidade. Chame isso após teletransportar seu jogador ou "
"após uma ação semelhante ter movido o jogador para evitar resultados de "
"reprojeção incorretos devido a esse movimento."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFrameSynthesisExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Enable frame synthesis. When [code]true[/code] motion vector and depth data "
"is provided to the XR runtime."
msgstr ""
"Ativa a síntese de quadros. Quando [code]true[/code], dados de vetor de "
"movimento e profundidade são fornecidos ao tempo de execução XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFrameSynthesisExtension.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code] this informs the XR runtime we will be providing frames "
"at a greatly reduced rate. Enable this when you expect your application to "
"run at low framerates and wish to inject multiple reprojected frames."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], isso informa ao runtime de XR que forneceremos quadros "
"a uma taxa bastante reduzida. Ative isto quando esperar que seu aplicativo "
"seja executado a baixas taxas de quadros e desejar injetar múltiplos quadros "
"reprojetados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureExtension.xml
msgid "The OpenXR Future extension allows for asynchronous APIs to be used."
msgstr "A extensão OpenXR Future permite o uso de APIs assíncronas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureExtension.xml
msgid ""
"This is a support extension in OpenXR that allows other OpenXR extensions to "
"start asynchronous functions and get a callback after this function "
"finishes. It is not intended for consumption within GDScript but can be "
"accessed from GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"Esta é uma extensão de suporte no OpenXR que permite que outras extensões do "
"OpenXR iniciem funções assíncronas e obtenham um retorno de chamada após a "
"conclusão desta função. Não se destina ao consumo dentro do GDScript, mas "
"pode ser acessado a partir do GDExtension."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Cancels an in-progress future. [param future] must be an [code]XrFutureEXT[/"
"code] value previously returned by an API that started an asynchronous "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Cancela um futuro em andamento. [param future] deve ser um valor "
"[code]XrFutureEXT[/code] retornado anteriormente por uma API que iniciou uma "
"função assíncrona."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if futures are available in the OpenXR runtime "
"used. This function will only return a usable result after OpenXR has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se futuros (futures) estiverem disponíveis no "
"runtime OpenXR usado. Esta função só retornará um resultado utilizável após "
"o OpenXR ter sido inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Register an OpenXR Future object so we monitor for completion. [param "
"future] must be an [code]XrFutureEXT[/code] value previously returned by an "
"API that started an asynchronous function.\n"
"You can optionally specify [param on_success], it will be invoked on "
"successful completion of the future.\n"
"Or you can use the returned [OpenXRFutureResult] object to [code]await[/"
"code] its [signal OpenXRFutureResult.completed] signal.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var future_result = OpenXRFutureExtension.register_future(future)\n"
"await future_result.completed\n"
"if future_result.get_status() == OpenXRFutureResult.RESULT_FINISHED:\n"
"\t# Handle your success\n"
"\tpass\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid ""
"Result object tracking the asynchronous result of an OpenXR Future object."
msgstr ""
"Objeto de resultado que rastreia o resultado assíncrono de um objeto OpenXR "
"Future."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid ""
"Result object tracking the asynchronous result of an OpenXR Future object, "
"you can use this object to track the result status."
msgstr ""
"Objeto de resultado que rastreia o resultado assíncrono de um objeto OpenXR "
"Future, você pode usar este objeto para rastrear o status do resultado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid ""
"Cancel this future, this will interrupt and stop the asynchronous function."
msgstr "Cancele este futuro; isso interromperá e parará a função assíncrona."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid "Return the [code]XrFutureEXT[/code] value this result relates to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor de [code]XrFutureEXT[/code] ao qual este resultado se refere."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the result value of our asynchronous function (if set by the "
"extension). The type of this result value depends on the function being "
"called. Consult the documentation of the relevant function."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor do resultado da nossa função assíncrona (se definida pela "
"extensão). O tipo deste valor de resultado depende da função que está sendo "
"chamada. Consulte a documentação da função relevante."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid "Returns the status of this result."
msgstr "Retorna o status deste resultado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid ""
"Stores the result value we expose to the user.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should only be called by an OpenXR extension that "
"implements an asynchronous function."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the asynchronous function is finished or has been cancelled."
msgstr "Emitido quando a função assíncrona termina ou é cancelada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid "The asynchronous function is running."
msgstr "A função assíncrona está em execução."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid "The asynchronous function has finished."
msgstr "A função assíncrona terminou."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRFutureResult.xml
msgid "The asynchronous function has been cancelled."
msgstr "A função assíncrona foi cancelada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Use [XRHandModifier3D] instead."
msgstr "Use [XRHandModifier3D] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Node supporting hand and finger tracking in OpenXR."
msgstr "Nó que suporta rastreamento de mãos e dedos no OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid ""
"This node enables OpenXR's hand tracking functionality. The node should be a "
"child node of an [XROrigin3D] node, tracking will update its position to the "
"player's tracked hand Palm joint location (the center of the middle finger's "
"metacarpal bone). This node also updates the skeleton of a properly skinned "
"hand or avatar model.\n"
"If the skeleton is a hand (one of the hand bones is the root node of the "
"skeleton), then the skeleton will be placed relative to the hand palm "
"location and the hand mesh and skeleton should be children of the OpenXRHand "
"node.\n"
"If the hand bones are part of a full skeleton, then the root of the hand "
"will keep its location with the assumption that IK is used to position the "
"hand and arm.\n"
"By default the skeleton hand bones are repositioned to match the size of the "
"tracked hand. To preserve the modeled bone sizes change [member bone_update] "
"to apply rotation only."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Specify the type of updates to perform on the bone."
msgstr "Especifique o tipo de atualizações a serem realizadas no osso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies whether this node tracks the left or right hand of the player."
msgstr "Especifica se este nó rastreia a mão esquerda ou direita do jogador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Set a [Skeleton3D] node for which the pose positions will be updated."
msgstr ""
"Define um nó [Skeleton3D] para o qual as posições de pose serão atualizadas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Set the motion range (if supported) limiting the hand motion."
msgstr ""
"Definir o intervalo de movimento (se suportado) limitando o movimento da mão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid ""
"Set the type of skeleton rig the [member hand_skeleton] is compliant with."
msgstr ""
"Define o tipo de rig de esqueleto com o qual o [member hand_skeleton] é "
"compatível."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Tracking the player's left hand."
msgstr "Rastreando a mão esquerda do jogador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Tracking the player's right hand."
msgstr "Rastreando a mão direita do jogador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Maximum supported hands."
msgstr "Máximo de mãos suportadas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "When player grips, hand skeleton will form a full fist."
msgstr "Quando o jogador agarra, o esqueleto da mão formará um punho fechado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid ""
"When player grips, hand skeleton conforms to the controller the player is "
"holding."
msgstr ""
"Quando o jogador aperta os controles, o esqueleto da mão se adapta ao "
"controle que o jogador está segurando."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Maximum supported motion ranges."
msgstr "Máximo de intervalos de movimento suportados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "An OpenXR compliant skeleton."
msgstr "Um esqueleto compatível com OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "A [SkeletonProfileHumanoid] compliant skeleton."
msgstr "Um esqueleto compatível com [SkeletonProfileHumanoid]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid ""
"The skeletons bones are fully updated (both position and rotation) to match "
"the tracked bones."
msgstr ""
"Os ossos dos esqueletos são totalmente atualizados (posição e rotação) para "
"corresponder aos ossos rastreados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid ""
"The skeletons bones are only rotated to align with the tracked bones, "
"preserving bone length."
msgstr ""
"Os ossos dos esqueletos são apenas rotacionados para se alinharem com os "
"ossos rastreados, preservando o comprimento do osso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHand.xml
msgid "Maximum supported bone update mode."
msgstr "Modo máximo de atualização de ossos suportado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHapticBase.xml
msgid "OpenXR Haptic feedback base class."
msgstr "Classe base de feedback háptico OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHapticBase.xml
msgid "This is a base class for haptic feedback resources."
msgstr "Esta é uma classe base para recursos de feedback tátil."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHapticVibration.xml
msgid "Vibration haptic feedback."
msgstr "Feedback háptico de vibração."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHapticVibration.xml
msgid ""
"This haptic feedback resource makes it possible to define a vibration based "
"haptic feedback pulse that can be triggered through actions in the OpenXR "
"action map."
msgstr ""
"Este recurso de feedback tátil torna possível definir um pulso de feedback "
"tátil baseado em vibração que pode ser acionado por meio de ações no mapa de "
"ações do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHapticVibration.xml
msgid ""
"The amplitude of the pulse between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr "A amplitude do pulso entre [code]0.0[/code] e [code]1.0[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHapticVibration.xml
msgid ""
"The duration of the pulse in nanoseconds. Use [code]-1[/code] for a minimum "
"duration pulse for the current XR runtime."
msgstr ""
"A duração do pulso em nanossegundos. Use [code]-1[/code] para um pulso de "
"duração mínima para o tempo de execução XR atual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRHapticVibration.xml
msgid ""
"The frequency of the pulse in Hz. [code]0.0[/code] will let the XR runtime "
"chose an optimal frequency for the device used."
msgstr ""
"A frequência do pulso em Hz. [code]0.0[/code] permitirá que o runtime XR "
"escolha uma frequência ideal para o dispositivo usado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid "Suggested bindings object for OpenXR."
msgstr "Objeto de vinculações sugeridas para OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid ""
"This object stores suggested bindings for an interaction profile. "
"Interaction profiles define the metadata for a tracked XR device such as an "
"XR controller.\n"
"For more information see the [url=https://www.khronos.org/registry/OpenXR/"
"specs/1.0/html/xrspec.html#semantic-path-interaction-profiles]interaction "
"profiles info in the OpenXR specification[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid "Retrieve the binding at this index."
msgstr "Recupera a vinculação neste índice."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid "Get the number of bindings in this interaction profile."
msgstr "Obtém o número de vinculações neste perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Get the [OpenXRBindingModifier] at this index."
msgstr "Obtém o [OpenXRBindingModifier] neste índice."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid "Get the number of binding modifiers in this interaction profile."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o número de modificadores de vinculação neste perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid "Binding modifiers for this interaction profile."
msgstr "Modificadores de vinculação para este perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid "Action bindings for this interaction profile."
msgstr "Vínculos de ação para este perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfile.xml
msgid "The interaction profile path identifying the XR device."
msgstr "O caminho do perfil de interação que identifica o dispositivo XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileEditor.xml
msgid "Default OpenXR interaction profile editor."
msgstr "Editor de perfil de interação OpenXR padrão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileEditor.xml
msgid ""
"This is the default OpenXR interaction profile editor that provides a "
"generic interface for editing any interaction profile for which no custom "
"editor has been defined."
msgstr ""
"Este é o editor de perfil de interação OpenXR padrão que fornece uma "
"interface genérica para editar qualquer perfil de interação para o qual "
"nenhum editor personalizado foi definido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileEditorBase.xml
msgid "Base class for editing interaction profiles."
msgstr "Classe base para editar perfis de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"This is a base class for interaction profile editors used by the OpenXR "
"action map editor. It can be used to create bespoke editors for specific "
"interaction profiles."
msgstr ""
"Esta é uma classe base para editores de perfil de interação usados pelo "
"editor de mapas de ação do OpenXR. Ela pode ser usada para criar editores "
"personalizados para perfis de interação específicos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileEditorBase.xml
msgid ""
"Setup this editor for the provided [param action_map] and [param "
"interaction_profile]."
msgstr ""
"Configura este editor para o [param action_map] e o [param "
"interaction_profile] fornecidos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileMetadata.xml
msgid "Meta class registering supported devices in OpenXR."
msgstr "Meta classe que registra dispositivos suportados no OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileMetadata.xml
msgid ""
"This class allows OpenXR core and extensions to register metadata relating "
"to supported interaction devices such as controllers, trackers, haptic "
"devices, etc. It is primarily used by the action map editor and to sanitize "
"any action map by removing extension-dependent entries when applicable."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe permite que o núcleo e as extensões do OpenXR registrem "
"metadados relacionados a dispositivos de suporte à interação, como "
"controles, rastreadores, dispositivos hápticos, etc. É usada principalmente "
"pelo editor de mapas de ação e para sanitizar qualquer mapa de ação "
"removendo entradas dependentes de extensões quando aplicável."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileMetadata.xml
msgid ""
"Registers an interaction profile using its OpenXR designation (e.g. [code]/"
"interaction_profiles/khr/simple_controller[/code] is the profile for "
"OpenXR's simple controller profile).\n"
"[param display_name] is the description shown to the user. [param "
"openxr_path] is the interaction profile path being registered. [param "
"openxr_extension_names] optionally restricts this profile to the given "
"extension being enabled/available. If the extension is not available, the "
"profile and all related entries used in an action map are filtered out."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileMetadata.xml
msgid ""
"Registers an input/output path for the given [param interaction_profile]. "
"The profile should previously have been registered using [method "
"register_interaction_profile]. [param display_name] is the description shown "
"to the user. [param toplevel_path] specifies the bind path this input/output "
"can be bound to (e.g. [code]/user/hand/left[/code] or [code]/user/hand/"
"right[/code]). [param openxr_path] is the action input/output being "
"registered (e.g. [code]/user/hand/left/input/aim/pose[/code]). [param "
"openxr_extension_names] restricts this input/output to an enabled/available "
"extension, this doesn't need to repeat the extension on the profile but "
"relates to overlapping extension (e.g. [code]XR_EXT_palm_pose[/code] that "
"introduces [code]…/input/palm_ext/pose[/code] input paths). [param "
"action_type] defines the type of input or output provided by OpenXR."
msgstr ""
"Registra um caminho de entrada/saída para o [param interaction_profile] "
"fornecido. O perfil deve ter sido previamente registrado usando [method "
"register_interaction_profile]. [param display_name] é a descrição mostrada "
"ao usuário. [param toplevel_path] especifica o caminho de vinculação ao qual "
"esta entrada/saída pode ser vinculada (por exemplo, [code]/user/hand/left[/"
"code] ou [code]/user/hand/right[/code]). [param openxr_path] é a entrada/"
"saída de ação sendo registrada (por exemplo, [code]/user/hand/left/input/aim/"
"pose[/code]). [param openxr_extension_names] restringe esta entrada/saída a "
"uma extensão habilitada/disponível, isso não precisa repetir a extensão no "
"perfil, mas se relaciona com extensões sobrepostas (por exemplo, "
"[code]XR_EXT_palm_pose[/code] que introduz caminhos de entrada [code]…/input/"
"palm_ext/pose[/code]). [param action_type] define o tipo de entrada ou saída "
"fornecido pelo OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileMetadata.xml
msgid ""
"Allows for renaming old input/output paths to new paths in order to load and "
"process older action maps."
msgstr ""
"Permite renomear caminhos antigos de entrada/saída para novos caminhos para "
"carregar e processar mapas de ação mais antigos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileMetadata.xml
msgid ""
"Allows for renaming old interaction profile paths to new paths in order to "
"load and process older action maps."
msgstr ""
"Permite renomear antigos caminhos de perfil de interação para novos "
"caminhos, a fim de carregar e processar mapas de ação mais antigos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInteractionProfileMetadata.xml
msgid ""
"Registers a top level path to which profiles can be bound. For instance "
"[code]/user/hand/left[/code] refers to the bind point for the player's left "
"hand. Extensions can register additional top level paths, for instance a "
"haptic vest extension might register [code]/user/body/vest[/code].\n"
"[param display_name] is the name shown to the user. [param openxr_path] is "
"the top level path being registered. [param openxr_extension_names] is "
"optional and ensures the top level path is only used if the specified "
"extension is available/enabled.\n"
"When a top level path ends up being bound by OpenXR, an "
"[XRPositionalTracker] is instantiated to manage the state of the device."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Our OpenXR interface."
msgstr "Nossa interface OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The OpenXR interface allows Godot to interact with OpenXR runtimes and make "
"it possible to create XR experiences and games.\n"
"Due to the needs of OpenXR this interface works slightly different than "
"other plugin based XR interfaces. It needs to be initialized when Godot "
"starts. You need to enable OpenXR, settings for this can be found in your "
"games project settings under the XR heading. You do need to mark a viewport "
"for use with XR in order for Godot to know which render result should be "
"output to the headset."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Setting up XR"
msgstr "Configurando o XR"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of action sets registered with Godot (loaded from the action "
"map at runtime)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma lista de conjuntos de ações registrados no Godot (carregados do "
"mapa de ações em tempo de execução)."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of display refresh rates supported by the current HMD. Only "
"returned if this feature is supported by the OpenXR runtime and after the "
"interface has been initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma lista de taxas de atualização de exibição suportadas pelo HMD "
"atual. Retornado apenas se este recurso for suportado pelo tempo de execução "
"OpenXR e após a interface ter sido inicializada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_angular_velocity] obtained from "
"[method XRServer.get_tracker] instead."
msgstr ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_angular_velocity] obtido de [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled, returns the angular velocity of a joint ([param "
"joint]) of a hand ([param hand]) as provided by OpenXR. This is relative to "
"[XROrigin3D]!"
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado, retorna a velocidade angular de "
"uma junta ([param joint]) de uma mão ([param hand]) fornecida pelo OpenXR. "
"Isto é relativo ao [XROrigin3D]!"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_flags] obtained from [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] instead."
msgstr ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_flags] obtido de [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled, returns flags that inform us of the validity of "
"the tracking data."
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado, retorna sinalizadores que nos "
"informam sobre a validade dos dados de rastreamento."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_linear_velocity] obtained from "
"[method XRServer.get_tracker] instead."
msgstr ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_linear_velocity] obtido de [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled, returns the linear velocity of a joint ([param "
"joint]) of a hand ([param hand]) as provided by OpenXR. This is relative to "
"[XROrigin3D] without worldscale applied!"
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado, retorna a velocidade linear de "
"uma junta ([param joint]) de uma mão ([param hand]) conforme fornecida pelo "
"OpenXR. Isso é relativo a [XROrigin3D] sem a escala de mundo aplicada!"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_transform] obtained from [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] instead."
msgstr ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_transform] obtido de [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled, returns the position of a joint ([param joint]) "
"of a hand ([param hand]) as provided by OpenXR. This is relative to "
"[XROrigin3D] without worldscale applied!"
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado, retorna a posição de uma junta "
"([param joint]) de uma mão ([param hand]) conforme fornecida pelo OpenXR. "
"Isso é relativo ao [XROrigin3D] sem a escala de mundo aplicada!"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_radius] obtained from [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] instead."
msgstr ""
"Use [method XRHandTracker.get_hand_joint_radius] obtido de [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled, returns the radius of a joint ([param joint]) of "
"a hand ([param hand]) as provided by OpenXR. This is without worldscale "
"applied!"
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado, retorna o raio de uma junta "
"([param joint]) de uma mão ([param hand]) fornecido pelo OpenXR. Isso é "
"feito sem a escala de mundo aplicada!"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled, returns the rotation of a joint ([param joint]) "
"of a hand ([param hand]) as provided by OpenXR."
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado, retorna a rotação de uma "
"articulação ([param joint]) de uma mão ([param hand]) conforme fornecida "
"pelo OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Use [member XRHandTracker.hand_tracking_source] obtained from [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] instead."
msgstr ""
"Use [member XRHandTracker.hand_tracking_source] obtido de [method "
"XRServer.get_tracker] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled and hand tracking source is supported, gets the "
"source of the hand tracking data for [param hand]."
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado e a fonte de rastreamento de mãos "
"for suportada, obtém a fonte dos dados de rastreamento de mãos para [param "
"hand]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled and motion range is supported, gets the currently "
"configured motion range for [param hand]."
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado e o intervalo de movimento for "
"suportado, obtém o intervalo de movimento configurado atualmente para [param "
"hand]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Returns the current state of our OpenXR session."
msgstr "Retorna o estado atual da nossa sessão OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the given action set is active."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o conjunto de ações fornecido estiver ativo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the capabilities of the eye gaze interaction extension.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only returns a valid value after OpenXR has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR's foveation extension is supported. The "
"interface must be initialized before this returns a valid value.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using the Vulkan rendering driver, [member "
"Viewport.vrs_mode] must be set to [constant Viewport.VRS_XR] to support "
"foveation."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR's hand interaction profile is supported "
"and enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only returns a valid value after OpenXR has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o perfil de interação de mãos do OpenXR for "
"compatível e estiver habilitado.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso só retorna um valor válido após o OpenXR ter sido "
"inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR's hand tracking is supported and "
"enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only returns a valid value after OpenXR has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o rastreamento de mãos do OpenXR for compatível "
"e estiver habilitado.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso só retorna um valor válido após o OpenXR ter sido "
"inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR's user presence extension is supported "
"and enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only returns a valid value after OpenXR has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a extensão de presença do usuário do OpenXR for "
"compatível e estiver habilitada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso só retorna um valor válido após o OpenXR ter sido "
"inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if system has detected the presence of a user in "
"the XR experience."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o sistema detectou a presença de um usuário na "
"experiência de XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Sets the given action set as active or inactive."
msgstr "Define o conjunto de ações fornecido como ativo ou inativo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Sets the CPU performance level of the OpenXR device."
msgstr "Define o nível de desempenho da CPU do dispositivo OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Sets the GPU performance level of the OpenXR device."
msgstr "Define o nível de desempenho da GPU do dispositivo OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If handtracking is enabled and motion range is supported, sets the currently "
"configured motion range for [param hand] to [param motion_range]."
msgstr ""
"Se o rastreamento de mãos estiver ativado e o intervalo de movimento for "
"suportado, define o intervalo de movimento configurado atualmente para "
"[param hand] como [param motion_range]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The display refresh rate for the current HMD. Only functional if this "
"feature is supported by the OpenXR runtime and after the interface has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"A taxa de atualização de exibição do HMD atual. Só funciona se este recurso "
"for suportado pelo tempo de execução OpenXR e após a interface ter sido "
"inicializada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables dynamic foveation adjustment. The interface "
"must be initialized before this is accessible. If enabled, foveation will "
"automatically be adjusted between low and [member foveation_level]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa o ajuste dinâmico de foveação. A interface deve "
"ser inicializada antes que isso seja acessível. Se ativado, a foveação será "
"ajustada automaticamente entre baixa e [member foveation_level]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The foveation level, from [code]0[/code] (off) to [code]3[/code] (high). The "
"interface must be initialized before this is accessible."
msgstr ""
"O nível de foveação, de [code]0[/code] (desligado) a [code]3[/code] (alto). "
"A interface deve ser inicializada antes que isso seja acessível."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables subsampled images with foveation, which can "
"provide a performance boost on Vulkan."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa imagens subamostradas com foveação, o que pode "
"fornecer um ganho de desempenho no Vulkan."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The render size multiplier for the current HMD. Must be set before the "
"interface has been initialized."
msgstr ""
"O multiplicador de tamanho de renderização para o HMD atual. Deve ser "
"definido antes que a interface seja inicializada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Informs the device CPU performance level has changed in the specified "
"subdomain."
msgstr ""
"Informa que o nível de desempenho da CPU do dispositivo foi alterado no "
"subdomínio especificado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Informs the device GPU performance level has changed in the specified "
"subdomain."
msgstr ""
"Informa que o nível de desempenho da GPU do dispositivo foi alterado no "
"subdomínio especificado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Informs our OpenXR instance is exiting."
msgstr "Informa que nossa instância OpenXR está saindo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Informs the user queued a recenter of the player position."
msgstr ""
"Informa que o usuário solicitou uma recentralização da posição do jogador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Informs the user the HMD refresh rate has changed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only emitted if XR runtime supports the refresh rate extension."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Informs our OpenXR session has been started."
msgstr "Informa que nossa sessão OpenXR foi iniciada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Informs our OpenXR session now has focus, for example output is sent to the "
"HMD and we're receiving XR input."
msgstr ""
"Informa que nossa sessão OpenXR agora tem foco; por exemplo, a saída é "
"enviada para o HMD e estamos recebendo entrada XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Informs our OpenXR session is in the process of being lost."
msgstr "Informa que nossa sessão OpenXR está prestes a ser perdida."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Informs our OpenXR session is stopping."
msgstr "Informa que nossa sessão OpenXR está parando."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Informs our OpenXR session has been synchronized."
msgstr "Informa que nossa sessão OpenXR foi sincronizada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Informs our OpenXR session is now visible, for example output is sent to the "
"HMD but we don't receive XR input."
msgstr ""
"Informa que nossa sessão OpenXR agora está visível; por exemplo, a saída é "
"enviada para o HMD, mas não recebemos entrada XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Signal emitted when the user presence value changes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This signal will not be emitted during application startup and "
"application shutdown. Developers should assume user presence is gained on "
"startup and lost on shutdown."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The state of the session is unknown, we haven't tried setting up OpenXR yet."
msgstr ""
"O estado da sessão é desconhecido; ainda não tentamos configurar o OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The initial state after the OpenXR session is created or after the session "
"is destroyed."
msgstr ""
"O estado inicial após a criação da sessão OpenXR ou após a destruição da "
"sessão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"OpenXR is ready to begin our session. [signal session_begun] is emitted when "
"we change to this state."
msgstr ""
"O OpenXR está pronto para iniciar nossa sessão. [signal session_begun] é "
"emitido quando mudamos para este estado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The application has synched its frame loop with the runtime but we're not "
"rendering anything. [signal session_synchronized] is emitted when we change "
"to this state."
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo sincronizou seu loop de quadros com o tempo de execução, mas "
"não estamos renderizando nada. O sinal [signal session_synchronized] é "
"emitido quando mudamos para este estado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The application has synched its frame loop with the runtime and we're "
"rendering output to the user, however we receive no user input. [signal "
"session_visible] is emitted when we change to this state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is the current state just before we get the focused state, "
"whenever the user opens a system menu, switches to another application, or "
"takes off their headset."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The application has synched its frame loop with the runtime, we're rendering "
"output to the user and we're receiving XR input. [signal session_focussed] "
"is emitted when we change to this state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is the state OpenXR will be in when the user can fully "
"interact with your game."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Our session is being stopped. [signal session_stopping] is emitted when we "
"change to this state."
msgstr ""
"Nossa sessão está sendo encerrada. [signal session_stopping] é emitido "
"quando mudamos para este estado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The session is about to be lost. [signal session_loss_pending] is emitted "
"when we change to this state."
msgstr ""
"A sessão está prestes a ser perdida. [signal session_loss_pending] é emitido "
"quando mudamos para este estado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The OpenXR instance is about to be destroyed and we're exiting. [signal "
"instance_exiting] is emitted when we change to this state."
msgstr ""
"A instância OpenXR está prestes a ser destruída e estamos saindo. O [signal "
"instance_exiting] é emitido quando mudamos para este estado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Left hand."
msgstr "Mão esquerda."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Right hand."
msgstr "Mão direita."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Maximum value for the hand enum."
msgstr "Valor máximo para a enumeração de mão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Full hand range, if user closes their hands, we make a full fist."
msgstr ""
"Alcance completo da mão; se o usuário fechar as mãos, faremos um punho "
"fechado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"Conform to controller, if user closes their hands, the tracked data conforms "
"to the shape of the controller."
msgstr ""
"Conforma-se ao controle; se o usuário fechar as mãos, os dados rastreados se "
"conformam à forma do controle."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Maximum value for the motion range enum."
msgstr "Valor máximo para a enumeração de intervalo de movimento."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The source of hand tracking data is unknown (the extension is likely "
"unsupported)."
msgstr ""
"A fonte dos dados de rastreamento de mãos é desconhecida (a extensão "
"provavelmente não é compatível)."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The source of hand tracking is unobstructed, this means that an accurate "
"method of hand tracking is used, e.g. optical hand tracking, data gloves, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"A fonte de rastreamento de mãos está desimpedida, o que significa que é "
"usado um método preciso de rastreamento de mãos, por exemplo, rastreamento "
"óptico de mãos, luvas de dados, etc."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The source of hand tracking is a controller, bone positions are inferred "
"from controller inputs."
msgstr ""
"A fonte de rastreamento de mãos é um controle; as posições dos ossos são "
"inferidas a partir das entradas do controle."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum HandTrackedSource] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum HandTrackedSource]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Palm joint."
msgstr "Articulação da palma."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Wrist joint."
msgstr "Articulação do punho."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Thumb metacarpal joint."
msgstr "Articulação metacarpal do polegar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Thumb proximal joint."
msgstr "Articulação proximal do polegar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Thumb distal joint."
msgstr "Articulação distal do polegar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Thumb tip joint."
msgstr "Articulação distal do polegar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Index finger metacarpal joint."
msgstr "Articulação metacarpal do dedo indicador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Index finger phalanx proximal joint."
msgstr "Articulação proximal da falange do dedo indicador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Index finger phalanx intermediate joint."
msgstr "Articulação intermediária da falange do dedo indicador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Index finger phalanx distal joint."
msgstr "Articulação distal da falange do dedo indicador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Index finger tip joint."
msgstr "Articulação da ponta do dedo indicador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Middle finger metacarpal joint."
msgstr "Articulação metacarpal do dedo médio."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Middle finger phalanx proximal joint."
msgstr "Articulação proximal da falange do dedo médio."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Middle finger phalanx intermediate joint."
msgstr "Articulação intermediária da falange do dedo médio."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Middle finger phalanx distal joint."
msgstr "Articulação distal da falange do dedo médio."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Middle finger tip joint."
msgstr "Articulação da ponta do dedo médio."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Ring finger metacarpal joint."
msgstr "Articulação metacarpal do dedo anelar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Ring finger phalanx proximal joint."
msgstr "Articulação proximal da falange do dedo anelar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Ring finger phalanx intermediate joint."
msgstr "Articulação intermediária da falange do dedo anelar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Ring finger phalanx distal joint."
msgstr "Articulação distal da falange do dedo anelar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Ring finger tip joint."
msgstr "Articulação da ponta do dedo anelar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Pinky finger metacarpal joint."
msgstr "Articulação metacarpal do dedo mínimo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Pinky finger phalanx proximal joint."
msgstr "Articulação proximal da falange do dedo mínimo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Pinky finger phalanx intermediate joint."
msgstr "Articulação intermediária da falange do dedo mínimo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Pinky finger phalanx distal joint."
msgstr "Articulação distal da falange do dedo mínimo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml doc/classes/XRHandTracker.xml
msgid "Pinky finger tip joint."
msgstr "Articulação da ponta do dedo mínimo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum HandJoints] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum HandJoints]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The application has entered a non-XR section (head-locked / static screen), "
"during which power savings are to be prioritized."
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo entrou em uma seção não-XR (tela travada na cabeça / estática), "
"durante a qual a economia de energia deve ser priorizada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The application has entered a low and stable complexity section, during "
"which reducing power is more important than occasional late rendering frames."
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo entrou em uma seção de complexidade baixa e estável, durante a "
"qual a redução de energia é mais importante do que quadros de renderização "
"atrasados ocasionalmente."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The application has entered a high or dynamic complexity section, during "
"which the XR Runtime strives for consistent XR compositing and frame "
"rendering within a thermally sustainable range."
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo entrou em uma seção de alta complexidade ou complexidade "
"dinâmica, durante a qual o Runtime XR se esforça para manter uma composição "
"XR e renderização de quadros consistentes dentro de uma faixa termicamente "
"sustentável."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The application has entered a section with very high complexity, during "
"which the XR Runtime is allowed to step up beyond the thermally sustainable "
"range."
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo entrou em uma seção com complexidade muito alta, durante a qual "
"o Runtime XR tem permissão para subir além da faixa termicamente sustentável."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "The compositing performance within the runtime has reached a new level."
msgstr "O desempenho de composição no tempo de execução atingiu um novo nível."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "The application rendering performance has reached a new level."
msgstr "O desempenho de renderização do aplicativo atingiu um novo patamar."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "The temperature of the device has reached a new level."
msgstr "A temperatura do dispositivo atingiu um novo nível."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The sub-domain has reached a level where no further actions other than "
"currently applied are necessary."
msgstr ""
"O subdomínio atingiu um nível em que nenhuma ação além das atualmente "
"aplicadas é necessária."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The sub-domain has reached an early warning level where the application "
"should start proactive mitigation actions."
msgstr ""
"O subdomínio atingiu um nível de aviso prévio onde o aplicativo deve iniciar "
"ações de mitigação proativas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"The sub-domain has reached a critical level where the application should "
"start drastic mitigation actions."
msgstr ""
"O subdomínio atingiu um nível crítico em que o aplicativo deve iniciar ações "
"drásticas de mitigação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid "No flags are set."
msgstr "Nenhum sinalizador está definido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If set, the orientation data is valid, otherwise, the orientation data is "
"unreliable and should not be used."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, os dados de orientação são válidos; caso contrário, os dados de "
"orientação não são confiáveis e não devem ser usados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If set, the orientation data comes from tracking data, otherwise, the "
"orientation data contains predicted data."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, os dados de orientação vêm de dados de rastreamento; caso "
"contrário, os dados de orientação contêm dados previstos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If set, the positional data is valid, otherwise, the positional data is "
"unreliable and should not be used."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, os dados posicionais são válidos; caso contrário, os dados "
"posicionais não são confiáveis e não devem ser usados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If set, the positional data comes from tracking data, otherwise, the "
"positional data contains predicted data."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, os dados posicionais vêm de dados de rastreamento; caso "
"contrário, os dados posicionais contêm dados previstos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If set, our linear velocity data is valid, otherwise, the linear velocity "
"data is unreliable and should not be used."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, nossos dados de velocidade linear são válidos; caso contrário, "
"os dados de velocidade linear não são confiáveis e não devem ser usados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRInterface.xml
msgid ""
"If set, our angular velocity data is valid, otherwise, the angular velocity "
"data is unreliable and should not be used."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, nossos dados de velocidade angular são válidos; caso contrário, "
"os dados de velocidade angular não são confiáveis e não devem ser usados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Defines a binding between an [OpenXRAction] and an XR input or output."
msgstr "Define uma ligação entre um [OpenXRAction] e uma entrada ou saída XR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid ""
"This binding resource binds an [OpenXRAction] to an input or output. As most "
"controllers have left hand and right versions that are handled by the same "
"interaction profile we can specify multiple bindings. For instance an action "
"\"Fire\" could be bound to both \"/user/hand/left/input/trigger\" and \"/"
"user/hand/right/input/trigger\". This would require two binding entries."
msgstr ""
"Este recurso de vinculação associa um [OpenXRAction] a uma entrada ou saída. "
"Como a maioria dos controladores possui versões para a mão esquerda e "
"direita que são tratadas pelo mesmo perfil de interação, podemos especificar "
"várias vinculações. Por exemplo, uma ação \"Fire\" pode ser vinculada tanto "
"a \"/user/hand/left/input/trigger\" quanto a \"/user/hand/right/input/"
"trigger\". Isso exigiria duas entradas de vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Binding is for a single path."
msgstr "A vinculação é para um único caminho."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Add an input/output path to this binding."
msgstr "Adiciona um caminho de entrada/saída a esta vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Get the number of binding modifiers for this binding."
msgstr "Obtém o número de modificadores de vinculação para esta vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Get the number of input/output paths in this binding."
msgstr "Obtém o número de caminhos de entrada/saída nesta vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this input/output path is part of this binding."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este caminho de entrada/saída fizer parte desta "
"vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Removes this input/output path from this binding."
msgstr "Remove este caminho de entrada/saída deste vínculo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "[OpenXRAction] that is bound to [member binding_path]."
msgstr "[OpenXRAction] que está vinculado a [member binding_path]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Binding modifiers for this binding."
msgstr "Modificadores de vinculação para esta vinculação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid ""
"Binding path that defines the input or output bound to [member action].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Binding paths are suggestions, an XR runtime may choose to bind "
"the action to a different input or output emulating this input or output."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Use [member binding_path] instead."
msgstr "Use [member binding_path] em vez disso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBinding.xml
msgid "Paths that define the inputs or outputs bound on the device."
msgstr "Caminhos que definem as entradas ou saídas vinculadas no dispositivo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRIPBindingModifier.xml
msgid "Binding modifier that applies directly on an interaction profile."
msgstr ""
"Modificador de vínculo que se aplica diretamente em um perfil de interação."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRMarkerTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Spatial entity tracker for our spatial entity marker tracking extension."
msgstr ""
"Rastreador de entidade espacial para nossa extensão de rastreamento de "
"marcador de entidade espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRMarkerTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Spatial entity tracker for our OpenXR spatial entity marker tracking "
"extension. These trackers identify entities in our real space detected by a "
"visual marker such as a QRCode or Aruco code, and map their location to our "
"virtual space."
msgstr ""
"Rastreador de entidades espaciais para nossa extensão de rastreamento de "
"marcadores de entidades espaciais do OpenXR. Esses rastreadores identificam "
"entidades em nosso espaço real detectadas por um marcador visual, como um "
"QRCode ou código Aruco, e mapeiam sua localização para nosso espaço virtual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRMarkerTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the marker data for this marker. This can return a [String] or "
"[PackedByteArray]. Only applicable to QR Code based markers."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os dados do marcador para este marcador. Pode retornar uma [String] "
"ou [PackedByteArray]. Aplicável apenas a marcadores baseados em QR Code."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRMarkerTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the marker data for this marker.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This should only be set by marker discovery logic."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRMarkerTracker.xml
msgid "The bounds size for this marker."
msgstr "O tamanho dos limites para este marcador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRMarkerTracker.xml
msgid ""
"The marker ID for this marker, this is only returned for Aruco and April Tag "
"markers. Call [method get_marker_data] for QRCode markers."
msgstr ""
"O ID do marcador para este marcador; isso é retornado apenas para marcadores "
"Aruco e April Tag. Chame [method get_marker_data] para marcadores QRCode."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRMarkerTracker.xml
msgid "The type of marker."
msgstr "O tipo de marcador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid "Spatial entity tracker for our spatial entity plane tracking extension."
msgstr ""
"Rastreador de entidade espacial para nossa extensão de rastreamento de plano "
"de entidade espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Spatial entity tracker for our OpenXR spatial entity plane tracking "
"extension. These trackers identify entities in our real space such as walls, "
"floors, tables, etc. and map their location to our virtual space."
msgstr ""
"Rastreador de entidade espacial para nossa extensão de rastreamento de plano "
"de entidade espacial OpenXR. Esses rastreadores identificam entidades em "
"nosso espaço real, como paredes, pisos, mesas, etc., e mapeiam sua "
"localização para o nosso espaço virtual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the mesh data for this tracker. You should only call this if you are "
"handling your own discovery logic."
msgstr ""
"Limpa os dados de malha para este rastreador. Você só deve chamar isso se "
"estiver gerenciando sua própria lógica de descoberta."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Gets a mesh created from either the mesh data or from our bounding size for "
"this plane."
msgstr ""
"Obtém uma malha criada a partir dos dados da malha ou do nosso tamanho de "
"delimitação para este plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the transform by which to offset the mesh and collision shape from our "
"pose to display these correctly."
msgstr ""
"Obtém a transformação pela qual deslocar a malha e a forma de colisão de "
"nossa pose para exibi-las corretamente."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Gets a collision shape built either from the mesh data or from our bounding "
"size for this plane."
msgstr ""
"Obtém uma forma de colisão construída a partir dos dados da malha ou do "
"nosso tamanho de delimitação para este plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the mesh data for this plane. You should only call this if you are "
"handling your own discovery logic."
msgstr ""
"Define os dados de malha para este plano. Você só deve chamar isso se "
"estiver gerenciando sua própria lógica de descoberta."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid "The bounding size of the plane. This is a 2D size."
msgstr "O tamanho delimitador do plano. Este é um tamanho 2D."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid "The main alignment in space of this plane."
msgstr "O alinhamento principal no espaço deste plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid "The semantic label for this plane."
msgstr "O rótulo semântico para este plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRPlaneTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when our mesh data has changed the mesh instance and collision needs "
"to be updated."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando nossos dados de malha alteram a instância da malha e a "
"colisão precisa ser atualizada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModel.xml
msgid "This node will display an OpenXR render model."
msgstr "Este nó exibirá um modelo de renderização OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModel.xml
msgid ""
"This node will display an OpenXR render model by accessing the associated "
"GLTF and processes all animation data (if supported by the XR runtime).\n"
"Render models were introduced to allow showing the correct model for the "
"controller (or other device) the user has in hand, since the OpenXR action "
"map does not provide information about the hardware used by the user. Note "
"that while the controller (or device) can be somewhat inferred by the bound "
"action map profile, this is a dangerous approach as the user may be using "
"hardware not known at time of development and OpenXR will simply simulate an "
"available interaction profile."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModel.xml
msgid "Returns the top level path related to this render model."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho de nível superior relacionado a este modelo de "
"renderização."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModel.xml
msgid ""
"The render model RID for the render model to load, as returned by [method "
"OpenXRRenderModelExtension.render_model_create] or [method "
"OpenXRRenderModelExtension.render_model_get_all]."
msgstr ""
"O RID do modelo de renderização para o modelo de renderização a ser "
"carregado, conforme retornado por [method "
"OpenXRRenderModelExtension.render_model_create] ou [method "
"OpenXRRenderModelExtension.render_model_get_all]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModel.xml
msgid "Emitted when the top level path of this render model has changed."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o caminho de nível superior deste modelo de renderização foi "
"alterado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid "This class implements the OpenXR Render Model Extension."
msgstr "Esta classe implementa a Extensão de Modelo de Renderização OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"This class implements the OpenXR Render Model Extension, if enabled it will "
"maintain a list of active render models and provides an interface to the "
"render model data."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe implementa a Extensão de Modelo de Renderização OpenXR; se "
"ativada, ela manterá uma lista de modelos de renderização ativos e fornecerá "
"uma interface para os dados do modelo de renderização."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if OpenXR's render model extension is supported "
"and enabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only returns a valid value after OpenXR has been "
"initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a extensão de modelo de renderização do OpenXR "
"for compatível e estiver habilitada.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso só retorna um valor válido após o OpenXR ter sido "
"inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a render model object within OpenXR using a render model id.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function is exposed for dependent OpenXR extensions that "
"provide render model ids to be used with the render model extension."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Destroys a render model object within OpenXR that was previously created "
"with [method render_model_create].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This function is exposed for dependent OpenXR extensions that "
"provide render model ids to be used with the render model extension."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of all currently active render models registered with this "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um array de todos os modelos de renderização ativos atualmente "
"registrados com esta extensão."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the number of animatable nodes this render model has."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de nós animáveis que este modelo de renderização possui."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the name of the given animatable node."
msgstr "Retorna o nome do nó animável fornecido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current local transform for an animatable node. This is updated "
"every frame."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a transformação local atual para um nó animável. Isso é atualizado a "
"cada quadro."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the tracking confidence of the tracking data for the render model."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a confiança de rastreamento dos dados de rastreamento para o modelo "
"de renderização."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the root transform of a render model. This is the tracked position "
"relative to our [XROrigin3D] node."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a transformação raiz de um modelo de renderização. Esta é a posição "
"rastreada em relação ao nosso nó [XROrigin3D]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a list of active subaction paths for this [param render_model].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If different devices are bound to your actions than available "
"in suggested interaction bindings, this information shows paths related to "
"the interaction bindings being mimicked by that device."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the top level path associated with this [param render_model]. If "
"provided this identifies whether the render model is associated with the "
"player's hands or other body part."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho de nível superior associado a este [param render_model]. "
"Se fornecido, isso identifica se o modelo de renderização está associado às "
"mãos do jogador ou a outra parte do corpo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if this animatable node should be visible."
msgstr "Retorna [code]true[/code] se este nó animável deve estar visível."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an instance of a subscene that contains all [MeshInstance3D] nodes "
"that allow you to visualize the render model."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma instância de uma subcena que contém todos os nós "
"[MeshInstance3D] que permitem visualizar o modelo de renderização."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid "Emitted when a new render model is added."
msgstr "Emitido quando um novo modelo de renderização é adicionado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid "Emitted when a render model is removed."
msgstr "Emitido quando um modelo de renderização é removido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelExtension.xml
msgid "Emitted when the top level path associated with a render model changed."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o caminho de nível superior associado a um modelo de "
"renderização é alterado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid "Helper node that will automatically manage displaying render models."
msgstr ""
"Nó auxiliar que gerenciará automaticamente a exibição de modelos de "
"renderização."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"This helper node will automatically manage displaying render models. It will "
"create new [OpenXRRenderModel] nodes as controllers and other hand held "
"devices are detected, and remove those nodes when they are deactivated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you want more control over this logic you can alternatively "
"call [method OpenXRRenderModelExtension.render_model_get_all] to obtain a "
"list of active render model ids and create [OpenXRRenderModel] instances for "
"each render model id provided."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"Position render models local to this pose (this will adjust the position of "
"the render models container node)."
msgstr ""
"Posiciona os modelos de renderização locais a esta pose (isso ajustará a "
"posição do nó container dos modelos de renderização)."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"Limits render models to the specified tracker. Include: 0 = All render "
"models, 1 = Render models not related to a tracker, 2 = Render models "
"related to the left hand tracker, 3 = Render models related to the right "
"hand tracker."
msgstr ""
"Limita modelos de renderização ao rastreador especificado. Inclui: 0 = Todos "
"os modelos de renderização, 1 = Modelos de renderização não relacionados a "
"um rastreador, 2 = Modelos de renderização relacionados ao rastreador da mão "
"esquerda, 3 = Modelos de renderização relacionados ao rastreador da mão "
"direita."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid "Emitted when a render model node is added as a child to this node."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando um nó de modelo de renderização é adicionado como filho a "
"este nó."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a render model child node is about to be removed from this node."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando um nó filho de modelo de renderização está prestes a ser "
"removido deste nó."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"All active render models are shown regardless of what tracker they relate to."
msgstr ""
"Todos os modelos de renderização ativos são exibidos, independentemente do "
"rastreador a que se relacionam."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"Only active render models are shown that are not related to any tracker we "
"manage."
msgstr ""
"Apenas modelos de renderização ativos são mostrados que não estão "
"relacionados a nenhum rastreador que gerenciamos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"Only active render models are shown that are related to the left hand "
"tracker."
msgstr ""
"Apenas modelos de renderização ativos que estão relacionados ao rastreador "
"de mão esquerda são exibidos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRRenderModelManager.xml
msgid ""
"Only active render models are shown that are related to the right hand "
"tracker."
msgstr ""
"Apenas modelos de renderização ativos que estão relacionados ao rastreador "
"de mão direita são exibidos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid "Implementation for handling spatial entity anchor logic."
msgstr ""
"Implementação para manipulação de lógica de âncora de entidade espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"This is an internal class that handles the OpenXR anchor spatial entity "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"Esta é uma classe interna que lida com a extensão de entidade espacial de "
"âncora do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Calls [method create_persistence_context] with a configuration that likely "
"works with the XR runtime.\n"
"[param user_callback] is called when the context is created."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new anchor that will be tracked by the XR runtime. The [param "
"transform] should be a transform in the local space of your [XROrigin3D] "
"node. If [param spatial_context] is not specified the default will be used, "
"this requires [member ProjectSettings.xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/"
"enable_builtin_anchor_detection] to be set. The returned tracker will track "
"the location in case our reference space changes.\n"
"[param next] must be a valid next object for the "
"[code]XrSpatialAnchorCreateInfoEXT[/code] chain."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new persistence context for storing persistent data.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an asynchronous method and returns an "
"[OpenXRFutureResult] object with which to track the status, discarding this "
"object will not cancel the creation process. On success [param "
"user_callback] will be called if specified. The result value for this "
"function is the [RID] for our persistence context."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Calls [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.update_spatial_entities] and "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot] with the anchor "
"entities associated with [param spatial_context].\n"
"[param component_data] are the [OpenXRSpatialComponentData]s to update for "
"this anchor capability.\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_create] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.update_spatial_entities].\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_query] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Frees a persistence context previously created with [method "
"create_persistence_context]."
msgstr ""
"Libera um contexto de persistência criado anteriormente com [method "
"create_persistence_context]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the internal handle for this persistence context.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For GDExtension implementations."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o identificador interno deste contexto de persistência.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para implementações de GDExtension."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this persistence scope is supported by our "
"spatial anchor capability.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only valid after an OpenXR instance has been created."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este escopo de persistência for compatível com "
"nossa capacidade de âncoras espaciais.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Válido apenas após uma instância do OpenXR ter sido criada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if spatial anchors are supported by the hardware. "
"Only returns a valid value after OpenXR has been initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se âncoras espaciais forem suportadas pelo "
"hardware. Só retorna um valor válido após o OpenXR ter sido inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if persistent spatial anchors are supported by the "
"hardware. Only returns a valid value after OpenXR has been initialized."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se âncoras espaciais persistentes forem suportadas "
"pelo hardware. Só retorna um valor válido após o OpenXR ter sido "
"inicializado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Changes this anchor into a persistent anchor. This means its location will "
"be stored on the device and the anchor will be restored the next time your "
"application starts. If [param persistence_context] is not specified the "
"default will be used, this requires [member ProjectSettings.xr/openxr/"
"extensions/spatial_entity/enable_builtin_anchor_detection] to be set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an asynchronous method and returns an "
"[OpenXRFutureResult] object with which to track the status, discarding this "
"object will not cancel the creation process. On success [param "
"user_callback] will be called if specified. The result value for this "
"function is a boolean which will be set to [code]true[/code] on successful "
"completion."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Remove an anchor previously created with [method create_new_anchor]. If this "
"anchor was persistent you must first call [method unpersist_anchor] and "
"await its callback."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma âncora criada anteriormente com [method create_new_anchor]. Se "
"esta âncora for persistente, você deve primeiro chamar [method "
"unpersist_anchor] e aguardar o seu retorno de chamada."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Calls [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities] and "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot] with the anchor "
"entities associated with [param spatial_context].\n"
"[param component_data] are the [OpenXRSpatialComponentData]s to discover for "
"this anchor capability.\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_create] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities].\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_query] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot].\n"
"[param user_callback], when non-null, is called with two parameters usually "
"twice. The first parameter is the [RID] of the discovery snapshot and the "
"second parameter is a boolean where [code]false[/code] indicates the "
"discovery snapshot is about to be processed, and [code]true[/code] indicates "
"the discovery snapshot has been processed and [param component_data] has "
"valid data. The second call is skipped if an error was encountered.\n"
"The returned [OpenXRFutureResult] is identical to the return from [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the persistent data from this anchor. The runtime will not recreate "
"the anchor when your application restarts. If [param persistence_context] is "
"not specified the default will be used, this requires [member "
"ProjectSettings.xr/openxr/extensions/spatial_entity/enabled] to be set.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an asynchronous method and returns an "
"[OpenXRFutureResult] object with which to track the status, discarding this "
"object will not cancel the creation process. On success [param "
"user_callback] will be called if specified. The result value for this "
"function is a boolean which will be set to [code]true[/code] on successful "
"completion."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Provides the application with read-only access (i.e. application cannot "
"modify this scope) to spatial entities persisted and managed by the system. "
"The application can use the UUID in the persistence component for this scope "
"to correlate entities across spatial contexts and device reboots."
msgstr ""
"Fornece ao aplicativo acesso somente leitura (ou seja, o aplicativo não pode "
"modificar este escopo) a entidades espaciais persistidas e gerenciadas pelo "
"sistema. O aplicativo pode usar o UUID no componente de persistência para "
"este escopo para correlacionar entidades entre contextos espaciais e "
"reinicializações do dispositivo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Persistence operations and data access is limited to spatial anchors, on the "
"same device, for the same user and same app (using [method persist_anchor] "
"and [method unpersist_anchor] functions)"
msgstr ""
"As operações de persistência e o acesso aos dados são limitados a âncoras "
"espaciais, no mesmo dispositivo, para o mesmo usuário e o mesmo aplicativo "
"(usando as funções [method persist_anchor] e [method unpersist_anchor])"

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAnchor.xml
msgid "Configuration header for spatial anchors."
msgstr "Cabeçalho de configuração para âncoras espaciais."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAnchor.xml
msgid ""
"Configuration header for spatial anchors. Pass this to [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] to create a spatial "
"context with spatial anchor capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Cabeçalho de configuração para âncoras espaciais. Passe isso para [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] para criar um contexto "
"espacial com recursos de âncora espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAnchor.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationMicroQrCode.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationPlaneTracking.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationQrCode.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the components enabled by this configuration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only valid after this configuration was used to create a "
"spatial context."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
msgid "Configuration header for April tag markers."
msgstr "Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores April tag."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
msgid ""
"Configuration header for April tag markers. Pass this to [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] to create a spatial "
"context that can detect April tags."
msgstr ""
"Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores April tag. Passe isso para [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] para criar um contexto "
"espacial que possa detectar April tags."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
msgid ""
"Dictionary to use to decode April tags.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Must be set before using this configuration to create a spatial "
"context."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
msgid ""
"4 by 4 bits, minimum Hamming distance between any two codes = 5, 30 codes."
msgstr ""
"4 por 4 bits, distância de Hamming mínima entre quaisquer dois códigos = 5, "
"30 códigos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
msgid ""
"5 by 5 bits, minimum Hamming distance between any two codes = 9, 35 codes."
msgstr ""
"5 por 5 bits, distância de Hamming mínima entre quaisquer dois códigos = 9, "
"35 códigos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
msgid ""
"6 by 6 bits, minimum Hamming distance between any two codes = 10, 2320 codes."
msgstr ""
"6 por 6 bits, distância de Hamming mínima entre quaisquer dois códigos = 10, "
"2320 códigos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAprilTag.xml
msgid ""
"6 by 6 bits, minimum Hamming distance between any two codes = 11, 587 codes."
msgstr ""
"6 por 6 bits, distância de Hamming mínima entre quaisquer dois códigos = 11, "
"587 códigos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "Configuration header for Aruco markers."
msgstr "Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores Aruco."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid ""
"Configuration header for Aruco markers. Pass this to [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] to create a spatial "
"context that can detect Aruco markers."
msgstr ""
"Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores Aruco. Passe isso para [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] para criar um contexto "
"espacial que possa detectar marcadores Aruco."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid ""
"Dictionary to use to decode Aruco markers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Must be set before using this configuration to create a spatial "
"context."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "4 by 4 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 50 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 4 por 4 pixels com 50 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "4 by 4 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 100 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 4 por 4 pixels com 100 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "4 by 4 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 250 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 4 por 4 pixels com 250 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "4 by 4 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 1000 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 4 por 4 pixels com 1000 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "5 by 5 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 50 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 5 por 5 pixels com 50 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "5 by 5 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 100 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 5 por 5 pixels com 100 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "5 by 5 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 250 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 5 por 5 pixels com 250 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "5 by 5 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 1000 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 5 por 5 pixels com 1000 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "6 by 6 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 50 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 6 por 6 pixels com 50 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "6 by 6 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 100 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 6 por 6 pixels com 100 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "6 by 6 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 250 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 6 por 6 pixels com 250 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "6 by 6 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 1000 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 6 por 6 pixels com 1000 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "7 by 7 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 50 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 7 por 7 pixels com 50 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "7 by 7 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 100 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 7 por 7 pixels com 100 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "7 by 7 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 250 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 7 por 7 pixels com 250 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationAruco.xml
msgid "7 by 7 pixel Aruco marker dictionary with 1000 IDs."
msgstr "Dicionário de marcadores Aruco de 7 por 7 pixels com 1000 IDs."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid "Wrapper base class for OpenXR Spatial Capability Configuration headers."
msgstr ""
"Classe base de \"wrapper\" para cabeçalhos de Configuração de Capacidade "
"Espacial do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid ""
"Wrapper base class for OpenXR Spatial Capability Configuration headers. This "
"class needs to be implemented for each capability configuration structure "
"usable within OpenXR's spatial entities system."
msgstr ""
"Classe base de wrapper para cabeçalhos de Configuração de Capacidade "
"Espacial OpenXR. Esta classe precisa ser implementada para cada estrutura de "
"configuração de capacidade utilizável dentro do sistema de entidades "
"espaciais do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid ""
"Return a pointer (encoded as an [code]int64_t[/code]) to a struct holding "
"the spatial capability configuration data. The memory for this struct should "
"remain accessible as long as this object remains instantiated."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um ponteiro (codificado como um [code]int64_t[/code]) para uma "
"struct que contém os dados de configuração de capacidade espacial. A memória "
"para esta struct deve permanecer acessível enquanto este objeto permanecer "
"instanciado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid ""
"Return [code]true[/code] if this object contains a valid configuration that "
"can be retrieved when calling [method _get_configuration]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este objeto contiver uma configuração válida "
"que possa ser recuperada ao chamar [method _get_configuration]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid ""
"Gets a pointer to the [code]XrSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeaderEXT[/"
"code] struct.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used from GDExtensions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this object contains a valid configuration that "
"can be used when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este objeto contiver uma configuração válida "
"que possa ser usada ao chamar [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationMicroQrCode.xml
msgid "Configuration header for QR code markers."
msgstr "Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores de código QR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationMicroQrCode.xml
msgid ""
"Configuration header for QR code markers. Pass this to [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] to create a spatial "
"context that can detect QR code markers."
msgstr ""
"Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores de código QR. Passe isso para "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] para criar um "
"contexto espacial que possa detectar marcadores de código QR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationPlaneTracking.xml
msgid "Configuration header for plane tracking."
msgstr "Cabeçalho de configuração para rastreamento de plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationPlaneTracking.xml
msgid ""
"Configuration header for plane tracking. Pass this to [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] to create a spatial "
"context with plane tracking capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Cabeçalho de configuração para rastreamento de planos. Passe isso para "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] para criar um "
"contexto espacial com recursos de rastreamento de planos."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationPlaneTracking.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if we support the plane semantic label component "
"(only valid after the OpenXR session has started). You can query these using "
"the [OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList] data object."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se dermos suporte ao componente de rótulo "
"semântico de plano (válido apenas após o início da sessão OpenXR). Você pode "
"consultá-los usando o objeto de dados "
"[OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationPlaneTracking.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if we support the mesh 2D component (only valid "
"after the OpenXR session has started). You can query these using the "
"[OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh2DList] data object."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o componente mesh 2D for suportado (apenas "
"válido após a sessão OpenXR ter iniciado). Você pode consultá-los usando o "
"objeto de dados [OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh2DList]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationPlaneTracking.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if we support the polygon 2D component (only valid "
"after the OpenXR session has started). You can query these using the "
"[OpenXRSpatialComponentPolygon2DList] data object."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o componente polígono 2D for suportado (apenas "
"válido após a sessão OpenXR ter iniciado). Você pode consultá-los usando o "
"objeto de dados [OpenXRSpatialComponentPolygon2DList]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationQrCode.xml
msgid "Configuration header for micro QR code markers."
msgstr "Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores de microponto QR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationQrCode.xml
msgid ""
"Configuration header for micro QR code markers. Pass this to [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] to create a spatial "
"context that can detect micro QR code markers."
msgstr ""
"Cabeçalho de configuração para marcadores de micro QR code. Passe isso para "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] para criar um "
"contexto espacial que possa detectar marcadores de micro QR code."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentAnchorList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries anchor result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de âncora das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentAnchorList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries anchor result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de âncora das consultas ao "
"chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentAnchorList.xml
msgid "Returns the transform for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna a transformação para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded2DList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries bounded2d result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado bounded2d das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded2DList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries 2D bounding rectangle result data when "
"calling [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados do resultado do retângulo delimitador 2D de "
"consultas ao chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded2DList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the center of our bounding rectangle for the entity at this [param "
"index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o centro do nosso retângulo delimitador para a entidade neste [param "
"index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded2DList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the size of our bounding rectangle for the entity at this [param "
"index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho do nosso retângulo delimitador para a entidade neste "
"[param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded3DList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries bounded3d result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado bounded3d das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded3DList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries 3d bounding box result data when calling "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de caixa delimitadora 3D das "
"consultas ao chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded3DList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the center of our bounding box for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o centro da nossa caixa delimitadora para a entidade neste [param "
"index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentBounded3DList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the size of our bounding box for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tamanho da nossa caixa delimitadora para a entidade neste [param "
"index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentData.xml
msgid "Object for storing OpenXR spatial entity component data."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenamento de dados de componentes de entidade espacial "
"OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentData.xml
msgid "Return the component type for the component we store data for."
msgstr "Retorna o tipo de componente para o qual armazenamos dados."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentData.xml
msgid ""
"Return a pointer to the structure data that will be submitted along with the "
"snapshot query. This pointer must remain valid as long as this object is "
"instantiated."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um ponteiro para os dados da estrutura que serão enviados junto com "
"a consulta de snapshot. Este ponteiro deve permanecer válido enquanto este "
"objeto estiver instanciado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentData.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the expected capacity as provided by the spatial entities query system. "
"Buffers should be initialized with the correct storage."
msgstr ""
"Define a capacidade esperada conforme fornecida pelo sistema de consulta de "
"entidades espaciais. Os buffers devem ser inicializados com o armazenamento "
"correto."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentData.xml
msgid ""
"Gets this [OpenXRSpatialComponentData]'s [code]XrSpatialComponentTypeEXT[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o [code]XrSpatialComponentTypeEXT[/code] deste "
"[OpenXRSpatialComponentData]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries marker result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de marcador das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries marker result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de marcador das consultas ao "
"chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns either a [String] or a [PackedByteArray] buffer with data for the "
"marker at this [param index]. Only applicable for QR code markers."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma [String] ou um buffer [PackedByteArray] com dados para o "
"marcador neste [param index]. Aplicável apenas a marcadores de código QR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the marker ID for the marker at this [param index]. Only applicable "
"for Aruco or April Tag markers."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID do marcador para o marcador neste [param index]. Aplicável "
"apenas para marcadores Aruco ou April Tag."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Returns the marker type for the marker at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o tipo de marcador para o marcador neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Unknown or unset marker type."
msgstr "Tipo de marcador desconhecido ou não definido."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Marker based on a QR code."
msgstr "Marcador baseado em um código QR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Marker based on a micro QR code."
msgstr "Marcador baseado em um micro QR code."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Marker based on an Aruco code."
msgstr "Marcador baseado em um código Aruco."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Marker based on an April Tag."
msgstr "Marcador baseado em uma April Tag."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMarkerList.xml
msgid "Maximum value for this enum."
msgstr "Valor máximo para esta enumeração."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh2DList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries mesh2d result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de mesh2d das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh2DList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries 2D mesh result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de malha 2D das consultas ao "
"chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh2DList.xml
msgid "Returns the mesh indices for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna os índices da malha para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh2DList.xml
#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh3DList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the transform for positioning our mesh for the entity at this [param "
"index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a transformação para posicionar nossa malha para a entidade neste "
"[param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh2DList.xml
msgid "Returns the mesh vertices for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna os vértices da malha para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh3DList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries mesh3d result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de mesh3d das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh3DList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries 3d mesh result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de malha 3D das consultas ao "
"chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentMesh3DList.xml
msgid "Returns the mesh for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna a malha para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentParentList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries parent result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado pai das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentParentList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries parent result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de pai das consultas ao chamar "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentParentList.xml
msgid "Returns the RID for the parent entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o RID para a entidade pai neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPersistenceList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the query persistence result data."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de persistência da consulta."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPersistenceList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the query persistence result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de persistência de consulta ao "
"chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPersistenceList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the persistent state ([code]XrSpatialPersistenceStateEXT[/code]) for "
"the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o estado persistente ([code]XrSpatialPersistenceStateEXT[/code]) "
"para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPersistenceList.xml
msgid "Returns the persistent uuid for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o uuid persistente para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries plane alignment result data."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de alinhamento de plano de "
"consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries plane alignment result data when calling "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de alinhamento de plano das "
"consultas ao chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the plane alignment for the parent entity at this [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o alinhamento do plano para a entidade pai neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentList.xml
msgid "Plane is facing upward."
msgstr "O plano está voltado para cima."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentList.xml
msgid "Plane is facing downwards."
msgstr "O plano está voltado para baixo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentList.xml
msgid "Plane is vertically aligned."
msgstr "O plano está alinhado verticalmente."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentList.xml
msgid "Plane has an arbitrary alignment."
msgstr "O plano tem um alinhamento arbitrário."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries plane semantic label result data."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de rótulo semântico de plano de "
"consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries plane semantic label result data when calling "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados do resultado do rótulo semântico do plano de "
"consultas ao chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the plane semantic label for the parent entity at this [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o rótulo semântico do plano para a entidade pai neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid "Uncategorized plane."
msgstr "Plano não categorizado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid "Plane represents a floor."
msgstr "O plano representa um piso."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid "Plane represents a wall."
msgstr "O plano representa uma parede."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid "Plane represents a ceiling."
msgstr "O plano representa um teto."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelList.xml
msgid "Plane represents the surface of a table."
msgstr "O plano representa a superfície de uma mesa."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPolygon2DList.xml
msgid "Object for storing the queries polygon2d result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado polygon2d das consultas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPolygon2DList.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the queries 2D polygon result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os dados de resultado de polígono 2D das consultas ao "
"chamar [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPolygon2DList.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the transform for positioning our polygon for the entity at this "
"[param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a transformação para posicionar nosso polígono para a entidade neste "
"[param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialComponentPolygon2DList.xml
msgid "Returns the polygon vertices for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna os vértices do polígono para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialContextPersistenceConfig.xml
msgid "Configuration header for spatial persistence."
msgstr "Cabeçalho de configuração para persistência espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialContextPersistenceConfig.xml
msgid ""
"Configuration header for spatial persistence. Pass this to [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] as the next parameter "
"to create a spatial context with spatial persistence capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Cabeçalho de configuração para persistência espacial. Passe isso para "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.create_spatial_context] como o próximo "
"parâmetro para criar um contexto espacial com recursos de persistência "
"espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialContextPersistenceConfig.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a persistence context to this configuration. You must add at least one "
"persistence context to create a valid configuration. You can create a "
"persistence context by calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.create_persistence_context]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um contexto de persistência a esta configuração. Você deve "
"adicionar pelo menos um contexto de persistência para criar uma configuração "
"válida. Você pode criar um contexto de persistência chamando [method "
"OpenXRSpatialAnchorCapability.create_persistence_context]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialContextPersistenceConfig.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the persistence context(s) (as [RID]s) received by [method "
"add_persistence_context]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o(s) contexto(s) de persistência (como [RID]s) recebidos por [method "
"add_persistence_context]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialContextPersistenceConfig.xml
msgid "Removes a persistence context."
msgstr "Remove um contexto de persistência."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "OpenXR extension that handles spatial entities."
msgstr "Extensão do OpenXR que lida com entidades espaciais."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"OpenXR extension that handles spatial entities and, when enabled, allows "
"querying those spatial entities. This extension will also automatically "
"manage [XRTracker] objects for static entities."
msgstr ""
"Extensão OpenXR que lida com entidades espaciais e, quando habilitada, "
"permite consultar essas entidades espaciais. Esta extensão também gerenciará "
"automaticamente os objetos [XRTracker] para entidades estáticas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Registers an entity that was created directly on the OpenXR runtime."
msgstr ""
"Registra uma entidade que foi criada diretamente no tempo de execução do "
"OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new spatial context that handles entities for the provided "
"capability configurations. [param capability_configurations] is an array of "
"[OpenXRSpatialCapabilityConfigurationBaseHeader] with the needed capability "
"configuration data.\n"
"[param next] is an optional parameter that can contain additional "
"information for creating our spatial context.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an asynchronous method and returns an "
"[OpenXRFutureResult] object with which to track the status, discarding this "
"object will not cancel the creation process. On success [param "
"user_callback] will be called if specified. The result data for this "
"function is the [RID] for our spatial context."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Starts a new discovery query, this will gather all objects tracked by the "
"[param spatial_context] that have at least one of the component types "
"specified in [param component_types].\n"
"[param next] is an optional parameter that can contain additional "
"information for executing the discovery query.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is an asynchronous method and returns an "
"[OpenXRFutureResult] object with which to track the status, discarding this "
"object will not cancel the discovery process. On success [param "
"user_callback] will be called if specified. The result data for this "
"function is the [RID] for our snapshot."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Convenience method when the caller only has an [Array] of "
"[OpenXRSpatialComponentData] and needs to discover spatial entities."
msgstr ""
"Método de conveniência quando o chamador possui apenas um [Array] de "
"[OpenXRSpatialComponentData] e precisa descobrir entidades espaciais."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the [RID] for the specified spatial entity ID."
msgstr "Retorna o [RID] para o ID de entidade espacial especificado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Frees a spatial context previously created when calling [method "
"create_spatial_context]. If the spatial context creation is still ongoing, "
"the asynchronous process is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Libera um contexto espacial criado anteriormente ao chamar [method "
"create_spatial_context]. Se a criação do contexto espacial ainda estiver em "
"andamento, o processo assíncrono é cancelado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Frees an entity previously created when calling [method add_spatial_entity] "
"or [method make_spatial_entity]."
msgstr ""
"Libera uma entidade criada anteriormente ao chamar [method "
"add_spatial_entity] ou [method make_spatial_entity]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Frees a spatial snapshot previously created when calling [method "
"discover_spatial_entities]. If the spatial snapshot creation is still "
"ongoing, the asynchronous process is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Libera um instantâneo espacial criado anteriormente ao chamar [method "
"discover_spatial_entities]. Se a criação do instantâneo espacial ainda "
"estiver emandamento, o processo assíncrono será cancelado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a buffer with floats from a buffer that was retrieved when taking a "
"snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um buffer com números de ponto flutuante de um buffer recuperado ao "
"tirar um instantâneo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the OpenXR spatial context handle for this snapshot.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used from GDExtensions that "
"implement spatial entity capability handlers."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the spatial context finished its creation and "
"is ready to be used."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o contexto espacial terminou sua criação e está "
"pronto para ser usado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the spatial context for this entity."
msgstr "Retorna o contexto espacial para esta entidade."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the internal [code]XrSpatialEntityIdEXT[/code] associated with the "
"entity."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [code]XrSpatialEntityIdEXT[/code] interno associado à entidade."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Returns the spatial context related to this spatial snapshot."
msgstr "Retorna o contexto espacial relacionado a este snapshot espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the OpenXR spatial snapshot handle for this snapshot.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used from GDExtensions that "
"implement spatial entity capability handlers."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a string from a buffer that was retrieved when taking a snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma string de um buffer que foi recuperado ao tirar um snapshot."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a buffer with 8 bit ints from a buffer that was retrieved when "
"taking a snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um buffer com inteiros de 8 bits de um buffer recuperado ao tirar um "
"instantâneo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a buffer with 16 bit ints from a buffer that was retrieved when "
"taking a snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um buffer com inteiros de 16 bits de um buffer recuperado ao tirar "
"um instantâneo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a buffer with 32 bit ints from a buffer that was retrieved when "
"taking a snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um buffer com inteiros de 32 bits de um buffer recuperado ao tirar "
"um instantâneo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a buffer with [Vector2] entries from a buffer that was retrieved "
"when taking a snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um buffer com entradas [Vector2] de um buffer que foi recuperado ao "
"tirar um instantâneo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a buffer with [Vector3] entries from a buffer that was retrieved "
"when taking a snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um buffer com entradas [Vector3] de um buffer que foi recuperado ao "
"tirar um instantâneo."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new entity for this [param entity_id]. The [param spatial_context] "
"should match the context that discovered the entity."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma nova entidade para este [param entity_id]. O [param "
"spatial_context] deve corresponder ao contexto que descobriu a entidade."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Queries the snapshot data. This will find all entities in the snapshot that "
"contain all requested components in [param component_data]. The objects held "
"within [param component_data] will then be populated with the queried data. "
"[param component_data] must always have an object of "
"[OpenXRSpatialQueryResultData] as the first entry.\n"
"[param next] is an optional parameter that can contain additional "
"information passed when setting our query conditions."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this spatial entity [param capability] is "
"supported by the hardware used."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se esta [param capability] de entidade espacial "
"for suportada pelo hardware utilizado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [param capability] supports the [param "
"component_type]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se esta [param capability] suportar o [param "
"component_type]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Performs a snapshot for a limited number of entities. This is NOT an "
"asynchronous method and will return the snapshot immediately."
msgstr ""
"Executa um instantâneo para um número limitado de entidades. Este NÃO é um "
"método assíncrono e retornará o instantâneo imediatamente."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when OpenXR recommends running a discovery query because entities "
"managed by this spatial context have (likely) changed."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o OpenXR recomenda executar uma consulta de descoberta porque "
"as entidades gerenciadas por este contexto espacial (provavelmente) mudaram."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Plane tracking capability."
msgstr "Capacidade de rastreamento de plano."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "QR code based marker tracking capability."
msgstr "Capacidade de rastreamento de marcadores baseada em código QR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Micro QR code based marker tracking capability."
msgstr "Capacidade de rastreamento de marcadores baseada em microponto QR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Aruco marker based marker tracking capability."
msgstr "Capacidade de rastreamento de marcadores baseada em marcador Aruco."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "April tag based marker tracking capability."
msgstr "Capacidade de rastreamento de marcadores baseada em April tag."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid "Anchor capability."
msgstr "Capacidade de ancoragem."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides the 2D bounds for a spatial entity. The "
"corresponding list structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentBounded2DListEXT[/"
"code]; the corresponding data structure is [code]XrSpatialBounded2DDataEXT[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece os limites 2D para uma entidade espacial. A estrutura "
"de lista correspondente é [code]XrSpatialComponentBounded2DListEXT[/code]; a "
"estrutura de dados correspondente é [code]XrSpatialBounded2DDataEXT[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides the 3D bounds for a spatial entity. The "
"corresponding list structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentBounded3DListEXT[/"
"code]; the corresponding data structure is [code]XrBoxf[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece os limites 3D para uma entidade espacial. A estrutura "
"de lista correspondente é [code]XrSpatialComponentBounded3DListEXT[/code]; a "
"estrutura de dados correspondente é [code]XrBoxf[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides the XrSpatialEntityIdEXT of the parent for a spatial "
"entity. The corresponding list structure is "
"[code]XrSpatialComponentParentListEXT[/code]; the corresponding data "
"structure is [code]XrSpatialEntityIdEXT[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece o XrSpatialEntityIdEXT do pai para uma entidade "
"espacial. A estrutura de lista correspondente é "
"[code]XrSpatialComponentParentListEXT[/code]; a estrutura de dados "
"correspondente é [code]XrSpatialEntityIdEXT[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides a 3D mesh for a spatial entity. The corresponding "
"list structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentMesh3DListEXT[/code]; the "
"corresponding data structure is [code]XrSpatialMeshDataEXT[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece uma malha 3D para uma entidade espacial. A estrutura "
"de lista correspondente é [code]XrSpatialComponentMesh3DListEXT[/code]; a "
"estrutura de dados correspondente é [code]XrSpatialMeshDataEXT[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides the plane alignment enum for a spatial entity. The "
"corresponding list structure is "
"[code]XrSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentListEXT[/code]; the corresponding data "
"structure is [code]XrSpatialPlaneAlignmentEXT[/code] (Added by the "
"[code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece o enum de alinhamento de plano para uma entidade "
"espacial. A estrutura de lista correspondente é "
"[code]XrSpatialComponentPlaneAlignmentListEXT[/code]; a estrutura de dados "
"correspondente é [code]XrSpatialPlaneAlignmentEXT[/code] (Adicionado pela "
"extensão [code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides a 2D mesh for a spatial entity. The corresponding "
"list structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentMesh2DListEXT[/code]; the "
"corresponding data structure is [code]XrSpatialMeshDataEXT[/code] (Added by "
"the [code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece uma malha 2D para uma entidade espacial. A estrutura "
"de lista correspondente é [code]XrSpatialComponentMesh2DListEXT[/code]; a "
"estrutura de dados correspondente é [code]XrSpatialMeshDataEXT[/code] "
"(Adicionado pela extensão [code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides a 2D boundary polygon for a spatial entity. The "
"corresponding list structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentPolygon2DListEXT[/"
"code]; the corresponding data structure is [code]XrSpatialPolygon2DDataEXT[/"
"code] (Added by the [code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece um polígono de limite 2D para uma entidade espacial. "
"A estrutura de lista correspondente é "
"[code]XrSpatialComponentPolygon2DListEXT[/code]; a estrutura de dados "
"correspondente é [code]XrSpatialPolygon2DDataEXT[/code] (Adicionado pela "
"extensão [code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides a semantic label for a plane. The corresponding list "
"structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelListEXT[/code]; the "
"corresponding data structure is [code]XrSpatialPlaneSemanticLabelEXT[/code] "
"(Added by the [code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece um rótulo semântico para um plano. A estrutura de "
"lista correspondente é [code]XrSpatialComponentPlaneSemanticLabelListEXT[/"
"code]; a estrutura de dados correspondente é "
"[code]XrSpatialPlaneSemanticLabelEXT[/code] (Adicionado pela extensão "
"[code]XR_EXT_spatial_plane_tracking[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"A component describing the marker type, ID and location. The corresponding "
"list structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentMarkerListEXT[/code]; the "
"corresponding data structure is [code]XrSpatialMarkerDataEXT[/code] (Added "
"by the [code]XR_EXT_spatial_marker_tracking[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Um componente que descreve o tipo, ID e local do marcador. A estrutura de "
"lista correspondente é [code]XrSpatialComponentMarkerListEXT[/code]; a "
"estrutura de dados correspondente é [code]XrSpatialMarkerDataEXT[/code] "
"(Adicionado pela extensão [code]XR_EXT_spatial_marker_tracking[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides the location for an anchor. The corresponding list "
"structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentAnchorListEXT[/code]; the corresponding "
"data structure is [code]XrPosef[/code] (Added by the "
"[code]XR_EXT_spatial_anchor[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece o local para uma âncora. A estrutura de lista "
"correspondente é [code]XrSpatialComponentAnchorListEXT[/code]; a estrutura "
"de dados correspondente é [code]XrPosef[/code] (Adicionado pela extensão "
"[code]XR_EXT_spatial_anchor[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Component that provides the persisted UUID for a spatial entity. The "
"corresponding list structure is [code]XrSpatialComponentPersistenceListEXT; "
"the corresponding data structure is [code]XrSpatialPersistenceDataEXT[/code] "
"(Added by the [code]XR_EXT_spatial_persistence[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Componente que fornece o UUID persistido para uma entidade espacial. A "
"estrutura de lista correspondente é "
"[code]XrSpatialComponentPersistenceListEXT; a estrutura de dados "
"correspondente é [code]XrSpatialPersistenceDataEXT[/code] (Adicionado pela "
"extensão [code]XR_EXT_spatial_persistence[/code])."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for Positional trackers managed by OpenXR's spatial entity "
"extensions."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para rastreadores posicionais gerenciados pelas extensões de "
"entidade espacial do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid ""
"These are trackers created and managed by OpenXR's spatial entity extensions "
"that give access to specific data related to OpenXR's spatial entities. They "
"will always be of type [code]TRACKER_ANCHOR[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Estes são rastreadores criados e gerenciados pelas extensões de entidades "
"espaciais do OpenXR que fornecem acesso a dados específicos relacionados às "
"entidades espaciais do OpenXR. Eles serão sempre do tipo "
"[code]TRACKER_ANCHOR[/code]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new [OpenXRStructureBase] to the next-chain.\n"
"[method get_next] will return this [param next] until either [method "
"add_next] is called again or it's removed in [method remove_next]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the head [OpenXRStructureBase] in the next-chain.\n"
"See also [method add_next] and [method remove_next]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the spatial context used to create this [OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém o contexto espacial usado para criar este [OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a [param next] object previously added in [method add_next] from the "
"next-chain."
msgstr ""
"Remove um objeto [param next] adicionado anteriormente em [method add_next] "
"da cadeia seguinte."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid "Sets the spatial context used to create this tracker."
msgstr "Define o contexto espacial usado para criar este rastreador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid "The spatial entity associated with this tracker."
msgstr "A entidade espacial associada a este rastreador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid "The spatial tracking state for this tracker."
msgstr "O estado de rastreamento espacial para este rastreador."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the next-chain changes, from either [method add_next] or "
"[method remove_next]."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando a cadeia seguinte muda, seja por [method add_next] ou [method "
"remove_next]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid "This anchor has stopped tracking."
msgstr "Esta âncora parou de rastrear."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid "Tracking is currently paused."
msgstr "O rastreamento está pausado no momento."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialEntityTracker.xml
msgid "This anchor is currently being tracked."
msgstr "Esta âncora está sendo rastreada no momento."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid "Implementation for handling spatial entity marker tracking logic."
msgstr ""
"Implementação para manipulação de lógica de rastreamento de marcador de "
"entidade espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid "This class handles the OpenXR marker tracking spatial entity extension."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe lida com a extensão de entidade espacial de rastreamento de "
"marcador OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Calls [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.update_spatial_entities] and "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot] with the marker "
"entities associated with [param spatial_context].\n"
"[param component_data] are the [OpenXRSpatialComponentData]s to update for "
"this marker capability.\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_create] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.update_spatial_entities].\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_query] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if April tag marker tracking is supported by the "
"current device."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o rastreamento de marcadores April tag for "
"suportado pelo dispositivo atual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if Aruco marker tracking is supported by the "
"current device."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o rastreamento de marcadores Aruco for "
"suportado pelo dispositivo atual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if micro QR code marker tracking is supported by "
"the current device."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o rastreamento de marcadores de micromarcos QR "
"for suportado pelo dispositivo atual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if QR code marker tracking is supported by the "
"current device."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o rastreamento de marcadores de código QR for "
"suportado pelo dispositivo atual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialMarkerTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Calls [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities] and "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot] with the marker "
"entities associated with [param spatial_context].\n"
"[param component_data] are the [OpenXRSpatialComponentData]s to discover for "
"this marker capability.\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_create] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities].\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_query] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot].\n"
"[param user_callback], when non-null, is called with two parameters usually "
"twice. The first parameter is the [RID] of the discovery snapshot and the "
"second parameter is a boolean where [code]false[/code] indicates the "
"discovery snapshot is about to be processed, and [code]true[/code] indicates "
"the discovery snapshot has been processed and [param component_data] has "
"valid data. The second call is skipped if an error was encountered.\n"
"The returned [OpenXRFutureResult] is identical to the return from [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability.xml
msgid "Implementation for handling spatial entity plane tracking logic."
msgstr ""
"Implementação para manipulação de lógica de rastreamento de plano de "
"entidade espacial."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability.xml
msgid "This class handles the OpenXR plane tracking spatial entity extension."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe lida com a extensão de entidade espacial de rastreamento de "
"plano OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if plane tracking is supported by the current "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o rastreamento de planos for suportado pelo "
"dispositivo atual."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialPlaneTrackingCapability.xml
msgid ""
"Calls [method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities] and "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot] with the plane entities "
"associated with [param spatial_context].\n"
"[param component_data] are the [OpenXRSpatialComponentData]s to discover for "
"this plane capability.\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_create] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities].\n"
"If [param next_snapshot_query] is non-null, then pass this to the "
"[code]next[/code] parameter in [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot].\n"
"[param user_callback], when non-null, is called with two parameters usually "
"twice. The first parameter is the [RID] of the discovery snapshot and the "
"second parameter is a boolean where [code]false[/code] indicates the "
"discovery snapshot is about to be processed, and [code]true[/code] indicates "
"the discovery snapshot has been processed and [param component_data] has "
"valid data. The second call is skipped if an error was encountered.\n"
"The returned [OpenXRFutureResult] is identical to the return from [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.discover_spatial_entities]."
msgstr ""

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialQueryResultData.xml
msgid "Object for storing the main query result data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar os principais dados de resultados de consulta."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialQueryResultData.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing the main query result data when calling [method "
"OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]. This must always be the first "
"component requested."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar os principais dados de resultado de consulta ao chamar "
"[method OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension.query_snapshot]. Este deve ser sempre o "
"primeiro componente solicitado."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialQueryResultData.xml
msgid "Returns the number of entities that were retrieved."
msgstr "Retorna o número de entidades que foram recuperadas."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialQueryResultData.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the entity id ([code]XrSpatialEntityIdEXT[/code]) for the entity at "
"this [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID da entidade ([code]XrSpatialEntityIdEXT[/code]) para a entidade "
"neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRSpatialQueryResultData.xml
msgid "Returns the entity state for the entity at this [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o estado da entidade para a entidade neste [param index]."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRStructureBase.xml
msgid "Object for storing OpenXR structure data."
msgstr "Objeto para armazenar dados de estrutura OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRStructureBase.xml
msgid ""
"Object for storing OpenXR structure data that is passed when calling into "
"OpenXR APIs."
msgstr ""
"Objeto para armazenar dados de estrutura OpenXR que são passados ao chamar "
"as APIs do OpenXR."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRStructureBase.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the structure type (OpenXR [code]XrStructureType[/code]) used for "
"this structure."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo de estrutura ([code]XrStructureType[/code] do OpenXR) usado "
"para esta estrutura."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRStructureBase.xml
msgid ""
"Setting another structure object here chains these structures together to "
"extend the API functionality. Consult the OpenXR documentation for which "
"structures can be used with a given API call."
msgstr ""
"Definir outro objeto de estrutura aqui encadeia essas estruturas para "
"estender a funcionalidade da API. Consulte a documentação do OpenXR para "
"saber quais estruturas podem ser usadas com uma determinada chamada de API."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRVisibilityMask.xml
msgid "Draws a stereo correct visibility mask."
msgstr "Desenha uma máscara de visibilidade estéreo correta."

#: modules/openxr/doc_classes/OpenXRVisibilityMask.xml
msgid ""
"The visibility mask allows us to black out the part of the render result "
"that is invisible due to lens distortion.\n"
"As this is rendered first, it prevents fragments with expensive lighting "
"calculations to be processed as they are discarded through z-checking."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptimizedTranslation.xml
msgid "An optimized translation."
msgstr "Uma tradução otimizada."

#: doc/classes/OptimizedTranslation.xml
msgid ""
"An optimized translation. Uses real-time compressed translations, which "
"results in very small dictionaries.\n"
"This class does not store the untranslated strings for optimization "
"purposes. Therefore, [method Translation.get_message_list] always returns an "
"empty array, and [method Translation.get_message_count] always returns "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptimizedTranslation.xml
msgid ""
"Generates and sets an optimized translation from the given [Translation] "
"resource. Returns [code]true[/code] if successful.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Messages in [param from] should not use context or plural "
"forms.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used in the editor. It does "
"nothing when called from an exported project."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"A button that brings up a dropdown with selectable options when pressed."
msgstr ""
"Um botão que exibe um menu suspenso com opções selecionáveis quando "
"pressionado."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"[OptionButton] is a type of button that brings up a dropdown with selectable "
"items when pressed. The item selected becomes the \"current\" item and is "
"displayed as the button text.\n"
"See also [BaseButton] which contains common properties and methods "
"associated with this node.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The IDs used for items are limited to signed 32-bit integers, "
"not the full 64 bits of [int]. These have a range of [code]-2^31[/code] to "
"[code]2^31 - 1[/code], that is, [code]-2147483648[/code] to "
"[code]2147483647[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [member Button.text] and [member Button.icon] properties "
"are set automatically based on the selected item. They shouldn't be changed "
"manually."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an item, with a [param texture] icon, text [param label] and "
"(optionally) [param id]. If no [param id] is passed, the item index will be "
"used as the item's ID. New items are appended at the end.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The item will be selected if there are no other items."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an item, with text [param label] and (optionally) [param id]. If no "
"[param id] is passed, the item index will be used as the item's ID. New "
"items are appended at the end.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The item will be selected if there are no other items."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a separator to the list of items. Separators help to group items, and "
"can optionally be given a [param text] header. A separator also gets an "
"index assigned, and is appended at the end of the item list."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um separador à lista de itens. Os separadores ajudam a agrupar "
"itens e podem opcionalmente receber um cabeçalho [param text]. Um separador "
"também recebe um índice atribuído e é anexado ao final da lista de itens."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Clears all the items in the [OptionButton]."
msgstr "Limpa todos os itens no [OptionButton]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Returns the auto translate mode of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o modo de tradução automática do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Returns the icon of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o ícone do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Returns the ID of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o ID do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Returns the index of the item with the given [param id]."
msgstr "Retorna o índice do item com o [param id] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Retrieves the metadata of an item. Metadata may be any type and can be used "
"to store extra information about an item, such as an external string ID."
msgstr ""
"Recupera os metadados de um item. Os metadados podem ser de qualquer tipo e "
"podem ser usados para armazenar informações extras sobre um item, como um ID "
"de string externo."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Returns the text of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna o texto do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Returns the tooltip of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Retorna a dica de ferramenta (tooltip) do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the first item which is not disabled, or marked as a "
"separator. If [param from_last] is [code]true[/code], the items will be "
"searched in reverse order.\n"
"Returns [code]-1[/code] if no item is found."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the selected item, or [code]-1[/code] if no item is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID do item selecionado ou [code]-1[/code] se nenhum item estiver "
"selecionado."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the metadata of the selected item. Metadata for items can be set using "
"[method set_item_metadata]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém os metadados do item selecionado. Metadados para itens podem ser "
"definidos usando [method set_item_metadata]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this button contains at least one item which is "
"not disabled, or marked as a separator."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este botão contiver pelo menos um item que não "
"esteja desativado ou marcado como um separador."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at index [param idx] is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o item no índice [param idx] estiver "
"desabilitado."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at index [param idx] is marked as a "
"separator."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o item no índice [param idx] estiver marcado "
"como separador."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Removes the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Remove o item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Selects an item by index and makes it the current item. This will work even "
"if the item is disabled.\n"
"Passing [code]-1[/code] as the index deselects any currently selected item."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the auto translate mode of the item at index [param idx].\n"
"Items use [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT] by default, which uses "
"the same auto translate mode as the [OptionButton] itself."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the item at index [param idx] is disabled.\n"
"Disabled items are drawn differently in the dropdown and are not selectable "
"by the user. If the current selected item is set as disabled, it will remain "
"selected."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Sets the icon of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Define o ícone do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Sets the ID of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Define o ID do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the metadata of an item. Metadata may be of any type and can be used to "
"store extra information about an item, such as an external string ID."
msgstr ""
"Define os metadados de um item. Os metadados podem ser de qualquer tipo e "
"podem ser usados para armazenar informações extras sobre um item, como um ID "
"de string externo."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Sets the text of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Define o texto do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "Sets the tooltip of the item at index [param idx]."
msgstr "Define a dica de ferramenta (tooltip) do item no índice [param idx]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Adjusts popup position and sizing for the [OptionButton], then shows the "
"[PopupMenu]. Prefer this over using [code]get_popup().popup()[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta a posição e o tamanho do pop-up para o [OptionButton], e então mostra "
"o [PopupMenu]. Prefira isso em vez de usar [code]get_popup().popup()[/code]."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], minimum size will be determined by the longest item's "
"width, instead of the currently selected one's. It will also take the "
"popup's margins into account, making the button match its total width.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] For performance reasons, the minimum size doesn't update "
"immediately when adding, removing or modifying items."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "The number of items to select from."
msgstr "O número de itens para selecionar."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows a search bar at the top of the [PopupMenu] for "
"filtering items. See [member search_bar_min_item_count] for dynamically "
"controlling its visibility based on the number of items."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe uma barra de pesquisa na parte superior do "
"[PopupMenu] para filtrar itens. Consulte [member search_bar_min_item_count] "
"para controlar dinamicamente sua visibilidade com base no número de itens."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables fuzzy searching in the [PopupMenu] search bar. "
"This allows the search results to include items that almost match the search "
"query, as well items that match the individual characters of the search "
"query, but not in sequence.\n"
"Use [member search_bar_fuzzy_search_max_misses] to set the maximum number of "
"mismatches allowed in the search results."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum number of mismatches allowed in each search result when "
"fuzzy searching is enabled for the [PopupMenu] search bar. Any item with "
"more mismatches will be hidden from the search results."
msgstr ""
"Define o número máximo de incompatibilidades permitidas em cada resultado de "
"pesquisa quando a pesquisa difusa (fuzzy) está ativada para a barra de "
"pesquisa do [PopupMenu]. Qualquer item com mais incompatibilidades será "
"ocultado dos resultados da pesquisa."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the minimum number of items required for the [PopupMenu] search bar to "
"be visible. [member search_bar_enabled] must be [code]true[/code] for this "
"to have any effect."
msgstr ""
"Define o número mínimo de itens necessários para que a barra de pesquisa do "
"[PopupMenu] fique visível. [member search_bar_enabled] deve ser [code]true[/"
"code] para que isso tenha qualquer efeito."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"The index of the currently selected item, or [code]-1[/code] if no item is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"O índice do item atualmente selecionado, ou [code]-1[/code] se nenhum item "
"estiver selecionado."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user navigates to an item using the [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] or [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_down] input "
"actions. The index of the item focused is passed as argument."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o usuário navega para um item usando as ações de entrada "
"[member ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] ou [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_down]. O índice do item em foco é passado como argumento."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the current item has been changed by the user. The index of the "
"item selected is passed as argument.\n"
"[member allow_reselect] must be enabled to reselect an item."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"The horizontal space between the arrow icon and the right edge of the button."
msgstr "O espaço horizontal entre o ícone de seta e a borda direita do botão."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid ""
"If different than [code]0[/code], the arrow icon will be modulated to the "
"font color."
msgstr ""
"Se for diferente de [code]0[/code], o ícone de seta será modulado para a cor "
"da fonte."

#: doc/classes/OptionButton.xml
msgid "The arrow icon to be drawn on the right end of the button."
msgstr "O ícone de seta a ser desenhado na extremidade direita do botão."

#: doc/classes/ORMMaterial3D.xml
msgid ""
"A PBR (Physically Based Rendering) material to be used on 3D objects. Uses "
"an ORM texture."
msgstr ""
"Um material PBR (renderização baseada em física) para ser usado em objetos "
"3D. Usa uma textura ORM."

#: doc/classes/ORMMaterial3D.xml
msgid ""
"ORMMaterial3D's properties are inherited from [BaseMaterial3D]. Unlike "
"[StandardMaterial3D], ORMMaterial3D uses a single texture for ambient "
"occlusion, roughness and metallic maps, known as an ORM texture."
msgstr ""
"As propriedades de ORMMaterial3D são herdadas de [BaseMaterial3D]. Ao "
"contrário do [StandardMaterial3D], o ORMMaterial3D usa uma única textura "
"para mapas de oclusão de ambiente, rugosidade e metalidade, conhecida como "
"textura ORM."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Provides access to common operating system functionalities."
msgstr "Fornece acesso a funcionalidades comuns do sistema operacional."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"The [OS] class wraps the most common functionalities for communicating with "
"the host operating system, such as the video driver, delays, environment "
"variables, execution of binaries, command line, etc.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In Godot 4, [OS] functions related to window management, "
"clipboard, and TTS were moved to the [DisplayServer] singleton (and the "
"[Window] class). Functions related to time were removed and are only "
"available in the [Time] class."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Add a custom logger to intercept the internal message stream."
msgstr ""
"Adicionar um registrador personalizado para interceptar o fluxo de mensagens "
"interno."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Displays a modal dialog box using the host platform's implementation. The "
"engine execution is blocked until the dialog is closed."
msgstr ""
"Exibe uma caixa de diálogo modal usando a implementação da plataforma host. "
"A execução do motor é bloqueada até que o diálogo seja fechado."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Shuts down the system MIDI driver. Godot will no longer receive "
"[InputEventMIDI]. See also [method open_midi_inputs] and [method "
"get_connected_midi_inputs].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, Windows, and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Crashes the engine (or the editor if called within a [code]@tool[/code] "
"script). See also [method kill].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method should [i]only[/i] be used for testing the system's "
"crash handler, not for any other purpose. For general error reporting, use "
"(in order of preference) [method @GDScript.assert], [method "
"@GlobalScope.push_error], or [method alert]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new instance of Godot that runs independently. The [param "
"arguments] are used in the given order and separated by a space.\n"
"If the process is successfully created, this method returns the new process' "
"ID, which you can use to monitor the process (and potentially terminate it "
"with [method kill]). If the process cannot be created, this method returns "
"[code]-1[/code].\n"
"See [method create_process] if you wish to run a different process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux, macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new process that runs independently of Godot. It will not "
"terminate when Godot terminates. The path specified in [param path] must "
"exist and be an executable file or macOS [code].app[/code] bundle. The path "
"is resolved based on the current platform. The [param arguments] are used in "
"the given order and separated by a space.\n"
"On Windows, if [param open_console] is [code]true[/code] and the process is "
"a console app, a new terminal window will be opened.\n"
"If the process is successfully created, this method returns its process ID, "
"which you can use to monitor the process (and potentially terminate it with "
"[method kill]). Otherwise, this method returns [code]-1[/code].\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Run another instance of the project:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var pid = OS.create_process(OS.get_executable_path(), [])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var pid = OS.CreateProcess(OS.GetExecutablePath(), []);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See [method execute] if you wish to run an external command and retrieve the "
"results.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux, macOS, and "
"Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed applications are limited to run only "
"embedded helper executables, specified during export or system .app bundle, "
"system .app bundles will ignore arguments."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo processo que roda independentemente do Godot. Ele não será "
"encerrado quando o Godot for encerrado. O caminho especificado em [param "
"path] deve existir e ser um arquivo executável ou um pacote [code].app[/"
"code] do macOS. O caminho é resolvido com base na plataforma atual. Os "
"[param arguments] são usados na ordem fornecida e separados por um espaço.\n"
"No Windows, se [param open_console] for [code]true[/code] e o processo for "
"um aplicativo de console, uma nova janela de terminal será aberta.\n"
"Se o processo for criado com sucesso, este método retorna seu ID de "
"processo, que você pode usar para monitorar o processo (e potencialmente "
"encerrá-lo com [method kill]). Caso contrário, este método retorna [code]-1[/"
"code].\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Executar outra instância do projeto:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var pid = OS.create_process(OS.get_executable_path(), [])\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var pid = OS.CreateProcess(OS.GetExecutablePath(), []);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Veja [method execute] se desejar executar um comando externo e recuperar os "
"resultados.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, Linux, macOS e Windows.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No macOS, aplicativos em sandbox são limitados a rodar apenas "
"executáveis auxiliares embutidos, especificados durante a exportação ou "
"pacote .app do sistema; pacotes .app do sistema ignorarão os argumentos."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Delays execution of the current thread by [param msec] milliseconds. [param "
"msec] must be greater than or equal to [code]0[/code]. Otherwise, [method "
"delay_msec] does nothing and prints an error message.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method delay_msec] is a [i]blocking[/i] way to delay code "
"execution. To delay code execution in a non-blocking way, you may use "
"[method SceneTree.create_timer]. Awaiting with [SceneTreeTimer] delays the "
"execution of code placed below the [code]await[/code] without affecting the "
"rest of the project (or editor, for [EditorPlugin]s and [EditorScript]s).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [method delay_msec] is called on the main thread, it will "
"freeze the project and will prevent it from redrawing and registering input "
"until the delay has passed. When using [method delay_msec] as part of an "
"[EditorPlugin] or [EditorScript], it will freeze the editor but won't freeze "
"the project if it is currently running (since the project is an independent "
"child process)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Delays execution of the current thread by [param usec] microseconds. [param "
"usec] must be greater than or equal to [code]0[/code]. Otherwise, [method "
"delay_usec] does nothing and prints an error message.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method delay_usec] is a [i]blocking[/i] way to delay code "
"execution. To delay code execution in a non-blocking way, you may use "
"[method SceneTree.create_timer]. Awaiting with a [SceneTreeTimer] delays the "
"execution of code placed below the [code]await[/code] without affecting the "
"rest of the project (or editor, for [EditorPlugin]s and [EditorScript]s).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When [method delay_usec] is called on the main thread, it will "
"freeze the project and will prevent it from redrawing and registering input "
"until the delay has passed. When using [method delay_usec] as part of an "
"[EditorPlugin] or [EditorScript], it will freeze the editor but won't freeze "
"the project if it is currently running (since the project is an independent "
"child process)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Executes the given process in a [i]blocking[/i] way. The file specified in "
"[param path] must exist and be executable. The system path resolution will "
"be used. The [param arguments] are used in the given order, separated by "
"spaces, and wrapped in quotes.\n"
"If an [param output] array is provided, the complete shell output of the "
"process is appended to [param output] as a single [String] element. If "
"[param read_stderr] is [code]true[/code], the output to the standard error "
"stream is also appended to the array.\n"
"On Windows, if [param open_console] is [code]true[/code] and the process is "
"a console app, a new terminal window is opened.\n"
"This method returns the exit code of the command, or [code]-1[/code] if the "
"process fails to execute.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The main thread will be blocked until the executed command "
"terminates. Use [Thread] to create a separate thread that will not block the "
"main thread, or use [method create_process] to create a completely "
"independent process.\n"
"For example, to retrieve a list of the working directory's contents:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var output = []\n"
"var exit_code = OS.execute(\"ls\", [\"-l\", \"/tmp\"], output)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array output = [];\n"
"int exitCode = OS.Execute(\"ls\", [\"-l\", \"/tmp\"], output);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"If you wish to access a shell built-in or execute a composite command, a "
"platform-specific shell can be invoked. For example:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var output = []\n"
"OS.execute(\"CMD.exe\", [\"/C\", \"cd %TEMP% && dir\"], output)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array output = [];\n"
"OS.Execute(\"CMD.exe\", [\"/C\", \"cd %TEMP% && dir\"], output);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux, macOS, and "
"Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To execute a Windows command interpreter built-in command, "
"specify [code]cmd.exe[/code] in [param path], [code]/c[/code] as the first "
"argument, and the desired command as the second argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To execute a PowerShell built-in command, specify "
"[code]powershell.exe[/code] in [param path], [code]-Command[/code] as the "
"first argument, and the desired command as the second argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To execute a Unix shell built-in command, specify shell "
"executable name in [param path], [code]-c[/code] as the first argument, and "
"the desired command as the second argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed applications are limited to run only "
"embedded helper executables, specified during export.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, system commands such as [code]dumpsys[/code] can "
"only be run on a rooted device."
msgstr ""
"Executa o processo fornecido de maneira [i]bloqueante[/i]. O arquivo "
"especificado em [param path] deve existir e ser executável. A resolução do "
"caminho do sistema será usada. Os [param arguments] são usados na ordem "
"fornecida, separados por espaços e envolvidos entre aspas.\n"
"Se um array [param output] for fornecido, a saída completa do shell do "
"processo será anexada a [param output] como um único elemento [String]. Se "
"[param read_stderr] for [code]true[/code], a saída para o fluxo de erro "
"padrão também será anexada ao array.\n"
"No Windows, se [param open_console] for [code]true[/code] e o processo for "
"um aplicativo de console, uma nova janela de terminal será aberta.\n"
"Este método retorna o código de saída do comando, ou [code]-1[/code] se o "
"processo falhar ao executar.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A thread principal será bloqueada até que o comando executado "
"termine. Use [Thread] para criar uma thread separada que não bloqueará a "
"thread principal, ou use [method create_process] para criar um processo "
"completamente independente.\n"
"Por exemplo, para recuperar uma lista do conteúdo do diretório de trabalho:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var output = []\n"
"var exit_code = OS.execute(\"ls\", [\"-l\", \"/tmp\"], output)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array output = [];\n"
"int exitCode = OS.Execute(\"ls\", [\"-l\", \"/tmp\"], output);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Se você deseja acessar um comando interno do shell ou executar um comando "
"composto, um shell específico da plataforma pode ser invocado. Por exemplo:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var output = []\n"
"OS.execute(\"CMD.exe\", [\"/C\", \"cd %TEMP% && dir\"], output)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"Godot.Collections.Array output = [];\n"
"OS.Execute(\"CMD.exe\", [\"/C\", \"cd %TEMP% && dir\"], output);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, Linux, macOS e Windows.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para executar um comando interno do interpretador de comandos "
"do Windows, especifique [code]cmd.exe[/code] em [param path], [code]/c[/"
"code] como o primeiro argumento e o comando desejado como o segundo "
"argumento.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para executar um comando interno do PowerShell, especifique "
"[code]powershell.exe[/code] em [param path], [code]-Command[/code] como o "
"primeiro argumento e o comando desejado como o segundo argumento.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para executar um comando interno do shell Unix, especifique o "
"nome do executável do shell em [param path], [code]-c[/code] como o primeiro "
"argumento e o comando desejado como o segundo argumento.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No macOS, aplicativos em sandbox são limitados a executar "
"apenas executáveis auxiliares embutidos, especificados durante a "
"exportação.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No Android, comandos de sistema como [code]dumpsys[/code] só "
"podem ser executados em um dispositivo com root."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new process that runs independently of Godot with redirected IO. "
"It will not terminate when Godot terminates. The path specified in [param "
"path] must exist and be an executable file or macOS [code].app[/code] "
"bundle. The path is resolved based on the current platform. The [param "
"arguments] are used in the given order and separated by a space.\n"
"If [param blocking] is [code]false[/code], created pipes work in non-"
"blocking mode, i.e. read and write operations will return immediately. Use "
"[method FileAccess.get_error] to check if the last read/write operation was "
"successful.\n"
"If the process cannot be created, this method returns an empty [Dictionary]. "
"Otherwise, this method returns a [Dictionary] with the following keys:\n"
"- [code]\"stdio\"[/code] - [FileAccess] to access the process stdin and "
"stdout pipes (read/write).\n"
"- [code]\"stderr\"[/code] - [FileAccess] to access the process stderr pipe "
"(read only).\n"
"- [code]\"pid\"[/code] - Process ID as an [int], which you can use to "
"monitor the process (and potentially terminate it with [method kill]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux, macOS, and "
"Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To execute a Windows command interpreter built-in command, "
"specify [code]cmd.exe[/code] in [param path], [code]/c[/code] as the first "
"argument, and the desired command as the second argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To execute a PowerShell built-in command, specify "
"[code]powershell.exe[/code] in [param path], [code]-Command[/code] as the "
"first argument, and the desired command as the second argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To execute a Unix shell built-in command, specify shell "
"executable name in [param path], [code]-c[/code] as the first argument, and "
"the desired command as the second argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, sandboxed applications are limited to run only "
"embedded helper executables, specified during export or system .app bundle, "
"system .app bundles will ignore arguments."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo processo que roda independentemente do Godot com E/S "
"redirecionada. Ele não será encerrado quando o Godot for encerrado. O "
"caminho especificado em [param path] deve existir e ser um arquivo "
"executável ou um pacote [code].app[/code] do macOS. O caminho é resolvido "
"com base na plataforma atual. Os [param arguments] são usados na ordem "
"fornecida e separados por um espaço.\n"
"Se [param blocking] for [code]false[/code], os pipes criados funcionam em "
"modo não bloqueante, ou seja, as operações de leitura e escrita retornarão "
"imediatamente. Use [method FileAccess.get_error] para verificar se a última "
"operação de leitura/escrita foi bem-sucedida.\n"
"Se o processo não puder ser criado, este método retorna um [Dictionary] "
"vazio. Caso contrário, este método retorna um [Dictionary] com as seguintes "
"chaves:\n"
"- [code]\"stdio\"[/code] - [FileAccess] para acessar os pipes de entrada "
"(stdin) e saída padrão (stdout) do processo (leitura/escrita).\n"
"- [code]\"stderr\"[/code] - [FileAccess] para acessar o pipe de erro padrão "
"(stderr) do processo (apenas leitura).\n"
"- [code]\"pid\"[/code] - ID do processo como um [int], que você pode usar "
"para monitorar o processo (e potencialmente encerrá-lo com [method kill]).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, Linux, macOS e Windows.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para executar um comando interno do interpretador de comandos "
"do Windows, especifique [code]cmd.exe[/code] em [param path], [code]/c[/"
"code] como o primeiro argumento e o comando desejado como o segundo "
"argumento.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para executar um comando interno do PowerShell, especifique "
"[code]powershell.exe[/code] em [param path], [code]-Command[/code] como o "
"primeiro argumento e o comando desejado como o segundo argumento.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Para executar um comando interno de um shell Unix, especifique "
"o nome do executável do shell em [param path], [code]-c[/code] como o "
"primeiro argumento e o comando desejado como o segundo argumento.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] No macOS, aplicativos em área restrita (sandboxed) são "
"limitados a executar apenas executáveis auxiliares embutidos, especificados "
"durante a exportação ou pacote .app do sistema; pacotes .app do sistema "
"ignorarão os argumentos."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Finds the keycode for the given string. The returned values are equivalent "
"to the [enum Key] constants.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"C\"))         # Prints 67 (KEY_C)\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"Escape\"))    # Prints 4194305 "
"(KEY_ESCAPE)\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"Shift+Tab\")) # Prints 37748738 "
"(KEY_MASK_SHIFT | KEY_TAB)\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"Unknown\"))   # Prints 0 (KEY_NONE)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"C\"));         // Prints C (Key.C)\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"Escape\"));    // Prints Escape "
"(Key.Escape)\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"Shift+Tab\")); // Prints 37748738 "
"(KeyModifierMask.MaskShift | Key.Tab)\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"Unknown\"));   // Prints None "
"(Key.None)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See also [method get_keycode_string]."
msgstr ""
"Encontra o código de tecla para a string fornecida. Os valores retornados "
"são equivalentes às constantes de [enum Key].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"C\"))         # Imprime 67 (KEY_C)\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"Escape\"))    # Imprime 4194305 "
"(KEY_ESCAPE)\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"Shift+Tab\")) # Imprime 37748738 "
"(KEY_MASK_SHIFT | KEY_TAB)\n"
"print(OS.find_keycode_from_string(\"Unknown\"))   # Imprime 0 (KEY_NONE)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"C\"));         // Imprime C (Key.C)\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"Escape\"));    // Imprime Escape "
"(Key.Escape)\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"Shift+Tab\")); // Imprime 37748738 "
"(KeyModifierMask.MaskShift | Key.Tab)\n"
"GD.Print(OS.FindKeycodeFromString(\"Unknown\"));   // Imprime None "
"(Key.None)\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Veja também [method get_keycode_string]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [i]global[/i] cache data directory according to the operating "
"system's standards.\n"
"On the Linux/BSD platform, this path can be overridden by setting the "
"[code]XDG_CACHE_HOME[/code] environment variable before starting the "
"project. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]File paths in Godot "
"projects[/url] in the documentation for more information. See also [method "
"get_config_dir] and [method get_data_dir].\n"
"Not to be confused with [method get_user_data_dir], which returns the "
"[i]project-specific[/i] user data path."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the command-line arguments passed to the engine, excluding arguments "
"processed by the engine, such as [code]--headless[/code] and [code]--"
"fullscreen[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Godot has been executed with the following command:\n"
"# godot --headless --verbose --scene my_scene.tscn --custom\n"
"OS.get_cmdline_args() # Returns [\"--scene\", \"my_scene.tscn\", \"--"
"custom\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Command-line arguments can be written in any form, including both [code]--"
"key value[/code] and [code]--key=value[/code] forms so they can be properly "
"parsed, as long as custom command-line arguments do not conflict with engine "
"arguments.\n"
"You can also incorporate environment variables using the [method "
"get_environment] method.\n"
"You can set [member ProjectSettings.editor/run/main_run_args] to define "
"command-line arguments to be passed by the editor when running the project.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Parse command-line arguments into a [Dictionary] using the "
"[code]--key=value[/code] form for arguments:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var arguments = {}\n"
"for argument in OS.get_cmdline_args():\n"
"\tif argument.contains(\"=\"):\n"
"\t\tvar key_value = argument.split(\"=\")\n"
"\t\targuments[key_value[0].trim_prefix(\"--\")] = key_value[1]\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\t# Options without an argument will be present in the dictionary,\n"
"\t\t# with the value set to an empty string.\n"
"\t\targuments[argument.trim_prefix(\"--\")] = \"\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var arguments = new Dictionary<string, string>();\n"
"foreach (var argument in OS.GetCmdlineArgs())\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (argument.Contains('='))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tstring[] keyValue = argument.Split(\"=\");\n"
"\t\targuments[keyValue[0].TrimPrefix(\"--\")] = keyValue[1];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\telse\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Options without an argument will be present in the dictionary,\n"
"\t\t// with the value set to an empty string.\n"
"\t\targuments[argument.TrimPrefix(\"--\")] = \"\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Passing custom user arguments directly is not recommended, as "
"the engine may discard or modify them. Instead, pass the standard UNIX "
"double dash ([code]--[/code]) and then the custom arguments, which the "
"engine will ignore by design. These can be read via [method "
"get_cmdline_user_args]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os argumentos de linha de comando passados para o engine, excluindo "
"argumentos processados pelo engine, como [code]--headless[/code] e [code]--"
"fullscreen[/code].\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# O Godot foi executado com o seguinte comando:\n"
"# godot --headless --verbose --scene my_scene.tscn --custom\n"
"OS.get_cmdline_args() # Retorna [\"--scene\", \"my_scene.tscn\", \"--"
"custom\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"Os argumentos de linha de comando podem ser escritos de qualquer forma, "
"incluindo as formas [code]--key value[/code] e [code]--key=value[/code], "
"para que possam ser analisados adequadamente, desde que os argumentos de "
"linha de comando personalizados não entrem em conflito com os argumentos do "
"engine.\n"
"Você também pode incorporar variáveis de ambiente usando o método [method "
"get_environment].\n"
"Você pode definir [member ProjectSettings.editor/run/main_run_args] para "
"definir argumentos de linha de comando a serem passados pelo editor ao "
"executar o projeto.\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Analisa os argumentos de linha de comando em um [Dictionary] "
"usando a forma [code]--key=value[/code] para os argumentos:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var arguments = {}\n"
"for argument in OS.get_cmdline_args():\n"
"\tif argument.contains(\"=\"):\n"
"\t\tvar key_value = argument.split(\"=\")\n"
"\t\targuments[key_value[0].trim_prefix(\"--\")] = key_value[1]\n"
"\telse:\n"
"\t\t# Opções sem um argumento estarão presentes no dicionário,\n"
"\t\t# com o valor definido como uma string vazia.\n"
"\t\targuments[argument.trim_prefix(\"--\")] = \"\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var arguments = new Dictionary<string, string>();\n"
"foreach (var argument in OS.GetCmdlineArgs())\n"
"{\n"
"\tif (argument.Contains('='))\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\tstring[] keyValue = argument.Split(\"=\");\n"
"\t\targuments[keyValue[0].TrimPrefix(\"--\")] = keyValue[1];\n"
"\t}\n"
"\telse\n"
"\t{\n"
"\t\t// Opções sem um argumento estarão presentes no dicionário,\n"
"\t\t// com o valor definido como uma string vazia.\n"
"\t\targuments[argument.TrimPrefix(\"--\")] = \"\";\n"
"\t}\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Não é recomendado passar argumentos de usuário personalizados "
"diretamente, pois o engine pode descartá-los ou modificá-los. Em vez disso, "
"passe o travessão duplo padrão do UNIX ([code]--[/code]) e, em seguida, os "
"argumentos personalizados, que o engine ignorará por design. Eles podem ser "
"lidos por meio de [method get_cmdline_user_args]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the command-line user arguments passed to the engine. User arguments "
"are ignored by the engine and reserved for the user. They are passed after "
"the double dash [code]--[/code] argument. [code]++[/code] may be used when "
"[code]--[/code] is intercepted by another program (such as [code]startx[/"
"code]).\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"# Godot has been executed with the following command:\n"
"# godot --fullscreen --custom -- --level=2 --hardcore\n"
"\n"
"OS.get_cmdline_args()      # Returns [\"--custom\"]\n"
"OS.get_cmdline_user_args() # Returns [\"--level=2\", \"--hardcore\"]\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"To get arguments passed before [code]--[/code] or [code]++[/code], use "
"[method get_cmdline_args]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [i]global[/i] user configuration directory according to the "
"operating system's standards.\n"
"On the Linux/BSD platform, this path can be overridden by setting the "
"[code]XDG_CONFIG_HOME[/code] environment variable before starting the "
"project. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]File paths in Godot "
"projects[/url] in the documentation for more information. See also [method "
"get_cache_dir] and [method get_data_dir].\n"
"Not to be confused with [method get_user_data_dir], which returns the "
"[i]project-specific[/i] user data path."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of connected MIDI device names, if they exist. Returns an "
"empty array if the system MIDI driver has not previously been initialized "
"with [method open_midi_inputs]. See also [method close_midi_inputs].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, Windows, and Web.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Web platform, Web MIDI needs to be supported by the "
"browser. [url=https://caniuse.com/midi]For the time being[/url], it is "
"currently supported by all major browsers, except Safari.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Web platform, using MIDI input requires a browser "
"permission to be granted first. This permission request is performed when "
"calling [method open_midi_inputs]. The browser will refrain from processing "
"MIDI input until the user accepts the permission request."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [i]global[/i] user data directory according to the operating "
"system's standards.\n"
"On the Linux/BSD platform, this path can be overridden by setting the "
"[code]XDG_DATA_HOME[/code] environment variable before starting the project. "
"See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]File paths in Godot "
"projects[/url] in the documentation for more information. See also [method "
"get_cache_dir] and [method get_config_dir].\n"
"Not to be confused with [method get_user_data_dir], which returns the "
"[i]project-specific[/i] user data path."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the distribution for Linux and BSD platforms (e.g. "
"\"Ubuntu\", \"Manjaro\", \"OpenBSD\", etc.).\n"
"Returns the same value as [method get_name] for stock Android ROMs, but "
"attempts to return the custom ROM name for popular Android derivatives such "
"as \"LineageOS\".\n"
"Returns the same value as [method get_name] for other platforms.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not supported on the Web platform. It returns an "
"empty string."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Generates a [PackedByteArray] of cryptographically secure random bytes with "
"given [param size].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Generating large quantities of bytes using this method can "
"result in locking and entropy of lower quality on most platforms. Using "
"[method Crypto.generate_random_bytes] is preferred in most cases."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the given environment variable, or an empty string if "
"[param variable] doesn't exist.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Double-check the casing of [param variable]. Environment "
"variable names are case-sensitive on all platforms except Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, applications do not have access to shell environment "
"variables."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the file path to the current engine executable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, if you want to launch another instance of Godot, "
"always use [method create_instance] instead of relying on the executable "
"path."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"On Android devices: Returns the list of dangerous permissions that have been "
"granted.\n"
"On macOS: Returns the list of granted permissions and user selected folders "
"accessible to the application (sandboxed applications only). Use the native "
"file dialog to request folder access permission.\n"
"On iOS, visionOS: Returns the list of granted permissions."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the given keycode as a [String].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(OS.get_keycode_string(KEY_C))                    # Prints \"C\"\n"
"print(OS.get_keycode_string(KEY_ESCAPE))               # Prints \"Escape\"\n"
"print(OS.get_keycode_string(KEY_MASK_SHIFT | KEY_TAB)) # Prints "
"\"Shift+Tab\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(Key.C));                                    // "
"Prints \"C\"\n"
"GD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(Key.Escape));                               // "
"Prints \"Escape\"\n"
"GD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString((Key)KeyModifierMask.MaskShift | Key.Tab)); // "
"Prints \"Shift+Tab\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"See also [method find_keycode_from_string], [member InputEventKey.keycode], "
"and [method InputEventKey.get_keycode_with_modifiers]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o código de tecla fornecido como um [String].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(OS.get_keycode_string(KEY_C))                   # Imprime \"C\"\n"
"print(OS.get_keycode_string(KEY_ESCAPE))               # Imprime \"Escape\"\n"
"print(OS.get_keycode_string(KEY_MASK_SHIFT | KEY_TAB)) # Imprime "
"\"Shift+Tab\"\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(Key.C));                                    // "
"Imprime \"C\"\n"
"GD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString(Key.Escape));                               // "
"Imprime \"Escape\"\n"
"GD.Print(OS.GetKeycodeString((Key)KeyModifierMask.MaskShift | Key.Tab)); // "
"Imprime \"Shift+Tab\"\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Veja também [method find_keycode_from_string], [member "
"InputEventKey.keycode] e [method InputEventKey.get_keycode_with_modifiers]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the host OS locale as a [String] of the form "
"[code]language_Script_COUNTRY_VARIANT@extra[/code]. Every substring after "
"[code]language[/code] is optional and may not exist.\n"
"- [code]language[/code] - 2 or 3-letter [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"List_of_ISO_639-1_codes]language code[/url], in lower case.\n"
"- [code skip-lint]Script[/code] - 4-letter [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/ISO_15924]script code[/url], in title case.\n"
"- [code]COUNTRY[/code] - 2 or 3-letter [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"ISO_3166-1]country code[/url], in upper case.\n"
"- [code]VARIANT[/code] - language variant, region and sort order. The "
"variant can have any number of underscored keywords.\n"
"- [code]extra[/code] - semicolon separated list of additional key words. "
"This may include currency, calendar, sort order and numbering system "
"information.\n"
"If you want only the language code and not the fully specified locale from "
"the OS, you can use [method get_locale_language]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the host OS locale's 2 or 3-letter [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/List_of_ISO_639-1_codes]language code[/url] as a string which should be "
"consistent on all platforms. This is equivalent to extracting the "
"[code]language[/code] part of the [method get_locale] string.\n"
"This can be used to narrow down fully specified locale strings to only the "
"\"common\" language code, when you don't need the additional information "
"about country code or variants. For example, for a French Canadian user with "
"[code]fr_CA[/code] locale, this would return [code]fr[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the main thread. See [method get_thread_caller_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Thread IDs are not deterministic and may be reused across "
"application restarts."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] containing information about the current memory with "
"the following entries:\n"
"- [code]\"physical\"[/code] - total amount of usable physical memory in "
"bytes. This value can be slightly less than the actual physical memory "
"amount, since it does not include memory reserved by the kernel and "
"devices.\n"
"- [code]\"free\"[/code] - amount of physical memory, that can be immediately "
"allocated without disk access or other costly operations, in bytes. The "
"process might be able to allocate more physical memory, but this action will "
"require moving inactive pages to disk, which can be expensive.\n"
"- [code]\"available\"[/code] - amount of memory that can be allocated "
"without extending the swap file(s), in bytes. This value includes both "
"physical memory and swap.\n"
"- [code]\"stack\"[/code] - size of the current thread stack in bytes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Each entry's value may be [code]-1[/code] if it is unknown."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the model name of the current device.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, macOS, and Windows. "
"Returns [code]\"GenericDevice\"[/code] on unsupported platforms."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do modelo do dispositivo atual.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, iOS, macOS e Windows. "
"Retorna [code]\"GenericDevice\"[/code] em plataformas não compatíveis."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the host platform.\n"
"- On Windows, this is [code]\"Windows\"[/code].\n"
"- On macOS, this is [code]\"macOS\"[/code].\n"
"- On Linux-based operating systems, this is [code]\"Linux\"[/code].\n"
"- On BSD-based operating systems, this is [code]\"FreeBSD\"[/code], [code]"
"\"NetBSD\"[/code], [code]\"OpenBSD\"[/code], or [code]\"BSD\"[/code] as a "
"fallback.\n"
"- On Android, this is [code]\"Android\"[/code].\n"
"- On iOS, this is [code]\"iOS\"[/code].\n"
"- On Web, this is [code]\"Web\"[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom builds of the engine may support additional platforms, "
"such as consoles, possibly returning other names.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"match OS.get_name():\n"
"\t\"Windows\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to Windows!\")\n"
"\t\"macOS\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to macOS!\")\n"
"\t\"Linux\", \"FreeBSD\", \"NetBSD\", \"OpenBSD\", \"BSD\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to Linux/BSD!\")\n"
"\t\"Android\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to Android!\")\n"
"\t\"iOS\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to iOS!\")\n"
"\t\"Web\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to the Web!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"switch (OS.GetName())\n"
"{\n"
"\tcase \"Windows\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to Windows\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"macOS\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to macOS!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"Linux\":\n"
"\tcase \"FreeBSD\":\n"
"\tcase \"NetBSD\":\n"
"\tcase \"OpenBSD\":\n"
"\tcase \"BSD\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to Linux/BSD!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"Android\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to Android!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"iOS\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to iOS!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"Web\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to the Web!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Web platforms, it is still possible to determine the host "
"platform's OS with feature tags. See [method has_feature]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome da plataforma hospedeira.\n"
"- No Windows, é [code]\"Windows\"[/code].\n"
"- No macOS, é [code]\"macOS\"[/code].\n"
"- Em sistemas operacionais baseados em Linux, é [code]\"Linux\"[/code].\n"
"- Em sistemas operacionais baseados em BSD, é [code]\"FreeBSD\"[/code], "
"[code]\"NetBSD\"[/code], [code]\"OpenBSD\"[/code] ou [code]\"BSD\"[/code] "
"como fallback.\n"
"- No Android, é [code]\"Android\"[/code].\n"
"- No iOS, é [code]\"iOS\"[/code].\n"
"- Na Web, é [code]\"Web\"[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Compilações personalizadas do engine podem suportar plataformas "
"adicionais, como consoles, retornando possivelmente outros nomes.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"match OS.get_name():\n"
"\t\"Windows\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to Windows!\")\n"
"\t\"macOS\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to macOS!\")\n"
"\t\"Linux\", \"FreeBSD\", \"NetBSD\", \"OpenBSD\", \"BSD\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to Linux/BSD!\")\n"
"\t\"Android\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to Android!\")\n"
"\t\"iOS\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to iOS!\")\n"
"\t\"Web\":\n"
"\t\tprint(\"Welcome to the Web!\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"switch (OS.GetName())\n"
"{\n"
"\tcase \"Windows\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to Windows\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"macOS\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to macOS!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"Linux\":\n"
"\tcase \"FreeBSD\":\n"
"\tcase \"NetBSD\":\n"
"\tcase \"OpenBSD\":\n"
"\tcase \"BSD\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to Linux/BSD!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"Android\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to Android!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"iOS\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to iOS!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"\tcase \"Web\":\n"
"\t\tGD.Print(\"Welcome to the Web!\");\n"
"\t\tbreak;\n"
"}\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Em plataformas Web, ainda é possível determinar o SO da "
"plataforma hospedeira com tags de recursos. Consulte [method has_feature]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the exit code of a spawned process once it has finished running (see "
"[method is_process_running]).\n"
"Returns [code]-1[/code] if the [param pid] is not a PID of a spawned child "
"process, the process is still running, or the method is not implemented for "
"the current platform.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returns [code]-1[/code] if the [param pid] is a macOS bundled "
"app process.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux, macOS and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o código de saída de um processo criado após ele ter terminado de "
"executar (veja [method is_process_running]).\n"
"Retorna [code]-1[/code] se o [param pid] não for o PID de um processo filho "
"criado, se o processo ainda estiver em execução ou se o método não estiver "
"implementado para a plataforma atual.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Retorna [code]-1[/code] se o [param pid] for de um processo de "
"aplicativo empacotado do macOS.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, Linux, macOS e Windows."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number used by the host machine to uniquely identify this "
"application.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Web, this method always returns [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número usado pela máquina host para identificar exclusivamente "
"este aplicativo.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Na Web, este método sempre retorna [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the number of [i]logical[/i] CPU cores available on the host "
"machine. On CPUs with HyperThreading enabled, this number will be greater "
"than the number of [i]physical[/i] CPU cores."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o número de núcleos de CPU [i]lógicos[/i] disponíveis na máquina "
"host. Em CPUs com HyperThreading ativado, esse número será maior que o "
"número de núcleos de CPU [i]físicos[/i]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the full name of the CPU model on the host machine (e.g. [code]"
"\"Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700K CPU @ 4.00GHz\"[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Windows, macOS, Linux and "
"iOS. On Android and Web, [method get_processor_name] returns an empty string."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of command line arguments that will be used when the "
"project automatically restarts using [method set_restart_on_exit]. See also "
"[method is_restart_on_exit_set]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de argumentos de linha de comando que serão usados quando o "
"projeto reiniciar automaticamente usando [method set_restart_on_exit]. Veja "
"também [method is_restart_on_exit_set]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum amount of static memory used. Only works in debug builds."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade máxima de memória estática usada. Funciona apenas em "
"builds de depuração."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the amount of static memory being used by the program in bytes. Only "
"works in debug builds."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a quantidade de memória estática sendo usada pelo programa em bytes. "
"Funciona apenas em builds de depuração."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the type of the standard error device.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo do dispositivo de erro padrão.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Linux, macOS e Windows."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the type of the standard input device.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On exported Windows builds, run the console wrapper executable "
"to access the standard input. If you need a single executable with full "
"console support, use a custom build compiled with the "
"[code]windows_subsystem=console[/code] flag."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the type of the standard output device.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o tipo do dispositivo de saída padrão.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Linux, macOS e Windows."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of certification authorities trusted by the operating "
"system as a string of concatenated certificates in PEM format."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de autoridades de certificação confiáveis pelo sistema "
"operacional como uma string de certificados concatenados em formato PEM."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the path to commonly used folders across different platforms, as "
"defined by [param dir]. See the [enum SystemDir] constants for available "
"locations.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux, macOS and "
"Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Shared storage is implemented on Android and allows to "
"differentiate between app specific and shared directories, if [param "
"shared_storage] is [code]true[/code]. Shared directories have additional "
"restrictions on Android."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the path to the system font file with [param font_name] and style. "
"Returns an empty string if no matching fonts found.\n"
"The following aliases can be used to request default fonts: \"sans-serif\", "
"\"serif\", \"monospace\", \"cursive\", and \"fantasy\".\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returned font might have different style if the requested style "
"is not available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Linux, macOS and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an array of the system substitute font file paths, which are similar "
"to the font with [param font_name] and style for the specified text, locale, "
"and script. Returns an empty array if no matching fonts found.\n"
"The following aliases can be used to request default fonts: \"sans-serif\", "
"\"serif\", \"monospace\", \"cursive\", and \"fantasy\".\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Depending on OS, it's not guaranteed that any of the returned "
"fonts will be suitable for rendering specified text. Fonts should be loaded "
"and checked in the order they are returned, and the first suitable one "
"used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Returned fonts might have different style if the requested "
"style is not available or belong to a different font family.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Linux, macOS and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the list of font family names available.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Linux, macOS and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a lista de nomes de famílias de fontes disponíveis.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, iOS, Linux, macOS e "
"Windows."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [i]global[/i] temporary data directory according to the "
"operating system's standards."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o diretório de dados temporários [i]global[/i] de acordo com os "
"padrões do sistema operacional."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the ID of the current thread. This can be used in logs to ease "
"debugging of multi-threaded applications.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Thread IDs are not deterministic and may be reused across "
"application restarts."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a string that is unique to the device.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This string may change without notice if the user reinstalls "
"their operating system, upgrades it, or modifies their hardware. This means "
"it should generally not be used to encrypt persistent data, as the data "
"saved before an unexpected ID change would become inaccessible. The returned "
"string may also be falsified using external programs, so do not rely on the "
"string returned by this method for security purposes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Web, returns an empty string and generates an error, as this "
"method cannot be implemented for security reasons."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the absolute directory path where user data is written (the "
"[code]user://[/code] directory in Godot). The path depends on the project "
"name and [member ProjectSettings.application/config/use_custom_user_dir].\n"
"- On Windows, this is [code]%AppData%\\Godot\\app_userdata\\[project_name][/"
"code], or [code]%AppData%\\[custom_name][/code] if "
"[code]use_custom_user_dir[/code] is set. [code]%AppData%[/code] expands to "
"[code]%UserProfile%\\AppData\\Roaming[/code].\n"
"- On macOS, this is [code]~/Library/Application Support/Godot/app_userdata/"
"[project_name][/code], or [code]~/Library/Application Support/[custom_name][/"
"code] if [code]use_custom_user_dir[/code] is set.\n"
"- On Linux and BSD, this is [code]~/.local/share/godot/app_userdata/"
"[project_name][/code], or [code]~/.local/share/[custom_name][/code] if "
"[code]use_custom_user_dir[/code] is set.\n"
"- On Android and iOS, this is a sandboxed directory in either internal or "
"external storage, depending on the user's configuration.\n"
"- On Web, this is a virtual directory managed by the browser.\n"
"If the project name is empty, [code][project_name][/code] falls back to "
"[code][unnamed project][/code].\n"
"Not to be confused with [method get_data_dir], which returns the [i]global[/"
"i] (non-project-specific) user home directory."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the exact production and build version of the operating system. This "
"is different from the branded version used in marketing. This helps to "
"distinguish between different releases of operating systems, including minor "
"versions, and insider and custom builds.\n"
"- For Windows, the major and minor version are returned, as well as the "
"build number. For example, the returned string may look like "
"[code]10.0.9926[/code] for a build of Windows 10.\n"
"- For rolling distributions, such as Arch Linux, an empty string is "
"returned.\n"
"- For macOS and iOS, the major and minor version are returned, as well as "
"the patch number.\n"
"- For Android, the SDK version and the incremental build number are "
"returned. If it's a custom ROM, it attempts to return its version instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is not supported on the Web platform. It returns an "
"empty string."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the branded version used in marketing, followed by the build number "
"(on Windows), the version number (on macOS), or the SDK version and "
"incremental build number (on Android). Examples include [code]11 (build "
"22000)[/code], [code]Sequoia (15.0.0)[/code], and [code]15 (SDK 35 build "
"abc528-11988f)[/code].\n"
"This value can then be appended to [method get_name] to get a full, human-"
"readable operating system name and version combination for the operating "
"system. Windows feature updates such as 24H2 are not contained in the "
"resulting string, but Windows Server is recognized as such (e.g. [code]2025 "
"(build 26100)[/code] for Windows Server 2025).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only supported on Windows, macOS, and Android. "
"On other operating systems, it returns the same value as [method "
"get_version]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the video adapter driver name and version for the user's currently "
"active graphics card, as a [PackedStringArray]. See also [method "
"RenderingServer.get_video_adapter_api_version].\n"
"The first element holds the driver name, such as [code]nvidia[/code], "
"[code]amdgpu[/code], etc.\n"
"The second element holds the driver version. For example, on the "
"[code]nvidia[/code] driver on a Linux/BSD platform, the version is in the "
"format [code]510.85.02[/code]. For Windows, the driver's format is "
"[code]31.0.15.1659[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only supported on Linux/BSD and Windows when not "
"running in headless mode. On other platforms, it returns an empty array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method will run slowly the first time it is called in a "
"session; it can take several seconds depending on the operating system and "
"hardware. It is blocking if called on the main thread, so it's recommended "
"to call it on a separate thread using [Thread]. This allows the engine to "
"keep running while the information is being retrieved. However, [method "
"get_video_adapter_driver_info] is [i]not[/i] thread-safe, so it should not "
"be called from multiple threads at the same time.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var thread = Thread.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tthread.start(\n"
"\t\tfunc():\n"
"\t\t\tvar driver_info = OS.get_video_adapter_driver_info()\n"
"\t\t\tif not driver_info.is_empty():\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Driver: %s %s\" % [driver_info[0], driver_info[1]])\n"
"\t\t\telse:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Driver: (unknown)\")\n"
"\t)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tthread.wait_to_finish()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do driver do adaptador de vídeo e a versão da placa gráfica "
"atualmente ativa do usuário, como um [PackedStringArray]. Consulte também "
"[method RenderingServer.get_video_adapter_api_version].\n"
"O primeiro elemento contém o nome do driver, como [code]nvidia[/code], "
"[code]amdgpu[/code], etc.\n"
"O segundo elemento contém a versão do driver. Por exemplo, no driver "
"[code]nvidia[/code] em uma plataforma Linux/BSD, a versão está no formato "
"[code]510.85.02[/code]. Para o Windows, o formato do driver é "
"[code]31.0.15.1659[/code].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é suportado apenas no Linux/BSD e no Windows quando "
"não executado em modo sem cabeça (headless). Em outras plataformas, ele "
"retorna um array vazio.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método será executado lentamente na primeira vez que for "
"chamado em uma sessão; pode levar vários segundos dependendo do sistema "
"operacional e do hardware. Ele é bloqueante se chamado na thread principal, "
"portanto, é recomendável chamá-lo em uma thread separada usando [Thread]. "
"Isso permite que o engine continue funcionando enquanto as informações são "
"recuperadas. No entanto, [method get_video_adapter_driver_info] [i]não[/i] é "
"seguro para threads, portanto, não deve ser chamado de várias threads ao "
"mesmo tempo.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var thread = Thread.new()\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tthread.start(\n"
"\t\tfunc():\n"
"\t\t\tvar driver_info = OS.get_video_adapter_driver_info()\n"
"\t\t\tif not driver_info.is_empty():\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Driver: %s %s\" % [driver_info[0], driver_info[1]])\n"
"\t\t\telse:\n"
"\t\t\t\tprint(\"Driver: (unknown)\")\n"
"\t)\n"
"\n"
"func _exit_tree():\n"
"\tthread.wait_to_finish()\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the environment variable with the name [param "
"variable] exists.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Double-check the casing of [param variable]. Environment "
"variable names are case-sensitive on all platforms except Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the feature for the given feature tag is "
"supported in the currently running instance, depending on the platform, "
"build, etc. Can be used to check whether you're currently running a debug "
"build, on a certain platform or arch, etc. Refer to the [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]Feature Tags[/url] documentation for more "
"details.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Tag names are case-sensitive.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Web platform, one of the following additional tags is "
"defined to indicate the host platform: [code]web_android[/code], "
"[code]web_ios[/code], [code]web_linuxbsd[/code], [code]web_macos[/code], or "
"[code]web_windows[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the Godot binary used to run the project is a "
"[i]debug[/i] export template, or when running in the editor.\n"
"Returns [code]false[/code] if the Godot binary used to run the project is a "
"[i]release[/i] export template.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To check whether the Godot binary used to run the project is an "
"export template (debug or release), use [code]OS.has_feature(\"template\")[/"
"code] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the input keycode corresponds to a Unicode "
"character. For a list of codes, see the [enum Key] constants.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_G))      # Prints true\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_KP_4))   # Prints true\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_TAB))    # Prints false\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_ESCAPE)) # Prints false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.G));      // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.Kp4));    // Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.Tab));    // Prints False\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.Escape)); // Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o código de tecla de entrada corresponder a um "
"caractere Unicode. Para obter uma lista de códigos, consulte as constantes "
"de [enum Key].\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_G))      # Imprime true\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_KP_4))   # Imprime true\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_TAB))    # Imprime false\n"
"print(OS.is_keycode_unicode(KEY_ESCAPE)) # Imprime false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.G));      // Imprime True\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.Kp4));    // Imprime True\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.Tab));    // Imprime False\n"
"GD.Print(OS.IsKeycodeUnicode((long)Key.Escape)); // Imprime False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the child process ID ([param pid]) is still "
"running or [code]false[/code] if it has terminated. [param pid] must be a "
"valid ID generated from [method create_process].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Linux, macOS, and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o ID do processo filho ([param pid]) ainda "
"estiver em execução ou [code]false[/code] se ele tiver terminado. [param "
"pid] deve ser um ID válido gerado por [method create_process].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, iOS, Linux, macOS e "
"Windows."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the project will automatically restart when it "
"exits for any reason, [code]false[/code] otherwise. See also [method "
"set_restart_on_exit] and [method get_restart_on_exit_arguments]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o projeto for reiniciado automaticamente quando "
"for encerrado por qualquer motivo, caso contrário, [code]false[/code]. "
"Consulte também [method set_restart_on_exit] e [method "
"get_restart_on_exit_arguments]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the application is running in the sandbox.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on macOS and Linux."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o aplicativo estiver sendo executado no "
"sandbox.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado apenas no macOS e Linux."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the engine was executed with the [code]--"
"verbose[/code] or [code]-v[/code] command line argument, or if [member "
"ProjectSettings.debug/settings/stdout/verbose_stdout] is [code]true[/code]. "
"See also [method @GlobalScope.print_verbose]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se a engine foi executada com o argumento de linha "
"de comando [code]--verbose[/code] ou [code]-v[/code], ou se [member "
"ProjectSettings.debug/settings/stdout/verbose_stdout] for [code]true[/code]. "
"Veja também [method @GlobalScope.print_verbose]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the [code]user://[/code] file system is "
"persistent, that is, its state is the same after a player quits and starts "
"the game again. Relevant to the Web platform, where this persistence may be "
"unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o sistema de arquivos [code]user://[/code] for "
"persistente, ou seja, seu estado é o mesmo depois que um jogador sai e "
"inicia o jogo novamente. Relevante para a plataforma Web, onde essa "
"persistência pode não estar disponível."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Kill (terminate) the process identified by the given process ID ([param "
"pid]), such as the ID returned by [method execute] in non-blocking mode. See "
"also [method crash].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method can also be used to kill processes that were not "
"spawned by the engine.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Linux, macOS and "
"Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the file or directory at the given [param path] to the system's "
"recycle bin. See also [method DirAccess.remove].\n"
"The method takes only global paths, so you may need to use [method "
"ProjectSettings.globalize_path]. Do not use it for files in [code]res://[/"
"code] as it will not work in exported projects.\n"
"Returns [constant FAILED] if the file or directory cannot be found, or the "
"system does not support this method.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var file_to_remove = \"user://slot1.save\"\n"
"OS.move_to_trash(ProjectSettings.globalize_path(file_to_remove))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fileToRemove = \"user://slot1.save\";\n"
"OS.MoveToTrash(ProjectSettings.GlobalizePath(fileToRemove));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, Linux, macOS and "
"Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the user has disabled the recycle bin on their system, the "
"file will be permanently deleted instead."
msgstr ""
"Move o arquivo ou diretório no [param path] fornecido para a lixeira do "
"sistema. Consulte também [method DirAccess.remove].\n"
"O método aceita apenas caminhos globais, portanto, pode ser necessário usar "
"[method ProjectSettings.globalize_path]. Não o use para arquivos em "
"[code]res://[/code], pois não funcionará em projetos exportados.\n"
"Retorna [constant FAILED] se o arquivo ou diretório não puder ser encontrado "
"ou se o sistema não suportar este método.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var file_to_remove = \"user://slot1.save\"\n"
"OS.move_to_trash(ProjectSettings.globalize_path(file_to_remove))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var fileToRemove = \"user://slot1.save\";\n"
"OS.MoveToTrash(ProjectSettings.GlobalizePath(fileToRemove));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método é implementado no Android, Linux, macOS e Windows.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Se o usuário desativou a lixeira em seu sistema, o arquivo será "
"excluído permanentemente."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the singleton for the system MIDI driver, allowing Godot to "
"receive [InputEventMIDI]. See also [method get_connected_midi_inputs] and "
"[method close_midi_inputs].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, Windows, and Web.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Web platform, Web MIDI needs to be supported by the "
"browser. [url=https://caniuse.com/midi]For the time being[/url], it is "
"currently supported by all major browsers, except Safari.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On the Web platform, using MIDI input requires a browser "
"permission to be granted first. This permission request is performed when "
"calling [method open_midi_inputs]. The browser will refrain from processing "
"MIDI input until the user accepts the permission request."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Opens one or more files/directories with the specified application. The "
"[param program_path] specifies the path to the application to use for "
"opening the files, and [param paths] contains an array of file/directory "
"paths to open.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is mostly only relevant for macOS, where opening "
"files using [method create_process] might fail. On other platforms, this "
"falls back to using [method create_process].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On macOS, [param program_path] should ideally be the path to a "
"[code].app[/code] bundle."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Reads a user input as raw data from the standard input. This operation can "
"be [i]blocking[/i], which causes the window to freeze if [method "
"read_buffer_from_stdin] is called on the main thread.\n"
"- If standard input is console, this method will block until the program "
"receives a line break in standard input (usually by the user pressing "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd]).\n"
"- If standard input is pipe, this method will block until a specific amount "
"of data is read or pipe is closed.\n"
"- If standard input is a file, this method will read a specific amount of "
"data (or less if end-of-file is reached) and return immediately.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On exported Windows builds, run the console wrapper executable "
"to access the terminal. If standard input is console, calling this method "
"without console wrapped will freeze permanently. If standard input is pipe "
"or file, it can be used without console wrapper. If you need a single "
"executable with full console support, use a custom build compiled with the "
"[code]windows_subsystem=console[/code] flag."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Reads a user input as a UTF-8 encoded string from the standard input. This "
"operation can be [i]blocking[/i], which causes the window to freeze if "
"[method read_string_from_stdin] is called on the main thread.\n"
"- If standard input is console, this method will block until the program "
"receives a line break in standard input (usually by the user pressing "
"[kbd]Enter[/kbd]).\n"
"- If standard input is pipe, this method will block until a specific amount "
"of data is read or pipe is closed.\n"
"- If standard input is a file, this method will read a specific amount of "
"data (or less if end-of-file is reached) and return immediately.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method automatically replaces [code]\\r\\n[/code] line "
"breaks with [code]\\n[/code] and removes them from the end of the string. "
"Use [method read_buffer_from_stdin] to read the unprocessed data.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Linux, macOS, and Windows.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On exported Windows builds, run the console wrapper executable "
"to access the terminal. If standard input is console, calling this method "
"without console wrapped will freeze permanently. If standard input is pipe "
"or file, it can be used without console wrapper. If you need a single "
"executable with full console support, use a custom build compiled with the "
"[code]windows_subsystem=console[/code] flag."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Remove a custom logger added by [method add_logger]."
msgstr "Remove um logger personalizado adicionado por [method add_logger]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Requests permission from the OS for the given [param name]. Returns "
"[code]true[/code] if the permission has already been granted. See also "
"[signal MainLoop.on_request_permissions_result].\n"
"The [param name] must be the full permission name. For example:\n"
"- [code]OS.request_permission(\"android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\")[/"
"code]\n"
"- [code]OS.request_permission(\"android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS\")[/"
"code]\n"
"- [code]OS.request_permission(\"macos.permission.RECORD_SCREEN\")[/code]\n"
"- [code]OS.request_permission(\"appleembedded.permission.AUDIO_RECORD\")[/"
"code]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On Android, permission must be checked during export.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, macOS, and visionOS "
"platforms."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Requests [i]dangerous[/i] permissions from the OS. Returns [code]true[/code] "
"if permissions have already been granted. See also [signal "
"MainLoop.on_request_permissions_result].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Permissions must be checked during export.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only implemented on Android. Normal permissions "
"are automatically granted at install time in Android applications."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"On macOS (sandboxed applications only), this function clears list of user "
"selected folders accessible to the application."
msgstr ""
"No macOS (apenas aplicativos em sandbox), esta função limpa a lista de "
"pastas selecionadas pelo usuário acessíveis ao aplicativo."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the value of the environment variable [param variable] to [param "
"value]. The environment variable will be set for the Godot process and any "
"process executed with [method execute] after running [method "
"set_environment]. The environment variable will [i]not[/i] persist to "
"processes run after the Godot process was terminated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Environment variable names are case-sensitive on all platforms "
"except Windows. The [param variable] name cannot be empty or include the "
"[code]=[/code] character. On Windows, there is a 32767 characters limit for "
"the combined length of [param variable], [param value], and the [code]=[/"
"code] and null terminator characters that will be registered in the "
"environment block."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"If [param restart] is [code]true[/code], restarts the project automatically "
"when it is exited with [method SceneTree.quit] or [constant "
"Node.NOTIFICATION_WM_CLOSE_REQUEST]. Command-line [param arguments] can be "
"supplied. To restart the project with the same command line arguments as "
"originally used to run the project, pass [method get_cmdline_args] as the "
"value for [param arguments].\n"
"This method can be used to apply setting changes that require a restart. See "
"also [method is_restart_on_exit_set] and [method "
"get_restart_on_exit_arguments].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is only effective on desktop platforms, and only "
"when the project isn't started from the editor. It will have no effect on "
"mobile and Web platforms, or when the project is started from the editor.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the project process crashes or is [i]killed[/i] by the user "
"(by sending [code]SIGKILL[/code] instead of the usual [code]SIGTERM[/code]), "
"the project won't restart automatically."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Assigns the given name to the current thread. Returns [constant "
"ERR_UNAVAILABLE] if unavailable on the current platform."
msgstr ""
"Atribui o nome fornecido à thread atual. Retorna [constant ERR_UNAVAILABLE] "
"se indisponível na plataforma atual."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"If [param enabled] is [code]true[/code], when opening a file for writing, a "
"temporary file is used in its place. When closed, it is automatically "
"applied to the target file.\n"
"This can useful when files may be opened by other applications, such as "
"antiviruses, text editors, or even the Godot editor itself."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Requests the OS to open a resource identified by [param uri] with the most "
"appropriate program. For example:\n"
"- [code]OS.shell_open(\"C:\\\\Users\\\\name\\\\Downloads\")[/code] on "
"Windows opens the file explorer at the user's Downloads folder.\n"
"- [code]OS.shell_open(\"C:/Users/name/Downloads\")[/code] also works on "
"Windows and opens the file explorer at the user's Downloads folder.\n"
"- [code]OS.shell_open(\"https://godotengine.org\")[/code] opens the default "
"web browser on the official Godot website.\n"
"- [code]OS.shell_open(\"mailto:example@example.com\")[/code] opens the "
"default email client with the \"To\" field set to [code]example@example.com[/"
"code]. See [url=https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2368]RFC 2368 - The "
"mailto URL scheme[/url] for a list of fields that can be added.\n"
"Use [method ProjectSettings.globalize_path] to convert a [code]res://[/code] "
"or [code]user://[/code] project path into a system path for use with this "
"method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use [method String.uri_encode] to encode characters within URLs "
"in a URL-safe, portable way. This is especially required for line breaks. "
"Otherwise, [method shell_open] may not work correctly in a project exported "
"to the Web platform.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is implemented on Android, iOS, Web, Linux, macOS "
"and Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Requests the OS to open the file manager, navigate to the given [param "
"file_or_dir_path] and select the target file or folder.\n"
"If [param open_folder] is [code]true[/code] and [param file_or_dir_path] is "
"a valid directory path, the OS will open the file manager and navigate to "
"the target folder without selecting anything.\n"
"Use [method ProjectSettings.globalize_path] to convert a [code]res://[/code] "
"or [code]user://[/code] project path into a system path to use with this "
"method.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is currently only implemented on Windows and macOS. "
"On other platforms, it will fallback to [method shell_open] with a directory "
"path of [param file_or_dir_path] prefixed with [code]file://[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the given environment variable from the current environment, if it "
"exists. The [param variable] name cannot be empty or include the [code]=[/"
"code] character. The environment variable will be removed for the Godot "
"process and any process executed with [method execute] after running [method "
"unset_environment]. The removal of the environment variable will [i]not[/i] "
"persist to processes run after the Godot process was terminated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Environment variable names are case-sensitive on all platforms "
"except Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the engine filters the time delta measured between "
"each frame, and attempts to compensate for random variation. This only works "
"on systems where V-Sync is active.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On start-up, this is the same as [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/delta_smoothing]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the engine optimizes for low processor usage by only "
"refreshing the screen if needed. Can improve battery consumption on mobile.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On start-up, this is the same as [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/low_processor_mode]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of sleeping between frames when the low-processor usage mode is "
"enabled, in microseconds. Higher values will result in lower CPU usage. See "
"also [member low_processor_usage_mode].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On start-up, this is the same as [member "
"ProjectSettings.application/run/low_processor_mode_sleep_usec]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"The Vulkan rendering driver. It requires Vulkan 1.0 support and "
"automatically uses features from Vulkan 1.1, 1.2, and 1.3 if available."
msgstr ""
"O driver de renderização Vulkan. Requer suporte a Vulkan 1.0 e usa "
"automaticamente recursos do Vulkan 1.1, 1.2 e 1.3, se disponíveis."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"The OpenGL 3 rendering driver. It uses OpenGL 3.3 Core Profile on desktop "
"platforms, OpenGL ES 3.0 on mobile devices, and WebGL 2.0 on Web."
msgstr ""
"O driver de renderização OpenGL 3. Ele usa o Perfil Core OpenGL 3.3 em "
"plataformas de desktop, OpenGL ES 3.0 em dispositivos móveis e WebGL 2.0 na "
"Web."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"The Direct3D 12 rendering driver. It requires the 12_0 feature level and "
"Shader Model 6.0 support."
msgstr ""
"O driver de renderização Direct3D 12. Ele requer o nível de recurso 12_0 e "
"suporte ao Shader Model 6.0."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "The Metal rendering driver."
msgstr "O driver de renderização Metal."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the Desktop directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório Área de Trabalho."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the DCIM (Digital Camera Images) directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório DCIM (Imagens de Câmera Digital)."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the Documents directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório Documentos."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the Downloads directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório Downloads."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the Movies (or Videos) directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório Filmes (ou Vídeos)."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the Music directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório de música."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the Pictures directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório Imagens."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Refers to the Ringtones directory path."
msgstr "Refere-se ao caminho do diretório Toques."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Standard I/O device is invalid. No data can be received from or sent to "
"these standard I/O devices."
msgstr ""
"O dispositivo de E/S padrão é inválido. Nenhum dado pode ser recebido de ou "
"enviado para esses dispositivos de E/S padrão."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Standard I/O device is a console. This typically occurs when Godot is run "
"from a terminal with no redirection. This is also used for all standard I/O "
"devices when running Godot from the editor, at least on desktop platforms."
msgstr ""
"O dispositivo de E/S padrão é um console. Isso normalmente ocorre quando o "
"Godot é executado a partir de um terminal sem redirecionamento. Isso também "
"é usado para todos os dispositivos de E/S padrão ao executar o Godot a "
"partir do editor, pelo menos em plataformas de desktop."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Standard I/O device is a regular file. This typically occurs with "
"redirection from a terminal, e.g. [code]godot > stdout.txt[/code], "
"[code]godot < stdin.txt[/code] or [code]godot > stdout_stderr.txt 2>&1[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"O dispositivo de E/S padrão é um arquivo regular. Isso normalmente ocorre "
"com redirecionamento de um terminal, por exemplo, [code]godot > stdout.txt[/"
"code], [code]godot < stdin.txt[/code] ou [code]godot > stdout_stderr.txt "
"2>&1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid ""
"Standard I/O device is a FIFO/pipe. This typically occurs with pipe usage "
"from a terminal, e.g. [code]echo \"Hello\" | godot[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O dispositivo de E/S padrão é um FIFO/pipe. Isso normalmente ocorre com o "
"uso de pipe a partir de um terminal, por exemplo, [code]echo \"Hello\" | "
"godot[/code]."

#: doc/classes/OS.xml
msgid "Standard I/O device type is unknown."
msgstr "O tipo de dispositivo de E/S padrão é desconhecido."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid "A packed array of bytes."
msgstr "Um array compactado de bytes."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"An array specifically designed to hold bytes. Packs data tightly, so it "
"saves memory for large array sizes.\n"
"[PackedByteArray] also provides methods to encode/decode various types to/"
"from bytes. The way values are encoded is an implementation detail and "
"shouldn't be relied upon when interacting with external apps.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Packed arrays are always passed by reference. To get a copy of "
"an array that can be modified independently of the original array, use "
"[method duplicate]. This is [i]not[/i] the case for built-in properties and "
"methods. In these cases the returned packed array is a copy, and changing it "
"will [i]not[/i] affect the original value. To update a built-in property of "
"this type, modify the returned array and then assign it to the property "
"again.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a packed array will evaluate to "
"[code]false[/code] if it's empty. Otherwise, a packed array will always "
"evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid "Constructs an empty [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr "Constrói um [PackedByteArray] vazio."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a [PackedByteArray] as a copy of the given [PackedByteArray]."
msgstr ""
"Constrói um [PackedByteArray] como uma cópia do [PackedByteArray] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a new [PackedByteArray]. Optionally, you can pass in a generic "
"[Array] that will be converted."
msgstr ""
"Constrói um novo [PackedByteArray]. Opcionalmente, você pode passar um "
"[Array] genérico que será convertido."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml doc/classes/PackedColorArray.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedFloat32Array.xml doc/classes/PackedFloat64Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedInt32Array.xml doc/classes/PackedInt64Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedStringArray.xml doc/classes/PackedVector2Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedVector3Array.xml doc/classes/PackedVector4Array.xml
msgid ""
"Appends an element at the end of the array (alias of [method push_back])."
msgstr ""
"Insere um elemento ao final de um array (apelido para [method push_back])."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid "Appends a [PackedByteArray] at the end of this array."
msgstr "Adiciona um [PackedByteArray] ao final deste array."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml doc/classes/PackedColorArray.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedInt32Array.xml doc/classes/PackedInt64Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedStringArray.xml
msgid ""
"Finds the index of an existing value (or the insertion index that maintains "
"sorting order, if the value is not yet present in the array) using binary "
"search. Optionally, a [param before] specifier can be passed. If "
"[code]false[/code], the returned index comes after all existing entries of "
"the value in the array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Calling [method bsearch] on an unsorted array results in "
"unexpected behavior."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"Swaps the byte order of [param count] 16-bit segments of the array starting "
"at [param offset]. Swap is done in-place. If [param count] is less than "
"zero, all segments to the end of array are processed, if processed data size "
"is not a multiple of 2, the byte after the last processed 16-bit segment is "
"not modified."
msgstr ""
"Inverte a ordem dos bytes de [param count] segmentos de 16 bits do array "
"começando em [param offset]. A inversão é feita no próprio local (in-place). "
"Se [param count] for menor que zero, todos os segmentos até o final do array "
"serão processados; se o tamanho dos dados processados não for múltiplo de 2, "
"o byte após o último segmento de 16 bits processado não será modificado."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"Swaps the byte order of [param count] 32-bit segments of the array starting "
"at [param offset]. Swap is done in-place. If [param count] is less than "
"zero, all segments to the end of array are processed, if processed data size "
"is not a multiple of 4, bytes after the last processed 32-bit segment are "
"not modified."
msgstr ""
"Inverte a ordem dos bytes de [param count] segmentos de 32 bits do array "
"começando em [param offset]. A inversão é feita no próprio local (in-place). "
"Se [param count] for menor que zero, todos os segmentos até o final do array "
"serão processados; se o tamanho dos dados processados não for múltiplo de 4, "
"os bytes após o último segmento de 32 bits processado não serão modificados."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"Swaps the byte order of [param count] 64-bit segments of the array starting "
"at [param offset]. Swap is done in-place. If [param count] is less than "
"zero, all segments to the end of array are processed, if processed data size "
"is not a multiple of 8, bytes after the last processed 64-bit segment are "
"not modified."
msgstr ""
"Inverte a ordem dos bytes de [param count] segmentos de 64 bits do array "
"começando em [param offset]. A inversão é feita no próprio local (in-place). "
"Se [param count] for menor que zero, todos os segmentos até o final do array "
"serão processados; se o tamanho dos dados processados não for múltiplo de 8, "
"os bytes após o último segmento de 64 bits processado não serão modificados."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml doc/classes/PackedColorArray.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedFloat32Array.xml doc/classes/PackedFloat64Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedInt32Array.xml doc/classes/PackedInt64Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedStringArray.xml doc/classes/PackedVector2Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedVector3Array.xml doc/classes/PackedVector4Array.xml
msgid ""
"Clears the array. This is equivalent to using [method resize] with a size of "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Limpa o array. Equivalente a usar [method resize] com tamanho igual a "
"[code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a new [PackedByteArray] with the data compressed. Set the "
"compression mode using one of [enum FileAccess.CompressionMode]'s constants."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um novo [PackedByteArray] com os dados compactados. Defina o modo de "
"compactação usando uma das constantes de [enum FileAccess.CompressionMode]."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml doc/classes/PackedColorArray.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedInt32Array.xml doc/classes/PackedInt64Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedStringArray.xml
msgid "Returns the number of times an element is in the array."
msgstr "Retorna quantas vezes um elemento está no array."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
msgid ""
"Decodes a 64-bit floating-point number from the bytes starting at [param "
"byte_offset]. Fails if the byte count is insufficient. Returns [code]0.0[/"
"code] if a valid number can't be decoded."
msgstr ""
"Decodifica um número de ponto flutuante de 64 bits a partir dos bytes "
"começando em [param byte_offset]. Falha se a contagem de bytes for "
"insuficiente. Retorna [code]0.0[/code] se um número válido não puder ser "
"decodificado."

#: doc/classes/PackedByteArray.xml
