#: doc/classes/PackedVector2Array.xml doc/classes/PackedVector3Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedVector4Array.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the array contains [param value].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Vectors with [constant @GDScript.NAN] elements don't behave the "
"same as other vectors. Therefore, the results from this method may not be "
"accurate if NaNs are included."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PackedVector2Array.xml
msgid "Inserts a [Vector2] at the end."
msgstr "Insere um [Vector2] no final."

#: doc/classes/PackedVector2Array.xml doc/classes/PackedVector3Array.xml
#: doc/classes/PackedVector4Array.xml
msgid ""
"Searches the array in reverse order. Optionally, a start search index can be "
"passed. If negative, the start index is considered relative to the end of "
"the array.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Vectors with [constant @GDScript.NAN] elements don't behave the "
"same as other vectors. Therefore, the results from this method may not be "
"accurate if NaNs are included."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PackedVector2Array.xml
msgid "Changes the [Vector2] at the given index."
msgstr "Altera o [Vector2] no índice fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PackedVector2Array.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the slice of the [PackedVector2Array], from [param begin] "
"(inclusive) to [param end] (exclusive), as a new [PackedVector2Array].\n"
