#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a constant positioned force to the body that keeps being applied over "
"time until cleared with [code]body_set_constant_force(body, Vector3(0, 0, 0))"
"[/code].\n"
"[param position] is the offset from the body origin in global coordinates."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a constant rotational force without affecting position that keeps being "
"applied over time until cleared with [code]body_set_constant_torque(body, "
"Vector3(0, 0, 0))[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma força rotacional constante sem afetar a posição que continua "
"sendo aplicada ao longo do tempo até ser limpa com "
"[code]body_set_constant_torque(body, Vector3(0, 0, 0))[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a shape to the body, along with a transform matrix. Shapes are usually "
"referenced by their index, so you should track which shape has a given index."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma forma ao corpo, juntamente com uma matriz de transformação. As "
"formas geralmente são referenciadas pelo índice, portanto, você deve "
"rastrear qual forma tem um determinado índice."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a directional force without affecting rotation. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update.\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method body_apply_force] at the body's center "
"of mass."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a directional impulse without affecting rotation.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise).\n"
"This is equivalent to using [method body_apply_impulse] at the body's center "
"of mass."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a rotational force without affecting position. A force is time "
"dependent and meant to be applied every physics update."
msgstr ""
"Aplica uma força de rotação sem afetar a posição. Uma força é dependente do "
"tempo e destina-se a ser aplicada a cada atualização de física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a rotational impulse to the body without affecting the position.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Removes all shapes from a body."
msgstr "Remove todas as formas de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D body object in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. The default settings for the created area include a collision "
"layer and mask set to [code]1[/code], and body mode set to [constant "
"BODY_MODE_RIGID].\n"
"Use [method body_add_shape] to add shapes to it, use [method body_set_state] "
"to set its transform, and use [method body_set_space] to add the body to a "
"space."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the physics layer or layers a body belongs to."
msgstr "Retorna a camada ou camadas de física a que um corpo pertence."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the physics layer or layers a body can collide with."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a camada ou camadas de física com as quais um corpo pode colidir."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the body's collision priority."
msgstr "Retorna a prioridade de colisão do corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the body's total constant positional forces applied during each "
"physics update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_force] and [method "
"body_add_constant_central_force]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the body's total constant rotational forces applied during each "
"physics update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_torque]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D] of the body. Returns [code]null[/"
"code] if the body is destroyed or removed from the physics space."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D] do corpo. Retorna [code]null[/code] se "
"o corpo for destruído ou removido do espaço de física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum contacts that can be reported. See [method "
"body_set_max_contacts_reported]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o máximo de contatos que podem ser relatados. Veja [method "
"body_set_max_contacts_reported]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the body mode."
msgstr "Retorna o modo do corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of a body parameter. A list of available parameters is on "
"the [enum BodyParameter] constants."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor de um parâmetro de corpo. Uma lista de parâmetros "
"disponíveis está nas constantes do [enum BodyParameter]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [RID] of the nth shape of a body."
msgstr "Retorna o [RID] da enésima forma de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the number of shapes assigned to a body."
msgstr "Retorna o número de formas atribuídas a um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the transform matrix of a body shape."
msgstr "Retorna a matriz de transformação da forma de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [RID] of the space assigned to a body."
msgstr "Retorna o [RID] do espaço atribuído a um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns a body state."
msgstr "Retorna um estado de corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the continuous collision detection mode is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o modo de detecção de colisão contínua está ativado."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a body from the list of bodies exempt from collisions.\n"
"Continuous collision detection tries to predict where a moving body will "
"collide, instead of moving it and correcting its movement if it collided."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Removes a shape from a body. The shape is not deleted, so it can be reused "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Remove uma forma de um corpo. A forma não é excluída, portanto pode ser "
"reutilizada posteriormente."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Restores the default inertia and center of mass based on shapes to cancel "
"any custom values previously set using [method body_set_param]."
msgstr ""
"Restaura a inércia padrão e o centro de massa com base nas formas para "
"cancelar quaisquer valores personalizados definidos anteriormente usando "
"[method body_set_param]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml doc/classes/RigidBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets an axis velocity. The velocity in the given vector axis will be set as "
"the given vector length. This is useful for jumping behavior."
msgstr ""
"Define uma velocidade de eixo. A velocidade no eixo do vetor fornecido será "
"definida como o comprimento do vetor fornecido. Isso é útil para o "
"comportamento de pulo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers a body belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Define a(s) camada(s) de física na(s) qual(is) um corpo pode pertencer."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers a body can collide with."
msgstr "Define a(s) camada(s) de física na(s) qual(is) um corpo pode colidir."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the body's collision priority."
msgstr "Define a prioridade de colisão do corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the body's total constant positional forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_force] and [method "
"body_add_constant_central_force]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the body's total constant rotational forces applied during each physics "
"update.\n"
"See [method body_add_constant_torque]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the continuous collision detection mode is enabled.\n"
"Continuous collision detection tries to predict where a moving body will "
"collide, instead of moving it and correcting its movement if it collided."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]verdadeiro[/code], o modo de detecção de colisão contínua é "
"ativada.\n"
"A detecção de colisão contínua busca prever quando que um corpo em movimento "
"irá colidir, ao invés de movê-lo e corrigir seu movimento se este colidiu."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the body's custom force integration callback function to [param "
"callable]. Use an empty [Callable] ([code skip-lint]Callable()[/code]) to "
"clear the custom callback.\n"
"The function [param callable] will be called every physics tick, before the "
"standard force integration (see [method body_set_omit_force_integration]). "
"It can be used for example to update the body's linear and angular velocity "
"based on contact with other bodies.\n"
"If [param userdata] is not [code]null[/code], the function [param callable] "
"must take the following two parameters:\n"
"1. [code]state[/code]: a [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D], used to retrieve and "
"modify the body's state,\n"
"2. [code skip-lint]userdata[/code]: a [Variant]; its value will be the "
"[param userdata] passed into this method.\n"
"If [param userdata] is [code]null[/code], then [param callable] must take "
"only the [code]state[/code] parameter."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum contacts to report. Bodies can keep a log of the contacts "
"with other bodies. This is enabled by setting the maximum number of contacts "
"reported to a number greater than 0."
msgstr ""
"Define o máximo de contatos a relatar. Os corpos podem manter um registro "
"dos contatos com outros corpos. Isso é ativado definindo o número máximo de "
"contatos relatados para um número maior que 0."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the body mode."
msgstr "Define o modo do corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the body omits the standard force integration. If [param "
"enable] is [code]true[/code], the body will not automatically use applied "
"forces, torques, and damping to update the body's linear and angular "
"velocity. In this case, [method body_set_force_integration_callback] can be "
"used to manually update the linear and angular velocity instead.\n"
"This method is called when the property [member "
"RigidBody3D.custom_integrator] is set."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a body parameter. A list of available parameters is on the [enum "
"BodyParameter] constants."
msgstr ""
"Define um parâmetro de corpo. Uma lista de parâmetros disponíveis está nas "
"constantes [enum BodyParameter]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the body pickable with rays if [param enable] is set."
msgstr ""
"Define o corpo como selecionável por raios se [param enable] estiver "
"definido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Substitutes a given body shape by another. The old shape is selected by its "
"index, the new one by its [RID]."
msgstr ""
"Substitui uma determinada forma de corpo por outra. A antiga forma é "
"selecionada por seu índice, a nova por seu [RID]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the transform matrix for a body shape."
msgstr "Define a matriz de transformação para uma forma de corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Assigns a space to the body (see [method space_create])."
msgstr "Atribui um espaço ao corpo (consulte [method space_create])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets a body state."
msgstr "Define um estado de corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the body's state synchronization callback function to [param callable]. "
"Use an empty [Callable] ([code skip-lint]Callable()[/code]) to clear the "
"callback.\n"
"The function [param callable] will be called every physics frame, assuming "
"that the body was active during the previous physics tick, and can be used "
"to fetch the latest state from the physics server.\n"
"The function [param callable] must take the following parameters:\n"
"1. [code]state[/code]: a [PhysicsDirectBodyState3D], used to retrieve the "
"body's state."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a collision would result from moving along a "
"motion vector from a given point in space. [PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D] "
"is passed to set motion parameters. [PhysicsTestMotionResult3D] can be "
"passed to return additional information."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se uma colisão resultaria do movimento ao longo de "
"um vetor de movimento a partir de um determinado ponto no espaço. "
"[PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D] é passado para definir os parâmetros de "
"movimento. [PhysicsTestMotionResult3D] pode ser passado para retornar "
"informações adicionais."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D box shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the box's half-extents."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de caixa 3D no servidor de física e retorna o [RID] que a "
"identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir as metades das "
"dimensões da caixa."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D capsule shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the capsule's height and "
"radius."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de cápsula 3D no servidor de física e retorna o [RID] que a "
"identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir a altura e o raio da "
"cápsula."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D concave polygon shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the concave "
"polygon's triangles."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de polígono côncavo 3D no servidor de física e retorna o "
"[RID] que a identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir os "
"triângulos do polígono côncavo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Gets a cone twist joint parameter."
msgstr "Obtém um parâmetro de articulação de torção de cone."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets a cone twist joint parameter."
msgstr "Define um parâmetro de articulação de torção de cone."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D convex polygon shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the convex "
"polygon's points."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de polígono convexo 3D no servidor de física e retorna o "
"[RID] que a identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir os pontos "
"do polígono convexo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a custom shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the shape's data.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Custom shapes are not supported by the built-in physics "
"servers, so calling this method always produces an error when using Godot "
"Physics or Jolt Physics. Custom physics servers implemented as GDExtensions "
"may support a custom shape."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D cylinder shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] "
"that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the cylinder's height "
"and radius."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de cilindro 3D no servidor de física e retorna o [RID] que a "
"identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir a altura e o raio do "
"cilindro."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Destroys any of the objects created by PhysicsServer3D. If the [RID] passed "
"is not one of the objects that can be created by PhysicsServer3D, an error "
"will be sent to the console."
msgstr ""
"Destrói qualquer um dos objetos criados por PhysicsServer3D. Se o [RID] "
"passado não for um dos objetos que podem ser criados por PhysicsServer3D, um "
"erro será enviado para o console."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the value of a generic 6DOF joint flag."
msgstr "Retorna o valor de uma flag de articulação 6DOF genérica."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the value of a generic 6DOF joint parameter."
msgstr "Retorna o valor de um parâmetro de junta 6DOF genérico."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the value of a given generic 6DOF joint flag."
msgstr "Define o valor de uma flag de articulação 6DOF genérica dada."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the value of a given generic 6DOF joint parameter."
msgstr "Define o valor de um determinado parâmetro de junta 6DOF genérico."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D heightmap shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] "
"that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the heightmap's data."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de mapa de altura 3D no servidor de física e retorna o [RID] "
"que a identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir os dados do mapa "
"de altura."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Gets a hinge joint flag."
msgstr "Obtém um sinalizador de articulação de dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Gets a hinge joint parameter."
msgstr "Obtém um parâmetro de articulação de dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets a hinge joint flag."
msgstr "Define um sinalizador de articulação de dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets a hinge joint parameter."
msgstr "Define um parâmetro de articulação de dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the bodies attached to the [Joint3D] will collide with each "
"other."
msgstr "Define se os corpos anexados ao [Joint3D] colidirão entre si."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Gets the priority value of the Joint3D.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This method always "
"returns [code]1[/code] when using Jolt Physics, as it does not support joint "
"solver priority."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the type of the Joint3D."
msgstr "Retorna o tipo do Joint3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns whether the bodies attached to the [Joint3D] will collide with each "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Retorna se os corpos anexados ao [Joint3D] irão colidir uns com os outros."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Make the joint a generic six degrees of freedom (6DOF) joint. Use [method "
"generic_6dof_joint_set_flag] and [method generic_6dof_joint_set_param] to "
"set the joint's flags and parameters respectively."
msgstr ""
"Tornar a junta uma junta genérica de seis graus de liberdade (6DOF). Use "
"[method generic_6dof_joint_set_flag] e [method generic_6dof_joint_set_param] "
"para definir os sinalizadores e parâmetros da junta, respectivamente."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the priority value of the Joint3D.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This method has no "
"effect when using Jolt Physics, as it does not support joint solver priority."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns position of the joint in the local space of body a of the joint."
msgstr "Retorna a posição da junta no espaço local do corpo a da junta."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns position of the joint in the local space of body b of the joint."
msgstr "Retorna a posição da junta no espaço local do corpo b da junta."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Gets a pin joint parameter."
msgstr "Obtém um parâmetro de articulação de pino."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets position of the joint in the local space of body a of the joint."
msgstr ""
"Define a posição da articulação no espaço local do corpo a da articulação."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets position of the joint in the local space of body b of the joint."
msgstr ""
"Define a posição da articulação no espaço local do corpo b da articulação."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D separation ray shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the shape's "
"[code]length[/code] and [code]slide_on_slope[/code] properties."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de raio de separação 3D no servidor de física e retorna o "
"[RID] que a identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir as "
"propriedades [code]length[/code] e [code]slide_on_slope[/code] da forma."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Activates or deactivates the 3D physics engine."
msgstr "Ativa ou desativa o motor de física 3D."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the shape data that configures the shape, such as the half-extents "
"of a box or the triangles of a concave (trimesh) shape. See [method "
"shape_set_data] for the precise format of this data in each case."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os dados da forma que configuram a forma, como as meias-extensões de "
"uma caixa ou os triângulos de uma forma côncava (trimesh). Consulte [method "
"shape_set_data] para obter o formato preciso desses dados em cada caso."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the collision margin for the shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not used in Godot Physics, so will always return "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the shape data that configures the shape. The [param data] to be passed "
"depends on the shape's type (see [method shape_get_type]):\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_WORLD_BOUNDARY]: a [Plane],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY]: a dictionary containing the key [code]"
"\"length\"[/code] with a [float] value and the key [code]\"slide_on_slope\"[/"
"code] with a [bool] value,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SPHERE]: a [float] that is the radius of the sphere,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_BOX]: a [Vector3] containing the half-extents of the box,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CAPSULE]: a dictionary containing the keys [code]"
"\"height\"[/code] and [code]\"radius\"[/code] with [float] values,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CYLINDER]: a dictionary containing the keys [code]"
"\"height\"[/code] and [code]\"radius\"[/code] with [float] values,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONVEX_POLYGON]: a [PackedVector3Array] of points defining "
"a convex polygon (the shape will be the convex hull of the points),\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONCAVE_POLYGON]: a dictionary containing the key [code]"
"\"faces\"[/code] with a [PackedVector3Array] value (with a length divisible "
"by 3, so that each 3-tuple of points forms a face) and the key [code]"
"\"backface_collision\"[/code] with a [bool] value,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_HEIGHTMAP]: a dictionary containing the keys [code]"
"\"width\"[/code] and [code]\"depth\"[/code] with [int] values, and the key "
"[code]\"heights\"[/code] with a value that is a packed array of [float]s of "
"length [code]width * depth[/code] (that is a [PackedFloat32Array], or a "
"[PackedFloat64Array] if Godot was compiled with the [code]precision=double[/"
"code] option), and optionally the keys [code]\"min_height\"[/code] and [code]"
"\"max_height\"[/code] with [float] values,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SOFT_BODY]: the input [param data] is ignored and this "
"method has no effect,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CUSTOM]: the input [param data] is interpreted by a custom "
"physics server, if it supports custom shapes."
msgstr ""
"Define os dados da forma que configuram a mesma. O [param data] a ser "
"passado depende do tipo da forma (consulte [method shape_get_type]):\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_WORLD_BOUNDARY]: um [Plane],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY]: um dicionário contendo a chave [code]"
"\"length\"[/code] com um valor [float] e a chave [code]\"slide_on_slope\"[/"
"code] com um valor [bool],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SPHERE]: um [float] que é o raio da esfera,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_BOX]: um [Vector3] contendo as extensões parciais (metades "
"das dimensões) da caixa,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CAPSULE]: um dicionário contendo as chaves [code]"
"\"height\"[/code] e [code]\"radius\"[/code] com valores [float],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CYLINDER]: um dicionário contendo as chaves [code]"
"\"height\"[/code] e [code]\"radius\"[/code] com valores [float],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONVEX_POLYGON]: um [PackedVector3Array] de pontos "
"definindo um polígono convexo (a forma será a envoltória convexa dos "
"pontos),\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CONCAVE_POLYGON]: um dicionário contendo a chave [code]"
"\"faces\"[/code] com um valor [PackedVector3Array] (com um comprimento "
"divisível por 3, de modo que cada tupla de 3 pontos forma uma face) e a "
"chave [code]\"backface_collision\"[/code] com um valor [bool],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_HEIGHTMAP]: um dicionário contendo as chaves [code]"
"\"width\"[/code] e [code]\"depth\"[/code] com valores [int], e a chave [code]"
"\"heights\"[/code] com um valor que é uma matriz empacotada de [float]s de "
"comprimento [code]width * depth[/code] (que é um [PackedFloat32Array], ou um "
"[PackedFloat64Array] se o Godot foi compilado com a opção "
"[code]precision=double[/code]), e opcionalmente as chaves [code]"
"\"min_height\"[/code] e [code]\"max_height\"[/code] com valores [float],\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_SOFT_BODY]: o [param data] de entrada é ignorado e este "
"método não tem efeito,\n"
"- [constant SHAPE_CUSTOM]: o [param data] de entrada é interpretado por um "
"servidor de física personalizado, se ele suportar formas personalizadas."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the collision margin for the shape.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not used in Godot Physics."
msgstr ""
"Define a margem de colisão da forma.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Isso não é usado no Godot Physics."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Gets a slider joint parameter."
msgstr "Obtém um parâmetro de articulação deslizante."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Adds the given body to the list of bodies exempt from collisions."
msgstr "Adiciona o corpo fornecido à lista de corpos isentos de colisões."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Distributes and applies a force to all points. A force is time dependent and "
"meant to be applied every physics update."
msgstr ""
"Distribui e aplica uma força a todos os pontos. Uma força depende do tempo e "
"destina-se a ser aplicada a cada atualização de física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Distributes and applies an impulse to all points.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies a force to a point. A force is time dependent and meant to be "
"applied every physics update."
msgstr ""
"Aplica uma força a um ponto. Uma força depende do tempo e deve ser aplicada "
"a cada atualização de física."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml doc/classes/SoftBody3D.xml
msgid ""
"Applies an impulse to a point.\n"
"An impulse is time-independent! Applying an impulse every frame would result "
"in a framerate-dependent force. For this reason, it should only be used when "
"simulating one-time impacts (use the \"_force\" functions otherwise)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Creates a new soft body and returns its internal [RID]."
msgstr "Cria um novo corpo macio e retorna seu [RID] interno."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the bounds of the given soft body in global coordinates."
msgstr "Retorna os limites do corpo flexível dado em coordenadas globais."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the physics layer or layers that the given soft body belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a camada ou camadas de física às quais o corpo macio fornecido "
"pertence."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the physics layer or layers that the given soft body can collide "
"with."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a camada ou camadas de física com as quais o corpo macio fornecido "
"pode colidir."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the damping coefficient of the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna o coeficiente de amortecimento do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the drag coefficient of the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna o coeficiente de arrasto do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the linear stiffness of the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna a rigidez linear do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the current position of the given soft body point in global "
"coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a posição atual do ponto de corpo macio fornecido em coordenadas "
"globais."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the pressure coefficient of the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna o coeficiente de pressão do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the shrinking factor of the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna o fator de encolhimento do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the simulation precision of the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna a precisão da simulação do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the [RID] of the space assigned to the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna o [RID] do espaço atribuído ao corpo flexível dado."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the given soft body state.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot's default physics implementation does not support "
"[constant BODY_STATE_LINEAR_VELOCITY], [constant "
"BODY_STATE_ANGULAR_VELOCITY], [constant BODY_STATE_SLEEPING], or [constant "
"BODY_STATE_CAN_SLEEP]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the total mass assigned to the given soft body."
msgstr "Retorna a massa total atribuída ao corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns whether the given soft body point is pinned."
msgstr "Retorna se o ponto de corpo macio fornecido está fixado."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Moves the given soft body point to a position in global coordinates."
msgstr ""
"Move o ponto do corpo flexível dado para uma posição em coordenadas globais."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Pins or unpins the given soft body point based on the value of [param pin].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Pinning a point effectively makes it kinematic, preventing it "
"from being affected by forces, but you can still move it using [method "
"soft_body_move_point]."
msgstr ""
"Fixa ou desafixa o ponto do corpo mole fornecido com base no valor de [param "
"pin].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Fixar um ponto torna-o efetivamente cinemático, impedindo que "
"seja afetado por forças, mas você ainda pode movê-lo usando [method "
"soft_body_move_point]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Unpins all points of the given soft body."
msgstr "Desfixa todos os pontos do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Removes the given body from the list of bodies exempt from collisions."
msgstr "Remove o corpo fornecido da lista de corpos isentos de colisões."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers the given soft body belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Define a camada ou camadas de física a que o corpo flexível dado pertence."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the physics layer or layers the given soft body can collide with."
msgstr ""
"Define a camada ou camadas de física com as quais o corpo flexível dado pode "
"colidir."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the damping coefficient of the given soft body. Higher values will slow "
"down the body more noticeably when forces are applied."
msgstr ""
"Define o coeficiente de amortecimento do corpo flexível (soft body) "
"fornecido. Valores mais altos desacelerarão o corpo de forma mais "
"perceptível quando forças forem aplicadas."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the drag coefficient of the given soft body. Higher values increase "
"this body's air resistance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This value is currently unused by Godot's default physics "
"implementation."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the linear stiffness of the given soft body. Higher values will result "
"in a stiffer body, while lower values will increase the body's ability to "
"bend. The value can be between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] "
"(inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Define a rigidez linear do corpo flexível fornecido. Valores mais altos "
"resultarão em um corpo mais rígido, enquanto valores mais baixos aumentarão "
"a capacidade de flexão do corpo. O valor pode estar entre [code]0.0[/code] e "
"[code]1.0[/code] (inclusivo)."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the mesh of the given soft body."
msgstr "Define a malha do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the pressure coefficient of the given soft body. Simulates pressure "
"build-up from inside this body. Higher values increase the strength of this "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"Define o coeficiente de pressão do corpo maleável dado. Simula o acúmulo de "
"pressão de dentro deste corpo. Valores mais altos aumentam a intensidade "
"desse efeito."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the given soft body will be pickable when using object picking."
msgstr ""
"Define se o corpo flexível fornecido será selecionável ao usar a seleção de "
"objetos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the shrinking factor of the given soft body."
msgstr "Define o fator de encolhimento do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the simulation precision of the given soft body. Increasing this value "
"will improve the resulting simulation, but can affect performance. Use with "
"care."
msgstr ""
"Define a precisão de simulação do corpo maleável fornecido. O aumento deste "
"valor melhorará a simulação resultante, mas poderá afetar o desempenho. Use "
"com cuidado."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Assigns a space to the given soft body (see [method space_create])."
msgstr ""
"Atribui um espaço ao corpo maleável fornecido (consulte [method "
"space_create])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the given body state for the given body.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Godot's default physics implementation does not support "
"[constant BODY_STATE_LINEAR_VELOCITY], [constant "
"BODY_STATE_ANGULAR_VELOCITY], [constant BODY_STATE_SLEEPING], or [constant "
"BODY_STATE_CAN_SLEEP]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the total mass for the given soft body."
msgstr "Define a massa total para o corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Sets the global transform of the given soft body."
msgstr "Define a transformação global do corpo macio fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Requests that the physics server updates the rendering server with the "
"latest positions of the given soft body's points through the [param "
"rendering_server_handler] interface."
msgstr ""
"Solicita que o servidor de física atualize o servidor de renderização com as "
"posições mais recentes dos pontos do corpo maleável fornecido através da "
"interface [param rendering_server_handler]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a space. A space is a collection of parameters for the physics "
"engine that can be assigned to an area or a body. It can be assigned to an "
"area with [method area_set_space], or to a body with [method body_set_space]."
msgstr ""
"Cria um espaço. Um espaço é uma coleção de parâmetros para o engine de "
"física que pode ser atribuído a uma área ou a um corpo. Ele pode ser "
"atribuído a uma área com [method area_set_space], ou a um corpo com [method "
"body_set_space]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the state of a space, a [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]. This object can "
"be used to make collision/intersection queries."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o estado de um espaço, um [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]. Este objeto "
"pode ser usado para fazer consultas de colisão/intersecção."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns the value of a space parameter."
msgstr "Retorna o valor de um parâmetro de espaço."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Returns whether the space is active."
msgstr "Retorna se o espaço está ativo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Marks a space as active. It will not have an effect, unless it is assigned "
"to an area or body."
msgstr ""
"Marca um espaço como ativo. Ele não terá efeito, a menos que seja atribuído "
"a uma área ou corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the value for a space parameter. A list of available parameters is on "
"the [enum SpaceParameter] constants."
msgstr ""
"Define o valor para um parâmetro de espaço. Uma lista de parâmetros "
"disponíveis está nas constantes do [enum SpaceParameter]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D sphere shape in the physics server, and returns the [RID] that "
"identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the sphere's radius."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de esfera 3D no servidor de física e retorna o [RID] que a "
"identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir o raio da esfera."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D world boundary shape in the physics server, and returns the "
"[RID] that identifies it. Use [method shape_set_data] to set the shape's "
"normal direction and distance properties."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma forma de limite de mundo 3D no servidor de física e retorna o [RID] "
"que a identifica. Use [method shape_set_data] para definir as propriedades "
"de direção normal e distância da forma."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [PinJoint3D]."
msgstr "O [Joint3D] é um [PinJoint3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [HingeJoint3D]."
msgstr "O [Joint3D] é um [HingeJoint3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [SliderJoint3D]."
msgstr "O [Joint3D] é um [SliderJoint3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [ConeTwistJoint3D]."
msgstr "O [Joint3D] é um [ConeTwistJoint3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The [Joint3D] is a [Generic6DOFJoint3D]."
msgstr "O [Joint3D] é um [Generic6DOFJoint3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The strength with which the pinned objects try to stay in positional "
"relation to each other. The higher, the stronger.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The strength with which the pinned objects try to stay in velocity relation "
"to each other. The higher, the stronger.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If above 0, this value is the maximum value for an impulse that this Joint3D "
"puts on its ends.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The speed with which the two bodies get pulled together when they move in "
"different directions.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The maximum rotation across the Hinge."
msgstr "A rotação máxima através da Dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The minimum rotation across the Hinge."
msgstr "A rotação mínima através da Dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The speed with which the rotation across the axis perpendicular to the hinge "
"gets corrected.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"[b]Nota:[/b] Suportado apenas ao usar GodotPhysics3D. Este parâmetro é "
"ignorado ao usar Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The lower this value, the more the rotation gets slowed down.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the Hinge has a maximum and a minimum rotation."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], a dobradiça possui uma rotação máxima e mínima."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], a motor turns the Hinge."
msgstr "Se [code]true[/code], um motor gira a Dobradiça."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum difference between the pivot points on their X axis before "
"damping happens."
msgstr ""
"A diferença máxima entre os pontos de pivô em seu eixo X antes que ocorra o "
"amortecimento."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml doc/classes/SliderJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum difference between the pivot points on their X axis before "
"damping happens."
msgstr ""
"A diferença mínima entre os pontos de pivô em seu eixo X antes que ocorra o "
"amortecimento."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis once the limits get "
"surpassed. The lower, the slower the movement.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution once the limits are surpassed. The lower, the more "
"velocity-energy gets lost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping once the slider limits are surpassed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across the slider axis as long as the "
"slider is in the limits. The lower, the slower the movement.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution inside the slider limits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping inside the slider limits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the movement across axes orthogonal to the slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution when movement is across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping when movement is across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The upper limit of rotation in the slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The lower limit of rotation in the slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor applied to the all rotation once the limit is surpassed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution of the rotation when the limit is surpassed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping of the rotation when the limit is surpassed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor that gets applied to the all rotation in the limits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution of the rotation in the limits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping of the rotation in the limits.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor that gets applied to the all rotation across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the "
"slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping of the rotation across axes orthogonal to the slider.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum SliderJointParam] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho do enum [enum SliderJointParam]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Swing is rotation from side to side, around the axis perpendicular to the "
"twist axis.\n"
"The swing span defines, how much rotation will not get corrected along the "
"swing axis.\n"
"Could be defined as looseness in the [ConeTwistJoint3D]. If below 0.05, this "
"behavior is locked."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Twist is the rotation around the twist axis, this value defined how far the "
"joint can twist. Twist is locked if below 0.05."
msgstr ""
"Torção é a rotação em torno do eixo de torção; este valor define até onde a "
"junta pode torcer. A torção é travada se estiver abaixo de 0,05."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The speed with which the swing or twist will take place. The higher, the "
"faster.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The ease with which the Joint3D twists, if it's too low, it takes more force "
"to twist the joint.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Defines, how fast the swing- and twist-speed-difference on both sides gets "
"synced.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor that gets applied to the movement across the axes. The lower, the "
"slower the movement.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of restitution on the axes movement. The lower, the more velocity-"
"energy gets lost.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of damping that happens at the linear motion across the axes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "The velocity that the joint's linear motor will attempt to reach."
msgstr "A velocidade que o motor linear da articulação tentará alcançar."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum force that the linear motor can apply while trying to reach the "
"target velocity."
msgstr ""
"A força máxima que o motor linear pode aplicar ao tentar alcançar a "
"velocidade alvo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"A factor that gets multiplied onto all rotations across the axes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of rotational damping across the axes. The lower, the more "
"damping occurs.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The amount of rotational restitution across the axes. The lower, the more "
"restitution occurs.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum amount of force that can occur, when rotating around the axes.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"When correcting the crossing of limits in rotation across the axes, this "
"error tolerance factor defines how much the correction gets slowed down. The "
"lower, the slower.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum G6DOFJointAxisParam] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum G6DOFJointAxisParam]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "If set, linear motion is possible within the given limits."
msgstr "Se definido, o movimento linear é possível dentro dos limites dados."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "If set, rotational motion is possible."
msgstr "Se definido, o movimento rotacional é possível."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "If set, there is a rotational motor across these axes."
msgstr "Se definido, há um motor rotacional através desses eixos."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set, there is a linear motor on this axis that targets a specific "
"velocity."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, há um motor linear neste eixo que visa uma velocidade "
"específica."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Represents the size of the [enum G6DOFJointAxisFlag] enum."
msgstr "Representa o tamanho da enumeração [enum G6DOFJointAxisFlag]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a world boundary shape (used by the "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D] resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de limite de mundo (usada pelo recurso "
"[WorldBoundaryShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a separation ray shape (used by the "
"[SeparationRayShape3D] resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de raio de separação (usada pelo recurso "
"[SeparationRayShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a sphere shape (used by the [SphereShape3D] resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de esfera (usada pelo recurso "
"[SphereShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant for creating a box shape (used by the [BoxShape3D] resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de caixa (usada pelo recurso [BoxShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a capsule shape (used by the [CapsuleShape3D] "
"resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de cápsula (usada pelo recurso "
"[CapsuleShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a cylinder shape (used by the [CylinderShape3D] "
"resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de cilindro (usada pelo recurso "
"[CylinderShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a convex polygon shape (used by the "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D] resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de polígono convexo (usada pelo recurso "
"[ConvexPolygonShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a concave polygon (trimesh) shape (used by the "
"[ConcavePolygonShape3D] resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de polígono côncavo (trimesh) (usada pelo "
"recurso [ConcavePolygonShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant for creating a heightmap shape (used by the [HeightMapShape3D] "
"resource)."
msgstr ""
"Constante para criar uma forma de mapa de altura (usada pelo recurso "
"[HeightMapShape3D])."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant used internally for a soft body shape. Any attempt to create this "
"kind of shape results in an error."
msgstr ""
"Constante usada internamente para uma forma de corpo macio. Qualquer "
"tentativa de criar este tipo de forma resulta em um erro."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant used internally for a custom shape. Any attempt to create this kind "
"of shape results in an error when using Godot Physics or Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""
"Constante usada internamente para uma forma personalizada. Qualquer "
"tentativa de criar esse tipo de forma resulta em um erro ao usar Godot "
"Physics ou Jolt Physics."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get gravity override mode in an area. See [enum "
"AreaSpaceOverrideMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o modo de substituição de gravidade em uma "
"área. Consulte [enum AreaSpaceOverrideMode] para valores possíveis."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get gravity strength in an area."
msgstr "Constante para definir/obter a intensidade da gravidade em uma área."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get gravity vector/center in an area."
msgstr "Constante para definir/obter vetor/centro de gravidade em uma área."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get whether the gravity vector of an area is a direction, or "
"a center point."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter se o vetor de gravidade de uma área é uma "
"direção ou um ponto central."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the distance at which the gravity strength is equal to "
"the gravity controlled by [constant AREA_PARAM_GRAVITY]. For example, on a "
"planet 100 meters in radius with a surface gravity of 4.0 m/s², set the "
"gravity to 4.0 and the unit distance to 100.0. The gravity will have falloff "
"according to the inverse square law, so in the example, at 200 meters from "
"the center the gravity will be 1.0 m/s² (twice the distance, 1/4th the "
"gravity), at 50 meters it will be 16.0 m/s² (half the distance, 4x the "
"gravity), and so on.\n"
"The above is true only when the unit distance is a positive number. When "
"this is set to 0.0, the gravity will be constant regardless of distance."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get linear damping override mode in an area. See [enum "
"AreaSpaceOverrideMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o modo de substituição de amortecimento linear "
"em uma área. Veja [enum AreaSpaceOverrideMode] para valores possíveis."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get the linear damping factor of an area."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o fator de amortecimento linear de uma área."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get angular damping override mode in an area. See [enum "
"AreaSpaceOverrideMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o modo de substituição de amortecimento angular "
"em uma área. Veja [enum AreaSpaceOverrideMode] para valores possíveis."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get the angular damping factor of an area."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o fator de amortecimento linear de uma área."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get the priority (order of processing) of an area."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter a prioridade (ordem de processamento) de uma "
"área."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the magnitude of area-specific wind force. This wind "
"force only applies to [SoftBody3D] nodes. Other physics bodies are currently "
"not affected by wind."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter a magnitude da força do vento específica da "
"área. Essa força do vento se aplica apenas a nós [SoftBody3D]. Outros corpos "
"físicos atualmente não são afetados pelo vento."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the 3D vector that specifies the origin from which an "
"area-specific wind blows."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o vetor 3D que especifica a origem de onde "
"sopra um vento específico de área."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the 3D vector that specifies the direction in which an "
"area-specific wind blows."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o vetor 3D que especifica a direção na qual "
"sopra um vento específico de área."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the exponential rate at which wind force decreases with "
"distance from its origin."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter a taxa exponencial na qual a força do vento "
"diminui com a distância de sua origem."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get a body's bounce factor."
msgstr "Constante para definir/obter o fator de ressalto de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get a body's friction."
msgstr "Constante para definir/obter o atrito de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get a body's mass."
msgstr "Constante para definir/obter a massa de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get a body's inertia."
msgstr "Constante para definir/obter a inércia de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get a body's center of mass position in the body's local "
"coordinate system."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter a posição do centro de massa de um corpo no "
"sistema de coordenadas local do corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get a body's gravity multiplier."
msgstr "Constante para definir/obter o multiplicador de gravidade de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get a body's linear damping mode. See [enum BodyDampMode] "
"for possible values."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o modo de amortecimento linear de um corpo. "
"Consulte [enum BodyDampMode] para valores possíveis."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get a body's angular damping mode. See [enum BodyDampMode] "
"for possible values."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o modo de amortecimento angular de um corpo. "
"Veja [enum BodyDampMode] para valores possíveis."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get a body's linear damping factor."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o fator de amortecimento linear de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid "Constant to set/get a body's angular damping factor."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o fator de amortecimento angular de um corpo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum distance a pair of bodies has to move before "
"their collision status has to be recalculated."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter a distância máxima que um par de corpos precisa "
"se mover antes que seu status de colisão precise ser recalculado."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum distance a shape can be from another before "
"they are considered separated and the contact is discarded."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter a distância máxima que uma forma pode estar de "
"outra antes de serem consideradas separadas e o contato ser descartado."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum distance a shape can penetrate another shape "
"before it is considered a collision."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter a distância máxima que uma forma pode penetrar "
"outra forma antes de ser considerada uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the default solver bias for all physics contacts. A "
"solver bias is a factor controlling how much two objects \"rebound\", after "
"overlapping, to avoid leaving them in that state because of numerical "
"imprecision."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o viés de resolvedor padrão para todos os "
"contatos de física. Um viés de resolvedor é um fator que controla o quanto "
"dois objetos \"rebatem\", após a sobreposição, para evitar deixá-los nesse "
"estado devido a imprecisão numérica."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the threshold linear velocity of activity. A body marked "
"as potentially inactive for both linear and angular velocity will be put to "
"sleep after the time given.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the threshold angular velocity of activity. A body "
"marked as potentially inactive for both linear and angular velocity will be "
"put to sleep after the time given.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only supported when using GodotPhysics3D. This parameter is "
"ignored when using Jolt Physics."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the maximum time of activity. A body marked as "
"potentially inactive for both linear and angular velocity will be put to "
"sleep after this time."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o tempo máximo de atividade. Um corpo marcado "
"como potencialmente inativo para velocidade linear e angular será colocado "
"em modo de espera após esse tempo."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3D.xml
msgid ""
"Constant to set/get the number of solver iterations for contacts and "
"constraints. The greater the number of iterations, the more accurate the "
"collisions and constraints will be. However, a greater number of iterations "
"requires more CPU power, which can decrease performance."
msgstr ""
"Constante para definir/obter o número de iterações do solver para contatos e "
"restrições. Quanto maior o número de iterações, mais precisas serão as "
"colisões e restrições. No entanto, um maior número de iterações requer mais "
"poder de CPU, o que pode diminuir o desempenho."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DExtension.xml
msgid ""
"Provides virtual methods that can be overridden to create custom "
"[PhysicsServer3D] implementations."
msgstr ""
"Fornece métodos virtuais que podem ser substituídos para criar "
"implementações personalizadas de [PhysicsServer3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DExtension.xml
msgid ""
"This class extends [PhysicsServer3D] by providing additional virtual methods "
"that can be overridden. When these methods are overridden, they will be "
"called instead of the internal methods of the physics server.\n"
"Intended for use with GDExtension to create custom implementations of "
"[PhysicsServer3D]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DManager.xml
msgid "A singleton for managing [PhysicsServer3D] implementations."
msgstr "Um singleton para gerenciar implementações de [PhysicsServer3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DManager.xml
msgid ""
"[PhysicsServer3DManager] is the API for registering [PhysicsServer3D] "
"implementations and for setting the default implementation.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not possible to switch physics servers at runtime. This "
"class is only used on startup at the server initialization level, by Godot "
"itself and possibly by GDExtensions."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DManager.xml
msgid ""
"Register a [PhysicsServer3D] implementation by passing a [param name] and a "
"[Callable] that returns a [PhysicsServer3D] object."
msgstr ""
"Registre uma implementação de [PhysicsServer3D] passando um [param name] e "
"um [Callable] que retorna um objeto [PhysicsServer3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DManager.xml
msgid ""
"Set the default [PhysicsServer3D] implementation to the one identified by "
"[param name], if [param priority] is greater than the priority of the "
"current default implementation."
msgstr ""
"Define a implementação padrão de [PhysicsServer3D] para aquela identificada "
"por [param name], se [param priority] for maior que a prioridade da "
"implementação padrão atual."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DRenderingServerHandler.xml
msgid ""
"A class used to provide [method "
"PhysicsServer3DExtension._soft_body_update_rendering_server] with a "
"rendering handler for soft bodies."
msgstr ""
"Uma classe usada para fornecer a [method "
"PhysicsServer3DExtension._soft_body_update_rendering_server] um manipulador "
"de renderização para corpos flexíveis."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DRenderingServerHandler.xml
msgid ""
"Called by the [PhysicsServer3D] to set the bounding box for the [SoftBody3D]."
msgstr ""
"Chamado pelo [PhysicsServer3D] para definir a caixa delimitadora do "
"[SoftBody3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DRenderingServerHandler.xml
msgid ""
"Called by the [PhysicsServer3D] to set the normal for the [SoftBody3D] "
"vertex at the index specified by [param vertex_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param normal] parameter used to be of type [code]const "
"void*[/code] prior to Godot 4.2."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DRenderingServerHandler.xml
msgid ""
"Called by the [PhysicsServer3D] to set the position for the [SoftBody3D] "
"vertex at the index specified by [param vertex_id].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [param vertex] parameter used to be of type [code]const "
"void*[/code] prior to Godot 4.2."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DRenderingServerHandler.xml
msgid "Sets the bounding box for the [SoftBody3D]."
msgstr "Define a caixa delimitadora para o [SoftBody3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DRenderingServerHandler.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the normal for the [SoftBody3D] vertex at the index specified by [param "
"vertex_id]."
msgstr ""
"Define a normal para o vértice do [SoftBody3D] no índice especificado por "
"[param vertex_id]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsServer3DRenderingServerHandler.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the position for the [SoftBody3D] vertex at the index specified by "
"[param vertex_id]."
msgstr ""
"Define a posição para o vértice do [SoftBody3D] no índice especificado por "
"[param vertex_id]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.xml
msgid "Provides parameters for [PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D]'s methods."
msgstr "Fornece parâmetros para os métodos de [PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"By changing various properties of this object, such as the shape, you can "
"configure the parameters for [PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D]'s methods."
msgstr ""
"Ao alterar várias propriedades deste objeto, como a forma, você pode "
"configurar os parâmetros para os métodos de [PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.xml
msgid "The collision margin for the shape."
msgstr "A margem de colisão para a forma."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.xml
msgid "The motion of the shape being queried for."
msgstr "O movimento da forma que está sendo consultada."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Shape2D] that will be used for collision/intersection queries. This "
"stores the actual reference which avoids the shape to be released while "
"being used for queries, so always prefer using this over [member shape_rid]."
msgstr ""
"O [Shape2D] que será usado para consultas de colisão/intersecção. Isso "
"armazena a referência real que evita que a forma seja liberada enquanto é "
"usada para consultas, portanto, sempre prefira usar isso em vez de [member "
"shape_rid]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"The queried shape's [RID] that will be used for collision/intersection "
"queries. Use this over [member shape] if you want to optimize for "
"performance using the Servers API:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer2D.circle_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 64\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"# Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer2D.CircleShapeCreate();\n"
"int radius = 64;\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"// Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"O [RID] da forma consultada que será usado para consultas de colisão/"
"intersecção. Use isto em vez de [member shape] se você quiser otimizar o "
"desempenho usando a API de Servidores (Servers API):\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer2D.circle_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 64\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# Execute as consultas de física aqui...\n"
"\n"
"# Libere a forma quando terminar as consultas de física.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer2D.CircleShapeCreate();\n"
"int radius = 64;\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// Execute as consultas de física aqui...\n"
"\n"
"// Libere a forma quando terminar as consultas de física.\n"
"PhysicsServer2D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.xml
msgid "The queried shape's transform matrix."
msgstr "A matriz de transformação da forma consultada."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.xml
msgid "Provides parameters for [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]'s methods."
msgstr "Fornece parâmetros para os métodos de [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"By changing various properties of this object, such as the shape, you can "
"configure the parameters for [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]'s methods."
msgstr ""
"Ao alterar várias propriedades deste objeto, como a forma, você pode "
"configurar os parâmetros para os métodos de [PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"The [Shape3D] that will be used for collision/intersection queries. This "
"stores the actual reference which avoids the shape to be released while "
"being used for queries, so always prefer using this over [member shape_rid]."
msgstr ""
"O [Shape3D] que será usado para consultas de colisão/intersecção. Isso "
"armazena a referência real que evita que a forma seja liberada enquanto é "
"usada para consultas, portanto, sempre prefira usar isso em vez de [member "
"shape_rid]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"The queried shape's [RID] that will be used for collision/intersection "
"queries. Use this over [member shape] if you want to optimize for "
"performance using the Servers API:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer3D.sphere_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 2.0\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"# Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer3D.SphereShapeCreate();\n"
"float radius = 2.0f;\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// Execute physics queries here...\n"
"\n"
"// Release the shape when done with physics queries.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"O [RID] da forma consultada que será usado para consultas de colisão/"
"intersecção. Use isto em vez de [member shape] se você quiser otimizar o "
"desempenho usando a API de Servidores (Servers API):\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var shape_rid = PhysicsServer3D.sphere_shape_create()\n"
"var radius = 2.0\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.shape_set_data(shape_rid, radius)\n"
"\n"
"var params = PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D.new()\n"
"params.shape_rid = shape_rid\n"
"\n"
"# Execute as consultas de física aqui...\n"
"\n"
"# Libere a forma quando terminar as consultas de física.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.free_rid(shape_rid)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"RID shapeRid = PhysicsServer3D.SphereShapeCreate();\n"
"float radius = 2.0f;\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.ShapeSetData(shapeRid, radius);\n"
"\n"
"var params = new PhysicsShapeQueryParameters3D();\n"
"params.ShapeRid = shapeRid;\n"
"\n"
"// Execute as consultas de física aqui...\n"
"\n"
"// Libere a forma quando terminar as consultas de física.\n"
"PhysicsServer3D.FreeRid(shapeRid);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
msgid "Provides parameters for [method PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr "Fornece parâmetros para [method PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"By changing various properties of this object, such as the motion, you can "
"configure the parameters for [method PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"Ao alterar várias propriedades deste objeto, como o movimento, você pode "
"configurar os parâmetros para [method PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are used to detect collisions and can "
"stop the motion. Can be useful when snapping to the ground.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer2D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are only used for separation when "
"overlapping with other bodies. That's the main use for separation ray shapes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"Optional array of body [RID] to exclude from collision. Use [method "
"CollisionObject2D.get_rid] to get the [RID] associated with a "
"[CollisionObject2D]-derived node."
msgstr ""
"Array opcional de [RID] de corpo a ser excluído da colisão. Use [method "
"CollisionObject2D.get_rid] para obter o [RID] associado a um nó derivado de "
"[CollisionObject2D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"Optional array of object unique instance ID to exclude from collision. See "
"[method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"Array opcional de IDs de instâncias exclusivas de objetos a serem excluídos "
"da colisão. Consulte [method Object.get_instance_id]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"Transform in global space where the motion should start. Usually set to "
"[member Node2D.global_transform] for the current body's transform."
msgstr ""
"Transformação no espaço global onde o movimento deve começar. Geralmente "
"definido como [member Node2D.global_transform] para a transformação do corpo "
"atual."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid "Increases the size of the shapes involved in the collision detection."
msgstr "Aumenta o tamanho das formas envolvidas na detecção de colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid "Motion vector to define the length and direction of the motion to test."
msgstr ""
"Vetor de movimento para definir o comprimento e a direção do movimento a ser "
"testado."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters2D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], any depenetration from the recovery phase is "
"reported as a collision; this is used e.g. by [CharacterBody2D] for "
"improving floor detection during floor snapping.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], only collisions resulting from the motion are "
"reported, which is generally the desired behavior."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid "Provides parameters for [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr "Fornece parâmetros para [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"By changing various properties of this object, such as the motion, you can "
"configure the parameters for [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"Ao alterar várias propriedades deste objeto, como o movimento, você pode "
"configurar os parâmetros para [method PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are used to detect collisions and can "
"stop the motion. Can be useful when snapping to the ground.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], shapes of type [constant "
"PhysicsServer3D.SHAPE_SEPARATION_RAY] are only used for separation when "
"overlapping with other bodies. That's the main use for separation ray shapes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"Optional array of body [RID] to exclude from collision. Use [method "
"CollisionObject3D.get_rid] to get the [RID] associated with a "
"[CollisionObject3D]-derived node."
msgstr ""
"Array opcional de [RID] de corpo a ser excluído da colisão. Use [method "
"CollisionObject3D.get_rid] para obter o [RID] associado a um nó derivado de "
"[CollisionObject3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"Transform in global space where the motion should start. Usually set to "
"[member Node3D.global_transform] for the current body's transform."
msgstr ""
"Transformação no espaço global onde o movimento deve começar. Geralmente "
"definido como [member Node3D.global_transform] para a transformação do corpo "
"atual."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of returned collisions, between [code]1[/code] and [code]32[/"
"code]. Always returns the deepest detected collisions."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de colisões retornadas, entre [code]1[/code] e [code]32[/"
"code]. Retorna sempre as colisões mais profundas detectadas."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionParameters3D.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], any depenetration from the recovery phase is "
"reported as a collision; this is used e.g. by [CharacterBody3D] for "
"improving floor detection during floor snapping.\n"
"If set to [code]false[/code], only collisions resulting from the motion are "
"reported, which is generally the desired behavior."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Describes the motion and collision result from [method "
"PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"Descreve o resultado de movimento e colisão de [method "
"PhysicsServer2D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's attached [Object], if a collision occurred."
msgstr "Retorna o [Object] anexado do corpo colidente, se uma colisão ocorreu."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object], if "
"a collision occurred. See [method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID de instância exclusivo do [Object] anexado do corpo em colisão, "
"se ocorreu uma colisão. Veja [method Object.get_instance_id]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer2D], if a "
"collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] do corpo em colisão usado pelo [PhysicsServer2D], caso tenha "
"ocorrido uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape index, if a collision occurred. See "
"[CollisionObject2D]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice da forma do corpo em colisão, caso tenha ocorrido uma "
"colisão. Consulte [CollisionObject2D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid "Returns the colliding body's velocity, if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a velocidade do corpo em colisão, caso uma colisão tenha ocorrido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the length of overlap along the collision normal, if a collision "
"occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o comprimento da sobreposição ao longo da normal de colisão, se "
"ocorreu uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid "Returns the moving object's colliding shape, if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a forma colisora do objeto em movimento, caso uma colisão tenha "
"ocorrido."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision, if a "
"collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a normal da forma do corpo colidido no ponto de colisão, caso tenha "
"ocorrido uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the point of collision in global coordinates, if a collision "
"occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto de colisão em coordenadas globais, se uma colisão ocorreu."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum fraction of the motion that can occur without a "
"collision, between [code]0[/code] and [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a fração máxima do movimento que pode ocorrer sem uma colisão, entre "
"[code]0[/code] e [code]1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the minimum fraction of the motion needed to collide, if a collision "
"occurred, between [code]0[/code] and [code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a fração mínima do movimento necessária para colidir, se ocorreu uma "
"colisão, entre [code]0[/code] e [code]1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Describes the motion and collision result from [method "
"PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."
msgstr ""
"Descreve o resultado de movimento e colisão de [method "
"PhysicsServer3D.body_test_motion]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's attached [Object] given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [Object] anexado do corpo em colisão dado um índice de colisão (a "
"colisão mais profunda por padrão), se ocorreu uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the unique instance ID of the colliding body's attached [Object] "
"given a collision index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision "
"occurred. See [method Object.get_instance_id]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ID de instância exclusivo do [Object] anexado do corpo colidente "
"dado um índice de colisão (a colisão mais profunda por padrão), se ocorreu "
"uma colisão. Consulte [method Object.get_instance_id]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's [RID] used by the [PhysicsServer3D] given a "
"collision index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o [RID] do corpo em colisão usado pelo [PhysicsServer3D], dado um "
"índice de colisão (a colisão mais profunda por padrão), caso tenha ocorrido "
"uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape index given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred. See "
"[CollisionObject3D]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice da forma do corpo em colisão, dado um índice de colisão (a "
"colisão mais profunda por padrão), caso tenha ocorrido uma colisão. Consulte "
"[CollisionObject3D]."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's velocity given a collision index (the deepest "
"collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a velocidade do corpo colidente dada uma imagem de colisão (a "
"colisão mais profunda por padrão), se ocorreu uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the length of overlap along the collision normal given a collision "
"index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o comprimento da sobreposição ao longo da normal de colisão dado um "
"índice de colisão (a colisão mais profunda por padrão), se uma colisão "
"ocorreu."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the moving object's colliding shape given a collision index (the "
"deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a forma de colisão do objeto em movimento dado um índice de colisão "
"(a colisão mais profunda por padrão), se ocorreu uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the colliding body's shape's normal at the point of collision given "
"a collision index (the deepest collision by default), if a collision "
"occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a normal da forma do corpo em colisão no ponto da colisão, dado um "
"índice de colisão (a colisão mais profunda por padrão), caso tenha ocorrido "
"uma colisão."

#: doc/classes/PhysicsTestMotionResult3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the point of collision in global coordinates given a collision index "
"(the deepest collision by default), if a collision occurred."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto de colisão em coordenadas globais dado um índice de colisão "
"(a colisão mais profunda por padrão), se uma colisão ocorreu."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 2D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta física que conecta dois corpos físicos 2D em um único ponto, "
"permitindo que eles rotacionem livremente."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 2D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate. For example, a [RigidBody2D] can be attached "
"to a [StaticBody2D] to create a pendulum or a seesaw."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta de física que conecta dois corpos físicos 2D em um único ponto, "
"permitindo que eles girem livremente. Por exemplo, um [RigidBody2D] pode ser "
"conectado a um [StaticBody2D] para criar um pêndulo ou uma gangorra."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the pin maximum and minimum rotation, defined by "
"[member angular_limit_lower] and [member angular_limit_upper] are applied."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a rotação máxima e mínima do pino, definida por "
"[member angular_limit_lower] e [member angular_limit_upper], são aplicadas."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum rotation. Only active if [member angular_limit_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A rotação mínima. Só fica ativa se [member angular_limit_enabled] for "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum rotation. Only active if [member angular_limit_enabled] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"A rotação máxima. Só fica ativa se [member angular_limit_enabled] for "
"[code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint2D.xml
msgid "When activated, a motor turns the pin."
msgstr "Quando ativado, um motor gira o pino."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint2D.xml
msgid ""
"The higher this value, the more the bond to the pinned partner can flex."
msgstr ""
"Quanto maior este valor, mais a ligação com o parceiro fixado pode flexionar."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 3D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta física que conecta dois corpos físicos 3D em um único ponto, "
"permitindo que eles rotacionem livremente."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"A physics joint that attaches two 3D physics bodies at a single point, "
"allowing them to freely rotate. For example, a [RigidBody3D] can be attached "
"to a [StaticBody3D] to create a pendulum or a seesaw."
msgstr ""
"Uma junta de física que conecta dois corpos físicos 3D em um único ponto, "
"permitindo que eles girem livremente. Por exemplo, um [RigidBody3D] pode ser "
"conectado a um [StaticBody3D] para criar um pêndulo ou uma gangorra."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The force with which the pinned objects stay in positional relation to each "
"other. The higher, the stronger."
msgstr ""
"A força com a qual os objetos fixados permanecem em relação posicional entre "
"si. Quanto maior, mais forte."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"The force with which the pinned objects stay in velocity relation to each "
"other. The higher, the stronger."
msgstr ""
"A força com a qual os objetos fixados permanecem em relação de velocidade "
"entre si. Quanto maior, mais forte."

#: doc/classes/PinJoint3D.xml
msgid ""
"If above 0, this value is the maximum value for an impulse that this Joint3D "
"produces."
msgstr ""
"Se estiver acima de 0, este valor é o valor máximo para um impulso que este "
"Joint3D produz."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderCubemap.xml
msgid "A [Cubemap] without image data."
msgstr "Um [Cubemap] sem dados de imagem."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderCubemap.xml
msgid ""
"This class replaces a [Cubemap] or a [Cubemap]-derived class in 2 "
"conditions:\n"
"- In dedicated server mode, where the image data shouldn't affect game "
"logic. This allows reducing the exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When the [Cubemap]-derived class is missing, for example when using a "
"different engine version.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not intended for rendering or for use in shaders. "
"Operations like calculating UV are not guaranteed to work."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderCubemapArray.xml
msgid "A [CubemapArray] without image data."
msgstr "Um [CubemapArray] sem dados de imagem."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderCubemapArray.xml
msgid ""
"This class replaces a [CubemapArray] or a [CubemapArray]-derived class in 2 "
"conditions:\n"
"- In dedicated server mode, where the image data shouldn't affect game "
"logic. This allows reducing the exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When the [CubemapArray]-derived class is missing, for example when using a "
"different engine version.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This class is not intended for rendering or for use in shaders. "
"Operations like calculating UV are not guaranteed to work."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderMaterial.xml
msgid "Placeholder class for a material."
msgstr "Classe de espaço reservado para um material."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Material] subclass in "
"2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the "
"exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderMesh.xml
msgid "Placeholder class for a mesh."
msgstr "Classe de espaço reservado para uma malha."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderMesh.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Mesh] subclass in 2 "
"conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the "
"exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderMesh.xml
msgid "The smallest [AABB] enclosing this mesh in local space."
msgstr "O menor [AABB] envolvendo esta malha no espaço local."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture2D.xml
msgid "Placeholder class for a 2-dimensional texture."
msgstr "Classe de espaço reservado para uma textura bidimensional."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture2D.xml
#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture2DArray.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Texture2D] subclass "
"in 2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the "
"exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not intended to be used as an actual texture for "
"rendering. It is not guaranteed to work like one in shaders or materials "
"(for example when calculating UV)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture2D.xml doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture3D.xml
msgid "The texture's size (in pixels)."
msgstr "O tamanho da textura (em pixels)."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture2DArray.xml
#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTextureLayered.xml
msgid "Placeholder class for a 2-dimensional texture array."
msgstr "Classe de espaço reservado para um array de texturas bidimensional."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture3D.xml
msgid "Placeholder class for a 3-dimensional texture."
msgstr "Classe de espaço reservado para uma textura tridimensional."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTexture3D.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [Texture3D] subclass "
"in 2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the "
"exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not intended to be used as an actual texture for "
"rendering. It is not guaranteed to work like one in shaders or materials "
"(for example when calculating UV)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTextureLayered.xml
msgid ""
"This class is used when loading a project that uses a [TextureLayered] "
"subclass in 2 conditions:\n"
"- When running the project exported in dedicated server mode, only the "
"texture's dimensions are kept (as they may be relied upon for gameplay "
"purposes or positioning of other elements). This allows reducing the "
"exported PCK's size significantly.\n"
"- When this subclass is missing due to using a different engine version or "
"build (e.g. modules disabled).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is not intended to be used as an actual texture for "
"rendering. It is not guaranteed to work like one in shaders or materials "
"(for example when calculating UV)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTextureLayered.xml
msgid "The number of layers in the texture array."
msgstr "O número de camadas no array de texturas."

#: doc/classes/PlaceholderTextureLayered.xml
msgid "The size of each texture layer (in pixels)."
msgstr "O tamanho de cada camada de textura (em pixels)."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "A plane in Hessian normal form."
msgstr "Um plano na forma normal de Hesse."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Represents a normalized plane equation. [member normal] is the normal of the "
"plane (a, b, c normalized), and [member d] is the distance from the origin "
"to the plane (in the direction of \"normal\"). \"Over\" or \"Above\" the "
"plane is considered the side of the plane towards where the normal is "
"pointing.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a plane will evaluate to [code]false[/"
"code] if all its components equal [code]0[/code]. Otherwise, a plane will "
"always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a default-initialized [Plane] with all components set to [code]0[/"
"code]."
msgstr ""
"Constrói um [Plane] inicializado por padrão com todos os componentes "
"definidos como [code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Plane] as a copy of the given [Plane]."
msgstr "Constrói um [Plane] como uma cópia do [Plane] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the four parameters. The three components of the "
"resulting plane's [member normal] are [param a], [param b] and [param c], "
"and the plane has a distance of [param d] from the origin."
msgstr ""
"Cria um plano a partir dos quatro parâmetros. Os três componentes da [member "
"normal] do plano resultante são [param a], [param b] e [param c], e o plano "
"tem uma distância de [param d] da origem."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the normal vector. The plane will intersect the "
"origin.\n"
"The [param normal] of the plane must be a unit vector."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the normal vector and the plane's distance from the "
"origin.\n"
"The [param normal] of the plane must be a unit vector."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a plane from the normal vector and a point on the plane.\n"
"The [param normal] of the plane must be a unit vector."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "Creates a plane from the three points, given in clockwise order."
msgstr "Cria um plano a partir dos três pontos, fornecidos em sentido horário."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the shortest distance from the plane to the position [param point]. "
"If the point is above the plane, the distance will be positive. If below, "
"the distance will be negative."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a menor distância do plano até a posição [param point]. Se o ponto "
"estiver acima do plano, a distância será positiva. Se abaixo, a distância "
"será negativa."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "Returns the center of the plane."
msgstr "Retorna o centro do plano."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is inside the plane. Comparison "
"uses a custom minimum [param tolerance] threshold."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se [param point] estiver dentro do plano. A "
"comparação usa um limite mínimo de [param tolerance] personalizado."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the intersection point of the three planes [param b], [param c] and "
"this plane. If no intersection is found, [code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto de interseção dos três planos [param b], [param c] e este "
"plano. Se nenhuma interseção for encontrada, [code]null[/code] é retornado."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the intersection point of a ray consisting of the position [param "
"from] and the direction normal [param dir] with this plane. If no "
"intersection is found, [code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto de interseção de um raio consistindo na posição [param from] "
"e na normal de direção [param dir] com este plano. Se nenhuma interseção for "
"encontrada, [code]null[/code] será retornado."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the intersection point of a segment from position [param from] to "
"position [param to] with this plane. If no intersection is found, "
"[code]null[/code] is returned."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o ponto de interseção de um segmento da posição [param from] até a "
"posição [param to] com este plano. Se nenhuma interseção for encontrada, "
"[code]null[/code] será retornado."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this plane and [param to_plane] are "
"approximately equal, by running [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] on "
"each component."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este plano e [param to_plane] forem "
"aproximadamente iguais, executando [method @GlobalScope.is_equal_approx] em "
"cada componente."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this plane is finite, by calling [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] on each component."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este plano for finito, chamando [method "
"@GlobalScope.is_finite] em cada componente."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] is located above the plane."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se [param point] estiver localizado acima do plano."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the plane, with normalized [member normal] (so it's a unit "
"vector). Returns [code]Plane(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] if [member normal] can't be "
"normalized (it has zero length)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma cópia do plano, com [member normal] normalizado (de modo que "
"seja um vetor unitário). Retorna [code]Plane(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code] se [member "
"normal] não puder ser normalizado (tiver comprimento zero)."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the orthogonal projection of [param point] into a point in the plane."
msgstr "Retorna a projeção ortogonal de [param point] em um ponto no plano."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"The distance from the origin to the plane, expressed in terms of [member "
"normal] (according to its direction and magnitude). Actual absolute distance "
"from the origin to the plane can be calculated as [code]abs(d) / "
"normal.length()[/code] (if [member normal] has zero length then this [Plane] "
"does not represent a valid plane).\n"
"In the scalar equation of the plane [code]ax + by + cz = d[/code], this is "
"[code skip-lint]d[/code], while the [code](a, b, c)[/code] coordinates are "
"represented by the [member normal] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"The normal of the plane, typically a unit vector. Shouldn't be a zero vector "
"as [Plane] with such [member normal] does not represent a valid plane.\n"
"In the scalar equation of the plane [code]ax + by + cz = d[/code], this is "
"the vector [code](a, b, c)[/code], where [code skip-lint]d[/code] is the "
"[member d] property."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "The X component of the plane's [member normal] vector."
msgstr "O componente X do vetor [member normal] do plano."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "The Y component of the plane's [member normal] vector."
msgstr "O componente Y do vetor [member normal] do plano."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "The Z component of the plane's [member normal] vector."
msgstr "O componente Z do vetor [member normal] do plano."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "A plane that extends in the Y and Z axes (normal vector points +X)."
msgstr ""
"Um plano que se estende nos eixos Y e Z (o vetor normal aponta para +X)."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "A plane that extends in the X and Z axes (normal vector points +Y)."
msgstr ""
"Um plano que se estende nos eixos X e Z (o vetor normal aponta para +Y)."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid "A plane that extends in the X and Y axes (normal vector points +Z)."
msgstr ""
"Um plano que se estende nos eixos X e Y (o vetor normal aponta para +Z)."

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the planes are not equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Inversely transforms (multiplies) the [Plane] by the given [Transform3D] "
"transformation matrix.\n"
"[code]plane * transform[/code] is equivalent to "
"[code]transform.affine_inverse() * plane[/code]. See [method "
"Transform3D.affine_inverse]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the planes are exactly equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, consider using [method "
"is_equal_approx] instead, which is more reliable."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Plane.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the negative value of the [Plane]. This is the same as writing "
"[code]Plane(-p.normal, -p.d)[/code]. This operation flips the direction of "
"the normal vector and also flips the distance value, resulting in a Plane "
"that is in the same place, but facing the opposite direction."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor negativo do [Plane]. Isto é o mesmo que escrever "
"[code]Plane(-p.normal, -p.d)[/code]. Esta operação inverte a direção do "
"vetor normal e também inverte o valor da distância, resultando em um Plane "
"que está no mesmo lugar, mas virado na direção oposta."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid "Class representing a planar [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "Classe que representa um [PrimitiveMesh] planar."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Class representing a planar [PrimitiveMesh]. This flat mesh does not have a "
"thickness. By default, this mesh is aligned on the X and Z axes; this "
"default rotation isn't suited for use with billboarded materials. For "
"billboarded materials, change [member orientation] to [constant FACE_Z].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using a large textured [PlaneMesh] (e.g. as a floor), you "
"may stumble upon UV jittering issues depending on the camera angle. To solve "
"this, increase [member subdivide_depth] and [member subdivide_width] until "
"you no longer notice UV jittering."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid "Offset of the generated plane. Useful for particles."
msgstr "Deslocamento do plano gerado. Útil para partículas."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid "Direction that the [PlaneMesh] is facing."
msgstr "Direção para a qual o [PlaneMesh] está voltado."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid "Size of the generated plane."
msgstr "Tamanho do plano gerado."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid "Number of subdivision along the Z axis."
msgstr "Número de subdivisões ao longo do eixo Z."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid "Number of subdivision along the X axis."
msgstr "Número de subdivisões ao longo do eixo X."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid "[PlaneMesh] will face the positive X-axis."
msgstr "O [PlaneMesh] estará voltado para o eixo X positivo."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid ""
"[PlaneMesh] will face the positive Y-axis. This matches the behavior of the "
"[PlaneMesh] in Godot 3.x."
msgstr ""
"[PlaneMesh] ficará voltado para o eixo Y positivo. Isso corresponde ao "
"comportamento do [PlaneMesh] no Godot 3.x."

#: doc/classes/PlaneMesh.xml
msgid ""
"[PlaneMesh] will face the positive Z-axis. This matches the behavior of the "
"QuadMesh in Godot 3.x."
msgstr ""
"[PlaneMesh] ficará voltado para o eixo Z positivo. Isso corresponde ao "
"comportamento do QuadMesh no Godot 3.x."

#: doc/classes/PointLight2D.xml
msgid "Positional 2D light source."
msgstr "Fonte de luz 2D posicional."

#: doc/classes/PointLight2D.xml
msgid ""
"Casts light in a 2D environment. This light's shape is defined by a (usually "
"grayscale) texture."
msgstr ""
"Projeta luz em um ambiente 2D. A forma desta luz é definida por uma textura "
"(geralmente em escala de cinza)."

#: doc/classes/PointLight2D.xml
msgid ""
"The height of the light. Used with 2D normal mapping. The units are in "
"pixels, e.g. if the height is 100, then it will illuminate an object 100 "
"pixels away at a 45° angle to the plane."
msgstr ""
"A altura da luz. Usada com mapeamento normal 2D. As unidades são em pixels, "
"por exemplo, se a altura for 100, ela iluminará um objeto a 100 pixels de "
"distância em um ângulo de 45° em relação ao plano."

#: doc/classes/PointLight2D.xml
msgid "The offset of the light's [member texture]."
msgstr "O deslocamento do [member texture] da luz."

#: doc/classes/PointLight2D.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] used for the light's appearance."
msgstr "[Texture2D] usado para a aparência da luz."

#: doc/classes/PointLight2D.xml
msgid "The [member texture]'s scale factor."
msgstr "O fator de escala do [member texture]."

#: doc/classes/PointMesh.xml
msgid "Mesh with a single point primitive."
msgstr "Malha com uma única primitiva de ponto."

#: doc/classes/PointMesh.xml
msgid ""
"A [PointMesh] is a primitive mesh composed of a single point. Instead of "
"relying on triangles, points are rendered as a single rectangle on the "
"screen with a constant size. They are intended to be used with particle "
"systems, but can also be used as a cheap way to render billboarded sprites "
"(for example in a point cloud).\n"
"In order to be displayed, point meshes must be used with a material that has "
"a point size. The point size can be accessed in a shader with the "
"[code]POINT_SIZE[/code] built-in, or in a [BaseMaterial3D] by setting the "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.use_point_size] and [member "
"BaseMaterial3D.point_size] properties.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using point meshes, properties that normally affect "
"vertices will be ignored, including [member BaseMaterial3D.billboard_mode], "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.grow], and [member BaseMaterial3D.cull_mode]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "A 2D polygon."
msgstr "Um polígono 2D."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"A Polygon2D is defined by a set of points. Each point is connected to the "
"next, with the final point being connected to the first, resulting in a "
"closed polygon. Polygon2Ds can be filled with color (solid or gradient) or "
"filled with a given texture."
msgstr ""
"Um Polygon2D é definido por um conjunto de pontos. Cada ponto é conectado ao "
"próximo, com o ponto final sendo conectado ao primeiro, resultando em um "
"polígono fechado. Polygon2Ds podem ser preenchidos com cor (sólida ou "
"gradiente) ou preenchidos com uma textura fornecida."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Adds a bone with the specified [param path] and [param weights]."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona um osso com o [param path] e os [param weights] especificados."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Removes all bones from this [Polygon2D]."
msgstr "Remove todos os ossos deste [Polygon2D]."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Removes the specified bone from this [Polygon2D]."
msgstr "Remove o osso especificado deste [Polygon2D]."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Returns the number of bones in this [Polygon2D]."
msgstr "Retorna o número de ossos neste [Polygon2D]."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Returns the path to the node associated with the specified bone."
msgstr "Retorna o caminho para o nó associado ao osso especificado."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Returns the weight values of the specified bone."
msgstr "Retorna os valores de peso do osso especificado."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Sets the path to the node associated with the specified bone."
msgstr "Define o caminho para o nó associado ao osso especificado."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Sets the weight values for the specified bone."
msgstr "Define os valores de peso para o osso especificado."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], polygon edges will be anti-aliased."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as bordas do polígono serão suavizadas (anti-aliased)."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"The polygon's fill color. If [member texture] is set, it will be multiplied "
"by this color. It will also be the default color for vertices not set in "
"[member vertex_colors]."
msgstr ""
"A cor de preenchimento do polígono. Se [member texture] estiver definida, "
"ela será multiplicada por esta cor. Também será a cor padrão para vértices "
"não definidos em [member vertex_colors]."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "Number of internal vertices, used for UV mapping."
msgstr "Número de vértices internos, usados para mapeamento UV."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Added padding applied to the bounding box when [member invert_enabled] is "
"set to [code]true[/code]. Setting this value too small may result in a \"Bad "
"Polygon\" error."
msgstr ""
"Preenchimento adicional aplicado à caixa delimitadora quando [member "
"invert_enabled] está definido como [code]true[/code]. Definir esse valor "
"muito pequeno pode resultar em um erro \"Bad Polygon\"."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the polygon will be inverted, containing the area "
"outside the defined points and extending to the [member invert_border]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o polígono será invertido, contendo a área fora dos "
"pontos definidos e estendendo-se até o [member invert_border]."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "The offset applied to each vertex."
msgstr "O deslocamento aplicado a cada vértice."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"The polygon's list of vertices. The final point will be connected to the "
"first."
msgstr ""
"A lista de vértices do polígono. O ponto final será conectado ao primeiro."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"The list of polygons, in case more than one is being represented. Every "
"individual polygon is stored as a [PackedInt32Array] where each [int] is an "
"index to a point in [member polygon]. If empty, this property will be "
"ignored, and the resulting single polygon will be composed of all points in "
"[member polygon], using the order they are stored in."
msgstr ""
"A lista de polígonos, caso mais de um esteja sendo representado. Cada "
"polígono individual é armazenado como um [PackedInt32Array] onde cada [int] "
"é um índice para um ponto em [member polygon]. Se estiver vazio, esta "
"propriedade será ignorada e o polígono único resultante será composto por "
"todos os pontos em [member polygon], usando a ordem em que estão armazenados."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Path to a [Skeleton2D] node used for skeleton-based deformations of this "
"polygon. If empty or invalid, skeletal deformations will not be used."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para um nó [Skeleton2D] usado para deformações baseadas em esqueleto "
"deste polígono. Se estiver vazio ou inválido, as deformações esqueléticas "
"não serão usadas."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "The polygon's fill texture. Use [member uv] to set texture coordinates."
msgstr ""
"A textura de preenchimento do polígono. Use [member uv] para definir as "
"coordenadas de textura."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Amount to offset the polygon's [member texture]. If set to [code]Vector2(0, "
"0)[/code], the texture's origin (its top-left corner) will be placed at the "
"polygon's position."
msgstr ""
"Quantidade para deslocar a [member texture] do polígono. Se definido como "
"[code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code], a origem da textura (seu canto superior "
"esquerdo) será colocada na posição do polígono."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid "The texture's rotation in radians."
msgstr "A rotação da textura em radianos."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Amount to multiply the [member uv] coordinates when using [member texture]. "
"Larger values make the texture smaller, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Quantidade para multiplicar as coordenadas [member uv] ao usar [member "
"texture]. Valores maiores tornam a textura menor e vice-versa."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Texture coordinates for each vertex of the polygon. There should be one UV "
"value per polygon vertex. If there are fewer, undefined vertices will use "
"[code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Coordenadas de textura para cada vértice do polígono. Deve haver um valor UV "
"por vértice de polígono. Se houver menos, os vértices indefinidos usarão "
"[code]Vector2(0, 0)[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Polygon2D.xml
msgid ""
"Color for each vertex. Colors are interpolated between vertices, resulting "
"in smooth gradients. There should be one per polygon vertex. If there are "
"fewer, undefined vertices will use [member color]."
msgstr ""
"Cor para cada vértice. As cores são interpoladas entre os vértices, "
"resultando em gradientes suaves. Deve haver uma por vértice de polígono. Se "
"houver menos, os vértices indefinidos usarão [member color]."

#: doc/classes/PolygonOccluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"Flat 2D polygon shape for use with occlusion culling in [OccluderInstance3D]."
msgstr ""
"Forma de polígono 2D plano para uso com \"occlusion culling\" em "
"[OccluderInstance3D]."

#: doc/classes/PolygonOccluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"[PolygonOccluder3D] stores a polygon shape that can be used by the engine's "
"occlusion culling system. When an [OccluderInstance3D] with a "
"[PolygonOccluder3D] is selected in the editor, an editor will appear at the "
"top of the 3D viewport so you can add/remove points. All points must be "
"placed on the same 2D plane, which means it is not possible to create "
"arbitrary 3D shapes with a single [PolygonOccluder3D]. To use arbitrary 3D "
"shapes as occluders, use [ArrayOccluder3D] or [OccluderInstance3D]'s baking "
"feature instead.\n"
"See [OccluderInstance3D]'s documentation for instructions on setting up "
"occlusion culling."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PolygonOccluder3D.xml
msgid ""
"The polygon to use for occlusion culling. The polygon can be convex or "
"concave, but it should have as few points as possible to maximize "
"performance.\n"
"The polygon must [i]not[/i] have intersecting lines. Otherwise, "
"triangulation will fail (with an error message printed)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PolygonPathFinder.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if [param point] falls inside the polygon area.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(0.2, 0.2))) # Prints true\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(1.0, 1.0))) # Prints "
"false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(0.2f, 0.2f))); // "
"Prints True\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(1.0f, 1.0f))); // "
"Prints False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se [param point] estiver dentro da área do "
"polígono.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(0.2, 0.2))) # Imprime "
"true\n"
"print(polygon_path_finder.is_point_inside(Vector2(1.0, 1.0))) # Imprime "
"false\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(0.2f, 0.2f))); // "
"Imprime True\n"
"GD.Print(polygonPathFinder.IsPointInside(new Vector2(1.0f, 1.0f))); // "
"Imprime False\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/PolygonPathFinder.xml
msgid ""
"Sets up [PolygonPathFinder] with an array of points that define the vertices "
"of the polygon, and an array of indices that determine the edges of the "
"polygon.\n"
"The length of [param connections] must be even, returns an error if odd.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Configura o [PolygonPathFinder] com uma matriz de pontos que definem os "
"vértices do polígono e uma matriz de índices que determinam as arestas do "
"polígono.\n"
"O comprimento de [param connections] deve ser par, retornando um erro se for "
"ímpar.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var polygon_path_finder = PolygonPathFinder.new()\n"
"var points = [Vector2(0.0, 0.0), Vector2(1.0, 0.0), Vector2(0.0, 1.0)]\n"
"var connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0]\n"
"polygon_path_finder.setup(points, connections)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var polygonPathFinder = new PolygonPathFinder();\n"
"Vector2[] points =\n"
"[\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(1.0f, 0.0f),\n"
"\tnew Vector2(0.0f, 1.0f)\n"
"];\n"
"int[] connections = [0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 0];\n"
"polygonPathFinder.Setup(points, connections);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/Popup.xml
msgid "Base class for contextual windows and panels with fixed position."
msgstr "Classe base para janelas contextuais e painéis com posição fixa."

#: doc/classes/Popup.xml
msgid ""
"[Popup] is a base class for contextual windows and panels with fixed "
"position. It's a modal by default (see [member Window.popup_window]) and "
"provides methods for implementing custom popup behavior.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [Popup] is invisible by default. To make it visible, call one "
"of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such as "
"[method Window.popup_centered_clamped]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Popup.xml
msgid "Emitted when the popup is hidden."
msgstr "Emitido quando a janela pop-up é oculta."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "A modal window used to display a list of options."
msgstr "Uma janela modal usada para exibir uma lista de opções."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"[PopupMenu] is a modal window used to display a list of options. Useful for "
"toolbars and context menus.\n"
"The size of a [PopupMenu] can be limited by using [member Window.max_size]. "
"If the height of the list of items is larger than the maximum height of the "
"[PopupMenu], a [ScrollContainer] within the popup will allow the user to "
"scroll the contents. If no maximum size is set, or if it is set to [code]0[/"
"code], the [PopupMenu] height will be limited by its parent rect.\n"
"All [code]set_*[/code] methods allow negative item indices, i.e. [code]-1[/"
"code] to access the last item, [code]-2[/code] to select the second-to-last "
"item, and so on.\n"
"[b]Incremental search:[/b] Like [ItemList] and [Tree], [PopupMenu] supports "
"searching within the list while the control is focused. Press a key that "
"matches the first letter of an item's name to select the first item starting "
"with the given letter. After that point, there are two ways to perform "
"incremental search: 1) Press the same key again before the timeout duration "
"to select the next item starting with the same letter. 2) Press letter keys "
"that match the rest of the word before the timeout duration to match to "
"select the item in question directly. Both of these actions will be reset to "
"the beginning of the list if the timeout duration has passed since the last "
"keystroke was registered. You can adjust the timeout duration by changing "
"[member ProjectSettings.gui/timers/incremental_search_max_interval_msec].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [PopupMenu] is invisible by default. To make it visible, call "
"one of the [code]popup_*[/code] methods from [Window] on the node, such as "
"[method Window.popup_centered_clamped].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The ID values used for items are limited to 32 bits, not full "
"64 bits of [int]. This has a range of [code]-2^32[/code] to [code]2^32 - 1[/"
"code], i.e. [code]-2147483648[/code] to [code]2147483647[/code]."
msgstr ""
"[PopupMenu] é uma janela modal usada para exibir uma lista de opções. Útil "
"para barras de ferramentas e menus de contexto.\n"
"O tamanho de um [PopupMenu] pode ser limitado usando [member "
"Window.max_size]. Se a altura da lista de itens for maior que a altura "
"máxima do [PopupMenu], um [ScrollContainer] dentro do pop-up permitirá que o "
"usuário rola o conteúdo. Se nenhum tamanho máximo for definido, ou se for "
"definido como [code]0[/code], a altura do [PopupMenu] será limitada pelo "
"retângulo pai (parent rect).\n"
"Todos os métodos [code]set_*[/code] permitem índices de itens negativos, ou "
"seja, [code]-1[/code] para acessar o último item, [code]-2[/code] para "
"selecionar o penúltimo item, e assim por diante.\n"
"[b]Busca incremental:[/b] Assim como o [ItemList] e o [Tree], o [PopupMenu] "
"suporta busca dentro da lista enquanto o controle está focado. Pressione uma "
"tecla que corresponda à primeira letra do nome de um item para selecionar o "
"primeiro item que começa com a letra fornecida. A partir desse ponto, "
"existem duas maneiras de realizar a busca incremental: 1) Pressione a mesma "
"tecla novamente antes do tempo limite para selecionar o próximo item que "
"começa com a mesma letra. 2) Pressione teclas de letras que correspondam ao "
"resto da palavra antes do tempo limite para selecionar o item em questão "
"diretamente. Ambas as ações serão redefinidas para o início da lista se o "
"tempo limite tiver passado desde que a última tecla foi registrada. Você "
"pode ajustar a duração do tempo limite alterando [member ProjectSettings.gui/"
"timers/incremental_search_max_interval_msec].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] O [PopupMenu] é invisível por padrão. Para torná-lo visível, "
"chame um dos métodos [code]popup_*[/code] de [Window] no nó, como [method "
"Window.popup_centered_clamped].\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Os valores de ID usados para os itens são limitados a 32 bits, "
"e não aos 64 bits completos de um [int]. Isso possui um intervalo de "
"[code]-2^32[/code] a [code]2^32 - 1[/code], ou seja, de [code]-2147483648[/"
"code] a [code]2147483647[/code]."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Checks the provided [param event] against the [PopupMenu]'s shortcuts and "
"accelerators, and activates the first item with matching events. If [param "
"for_global_only] is [code]true[/code], only shortcuts and accelerators with "
"[code]global[/code] set to [code]true[/code] will be called.\n"
"Returns [code]true[/code] if an item was successfully activated.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Certain [Control]s, such as [MenuButton], will call this method "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. "
"If no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding "
"to [constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which "
"means it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for "
"more info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item and assigns the specified [Shortcut] to it. Sets "
"the label of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item with text [param label] and icon [param texture].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. "
"If no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding "
"to [constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which "
"means it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for "
"more info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new checkable item and assigns the specified [Shortcut] and icon "
"[param texture] to it. Sets the label of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s "
"name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new item with text [param label] and icon [param texture].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. "
"If no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding "
"to [constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which "
"means it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for "
"more info on accelerators."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Same as [method add_icon_check_item], but uses a radio check button."
msgstr ""
"O mesmo que [method add_icon_check_item], mas usa um botão de marcação de "
"rádio."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Same as [method add_icon_check_shortcut], but uses a radio check button."
msgstr ""
"O mesmo que [method add_icon_check_shortcut], mas usa um botão de seleção de "
"rádio."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new item and assigns the specified [Shortcut] and icon [param "
"texture] to it. Sets the label of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"If [param allow_echo] is [code]true[/code], the shortcut can be activated "
"with echo events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new item with text [param label].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. "
"If no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding "
"to [constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which "
"means it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for "
"more info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The provided [param id] is used only in [signal id_pressed] and "
"[signal id_focused] signals. It's not related to the [code]index[/code] "
"arguments in e.g. [method set_item_checked]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new multistate item with text [param label].\n"
"Contrarily to normal binary items, multistate items can have more than two "
"states, as defined by [param max_states]. The default value is defined by "
"[param default_state].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. "
"If no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding "
"to [constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which "
"means it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for "
"more info on accelerators.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"\tadd_multistate_item(\"Item\", 3, 0)\n"
"\n"
"\tindex_pressed.connect(func(index: int):\n"
"\t\t\ttoggle_item_multistate(index)\n"
"\t\t\tmatch get_item_multistate(index):\n"
"\t\t\t\t0:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"First state\")\n"
"\t\t\t\t1:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"Second state\")\n"
"\t\t\t\t2:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tprint(\"Third state\")\n"
"\t\t)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Multistate items don't update their state automatically and "
"must be done manually. See [method toggle_item_multistate], [method "
"set_item_multistate] and [method get_item_multistate] for more info on how "
"to control it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new radio check button with text [param label].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided, as well as an accelerator ([param "
"accel]). If no [param id] is provided, one will be created from the index. "
"If no [param accel] is provided, then the default value of 0 (corresponding "
"to [constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE]) will be assigned to the item (which "
"means it won't have any accelerator). See [method get_item_accelerator] for "
"more info on accelerators.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a new radio check button and assigns a [Shortcut] to it. Sets the label "
"of the checkbox to the [Shortcut]'s name.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually. See "
"[method set_item_checked] for more info on how to control it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a separator between items. Separators also occupy an index, which you "
"can set by using the [param id] parameter.\n"
"A [param label] can optionally be provided, which will appear at the center "
"of the separator."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a [Shortcut].\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index.\n"
"If [param allow_echo] is [code]true[/code], the shortcut can be activated "
"with echo events."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Prefer using [method add_submenu_node_item] instead."
msgstr "Prefira usar [method add_submenu_node_item] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an item that will act as a submenu of the parent [PopupMenu] node when "
"clicked. The [param submenu] argument must be the name of an existing "
"[PopupMenu] that has been added as a child to this node. This submenu will "
"be shown when the item is clicked, hovered for long enough, or activated "
"using the [code]ui_select[/code] or [code]ui_right[/code] input actions.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Adds an item that will act as a submenu of the parent [PopupMenu] node when "
"clicked. This submenu will be shown when the item is clicked, hovered for "
"long enough, or activated using the [code]ui_select[/code] or "
"[code]ui_right[/code] input actions.\n"
"[param submenu] must be either child of this [PopupMenu] or has no parent "
"node (in which case it will be automatically added as a child). If the "
"[param submenu] popup has another parent, this method will fail.\n"
"An [param id] can optionally be provided. If no [param id] is provided, one "
"will be created from the index."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Removes all items from the [PopupMenu]. If [param free_submenus] is "
"[code]true[/code], the submenu nodes are automatically freed."
msgstr ""
"Remove todos os itens do [PopupMenu]. Se [param free_submenus] for "
"[code]true[/code], os nós de submenu são liberados automaticamente."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the currently focused item. Returns [code]-1[/code] if "
"no item is focused."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice do item atualmente focado. Retorna [code]-1[/code] se "
"nenhum item estiver focado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the accelerator of the item at the given [param index]. An "
"accelerator is a keyboard shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu "
"button even if it's not currently open. The return value is an integer which "
"is generally a combination of [enum KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using "
"bitwise OR such as [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd]). "
"If no accelerator is defined for the specified [param index], [method "
"get_item_accelerator] returns [code]0[/code] (corresponding to [constant "
"@GlobalScope.KEY_NONE])."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o acelerador do item no [param index] fornecido. Um acelerador é um "
"atalho de teclado que pode ser pressionado para acionar o botão do menu, "
"mesmo que ele não esteja aberto no momento. O valor de retorno é um inteiro "
"que geralmente é uma combinação de [enum KeyModifierMask]s e [enum Key]s "
"usando OR bit a bit, como [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/"
"kbd]). Se nenhum acelerador for definido para o [param index] especificado, "
"[method get_item_accelerator] retorna [code]0[/code] (correspondente a "
"[constant @GlobalScope.KEY_NONE])."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns the auto translate mode of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o modo de tradução automática do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns the icon of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o ícone do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum allowed width of the icon for the item at the given "
"[param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a largura máxima permitida do ícone para o item no [param index] "
"fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Color] modulating the item's icon at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Color] modulando o ícone do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns the ID of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o ID do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns the horizontal offset of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o deslocamento horizontal do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the item containing the specified [param id]. The index "
"is automatically assigned to each item by the engine when added and "
"represents the order items will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o índice do item que contém o [param id] especificado. O índice é "
"atribuído automaticamente a cada item pelo motor quando adicionado e "
"representa a ordem em que os itens serão exibidos."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the metadata of the specified item, which might be of any type. You "
"can set it with [method set_item_metadata], which provides a simple way of "
"assigning context data to items."
msgstr ""
"Retorna os metadados do item especificado, que podem ser de qualquer tipo. "
"Você pode defini-los com [method set_item_metadata], o que fornece uma "
"maneira simples de atribuir dados de contexto aos itens."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns the state of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o estado do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns the max states of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o número máximo de estados do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the [Shortcut] associated with the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o [Shortcut] associado ao item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Prefer using [method get_item_submenu_node] instead."
msgstr "Prefira usar [method get_item_submenu_node] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the submenu name of the item at the given [param index]. See [method "
"add_submenu_item] for more info on how to add a submenu."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o nome do submenu do item no [param index] fornecido. Veja [method "
"add_submenu_item] para mais informações sobre como adicionar um submenu."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the submenu of the item at the given [param index], or [code]null[/"
"code] if no submenu was added. See [method add_submenu_node_item] for more "
"info on how to add a submenu."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o submenu do item no [param index] fornecido, ou [code]null[/code] "
"se nenhum submenu foi adicionado. Veja [method add_submenu_node_item] para "
"mais informações sobre como adicionar um submenu."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns the text of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Retorna o texto do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the tooltip associated with the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a dica de ferramenta (tooltip) associada ao item no [param index] "
"fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] is "
"checkable in some way, i.e. if it has a checkbox or radio button.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark or radio button, but "
"don't have any built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked "
"manually."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] is checked."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o item no [param index] fornecido estiver "
"marcado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] is "
"disabled. When it is disabled it can't be selected, or its action invoked.\n"
"See [method set_item_disabled] for more info on how to disable an item."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item at the given [param index] has radio "
"button-style checkability.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is purely cosmetic; you must add the logic for checking/"
"unchecking items in radio groups."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the item is a separator. If it is, it will be "
"displayed as a line. See [method add_separator] for more info on how to add "
"a separator."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o item for um separador. Se for, ele será "
"exibido como uma linha. Veja [method add_separator] para mais informações "
"sobre como adicionar um separador."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Returns [code]true[/code] if the specified item's shortcut is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o atalho do item especificado estiver "
"desativado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the system native menu is supported and "
"currently used by this [PopupMenu]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o menu nativo do sistema for suportado e "
"atualmente usado por este [PopupMenu]."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the menu is bound to the special system menu."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o menu estiver vinculado ao menu de sistema "
"especial."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Removes the item at the given [param index] from the menu.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The indices of items after the removed item will be shifted by "
"one."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Moves the scroll view to make the item at the given [param index] visible."
msgstr ""
"Move a visualização de rolagem para tornar o item no [param index] fornecido "
"visível."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the currently focused item as the given [param index].\n"
"Passing [code]-1[/code] as the index makes so that no item is focused."
msgstr ""
"Define o item atualmente em foco como o [param index] fornecido.\n"
"Passar [code]-1[/code] como índice faz com que nenhum item fique em foco."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the accelerator of the item at the given [param index]. An accelerator "
"is a keyboard shortcut that can be pressed to trigger the menu button even "
"if it's not currently open. [param accel] is generally a combination of "
"[enum KeyModifierMask]s and [enum Key]s using bitwise OR such as "
"[code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd])."
msgstr ""
"Define o acelerador do item no [param index] fornecido. Um acelerador é um "
"atalho de teclado que pode ser pressionado para acionar o botão do menu, "
"mesmo que ele não esteja aberto no momento. [param accel] é geralmente uma "
"combinação de [enum KeyModifierMask]s e [enum Key]s usando OR bit a bit, "
"como [code]KEY_MASK_CTRL | KEY_A[/code] ([kbd]Ctrl + A[/kbd])."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether the item at the given [param index] has a checkbox. If "
"[code]false[/code], sets the type of the item to plain text.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Checkable items just display a checkmark, but don't have any "
"built-in checking behavior and must be checked/unchecked manually."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the type of the item at the given [param index] to radio button. If "
"[code]false[/code], sets the type of the item to plain text."
msgstr ""
"Define o tipo do item no [param index] fornecido como botão de opção (radio "
"button). Se [code]false[/code], define o tipo do item como texto simples."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Mark the item at the given [param index] as a separator, which means that it "
"would be displayed as a line. If [code]false[/code], sets the type of the "
"item to plain text."
msgstr ""
"Marca o item no [param index] fornecido como um separador, o que significa "
"que ele será exibido como uma linha. Se [code]false[/code], define o tipo do "
"item como texto simples."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the auto translate mode of the item at the given [param index].\n"
"Items use [constant Node.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT] by default, which uses "
"the same auto translate mode as the [PopupMenu] itself."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Sets the checkstate status of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Define o status de marcação do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Enables/disables the item at the given [param index]. When it is disabled, "
"it can't be selected and its action can't be invoked."
msgstr ""
"Ativa/desativa o item no [param index] fornecido. Quando está desativado, "
"ele não pode ser selecionado e sua ação não pode ser invocada."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Replaces the [Texture2D] icon of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Substitui o ícone [Texture2D] do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum allowed width of the icon for the item at the given [param "
"index]. This limit is applied on top of the default size of the icon and on "
"top of [theme_item icon_max_width]. The height is adjusted according to the "
"icon's ratio."
msgstr ""
"Define a largura máxima permitida do ícone para o item no [param index] "
"fornecido. Esse limite é aplicado além do tamanho padrão do ícone e além de "
"[theme_item icon_max_width]. A altura é ajustada de acordo com a proporção "
"do ícone."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets a modulating [Color] of the item's icon at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Define uma [Color] de modulação do ícone do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [param id] of the item at the given [param index].\n"
"The [param id] is used in [signal id_pressed] and [signal id_focused] "
"signals."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Sets the horizontal offset of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Define o deslocamento horizontal do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Changes the index of the item at index [param index] to be at index [param "
"target_index]. This can be used to move an item above other items. The moved "
"item will keep the same ID, even if it was generated from the original "
"index.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The indices of any items between index [param index] and index "
"[param target_index] will be shifted by one."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the metadata of an item, which may be of any type. You can later get it "
"with [method get_item_metadata], which provides a simple way of assigning "
"context data to items."
msgstr ""
"Define os metadados de um item, que podem ser de qualquer tipo. Você pode "
"obtê-los posteriormente com [method get_item_metadata], o que fornece uma "
"maneira simples de atribuir dados de contexto aos itens."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the state of a multistate item. See [method add_multistate_item] for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Define o estado de um item de múltiplos estados. Consulte [method "
"add_multistate_item] para obter detalhes."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the max states of a multistate item. See [method add_multistate_item] "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"Define o número máximo de estados de um item multiestado. Veja [method "
"add_multistate_item] para detalhes."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Sets a [Shortcut] for the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Define um [Shortcut] para o item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Disables the [Shortcut] of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Desativa o [Shortcut] do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Prefer using [method set_item_submenu_node] instead."
msgstr "Prefira usar [method set_item_submenu_node] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the submenu of the item at the given [param index]. The submenu is the "
"name of a child [PopupMenu] node that would be shown when the item is "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"Define o submenu do item no [param index] fornecido. O submenu é o nome de "
"um nó [PopupMenu] filho que será exibido quando o item for clicado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the submenu of the item at the given [param index]. The submenu is a "
"[PopupMenu] node that would be shown when the item is clicked. It must "
"either be a child of this [PopupMenu] or has no parent (in which case it "
"will be automatically added as a child). If the [param submenu] popup has "
"another parent, this method will fail."
msgstr ""
"Define o submenu do item no [param index] fornecido. O submenu é um nó "
"[PopupMenu] que será exibido quando o item for clicado. Ele deve ser filho "
"deste [PopupMenu] ou não ter pai (caso em que será adicionado "
"automaticamente como filho). Se o pop-up [param submenu] tiver outro pai, "
"este método falhará."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Sets the text of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Define o texto do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Sets the [String] tooltip of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr ""
"Define a dica de ferramenta [String] do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Toggles the check state of the item at the given [param index]."
msgstr "Alterna o estado de marcação do item no [param index] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Cycle to the next state of a multistate item. See [method "
"add_multistate_item] for details."
msgstr ""
"Alterna para o próximo estado de um item de múltiplos estados. Consulte "
"[method add_multistate_item] para obter detalhes."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], allows navigating [PopupMenu] with letter keys."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite navegar pelo [PopupMenu] com teclas de letras."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hides the [PopupMenu] when a checkbox or radio button "
"is selected."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], oculta o [PopupMenu] quando uma caixa de seleção ou "
"botão de rádio é selecionado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], hides the [PopupMenu] when an item is selected."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], oculta o [PopupMenu] quando um item é selecionado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], hides the [PopupMenu] when a state item is selected."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], oculta o [PopupMenu] quando um item de estado é "
"selecionado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [MenuBar] will use native menu when supported.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [PopupMenu] is linked to [StatusIndicator], [MenuBar], or "
"another [PopupMenu] item it can use native menu regardless of this property, "
"use [method is_native_menu] to check it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shows a search bar at the top of the [PopupMenu] for "
"filtering items. See [member search_bar_min_item_count] for dynamically "
"controlling its visibility based on the number of items.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When enabled, [member allow_search] is ignored."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the minimum number of items required for the search bar to be visible. "
"[member search_bar_enabled] must be [code]true[/code] for this to have any "
"effect. Separator items are not counted."
msgstr ""
"Define o número mínimo de itens necessários para que a barra de pesquisa "
"esteja visível. [member search_bar_enabled] deve ser [code]true[/code] para "
"que isso tenha algum efeito. Itens separadores não são contados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shrinks [PopupMenu] to minimum height when it's shown."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], reduz o [PopupMenu] para a altura mínima quando ele "
"for exibido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], shrinks [PopupMenu] to minimum width when it's shown."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], reduz o [PopupMenu] para a altura mínima quando ele "
"for exibido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the delay time in seconds for the submenu item to popup on mouse "
"hovering. If the popup menu is added as a child of another (acting as a "
"submenu), it will inherit the delay time of the parent menu item.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the mouse is exiting a submenu item with an open submenu and "
"enters a different submenu item, the submenu popup delay time is affected by "
"the direction of the mouse movement toward the open submenu. If the mouse is "
"moving toward the submenu, the open submenu will wait approximately "
"[code]0.5[/code] seconds before closing, which then allows the hovered "
"submenu item to open. This additional delay allows the mouse time to move to "
"the open submenu across other menu items without prematurely closing. If the "
"mouse is not moving toward the open submenu, for example in a downward "
"direction, the open submenu will close immediately."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If set to one of the values of [enum NativeMenu.SystemMenus], this "
"[PopupMenu] is bound to the special system menu. Only one [PopupMenu] can be "
"bound to each special menu at a time."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como um dos valores de [enum NativeMenu.SystemMenus], este "
"[PopupMenu] é vinculado ao menu especial do sistema. Apenas um [PopupMenu] "
"pode ser vinculado a cada menu especial por vez."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when the user navigated to an item of some [param id] using the "
"[member ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] or [member ProjectSettings.input/"
"ui_down] input action."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando o usuário navega para um item de algum [param id] usando a "
"ação de entrada [member ProjectSettings.input/ui_up] ou [member "
"ProjectSettings.input/ui_down]."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when an item of some [param id] is pressed. Also emitted when its "
"accelerator is activated on macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [param id] is negative (either explicitly or due to "
"overflow), this will return the corresponding index instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when an item of some [param index] is pressed. Also emitted when its "
"accelerator is activated on macOS."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando um item de algum [param index] é pressionado. Também emitido "
"quando seu atalho é ativado no macOS."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Emitted when any item is added, modified or removed."
msgstr "Emitido quando qualquer item é adicionado, modificado ou removido."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"The text [Color] used for shortcuts and accelerators that show next to the "
"menu item name when defined. See [method get_item_accelerator] for more info "
"on accelerators."
msgstr ""
"A [Color] do texto usada para atalhos e aceleradores que aparecem ao lado do "
"nome do item de menu quando definidos. Veja [method get_item_accelerator] "
"para mais informações sobre aceleradores."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "The default text [Color] for menu items' names."
msgstr "O [Color] de texto padrão para nomes de itens de menu."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Color] used for disabled menu items' text."
msgstr "[Color] usado para o texto de itens de menu desativados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Color] used for the hovered text."
msgstr "[Color] usado para o texto com o cursor em cima."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Color] used for labeled separators' text. See [method add_separator]."
msgstr ""
"[Color] usado para o texto de separadores rotulados. Consulte [method "
"add_separator]."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "The tint of text outline of the labeled separator."
msgstr "A tonalidade do contorno do texto do separador rotulado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"If not [code]0[/code], the icon gutter will be merged with the checkbox "
"gutter when possible. This acts as a boolean."
msgstr ""
"Se não for [code]0[/code], a calha de ícones será mesclada com a calha de "
"caixas de seleção quando possível. Isso funciona como um booleano."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "The horizontal space between the item's elements."
msgstr "O espaço horizontal entre os elementos do item."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum allowed width of the item's icon. This limit is applied on top "
"of the default size of the icon, but before the value set with [method "
"set_item_icon_max_width]. The height is adjusted according to the icon's "
"ratio."
msgstr ""
"A largura máxima permitida do ícone do item. Esse limite é aplicado além do "
"tamanho padrão do ícone, mas antes do valor definido com [method "
"set_item_icon_max_width]. A altura é ajustada de acordo com a proporção do "
"ícone."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Width of the single indentation level."
msgstr "Largura do nível de indentação único."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Horizontal padding to the right of the items (or left, in RTL layout)."
msgstr ""
"Preenchimento horizontal à direita dos itens (ou esquerda, em layout RTL)."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Horizontal padding to the left of the items (or right, in RTL layout)."
msgstr ""
"Preenchimento horizontal à esquerda dos itens (ou direita, em layout RTL)."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "The vertical space between search bar and menu items."
msgstr "O espaço vertical entre a barra de pesquisa e os itens do menu."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "The size of the labeled separator text outline."
msgstr "O tamanho do contorno do texto do separador rotulado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "The vertical space between each menu item."
msgstr "O espaço vertical entre cada item de menu."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Font] used for the menu items."
msgstr "[Font] usado para os itens de menu."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Font] used for the labeled separator."
msgstr "[Font] usada para o separador rotulado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Font size of the labeled separator."
msgstr "Tamanho da fonte do separador rotulado."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "Font size of the menu items."
msgstr "Tamanho da fonte dos itens de menu."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the checked checkbox items."
msgstr "Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de caixa de seleção marcados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the checked checkbox items when they are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de caixa de seleção marcados quando estão "
"desativados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the checked radio button items."
msgstr "Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de botão de opção marcados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] icon for the checked radio button items when they are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de botão de opção marcados quando estão "
"desativados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked radio button items."
msgstr "Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de botão de opção desmarcados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked radio button items when they are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de botão de rádio desmarcados quando estão "
"desativados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the search bar's search icon."
msgstr "Ícone [Texture2D] para o ícone de pesquisa da barra de pesquisa."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the submenu arrow (for left-to-right layouts)."
msgstr ""
"Ícone [Texture2D] para a seta do submenu (para layouts da esquerda para a "
"direita)."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the submenu arrow (for right-to-left layouts)."
msgstr ""
"Ícone [Texture2D] para a seta do submenu (para layouts da direita para a "
"esquerda)."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked checkbox items."
msgstr "Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de caixa de seleção desmarcados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"[Texture2D] icon for the unchecked checkbox items when they are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ícone [Texture2D] para os itens de caixa de seleção desmarcados quando estão "
"desativados."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[StyleBox] displayed when the [PopupMenu] item is hovered."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] exibido quando o item do [PopupMenu] está recebendo foco do "
"cursor."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the left side of labeled separator. See [method "
"add_separator]."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] para o lado esquerdo do separador com rótulo. Consulte [method "
"add_separator]."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid ""
"[StyleBox] for the right side of labeled separator. See [method "
"add_separator]."
msgstr ""
"[StyleBox] para o lado direito do separador com rótulo. Consulte [method "
"add_separator]."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml doc/classes/PopupPanel.xml
msgid "[StyleBox] for the background panel."
msgstr "[StyleBox] para o painel de fundo."

#: doc/classes/PopupMenu.xml
msgid "[StyleBox] used for the separators. See [method add_separator]."
msgstr "[StyleBox] usado para os separadores. Consulte [method add_separator]."

#: doc/classes/PopupPanel.xml
msgid "A popup with a panel background."
msgstr "Um pop-up com um fundo de painel."

#: doc/classes/PopupPanel.xml
msgid ""
"A popup with a configurable panel background. Any child controls added to "
"this node will be stretched to fit the panel's size (similar to how "
"[PanelContainer] works). If you are making windows, see [Window]."
msgstr ""
"Um pop-up com um fundo de painel configurável. Quaisquer controles filhos "
"adicionados a este nó serão esticados para ajustar-se ao tamanho do painel "
"(semelhante a como o [PanelContainer] funciona). Se você estiver criando "
"janelas, consulte [Window]."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Provides a compressed texture for disk and/or VRAM in a way that is portable."
msgstr ""
"Oferece uma textura compactada para o disco e/ou VRAM de uma forma que é "
"portátil."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"This class allows storing compressed textures as self contained (not "
"imported) resources.\n"
"For 2D usage (compressed on disk, uncompressed on VRAM), the lossy and "
"lossless modes are recommended. For 3D usage (compressed on VRAM) it depends "
"on the target platform.\n"
"If you intend to only use desktop, S3TC or BPTC are recommended. For only "
"mobile, ETC2 is recommended.\n"
"For portable, self contained 3D textures that work on both desktop and "
"mobile, Basis Universal is recommended (although it has a small quality cost "
"and longer compression time as a tradeoff).\n"
"This resource is intended to be created from code."
msgstr ""
"Esta classe permite armazenar texturas compactadas como recursos auto-"
"contidos (não importados).\n"
"Para uso em 2D (comprimido em disco, descomprimido em VRAM), os modos lossy "
"e lossless são recomendados. Para uso em 3D (comprimido em VRAM) depende da "
"plataforma de destino.\n"
"Se o seu jogo será só para desktop, S3TC ou BPTC são recomendados. Para "
"dispositivos móveis, ETC2 é recomendado.\n"
"Para texturas 3D portáteis, auto-contidas que funcionam tanto no desktop "
"quanto no mobile, Basis Universal é recomendado (embora a velocidade de "
"compressão e qualidade da imagem sejam um pouco piores).\n"
"Este recurso é feito para ser criado a partir de código."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Initializes the compressed texture from a base image. The compression mode "
"must be provided.\n"
"[param normal_map] is recommended to ensure optimum quality if this image "
"will be used as a normal map.\n"
"If lossy compression is requested, the quality setting can optionally be "
"provided. This maps to Lossy WebP compression quality."
msgstr ""
"Inicializa a textura compactada de uma imagem base. O modo de compressão "
"deve ser fornecido.\n"
"Defina [param normal_map] como true se a imagem for ser usada como normal "
"map, para garantir a melhor qualidade.\n"
"Se você quiser compressão lossy, pode configurar a qualidade. Essa opção é "
"equivalente às opções de qualidade do Lossy WebP."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid "Return the compression mode used (valid after initialized)."
msgstr "Retorna o modo de compressão usado (válido após inicialização)."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the flag is overridden for all textures of this "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se esta flag for substituida em todas as texturas "
"deste tipo."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the compressor parameters for Basis Universal compression. See also the "
"settings in [ResourceImporterTexture].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method must be called before [method create_from_image] "
"for this to work."
msgstr ""
"Define os parâmetros do compressor para compressão Basis Universal. Veja "
"também as configurações em [ResourceImporterTexture].\n"
"[b]Obs.:[/b] Este método deve ser chamado antes [method create_from_image] "
"para funcionar."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [param keep] is [code]true[/code], overrides the flag globally for all "
"textures of this type. This is used primarily by the editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [param keep] for [code]true[/code], substitui a bandeira globalmente para "
"todas as texturas deste tipo. Isso é usado principalmente pelo editor."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], when running in the editor, this texture will keep the "
"source-compressed data in memory, allowing the data to persist after "
"loading. Otherwise, the source-compressed data is lost after loading and the "
"texture can't be re-saved.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property must be set before [method create_from_image] for "
"this to work."
msgstr ""
"Se for [code]true[/code], ao rodar no editor, esta textura manterá os dados "
"compactados de origem na memória, permitindo que os dados persistam após o "
"carregamento. Caso contrário, os dados compactados são perdidos após o "
"carregamento e a textura não pode ser salva novamente.\n"
"[b]Obs.:[/b] Esta propriedade deve ser definida antes de chamar [método "
"create_from_image]."

#: doc/classes/PortableCompressedTexture2D.xml
msgid "Allows overriding the texture's size (for 2D only)."
msgstr "Permite substituir o tamanho da textura (apenas para 2D)."

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for all primitive meshes. Handles applying a [Material] to a "
"primitive mesh."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para todas as malhas primitivas. Trata a aplicação de um "
"[Material] a uma malha primitiva."

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Base class for all primitive meshes. Handles applying a [Material] to a "
"primitive mesh. Examples include [BoxMesh], [CapsuleMesh], [CylinderMesh], "
"[PlaneMesh], [PrismMesh], and [SphereMesh]."
msgstr ""
"Classe base para todas as malhas primitivas. Trata a aplicação de um "
"[Material] a uma malha primitiva. Exemplos incluem [BoxMesh], [CapsuleMesh], "
"[CylinderMesh], [PlaneMesh], [PrismMesh] e [SphereMesh]."

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Override this method to customize how this primitive mesh should be "
"generated. Should return an [Array] where each element is another Array of "
"values required for the mesh (see the [enum Mesh.ArrayType] constants)."
msgstr ""
"Substitua este método para personalizar como esta malha primitiva deve ser "
"gerada. Deve retornar um [Array] onde cada elemento é outro Array de valores "
"necessários para a malha (veja as constantes [enum Mesh.ArrayType])."

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the mesh arrays used to make up the surface of this primitive mesh.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] Pass the result to [method "
"ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] to create a new surface:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var c = CylinderMesh.new()\n"
"var arr_mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"arr_mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, "
"c.get_mesh_arrays())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var c = new CylinderMesh();\n"
"var arrMesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"arrMesh.AddSurfaceFromArrays(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles, "
"c.GetMeshArrays());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Retorna os arrays de malha usados para compor a superfície desta malha "
"primitiva.\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Passe o resultado para [method "
"ArrayMesh.add_surface_from_arrays] para criar uma nova superfície:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"var c = CylinderMesh.new()\n"
"var arr_mesh = ArrayMesh.new()\n"
"arr_mesh.add_surface_from_arrays(Mesh.PRIMITIVE_TRIANGLES, "
"c.get_mesh_arrays())\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"var c = new CylinderMesh();\n"
"var arrMesh = new ArrayMesh();\n"
"arrMesh.AddSurfaceFromArrays(Mesh.PrimitiveType.Triangles, "
"c.GetMeshArrays());\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid "Request an update of this primitive mesh based on its properties."
msgstr ""
"Solicita uma atualização desta malha primitiva com base em suas propriedades."

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid ""
"If set, generates UV2 UV coordinates applying a padding using the [member "
"uv2_padding] setting. UV2 is needed for lightmapping."
msgstr ""
"Se definido, gera coordenadas UV2 UV aplicando um preenchimento usando a "
"configuração [member uv2_padding]. UV2 é necessário para mapeamento de luz."

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the order of the vertices in each triangle is "
"reversed, resulting in the backside of the mesh being drawn.\n"
"This gives the same result as using [constant BaseMaterial3D.CULL_FRONT] in "
"[member BaseMaterial3D.cull_mode]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid "The current [Material] of the primitive mesh."
msgstr "O [Material] atual da malha primitiva."

#: doc/classes/PrimitiveMesh.xml
msgid ""
"If [member add_uv2] is set, specifies the padding in pixels applied along "
"seams of the mesh. Lower padding values allow making better use of the "
"lightmap texture (resulting in higher texel density), but may introduce "
"visible lightmap bleeding along edges.\n"
"If the size of the lightmap texture can't be determined when generating the "
"mesh, UV2 is calculated assuming a texture size of 1024x1024."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/PrismMesh.xml
msgid "Class representing a prism-shaped [PrimitiveMesh]."
msgstr "Classe que representa um [PrimitiveMesh] em formato de prisma."

#: doc/classes/PrismMesh.xml
msgid ""
"Displacement of the upper edge along the X axis. 0.0 positions edge straight "
"above the bottom-left edge."
msgstr ""
"Deslocamento da borda superior ao longo do eixo X. 0.0 posiciona a borda "
"diretamente acima da borda inferior esquerda."

#: doc/classes/PrismMesh.xml
msgid "Size of the prism."
msgstr "Tamanho do prisma."

#: doc/classes/PrismMesh.xml
msgid "Number of added edge loops along the Z axis."
msgstr "Número de loops de aresta adicionados ao longo do eixo Z."

#: doc/classes/PrismMesh.xml
msgid "Number of added edge loops along the Y axis."
msgstr "Número de loops de aresta adicionados ao longo do eixo Y."

#: doc/classes/PrismMesh.xml
msgid "Number of added edge loops along the X axis."
msgstr "Número de loops de aresta adicionados ao longo do eixo X."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid "A material that defines a simple sky for a [Sky] resource."
msgstr "Um material que define um céu simples para um recurso [Sky]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] provides a way to create an effective background "
"quickly by defining procedural parameters for the sun, the sky and the "
"ground. The sky and ground are defined by a main color, a color at the "
"horizon, and an easing curve to interpolate between them. Suns are described "
"by a position in the sky, a color, and a max angle from the sun at which the "
"easing curve ends. The max angle therefore defines the size of the sun in "
"the sky.\n"
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] supports up to 4 suns, using the color, and energy, "
"direction, and angular distance of the first four [DirectionalLight3D] nodes "
"in the scene. This means that the suns are defined individually by the "
"properties of their corresponding [DirectionalLight3D]s and globally by "
"[member sun_angle_max] and [member sun_curve].\n"
"[ProceduralSkyMaterial] uses a lightweight shader to draw the sky and is "
"therefore suited for real-time updates. This makes it a great option for a "
"sky that is simple and computationally cheap, but unrealistic. If you need a "
"more realistic procedural option, use [PhysicalSkyMaterial]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the ground at the bottom. Blends with [member ground_horizon_color]."
msgstr ""
"Cor do solo na parte inferior. Mistura-se com [member ground_horizon_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"How quickly the [member ground_horizon_color] fades into the [member "
"ground_bottom_color]."
msgstr ""
"Com que rapidez a [member ground_horizon_color] desaparece na [member "
"ground_bottom_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Multiplier for ground color. A higher value will make the ground brighter."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador para a cor do solo. Um valor mais alto tornará o solo mais "
"brilhante."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the ground at the horizon. Blends with [member ground_bottom_color]."
msgstr "Cor do solo no horizonte. Mistura-se com [member ground_bottom_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The sky cover texture to use. This texture must use an equirectangular "
"projection (similar to [PanoramaSkyMaterial]). The texture's colors will be "
"[i]added[/i] to the existing sky color, and will be multiplied by [member "
"sky_energy_multiplier] and [member sky_cover_modulate]. This is mainly "
"suited to displaying stars at night, but it can also be used to display "
"clouds at day or night (with a non-physically-accurate look)."
msgstr ""
"A textura de cobertura do céu a ser usada. Esta textura deve usar uma "
"projeção equirretangular (semelhante ao [PanoramaSkyMaterial]). As cores da "
"textura serão [i]adicionadas[/i] à cor do céu existente e serão "
"multiplicadas por [member sky_energy_multiplier] e [member "
"sky_cover_modulate]. Isso é adequado principalmente para exibir estrelas à "
"noite, mas também pode ser usado para exibir nuvens de dia ou à noite (com "
"uma aparência não fisicamente precisa)."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"The tint to apply to the [member sky_cover] texture. This can be used to "
"change the sky cover's colors or opacity independently of the sky energy, "
"which is useful for day/night or weather transitions. Only effective if a "
"texture is defined in [member sky_cover]."
msgstr ""
"A tonalidade a ser aplicada à textura [member sky_cover]. Isso pode ser "
"usado para alterar as cores ou a opacidade da cobertura do céu "
"independentemente da energia do céu, o que é útil para transições de dia/"
"noite ou clima. Só é eficaz se uma textura estiver definida em [member "
"sky_cover]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"How quickly the [member sky_horizon_color] fades into the [member "
"sky_top_color]."
msgstr ""
"A rapidez com que a [member sky_horizon_color] faz o \"fade\" para a [member "
"sky_top_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid "Multiplier for sky color. A higher value will make the sky brighter."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicador para a cor do céu. Um valor mais alto tornará o céu mais "
"brilhante."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid "Color of the sky at the horizon. Blends with [member sky_top_color]."
msgstr "Cor do céu no horizonte. Mistura-se com [member sky_top_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid "Color of the sky at the top. Blends with [member sky_horizon_color]."
msgstr "Cor do céu no topo. Mistura-se com [member sky_horizon_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid "Distance from center of sun where it fades out completely."
msgstr "Distância do centro do sol onde ele desaparece completamente."

#: doc/classes/ProceduralSkyMaterial.xml
msgid ""
"How quickly the sun fades away between the edge of the sun disk and [member "
"sun_angle_max]."
msgstr ""
"Com que rapidez o sol desaparece entre a borda do disco solar e [member "
"sun_angle_max]."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "A control used for visual representation of a percentage."
msgstr "Um controle usado para a representação visual de uma porcentagem."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid ""
"A control used for visual representation of a percentage. Shows the fill "
"percentage in the center. Can also be used to show indeterminate progress. "
"For more fill modes, use [TextureProgressBar] instead."
msgstr ""
"Um controle usado para a representação visual de uma porcentagem. Mostra a "
"porcentagem de preenchimento no centro. Também pode ser usado para mostrar "
"progresso indeterminado. Para mais modos de preenchimento, use "
"[TextureProgressBar] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]false[/code], the [member indeterminate] animation will be paused "
"in the editor."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]false[/code], a animação [member indeterminate] será pausada no "
"editor."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml doc/classes/TextureProgressBar.xml
msgid "The fill direction. See [enum FillMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"A direção de preenchimento. Consulte [enum FillMode] para valores possíveis."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], the progress bar indicates that something is "
"happening with an animation, but does not show the fill percentage or value."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], a barra de progresso indica que algo "
"está acontecendo com uma animação, mas não mostra a porcentagem ou o valor "
"de preenchimento."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the fill percentage is displayed on the bar."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a porcentagem de preenchimento é exibida na barra."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid ""
"The progress bar fills from begin to end horizontally, according to the "
"language direction. If [method Control.is_layout_rtl] returns [code]false[/"
"code], it fills from left to right, and if it returns [code]true[/code], it "
"fills from right to left."
msgstr ""
"A barra de progresso preenche do início ao fim horizontalmente, de acordo "
"com a direção do idioma. Se [method Control.is_layout_rtl] retornar "
"[code]false[/code], ela preenche da esquerda para a direita, e se retornar "
"[code]true[/code], preenche da direita para a esquerda."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid ""
"The progress bar fills from end to begin horizontally, according to the "
"language direction. If [method Control.is_layout_rtl] returns [code]false[/"
"code], it fills from right to left, and if it returns [code]true[/code], it "
"fills from left to right."
msgstr ""
"A barra de progresso preenche do fim ao início horizontalmente, de acordo "
"com a direção do idioma. Se [method Control.is_layout_rtl] retornar "
"[code]false[/code], ela preenche da direita para a esquerda, e se retornar "
"[code]true[/code], preenche da esquerda para a direita."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "The progress fills from top to bottom."
msgstr "O progresso preenche de cima para baixo."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "The progress fills from bottom to top."
msgstr "O progresso preenche de baixo para cima."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "The color of the text."
msgstr "A cor do texto."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "The tint of text outline of the [ProgressBar]."
msgstr "A tonalidade do contorno do texto do [ProgressBar]."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid ""
"Font used to draw the fill percentage if [member show_percentage] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Fonte usada para desenhar a porcentagem de preenchimento se [member "
"show_percentage] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid ""
"Font size used to draw the fill percentage if [member show_percentage] is "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Tamanho da fonte usado para desenhar a porcentagem de preenchimento se "
"[member show_percentage] for [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "The style of the background."
msgstr "O estilo do plano de fundo."

#: doc/classes/ProgressBar.xml
msgid "The style of the progress (i.e. the part that fills the bar)."
msgstr "O estilo do progresso (ou seja, a parte que preenche a barra)."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "A 4×4 matrix for 3D projective transformations."
msgstr "Uma matriz de 4×4 para transformações projetivas 3D."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"A 4×4 matrix used for 3D projective transformations. It can represent "
"transformations such as translation, rotation, scaling, shearing, and "
"perspective division. It consists of four [Vector4] columns.\n"
"For purely linear transformations (translation, rotation, and scale), it is "
"recommended to use [Transform3D], as it is more performant and requires less "
"memory.\n"
"Used internally as [Camera3D]'s projection matrix.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In a boolean context, a projection will evaluate to "
"[code]false[/code] if it's equal to [constant IDENTITY]. Otherwise, a "
"projection will always evaluate to [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Constructs a default-initialized [Projection] identical to [constant "
"IDENTITY].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In C#, this constructs a [Projection] identical to [constant "
"ZERO]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "Constructs a [Projection] as a copy of the given [Projection]."
msgstr "Constrói um [Projection] como uma cópia do [Projection] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "Constructs a Projection as a copy of the given [Transform3D]."
msgstr "Constrói uma Projection como uma cópia do [Transform3D] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "Constructs a Projection from four [Vector4] values (matrix columns)."
msgstr ""
"Constrói uma Projection a partir de quatro valores [Vector4] (colunas da "
"matriz)."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions from a depth range of "
"[code]-1[/code] to [code]1[/code] to one that ranges from [code]0[/code] to "
"[code]1[/code], and flips the projected positions vertically, according to "
"[param flip_y]."
msgstr ""
"Cria uma nova [Projection] que projeta posições de um intervalo de "
"profundidade de [code]-1[/code] a [code]1[/code] para um que varia de "
"[code]0[/code] a [code]1[/code] e inverte as posições projetadas "
"verticalmente, de acordo com [param flip_y]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that scales a given projection to fit around a "
"given [AABB] in projection space."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo [Projection] que escala uma projeção dada para se ajustar ao "
"redor de um [AABB] dado no espaço de projeção."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] for projecting positions onto a head-mounted "
"display with the given X:Y aspect ratio, distance between eyes, display "
"width, distance to lens, oversampling factor, and depth clipping planes.\n"
"[param eye] creates the projection for the left eye when set to 1, or the "
"right eye when set to 2."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions in a frustum with the "
"given clipping planes."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo [Projection] que projeta posições em um frustum com os planos "
"de corte fornecidos."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions in a frustum with the "
"given size, X:Y aspect ratio, offset, and clipping planes.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is "
"flipped over its diagonal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions into the given [Rect2]."
msgstr "Cria um novo [Projection] que projeta posições no [Rect2] fornecido."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using an orthogonal "
"projection with the given clipping planes."
msgstr ""
"Cria um novo [Projection] que projeta posições usando uma projeção ortogonal "
"com os planos de corte fornecidos."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using an orthogonal "
"projection with the given size, X:Y aspect ratio, and clipping planes.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is "
"flipped over its diagonal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using a perspective "
"projection with the given Y-axis field of view (in degrees), X:Y aspect "
"ratio, and clipping planes.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is "
"flipped over its diagonal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a new [Projection] that projects positions using a perspective "
"projection with the given Y-axis field of view (in degrees), X:Y aspect "
"ratio, and clipping distances. The projection is adjusted for a head-mounted "
"display with the given distance between eyes and distance to a point that "
"can be focused on.\n"
"[param eye] creates the projection for the left eye when set to 1, or the "
"right eye when set to 2.\n"
"[param flip_fov] determines whether the projection's field of view is "
"flipped over its diagonal."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a scalar value that is the signed factor by which areas are scaled "
"by this matrix. If the sign is negative, the matrix flips the orientation of "
"the area.\n"
"The determinant can be used to calculate the invertibility of a matrix or "
"solve linear systems of equations involving the matrix, among other "
"applications."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of this [Projection] with the signs of the values of the Y "
"column flipped."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma cópia desta [Projection] com os sinais dos valores da coluna Y "
"invertidos."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "Returns the X:Y aspect ratio of this [Projection]'s viewport."
msgstr "Retorna a proporção de aspecto X:Y do viewport deste [Projection]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the dimensions of the far clipping plane of the projection, divided "
"by two."
msgstr ""
"Retorna as dimensões do plano de corte distante da projeção, divididas por "
"dois."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "Returns the horizontal field of view of the projection (in degrees)."
msgstr "Retorna o campo de visão horizontal da projeção (em graus)."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the vertical field of view of the projection (in degrees) associated "
"with the given horizontal field of view (in degrees) and aspect ratio.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Unlike most methods of [Projection], [param aspect] is expected "
"to be 1 divided by the X:Y aspect ratio."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the factor by which the visible level of detail is scaled by this "
"[Projection]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o fator pelo qual o nível visível de detalhe é dimensionado por esta "
"[Projection]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [param for_pixel_width] divided by the viewport's width measured in "
"meters on the near plane, after this [Projection] is applied."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [param for_pixel_width] dividido pela largura da viewport medida em "
"metros no plano próximo, após esta [Projection] ser aplicada."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the clipping plane of this [Projection] whose index is given by "
"[param plane].\n"
"[param plane] should be equal to one of [constant PLANE_NEAR], [constant "
"PLANE_FAR], [constant PLANE_LEFT], [constant PLANE_TOP], [constant "
"PLANE_RIGHT], or [constant PLANE_BOTTOM]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the dimensions of the viewport plane that this [Projection] projects "
"positions onto, divided by two."
msgstr ""
"Retorna as dimensões do plano do viewport para o qual este [Projection] "
"projeta posições, divididas por dois."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the distance for this [Projection] beyond which positions are "
"clipped."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a distância para este [Projection] além da qual as posições são "
"recortadas."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the distance for this [Projection] before which positions are "
"clipped."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a distância para este [Projection] antes da qual as posições são "
"recortadas."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] that performs the inverse of this [Projection]'s "
"projective transformation."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Projection] que executa o inverso da transformação projetiva "
"deste [Projection]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if this [Projection] performs an orthogonal "
"projection."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se este [Projection] realizar uma projeção "
"ortogonal."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] with the X and Y values from the given [Vector2] "
"added to the first and second values of the final column respectively."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma [Projection] com os valores X e Y do [Vector2] fornecido "
"adicionados ao primeiro e segundo valores da coluna final, respectivamente."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] with the near clipping distance adjusted to be [param "
"new_znear].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The original [Projection] must be a perspective projection."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"The projection matrix's W vector (column 3). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]3[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O vetor W da matriz de projeção (coluna 3). Equivalente ao índice de matriz "
"[code]3[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"The projection matrix's X vector (column 0). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O vetor X da matriz de projeção (coluna 0). Equivalente ao índice de matriz "
"[code]0[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"The projection matrix's Y vector (column 1). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]1[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O vetor Y da matriz de projeção (coluna 1). Equivalente ao índice de matriz "
"[code]1[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"The projection matrix's Z vector (column 2). Equivalent to array index "
"[code]2[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O vetor Z da matriz de projeção (coluna 2). Equivalente ao índice de matriz "
"[code]2[/code]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "The index value of the projection's near clipping plane."
msgstr "O valor do índice do plano de corte próximo da projeção."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "The index value of the projection's far clipping plane."
msgstr "O valor do índice do plano de corte distante da projeção."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "The index value of the projection's left clipping plane."
msgstr "O valor do índice do plano de corte esquerdo da projeção."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "The index value of the projection's top clipping plane."
msgstr "O valor do índice do plano de corte superior da projeção."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "The index value of the projection's right clipping plane."
msgstr "O valor do índice do plano de corte direito da projeção."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "The index value of the projection bottom clipping plane."
msgstr "O valor do índice do plano de corte inferior da projeção."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"A [Projection] with no transformation defined. When applied to other data "
"structures, no transformation is performed."
msgstr ""
"Um [Projection] sem transformação definida. Quando aplicado a outras "
"estruturas de dados, nenhuma transformação é realizada."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"A [Projection] with all values initialized to 0. When applied to other data "
"structures, they will be zeroed."
msgstr ""
"Um [Projection] com todos os valores inicializados como 0. Quando aplicado a "
"outras estruturas de dados, eles serão zerados."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the projections are not equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, this may return "
"[code]true[/code], even if the projections are virtually equal. An "
"[code]is_equal_approx[/code] method may be added in a future version of "
"Godot."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Projection] that applies the combined transformations of this "
"[Projection] and [param right]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna uma [Projection] que aplica as transformações combinadas desta "
"[Projection] e de [param right]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid "Projects (multiplies) the given [Vector4] by this [Projection] matrix."
msgstr ""
"Projeta (multiplica) o [Vector4] fornecido por esta matriz [Projection]."

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the projections are equal.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Due to floating-point precision errors, this may return "
"[code]false[/code], even if the projections are virtually equal. An "
"[code]is_equal_approx[/code] method may be added in a future version of "
"Godot."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Projection.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the column of the [Projection] with the given index.\n"
"Indices are in the following order: x, y, z, w."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Stores globally-accessible variables."
msgstr "Armazena variáveis acessíveis globalmente."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Stores variables that can be accessed from everywhere. Use [method "
"get_setting], [method set_setting] or [method has_setting] to access them. "
"Variables stored in [code]project.godot[/code] are also loaded into "
"[ProjectSettings], making this object very useful for reading custom game "
"configuration options.\n"
"When naming a Project Settings property, use the full path to the setting "
"including the category. For example, [code]\"application/config/name\"[/"
"code] for the project name. Category and property names can be viewed in the "
"Project Settings dialog.\n"
"[b]Feature tags:[/b] Project settings can be overridden for specific "
"platforms and configurations (debug, release, ...) using [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/export/feature_tags.html]feature tags[/url].\n"
"[b]Overriding:[/b] Any project setting can be overridden by creating a file "
"named [code]override.cfg[/code] in the project's root directory. This file "
"is in the same format as [code]project.godot[/code], and can also be written "
"using [ConfigFile]. This can also be used in exported projects by placing "
"this file in the same directory as the project binary. Overriding will still "
"take the base project settings' [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/export/"
"feature_tags.html]feature tags[/url] in account. Therefore, make sure to "
"[i]also[/i] override the setting with the desired feature tags if you want "
"them to override base project settings on all platforms and configurations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Project Settings"
msgstr "Configurações do Projeto"

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Adds a custom property info to a property. The dictionary must contain:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code]: [String] (the property's name)\n"
"- [code]\"type\"[/code]: [int] (see [enum Variant.Type])\n"
"- optionally [code]\"hint\"[/code]: [int] (see [enum PropertyHint]) and "
"[code]\"hint_string\"[/code]: [String]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set(\"category/property_name\", 0)\n"
"\n"
"var property_info = {\n"
"\t\"name\": \"category/property_name\",\n"
"\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\"hint_string\": \"one,two,three\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.add_property_info(property_info)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.Singleton.Set(\"category/property_name\", 0);\n"
"\n"
"var propertyInfo = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"name\", \"category/propertyName\" },\n"
"\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t{ \"hint\", (int)PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t{ \"hint_string\", \"one,two,three\" },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.AddPropertyInfo(propertyInfo);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Setting [code]\"usage\"[/code] for the property is not "
"supported. Use [method set_as_basic], [method set_restart_if_changed], and "
"[method set_as_internal] to modify usage flags."
msgstr ""
"Adiciona informações de propriedade personalizadas a uma propriedade. O "
"dicionário deve conter:\n"
"- [code]\"name\"[/code]: [String] (o nome da propriedade)\n"
"- [code]\"type\"[/code]: [int] (consulte [enum Variant.Type])\n"
"- opcionalmente [code]\"hint\"[/code]: [int] (consulte [enum PropertyHint]) "
"e [code]\"hint_string\"[/code]: [String]\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set(\"category/property_name\", 0)\n"
"\n"
"var property_info = {\n"
"\t\"name\": \"category/property_name\",\n"
"\t\"type\": TYPE_INT,\n"
"\t\"hint\": PROPERTY_HINT_ENUM,\n"
"\t\"hint_string\": \"one,two,three\"\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.add_property_info(property_info)\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.Singleton.Set(\"category/property_name\", 0);\n"
"\n"
"var propertyInfo = new Godot.Collections.Dictionary\n"
"{\n"
"\t{ \"name\", \"category/propertyName\" },\n"
"\t{ \"type\", (int)Variant.Type.Int },\n"
"\t{ \"hint\", (int)PropertyHint.Enum },\n"
"\t{ \"hint_string\", \"one,two,three\" },\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"ProjectSettings.AddPropertyInfo(propertyInfo);\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Definir [code]\"usage\"[/code] para a propriedade não é "
"suportado. Use [method set_as_basic], [method set_restart_if_changed] e "
"[method set_as_internal] para modificar as flags de uso."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Clears the whole configuration (not recommended, may break things)."
msgstr "Limpa toda a configuração (não recomendado, pode quebrar as coisas)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Gets an array of the settings which have been changed since the last save. "
"Note that internally [code]changed_settings[/code] is cleared after a "
"successful save, so generally the most appropriate place to use this method "
"is when processing [signal settings_changed]."
msgstr ""
"Obtém uma matriz das configurações que foram alteradas desde o último "
"salvamento. Observe que internamente [code]changed_settings[/code] é limpo "
"após um salvamento bem-sucedido, portanto, geralmente o lugar mais "
"apropriado para usar este método é ao processar o sinal [signal "
"settings_changed]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns an [Array] of registered global classes. Each global class is "
"represented as a [Dictionary] that contains the following entries:\n"
"- [code]base[/code] is a name of the base class;\n"
"- [code]class[/code] is a name of the registered global class;\n"
"- [code]icon[/code] is a path to a custom icon of the global class, if it "
"has any;\n"
"- [code]language[/code] is a name of a programming language in which the "
"global class is written;\n"
"- [code]path[/code] is a path to a file containing the global class.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Both the script and the icon paths are local to the project "
"filesystem, i.e. they start with [code]res://[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the order of a configuration value (influences when saved to the "
"config file)."
msgstr ""
"Retorna a ordem de um valor de configuração (influencia quando salvo no "
"arquivo de configuração)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the setting identified by [param name]. If the setting "
"doesn't exist and [param default_value] is specified, the value of [param "
"default_value] is returned. Otherwise, [code]null[/code] is returned.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/name\"))\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/custom_description\", "
"\"No description specified.\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/name\"));\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/"
"custom_description\", \"No description specified.\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method doesn't take potential feature overrides into "
"account automatically. Use [method get_setting_with_override] to handle "
"seamlessly.\n"
"See also [method has_setting] to check whether a setting exists."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o valor da configuração identificada por [param name]. Se a "
"configuração não existir e [param default_value] for especificado, o valor "
"de [param default_value] será retornado. Caso contrário, [code]null[/code] "
"será retornado.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/name\"))\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"application/config/custom_description\", "
"\"No description specified.\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/name\"));\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSetting(\"application/config/"
"custom_description\", \"No description specified.\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Este método não leva em conta substituições potenciais de "
"recursos automaticamente. Use [method get_setting_with_override] para lidar "
"com isso de forma integrada.\n"
"Veja também [method has_setting] para verificar se uma configuração existe."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [method get_setting], but applies feature tag overrides if any "
"exists and is valid.\n"
"[b]Example:[/b] If the setting override [code]\"application/config/"
"name.windows\"[/code] exists, and the following code is executed on a "
"[i]Windows[/i] operating system, the overridden setting is printed instead:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(\"application/config/"
"name\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSettingWithOverride(\"application/config/"
"name\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"
msgstr ""
"Semelhante a [method get_setting], mas aplica substituições de tags de "
"recurso, caso alguma exista e seja válida.\n"
"[b]Exemplo:[/b] Se a substituição de configuração [code]\"application/config/"
"name.windows\"[/code] existir e o código a seguir for executado em um "
"sistema operacional [i]Windows[/i], a configuração substituída será "
"impressa:\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"print(ProjectSettings.get_setting_with_override(\"application/config/"
"name\"))\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"GD.Print(ProjectSettings.GetSettingWithOverride(\"application/config/"
"name\"));\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]"

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Similar to [method get_setting_with_override], but applies feature tag "
"overrides instead of current OS features."
msgstr ""
"Semelhante a [method get_setting_with_override], mas aplica substituições de "
"tags de recursos em vez dos recursos atuais do SO."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the absolute, native OS path corresponding to the localized [param "
"path] (starting with [code]res://[/code] or [code]user://[/code]). The "
"returned path will vary depending on the operating system and user "
"preferences. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html]File paths in "
"Godot projects[/url] to see what those paths convert to. See also [method "
"localize_path].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [method globalize_path] with [code]res://[/code] will not work "
"in an exported project. Instead, prepend the executable's base directory to "
"the path when running from an exported project:\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"var path = \"\"\n"
"if OS.has_feature(\"editor\"):\n"
"\t# Running from an editor binary.\n"
"\t# `path` will contain the absolute path to `hello.txt` located in the "
"project root.\n"
"\tpath = ProjectSettings.globalize_path(\"res://hello.txt\")\n"
"else:\n"
"\t# Running from an exported project.\n"
"\t# `path` will contain the absolute path to `hello.txt` next to the "
"executable.\n"
"\t# This is *not* identical to using `ProjectSettings.globalize_path()` with "
"a `res://` path,\n"
"\t# but is close enough in spirit.\n"
"\tpath = OS.get_executable_path().get_base_dir().path_join(\"hello.txt\")\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if a configuration value is present.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] In order to be be detected, custom settings have to be either "
"defined with [method set_setting], or exist in the [code]project.godot[/"
"code] file. This is especially relevant when using [method "
"set_initial_value]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Loads the contents of the .pck or .zip file specified by [param pack] into "
"the resource filesystem ([code]res://[/code]). Returns [code]true[/code] on "
"success.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If a file from [param pack] shares the same path as a file "
"already in the resource filesystem, any attempts to load that file will use "
"the file from [param pack] unless [param replace_files] is set to "
"[code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The optional [param offset] parameter can be used to specify "
"the offset in bytes to the start of the resource pack. This is only "
"supported for .pck files.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [DirAccess] will not show changes made to the contents of "
"[code]res://[/code] after calling this function."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Returns the localized path (starting with [code]res://[/code]) corresponding "
"to the absolute, native OS [param path]. See also [method globalize_path]."
msgstr ""
"Retorna o caminho localizado (começando com [code]res://[/code]) "
"correspondente ao [param path] nativo e absoluto do SO. Consulte também "
"[method globalize_path]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the configuration to the [code]project.godot[/code] file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This method is intended to be used by editor plugins, as "
"modified [ProjectSettings] can't be loaded back in the running app. If you "
"want to change project settings in exported projects, use [method "
"save_custom] to save an [code]override.cfg[/code] file."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Saves the configuration to a custom file. The file extension must be "
"[code].godot[/code] (to save in text-based [ConfigFile] format) or "
"[code].binary[/code] (to save in binary format). You can also save an "
"[code]override.cfg[/code] file, which is also text, but can be used in "
"exported projects unlike other formats."
msgstr ""
"Salva a configuração em um arquivo personalizado. A extensão do arquivo deve "
"ser [code].godot[/code] (para salvar no formato [ConfigFile] baseado em "
"texto) ou [code].binary[/code] (para salvar no formato binário). Você também "
"pode salvar um arquivo [code]override.cfg[/code], que também é de texto, mas "
"pode ser usado em projetos exportados, ao contrário de outros formatos."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Defines if the specified setting is considered basic or advanced. Basic "
"settings will always be shown in the project settings. Advanced settings "
"will only be shown if the user enables the \"Advanced Settings\" option."
msgstr ""
"Define se a configuração especificada é considerada básica ou avançada. "
"Configurações básicas serão sempre exibidas nas configurações do projeto. "
"Configurações avançadas só serão exibidas se o usuário ativar a opção "
"\"Advanced Settings\"."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Defines if the specified setting is considered internal. An internal setting "
"won't show up in the Project Settings dialog. This is mostly useful for "
"addons that need to store their own internal settings without exposing them "
"directly to the user."
msgstr ""
"Define se a configuração especificada é considerada interna. Uma "
"configuração interna não aparecerá na caixa de diálogo Configurações do "
"Projeto. Isso é muito útil para complementos que precisam armazenar suas "
"próprias configurações internas sem expô-las diretamente ao usuário."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the specified setting's initial value. This is the value the setting "
"reverts to. The setting should already exist before calling this method. "
"Note that project settings equal to their default value are not saved, so "
"your code needs to account for that.\n"
"[codeblock]\n"
"extends EditorPlugin\n"
"\n"
"const SETTING_NAME = \"addons/my_setting\"\n"
"const SETTING_DEFAULT = 10.0\n"
"\n"
"func _enter_tree():\n"
"\tif not ProjectSettings.has_setting(SETTING_NAME):\n"
"\t\tProjectSettings.set_setting(SETTING_NAME, SETTING_DEFAULT)\n"
"\n"
"\tProjectSettings.set_initial_value(SETTING_NAME, SETTING_DEFAULT)\n"
"[/codeblock]\n"
"If you have a project setting defined by an [EditorPlugin], but want to use "
"it in a running project, you will need a similar code at runtime."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the order of a configuration value (influences when saved to the config "
"file)."
msgstr ""
"Define a ordem de um valor de configuração (influencia quando salvo no "
"arquivo de configuração)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether a setting requires restarting the editor to properly take "
"effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This is just a hint to display to the user that the editor must "
"be restarted for changes to take effect. Enabling [method "
"set_restart_if_changed] does [i]not[/i] delay the setting being set when "
"changed."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the value of a setting.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.SetSetting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"This can also be used to erase custom project settings. To do this change "
"the setting value to [code]null[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Define o valor de uma configuração.\n"
"[codeblocks]\n"
"[gdscript]\n"
"ProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\")\n"
"[/gdscript]\n"
"[csharp]\n"
"ProjectSettings.SetSetting(\"application/config/name\", \"Example\");\n"
"[/csharp]\n"
"[/codeblocks]\n"
"Isso também pode ser usado para apagar configurações de projeto "
"personalizadas. Para fazer isso, altere o valor da configuração para "
"[code]null[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Accessibility driver:\n"
"-[b]accesskit[/b] (default): AccessKit driver.\n"
"-[b]dummy[/b]: Dummy driver, screen reader support is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Accessibility support mode:\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] ([code]0[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, but "
"updates to the accessibility information are processed only if an assistive "
"app (such as a screen reader or a Braille display) is active (default).\n"
"- [b]Always Active[/b] ([code]1[/code]): Accessibility support is enabled, "
"and updates to the accessibility information are always processed, "
"regardless of the status of assistive apps.\n"
"- [b]Disabled[/b] ([code]2[/code]): Accessibility support is fully "
"disabled.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Accessibility debugging tools, such as Accessibility Insights "
"for Windows, Accessibility Inspector (macOS), or AT-SPI Browser (Linux/BSD), "
"do not count as assistive apps. To test your project with these tools, use "
"[b]Always Active[/b]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "The number of accessibility information updates per second."
msgstr "O número de atualizações de informações de acessibilidade por segundo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [member MeshInstance3D.skeleton] will point to the "
"parent node ([code]..[/code]) by default, which was the behavior before "
"Godot 4.6. It's recommended to keep this setting disabled unless the old "
"behavior is needed for compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If you disable this option in an existing project, it's "
"strongly recommended to use the [code]Project > Tools > Upgrade Project "
"Files...[/code] option to ensure existing scenes do not break."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [AnimationMixer] prints the warning of interpolation "
"being forced to choose the shortest rotation path due to multiple angle "
"interpolation types being mixed in the [AnimationMixer] cache."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o [AnimationMixer] exibe o aviso de que a interpolação "
"foi forçada a escolher o caminho de rotação mais curto devido à mistura de "
"vários tipos de interpolação de ângulo no cache do [AnimationMixer]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [SkeletonModifier3D] prints a warning if there's no "
"matching object for the track path in the scene when assigning."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], [SkeletonModifier3D] exibe um aviso se não houver um "
"objeto correspondente para o caminho da trilha na cena ao atribuir."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], [AnimationMixer] prints the warning of no matching "
"object of the track path in the scene."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], [AnimationMixer] imprime o aviso de nenhum objeto "
"correspondente ao caminho da trilha na cena."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Background color for the boot splash."
msgstr "Cor de fundo para a tela de inicialização."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path to an image used as the boot splash. If left empty, the default Godot "
"Engine splash will be displayed instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Only effective if [member application/boot_splash/show_image] "
"is [code]true[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The only supported format is PNG. Using another image format "
"will result in an error.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The image will also show when opening the project in the "
"editor. If you want to display the default splash image in the editor, add "
"an empty override for [code]editor_hint[/code] feature."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Minimum boot splash display time (in milliseconds). It is not recommended to "
"set too high values for this setting."
msgstr ""
"Tempo mínimo de exibição da tela de inicialização (em milissegundos). Não é "
"recomendado definir valores muito altos para esta configuração."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], displays the image specified in [member application/"
"boot_splash/image] when the engine starts. If [code]false[/code], only "
"displays the plain color specified in [member application/boot_splash/"
"bg_color]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], exibe a imagem especificada em [member application/"
"boot_splash/image] quando a engine inicia. Se [code]false[/code], exibe "
"apenas a cor sólida especificada em [member application/boot_splash/"
"bg_color]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies how the splash image will be stretched. For the original size "
"without stretching, set to disabled. See [enum "
"RenderingServer.SplashStretchMode] constants for more information."
msgstr ""
"Especifica como a imagem de abertura será esticada. Para o tamanho original "
"sem estiramento, defina como desativado. Consulte as constantes de [enum "
"RenderingServer.SplashStretchMode] para obter mais informações."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], applies linear filtering when scaling the image "
"(recommended for high-resolution artwork). If [code]false[/code], uses "
"nearest-neighbor interpolation (recommended for pixel art)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], aplica filtragem linear ao redimensionar a imagem "
"(recomendado para arte de alta resolução). Se [code]false[/code], usa "
"interpolação de vizinho mais próximo (recomendado para pixel art)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application automatically accepts quitting "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o aplicativo aceita automaticamente solicitações de "
"encerramento."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"This user directory is used for storing persistent data ([code]user://[/"
"code] filesystem). If a custom directory name is defined, this name will be "
"appended to the system-specific user data directory (same parent folder as "
"the Godot configuration folder documented in [method "
"OS.get_user_data_dir]).\n"
"The [member application/config/use_custom_user_dir] setting must be enabled "
"for this to take effect.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member application/config/custom_user_dir_name] contains "
"trailing periods, they will be stripped as folder names ending with a period "
"are not allowed on Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The project's description, displayed as a tooltip in the Project Manager "
"when hovering the project."
msgstr ""
"A descrição do projeto, exibida como uma dica de ferramenta no Gerenciador "
"de Projetos ao passar o mouse sobre o projeto."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables loading of project settings overrides (file "
"defined in [member application/config/project_settings_override] and "
"[code]res://override.cfg[/code]) and related CLI arguments."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], desativa o carregamento de substituições de "
"configurações do projeto (arquivo definido em [member application/config/"
"project_settings_override] e [code]res://override.cfg[/code]) e argumentos "
"de CLI relacionados."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Icon used for the project, set when project loads. Exporters will also use "
"this icon as a fallback if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Ícone usado para o projeto, definido quando o projeto é carregado. Os "
"exportadores também usarão este ícone como um recurso reserva, se necessário."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Icon set in [code].icns[/code] format used on macOS to set the game's icon. "
"This is done automatically on start by calling [method "
"DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."
msgstr ""
"Ícone definido no formato [code].icns[/code] usado no macOS para definir o "
"ícone do jogo. Isso é feito automaticamente na inicialização chamando "
"[method DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The project's name. It is used both by the Project Manager and by exporters. "
"The project name can be translated by translating its value in localization "
"files. The window title will be set to match the project name automatically "
"on startup.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value will also change the user data folder's "
"path if [member application/config/use_custom_user_dir] is [code]false[/"
"code]. After renaming the project, you will no longer be able to access "
"existing data in [code]user://[/code] unless you rename the old folder to "
"match the new project name. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/"
"data_paths.html]Data paths[/url] in the documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Translations of the project's name. This setting is used by OS tools to "
"translate application name on Android, iOS and macOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When left empty, the application name is translated using the "
"project translations."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies a file to override project settings. For example: [code]user://"
"custom_settings.cfg[/code]. See \"Overriding\" in the [ProjectSettings] "
"class description at the top for more information.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of this setting's value, [code]res://override.cfg[/"
"code] will still be read to override the project settings."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the application quits automatically when navigating "
"back (e.g. using the system \"Back\" button on Android)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o aplicativo é fechado automaticamente ao navegar para "
"trás (por exemplo, usando o botão \"Voltar\" do sistema no Android)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the project will save user data to its own user "
"directory. If [member application/config/custom_user_dir_name] is empty, "
"[code]<OS user data directory>/<project name>[/code] directory will be used. "
"If [code]false[/code], the project will save user data to [code]<OS user "
"data directory>/Godot/app_userdata/<project name>[/code].\n"
"See also [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#accessing-persistent-"
"user-data-user]File paths in Godot projects[/url]. This setting is only "
"effective on desktop platforms."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the project will use a hidden directory ([code].godot[/"
"code]) for storing project-specific data (metadata, shader cache, etc.).\n"
"If [code]false[/code], a non-hidden directory ([code]godot[/code]) will be "
"used instead.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Restart the application after changing this setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Changing this value can help on platforms or with third-party "
"tools where hidden directory patterns are disallowed. Only modify this "
"setting if you know that your environment requires it, as changing the "
"default can impact compatibility with some external tools or plugins which "
"expect the default [code].godot[/code] folder."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The project's human-readable version identifier. This is used by exporters "
"if the version identifier isn't overridden there. If [member application/"
"config/version] is an empty string and the version identifier isn't "
"overridden in an exporter, the exporter will use [code]1.0.0[/code] as a "
"version identifier."
msgstr ""
"O identificador de versão legível por humanos do projeto. Isso é usado por "
"exportadores se o identificador de versão não for sobrescrito neles. Se "
"[member application/config/version] for uma string vazia e o identificador "
"de versão não for sobrescrito em um exportador, o exportador usará "
"[code]1.0.0[/code] como identificador de versão."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Icon set in [code].ico[/code] format used on Windows to set the game's icon. "
"This is done automatically on start by calling [method "
"DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."
msgstr ""
"Ícone definido no formato [code].ico[/code] usado no Windows para definir o "
"ícone do jogo. Isso é feito automaticamente na inicialização chamando "
"[method DisplayServer.set_native_icon]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Time samples for frame deltas are subject to random variation introduced by "
"the platform, even when frames are displayed at regular intervals thanks to "
"V-Sync. This can lead to jitter. Delta smoothing can often give a better "
"result by filtering the input deltas to correct for minor fluctuations from "
"the refresh rate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Delta smoothing is only attempted when [member display/window/"
"vsync/vsync_mode] is set to [code]enabled[/code], as it does not work well "
"without V-Sync.\n"
"It may take several seconds at a stable frame rate before the smoothing is "
"initially activated. It will only be active on machines where performance is "
"adequate to render frames at the refresh rate."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables printing to standard error. If [code]true[/"
"code], this also hides error and warning messages printed by [method "
"@GlobalScope.push_error] and [method @GlobalScope.push_warning]. See also "
"[member application/run/disable_stdout].\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the "
"application. To control this at runtime, use [member "
"Engine.print_error_messages]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], disables printing to standard output. This is "
"equivalent to starting the editor or project with the [code]--quiet[/code] "
"[url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command line "
"argument[/url]. See also [member application/run/disable_stderr].\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the "
"application. To control this at runtime, use [member Engine.print_to_stdout]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows the [kbd]Alt + Space[/kbd] keys to display the "
"window menu. This menu allows the user to perform various window management "
"operations such as moving, resizing, or minimizing the window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When the menu is displayed, project execution will pause until "
"the menu is [i]fully[/i] closed due to Windows behavior. Consider this when "
"enabling this setting in a networked multiplayer game. The menu is only "
"considered fully closed when an option is selected, when the user clicks "
"outside, or when [kbd]Escape[/kbd] is pressed after bringing up the window "
"menu [i]and[/i] another key is pressed afterwards.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on Windows."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], flushes the standard output stream every time a line "
"is printed. This affects both terminal logging and file logging.\n"
"When running a project, this setting must be enabled if you want logs to be "
"collected by service managers such as systemd/journalctl. This setting is "
"disabled by default on release builds, since flushing on every printed line "
"will negatively affect performance if lots of lines are printed in a rapid "
"succession. Also, if this setting is enabled, logged files will still be "
"written successfully if the application crashes or is otherwise killed by "
"the user (without being closed \"normally\").\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regardless of this setting, the standard error stream "
"([code]stderr[/code]) is always flushed when a line is printed to it.\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the application."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Debug build override for [member application/run/flush_stdout_on_print], as "
"performance is less important during debugging.\n"
"Changes to this setting will only be applied upon restarting the application."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Forces a [i]constant[/i] delay between frames in the main loop (in "
"milliseconds). In most situations, [member application/run/max_fps] should "
"be preferred as an FPS limiter as it's more precise.\n"
"This setting can be overridden using the [code]--frame-delay <ms;>[/code] "
"command line argument."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], loads the default shell and copies environment "
"variables set by the shell startup scripts to the app environment.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented on macOS for non-sandboxed "
"applications only."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables low-processor usage mode. When enabled, the "
"engine takes longer to redraw, but only redraws the screen if necessary. "
"This may lower power consumption, and is intended for editors or mobile "
"applications. For most games, because the screen needs to be redrawn every "
"frame, it is recommended to keep this setting disabled."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa o modo de uso de baixo consumo do processador. "
"Quando ativado, o motor leva mais tempo para redesenhar, mas só redesenha a "
"tela se necessário. Isso pode diminuir o consumo de energia e é destinado a "
"editores ou aplicativos móveis. Para a maioria dos jogos, como a tela "
"precisa ser redesenhada a cada quadro, é recomendável manter esta "
"configuração desativada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Amount of sleeping between frames when the low-processor usage mode is "
"enabled (in microseconds). Higher values will result in lower CPU usage."
msgstr ""
"Quantidade de pausa entre quadros quando o modo de uso de baixo "
"processamento está ativado (em microssegundos). Valores mais altos "
"resultarão em menor uso da CPU."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "The name of the type implementing the engine's main loop."
msgstr "O nome do tipo que implementa o loop principal do motor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Path to the main scene file that will be loaded when the project runs."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para o arquivo de cena principal que será carregado quando o projeto "
"for executado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of frames per second allowed. A value of [code]0[/code] means "
"\"no limit\". The actual number of frames per second may still be below this "
"value if the CPU or GPU cannot keep up with the project logic and "
"rendering.\n"
"Limiting the FPS can be useful to reduce system power consumption, which "
"reduces heat and noise emissions (and improves battery life on mobile "
"devices).\n"
"If [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is set to [code]Enabled[/code] "
"or [code]Adaptive[/code], it takes precedence and the forced FPS number "
"cannot exceed the monitor's refresh rate. See also [method "
"DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate].\n"
"If [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [code]Enabled[/code], on "
"monitors with variable refresh rate enabled (G-Sync/FreeSync), using an FPS "
"limit slightly lower than the monitor's refresh rate will [url=https://"
"blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-vsync-on/]reduce input lag while avoiding "
"tearing[/url]. At higher refresh rates, the difference between the FPS limit "
"and the monitor refresh rate should be increased to ensure frames to account "
"for timing inaccuracies. The optimal formula for the FPS limit value in this "
"scenario is [code]r - (r * r) / 3600.0[/code], where [code]r[/code] is the "
"monitor's refresh rate.\n"
"If [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] is [code]Disabled[/code], "
"limiting the FPS to a high value that can be consistently reached on the "
"system can reduce input lag compared to an uncapped framerate. Since this "
"works by ensuring the GPU load is lower than 100%, this latency reduction is "
"only effective in GPU-bottlenecked scenarios, not CPU-bottlenecked "
"scenarios.\n"
"See also [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second].\n"
"This setting can be overridden using the [code]--max-fps <fps>[/code] "
"command line argument (including with a value of [code]0[/code] for "
"unlimited framerate).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the rendering FPS cap at runtime, set [member Engine.max_fps] instead."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de quadros por segundo permitido. Um valor de [code]0[/code] "
"significa \"sem limite\". O número real de quadros por segundo ainda pode "
"ficar abaixo desse valor se a CPU ou a GPU não conseguirem acompanhar a "
"lógica do projeto e a renderização.\n"
"Limitar o FPS pode ser útil para reduzir o consumo de energia do sistema, o "
"que diminui emissões de calor e ruído (e melhora a duração da bateria em "
"dispositivos móveis).\n"
"Se [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] estiver definido como "
"[code]Enabled[/code] ou [code]Adaptive[/code], isso terá precedência e o "
"número de FPS forçado não poderá exceder a taxa de atualização do monitor. "
"Consulte também [method DisplayServer.screen_get_refresh_rate].\n"
"Se [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] estiver como [code]Enabled[/"
"code], em monitores com taxa de atualização variável habilitada (G-Sync/"
"FreeSync), usar um limite de FPS ligeiramente inferior à taxa de atualização "
"do monitor irá [url=https://blurbusters.com/howto-low-lag-vsync-on/]reduzir "
"o atraso de entrada (input lag) enquanto evita o corte de imagem (tearing)[/"
"url]. Em taxas de atualização mais altas, a diferença entre o limite de FPS "
"e a taxa de atualização do monitor deve ser aumentada para garantir que os "
"quadros considerem as imprecisões de tempo. A fórmula ideal para o valor do "
"limite de FPS neste cenário é [code]r - (r * r) / 3600.0[/code], onde "
"[code]r[/code] é a taxa de atualização do monitor.\n"
"Se [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] estiver como [code]Disabled[/"
"code], limitar o FPS a um valor alto que possa ser alcançado "
"consistentemente no sistema pode reduzir o atraso de entrada em comparação "
"com uma taxa de quadros sem limite. Como isso funciona garantindo que a "
"carga da GPU seja inferior a 100%, essa redução de latência só é eficaz em "
"cenários limitados pela GPU (GPU-bottlenecked), e não em cenários limitados "
"pela CPU (CPU-bottlenecked).\n"
"Consulte também [member physics/common/physics_ticks_per_second].\n"
"Esta configuração pode ser substituída usando o argumento de linha de "
"comando [code]--max-fps <fps>[/code] (incluindo com um valor de [code]0[/"
"code] para taxa de quadros ilimitada).\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade é lida apenas quando o projeto é iniciado. "
"Para alterar o limite de FPS de renderização em tempo de execução, defina "
"[member Engine.max_fps] em vez disso."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the engine header is printed in the console on "
"startup. This header describes the current version of the engine, as well as "
"the renderer being used. This behavior can also be disabled on the command "
"line with the [code]--no-header[/code] option."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o cabeçalho da engine é impresso no console na "
"inicialização. Este cabeçalho descreve a versão atual da engine, bem como o "
"renderizador que está sendo usado. Esse comportamento também pode ser "
"desativado na linha de comando com a opção [code]--no-header[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Audio buses will disable automatically when sound goes below a given dB "
"threshold for a given time. This saves CPU as effects assigned to that bus "
"will no longer do any processing."
msgstr ""
"Os barramentos de áudio desativam automaticamente quando o som fica abaixo "
"de um determinado limite de dB por um determinado tempo. Isso economiza CPU, "
"pois os efeitos atribuídos a esse barramento não farão mais nenhum "
"processamento."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [AudioBusLayout] resource file to use in the project, unless "
"overridden by the scene."
msgstr ""
"Arquivo de recurso [AudioBusLayout] padrão a ser usado no projeto, a menos "
"que substituído pela cena."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the audio driver to use. This setting is platform-dependent as "
"each platform supports different audio drivers. If left empty, the default "
"audio driver will be used.\n"
"The [code]Dummy[/code] audio driver disables all audio playback and "
"recording, which is useful for non-game applications as it reduces CPU "
"usage. It also prevents the engine from appearing as an application playing "
"audio in the OS' audio mixer.\n"
"To query the value that is being used at run-time (which may be overridden "
"by command-line arguments or headless mode), use [method "
"AudioServer.get_driver_name].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The driver in use can be overridden at runtime via the [code]--"
"audio-driver[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], microphone input will be allowed. This requires "
"appropriate permissions to be set when exporting to Android or iOS.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If the operating system blocks access to audio input devices "
"(due to the user's privacy settings), audio capture will only return "
"silence. On Windows, make sure that apps are allowed to access the "
"microphone in the OS' privacy settings."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Target mixing rate used for audio (in Hz). In general, it's better to not "
"touch this and leave it to the host operating system.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] On iOS and macOS, mixing rate is determined by audio driver, "
"this value is ignored.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Input and output mixing rates might be different. Use [method "
"AudioServer.get_mix_rate] and [method AudioServer.get_input_mix_rate] to get "
"actual values."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Safer override for [member audio/driver/mix_rate] in the Web platform. Here "
"[code]0[/code] means \"let the browser choose\" (since some browsers do not "
"like forcing the mix rate)."
msgstr ""
"Substituição mais segura para [member audio/driver/mix_rate] na plataforma "
"Web. Aqui, [code]0[/code] significa \"deixar o navegador escolher\" (já que "
"alguns navegadores não gostam de forçar a taxa de mixagem)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the preferred output latency in milliseconds for audio. Lower "
"values will result in lower audio latency at the cost of increased CPU "
"usage. Low values may result in audible crackling on slower hardware.\n"
"Audio output latency may be constrained by the host operating system and "
"audio hardware drivers. If the host can not provide the specified audio "
"output latency then Godot will attempt to use the nearest latency allowed by "
"the host. As such you should always use [method "
"AudioServer.get_output_latency] to determine the actual audio output "
"latency.\n"
"Audio output latency can be overridden using the [code]--audio-output-"
"latency <ms>[/code] command line argument.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on Android."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Safer override for [member audio/driver/output_latency] in the Web platform, "
"to avoid audio issues especially on mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"Substituição mais segura para [member audio/driver/output_latency] na "
"plataforma Web, para evitar problemas de áudio, especialmente em "
"dispositivos móveis."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The base strength of the panning effect for all [AudioStreamPlayer2D] nodes. "
"The panning strength can be further scaled on each Node using [member "
"AudioStreamPlayer2D.panning_strength]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] disables "
"stereo panning entirely, leaving only volume attenuation in place. A value "
"of [code]1.0[/code] completely mutes one of the channels if the sound is "
"located exactly to the left (or right) of the listener.\n"
"The default value of [code]0.5[/code] is tuned for headphones. When using "
"speakers, you may find lower values to sound better as speakers have a lower "
"stereo separation compared to headphones."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The base strength of the panning effect for all [AudioStreamPlayer3D] nodes. "
"The panning strength can be further scaled on each Node using [member "
"AudioStreamPlayer3D.panning_strength]. A value of [code]0.0[/code] disables "
"stereo panning entirely, leaving only volume attenuation in place. A value "
"of [code]1.0[/code] completely mutes one of the channels if the sound is "
"located exactly to the left (or right) of the listener.\n"
"The default value of [code]0.5[/code] is tuned for headphones which means "
"that the opposite side channel goes no lower than 50% of the volume of the "
"nearside channel. You may find that you can set this value higher for "
"speakers to have the same effect since both ears can hear from each speaker."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the default playback type of the platform.\n"
"The default value is set to [b]Stream[/b], as most platforms have no issues "
"mixing streams."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the default playback type of the Web platform.\n"
"The default value is set to [b]Sample[/b] as the Web platform is not suited "
"to mix audio streams outside of the Web Audio API, especially when exporting "
"a single-threaded game. [b]Sample[/b] allows for lower latency on the web "
"platform at the cost of flexibility ([AudioEffect]s are not supported).\n"
"[b]Warning:[/b] Forcing [b]Stream[/b] on the Web platform may cause high "
"audio latency and crackling, especially when exporting a multi-threaded game."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/avfaudio/"
"avaudiosession/categoryoptions/1616611-mixwithothers]mixWithOthers[/url] "
"option for the AVAudioSession on iOS. This will override the mix behavior, "
"if the category is set to [code]Play and Record[/code], [code]Playback[/"
"code], or [code]Multi Route[/code].\n"
"[code]Ambient[/code] always has this set per default."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/avfaudio/"
"avaudiosessioncategory]AVAudioSessionCategory[/url] on iOS. Use the "
"[code]Playback[/code] category to get sound output, even if the phone is in "
"silent mode."
msgstr ""
"Define a [url=https://developer.apple.com/documentation/avfaudio/"
"avaudiosessioncategory]AVAudioSessionCategory[/url] no iOS. Use a categoria "
"[code]Playback[/code] para obter saída de som, mesmo se o telefone estiver "
"no modo silencioso."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], text-to-speech support is enabled on startup, "
"otherwise it is enabled the first time any TTS method is used. See also "
"[method DisplayServer.tts_get_voices] and [method DisplayServer.tts_speak].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Enabling TTS can cause additional idle CPU usage and interfere "
"with the sleep mode, so consider disabling it if TTS is not used."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Setting to hardcode audio delay when playing video. Best to leave this "
"unchanged unless you know what you are doing."
msgstr ""
"Configuração para fixar o atraso de áudio ao reproduzir vídeo. É melhor "
"deixar isso inalterado, a menos que você saiba o que está fazendo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], ambient lights will be imported from COLLADA models as "
"[DirectionalLight3D]. If [code]false[/code], ambient lights will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], as luzes ambiente serão importadas de modelos COLLADA "
"como [DirectionalLight3D]. Se [code]false[/code], as luzes ambiente serão "
"ignoradas."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default compression level for gzip. Affects compressed scenes and "
"resources. Higher levels result in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression level. "
"[code]-1[/code] uses the default gzip compression level, which is identical "
"to [code]6[/code] but could change in the future due to underlying zlib "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"O nível de compactação padrão para gzip. Afeta cenas e recursos compactados. "
"Níveis mais altos resultam em arquivos menores ao custo de velocidade de "
"compactação. A velocidade de descompactação não é afetada significativamente "
"pelo nível de compactação. [code]-1[/code] usa o nível de compactação gzip "
"padrão, que é idêntico a [code]6[/code], mas pode mudar no futuro devido a "
"atualizações subjacentes do zlib."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default compression level for Zlib. Affects compressed scenes and "
"resources. Higher levels result in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression level. "
"[code]-1[/code] uses the default gzip compression level, which is identical "
"to [code]6[/code] but could change in the future due to underlying zlib "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"O nível de compactação padrão para Zlib. Afeta cenas e recursos compactados. "
"Níveis mais altos resultam em arquivos menores ao custo de velocidade de "
"compactação. A velocidade de descompactação não é afetada significativamente "
"pelo nível de compactação. [code]-1[/code] usa o nível de compactação gzip "
"padrão, que é idêntico a [code]6[/code], mas pode mudar no futuro devido a "
"atualizações subjacentes do zlib."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default compression level for Zstandard. Affects compressed scenes and "
"resources. Higher levels result in smaller files at the cost of compression "
"speed. Decompression speed is mostly unaffected by the compression level."
msgstr ""
"O nível de compressão padrão para o Zstandard. Afeta cenas e recursos "
"compactados. Níveis mais altos resultam em arquivos menores ao custo da "
"velocidade de compressão. A velocidade de descompressão não é afetada em sua "
"maior parte pelo nível de compressão."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enables [url=https://github.com/facebook/zstd/releases/tag/v1.3.2]long-"
"distance matching[/url] in Zstandard."
msgstr ""
"Ativa o [url=https://github.com/facebook/zstd/releases/tag/"
"v1.3.2]emparelhamento de longa distância[/url] no Zstandard."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Largest size limit (in power of 2) allowed when compressing using long-"
"distance matching with Zstandard. Higher values can result in better "
"compression, but will require more memory when compressing and decompressing."
msgstr ""
"Maior limite de tamanho (em potência de 2) permitido ao compactar usando "
"correspondência de longa distância com o Zstandard. Valores mais altos podem "
"resultar em melhor compressão, mas exigirão mais memória ao compactar e "
"descompactar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If canvas item redraw debugging is active, this color will be flashed on "
"canvas items when they redraw."
msgstr ""
"Se a depuração de redesenho de item de canvas estiver ativa, esta cor "
"piscará nos itens de canvas quando eles se redesenharem."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If canvas item redraw debugging is active, this will be the time the flash "
"will last each time they redraw."
msgstr ""
"Se a depuração de redesenho de item de canvas estiver ativa, este será o "
"tempo que o piscar durará a cada redesenho."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], logs all output and error messages to files. See also "
"[member debug/file_logging/log_path], [member debug/file_logging/"
"max_log_files], and [member application/run/flush_stdout_on_print]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], registra todas as saídas e mensagens de erro em "
"arquivos. Consulte também [member debug/file_logging/log_path], [member "
"debug/file_logging/max_log_files] e [member application/run/"
"flush_stdout_on_print]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Desktop override for [member debug/file_logging/enable_file_logging], as log "
"files are not readily accessible on mobile/Web platforms."
msgstr ""
"Substituição de desktop para [member debug/file_logging/"
"enable_file_logging], já que os arquivos de log não são facilmente "
"acessíveis em plataformas móveis/Web."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path at which to store log files for the project. Using a path under "
"[code]user://[/code] is recommended.\n"
"This can be specified manually on the command line using the [code]--log-"
"file <file>[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]. If this command line "
"argument is specified, log rotation is automatically disabled (see [member "
"debug/file_logging/max_log_files])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum number of log files allowed (used for rotation). Set "
"to [code]1[/code] to disable log file rotation.\n"
"If the [code]--log-file <file>[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url] is used, log rotation "
"is always disabled."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an [code]assert[/code] call always evaluates to "
"[code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma chamada [code]assert[/code] é sempre "
"avaliada como [code]false[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an [code]assert[/code] call always evaluates to "
"[code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma chamada [code]assert[/code] é sempre "
"avaliada como [code]true[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable captured by a lambda is reassigned, since "
"this does not modify the outer local variable."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma variável local capturada por uma expressão "
"lambda é reatribuída, já que isso não modifica a variável local externa."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an identifier contains characters that can be confused "
"with something else, like when mixing different alphabets."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando um identificador contém caracteres que podem ser "
"confundidos com outra coisa, como ao misturar alfabetos diferentes."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an identifier declared in the nested block has the same "
"name as an identifier declared below in the parent block."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando um identificador declarado no bloco aninhado tem o "
"mesmo nome que um identificador declarado abaixo no bloco pai."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an identifier that will be shadowed below in the block is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um identificador que será sombreado abaixo no "
"bloco é usado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a built-in property of type [code]Packed*Array[/code] is "
"modified using a complex assignment chain or a non-[code]const[/code] method "
"call. In this case, you are only modifying a temporary value, and the "
"property's value remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma propriedade integrada do tipo "
"[code]Packed*Array[/code] é modificada usando uma cadeia de atribuição "
"complexa ou uma chamada de método não-[code]const[/code]. Nesse caso, você "
"está modificando apenas um valor temporário, e o valor da propriedade "
"permanece inalterado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when deprecated keywords are used.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] There are currently no deprecated keywords, so this warning is "
"never produced."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The rules for including or excluding scripts when generating warnings, as a "
"dictionary. Each rule is an entry consisting of a directory path (key) and a "
"decision (value). When trying to generate a warning, the GDScript parser "
"chooses the most specific rule, i.e. the most nested directory containing "
"the script. If the decision is [b]Exclude[/b], warnings are not generated "
"for this script. If the decision is [b]Include[/b] or the script doesn't "
"satisfy any of the rules, the warning configuration specified in the Project "
"Settings is applied.\n"
"It is recommended to include your own addons/libraries, either project-"
"specific or actively being developed at the moment. Third-party or project-"
"agnostic addons/libraries should be excluded, as they may be incompatible "
"with the project's warning configuration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] It is not recommended to remove or change the rule for [code]"
"\"res://addons\"[/code] as the project's warning configuration may break "
"third-party addons. Instead, consider including individual addons, if "
"necessary.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The editor does not check whether the specified paths are "
"existing directories. It also does not automatically update these paths when "
"directories are moved."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an empty file is parsed."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um arquivo vazio é analisado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables specific GDScript warnings (see [code]debug/"
"gdscript/warnings/*[/code] settings). If [code]false[/code], disables all "
"GDScript warnings."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa avisos específicos do GDScript (consulte as "
"configurações [code]debug/gdscript/warnings/*[/code]). Se [code]false[/"
"code], desativa todos os avisos do GDScript."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a variable has an enum type but no explicit default value, "
"but only if the enum does not contain [code]0[/code] as a valid value."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando uma variável tem um tipo enum mas nenhum valor padrão "
"explícito, mas apenas se o enum não contiver [code]0[/code] como um valor "
"válido."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when [method Node.get_node] (or the shorthand [code]$[/code]) "
"is used as default value of a class variable without the [code]@onready[/"
"code] annotation."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando [method Node.get_node] (ou o atalho [code]$[/code]) é "
"usado como valor padrão de uma variável de classe sem a anotação "
"[code]@onready[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a ternary operator may emit values with incompatible types."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um operador ternário pode emitir valores com "
"tipos incompatíveis."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a static inferred type uses a [Variant] as initial value, "
"which makes the static type to also be Variant."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um tipo estático inferido usa um [Variant] "
"como valor inicial, o que faz com que o tipo estático também se torne "
"Variant."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a variable, constant, or parameter has an implicitly "
"inferred static type. In GDScript, type inference is performed by declaring "
"a variable with [code]:=[/code] instead of [code]=[/code] and leaving out "
"the type specifier. For example, [code]var x := 1[/code] will [i]infer[/i] "
"the [int] type, while [code]var x: int = 1[/code] explicitly declares the "
"variable as [int].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This warning is recommended [i]in addition[/i] to [member debug/"
"gdscript/warnings/untyped_declaration] if you want to always specify the "
"type explicitly. Having [code]INFERRED_DECLARATION[/code] warning level "
"higher than [code]UNTYPED_DECLARATION[/code] warning level makes little "
"sense and is not recommended."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when trying to use an integer as an enum without an explicit "
"cast."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, ao tentar usar um inteiro como um enum sem uma "
"conversão explícita."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when trying to use an integer as an enum when there is no "
"matching enum member for that numeric value."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao tentar usar um inteiro como um enum quando não há nenhum "
"membro de enum correspondente para esse valor numérico."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when dividing an integer by another integer (the decimal part "
"will be discarded)."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, ao dividir um inteiro por outro inteiro (a parte "
"decimal será descartada)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a coroutine without [code]await[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, ao chamar uma corrotina sem [code]await[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when the base class script has the [code]@tool[/code] "
"annotation, but the current class script does not have it."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando o script da classe base tem a anotação [code]@tool[/"
"code], mas o script da classe atual não a tem."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when passing a floating-point value to a function that expects "
"an integer (it will be converted and lose precision)."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao passar um valor de ponto flutuante para uma função que "
"espera um inteiro (ele será convertido e perderá precisão)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a method in the script overrides a native method, because "
"it may not behave as expected."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um método no script substitui um método "
"nativo, porque ele pode não se comportar conforme o esperado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when the [code]@onready[/code] annotation is used together with "
"the [code]@export[/code] annotation, since it may not behave as expected."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando a anotação [code]@onready[/code] é usada em conjunto "
"com a anotação [code]@export[/code], pois pode não se comportar conforme o "
"esperado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a function that is not a coroutine is called with await."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando uma função que não é uma corrotina é chamada com "
"await."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when the [code]@static_unload[/code] annotation is used in a "
"script without any static variables."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente quando a anotação [code]@static_unload[/code] é usada em um "
"script sem nenhuma variável estática."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When enabled, using a property, enum, or function that was renamed since "
"Godot 3 will produce a hint if an error occurs."
msgstr ""
"Quando ativado, o uso de uma propriedade, enum ou função que foi renomeada "
"desde o Godot 3 produzirá uma dica se ocorrer um erro."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a function without using its return value (by "
"assigning it to a variable or using it as a function argument). These return "
"values are sometimes used to indicate possible errors using the [enum Error] "
"enum."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, ao chamar uma função sem usar seu valor de retorno "
"(atribuindo-o a uma variável ou usando-o como um argumento de função). Esses "
"valores de retorno são às vezes usados para indicar possíveis erros usando o "
"enum [enum Error]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when defining a local or member variable, signal, or enum that "
"would have the same name as a built-in function or global class name, thus "
"shadowing it."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao definir uma variável local ou de membro, um sinal ou um "
"enum que teria o mesmo nome de uma função embutida ou de um nome de classe "
"global, gerando assim um sombreamento."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable or local constant shadows a member "
"declared in the current class."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma variável local ou constante local oculta "
"um membro declarado na classe atual."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable or local constant shadows a member "
"declared in a base class."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma variável local ou constante local oculta "
"um membro declarado em uma classe base."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling an expression that may have no effect on the "
"surrounding code, such as writing [code]2 + 2[/code] as a statement."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao chamar uma expressão que pode não ter efeito no código ao "
"redor, como escrever [code]2 + 2[/code] como uma instrução."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a ternary expression that may have no effect on "
"the surrounding code, such as writing [code]42 if active else 0[/code] as a "
"statement."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao chamar uma expressão ternária que pode não ter efeito no "
"código ao redor, como escrever [code]42 if active else 0[/code] como uma "
"instrução."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a static method from an instance of a class "
"instead of from the class directly."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, ao chamar um método estático a partir de uma "
"instância de uma classe em vez de diretamente da classe."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when using a variable that wasn't previously assigned."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao usar uma variável que não foi atribuída anteriormente."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when assigning a variable using an assignment operator like "
"[code]+=[/code] if the variable wasn't previously assigned."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao atribuir uma variável usando um operador de atribuição "
"como [code]+=[/code] se a variável não foi atribuída anteriormente."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when unreachable code is detected (such as after a "
"[code]return[/code] statement that will always be executed)."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando código inacessível é detectado (como após uma "
"instrução [code]return[/code] que sempre será executada)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when an unreachable [code]match[/code] pattern is detected."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um padrão [code]match[/code] inalcançável é "
"detectado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when using an expression whose type may not be compatible with "
"the function parameter expected."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao usar uma expressão cujo tipo pode não ser compatível com "
"o parâmetro de função esperado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a [Variant] value is cast to a non-Variant."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Aviso[/b] (Warn) ou [b]Erro[/b] (Error), produz um "
"aviso ou um erro respectivamente quando um valor [Variant] é convertido para "
"um tipo que não é Variant."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when calling a method whose presence is not guaranteed at "
"compile-time in the class."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao chamar um método cuja presença não é garantida em tempo "
"de compilação na classe."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when accessing a property whose presence is not guaranteed at "
"compile-time in the class."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando se acessa uma propriedade cuja presença não é "
"garantida em tempo de compilação na classe."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when returning a call from a [code]void[/code] function when "
"such call cannot be guaranteed to be also [code]void[/code]."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um erro "
"respectivamente ao retornar uma chamada de uma função [code]void[/code] "
"quando tal chamada não puder ser garantida como sendo também [code]void[/"
"code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a variable or parameter has no static type, or if a "
"function has no static return type.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This warning is recommended together with [member "
"EditorSettings.text_editor/completion/add_type_hints] to help achieve type "
"safety."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local constant is never used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma constante local nunca é usada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a function parameter is never used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um parâmetro de função nunca é usado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a private member variable is never used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma variável de membro privada nunca é usada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a signal is declared but never explicitly used in the "
"class."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando um sinal é declarado, mas nunca usado "
"explicitamente na classe."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [b]Warn[/b] or [b]Error[/b], produces a warning or an error "
"respectively when a local variable is unused."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [b]Warn[/b] ou [b]Error[/b], produz um aviso ou um "
"erro, respectivamente, quando uma variável local não é usada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Message to be displayed before the backtrace when the engine crashes. By "
"default, this message is only used in exported projects due to the editor-"
"only override applied to this setting."
msgstr ""
"Mensagem a ser exibida antes do rastreamento de pilha quando o motor trava. "
"Por padrão, esta mensagem é usada apenas em projetos exportados devido à "
"sobreposição exclusiva do editor aplicada a esta configuração."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Editor-only override for [member debug/settings/crash_handler/message]. Does "
"not affect exported projects in debug or release mode."
msgstr ""
"Substituição exclusiva do editor para [member debug/settings/crash_handler/"
"message]. Não afeta projetos exportados no modo de depuração ou lançamento."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Whether GDScript call stacks will be tracked in release builds, thus "
"allowing [method Engine.capture_script_backtraces] to function.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on editor builds or debug builds, "
"where GDScript call stacks are tracked regardless."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Whether GDScript local variables will be tracked in all builds, including "
"export builds, thus allowing [method Engine.capture_script_backtraces] to "
"capture them when enabling its [code]include_variables[/code] parameter.\n"
"Enabling this comes at the cost of roughly 50 bytes of memory per local "
"variable, for every compiled class in the entire project, so can be several "
"MiB in larger projects.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect when running the game from the "
"editor, where GDScript local variables are tracked regardless."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Maximum call stack allowed for debugging GDScript."
msgstr "Pilha de chamadas máxima permitida para depurar GDScript."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables warnings which can help pinpoint where nodes "
"are being incorrectly updated, which will result in incorrect interpolation "
"and visual glitches.\n"
"When a node is being interpolated, it is essential that the transform is set "
"during [method Node._physics_process] (during a physics tick) rather than "
"[method Node._process] (during a frame)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Maximum number of functions per frame allowed when profiling."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de funções por frame permitidas durante a criação de perfil."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of timestamp query elements allowed per frame for visual "
"profiling."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de elementos de consulta de carimbo de data/hora permitidos "
"por quadro para perfil visual."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Print frames per second to standard output every second."
msgstr "Imprimir quadros por segundo na saída padrão a cada segundo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Print GPU profile information to standard output every second. This includes "
"how long each frame takes the GPU to render on average, broken down into "
"different steps of the render pipeline, such as CanvasItems, shadows, glow, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Imprime informações de perfil de GPU na saída padrão a cada segundo. Isso "
"inclui quanto tempo cada quadro leva para a GPU renderizar em média, "
"dividido em diferentes etapas do pipeline de renderização, como CanvasItems, "
"sombras, brilho, etc."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Print more information to standard output when running. It displays "
"information such as memory leaks, which scenes and resources are being "
"loaded, etc. This can also be enabled using the [code]--verbose[/code] or "
"[code]-v[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url], even on an exported "
"project. See also [method OS.is_stdout_verbose] and [method "
"@GlobalScope.print_verbose]."
msgstr ""
"Imprime mais informações na saída padrão durante a execução. Exibe "
"informações como vazamentos de memória, quais cenas e recursos estão sendo "
"carregados, etc. Isso também pode ser ativado usando o [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]argumento de linha de comando[/"
"url] [code]--verbose[/code] ou [code]-v[/code], mesmo em um projeto "
"exportado. Veja também [method OS.is_stdout_verbose] e [method "
"@GlobalScope.print_verbose]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when the shader exceeds "
"certain device limits. Currently, the only device limit checked is the limit "
"on uniform buffer size. More device limits will be added in the future."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando o shader "
"excede certos limites do dispositivo. Atualmente, o único limite de "
"dispositivo verificado é o limite no tamanho do buffer de uniformes. Mais "
"limites de dispositivo serão adicionados no futuro."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables specific shader warnings (see [code]debug/"
"shader_language/warnings/*[/code] settings). If [code]false[/code], disables "
"all shader warnings."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ativa avisos específicos de shader (consulte as "
"configurações de [code]debug/shader_language/warnings/*[/code]). Se "
"[code]false[/code], desativa todos os avisos de shader."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when two floating-point "
"numbers are compared directly with the [code]==[/code] operator or the "
"[code]!=[/code] operator."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando dois números "
"de ponto flutuante são comparados diretamente com o operador [code]==[/code] "
"ou o operador [code]!=[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning upon encountering certain "
"formatting errors. Currently this only checks for empty statements. More "
"formatting errors may be added over time."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso ao encontrar certos "
"erros de formatação. Atualmente, isso verifica apenas instruções vazias. "
"Mais erros de formatação podem ser adicionados com o tempo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when the shader contains "
"[code]POSITION = vec4(vertex,[/code] as this was very common code written in "
"Godot 4.2 and earlier that was paired with a QuadMesh to produce a full "
"screen post processes pass. With the switch to reversed z in 4.3, this trick "
"no longer works, as it implicitly relied on the [code]VERTEX.z[/code] being "
"0."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando o shader "
"contém [code]POSITION = vec4(vertex,[/code], pois este era um código muito "
"comum escrito no Godot 4.2 e anteriores que era emparelhado com um QuadMesh "
"para produzir uma passagem de pós-processamento de tela inteira. Com a "
"mudança para z invertido no 4.3, esse truque não funciona mais, pois "
"dependia implicitamente de [code]VERTEX.z[/code] ser 0."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "When set to [code]true[/code], warnings are treated as errors."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], os avisos são tratados como erros."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a constant is never "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando uma constante "
"nunca é usada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a function is never "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando uma função "
"nunca é usada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a local variable is "
"never used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando uma variável "
"local nunca é usada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a struct is never "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando uma struct "
"nunca é usada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a uniform is never "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando um uniforme "
"nunca é usado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When set to [code]true[/code], produces a warning when a varying is never "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Quando definido como [code]true[/code], produz um aviso quando um varying "
"nunca é usado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the avoidance agents radius, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor do raio dos agentes de desvio, visível quando \"Desvio Visível\" está "
"ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays avoidance agents radius when \"Visible Avoidance\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe o raio dos agentes de desvio quando \"Desvio Visível\" "
"estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays avoidance obstacles radius when \"Visible Avoidance\" "
"is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe o raio dos obstáculos de desvio quando \"Desvio Visível\" "
"estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays static avoidance obstacles when \"Visible Avoidance\" "
"is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe obstáculos de desvio estáticos quando \"Desvio Visível\" "
"estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the avoidance obstacles radius, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" "
"is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor do raio dos obstáculos de desvio, visível quando \"Desvio Visível\" está "
"ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles edges when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents in, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled in "
"the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor das arestas dos obstáculos de desvio estático quando seus vértices estão "
"dispostos em ordem para empurrar os agentes para dentro, visível quando "
"\"Visible Avoidance\" está ativado no menu Debug."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles edges when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents out, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled "
"in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor das arestas dos obstáculos estáticos de desvio quando seus vértices são "
"ordenados para empurrar agentes para fora, visível quando \"Desvio Visível\" "
"está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles faces when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents in, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled in "
"the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor das faces dos obstáculos de desvio estático quando seus vértices estão "
"dispostos em ordem para empurrar os agentes para dentro, visível quando "
"\"Visible Avoidance\" está ativado no menu Debug."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the static avoidance obstacles faces when their vertices are winded "
"in order to push agents out, visible when \"Visible Avoidance\" is enabled "
"in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor das faces dos obstáculos estáticos de desvio quando seus vértices são "
"ordenados para empurrar agentes para fora, visível quando \"Desvio Visível\" "
"está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the contact points between collision shapes, visible when \"Visible "
"Collision Shapes\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor dos pontos de contato entre formas de colisão, visível quando \"Formas "
"de Colisão Visíveis\" está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets whether 2D physics will display collision outlines in game when "
"\"Visible Collision Shapes\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Define se a física 2D exibirá contornos de colisão no jogo quando \"Formas "
"de Colisão Visíveis\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Maximum number of contact points between collision shapes to display when "
"\"Visible Collision Shapes\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de pontos de contato entre as formas de colisão a serem "
"exibidos quando \"Formas de Colisão Visíveis\" estiver ativado no menu "
"Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the collision shapes, visible when \"Visible Collision Shapes\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor das formas de colisão, visível quando \"Formas de Colisão Visíveis\" "
"está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to display enabled navigation agent paths when an agent has debug "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Cor para exibir caminhos de agentes de navegação habilitados quando um "
"agente tem depuração ativada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Rasterized size (pixel) used to render navigation agent path points when an "
"agent has debug enabled."
msgstr ""
"Tamanho rasterizado (pixel) usado para renderizar os pontos do caminho do "
"agente de navegação quando um agente tem depuração ativada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to display edge connections between navigation regions, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor para exibir conexões de borda entre regiões de navegação, visíveis "
"quando \"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation agent paths when an agent has debug enabled."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe os caminhos dos agentes de navegação quando um agente tem "
"depuração ativada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays edge connections between navigation regions when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe conexões de borda entre regiões de navegação quando "
"\"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation mesh polygon edges when \"Visible "
"Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe as arestas do polígono da malha de navegação quando "
"\"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativada no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, colorizes each navigation mesh polygon face with a random color "
"when \"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, colore cada face de polígono da malha de navegação com uma cor "
"aleatória quando \"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation link connections when \"Visible Navigation\" "
"is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe as conexões de links de navegação quando \"Navegação "
"Visível\" estiver ativada no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to display enabled navigation mesh polygon edges, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor para exibir as arestas de polígono de malha de navegação ativadas, "
"visíveis quando \"Navegação Visível\" está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to display disabled navigation mesh polygon edges, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor para exibir as arestas de polígono de malha de navegação desativadas, "
"visíveis quando \"Navegação Visível\" está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to display enabled navigation mesh polygon faces, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor para exibir as faces de polígono de malha de navegação ativadas, "
"visíveis quando \"Navegação Visível\" está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to display disabled navigation mesh polygon faces, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor para exibir as faces de polígono de malha de navegação desativadas, "
"visíveis quando \"Navegação Visível\" está ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to use to display navigation link connections, visible when \"Visible "
"Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor a ser usada para exibir conexões de links de navegação, visível quando "
"\"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color to use to display disabled navigation link connections, visible when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor a ser usada para exibir conexões de links de navegação desativadas, "
"visíveis quando \"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation agent paths through geometry when an agent "
"has debug enabled."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe os caminhos do agente de navegação através da geometria "
"quando um agente tem a depuração ativada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays edge connections between navigation regions through "
"geometry when \"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe conexões de borda entre regiões de navegação através da "
"geometria quando \"Visible Navigation\" estiver ativado no menu de Depuração."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation mesh polygon edges through geometry when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe conexões de polígonos de malha de navegação através da "
"geometria quando \"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If enabled, displays navigation link connections through geometry when "
"\"Visible Navigation\" is enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Se ativado, exibe conexões de links de navegação através da geometria quando "
"\"Navegação Visível\" estiver ativado no menu Depurar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Color of the curve path geometry, visible when \"Visible Paths\" is enabled "
"in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Cor da geometria do caminho da curva, visível quando \"Visible Paths\" está "
"ativado no menu Debug."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Line width of the curve path geometry, visible when \"Visible Paths\" is "
"enabled in the Debug menu."
msgstr ""
"Largura da linha da geometria do caminho da curva, visível quando \"Visible "
"Paths\" está ativado no menu Debug."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the driver to be used by the display server. This property can not be "
"edited directly, instead, set the driver using the platform-specific "
"overrides."
msgstr ""
"Define o driver a ser usado pelo servidor de exibição. Esta propriedade não "
"pode ser editada diretamente; em vez disso, defina o driver usando as "
"substituições específicas da plataforma."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Android override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "Substituição do Android para [member display/display_server/driver]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "iOS override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "Substituição do iOS para [member display/display_server/driver]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "LinuxBSD override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "Substituição do LinuxBSD para [member display/display_server/driver]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "MacOS override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "Substituição do macOS para [member display/display_server/driver]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "visionOS override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "Substituição do visionOS para [member display/display_server/driver]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Windows override for [member display/display_server/driver]."
msgstr "Substituição do Windows para [member display/display_server/driver]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Custom image for the mouse cursor (limited to 256×256)."
msgstr "Imagem personalizada para o cursor do mouse (limitada a 256×256)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Hotspot for the custom mouse cursor image."
msgstr "Ponto de acesso para a imagem de cursor do mouse personalizada."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Position offset for tooltips, relative to the mouse cursor's hotspot."
msgstr ""
"Deslocamento de posição para dicas de ferramenta, relativo ao ponto de "
"acesso do cursor do mouse."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows HiDPI display on Windows, macOS, Android, iOS "
"and Web. If [code]false[/code], the platform's low-DPI fallback will be used "
"on HiDPI displays, which causes the window to be displayed in a blurry or "
"pixelated manner (and can cause various window management bugs). Therefore, "
"it is recommended to make your project scale to [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/"
"rendering/multiple_resolutions.html]multiple resolutions[/url] instead of "
"disabling this setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on Linux as DPI-awareness fallbacks "
"are not supported there."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Enable Swappy for stable frame pacing on Android. Highly recommended.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This option will be forced off when using OpenXR."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Swappy mode to use. The options are:\n"
"- [code]pipeline_forced_on[/code]: Try to honor [member Engine.max_fps]. "
"Pipelining is always on. This is the same behavior as a desktop PC.\n"
"- [code]auto_fps_pipeline_forced_on[/code]: Calculate the max FPS "
"automatically. The actual max FPS will be between [code]0[/code] and [member "
"Engine.max_fps]. While this sounds convenient, beware that Swappy will often "
"downgrade the max FPS until it finds a value that can be maintained. That "
"means, if your game runs between 40fps and 60fps on a 60hz screen, after "
"some time Swappy will downgrade the max FPS so that the game renders at a "
"perfect 30fps.\n"
"- [code]auto_fps_auto_pipeline[/code]: Same as "
"[code]auto_fps_pipeline_forced_on[/code], but if Swappy detects that "
"rendering is very fast (for example it takes less than 8ms to render on a "
"60hz screen), Swappy will disable pipelining to minimize input latency. This "
"is the default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member Engine.max_fps] is [code]0[/code], the actual max "
"FPS will be considered to be the screen's refresh rate (often 60hz, 90hz, or "
"120hz, depending on device model and OS settings)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default screen orientation to use on mobile devices. See [enum "
"DisplayServer.ScreenOrientation] for possible values.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When set to a portrait orientation, this project setting does "
"not flip the project resolution's width and height automatically. Instead, "
"you have to set [member display/window/size/viewport_width] and [member "
"display/window/size/viewport_height] accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], HDR output is requested for the main window and the "
"editor. The main window and editor will automatically switch between HDR and "
"SDR if it is moved between screens, screen capabilities change, or system "
"settings are modified. This will internally force [member "
"Viewport.use_hdr_2d] to be enabled on the main [Viewport]. All other "
"[SubViewport] of the [Window] must have their [member Viewport.use_hdr_2d] "
"property enabled to produce HDR output.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"this property at runtime, set [member Window.hdr_output_requested]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], iOS devices that support high refresh rate/"
"\"ProMotion\" will be allowed to render at up to 120 frames per second."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], dispositivos iOS que suportam alta taxa de atualização/"
"\"ProMotion\" terão permissão para renderizar a até 120 quadros por segundo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the home indicator is hidden automatically. This only "
"affects iOS devices without a physical home button."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o indicador de início é ocultado automaticamente. Isso "
"afeta apenas dispositivos iOS sem um botão de início físico."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the status bar is hidden while the app is running."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a barra de status é ocultada enquanto o aplicativo "
"está em execução."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], it will require two swipes to access iOS UI that uses "
"gestures.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on the home indicator if "
"[code]hide_home_indicator[/code] is [code]true[/code]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows per-pixel transparency for the window "
"background. This affects performance, so leave it on [code]false[/code] "
"unless you need it. See also [member display/window/size/transparent] and "
"[member rendering/viewport/transparent_background]."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], permite transparência por pixel para o fundo da "
"janela. Isso afeta o desempenho, portanto, deixe em [code]false[/code], a "
"menos que você precise. Veja também [member display/window/size/transparent] "
"e [member rendering/viewport/transparent_background]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Forces the main window to be always on top.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Forces the main window to be borderless.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Main window content is expanded to the full size of the window. Unlike a "
"borderless window, the frame is left intact and can be used to resize the "
"window, and the title bar is transparent, but has minimize/maximize/close "
"buttons.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is implemented only on macOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Main window initial position (in virtual desktop coordinates), this setting "
"is used only if [member display/window/size/initial_position_type] is set to "
"\"Absolute\" ([code]0[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only affects the exported project, or when the "
"project is run from the command line. In the editor, the value of [member "
"EditorSettings.run/window_placement/rect_custom_position] is used instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Main window initial position.\n"
"[code]0[/code] - \"Absolute\", [member display/window/size/initial_position] "
"is used to set window position.\n"
"[code]1[/code] - \"Primary Screen Center\".\n"
"[code]3[/code] - \"Other Screen Center\", [member display/window/size/"
"initial_screen] is used to set the screen.\n"
"[code]4[/code] - \"Center of Screen With Mouse Pointer\".\n"
"[code]5[/code] - \"Center of Screen With Keyboard Focus\".\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only affects the exported project, or when the "
"project is run from the command line. In the editor, the value of [member "
"EditorSettings.run/window_placement/rect] is used instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Main window initial screen, this setting is used only if [member display/"
"window/size/initial_position_type] is set to \"Other Screen Center\" "
"([code]2[/code]).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting only affects the exported project, or when the "
"project is run from the command line. In the editor, the value of [member "
"EditorSettings.run/window_placement/screen] is used instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the main window's maximize button is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o botão de maximizar da janela principal é desativado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code], the main window's minimize button is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], o botão de minimizar da janela principal é desativado."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Main window mode. See [enum DisplayServer.WindowMode] for possible values "
"and how each mode behaves.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Game embedding is available only in the \"Windowed\" mode."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Main window can't be focused. No-focus window will ignore all input, except "
"mouse clicks."
msgstr ""
"A janela principal não pode receber foco. Uma janela sem foco ignorará toda "
"a entrada, exceto cliques do mouse."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], allows the window to be resizable by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"whether the window is resizable at runtime, set [member Window.unresizable] "
"instead on the root Window, which can be retrieved using "
"[code]get_viewport().get_window()[/code]. [member Window.unresizable] takes "
"the opposite value of this setting.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Certain window managers can be configured to ignore the non-"
"resizable status of a window. Do not rely on this setting as a guarantee "
"that the window will [i]never[/i] be resizable.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting is ignored on iOS."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], the main window uses sharp corners by default.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is implemented only on Windows (11)."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a janela principal usa cantos nítidos por padrão.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] Esta propriedade é implementada apenas no Windows (11)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], enables a window manager hint that the main window "
"background [i]can[/i] be transparent. This does not make the background "
"actually transparent. For the background to be transparent, the root "
"viewport must also be made transparent by enabling [member rendering/"
"viewport/transparent_background].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] To use a transparent splash screen, set [member application/"
"boot_splash/bg_color] to [code]Color(0, 0, 0, 0)[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect if [member display/window/"
"per_pixel_transparency/allowed] is set to [code]false[/code].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting has no effect on Android as transparency is "
"controlled only via [member display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the game's main viewport height. On desktop platforms, this is also the "
"initial window height, represented by an indigo-colored rectangle in the 2D "
"editor. Stretch mode settings also use this as a reference when using the "
"[code]canvas_items[/code] or [code]viewport[/code] stretch modes. See also "
"[member display/window/size/viewport_width], [member display/window/size/"
"window_width_override] and [member display/window/size/"
"window_height_override]."
msgstr ""
"Define a altura da viewport principal do jogo. Em plataformas de desktop, "
"esta também é a altura inicial da janela, representada por um retângulo de "
"cor índigo no editor 2D. As configurações do modo de estiramento também usam "
"isso como referência ao usar os modos de estiramento [code]canvas_items[/"
"code] ou [code]viewport[/code]. Veja também [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_width], [member display/window/size/window_width_override] e "
"[member display/window/size/window_height_override]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the game's main viewport width. On desktop platforms, this is also the "
"initial window width, represented by an indigo-colored rectangle in the 2D "
"editor. Stretch mode settings also use this as a reference when using the "
"[code]canvas_items[/code] or [code]viewport[/code] stretch modes. See also "
"[member display/window/size/viewport_height], [member display/window/size/"
"window_width_override] and [member display/window/size/"
"window_height_override]."
msgstr ""
"Define a largura da viewport principal do jogo. Em plataformas de desktop, "
"esta também é a largura inicial da janela, representada por um retângulo de "
"cor índigo no editor 2D. As configurações do modo de estiramento também usam "
"isso como referência ao usar os modos de estiramento [code]canvas_items[/"
"code] ou [code]viewport[/code]. Veja também [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_height], [member display/window/size/window_width_override] e "
"[member display/window/size/window_height_override]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"On desktop platforms, overrides the game's initial window height. See also "
"[member display/window/size/window_width_override], [member display/window/"
"size/viewport_width] and [member display/window/size/viewport_height].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, or when set to [code]0[/code], the initial window "
"height is the [member display/window/size/viewport_height]. This setting is "
"ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"On desktop platforms, overrides the game's initial window width. See also "
"[member display/window/size/window_height_override], [member display/window/"
"size/viewport_width] and [member display/window/size/viewport_height].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] By default, or when set to [code]0[/code], the initial window "
"width is the [member display/window/size/viewport_width]. This setting is "
"ignored on iOS, Android, and Web."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Defines how the aspect ratio of the base size is preserved when stretching "
"to fit the resolution of the window or screen.\n"
"[code]\"ignore\"[/code]: Ignore the aspect ratio when stretching the screen. "
"This means that the original resolution will be stretched to exactly fill "
"the screen, even if it's wider or narrower. This may result in non-uniform "
"stretching: things looking wider or taller than designed.\n"
"[code]\"keep\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen. This "
"means that the viewport retains its original size regardless of the screen "
"resolution, and black bars will be added to the top/bottom of the screen "
"(\"letterboxing\") or the sides (\"pillarboxing\").\n"
"[code]\"keep_width\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen. "
"If the screen is wider than the base size, black bars are added at the left "
"and right (pillarboxing). But if the screen is taller than the base "
"resolution, the viewport will be grown in the vertical direction (and more "
"content will be visible at the bottom). You can also think of this as "
"\"Expand Vertically\".\n"
"[code]\"keep_height\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen. "
"If the screen is taller than the base size, black bars are added at the top "
"and bottom (letterboxing). But if the screen is wider than the base "
"resolution, the viewport will be grown in the horizontal direction (and more "
"content will be visible to the right). You can also think of this as "
"\"Expand Horizontally\".\n"
"[code]\"expand\"[/code]: Keep aspect ratio when stretching the screen, but "
"keep neither the base width nor height. Depending on the screen aspect "
"ratio, the viewport will either be larger in the horizontal direction (if "
"the screen is wider than the base size) or in the vertical direction (if the "
"screen is taller than the original size). This is the default for projects "
"created starting in Godot 4.7."
msgstr ""
"Define como a proporção (aspect ratio) do tamanho base é preservada ao "
"esticar para ajustar à resolução da janela ou tela.\n"
"[code]\"ignore\"[/code]: Ignora a proporção ao esticar a tela. Isso "
"significa que a resolução original será esticada para preencher exatamente a "
"tela, mesmo que ela seja mais larga ou mais estreita. Isso pode resultar em "
"um estiramento não uniforme: elementos parecendo mais largos ou mais altos "
"do que o projetado.\n"
"[code]\"keep\"[/code]: Mantém a proporção ao esticar a tela. Isso significa "
"que a viewport retém seu tamanho original independentemente da resolução da "
"tela, e barras pretas serão adicionadas na parte superior/inferior da tela "
"(\"letterboxing\") ou nas laterais (\"pillarboxing\").\n"
"[code]\"keep_width\"[/code]: Mantém a proporção ao esticar a tela. Se a tela "
"for mais larga do que o tamanho base, barras pretas são adicionadas à "
"esquerda e à direita (pillarboxing). Mas se a tela for mais alta do que a "
"resolução base, a viewport será expandida na direção vertical (e mais "
"conteúdo ficará visível na parte inferior). Você também pode pensar nisso "
"como \"Expandir Verticalmente\".\n"
"[code]\"keep_height\"[/code]: Mantém a proporção ao esticar a tela. Se a "
"tela for mais alta do que o tamanho base, barras pretas são adicionadas na "
"parte superior e inferior (letterboxing). Mas se a tela for mais larga do "
"que a resolução base, a viewport será expandida na direção horizontal (e "
"mais conteúdo ficará visível à direita). Você também pode pensar nisso como "
"\"Expandir Horizontalmente\".\n"
"[code]\"expand\"[/code]: Mantém a proporção ao esticar a tela, mas não "
"mantém nem a largura nem a altura base. Dependendo da proporção da tela, a "
"viewport será maior na direção horizontal (se a tela for mais larga que o "
"tamanho base) ou na direção vertical (se a tela for mais alta que o tamanho "
"original). Este é o padrão para projetos criados a partir do Godot 4.7."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Defines how the base size is stretched to fit the resolution of the window "
"or screen.\n"
"[code]\"disabled\"[/code]: No stretching happens. One unit in the scene "
"corresponds to one pixel on the screen. In this mode, [member display/window/"
"stretch/aspect] has no effect. Recommended for non-game applications.\n"
"[code]\"canvas_items\"[/code]: The base size specified in width and height "
"in the project settings is stretched to cover the whole screen (taking "
"[member display/window/stretch/aspect] into account). This means that "
"everything is rendered directly at the target resolution. 3D is unaffected, "
"while in 2D, there is no longer a 1:1 correspondence between sprite pixels "
"and screen pixels, which may result in scaling artifacts. Recommended for "
"most games that don't use a pixel art aesthetic, although it is possible to "
"use this stretch mode for pixel art games too (especially in 3D). This is "
"the default for projects created starting in Godot 4.7.\n"
"[code]\"viewport\"[/code]: The size of the root [Viewport] is set precisely "
"to the base size specified in the Project Settings' Display section. The "
"scene is rendered to this viewport first. Finally, this viewport is scaled "
"to fit the screen (taking [member display/window/stretch/aspect] into "
"account). Recommended for games that use a pixel art aesthetic."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The scale factor multiplier to use for 2D elements. This multiplies the "
"final scale factor determined by [member display/window/stretch/mode]. If "
"using the [b]Disabled[/b] stretch mode, this scale factor is applied as-is. "
"This can be adjusted to make the UI easier to read on certain displays."
msgstr ""
"O multiplicador do fator de escala a ser usado para elementos 2D. Isso "
"multiplica o fator de escala final determinado por [member display/window/"
"stretch/mode]. Se estiver usando o modo de estiramento [b]Disabled[/b], este "
"fator de escala é aplicado tal como está. Isso pode ser ajustado para tornar "
"a interface do usuário mais fácil de ler em determinadas telas."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The policy to use to determine the final scale factor for 2D elements. This "
"affects how [member display/window/stretch/scale] is applied, in addition to "
"the automatic scale factor determined by [member display/window/stretch/"
"mode].\n"
"[code]\"fractional\"[/code]: The scale factor will not be modified.\n"
"[code]\"integer\"[/code]: The scale factor will be floored to an integer "
"value, which means that the screen size will always be an integer multiple "
"of the base viewport size. This provides a crisp pixel art appearance.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] When using integer scaling with a stretch mode, resizing the "
"window to be smaller than the base viewport size will clip the contents. "
"Consider preventing that by setting [member Window.min_size] to the same "
"value as the base viewport size defined in [member display/window/size/"
"viewport_width] and [member display/window/size/viewport_height]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], subwindows are embedded in the main window (this is "
"also called single-window mode). Single-window mode can be faster as it does "
"not need to create a separate window for every popup and tooltip, which can "
"be a slow operation depending on the operating system and rendering method "
"in use.\n"
"If [code]false[/code], subwindows are created as separate windows (this is "
"also called multi-window mode). This allows them to be moved outside the "
"main window and use native operating system window decorations.\n"
"This is equivalent to [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/"
"single_window_mode] in the editor."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Sets the V-Sync mode for the main game window. The editor's own V-Sync mode "
"can be set using [member EditorSettings.interface/editor/display/"
"vsync_mode].\n"
"See [enum DisplayServer.VSyncMode] for possible values and how they affect "
"the behavior of your application.\n"
"Depending on the platform and rendering method, the engine will fall back to "
"[b]Enabled[/b] if the desired mode is not supported.\n"
"V-Sync can be disabled on the command line using the [code]--disable-vsync[/"
"code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.html]command "
"line argument[/url].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The [b]Adaptive[/b] and [b]Mailbox[/b] V-Sync modes are only "
"supported in the Forward+ and Mobile rendering methods, not Compatibility.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the V-Sync mode at runtime, call [method "
"DisplayServer.window_set_vsync_mode] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Name of the .NET assembly. This name is used as the name of the "
"[code].csproj[/code] and [code].sln[/code] files. By default, it's set to "
"the name of the project ([member application/config/name]) allowing to "
"change it in the future without affecting the .NET assembly."
msgstr ""
"Nome do assembly .NET. Este nome é usado como o nome dos arquivos "
"[code].csproj[/code] e [code].sln[/code]. Por padrão, ele é definido como o "
"nome do projeto ([member application/config/name]), permitindo alterá-lo no "
"futuro sem afetar o assembly .NET."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of times to attempt assembly reloading after rebuilding .NET "
"assemblies. Effectively also the timeout in seconds to wait for unloading of "
"script assemblies to finish."
msgstr ""
"Número de vezes para tentar recarregar assemblies após reconstruir "
"assemblies do .NET. Efetivamente, também é o tempo limite em segundos para "
"aguardar o término da descarregagem dos assemblies de script."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Directory that contains the [code].sln[/code] file. By default, the "
"[code].sln[/code] files is in the root of the project directory, next to the "
"[code]project.godot[/code] and [code].csproj[/code] files.\n"
"Changing this value allows setting up a multi-project scenario where there "
"are multiple [code].csproj[/code]. Keep in mind that the Godot project is "
"considered one of the C# projects in the workspace and it's root directory "
"should contain the [code]project.godot[/code] and [code].csproj[/code] next "
"to each other."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], text resource ([code]tres[/code]) and text scene "
"([code]tscn[/code]) files are converted to their corresponding binary format "
"on export. This decreases file sizes and speeds up loading slightly.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Because a resource's file extension may change in an exported "
"project, it is heavily recommended to use [method @GDScript.load] or "
"[ResourceLoader] instead of [FileAccess] to load resources dynamically.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The project settings file ([code]project.godot[/code]) will "
"always be converted to binary on export, regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The maximum width to use when importing textures as an atlas. The value will "
"be rounded to the nearest power of two when used. Use this to prevent "
"imported textures from growing too large in the other direction."
msgstr ""
"A largura máxima a ser usada ao importar texturas como um atlas. O valor "
"será arredondado para a potência de dois mais próxima quando usado. Use isso "
"para evitar que texturas importadas cresçam muito na outra direção."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "If [code]true[/code] importing of resources is run on multiple threads."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], a importação de recursos é executada em várias threads."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Number of bits per audio sample written to the [code].avi[/code] file. Only "
"16 and 32-bit are supported."
msgstr ""
"Número de bits por amostra de áudio gravados no arquivo [code].avi[/code]. "
"Apenas 16 e 32 bits são suportados."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], requests V-Sync to be disabled when writing a movie "
"(similar to setting [member display/window/vsync/vsync_mode] to [b]Disabled[/"
"b]). This can speed up video writing if the hardware is fast enough to "
"render, encode and save the video at a framerate higher than the monitor's "
"refresh rate.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] [member editor/movie_writer/disable_vsync] has no effect if the "
"operating system or graphics driver forces V-Sync with no way for "
"applications to disable it."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The number of frames per second to record in the video when writing a movie. "
"Simulation speed will adjust to always match the specified framerate, which "
"means the engine will appear to run slower at higher [member editor/"
"movie_writer/fps] values. Certain FPS values will require you to adjust "
"[member editor/movie_writer/mix_rate] to prevent audio from desynchronizing "
"over time.\n"
"This can be specified manually on the command line using the [code]--fixed-"
"fps <fps>[/code] [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/editor/"
"command_line_tutorial.html]command line argument[/url]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The audio mix rate to use in the recorded audio when writing a movie (in "
"Hz). This can be different from [member audio/driver/mix_rate], but this "
"value must be divisible by [member editor/movie_writer/fps] to prevent audio "
"from desynchronizing over time."
msgstr ""
"A taxa de mixagem de áudio a ser usada no áudio gravado ao gravar um filme "
"(em Hz). Isso pode ser diferente de [member audio/driver/mix_rate], mas esse "
"valor deve ser divisível por [member editor/movie_writer/fps] para evitar "
"que o áudio dessincronize com o tempo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The output path for the movie. The file extension determines the "
"[MovieWriter] that will be used.\n"
"Godot has 3 built-in [MovieWriter]s:\n"
"- OGV container with Theora for video and Vorbis for audio ([code].ogv[/"
"code] file extension). Lossy compression, medium file sizes, fast encoding. "
"The lossy compression quality can be adjusted by changing [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/video_quality] and [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/ogv/audio_quality]. The resulting file "
"can be viewed in Godot with [VideoStreamPlayer] and most video players, but "
"not web browsers as they don't support Theora.\n"
"- AVI container with MJPEG for video and uncompressed audio ([code].avi[/"
"code] file extension). Lossy compression, medium file sizes, fast encoding. "
"The lossy compression quality can be adjusted by changing [member "
"ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/video_quality]. The resulting file can "
"be viewed in most video players, but it must be converted to another format "
"for viewing on the web or by Godot with [VideoStreamPlayer]. MJPEG does not "
"support transparency. AVI output is currently limited to a file of 4 GB in "
"size at most.\n"
"- PNG image sequence for video and WAV for audio ([code].png[/code] file "
"extension). Lossless compression, large file sizes, slow encoding. Designed "
"to be encoded to a video file with another tool such as [url=https://"
"ffmpeg.org/]FFmpeg[/url] after recording. Transparency is currently not "
"supported, even if the root viewport is set to be transparent.\n"
"If you need to encode to a different format or pipe a stream through third-"
"party software, you can extend this [MovieWriter] class to create your own "
"movie writers.\n"
"When using PNG output, the frame number will be appended at the end of the "
"file name. It starts from 0 and is padded with 8 digits to ensure correct "
"sorting and easier processing. For example, if the output path is [code]/tmp/"
"hello.png[/code], the first two frames will be [code]/tmp/hello00000000.png[/"
"code] and [code]/tmp/hello00000001.png[/code]. The audio will be saved at "
"[code]/tmp/hello.wav[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O caminho de saída para o filme. A extensão do arquivo determina o "
"[MovieWriter] que será usado.\n"
"O Godot possui 3 [MovieWriter]s integrados:\n"
"- Contêiner OGV com Theora para vídeo e Vorbis para áudio (extensão de "
"arquivo [code].ogv[/code]). Compressão com perdas, tamanhos de arquivo "
"médios, codificação rápida. A qualidade da compressão com perdas pode ser "
"ajustada alterando [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/"
"video_quality] e [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/ogv/"
"audio_quality]. O arquivo resultante pode ser visualizado no Godot com "
"[VideoStreamPlayer] e na maioria dos reprodutores de vídeo, mas não em "
"navegadores web, pois eles não suportam Theora.\n"
"- Contêiner AVI com MJPEG para vídeo e áudio não compactado (extensão de "
"arquivo [code].avi[/code]). Compressão com perdas, tamanhos de arquivo "
"médios, codificação rápida. A qualidade da compressão com perdas pode ser "
"ajustada alterando [member ProjectSettings.editor/movie_writer/"
"video_quality]. O arquivo resultante pode ser visualizado na maioria dos "
"reprodutores de vídeo, mas deve ser convertido para outro formato para "
"visualização na web ou pelo Godot com [VideoStreamPlayer]. O MJPEG não "
"suporta transparência. Atualmente, a saída AVI é limitada a um arquivo de no "
"máximo 4 GB de tamanho.\n"
"- Sequência de imagens PNG para vídeo e WAV para áudio (extensão de arquivo "
"[code].png[/code]). Compressão sem perdas, arquivos grandes, codificação "
"lenta. Projetado para ser codificado em um arquivo de vídeo com outra "
"ferramenta, como [url=https://ffmpeg.org/]FFmpeg[/url], após a gravação. "
"Atualmente, a transparência não é suportada, mesmo que a viewport raiz "
"esteja configurada para ser transparente.\n"
"Se precisar codificar para um formato diferente ou direcionar um fluxo por "
"meio de software de terceiros, você pode estender esta classe [MovieWriter] "
"para criar seus próprios gravadores de filme.\n"
"Ao usar a saída PNG, o número do quadro será anexado ao final do nome do "
"arquivo. Ele começa em 0 e é preenchido com 8 dígitos para garantir a "
"ordenação correta e um processamento mais fácil. Por exemplo, se o caminho "
"de saída for [code]/tmp/hello.png[/code], os dois primeiros quadros serão "
"[code]/tmp/hello00000000.png[/code] e [code]/tmp/hello00000001.png[/code]. O "
"áudio será salvo em [code]/tmp/hello.wav[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The audio encoding quality to use when writing Vorbis audio to a file, "
"between [code]-0.1[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Higher "
"[code]quality[/code] values result in better-sounding output at the cost of "
"larger file sizes. Even at quality [code]1.0[/code], compression remains "
"lossy.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This does not affect video quality, which is controlled by "
"[member editor/movie_writer/video_quality] instead."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The tradeoff between encoding speed and compression efficiency. Speed "
"[code]1[/code] is the slowest but provides the best compression. Speed "
"[code]4[/code] is the fastest but provides the worst compression. Video "
"quality is generally not affected significantly by this setting."
msgstr ""
"O equilíbrio entre velocidade de codificação e eficiência de compactação. A "
"velocidade [code]1[/code] é a mais lenta, mas fornece a melhor compactação. "
"A velocidade [code]4[/code] é a mais rápida, mas fornece a pior compactação. "
"A qualidade do vídeo geralmente não é afetada significativamente por esta "
"configuração."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Forces keyframes at the specified interval (in frame count). Higher values "
"can improve compression up to a certain level at the expense of higher "
"latency when seeking."
msgstr ""
"Força quadros-chave no intervalo especificado (em contagem de quadros). "
"Valores mais altos podem melhorar a compressão até certo ponto, ao custo de "
"maior latência ao buscar."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The speaker mode to use in the recorded audio when writing a movie. See "
"[enum AudioServer.SpeakerMode] for possible values."
msgstr ""
"O modo de alto-falante a ser usado no áudio gravado ao gravar um filme. Veja "
"[enum AudioServer.SpeakerMode] para valores possíveis."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The video encoding quality to use when writing a Theora or AVI (MJPEG) video "
"to a file, between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code] (inclusive). Higher "
"[code]quality[/code] values result in better-looking output at the cost of "
"larger file sizes. Recommended [code]quality[/code] values are between "
"[code]0.75[/code] and [code]0.9[/code]. Even at quality [code]1.0[/code], "
"compression remains lossy."
msgstr ""
"A qualidade de codificação de vídeo a ser usada ao gravar um vídeo Theora ou "
"AVI (MJPEG) em um arquivo, entre [code]0.0[/code] e [code]1.0[/code] "
"(inclusive). Valores de [code]quality[/code] mais altos resultam em uma "
"saída de melhor aparência ao custo de tamanhos de arquivo maiores. Os "
"valores de [code]quality[/code] recomendados estão entre [code]0.75[/code] e "
"[code]0.9[/code]. Mesmo na qualidade [code]1.0[/code], a compressão continua "
"com perdas."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The format of the default signal callback name (in the Signal Connection "
"Dialog). The following substitutions are available: [code]{NodeName}[/code], "
"[code]{nodeName}[/code], [code]{node_name}[/code], [code]{SignalName}[/"
"code], [code]{signalName}[/code], and [code]{signal_name}[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O formato do nome padrão do retorno de chamada do sinal (na Caixa de Diálogo "
"de Conexão de Sinal). As seguintes substituições estão disponíveis: [code]"
"{NodeName}[/code], [code]{nodeName}[/code], [code]{node_name}[/code], [code]"
"{SignalName}[/code], [code]{signalName}[/code] e [code]{signal_name}[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The format of the default signal callback name when a signal connects to the "
"same node that emits it (in the Signal Connection Dialog). The following "
"substitutions are available: [code]{NodeName}[/code], [code]{nodeName}[/"
"code], [code]{node_name}[/code], [code]{SignalName}[/code], [code]"
"{signalName}[/code], and [code]{signal_name}[/code]."
msgstr ""
"O formato do nome padrão de retorno de chamada de sinal quando um sinal se "
"conecta ao mesmo nó que o emite (no Diálogo de Conexão de Sinal). As "
"seguintes substituições estão disponíveis: [code]{NodeName}[/code], [code]"
"{nodeName}[/code], [code]{node_name}[/code], [code]{SignalName}[/code], "
"[code]{signalName}[/code] e [code]{signal_name}[/code]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When creating node names automatically, set the type of casing to use in "
"this project. This is mostly an editor setting."
msgstr ""
"Ao criar nomes de nós automaticamente, define o estilo de maiúsculas e "
"minúsculas a ser usado neste projeto. Esta é principalmente uma configuração "
"do editor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"What to use to separate node name from number. This is mostly an editor "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"O que usar para separar o nome do nó do número. Esta é principalmente uma "
"configuração do editor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When generating scene file names from scene root node, set the type of "
"casing to use in this project. This is mostly an editor setting."
msgstr ""
"Ao gerar nomes de arquivos de cena a partir do nó raiz da cena, define o "
"tipo de capitalização a ser usado neste projeto. Esta é principalmente uma "
"configuração do editor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When generating script file names from the selected node, set the type of "
"casing to use in this project. This is mostly an editor setting."
msgstr ""
"Ao gerar nomes de arquivos de script a partir do nó selecionado, define o "
"tipo de capitalização a ser usado neste projeto. Esta é principalmente uma "
"configuração do editor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The command-line arguments to append to Godot's own command line when "
"running the project. This doesn't affect the editor itself.\n"
"It is possible to make another executable run Godot by using the [code]"
"%command%[/code] placeholder. The placeholder will be replaced with Godot's "
"own command line. Program-specific arguments should be placed [i]before[/i] "
"the placeholder, whereas Godot-specific arguments should be placed [i]after[/"
"i] the placeholder.\n"
"For example, this can be used to force the project to run on the dedicated "
"GPU in an NVIDIA Optimus system on Linux:\n"
"[codeblock lang=text]\n"
"prime-run %command%\n"
"[/codeblock]"
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Text-based file extensions to include in the script editor's \"Find in "
"Files\" feature. You can add e.g. [code]tscn[/code] if you wish to also "
"parse your scene files, especially if you use built-in scripts which are "
"serialized in the scene files."
msgstr ""
"Extensões de arquivo baseadas em texto para incluir no recurso \"Localizar "
"em Arquivos\" do editor de scripts. Você pode adicionar, por exemplo, "
"[code]tscn[/code] se desejar analisar também seus arquivos de cena, "
"especialmente se usar scripts embutidos que são serializados nos arquivos de "
"cena."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Search path for project-specific script templates. Godot will search for "
"script templates both in the editor-specific path and in this project-"
"specific path."
msgstr ""
"Caminho de busca para modelos de script específicos do projeto. O Godot "
"procurará modelos de script tanto no caminho específico do editor quanto "
"neste caminho específico do projeto."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Blender 3D scene files with the [code].blend[/code] "
"extension will be imported by converting them to glTF 2.0.\n"
"This requires configuring a path to a Blender executable in the [member "
"EditorSettings.filesystem/import/blender/blender_path] setting. Blender 3.0 "
"or later is required."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] on Android where "
"Blender can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"Substituição para [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] no Android, "
"onde o Blender não pode ser acessado facilmente a partir do Godot."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] on the Web where "
"Blender can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"Substituição para [member filesystem/import/blender/enabled] na Web, onde o "
"Blender não pode ser acessado facilmente a partir do Godot."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], Autodesk FBX 3D scene files with the [code].fbx[/code] "
"extension will be imported by converting them to glTF 2.0.\n"
"This requires configuring a path to an FBX2glTF executable in the editor "
"settings at [member EditorSettings.filesystem/import/fbx/fbx2gltf_path]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] on Android where "
"FBX2glTF can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"Substituição para [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] no Android, "
"onde o FBX2glTF não pode ser acessado facilmente a partir do Godot."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Override for [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] on the Web where "
"FBX2glTF can't easily be accessed from Godot."
msgstr ""
"Substituição para [member filesystem/import/fbx2gltf/enabled] na Web, onde o "
"FBX2glTF não pode ser acessado facilmente a partir do Godot."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default value for [member ScrollContainer.scroll_deadzone], which will be "
"used for all [ScrollContainer]s unless overridden."
msgstr ""
"Valor padrão para [member ScrollContainer.scroll_deadzone], que será usado "
"para todos os [ScrollContainer]s, a menos que substituído."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The minimum distance the mouse cursor must move while pressed before a drag "
"operation begins in the default viewport. For custom viewports see [member "
"Viewport.gui_drag_threshold]."
msgstr ""
"A distância mínima que o cursor do mouse deve se mover enquanto pressionado "
"antes que uma operação de arrastar comece na viewport padrão. Para viewports "
"personalizadas, consulte [member Viewport.gui_drag_threshold]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Determines whether a [Control] should visually indicate focus when that "
"focus is gained using a mouse or touch input.\n"
"- [b]Never[/b] ([code]0[/code]) show the focused state for mouse/touch "
"input.\n"
"- [b]Text Input Controls[/b] ([code]1[/code]) show the focused state even if "
"that focus was gained via mouse/touch input (similar to browser behavior).\n"
"- [b]Always[/b] ([code]2[/code]) show the focused state, even if that focus "
"was gained via mouse/touch input."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If [code]true[/code], snaps [Control] node vertices to the nearest pixel to "
"ensure they remain crisp even when the camera moves or zooms."
msgstr ""
"Se [code]true[/code], ajusta os vértices do nó [Control] para o pixel mais "
"próximo para garantir que permaneçam nítidos mesmo quando a câmera se move "
"ou aplica zoom."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"How to position the Cancel and OK buttons in the project's [AcceptDialog] "
"windows. Different platforms have different conventions for this, which can "
"be overridden through this setting.\n"
"- [b]Auto[/b] follows the platform convention: OK first on Windows, KDE, and "
"LXQt; Cancel first on macOS and other Linux desktop environments.\n"
"- [b]Cancel First[/b] forces the Cancel/OK ordering.\n"
"- [b]OK First[/b] forces the OK/Cancel ordering.\n"
"To check if these buttons are swapped at runtime, use [method "
"DisplayServer.get_swap_cancel_ok].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This doesn't affect native dialogs such as the ones spawned by "
"[method DisplayServer.dialog_show]."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Maximum undo/redo history size for [TextEdit] fields."
msgstr ""
"Tamanho máximo do histórico de desfazer/refazer para campos [TextEdit]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code] and [member display/window/stretch/mode] is set "
"to [code]\"canvas_items\"[/code], font and [DPITexture] oversampling is "
"enabled in the main window. Use [member Viewport.oversampling] to control "
"oversampling in other viewports and windows."
msgstr ""
"Se definido como [code]true[/code] e [member display/window/stretch/mode] "
"estiver definido como [code]\"canvas_items\"[/code], o oversampling de "
"fontes e [DPITexture] será ativado na janela principal. Use [member "
"Viewport.oversampling] para controlar o oversampling em outras viewports e "
"janelas."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path to a custom [Theme] resource file to use for the project ([code].theme[/"
"code] or generic [code].tres[/code]/[code].res[/code] extension)."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para um arquivo de recurso de [Theme] personalizado a ser usado no "
"projeto (extensão [code].theme[/code] ou genérica [code].tres[/code]/"
"[code].res[/code])."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Path to a custom [Font] resource to use as default for all GUI elements of "
"the project."
msgstr ""
"Caminho para um recurso [Font] personalizado para usar como padrão para "
"todos os elementos de interface (GUI) do projeto."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Font anti-aliasing mode for the default project font. See [member "
"FontFile.antialiasing].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.antialiasing])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the default font will have mipmaps generated. "
"This prevents text from looking grainy when a [Control] is scaled down, or "
"when a [Label3D] is viewed from a long distance (if [member "
"Label3D.texture_filter] is set to a mode that displays mipmaps).\n"
"Enabling [member gui/theme/default_font_generate_mipmaps] increases font "
"generation time and memory usage. Only enable this setting if you actually "
"need it.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.generate_mipmaps])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Font hinting mode for the default project font. See [member "
"FontFile.hinting].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.hinting])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"If set to [code]true[/code], the default font will use multichannel signed "
"distance field (MSDF) for crisp rendering at any size. Since this approach "
"does not rely on rasterizing the font every time its size changes, this "
"allows for resizing the font in real-time without any performance penalty. "
"Text will also not look grainy for [Control]s that are scaled down (or for "
"[Label3D]s viewed from a long distance).\n"
"MSDF font rendering can be combined with [member gui/theme/"
"default_font_generate_mipmaps] to further improve font rendering quality "
"when scaled down.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.multichannel_signed_distance_field])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Font glyph subpixel positioning mode for the default project font. See "
"[member FontFile.subpixel_positioning].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This setting does not affect custom [Font]s used within the "
"project. Use the [b]Import[/b] dock for that instead (see [member "
"ResourceImporterDynamicFont.subpixel_positioning])."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"The default scale factor for [Control]s, when not overridden by a [Theme].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This property is only read when the project starts. To change "
"the default theme scale at runtime, set [member ThemeDB.fallback_base_scale] "
"instead. However, to adjust the scale of all 2D elements at runtime, it's "
"preferable to use [member Window.content_scale_factor] on the root [Window] "
"node instead (as this also affects overridden [Theme]s). See [url=$DOCS_URL/"
"tutorials/rendering/multiple_resolutions.html]Multiple resolutions[/url] in "
"the documentation for details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"LCD subpixel layout used for font anti-aliasing. See [enum "
"TextServer.FontLCDSubpixelLayout]."
msgstr ""
"Layout de subpíxel LCD usado para suavização de fontes. Consulte [enum "
"TextServer.FontLCDSubpixelLayout]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"When [member BaseButton.shortcut_feedback] is enabled, this is the time the "
"[BaseButton] will remain highlighted after a shortcut. This duration is not "
"affected by [member Engine.time_scale]."
msgstr ""
"Quando [member BaseButton.shortcut_feedback] estiver ativado, este é o tempo "
"que o [BaseButton] permanecerá destacado após um atalho. Essa duração não é "
"afetada por [member Engine.time_scale]."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Timer setting for incremental search in [Tree], [ItemList], etc. controls "
"(in milliseconds)."
msgstr ""
"Configuração de temporizador para busca incremental em controles [Tree], "
"[ItemList], etc. (em milissegundos)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Timer for detecting idle in [TextEdit] (in seconds)."
msgstr "Temporizador para detectar ociosidade no [TextEdit] (em segundos)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Default delay for tooltips (in seconds)."
msgstr "Atraso padrão para dicas de ferramenta (em segundos)."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "Delay for tooltips in the editor."
msgstr "Atraso para dicas de ferramenta no editor."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to confirm a focused button, menu or list item, "
"or validate input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to start or end a drag-and-drop operation without "
"using mouse.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to discard a modal or pending input.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to close a dialog window.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid "macOS specific override for the shortcut to close a dialog window."
msgstr ""
"Substituição específica do macOS para o atalho para fechar uma janela de "
"diálogo."

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to delete a color preset in a [ColorPicker].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to copy a selection to the clipboard.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to cut a selection to the clipboard.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to move down in the UI.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to go to the end position of a [Control] (e.g. "
"last item in an [ItemList] or a [Tree]), matching the behavior of [constant "
"KEY_END] on typical desktop UI systems.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to delete the selected file in a [FileDialog].\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Default [code]ui_*[/code] actions cannot be removed as they are "
"necessary for the internal logic of several [Control]s. The events assigned "
"to the action can however be modified."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml
msgid ""
"Default [InputEventAction] to open file filter in a [FileDialog].\n"
