"window or embedded inside another [Window] (see [member "
"Viewport.gui_embed_subwindows]).\n"
"At runtime, [Window]s will not close automatically when requested. You need "
"to handle it manually using the [signal close_requested] signal (this "
"applies both to pressing the close button and clicking outside of a popup)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "HDR output"
msgstr "Saída HDR"

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "Multiple Windows demo"
msgstr "Demonstração de Múltiplas Janelas"

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Virtual method to be implemented by the user. Overrides the value returned "
"by [method get_contents_minimum_size]."
msgstr ""
"Método virtual a ser implementado pelo usuário. Substitui o valor retornado "
"por [method get_contents_minimum_size]."

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [Color] with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_color_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_color] and [method "
"Control.add_theme_color_override] for more details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Creates a local override for a theme [StyleBox] with the specified [param "
"name]. Local overrides always take precedence when fetching theme items for "
"the control. An override can be removed with [method "
"remove_theme_stylebox_override].\n"
"See also [method get_theme_stylebox] and [method "
"Control.add_theme_stylebox_override] for more details."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid "Returns whether the window is being drawn to the screen."
msgstr "Retorna se a janela está sendo desenhada na tela."

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
msgid ""
"Requests an update of the [Window] size to fit underlying [Control] nodes."
msgstr ""
"Solicita uma atualização do tamanho da [Window] para caber nos nós [Control] "
"subjacentes."

#: doc/classes/Window.xml
