#: doc/classes/XRCamera3D.xml
msgid ""
"A camera node which automatically positions itself based on XR tracking data."
msgstr ""
"Um nó de câmera que se posiciona automaticamente com base em dados de "
"rastreamento XR."

#: doc/classes/XRCamera3D.xml
msgid ""
"A camera node which automatically positions itself based on XR tracking "
"data.\n"
"In contrast to [XRController3D], the render thread has access to more up-to-"
"date tracking data, and the location of the [XRCamera3D] node can lag a few "
"milliseconds behind what is used for rendering.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] If [member Viewport.use_xr] is [code]true[/code], most of the "
"camera properties are overridden by the active [XRInterface]. The only "
"properties that can be trusted are the near and far planes."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid "A 3D node representing a spatially-tracked controller."
msgstr "Um nó 3D representando um controlador rastreador espacialmente."

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid ""
"This is a helper 3D node that is linked to the tracking of controllers. It "
"also offers several handy passthroughs to the state of buttons and such on "
"the controllers.\n"
"Controllers are linked by their ID. You can create controller nodes before "
"the controllers are available. If your game always uses two controllers (one "
"for each hand), you can predefine the controllers with ID 1 and 2; they will "
"become active as soon as the controllers are identified. If you expect "
"additional controllers to be used, you should react to the signals and add "
"XRController3D nodes to your scene.\n"
"The position of the controller node is automatically updated by the "
"[XRServer]. This makes this node ideal to add child nodes to visualize the "
"controller.\n"
"The current [XRInterface] defines the names of inputs. In the case of "
"OpenXR, these are the names of actions in the current action set from the "
"OpenXR action map."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a numeric value for the input with the given [param name]. This is "
"used for triggers and grip sensors.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The current [XRInterface] defines the [param name] for each "
"input. In the case of OpenXR, these are the names of actions in the current "
"action set."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Variant] for the input with the given [param name]. This works "
"for any input type, the variant will be typed according to the actions "
"configuration.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The current [XRInterface] defines the [param name] for each "
"input. In the case of OpenXR, these are the names of actions in the current "
"action set."
msgstr ""

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid "Returns the hand holding this controller, if known."
msgstr "Retorna a mão que segura este controle, se conhecida."

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns a [Vector2] for the input with the given [param name]. This is used "
"for thumbsticks and thumbpads found on many controllers.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The current [XRInterface] defines the [param name] for each "
"input. In the case of OpenXR, these are the names of actions in the current "
"action set."
msgstr ""
"Retorna um [Vector2] para a entrada com o [param name] fornecido. Isso é "
"usado para os direcionais analógicos e touchpads encontrados em muitos "
"controles.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A [XRInterface] atual define o [param name] de cada entrada. No "
"caso do OpenXR, esses são os nomes das ações no conjunto de ações atual."

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid ""
"Returns [code]true[/code] if the button with the given [param name] is "
"pressed.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] The current [XRInterface] defines the [param name] for each "
"input. In the case of OpenXR, these are the names of actions in the current "
"action set."
msgstr ""
"Retorna [code]true[/code] se o botão com o [param name] fornecido estiver "
"pressionado.\n"
"[b]Nota:[/b] A [XRInterface] atual define o [param name] de cada entrada. No "
"caso do OpenXR, esses são os nomes das ações no conjunto de ações atual."

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when a button on this controller is pressed."
msgstr "Emitido quando um botão é pressionado neste controle."

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid "Emitted when a button on this controller is released."
msgstr "Emitido quando um botão é solto neste controle."

#: doc/classes/XRController3D.xml
msgid ""
"Emitted when a trigger or similar input on this controller changes value."
msgstr ""
"Emitido quando um gatilho ou entrada semelhante neste controle altera o "
